msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SchoolOfAlteration"
msgid ""
"Alteration magic is the art of <RT_BlueMed>altering the properties of "
"physical bodies</>.\n"
"\n"
"Wishing to walk on water or make yourself able to carry tons of equipment? "
"Mages specialized in Alteration, usually found at <RT_BlueMed>Cheydinhal's "
"Mages Guild</>, can teach you how to cast such spells.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"WaterBreathing\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• WATER BREATHING •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Allows the target to breathe underwater.</>\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"WaterWalking\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• WATER WALKING •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Allows the target to walk and jump on the surface of water.</> "
"The subject can still go underwater by jumping while standing still.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Shield\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SHIELD •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Grants the caster a temporary shield.</> The magnitude defines "
"how much Armor Rating is granted to the target.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"FireShield\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• FIRE SHIELD •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Grants the caster a temporary shield, along with a resistance to "
"fire.</> The magnitude defines both how much Armor Rating and resistance to "
"fire is granted to the target.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"LightningShield\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SHOCK SHIELD •</>\n"
"These spells creates a lightning shield around the target’s body. Its "
"magnitude is added to the target’s Armor Rating, and it <RT_BlueMed>reduces "
"damage from shock sources</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"FrostShield\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• FROST SHIELD •</>\n"
"These spells creates a frost shield around the target’s body. Its magnitude "
"is added to the target’s Armor Rating, and it <RT_BlueMed>reduces damage from "
"frost sources</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Burden\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• BURDEN •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Temporarily increases the weight carried by the "
"target.</>\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Feather\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• FEATHER •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Temporarily decreases the weight carried by the "
"target.</>\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Open\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• OPEN •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Opens any locked container or door.</> The magnitude defines the "
"highest lock level that can be opened."
msgstr ""

