msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_ShieldBashing"
msgid ""
"An <RT_BlueMed>Expert</> in <RT_BlueMed>Block</> gains the ability to "
"<RT_BlueMed>Shield Bash</>.\n"
"\n"
"When equipped with a <RT_BlueMed>Shield</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> while holding <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/> to perform a <RT_BlueMed>Shield "
