msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Armor"
msgid ""
"Armor <RT_BlueMed>reduces damage</> received from physical attacks. \n"
"\n"
"You can equip different <RT_BlueMed>armor pieces</>: Helmets, Cuirasses, "
"Gauntlets, Greaves, Boots and Shields, from your <RT_BlueMed>inventory</>. "
"\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Shields</> increase your ability to <RT_BlueMed>block</> in "
"addition of providing extra protection. Shields must be paired with a one-"
"handed weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Armor comes in two <RT_BlueMed>classes</>, both improved by their respective "
"Skills.\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Light</> armor trades protection for <RT_BlueMed>better "
"manoeuvrability</> in combat. \n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Heavy</> armor are <RT_BlueMed>as effective as they weight you "
"down</>. \n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Clothing</> does not count as armor and thus <RT_BlueMed>will not "
"protect you</> against your enemies' blows. On the other hand, they allow you "
"to <RT_BlueMed>cast spells at maximum effectiveness</>, making them an "
"excellent choice for mages."
msgstr ""

