msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Fencing"
msgid ""
"Being a <RT_BlueMed>member of the Thieves Guild</> provides you with many "
"advantages such as the opportunity to <RT_BlueMed>sell stolen "
"goods</>.\n"
"\n"
"Fences also <RT_BlueMed>launder</> stolen goods. Buy back a stolen item "
"you've sold and it will now be yours.\n"
"\n"
"If you are <RT_BlueMed>not a member</> of the Thieves Guild, fences will "
"claim that they <RT_BlueMed>do not know what you are talking about</>."
msgstr ""

