msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Blocking"
msgid ""
"Blocking allows you to <RT_BlueMed>reduce incoming physical damage</>, "
"including arrows, at the cost of Fatigue.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>block</>, hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/> while "
"<RT_BlueMed>facing the attacker.</>\n"
"\n"
"Your <RT_BlueMed>efficiency</> at blocking is highly impacted by your "
"<RT_BlueMed>Block Skill</> as well as your <RT_BlueMed>equipment</>. Blocking "
"barefisted only offers minor protection while a shield mitigates more "
"damage.\n"
"\n"
"Blocking an attack will <RT_BlueMed>recoil</> the attacker, creating a small "
"window for you to <RT_BlueMed>strike back</>. This is also true for you, so "
"be careful when you see an enemy blocking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_CharacterSkillPerks_Description_BlockMaster"
msgid ""
"Blocking an attack consumes <RT_BlueMed>almost no Fatigue</>. Your Shield "
"Bash deals <RT_BlueMed>much more damage</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_CharacterSkillPerks_Description_BlockExpert"
msgid ""
"Blocking an attack consumes <RT_BlueMed>even less Fatigue</>. You can perform "
"a <RT_BlueMed>Shield Bash</> by pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> "
"while blocking with a shield."
