msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SchoolOfConjuration"
msgid ""
"Conjuration magic is the art of <RT_BlueMed>summoning beings and magical "
"items</> from other planes.\n"
"\n"
"Wishing for an ally in combat or light but powerful weapons? Mages "
"specialized in Conjuration, usually found at <RT_BlueMed>Chorrol's Mages "
"Guild</>, can teach you how to cast such spells.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Ghost\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SUMMON CREATURE •</>\n"
"Summons various <RT_BlueMed>undead</> and <RT_BlueMed>Daedric creatures.</> "
"The creature appears near the caster and attacks any entity that threatens "
"the caster until the effect ends or the summoned creature is killed.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"BoundWeapon\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• BOUND ITEM •</>\n"
"Conjures a lesser Daedra bound in the form of a magical, wondrously "
"<RT_BlueMed>light Daedric item</>. Gears and weapons are automatically "
"equipped on the caster and disappear when the effect ends. Sheathing a bound "
"weapon will cause it to disappear early. \n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"TurnUndead\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• TURN UNDEAD •</>\n"
"Temporarily <RT_BlueMed>decreases an undead creature’s Confidence</>, "
"compulsing them to disengage combat and run away."
msgstr ""

