msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SchoolOfDestruction"
msgid ""
"Destruction magic is the art of <RT_BlueMed>harming and weakening</> your "
"opponents.\n"
"\n"
"Wishing to set your enemies ablaze or make them too weak to even stand up? "
"Mages specialized in Destruction, usually found at <RT_BlueMed>Skingrad's "
"Mages Guild</>, can teach you how to cast such spells.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"AttributeDamage\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• DAMAGE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Permanently decreases any of the target's Vitals, Skills or "
"Attributes.</> Damaged Vitals, Skills or Attributes can only be restored with "
"Restore or Dispel effects.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"FireDamage\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• FIRE DAMAGE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Harms the target with fire.</> Fire is most effective against "
"undead creatures, Trolls and Spriggans and less effective against most "
"Daedra.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"ShockDamage\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SHOCK DAMAGE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Harms the target using electricity.</> Shock is most effective "
"against Daedra and less effective against Spriggans and Storm "
"Atronachs.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"FrostDamage\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• FROST DAMAGE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Harms the target using ice.</> Unlike Fire and Shock, the Area of "
"effect of Frost defines the size of the projectile as it travels. Frost is "
"uneffective against undead creatures and most effective against Flame "
"Atronachs and Spider Daedra.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Drain\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• DRAIN •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Temporarily decreases the value of the target’s Vitals, Skills or "
"Attributes.</> Once the effect expires, the value is immediately "
"restored.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Weakness\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• WEAKNESS •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Decreases the target’s resistance to diseases, poisons or "
"specific kinds of magical or physical damage.</>\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Disintegrate\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• DISINTEGRATE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Decreases the durability of the target's equipped weapon or armor "
"piece.</>"
msgstr ""

