msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Diseases"
msgid ""
"Diseases are <RT_BlueMed>negative effects</>, that usually reduce your "
"<RT_BlueMed>Vitals, Attributes or Skills</>. Diseases are mostly contracted "
"by getting <RT_BlueMed>hit by infected creatures</>.\n"
"Diseases with similar effects <RT_BlueMed>stack</> with each other.\n"
"\n"
"Most diseases can be cured by casting a <RT_BlueMed>Cure Disease</> spell, by "
"consuming a <RT_BlueMed>Mandrake Root</> or a <RT_BlueMed>potion with a Cure "
"Disease</> effect, or by praying at a <RT_BlueMed>chapel's altar</>.\n"
"\n"
"One unique disease, <RT_BlueMed>Porphyric Hemophilia</>, will turn you into a "
"<RT_BlueMed>vampire</> if not cured for <RT_BlueMed>72 hours</>. Once turned, "
"a simple spell will not be enough to cure you. "
msgstr ""

