msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Encumbrance"
msgid ""
"Emcumbrance represents the <RT_BlueMed>maximum weight that you can "
"carry</>.\n"
"Your <RT_BlueMed>maximum Encumbrance</> can be increased by improving your "
"<RT_BlueMed>Strength</>.\n"
"\n"
"You can find your Encumbrance status in your <RT_BlueMed>Inventory "
"menu</>:\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"EncumbranceIndicator\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"\n"
"Additionally, as long as you carry too many items, an icon will be visible "
"next to your vitals.\n"
"\n"
"When over-encumbered, you are <RT_BlueMed>unable to run, sprint, jump, Dodge, "
"Power Attack, Shield Bash and fast travel</>.\n"
"\n"
"To perform these actions again, <RT_BlueMed>drop or sell items</>.\n"
"You can also <RT_BlueMed>find a horse</>, or cast <RT_BlueMed>Feather</> or "
"<RT_BlueMed>Fortify Strength</> spells to <RT_BlueMed>temporarily increase "
"your maximum Encumbrance</>."
msgstr ""

