msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Horses"
msgid ""
"Horses can be <RT_BlueMed>purchased</> from various <RT_BlueMed>stables</> "
"throughout Cyrodiil.\n"
"Each stable features <RT_BlueMed>different breeds</> of horses, which "
"<RT_BlueMed>vary in speed and resilience</>.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>mount a horse</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Actions_Activate\"/> "
"while facing it.\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>dismount</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Actions_Activate\"/> "
"again.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>To move forward and backwards</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementForward\"/> and <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementBackward\"/>.\n"
"Pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementLeft\"/> and <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementRight\"/> will make the horse <RT_BlueMed>turn "
"left and right</>.\n"
"\n"
"While moving, you can make the horse <RT_BlueMed>gallop</> by pressing <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Gallop\"/>.\n"
"You can <RT_BlueMed>jump</> over obstacles by pressing <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Jump\"/>, but be careful as horses can't jump very "
"high.\n"
"\n"
"If you find horses <RT_BlueMed>too expensive</>, you can always "
"<RT_BlueMed>steal</> one when unattended. <RT_BlueMed>Doing so is considered "
"a crime</> and, if caught, you may face a <RT_BlueMed>bounty</>.\n"
"\n"
"You can <RT_BlueMed>strengthen your horse</> by protecting it with "
"<RT_BlueMed>armor</>. Head towards the <RT_BlueMed>Chestnut Handy Stables</> "
"outside of the Imperial City, and speak to Snak gra-Bura.\n"
"She will only offer to protect horses <RT_BlueMed>you officially own</>, so "
"don't bother bringing a stolen one."
msgstr ""

