msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SchoolOfMysticism"
msgid ""
"Mysticism magic is the art of manipulating forces to <RT_BlueMed>bypass the "
"limitations of the physical world</>.\n"
"\n"
"Wishing to grab objects at a distance or to absorb your enemies' spells? "
"Mages specialized in Mysticism, usually found at <RT_BlueMed>Leyawiin's Mages "
"Guild</>, can teach you how to cast such spells.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dispel\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• DISPEL •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Removes all spell effects on the target.</> Does not affect "
"abilities, diseases, curses, or enchantments. Removes all effects from spells "
"whose effective Magicka cost is less than 5 times the magnitude.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"SoulTrap\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SOUL TRAP •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Traps the soul of the target upon death.</> The soul is stored in "
"the smallest possible empty Soul Gem in the caster’s inventory. The target "
"must be killed while the effect is still active.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Telekinesis\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• TELEKINESIS •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Allows the caster to pick up objects from a distance.</> The "
"magnitude of the spell affects the maximum distance at which it takes effect. "
"While Telekinesis is active, hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/> to move "
"the object closer and <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> to move it further. "
"You can drop or throw the item by pressing both <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/> and <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> at the "
"same time.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"SpellAbsorption\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SPELL ABSORPTION •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Grants the target a chance to absorb spells thrown at them.</> "
"The magnitude defines the percentage chance of absorbing the spell. If it "
"succeeds, the spell's effects are negated and the subject's Magicka is "
"restored based on the strength of the absorbed spell.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Reflect\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• REFLECT •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Grants the target a chance to reflect physical damage or spells "
