"the damage or spell. If it succeeds, the damage or spell effects are "
"reflected back at the caster.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Clairvoyance\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• CLAIRVOYANCE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Reveals to the caster a path towards their current objective.</>"
msgstr ""

