msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Greater&LesserPowers"
msgid ""
"Powers are <RT_BlueMed>powerful spells</>, bestowed either by "
"<RT_BlueMed>races and birthsigns</>, or obtained by visiting "
"<RT_BlueMed>Doomstones</>, becoming a <RT_BlueMed>vampire</>, or "
"<RT_BlueMed>accomplishing major feats</>.\n"
"They <RT_BlueMed>cannot be purchased or created</> and do not grant any kind "
"of experience.\n"
"\n"
"Powers are unaffected by <RT_BlueMed>Spell Effectiveness</> and "
"<RT_BlueMed>can be cast by anyone</>, no matter their skill "
"level.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Greater Powers cost no Magicka</> and are often unaffected by "
"Silence. They can however only be cast <RT_BlueMed>once a "
"day</>.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Lesser Powers</> usually <RT_BlueMed>cost Magicka</>, but most of "
"them are also unaffected by Silence."
msgstr ""

