msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SchoolOfRestoration"
msgid ""
"Restoration magic is the art of healing, revitalizing or fortifying yourself "
"or others.\n"
"\n"
"Wishing to cure any disease or greatly improve your resistance to magical "
"effects? Mages specialized in Restoration, usually found at "
"<RT_BlueMed>Anvil's Mages Guild</> or in chapels, can teach you how to cast "
"such spells.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Absorb\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• ABSORB •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Temporarily transfers part of the target’s Vitals, Skills or "
"Attributes to the caster.</> Once the effect expires, the values of the "
"caster and the target are restored, except for Vitals.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Cure\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• CURE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Cures any disease, poison, or paralysis the target may "
"have.</>\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Restore\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• RESTORE •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Permanently restores any of the target's damaged Vitals, Skills "
"or Attributes.</> This effect only repairs previous damage and cannot be used "
"to increase Vitals, Skills or Attributes past their base value.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Fortify\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• FORTIFY •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Temporarily increases the value of the target’s Vitals, Skills or "
"Attributes.</> Once the effect expires, the value is immediately "
"restored.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Resist\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• RESIST •</>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Increases the target’s resistance to diseases, poison, paralysis "
"or magical and physical damage.</> For poisons and damage reduction, the "
"magnitude defines the percentage of damage that is prevented. For diseases "
"and paralysis, the magnitude defines the percentage chance of not being "
"affected."
msgstr ""

