msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Major&MinorSkills"
msgid ""
"Skills are divided into two categories: <RT_BlueMed>Minor and Major "
"Skills</>.\n"
"\n"
"The Major and Minor Skills are <RT_BlueMed>defined by your class</>, shaping "
"your strengths and weaknesses.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Major skills</> are the primary Skills of your class. They start "
"20 levels higher, and are much easier to increase, making it the "
"<RT_BlueMed>most efficient way to gain Experience</>.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Minor skills</>, on the other hand, are secondary to your class's "
"focus. They start at a much lower level and are slower to increase, making "
"them <RT_BlueMed>grant far less Experience</>.\n"
"\n"
"Your class also defines a specialization. Associated Skills will start 5 "
"levels higher and are also slightly easier to increase."
msgstr ""

