msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SpellEffectiveness"
msgid ""
"Spell Effectiveness indicates <RT_BlueMed>how effective the spells you cast "
"are</>. This percentage is displayed below the Vitals in the "
"<RT_BlueMed>Magic section</> of the journal.\n"
"\n"
"Spell Effectiveness is <RT_BlueMed>reduced when wearing Light or Heavy "
"Armor</>, preventing you from casting spells at their maximum "
"efficiency.\n"
"\n"
"Increasing your skills in Light Armor or Heavy Armor will soften the negative "
"influence of Armor Rating on your total Spell Effectiveness. However, to go "
"above a score of 95% you are required to <RT_BlueMed>wear only clothing</> "
"such as robes and hoods."
msgstr ""

