msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SpellCasting"
msgid ""
"Spellcasters can <RT_BlueMed>channel Magicka</> to cast a variety of spells, "
"from destructive bolts to healing rituals, offering a <RT_BlueMed>versatile "
"approach</> to both offense and defense.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>cast</> your equipped spell, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Cast\"/>.\n"
"Casting spells requires both <RT_BlueMed>having enough Magicka</> and the "
"<RT_BlueMed>mastery</> of the appropriate <RT_BlueMed>school of "
"magic</>.\n"
"\n"
"Spells can be cast at <RT_BlueMed>different ranges</>:\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Self</> spells are cast directly <RT_BlueMed>on yourself</>.\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Target</> spells are cast as a <RT_BlueMed>projectile</>.\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Touch</> spells are cast as a <RT_BlueMed>close-range</> burst "
"of magic. Touch spells usually cost less Magicka to cast compared to Target "
"spells."
msgstr ""

