msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Compass"
msgid ""
"The compass shows the <RT_BlueMed>cardinal directions</> (North, South, East "
"and West), as well as <RT_BlueMed>nearby places of interests</> and "
"<RT_BlueMed>quest markers</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Map_Camp\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Camp</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_ElvenRuin\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Ayleid Ruin</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_OblivionGate\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Oblivion Gate</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_Cave\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Cave</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_FortRuin\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Fort</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_Settlement\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Settlement</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_City\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>City</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_Mine\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Mine</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_Inns\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Inn</>\n"
"<img id=\"Map_DaedricShrine\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Daedric Shrine</>\n"
"\n"
"Quest markers appear on the compass to indicate the direction of your current "
"active quest objective:\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>A red arrow</> means you must <RT_BlueMed>travel through a door "
"or portal</> to reach your objective.\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>A green arrow</> means you are <RT_BlueMed>already in the same "
"general location</> as your objective.\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>A blue arrow</> indicates a <RT_BlueMed>custom marker you've "
"placed yourself</> on your map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryDescription_InfoBox"
msgid ""
"The contextual box under your crosshair gives you information about the "
