msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_CrosshairIcons"
msgid ""
"The crosshair at the center of the screen helps you target "
"<RT_BlueMed>objects and characters</>.\n"
"\n"
"It changes shapes depending on your <RT_BlueMed>equipped weapon</>, or when "
"you <RT_BlueMed>sneak</>. It also changes when hovering objects or characters "
"you can <RT_BlueMed>interact</> with:\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Talk\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Talk</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_TalkImportant\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Talk to an important character</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_OpenDoor\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Open or close a door</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_OpenContainer\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Open a container</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_PickUp\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Pick up</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Read\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Read</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_RideHorse\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Ride a horse</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Sit\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Sit</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Sleep\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Sleep</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_PullPush\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Pull / Push</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_DrinkBlood\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/> "
"<RT_BlueMed>Drink blood</> (Vampire only)\n"
"\n"
"An info box may also appear when <RT_BlueMed>looking</> at an "
"<RT_BlueMed>item</>, displaying that item's <RT_BlueMed>name</>, along with "
"other useful information.\n"
"\n"
"If the interaction with the item is <RT_BlueMed>illegal</>, both the "
"crosshair and the info box will turn <RT_BlueMed>red</>:\n"
"<img id=\"InfoBoxCrime\" height=\"desired\" width=\"desired\"/>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_CrosshairIcons "
msgid ""
"The crosshair at the center of the screen helps you target objects and "
"characters.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>It will change based on the weapon you are wielding and the "
"action you can perform while targetting something in the world.</> It will be "
"diamond shaped when you are wielding a melee weapon and cross shaped when "
"wielding a ranged weapon such as a bow. When sneaking, it will change to a "
"line shape.\n"
"\n"
"When targeting an object, the crosshair will change to an icon showing the "
"following possible actions, if the possible action is illegal then the icon "
"will be red:\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Sit\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Sit</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Sleep\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Sleep</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_PullPush\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Pull / Push</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Read\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Read</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_TalkImportant\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Talk to an important "
"character</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_Talk\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Talk</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_RideHorse\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Ride a horse</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_OpenContainer\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Open a container</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_PickUp\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Pick up</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_OpenDoor\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Open a door</>\n"
"<img id=\"Crosshair_DrinkBlood\"/> <RT_BlueMed>Drink blood</> (Vampire only)"
msgstr ""

