msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Crimes"
msgid ""
"The following actions are considered crimes and are reported as such if you "
"are seen doing them:\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Stealing items or horses</>\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Pickpocketing or lockpicking</>\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Trespassing or jailbreaking</>\n"
"• <RT_BlueMed>Assaulting or killing a non-hostile character</> (defending "
"yourself is not a crime)\n"
"\n"
"When a crime is reported, a <RT_BlueMed>bounty</> is placed on your head, "
"matching the importance of the crime. You also gain "
"<RT_BlueMed>Infamy</>.\n"
"\n"
"You have several options when caught by a Guard with a bounty on you:\n"
"\n"
"• You can <RT_BlueMed>pay off the bounty</> on your head. Stolen items will "
"be taken from you, even those you've stolen without getting caught.\n"
"\n"
"• You can decide to <RT_BlueMed>resist the arrest</>. Guards are very tough "
"and will attempt to kill anyone who resists arrest. Even if you manage to "
"escape, you will still be held accountable for the bounty next time.\n"
"\n"
"• You can agree to <RT_BlueMed>go to jail</>."
msgstr ""

