"the nickname lies a darker reality. You dabbled in magic just to survive, and "
"your quick wits allowed you to live until this day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_RangedAttacks"
msgid ""
"Those who prefer a stealthier approach to combat can equip a <RT_BlueMed>Bow "
"and some arrows</> to eliminate their targets <RT_BlueMed>from afar</>.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>shoot</>, first hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> to "
"<RT_BlueMed>draw</> your bow, aim precisely, then <RT_BlueMed>release</> and "
"the arrow will fly in that direction.\n"
"Releasing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> <RT_BlueMed>before the bow is "
"fully drawn</> will result in a <RT_BlueMed>slower projectile</> that quickly "
"falls to the ground.\n"
"\n"
"Shooting with a bow <RT_BlueMed>consumes arrows</>. They can be "
"<RT_BlueMed>retrieved from corpses</> or <RT_BlueMed>picked up</> on the "
"ground.\n"
"\n"
"A <RT_BlueMed>Journeyman</> in <RT_BlueMed>Marksman</> can "
"<RT_BlueMed>zoom</> by holding <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/> while aiming "
"for a more precise shot."
msgstr ""

