msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_BasicMovement+Jump"
msgid ""
"Understanding how to move around is essential to explore the vast plains of "
"Cyrodiil.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>To move forward and backwards</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementForward\"/> and <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementBackward\"/>.\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>strafe left and right</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementLeft\"/> and <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementRight\"/>.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>jump</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Jump\"/>.\n"
"You can <RT_BlueMed>Sneak</> by pressing <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Crouch\"/>. Press again to stop sneaking.\n"
"\n"
"You can <RT_BlueMed>Sprint</> to move a lot faster by <RT_BlueMed>pressing</> "
"<IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Sprint\"/> <RT_BlueMed>while moving</>. Press again "
"to stop sprinting.\n"
"\n"
"As you sprint, your Fatigue <RT_BlueMed>gradually depletes</>.\n"
"If your Fatigue <RT_BlueMed>runs out</>, you will <RT_BlueMed>no longer be "
"able to sprint</> and have to wait for your Fatigue to "
"<RT_BlueMed>regenerate</>.\n"
"\n"
"You can <RT_BlueMed>only sprint forward</>, not to the side or backwards."
msgstr ""

