msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_ActiveEffects"
msgid ""
"Up to three temporary active effects can be displayed on the lower left of "
"the screen, constantly displaying what is affecting you.\n"
"\n"
"You can view all <RT_BlueMed>spells, abilities, powers, diseases and magic "
"effects</> that are currently affecting you in the Active Effects page of the "
"<RT_BlueMed>Magic menu</>.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Abilities</> are nearly always active. They primarily come from "
"races, birthsigns, vampirism or quests.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Enchantments</> are applied when an enchanted piece of armor or "
"clothing is equipped.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Negative effects</> are often the result of diseases, curses or "
"poisons."
msgstr ""

