msgctxt ""
"ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_MeleeAndHand-To-HandWeapons"
msgid ""
"Weapons are the <RT_BlueMed>primary tools</> used in combat. There are plenty "
"to choose from, each with their own <RT_BlueMed>flavor and "
"benefits</>.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Daggers, Shortswords, Longswords and Claymores</> are "
"<RT_BlueMed>melee</> weapons governed by the <RT_BlueMed>Blade Skill</>. They "
"are swift and can weaken your opponents to your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>War Axes, Maces, Battle-Axes and Warhammers</> are "
"<RT_BlueMed>melee</> weapons governed by the <RT_BlueMed>Blunt Skill</>. They "
"are slower but deal more damage and can grant you protection against "
"attacks.\n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Bows</> are <RT_BlueMed>ranged</> weapons governed by the "
"<RT_BlueMed>Marksman Skill</>. Bows are the only weapons that allow you to "
"fight from afar.\n"
"\n"
"Your <RT_BlueMed>Attributes</> affect the damage you deal with "
"weapons.\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>War Axes, Battle-Axes, Longswords, Maces, Claymores and "
"Warhammers</> are affected by <RT_BlueMed>Strength</>.\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Daggers, Shortswords and Bows</> are affected by "
"<RT_BlueMed>Agility</>. \n"
"\n"
"Finally, for the bravest of warriors, it is also possible to forgo weapons "
"and fight with your bare-hands.\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Fistfighting</> is affected by <RT_BlueMed>Strength</> and the "
"<RT_BlueMed>Hand-to-hand Skill</>.\n"
"Hitting enemies with your fists <RT_BlueMed>depletes their Fatigue</>, making "
"it easier to stagger them."
msgstr ""

