msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_Dialogue"
msgid ""
"You can approach someone and interact with them to start a dialogue.\n"
"\n"
"On the left is displayed a list of topics you can discuss with this person. "
"<RT_BlueMed>New topics</> can be unlocked by <RT_BlueMed>talking with people "
"or completing quests</>.\n"
"A topic displayed in <RT_BlueMed>white</> means you've never asked this topic "
"to that person, or that person is hiding information. If it is "
"<RT_BlueMed>grey</>, you <RT_BlueMed>already know</> this character's answer "
"for that topic.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the person you are talking to and the <RT_BlueMed>services they "
"offer</>, various icons may be displayed beneath the list of topics. These "
"icons will bring up other interaction menus when selected.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dialog_Persuasion\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• PERSUASION •</>\n"
"Attempt to raise that person's Disposition towards you, by rhetorics or by "
"bribing. They may then be <RT_BlueMed>more inclined to share information</> "
"or <RT_BlueMed>accept better trades</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dialog_Trade\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• BARTER •</>\n"
"Ask this person what goods they are <RT_BlueMed>selling</>, or if they are "
"willing to <RT_BlueMed>buy</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dialog_SpellTrade\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• SPELL BARTER •</>\n"
"Ask this person what <RT_BlueMed>spells</> they are "
"<RT_BlueMed>selling</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dialog_Repair\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• REPAIR •</>\n"
"Ask this person to <RT_BlueMed>repair your weapons and armor</>, for a "
"price.\n"
"Merchants can repair both <RT_BlueMed>normal</> and <RT_BlueMed>enchanted</> "
"items.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dialog_Training\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• TRAINING •</>\n"
"Ask this person to <RT_BlueMed>train you</>.\n"
"A <RT_BlueMed>precious few</> are capable of <RT_BlueMed>teaching Skills</>, "
"and <RT_BlueMed>even fewer</> can teach the Skills at the <RT_BlueMed>highest "
"levels</>.\n"
"\n"
"<img id=\"Dialog_Recharge\" height=\"desired\" "
"width=\"desired\"/>\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>• RECHARGE •</>\n"
"Ask this person to <RT_BlueMed>recharge your enchanted items</>, for a fee. "
msgstr ""

