msgctxt "ST_AltarDynamicTexts/LOC_AD_Help_EntryContent_SoulTrapping"
msgid ""
"You can trap your enemies' soul into empty Soul Gems using the "
"<RT_BlueMed>Soul Trap</> magic effect.\n"
"\n"
"If a creature is killed while affected by a Soul Trap effect, its soul will "
"be <RT_BlueMed>stored</> in an empty Soul Gem in your inventory.\n"
"\n"
"The more powerful the creature, the greater the strength of its soul. "
"<RT_BlueMed>Stronger souls</> require <RT_BlueMed>bigger Soul Gems</> to be "
"stored.\n"
"Soul Gems come in various sizes. When trapping a soul, the "
"<RT_BlueMed>smallest</> Soul Gem that can receive that soul is always "
"<RT_BlueMed>prioritized</>. \n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Black Soul Gems</> are the only type of Soul Gems able to store "
"<RT_BlueMed>humanoid souls</>."
msgstr ""

