" Owyn,\n"
" \n"
" I know you don't believe me. I know you think I'm just some stupid kid who "
"doesn't know what she's talking about. But the truth is the truth -- you ARE "
"my father. \n"
" \n"
" One night with a scullery maid is all it takes. Or maybe your father "
"deserted you, too, and never taught you the basic lessons of life? Anyway, "
"the past is long forgotten. What matters now is that you come to terms with "
"the truth. I am your daughter, and I will join the Arena as a combatant.\n"
" \n"
" Maybe someday, when I'm Grand Champion, you'll see that we have the same "
"blood, the same tenacity. Until then day comes, I'll train every moment of "
"every day. All I want, all I ever wanted, was to make you proud.\n"
" <DIV align=\"right\">\n"
"Your loving daughter,\n"
" <DIV align=\"right\">\n"
"Branwen\n"
" "
msgstr ""

