" Stir in milk until it thickens.\n"
" Add any chopped fruit you want.\n"
" I like to mix in some harrada.\n"
" Bake it until the crust turns light brown.\n"
" Served best with mead.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_BookContent/LOC_BK_ClutterLoveLetter02"
msgid ""
"<FONT face=5>My dearest lover,\n"
"     Yesterday was wonderful. We should plan to see the gardens every week. "
"Your gift was very touching. I will wear it when we next meet. Until then, "
"you have my eternal love.\n"
" \n"
" <div align=\"right\">\n"
"You know who"
msgstr ""

