msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid " I have delivered the amulet to Dagail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
" I should now make my way back to New Sheoth and report my success to "
"Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"1. I can't kill anyone while I'm on the job. Animals and monsters are fair "
"game though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid "2. Never steal from anyone in the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE50_LOG3"
msgid ""
"3. Never steal from beggars and peasants, especially in the Waterfront. The "
"Gray Fox protects them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE80_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Walking</> while sneaking makes much less noise, increasing your "
"chance of remaining undetected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE78_LOG0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>You cannot carry any more items!</>\n"
"Your inventory weight exceeds the maximum encumbrance (displayed in the lower "
"center of the inventory page). Press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_InventoryMenu_Drop\"/> to drop items you do not need, to "
"remove the over-encumbred status."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE78_LOG1"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>You cannot carry any more items!</>\n"
"Your inventory weight exceeds the maximum encumbrance (displayed in the lower "
"center of the inventory page). Use <IA id=\"IA_UI_Default_ShiftKey\"/> + <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_Keyboard_InventoryMenu_Drop\"/> to drop items you do not "
"need, to remove the over-encumbered status."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE74_LOG0_0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Your Fatigue is low</> and you may not be able to perform "
"exhausting actions. The green bar at the bottom right displays your current "
"Fatigue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE74_LOG0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Your Fatigue is low</> and you may not be able to perform "
"exhausting actions. The green bar at the bottom right displays your current "
"Fatigue.\n"
"\n"
"Make sure opponents don't <RT_BlueMed>deplete</> your Fatigue or you'll be "
"<RT_BlueMed>staggered</> or <RT_BlueMed>knocked down</>.\n"
"Fatigue returns quickly on its own, but you can also restore it more quickly "
"by drinking potions or sleeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE72_LOG0_0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Your Health is low</> and you are about to die. The red bar at "
"the bottom displays your current Health."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE72_LOG0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Your Health is low</> and you are about to die. The red bar at "
"the bottom displays your current Health.\n"
"\n"
"Health regenerates outside combat. You can restore it more quickly by "
"drinking potions, casting healing spells or waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE73_LOG0_0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Your Magicka is low</> and you may not be able to cast spells. "
"The blue bar at the bottom left displays your current Magicka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE73_LOG0"
msgid ""
"<RT_BlueMed>Your Magicka is low</> and you may not be able to cast spells. "
"The blue bar at the bottom left displays your current Magicka.\n"
"\n"
"Magicka returns slowly on its own. You can restore it more quickly by "
"drinking potions or sleeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A Dremora named \"Mehrunes' Harbinger\" told me to kill a guard to prove my "
"worth in Mehrunes Dagon's eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A Dunmer named Fathis Ules has told me that Albert Jemane, Reynald and "
"Guilbert's father, stole a valuable item from the Thieves Guild many years "
"ago. He's offered to pay me well to return this item to him in Chorrol. "
"Fathis believes it's now hidden inside of Redguard Valley Cave, which he's "
"marked on my map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A Dunmer named Ralsa Norvalo has approached me in the Imperial City Temple "
"District and asked me to meet her husband Gilen. I refused for now, and she "
"told me if I change my mind, to come to her house where she'll fill me in on "
"all of the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A Dunmer named Ralsa Norvalo has approached me, and said that her husband "
"needs assistance in a matter of what she calls \"the utmost importance to the "
"safety of the citizens of the Imperial City\". She told me to meet Gilen at "
"the house of someone named Seridur. Apparently, all will be explained when I "
"get there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS93_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A High Elf Sorceress named Varulae has asked me to retrieve her crystal ball, "
"located in the hold of the ship the Serpent's Wake, which is moored up in "
"Anvil Bay. The crystal ball is in a chest in the ship's hold. I should be "
"careful, however -- the crew have all been slain, and now roam the ship's "
"decks as creatures of undeath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A High Elf named Earana in Chorrol has asked me to bring her a book so that "
"she may translate it. I need to travel to Cloud Top to find the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A Mythic Dawn undercover agent named Ranaline told me to go to Mingo Cave, "
"wearing the Mythic Dawn's attire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A bear attacked me in the sacred grove, but I made no attempts to fight back. "
"A cave has been revealed, and it would seem the Boots of the Crusader are "
"waiting inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar in Bravil told me that Fathis Aren has claimed the ruined tower "
"southeast of the city for himself. The door to the tower is impenetrable, but "
"rumor has it that Fathis uses a secret passage from inside the castle to get "
"to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE4_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar reminded me that I can find S'krivva in the Lonely Suitor Lodge, or "
"at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE8_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar reminded me that S'krivva can be found at the Lonely Suitors Lodge "
"and at the Arena. I'll need to speak with her to see if there are any special "
"Thievs Guild assignments available."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid "A beggar told me I could find S'krivva at the Lonely Suitor Lodge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar told me that Amantius Allectus lives in the Temple district, on the "
"far east side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE42_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar told me that Hlidara Mothril, Alessia Caro's chambermaid, might be "
"able to tell me where she keeps her ring. I'll have to sweet talk her though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG00FindThievesGuild_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar told me that if I want to find the Gray Fox, I should look for the "
"Garden of Dareloth in the Waterfront District of the Imperial City around "
"midnight. The Gray Fox is the only clue I have to the mysterious Thieves "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE12_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A beggar told me that there may be secret ways in the castle. I am supposed "
"to find the blacksmith. I'm not really sure why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE82_LOG0_0"
msgid ""
"A closed eye indicates you are <RT_BlueMed>undetected</>. The eye slowly "
"opens as you are about to be detected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE82_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A closed eye indicates you are <RT_BlueMed>undetected</>. The eye slowly "
"opens as you are about to be detected.\n"
"\n"
"If the eye is fully open and opaque, you have been "
"<RT_BlueMed>detected</>.\n"
"\n"
"When a <RT_BlueMed>fight begins</>, the eye will flicker and two chevrons "
"will appear on its sides."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE17_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A diary I've found contains a password to explore further, and seems to "
"indicate that some kind of army is amassing here, led by somebody named "
"Drothan.  If I can find the journal in his cabin, I may be able to learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A full day has passed, and I haven't made it to Boreal Stone Cave to stop "
"Raynil. I fear I may be too late. I should hasten there as soon as I can to "
"confirm my theory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A group calling themselves the Society of Concerned Merchants has hired me to "
"investigate a new store that's just opened up in the Market District with "
"ridiculously low prices. They suspect the owner must be doing something "
"illegal. I should pay a visit to Thoronir at The Copious Coinpurse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A guard told me about strange notes in the Imperial City's Talos Plaza. It "
"seems to be related to the Mythic Dawn. I should go there and try to find one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A guard, Gaius Prentus, has approached me. He tells me that the people here "
"have all returned from inside this strange gate, and all are now mad. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "A man has told me that Hermaeus Mora wishes for me to visit his shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid "A messenger has arrived for me in Sheogorath's throne room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk01_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A powerful magic is preventing me from going further. I should tell of my "
"findings to Ilav."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk01_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A priest named Ilav Dralgoner mentioned an Ayleid ruin, Beldaburo. He says "
"it's where these disappearances are occurring. I must investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A resident of Split has told me I should speak to Horkvir Bear-Arm to help "
"solve the problem of all the doubles in this town. There are two Horkvir Bear-"
"Arms in town, so I can speak to either one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A room in Vahtacen contains a pillar that reacts to magic. I need to figure "
"out how it works, but I must be careful so that I am not harmed. It's been "
"suggested that I should stay away from anything but simple, single-effect "
"spells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"A second Obelisk has activated. I need to shut it down to stop the Knights "
"from overwhelming the defenders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "A third Obelisk has activated. I need to shut it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10SanctuaryFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"According to Lucien Lachance, I will now receive my contracts, as well as any "
"rewards I may be owed,  by visiting secret dead drop locations scattered "
"around Cyrodiil. My next contract can be found in a hidden hollow inside the "
"moss-covered rock on the top of Hero Hill, which is to the southeast of Fort "
"Farragut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND01_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"According to Sir Amiel's journal, the Helm of the Crusader is located in "
"Pelinal's shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCFrostcragSpire_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"According to a deed that's been delivered to me, I've inherited a property "
"called Frostcrag Spire from a long-lost relative. I've marked its location on "
"my map. At the next opportunity, I should make my way out there and inspect "
"my new acquisition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCDeepscorn_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"According to a mysterious message that's been delivered to me, I've inherited "
"an underground lair called Deepscorn Hollow from a long-lost relative. It's "
"situated at the southernmost point of Cyrodiil, south of Leyawiin. I've "
"marked its location on my map. At the next opportunity, I should make my way "
"out there and inspect my new acquisition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09Retirement_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Adamus Phillida is dead. I may return now to the Sanctuary for my reward. If "
"I want to receive a bonus, however, there is one more task I must complete. "
"Phillida wears an Imperial Legion ring. I should take his finger, with the "
"ring still attached, and put it in the desk of Phillida's Imperial Legion "
"successor, in his office in the Imperial City. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Adrienne Berene has agreed to send a recommendation to the Arcane University "
"on my behalf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "Advice for puzzle number three."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ09_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Aelwin Merowald at the Weye Settlement needed 12 Rumare Slaughterfish Scales. "
"After berating me for fishing \"his\" waters, he traded me an amulet for the "
"scales."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ09_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Aelwin Merowald at the Weye Settlement southwest of the Imperial City is "
"looking to acquire 12 Rumare Slaughterfish Scales to sell to a customer. He's "
"asked me to do the legwork, as he's getting quite old and can't handle the "
"difficult task. The Rumare slaughterfish is a special breed of slaughterfish "
"that can only be found in Lake Rumare, directly north of Weye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE160_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I approached the Grove Of Reflection, a shadowy image of myself "
"appeared from the waters of the grove and attacked me. I defeated it, and now "
"the Tree of Shades is beckoning to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAVaermina_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I left an offering of a black soul gem, Vaermina's followers summoned "
"the Daedra, who spoke to me. Vaermina told me of an Orb that had been stolen "
"by the wizard Arkved. I am to travel to his tower, retrieve the Orb, and "
"bring it back to Vaermina."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I left the requested items at the Shrine, Haskill spoke to me. He told "
"me of the settlement of Border Watch. I am to simulate a prophecy by "
"committing two acts. I should speak to the shaman in the settlement to learn "
"about the K'Sharra prophecy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"After I left the requested items at the Shrine, Sheogorath spoke to me. He "
"told me of the settlement of Border Watch. I am to simulate a prophecy by "
"committing two acts. I should speak to the shaman in the settlement to learn "
"about the K'Sharra prophecy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMeridia_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I made the correct offering, Meridia appeared and spoke to me. The "
"Daedra told me of a cult of necromancers in the Howling Cave who have been "
"stealing from graves in order to raise an undead army. Meridia wants the "
"necromancers killed. I can reach them from a secret door in the back of the "
"cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHircine_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I made the required offering, Hircine was summoned, and spoke to me. He "
"told me that he desires the horn of a unicorn. I may be able to find a "
"unicorn in the Harcane Grove."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I provided the offering to Sanguine, the Daedra Prince spoke to me. "
"Sanguine believes that the Countess of Leyawiin is too stuffy, and wants me "
"to do something about it. She will be hosting a dinner party tomorrow, and I "
"am to sneak into the castle undetected and cast the spell of Stark Reality on "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After I touched the Sigil Stone, I appeared outside of Oblivion and back on "
"Tamriel. The gate has been destroyed. I should report my actions to Amminus "
"Gregori as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE80_LOG1"
msgid ""
"After I touched the Sigil Stone, I found myself outside of Oblivion and back "
"on Tamriel. The gate is now nowhere to be found. I should now speak with "
"Farwil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After Thadon rose to deliver an odd soliloquy, he clutched his heart and fell "
"to the ground dead. I should now collect as much of his tainted blood as "
"possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After asking around Bruma, I've discovered that Raynil has been staying at "
"Olav's Tap and Tack while he's been in town. The inn is located next to the "
"city gates. This should be my next destination if I'm to question Raynil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After discussing the futility of her plan, Selene has agreed to hand back the "
"control of the Bloated Float to Ormil. I should speak to Ormil to find out "
"what he wishes me to do with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After entering the farmhouse, I encountered Faustina who enticed me to remove "
"my weapons, armor and clothing and place them aside. Once I did so, she "
"yelled out and the rest of the gang entered the room fully armed and ready "
"for battle. I had no choice but to kill them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"After entering the farmhouse, I encountered Faustina who tried to convince me "
"to join in on their scheme. When I told her no, she yelled out and the rest "
"of the gang entered the room fully armed and ready for battle. I had no "
"choice but to kill them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE60_LOG2"
msgid ""
"After entering the farmhouse, I encountered Faustina who tried to entice me "
"to remove my weapons, armor and clothing and place them aside. Knowing this "
"was a ruse, I refused. She yelled out and the rest of the gang entered the "
"room fully armed and ready for battle. I had no choice but to kill them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After giving him the four Dreamworld Elements, I've succeeded in convincing "
"Henantier he was in a dream, and we've returned to the real world. I should "
"speak to him now that we're back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After informing Sheogorath of my victory, Syl, the Duchess of Dementia became "
"furious. Before she stormed out of the Sacellum, she threatened that we "
"hadn't heard the last of her. I should continue speaking to Sheogorath to "
"receive my rewards of office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After informing Sheogorath of my victory, Thadon, the Duke of Mania became "
"furious. Before he departed the Sacellum, he threatened that we hadn't heard "
"the last of him. I should speak with Sheogorath about the next step in his "
"plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After questioning Velwyn, I've learned that his grandfather dabbled in "
"necromancy and was killed when the townspeople of Anvil found out. Strangely, "
"the body was never recovered. Since then, the house has been cursed. I need "
"to convince Velwyn to come back with me to Anvil and lift the curse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCFrostcragSpire_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After reading the dusty tome, I've learned that I can purchase everything I "
"need to restore this place to its former glory from Aurelinwae at the Mystic "
"Emporium in the Market District of the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCDeepscorn_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After reading the journal, I've learned that I can acquire everything I need "
"to restore this place to its original state from Rowley Eardwulf at the "
"Wawnet Inn just outside the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After recovering the Mace of the Crusader, I found the minions of Umaril "
"attacking the Chapel of Zenithar. They were all defeated and the Leyawiin's "
"Chapel escaped desecration. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After searching Roland's home, I've found a letter written to Roland from his "
"girlfriend. It mentions a cabin where the two would meet. It's located east "
"of the Imperial City in the Great Forest. I think this may be where Roland "
"could be hiding. I should head out there immediately before he has a chance "
"to escape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After seeing the orders, the Akaviri Commander vanished. The ruins are now "
"silent and at peace. After so many years, the Akaviri's final mission has "
"been completed.  I should proceed ahead and search for the Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After showing the macabre manifest to Thoronir, he agreed to stop meeting "
"Agarmir. He also told me that Agarmir said he had \"something important\" to "
"do this very day. I think I need to check out the local graveyard, as the "
"last name on the list was here in the Imperial City. I should return with one "
"more piece of evidence of Agarmir's crime to confirm the manifest's contents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After speaking to Gogan, I've learned that there are at least two gang "
"members, an Imperial and a Nord. They lure men to a remote location, trick "
"them into removing their clothes and equipment, and then ambush them while "
"they are defenseless. I think at this point I have enough information to pay "
"a visit to The Flowing Bowl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After touching the Altar of Arden-Sul, there was a brief flash of light. "
"Arctus, the High Priest of Dementia, has now proclaimed me Duchess of "
"Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"After touching the Altar of Arden-Sul, there was a brief flash of light. "
"Arctus, the High Priest of Dementia, has now proclaimed me Duke of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After touching the Altar of Arden-Sul, there was a brief flash of light. "
"Dervenin, the High Priest of Mania, has now proclaimed me Duchess of Mania. I "
"should speak with Sheogorath about the next step in his plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"After touching the Altar of Arden-Sul, there was a brief flash of light. "
"Dervenin, the High Priest of Mania, has now proclaimed me Duke of Mania.  I "
"should speak with Sheogorath about the next step in his plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After touching the altar, I heard the voice of Lorgren Benirus. He said he "
"wished to atone for his past and make peace with the Nines. All he wished was "
"to be whole again. This must be the way to lift the curse from Benirus Manor. "
"I should touch his skeleton while I carry the bony hand and put an end to "
"this madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"After touching the painting Rythe had been working on, I suddenly found "
"myself standing in a strange forest. It looks familiar, like the Great Forest "
"in the heart of Cyrodiil, but something is different about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Agarmir has been slain. Since the penalty for grave robbing is death, it "
"somehow seems as though justice has been done. I should search the gravesite "
"for anything potentially incriminating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Agata has asked that I attempt to question Dagail about her father, to find "
"out what his connection to the amulet may be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS52_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Agronak gro-Malog has been killed, and my quest to discover his true identity "
"can never be completed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS52_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Agronak gro-Malog, the Imperial Arena Grand Champion, has sent me on a quest "
"to find proof of his noble birthright. I must journey now to the west, to a "
"place called Crowhaven, and begin my search. Gro-Malog has provided me with a "
"key I will surely need, but even he is unsure what it opens. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ahdarji is offering 100 gold coins for her ring. The ring was stolen by "
"Amusei. I wonder if that is the same Argonian that I competed against to get "
"into the guild? I'll have to look around for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ahdarji was very grateful and rewarded me nicely for the ring. I get the "
"feeling she hates Argonians though. No wonder Amusei had trouble with her. "
"Now all I have to do is report back to S'krivva in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ahjazda believes the world is ending soon, so she's gathering supplies. She "
"would like me to find three items she's still missing: the Amulet of "
"Disintegration, the Ring of Desiccation, and the Calming Pants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Ahjazda has rewarded me for bringing her all the items she requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE201_LOG0"
msgid "Ahjazda is dead and will no longer need the items she requested I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ajum-Kajin has died. I will be unable to learn any more from him. Oreyn is "
"unhappy I took the interrogation too far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ajum-Kajin seems unwilling to answer me as to the source of the Blackwood "
"Company's power. I will have to persuade him further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "Ajum-Kajin will now return with me to Modryn Oreyn's house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMarksman_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Alawen has agreed to teach me, but only if I acquire a normal Elven bow and "
"bring it to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMarksman_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Alawen is dead. I have no hope of being taught more about Marksman skills now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Aldos Othran has been slain by a Cheydinhal guard. He had led me to his old "
"house, where he exchanged heated words with the guards. During the argument, "
"Aldos pulled a knife and the guard put him down. I should tell Llevana the "
"sad news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Aleron owed a great deal of money to an Orc usurer named Kurdan gro-Dragol. "
"He went there a day ago to beg for more time, and hasn't returned since. "
"Kurdan gro-Dragol usually frequents The Lonely Suitor Lodge, which is close "
"by. Perhaps I should pay him a visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlade_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Alix Lencolia has refused to train me, saying that he's never heard of me. "
"I'll need to make a name for myself, one way or the other, before he'll offer "
"his services."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlade_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Alix Lencolia has said he's heard of me, and so has offered to train me in "
"the use of Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlade_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Alix Lencolia is no more. I can be taught nothing more about my skill with "
"Blades now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"All of the Demented residents of Split are dead. I should return to Horkvir "
"Bear-Arm for my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE70_LOG1"
msgid ""
"All of the Manic residents of Split are dead. I should return to Horkvir Bear-"
"Arm for my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE53_LOG0"
msgid ""
"All of the cursed Blades of Sancre Tor have been destroyed. Their freed "
"spirits have gone to the Shrine of Tiber Septim to try to dispel the "
"enchantment laid upon it by the Underking long ago. I should go to the Shrine "
"at once to see if they succeed in their final quest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"All of the guests are dead, and no one knew I was the killer. I must now "
"return to the Sanctuary and speak with Ocheeva to receive my reward and bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"All of the guests have been killed, but someone discovered I was the "
"assassin. I must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with Ocheeva to finish "
"out the contract. Unfortunately, I will receive no bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "All of the priests of Arkay are dead. I should return to the shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"All of the rats in Arvena Thelas' basement are dead. I've failed my contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE140_LOG0"
msgid ""
"All of your possessions have been <RT_BlueMed>confiscated</> by the "
"guards.\n"
"You will get them back when you have served your sentence.\n"
"Go to sleep to <RT_BlueMed>begin serving your sentence</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE140_LOG1"
msgid ""
"All of your possessions have been <RT_BlueMed>confiscated</>, you will get "
"them back when you will be released."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Althel the archer on the parapet has no arrows. She won't accept normal "
"arrows. I'll have to find her arrows somewhere. She is perfectly positioned "
"to fire into the Fanatic raiders. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Althel was grateful for the arrows. She is sure to bring down some of the "
"invaders with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCHorseArmor_STAGE41_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Although I had no horse, Snak gra-Bura outfitted her old nag with steel armor "
"and gave it to me free of charge. From now on, she will outfit any legally "
"owned horse that I bring to her with Steel or Elven armor for 500 gold. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Although I tried to goad Petilius into fighting me, he would not. Perhaps I "
"will have to try when he is in a different state of mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE180_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Although my actions removed Ulrich from his position as Captain of the Guard, "
"Garrus didn't approve of my method."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Alves Uvenim identified the cursed staff as the Staff of the Everscamp. The "
"only way to rid one's self of the staff is if someone else willingly accepts "
"it. Finally, she pointed out that the only way to fully break the curse would "
"be to return it to where it came from; Darkfathom Cave. I should take this "
"information back to Rosentia immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amiable Fanriene has asked me to find him some place to sleep outside. I "
"should find someone who sleeps outside and ask for their help in finding a "
"good place to sleep outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amiable Fanriene is grateful that I have found him a safe place to sleep "
"outside. He should be able to get some sleep now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amminus Gregori has told me that Count Indarys wishes to speak to me "
"personally. I should head to Castle Cheydinhal now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amminus told me that Farwil heads up a group of soldiers calling themselves "
"\"The Knights of the Thorn\". This group seems to be a splinter faction of "
"the town guard that maintains a lodge just outside the city. From the "
"Amminus's snide comments, it doesn't sound like they're appreciated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amminus told me that the only way to close the Oblivion Gate is to locate the "
"Sigil Stone that resides within. Once the stone is in hand, the Gate will "
"cease to exist. I'll have to keep this in mind when I venture through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei and I escaped from Castle Skingrad. Let's see if he will keep his word "
"and tell me about the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei has given me another message from the Gray Fox. I am to meet him at "
"Ganrendel's house in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei has given me another message from the Gray Fox. I am to meet him at "
"Othrelo's house in the Elven Gardens district in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei is in jail here in Leyawiin. The only way I'm going to find that ring "
"is to talk to him there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei knows where the ring is, but he won't tell me unless I get him a "
"lockpick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei sought me out and delivered a message from the Gray Fox. I am to meet "
"him at the home of Malintus Ancrus in Chorrol. He has another task for me. It "
"seems Amusei has finally straightened up and joined the Thieves Guild. He is "
"even trusted enough to deliver messages for the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei told me that the ring was inscribed on the inside with the name "
"Alessia Caro, a.k.a. the Countess of Leyawiin. Apparently he tried to sell it "
"back to her. When he went to deliver the ring, he was arrested and thrown "
"into jail. She kept the ring. It must be somewhere in the castle, assuming "
"she isn't wearing it. I'll need to find someone who can tell exactly where. "
"This might be a good time to revisit Ahdarji, or to see what the beggars know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE52_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Amusei was grateful for being saved from the Pale Lady and told me where to "
"find the book. It is under a bush, behind Nerastarel's house, near a well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"An Obelisk has activated in the Palace courtyard! It seems that Order is "
"launching its final attempt to take control of the Shivering Isles. I need to "
"defeat Jyggalag and his minions once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"An Orc in the Leyawiin Castle County Hall claims to be a knight. Marius Caro, "
"Count Leyawiin, asked me to find out why she is there, and to report back to "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"An orc named Mazoga sent me to find Weebam-Na and tell him to meet Mazoga in "
"the County Hall of Castle Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ancotar gave me a ring and suggested I wear it while casting the Reverse "
"Invisibility scroll, to protect me from any side effects. He didn't mention "
"what those side effects might be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE42_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ancotar gave me another Reverse Invisibility scroll. He said it was his last "
"one. I need to make sure to stand in the middle of Aleswell when I use it "
"this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ancotar is dead, and I have no way of reversing the invisibility he cast on "
"the inhabitants of Aleswell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE46_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ancotar refused to give me a third Reverse Invisibility scroll after I wasted "
"the first two. I should return to Aleswell and tell Diram Serethi the bad "
"news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlock_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Andragil has agreed to help me train."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlock_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Andragil is dead. I can be taught no more to improve my Block skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Angry over Syl's replacement as the Duchess of Dementia, Thadon has betrayed "
"Sheogorath and joined with the forces of Order. According to Thadon, Order "
"has already taken the Fringe. I should travel to the Fringe and investigate "
"his claims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE5_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Angry over Thadon's replacement as the Duke of Mania, Syl has betrayed "
"Sheogorath and joined with the forces of Order. According to Syl, Order has "
"already taken the Fringe. I should travel to the Fringe and investigate her "
"claims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE60_LOG2"
msgid "Another Obelisk has activated. I should shut it down to weaken Jyggalag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid "Another Obelisk has activated. I should shut it down to weaken Jyggylag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Another Obelisk has activated. Jyggalag appeared to grow stronger when it "
"activated. Perhaps shutting down the Obelisks will weaken him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Another Obelisk has activated. Jyggylag appeared to grow stronger when it "
"activated. Perhaps shutting down the Obelisks will weaken him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Anya Herrick has named Ma'zaddha as being involved in some sort of plot "
"against Lady Syl. I should find and speak to him. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Anya Herrick refuses to speak with me. I need Herdir with me to help convince "
"her to talk. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Apparently Ahdarji can use the ring to read missives and other castle "
"documents written by the Count. She sells the information to other Counts of "
"Cyrodiil. Now that the cat is out of the bag, so to speak, she has upped the "
"reward to 200 gold coins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Apparently there is a corrupt Imperial Watchman in the city. Luronk gro-"
"Glurzog in the Temple district was complaining about him. Luronk ran afoul of "
"him at Jensine's Merchandise in the market district. Luronk didn't have a "
"name, but maybe Jensine does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE11_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Apparently there is a corrupt Imperial Watchman in the city. Ruslan in the "
"Temple district was complaining about him. Ruslan ran afoul of him at "
"Jensine's Merchandise in the market district. Ruslan didn't have a name, but "
"maybe Jensine does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG12Gate_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Arch-Mage Traven has been informed of Mucianus Alias' fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Areldur, a priest of Stendarr, has told me that the Gauntlets of the Crusader "
"cannot be moved. I should speak with Kellen, a descendant of Sir Casimir, to "
"learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arielle Jurard has instructed me to sleep at the Brina Cross Inn, then travel "
"along the Gold Road towards Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand Christophe has granted me a membership in the Thieves Guild. Amusei is "
"threatening to become a freelance thief. Armand has given me the rules of the "
"guild:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand Christophe has granted me a membership in the Thieves Guild. "
"Methredhel is irritated, but I think she'll get over it. Amusei is "
"threatening to become a freelance thief. Armand has given me the rules of the "
"guild:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02BloodPrice_STAGE21_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand has kicked me out of the Thieves Guild for violating one of the three "
"rules. I killed someone while attempting to recover the tax records. Blood "
"price is 1000 gold coins for each murder. I have to pay it to get back into "
"the guild. Unfortunately, he will only talk to me after midnight in the "
"Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03BloodPrice_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand is extremely unhappy. I have to pay a blood price of 1000 gold coins "
"for each resident of Cheydinhal's Chapel that I killed. Until I do, I am out "
"of the Thieves Guild. Unfortunately, he will only talk to me after midnight "
"in the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand is giving Amusei and I one more chance we have to steal Rohssan's "
"sword from somewhere in the Imperial City and bring it back to him. The first "
"one of us to do that will also be admitted into the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand is no longer my primary Thieves Guild contact. My new contact is "
"S'krivva, in the city of Bravil. I can find her either at home or at the "
"Lonely Suitor Lodge. I should ask her if there are any commission jobs for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02taxes_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand of the Thieves Guild has asked me to recover the tax records and taxes "
"collected by the Imperial Watch. They are being held by an over-zealous "
"Captain named Hieronymus Lex in the South Watchtower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand of the Thieves Guild has asked me to steal the bust of Llathasa "
"Indarys from Cheyhindal. They will pay 100 gold coins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand thanked me for my help in exposing Myvryna Arano as the informant. He "
"promoted me to Bandit in the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand told me that he won't have another commission job for me until I sell "
"more stolen property to Ongar the fence. I'll need about 100 gold worth of "
"stolen goods before he will trust me sufficiently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Armand told me that he won't have any commission jobs for me until I sell "
"more stolen property to Ongar the fence. I'll need about 50 gold worth of "
"stolen goods before he will trust me sufficiently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arnora told me about a particular crime that she was forced to help her "
"lover, Jorundr, commit. They stole some gold and buried it, but Jorundr was "
"arrested. When she returned to the hiding place, the gold was gone. Jorundr "
"must have moved it. Now she wants to recover the money. I should go to Bruma "
"Castle Dungeons and speak to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE180_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arnora's death occurred before I struck a bargain with Jorundr and if he "
"would have rewarded me before, he certainly won't now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arquen and I have been teleported to the Cheydinhal Sanctuary. I should speak "
"now with Arquen, who will serve as my servant and guide in the days to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arquen has informed me that she will recite an incantation that will allow "
"the Black Hand an audience with the Night Mother. Arquen also realizes this "
"is all very new to me, and told me I'd be fine as long as I just followed "
"along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arvena Thelas has rats in her basement, but they're not the problem. She "
"loves the rats, but she's been finding them dead. She would like me to go "
"down and investigate what's been happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arvena Thelas was glad to know what was killing her rats, but she still "
"doesn't feel safe. She'd like me to speak with Pinarus Inventius about "
"hunting down mountain lions in the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Arvena now believes that her neighbor, Quill-Weave, might be responsible. "
"Arvena has seen her sneaking around outside the house at night. I should "
"watch Quill-Weave and see what she's doing. I should not let Quill-Weave see "
"me, though, lest she get suspicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Aryarie at the Mage's Guild has told me she is glad someone from the Fighters "
"Guild is going to fulfill her contract. She was unwilling to hire the "
"Blackwood Company, as she disliked their reputation. She would like me to "
"find 10 portions of imp gall, and suggests Robber's Glen Cave might be a good "
"spot to hunt for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Aryarie was pleased with the Imp Gall I brought her. As an extra reward, "
"she's given me a Ring of Aegis. I should return to Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ArenaDialogue_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"As Arena Grand Champion, I can fight in weekly matches against various "
"creatures. All I need do is see Ysabel Andronicus in the Arena Bloodworks and "
"tell her I'm ready for a match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE190_LOG0"
msgid ""
"As Dyus requested, I've taken a branch of the Tree of Shades. I should now "
"seek out Ciirta in the Howling Halls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"As a reward for getting him home safely with the Brush of Truepaint, Rythe "
"presented me with a fitting reward; his Apron of Adroitness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"As a reward for my loyal service to the Dark Brotherhood, Vicente Valtieri is "
"willing to turn me into a vampire. If this is my wish, I should speak to "
"Valtieri about the Dark Gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"At Fisherman's Rock, Mazoga got into a fight with four bandits. Now all four "
"bandits are dead. Now I must report to Marius Caro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE20_LOG2"
msgid ""
"At least one survivor of the assault on the Oblivion Gate has been taken to "
"the large tower within Oblivion. I need to search for him there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "Atrabhi living on the Dementia side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid "Atrabhi living on the Mania side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Audens Avidius attacked me. He was that crooked guard in the Imperial City "
"that had threatened Luronk and Ruslan. He must have escaped from prison. "
"Sadly, I was forced to kill him. He kept raving about how he would get me for "
"putting him in jail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE91_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Audens Avidius has been arrested. That should make Jensine, Ruslan, and "
"Luronk happy. Hopefully it will serve as a lesson for any other guard that is "
"thinking about shaking down innocent citizens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE119_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Audens Avidius is dead. He was that crooked guard in the Imperial City that "
"had threatened Luronk and Ruslan. He must have escaped from prison. He kept "
"raving about how he would get me for putting him in jail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAAzura_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azura thanked me for allowing her followers the peace of death. She rewarded "
"me with Azura's Star."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan has given me a contract to escort Elante of Alinor, a scholar doing "
"research on Daedra. I am to meet her at the entrance to Brittlerock Cave, "
"northeast of Sutch, and protect her while she explores inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Thieves_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan has given me a contract to find the lair of some thieves near Anvil. I "
"am to travel with another fairly new recruit, Maglir. I should go to Anvil "
"first and see what information I can learn about the thieves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC05Stone_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan has paid me the balance of the contract. He tells me that he has no "
"further contracts to offer, but I should speak with Burz gro-Khash in "
"Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC02Protect_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan has told me about a contract in Anvil, at Norbert Lelles store, Lelles' "
"Quality Merchandise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan has told me of a contract in Anvil with Arvena Thelas. I should speak "
"to her about a problem with rats in her basement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC05Stone_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan has told me to report to the Chapel of Talos in Bruma and speak with "
"the priest Cirroc about a contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Azzan was pleased with my efforts escorting Elante of Alinor. He has paid out "
"the contract to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Thieves_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Azzan was pleased with our efforts, and has paid the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid "Azzan was unhappy that I allowed harm to come to Elante of Alinor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Barbas, the Hound of Clavicus Vile, has spoken to me through the figurine "
"that appeared in my pack. He tells me that returning the Umbra Sword to "
"Clavicus Vile is a mistake, likely to cause great ruin to Vile's domain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Barthel Gernand thanked me profusely for ending the goblin threat to "
"Cropsford. He promised me a hero's welcome in Cropsford once they have had a "
"chance to establish the settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bat gro-Orkul is the warden of the armory. He refuses to give anything out. "
"No wonder this place couldn't defend itself! I need to find a way to get "
"those arrows for Althel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE36_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Baurus has learned that the enemy is a secret cult of Mehrunes Dagon "
"worshippers known as the Mythic Dawn. He will continue to track down agents "
"in the Imperial City. I should talk to Tar-Meena at the Arcane University, an "
"expert in daedric cults. She may be able to tell me more about how to find "
"the Mythic Dawn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE34_LOG0"
msgid "Baurus wants me to search the dead agent's body. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ02_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Baurus, one of the Emperor's bodyguards, told me that Jauffre was the head of "
"the Blades, an order of knights sworn to protect the Emperors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BloodPrice_STAGE11_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Because Amantius Allectus died during my theft, I must pay Armand the blood "
"price of 500 gold coins. Otherwise I will be denied membership. "
"Unfortunately, he will only talk to me after midnight in the Garden of "
"Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE45_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Because Bolwing is dead, I have no way to get more information about the Fork "
"of Horripilation. Maybe I'll get lucky and find it during my travels in the "
"Shivering Isles. Sadly, that is the best the I can hope for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BloodPrice_STAGE16_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Because Rohssan died during my theft, I must pay Armand the blood price of "
"500 gold coins. Otherwise I will be denied membership. Unfortunately, Armand "
"will only talk to me after midnight in the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Because of my crimes against the Fighters Guild, I have been expelled. I "
"should speak with Vilena Donton in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Because of my crimes against the Fighters Guild, I have been permanently "
"expelled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Before I can claim the Throne of Madness and stop the forces of Order, I must "
"remake the Staff of Sheogorath. Haskill has advised me to seek out a remnant "
"of the great library of Jyggalag in Knifepoint Hollow. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Before exiting Xedilian, I was attacked by three unusual beings in equally "
"strange armor. I should ask Kiliban if he knows anything about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Before you can use the bow, you will need arrows. Search the nearby skeleton "
"to see if you can find some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bejeen denies knowing anything about the Eye of Nocturnal, and tells me "
"Weebam-Na knows nothing, either. Perhaps I should try to listen in on their "
"conversations, and see if they offer any clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE36_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bejeen is dead, so I can't learn where she has hidden the Eye of Nocturnal... "
"except by searching every dark, wet place in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Benirus Manor is haunted! I was awakened by ghosts that attacked me as I "
"slept. As I awoke, I thought I heard a crash from downstairs. I should search "
"the house and investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Berich Inian has agreed to lead me through Kvatch. I need to follow him "
"through the city to reach the guard house, and gain access to the Castle "
"Gatehouse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Berich Inian has died. I need to get the guard house key off his body and "
"proceed on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE43_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bhisha is dead. Fortunately, Ushnar didn't care how he died. I'll need to let "
"Ushnar know that Bhisha won't trouble him any more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Biene Amelion has told me that she wishes for me to retrieve her "
"grandfather's ceremonial sword and cuirass from their family tomb. She is in "
"debt to a local merchant, and she wishes to sell the sword and cuirass to pay "
"off the debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE45_STAGE205_LOG0"
msgid "Big Head is dead. I can never return the Fork of Horripilation to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE45_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Big-Head has asked me to find the Fork of Horripilation. It's obviously "
"important to him, and he has offered me a reward for its return. Big-Head has "
"given me a charm that should allow me to speak with the beggar Bolwing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE20_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard, said he had been out on patrol in the "
"streets of Chorrol that night. In addition, he mentioned seeing Chanel spend "
"a good deal of time in the castle's West Tower. But when he had confronted "
"her about it, she said that was where she had been performing some of her "
"magic research. I should continue questioning the suspects the Countess "
"recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE22_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard, said he had been out on patrol in the "
"streets of Chorrol that night. In addition, he mentioned seeing Chanel spend "
"a good deal of time in the castle's West Tower. But when he had confronted "
"her about it, she said that was where she had been performing some of her "
"magic research. I should continue questioning the suspects the Countess "
"recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE30_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard, said he had been out on patrol in the "
"streets of Chorrol that night. In addition, he mentioned seeing Chanel spend "
"a good deal of time in the castle's West Tower. But when he had confronted "
"her about it, she said that was where she had been performing some of her "
"magic research. I should continue questioning the suspects the Countess "
"recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE32_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard, said he had been out on patrol in the "
"streets of Chorrol that night. In addition, he mentioned seeing Chanel spend "
"a good deal of time in the castle's West Tower. But when he had confronted "
"her about it, she said that was where she had been performing some of her "
"magic research. I should continue questioning the suspects the Countess "
"recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE35_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard, said he had been out on patrol in the "
"streets of Chorrol that night. In addition, he mentioned seeing Chanel spend "
"a good deal of time in the castle's West Tower. But when he had confronted "
"her about it, she said that was where she had been performing some of her "
"magic research. I've spoken to all of the possible suspects and witnesses. "
"Now, I should concentrate on gathering the clues if I'm to solve the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Black Brugo is dead. I must report to Marius Caro and become a Knight-Errant "
"of the White Stallion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DABoethia_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Boethia has told me that I am to participate in the Tournament of Ten Bloods. "
"When I am ready, I should enter the nearby portal to Oblivion, and I will be "
"sent to one of his realms for the battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DABoethia_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Boethia was pleased with my performance in the Tournament of Ten Bloods. He "
"has rewarded me with the enchanted sword, Goldbrand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE42_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Both commanders have promised to light the Flame of Agnon for me if I help "
"them defeat their rivals. Now I need to decide which side I will help, and "
"how."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE62_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Both commanders have promised to light the Flame of Agnon for me if I help "
"them defeat their rivals. Now I need to decide which side I will help, and "
"how."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bothiel gave me a piece of paper Falcar dropped when he visited her about the "
"Revenant mentioned in the Necromancer's book. I should show the note to "
"Raminus Polus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCOrrery_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bothiel has been given the Dwarven Artifacts necessary for the Orrery. I "
"should give her a day to make the necessary repairs, and then visit the "
"Orrery again at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bradon's wife, Erline, told me her husband is innocent. She says that he "
"simply works at night, and sleeps during the day. She also suspects that "
"someone must have planted the body. She seemed to cast a suspicious light on "
"Raynil, whom she says she recognizes. I think I should locate Raynil and ask "
"him some questions as well. I should start with some of the merchants and "
"innkeepers in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingDestruction_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Bralsa Andaren is dead. I can no longer be taught more about Destruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Brithaur has refused to stop his crime spree because his \"collection\" isn't "
"complete. I may be able to use this to my advantage. I need to bring five "
"Flawless Pearls to him. Otherwise, I may have to seek more creative or "
"violent means to obtain Earil's reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "Brithaur is dead. I should tell Earil that he is no longer a problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE27_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Brother Holger has agreed to show me the entrance to the catacombs. I should "
"follow him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "Burd and I have reached the Sigil Stone chamber. Now to close the Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC06Courier_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has given me a contract to deliver a weapons shipment to "
"Fighters Guild members in the Desolate Mine northwest of Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has given me a contract to find and kill some fugitives from a "
"prison break that have been menacing Bravil. I should go there and see what I "
"can learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has given me a contract to go to Harlun's Watch, near "
"Cheydinhal, and investigate the disappearances of some of the local populace. "
"I should speak to Drarana Thelis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC09Ogres_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has given me a contract to help Lord Rugdumph gro-Shurgak find "
"his daughter, Lady Rogbut gra-Shurgak. I can find Lord Rugdumph at his estate "
"near Lake Arrius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has given me a contract to retrieve an heirloom for Biene "
"Amelion, who lives in Water's Edge, a small settlement near Leyawiin. I "
"should report to her for further details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has paid me the balance of the contract. He tells me that he "
"has no further contracts to offer, but I should speak with Azzan in Sutch, if "
"I have not already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash has paid me the balance of the contract. He tells me that he "
"has no further contracts to offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash was impressed with my efforts in tracking down and killing the "
"fugitives. He has paid me the balance of the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC09Ogres_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash was pleased with my efforts in retrieving Lady Rogbut gra-"
"Shurgak, and he paid me what was owed on the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC06Courier_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Burz gro-Khash was pleased with my efforts, and has paid me for completing "
"the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"By killing everyone in Bleaker's Way, I've spoiled Mephala's scheme, and "
"spoiled any chance of gaining her favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"By making Grommok think that he actually died and became a ghost, I've driven "
"him insane. Now that all of the adventurers have been dealt with, I should "
"speak to Kiliban."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Captain Burd and I have entered the Oblivion Gate. I need to accompany him to "
"the sigil stone and show him how to close the Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Captain Burd and his men are heading into the Oblivion Gate with me. I need "
"to accompany Burd to the Sigil Stone chamber of the Oblivion Gate and show "
"him how to close it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Captain Burd and his men are ready to help me close the Oblivion Gate. I just "
"need to let Burd know when I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Captain Burd thanked me for my help, and said that he and his guardsmen will "
"do their best to close any new Oblivion Gates that open near Bruma. I should "
"report my success to Jauffre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Captain Burd told me that no strangers were in town, although he said that "
"Jearl had recently returned from a trip. I should search Jearl's house for "
"anything that might reveal more about the activities of Mythic Dawn agents in "
"Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Captain Burd told me that no strangers were in town, although he said that "
"Jearl had recently returned from a trip. I should talk to Jearl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG16Amulet_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Caranya was a traitor to the Mages Guild, and intended to deliver the Amulet "
"to the King of Worms. I need to get out of Fort Ontus and take the Amulet "
"back to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE170_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Carius mentioned that Raynil has slipped through their grasp and made good "
"his escape from the area. They will keep watch for him, but they doubt he "
"will return. I'm afraid I'll never see him again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Carius told me that Raynil was seen leaving Bruma and heading west. According "
"to the journal, the cave where the artifact is stashed is in that direction. "
"Carius mentioned that the only cave in that direction that matches the "
"journal's description is Boreal Stone Cave. Carius also feels I have only a "
"day before Raynil can make good his escape, so I must get there quickly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE34_LOG1_1"
msgid ""
"Cast it by pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Cast\"/>. Clairvoyance can guide "
"you towards the next step of your journey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Castle Kvatch is now safely under Savlian Matius' control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10SpecialWizard_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Celedaen is dead. I must pick up my reward and next contract at the dead drop "
"located in an old sack hidden in the bushes beneath the Great Oak, in the "
"city of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Centuries ago, a great battle took place in Anvil Bay. In the battle, the "
"legendary pirate Torradan ap Dugal, the captain of the infamous Black Flag, "
"was defeated by the first Count of Anvil. Rumors have been circulating of a "
"hidden underground cavern beneath Castle Anvil. If the rumors are to be "
"believed, then the final resting place of Captain Dugal and his ship have "
"been uncovered. I should investigate these rumors as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQDragonArmor_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Chancellor Ocato has ordered a suit of Imperial Dragon armor forged for me in "
"gratitude for the services I rendered to the Empire during the Oblivion "
"Crisis. It will be waiting for me at the armory in the Imperial Legion "
"Compound in two weeks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE60_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Chanel seems to have painting supplies concealed in a lectern in her room. "
"The fact they're concealed seems suspicious. I now have enough clues to make "
"an accusation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE40_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Chanel seems to have painting supplies concealed in a lectern in her room. "
"The fact they're concealed seems suspicious. I think I should continue "
"searching for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Chanel seems to have painting supplies concealed in a lectern in her room. "
"The fact they're concealed seems suspicious. I think I should continue "
"searching for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Chanel was pleased that I didn't turn her in to the Countess. She told me "
"that as a reward, she'd paint a portrait for me, but it'll take three weeks. "
"I should return to Castle Chorrol at that time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE15_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Check Captain Renault's body to find a <RT_BlueMed>weapon</>. To open a "
"container or loot a body, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Actions_Activate\"/>. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE140_LOG1"
msgid "Ciirta is dead. Taking her eye should be a simple matter now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Cindanwe of Fellmoor is dead. I should check her corpse to see if she had "
"anything interesting on her when she died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE65_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Cindanwe of Fellmoor is dead. I should speak with Ranarr-Jo to tell him the "
"mission is accomplished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Claude Maric says that Umbacano has also hired him to retrieve the carving "
"from the High Fane, which Maric identified as Malada in the Valus Mountains. "
"Maric warned me that Malada is very dangerous, and advised that I read \"The "
"Cleansing of the Fane\" before I go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE33_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Claude Maric seems to know where the High Fane is located. Perhaps I can "
"persuade him to tell me what he knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Clavicus Vile appreciated my efforts. He has taken the Umbra Sword and "
"rewarded me with the Masque of Clavicus Vile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Clavicus Vile was not pleased that I elected not to return to him the Umbra "
"Sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE26_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Click on an item to equip it. Click again to unequip it. Shift-click to drop "
"an item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE94_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Click on the compass at the bottom of the journal to bring up the quest and "
"map tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE36_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Click on the spell icon at the bottom of the journal to bring up the magic "
"tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Arena_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "Climb the fence! *groan*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Combine ingredients with <RT_BlueMed>similar effects</> to create potions and "
"poisons.\n"
"Your <RT_BlueMed>Alchemy skill</> will make your <RT_BlueMed>creations more "
"powerful</>.\n"
"The more potions you create, the higher your Alchemy skill will "
"increase.\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Use additional apparatuses to improve the strength of the potions "
"you create.</>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Completing the skeleton was a ruse and Lorgren rose from the dead! I had no "
"choice but to destroy him. With his destruction, the curse of Benirus Manor "
"was lifted. I should return to The Count's Arms and speak to Velwyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ03_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Corrick Northwode was overjoyed to get back his wife's Jade Amulet. He "
"thanked me by rewarding me with gold he had recovered from Exhausted Mine "
"long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Cirion has given me his helm. With it, I can take his place and do "
"battle with Devoted Fanatic. Only then will the curse be lifted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor has information that he will provide only if I remove the "
"Vampire Hunters lurking around Skingrad, as well as a nest of vampires in "
"Bloodcrust Cavern outside of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor of Skingrad has asked me to find the cure for vampirism. I "
"should look for a woman in the wilderness along the Corbolo River, east of "
"the Imperial City and south of Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG09Motives_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor saved me from the ambush set by Mercator Hosidius. I need to "
"deliver his message to Raminus Polus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Count Hassildor thanked me for finding a cure for his wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor wishes to see me; I should travel to Skingrad immediately and "
"speak with Hal-Liurz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor's news about Mannimarco must be delivered to Hannibal Traven "
"right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Indarys of Cheydinhal has mentioned the opening of what they suspect to "
"be a gate to the realm of Oblivion just outside the city walls. The guards "
"seem on alert and tensions appear to be running high. He said if I wanted to "
"help, I should make my way through the west gates of Cheydinhal and speak to "
"the guards there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Marius Caro of Leyawiin has offered to make Mazoga and myself Knights-"
"Errant of the White Stallion if we find and kill the Orc named Black Brugo, "
"chieftain of the Black Bow Bandits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Count Marius Caro thanked me for my services to County Leyawiin, and "
"suggested that he might make Mazoga and I knights-errant as reward for our "
"noble deeds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Countess Carvain has told me that her scouts have already located the first "
"landmark mentioned in the diary, Dragonclaw Rock. It's been marked on my map, "
"so I should begin the journey from there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Countess Narina Carvain has told me that she's seeking a particular relic of "
"Akaviri origin: The Draconian Madstone, an amulet that supposedly grants the "
"wearer immunity to poison. It's recently come to her attention that it may be "
"located in the ruins at Pale Pass. She's offering a substantial reward for "
"the talisman's return. I should speak to her for more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Countess Umbranox has given me her response. Now I need to deliver it to "
"Hieronymus Lex. The look on his face should be priceless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Countess Valga has told me that the only people who were unaccounted for and "
"had access to her bedchamber were the resident mage, Chanel, and the castle "
"porter, Orgnolf. She suggested I question them and some of the other castle "
"residents: the Captain of the Guard, Bittneld, her herald, Laythe Wavrick, "
"and her Steward, Orok gro-Ghoth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Countess Valga of Castle Chorrol has tasked me with the recovery of a "
"portrait that was stolen from her throne room. It's very dear to her as it "
"reminds her of her husband who was lost years ago. She mentioned clues, "
"perhaps I should find out more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE125_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Cutter told me Madness Ore can be found in old ruins and is often carried by "
"Grummites."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE130_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Cutter told me about magical weapon and armor \"Matrices\" she can use to "
"create magical weapons and armor. If I find a matrix she'll be able to make a "
"magical item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE126_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Cutter will not make any Madness items for me until I am more experienced. "
"[Must be level 8 or higher]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid "DEBUG: All assassins are dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE23_LOG2"
msgid "DEBUG: Assassins finish package to reach floor marker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE12_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Renote reaches marker A. Start conversation with Glenroy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE17_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 17: Emperor approaches player"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE18_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 18: Renote to secret wall switch"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE19_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 19: Secret wall is open"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 20: Renote arrives at marker C"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE22_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 22: Trigger start of ambush"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE27_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 27: Start Baurus/Glenroy conv"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE28_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 28: Baurus waiting to warn player not to follow"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE29_LOG1"
msgid "DEBUG: Stage 29: Baurus finished warning player, head out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMysticism_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Dagail has agreed to train me in the school of Mysticism magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMysticism_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dagail is dead. I have lost my opportunity to be taught more about Mysticism "
"magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMysticism_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dagail refuses to train me until I have done more to seal the barriers "
"between Tamriel and Oblivion. I need to find more gates to Oblivion, and "
"close them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dahlia has helped me convince Jak Silver to join my crew. Jak Silver can get "
"all manner of items that are difficult to find in Cyrodiil. All he asks is "
"that I never question him about his sources. I can find Jak in the lower "
"decks of the Black Flag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dahlia has put me in contact with the famous black market fletcher Melliwin "
"the Mongrel. Melliwin will be able to provide me with marksman supplies and "
"training that I won't be able to find elsewhere. Melliwin has asked for a "
"place to practice her craft. I will find her in the main cavern of Dunbarrow "
"Cove, near the back wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGDirections_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dar Jee is the fence in Leyawiin. The beggar told me she lives east of the "
"temple. I should go to her if I have any stolen property to sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dar-Ma has perished.  I should at least inform Seed-Neeus of the bad news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG02Alter_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Deetsan has agreed to send a letter of recommendation to the Arcane "
"University in Falcar's stead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE37_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Denel has offered to find translations of the inscriptions on the walls of "
"Vahtacen. I should read all the inscriptions, and then tell him what they say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Desideratus did not take it well when I told him what I did to his betrothed. "
"However, he is now motivated to stay at his post and fight the invading "
"Fanatics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Desideratus took his \"beloved\" and ran off. Obviously that isn't going to "
"work. Hopefully he just put the doll back where I found it. I should go "
"check. There must be some other way to use that doll to get him to stay and "
"fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE8_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dion, Captain of the Skingrad guard, warned me to not get involved with "
"Glarthir, saying that he was crazy and possibly dangerous.  He also asked me "
"to contact him if Glarthir ever asked me to do anything strange."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Diram Serethi thanked me for helping him, and offered me free lodging in "
"Aleswell whenever I'm in the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Diram Serethi was disappointed to learn that I had wasted the Reverse "
"Invisibility scrolls that Ancotar had given me. He told me that I am not "
"welcome in Aleswell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Drarana Thelis was saddened at the fates of the townsfolk, but has rewarded "
"me for my efforts. I should report to Burz gro-Khash for payment of the "
"contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Due to my influence in New Sheoth with the House of Dementia, Kithlan has "
"agreed to have Brithaur thrown in the dungeon permanently for his crimes. I "
"should tell Earil the good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dumag gro-Bonk told me Amber can be found in root tunnel systems and on Gnarl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dumag gro-Bonk told me about magical weapon and armor \"Matrices\" he can use "
"to create magical weapons and armor. If I find a matrix he'll be able to make "
"a magical item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dumag gro-Bonk will not make any Amber items for me until I am more "
"experienced. [Must be level 8 or higher]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Dylora thanked me for helping the Dark Seducers secure their stronghold, and "
"has given me the ability to summon her kind. She has also given me a set of "
"matching armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Earana has asked me to bring her a book titled 'Fingers of the Mountain' so "
"that she may translate it. I need to tell Teekeeus about this immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Earana has asked me to steal back the book \"Fingers of the Mountain\" and "
"deliver it to her. I'll need to find where Teekeeus has placed it in the "
"Chorrol Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Earana has given me a translation of a portion of the book I delivered to "
"her. I need to read her notes, and then travel back to Cloud Top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Earil has offered me a reward if I can 'get rid' of Brithaur. I'll need to "
"find a way to get Brithaur to stop stealing from the shops in New Sheoth. "
"Before I make any hasty decisions, perhaps I should speak with Brithaur."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Earil thanked me for taking care of Brithaur, and has given me a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid "Elante of Alinor has died. I should report this to Azzan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Elante of Alinor has reached the Daedric shrine, and is ready to leave "
"Brittlerock Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Elante of Alinor wishes to remain in Brittlerock and continue studying the "
"shrine. I should return to Azzan for my payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Eldamil removed the Bands of the Chosen. I should now be able to leave the "
"Forbidden Grotto and continue on my way towards Mankar Camoran's palace at "
"the top of the mountain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE67_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Eldamil told me he would meet me further into the caves where he would be "
"able to remove the Bands of the Chosen from my wrists. I should continue "
"searching for a way through these caves to Mankar Camoran's palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Erline was pleased that I stopped Raynil. She told me that as an extra "
"precaution, Bradon had a command word protection put on the amulet so no one "
"could steal it and use it without his knowledge. Fortunately, Erline was "
"given the command word. After giving it to her, she said the word, and the "
"true nature of the item was revealed: The Phylacetary of Litheness. She then "
"said I could keep the item, as a token of her thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE21_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Etira Moslin says that Dar-Ma never arrived with the scheduled delivery.  She "
"seemed to be hiding something, however, and I should investigate the town "
"further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Etira Moslin still denies that Dar-Ma ever came to Hackdirt, although it is "
"obvious that Dar-Ma did ... and that she likely never left.  I will have to "
"search the town thoroughly for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Etira Moslin still denies that Dar-Ma ever came to Hackdirt.  She is "
"obviously lying, but I doubt she will tell me anything useful.  I should "
"continue to search the town for clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark11Kin_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Every member of the Draconis family has been killed.  I must pick up my "
"reward and next contract at the dead drop located in the stone well in the "
"Castle Skingrad Courtyard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE0_LOG1"
msgid "Everyone at their places at Marker J."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE0_LOG2"
msgid "Everyone in their places at marker G, waiting for player. (stage 56)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faelian has been killed, but not in a secure location, so my reward will be "
"reduced. I must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with Ocheeva to receive "
"my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE19_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faelian is alone every day for several hours at Lorkmir's House, in the Elven "
"Gardens District of the Imperial City. I could kill him there to avoid any "
"witnesses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faelian is dead. I killed him in Lorkmir's House, a secure location with no "
"witnesses. I must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with Ocheeva and "
"receive my reward and bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE16_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faelian lives at the Tiber Septim Hotel, in the Talos Plaza District of the "
"Imperial City. I should ask around for him there. I can feel myself getting "
"closer. But I must remember, I will forfeit my bonus if Faelian is killed in "
"an unsecure location. The hotel simply will not do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE17_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faelian lives at the Tiber Septim Hotel, in the Talos Plaza District of the "
"Imperial City. I should ask the publican, Augustus Calidia, if she has any "
"information. I can feel myself getting closer. But I must remember, I will "
"forfeit my bonus if Faelian is killed in an unsecure location. The hotel "
"simply will not do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faelian was once a wealthy nobleman, but has squandered his fortune away on "
"skooma. Faelian spends most of his time wandering the city looking for the "
"drug, leaving his sweetheart Atraena at the Tiber Septim Hotel. Maybe Atraena "
"has some more information. What I know for certain is that Faelian is very "
"close to death, but I must not kill him in the hotel if I wish to get my "
"bonus. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG17Ambush_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid "Falcar has fled back into the ruins of Silorn. I must find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Farwil has been slain. I should bring his signet ring to his father the "
"Count, then report to Amminus Gregori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Farwil has been slain. I should take his signet ring from his body to the "
"Count of Cheydinhal as proof of his son's demise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Farwil has died by my hands. Count Indarys will be extremely upset that this "
"has transpired. I fear I may have ruined the good deed my quest represented."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Farwil thanked me in his odd way, and told me to go speak to his father, the "
"Count of Cheydinhal. I should do so. Also, he's bestowed upon me the "
"\"honor\" of being a Knight of the Thorn. To humor him, I courteously "
"accepted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Farwil told me that all of the Knights of the Thorn have been killed except "
"himself and Bremman Senyan. They died trying to get inside the citadel to "
"obtain the Sigil Stone. He's now ordered me to go into the Citadel and "
"recover the Sigil Stone, and says he'll not leave this place until that task "
"is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGDirections_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Fathis Ules is the fence in the Imperial City. The beggar told me he lives "
"behind the temple. I should go to him if I have any stolen property to sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE74_LOG0_2"
msgid ""
"Fatigue returns quickly on its own, but you can also restore it more quickly "
"by drinking potions or sleeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Faustina Cartia approached me after I arrived at The Flowing Bowl. She said "
"that I had what it took to join their gang, and if I was interested, to meet "
"her in the farmhouse at a small settlement outside of Anvil called Gweden "
"around 11 tonight. This was the break I was looking for, so I'll follow my "
"map to that location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ferul Ravel has told me I'll need a lesser soul gem, a head of lettuce, and "
"some yarn as an offering at the statue of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid "Fimmion gave me Uungor's lucky grapes. I should bring them to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"First, I steal the letter from steward Dairihill's desk in Castle Anvil. Then "
"get a forgery made. I have to find and pay for my own forger. Then seal it "
"with the Imperial Watch seal from the legion commander's desk in the Imperial "
"City. Dairihill cannot be trusted to deliver the letter. I must personally "
"deliver the forged letter to Countess Umbranox of Anvil. I will be paid 500 "
"gold, plus the cost of the forgery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG12Gate_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Fithragaer is the only survivor from the group of Battlemages sent to find "
"Mucianus Alias. I need to help him reach the Necromancers within Nenyond "
"Twyll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG12Gate_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Fithragaer, the only surviving Battlemage, is dead. I'll need to continue on "
"my own into the ruins to find Mucianus Alias."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAcrobatics_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"For further training in Acrobatics, I need to search the mountains in the "
"northeast of Cyrodiil for Aerin's Camp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSneak_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"For more training in Sneaking, I need to find Marana Rian in the Imperial "
"City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG9"
msgid ""
"Fortunately, I recognized the drawing as Malada, an Ayleid ruin in the Valus "
"Mountains. I should return to Malada and look for the carved panel that "
"Umbacano wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG10"
msgid ""
"Fortunately, I remembered a book I had read about the High Fane, which "
"identified it as Malada, an Ayleid ruin in the Valus Mountains. I should go "
"to Malada and look for the carved panel that Umbacano wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Francois Motierre has been killed. I must now return to the Sanctuary and "
"report my failure to Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Frathen Drothan is dead, and with him dies any threat the Drothmeri Army may "
"have posed to the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Garrus Darelliun let me know his dislike of his commanding officer and took "
"it a step further by letting me know he thinks Ulrich is pocketing much of "
"the money from the inflated fines. He said I should speak to Aldos, as Garrus "
"needs a witness to bring Ulrich to justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Garrus has informed me that he was made Captain of the Guard of Cheydinhal to "
"replace Ulrich, and has rewarded me for helping him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Garrus was saddened by the news of Aldos's death. He vowed to bring Ulrich to "
"justice by any means. He suggested the only way to incriminate the Captain "
"would be by searching his quarters. He is suggesting that I sneak in there "
"and look for such evidence. I'll have to decide if I want to do this Garrus's "
"way or Llevana's way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE95_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Garrus was upset that I would resort to such a method to have Ulrich removed "
"from his position, but he was glad it was over. He said he would report this "
"to the Count of Cheydinhal, and told me to meet him at the Cheydinhal Bridge "
"Inn in two hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02Watery_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Gaston Tussaud is dead. I must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with "
"Vicente Valtieri to receive my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Gilgondorin said that the \"mouth of the panther\" is a reference to the old "
"nautical term for the Panther River and the delta where it meets Niben Bay. "
"The name was given to it by sailors because of the pointed rock formations "
"jutting from the water that vaguely resemble teeth. He added its location to "
"my map. I should make my way over there to unravel Grantham's cryptic message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Gilgondorin told me that the Forlorn Watchman appears at Bawnwatch Camp every "
"night at 8 on the shore of Niben Bay. He was very helpful, and even marked "
"the camp's location on my map. Perhaps I should make my way out there and see "
"what this local legend is all about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingArmorer_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Gin-Wulm is dead. I can receive no further training in my Armorer skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Glarthir believes that Bernadette Peneles is following him. I need to be "
"outside his house at 6am and see what she does. He will then meet me behind "
"the Great Chapel at midnight to get my report."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Glarthir claims that there is a conspiracy against him among the people of "
"Skingrad.  He wouldn't say why, but implied that he knows secrets which "
"powerful people want to keep quiet. I have agreed to help him determine "
"whether he is being followed or watched, and he has promised to pay me 150 "
"gold for my services."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE50_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Glarthir has given me a list of people he wants me to kill. Everyone on the "
"list was someone I told him was spying on him. He told me to meet him behind "
"the Great Chapel at midnight after they were all dead, and he would pay me "
"1000 septims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Glarthir has gone on a rampage in Skingrad. It seems since I wouldn't help "
"him, he decided to kill those whom he believed were conspiring against him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE30_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Glarthir has one final person for me to investigate. He believes that Davide "
"Surilie is spying on his house.  I should observe him for a day and then "
"report back to Glarthir at midnight at our usual spot behind the Great Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE81_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Glarthir is dead. My attempts to convince him that there was no conspiracy "
"against him have ended in tragedy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Glarthir now believes that I am part of the conspiracy against him, and is "
"trying to kill me! I have no choice but to defend myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE20_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Glarthir now wants me to observe the behavior of Toutius Sextius, another "
"suspected member of the conspiracy against him. Glarthir said that if I "
"waited outside Toutius Sextius's house this morning, I would see Toutius "
"following him, and then could find out who Toutius was reporting to.  At "
"midnight I am to meet Glarthir in our usual spot behind the Great Chapel and "
"tell him what I learned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Glarthir seems pleased with my efforts in investigating the people he "
"believed were conspiring against him. He paid me well for my work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE50_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Glarthir wants me to kill Bernadette Peneles, who I said was spying on him. "
"He told me to meet him behind the Great Chapel at midnight after she was "
"dead, and he would pay me 1000 septims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Glarthir wants me to kill Davide Surilie, who I said was spying on him. He "
"told me to meet him behind the Great Chapel at midnight after Davide was "
"dead, and he would pay me 1000 septims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Glarthir wants me to kill Toutius Sextius, who I said was spying on him. He "
"told me to meet him behind the Great Chapel at midnight after Toutius was "
"dead, and he would pay me 1000 septims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE54_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Glarthir was overjoyed to learn that his enemies were dead, and paid me as "
"promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE54_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Glarthir was overjoyed to learn that his enemy is dead, and paid me as "
"promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE140_LOG2"
msgid "Go to <RT_BlueMed>sleep</> to serve your sentence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE22_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Go to your Inventory. From here, you can equip armor and weapons by hovering "
"the item on the list and clicking on the equip button or by pressing <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Generic_Accept\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Graman said he wouldn't sail the ship while the Bloated Float's owner, Ormil, "
"is still in danger. I need to rescue Ormil in the captain's cabin to get the "
"ship underway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Grantham's map has led me to a treasure chest concealed among some rocks. "
"This must be where Grantham hid his belongings while he was at sea. He has "
"passed this on to me now, as a reward for helping free his spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Guilbert and Reynald Jemane have asked for my help in reclaiming their "
"ancestral home. I need to look for Weatherleah, somewhere to the south of "
"Chorrol. Perhaps I could ask around town and see if anyone can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Guilbert thanked me again for all I did to reunite his family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Guilbert was glad that I'd found Weatherleah's location, but I'll need to "
"kill the ogres so that it's safe to travel there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Guilbert was very happy to hear that I'd killed the band of ogres at "
"Weatherleah, and is anxious to return. I should take he and his brother there "
"as soon as I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE62_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Gwinas has picked up his copy of Volume 3. I need to get that book from "
"Gwinas. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Gwinas told me that Volume 4, the last book I need, can only be given to you "
"by a member of the Mythic Dawn. He had set up a meeting with one, whom he "
"called \"The Sponsor\". He was to go alone and sit at the table in the Sunken "
"Sewer beneath the Imperial City. I will go and take that meeting instead, but "
"should find Baurus first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG18KingofWorms_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hannibal Traven has promoted me to Arch-Mage, and has tasked me with stopping "
"the King of Worms. I need to take the Black Soul Gem to Echo Cave and "
"confront him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hannibal Traven wants me to check in with Jeanne Frasoric at the Bruma Mages "
"Guild. I should go there immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Harrow, the Warden of the Shrine, accepted me as an initiate into the Mythic "
"Dawn cult. I was required to give him all my possessions and dress in an "
"initiate's robe. He said that the Master, Mankar Camoran himself, is here at "
"the shrine, and might perform my initiation himself. I should follow Harrow "
"and see if he leads me to Mankar Camoran and the Amulet of Kings. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Haskill has congratulated me for simulating the first two signs of the "
"K'Sharra Prophecy. I am to go to the center of town to await the final sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Haskill has rewarded me for my efforts by giving me Wabbajack. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Haskill has told me that his Lord Sheogorath is searching for a mortal to "
"become his champion. I should speak again with Haskill when I have made my "
"decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark15Coldest_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Havilstein Hoar-Blood is dead. I must now pick up my reward and next contract "
"at the dead drop located in an old chest that is sunk into the pool at the "
"Ayleid ruin of Nornal. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE72_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"Health regenerates outside combat. You can restore it more quickly by "
"drinking potions, casting healing spells or waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHandtoHand_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Helvius Cecia has agreed to train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHandtoHand_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Helvius Cecia is dead. I have no chance to be taught more about Hand to Hand "
"combat now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Henantier has thanked me for saving him. As a reward, he's provided me with "
"some of his magic scrolls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Herdir has agreed to accompany me. I need to speak with people in Crucible "
"for information about this supposed conspiracy. Perhaps starting with those "
"close to Syl would be useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hermaeus Mora was pleased with the souls I brought him. He has rewarded me "
"with the Oghma Infinium. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hermaeus Mora wishes for me to gather for him ten souls, one of each of the "
"races."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Herminia Cinna gave me the key to the royal burial vault of Lindai, which she "
"believes holds a similar Ayleid Crown. She suggested that Umbacano would not "
"know the difference between the Crown of Lindai and the Crown of Nenalata, "
"since he has never seen either one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Herminia Cinna refused to sell me the Crown of Nenalata that Umbacano wants. "
"She hinted that it can be used to access potent magical powers that would "
"dangerous in the wrong hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hides-His-Heart has been killed. I must now return to the Sanctuary and "
"report my failure to Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hieronymus Lex found the bust I planted. Now all I have to do is report to "
"Armand. Unfortunately I'll have to wait until the next midnight for him to "
"return to the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hieronymus Lex was shocked to learn he had been reassigned. Now the Thieves "
"Guild will be safe from his persecution. All I have to do is get back to "
"S'krivva to collect my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHircine_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hircine was impressed with my skill in hunting the unicorn. He has rewarded "
"me with the Savior's Hide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHircine_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hircine's followers have told me that, in order to summon the Daedra, I must "
"leave an offering of a wolf or bear pelt at the statue.  [You must be level "
"17 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid "Hirrus Clutumnus asked me for a favor, I've turned him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "Hirrus Clutumnus has asked that I kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hirrus Clutumnus is dead, just as he wanted. I can now get my reward from his "
"house. The key should be on his corpse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid "Hirrus Clutumnus is dead. I'll never find out what he wanted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hirrus Clutumnus told me to meet him after dark at the sewer grate northeast "
"of the statue of Sheogorath sitting on his throne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"History has been rewritten. I should go see the new Thieves Guild Hall in the "
"Imperial City Waterfront. The Gray Fox, or Count Corvus as he is now known, "
"told me that I get to run the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE130_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Hloval Dreth was grateful for the help. He is able to attack the Fanatic "
"raiders now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE28_LOG1_1"
msgid ""
"Hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> to perform a <RT_BlueMed>stronger "
"attack</>. To <RT_BlueMed>block</>, hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "Horkvir Bear-Arm living on the Dementia side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid "Horkvir Bear-Arm living on the Mania side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I  have spoken with Kud-Ei in Bravil. She has told me that in order to join "
"the Mages Guild, I must not be a wanted criminal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE56_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I accepted Eldamil's offer to help me escape the Forbidden Grottos. Eldamil "
"wants me to pretend to be a prisoner until his Dremora overseer finishes his "
"inspection. I wonder if I can trust him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I agreed to help Ulfri defeat the Golden Saints. Her scouts report that the "
"Saints have launched their attack. I should follow Ulfri and help her destroy "
"the Golden Saints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I agreed to lead Mazoga to Fisherman's Rock. Fisherman's Rock is north of "
"Leyawiin, about six hours walk, on a point of land on the eastern shore of "
"the Niben. At Fisherman's Rock, Mazoga wants to talk to someone named Mogens "
"Wind-shifter. She made it clear I was not to interfere before she talked to "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I allowed Petilius to kill me, but he did not use the Cursed Mace. I have "
"failed in the task given to me by Molag Bal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I am certain that Chanel is the culprit. After all, the evidence clearly "
"points to her. But without a full confession, Countess Valga won't be "
"satisfied. I need to convince Chanel to trust me enough to tell me why she "
"did the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ArenaDialogue_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I am now a combatant in the Arena faction. To arrange for a match, I must "
"speak with Owyn in the Arena Bloodworks, in the Imperial City. After every "
"match, I must speak to Owyn again to close out the match and receive any "
"rewards earned. While I'm involved in any active matches, I will be unable to "
"bet on any fights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ArenaDialogue_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I am now an Arena Champion. There are no more standard matches left to fight. "
"Instead, I must challenge the Grand Champion, Agronak gro-Malog, for his "
"title.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I am to meet Oreyn at the Fighters Guild in Leyawiin. From there, we will "
"travel to Arpenia to look for Azani Blackheart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I am to meet Relmyna Verenim at the statue of Lord Sheogorath in the Fringe "
"where we will perform the ceremony to build the Gatekeeper. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I approached Armand Christophe about the Thieves Guild. Apparently this is "
"not the right time or place to discuss it. He told me to meet him in the "
"ruined Garden of Dareloth in the Waterfront distict of the Imperial City. I "
"have to be there at midnight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I arrived at Kvatch to find the city in ruins and the survivors camped "
"outside the walls. I need to find out if anyone here knows what happened to "
"Martin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE39_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I arrived at the battlefield to find one open Oblivion Gate. Once all three "
"are open, the Mythic Dawn will open a Great Gate, which I must enter and "
"retrieve its Great Sigil Stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ04_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I brought Martin and Jauffre safely to Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I brought Una Armina a Two-Headed Septim I found, and she was happy to add it "
"to her museum. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I brought Una Armina the Ring of Disrobing I found. She was pleased with it, "
"and asked me to bring her any new Oddities I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I can now summon Mehrunes' Harbinger at any time to obtain items imbued with "
"Mehrunes Dagon’s power. I should speak to Snak Gra-Bura at the Chestnut Handy "
"Stables about crafting a matching set of horse armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I cast the Reverse Invisibility spell Ancotar gave me, but I wasn't in "
"Aleswell when I did it, so I need to ask Ancotar for another one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I closed the Gate with Captain Burd. I should ask him if he needs any more "
"help from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I closed the Oblivion Gate outside of Anvil. I should speak to the Countess "
"about sending aid to Bruma now that Anvil is no longer directly threatened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE43_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I closed the Oblivion Gate outside of Bravil. I should speak to the Count "
"about sending aid to Bruma now that Bravil is no longer directly threatened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I closed the Oblivion Gate outside of Cheydinhal. I should speak to the Count "
"about sending aid to Bruma now that Cheydinhal is no longer directly "
"threatened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE42_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I closed the Oblivion Gate outside of Chorrol. I should speak to the Countess "
"about sending aid to Bruma now that Chorrol is no longer directly threatened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE44_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I closed the Oblivion Gate outside of Leyawiin. I should speak to the Count "
"about sending aid to Bruma now that Leyawiin is no longer directly threatened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE41_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I closed the Oblivion Gate outside of Skingrad. I should speak to the Count "
"about sending aid to Bruma now that Skingrad is no longer directly threatened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE50_LOG4"
msgid ""
"I convinced Kaneh to attack through the Underdeep. Ulfri will be pleased when "
"I lead the Golden Saints into her trap. I should help destroy the Golden "
"Saints once the Dark Seducers spring their ambush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk02_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I defeated the lich that stole the Elder Scroll. I must retrieve it "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I delivered Mazoga's message, and Weebam-Na agreed to go talk to Mazoga. "
"Maybe I should tag along and find out what this is all about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I delivered the Mysterium Xarxes to Martin, and told him that Mankar Camoran "
"had escaped to Paradise with the Amulet of Kings. Martin believes the key to "
"opening a portal to Camoran's Paradise lies within the pages of the Mysterium "
"Xarxes, but he will need some time to study it, and ward himself against its "
"evil power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I delivered the letter to The Stranger. He said to return in a day and he "
"would have the new letter ready. It's going to cost 500 gold coins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I delivered the news of Dar-Ma's death.  Seed-Neeus was devastated, but "
"thanked me for my brave attempt to save her daughter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE28_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I didn't find the Arrow of Extrication in his room. I should explore this "
"secret passage though. It would be very much like a wizard to hide his "
"valuables in some dark hole filled with monsters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I discovered that Theranis was arrested. It seems he was found in a tavern, "
"drunk and bragging about stealing something from Castle Skingrad. The Captain "
"of the Skingrad Guard overheard him and arrested him. I'm going to have to "
"break into the dungeon if I want to speak to Theranis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I failed to affect all the guests with the Stark Reality spell. The spell has "
"worn off, and my items have been returned to me, but I have failed my quest "
"for Sanguine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I fear I've slain one of the gang members prematurely. Although this puts a "
"stop to the crimes, a better way may have been available had I followed "
"through with the undercover operation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found Aldos, drunk as usual. He begged me to follow him back to his old "
"house where he wanted me to witness something. I should follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found Fathis Aren's rooms in Castle Bravil. Now to locate the Arrow of "
"Extrication."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ02_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I found Jauffre and gave him the Amulet of Kings. The Emperor's words to me "
"filled him with foreboding, especially in light of the destruction of the "
"city of Kvatch. Mehrunes Dagon, the Lord of Destruction, is one of the "
"princes of Oblivion, the demonic world. It seems that with no Emperor on the "
"throne, the daedra from Oblivion are able to invade our world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ02_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found Jauffre and gave him the Amulet of Kings. The Emperor's words to me "
"filled him with foreboding. Mehrunes Dagon, the Lord of Destruction, is one "
"of the princes of Oblivion, the demonic world. Jauffre fears that with no "
"Emperor on the throne, the daedra from Oblivion may be able to invade our "
"world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ04_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I found Jauffre. He believes the attackers may have taken the Amulet of Kings "
"from its hiding place in Weynon House. I should go and see if it is still "
"safe. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ04_STAGE20_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I found Jauffre. The attackers have stolen the Amulet of Kings from its "
"hiding place in Weynon House. At least Martin is safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found Mankar Camoran in his palace of Carac Agaialor. Now I must kill him "
"and take the Amulet of Kings back to Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found Martin among the survivors of Kvatch. He was surprised to learn that "
"Emperor Uriel Septim was his father, but has agreed to return to Weynon "
"Priory with me to speak to Jauffre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD06DeadViranus_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found Viranus Donton dead. I should look for clues as to what happened here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a Blind Watcher's Eye. This might be something Una Armina would want "
"for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a Deformed Swamp Tentacle. This might be something Una Armina would "
"want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid "I found a Xivilai trapped in a cave, and set it free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I found a book of Imbel family geneology. No mention of Springheel Jak's "
"burial location. Maybe the Earl himself can tell me, with a little friendly "
"persuasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a book of Imbel family geneology. Very interesting reading. I should "
"ask the Gray Fox about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a document in Jearl's basement that reveals the enemy's plans. I "
"should show this document to Jauffre immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a ghostly Dagger of Depletion in Hloval Dreth's rooms. It should let "
"him recharge his magicka. I wonder who or what he'll use it on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE110_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I found a ghostly Dagger of Depletion. For some reason I am unable to wield "
"it though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I found a key marked 'Basement Key'. Perhaps this clue can help me locate a "
"Mythic Dawn agent's base in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a key marked 'Basement Key'. Perhaps this clue can help me locate a "
"Mythic Dawn agent's base in Bruma. Captain Burd may be able to provide some "
"information about suspicious activity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a key on Ma'zaddha's body; he has hidden evidence somewhere that may "
"help my investigation. I'll need to find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a key shaped arrow head, but not the whole arrow. This must be what "
"the Gray Fox is looking for, or at least as close as I am going to get. I "
"should take it to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE52_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found a lump of Amber that looks vaguely like Sheogorath. This might be "
"something Una Armina would want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE64_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found out that Gwinas is staying at the Tiber Septim Hotel in the Talos "
"Plaza District. I need to find Gwinas and get Volume 3 of Camoran's "
"\"Commentaries\" from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found out that Gwinas is staying at the Tiber Septim Hotel in the Talos "
"Plaza District. I need to find out what Gwinas wanted with Volume 3 of "
"Camoran's \"Commentaries\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE120_LOG1"
msgid "I found some ghostly welkynd stones. I can't seem to use them myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found some ghostly welkynd stones. I might be able to use them to help "
"Hloval Dreth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found the Temple of the Ancestor Moths. Now I just have to locate Savilla's "
"Stone. Maybe I can persuade one of the monks to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE54_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found the ashes of someone named Din in an urn deep in the ruins of "
"Ebrocca. This might be something Una Armina would want for the Museum of "
"Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found the prisoner in Oblivion. He told me I need to reach the top of the "
"largest tower and look for the Sigil Stone. But I will need the Sigil "
"Keeper's key to gain entry into the Sigil Keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02taxes_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I found the tax records. Now to get them back to Armand in the Waterfront "
"district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE36_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I freed one group of ogres. I must check to see if there are more to be freed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE37_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I freed one group of ogres. I must check to see if there are more to be freed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE35_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I freed the Xivilai Anaxes from the cave where he was trapped. I should "
"return to Kathutet and see if he will give me the Bands of the Chosen, as he "
"promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03Accidents_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I fulfilled the contract, but not in the manner requested. As a result, I "
"have forfeited my bonus. I must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with "
"Vicente Valtieri to receive my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I gave Martin the Armor of Tiber Septim. He was able to recover Tiber "
"Septim's blood from it, which he needed for the Mysterium Xarxes ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ08_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I gave Martin the Daedric Artifact he needed for the Mysterium Xarxes ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ12_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I gave Martin the Great Welkynd Stone that he needs for the Mysterium Xarxes "
"ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I gave Umbacano the Ayleid Crown of Lindai, as Herminia Cinna suggested. He "
"did not appear to be aware that it was not the Ayleid Crown that he had asked "
"me to retrieve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I gave Umbacano the Ayleid Crown of Nenalata, as he requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I gave the Icestaff to Methredhel. She says we need to wait for the nobles "
"and wizards to act. She wants me to watch Lex until he is ordered to leave "
"the Waterfront. I have to make sure I get close enough to him to overhear any "
"conversations. When he does, I report back to Methredhel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE47_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I got a tip to speak with Hlidara Mothril. If I sweet talk her, she might "
"tell me more about Alessia Caro and the ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid "I got into a fight at Fisherman's Rock, and four bandits are dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I got into a fight at Fisherman's Rock. Mazoga will be angry. She told me I "
"was not to interfere before she talked to Mogens Windshifter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I got into a fight with the monks. The heist is ruined. There is no way to "
"get the Elder Scroll now. My only option is to flee the palace. I am certain "
"the Gray Fox will expel me from the guild. I don't think they'll let me back "
"in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I got myself hired as a servant in Castle Skingrad. I only have access to the "
"Great Keep, but that should help. Shum gro-Yarug says that the jailors will "
"open the prison door for me. Now I just have to find Theranis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have Desideratus doll, his \"betrothed.\" There must be a way to use it to "
"convince Desideratus to stay at his post."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have Hirrus Clutumnus' house key. I should go claim my reward from his "
"jewelry box."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE19_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have Hrormir's Icestaff. All I need to do is leave the note in the "
"nightstand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG06Bruma_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I have Jeanne's Manual of Spellcraft. I need to deliver it to Volanaro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have Rohssan's Cutlass. Now to get back to Armand in the garden of "
"Dareloth. I'll have to wait until midnight when he is there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have Savilla's Stone. Now to get back to Helvius Cecia's house in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ08_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have a Daedric Artifact, which Martin needs for the ritual to open a portal "
"to Camoran's Paradise. I should bring it to him at Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have accepted Vicente Valtieri's offer to turn me into a vampire. The next "
"time I sleep in the Sanctuary, Valtieri will visit me and pass along his Dark "
"Gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06WandererFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07MedicineFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08WhodunitFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01KnifeFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03AccidentsFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04ExecutionFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02WateryFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have accepted a quest from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have acquired the Boots of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09Retirement_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have acquired the severed finger of Adamus Phillida, with the ring still "
"attached. I should now go to the Imperial City, and place the finger in the "
"desk of Phillida's Imperial Legion successor, in his office in the Prison "
"Barracks. If I do this, I will receive a bonus. Or, I may forfeit the bonus "
"and simply return to Ocheeva at the Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have activated the Glass of Time. According to the Gray Fox, the door to "
"the Old Way in the Imperials Sewers should now be open. Now I just have to "
"find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCOrrery_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid "I have activated the Imperial Orrery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have administered the Languorwine antidote, and Francois Motierre has "
"awakened from his poison-induced sleep. I should now speak with him and make "
"sure he's well enough to travel to the Grey Mare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE80_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have agreed to help Dar-Ma escape.  She asked me to carry word to her "
"mother, Seed-Neeus of Chorrol, if she does not survive the attempt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have agreed to help Savlian Matius of the Kvatch Town Guard and his men as "
"they attempt to reach some survivors trapped in the Chapel of Akatosh inside "
"the city. He is willing to lead his guardsmen back into the city to attempt a "
"rescue, but the enemy have opened an Oblivion Gate across the entry to the "
"city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MSShadowscale_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have agreed to spare Scar-Tail's life. I must take the heart of the dead "
"Argonian assassin, and present that to Teinaava instead. To thank me, "
"Teinaava has shared the secret hiding place of his treasure -- in the "
"hollowed-out rock near Bogwater campfire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingArmorer_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have answered Gin-Wulm's question, and he has agreed to train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE45_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Bravil's lucky Old Lady's statue. The fourth note should be "
"nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Brellach. I need to locate the Golden Saint Captain and "
"rescue her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE34_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Fetid Grove. I should seek out Pyke's medallion within."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG15Helm_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Fort Teleman. I need to find Irlav Jarol, who should have "
"the Bloodworm Helm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND10_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Garlas Malatar. My sworn foe Umaril the Unfeathered awaits "
"me inside. The final duty in my holy quest is to find him, and destroy him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Hircine's shrine. The note should be behind a tree, found "
"by \"following the wolf's gaze\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Lake Arrius Caverns. The secret Mythic Dawn shrine must be "
"somewhere inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE78_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Llevana's house with Ulrich. I should see where he goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Molag Bal's shrine. I should be able to find the third note "
"by \"following the Light of the Dawn\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Pinnacle Rock. I need to locate the Dark Seducer Captain "
"and rescue her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG17Ambush_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Silorn, and spoken with Thalfin. We cannot enter the ruins, "
"so I must help prepare an ambush for the Necromancers when they attempt to "
"leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Summitmist Manor. I must now kill the unlucky guests -- "
"Matilde, Dovesi, Primo, Neville and Nels. If I can eliminate each guest "
"secretly, without any witnesses, I will receive my reward and a very valuable "
"reward. If I am discovered, the contract will be complete, but any bonus will "
"be forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Underpall Cave, the location of Lord Vlindrel's grave. Sir "
"Roderic died somewhere inside, battling the foul wraith that now wields the "
"Sword of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at Wellspring Cave. I should speak with Elette or Zahrasha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at the Bruma Mages Guild. It appears to have been attacked; I "
"should look for survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE9_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at the ruins of Cylarne. I will need to speak to the "
"commanders of the Golden Saints and Dark Seducers to find out how to light "
"the Flame of Agnon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE85_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have arrived at the statue of Sheogorath. I should speak with Relmyna "
"Verenim when she arrives. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid "I have arrived at the statue of Sheogorath. I should speak with Relmyna."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have arrived in Camoran's Paradise. The portal closed behind me. I must "
"find Mankar Camoran, kill him and recover the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk01_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived near Beldaburo, but nothing looks suspicious outside. I should "
"check inside the ruins themselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have arrived near Mingo Cave. Perhaps I can infiltrate their ranks if I don "
"their robes before entering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have asked Modryn Oreyn to act as my second-in-command. He accepted, and "
"will run day-to-day activities of the Fighters Guild in my absence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have attacked a member of the Mages Guild, and have been suspended from the "
"guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have attacked a member of the Mages Guild, and have been suspended from the "
"guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGExpelled_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have attacked another member of the Thieves Guild. Unless I pay the fine, I "
"am sure to be cast out of the guild. I should talk to Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have beaten Methredhel and Amusei to Amantius Allectus' diary. Now to get "
"back to Armand at Dareloth's garden by midnight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGExpelled_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been caught stealing from a member of the Thieves Guild. Unless I pay "
"the fine, I am sure to be cast out of the guild. I should talk to Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been confronted by Lucien Lachance, who told me I have inadvertently "
"been killing off the members of the Black Hand! I must now travel to the city "
"of Anvil. Once there, I should wait near the barrel behind the statue in the "
"pond, and see who comes to set up this fake dead drop. I must then confront "
"this person and find out why they've been tampering with my contracts. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been detected by someone in Fort Sutch. That means the poisoning will "
"fail. I must now kill Roderick the old fashioned way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been detected! I must now complete the contract by killing everyone in "
"Summitmist Manor, but my bonus will be forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG17Ambush_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been discovered by the Necromancers at Silorn. They will surely have "
"alerted Falcar; I'll need to enter the ruins and find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkExile3_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been exiled from the Dark Brotherhood for breaking one of the Tenets. "
"The next time I sleep, I will be visited by a spirit of vengeance known as "
"the Wrath of Sithis. But even if I defeat this spirit, I will never be "
"allowed to complete my duties in the Dark Brotherhood. I have gone too far, "
"and Sithis is most displeased..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkExile2_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been exiled from the Dark Brotherhood for breaking one of the Tenets. "
"The next time I sleep, I will be visited by a spirit of vengeance known as "
"the Wrath of Sithis. Only by defeating this spirit may I be allowed to rejoin "
"the Dark Brotherhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkExile_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been exiled from the Dark Brotherhood for breaking one of the Tenets. "
"The next time I sleep, I will be visited by a spirit of vengeance known as "
"the Wrath of Sithis. Only by defeating this spirit may I be allowed to rejoin "
"the Dark Brotherhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been given a recommendation from each ranking member in the local "
"guild halls, and have been given access to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been instructed to find the Shrine to Kynareth in Cyrodiil's Great "
"Forest, and speak with the Priests there about the Boots of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been promoted to the rank of Champion of the Fighters Guild. I'm told "
"that Modryn Oreyn is looking for me, and I should speak with him as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been reinstated into the Fighters Guild once again. I have been warned "
"that I will not be allowed back into the guild, should I commit another crime "
"against my brothers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been reinstated into the Mages Guild, with the warning that any "
"further infractions will result in permanent removal from the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have been reinstated into the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10BloodPrice_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been reinstated into the Thieves Guild. The blood price was steep, but "
"worth it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been tasked with finding the people conspiring against Lady Syl. I "
"need to find and speak to Herdir. He can always be found at the torture "
"chamber in the House of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told Erthor was last seen at Bleak Flats Cave, west of Skingrad. "
"I should remind Adrienne of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAAzura_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told by Azura's followers that an offering of glow dust, obtained "
"from a will-o-the-wisp, is needed to summon the Daedra. The statue should be "
"approached at dawn or dusk. [You must be level 2 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DABoethia_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told by one of Boethia's followers that in order to summon the "
"Daedra, I must give a daedra heart as an offering to the statue. [You must be "
"level 20 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told if I wish to join the Mages Guild, I should speak with the "
"head of any of the local guild halls in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told that Anya Herrick may know something about a conspiracy. I "
"should find and interrogate her. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told that I can find Maglir at the West Weald Inn in Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told that I can find the three Fighters Guild members in the Five "
"Claws Lodge, likely causing trouble. They warn me that it will be difficult "
"to subdue the three men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told that Weebam-Na and Bejeen were recently heard talking about "
"a valuable jewel they had found, and how it would make them wealthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD00JoinFG_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told that the Fighters Guild is looking for new members. I should "
"speak to Vilena Donton in Chorrol, Azzan in Anvil, or Burz gro-Khash in "
"Cheydinhal, if I wish to join."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD06DeadViranus_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid "I have been told to report to Modryn Oreyn for assigned duties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been told to report to Vilena Donton in Chorrol for assigned duties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08BloodPrice_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have been welcomed back into the Thieves Guild after paying my blood price. "
"I even got my fee for stealing Savilla's Stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE195_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have both items that Dyus needs to recreate the Staff of Sheogorath. I "
"should return to Knifepoint Hollow and speak with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE162_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have both the Key to Mania and the Key to Dementia. I can go through either "
"door of the Gates of Madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE58_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a eighth Ayleid statue. Only two more to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a fifth Ayleid statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE54_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a fourth Ayleid statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE59_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have brought Umbacano a ninth Ayleid statue. If I bring him one more he "
"will pay be a bonus of 5,000 gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE52_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a second Ayleid statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE57_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a seventh Ayleid statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE56_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a sixth Ayleid statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE53_LOG0"
msgid "I have brought Umbacano a third Ayleid statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have brought Umbacano all ten of the Ayleid statues. He was very pleased "
"and rewarded me well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid "I have captured the Essence of Breath. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid "I have captured the soul of Er-Teeus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I have captured the soul of Ilvel Romayn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I have captured the soul of Kewan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I have captured the soul of Maren the Seal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I have captured the soul of Mirie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE140_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have changed the actions of three of the defenders. Yet one of the Fanatics "
"still gets past the defenders. There is nothing more I can do here. Maybe "
"Count Cirion can help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have checked in with Raminus Polus. I now need to find Delmar in the Arcane "
"University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE47_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have chosen to leave Umbra in peace. I should return to the Shrine of "
"Clavicus Vile and make my decision known to the Daedra Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have closed the Gate by taking the Sigil Stone that anchors it within "
"Oblivion. I should tell Savlian Matius that the way into Kvatch is now open. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I have collected a vial of Blood Liqueur."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have collected the ashes of Hindaril for Melisande. I should bring them to "
"her at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE112_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have collected the three daggers that Ra'kheran has asked for. I should "
"return to him so that he can kill Ciirta."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have committed another crime against my Fighters Guild brothers, and I have "
"been expelled again. I should report to Vilena Donton in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlchemy_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have completed Sinderion's task, and he has agreed to train me in Alchemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TestToddQuest_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have completed all of Todd's testing. Everyone was very happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have completed my pilgrimage to the Wayshrines of the Divines. I should "
"pray and wait for a vision to guide me on my quest for the Crusader's Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have completed my task for Carahil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have completed the Summitmist Manor contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have completed the contract, but not as directed, so the bonus is forfeit. "
"I must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with Ocheeva to receive my "
"reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have confronted Muurine, who has confessed to trying to kill Lady Syl. I "
"should report this news to Lady Syl at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE43_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have convinced Bhisha to leave Crucible. Ushnar won't ever have to worry "
"about him again. I need to tell Ushnar about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have convinced Ulrich to follow me to Llevana's house. I should lead him "
"there now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have convinced the guard to let me into the Countess Caro's dinner party."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have decided to attempt to become Sheogorath's champion. In order to meet "
"Sheogorath, I must first pass through the Gates of Madness, guarded by the "
"Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have decided to attempt to become Sheogorath's champion. In order to meet "
"Sheogorath, I must first pass through the Gates of Madness, guarded by the "
"Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have decided to give Biene Amelion the money to pay off her debt. She has "
"asked that I keep the sword and armor until a time that she may be able to "
"repay me. I should return to Burz gro-Khash for payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have decided to give Biene Amelion the money to pay off her debt. She has "
"told me that I may keep the sword and armor, if I wish to retrieve them from "
"the Amelion Family Tomb. I should return to Burz gro-Khash for payment of the "
"contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DABoethia_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have defeated all of Boethia's followers in the Tournament of Ten Bloods. I "
"should speak once more with the Daedra Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE160_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have defeated the Devoted Fanatic. The curse of Vitharn has been lifted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ArenaDialogue_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have defeated the Gray Prince and have been named the new Arena Grand "
"Champion! Ysabel Andronicus told me to return to her after I've gotten some "
"rest, so we can discuss my future. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkExile3_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have defeated the final incarnation of the Wrath of Sithis, but my "
"relationship with the Dark Brotherhood can never be repaired..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have delivered Ardaline's staff to Kud-Ei, and have earned a recommendation "
"for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG15Helm_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have delivered the Bloodworm Helm to Hannibal Traven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have delivered the Chalice of Reversal to Thadon, and he has granted me a "
"place in his court."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have delivered the Chalice of Reversal to Thadon, and he has granted me a "
"place in his court."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have delivered the Soul Gems to Melisande. Now I must collect a series of "
"ingredients for her, so that she can brew the potion to cure vampirism. She "
"needs six cloves of garlic, five nightshade leaves, and two shoots of "
"bloodgrass. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have delivered the artifact to Irlav Jarol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE255_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have delivered the book \"Fingers of the Mountain\" to Teekeeus, who has "
"agreed to send a recommendation to the Arcane University for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE255_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have delivered the book \"Fingers of the Mountain\" to Teekeeus, who has "
"agreed to send a recommendation to the Arcane University for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND10_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have destroyed Umaril's physical form. If the Prophet told me true, I must "
"cast the Blessing of Talos on myself and I will follow Umaril's spirit  to a "
"place where he can be destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have destroyed an undead Blade in the catacombs of Sancre Tor. His released "
"spirit told me that he had been bound here long ago with three companions by "
"the Underking to guard the desecrated Shrine of Tiber Septim. He promised to "
"attempt to dispel the curse that the Underking placed on the Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have destroyed the machinery surrounding the Hist Tree, and the tree was "
"destroyed in the process. I should return to Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have destroyed the second of the cursed Blades guarding Sancre Tor, freeing "
"his spirit to help his companions lift the Underking's enchantment from the "
"Shrine of Tiber Septim. I should continue to search for the other two undead "
"Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE52_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have destroyed the third of the cursed Blades guarding Sancre Tor. I need "
"to find and destroy the last of the cursed Blades, so that his freed spirit "
"can help the ghosts of his companions dispel the evil enchantment blocking "
"the way to the Shrine of Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS52_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have discovered the Journal of the Lord Lovidicus. It does indeed contain "
"information about Agronak gro-Malog's birth, but proves he was the spawn of a "
"vampire! Agronak won't be happy to hear this, but it is the proof he wanted. "
"I must take the journal to him at the Imperial City Arena Bloodworks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10SpecialWizard_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have discovered the journal of the Necromancer Celedaen. It appears he has "
"used a magic hourglass called the Sands of Resolve to turn himself into a "
"lich and extend his life indefinitely. The process is not yet complete, "
"however, and the hourglass must remain on Celedaen's person for some time, as "
"it contains his life force. If I could remove the Sands of Resolve from "
"Celedaen's posession, perhaps through pickpocketing, he would surely die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE28_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have discovered the secret door Kithlan described. I should activate the "
"hidden switch and proceed inside in pursuit of Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have discovered the traitor's diary. He has been in the Dark Brotherhood "
"for years, and is now a member of the Black Hand! His goal is revenge against "
"Lucien Lachance and all of the Brotherhood for the murder of his mother when "
"he was a child, and he actually plans on killing the Night Mother!  I must "
"return to Lucien Lachance at once, at the farm called Applewatch, and give "
"him this information!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE1_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have eliminated one of the four Fanatic raiders that came in from the "
"dungeons. Only three to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE2_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have eliminated two of the four Fanatic raiders that came in from the "
"dungeons. Only two more to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03Accidents_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered Baenlin's house.  If I can access the second floor crawlspace "
"and loosen the fastenings on the mounted head, between 8:00 PM and 11:00 PM, "
"it will fall on Baenlin as he rests in his chair. If Baenlin dies any other "
"way, or if Gromm is killed, I will lose my bonus. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid "I have entered Bleak Mine. Now I must free Malacath's ogres."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS52_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered Crowhaven. Somewhere inside I will unlock the truth that "
"Agronak gro-Malog is searching for. I should be cautious, however. The fort "
"has long since lost its noble trappings, and the presence of evil is "
"unmistakable... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the Forbidden Grotto. Now to find my way through to the "
"Terrace of the Dawn where I hope to find Mankar Camoran and the Amulet of "
"Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ14_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the Great Gate. The Daedric Siege Engine is crawling towards "
"the portal! If it exits the Gate before I reach the Sigil Stone, all is lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the Shivering Isles. In order to find the lord of this Realm, "
"I must first pass through the Gates of Madness. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the gate and been greeted by a man named Haskill. He tells me "
"that he is the Chamberlain of Sheogorath. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the ruined city of Kvatch with Savlian Matius and his men. We "
"must clear the southern plaza before the survivors in the Chapel can be "
"rescued."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ12_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the ruins of Miscarcand. Now I must find its Great Welkynd "
"Stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04Execution_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have entered the sewers beneath the Imperial Prison. I must now proceed "
"through the sewers and into the prison itself, and kill Valen Dreth. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE102_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have escaped from the Imperial Palace by jumping down a chimney chute in "
"Ocato's bedroom. I hope the royal battlemage won't mind my misusing his ash "
"flue. I can only hope my fall doesn't end too abruptly. I wonder if this is "
"what the Gray Fox said I would need the Boots of Springheel Jak for? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have escaped with the Mysterium Xarxes. Now to deliver it to Martin at "
"Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC09Ogres_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have escorted Lady Rogbut back to her father's estate, much to Lord "
"Rugdumph's relief. He has rewarded me with Rugdumph's Sword. I should now "
"return to Burz gro-Khash for payment of the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I have failed Kynareth's test. I shall have to try again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have failed to follow Avita Vesnia's instructions. I shall have to try the "
"test of Kynareth some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have finished Syl's task. I should now speak with Thadon in the House of "
"Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have finished Syl's task. I should return to Sheogorath and tell him I've "
"done as he asked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have finished Thadon's task. I should now speak with Syl in the House of "
"Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have finished Thadon's task. I should return to Sheogorath and tell him "
"I've done as he asked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have finished selecting the body parts for the Gatekeeper. I should return "
"to Relmyna Verenim now. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have fled Chorrol, and Hides-His-Heart has not been killed. I must now wait "
"a day, so Motierre can be discovered and placed in the Chorrol Chapel "
"Undercroft. There, I must find Motierre and administer the antidote that will "
"revive him. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have followed the clues hidden in the four volumes written by Mankar "
"Camoran to a gravestone in Green Emperor Way. At noon, a map of Cyrodiil "
"appeared on the gravestone, with the location of the Mythic Dawn's shrine "
"marked on it. I need to find my way into the shrine and locate the Amulet of "
"Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I have found 10 portions of Imp Gall. I should bring them to Aryarie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Ajum-Kajin, cowering in his Blackwood Company hideout. I must "
"convince him to return with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Brenus Astis' journal. I should either speak with Maglir or tell "
"Modryn Oreyn that the contract is now completed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Dar-Ma held captive in caves beneath Hackdirt.  Now to free her "
"and escape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have found Dar-Ma's diary in the inn in Hackdirt.  I should confront the "
"innkeeper with this evidence and see if he changes his story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Dar-Ma's diary in the inn in Hackdirt.  Now that I know Dar-Ma "
"arrived here safely, I should ask the innkeeper if he knows what happened to "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Dar-Ma's horse behind Moslin's Dry Goods in Hackdirt, although "
"Etira Moslin already told me she never arrived here.  I should confront her "
"with this lie and see how she reacts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE31_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have found Dar-Ma's horse behind Moslin's Dry Goods in Hackdirt.  I should "
"ask Etira Moslin if she knows what happened to Dar-Ma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid "I have found Eletta, who is dead. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE25_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have found Eletta, who is dead. I should find out what happened to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Martin among the survivors inside the Chapel of Akatosh. He was "
"surprised to learn that Emperor Uriel Septim was his father, but he will not "
"leave until the way is safe for everyone to escape. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Melisande, who has offered to help me with a  cure for "
"vampirism. Once I have brought her five empty Grand Soul Gems, she will give "
"me further instructions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Flagon_STAGE33_LOG0"
msgid "I have found Newheim the Portly's flagon. I should return it to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Selenia Orania. She is dead. I should look for other survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Volanaro, who was killed. I should look for other survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE22_LOG1"
msgid "I have found Zahrasha, who is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found Zahrasha, who is dead. I should investigate what happened to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found a Dalvilu ceremonial dagger. This might be useful to leave as "
"evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found a strange book about the Mythic Dawn cult. I should show this to "
"Baurus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE61_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found a young Argonian named Dar-Ma held captive in caves beneath "
"Hackdirt.  She has asked me to help her escape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found all of the souls of Peryite's followers lost in Oblivion. "
"Peryite was to open a gate for me when they were found. I should head back to "
"where I entered this realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid "I have found and killed Ashanta."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid "I have found and killed Dreet-Lai."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I have found and killed Enrion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I have found and killed Hlofgar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found evidence of Necromancers creating Black Soul Gems at the Dark "
"Fissure Cave, as well as other altars throughout Cyrodiil. I need to get this "
"information to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Ayleid Crown of Lindai, just as Herminia Cinna said. Now to "
"return to Umbacano to complete my task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE45_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I have found the Fork of Horripilation. I should return it to Big-Head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ12_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Great Welkynd Stone. Now to bring it to Martin at Cloud "
"Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Old Way. This is clearly a long abandoned sub-basement of "
"the Imperial City. It looks like it's going to be a long journey to get into "
"the Imperial Palace this way. I need to find the door that connects to the "
"palace interior. If I remember correctly, I will need the Arrow Extrication "
"to unlock time in order to open that door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG02Alter_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I have found the Ring of Burden, and should return it to Falcar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Shrine of Tiber Septim. Its entrance is blocked by some kind "
"of enchantment. I will have to find some way to dispel the enchantment in "
"order to reach the Armor inside the shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Shrine to Nocturnal and spoken with her followers. They have "
"agreed to allow me to speak to the Daedra. I may approach the statue. [You "
"must be level 10 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Shrine to Peryite, but something is wrong with his "
"worshippers. They seem frozen in time, mindless. None move or speak. [You "
"must be level 10 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC05Stone_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Stone of St. Alessia in Sedor. I should return it to Cirroc "
"at the Temple of Talos in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the Ulfgar family ring. This might be useful to leave as "
"evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the amulet Dagail needed. I should return it to her immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the carving that Umbacano wants. I need to get out of the ruins "
"and return to the Imperial City to deliver it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the entrance to the catacombs of Sancre Tor. I should search "
"them for the Shrine of Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have found the items Ma'zaddha hid in his house. The evidence points to "
"Nelrene, and I should confront her about it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the items Ma'zaddha hid in his house. There is evidence of "
"Muurine's involvement; this should be enough to get her to confess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have found the sewer entrance that the Gray Fox told me to look for. Now I "
"need to find the Old Way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE80_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I have freed Dar-Ma from the clutches of the foul creatures that infest "
"Hackdirt.  Now to escape and deliver her safely back to Seed-Neeus in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have freed all the ogres in the Bleak Mine. I should return to the Shrine "
"of Malacath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02Watery_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have gained access to the Captain's cabin of the ship Marie Elena. I must "
"now kill Gaston Tussaud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01Knife_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have gained entrance into the Dark Brotherhood Sanctuary. I must now speak "
"with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have gained entry to the Anvil Lighthouse cellar. I must now search the "
"cellar for some clue to the Dark Brotherhood traitor's identity, or motives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have gathered a soul from each of the ten races for Hermaeus Mora. I should "
"return to his shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have given Biene Amelion her grandfather's ceremonial sword and armor so "
"she may sell it in order to pay off her debt. I should return to gro-Khash in "
"Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS93_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have given Varulae her crystal ball. She gave me the captain's enchanted "
"cutlass as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS52_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have given the Journal of the Lord Lovidicus to Agronak gro-Malog. In "
"return for my assistance, he has shared some of his combat knowledge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE95_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I have given the evidence to Garrus he needs to remove Ulrich from office. He "
"said he would take it directly to the Count of Cheydinhal. He told me to meet "
"him at the Cheydinhal Bridge Inn in two hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have given the ring to Oreyn. This will allow him to prove that it was the "
"Fighters Guild who finally defeated Azani Blackheart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC06Courier_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have given weapons to the three Fighters Guild members. We should now clear "
"the Mine of goblins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have goaded Melus Petilius into attacking me with the Cursed Mace. I have "
"been transported back to the Shrine of Molag Bal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have goaded Melus Petilus into attacking me, but not with the Cursed Mace. "
"I have been transported back to Molag Bal's shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have heard a rumor that a strange doorway has appeared on a small island in "
"the Niben Bay. I should investigate. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have helped Savlian Matius and his men retake the southern plaza. I should "
"talk to him about our next move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have immersed my Staff in the Font of Madness. I have gained the power of "
"Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have ingested the Hist Sap potion. I feel a strange feeling coming over me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD00JoinFG_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have joined the Fighters Guild. I am to speak with Azzan in Anvil or Burz "
"gro-Khash in Cheydinhal to receive contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have joined the Mages Guild. I must acquire recommendations from all of the "
"local Guild Hall leaders in order to gain access to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark14Honor_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed Alval Uvani. I must pick up my reward and next contract at the "
"dead drop located in the Market District of the Imperial City, in a hollowed-"
"out tree stump behind Stonewall Shields."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid "I have killed Bernadette Peneles, as Glarthir requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE52_LOG0"
msgid "I have killed Davide Surilie, as Glarthir requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE82_LOG0"
msgid "I have killed Glarthir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed Hrol Ulfgar. I should leave something in his corpse to "
"implicate the Dalvilu clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed Nivan Dalvilu. I should leave something in his corpse to "
"implicate the Ulfgar clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I have killed Ri'Zakar. I should get the basement key from his corpse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE53_LOG0"
msgid "I have killed Toutius Sextius, as Glarthir requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed a member of the Mages Guild, and have been suspended from the "
"guild for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed a member of the Mages Guild, and have been suspended from the "
"guild for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGExpelled_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed a member of the Thieves Guild. Unless I pay the blood price, I "
"am sure to be cast out from the guild. I should talk to Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAAzura_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed all of the vampires in the Gutted Mine. I should return to the "
"shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I have killed all the livestock in Border Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed one of Namira's Forgotten Ones. I have failed my quest for the "
"Daedric Prince."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed one of the priests of Arkay, though I was to allow Namira's "
"Forgotten to do it. I have failed in the task set out by Namira."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07BloodPrice_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed someone while trying to get Hieronymus Lex reassigned to Castle "
"Anvil. I've been warned that I'll have to pay a blood price of 1000 gold per "
"murder if I want to stay in the Thieves Guild. I can pay S'krivva once I took "
"care of Hieronymus Lex."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04BloodPrice_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed someone while trying to recover Ahdarji's ring. S'krivva is "
"sure to find out and make me pay the blood price for it. I'll have to pay her "
"to get back into the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06BloodPrice_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed someone while trying to the Lost Histories of Tamriel. I've "
"been warned that I'll have to pay a blood price if I want to stay in the "
"Thieves Guild. I can pay S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG18KingofWorms_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed the King of Worms. I should return to the Arcane University to "
"announce his defeat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMeridia_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed the necromancers in Howling Cave. I should return to the Shrine "
"of Meridia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC09Ogres_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed the ogres who kidnapped Lady Rogbut. I should now escort her "
"back to her father's estate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed the shaman of the Cracked Wood Cave goblin tribe. I need to let "
"Barthel Gernand know it's safe to begin building the settlement at Cropsford."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHircine_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have killed the unicorn and retrieved its horn. I should return to the "
"shrine of Hircine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have learned Nivan Dalvilu is the head of the Dalvilu family, and Hrol "
"Ulfgar the leader of the Nordic clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have learned from the followers of Namira, that they will only summon the "
"Daedra for someone repulsive. If I am to get their help, I will need to make "
"my self less attractive to others. [You must be level 5 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE6_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have learned that Dairihill's office is in the castle's private quarters, "
"which is off limits. I should look for an indirect way to get in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I have learned that Petilius visits the grave of his wife every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have learned that the Flame of Agnon can only be lit by the Dark Seducers "
"or Golden Saints at the two altars that feed the Flame, the Altars of Rapture "
"and Depair. I need to help one side or the other take control of both altars "
"so that they will light the Flame for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have learned that the Flame of Agnon can only be lit by the Dark Seducers "
"or Golden Saints at the two altars that feed the Flame, the Altars of Rapture "
"and Depair. I need to help one side or the other take control of both altars "
"so that they will light the Flame for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid "I have learned where to retrieve the sword and armor for Biene Amelion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid "I have left the Dalvilu dagger in the corpse of Hrol Ulfgar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid "I have left the Ulfgar family ring in the corpse of Nivan Dalvilu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have lifted the curse from Kellen, which means taking it on myself. As a "
"result, I am weary and my fatigue has been affected. With the curse lifted, I "
"can now retrieve the Gauntlets of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have located the ruins of the High Fane, now known as Malada. I need to "
"explore Malada and recover the carved panel that Umbacano wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMarksman_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have met Alawen's requirements, and she has agreed to teach me what she "
"knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingDestruction_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have met Bralsa Andaren's demands, and she has agreed to teach me what she "
"knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have met Velwyn back at The Count's Arms. He congratulated me and then told "
"me he would be off again to live in the Imperial City. Now I can truly call "
"Benirus Manor my home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have met the one called Umbra and been offered a choice: stay and fight, or "
"leave in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08BloodPrice_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have murdered someone while trying to recover Savilla's Stone. I will have "
"to pay the blood price of 1000 gold to salvage my Thieves Guild membership. I "
"can pay Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have obeyed Mehrunes Dagon's will and reduced the guard to ashes. I shall "
"request my reward now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark11Kin_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have obtained a document that lists the locations of all the Draconis "
"family members. I must kill Matthias Draconis in the Talos Plaza District of "
"the Imperial City, Andreas Draconis in the Drunken Dragon Inn, Sibylla "
"Draconis in Muck Valley Cavern and Caelia Draconis in Castle Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have obtained a key to the Anvil Lighthouse cellar, where the traitor has "
"been living. I must unlock the cellar door and proceed down, so I may "
"continue my investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have obtained allies from everyone that might help. Bruma is as well-"
"defended as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MSShadowscale_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have obtained the Argonian's heart. I must now return to the Dark "
"Brotherhood Sanctuary in Cheydinhal and present it to Teinaava."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BloodPrice_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have paid the blood price for murder while trying to get membership in the "
"Thieves Guild. Apparently it's one of their rules that I can't kill anyone "
"while \"on the job.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGExpelled_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I have paid the fine and been readmitted into the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have passed the first hurdle. The Mythic Dawn guard has let me into the "
"secret shrine. Now to locate the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have persuaded one of Bravil's citizens to tell me more about the "
"fugitives. There are four of them. They are thought to be hiding in "
"Bloodmayne Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark13Justice_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have picked up my next contract from the dead drop beneath the Old Bridge. "
"I have been ordered to kill an Argonian hunter named Shaleez, who is holed up "
"in the Flooded Mine. She is a wanted psychopath, so I should be cautious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark12Harem_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have picked up my next contract from the dead drop in the Castle Skingrad "
"well. I have been ordered to kill the Khajiit J'Ghasta, who can be found at "
"his house in Bruma. J'Ghasta is a master of unarmed combat, and will prove a "
"challenging opponent. I should also be aware that J'Ghasta is expecting "
"trouble, and has paid off the guards to look the other way if our fight "
"spills out into the city streets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark14Honor_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have picked up my next contract from the dead drop in the coffin outside "
"Fort Redman. I have been ordered to kill Alval Uvani, a Dark Elf merchant who "
"spends his time traveling around Cyrodiil. I should consult the schedule that "
"has been left for me to determine where and when I should strike. Uvani is a "
"master in the Destruction school of magicka, and has killed before, but he "
"does have a weakness: if Alval Uvani drinks Mead, he will be rendered "
"immobile, due to a rare allergy to honey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark15Coldest_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have picked up my next contract from the dead drop in the hollowed-out tree "
"stump. I have been ordered to go to the campsite on Gnoll Mountain and kill "
"Havilstein Hoar-Blood, a savage Nord Barbarian skilled in the use of the axe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10SpecialWizard_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have picked up my reward and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark11Kin_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have picked up my reward and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark12Harem_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have picked up my reward and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark13Justice_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have picked up my reward and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark14Honor_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have picked up my reward and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark15Coldest_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have picked up my reward and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09Retirement_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have placed the finger of Adamus Phillida in the desk of his successor, in "
"his office in the Imperial City. I should now return to Ocheeva and claim my "
"reward, and bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have poisoned the grain supply in the town of Border Watch. This has killed "
"all the livestock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE11_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Akatosh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE12_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Arkay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE13_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Dibella."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE14_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Julianos."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Kynareth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE16_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Mara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE17_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Stendarr."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Talos."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE19_LOG0"
msgid "I have prayed at the Wayshrine of Zenithar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have prayed at the altar in the Chapel of Stendarr, and have been granted "
"the ability to Lay Hands on Kellen. I need to see him at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MSShadowscale_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have presented Teinaava with the Argonian's heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have reached The Shadeleaf Copse. I can now begin my search for the "
"Nirnroot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have read Jakben Imbel's diary, or should I say Springheel Jak's diary. Now "
"I understand why the boots were not in the tomb. Why bury such a valuable "
"item when you can wear it? Even more shocking, it seems that Springheel Jak "
"may have know the Gray Fox himself! They may have been partners in crime "
"several centuries ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09RetirementFIN_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have read the sealed orders from Lucien Lachance. I am to meet him at Fort "
"Farragut, which is in the wilderness northeast of the Dark Brotherhood "
"Sanctuary. Apparently, he has a special assignment for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10SpecialWizard_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have received my new orders from Lucien Lachance. I must go to Leafrot Cave "
"and kill a Necromancer who has begun the process of transforming himself into "
"a lich. This Necromancer, Celedaen, has not yet completed his metamorphosis "
"but is still incredibly powerful -- possibly too powerful to kill if faced "
"directly. I should search the cave for Celedaen's writings, and try to "
"discover his weakness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark11Kin_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have received my new orders from Lucien Lachance. I must kill every member "
"of the Draconis family -- Perennia Draconis, Matthias Draconis, Andreas "
"Draconis, Sibylla Draconis and Caelia Draconis. I know the location of only "
"the family matron, Perennia Draconis, who can be found on the farm known as "
"Applewatch. I should head to Applewatch, find out as much information as I "
"can on the locations of the other family members, and then systematically "
"kill them all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have received recommendations from all of the local guild halls in "
"Cyrodiil. I must now travel to the Arcane University, and speak with Raminus "
"Polus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCOrrery_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have recovered all of the missing Dwarven artifacts. I should take them to "
"Bothiel at the Arcane University at once, so she can repair the Orrery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have recovered the Gauntlets of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND05_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have recovered the Shield of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have recovered the Sword of the Crusader, but it has been desecrated by the "
"foul wraith that wielded it. I should take it to the Chapel of Arkay in "
"Cheydinhal to reconsecrate it to its holy purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE112_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have refused to give Ra'kheran the daggers that he needs to kill Ciirta. I "
"should return to him if I change my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have refused to steal \"Fingers of the Mountain\" for Earana. That should "
"be an end to my dealings with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have rented a bed at the Brina Cross Inn. I need to wait in my room for "
"Arielle Jurard, and then spend the night sleeping in the Inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10Sanctuary_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have reported back to Lucien Lachance at Fort Farragut. He has advanced me "
"to rank of Silencer and given me his own horse, a magical steed named "
"Shadowmere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have reported back to Vicente Valtieri. Because of my failure, I have "
"received no reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09RetirementFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have reported to Lucien Lachance at Fort Farragut, and received my special "
"assignment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have rescued Martin from the Chapel of Akatosh. He was surprised to learn "
"that Emperor Uriel Septim was his father, but has agreed to return to Weynon "
"Priory with me to speak to Jauffre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid "I have retrieved Dermis Membrane. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I have retrieved Osseous Marrow. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS93_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have retrieved Varulae's crystal ball. I must now return it to her on the "
"top deck of the Serpent's Wake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have retrieved the Ayleid Crown from Herminia Cinna's house. Now to deliver "
"it to Umbacano."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAVaermina_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have retrieved the Orb of Vaermina. I should now return it to the Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I have retrieved the Umbra Sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have retrieved the ceremonial sword and armor from the Amelion Tomb. I "
"should return them to Biene Amelion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE45_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have returned the Fork of Horripilation to Big-Head. He has told me a "
"secret as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC05Stone_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have returned the Stone of St. Alessia to Cirroc. As a show of his "
"gratitude, he's given me some Strong Healing Potions. I should return to "
"Azzan to collect my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC07Heirloom_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have returned to Burz gro-Khash, who was pleased with my efforts. He has "
"paid me what was owed on the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09Retirement_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have returned to Ocheeva at the Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have returned to the Sanctuary and spoken with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have returned to the mortal realm, and the souls of Peryite's followers "
"have gone back to their bodies. I should speak with the Daedra again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03BloodPrice_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have slain one of the residents of the Chapel of Arkay in Cheydinhal. I'll "
"have to pay the blood price for it. Armand told me it is 1000 gold per person "
"slain. Unfortunately, he will only talk to me after midnight in the Garden of "
"Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02BloodPrice_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have slain someone while trying to recover the tax records. Armand will not "
"be happy about this if he finds out. Murder is against the Thieves Guild "
"rules. It will cost me 1000 gold per person slain to get back into the guild. "
"Unfortunately, he will only talk to me after midnight in the Garden of "
"Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkExile_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have slain the Wrath of Sithis, and am no longer exiled from the Dark "
"Brotherhood. I may resume my duties as normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkExile2_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have slain the Wrath of Sithis, and am no longer exiled from the Dark "
"Brotherhood. I may resume my duties as normal. I should be wary, however, for "
"this was my last chance at redemption. If I invoke the Wrath of Sithis again, "
"I will be forever exiled, even if the spirit is slain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken to Arquen, and the Black Hand has been teleported to the site "
"of the ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken to Drarana Thelis in Harlun's Watch. She tells me that folks "
"have been seeing strange lights in the swamps, and when they've gone to "
"investigate, none have returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken to Modryn Oreyn, who tells me that, although he has been "
"expelled from the Fighters Guild, he will still work to restore its honor. To "
"that end, he wants me to go to the Glademist Cave and capture a Blackwood "
"Company leader, Ajum-Kajin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken to a resident of Brindle Home, who tells me that Petilius has "
"lived in a small house outside of town since the death of his wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Adrienne Berene in Skingrad. She told me I must not be a "
"wanted criminal if I wish to join the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Arquen and she has offered her guidance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD00JoinFG_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Azzan in Anvil. He has told me that I must not be a wanted "
"criminal or have a long history of lawlessness in order to join the Fighters "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD00JoinFG_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Burz gro-Khash in Cheydinhal. He has told me that I must "
"not be a wanted criminal or have a long history of lawlessness in order to "
"join the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE21_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Carahil in Anvil. She has told me I must not be a wanted "
"criminal if I wish to join the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Dagail in Leyawiin. She has told me that in order to join "
"the Mages Guild, I must not be a wanted criminal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Fafnir, the doorman, who appears to be a fellow member of "
"the Dark Brotherhood. He has provided me with the key to Summitmist Manor, "
"which I am to use only after all the guests lie dead. I should now proceed "
"inside and meet the other guests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE24_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Falcar in Cheydinhal. He has told me I cannot be a wanted "
"criminal if I wish to join the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE23_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Jeanne Frasoric in Bruma. She has told me I must not be a "
"wanted criminal if I wish to join the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Lord Drad. He believes the ogres to be suitable slaves, as "
"it does not violate Imperial Law. I fear I've angered him, though, and he "
"will no longer speak with me. Perhaps his wife will be more forthcoming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Lord Drad. He believes the ogres to be suitable slaves, as "
"they are mindless beasts, and is pleased with the ogres he uses in Bleak "
"Mine. It appears I will have to free the ogres myself, if I am to complete "
"Malacath's task for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Ocheeva and received a special reward, the Night Mother's "
"Blessing. I now have permanent increases to my Sneak, Blade, Security, "
"Acrobatics and Marksman skills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Ocheeva and received my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09RetirementFIN_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Ocheeva, and she has given me sealed orders from Lucien "
"Lachance himself. Apparently it is an urgent matter, and I must read the "
"orders as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01Knife_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG00Join_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Teekeus in Chorrol. He has told me that  I must not be a "
"wanted criminal if I wish to join the Mages Guild,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04Execution_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Vicente Valtieri and received my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Vicente Valtieri and received my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02Watery_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03Accidents_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have spoken with Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD00JoinFG_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have spoken with Vilena Donton in Chorrol. She has told me that I must not "
"be a wanted criminal or have a long history of lawlessness in order to join "
"the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have stolen Amantius Allectus' diary from Methredhel. Now to get back to "
"Armand at Dareloth's garden by midnight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have stolen from the Mages' Guild, and have been suspended from the guild "
"for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have stolen from the Mages' Guild, and have been suspended from the guild "
"for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have succeeded in casting the Stark Reality spell on the Countess of "
"Leyawiin and her company. I should return to the Shrine of Sanguine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have successfully entered Fort Sutch. I must now locate Roderick's medicine "
"and replace it with the bottle of posioned medicine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingConjuration_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have summoned a Faded Wraith for Olyn Seran, and he has agreed to train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have supllied Lorkmir with skooma, and gained some valuable information in "
"return. Every day, from 11:00 in the morning until 5:00 at night, Faelian "
"goes to Lorkmir's House, in the Elven Gardens District of the Imperial City. "
"The house is deserted, so Faelian goes there to use his skooma. I could kill "
"him there to avoid any witnesses. And, conveniently enough, he's even given "
"me a key. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have survived Dunroot Burrow. Now I need to search the tower above for the "
"Chalice of Reversal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have taken Rodericks' medicine. I must now put the bottle of poisoned "
"medicine in its place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC02Protect_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have taken care of the crooks breaking into Norbert Lelles' store. I should "
"speak with the shopkeeper himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have taken the Totem Head from the goblins at Timberscar Cave. I should "
"return to Mirisa and ask her what to do next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the Armor of Tiber Septim. Now to take it to Martin at Cloud Ruler "
"Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE45_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have the Bands of the Chosen. I should find the door to the Forbidden "
"Grotto and see if he was telling the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the Chalice of Reversal. It should be delivered to Thadon as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the Elder Scroll! This is the treasure of the century. My name shall "
"be known across Tamriel for this theft! Now to get it back to the Gray Fox. "
"The way back is blocked. I'll have to go upstairs to find a way out. Even "
"through they are blind, these monks will not be easy to sneak past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE161_LOG0"
msgid "I have the Key to Dementia and can enter through the Gates of Madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE160_LOG0"
msgid "I have the Key to Mania and can enter through the Gates of Madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the Lost Histories of Tamriel. Now all I have to do is return it to "
"S'krivva in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the Mysterium Xarxes, the Mythic Dawn's book of secrets. Now I must "
"escape this place and return to Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the boots. Now to get back to the Gray Fox in Ganredhel's house in "
"Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I have the bust. Now to get back to Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have the fourth and last volume of Mankar Camoran's writings on the "
"Mysterium Xarxes. I can now piece together the clues within them to find the "
"Mythic Dawn's secret shrine. Maybe Tar-Meena can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I have the key to the Sigil Keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I have the letter. Now I need to find a forger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I have told Arch-Mage Traven about Mannimarco's presence in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have used cheese to lure many rats into Border Watch. I should speak with "
"Ri'Bassa to see if he believes this to be part of the prophecy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10SanctuaryFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have visited my first dead drop location and received my next contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE117_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I have waited three days and embraced the Dark Gift. I am now a full vampire, "
"like Vicente."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE70_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I have witnessed Sheogorath create the Plague of Fear. I should return to the "
"Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid "I have witnessed the Plague of Fear. I should return to the Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I heard a rumor about the fortress of Vitharn in the far south of the "
"Shivering Isles. Someday I should investigate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseBravil_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I just bought a house in Bravil on the east side of the canal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseBruma_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I just bought a house in Bruma. It's right next to the main gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseCheydinhal_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I just bought a house in Cheydinhal. It's right next to the town statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseChorrol_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I just bought a house in Chorrol. It's on the main plaza and back up against "
"the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseLeyawiin_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I just bought a house in Leyawiin. It's right in the middle of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseSkingrad_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I just bought a house in Skingrad. It's just inside the main gate, next to "
"the bridge that leads to the Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseImperialCity_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I just bought a house in the Imperial City. It's in the Waterfront district, "
"on the far side of the harbor wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10BloodPrice_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I just killed someone while trying to get the Boots of Springheel Jak. That "
"will cost me my Thieves Guild membership unless I can pay the blood price of "
"1000 gold for each murder. I can pay Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I killed Mankar Camoran. Upon his death, the Paradise he had created "
"dissolved around me, and I found myself back in Cloud Ruler Temple with the "
"Amulet of Kings in my hand. I must give the Amulet to Martin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE210_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I killed one of the Demented residents of Split. I won't get rewarded for my "
"efforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE210_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I killed one of the Manic residents of Split. I won't get rewarded for my "
"efforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE36_LOG0"
msgid "I killed the Xivilai that I freed from the cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02taxes_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I learned that Hieronymus Lex has an office in the South Watchtower. That's "
"probably where he keeps the taxes and tax records. I should check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I learned that the Gray Fox is not immortal. The Gray Cowl of Nocturnal has "
"been passed from master thief to master thief for close to 300 years now. The "
"original thief that stole it from Nocturnal is long dead. So who is the "
"current Gray Fox?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I learned that the bust of Llathasa Indarys is in her tomb. She is buried in "
"the chapel undercroft of the Temple of Arkay in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met Barthel Gernand on the road southeast of the Imperial City. He and his "
"family wish to build a settlement at Cropsford, but have been unable to do so "
"thanks to marauding goblins. I should talk to Mirisa about how to clear the "
"goblins from the settlement site."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met Faelian, and he wants me to supply him with skooma. If I do that, he "
"may consider me a friend, making his elimination that much easier. Faelian "
"mentioned that a man named Nordinor in Bravil sells skooma, late at night..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE9_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met Glarthir behind the Great Chapel as he had asked.  He wanted me to help "
"uncover evidence of a conspiracy against him, but I decided not to get "
"involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met Modryn Oreyn at his house, as he requested. He told me a story about "
"Azani Blackheart, Vitellus Donton's death, and the Blackwood Company's "
"current involvement. He would like me to go with him now to find out what "
"really happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met S'razirr at the Tiber Septim Hotel and paid him for his help at Malada."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met Umbacano outside the ruins of Nenalata. I need to guide him safely to "
"the throne room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE54_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met a High Elf named Eldamil. He served Mankar Camoran and the Mythic Dawn "
"on Tamriel, but since coming to Gaiar Alata and seeing the true nature of "
"Mankar Camoran's 'paradise', he claims to have regretted his deeds. He warned "
"me that it was impossible to leave these caves while wearing the Bands of the "
"Chosen, and offered to help me by removing them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I met a Khajiit named S'razirr in the wilderness near Malada. He admitted "
"that he is working for Claude Maric. He agreed to help me against Maric in "
"return for half of my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE40_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I met a Khajiit named S'razirr in the wilderness near Malada. He admitted "
"that he is working for Claude Maric. He agreed to help me against Maric in "
"return for one quarter of my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met a dremora named Kathutet who offered to help me get into the Forbidden "
"Grottos if I helped him by freeing a Xivilai that the Mythic Dawn immortals "
"have trapped in a cave. He claimed that the only way to leave the Savage "
"Garden was by wearing the Bands of the Chosen, which he would give me if I "
"help him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE32_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met a dremora named Kathutet who told me that he holds the key to the "
"Forbidden Grotto, which he claims is the only way out of the Savage Garden. I "
"should find out what this key is and get it from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met a ghost named Count Cirion in the haunted keep of Vitharn. "
"Unfortunately, I insulted him before he could tell me his tale. Now I'm "
"locked into the keep. There must be a way out. Maybe I can talk to the other "
"ghosts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I met a mysterious Wood Elf named Glarthir in Skingrad who asked me to meet "
"him behind the Great Chapel at midnight tonight.  He wouldn't tell me what it "
"was about, but promised to make it worth my while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06WandererFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07MedicineFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08WhodunitFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09RetirementFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01KnifeFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03AccidentsFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04ExecutionFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05AssassinatedFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a contract from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02WateryFIN_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I must accept a quest from Vicente Valtieri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04Execution_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must break into the Imperial Prison and kill a Dark Elf prisoner named "
"Valen Dreth. I will receive a special bonus if I manage not to kill any "
"guards. I can enter the Imperial Prison through the connecting sewers, which "
"can be accessed through a locked manhole just outside the prison walls. "
"Vicente has provided me with a key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingDestruction_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must bring 20 bear pelts to Bralsa Andaren so that she will agree to teach "
"me what she knows about Destruction magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must escort Martin to the Elder Council Chambers in the Imperial Palace, to "
"formally present his claim to the Septim Throne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingArmorer_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must find the answer to Gin-Wulm's question: \"What does the name Hazadir "
"mean to you?\" He hinted that a book in the shop First Edition may have the "
"answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingRestoration_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must finish saving Kvatch from the Daedra that have attacked it before "
"Oleta will train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must follow Baurus to the Sunken Sewer beneath the Elven Gardens District "
"and obtain Volume 4 of Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries on the Mysterium "
"Xarxes\". One of us will need to meet \"The Sponsor\" alone to get the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid "I must follow the man who is watching Baurus and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to Chorrol, break into Francois Motierre's house, and then speak "
"with him. Motierre requested we meet this way, so he is expecting me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark08Whodunit_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to Summitmist Manor in Skingrad, meet with the other guests, and "
"pretend I too have been invited by a mysterious, unknown host. I must then "
"kill all the other guests. I should start my mission by speaking with the "
"doorman, just outside the manor. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to the Imperial City, find a High Elf named Faelian, and kill him. "
"If there are any witnesses to the killing, or if I eliminate him in any non-"
"secure location, my reward will be greatly reduced.  I should start my search "
"by asking any Elves in the Imperial City if they've ever heard of Faelian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark06Wanderer_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to the Imperial City, find a High Elf named Faelian, and kill him. "
"If there are any witnesses to the killing, or if I kill him in any non-secure "
"location, my reward will be greatly reduced.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02Watery_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to the Waterfront District in the Imperial City and gain access to "
"the pirate ship Marie Elena, so I can kill Captain Gaston Tussaud. I may be "
"able to smuggle myself onboard with the cargo, in one of the packing crates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark16Kiss_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to the city of Bravil, and lie in wait near the ancient statue "
"known as the Lucky Old Lady. A Wood Elf named Ungolim visits the statue every "
"night between around 6:00 PM and 1:00 AM to make a wish, as is the local "
"custom. When I see Ungolim, I must kill him. I should be warned, however, "
"that Ungolim has been alerted to danger, and if he senses an assassin will "
"probably attack on sight. He has also bribed the guards to look the other way "
"if there is a fight. Perhaps a stealth approach would be best..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03Accidents_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must go to the city of Bruma, find Baenlin's house, and gain entrance. Once "
"inside, I should stage a tragic accident.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MSShadowscale_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must journey to the southeastern tip of Cyrodiil, to a swamp known as "
"Bogwater. There I will find a renegade Shadowscale known as Scar-Tail. I must "
"kill Scar-Tail, and return his heart to Teinaava."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark09Retirement_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must kill Adamus Phillida, a recently retired Imperial Legion officer, who "
"has taken up residence in the City Watch barracks in Leyawiin. For this task, "
"I have been given an enchanted arrow called the Rose of Sithis. If I can hit "
"Phillida with the arrow when he is not wearing his armor, the strike will be "
"fatal. I should head to Leyawiin, stalk Adamus Phillida, and attack when the "
"moment is right. The contract will be complete when Phillida lies dead, "
"whether I use the Rose of Sithis or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10Sanctuary_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must kill every Dark Brotherhood member in the Cheydinhal Sanctuary -- "
"Ocheeva, Vicente Valtieri, Antoinetta Marie, Gogron gro-Bolmog, Telaendril, "
"M'raaj-Dar and Teinaava. Because I am now working for the Black Hand, I am no "
"longer bound by the Five Tenets, and should employ any means necessary to "
"Purify the Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01Knife_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must now go to the abandoned house in the city of Cheydinhal, and attempt "
"to open the door in the basement. When questioned, I must answer with "
"\"Sanguine, my Brother\" to gain access to the secret Dark Brotherhood "
"Sanctuary. Once inside, I should speak with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHandtoHand_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must prove my worthiness to Helvius Cecia before he will consider training "
"me. He's asked that I hit him as hard as I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlteration_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must remain with Tooth-in-the-Sea for three consecutive hours if I am to "
"prove myself worthy of his training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingDestruction_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must seek out Bralsa Andaren if I wish to learn more about Destruction "
"magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must sneak into Fort Sutch, find the medicine of the debilitated warlord "
"Roderick, and replace it with the poisoned bottle Ocheeva has given me. If I "
"am detected by any of the mercenaries, or if Roderick is killed in any other "
"manner, my bonus is forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE12_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must sneak into Fort Sutch, find the medicine of the debilitated warlord "
"Roderick, and replace it with the poisoned bottle Ocheeva has given me. If I "
"am detected by any of the mercenaries, or if Roderick is killed in any other "
"manner, my bonus is forfeit. Fortunately, I've learned of an alternate way "
"inside that should be unguarded. Not far from the ruins of Fort Sutch lie the "
"ruins of the Fort Sutch Abbey. If I enter there, I can get to Fort Sutch "
"underground through some flooded tunnels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must wait in Francois Motierre's house for the enforcer Hides-His-Heart to "
"arrive. After this \"confrontation,\" I am to slice Motierre once with the "
"specially poisoned Languorwine Blade to stage his death. I must do this "
"before Hides-His-Heart attacks Motierre!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TestToddQuest_STAGE0_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I must walk around and test everything. First I should go into the forest "
"outside the toddtest room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I need to accompany Savlian Matius to the gates of Castle Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingLightArmor_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to bring J'bari an Elven Cuirass if I want him to train me in Light "
"Armor use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE20_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I need to bring Umbacano one of the Ayleid Crowns, either by stealing the "
"Crown of Nenalata from Herminia Cinna, or by recovering the Crown of Lindai "
"as Herminia Cinna suggested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingIllusion_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to bring ten Welkynd Stones to Martina Floria if I want her help in "
"Illusion training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE41_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to bring the Totem Head to Mirisa, so she can be sure that the goblin "
"threat to Cropsford is ended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I need to deliver the Ayleid artifact to Irlav Jarol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlock_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to demonstrate to Andragil that I can block her attacks. I'll need to "
"prepare as well as I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG02Alter_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to enter the well behind the Mages Guild in Cheydinhal to retrieve a "
"Ring of Burden for Falcar. The last person given this task has disappeared; "
"should I learn anything about him, I should speak with Deetsan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMarksman_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I need to find Alawen, so that I may master my use of a bow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlade_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find Alix Lencolia if I want more training in the use of Blades. "
"It's been suggested that he's at Faregyl Inn; I should look for him there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find Bothiel in the Arcane University and speak with her about this "
"\"Shade of the Revenant\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND05_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find Fort Bulwark, and locate the Shield of the Crusader inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlunt_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find Irene Metric in the Imperial City if I want her help in Blunt "
"weapon training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find an amulet so that Dagail will send a recommendation to the "
"Arcane University for me. Agata may know more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I need to find the Ayleid ruins of Vahtacen and speak with Skaleel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find the Dark Fissure, south of Cheydinhal, before the next time "
"\"the Shade of the Revenant\" occurs. I should be on the lookout for the "
"\"heavenly lights\" mentioned in the Necromancer's book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find the fort at which Dagail's father was stationed. It should be "
"somewhere near Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to find the grove near Wellspring Cave, northeast of the Imperial "
"City, to acquire wood for my Mage's Staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I need to follow Antus and Rallus Odiil to their farm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to follow Savlian Matius into Castle Kvatch, and help find the Count "
"of Kvatch, Ormellius Goldwine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I need to get Kishashi to trust me. She mentioned needing five Pod Pits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG02Alter_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I need to get the key to the Cheydinhal Mages' Guild well from Deetsan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHeavyArmor_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to give Malene the silver pitcher and four silver glasses as a gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid "I need to go into the Oblivion Gate and figure out how to close it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE17_LOG0"
msgid "I need to go to Bleak Flats Cave and find Erthor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I need to go to Sancre Tor, find the Shrine of Tiber Septim and bring his "
"ancient armor back to Martin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I need to go to the Mystic Archives and speak with Tar-Meena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE45_LOG1"
msgid "I need to help Savlian Matius break the siege of Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ08_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I need to locate a Daedric Artifact and bring it back to Martin at Cloud "
"Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG8"
msgid ""
"I need to locate the Ayleid ruin known as the High Fane. Most likely, it is "
"now known by a different name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to look for Berich Inian in Kvatch's Chapel, and ask him for a key to "
"the Guard House."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG06Bruma_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to meet Volanaro in the living quarters of the Bruma Mages Guild hall "
"after 10 PM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMercantile_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to prove to Palonirya that I have what it takes to succeed in business "
"by showing her at least ten thousand gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid "I need to reach the Wellspring of the Aureal within Brellach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I need to reach the Wellspring of the Mazken within Pinnacle Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to rent a bed for the night at the Brina Cross Inn, while posing as a "
"traveling merchant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to report to Sheogorath that Xedilian is working, and that Knights of "
"Order have appeared in the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to return to Weynon Priory with Martin and discuss our next move with "
"Jauffre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG02Alter_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to search Falcar's quarters in the Cheydinhal Mages' Guild for any "
"sign of his recommendation letter. If found, it should be given to Deetsan, "
"along with anything unusual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE45_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I need to see if anyone in the camp outside Kvatch will help me rescue Martin "
"and the other people trapped in the Chapel of Akatosh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlchemy_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to seek out Sinderion in Skingrad if I wish to learn more about "
"Alchemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid "I need to speak to Earana, and find out why she is in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak to the Duke of Mania and the Duchess of Dementia, as "
"Sheogorath wishes for me to better understand the inner workings of his Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Arielle Jurard at the Brina Cross Inn, north of Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Count Hassildor of Skingrad. I should find his Steward "
"at Castle Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG12Gate_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Hannibal Traven, who has a special assignment for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHandtoHand_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Helvius Cecia in Bruma about training hand to hand "
"combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG19Alchemy_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Julienne Fanis about collecting Alchemical ingredients "
"for the Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingIllusion_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Martina Floria if I want further Illusion training. She "
"can be found at the Arcane University in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMercantile_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Palonirya in the Imperial City if I want her help "
"training my Mercantile skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with Thadon in order to learn more about the realm of Mania. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSpeechcraft_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with every beggar in Cyrodiil before Tandilwe will agree to "
"train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to speak with the mages in the Leyawiin guild hall, in case any of "
"them have seen Dagail's amulet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to talk to Carahil in Anvil and inform her that Caminalda has been "
"defeated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG06Bruma_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I need to tell Jeanne Frasoric that J'skar is visible again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to Brellach, and help the Golden Saints retake their "
"stronghold from the forces of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG16Amulet_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to Fort Ontus to retrieve the Necromancer's Amulet, and "
"return it to the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG15Helm_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to Fort Teleman and retrieve the Bloodworm Helm, so that it "
"may be kept safe at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG12Gate_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to Nenyond Twyll, south of the Imperial City, and make sure "
"Mucianus Alias is safely rescued from the Necromancers there. I am to escort "
"him back to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to Pinnacle Rock, and help the Dark Seducers retake their "
"stronghold from the forces of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to the House of Dementia, and seek an audience with Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG17Ambush_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to travel to the south of Cyrodiil and meet a group of Battlemages "
"preparing to storm the ruins of Silorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG06Bruma_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I need to unlock Jeanne's desk in her room upstairs in the Bruma Mages Guild, "
"and find her Manual of Spellcraft. If I bring it to Volanaro, he's agreed to "
"help me find J'skar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I now have Grantham's map in my possession. With it, I should be able to find "
"the location of his treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE45_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I now have Volume 3 of the four books I need, but I should find out why the "
"bookseller had it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE45_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I now have Volume 3 of the four books I need. I now need to meet with the "
"Sponsor to get Volume 4, but I should find Baurus first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I now have Volume 3 of the four books I need. I should search Gwinas's body "
"for clues to what he wanted with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE45_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I now have Volume 3 of the four books I need. I should wait for Gwinas to "
"come to the store, and see why he wanted it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE45_LOG4"
msgid ""
"I now have Volume 3 of the four books I need. I still need to find out what "
"Gwinas wanted with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I now have all of the items required by Relmyna Verenim. I should return to "
"her. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I overheard Bejeen and Weebam-Na speaking of Tidewater Cave, and the treasure "
"they've hidden there. I should investigate the cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE48_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I overheard Bejeen and Weebam-Na talking, but they stopped when they realized "
"I was there. I must eavesdrop on them without being detected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I overheard the pompous Hieronymous Lex say that there is an informant in the "
"Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I overheard two Golden Saint officers arguing about the best way to attack "
"the Dark Seducers. The lieutenant, Mirel, mentioned something about the "
"Underdeep, a secret side passage leading to the Dark Seducer altar. I should "
"find out more about this passage from Mirel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04BloodPrice_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I paid S'krivva the blood price for my killings. Recovering Ahdarji's ring "
"cost me more than I earned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02BloodPrice_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I paid my blood price to be readmitted into the Thieves Guild. With that out "
"of the way, Armand has promoted me to Footpad in the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03BloodPrice_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid "I paid my blood price. Armand has readmitted me into the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I persuaded Mazoga to forgive me. She explained that she was angry because "
"she was seeking revenge on one of the four bandits, Mogens Wind-Shifter, for "
"the murder of her friend, Ra'vindra. Mazoga forgave me for spoiling her "
"vengeance. Now I must report to Marius Caro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I placed the \"betrothed\" doll on one of the invaders. Desideratus will have "
"to fight them to rescue his \"betrothed\" now. I should go tell him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE90_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I promised to pay S'razirr half my reward for his help. I should meet him at "
"the Tiber Septim Hotel ... if I intend to keep my side of our bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE90_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I promised to pay S'razirr one quarter of my reward for his help. I should "
"meet him at the Tiber Septim Hotel ... if I intend to keep my side of our "
"bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ14_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I reached the Great Sigil Stone and closed the Gate. The Battle of Bruma is "
"won! Now to give the sigil stone to Martin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I read the note that Hieronymus Lex dropped. Apparently he used guards from "
"the Arcane University in his lockdown of the Waterfront. The wizards are "
"blaming him for the theft of the Icestaff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCBattlehornCastle_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I received a note from Nilphas Omellian, offering to install an ancient "
"Dwemer Forge in Battlehorn Castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQDragonArmor_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I received the Imperial Dragon armor that Chancellor Ocato had forged for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I reported the 'attacks' on the family leaders. Soon the families will be at "
"each other's throats. Now I must return to the shrine of Mephala."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I reported to Glarthir that Davide Surilie was spying on him, just as he had "
"suspected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I reported to Glarthir that Toutius Sextius was watching him, just as he had "
"thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG02taxes_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I returned the tax records and taxes to Armand. He let me keep the gold. The "
"Gray Fox will redistribute them to the peasants in the Waterfront district "
"using money from the guild treasury. Armand has promoted me to Footpad in the "
"Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC06Courier_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I returned to Burz gro-Khash, who was not happy I allowed other guild members "
"to die. I was still rewarded for delivering the weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I returned twenty bear pelts to Vilena Donton, and I have been reinstated "
"into the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should begin asking around New Sheoth about Thadon's court and learn the "
"best way to get him to overdose on Greenmote without his knowledge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should find Relmyna at midnight, and spy on her visit with the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE30_LOG5"
