"I should find Relmyna at midnight, and spy on her visit with the Gatekeeper. "
"I can also find Jayred to get the arrows made from dead Gatekeeper bones, "
"once he is done making them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE30_LOG4"
