"to Relmyna to learn more about the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE60_LOG6"
msgid ""
"I should follow Jayred to the \"Gardens of Flesh and Bone.\" I can also use "
"Relmyna's Tears to harm the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should free the spirits of the other cursed Blades of Sancre Tor, so that "
"they can help to dispel the Underking's evil enchantment from the Shrine of "
"Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE51_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should meet Glarthir at midnight tonight behind the Great Chapel to collect "
"my final payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE52_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should meet Glarthir at midnight tonight behind the Great Chapel to collect "
"my final payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE53_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should meet Glarthir at midnight tonight behind the Great Chapel to collect "
"my final payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should play along for now, until I figure out who the traitor is. I'm sure "
"Arquen will give me further instruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should prepare myself to travel to Camoran's Paradise and take back the "
"Amulet of Kings from Mankar Camoran. When I am ready, I should meet Martin in "
"the Great Hall at Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ08_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should read \"Modern Heretics\" for information about how to locate a "
"daedric artifact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should report to Sheogorath that I have lit the Great Torch as he requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should return to Chorrol in one week's time to see if Jirolin has made any "
"progress with the ogres."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE25_LOG1"
msgid ""
