"Relmyna's Tears to harm the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should talk to Savlian Matius, the acting captain of the surviving Kvatch "
"guard. He may know if Martin survived the fall of the city. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE20_LOG6"
msgid "I should talk to the sorceress Relmyna Verenim about the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

