"also tell Jayred I'm ready to go to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should talk to the sorceress Relmyna Verenim about the Gatekeeper. Jayred "
"is still willing to come fight the Gatekeeper with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should tell Captain Burd about the visitor staying with Jearl, since he "
"said there were no strangers in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHeavyArmor_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should tell Pranal that I've given Malene the gift he wanted her to have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I should tell the Countess of Bruma that Martin will meet her in the Chapel "
"of Talos for a war council."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I should travel to the Arcane University in the Imperial City and speak with "
"Raminus Polus about the possibility of a cure for Vampirism."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I showed Glarthir's note to a town guard, who told me they would handle the "
"matter from here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I slid the note into the Archmage's night stand. Now to get the staff back to "
"Methredhel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to Chancellor Ocato, the head of the Elder Council. He was unable to "
"promise any soldiers from the Imperial Legions, since they are all tied down "
"in the provinces fighting the daedric invasion. He suggested I ask the Counts "
"and Countesses of Cyrodiil for help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to Jensine in the Imperial market district about the corrupt "
"watchman. She told me the same story as Ruslan and Luronk. The Imperial Watch "
"Captain Audens Avidius is extorting money from the shopkeepers. They are all "
"too afraid of him to do anything about it. I need to find someone with the "
"authority to stop him. She says only another watch captain would be able to "
"arrest him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE32_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to Savlian Matius of the Kvatch guard. He would like to send help to "
"Bruma, but he cannot spare the troops until the city is completely retaken "
"from the daedra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to Weebam-Na and gave him Mazoga's message. Weebam-Na doesn't want to "
"cooperate. Perhaps I can persuade him to change his mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to a Dark Seducer guarding the ruins of Cylarne. She told me that the "
"Flame of Agnon can only be lit by the Dark Seducers or Golden Saints at the "
"two altars that feed the Flame, the Altars of Rapture and Depair. I need to "
"help one side or the other take control of both altars so that they will "
"light the Flame for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to a Golden Saint guarding the ruins of Cylarne. She told me that the "
"Flame of Agnon can only be lit by the Dark Seducers or Golden Saints at the "
"two altars that feed the Flame, the Altars of Rapture and Despair. I need to "
"help one side or the other take control of both altars so that they will "
"light the Flame for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE27_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Bravil. He promised to send some of his best soldiers "
"to help defend Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Bravil. He said he would be glad to send help, if "
"only his own city wasn't threatened by an Oblivion Gate. I should close the "
"gate outside Bravil and then talk to the Count again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Cheydinhal. He promised to send some of his best "
"soldiers to help defend Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Cheydinhal. He said he would be glad to send help, if "
"only his own city wasn't threatened by an Oblivion Gate. I should close the "
"gate outside Cheydinhal and then talk to the Count again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE29_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Leyawiin. He promised to send soldiers to help defend "
"Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE28_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Leyawiin. He said cannot send aid to Bruma with an "
"Oblivion Gate threatening his own city. I should close the gate outside "
"Leyawiin and then talk to the Count again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE23_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Skingrad. He promised to send some of his best "
"soldiers to help defend Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Count of Skingrad. He said he would be glad to send help, if "
"only his own city wasn't threatened by an Oblivion Gate. I should close the "
"gate outside Skingrad and then talk to the Count again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE21_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Countess of Anvil. She promised to send some of her best "
"soldiers to help defend Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Countess of Anvil. She said she would be glad to send help, if "
"only her own city wasn't threatened by an Oblivion Gate. I should close the "
"gate outside Anvil and then talk to the Countess again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Countess of Chorrol. She promised to send some of her best "
"soldiers to help defend Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE24_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke to the Countess of Chorrol. She said she would be glad to send help, "
"if only her own city wasn't threatened by an Oblivion Gate. I should close "
"the gate outside Chorrol and then talk to the Countess again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Armand Christophe, who is a member of the Thieves Guild. He "
"offered me a chance to join the guild, but I have to compete against two "
"other thieves, Methredhel and Amusei. Which ever one of us steals Amantius "
"Allectus' Diary first will be inducted into the Thieves Guild. It's somewhere "
"in the Imperial City. He told me that the beggars might be able to tell me "
"where to find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Bogrum gro-Galash at the Lonely Suitor Lodge. He told me that "
"the description I gave matched the inn's cook, Ranaline. She's a reclusive "
"Dunmer, I should try and find her to see what she knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCOrrery_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Bothiel from the Arcane Univesity and she gave me a note "
"mentioning a shipment of Dwarven artifacts that has been stolen by bandits. "
"She said she would pay handsomely for retrieving them. I should head towards "
"Camp Ales and get my hands on those artifacts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Enilroth, a Wood Elf boy who was paid by a \"robed man\" to put "
"the dead drop items in the barrel by the pond. Enilroth told me the man had "
"been living in the cellar of the Anvil Lighthouse, but recently left. This "
"robed man must be the traitor! I must speak with Ulfgar Fog-Eye, the "
"Lighthouse keeper, and see if he can be persuaded to part with a key to the "
"cellar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Kaneh, the commander of the Golden Saints in Cylarne. She is "
"preparing to assault the altar controlled by the Dark Seducers, and believes "
"that with my help, they could finally drive the Seducers out of Cylarne. Once "
"she controls both altars, she will be glad to light the Flame of Agnon for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCHorseArmor_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Snak Gra-Bura from the Chestnut Handy Stables. She says she can "
"provide armor for horses. I should bring a horse to her and get it armored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Ulfri, the commander of the Dark Seducers in Cylarne. She is "
"preparing to defend her position against a Golden Saint attack, and promised "
"that if I help her destroy the Golden Saints, she will light the Flame of "
"Agnon for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I spoke with a Dunmer named Ranaline. She seemed to know about the notes but "
"looked very distrustful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE190_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I stepped into the Flame of Agnon and am now ablaze with the holy fire. I "
"should return to New Sheoth and light the Great Torch in the Sacellum Arden-"
"Sul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE91_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I stepped into the void to try and reach the Mace of Zenithar, but my feet "
"met nothing but air and I fell into the darkness. There must be a way to walk "
"between the platforms and reach the mace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I told Glarthir that Bernadette Peneles was not watching or following him.  "
"He was surprised but seemed to accept it as true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Glarthir that Bernadette Peneles was watching him, as he suspected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I told Glarthir that Davide Surilie was not spying on him.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Glarthir that I would not kill anyone for him. He took it badly, and "
"now seems determined to take matters into his own hands. I fear he may become "
"violent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I told Glarthir that Toutius Sextius was not watching or following him.  He "
"was harder to convince this time, and seems to be starting to mistrust me now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE30_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I told Glarthir that Toutius Sextius was not watching or following him.  He "
"was surprised but seemed to accept it as true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Hieronymus Lex that Myvryna was the thief. He didn't believe me, "
"probably because she is his informant. Fortunately his overblown sense of "
"duty will make him check it out anyway. He is insisting I follow him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk01_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Ilav about my findings. He mentioned a Time Wound. I do not know much "
"about it, but it is apparently being opened by an Elder Scroll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE42_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I told Kaneh I wasn't ready to help her attack the Dark Seducers. I should "
"probably speak to the Dark Seducers' commander before deciding which side I "
"want to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I told Kaneh that I would help her defeat the Dark Seducers who control the "
"Altar of Despair. We attack immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Kaneh that I would scout the Dark Seducer positions and report back to "
"her. I should check their deployments in both the main passage and the "
"Underdeep, so that I can recommend the best way to assault the Altar of "
"Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Mazoga about the four bandits I killed at Fisherman's Rock. She was "
"angry, and she won't tell me why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Modryn Oreyn that I completed Maglir's contract. He doesn't believe "
"it's good to let Maglir slide on these things, but he applauded my sense of "
"duty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Modryn Oreyn that I convinced Maglir to complete the contract. I'm not "
"certain he believed me, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE62_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I told Ulfri I wasn't ready to help her defeat the Golden Saints. I should "
"probably speak to the Golden Saints commander before deciding which side I "
"want to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Ulfri that I could lead the Golden Saints into an ambush if she "
"redeployed her troops into the Underdeep. She agreed to my plan. Now I must "
"return to Kaneh and decide who I want to betray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told Ulfri that I would try to find out the Golden Saints' attack plans, "
"and then report back to her. She suggested that I speak to Kaneh, the Saints' "
"commander, who should be at their main encampment at the Altar of Rapture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I told the Countess of Martin's plans. She reluctantly agreed, and is going "
"to meet Martin at the Chapel of Talos. When I am ready for battle, I should "
"inform the Countess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE71_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I took a note from Gwinas, from someone in the Mythic Dawn calling themselves "
"\"The Sponsor\". The note explains that Volume 4, one of the books I need, "
"can only be given to you by a member of the Mythic Dawn. He was to go alone "
"and sit at the table in the Sunken Sewer beneath the Imperial City, where The "
"Sponsor would meet him. I will go and take that meeting instead, but must get "
"Volume 3 first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE71_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I took a note from Gwinas, from someone in the Mythic Dawn calling themselves "
"\"The Sponsor\". The note explains that Volume 4, the last book I need, can "
"only be given to you by a member of the Mythic Dawn. He was to go alone and "
"sit at the table in the Sunken Sewer beneath the Imperial City, where The "
"Sponsor would meet him. I will go and take that meeting instead, but should "
"find Baurus first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE76_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I took back the carving from Claude Maric. Now to deliver it to Umbacano."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I took the Bands of the Chosen from a Dremora named Kathutet. Perhaps they "
"will provide the means to help me escape from the Savage Garden and reach "
"Mankar Camoran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk02_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I took the Elder Scroll from the lich. I must keep it with me at all times "
"and bring it back to Ilav as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I tried reporting Audens Avidius to Hieronymus Lex, who is one of the other "
"guard captains. He is busy chasing after the Gray Fox. He said I should try "
"the third guard captain, Itius Hayn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I tried reporting Audens Avidius to Servatius Quintilius, who is one of the "
"other guard captains. He is new to the job and won't act against one of the "
"other guard captains. He said I should try the third guard captain, Itius "
"Hayn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I tried to bribe my way into the jail to see Theranis, but the jailor is too "
"honest. Either that or he is terrified of Count Hassildor. It's too bad I "
"can't get a job in the castle. What does a guy have to do in this town to see "
"the inside of the jail? Get arrested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE44_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I used the second Reverse Invisibility spell Ancotar gave me, but I wasn't in "
"Aleswell when I did it, so I need to ask Ancotar for another one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was able to join the Blackwood Company. I am to report to the training room "
"to prepare for an upcoming mission."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was ambushed by Claude Maric outside of Malada, but I refused to hand over "
"the Ayleid carving. I must escape and return the carving to Umbacano in the "
"Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was ambushed by Claude Maric outside of Malada. He forced me to hand over "
"the Ayleid carving. I should return to the Imperial City and find out how "
"much Umbacano knew about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE54_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was ambushed by Claude Maric outside of Malada. I must escape and return "
"the carving to Umbacano in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was detected while attempting to cast the spell of Stark Reality on the "
"Countess of Leyawiin and her guests. I should return to the Shrine of "
"Sanguine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was discovered while attempting to overhear Mazaddha's conversation with "
"Nelrene. I will have to try again another night, and be more careful to "
"remain undetected. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG00FindThievesGuild_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was given a mysterious note by a mysterious Dark Elf. It offers greater "
"wealth and less jail time. Maybe I should check it out. I have to wait until "
"midnight, and then go to the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark16Kiss_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I was intercepted by Lucien Lachance shortly after Ungolim was killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I was struck by lightning, and have been granted a powerful new spell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid "I was struck by lightning, and have been granted a powerful new spell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk01_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was told an old priest in Kvatch is losing faith because of mysterious "
"disappearances. I should try to find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was told by a resident of Cheydinhal that there is in fact a Guilbert "
"Jemane in town. I should go find this Guilbert and uncover his relation to "
"Reynald."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was told by one of the townspeople in Cheydinhal that the guards have been "
"imposing heavy and unfair fines lately. This seemed to begin ever since the "
"new Captain of the Guard, Ulrich Leland, took office. I was referred to "
"Llevana Nedaren, who lives in the south end of town, as she is the most vocal "
"about her dislike of the new commander."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseSkingrad_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I was told that I need to speak with Shum gro-Yarug to buy a house in "
"Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I went to Modryn Oreyn to ask about duties, but he told me he had no "
"\"official\" duties. However, he asked me to meet him at his house later "
"tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSecurity_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I wish to learn more about Security, I need to find J'baana in the Legion "
"Headquarters of the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ02_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I witnessed Emperor Uriel Septim's assassination. Before he died, the emperor "
"gave me the Amulet of Kings. He told me to take it to someone named Jauffre, "
"and that Jauffre would know how to find his last surviving son. He warned "
"that the assassins were in the service of the Lord of Destruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I'm hearing a strange report of odd noises and smells coming from around "
"Rosentia Gallenus's house here in Leyawiin. Perhaps I should go and "
"investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I'm taking the Jemane brothers back to Weatherleah to reclaim their "
"inheritance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've accepted Ra'kheran's offer. He wants me to bring him three Apostle "
"Daggers. He will then carry out his revolt against Ciirta and I should be "
"able to retrieve her eye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've accepted the task. Countess Carvain revealed that she has the diary of a "
"messenger from the original Akiviri army that marched on Cyrodiil at the end "
"of the First Era. The messenger's diary supposedly gives clues to the "
"location of the ruins at Pale Pass. The Countess has provided me with a map, "
"a translation of the diary to use as a guide and a key that may unlock a door "
"at the site."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ09_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've acquired 12 Rumare Slaughterfish Scales. I should bring them to Aelwin "
"Merowald at the Weye Settlement as soon as I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've acquired Agarmir's shovel still damp with the fresh earth of the open "
"grave. This is the final bit of proof I need of Agarmir's crimes. I should "
"bring it back to Thoronir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE70_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've acquired Cindanwe's notebook. I should speak with Ranarr-Jo to tell him "
"the mission is accomplished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've acquired Cindanwe's notebook. Maybe I should talk to the other people in "
"the settlement about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've acquired a spoon from Kishashi that supposedly will get Ranarr-Jo to "
"trust me. I should talk to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've acquired refined frost salts from Julienne. I should now make my way to "
"Frostfire Glade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've agreed to find work for my three guildmates here in Leyawiin. Perhaps "
"some of the locals know of some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE16_LOG0"
msgid "I've agreed to kill all of the Demented in Split."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid "I've agreed to kill all of the Manics living in Split."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've agreed to look for Dar-Ma, the daughter of Seed-Neeus of Chorrol. I "
"should go to Hackdirt and speak to Etira Moslin, the owner of the village "
"store. Seed-Neeus also suggested I look for Dar-Ma's favorite horse, Blossom -"
"- if I find the horse, Dar-Ma is likely nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE160_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Boreal Stone Cave, and have found it to be completely empty. "
"I fear Raynil has made off with the artifact and he has disappeared. I should "
"inform Carius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I've arrived at Boreal Stone Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I've arrived at Darkfathom Cave. I should proceed inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCDeepscorn_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Deepscorn Hollow. Rumors talk of an underground lair hidden "
"there, I should try to find the entrance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Dragonclaw Rock. I should consult the messenger's diary to "
"learn the way to the next landmark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG18KingofWorms_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Echo Cave, and have gained access to Mannimarco's lair. I "
"need to find him inside, and put an end to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I've arrived at Fort Blueblood. Dagail's father should be buried inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Fort Grief. I should proceed inside the ruined keep and begin "
"my search for the axe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG16Amulet_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Fort Ontus. I need to find Caranya, and get the Necromancer's "
"Amulet from her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCFrostcragSpire_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Frostcrag Spire. I should make my way inside this curious but "
"extraordinary tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Gweden. I should enter the main farmhouse and find out what "
"Faustina and Signy have in store for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Gweden. I'll need to wait until around 11 in the evening to "
"go inside and find out what Faustina and Signy have in store for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Roland Jenseric's house. I should begin to search the place "
"for any clues as to his whereabouts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Roland's cabin. I should proceed inside to see if he's here. "
"I should be cautious, as Seridur warned me that vampires could be very "
"dangerous. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ02_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at Weynon Priory. Now I must take the Amulet of Kings to Jauffre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at my new house in Anvil, Benirus Manor. Looks like the place "
"may need some work, but it was a great deal I just couldn't pass up. I can "
"now make myself at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at the Mouth of the Panther. Beyond the tooth-like rocks is the "
"remains of a small cargo ship named the Emma May that looks like it sank a "
"long time ago. I should investigate this wreck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at the entrance to Frostfire Glade. Like the book describes, the "
"refined frost salts are in my hand; all I must do is open the seal by "
"touching it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at the entrance to Redguard Valley Cave. I should proceed inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE41_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at the pool Sickly Bernice described. I should get as close as "
"possible to the statue in its center to gather a sample of the aquanostrum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived at the shrine to Sheogorath. I should find the altar and place "
"the staff near it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ02_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've arrived in Chorrol. Now to find Jauffre at Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived in the Fringe to find that it has been completely conquered by "
"the forces of Order. Passwall may have been attacked. I should take a closer "
"look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived in the Grove of Reflection. According to Dyus, I must locate the "
"Tree of Shades and find a way to reveal my true self before I will be allowed "
"to take one of its branches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCBattlehornCastle_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've arrived near Battlehorn Castle. I hear battle noises, as if the castle "
"was being attacked. I should try to see if I can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've awakened from my Hist Sap stupor at Modryn Oreyn's house. He worries "
"that the company will have taken the settlement and moved the residents out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've awakened to find that the Bloated Float has somehow put to sea with "
"myself on board. I need to find the owner and discover what's happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been approached by a Khajiit named Ra'kheran. He has offered to kill "
"Ciirta for me if I assist him in his plan to take over the Apostles of the "
"Song. As he cannot be seen gathering weapons, he's asked me to bring him "
"three Apostle Daggers. If he carries this plan out, I should be able to take "
"Ciirta's eye after she is dead. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ10_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been asked by Maeva the Buxom at Whitmond Farm outside Anvil to help her "
"recover a family heirloom her husband stole when he left her. The mace is "
"named Rockshatter. Her husband, Bjalfi the Contemptible, was last seen "
"heading for the ruins of Fort Strand to join the Marauder Gang there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been detected committing a crime in Bleaker's Way. I will not be able to "
"continue my task for Mephala."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE8_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been directed by Sheogorath become the sovereign of Mania or Dementia. "
"He's suggested I speak to Arctus, High Priest of Dementia or Dervenin, High "
"Priest of Mania at the Sacellum Arden-Sul here in New Sheoth to learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been directed to Uungor as a likely candidate to give up his sleeping "
"spot for Amiable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been duped! The woman in Syl's bed was merely a decoy. Kithlan has told "
"me that Syl must have used her escape tunnel to make good her escape from the "
"Palace. I should immediately pursue Syl before she gets away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been given a charm scroll, and need to use it to help persuade Varon "
"Varmori in Bravil to return Ardaline's staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE8_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been given the Manual of Xedilian and a strange device called an "
"Attenuator of Judgment by Sheogorath. I've been directed to proceed to "
"Xedilian, and to return the place to working order. I should either read the "
"Manual or speak to Sheogorath's Chamberlain, Haskill, to familiarize myself "
"with the strange dungeon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND10_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been granted the Blessing of Talos by the Prophet. I am now ready to "
"destroy Umaril. My knights are on their way to Garlas Malatar to prepare for "
"our final assault on his fortress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told I should report to Modryn Oreyn in Chorrol for assigned duties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that Ma'zaddha has been meeting Nelrene late at night in "
"Crucible. I'll need to find them and listen in on their conversation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that Maglir can be found in the tavern at the Lonely Suitor "
"Lodge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that Roland Jenseric here in the Temple District of the "
"Imperial City is a vampire. The Order would like me to kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that Umbra was once a resident of Pell's Gate, but now has "
"left. Some claim to have seen her recently near the Vindasel Ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that Velwyn stays in the King and Queen Tavern here in the "
"Imperial City. I should go there to find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHeavyArmor_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that if I want additional training in the use of Heavy Armor, "
"I need to find a man named Pranal, who was last seen at the Roxey Inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingLightArmor_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've been told that if I want more Light Armor training, I need to talk to "
"J'bari in Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've brough Margarte the ectoplasm she requested. She'll now pay Fighters "
"Guild members for minotaur horns and ogre teeth. I should tell the men back "
"at the Five Claws."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I've brought Ahjazda the Amulet of Disintegration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I've brought Ahjazda the Calming Pants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid "I've brought Ahjazda the Ring of Desiccation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've brought Guilbert Jemane safely to Weatherleah. Unfortunately, Reynald "
"was killed along the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've burned the doll in the ghostly flames. Desideratus has no reason to find "
"his betrothed now, because she is no more. I should go tell him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've burned the doll in the ghostly flames. I don't know why I was able to do "
"that, but there must have been some purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE32_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of a Bosmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of a Breton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of a Dunmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE34_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of a Khajiit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE37_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of a Nord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE38_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of a Redguard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE36_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of an Altmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of an Argonian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE33_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of an Imperial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAHermaeusMora_STAGE39_LOG0"
msgid "I've captured the soul of an Orc."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've caused Syndelius the Mage to go insane by pouring hundreds of keys on "
"the ground which convinced him that one of them opened the gate to the huge "
"treasure pile. All that remains now is the leader of the group, Grommok. I "
"should make my way to the last observation room and choose how the stubborn "
"Orc will encounter his final obstacle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've caused the death of the remaining Orc adventurer, Grommok, by animating "
"the zombies in the final room of Xedilian. Now that all of the adventurers "
"have been dealt with, I should speak to Kiliban."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I've chosen a staff, and need to speak to Delmar when it's complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE36_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "I've claimed my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ08_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've come across a bottle of wine with markings I've never seen before. I can "
"barely make out \"Shadowbanish Wine\" on the label. It must be quite "
"valuable. I should hold onto it until I find out more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ07_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've come across a discarded page from a journal of a Slythe Seringi in an "
"abandoned farmhouse near the ruins of Kvatch. It mentions some sort of "
"pilgrimage to bring an offering of great value to something called \"The "
"Sunken One\". All signs point to Sandstone Cavern nearby. I should proceed "
"there, as I fear for Slythe's safety."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ07_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've come across a second discarded page from Slythe Seringi's journal. This "
"one details his descent into Sandstone Cavern and how he met dangerous "
"resistance and began to doubt his journey. I should press on and see if I can "
"locate him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ10_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've come across an unusual mace named Rockshatter on the body of a Nord. The "
"mace has a worn inscription on the haft reading \"To Maeva and Bjalfi in "
"honor of your union.\" I should hang onto this weapon, as I'm sure Maeva will "
"want to know her late husband's fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ03_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've come upon a sad Breton named Corrick Northwode at Harm's Folly "
"settlement. It seems a goblin war party attacked his home, killed his wife "
"and retreated back to their lair, Exhausted Mine. Now he wants me to go there "
"and recover his wife's Jade Amulet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE13_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've come upon an Oblivion Gate dominating the landscape outside the walls of "
"Cheydinhal. A few Cheydinhal guards seem to be patrolling its perimeter. I "
"should approach one of them and see if I can render any assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've committed a crime and been sent to jail. Perhaps now I can convince "
"Jorundr to tell me about the stolen gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've committed a crime and been sent to jail. This may be the perfect "
"opportunity to speak to Jorundr about the stolen gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE130_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Casimir's quest by recovering the Gauntlets of the "
"Crusader. I should continue to search for the Relics that the other ghost "
"Knights were questing for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE130_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Casimir's quest by recovering the Gauntlets of the "
"Crusader. I should return to the Priory and find out if there is any news of "
"the remaining two Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE130_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Casimir's quest by recovering the Gauntlets of the "
"Crusader. I should talk to the other ghost Knights for help in recovering the "
"remaining Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE120_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Henrik's quest by recovering the Shield of the Crusader. I "
"should continue to search for the Relics that the other ghost Knights were "
"questing for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE120_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Henrik's quest by recovering the Shield of the Crusader. I "
"should return to the Priory and find out if there is any news of the "
"remaining two Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE120_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Henrik's quest by recovering the Shield of the Crusader. I "
"should talk to the other ghost Knights for help in recovering the remaining "
"Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE100_LOG4"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Juncan's quest by recovering the Boots of the Crusader. I "
"should continue to search for the Relics that the other ghost Knights were "
"questing for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE100_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Juncan's quest by recovering the Boots of the Crusader. I "
"should return to the Priory and find out if there is any news of the "
"remaining two Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE100_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Juncan's quest by recovering the Boots of the Crusader. I "
"should talk to the other ghost Knights for help in recovering the remaining "
"Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE110_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Ralvas's quest by recovering the Mace of the Crusader. I "
"should continue to search for the Relics that the other ghost Knights were "
"questing for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE110_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Ralvas's quest by recovering the Mace of the Crusader. I "
"should return to the Priory and find out if there is any news of the "
"remaining two Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE110_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've completed Sir Ralvas's quest by recovering the Mace of the Crusader. I "
"should talk to the other ghost Knights for help in recovering the remaining "
"Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've completely upgraded Dunbarrow Cove and hired on a full crew. Once a "
"week, the pirates who follow me will provide me with my share of their "
"plunder. In order to send them out, I must speak with one of them to send "
"them on a mission. They will return to Dunbarrow Cove in one week with my "
"share of the loot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've confronted Chanel with the clues, and she admitted taking the painting. "
"She pointed out where it was hidden, and now I must decide whether or not to "
"tell the Countess about her crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've confronted Orgnolf with the clues, but all he did was become irate and "
"threatened to tell the Countess of my false accusations. I think I made the "
"wrong choice. I should go speak to Chanel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've confronted Quill-Weave, and she has admitted to trying to kill off "
"Arvena's rats. She has promised to stop, and has asked me not to tell Arvena "
"what she's done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've convinced Arnora to give me her amulet. However, I've agreed to split "
"the gold with her. She gave me the key to unlock the chest next to her bed. "
"Inside is the amulet Jorundr is looking for. I should retrieve it and bring "
"it to the Bruma Castle Dungeon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've convinced both Ruslan and Luronk to testify against Audens Avidius. I "
"hope Itius Hayn is true to his word and arrests his fellow Watch Captain. "
"Otherwise those two are going to be in a lot of trouble. I could keep an eye "
"on those two and make sure they go to see Itius first thing in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE78_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've decided Baurus will be the one to take the book from The Sponsor and I "
"will provide backup. No matter what happens, we must get that book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE77_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've decided to be the one to take the book from The Sponsor and Baurus will "
"provide backup. No matter what happens, I must get that book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE84_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've decided to give Roland a chance, and will investigate his story. Roland "
"told me that Seridur makes the occasional trip to the First Edition bookshop "
"in the Market District of the Imperial City. He told me I should speak to the "
"owner, Phintias."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've decided to kill Selene. Now that she's dead, I should speak to Ormil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE13_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've declined Countess Narina Carvain's offer for now. She said I could "
"return at any time if I wish to change my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've declined to help Tivela locate her husband, but she said she'd be here "
"if I change my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've defeated Kalthar, who was attempting to manipulate Dagail. I need to "
"give her this information immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've defeated all of the hunters. I should search the body of the Orc Hunter "
"for the key to the keep door of Fort Grief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've defeated the ghostly guardians of the Cuirass of the Crusader. I can now "
"claim it for my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG09Motives_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I've delievered Hassildor's message to Raminus Polus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've delivered the \"Fingers of the Mountain\" book to Earana. I need to "
"return to her in a days' time to receive my reward for helping her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've delivered the \"Fingers of the Mountain\" book to Earana. I need to "
"return to her in a days' time to receive my reward for helping her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've delivered the \"Fingers of the Mountain\" book to Earana. I need to "
"return to her in a days' time to receive my reward for helping her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've delivered the \"Fingers of the Mountain\" book to Teekeeus at the "
"Chorrol Mages Guild. In exchange, Teekeeus has agreed to write a "
"recommendation for me. I shall have to tell Earana she won't be getting the "
"book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG16Amulet_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid "I've delivered the Necromancer's Amulet to Hannibal Traven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've destroyed the commander of the Akaviri fort. I should proceed ahead and "
"search for the Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've destroyed the last of the undead pirates and claimed Dunbarrow Cove as "
"my own. The cavern and the hulk of the Black Flag are in terrible condition "
"after hundreds of years underground. I should speak with Dahlia Rackham of "
"the Clarabella. She will be able to assist me in hiring a crew to turn "
"Dunbarrow Cove into a suitable base of operations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered a chrysalis that generates a tame Gnarl Cultivator. Perhaps "
"these gnarls can help me halt the spread of Order throughout the Fountainhead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCFrostcragSpire_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered a dusty tome within Frostcrag Spire. I should read it to "
"learn more about this unusual structure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCDeepscorn_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered a long forgotten journal within Deepscorn Lair. I should read "
"it to learn more about this unusual structure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered a small journal in Raynil's room at the inn. It seems he was "
"part of a group of adventurers who uncovered an artifact of some sort from "
"some Ayleid ruins. They all agreed to stash the artifact in a cave until more "
"research could be done about it. Each of them took a key to the chest it was "
"secured in. The two other members of the group were Bradon and someone named "
"Gelebourne. I need to find out more about Gelebourne to confirm my suspicions "
"about Raynil. Olav may be able to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseSkingradQuest_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered an old, dusty parchment in an unused part of Rosethorn Hall. "
"I doubt that it's been disturbed in at least 200 years or more. It tells of a "
"treasure located somewhere within this place. If I can answer the riddle, I "
"may know what I'm looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered that Agarmir has a house in Talos Plaza. I should go inside "
"when he's not around and investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered that Bradon Lirrian, a resident here in Bruma, was actually a "
"vampire. He was slain by a vampire hunter who has appeared in town named "
"Raynil Dralas. However, the circumstances of this incident sound sketchy at "
"best. I should make my way to the crime scene at Bradon's house to "
"investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered that Seridur makes the occasional visit to a place called "
"Memorial Cave. It's a burial site for many heroes that died in past wars. "
"Seridur supposedly has a relative interred there. Perhaps I should go "
"investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered that Syl tends to stay out of public sight, and lets members "
"of her court perform her day-to-day needs. It was suggested I seek out Anya "
"Herrick, her Courtier and Kithlan, her Steward for more information. Perhaps "
"if I can convince them to see things my way, I'll get some help from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered that Velwyn has left town and made his way to the Imperial "
"City. If I am to find out why Benirus Manor is haunted, I need to find him "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the body of the messenger who penned the diary I've been "
"carrying. Even though he died over a thousand years ago, the bones have been "
"well preserved by the frost in the caves. He seems to be clutching something "
"in his bony hand. I should investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the crumbled walls of the once mighty Fort Pale Pass. It "
"appears to have been destroyed by a landslide long ago. I should proceed into "
"the ruins and search for the Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the first of the three Focus Crystals. It was affixed to the "
"top of a Grummite Shaman's Crystal Staff. I think they are using the crystals "
"as a power source for their weapons. Now that I've removed it from the staff, "
"I should place the Focus Crystal in its Judgment Nexus to continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the logbook of the Emma May. It appears that at some point, "
"there was a mutiny and the ship was diverted from its course. Two men tried "
"to stop the mutiny, but were imprisoned below decks. Seeking shelter from a "
"bad storm, the ship pulled into what looked like a safe cove. That was the "
"last entry. I fear that they didn't see the rocks of the Mouth of the Panther "
"and ran aground. I should continue investigating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ04_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the research notes of a Lithnilian. The notes mention him "
"being at the Imperial Bridge Inn. Perhaps if I return this book to him, he'll "
"offer me a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the second Focus Crystal. I should place it in its Judgment "
"Nexus to continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the source of Order's power -- an obelisk is having its power "
"amplified by the spire that leads to the center of Passwall. I must find a "
"way to shut down the obelisk. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've discovered the third and final Focus Crystal. I should place it in its "
"Judgment Nexus to continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've dispelled Drothan's barrier and can now follow him into Varsa Baalim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHeavyArmor_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've done all that Pranal has asked of me, and he has agreed to teach me what "
"he knows about Heavy Armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've emerged from The Serpent's Trail and find myself face to face with the "
"legendary Pale Pass. A path winds down into the snowy valley. If I follow it, "
"it should lead me directly to the ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ01_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've encountered an Ogre out in the wilderness. This seems to be S'jirra's "
"thief, as it was carrying her Jumbo Potatoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Frostfire Glade. The entire area seems filled with a swirling, "
"freezing mist. The extreme cold in this place is unbearable without magical "
"protection. The glade is true to its namesake; the frost burns as if it was "
"fire. I should now carefully begin searching it for Garridan's Tears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Henantier's Dreamworld. To my surprise, I've arrived naked "
"except for the Dreamworld amulet! Not only am I unarmed, but also I've "
"discovered that the amulet is preventing me from using any magic. I'll have "
"to explore this strange place in hopes of finding something to defend myself "
"with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE41_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Knotty Bramble. I should make my way carefully to the pool "
"Sickly Bernice spoke of and recover a sample of aquanostrum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Memorial Cave. It's now being used as a vampire den. I need to "
"see if I can find Seridur in here and put a stop to his charade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Raynil's room. I should carefully search the place for anything "
"suspicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Sundercliff Watch, a place that folklore links to Mehrunes "
"Dagon. I should explore the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Syl's Private Chambers. I now need to locate Syl herself and put "
"an end to her reign as Duke of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered Xedilian. I should now begin locating the Focus Crystals that "
"link the Resonator of Judgment with the rest of the dungeon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE4_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered the Catacombs of the blind monks. The Gray Fox hinted that the "
"true guardians of Savilla's Stone would not be subject to Blood Price. I'm "
"betting that also means they won't be too happy to see me. I'd better be "
"careful from here on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered the Nefarivigum and read Drothan's notes. They seem to indicate "
"that by eating the heart of Dagon's champion, I'll be allowed to retrieve the "
"Razor. Drothan seemed to suspect some other means of claiming the dagger, "
"though he seemed unsure how. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE190_LOG0"
msgid "I've entered the Shivering Isles. I should seek out Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered the house of Bradon Lirrian in Bruma. A guard named Carius "
"Runellius has told me that this was the scene of a crime, and unless I was a "
"guard or someone named Raynil Dralas, I should leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered the lost Ayleid city of Varsa Baalim. There's no telling what I "
"may encounter here; I must be on my guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've entered the main hall in the House of Mania later than expected to find "
"Thadon already dead from his Greenmote overdose. I should now collect as much "
"of his tainted blood as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered the main hall in the House of Mania, and the evening feast is "
"underway. I should watch the effect the Greenmote overdose has on Thadon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ07_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've entered what appears to be a recently abandoned farmhouse. Perhaps if I "
"search around, I may find a clue as to the owner's whereabouts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've followed Wide-Eye to a unremarkable alcove in the Palace courtyard. I "
"should watch from this vantage point to see what she does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've followed the rumors and found Dunbarrow Cove and the remains of the "
"Black Flag. However, the caverns are overrun by the skeletons of the pirates "
"who perished here. I'll have to put them all to rest before I can begin to "
"refit the cove."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found 20 more of the Nirnroot. I should return to Sinderion in Skingrad "
"so he can begin creating a moderate version of the Elixir of Exploration from "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found 30 more of the Nirnroot. I should return to Sinderion in Skingrad "
"so he can begin creating a strong version of the Elixir of Exploration from "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found 40 more samples of Nirnroot. I should return to Sinderion in "
"Skingrad so he can begin creating a grand version of the Elixir of "
"Exploration from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE160_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Arnora's body in her house. Tyrellius has indeed killed her. I "
"should probably leave before the town guard thinks I had something to do with "
"it. On the bright side, all of Jorundr's gold is now mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ10_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Bjalfi the Contemptible inside Fort Strand, with Rockshatter still "
"in his possession. I should take the weapon back to Maeva and tell her of her "
"late husband's fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC04Scholar_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Elante of Alinor in Brittlerock Cave. She tells me that she would "
"like to travel to the bottom of this cave complex, as she has heard there is "
"a Daedric Shrine there. She will lead the way, and I will protect her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Erthor in Bleak Flats Cave, and have agreed to escort him back to "
"Adrienne Berene in Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Erthor in Bleak Flats Cave, and have told him to return to his "
"guild hall. I need to report back to Adrienne Berene in Skingrad once Erthor "
"has returned to town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND05_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I've found Fort Bulwark. I need to get inside and find the Shield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Jirloin Doran trapped in Rock Bottom Caverns. I'll need to help "
"him escape the ogres."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE92_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Ma'zaddha dead in his home. I should see if he was holding any "
"evidence of this conspiracy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG12Gate_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Mucianus Alias. He's been transformed into some kind of walking "
"dead; there's nothing I can do for him. I should report his fate to Hannibal "
"Traven at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Velwyn at The King and Queen Tavern in the Imperial City. I should "
"speak to him further about the manor and the strange goings on within."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found Weatherleah south of Chorrol, but it's overrun with ogres. I "
"should report this information to Guilbert."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE59_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a Dagger of Friendship, which seems to heal anyone it strikes. "
"This might be something Una Armina would want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE61_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a Mute Screaming Maw, which seems like something Una Armina might "
"want to display at her Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a Ring of Disrobing. which forces anyone wearing it to remove all "
"their clothes. This might be something Una Armina would want for the Museum "
"of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found a bezoar, this may help me bypass the enchantment on the door to "
"Varsa Baalim.  Perhaps Drothan's journal can tell me more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ03_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a jade amulet with the inscription \"For Kayleen\" in the "
"possession of a Goblin boss. This must have been stolen from someone. I "
"should hold onto it until I locate the owner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD06DeadViranus_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a journal that Viranus Donton kept during his final days. In it, "
"he describes how the mission went well until the Blackwood Company arrived. "
"They battled, and he survived, gravely wounded. It appears he finally "
"succumbed to his wounds. I should report this to Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a key in the remains of Gable, the traitor named in the Emma May's "
"log. I should search the Emma May for a lock to match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCOrrery_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a list of locations at which the Dwarven Artifacts for the Orrery "
"are being held. I should visit Dagny's Camp, Brotch Camp, Bodean Camp and "
"Varus Camp to track down the remaining bandits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a manifest that seems to detail names of the recently deceased, "
"what they were buried with and their locations in Cyrodiil. I should take "
"this macabre manifest and confront Thoronir, as he may not realize where his "
"merchandise is coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE115_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found a matrix that looks like it might be a mold for a different type "
"of armor. I should ask around. Someone in the Shivering Isles must know what "
"these things are for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE15_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found a matrix that looks like it might be a mold for a different type "
"of item. I should ask around. Someone in the Shivering Isles must know what "
"these things are for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found a second bezoar and suspect that I can now dispel the enchanted "
"barrier on Varsa Baalim's door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a second note. It mentions a third note near the \"Horned Fiend's "
"shrine\". I should head towards Molag Bal's shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a skeletal hand next to a page from a diary. The diary makes "
"mention of a secret room in the house that only a true-blooded Benirus can "
"open. I am going to need to talk to Velwyn about this. I may have to ask "
"around town to find out where he's gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a skeleton chained to the wall in the lowest deck of the Emma May. "
"I believe these to be the remains of Grantham Blakeley. I should use the key "
"I found to unlock his shackles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE01Door_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I've found a strange door in Niben Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a strange note in the Imperial City's Talos District. It mentions "
"another note, and speaks about the Lord of the Hunt. I should head towards "
"Hircine's shrine and investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE56_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a tomato which seems to act as a soul gem. This might be something "
"Una Armina would want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found a trap door that seems to lead to caverns beneath Hackdirt. I "
"should enter these caverns and search for Dar-Ma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "I've found all the interesting items for which Una Armina was searching."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE53_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an ancient pelvic bone with a small inscription that reads "
"\"Pelagius III, 3rd Sun's Dawn.\" This might be something Una Armina would "
"want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an interesting painting in a concealed area of the West Tower. It "
"seems someone in the castle is a painter. I now have enough clues to make an "
"accusation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an interesting painting in a concealed area of the West Tower. It "
"seems someone in the castle is a painter. I think I should continue looking "
"for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an interesting painting in a concealed area of the West Tower. It "
"seems someone in the castle is a painter. I think I should continue looking "
"for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I've found an object deep within Vahtacen. I should take it to Skaleel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE57_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an unusual alchemical Mixing Bowl. This might be something Una "
"Armina would want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an unusual item called a matrix. It looks like a mold of some "
"kind, and seems magical. I should ask around. Someone in the Shivering Isles "
"must know what this is used for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an unusual item called a matrix. It looks like a mold of some "
"kind, and seems magical. I should ask around. Someone in the Shivering Isles "
"must know what this is used for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE58_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an unusual key made out of a Hound's Tooth. This might be "
"something Una Armina would want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found an unusual two-headed septim coin. This might be something Una "
"Armina would want for the Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found both bezoars mentioned in Drothan's Journal, and can now dispel "
"the enchantment blocking the door to Varsa Baalim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found my way into Agarmir's basement. The place consists of an odd "
"assortment of clothing and trinkets. Most disturbing is the dirty shovel and "
"mud-encrusted boots tucked into the corner and the bits of ground bonemeal "
"strewn about. I suspect Agarmir's stock he sells to Thoronir is taken from "
"the recently dead. I should continue to search carefully for more solid "
"evidence into this grisly accusation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found one of Garridan's Tears. I should continue searching, as there may "
"be more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE91_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found one of Garridan's Tears. I should continue searching, as there may "
"be more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE92_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found one of Garridan's Tears. I should continue searching, as there may "
"be more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE93_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found one of Garridan's Tears. I should continue searching, as there may "
"be more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found one of the bezoars mentioned in Drothan's Journal. When I find the "
"other I can dispel the enchantment and enter Varsa Baalim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found paint stains and a paint footprint on the carpet in the dining "
"area off the Great Hall. I now have enough clues to make an accusation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found paint stains and a paint footprint on the carpet in the dining "
"area off the Great Hall. I think I should continue looking for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found paint stains and a paint footprint on the carpet in the dining "
"area off the Great Hall. I think I should continue looking for more clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND05_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found some sort of puzzle or trap deep inside Fort Bulwark. I'll need to "
"figure out what it means in order to acquire the Shield of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've found the Amulet of Disintegration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the Bloated Float's bouncer, Graman gro-Marad, locked in a supply "
"room. he confirmed that the ship has been hijacked and that the owner, Ormil, "
"was also taken. Graman told me that if I can get him to the ship's wheel on "
"the top deck, he could take the Bloated Float back to the Imperial City. I "
"should now make my way up to the Tavern Deck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid "I've found the Calming Pants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I've found the Eye of Nocturnal. I should return to the Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I've found the Ring of Desiccation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the body of Count Goldwine. I should deliver his signet ring to "
"Savlian Matius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the body of Sir Amiel, who appears to have perished centuries ago "
"while questing for the Shrine of the Crusader. Perhaps I can find some clues "
"on his body that will help my own quest for the Crusader's Relics turn out "
"better than his."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the book \"Necromancer's Moon\", and should take it to Raminus "
"Polus after consulting with Tar-Meena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the book titled \"Fingers of the Mountain\"; I need to deliver it "
"to either Earana at the Grey Mare tavern in Chorrol, or to Teekeeus at the "
"Chorrol Mages' Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've found the door to Varsa Baalim. An enchantment blocks the door; I "
"suspect two nearby pedestals may be a clue to dispelling the barrier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the door to Varsa Baalim. The two pedestals nearby must be where "
"the bezoars need to be placed to dispel Drothan's enchantment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the fifth and final one of Garridan's Tears. I can now return to "
"S'drassa in Leyawiin for my hard-earned reward, and perhaps a warm fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the fourth note. It mentions a shy Dunmer, familiar with fire, who "
"can guide me to the pyre. I should head towards the nearest inn to try and "
"find her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the key to the door of the keep at Fort Grief. I should now return "
"to Aleron and get us both off this island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE44_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the last of the items that Ahjazda requires. I should return them "
"to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC05Stone_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the lone survivor of the group of bandits that stole the Stone of "
"St. Alessia. He and his men were attacked by ogres and left for dead. He "
"tells me that the creatures took the Stone and all their other precious "
"stones with them. He believes that the creatures live in the Ayeleid ruin of "
"Sedor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the third landmark, The Serpent's Trail, which seems to be an "
"underground passage. I'll need to traverse this passage if I'm to find the "
"ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the third note. It mentions the last note's location, in a decayed "
"city where the Larsius river touches the bay. It speaks of some sort of lucky "
"Old Lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the three Fighters Guild members, arguing loudly in the Five Claws "
"Lodge. I will need to subdue them, either by knocking them unconscious or "
"using a spell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the treasure that Jorundr concealed outside the walls of Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the treasure that Jorundr concealed. I should go check to see if "
"Tyrellius was telling the truth about Arnora."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've found the tunnel entrance in Kvatch. I need to follow it to the "
"gatehouse, so I can raise the gates and let the guards into the castle "
"courtyard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've freed Jirolin from his confines. I need to make sure he returns safely "
"to Chorrol, which means getting him out of Rock Bottom Caverns."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Brithaur five flawless pearls. He's now agreed to leave the "
"shopkeepers of Crucible alone. I should go tell Earil the good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Countess Carvain the Draconian Madstone. She was extremely "
"pleased, and rewarded me with an Akaviri artifact from her personal "
"collection called the Ring of the Vipereye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Garridan's Tears to S'drassa. He rewarded me with a fair amount of "
"gold for each of them, plus a bonus for finding more than he had expected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Gelebourne's journal to Carius. He was shocked at the story "
"contained within, and vowed to bring Raynil to justice. He's gone to inform "
"the guards. He said to meet him back at Olav's Tap and Tack in an hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Kishashi five Pod Pits. That made her happy. She should trust me "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Ra'kheran the daggers that he needs to begin his revolt against "
"Ciirta. I should follow him and retrieve Ciirta's eye once she is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Ranarr-Jo a spoon from Kishashi. It apparently is a sign he should "
"trust me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Sinderion 20 samples of Nirnroot. He told me if I wish to have a "
"strong version of the Elixir of Exploration made, he'd need 30 more samples."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Sinderion 30 samples of Nirnroot. He told me if I wish to have a "
"grand version of the Elixir of Exploration made, he'd need 40 more samples."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given Sinderion the first 10 samples of Nirnroot. He told me if I wish "
"to have a moderate version of the Elixir of Exploration made, he'd need 20 "
"more samples."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given all six of the West Weald Bear fangs to Thorley Aethelred, who in "
"turn rewarded me with an enchanted tome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ08_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given six bottles of Shadowbanish Wine to Nerussa. In return, she paid "
"me a large finder's fee of 1000 gold. She also told me if I find any more "
"bottles of the wine, she'd gladly pay me 100 gold each for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ09_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given the 12 Rumare Slaughterfish Scales to Aelwin Merowald and he's "
"rewarded me with a magical ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE72_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given the Brush of Truepaint to Rythe. He said he could paint an exit "
"and beckoned me to follow him. I should do so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've given the sword I took from the Ogre Chieftain to Fathis, and he's paid "
"me quite well in return. I should go speak to the Jemane brothers about "
"what's happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Arena_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I've got everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid "I've got the arrows. Now to get them to Althel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I've got the ring. Now to find Ahdarji and collect my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've gotten the key to get into the basement, where the Hist Tree is located."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE191_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've have Ciirta's eye. I should now seek out the second item that I need to "
"create the Staff of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11a_STAGE96_LOG0"
msgid "I've have Ciirta's left eye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11a_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've have Ciirta's left eye. I should now seek out the second item that I "
"need to create the Staff of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard a rumor about the ghost of an old man who walks the shores of "
"Niben Bay at night. It's said that he walks slowly along the coast, and then "
"looks mournfully out into the Bay until the sun rises. The people of Bravil "
"have taken to calling him 'the Forlorn Watchman'. I was referred to "
"Gilgondorin at Silverhome-on-the-Water to learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard a rumor that Margarte, who lives in Leyawiin, may have jobs for "
"the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCBattlehornCastle_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard a rumor that the defenders of Battlehorn Castle are besieged by "
"marauders and are appealing for aid. Apparently their commander has been "
"killed, and they're offering the castle itself to anyone who will help lift "
"the siege."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard an all female gang of thieves is preying on the men folk of Anvil. "
"While I didn't get all the details, I was pointed in the direction of Gogan "
"and Maelona, two local Anvil residents. Somehow, Gogan is \"intimately\" "
"involved whatever that means."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE7_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard of a mysterious Prophet who preaches outside the desecrated Chapel "
"of Dibella in Anvil. I should find out if he knows anything about who "
"attacked the Chapel and why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors in Chorrol that Reynald Jemane has been seen in Cheydinhal, "
"and that he's acting strange. Whenever approached by someone from Chorrol, he "
"seems to have no memory of them whatsoever, even if he's met them before. "
"This seems strange enough to follow up on. I should go find Reynald Jemane "
"around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE6_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors of an attack on the Chapel of Dibella in Anvil. No one "
"seems to know what happened, but all the priests and priestesses were killed "
"and the altars desecrated. It might be worth going to Anvil to see for myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors of strange happenings in the settlement of Aleswell, north "
"of the Imperial City. I should investigate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard talk of a lost Ayleid City called Varsa Baalim where Mehrunes "
"Razor is hidden. If I search the ruins of Sundercliff Watch in the Eastern "
"Niben, I may be able to find the lost city and recover this powerful daedric "
"artifact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Arnora Auria of Bruma is looking for some help recovering "
"some money that was stolen from her. I should make my way to her house and "
"see if I can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE35_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Earil has a problem with Brithaur, and wants something done "
"about it. I should go and speak to him about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Kud-Ei at the Mage's Guild in Bravil is searching for "
"assistance in locating a missing friend. A reward is being offered, so I've "
"decided to find out more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've heard that a famous painter named Rythe Lythandas has gone missing. "
"Apparently, his wife Tivela has been frantically searching for him. Perhaps I "
"should visit their home here in Cheydinhal to see if I can assist with the "
"search."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "I've heard that a smith in New Sheoth is collecting Amber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid "I've heard that a smith in New Sheoth is collecting Madness Ore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've hired Kovan Kren onto my crew. Kovan is a former spymaster for one of "
"the great houses of Morrowind. Although he will not say which house he worked "
"for, his expertise in stealth will be invaluable. Kovan will be in the main "
"cavern of Dunbarrow Cove, should I wish to speak with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseServant_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've hired a pleasant Nord woman named Eyja to staff my home as a maid at "
"Rosethorn Hall. She said she'd take residence in the Servant's Quarters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've hired a smuggler named Khafiz to my crew. He will help me move any "
"stolen goods that I may pick up on my travels. If he is to work on my crew, "
"Khafiz insists on bringing his pet warthog, Bacon. I can find Khafiz and "
"Bacon in the caverns of Dunbarrow Cove. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've hired the famous housebreaker Tahm Blackwell to train my crew and I in "
"the fine art of security. Tahm can provide me with specialty training and "
"items that will make it possible for me to slip in and out of any place that "
"I want to go. Tahm will wait near my personal cabin until I need him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've informed Anya Herrick of my plans to replace Syl. She seems somewhat "
"hesitant, but claims she will create a distraction and rid the interior of "
"the Dementia wing of the Palace of its Elite Dark Seducers. I should now "
"attempt to speak with Kithlan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've informed Anya Herrick of my plans to replace Syl. She seems somewhat "
"hesitant, but claims she will create a distraction and rid the interior of "
"the Dementia wing of the Palace of its Elite Dark Seducers. I should now "
"infiltrate Syl's wing of the Palace, and end the Duchess of Dementia's life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE15_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've informed Kithlan of my plans to replace Syl. He seems eager to help, and "
"has provided me with a key to the Dementia wing of the Palace. I should now "
"attempt to speak with Anya Herrick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've informed Kithlan of my plans to replace Syl. He seems eager to help, and "
"has provided me with a key to the Dementia wing of the Palace. I should now "
"infiltrate Syl's wing of the Palace, and end the Duchess of Dementia's life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE140_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed a corrupt guard named Tyrellius Logellus near the stashed loot. "
"Apparently, he had overheard my conversation with Jorundr in the Bruma Castle "
"Dungeons and wanted the gold for himself. I think he's also killed Arnora. I "
"can now recover the gold unhindered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed a mountain lion in Arvena Thelas' basement. They must be sneaking "
"in through a hole in the wall somewhere. I should tell Arvena what has "
"happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed a resident of Split without reason. I will not be able to restore "
"the balance here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed a second thief, this one a Dark Elf named Minx. Seems like these "
"thieves are using strange code names. The only useful bit of advice I "
"discovered is that their leader seems to be named Selene. I should search her "
"belongings for anything of use, then make my way to the top deck and secure "
"the ship's wheel for Graman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed a thief named Lynch. Apparently, he's a member of some group "
"calling themselves the \"Blackwater Brigands\". They must have hijacked the "
"Bloated Float and put her out to sea! It appears that Lynch has locked the "
"Bloated Float's bouncer in the Storage Room. I should search his body and see "
"if there's a key to free him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed all and everyone, although this Dremora looks sturdier than "
"others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've killed all of the trolls in Swampy Cave. I should look for evidence that "
"these were the creatures responsible for the disappearances at Harlun's Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed all of the trolls in Swampy Cave. I should report what I've found "
"to Drarana Thelis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09BloodPrice_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed someone while attempting to get the Arrow of Extrication. Murder "
"is against the Thieves Guild code. I'll have pay the blood price for it of "
"1000 gold coins per person killed. I can pay Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05BloodPrice_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed someone while trying to help the Thieves Guild break Lex's siege "
"of the Waterfront. I'll have to pay the blood price. It's going to cost me "
"1000 gold for each murder. I can pay S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I've killed the Mythic Dawn's members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE160_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've killed the Priests of Order who had cursed the Pool of Dementia. Now to "
"cleanse the Pool of Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE160_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've killed the Priests of Order who had cursed the Pool of Dementia. The "
"traitor, Syl, was among them. Now that I've cleansed both Pools that feed the "
"Font of Madness, I should be able to imbue the Staff of Sheogorath with power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE160_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've killed the Priests of Order who had cursed the Pool of Dementia. The "
"traitor, Thadon, was among them. Now that I've cleansed both Pools that feed "
"the Font of Madness, I should be able to imbue the Staff of Sheogorath with "
"power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE150_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've killed the Priests of Order who had cursed the Pool of Mania. Now to "
"cleanse the Pool of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE150_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've killed the Priests of Order who had cursed the Pool of Mania. The "
"traitor, Syl, was among them. Now that I've cleansed both Pools that feed the "
"Font of Madness, I should be able to  imbue the Staff of Sheogorath with "
"power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE150_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've killed the Priests of Order who had cursed the Pool of Mania. The "
"traitor, Thadon, was among them. Now that I've cleansed both Pools that feed "
"the Font of Madness, I should be able to imbue the Staff of Sheogorath with "
"power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've killed the second mountain lion in Arvena Thelas' basement. I should "
"tell Arvena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE51_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've knelt before the shrine of Saint Kaladas in Leyawiin and found myself "
"transported to some sort of dark void. I can see the Mace of Zenithar off in "
"the distance, but there seems to be no way to reach it. According to Sir "
"Ralvas, I must allow my faith in the Nine to guide me to the mace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've knelt before the shrine of Saint Kaladas in Leyawiin and found myself "
"transported to some sort of dark void. I can see the Mace of Zenithar off in "
"the distance. There is a glowing walkway leading towards them. The boots of "
"Kynareth are vibrating softly and they seem to have some connection to the "
"mystical path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've learned that Jearl has a visitor staying with her. I should find out who "
"this visitor is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've learned that a thief broke into Rythe's studio and stole his Brush of "
"Truepaint. Using the artifact, he escaped into the painting. He then painted "
"trolls to protect himself, but they turned on their creator and killed him. "
"Now the Brush is on the thief's body, and we can't leave without it. I should "
"take my leave of Rythe for now and begin exploring this surreal forest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've learned that in order to restore Xedilian, I must activate the Resonator "
"of Judgment. To do so, I will need to find three Focus Crystals and place "
"them each in a Judgment Nexus, which will prepare the Resonator for "
"attunement. I should proceed to Xedilian now and begin my search."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've learned that the Blackwood Company is over 100 strong, and growing every "
"day. I must find out who leads them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE2_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've learned that the Countess of Bruma, Narina Carvain is the collector of "
"Akaviri artifacts. Apparently, she's seeking a particular piece to add her "
"relics. The townsperson I spoke to recommended I seek out Tolgan, her "
"steward, if I was interested in retrieving the piece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've learned their leader is Ri'Zakar. I must now learn the source of their "
"power, what gives them such courage in battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE82_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located Agarmir inside the Trentius Family Mausoleum. It appears as "
"though he's attempting to desecrate another grave along with someone else I "
"don't recognize. I need to convince him to stop this heinous act."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located Farwil and one other survivor of his group. They look wounded "
"and shaken. I should speak to them to learn what's happened here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located Henantier. He seems awfully confused and doesn't understand "
"where he is or how he got here. He did mention that he lost some things. "
"Perhaps they're keys or clues explaining how to exit this bizarre place.  I "
"have no choice but to explore the recesses of his Dreamworld and find these "
"objects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located Raynil in Boreal Stone Cave. He refused to surrender, choosing "
"instead to attack me. I was forced to kill him to defend myself. I can now "
"recover the artifact mentioned in Gelebounre's journal from the chest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located Rythe Lythandas. He was standing in this strange forest, "
"seemingly waiting for someone to rescue him. He blames his predicament on a "
"thief. I should continue speaking with Rythe to find out more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ07_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located Slythe Seringi's corpse. I should search around him to learn the "
"conclusion to his sad journey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've located a Dunmer and a Breton in the Oblivion plane. They look wounded "
"and shaken. I should speak to them to learn what's happened here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE75_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Courage, the final element in this bizarre "
"amalgam of Henantier's dreams. I should bring all four elements to Henantier "
"and try to restore his sanity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE72_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Courage, the second Element to be found in "
"Henantier's Dreamword. I should continue searching for more elements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE74_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Courage, the third Element to be found in "
"Henantier's Dreamword. I should continue searching for more elements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE70_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Courage. This must be one of the things that "
"Henantier misplaced. Losing this attribute of his mind must be what's making "
"him so confused. If I can find all of the elements, and bring them back to "
"him, it should restore Henantier's sanity and help him awaken. I should "
"continue searching for other elements if I ever intend to leave this waking "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE75_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Patience, the final element in this bizarre "
"amalgam of Henantier's dreams. I should bring all four elements to Henantier "
"and try to restore his sanity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE72_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Patience, the second Element to be found in "
"Henantier's Dreamword.  I should continue searching for more elements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE74_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Patience, the third Element to be found in "
"Henantier's Dreamword. I should continue searching for more elements."
msgstr ""

