"Henantier misplaced. Losing this attribute of his mind must be what's making "
"him so confused. If I can find all of the elements, and bring them back to "
"him, it should restore Henantier's sanity and help him awaken. I should "
"continue searching for other elements if I ever intend to leave this waking "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Resolve, the final element in this bizarre "
"amalgam of Henantier's dreams. I should bring all four elements to Henantier "
"and try to restore his sanity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE72_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Resolve, the second Element to be found in "
"Henantier's Dreamword. I should continue searching for more elements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE74_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Resolve, the third Element to be found in "
"Henantier's Dreamword. I should continue searching for more elements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the Element of Resolve. This must be one of the things that "
"Henantier misplaced. Losing this attribute of his mind must be what's making "
"him so confused. If I can find all of the elements, and bring them back to "
"him, it should restore Henantier's sanity and help him awaken. I should "
"continue searching for other elements if I ever intend to leave this waking "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE53_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the Wellspring of the Aureal. It's been covered in Order "
"crystals; I'll need to destroy them to restore the Wellspring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE48_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the Wellspring of the Mazken. It's been covered in Order "
"crystals; I'll need to destroy them to restore the Wellspring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've located the thief's corpse. I should now search it for the Brush of "
"Truepaint."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've made my way into the ruins of Xeddefen. I must seek out the spire's "
"source of power and find a way to deactivate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've managed to subdue the three Fighters Guild members. I should find out "
"why they have been causing so much trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Amminus Gregori at an Oblivion Gate that has appeared outside of "
"Cheydinhal. He said that a group of Knights led by the Count of Cheydinhal's "
"son, Farwil Indarys, went inside to close the Gate. That was almost two days "
"ago. The Count has posted a generous reward for the closing of the Oblivion "
"Gate and information on Farwil's whereabouts. I should question him to learn "
"more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid "I've met Cutter of New Sheoth. She can forge items from Madness Ore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE30_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Dumag gro-Bonk who lives in New Sheoth. He can forge things from "
"Amber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Guilbert Jemane, who is Reynald's twin brother. Guilbert did not "
"know that his brother was still alive, and is anxious to meet him. He asked "
"me to meet him in Chorrol, so that they can thank me together for my help in "
"reuniting them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Kiliban Nyrandil inside one of the many observation rooms of "
"Xedilian. It also appears that Xedilian has its first visitors, a group of "
"adventurers. It's up to me to decide whether to allow Xedilian to kill them "
"or drive them insane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ04_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Lithnilian, an Altmer Sorcerer, at the Imperial Bridge Inn in the "
"wilderness southeast of the Imperial City. He's asked me to locate his "
"research notes on Welkynd Stones which he lost in the depths of Bramblepoint "
"Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Ursanne Loche in Bravil. She's told me that her husband, Aleron "
"Loche is missing and she needs my help to locate him. I should ask her more "
"about Aleron to help determine if I'm interested in helping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Velwyn Benirus. He has a manor house for sale here in Anvil. I "
"should question him further to see how much he wants for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met Velwyn at The Count's Arms Tavern. He's agreed to escort me to the "
"house and open the secret room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ02_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met a Legion Guard named Lerexus Callidus outside the walls of Leyawiin. "
"He tells me there is a Skooma dealer named Kylius Lonavo in the Greyland "
"settlement just up the road. He's offered me a reward to go into the house, "
"put a stop to the drug traders and bring him Lonavo's ring as proof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met a Nord named Tolgan. Apparently, he's the herald of Countess Narina "
"Carvain from here in Bruma. He presented me with a stipend of gold, and a "
"request from Lady Carvain to meet her at the castle. Not wanting to offend "
"the Countess, I should accept the request, and make my way there when she "
"holds court."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met a kindly Dunmer named Tivela Lythandas. It seems that her husband, "
"Rythe, has gone missing. She seems extremely distraught, so perhaps I should "
"talk to her to find out more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met a man named Claude Maric, who claims to be another treasure hunter "
"hired by Umbacano. He promised to tell me more over drinks at the Tiber "
"Septim Hotel across the street from Umbacano's house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE34_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met a man named Pyke in the Hale Settlement. He claims to be something "
"called a \"Knight of the Thorn\"; an elite group of knights from Cyrodiil. In "
"a recent clash with some Grummites, he lost his Knights of the Thorn "
"medallion and wants me to recover it from Fetid Grove, which he marked on my "
"map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ01_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've met a strange Khajiit named S'jirra at the Faregyl Inn. She insists "
"someone is stealing her supply of Jumbo Potatoes. Apparently, she uses them "
"to make what she calls her \"Famous Potato Bread\". She's offered a reward "
"for the potatoes safe return. Whoever they are, S'jirra said they were "
"\"huge\" and headed west."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've noticed that the door to the Trentius Family Mausoleum has been "
"unsealed. This must be Agarmir's doing. I should proceed inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseCheydinhal_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've now bought everything Borba gra-Uzgash has for my house in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseLeyawiin_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've now bought everything Gundalas has for my house in Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseSkingrad_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've now bought everything Gunder has for my house in Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseBravil_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've now bought everything Nilawen has for my house in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseChorrol_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've now bought everything Seed-Neeus has for my house in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseImperialCity_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've now bought everything Sergius has for my house in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseBruma_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've now bought everything Suurootan has for my house in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've now found a total of 10 Nirnroot. I should return to Sinderion in "
"Skingrad so he can begin creating an Elixir of Exploration from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCFrostcragSpire_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've now purchased everything Aurelinwae had available for Frostcrag Spire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCBattlehornCastle_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've now purchased everything Nilphas Omellian had available for Battlehorn "
"Castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCDeepscorn_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've now purchased everything Rowley Eardwulf had available for Deepscorn "
"Hollow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've observed Wide-Eye activating the secret entrance to the Greenmote Silo. "
"I need to get inside and procure two extra doses of the potent drug without "
"getting caught."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've observed a meeting between Thoronir and a mysterious man named Agarmir. "
"Looks like my new target is Agarmir. I should follow him and see where he "
"goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've obtained Thadon's drug-tainted blood. I now need to make my way back to "
"the Altar of Arden-Sul at the Sacellum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've obtained the Draconian Madstone. I should now make the long journey back "
"to Countess Carvain in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I've obtained the fifth West Weald Bear Fang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've obtained the first West Weald Bear Fang from a bear that has been "
"threatening Thorley Aethelred's sheep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "I've obtained the fourth West Weald Bear Fang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've obtained the second West Weald Bear Fang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've obtained the sixth and final West Weald Bear Fang. I should return to "
"Shardrock and give the fangs to Thorley Aethelred as proof of my deed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "I've obtained the third West Weald Bear Fang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've obtained two doses of Greenmote. I now need to sneak into Thadon's "
"kitchen sometime before eight o'clock and attempt to slip an extra dose into "
"his evening meal and into his wine without being seen, otherwise try again "
"tomorrow night. Gundlar prepare the meal in the morning, so I'll have to wait "
"until the afternoon to poison his food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE125_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've opened the gate. The Golden Saints can now continue their attack. I "
"should accompany them and help them destroy the rest of the Dark Seducers in "
"Cylarne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND10_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've ordered my Knights to attack Umaril and his Aurorans at Garlas Malatar. "
"We must destroy Umaril once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've overheard Ma'zaddha and Nelrene speaking. I need to confront Ma'zaddha "
"with this information. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've overheard a rumor that Velwyn Benirus wants to sell a manor here in "
"Anvil, and that he's selling it cheap. I should go find him and see what he "
"has to offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've overloaded the obelisk and collapsed the spire. The caverns are now "
"coming down around me and I must escape before I'm trapped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've paid Soris Arenim, and he has given me Ardaline's staff. I need to "
"deliver the staff to Kud-Ei in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've paid Sulinus Vassinus, and he has agreed to go to Bleak Flats Cave and "
"perform the task I was given. Once he returns, I can take credit for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed Jirolin's gems at Spy Rock. I should return and let him know I've "
"completed the task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed evidence on both bodies of the family leaders. Now I must tell "
"someone I saw them attack each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE47_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed the Olroy Cheese into the cooking pot. The smell coming from it "
"is astounding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed the first Focus Crystal into its Nexus. I can now continue "
"searching for Focus Crystals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed the second Focus Crystal into its Nexus. I can now continue "
"searching for the final Focus Crystal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed the staff near the altar at the shrine to Sheogorath. The scamps "
"seem pleased with their new home, and best of all have stopped following me. "
"I should return to Rosentia with the news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've placed the third and final Focus Crystal into its Judgment Nexus. The "
"path to the Resonator of Judgment itself is now clear. My next task should be "
"to attune the Resonator by using the Attenuator of Judgment that Sheogorath "
"provided me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've planted the Icestaff in the chest in Ontus' bedroom. I should go see "
"S'krivva and collect my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've purchased Knightfall from Phinitas at the First Edition Bookshop in the "
"Market District. I should read it to find out more about Garridan's Tears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've purchased an upgrade to my personal quarters on the Black Flag. I should "
"be able to sleep more comfortably now. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've purchased the manor from Velwyn. He gave me a key and the deed of "
"ownership. I can now move in there at any time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "I've put Cindanwe's house in disarray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've raised the gates into Castle Kvatch. I must now help Savlian and his men "
"defeat the monsters within."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 100 gold worth of goods. I should go "
"see Armand sometime. He might have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 1000 gold worth of goods. When I'm "
"in the cities, I'll have to keep an eye out for another messenger from the "
"Gray Fox. He could call for me at any time. I should wait in the Imperial "
"City if I want them to find me quickly. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 200 gold worth of goods. I should go "
"see S'krivva sometime. She might have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 300 gold worth of goods. I should go "
"see S'krivva sometime. She might have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 400 gold worth of goods. I should go "
"see S'krivva sometime. She might have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 50 gold worth of goods. I should go "
"see Armand sometime. He might have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 500 gold worth of goods. I should go "
"see S'krivva sometime. She might have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 600 gold worth of goods. When I'm in "
"the cities, I'll have to keep an eye out for messengers from the Gray Fox. He "
"could call for me at any time. I should wait in the Imperial City if I want "
"them to find me quickly. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 700 gold worth of goods. When I'm in "
"the cities, I'll have to keep an eye out for another messenger from the Gray "
"Fox. He could call for me at any time. I should wait in the Imperial City if "
"I want them to find me quickly. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached my goal. I have fenced over 800 gold worth of goods. When I'm in "
"the cities, I'll have to keep an eye out for another messenger from the Gray "
"Fox. He could call for me at any time. I should wait in the Imperial City if "
"I want them to find me quickly. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE21_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached the Grove of Trials. I shall have to wait and see what Kynareth "
"has in store for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE38_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached the Sigil Stone. Now I need to bring Captain Burd here and show "
"him how to close an Oblivion Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reached the second landmark, The Sentinel. I should consult the "
"messenger's diary once again to discern the way to the third landmark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've read Drothan's Journal. He's gone into Varsa Baalim in search of "
"something called the 'Nefarivigum', which he believes protects Mehrunes "
"Razor. He has left enchanted bezoars in the care of his Commander and "
"Forgemaster. With these bezoars, I'll be able to dispel his enchantment and "
"follow him into Varsa Baalim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've received a note from a man called Umbacano; he's interested in the "
"Ayleid statue I found and sold. I should find him in the Imperial City and "
"see what he wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've received some items and gold from Kiliban Nyrandil that had belonged to "
"the adventurers. I can now safely report back to Sheogorath that Xedilian is "
"in full operation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE38_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've reconsidered and decided to help Tivela locate Rythe. She gave me the "
"key to his studio.  If I intend to find her husband, that would be the best "
"place to start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ03_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered Kayleen's Jade Amulet. I should return it to Corrick at Harm's "
"Folly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ02_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered Kylius Lonavo's ring. I should bring it to Lerexus as soon as "
"possible to obtain my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ04_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered Lithnilian's research notes from Bramblepoint Cave. I should "
"return it to Lithnilian for the promised reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DL9MehrunesQuest_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered Mehrunes Razor, a potent daedric dagger which has a chance to "
"instantly destroy an opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE34_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered Pyke's Medallion. I should now return to the Hale Settlement "
"and bring Pyke his missing property."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE41_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered a sample of aquanostrum from the pool Sickly Bernice "
"described. I should return to New Sheoth and present it to her for my well-"
"deserved reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered a sprig of Nirnroot. A plant ingredient this unusual must have "
"value. Perhaps I should bring it to an alchemist and find out a little more "
"about it. An alchemist can be found in almost every city in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE34_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered an unusual amulet with the markings of a group calling itself "
"The Knights of the Thorn. On the back, there is an inscription that reads "
"\"To Pyke, from Farwil.\" I can only assume that Pyke is here in the "
"Shivering Isles. If I can find him, I'm sure he will be happy to get his "
"medallion back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ08_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered six bottles of Shadowbanish Wine. I should bring them back to "
"Nerussa at the Wawnet Inn for my final reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG17Ambush_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered the Black Soul Gem. It needs to be taken back to Hannibal "
"Traven at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG15Helm_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered the Bloodworm Helm. I need to deliver it to Arch-Mage Traven "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered the Cuirass of the Crusader. I should talk to the ghosts of "
"the former Knights of the Nine to see if they can aid me in my quest for the "
"remaining Crusader's Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND01_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've recovered the Helm of the Crusader, the first piece of the Crusader's "
"Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE100_LOG2"
msgid "I've recovered the Mace of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've removed Syl's heart. I now need to make my way back to the Altar of "
"Arden-Sul at the Sacellum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND05_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've rescued Sir Thedret, a knight imprisoned within the Fort. I need to "
"watch out for traps in the lower levels, and remember the phrase \"When the "
"eyes of the Guardians are upon you, Julianos will show you favor.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've retrieved the Brush of Truepaint. I should go back and return it to "
"Rythe, so together we can leave this strange landscape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've retrieved the Honorblade of Chorrol from the Ogre Chieftain. This has to "
"be the item Fathis was seeking. However, due to the nature of the item, I "
"think someone at Castle Chorrol would be anxious to have this back. I need to "
"decide whether to sell the weapon to Fathis, or return it to the Castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Flagon_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned Newheim's Flagon to the Nord, who was pleased to have the "
"heirloom returned. He rewarded me with three bottles of his own special brew."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ10_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned Rockshatter to Maeva. She was pleased and rewarded me with a "
"small parcel of gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ01_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned the Jumbo Potatoes to S'jirra. She was overjoyed and rewarded "
"me with her first batch of Famous Potato Bread."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ04_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned the research notes to Lithnilian at the Imperial Bridge Inn. He "
"generously rewarded me for my efforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned the sword to Laythe Wavrick, Herald to the Countess of Chorrol. "
"In gratitude, he's rewarded me with the Escutcheon of Chorrol, an item only "
"bestowed to the most honored of heroes. I should go speak to the Jemane "
"brothers about what's happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned to Roland's cabin and told him what had transpired. He thanked "
"me for clearing his name, and vowed to take Seridur's place to continue the "
"Order of the Virtuous Blood. He said I should meet him there for a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned to Seridur's home, which the Order still uses to meet. Roland "
"was there, and he told me I was now an honorary member of their group. He "
"also bestowed an enchanted ring on me to help me in my future encounters with "
"vampires."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned to Water's Edge to a gruesome sight. Biene Amelion's father "
"stands over the corpses of his daughter and the rest of the settlement. There "
"are corpses all around--not goblin corpses as it had appeared in my Hist Sap-"
"clouded mind, but human corpses. The Blackwood Company and I slaughtered the "
"entire population of Water's Edge. I must return to Oreyn immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've returned to find Kurdan himself standing over the corpse of Aleron, whom "
"he'd murdered. I had no choice but to attack and slay him. I should search "
"Kurdan's corpse for anything that may help me get out of these ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've sealed the letter with the Legion Commander's seal. Now I must deliver "
"it to Countess Umbranox personally. I will take on the role of courier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE27_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've searched both chests in Fathis Aren's room. Neither had the Arrow of "
"Extrication. I'm beginning to think it isn't here. This room doesn't seem to "
"have enough wizardly stuff for a wizard of Fathis stature. I wonder if there "
"is a secret chamber where he keeps his more valuable treasures?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've seated myself in the reading chair. Now I just have to wait for them to "
"bring me the scroll. So long as I don't speak to any of them, the priests "
"seem to be assuming I am Celia Camoran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've seen Quill-Weave leaving meat outside Arvena Thelas' house. This must be "
"what is attracting the mountain lions into town and into Arvena's basement. I "
"should confront Quill-Weave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've shown Arnora's Amulet to Jorundr. He revealed the location of the "
"treasure as being buried outside the town wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've shown the reward given to me by Laythe Wavrick to Guilbert Jemane. He "
"was saddened to hear that his father was actually a master thief, but was "
"happy that the Honorblade was returned to Castle Chorrol where it belongs. He "
"rewarded me with a personal keepsake as thanks for righting one of his "
"family's past wrongs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain Arnora. I should take the amulet off her body and bring it to "
"Jorundr."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid "I've slain Henantier in his sleep. His nightmares are now over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ05_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain Raelynn the Gravefinder. I should return to Malene at the Roxey "
"Inn and deliver the good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain Roland Jenseric. I should return to the Order and tell Seridur "
"that my task is completed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain Seridur. I should return immediately to Roland's cabin and give "
"him the news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "I've slain Syl. I should now remove her heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain Ulrich Leland. At my first opportunity, I should speak with Garrus "
"Darelliun, his second-in-command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ01_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain an Ogre out in the wilderness. Oddly, it was carrying a bunch of "
"Jumbo Potatoes. I should hang onto these, as they seem quite unusual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slain yet another thief, this one a large Nord named Wrath. He was "
"guarding the ship's wheel. He mentioned that they hijacked the Bloated Float "
"to recover something called the \"Golden Galleon\". I should now get Graman "
"and tell him that the path to the ship's wheel is safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've slipped an extra dose of Greenmote into Thadon's meal and Thadon's wine. "
"I should proceed to the dining area at eight o'clock for the evening feast "
"and watch the effect the Greenmote overdose has on Thadon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've solved the puzzle of the pillar, opening up more of the ruins of "
"Vahtacen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG04Restore_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spent the night at the Brina Cross Inn. I need to follow the Gold Road "
"towards Kvatch, and be wary of anyone along the road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Arctus, High Priest of Dementia. The Ritual of Accession for "
"Dementia is simple; Syl would have to be slain by the proposed successor, and "
"her heart brought to the Altar of Arden-Sul at the Sacellum. After I decide "
"which ritual to undertake, I should return to Sheogorath and inform him of my "
"choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Arctus, High Priest of Dementia. The Ritual of Accession for "
"Dementia is simple; Syl would have to be slain by the proposed successor, and "
"her heart brought to the Altar of Arden-Sul at the Sacellum. I should now "
"speak to Dervenin to learn of Mania's ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Arnora, but it sounds like she wants me to do something "
"potentially illegal. I've told her I'm not interested. It sounded like she'd "
"welcome me back if I changed my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Carius Runellius, an investigator for the Bruma city watch, at "
"the crime scene. He says that Raynil slipped into the house undetected and "
"killed the vampire in its sleep around noon. The wife wasn't home, as she "
"works during the day. Also, the body of an unidentified beggar has been found "
"stashed in Bradon's house. I should question Bradon's wife if I want to "
"investigate further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Count Indarys. He was pleased that the Oblivion Gate outside "
"his city was closed, and ecstatic that his son was still alive. To reward my "
"actions, he presented me with a fine sword named Thornblade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Count Indarys. He was pleased that the Oblivion Gate outside "
"his city was closed, and ecstatic that his son was still alive. To reward my "
"actions, he presented me with a fine weapon named the Staff of Indarys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Count Indarys. He was pleased that the Oblivion Gate outside "
"his city was closed, but heartbroken about his son's death. Still, he was "
"generous enough to reward me in gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Count Indarys. He was pleased that the Oblivion Gate outside "
"his city was closed, but heartbroken about his son's death. Still, he was "
"generous enough to reward me with 200 gold. When I tried to present him with "
"Farwil's signet ring, he relented and allowed me to keep it as a memento of "
"my journey with Farwil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE15_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Dervenin, High Priest of Mania. The Ritual of Accession for "
"Mania requires the current ruler to commit suicide by taking three doses of "
"Greenmote, which is lethal. Then his drug-tainted blood must be brought to "
"the Altar of Arden-Sul at the Sacellum. After I decide which ritual to "
"undertake, I should return to Sheogorath and inform him of my choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Dervenin, High Priest of Mania. The Ritual of Accession for "
"Mania requires the current ruler to commit suicide by taking three doses of "
"Greenmote, which is lethal. Then his drug-tainted blood must be brought to "
"the Altar of Arden-Sul at the Sacellum. I should now speak to Arctus to learn "
"of Dementia's ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Kud-Ei of the Mage's Guild in Bravil. It seems that her "
"friend, Henantier isn't missing after all, but trapped somewhere and Kud-Ei "
"needs my help liberating him. Kud-Ei said to return to her when I'm ready and "
"she'll take me to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Maelona, a Reguard commoner who lives in Anvil. It seems that "
"a gang of female thieves has taken up residence somewhere nearby. They're "
"luring men out to their farmhouse by seducing them, and then in actuality, "
"robbing them of all their goods when they arrive. The men are so embarrassed "
"about this that they won't report it to the authorities. Maelona's husband is "
"one of the \"victims\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ08_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Nerussa, the publican at the Wawnet Inn just outside the "
"Imperial City. She's searching for a rare wine named Shadowbanish Wine that "
"she says is most commonly found in fort ruins. She tells me if I retrieve six "
"bottles, I'll be well compensated. Looks like I'll need to keep a careful eye "
"out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC02Protect_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Norbert Lelles, who says he has had break-ins at his store "
"almost nightly. He would like someone to stay in the store tonight and catch "
"the crooks in the act."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Olav at Olav's Tap and Tack. I was able to convince him to "
"give me the key to Raynil's room. He told me that it was up the stairs and at "
"the end of the hall. That should be my next destination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM01_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Ranaline about the Mythic Dawn notes. She mentioned a new base "
"of operation of the Mythic Dawn in Mingo Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Sheogorath and chosen the Ritual of Accession for Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07_STAGE200_LOG1"
msgid "I've spoken to Sheogorath and chosen the Ritual of Accession for Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE41_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to Sickly Bernice in New Sheoth. It seems she believes she is "
"dying of some horrible malady, and only I can locate the cure. Strangely, she "
"looks well to me, but she promises a reward for the cure's return. Perhaps I "
"should hear her out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to a collector of Ayleid artifacts named Umbacano. He has offered "
"to pay me handsomely for any Ayleid Ancestor statues that I bring him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to a mysterious Prophet, who told me that in order to seek the "
"Relics of the Crusader, I must first do a pilgrimage to the Wayshrines of the "
"Divines. He gave me a map of the Pilgrim's Way to help me locate the shrines. "
"Once I have visited a wayshrine for each of the Nine Divines, I may receive a "
"vision if I am judged a worthy knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to the Countess about Chanel's crime, and she's been banished "
"from the Castle. However, since the investigation didn't go smoothly, the "
"Countess wasn't pleased and only rewarded me with some gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to the Countess about Chanel's crime. She's been banished from "
"the Castle, and as a reward, a sizable bounty of gold and gems has been given "
"to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_NDPilgrim_STAGE9_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to the Prophet outside Anvil Chapel. He claims that an ancient "
"Ayleid sorceror-king has returned from beyond the grave to destroy the "
"church, and that only a true knight wearing the legendary Crusader's Relics "
"can possibly defeat him. I should speak to him further to find out how to "
"find these lost Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE45_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to the beggar Bolwing. He tells me that the Fork of Horripilation "
"is being fought over by groups of Heretics and Zealots. I'll have to get it "
"from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC05Stone_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to the priest Cirroc in Bruma. He would like me to retrieve a "
"holy relic of the Church, the Stone of St. Alessia. He believes it was stolen "
"by bandits recently, and he's heard that they were headed east out of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Diram Serethi of Aleswell, though I haven't actually seen "
"him. He's explained that all of the residents are invisible; he suspects a "
"wizard named Ancotar is to blame. I should look for Ancotar in the ruins of "
"Fort Caractacus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Dyus about the staff of Sheogorath. He is the remnant of the "
"library that Haskill spoke of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Erissare Arenim. She told me that Soris has the staff in the "
"basement of their house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC06Courier_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Rienna, one of the fighters in the Desolate Mine. She tells "
"me that the cave has been infested with goblins, and we should clear the "
"place out before leaving. I will have to give them each weapons, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Soris Arenim. He will not give back the staff, but will sell "
"it for 200 gold. If I choose to buy it back, I need to pay him the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Viranus Donton, and he is prepared accompany me to Nonwyll "
"Cavern."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with one of Ciirta's followers outside of the Howling Halls. She "
"said that I should be safe inside so long as I wear the robes of the Apostles "
"and do not take any suspicious action. If I can avoid confrontation, I might "
"be able to make it to Ciirta without alerting all of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with the Harbinger. She taught me how to conjure her at any time, "
"if I wish. I should try it and see what she can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with the ghosts of the Knights of the Nine and learned where "
"several parts of the Armor of the Crusader are hidden. I should return when I "
"have collected them all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE140_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've squeezed the handkerchief full of the Sorceress' tears into a bottle. "
"This may act as a poison to the Gatekeeper. I have a limited number of doses, "
"so I will need to be careful using them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE140_LOG5"
msgid ""
"I've squeezed the handkerchief full of the Sorceress' tears into a bottle. "
"This may act as a poison to the Gatekeeper. I have a limited number of doses, "
"so I will need to be careful using them. I can also find Jayred to get the "
"arrows made from dead Gatekeeper bones, once he is done making them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE140_LOG4"
msgid ""
"I've squeezed the handkerchief full of the Sorceress' tears into a bottle. "
"This may act as a poison to the Gatekeeper. I have a limited number of doses, "
"so I will need to be careful using them. I can also follow Jayred to the "
"Gardens of Flesh and Bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE140_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've squeezed the handkerchief full of the Sorceress' tears into a bottle. "
"This may act as a poison to the Gatekeeper. I have a limited number of doses, "
"so I will need to be careful using them. I can also talk to Jayred about "
"killing the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE140_LOG6"
msgid ""
"I've squeezed the handkerchief full of the Sorceress' tears into a bottle. "
"This may act as a poison to the Gatekeeper. I have a limited number of doses, "
"so I will need to be careful using them. Jayred is still willing to come "
"fight the Gatekeeper with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE140_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've squeezed the handkerchief full of the Sorceress' tears into a bottle. "
"This may act as a poison to the Gatekeeper. I have a limited number of doses, "
"so I will need to be careful using them.. I can also tell Jayred I'm ready to "
"go to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE82_LOG0"
msgid "I've stayed my hand, and will let Roland live for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've stepped through the Oblivion Gate outside of Cheydinhal and now find "
"myself in the dreaded plane of Oblivion itself. I should proceed carefully, "
"as unknown dangers await me here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've stepped through the Oblivion Gate outside of Cheydinhal and now find "
"myself in the dreaded plane of Oblivion itself. My only chance to destroy the "
"gate and return home would be obtaining the Sigil Stone in this plane's "
"citadel. I should make my way there now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've stolen the \"Fingers of the Mountain\" book from Earana's room in the "
"Grey Mare. I need to find Teekeeus, and deliver it to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've stolen the \"Fingers of the Mountain\" book from the Chorrol Mages "
"Guild. I need to find Earana, and deliver it to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've stolen the staff from Soris Arenim's house. I need to deliver it to Kud-"
"Ei in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE80_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've survived the collapsing ruins of Xeddefen. I should seek out Aurig Desha "
"and ask her how the battle above ground went."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've survived the collapsing ruins of Xeddefen. I should seek out Grakendo "
"Udico and ask her how the battle above ground went."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've taken Felldew in order to enter Dunroot Burrow. I shall have to be "
"careful as I proceed through the Burrow. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've talked to Ancotar, who was unaware of the effect his magic had on the "
"people of Aleswell. He's given me a scroll that should reverse the effects; I "
"need to return to Aleswell to restore its residents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE25_LOG2"
msgid ""
"I've talked to Aurig Desha about what has happened in Passwall. Order has "
"been attacking the town non-stop. She's asked for my help in protecting the "
"Passwall. I must place the Golden Saints in the best positions possible to "
"prepare for the attack. When I am satisfied, I should speak to the Aurig."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE25_LOG3"
msgid ""
"I've talked to Aurig Desha about what has happened in Passwall. Order has "
"been attacking the town non-stop. She's asked for my help in protecting the "
"Passwall. I should provide what aid I can and speak to her when I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've talked to Grakendo Udico about what has happened in Passwall. Order has "
"been attacking the town non-stop. She's asked for my help in protecting the "
"Passwall. I must place the Dark Seducers in the best positions possible to "
"prepare for the attack. When I am satisfied, I should speak to the Grekendo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE25_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've talked to Grakendo Udico about what has happened in Passwall. Order has "
"been attacking the town non-stop. She's asked for my help in protecting the "
"Passwall. I should provide what aid I can and speak to her when I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Arvena Thelas that the problem has been solved, and she has paid me "
"for the contract. I should see Quill-Weave and tell her I've protected her "
"secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Arvena Thelas what Quill-Weave has been doing. She thanked me for "
"my help, and has paid me for the contract. She's also taught me a bit about "
"Speechcraft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Arvena about the mountain lions, but she doesn't believe her "
"problem is solved, as there's a mountain lion in her basement now. I'll have "
"to kill it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Dubok, Rellian, and Vantus about Margarte's need for ingredients. "
"They've agreed to accept the long-term contract. As this should keep them out "
"of trouble, I should report back to Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "I've told Hannibal Traven what J'skar saw at the Bruma Mages Guild hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Oreyn that I will not accompany him in investigating how the "
"Blackwood Company fulfilled the Azani Blackheart contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD06DeadViranus_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Oreyn that Viranus Donton is dead. He wants me to go back to "
"Forsaken Mine and find proof of what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Raminus Polus everything about Necromancers and black soul gems "
"that I have seen"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told Ursanne about her husband's death. I said that he fought bravely "
"and that his thoughts were with her before he died. She thanked me for my "
"kind words and bestowed a book upon me that belonged to Aleron. I know that I "
"did the best I could, but at least Aleron's death was avenged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've told the Countess that neither suspect is the criminal, and that the "
"painting must be in the possession of someone outside the Castle walls. She "
"seemed disappointed, but I've kept Chanel's honor intact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've unleashed the Giant Gnarl on the adventurers in Xedilian. With the "
"threat of what he perceived as certain death knocking at his door, Lewin the "
"Rogue has gone insane. I should make my way to the next observation room and "
"choose how the adventurers will encounter their next obstacle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE15_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've unleashed the Gnarl Swarm on the adventurers in Xedilian. Unable to "
"survive their onslaught, Lewin the Rogue has been slain. I should make my way "
"to the next observation room and choose how the adventurers will encounter "
"their next obstacle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE73_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've used the Arrow of Extrication to activate the door and open the secret "
"way into the palace. There is no telling where I might end up. I should take "
"care to extinguish my lights, muffle my footsteps, and be stealthy as I enter "
"the door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS47_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've used the scroll Ancotar gave me, and the people of Aleswell are once "
"again visible. Diram Serethi would probably like to congratulate me on my "
"success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"I've willingly accepted the staff from Rosentia. The scamps are now under my "
"escort. I should hasten to Darkfathom Cave and be rid of these annoying "
"creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've witnessed Necromancers creating Black Soul Gems at the Dark Fissure "
"cave. I need to get this information to Raminus Polus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"I've witnessed a gnarl removing the Order crystals that were poisoning a door "
"here in the Fountainhead. It seems that the tame gnarls here can halt the "
"spread of Order throughout the dungeon. I may be able to use their help as I "
"work my way to the Pools of Mania and Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If Aleron and I are to survive, I need to proceed down into the Hunter's Run "
"and defeat the hunters being sent after us. According to the \"rules\", one "
"of them will have the key to unlock the door Kurdan sealed behind us. Since "
"Aleron is in no condition to fight, I'll have to seek these hunters out "
"myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSecurity_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I want J'baana to train me, I need to travel to Bravil and fetch a message "
"from S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMysticism_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I want further Mysticism training, I need to visit Dagail at the Mages "
"Guild in Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlock_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I want more training to improve my Block skill, I need to find Andragil, "
"who lives in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAthletics_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I want to learn more about Athletics, I should find Rusia Bradus in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSpeechcraft_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I want to learn more about Speechcraft, I need to seek out Tandilwe at the "
"Temple of the One in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ArenaDialogue_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I wish to join the Arena faction as a combatant, I must speak with Owyn "
"the Blademaster in the Arena Bloodworks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingRestoration_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If I wish to train further in Restoration, I must find Oleta at the Chapel of "
"Akatosh in Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE82_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"If the eye is fully open and opaque, you have been <RT_BlueMed>detected</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE70_LOG1"
msgid ""
"If you have a lockpick, you can try to pick most locks. To move the lockpick "
"from slot to slot, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_MoveLeft\"/>/<IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_MoveRight\"/>. Press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_MoveUp\"/> or move your mouse up to move the "
"pick upward into a tumbler. When the tumbler reaches the top of the lock, you "
"will hear a metallic sound, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_SetTumbler\"/> to secure it in place. When "
"<RT_BlueMed>all tumblers are secured at the top</>, the lock will open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"If you have a lockpick, you can try to pick most locks. To move the lockpick "
"from slot to slot, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_MoveLeft\"/>/<IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_MoveRight\"/>. Press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_LockPickMenu_MoveUp\"/> to move the pick upward into a "
"tumbler. When the tumbler reaches the top of the lock, you will hear a "
"metallic sound, press <IA id=\"IA_UI_Generic_Accept\"/> to secure it in "
"place. When <RT_BlueMed>all tumblers are secured at the top</>, the lock will "
"open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk02_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ilav made me a Paladin of his order and will be willingly giving me any armor "
"or weapon from their chantry at any time! I should speak to Snak Gra-Bura at "
"the Chestnut Handy Stables about crafting a matching set of horse armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk02_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ilav mentioned a Time Wound. I do not know much about it, but it is "
"apparently being opened by an Elder Scroll. I must retrieve it at all costs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEAk02_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ilav's blessing allowed me to go past the magic that blocked me. Time to face "
"whoever is messing with Time itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Ilend Vonius, one of the Kvatch Guardsmen who entered the Oblivion Gate to "
"try to close it, told me that at least one other survivor of the assault on "
"the Gate has been taken to the large tower within Oblivion. I should search "
"for him there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In \"The Cleansing of the High Fane\", the High Fane is identified as the "
"ruin now known as Malada, in the Valus Mountains. I should proceed to Malada "
"and look for the carved panel that Umbacano wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In Ulrich's quarters, I've discovered a letter he wrote to some relatives "
"outside of Cyrodiil. In it, he talks about sending them a great deal of money "
"and goods he purchased using the illicit funds. This is the evidence Garrus "
"would need. I should take it to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In attempting to use the defiled Sword of the Crusader, I have received a "
"terrible curse. I can only hope that this curse will be lifted when I "
"reconsecrate the Sword at the Chapel of Arkay in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In each attempt to persuade, you must <RT_BlueMed>Admire, Boast, Joke</>, and "
"<RT_BlueMed>Coerce</>.\n"
"Each of these actions <RT_BlueMed>raises</> or <RT_BlueMed>lowers</> the "
"character's <RT_BlueMed>disposition</>.\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Do not take too long</>, because the character's disposition is "
"steadily falling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE64_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"In order to <RT_BlueMed>create potions or poisons</>, you'll need ingredients "
"that share similar effects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to be accepted back into the Fighters Guild, I must collect twenty "
"bear pelts and return them to Vilena Donton in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND03_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to be granted the Boots of the Crusader, I must travel to a sacred "
"grove in the Great Forest and be tested by Kynareth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to boost the young Donton's confidence, I'm to help Viranus discover "
"what became of Galtus Previa in Nonwyll Cavern, northwest of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSneak_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to get Marana Rian to train me, I must steal a coin from her pocket "
"without her noticing, and return it to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to get a recommendation from Adrienne Berene, I need to find Erthor "
"and return him to the Skingrad Mages Guild. I should speak with the other "
"guild mages to learn his whereabouts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to regain favor with the Mages Guild, I must bring 20 Nightshade and "
"20 Mandrake Root to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to regain favor with the Mages Guild, I must bring 20 Nightshade and "
"20 Mandrake Root to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to regain favor with the guild, I must bring 20 Dragon's Tongue and "
"20 Redwort Flower to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to regain favor with the guild, I must bring 20 Dragon's Tongue and "
"20 Redwort Flower to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion01_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to regain favor with the guild, I must gather 20 Vampire Dust and 20 "
"Daedra Hearts and deliver them to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MGExpulsion02_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to regain favor with the guild, I must gather 20 Vampire Dust and 20 "
"Daedra Hearts and deliver them to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to remake the Staff of Sheogorath, Dyus requires two items. I must "
"seek out the Eye of Ciirta and a Branch of the Tree of Shades. The first is "
"an eye that has seen something that no other has. I can acquire this item "
"from a woman named Ciirta in the Howling Halls. The second item is a branch "
"of the Tree of Shades, an ancient tree that grows in the Grove of Reflection "
"in the ruins of Milchar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingConjuration_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In order to train further in Conjuration, I must find Olyn Seran, a Daedra "
"Worshipper somewhere in the Great Forest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In the center of Frostfire Glade, I've discovered an astonishing sight. "
"Garridan himself locked in an eternal frozen struggle with a huge Frost "
"Atronach. It appears that Garridan had dropped his weapon and was using the "
"Ewer to protect himself. The Atronach smashed the Ewer, which must have "
"reacted with the magical waters and froze everything solid. A sad end for "
"such a noble knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"In the wreck of the Emma May, a spirit attacked me. The vessel seems "
"completely infested with them. I suspect them to be the remains of the Emma "
"May's crew. Why this happened to them puzzles me. I should press forward and "
"investigate further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE20_LOG1_1"
msgid ""
"In your <RT_BlueMed>journal</>, you can see your character attributes, equip "
"objects, choose spells and consult your map and quests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE76_LOG1_1"
msgid ""
"In your journal, select an item or spell and press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_QuickKeys_OpenMenu\"/> to select a slot, then use your mouse to "
"<RT_BlueMed>equip</> your choice. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE76_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"In your journal, select an item or spell and press <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_InventoryMenu_AssignToWheel\"/>to show the Shortcuts and "
"<RT_BlueMed>bind</> a slot by pressing <IA id=\"IA_UI_Generic_Accept\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseSkingradQuest_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Inside a battered hourglass, I've discovered a ring and several precious "
"gems. This must be the treasure of Rosethorn Hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Inside the Swampy Cave, I've found the corpses of the townsfolk that are "
"missing. It looks like trolls have been feeding on the people weakened by the "
"will-o-the-wisps. I should make sure to clear out all the remaining trolls "
"from the cave complex."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Inside the Swampy Cave, I've found the corpses of the townsfolk that are "
"missing. It looks like trolls have been feeding on the people weakened by the "
"will-o-the-wisps. I should report this to Drarana Thelis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlunt_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Irene Metric is dead. My opportunity to learn more from her about Blunt "
"Weapons has ended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlunt_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Irene Metrick has agreed to help train me in the use of Blunt weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingBlunt_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Irene Metrick has told me I need to kill more people before she'll consider "
"helping me train."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid "It appears Ajum-Kajin may be ready to give me information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It is now safe for the survivors of the attack on Kvatch to leave the Chapel "
"for safety in the camp south of the city. Savlian has asked me to help him "
"further. I should let him know when I am ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It looks like Ajum-Kajin is ready to tell me more. I should question him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BloodPrice_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It may have been a mistake to kill Rohssan. I seem to recall Armand telling "
"me that I couldn't kill anyone while retrieving his sword. I'll have to pay "
"him a fine to get back into the guild. Unfortunately, he will only talk to me "
"after midnight in the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BloodPrice_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It may have been a mistake to kill one of the Allectus. I seem to recall "
"Armand telling me that I couldn't kill anyone while retrieving his diary. "
"I'll have to pay Armand a hefty fine. Unfortunately, he will only talk to me "
"after midnight in the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It seems that Alessia Caro wears the ring all the time, which is going to "
"make is really difficult to steal it from her. However, I learned that she "
"always takes it off at night. I'll have to sneak into her bedroom at night "
"and rifle through that jewelry box."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE2_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It seems that Count Marius Caro is concerned about an Orc named Mazoga at "
"Castle Leyawiin. This Orc claims she is a knight. Perhaps Marius Caro would "
"welcome my aid in finding out more about her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It seems that Desideratus \"betrothed\" is actually a child's doll. I'll have "
"to think of some way to keep him from obessing about the doll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It seems that the butler, Shum gro-Yarug, is hiring up at Castle Skingrad. "
"Penetrating the castle would be much easier if I had that job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC10Swamp_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It seems that the strange lights people were seeing over the swamp are will-o-"
"the-wisps. But, there don't seem to be any signs of the townsfolk who "
"disappeared. The Will-o-the-wisps were surrounding a cave, though. I should "
"investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE48_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It seems there is a secret passage that leads from the basement to the "
"Countess' private chambers. If I can find it, that passage might be a safer "
"way to sneak into her room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It was suggested that I speak to Thadon's steward, Wide-Eye. I was told I "
"could find her in the House of Mania or elsewhere in New Sheoth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLC06ThievesDen_STAGE11_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It would appear that there is a cave that leads under Castle Anvil, it might "
"be worth a look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE97_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It's been about two hours, and Garrus Darelliun should be meeting me at the "
"Cheydinhal Bridge Inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE220_LOG0"
msgid ""
"It's been three weeks. I should return to Castle Chorrol and pick up my "
"painting from Chanel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark12Harem_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"J'Ghasta is dead. I must pick up my reward and next contract at the dead drop "
"located in the rotten box under the Old Bridge, just south of the Imperial "
"City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSecurity_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "J'baana has agreed to help with my Security training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSecurity_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"J'baana is dead. There is no way I can be taught more about Security skills "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingLightArmor_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "J'bari has agreed to help with my Light Armor training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingLightArmor_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"J'bari is dead. I have lost my opportunity to learn more about Light Armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"J'skar is the only survivor of the slaughter at the Mages Guild Hall in "
"Bruma. He's given me information about the King of Worms. Hannibal Traven "
"should be told immediately; I should return to the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "J'zidzo living on the Dementia side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid "J'zidzo living on the Mania side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "Jastira Nanus living on the Dementia side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid "Jastira Nanus living on the Mania side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre is worried that the Bruma Guard will not be able to defend Bruma from "
"a full-scale attack by the Mythic Dawn and their daedric allies. He suggested "
"that I try to obtain support from the other cities of Cyrodiil. Perhaps I can "
"persuade the Elder Council in the Imperial City to help as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre said that Martin has completely deciphered the ritual in the "
"Mysterium Xarxes. I should speak to Martin immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me that an Oblivion Gate has opened near Bruma, and the Countess "
"has asked for the Blades to help her guardsmen close it. I should find "
"Captain Burd outside the city walls and help him close the Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me that strangers have been sighted near Cloud Ruler Temple. He "
"suspects they are Mythic Dawn spies based out of Bruma. He suggested that "
"Captain Burd of the Bruma Guard might know of any strangers in town. Steffan "
"of the Blades can tell me where he has seen the suspected spies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me that the Armor of Tiber Septim, a holy relic of the Blades, "
"is contained in a shrine in the catacombs of Sancre Tor. It is said to be "
"splashed with Tiber Septim's blood. Jauffre warned me that the catacombs have "
"become very dangerous, but neither he nor Martin can think of any other way "
"to obtain the blood of a divine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me that the Emperor has an illegitimate son named Martin who is "
"currently serving as a priest in the Chapel of Akatosh in the city of Kvatch. "
"I must proceed to Kvatch at once and bring Martin safely back to Weynon "
"Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE10_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me that the Emperor has an illegitimate son named Martin who is "
"currently serving as a priest in the Chapel of Akatosh in the city of Kvatch. "
"I realized that Martin was among the survivors I helped rescue from Kvatch. I "
"must return to Kvatch at once and bring him safely back to Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me that the Emperor has an illegitimate son named Martin who is "
"currently serving as a priest in the Chapel of Akatosh in the city of Kvatch. "
"Jauffre fears that the attack on Kvatch was part of the enemy's plan to "
"eliminate all the Septim heirs. I must return to Kvatch at once, find Martin, "
"and bring him safely back to Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre told me to make sure that all the Mythic Dawn agents were dead. The "
"document I found spoke of two agents. I must track down and kill both of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre wants me to contact Baurus at Luther Broad's Boarding House in the "
"Imperial City. The enemy has the Amulet of Kings, and Baurus may have the "
"leads we need to get it back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre was pleased that I eliminated the spies in Bruma, but is worried that "
"the Mythic Dawn have already learned that Martin is at Cloud Ruler Temple. He "
"promised to warn the Countess that Bruma is in grave danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jauffre was pleased to hear of my success helping the Bruma Guard close the "
"Oblivion Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE80_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Jayred has collected bone fragments from a skeleton of what appears to be "
"another Gatekeeper. I should see Jayred in a few hours retrieve the arrows "
"made from these fragments."
msgstr ""

