"when I'm ready to go. I can also use Relmyna's Tears to harm the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG06Bruma_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Jeanne Frasoric has agreed to send a recommendation to Raminus Polus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG06Bruma_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jeanne Frasoric has tasked me with finding J'skar. I should speak with the "
"guild mages in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG14Plot_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "Jeanne Frasoric is dead. I should look for other survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jensine awarded me a bounty of gold on behalf of the Society of Concerned "
"Merchants for restoring the economy of the Market District to its rightful "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jensine refuses to testify against Audens Avidius. I don't think I can "
"persuade her. I'll have to try the other two, Luronk and Ruslan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Jirolin Doran is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jirolin Doran of Chorrol believes that ogres are somehow distantly related to "
"his family line. As such, he's asked me to take an offering of gems and gold "
"to Spy Rock in an effort to establish communications with the ogres."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jirolin Doran took it upon himself to check back at Spy Rock; I should head "
"there and find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jirolin is not at Spy Rock. He left a note stating the ogres were escorting "
"him to their home at Rock Bottom Caverns. I should go there and find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jirolin thanked me for saving him from the ogres, and gave me some of his "
"offering to the ogres as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS17_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jirolin will head back to Chorrol on his own. I can either head there myself, "
"or go back into Rock Bottom Caverns to raid the stores of treasure the ogres "
"have collected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE55_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Jiv Hiriel suggested that the trapdoor in Moslin's Inn offers the best way "
"into the caverns, as it is nearest where Dar-Ma is being held prisoner. I "
"should sneak into the caverns and try to find her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jiv Hiriel told me that Dar-Ma is being held in caverns beneath the town, "
"apparently for some kind of ritual sacrifice. He gave me a key that will open "
"the trapdoors in any of the houses. The villagers gather for worship in the "
"caverns every night, so that will be the best time to slip into the caverns "
"unnoticed and rescue Dar-Ma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jiv Hiriel, one of the Hackdirt villagers, seems to know something about Dar-"
"Ma. He was afraid to talk openly, but asked me to meet him in his house "
"tonight after dark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jorundr had a completely different take on what happened with Arnora. He says "
"she turned him in, hoping to get the gold for herself, but he had moved it. "
"He's furious and wants revenge. Jorundr then offered to give me all of the "
"gold if I kill her. All I have to do is show him her amulet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jorundr refused to speak to me. He said that he doesn't talk to "
"\"outsiders\". I think he's referring to the fact that I'm not a prisoner. "
"Sounds like the only way to get him to talk is by getting arrested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG19Alchemy_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Julienne Fanis has told me there is a special chest in the Arch Mage's "
"quarters. Once a week, I may place an ingredient inside, and return a day "
"later to find that ingredient replicated for my use. If I take too long in "
"returning to the chest, however, I will lose whatever was placed inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Julienne Fanis referred me to a book, \"Knightfall\", available at the First "
"Edition bookshop in the Market District if I wanted to learn more about the "
"possible location of Garridan's Tears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Just as Haskill suspected, Jyggalag's priests are poisoning the roots of the "
"Tree of Madness. I have cleansed one of the minor pools, but I must find the "
"Pools of Mania and Dementia in order to save the Tree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark02Watery_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Just as expected, the crate I hid in has been transported to the ship's hold. "
"I must now find and kill the Captain, Gaston Tussaud. He's probably in his "
"cabin, at the rear of the ship, on a higher deck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE14_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Jyggalag has spoken to me and told me the Greymarch is ended and the forces "
"of Order have retreated. Haskill will likely know how I should proceed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG07Leyawiin_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kalthar seemed to know a great deal about the missing amulet. I should tell "
"Agata what he has told me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE170_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kaneh sacrificed herself on the Altar of Despair in order to light the Flame "
"of Agnon. I can now retrieve the Flame from the courtyard and bring it back "
"to New Sheoth as Sheogorath commanded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kaneh thanked me for my help in securing Cylarne for the Golden Saints. She "
"is now heading for the Altar of Despair, where she says she will \"sacrifice "
"herself\" to kindle the Flame of Agnon. I should accompany her and see what "
"happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE124_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kaneh wants me to open a gate that is blocking the progress of the Golden "
"Saints' attack. She and her troops will hold their position until I find a "
"way to open the gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE42_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kathutet was angry at me for killing the Xivilai. I will have to take the "
"Bands of the Chosen from him by force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kellen told me that his family has been cursed for generations, and that he "
"has come to the Chapel of Stendarr to be freed of this curse. I should speak "
"with Areldur."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kiliban Nyrandil has told me to meet him in Xedilian's reception chamber "
"where I can recover the defeated adventurer's gear. I should use the final "
"transport pad and make my way there now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kiliban explained the identity of the strange beings, calling them Knights of "
"Order. He seemed very dismayed and wishes me to hasten to Sheogorath and "
"report their presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE220_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kishashi is dead. I'll never be able to earn her trust now. Ranarr-Jo will "
"just have to deal with things on his own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kithlan has told me that Lady Syl is especially reclusive lately. I may be "
"able to catch her in the garden late around midnight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kithlan has told me that the Chalice of Reversal is locked away in Dunroot "
"Burrow. I'll need to ingest Felldew to enter the Burrow, and pass through to "
"reach the tower. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Knightfall tells the tale of Garridan and the quest for the Everflow Ewer at "
"a place known as Frostfire Glade. It is supposedly located in the mountains "
"near Bruma. Using some of the references from the story, I was able to "
"pinpoint it on my map. The book also mentions needing special refined frost "
"salts to get into the Glade. I should speak to Julienne Fanis about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei has explained that Henantier has become the victim of his own "
"creation, the Dreamworld Amulet. He's trapped inside his own dreams, and I'll "
"need to put on the amulet and go to sleep to enter Henantier's dreams and "
"hopefully retrieve him. When I'm ready to do this, I should speak to Kud-Ei, "
"who will prepare me for the journey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei has given me Henantier's Dreamworld Amulet. I need to enter his dream "
"by going to sleep while wearing the amulet. Kud-Ei also warned me that if "
"Henantier is slain in the Dreamworld while I'm there, I'd be killed as well, "
"so I must be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei has given me several more scrolls, and asked me to get the staff back. "
"I need to find Soris Arenim in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kurdan gro-Dragol has told me that he knows the location of Aleron Loche, and "
"if I want him to reveal it to me, I'll have to retrieve an axe that belonged "
"to his father and was lost on Fort Grief Island some time ago. If I don't "
"bring the axe back, he says that Aleron will die. When I'm ready, I need to "
"speak to Kurdan who will provide a boat for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Kurdan gro-Dragol told me that the boat is waiting for me at the dock next to "
"the magic shop here in Bravil. I should get underway soon, as I wish to find "
"out what's happened to Aleron."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE34_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Lady Drad has told me that the ogres are located in Bleak Mine, not far from "
"here. I will have to go free them to appease Malacath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE130_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Lady Syl has asked me to meet her in the torture chamber. I should travel "
"there immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND07_STAGE20_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Lathon, the young squire of Sir Roderic, arrived at the Priory with a tragic "
"tale. It seems that his master perished while attempting to defeat the "
"dreadful undead guardian of the Sword of the Crusader. Lathon was able to "
"escape with the Greaves of the Crusader, which he surrendered to me. I have "
"made him a Knight, and asked him to accompany me to Underpall Cave where Sir "
"Roderic fell. We will avenge his former master and reclaim the Sword of the "
"Crusader for the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND07_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Lathon, the young squire of Sir Roderic, arrived at the Priory with a tragic "
"tale. It seems that his master perished while attempting to defeat the "
"dreadful undead guardian of the Sword of the Crusader. Lathon was able to "
"escape with the Greaves of the Crusader, which he surrendered to me. I need "
"to go to Underpall Cave where Sir Roderic fell, and reclaim the Sword of the "
"Crusader for the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE20_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Laythe Wavrick, the castle herald, told me that he's observed Orgnolf having "
"a drinking problem and often asking for money to fund his new habit. I should "
"continue questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE22_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Laythe Wavrick, the castle herald, told me that he's observed Orgnolf having "
"a drinking problem and often asking for money to fund his new habit. I should "
"continue questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE30_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Laythe Wavrick, the castle herald, told me that he's observed Orgnolf having "
"a drinking problem and often asking for money to fund his new habit. I should "
"continue questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE32_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Laythe Wavrick, the castle herald, told me that he's observed Orgnolf having "
"a drinking problem and often asking for money to fund his new habit. I should "
"continue questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE35_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Laythe Wavrick, the castle herald, told me that he's observed Orgnolf having "
"a drinking problem and often asking for money to fund his new habit. I've "
"spoken to all of the possible suspects and witnesses. Now, I should "
"concentrate on gathering the clues if I'm to solve the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ02_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Lerexus Callidus has rewarded me for putting a stop to the drug traffickers "
"in Greyland Settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Llevana Nedaren told me about the plight of a good friend of hers, Aldos "
"Othran. She explained how he was evicted from his home for non-payment of "
"fines and expressed her hatred of Ulrich. She mentioned that Ulrich's second "
"in command, Garrus Darelliun, seemed sympathetic to the people's plight. I "
"should speak to Garrus next about this matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Llevana was furious after I told her of Aldos's fate. She wants me to go "
"speak to Ulrich and somehow convince him to follow me back to her house, "
"where she would \"take care of him.\" This doesn't sound like the best method "
"to deal with Ulrich. I think I should speak to Garrus first then decide how "
"to handle this situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC09Ogres_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Lord Rugdumph tells me that his daughter was out picking rocks, and he fears "
"she may have been taken away by a band of ogres that are known to live east "
"of the estate. I am to find and return her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGDirections_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Luciana Galena is the fence in Bravil. The beggar told me she lives by the "
"arena. I should go to her if I have any stolen property to sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark17Following_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Lucien Lachance is dead, killed by the surviving members of the Black Hand, "
"who don't even realize the real traitor is still among them!  They have "
"advanced me to Speaker, in Lachance's place. Between the hours of midnight "
"and 3:00 AM, I must speak with Arquen about the Night Mother, and all of the "
"Black Hand -- including me -- will be teleported to the Night Mother's "
"resting place, for some ancient ritual. I must do as Arquen says, so that I "
"might expose the traitor..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01Knife_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Lucien Lachance, the Dark Brotherhood's representative, has been killed. He "
"was my link to the mysterious assassins guild, and now that link has been "
"severed... forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Luronk gro-Glurzog has agreed to testify against Audens Avidius in the "
"morning. Now I just have to get Ruslan to testify as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha admitted to being involved in a plot to kill Lady Syl. He's asked "
"for time to learn more about who's behind it. I should meet him at his house "
"in one day's time. In the meantime, I should investigate Nelrene's role in "
"this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha refuses to give me any information. I need evidence that he's "
"involved; I should speak to the citizens of Crucible to learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maelona and Gogan entered the farmhouse in Anvil City Guard armor. It turns "
"out that they have been undercover as a married couple for some time trying "
"to put a stop to the gang. She says I was spotted heading to Gweden so she "
"went back for reinforcements and headed here. She has taken Faustina into "
"custody and paid me the gold she promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maelona and Gogan entered the farmhouse in Anvil City Guard armor. It turns "
"out that they have been undercover as a married couple for some time trying "
"to put a stop to the gang. She says I was spotted heading to Gweden so she "
"went back for reinforcements and headed here. She said she would take care of "
"the bodies, and paid me my gold as promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maelona told me that the men are usually approached at the local watering "
"hole, The Flowing Bowl. That's where I should make contact with the gang. I "
"should speak to Gogan, as he may be able to add some more useful information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE73_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"Magicka returns slowly on its own. You can restore it more quickly by "
"drinking potions or sleeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Thieves_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maglir and I have succeeded in clearing Hrota Cave of all of the thieves "
"living there. I should return to Azzan for payment of the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maglir has told me that he doesn't care whether or not Modryn Oreyn knows "
"that he did not complete the contract. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Maglir tells me I should speak with Aryarie at the Mage's Guild if I want to "
"finish the Guild contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maglir tells me his contract was to find the scholar Brenus Astis' journal "
"within Fallen Rock Cave. He doesn't believe he's being paid well enough for "
"the dangerous assignment, so he has chosen not to complete it. He has told me "
"I should complete the contract instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Maglir tells me that he is no longer a member of the Fighters Guild. He is "
"tired of trying to scrounge up work, so he has joined the Blackwood Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE74_LOG0_1"
msgid ""
"Make sure opponents don't <RT_BlueMed>deplete</> your Fatigue or you'll be "
"<RT_BlueMed>staggered</> or <RT_BlueMed>knocked down</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Malacath wanted his ogres freed... not killed. Now there's no chance of "
"earning the reward he promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Malacath was satisfied with my efforts to free the ogres. He has rewarded me "
"with Volendrung."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ05_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Malene at the Roxey Inn in the wilderness north of the Imperial City has "
"asked me to help her rid the area of a Necromancer who calls herself Raelynn "
"the Gravefinder. Raelynn can be found in Moss Rock Cavern to the north."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ05_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Malene was delighted with the news of Raelynn the Gravefinder's death, and "
"rewarded me with some coin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran escaped to his realm of Paradise with the Amulet of Kings, and "
"closed his magical portal behind him. But I have the Mysterium Xarxes, the "
"Mythic Dawn's book of secrets. Now I must escape this place and return to "
"Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran escaped to his realm of Paradise with the Amulet of Kings, and "
"closed his magical portal behind him. But the Mysterium Xarxes itself is here "
"in the shrine. I must get the Mysterium Xarxes. It is my only hope of finding "
"a way to recover the Amulet now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSneak_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Marana Rian has agreed to train me in Sneaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSneak_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Marana Rian is dead. There's no way I can be taught more about Sneaking now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Margarte has told me that she would pay well for minotaur horns or ogre "
"teeth. However, she doesn't trust the Guild yet. I'll need to bring her five "
"portions of ectoplasm, and she'll give us her business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin and I are inside the Temple of the One. I must get Martin to the "
"Dragonfires, or all hope is lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin and I have arrived on the battlefield. I must protect Martin until the "
"Great Gate opens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Martin asked me to speak to Jauffre about Mythic Dawn agents spying on Cloud "
"Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin has deciphered a second item needed for the ritual: the 'blood of a "
"Divine'. He could not imagine a way to obtain such a thing, until Jauffre "
"suggested a solution: the blood of Tiber Septim, who was once mortal but "
"became a god. I should ask Jauffre how to obtain this blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin has deciphered the fourth item needed for the ritual: a Great Sigil "
"Stone. Unfortunately, it is the anchor for a Great Gate -- the kind of "
"Oblivion Gate the Mythic Dawn opened at Kvatch. While it is very dangerous to "
"allow the Mythic Dawn to proceed with their plan to attack Bruma, it is our "
"only hope to obtain a Great Sigil Stone. Martin will lead the defense of "
"Bruma, while I enter the Great Gate to obtain its Sigil Stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ12_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin has deciphered the third item needed for the ritual: a rare Ayleid "
"artifact known as a Great Welkynd Stone. He knows of only one place that "
"still might contain one, the Ayleid ruins of Miscarcand. I must find the "
"Great Welkynd Stone of Miscarcand and bring it to Martin at Cloud Ruler "
"Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ08_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin has found a section of the Mysterium Xarxes which describes a ritual "
"which will allow him to open a portal to Camoran's Paradise, where Mankar "
"Camoran has taken the Amulet of Kings. He has learned that four items are "
"required for this ritual, but has only identifed one so far: 'the blood of a "
"Daedra Lord', which he says refers to a Daedric Artifact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ12_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Martin has not yet deciphered the last item needed for the ritual to open a "
"portal to Camoran's Paradise. I should help the Bruma Guard close the "
"Oblivion Gate outside Bruma while he continues to study the Mysterium Xarxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin performed the ritual and opened the portal to Camoran's Paradise. He "
"warned me that the portal would close behind me. Martin believes that since "
"Mankar Camoran bound himself to the Mysterium Xarxes in the creation of "
"Paradise, I can only return to Tamriel by killing him. I must enter the "
"portal, kill Mankar Camoran, recover the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin said that while mortal weapons may hurt Mehrunes Dagon, they cannot "
"destroy him. He said that if he can only reach the Temple of the One, there "
"is still a chance to turn defeat into victory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin shattered the Amulet of Kings and transformed himself into an avatar "
"of Akatosh, the Dragon God of Time. In dragon form he banished Mehrunes Dagon "
"to Oblivion and ended the Oblivion Crisis, and then vanished. Whether he is "
"dead, or has ascended to join his ancestor Tiber Septim, no one knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ10_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid "Martin told me that Jauffre needs to speak to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin took the Amulet of Kings from me, and placed it around his neck -- he "
"is indeed of the Septim blood. But he reminded me that Mankar Camoran's death "
"will not halt the Oblivion crisis. Mehrunes Dagon's invasion will continue "
"until Martin lights the Dragonfires in the Temple of the One."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ14_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martin was pleased to see me return alive from the Great Gate. I gave him the "
"Great Sigil Stone, and he has gone to Cloud Ruler Temple to prepare for the "
"portal-opening ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingIllusion_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Martina Floria has agreed to train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingIllusion_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Martina Floria is dead. It is now impossible for me to be taught more about "
"Illusion magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mazoga asked me to take her to Fisherman's Rock, and I told her, 'Maybe "
"later.' She seemed disappointed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid "Mazoga is dead. Now I'll never know how to find Black Brugo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Mazoga is dead. Now I'll never learn Mazoga's story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mazoga knows Black Brugo, and has a plan to ambush him. Black Brugo visits "
"his gang's hideout to collect his share of the loot every night between "
"midnight and six in the morning. The hideout is an Ayleid ruin west of "
"Leyawiin called Telepe. Mazoga offered to help me find and kill Black Brugo. "
"She will wait in the Castle Hall until I ask her to follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mazoga spoke to Mogens Wind-Shifter, and then they started to fight. Mogens "
"has his gang with him so Mazoga needs some help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE85_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mazoga told me she attacked the bandits to avenge the murder of her friend, "
"Ra'vindra. She invited me to take what I wish from the dead... her vengeance "
"is her reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mazoga told me she attacked the bandits to avenge the murder of her friend, "
"Ra'vindra. She invited me to take what I wish from the dead... her vengeance "
"is her reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mazoga was reluctant to betray a former associate, but she says, sooner or "
"later, Black Brugo visits a hideout west of Leyawiin called Telepe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mehrunes Dagon is here! The barriers between Oblivion and Tamriel have been "
"destroyed! Our only hope now is to somehow defeat Mehrunes Dagon and cast him "
"back into Oblivion. Perhaps Martin will know what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Melisande has created a potion to cure vampirism. I have been given two "
"doses; one for myself and one that I need to take to Castle Skingrad. I "
"should travel there and speak with Hal-Liurz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE41_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Melisande has given me a special dagger, with which I am to collect the blood "
"of an Argonian. I should find an Argonian, stab him with the dagger, and "
"return it to Melisande."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE42_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Melisande requires the ashes of a powerful vampire to complete her cure. I "
"should search the area near the North Panther River for Hindaril, a vampire "
"who was imprisoned in an underground cavern many years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Melisande's dagger is covered in Argonian blood. I should deliver it to her "
"so that she can brew the potion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Melus Petiliusis dead, so I cannot complete the task given to me by Molag Bal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mephala has told me about the settlement of Bleaker's Way. She would like me "
"to kill the leaders of the two families, and leave evidence that the murders "
"were done by the other family. I am to allow no one to see me commit the "
"crimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE105_LOG0"
msgid "Mephala was disappointed in my failure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mephala was pleased with the strife I have caused. She has rewarded me with "
"the Ebony Blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mephala's followers have told me that, in order to summon the Daedra, I must "
"first leave an offering of nightshade at her statue between midnight and "
"dawn. [You must be level 15 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG09Motives_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mercator Hosidius told me the Count will meet with me South of the Cursed "
"Mine west of town at 2 AM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG09Motives_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mercator Hosidius, a liason to the Count of Skingrad, has told me the Count "
"is not accepting visitors. I need to return tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMeridia_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Meridia was gratified that I had performed the task assigned to me. As a "
"reward, I have been given the Ring of Khajiiti."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel contacted me. She says that this whole job was just a setup to "
"flush out the informant, a Dark Elf named Myvryna Arano. They didn't see fit "
"to let me in on the plan though. She has specific instructions from Armand to "
"plant the bust in Myvryna's cupboard. Then I have to find Hieronymus Lex and "
"snitch on her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel delivered the diary to Armand before me. She has been accepted "
"into the Thieves Guild. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel has a plan to force Hieronymus Lex to lift his seige of the "
"Waterfront. Myself and four other Thieves Guild operatives will go on a crime "
"spree. Each of us is assigned a high profile item to steal. I am to steal "
"Hrormir's staff from the Archmage's room at the Arcane University. I have a "
"note I am supposed to leave in his nightstand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel has beaten me to Amantius Allectus' diary. If I can't get it from "
"her somehow, she will get into the guild and I'll be left out in the cold. "
"It's too bad the competition rules won't let me kill her. However, Armand "
"didn't say anything about stealing from her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel has escaped. If I want that diary, I going to have to track her "
"down. I wonder if the beggars can help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel has one last task for me. It's too dangerous to return Hrormir's "
"Icestaff directly to the Arcane University. Instead,  I have to put the "
"Icestaff into a chest in Ontus Vanin's home. He is a researcher for the "
"Arcane University and will certainly find it there. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Methredhel sought me out and delivered a message from the Gray Fox. I am to "
"meet him at the home of Helvius Cecia in Bruma. He has an important task for "
"me. Finally, I am going to get to meet the head of the Thieves Guild in "
"person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirel, the Golden Saint lieutenant, told me that his scouts have recently "
"discovered a side passage leading to the Altar of Despair through the "
"Underdeep. He believes an attack down this route will take the Dark Seducers "
"by surprise, but has not been able to convince his commander, Kaneh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Mirel, the Golden Saint lieutenant, told me that his scouts have recently "
"discovered a side passage leading to the Altar of Despair through the "
"Underdeep. He believes an attack down this route will take the Dark Seducers "
"by surprise. I should scout the Dark Seducer deployments in both the side "
"passage and the main passage and find out if Mirel is right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili Ulven has asked that I capture a Baliwog for her. All I need to do is "
"get it close to her and she'll subdue it. She has promised to reward me "
"handsomely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili Ulven has asked that I capture a Gnarl for her. All I need to do is "
"get it close to her and she'll subdue it. She has promised to reward me "
"handsomely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili Ulven has asked that I capture a Scalon for her. All I need to do is "
"get it close to her and she'll subdue it. She has promised to reward me "
"handsomely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili Ulven has asked that I capture an Elytra for her. All I need to do is "
"get it close to her and she'll subdue it. She has promised to reward me "
"handsomely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili Ulven has died. I'll never understand what she was trying to "
"accomplish with her taxonomy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid "Mirili Ulven has paid me for capturing a Baliwog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid "Mirili Ulven has paid me for capturing a Gnarl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid "Mirili Ulven has paid me for capturing a Scalon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid "Mirili Ulven has paid me for capturing an Elytra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili Ulven of Highcross is willing to pay 10 gold coins for samples of "
"various rare items. She'll only pay for one sample of each though. She gave "
"me a list of the items she is interested in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE37_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirili has all of her plants and animals now. Her beastiary is complete and "
"her taxonomy of plantlife is complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirisa said that I ended the war just by taking the head from Timberscar "
"Cave. I should tell Barthel Gernand that it's safe for him and his family to "
"return to Cropsford."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Mirisa says that the goblins at Cropsford are war parties from Cracked Wood "
"Cave, on their way to attack a rival tribe at Timberscar Cave. She's not "
"sure, but usually goblin wars are caused by one tribe stealing the Totem Head "
"from another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Mirisa suggested two ways to deal with the goblins at Cropsford. One is to "
"recover the Totem Head from the goblins in Timberscar Cave, which would stop "
"the war between the two tribes and leave Cropsford in peace. The other way to "
"keep the goblins away from Cropsford is to kill the shaman of the Cracked "
"Wood Cave tribe, which should effectively destroy the tribe and stop their "
"war parties from attacking Cropsford."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn has assigned me another of my duties. I am to travel to Leyawiin "
"and find out why three members of the Fighters Guild--Dubok gro-Shagk, "
"Rellian, and Vantus Prelius--have been causing trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn has decided that the threat of the Blackwood Company must be "
"ended. He wants me to travel to their headquarters and destroy the Hist Tree. "
"It will be behind a locked door, and it is likely that only Ri'Zakar himself "
"has a key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD06DeadViranus_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn has given me another duty to perform. A band of fighters was "
"contracted to clear the Forsaken Mine of trolls, but none of them have been "
"heard from, including Viranus Donton. I am to go investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn has told me that as my first duty, I am to find out why Maglir "
"has defaulted on a contract he was given near Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn has told me to go to Bravil and find out why Maglir has "
"defaulted on another contract. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn was disturbed by the news about Maglir, but was glad that I was "
"able to complete the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn would like me to complete a mission with Viranus Donton, the "
"Guild Master's son. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Modryn Oreyn would like me to join the Blackwood Company. I am to go to their "
"headquarters in Leyawiin, infiltrate their ranks, and follow them on a "
"mission to find out the secret of their effectiveness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Molag Bal has spoken to me, and wishes me to help him corrupt Melus Petilius, "
"by forcing him to kill me with the Cursed Mace. I should travel to Brindle "
"Home and see what I can find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Molag Bal was pleased that I was able to corrupt the paladin. He has rewarded "
"me with the Mace of Molag Bal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMolagBal_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Molag Bal's follower has told me that, in order to summon the Daedra, I must "
"present an offering of a lion pelt to the statue. [You must be level 17 to "
"begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Motierre has been revived, but his ancestors have risen from the dead, angry "
"at the desecration of their tomb! I must keep Motierre alive and escort him "
"out of the Undercroft and to the Grey Mare, where he can arrange passage out "
"of Cyrodiil.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Motierre has been slashed with the Languorwine Blade and appears to have died "
"from the wound, as expected. I must now flee from Chorrol, and leave Hides-"
"His-Heart alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05Assassinated_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Motierre has escaped. I must now return to the Dark Brotherhood Sanctuary and "
"speak with Vicente Valtieri to receive my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "My Mage's Staff is complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE90_LOG1"
msgid ""
"My attempts to reach the Mace of Zenithar have been unsuccessful. No matter "
"what I try, I cannot reach the other platform. Perhaps if I continue my quest "
"for the other relics, an answer will present itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"My attempts to reach the Mace of Zenithar have been unsuccessful. No matter "
"what I try, I cannot reach the other platform. Perhaps the solution lies with "
"one of the other relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DEM02_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "My cover is blown. I have no option other than fighting back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ06_STAGE41_LOG1"
msgid ""
"My cover is blown. The Mythic Dawn know I am an enemy. I must reach the inner "
"shrine and locate the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid ""
"My report that the Underdeep was lightly defended convinced Kaneh that this "
"was the better attack route. I need to help the Golden Saints get through the "
"Underdeep before the Dark Seducers realize what is happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"My sources tell me that there is a master forger in Anvil. He is known only "
"as The Stranger. He lives in a house by the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Namira appreciated my efforts. I have been rewarded with the Ring of Namira."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Near the body of the messenger, I've discovered a slate tablet with what "
"appears to be Akaviri writing on its surface. These must be the orders the "
"messenger spoke about in the diary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE110_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Nelrene admits to being involved in a conspiracy, and has named Muurine as "
"the architect of the plot. I'll need more evidence before confronting Muurine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Nelrene has admitted to being involved in the conspiracy. I now have enough "
"evidence to confront Muurine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Nelrene has denied involvement in any sort of conspiracy. I'll need to be "
"more persuasive with her, or find direct evidence she's involved. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Flagon_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Newheim has mentioned that he had a family heirloom, a pewter flagon, stolen "
"by the thieves. If I return it to him, he'll reward me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Thieves_STAGE24_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Newheim has told me that the thieves are all Bosmer and may be located in "
"Hrota Cave, north of the city of Anvil. Maglir and I should travel there and "
"take care of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE58_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Nice shot! You can retrieve arrows from the world, as well as recovering the "
"arrows you fire into enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Nocturnal was pleased that I have returned the Eye of Nocturnal. I have been "
"rewarded with the Skeleton Key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC02Protect_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Norbert Lelles was surprised to learn that the men breaking in were all "
"former employees, though none had been with him long. He was glad that the "
"problem was taken care of, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Now I must reach the Sigil Stone and remove it from the Sigil Keep to close "
"the Oblivion Gate that it anchors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE34_LOG1_0"
msgid ""
"Now practice casting spells. Open your journal, navigate to the Magic tab and "
"equip the Clairvoyance spell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE34_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Now practice casting spells. Open your journal, navigate to the Magic tab and "
"equip the Clairvoyance spell.\n"
"\n"
"Cast it by pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Cast\"/>. Clairvoyance can guide "
"you towards the next step of your journey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I have killed all of the fugitives, I should return to Burz gro-"
"Khash for my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE5_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Now that I have secured the stronghold of the Dark Seducers, I should speak "
"to Sheogorath about our next step."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I have secured the stronghold of the Golden Saints, I should speak "
"to Sheogorath about our next step."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseBravil_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in Bravil, I may want to head over to "
"Nilawen at The Fair Deal to secure some furnishings for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseBruma_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in Bruma, I may want to head over to "
"Suurootan at Novaroma to secure some furnishings for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseCheydinhal_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in Cheydinhal, I may want to head over "
"to Borba gra-Uzgash at Borba's Goods and Stores to secure some furnishings "
"for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseChorrol_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in Chorrol, I may want to head over to "
"Seed-Neeus at Northern Goods and Trade to secure some furnishings for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseLeyawiin_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in Leyawiin, I may want to head over to "
"Gundalas at Best Goods and Guarantees to secure some furnishings for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseSkingrad_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in Skingrad, I may want to head over to "
"Gunder at Colovian Traders to secure some furnishings for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_HouseImperialCity_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've arrived at my new house in the Imperial City, I may want to "
"head over to Sergius Verus at Three Brothers Trade Goods to secure some "
"furnishings for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've become a member of the courts of both of the Dukes of Madness, "
"I should return to Sheogorath and report my progress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE12_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Now that I've recovered the Helm, I should proceed to the Priory of the Nine "
"to see if it still holds the Cuirass of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE12_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Now that I've recovered the Helm, I should proceed to the Priory of the Nine. "
"According to Sir Amiel's journal, I will need his ring to enter the Priory "
"vaults where the Cuirass was kept."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE50_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Now that Ulfri's troops are redeployed to defend the Underdeep, Kaneh's "
"attack down the main passage should catch the Dark Seducers completely off "
"guard. I should help Kaneh defeat Ulfri and take control of the Altar of "
"Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE52_LOG0"
msgid "Now that you have arrows, pick up the bow and practice using it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05AssassinatedFIN_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Ocheeva has given me a new contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingRestoration_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oleta is dead. I have no chance of being taught more about Restoration magic "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingRestoration_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oleta thanked me for helping to save Kvatch, and offered to train me in "
"Restoration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingConjuration_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Olyn Seran is dead. I have no chance to be taught more about Conjuration now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingConjuration_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Olyn Seran wants me to prove my worth before he will train me. I need to "
"summon a Faded Wraith in his presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ07_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"On Slythe's corpse, I've located his last journal entry. It seems he fell "
"here believing he was truly going to meet his god and give an offering to him "
"to help all of Tamriel. His death is a sad end to such a well-intended "
"sojourn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE14_LOG0"
msgid ""
"On behalf of the Elder Council, Chancellor Ocato has recognized Martin as "
"Uriel Septim's heir. Now all that remains is for Martin to light the "
"Dragonfires in the Temple of the One."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Once Ulrich was led inside Llevana's house, she cast some sort of paralysis "
"spell on him. At that point, Llevana released some rats upon Ulrich's "
"helpless body that bit into him until he was dead. I should report this to "
"Garrus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark19Whispers_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Once a week, I must speak with the statue of the Night Mother in Bravil. The "
"Night Mother will give me a list of names and locations of people who require "
"a visit from a Dark Brotherhood Speaker, to arrange an assassination. If I "
"take this information to Arquen in the Cheydinhal Sanctuary, she will give me "
"my weekly earnings. I can do this every week for as long as I want, and there "
"is no penalty if I choose not to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"One of Clavicus Vile's worshippers has told me that in order to summon the "
"Daedra, an offering of 500 gold must be given to the statue. [You must be "
"level 20 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"One of Malacath's worshippers has told me that, in order to have the Daedra "
"summoned, I must leave an offering of Troll Fat at the statue. [You must be "
"level 10 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMeridia_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"One of Meridia's followers has told me that the Daedra can be summoned if "
"something from the corpse of an undead creature is left as an offering at the "
"statue. [You must be level 10 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"One of my fellow Thieves has given me information on the fugitives. There are "
"four of them: Enrion, Hlofgar, Ashanta, and Dreet-Lai. They are thought to be "
"hiding in Bloodmayne Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS05_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS09_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS10_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE250_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "One of the characters needed to complete this quest has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"One of the shopkeepers in the Market District of the Imperial City has "
"informed me of another shop that opened recently. Apparently, this shop's "
"prices are so low it's undercutting all of their sales. They're collectively "
"looking for someone to hire to investigate, as they suspect foul play. I was "
"told to go speak with Jensine at her \"Good as New\" Merchandise store for "
"more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"One of the townspeople in Cheydinhal has mentioned the opening of what they "
"suspect to be a gate to the realm of Oblivion just outside the city walls. "
"The city guards seem on alert and tensions appear to be running high. I "
"should make my way through the west gates of Cheydinhal to investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"One of the townspeople in Chorrol mentioned that Sabine Laul at the Fighters "
"Guild may know Weatherleah's location, as she has explored much of the "
"surrounding area. I should speak to her next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGDirections_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ongar is the fence in Bruma. The beggar told me he lives behind the temple. I "
"should go to him if I have any stolen property to sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Opening the waterlogged chest with all three keys, I discovered the artifact "
"to be an amulet. It seems fairly unremarkable, and I am unsure of its "
"function. I think I should bring it back to Erline Lirrian and see what she "
"wants me to do with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "Oreyn and I have found and defeated Azani Blackheart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn believes our work is now finished. He has given me the Helm of Oreyn "
"Bearclaw as a symbol of our friendship. He suggests I speak with Vilena "
"Donton and tell her all that has transpired."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD04Defector_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn says I should speak with Aryarie in the Bravil Mages Guild in order to "
"get the details needed to complete Maglir's contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD06DeadViranus_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn was both angered and saddened by what I told him. He has asked that I "
"allow him to tell Vilena Donton the news about her son. Until then, he "
"suggests I find contract work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn was deeply troubled by what I told him, but realizes that there was "
"little I could have done to prevent it. He believes it is time to end the "
"Blackwood Company forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn was pleased with my efforts, though troubled that the Blackwood Company "
"is stealing Fighters Guild contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn wishes to make sure people know who truly defeated the great warrior, "
"and recognize the lies of the Blackwood Company. Oreyn would like me to give "
"him Azani Blackheart's Ring as proof of our accomplishments here today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn would like me to learn some things from Ajum-Kajin: how large the "
"Blackwood Company is; who leads the Company; and what is the source of their "
"power. Oreyn has told me I am to use whatever means necessary to get this "
"information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Oreyn would like to speak more about duties, once I am promoted to the next "
"rank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ormil has explained that the treasure the thieves were looking for was just a "
"publicity stunt he created to drum up more business for the tavern. He never "
"expected to have the Bloated Float hijacked as a result of that stunt. He "
"then suggested I get some sleep again for the voyage back to the Imperial "
"City. I should do so to stay out of their way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ormil has instructed me to escort Selene to the room next to mine on the inn "
"deck where she'll be locked in until we arrive at port. I should do so before "
"the Bloated Float can get underway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ormil presented me with a bag of gold, and explained to me that the Imperial "
"City guard had been looking for Selene, and there was a reward for her "
"capture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Orok gro-Ghoth mentioned he was in the castle that entire night because it "
"had been raining, but didn't see Orgnolf or Chanel. Also, he mentioned he had "
"caught Orgnolf drinking in the West Tower once. When he had threatened to "
"tell the Countess about it, Orgnolf apparently stopped. I should continue "
"questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE22_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Orok gro-Ghoth mentioned he was in the castle that entire night because it "
"had been raining, but didn't see Orgnolf or Chanel. Also, he mentioned he had "
"caught Orgnolf drinking in the West Tower once. When he had threatened to "
"tell the Countess about it, Orgnolf apparently stopped. I should continue "
"questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Orok gro-Ghoth mentioned he was in the castle that entire night because it "
"had been raining, but didn't see Orgnolf or Chanel. Also, he mentioned he had "
"caught Orgnolf drinking in the West Tower once. When he had threatened to "
"tell the Countess about it, Orgnolf apparently stopped. I should continue "
"questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE32_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Orok gro-Ghoth mentioned he was in the castle that entire night because it "
"had been raining, but didn't see Orgnolf or Chanel. Also, he mentioned he had "
"caught Orgnolf drinking in the West Tower once. When he had threatened to "
"tell the Countess about it, Orgnolf apparently stopped. I should continue "
"questioning the suspects the Countess recommended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Orok gro-Ghoth mentioned he was in the castle that entire night because it "
"had been raining, but didn't see Orgnolf or Chanel. Also, he mentioned he had "
"caught Orgnolf drinking in the West Tower once. When he had threatened to "
"tell the Countess about it, Orgnolf apparently stopped. I've spoken to all of "
"the possible suspects and witnesses. Now, I should concentrate on gathering "
"the clues if I'm to solve the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE13_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Orrin has shown me a secret passage within the walls of Castle Anvil. It "
"should let me get closer to Dairihill's office without being seen by the "
"castle guards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGDirections_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Orrin is the fence in Anvil. The beggar told me he lives in the far western "
"corner of the city. I should go to him if I have any stolen property to sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMercantile_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Palonirya has agreed to train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingMercantile_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Palonirya is dead. I cannot be taught any more to improve my Mercantile skill"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Passwall has been liberated and the forces of Order have been defeated. I "
"should speak with Sheogorath. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC03Thieves_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"People in Anvil have suggested I speak with Newheim the Portly. He apparently "
"had some goods stolen by the thieves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark11Kin_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Perennia Draconis has given me a document that lists the locations of all the "
"members of her family. She thought I was the delivery person she hired to buy "
"gifts for her children. I will instead use the list to find and slay each "
"family member. I should start with Perennia herself. Then I must kill "
"Matthias Draconis in the Talos Plaza District of the Imperial City, Andreas "
"Draconis in the Drunken Dragon Inn, Sibylla Draconis in Muck Valley Cavern "
"and Caelia Draconis in Castle Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Peryite has told me that five of his followers, in an attempt to get closer "
"to Him, have transported their souls to a plane of Oblivion. The Daedra would "
"like me to travel there and carry their souls back to this world. I should "
"approach the statue again when I am prepared to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAPeryite_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Peryite was grateful for my help. He has given me Spell Breaker as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Phintias told me he was holding Volume 3 of Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries "
"on the Mysterium Xarxes\" for a client named Gwinas, who has already paid for "
"it. I should wait for Gwinas to come to the store, and see why he wanted it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Phintias told me that Gwinas is on his way to pick up his copy of Volume 3. I "
"should wait for him to arrive and find out what Gwinas knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Phintias, the bookseller at First Edition, has told me that he has a copy of "
"Volume 3 of Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries on the Mysterium Xarxes\" locked "
"away. He is holding it for a client named Gwinas who has already paid for it. "
"I need to get that book, and find out why Gwinas wanted it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Pinarus has agreed to look for mountain lions with me. If we find them, we'll "
"kill them, and make Arvena feel safer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHeavyArmor_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Pranal has asked me to buy a gift for Malene, the owner of the Roxey Inn. I "
"need to find a silver pitcher and four silver glasses and bring them to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingHeavyArmor_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Pranal has died, which means I cannot be taught more about Heavy Armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE10_LOG2_0"
msgid ""
"Press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementForward\"/>, <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementLeft\"/>, <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementBackward\"/> or <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementRight\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>move</>.\n"
"Use the mouse to turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE10_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementForward\"/>, <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementLeft\"/>, <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementBackward\"/> or <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementRight\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>move</>.\n"
"Use the mouse to turn.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>sprint</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Sprint\"/> while "
"moving.\n"
"If you'd rather <RT_BlueMed>walk</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_ToggleWalk\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE76_LOG0_2"
msgid ""
"Press <IA id=\"IA_Game_QuickKeys_OpenMenu\"/> to bring up the Shortcuts, then "
"use <IA id=\"IA_UI_Generic_NavigateRight\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>equip</> a slot "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE22_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Press <IA id=\"IA_UI_Specific_Common_PreviousMenu\"/> or <IA "
"id=\"IA_UI_Specific_Common_NextMenu\"/> to change menus. From the inventory "
"tab, you can equip armor and weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE26_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Press A to equip the item. Press A again to unequip it. X will drop items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE76_LOG1_2"
msgid ""
"Pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_QuickKeys_Keyboard_1\"/> to <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_QuickKeys_Keyboard_8\"/> will also equip that shortcut "
"immediately. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE34_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Pyke was overjoyed at the return of his Medallion, and has rewarded me with a "
"gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Quill-Weave thanked me for protecting her secret, and has trained me in "
"Acrobatics for free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE111_LOG0"
msgid "Ra'kheran is dead. Without his help, I'll have to kill Ciirta myself. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE140_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ra'kheran's betrayal of Ciirta has been successful. Now that she is dead, "
"taking her eye should be a simple matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG09Motives_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Raminus Polus has asked me to retrieve a book from Janus Hassildor, Count of "
"Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Raminus Polus has asked that I speak with Irlav Jarol about assisting with "
"his research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG18KingofWorms_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Raminus Polus thanked me for putting an end to the King of Worms, and has "
"recognized me as Arch-Mage of the Mages' Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ranaar-Jo of Fellmoor is in desperate need of help, except he won't trust me "
"until I've earned Kishashi's trust. I should find her and win her over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ranarr-Jo has asked me to wreck Cindanwe's house, and steal her notebook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE210_LOG1"
msgid "Ranarr-Jo is dead. I suppose he won't have to worry about Cindanwe now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid "Ranarr-Jo is dead. I'll never know what he needed help with now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ranarr-Jo is grateful that I've taken care of Cindanwe. Now he and his "
"neighbors can live in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE39_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Ranarr-Jo is in need of a hero, but Kishashi won't tell me more until she can "
"trust me. If I want to know more, I need to get her to trust me. She "
"mentioned needing five pod pits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Rather than divulge the Blackwood Company's secret, Ajum-Kajin has killed "
"himself. I should speak with Oreyn for further instruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Relmyna has asked me to enter the depths of the Gardens of Flesh and Bone, "
"and retrieve some mystical components needed for the ceremony to create the "
"new Gatekeeper. I am to return with Blood Liqueur, Osseous Marrow, Dermis "
"Membrane, and the Essence of Breath. She has given me a key that I can use to "
"get into the Gardens and directly to her Sanctum when I return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Relmyna has instructed me to choose the body parts with which we will create "
"the new Gatekeeper. I am to pick out a head, a torso, a heart, a right arm, a "
"left arm, and legs. I should speak with her when I am finished. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Relmyna will perform the ceremonial magic, and I am to follow her "
"instructions during the ceremony. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Reynald denies that he's ever been to Cheydinhal recently. In fact, in his "
"drunken condition, it's doubtful he could make it anywhere without falling "
"down. Reynald's paid me fifty gold to travel to Cheydinhal and find the man "
"who's impersonating him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ri'Bassa has suggested I stay at the Border Watch Inn, which apparently has a "
"large collection of cheeses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Roland Jenseric insists that he's not a vampire. In fact, he's accusing "
"Seridur of being one instead! I should listen to what he has to say about "
"Seridur and see if I can determine who's telling the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Roland tells me that he thought his lover was having an affair, so he "
"followed her one night on a walk. He came across Seridur draining the blood "
"from her neck. Roland says he attacked Seridur, and in the chaos, Roland's "
"lover was killed. Seridur got away. Knowing Selidur was a respected member of "
"the Imperial City, he panicked and ran to the cabin here to collect his "
"thoughts and decide what to do next. I need to decide what to do about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Rosentia Gallenus has told me she acquired a strange Daedric staff, and after "
"trying to examine it, she inadvertently summoned some scamps. Now the things "
"follow her wherever she goes. Worse still, the staff seems cursed and she "
"cannot drop it, sell it or get rid of it. She implored me to help her figure "
"a way to rid her of the curse. She suggested I speak to a friend of hers at "
"the Mages Guild, Alves Uvenim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS43_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Rosentia Gallenus was gratified that I rid her of the scamps, and rewarded me "
"with a daedric ring she identified as the Ring of Eidolon's Edge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAthletics_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Rusia Bradus has agreed to train me in Athletics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAthletics_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Rusia Bradus has died, along with my chances of learning more about Athletics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAthletics_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Rusia Bradus says I need to see more of the world for myself. I need to "
"explore Cyrodiil and discover more places on my own before she will train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ruslan has agreed to testify against Audens Avidius in the morning. Now I "
"just have to get Luronk gro-Glurzog to testify as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Rythe used the Brush of Truepaint to paint a door back to his studio. I "
"should now step through and return back to Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'drassa described a bit about Garridan's Tears to me. Apparently, they're "
"literally tears of a knight who was somehow frozen long ago. To find where "
"they may be located, he suggested I speak to a colleague of his at the Arcane "
"University in the Imperial City, Julienne Fanis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS37_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'drassa of the Mage's Guild in Leyawiin has tasked me to find Garridan's "
"Tears. S'drassa enjoys collecting crystals of a magical nature, and is "
"willing to pay a handsome amount gold for each Tear I recover. I should "
"continue to speak to him about these unique formations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05BloodPrice_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has accepted my blood price. I have been reinstated in the Thieves "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has asked me to retrieve a ring that belongs to Ahdarji. She is a "
"Khajiit living in Leyawiin. I need to go to Leyawiin and see if I can find "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSecurity_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has given me a message for J'baana. I should deliver it to him at "
"once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07BloodPrice_STAGE71_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has kicked me out of the Thieves Guild because I killed someone "
"while trying to get the letter forged and replaced. I'll have to pay the "
"blood price of 1000 gold per murder to be let back in. I can pay S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06BloodPrice_STAGE61_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has kicked me out of the Thieves Guild for killing someone while "
"recovering Ahdarji's ring. The only way I can get back into the guild is to "
"pay a blood price of 1000 gold coins for each person I killed. I can pay  "
"S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05BloodPrice_STAGE51_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has kicked me out of the guild until I pay the blood price for my "
"murders. I have to pay 1000 gold for each person I killed while helping "
"Methredhel break the siege of the Waterfront. I can pay S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07BloodPrice_STAGE75_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva has readmitted me to the Thieves Guild. Of course I had to pay the "
"blood price first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid "S'krivva has rewarded me for recovering Lost Histories of Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva of the Thieves Guild has asked me to find out what happened to the "
"thief named Theranis. He was sent to steal a book entitled Lost Histories of "
"Tamriel from the wizard in Castle Skingrad. My job is to recover the book. "
"S'krivva doesn't care if Theranis delivers it to her or I do.  I'm getting "
"400 gold coins either way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva tells me that Hieronymus Lex, Captain of the Imperial Watch, has "
"pulled guards from all over the Imperial City to lockdown the Waterfront. He "
"has vowed to remain there until someone rats out the Gray Fox. If I want to "
"help I have to find Methredhel. She is hiding somewhere in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04BloodPrice_STAGE41_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva tells me that I must pay a blood price of 1000 gold coins for each "
"person I killed while recovering Ahdarji's ring. Until I do, I am no longer a "
"Thieves Guild member."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE69_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva tells me that I must pay a blood price of 1000 gold coins for each "
"person I killed while recovering Ahdarji's ring. Until I do, I am no longer a "
"Thieves Guild member."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva tells me that the Gray Fox is tired of Hieronymus Lex causing "
"problems. He wants Lex removed once and for all. Countess Umbranox of Anvil "
"is in need of a Captain of the Guard. She sent away for a list of "
"recommendations from the Imperial Watch guard. I must create a forgery that "
"recommends Lex and deliver it to her personally. The Gray Fox has a special "
"interest in Countess Umbranox and has choosen Lex to be her protector. Very "
"curious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG04Mistake_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva thanked me for my devotion to duty within the Thieves Guild. I guess "
"that mean Ahdarji told her I returned the ring. I've been promoted within the "
"guild as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva thanked me for my help in this delicate matter. Hieronymus Lex will "
"no longer be a threat to the Thieves Guild or the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva told me that she has no more commission jobs for me. However, the "
"Gray Fox may be contacting me soon. Until then I sell more stolen property to "
"the guild fences. I'll need at least 600 gold worth of stolen goods to get "
"his attention.. I should see what kinds of prices I can get from the new "
"fence, Orrin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva told me that she won't have another commission job for me until I "
"sell more stolen property to Ongar or Dar Jee. I'll need about 200 gold worth "
"of stolen goods before she will trust me sufficiently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva told me that she won't have another commission job for me until I "
"sell more stolen property to the guild fences, like Luciana Galena. I'll need "
"about 500 gold worth of stolen goods before she will trust me sufficiently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva told me that she won't have any commission jobs for me until I sell "
"more stolen property to Ongar or Dar Jee. I'll need about 300 gold worth of "
"stolen goods before she will trust me sufficiently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva told me that she won't have any commission jobs for me until I sell "
"more stolen property to a fence. I'll need about 400 gold worth of stolen "
"goods before she will trust me sufficiently. I should check out the new "
"fence, Luciana Galena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"S'krivva was very pleased. The Arcane University has forced Hieronymus Lex to "
"break his siege of the Waterfront. She paid me the 300 gold coins she "
"promised. I have been promoted to Cat Burglar within the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE18_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sabine Laul at the Fighters Guild in Chorrol told me that Weatherleah should "
"be due south of Chorrol and she's kindly marked it on my map. I should head "
"out there now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sanguine was pleased with my efforts. He has given me the Sanguine Rose as a "
"reward. I may retrieve my belongings in the nearby chest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE8_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Savlian Matius asked me to help close the Oblivion Gate outside the ruins of "
"Kvatch. He sent some of his men into it, but they never came back. I should "
"let him know when I'm ready to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Savlian Matius has asked me to help with the next phase of the battle for "
"Kvatch. I should speak to him when I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Savlian Matius has been killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS49_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Savlian Matius has died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS48_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Savlian Matius of the Kvatch Town Guard has asked me to aid him as he and his "
"men attempt to re-take the city of Kvatch. They're pushing in now; I'll need "
"to follow closely and make sure Savlian survives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE33_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Savlian Matius thanked me again for my help in retaking Kvatch, and promised "
"to send whatever troops he could spare to help defend Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ03_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Savlian Matius told me that he believes Martin is with a group that "
"barricaded themselves within the Chapel of Akatosh inside the city. I need to "
"follow his instructions in order to break the siege of Kvatch and rescue the "
"survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MSShadowscale_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Scar-Tail has been killed. I must now return to the Dark Brotherhood "
"Sanctuary in Cheydinhaal and present his heart to Teinaava."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Arena_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid "Security trainer and his box of locks are active!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE100_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Seed-Neeus was overjoyed to see her daughter again.  They both thanked me "
"profusely and swore their eternal gratitude, and Seed-Neeus gave me free "
"Mercantile training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE94_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Select the compass at the bottom of the journal to bring up the quest and map "
"tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE36_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Select the spell icon at the bottom of the journal to bring up the magic tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE78_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Selene is now safely locked inside a room on the inn deck. I should return to "
"Ormil and let him know, so we can finally get this ship home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16B_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Selling the Honorblade of Chorrol to Fathis has left me with no evidence of "
"Albert Jemane's past, preventing me from convincing Guilbert that his father "
"was once a notorious member of the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Seridur has revealed to me that he's a member of a group of individuals "
"dedicated to the destruction of vampires called The Order of the Virtuous "
"Blood. Their goal is to keep the Imperial City safe from these creatures of "
"the night. I should continue speaking to him and find out how I can assist "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE160_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Seridur was pleased with me, and rewarded me with 250 gold. He said that I've "
"done a great service for the Imperial City and I should be proud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE0_LOG5"
msgid "Set everyone in their places for player to enter room B"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE0_LOG3"
msgid "Set everyone in their places waiting at Marker F"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE0_LOG6"
msgid "Set everyone to their places for Ambush A"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE0_LOG4"
msgid "Set everyone to their places in Room B, ready to head for Marker F"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark13Justice_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Shaleez is dead. I must pick up my reward and next contract at the dead drop "
"located in the coffin just outside the ruins of Fort Redman. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE200_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has awarded me the Ring of Lordship. I am now officially Duchess "
"of Dementia of the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE200_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has awarded me the Ring of Lordship. I am now officially Duchess "
"of Mania of the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE200_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has awarded me the Ring of Lordship. I am now officially Duke of "
"Dementia of the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE200_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has awarded me the Ring of Lordship. I am now officially Duke of "
"Mania of the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE65_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has congratulated me for simulating the first two signs of the "
"K'Sharra Prophecy. I am to go to the center of town to await the final sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04Shell_STAGE3_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has given me the ability to summon Haskill. He's very insistent "
"and won't tell me what he wants of me until I do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE100_LOG1"
msgid "Sheogorath has rewarded me for my efforts by giving me Wabbajack. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has tasked me with rebuilding the Gatekeeper. He has given me "
"instructions to visit the powerful sorceress named Relmyna Verenim in Xaselm "
"to petition her assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE11_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath has vanished before we could complete the plan to stop the forces "
"of Order. Perhaps Haskill will know what steps we should take."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "Sheogorath is pleased with my progress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE8_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath wants me to relight the Great Torch of New Sheoth. I need to go to "
"the ruins of Cylarne, kindle the Flame of Agnon there, and return with its "
"holy fire. Sheogorath warned me that the Golden Saints and Dark Seducers who "
"guard the shrine often fight each other, so I should proceed cautiously."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sheogorath's followers have told me to speak with Ferul Ravel if I wish to "
"have the Daedra summoned. [You must be level 2 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Shutting down the Obelisks appears to weaken Jyggalag of some of his powers. "
"I should deactivate as many Obelisks as I can to weaken Jyggalag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE41_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Sickly Bernice has rewarded me for recovering the cure to her ailment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE41_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sickly Bernice has told me the cure for her mysterious malady is a sample of "
"water from a pool at the bottom of Knotty Bramble that she calls aquanostrum. "
"She's marked the location on my map. I should make my way there and recover "
"this miraculous antidote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Signy Home-Wrecker has met me at The Flowing Bowl, accompanied by Faustina "
"Cartia. She enticed me to meet them at their farmhouse around 11 this "
"evening, \"for a night of fun I won't soon forget\". I have decided to take "
"them up on their temping offer, as this will point me in the direction of "
"their hideout. The farmhouse seems to be just outside of Anvil in the "
"settlement named Gweden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE25_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Since I already killed the shaman from the Cracked Wood Cave goblin tribe, I "
"should let Barthel Gernand know that it is safe to begin building the "
"settlement at Cropsford."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS46_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Since I already took the Tribal Totem from the goblins at Timberscar Cave, I "
"should let Barthel Gernand know that it is safe to begin building the "
"settlement at Cropsford."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE200_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Since all the Demented duplicates in Split are dead, Horkvir Bear-Arm gave me "
"my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Since all the Manic duplicates in Split are dead, Horkvir Bear-Arm gave me my "
"reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlchemy_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sinderion has asked that I bring him a bottle of Tamika's Vintage 399 wine, "
"and a bottle of Surilie Brother's Vintage 399 wine. I should acquire them so "
"that he will agree to train me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sinderion has died, and the future of Nirnroot research has disappeared with "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sinderion informed me that he's exhausted his research regarding the Elixir "
"of Exploration. However, he mentioned that he'd be glad to pay for any more "
"samples of Nirnroot that I can find so he can keep himself supplied with the "
"ingredient. Hopefully, I will come across more in my travels to bring to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlchemy_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sinderion is dead. It will be impossible for me to receive further Alchemy "
"training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sinderion, an alchemist in Skingrad is looking for a rare root known as "
"Nirnroot. According to his research, this rare root can be a powerful "
"ingredient in the creation of a special potion known as the Elixir of "
"Exploration. Because of this, Sinderion has tasked me to find 10 samples of "
"this mystical plant. He indicated a part of the Great Forest to the northeast "
"called Shadeleaf Copse as a good starting point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Sir Amiel was a member of the Knights of the Nine, a holy order devoted to "
"recovering the Relics of the Crusader. Through reading his journal, I've "
"learned the location of their former headquarters, the Priory of the Nine in "
"the West Weald. I should proceed to the old Priory and see if it still holds "
"the Cuirass of the Crusader, as Sir Amiel's journal suggests, but first I "
"should make sure I have his ring, which I may need to access the Priory "
"vaults."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE10_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Sir Amiel was a member of the Knights of the Nine, a holy order devoted to "
"recovering the Relics of the Crusader. Through reading his journal, I've "
"learned the location of their former headquarters, the Priory of the Nine in "
"the West Weald. I should proceed to the old Priory and see if it still holds "
"the Cuirass of the Crusader, as Sir Amiel's journal suggests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE10_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Sir Amiel was a member of the Knights of the Nine, a holy order devoted to "
"recovering the Relics of the Crusader. Through reading his journal, I've "
"learned the location of their former headquarters, the Priory of the Nine in "
"the West Weald. Once I've recovered the Helm from the Shrine of the Crusader, "
"I should proceed to the old Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sir Casimir has told me the Gauntlets of the Crusader are located in the "
"Chapel of Stendarr in Chorrol. I must travel there and figure out how to "
"retrieve them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND04_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sir Ralvas has told me where to find the Mace of Zenithar. In order to "
"recover the mace, I must travel to the Chapel of Zenithar in Leyawiin. In the "
"undercroft of the chapel, I must kneel at the shrine there. According to Sir "
"Ralvas, I will be tested and \"my faith will be my guide\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG10Vahtacen_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Skaleel may have some reference material for deciphering the Ayleid symbols "
"in Vahtacen. I should ask her for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCHorseArmor_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Snak gra-Bura armored my horse for free. From now on, she will outfit any "
"legally owned horse that I bring to her with Steel or Elven armor for 500 "
"gold. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE55_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Somehow one of the ghostly invaders accepted the doll from me. I don't know "
"why, but there must be some purpose to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMephala_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Something I did in Bleaker's Way apparently spoiled Mephala's schemes, so she "
"refused my offering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Something has happened to the Wellspring of the Aureal in Brellach. I need to "
"proceed on my own to restore it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Something has happened to the Wellspring of the Mazken in Pinnacle Rock. I "
"need to proceed on my own to restore it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with the Font of Madness. It won't accept the Staff of "
"Sheogorath and imbue it with power as Dyus described. Perhaps Haskill will "
"know what's wrong with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Speaking to Thoronir hasn't revealed any information. Since he's obviously "
"hiding something, I should keep an eye on him, and watch what he does after "
"his shop closes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Staada thanked me for helping the Golden Saints secure their stronghold, and "
"has given me the ability to summon her kind. She has also given me a set of "
"matching armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Arena_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid "Stealth trainer for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Steffan told me that the suspicious strangers have been seen on the road to "
"Cloud Ruler Temple, usually near the runestone at dusk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sulinus Vassinus has offered to complete my task at Bleak Flats Cave for me, "
"at a price. If I'm going to take him up on the offer, I need to bring him 300 "
"gold. Otherwise, I should speak with the other guild mages to find where "
"Erthor is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG01Destruct_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Sulinus Vassinus has returned, and says that Erthor is safe. I need to go to "
"Adrienne Berene, and tell her I saved him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE52_LOG1"
msgid "TEMP: 52 Glenroy reaches marker F"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Charactergen_STAGE54_LOG1"
msgid "TEMP: 54 Player near Marker F"
msgstr ""

