msgid "TEMP: Valen Dreth done talking. Trigger start of Emperor conversation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSpeechcraft_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Tandilwe has agreed to train me in Speechcraft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSpeechcraft_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tandilwe has refused to ever train me, since one of the beggars has been "
"killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingSpeechcraft_STAGE255_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tandilwe is dead. I have lost my chance to be taught more about Speechcraft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Tar-Meena gave me the second of Mankar Camoran's books about the Mysterium "
"Xarxes, but said that she has never seen Mankar Camoran's third and fourth "
"books on the Mysterium Xarxes. She suggested that I speak to Phintias, the "
"prioprietor of the First Edition bookstore in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE93_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tar-Meena has discovered the message in the books: \"Green Emperor Way Where "
"Tower Touches Midday Sun\". I should go to Green Emperor Way by the Imperial "
"Tower and see what can be found."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE91_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tar-Meena says that Mankar Camoran hid a message within his writings, so only "
"the \"enlightened ones\" could join him and the Mythic Dawn. I should study "
"these books some more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE92_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tar-Meena thinks using the first word of each paragraph in the books may "
"reveal a message. I need to keep looking and see where this leads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tar-Meena told me that Mankar Camoran is the leader of the Mythic Dawn. Tar-"
"Meena believes that the location of their secret shrine is hidden within "
"Mankar Camoran's books about the Mysterium Xarxes. If I want to locate the "
"Mythic Dawn, I must find and decipher the clues in all four volumes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG11NecroMoon_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tar-Meena told me to find a book entitled \"Necromancer's Moon\". I need to "
"look for it in the Mystic Archives of the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Teeekeeus has asked that I re-acquire the book \"Fingers of the Mountain\" "
"from Earana. I need to get the book and return it to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05A_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Teeekeeus has asked that I re-acquire the book \"Fingers of the Mountain\" "
"from Earana. I need to get the book and return it to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG05Fingers_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Teekeeus has asked that I find  the Fingers of the Mountain text, and bring "
"it to him immediately. I need to search Cloud Top for the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Thadon has asked that I retrieve for him the Chalice of Reversal. I need to "
"find someone in his court, or in Syl's, who knows where it might be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE80_LOG0_0"
msgid ""
"That goblin up ahead has not seen you yet. You can <RT_BlueMed>sneak</> by "
"pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Crouch\"/>. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"That goblin up ahead has not seen you yet. You can <RT_BlueMed>sneak</> by "
"pressing <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Crouch\"/>. \n"
"\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Walking</> while sneaking makes much less noise, increasing your "
"chance of remaining undetected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The <RT_BlueMed>red arrow on your compass</> shows the direction of "
"<RT_BlueMed>Weynon Priory</>.\n"
"You can walk there by following your compass, or open your world map <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Default_OpenMapMenu\"/> to travel there directly.\n"
"Or you can set off in any direction and begin exploring the world on your "
"own.\n"
"<RT_BlueMed>Good luck!</>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Argonian in the cell with Theranis turned out to be Amusei! Before he "
"died, Theranis told Amusei where he hid a special treasure, which I assume is "
"the book. If I can get him out of here, Amusei will tell me where the book is "
"hidden. Of course being seen helping a known prisoner to escape is a crime. "
"I'll have to avoid the guards in the castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG17Ambush_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "The Black Soul Gem has been delivered to Hannibal Traven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Blackwood Company has been hired by the Water's Edge Settlement to take "
"care of some goblins that have been raiding their town. First, though, we are "
"all to drink a potion made from the sap of a Hist Tree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS31_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Bloated Float has arrived back at the Imperial City. I should speak with "
"Ormil before I disembark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE9_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Captain of my Palace Guard has informed me that an Obelisk has activated "
"in the Palace courtyard! It seems that Order is launching its final attempt "
"to take control of the Shivering Isles. I need to defeat Jyggylag and his "
"minions once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE13_STAGE6_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Captain of my Palace Guard needs my assistance at once. The messenger "
"didn't know any details, but it sounds urgent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Count praised me for killing Black Brugo. He has made me Knight-Errant of "
"the Order of the White Stallion, and has given me a guard's shield bearing "
"the heraldry of Count Leyawiin, and the key to White Stallion Lodge on the "
"western shores of the Niben River. The Count also asked me to find and kill "
"any remaining members of the Black Bow Bandits, and promised a bounty of 100 "
"gold for every Black Bow I deliver to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Count praised us for killing Black Brugo. He has made Mazoga and me "
"Knights-Errant of the Order of the White Stallion, and has given us guard's "
"shields bearing the heraldry of Count Leyawiin, and keys to White Stallion "
"Lodge on the western shores of the Niben River. The Count also asked us to "
"find and kill any remaining members of the Black Bow Bandits, and promised a "
"bounty of 100 gold for every Black Bow we deliver to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ13_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Countess has ordered her men to let the Mythic Dawn open the three Gates, "
"and to deploy for battle outside the city gates. Martin has gone to lead the "
"defense of the city. I should proceed to the battleground at once, and "
"protect Martin at all costs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ11_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Countess of Bruma urged me to obtain any additional help that I can find. "
"She fears that her troops will be overwhelmed before I can close the Great "
"Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS40_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Countess of Skingrad is dead. I need to speak with Hai-Liurz at Castle "
"Skingrad after the Count has had time to grieve for his wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ14_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Daedric Siege Engine has almost exited the Gate! I must reach the Sigil "
"Stone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ14_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "The Daedric Siege Engine has exited the Great Gate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Dark Seducer commander Grakendo Udico has a plan to retake Passwall. I "
"need to slip through the gate into the ruins of Xeddefen while her Dark "
"Seducers distract the knights. They will continue to hold the line at "
"Passwall. I have to use this opportunity to slip into Xeddefen and find "
"Order's source of power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE120_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Dark Seducer commander is dead. I should finish off the remaining Dark "
"Seducers in Cylarne to complete the Golden Saints' victory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE37_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Dark Seducers are defending the main passage to the Altar of Despair in "
"strength. The Underdeep, by contrast, appears to be only lightly defended. "
"This information might convince Kaneh to attack through the Underdeep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE38_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Dark Seducers are defending the main passage to the Altar of Despair in "
"strength. The route through the Underdeep appears to be only lightly "
"defended. This information might convince Kaneh to attack through the "
"Underdeep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE140_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Dark Seducers in Cylarne have been utterly destroyed. I should speak to "
"Kaneh about lighting the Flame of Agnon now that her forces control both of "
"the altars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE12_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Demented Horkvir Bear-Arm has suggested I kill all the Manics in town. "
"He'll reward me if I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC06Courier_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Desolate Mine is now clear of the goblins infesting it. I should return "
"to Burz gro-Khash for payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE33_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Dremora Kathutet claims that something called the Bands of the Chosen are "
"the key to the Forbidden Grotto, the only way out of the Savage Garden. I "
"should get these Bands from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS13_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Dumner has identified himself as Farwil Indarys, son of the Count of "
"Cheydinhal and a \"Knight of the Thorn\". He told me that all his companions "
"have been killed except himself and Bremman Senyan. They died trying to get "
"inside the citadel to obtain the Sigil Stone. He's now ordered me to go into "
"the Citadel and recover the Sigil Stone, and says he'll not leave this place "
"until that task is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE12_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Font of Madness has been poisoned by Order! If it becomes fully Ordered, "
"the realm is lost and Jyggalag has won. Haskill suspects that Order has "
"somehow gained access to the Pools of Madness that nourish the Font. I need "
"to enter the Fountainhead beneath the Tree and find the source of the poison "
"before it is too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE09_STAGE170_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gatekeeper has been rebuilt. I should return to Sheogorath with news of "
"my success. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE150_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gatekeeper is dead. I should retrieve the keys to the Gates of Madness "
"from the Gatekeeper's corpse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE7_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gates of Madness are locked. Haskill mentioned that the Gates were "
"guarded by the Gatekeeper. He must have the keys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE50_LOG3"
msgid ""
"The Goblins have been defeated; I should return to Chorrol and tell Valus "
"Odiil his sons are safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE50_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Goblins have been defeated; I should return to Valus Odiil and inform him "
"that Antus did not survive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Goblins have been defeated; I should return to Valus Odiil and inform him "
"that Rallus did not survive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Goblins have been defeated; I should return to Valus Odiil and inform him "
"that his sons did not survive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE35_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Golden Saint commander Aurig Desha has a plan to retake Passwall. I need "
"to slip through the gate into the ruins of Xeddefen while her Golden Saints "
"distract the knights. They will continue to hold the line at Passwall. I have "
"to use this opportunity to slip into Xeddefen and find Order's source of "
"power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Golden Saint commander is dead. I should finish off the remaining Golden "
"Saints in Cylarne to complete the Dark Seducers' victory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE130_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Golden Saints in Cylarne have been utterly destroyed. I should speak to "
"Ulfri about lighting the Flame of Agnon now that her forces control both of "
"the altars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE39_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox accepted the key shaped arrow head. Apparently it is all that "
"remains of the Arrow of Extrication. He is going to try and get it reforged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox accepted the key shaped arrow head. Apparently it is all that "
"remains of the Arrow of Extrication. He is going to try and get it reforged. "
"He thanked me for my efforts and promoted me to Master Thief in the Thieves "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid "The Gray Fox gave me his thanks for getting the boots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has asked me to find out where Springheel Jak is buried. This "
"famous thief died 300 years ago. He is rumored to have owned a pair of "
"magical boots. The story also says he was buried in those boots. A relative "
"of his, Jakben, Earl of Imbel, lives somewhere in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has given me the task of recovering Savilla's Stone from a "
"monastery known as the Temple of the Ancestor Moths. It is in the mountains, "
"somewhere north of Cheydinhal, in the farthest corner of Cyrodiil. Killing "
"the human guardians of the stone will not put a bloodprice on my head, but "
"killing innocent people will. The Gray Fox has promised me 500 gold coins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08BloodPrice_STAGE81_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has kicked me out of the Thieves Guild for killing someone while "
"trying to recover Savilla's Stone. I'll have to pay 1000 gold per person "
"killed as a blood price. I can pay Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09BloodPrice_STAGE91_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has recinded my Thieves Guild membership because I committed "
"murder while obtaining the Arrow of Extrication. I can get back in if I pay "
"the blood price. I can pay Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10BloodPrice_STAGE101_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has revoked my Thieves Guild membership. If I want back in, I'll "
"have to pay 1000 gold for each murder to satisfy the blood price. I can pay "
"Armand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has rewarded me for my efforts. He was fairly mysterious about "
"why he needed the stone. He asked me to be available for when he next calls "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox has yet to pay me for stealing the Elder Scroll from the "
"Imperial Palace. To get my reward, I have to present a ring to Millona "
"Umbranox, the Countess of Anvil, and gauge her reaction to it. I don't "
"understand what this has to do with the Elder Scroll, but for now I'll trust "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox intends to steal one of the Elder Scrolls from the Imperial "
"Palace. The audacity of such a theft is astounding! The Gray Fox has laid out "
"the plan for me. It's not simple, but he has given me a written copy for my "
"reference. He has even set aside the guild rule of blood price for this "
"heist. Now I just have to execute the plan. The first step is to infiltrate "
"the Imperial Palace and activate the Glass of Time, whatever that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox intends to steal one of the Elder Scrolls from the Imperial "
"Palace. The audacity of such a theft is astounding! When I am ready, I should "
"come back to him at Othrelos house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox may be contacting me soon. Until then I sell more stolen "
"property to the guild fences, like Orrin. I'll need at least 700 gold worth "
"of stolen goods to get his attention.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox may be contacting me soon. Until then I sell more stolen "
"property to the guild fences, such as Fathis Ules. I'll need at least 1000 "
"gold worth of stolen goods to get his attention.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TGStolenGoods_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox may be contacting me soon. Until then I sell more stolen "
"property to the guild fences. I'll need at least 800 gold worth of stolen "
"goods to get his attention.. Now I can use the best fence the guild has, "
"Fathis Ules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox thanked me for getting him the boots. He paid me 500 gold coins "
"for my efforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE49_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox thanked me for getting him the boots. However, I will not get my "
"fee until I pay the blood price for my murders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE39_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox took Savilla's Stone, but is withholding my payment until I pay "
"the blood price and am reinstated into the guild"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09Arrow_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox will pay me 500 gold coins to steal the Arrow of Extrication. It "
"was recently recovered by Bravil's court wizard, Fathis Aren. There will be "
"no bloodprice for killing Fathis, so long as he doesn't die in the castle. I "
"should start my search in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE140_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Gray Fox, who is no longer the Gray Fox, but is now Corvus Umbranox, has "
"given me the Gray Cowl of Nocturnal. I am now the new Gray Fox and the new "
"guildmaster of the Thieves Guild. Due to the magic of the cowl, the Thieves "
"of the guild will not notice the change. However, since the curse is lifted, "
"I can remove the cowl and be recognized as myself again. Interestingly, the "
"cowl's magic makes it so that anyone seeing me remove the cowl does not "
"associate me with the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ14_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Great Gate has opened! I must enter it at once and get its Great Sigil "
"Stone, before the Bruma defenders are overwhelmed. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Imperial City is under attack! Oblivion Gates have opened all over the "
"city and daedra are pouring out! I must escort Martin safely to the Temple of "
"the One where he can light the Dragonfires, close the Oblivion Gates, and "
"save the city!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQDragonArmor_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Dragon armor ordered for me by Chancellor Ocato should be ready. "
"I can pick it up from the armory in the Imperial Legion Compound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Jemane brothers have been reunited. After they speak, I should speak to "
"Guilbert, who seems the more levelheaded of the two brothers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE100_LOG2"
msgid "The Jemane brothers have returned safely to Weatherleah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE13_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Manic Horkvir Bear-Arm has suggested I kill all the Demented in town. "
"He'll reward me if I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG08Blind_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Monks of the Ancestor Moths read the Elder Scrolls. Apparenlty this makes "
"them blind. When they retire, they are sent to live in an undergound temple. "
"They are all masters of fighting in the dark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Moth Priests are onto me! I have to get out of here. The way back is "
"closed. My only hope is to go forward and hope I can find another exit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE30_LOG3"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Jearl is dead. I should continue to search for "
"other spies and locate their base in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE30_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Jearl is dead. I should continue to search for "
"other spies and locate their base in Bruma. Perhaps I should speak to Captain "
"Burd, as Jauffre suggested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Jearl is dead. I should continue to search for "
"the other Mythic Dawn spy in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Jearl is dead. I should report to Jauffre that "
"both the Mythic Dawn spies are dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE31_LOG3"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Saveri Faram is dead. I should continue to search "
"for other spies and locate their base in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE31_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Saveri Faram is dead. I should continue to search "
"for other spies and locate their base in Bruma. Perhaps I should speak to "
"Captain Burd, as Jauffre suggested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE31_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Saveri Faram is dead. I should continue to search "
"for the other Mythic Dawn spy in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn agent named Saveri Faram is dead. I should report to Jauffre "
"that both the Mythic Dawn spies are dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother has named me Listener of the Black Hand! It would appear my "
"days of killing for the Dark Brotherhood have come to an end. When I'm ready, "
"I should speak to the Night Mother again and she will use her power to "
"teleport me to the Cheydinhal Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCOrrery_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Orrery at the Arcane University should be functional once more. I can "
"visit it as often as I like, and also receive powers based on the phases of "
"the moons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND09_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Prophet has arrived at the Priory to see me. My knights have gathered in "
"the Chapel to listen to him preach. I should speak to him immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark10Sanctuary_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Purification is now complete. Every Dark Brotherhood member based out of "
"the Cheydinhal Sanctuary has been killed. I must now report back to Lucien "
"Lachance at Fort Farragut. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "The Resonator of Judgment has been attuned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE81_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Sponsor has realized that Baurus did not come alone. I must get the "
"fourth book from him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE81_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Sponsor has realized that I did not come alone. I must get the fourth "
"book from him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE82_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Sponsor wants Baurus dead! I need to get the fourth book of Mankar "
"Camoran's \"Commentaries\" from him no matter what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE82_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Sponsor wants me dead! I need to get the fourth book of Mankar Camoran's "
"\"Commentaries\" from him no matter what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG07Lex_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Stranger has forged a new letter for me. Now I have to go to the Imperial "
"Legion compound in the Imperial City. I have to seal the letter using the "
"official seal of the Legion Commander."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE80_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Sword of the Crusader has been reconsecrated. I now possess all eight of "
"the Crusader's Relics. Before I return to the Priory, I must prevent Umaril's "
"aurorans from desecrating the Chapel of Arkay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE80_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The Sword of the Crusader has been reconsecrated. I now possess all eight of "
"the Crusader's Relics. I should return to the Priory to consult with my "
"knights about how to attack and destroy Umaril."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE37_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Underdeep is only lightly defended by the Dark Seducers. It appears that "
"they do not believe the Golden Saints will attack this way. I should survey "
"the Dark Seducer deployments along the main passage leading to the Altar of "
"Despair, and then report my findings to Kaneh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Vampire Hunters have left Skingrad. All that's left now is to remove the "
"vampires from Bloodcrust Cavern."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Vampire Hunters have left Skingrad. I should return to Castle Skingrad "
"and speak with Hal-Liurz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "The Vampire Hunters in Skingrad have been killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Vampires in Bloodcrust Cavern have been disposed of. I should return to "
"Count Hassildor and let him know my task is complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG13Information_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Vampires in Bloodcrust Cavern have been disposed of. Now I must deal with "
"the Vampire Hunters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Waterfront is crawling with Imperial Watch. They are all looking for "
"Armand Christophe. I'm sure he won't show at midnight. Dareloth's Garden is "
"too hot. I'll need to find out where he is hiding. Maybe one of the other "
"Thieves Guild members knows. I'll have to start asking around for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE54_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring of the Aureal has been restored. I need to help Staada defeat "
"the remnants of the forces of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE55_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring of the Aureal has been restored. I need to speak with Staada."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE49_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring of the Mazken has been restored. I need to help Dylora defeat "
"the remnants of the forces of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE50_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring of the Mazken has been restored. I need to speak with Dylora."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE36_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The Xivilai Anaxes is dead, although Kathutet told me not to kill it. I "
"should find out if he will still give me the Bands of the Chosen, as he "
"promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS39_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The alchemist I've spoken to has referred me to Sinderion in Skingrad. "
"Apparently he specializes in the more botanical aspects of alchemy. I should "
"bring the Nirnroot to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG09BloodPrice_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The bloodprice has been accepted. I am back in the Thieves Guild. My "
"promotion ot MasterThief is now final as well. I finally got paid for the "
"theft of the Arrow of Extrication."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ08_STAGE9_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The book \"Modern Heretics\" describes the location of the Shrine of Azura. "
"Perhaps if I visit this Shrine I can learn how to obtain a Daedric Artifact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE37_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The boots were not in the tomb of Springheel Jak. I did find a diary though. "
"Maybe it can provide a clue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark07Medicine_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The bottle of poisoned medicine has been placed in the cabinet, and the real "
"medicine removed. The next time Roderick is given treatment, he will die. I "
"must now return to the Sanctuary and speak with Ocheeva to receive my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE56_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The bucket near the well will make a good target practice. To draw and aim "
"your bow, hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> and release it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG03Elven_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The bust is in Myvryna's cupboard. Now to tell that windbag Lex where to find "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE05_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The conspiracy has been stamped out. Lady Syl has executed Muurine, and "
"thanked me for my help. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04Execution_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The contract has been fulfilled, but I was unable to prevent the death of any "
"guards. I must return to the Sanctuary and speak with Vicente Valtieri to "
"receive my reward. Unfortunately, the bonus is forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE40_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The counterattack on Xeddefen has begun. Aureg Desha and her Golden Saints "
"will distract the knights. While the Golden Saints fight, I need to slip past "
"the gates of Xeddefen and locate the source of the Spire's power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The counterattack on Xeddefen has begun. Kiskella Udico and her Dark Seducers "
"will distract the knights. While the Dark Seducers fight, I need to slip past "
"the gates of Xeddefen and locate the source of the Spire's power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ15_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The dremora Kathutet gave me the Bands of the Chosen, which he says will let "
"me escape the Savage Garden into the Forbidden Grotto. I should find the door "
"to the Forbidden Grotto and see if he was telling the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The effects of Felldew have worn off, and withdrawal is setting in. I need to "
"either reach the Chalice of Reversal quickly, or find more Felldew as I make "
"my way through the Burrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ05_STAGE32_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The enemy agent who attacked Baurus is dead. I should find out what Baurus "
"has learned about our enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ04_STAGE25_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The enemy has stolen the Amulet of Kings from its hiding place in Weynon "
"Priory. I should let Jauffre know at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASanguine_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The follower of Sanguine have told me that, in order to summon the Daedra, I "
"will need to leave an offering of Cyrodilic Brandy at the statue. [You must "
"be level 8 to begin this quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The followers of Namira have decided that I am repulsive enough to summon the "
"Daedra. I may now approach the statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The force of Knights attacking Passwall have been eliminated. I should speak "
"to Aurig Desha about the situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The force of Knights attacking Passwall have been eliminated. I should speak "
"to Grakendo Udico about the situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE08_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid "The forces of Order are advancing on Passwall. We must defeat them all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The formidable Gatekeeper has destroyed a party of adventurers. I should talk "
"to the residents of Passwall before trying to deal with this creature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The ghost of Count Cirion has told me a tale of tragedy. The people of "
"Vitharn were overrun by invaders centuries ago. Four defenders in the bailey "
"failed in their duties. Now cursed to relive the last moments of the invasion "
"over and over. Count Cirion has begged me to put the shades of his people to "
"rest. I have no idea how to do this. Maybe the ghosts themselves can tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ghost of Desideratus Annius told me he must get back home to protect his "
"betrothed. Tragically, by leaving his post, they both perished. There must be "
"something I can do to get him to stand fast. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ghost of Grantham Blakeley appeared after I unlocked the shackles. He "
"thanked me for freeing him and said to take the map concealed somewhere in "
"this room. I think the map leads to the old man's treasure. I should take the "
"map and leave this place. My work here is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ghost stopped its somber walk at a rocky outcropping jutting into Niben "
"Bay. He identified himself as Grantham Blakeley, and simply said \"Look for "
"me in the mouth of the panther. Please, release me.\" Then it turned back out "
"to the Bay and looked out over the water. I think it was looking that way "
"specifically. I should try and ask Gilgondorin about the \"mouth of the "
"panther\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The ghost stopped its somber walk at a rocky outcropping jutting into Niben "
"Bay. He identified himself as Grantham Blakeley, and simply said \"Look for "
"me in the mouth of the panther. Please, release me.\" Then it turned back out "
"to the Bay and looked out over the water. I think it was looking that way "
"specifically. Perhaps someone in Bravil would know more about this spirit and "
"the \"mouth of the panther\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS06_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ghostly figure of the Forlorn Watchman has appeared on the shore of Niben "
"Bay. Perhaps I should watch him for a bit and see what he does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "The ghosts of Vitharn have been laid to rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND02_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ghosts of the former Knights of the Nine have appeared and blocked my "
"path to the Cuirass of the Crusader. They will not let me pass until I best "
"each of them in single combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ09_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ghosts of the four cursed Blades have dispelled the evil enchantment on "
"the Shrine of Tiber Septim. The way to the Armor is now open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid "The goblins invading Water's Edge have been defeated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The guards are no help. Any complaints about guard activities are to be taken "
"to the guard captain. Of course Audens Avidius is one of the guard captains, "
"so that won't work. I could try talking to one of the other Watch Captains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The incantation has revealed the hidden door to the Night Mother's crypt! I "
"must follow the other members of the Black Hand down into the crypt. Once "
"we're down there, the traitor will surely try to destroy the Night Mother. I "
"must stop the traitor at all costs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS11_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The innkeeper, Olav, told me that Gelebourne was slain in Skingrad by none "
"other than Raynil. As with Bradon, Raynil claimed Gelebourne was a vampire. I "
"think Raynil is using the vampire as a cover story to get the keys to the "
"chest where they stashed the artifact. I think it's time to speak to Carius "
"Runellius about Raynil. He must be stopped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The key I discovered on the Orc Hunter was indeed a fake and the real key was "
"on Kurdan's body. He'd never intended to let us leave whether we won his "
"demented hunt or not. The real key should allow me to unlock the gateroom "
"inside the Hunter's Run and then leave Fort Grief. I will then have to bring "
"Ursanne the sad news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE38_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The main passage leading to the Altar of Despair is strongly defended by the "
"Dark Seducers. I should scout the Underdeep to see if it might provide an "
"easier attack route."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01Knife_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The man named Rufio is dead. The next time I sleep in a location he deems "
"secure, Lucien Lachance will visit me once more, and complete my entrance "
"into the Dark Brotherhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DLCBattlehornCastle_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The marauders who were attacking Battlehorn Castle have been defeated, and "
"the grateful survivors have granted me the deed to the castle. I've learned "
"that I can purchase everything I need to restore Battlehorn Castle to its "
"former glory from Nilphas Omellian at the Merchants Inn in the Market "
"District of the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD02DandD_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The men tell me that the reason they've been spending time in the tavern is "
"sheer boredom. The Blackwood Company has been stealing all the Fighters Guild "
"work in the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark03Accidents_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The mounted head has fallen on Baenlin, killing him as expected. I must "
"return to the Sanctuary and speak with Vicente Valtieri to receive my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The necromancers that ambushed me have been defeated. I need to get wood for "
"a staff, and get back to Raminus Polus to tell him what's happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG08MagesStaff_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The necromancers that ambushed me have been defeated. I need to take this "
"unfinished staff, and get back to Raminus Polus to tell him what's happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE92_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The nine divines grant you insight, making you realize the importance of "
"Uriel Septim's request. Equip and cast the Clairvoyance spell to "
"<RT_BlueMed>reveal the path to your next objective</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS16A_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ogres have been defeated. I should make my way back to Chorrol and bring "
"this information to Guilbert."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The only prisoner in Castle Skingrad's jail is Larthjar. He told me that the "
"Pale Lady, whoever she is, took Theranis days ago. I don't like the sound of "
"that. There was an Argonian prisoner in the same cell as Theranis. Apparently "
"he was also taken by the Pale Lady just a couple of hours ago. The Argonian "
"put up quite a struggle and was bleeding. It's the only clue I've got right "
"now. I'd better follow it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE130_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The potential <RT_BlueMed>gain</> or <RT_BlueMed>loss</> for each action is "
"<RT_BlueMed>based on your Speechcraft and how full the wedge is</>.\n"
"Try to select fuller wedges when they are aligned with actions the person "
"likes.\n"
"Try to select emptied wedges when they are aligned with actions he doesn't "
"like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND06_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The priest has told me that the only way to lift the curse from Kellen is to "
"take it on myself. I need to pray at the altar in the Chapel if I wish to "
"lift the curse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The priest, Hloval Dreth, doesn't have nearly enough magicka to support the "
"soldiers defending the gates. I need to find something that will boost his "
"magicka. He won't take my earthly items, so it will have to be something in "
"his spirit realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The remaining forces of Order have been defeated. I should speak to Staada."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE10_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The remaining forces of Order have been defeated. I should speak with Dylora."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC08Prison_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The residents of Bravil are reluctant to speak about the fugitives, for fear "
"of retribution. Perhaps I will have to persuade one of them to give me the "
"information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS12_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The ruins appear to be infested with undead Akaviri. I don't know how long "
"they've been trapped here, but I should proceed with caution. I need to "
"locate the Akaviri commander of the fort who is said to possess the Draconian "
"Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DASheogorath_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The shaman Ri'Bassa has told me of the K'Sharra Prophecy. The first sign is "
"vermin infestation. The second sign is plague, and all the livestock are "
"supposed to die. I will need to find a way first to create an infestation of "
"vermin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE130_LOG5"
msgid ""
"The sorceress has dropped a handkerchief full of her tears, which apparently "
"can hurt the Gatekeeper. I should get  that handkerchief. I can also find "
"Jayred to get the arrows made from dead Gatekeeper bones, once he is done "
"making them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE130_LOG1"
msgid ""
"The sorceress has dropped a handkerchief full of her tears, which apparently "
"can hurt the Gatekeeper. I should get that handkerchief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE130_LOG4"
msgid ""
"The sorceress has dropped a handkerchief full of her tears, which apparently "
"can hurt the Gatekeeper. I should get that handkerchief. I can also follow "
"Jayred to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE130_LOG2"
msgid ""
"The sorceress has dropped a handkerchief full of her tears, which apparently "
"can hurt the Gatekeeper. I should get that handkerchief. I can also talk to "
"Jayred about killing the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE130_LOG3"
msgid ""
"The sorceress has dropped a handkerchief full of her tears, which apparently "
"can hurt the Gatekeeper. I should get that handkerchief. I can also tell "
"Jayred I'm ready to go to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE02_STAGE130_LOG6"
msgid ""
"The sorceress has dropped a handkerchief full of her tears, which apparently "
"can hurt the Gatekeeper. I should get that handkerchief. Jayred is still "
"willing to come fight the Gatekeeper with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark18Mother_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The traitor, Mathieu Bellamont, is dead, and the crisis that has plagued the "
"Dark Brotherhood is now over. The Night Mother still needs to name a new "
"Listener. I should wait and hear what she has to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The tree has become a perversion of nature. It is surrounded by alien "
"machinery. If I am to destroy this monstrosity, I will need to find a way to "
"destroy the machinery that surrounds it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG01BestThief_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The word on the street is that Methredhel delivered Amantius Allectus diary "
"to Armand. I hope Armand has something else I can do to get into the Thieves "
"Guild. I should go see him at midnight in the Garden of Dareloth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"The wraith of Lord Vlindrel is destroyed. I need to reclaim the Sword of the "
"Crusader that he somehow twisted to his evil purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06Atonement_STAGE45_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Theranis is dead. I found his body in the secret chamber with Amusei and the "
"Pale Lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE11_LOG0"
msgid ""
"There are ghostly warriors fighting in this place. Their battle cries lead me "
"to believe this place is named Vitharn. Something strange is going on here. I "
"can see the fortress keep, but there is no obvious entrance. I'll have to "
"search around for a hidden way in. Even then, I'm not sure what I'll find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"There is a descendent of Springheel Jak living in the Imperial City named "
"Jakben, Earl of Imbel. The Gray Fox has suggested I look there for clues as "
"to where he is buried. Once I know where to look, I am to get the boots and "
"bring them back to the Gray Fox in Ganredhel's house in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"There must be some secret way to open this door. I'll bet this is where I "
"have to use the Arrow of Extrication. Most likely I have to be standing in a "
"special place for the keyhole to open up. It will be somewhere with a clear "
"view of this pillar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG02Alter_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"There's no evidence of a recommendation in Falcar's room, but I've found "
"Black Soul Gems. I should take them to Deetsan immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE90_LOG1"
msgid "These ghostly arrows are quite strange. I am unable to nock them though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE71_LOG0"
msgid ""
"These walls look like they are meant to move. Maybe the place I need to stand "
"to fire the arrow is behind them. I'd better look for a way to get through "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE32_STAGE45_LOG1"
msgid ""
"This ghostly doll is very odd. I have a feeling I should keep it with me for "
"a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG11Heist_STAGE72_LOG0"
msgid ""
"This must be the spot. Standing on this pressure plate opens the pedestal at "
"the far end of the room. I should practice with normal arrows a few times "
"before trying the Arrow of Extrication. I will only get one try. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE96_LOG2"
msgid ""
"This page displays all your active quests. Click on an active quest and hit "
"the MAP button to display the world map showing your current quest target (if "
"any). You can click on any icon on the map to travel directly to that "
"location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE96_LOG1"
msgid ""
"This page displays all your active quests. Select an active quest and press X "
"to display the world map showing your current quest target (if any). You can "
"select any icon on the map to travel directly to that location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ06_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Thorley Aethelred, a shepherd who lives at the Shardrock Farm, has tasked me "
"to slay six West Weald Bears and bring back their fangs as proof. They've "
"been threatening his sheep, and he has nowhere else to turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS29_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Thoronir has agreed to donate all his ill-gotten merchandise to the local "
"temple and begin selling legitimate merchandise. He also rewarded me with a "
"small ring as a token of his esteem. I should now bring the macabre manifest "
"and Agarmir's shovel to Jensine for my reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD07Kidnap_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Though we did not get all of the answers we had hoped for, Oreyn is pleased "
"with the information we gained."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tivela told me that Rythe had been locked in his studio to work on his latest "
"painting. He usually comes out to eat and sleep, but hadn't done so for more "
"than a day. When she went in to investigate, he was gone. The odd thing was "
"that the study door was still locked. Tivela gave me the key to Rythe's "
"study. If I intend to find him, that's where I should start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE28_LOG1_0"
msgid ""
"To <RT_BlueMed>ready</> your weapon or fists, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_ReadyItem\"/>. To <RT_BlueMed>attack</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE28_LOG1"
msgid ""
"To <RT_BlueMed>ready</> your weapon or fists, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_ReadyItem\"/>. To <RT_BlueMed>attack</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/>.\n"
"\n"
"Hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Attack\"/> to perform a <RT_BlueMed>stronger "
"attack</>. To <RT_BlueMed>block</>, hold <IA id=\"IA_Game_Combat_Block\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE10_LOG2_1"
msgid ""
"To <RT_BlueMed>sprint</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Sprint\"/> while "
"moving.\n"
"If you'd rather <RT_BlueMed>walk</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_ToggleWalk\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE10_LOG1_1"
msgid ""
"To <RT_BlueMed>sprint</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Sprint\"/> while "
"moving. If you'd rather <RT_BlueMed>walk</>, push the <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementForward\"/> slightly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE20_LOG1_0"
msgid ""
"To bring up your <RT_BlueMed>journal</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Default_ToggleCharacterMenu\"/>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"To bring up your <RT_BlueMed>journal</>, press <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Default_ToggleCharacterMenu\"/>.\n"
"\n"
"In your <RT_BlueMed>journal</>, you can see your character attributes, equip "
"objects, choose spells and consult your map and quests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlteration_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To learn more about Alteration, I must find Tooth-in-the-Sea, who lives north "
"of Bravil, near Niben Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07A_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To learn more about Syl's routine, I should begin by asking around New Sheoth "
"about Syl to determine the best way to get close enough to kill her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS92_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To locate Black Brugo, the Count suggested I should ask Mazoga, who might "
"have contacts among outlaws."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS23_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To locate Roland Jenseric, Seridur suggested I search his home, which is also "
"here in the Temple District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To my surprise, I've come across Aleron Loche inside the ruined keep of Fort "
"Grief! He told me that the search for the axe is a ruse that Kurdan gro-"
"Dragol uses to lure people into the ruins. Apparently, Aleron and I are now "
"the prey in a bizarre hunting sport that Kurdan created. I should talk to "
"Aleron and find out more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To recover the stolen painting, I should begin by questioning the castle "
"residents, and then search the Castle for physical clues that could help "
"solve the mystery. My best bet would be to start with the Countess herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingArmorer_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To train further in my Armorer study, I must speak with Gin-Wulm in the "
"Imperial City's Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE54_LOG0"
msgid ""
"To use a bow, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Default_OpenInventoryMenu\"/> and "
"<RT_BlueMed>equip</> both the <RT_BlueMed>bow and the arrows</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlteration_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tooth-in-the-Sea has agreed to teach me what he knows about Alteration magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlteration_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tooth-in-the-Sea has told me I must prove myself; I need to meet him out in "
"Niben Bay during the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAlteration_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tooth-in-the-Sea is dead, making it impossible to further my training in the "
"skill of Alteration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TrainingAcrobatics_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Torbern has agreed to train me in Acrobatics in Aerin's absence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE42_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tove is dead. I'll never find another buyer for these useless Calipers and "
"Tongs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE42_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tove seems to have run out of uses for calipers and tongs. However, I earned "
"a tidy little sum off of him in the mean time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE42_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Tove the Unrestful is looking for calipers and tongs. He says he'll pay five "
"gold each for them. I don't remember agreeing to help him, but somehow I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE175_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ulfri sacrificed herself on the Altar of Despair in order to light the Flame "
"of Agnon. I can now retrieve the Flame from the courtyard and bring it back "
"to New Sheoth as Sheogorath commanded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE06_STAGE150_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Ulfri thanked me for my help in securing Cylarne for the Dark Seducers. She "
"is now heading for the Altar of Despair, where she says she will \"sacrifice "
"herself\" to kindle the Flame of Agnon. I should accompany her and see what "
"happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND10_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid "Umaril is utterly destroyed. I have completed my holy quest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE70_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Umaril's Aurorans have been destroyed. Cheydinhal Chapel is safe, for now. I "
"can now reconsecrate the Sword of the Crusader to Arkay on the high altar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND08_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umaril's Aurorans have been destroyed. Cheydinhal Chapel is safe, for now. I "
"should return to the Priory to consult with my knights about how to attack "
"and destroy Umaril."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE89_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano died during the expedition to Nenalata. I failed in my duty to "
"protect him. Now I will never know what secrets are hidden in the Throne Room "
"of Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano has asked me to meet him at the Ayleid ruin of Nenalata. He wants me "
"to help him reach the throne room so that he can complete his research on the "
"last king of the Ayleids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Umbacano has asked me to retrieve a carved panel from an Ayleid site known "
"only as the High Fane in his sources. He has given me a sketch which will "
"help me identify this ruin, as well as one of the carving which he wants. He "
"also gave me a carved stone key which will allow me to enter the central "
"chamber of the High Fane when I find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano has hired me to obtain an Ayleid Crown he wants from Herminia Cinna, "
"a rival collector. He paid me in advance; whatever I do not use to purchase "
"the crown I can keep as my fee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano has offered to pay well for any more statues I find. I should look "
"for more of them in Ayleid ruins, and bring them to him. If I can find all "
"ten of the statues, he will pay me a large bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano hired me to retrieve the Crown of the Ayleids from Herminia Cinna, a "
"rival collector. By chance, I had already stolen the crown, and was able to "
"deliver it immediately, to Umbacano's great surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE84_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano is dead. The only thing left to do is try to escape this death trap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG4"
msgid ""
"Umbacano promised to pay me 1200 gold if I retrieved the carved panel from "
"the High Fane for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG5"
msgid ""
"Umbacano promised to pay me 1600 gold if I retrieved the carved panel from "
"the High Fane for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG6"
msgid ""
"Umbacano promised to pay me 2000 gold if I retrieved the carved panel from "
"the High Fane for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG7"
msgid ""
"Umbacano promised to pay me 2500 gold if I retrieved the carved panel from "
"the High Fane for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG2"
msgid ""
"Umbacano promised to pay me 500 gold if I retrieved the carved panel from the "
"High Fane for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE10_LOG3"
msgid ""
"Umbacano promised to pay me 800 gold if I retrieved the carved panel from the "
"High Fane for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano thanked me for attempting to recover the carving, but has already "
"paid Claude Maric for completing the task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS22_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano thanked me for delivering the carving, and paid me the promised "
"reward for it in gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano was horribly destroyed in Nenalata when he declared himself King of "
"the Ayleids using the crown of the rival city of Lindai. Now to escape the "
"wrath of the undead denizens of Nenalata!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS27_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano was transformed into an evil Ayleid King in the throne room of "
"Nenalata. I must escape from this death trap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS21_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Umbacano's research has uncovered evidence that some of the Ayleid statues he "
"is looking for may be hidden in these ruins: Moranda, Mackamentain, "
"Wenyandawik, Ninendava, Fanacas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE190_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina is dead. There's no point in looking for any more exhibits for her "
"Museum of Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE21_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina paid me for the deformed Swamp Tentacle that I brought for her "
"museum. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE24_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was happy to add Din's Ashes as an exhibit in her Museum of "
"Oddities. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE29_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was happy to add my Dagger of Friendship as an exhibit in her "
"Museum of Oddities. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was pleased with the \"blind\" Watcher's Eye that I brought for "
"her museum. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE26_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was pleased with the \"soul tomato\" I brought for her Museum of "
"Oddities. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE28_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was pleased with the Hound's Tooth Key I brought for her museum. I "
"should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE31_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was pleased with the Mute Screaming Maw that I brought for her "
"museum. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE22_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was pleased with the Sheogorath-shaped lump of amber that I "
"brought for her museum. I should bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE27_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was pleased with the unusual Mixing Bowl I brought her. I should "
"bring her any new Oddities that I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE23_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina was very happy with the Pelvis of Pelagius. I should bring her any "
"new oddities I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE38_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Una Armina, the proprietor of the Museum of Oddities in Crucible, told me "
"that she is always looking for new exhibits for her museum. If I find "
"anything \"odd,\" I should bring it to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark16Kiss_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ungolim is dead. I must now journey to the city of Anvil, and pick up my "
"reward and next contract at the dead drop there. It is located in the barrel "
"just behind the pond, in the city of Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Upon awakening, I discovered two bleeding pinpricks on my neck. It would "
"appear Vicente Valtieri did indeed visit me last night, and pass along his "
"Dark Gift! If what Valtieri told me is true, my vampirism will begin to "
"manifest itself in three days, after I sleep once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_ND01_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Upon completing my pilgrimage to the wayshrines, I received a vision from the "
"Divine Crusader, Pelinal Whitestrake. He revealed the location of his lost "
"shrine, which is where I should begin my quest for the Relics of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS04_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Upon further questioning, I've discovered that Maelona's husband, Gogan, was "
"carrying a family heirloom when the all-female gang robbed him.  She's "
"desperate to get the ring back, and is offering 100 gold for its return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid "Urul gro-Agamph living on the Dementia side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE46_STAGE60_LOG1"
msgid "Urul gro-Agamph living on the Mania side of Split is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE10_LOG1_0"
msgid ""
"Use <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementLeft\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>move</>.\n"
"Use <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Turn\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>turn</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE10_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Use <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementLeft\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>move</>.\n"
"Use <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Turn\"/> to <RT_BlueMed>turn</>.\n"
"\n"
"To <RT_BlueMed>sprint</>, press <IA id=\"IA_Game_Movement_Sprint\"/> while "
"moving. If you'd rather <RT_BlueMed>walk</>, push the <IA "
"id=\"IA_Game_Movement_MovementForward\"/> slightly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE43_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ushnar gro-Shadborgob has asked me to make Bhisha the Khajiit \"disappear\". "
"He seems to have a unhealthy fear of cats. Ushnar said he would pay me to do "
"it, but he was somewhat vague about the nature of the payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE43_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ushnar gro-Shadborgob is dead and so is my hope to get a reward out of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE43_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Ushnar was very grateful. He gave me one of his former dogs as a pet. There "
"was something strange about how he phrased it though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE03A_STAGE20_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Using a huge pile of treasure as bait, I lured the two remaining adventurers "
"into a fire trap. Syndelius the Mage didn't survive the blast, leaving only "
"their leader, Grommok. I should make my way to the last observation room and "
"choose how the stubborn Orc will encounter his final obstacle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE30_LOG1"
msgid ""
"Uungor doesn't trust me enough to agree to switch sleeping accommodations "
"with Amiable Fanriene. I need to make him more disposed to the idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Uungor doesn't trust me enough to agree to switch sleeping accommodations "
"with Amiable Fanriene. I need to make him more disposed to the idea. Maybe "
"one of the others knows something that will work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Uungor has agreed to switch beds with Amiable Fanriene. I should return to "
"Amiable and tell him the good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE40_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Uungor is dead. Amiable Fanriene can now use his bedroll to sleep in. I "
"should go tell Amiable the good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAVaermina_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vaermina was pleased that I returned the Orb of Vaermina. I have been "
"rewarded with the Skull of Corruption."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAVaermina_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vaermina's followers have told me that an offering of a black soul gem is "
"needed in order to summon the Daedra. [You must be level 5 to begin this "
"quest.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark04Execution_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Valen Dreth is dead, and no guards have been killed. I must return to the "
"Sanctuary and speak with Vicente Valtieri to receive my reward, as well as a "
"bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Valus Odiil is concerned about his sons, who are going to fight creatures "
"that have been appearing in the woods outside of Chorrol. After speaking with "
"Valus, I've agreed to join them. When I'm prepared, I should make my way to "
"Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Valus Odiil thanked me for helping his sons, and gave me a fine weapon named "
"Chillrend as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Valus Odiil thanked me for trying to help his sons, but since both of them "
"died, he was unable to give any reward due to funeral expenses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Valus Odiil thanked me for trying to help his sons, but since one of them "
"died, he was unable to give a full reward due to funeral expenses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MG03Illusion_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Varon Vamori admitted to taking Ardaline's staff, but has sold it to a friend "
"in the Imperial City. I need to deliver this news to Kud-Ei."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Velwyn agreed to meet me back in Anvil at The Count's Arms. I should return "
"there as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE88_LOG0"
msgid "Velwyn and I have arrived at the secret door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE87_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Velwyn and I have arrived in Benirus Manor. I must proceed cautiously to the "
"secret room's entrance and prevent any harm from befalling us if the curse is "
"to ever be lifted from this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS02_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Velwyn successfully opened the door to the secret room, which has stopped the "
"ghosts from attacking. He then ran off, leaving me to clean up the mess. It's "
"up to me, and me alone, to investigate what's beyond the mysterious portal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE110_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vicente Valtieri believes there is a cure for vampirism. If I wish to "
"investigate further, I should speak with Raminus Polus, a mage who has done "
"some research into the subject. I can find him in the Imperial City, at the "
"Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark05AssassinatedFIN_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vicente Valtieri has no more contracts for me. Instead, I must speak with "
"Ocheeva here in the Sanctuary. She will provide my new assignments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE116_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vicente Valtieri is dead. If I need further information on vampirism, I'll "
"have to find it elsewhere..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DarkVamp_STAGE115_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vicente Valtieri is dead. If I wish to become a vampire, I must seek another "
"means of acquiring the Dark Gift..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FG00Expulsion_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vilena Donton has offered me a chance to redeem myself. I must bring her "
"twenty minotaur horns in order to be reinstated into the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD01Default_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vilena Donton has told me that, as a member of the Fighters Guild, there are "
"a number of duties I'll be expected to perform. She would like me to speak "
"with Modryn Oreyn about these."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE95_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vilena Donton suggests that one of my first actions should be to reinstate "
"Modryn Oreyn as my second-in-command, if he will accept the post."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD09Hist_STAGE90_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vilena Donton was astounded by the events I recounted, and she now realizes "
"that her unwillingness to act could have caused the demise of the Fighters "
"Guild. She has promoted me to Master of the Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Viranus Donton and I have arrived at Nonwyll Cavern. We'll have to find out "
"what happened to Galtus Previa, and I should make sure no harm comes to the "
"young Donton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vlandhonder Moslin denies knowing anything about Dar-Ma.  He says no young "
"Argonian has stayed in his inn recently.  His evasive manner leads me to "
"suspect he is lying, however, and I should continue my search of the town for "
"clues to Dar-Ma's whereabouts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS45_STAGE41_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Vlanhonder Moslin admits that Dar-Ma arrived in Hackdirt, but still denies "
"knowing anything about her disappearance.  I am now sure that foul play was "
"involved, and will continue my search of the town for any sign of her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS26_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Watch Captain Itius Hayn is willing to arrest Audens Avidius if I can produce "
"two witnesses that will publically accuse him. The only victims I know are "
"Ruslan, Luronk gro-Grurzog, and Jensine. I'll need to talk to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ04_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We agreed that we must find someplace safe to take Martin. Jauffre suggested "
"Cloud Ruler Temple, the hidden Blades fortress near Bruma. I should escort "
"Martin and Jauffre there immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ16_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We have arrived in the Elder Council Chamber. I must formally present "
"Martin's claim to Chancellor Ocato, the head of the Elder Council."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We have found the corpse of Galtus Previa. We should now return to Modryn "
"Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD03Viranus_STAGE100_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We have returned with news of Galtus Previa to Modryn Oreyn. He was pleased "
"with our efforts, and has paid the contract to Donton. For my efforts, he has "
"given me a magic blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS18_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We've arrived at Odiil Farm. I need to help Antus and Rallus Odiil defeat the "
"creatures that have been plaguing their home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE50_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We've arrived at Water's Edge, which it seems has been overrun by goblins. I "
"have been given the order to attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS14_STAGE80_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We've arrived back in Rythe's home. The painting is now sealed, and Rythe is "
"safe. I should speak to him when I have a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGC01Rats_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We've killed all the mountain lions Pinarus believes are in the area. I "
"should return to Arvena Thelas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD05Oreyn_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"We've searched the ruins of Arpenia, and the place is deserted. There are no "
"corpses, no signs of battle. Oreyn believes that the entire story was made up "
"by the Blackwood Company, that perhaps they paid off Azani Blackheart to move "
"his base of operations. Oreyn suggests we search nearby Ayeleid ruins, and "
"knows of one to the northeast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Weebam-Na denies knowing anything about the Eye of Nocturnal, and tells me "
"Bejeen knows nothing, either. Perhaps I should try to listen in on their "
"conversations, and see if they offer any clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Weebam-Na is dead, so I can't learn where he has hidden the Eye of "
"Nocturnal... except by searching every dark, wet place in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE210_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Weebam-Na is dead. Now I'll never know what Mazoga wanted, and I can never "
"learn Mazoga's story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS91_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Weebam-Na spoke with Mazoga. Perhaps now Mazoga will tell me what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE55_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Weebam-Na suspects I have been eavesdropping on his conversations. I must get "
"to Tidewater Cave and look for the Eye of Nocturnal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ04_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Weynon Priory is under attack! I must find and protect Jauffre, but make sure "
"that Martin remains safe from the enemy as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG10Boots_STAGE35_LOG0"
msgid ""
"What luck! The family mausoleum for the Imbels is in the basement of the "
"Jakben's house. The poor Earl was so terrified he told me everything I needed "
"to know. He even gave me the key! Now to find those boots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAAzura_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When Azura was summoned, she told me the tale of her followers who trapped "
"themselves in the Gutted Mine. She wishes me to find them and kill them, "
"releasing them from their vampiric existence. Azura will unseal the mine so I "
"may enter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS51_STAGE20_LOG2"
msgid ""
"When I asked about the night in question, Chanel told me that she spent some "
"time in the courtyard of the castle taking star readings. Then she made her "
"way to the dining area off of the Great Hall. Finally, she went to her "
"quarters to sleep. I should continue questioning the suspects the Countess "
"recommended."
msgstr ""

