msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAClavicusVile_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When I gave my offering at the Shrine of Clavicus Vile, the Daedra Lord told "
"me about Umbra, and how he wishes me to return to him the Umbra Sword. I "
"should start my search in Pell's Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE51_LOG2"
msgid ""
"When I have killed everyone on Glarthir's list, I should meet him at midnight "
"behind the Great Chapel for my payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE52_LOG2"
msgid ""
"When I have killed everyone on Glarthir's list, I should meet him at midnight "
"behind the Great Chapel for my payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS38_STAGE53_LOG2"
msgid ""
"When I have killed everyone on Glarthir's list, I should meet him at midnight "
"behind the Great Chapel for my payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DAMalacath_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When I left the offering, Malacath was summoned and spoke to me. He tasked me "
"with traveling to the estate of Lord Drad and freeing his ogre slaves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG06BloodPrice_STAGE65_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When I paid the blood price, S'krivva restored my standing with the Thieves "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE70_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When I told Burd that Jearl had an unknown visitor staying with her, he "
"authorized me to enter her house and search it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ07_STAGE70_LOG1"
msgid ""
"When I told Burd that Jearl was a Mythic Dawn agent, he authorized me to "
"enter her house and search it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE82_LOG0_2"
msgid ""
"When a <RT_BlueMed>fight begins</>, the eye will flicker and two chevrons "
"will appear on its sides."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANamira_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When summoned, Namira spoke to me about the Forgotten, a group of fanatical "
"worshippers that lives in the darkness of Anga. Some priests of Arkay are "
"planning to bring light to Anga and \"save\" the Forgotten Ones. I am to use "
"the spell that Namira has given me on the priests, and let the Forgotten Ones "
"finish them off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_DANocturnal_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When summoned, Nocturnal spoke to me of the Eye of Nocturnal, which has been "
"stolen. The Daedra believes the thieves to be in Leyawiin. I am to go there, "
"find the thieves, and return the Eye to the shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MQ01_STAGE120_LOG0"
msgid ""
"When you hover each possible action, the character's face <RT_BlueMed>shows "
"their reaction</> to it. It can be Love, Like, Dislike or Hate.\n"
"Their <RT_BlueMed>disposition increases</> if you select a "
"<RT_BlueMed>Loved</> or <RT_BlueMed>Liked action</> and "
"<RT_BlueMed>decreases</> if you select a <RT_BlueMed>Disliked</> or "
"<RT_BlueMed>Hated action</>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Arena_STAGE40_LOG0"
msgid "Where my supplier at? Oh yeah, in my cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_MS08_STAGE5_LOG0"
msgid ""
"While in Bravil, I've heard that Ursanne Loche's husband, Aleron, is missing. "
"If I wish to help, I should attempt to locate Ursanne and see if I can find "
"out more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_FGD08Infiltration_STAGE60_LOG0"
msgid ""
"While leaving Water's Edge, the Hist Sap again began to have a strange effect "
"on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_Dark01Knife_STAGE10_LOG0"
msgid ""
"While sleeping, I was visited by Lucien Lachance, a representative for the "
"assassins guild known as the Dark Brotherhood. He said that if I wish to join "
"his \"family,\" I must go to the Inn of Ill Omen, find a man named Rufio, and "
"kill him. If I simply leave Rufio alone, Lachance will never visit me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_TG05Misdirection_STAGE30_LOG0"
msgid ""
"While spying on Hieronymus Lex, I saw a Dremora delivered a note to him. Lex "
"has begun moving his watchmen out of the Waterfront. I think this is the "
"signal for me to report back to Methredhel. Lex dropped that note. I wonder "
"if I can find it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE07B_STAGE15_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Wide-Eye has described to me a bit of her routine. I'll need to find where "
"she gets Greenmote from and obtain some without being discovered. Wide-Eye "
"mentions she does a \"special errand\" at noon every day, I should follow her "
"and see where she goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SE04_STAGE20_LOG0"
msgid ""
"Wide-Eye has told me that the Chalice of Reversal is locked away in Dunroot "
"Burrow. I'll need to ingest Felldew to enter the Burrow, and pass through to "
"reach the Chalice. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_LogEntries/LOC_LE_SQ09_STAGE200_LOG0"
msgid "With Aelwin's death, it is impossible to complete this quest."
msgstr ""

