msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MankarSpeech_0001f879_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"As for the rest: the weak shall be winnowed; the timid shall be cast down; "
"the mighty shall tremble at my feet and pray for pardon.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechLoremasters_00002d2a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"As oiobala Umarile, Ehlnada racuvar\"! A curse and a threat to those who "
"have eyes to see and ears to hear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartA3_00002c84_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"\"As oiobala Umarile, Ehlnada racuvar\", in the Ayleid tongue. \"By the "
"eternal power of Umaril, the mortal gods shall be cast down.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechUmaril_00002a60_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"Be vigilant! I can no longer shield the host of Men from Umaril's "
"retribution.\" Thus spake Pelinal in the hour of his death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechUmaril_00002a5f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"Better that I had died believing myself the victor. Although cast beyond "
"the doors of night, he will return.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechLoremasters_00002d2c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "\"By the eternal power of Umaril, the mortal gods shall be cast down.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06BookLostHistories_0000bf83_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"\"Look under the bush near the well, behind Nerastarel's house.\" I was going "
"to take it for myself, but I owe you a great debt. You should take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_0006835d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"My lord\"? That isn't necessary. I'm just a man. Just a citizen of the "
"Empire, trying to do his duty. Just like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45EndChoice3_00081b7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"Poison\" is \"potion\" spelled differently. Both come in bottles, but one "
"is good to drink! Singing potions! Ringing potions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeAmberMace_0001f3e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"Smacking an idiot in the head a few times is the surest way to win an "
"argument,\" my Mama used to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ErthorTopic_0002d6e9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "\"Somewhere else\" meaning somewhere far away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ4_00002d0f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"That all the Interplay is one flea of assertion on a wolf of naught.\" It "
"is by these heresies that you fall from grace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47MageShopTalk_00030132_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"\"The explosions are scaring the sheep\" or \"A plague of rats ate all our "
"crops.\" Every day another complaint!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11TheLightTopic_0008f12d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"\"The light is knowledge,\" she says. \"Forsake all ignorance and morality in "
"favor of the light,\" she teaches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetA2_00002b86_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"\"The shade of Sir Berich spoke to me,\" was all he said. \"We must put him "
"to rest.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c241_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"\"This Heart is the heart of the world, for one was made to satisfy the "
"other.\" You all remember this. It is in every legend. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MankarSpeech_0001f878_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"When I walk the earth again, the Faithful among you shall receive your "
"reward: to be set above all other Mortals forever.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona08_0007ba9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"\"Whoever wears Nocturnal's cowl shall have his name stricken from history.\" "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000914da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "(Hic) Eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002f257_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "*Gasp!*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f08d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"*Gasp!* Here they come! Oh my, Aunt Margaret! You are looking the worse for "
"wear..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086752_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "*Gasp!* Listener! How may I serve you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Convo_000282de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"*Gasp* What's this? Oh, Dark Brotherhood assassin, please don't cut me with "
"that wicked blade! It looks like this is the end of poor Francois!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479da_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"... And heavens forfend that my husband, Eitar, devote a few minutes from his "
"all-consuming hobby..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000355cb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"... And now, his new wife, so beautiful, so fine. And wise? Oh, yes! The new "
"Lady Leyawiin is daughter to Countess Arriana Valga, County Chorrol..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinC1_0001e8d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "... Because I'm the emperor's son?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475b0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... Because you don't want to be on the dead guy side of the line, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraCultTopic_000a495d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... But it just so happens I've run into some Sanguine worshippers up in the "
"Imperial Reserve, a long way north-north-west of Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000355cb_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "... But listen to me! Cawing and chattering like an old fishcrow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479da_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... But my real passion is alchemy. I love brewing up new and interesting "
"potions... just for fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047710_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "... But now, with the emperor dead, everything is at sixes and sevens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479f4_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"... But that's what they call the stable when I buy it, and what do I care "
"what they call it...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b604_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "... I can see you have bad news. You didn't recover the Amulet, did you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16MartinB_0004bfbd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"... I have an idea. One last hope. I must reach the Dragonfires in the Temple "
"of the One."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000039bd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"... Oh, forget it. Let me guess: you're worried about what my men and I are "
"doing here in town, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047670_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... Slash 'N Smash... the BIG Orc Weapon Shop. BIG weapons. For BIG heroes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor17_00032481_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "... To face my apportioned fate, then fall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... Was I insufficiently clear? I beg your pardon. You do not interest me. We "
"will not be having further social discourse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "... Well, don't expect a handout from ME. You certainly don't need it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e84_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"... You're going to tell him I am quite capable of besmirching my good name "
"on my own. He should cease and desist immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488e5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... a pickpocket. But relax. You're safe from me. You look like you might "
"take offense. Too risky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c227_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"... and Dawn's Beauty, the Princedom of Lorkhan... misnamed 'Tamriel' by "
"deluded mortals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000355cb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"... and so she knows just how the county should be run.  Lady Alessia tells "
"Count Marius exactly what to do... and he does as she says... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetSermon01_00002cb9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"... and so, nine knights, as the embodiment of the might of the Nine Divines, "
"shall go forth together to face The Unfeathered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e88b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"... and we take the whole patriotic 'Imperial Mission' attitude with a dose "
"of salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479f4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... and, supposedly, because my face looks like a cat. Don't see it, myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479f4_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid "... good eating... they tell me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0aa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... sailors, ship-owners, men made rich and poor by the sea trade, and the "
"lonely wives of men who follow the sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479da_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"... stirring up trouble between Khajiits and Argonians, to help me find "
"ingredients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDAnvilChapel_00002a98_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"... the priests and priestesses of Dibella, slaughtered within the very walls "
"of her Chapel. The Altar itself desecrated!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047226_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "... there. You're not a prisoner of the Forbidden Grotto any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32MagicDagger_00012d1c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"...Someone like you! No need to thank me for letting you give me your power. "
"I deserve it, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"...and he says, \"Eat the Greenmote, drag Thadon. Eat the Greenmote, drag "
"Thadon.\" Ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479f4_Oblivion_RESP9"
msgid "...but that's a pile of money for horse steaks, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberTwoManEnd03_000732a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"...find it... yes... I must find the key... rich beyond all my dreams... "
"hehehe"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03LewinCrazyChatter_0008efaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "...huge t-tree... going...going... to k-kill us all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03LewinChamberOneGrow02_00066e59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "...ma-makes no sense...should be d-dead...what...who..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadonDeathSpeech05_0007b37d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "...my heart...can't breathe...help me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberOneStart_000648a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"...now keep your weapons ready and watch your backs. Do what I say, and we "
"might just get outta' here alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001333e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "0, 1, 0. I always aim for the heart. 1, 0, 1."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32HlovalsMagicka_00012d12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"0, 5. Hloval is our priest and healer. 7, 7.  Unfortunately he was born with "
"stunted magicka, but not a stunted ego."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Betrothed_00012d10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"0, 9. Ah, the doll. Poor Desideratus. 1, 5. Fanatics killed his whole family. "
"9, 6.  That doll is all he has left of them. 5, 5, 9, 4."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007301d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2, 3 - hurry before I lose count - 5, 6, 7... D'oh! I just lost count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00073043_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2, 3, 4...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e986_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2, 3. Hi, I'm Jastira Nanus... 4, 5, 6... As you can see, 7, 8, 9, 10... "
"I'm a little busy counting at the moment... 11, 12, 13."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013338_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2, 3. I need my arrows. 5, 7, 11. I can't get them. 13, 17, 19. If I "
"leave, who will keep up the count? 23, 29, 31."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b684_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2, 3. My arrows are finding their targets! 4, 5, 6."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_00013544_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2, 3. That idiot Bat gro-Orkul refused to equip some of us. 5, 8, 13.  He "
"has arrows, but won't give me any of them. 21, 34, 55."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e9c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2, 3... is this important? 4, 5, 6... I'm counting... 8, 9. Oh, no. I "
"missed 7. Speak up before I get mad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2.. A new person has come to the Isles... 4, 5... recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2...  the Greymarch is over. 4, 5... Thank Sheogorath... 6, 7."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043513_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2... Adventurers are being sucked up into that dungeon again... 5, 6."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2... Did you hear? The Gatekeeper is dead.... 4, 5... That's bad news... "
"7, 8."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2... Hate her. 3, 4... Sick, sick woman. 5, 6...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f476_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 2... Sheogorath's got his army... 3, 4... in the barracks... 5, 6."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 2... sad about Passwall. 3, 4... I wonder if they will rebuild it. ...5, 6."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1, 3, 5, 7... my Lord! I... I don't know what to say. 8, 16, 4..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"1, 6, 1. I was the first to spot the invaders. 8, 0, 3. I was on patrol when "
"I saw their skirmishers marching toward Vitharn. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "1,2... It's the Madgod! Wow. Wow. 4, 12, 36...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "12, 13... A new ruler for Bliss... 14, 15."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044230_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "12, 13... A new ruler for Crucible... 14, 15."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001333f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "12, 3, 2, 2. It's hopeless. 15, 5, 3. The town is lost. 0, 0, 0."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "12... uh... 6? 4?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"14, 11. I must guard the lever that opens the gate. 9, 4. If the gate is "
"opened, the Fanatics will overrun Vitharn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "2, 3... Good that there are no more doubles. 4, 5...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044211_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"2, 3... That big ol' torch in... 4, 5... New Sheoth is finally lit... 7, 8. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_00013546_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"2, 7, 1. You have arrows! 8, 2, 8.  Now let the battle be joined! 1, 8, 2. "
"Why aren't you counting? 8, 4, 5."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32HlovalsMagicka_00012d12_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"2,1. He does the best he can, but he never seems to have enough magicka. 5, 6."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013339_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"3, 1, 4. Without any arrows, I am useless in this battle. 1, 5, 9. But if I "
"leave to get them, who will count? 2, 6, 5."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "3, 4... I sure don't like my double. 5, 6... She doesn't count right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"3, 9, 8. I rode back as fast as I could to tell Count Cirion of the danger. "
"8, 7, 4. He went and hid. 9, 8, 9."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e920_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"30 should do it this time. Yes, that would be perfect. Oh, and as usual, I'll "
"have the moderate Elixir ready in 24 hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060538_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "5, 4... Sheogorath has left us alone in this terrible time. 3, 2, 1."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ecc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"5, 6... Thadon's back on the Felldew... 7, 8... without the downer... 10, 11."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "6, 12... You've just made things worse! 36! 42!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ece_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"6, 7... Good work! 8, 9... I'm the only Jastira this town needs. 10, 11...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "6, 9... You're working for those Demented people! 7, 12... Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ecf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "7, 8... Don't like that other Jastira. 9, 10... Not one bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa8a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"7, 8... The same goes for everyone else in town. 9, 10... You should talk to "
"Horkvir about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "7, 8... There's a new Gatekeeper in the Fringe. 9, 10."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007304b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "8, 9, 10."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"8, 9... Syl's rounding people up again. 10, 11... It's hard to count when you "
"are being tortured."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscScreamingInPain_00046f6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "<screaming in pain>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscScreamingInPain_00046f6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "<sobbing in pain>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A Chalice for Thadon! I like chalices. And mugs. And steins. Cups are good, "
"too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004564f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A Gnarl! You've earned your reward. Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A God. My God. Wow. I thought little furry puppy dogs were the cutest thing "
"in the world. But, look at you! I could just eat you up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQLastItem_00026ef7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "A Great Sigil Stone, then, is what we require."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChoice2B_0000c220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A Light Raiment, huh? You sure? I figured you for the Heavy Raiment type. You "
"know, hide behind a skin of steel? Hmph. Okay then, here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Shadowscale_000251fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A Shadowscale hatchling is trained in the arts of stealth and assassination, "
"and lives a life in service to the mighty kingdom of Argonia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice4BadDay_00061c4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A bad day? A bad day? Try a miserable existence!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestsOrderTopic_000910f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A bad lot. Traitors. You'll find them near the obelisks that dot the land. "
"They perform rituals at the obelisks to summon Knights to the Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000091c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A bargain at any price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37ExpertSpell_0007b227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A bargain at twice the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A bed you seek? There is one here for you, if you have the 10 gold to rent it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_00037ccc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A bed? Well of course! Of course! I've got a small room available right "
"upstairs, first door on the left. Only 10 gold. What do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirStoryCurse_00002b28_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A beggar who came to the Chapel each day for help tried my patience one too "
"many times. I lost my temper, and struck him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a984d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A bit eccentric. Loves old things. He's practically got a museum upstairs. "
"But he'd never let anybody else see it, oh no!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SESylTopic_00044f56_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "A bit harder to meet than Thadon. Consider making an appointment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon2_000288ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A blade. Fantastic! Let us take the fight to these vile creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "A bloody black horse courier. Hahahaha! ... Ahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Choice2_0002c7ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A brilliant idea! Oreyn only sends his best these days. Tell you what. You go "
"find us some paying work, and we'll happily go about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0007816d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A bunch of junk. That's what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007322b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A caliper a day makes the skyboat... wait, that doesn't rhyme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech1_00056049_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"A change is coming. Everything changes. Even Daedric Princes. Especially "
"Daedric Princes. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_0001e912_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A chapterhouse of the Order of Talos, a monastic order connected to the "
"Blades. It's located on the Black Road just outside of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_00066a50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A charged magic item is a useful magic item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00015e04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A coin for an old beggar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17GoOn_000366ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A contingent of Battlemages has been sent to the site. I would like you to "
"oversee their actions on my behalf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0003571c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A contract for you? I think I've got something that suits your experience. "
"Arvena Thelas has some problem with rats in her house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023e45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A contract is a secret pact one enters into with the Dark Brotherhood. They "
"provide us with gold, and we remove someone from existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023e45_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A contract is fulfilled by a skilled assassin such as yourself, who keeps the "
"Dark Brotherhood's end of the bargain. So it has always been. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c08d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A course of action could not be agreed upon. Some felt that we are in danger "
"of being exterminated, and that it is time to fight back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PayGoldforCrime_00045765_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A coward as well as a criminal. Very well, perhaps I'll have a chance to test "
"your mettle another day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_00058335_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A cure? Yes... Yes, I believe it's possible. A mage named Raminus Polus has "
"done some research. He's in the Imperial City, at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000748a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A cure? You mean, besides death?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingShort_000131db_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A curious thing, that. Long roads get longer too, if you're thinking about "
"them, but what about long words? They don't change nearly as much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009837a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A curse on that Hieronymus Lex!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartA3_00002c84_Knights_RESP3"
msgid "A curse upon Umaril's ancient foes -- and a threat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ChDementia_000139ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A dangerous choice. I like it! She's gotten to be a bit much, anyway. Thinks "
"everyone is out to get her. Which they are, in this case. So be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ffd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A day without sunshine is like... night. Ahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061429_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A dead Gatekeeper means more adventurers in the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A den of thieves? Near Anvil? Like that's news? There must be a dozen of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BattlePlans_0002771c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A desperate plan indeed. This ... Prince? Emperor? Martin would risk my whole "
"city to gain a Great Sigil Stone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A door has opened to the Realm, and a single man steps through. Will he come "
"to us full of lies, or will his intentions be true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081dc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A drink to the health of our Lord!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_00061c5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A fair bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro2_00082463_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A fair question. You won't, really. At least I don't think so. But you'll "
"have power. My power. Try not to lose it. It's a pain to replace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d497_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A farmhouse? Hmmm, last time it was a cabin. They must be moving around. Just "
"be cautious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactG_00038fb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A fearsome weapon, and steeped in the ancient evil of its master. May its "
"deadly power turn good, for once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000c45a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A fellow Argonian. How good to see. Were you anyone else, I would require a "
"test before offering you training, but it's one I'm sure you could pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ05RaelynntheGravefinder_0018abd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A few months ago, that witch of a Necromancer decided to inhabit Moss Rock "
"Cavern just north of my inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d24c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A few nights ago, I was roaming the city as I often do, looking for any signs "
"of a vampire. As I headed passed Roland's house I heard a cry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006139d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A few too many loose lips, it seems. It's not something I want to be public "
"knowledge, if you understand my meaning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A few weeks ago, a spellsword was passing through Leyawiin and heard that I "
"like to buy curiosities. He wanted to sell the staff you see me carrying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS39Seen_0004ed74_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A few years ago, an adventurer not unlike yourself sold me a musty old tome "
"containing alchemical formulas. Most of them were worthless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e977_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A few years ago, an adventurer not unlike yourself sold me a musty old tome "
"containing alchemical formulas. Most of them were worthless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001647e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A final task awaits you, when you are ready. It is time for you to strike "
"back at the King of Worms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0000921c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A fine bargain for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LadyRogbutTOPIC_0000bea4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A fine model of an Orcish woman. Now go find her. And don't be rude, or "
"she'll rip your ears off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Daedricshrine_00002e53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A fine study to add to my research. I thank you for your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_000091d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A fine transaction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro1_00082462_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A fly in the ointment. A new cause for a different effect. We're going to "
"change things. No... things will be different this time around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061425_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A fool and his Chalice. Wonderful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A friend gave me \"The Book of Daedra.\" It's an interesting study."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003406d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A friend of mine is a member of the Legion. He said some Altmer nobleman was "
"murdered, right here in the city! Faelian, I think his name was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Decision_0001e3ec_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "A friendly word of warning before you choose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00066cce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A gang of women in Anvil seducing men? Did you hear? Take my copy of the "
"Black Horse Courier. Poor fools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_000221f6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"A gate can be opened from the outside, however. It will be more difficult, as "
"I will have to temporarily bind myself to the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A gate opened and daedra poured out. Everybody ran. Or they died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b31f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A genuine masterpiece comes from the heart, not the mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gift_0018bc2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A gift, for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeAmberHammerMagic_00016ceb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A girl can always win an argument with a weapon like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008faaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A glorious existence. Truly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005decf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A good bargain, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_000465cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A good healer makes for a happy town. And Cirroc almost seems like another "
"Nord to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A good man who honors the Nine may visit the Wayshrines of Akatosh for "
"Blessings of Speed and Magicka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_000091d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A good price for a good customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC07Choice2_000091f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A great deal, over 1,000 septims. My father was quite a gambler. Quite a bad "
"gambler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC07Choice2_000146b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A great deal, over 1,000 septims. My father was quite a gambler. Quite a bad "
"gambler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_000223da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A great man, and a true believer, deep in faith and wisdom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091aab_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"A grim fate indeed, but one does not cross the Order of the Black Worm "
"without suffering greatly for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Mg12TravenGoOn_000835fa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A group of Battlemages were dispatched to Mucianus's last known location, "
"with the intent of bringing him in for questioning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_0000c08c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A group of mages led by Irlav Jarol took the Helm, and have retreated to Fort "
"Teleman, in an effort to study it further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028b83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A guest has been murdered. So it begins. You mark my words. This entire party "
"is a trap. Someone wants us all dead, and now they have their chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A hail and hardy welcome, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon1_000288b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A hammer! Excellent! Good for bashing in puny goblin skulls!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e44a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A happy customer is a returning customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A hated one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033578_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A hearty hello to you. So good to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetA1_00002b89_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A holy knight, like you, questing for the Relics at the Prophet's call. I was "
"his squire. I believed he was chosen by the gods to reclaim the Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA8_00002ade_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A humble heart is a good starting point. The gods will decide if you are "
"worthy to seek the Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_00003932_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A journal? Let me see that... Blackwood Company! Bastards! Rank amateurs! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A journal? Sounds like he fought bravely. I should have known the Blackheart "
"Company was involved. Reckless amateurs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000296a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A knight is only as good as his blade. A bit more practice never hurt anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeGauntlets_0001f3db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A lady might be a killer, but she shouldn't ruin her manicure by chipping a "
"nail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d4af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A letter, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ef8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A little bird told me that Syl is rounding up people again. That's silly, "
"isn't it? Would you like some milk, little kitty? You look thirsty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dcb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A little bird told me that you've been asking around town about Glarthir. Our "
"resident \"eccentric.\" I'd like to know why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03XedilianTopic_0008e94d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A little busy here! I'm trying to decide what to have for dinner. Oh, how I "
"love eating. One of my favorite things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00051ea1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A little closer..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b83b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A little closer..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00038995_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A little food and drink will do you some good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornMaidDrink_0000de4d_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "A little food and drink will do you some good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornMaidFood_0000de4e_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "A little food and drink will do you some good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A little skill with a shield can save your life. Of course, she'll only train "
"other Fighters Guild members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00013340_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A little stab in the back won't hurt too much. Then I'll have the magicka I "
"need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047748_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A little tip. People who ask a lot of questions around here tend to be not "
"very popular."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_0003cf9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A local gentleman has been looking to sell his manor. A bit run-down, but a "
"magnificent place, and priced to move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A local woman, Ursanne Loche, has a missing husband. She might appreciate "
"some help from someone like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000af05b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A lot of good men died. But it could have been worse. A lot worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HowlingHalls_00016b7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A lot of history has this place. It was I who led the apostles to steal the "
"stones from Cyrodiil when the original temple was destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049907_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A lot of mages swear by Rindir's Staffs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem9_0008242c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A lovely little Oddity -- a key made from a Hound's Tooth. And no one even "
"knows what it opens, imagine that! Shall we move on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A lovely little treachery. The Golden Saints almost beg to be betrayed, true, "
"but still, you took that little bit of extra time to think it through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_00066a4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A magic item without a charge is like a sword without a blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e10a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A man with pockets as deep as a cave whom everyone wishes would just go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42Skyboat_00073233_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A marvelous contraption. I've gotten it to float in water perfectly. Now if I "
"can just get the water to fly through the air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A master sorcerer like Janus Hassildor inevitably outlives all his peers. It "
"must be a lonely existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM1Armor_00014e6d_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "A meaningless choice. Be more specific."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM1Weapon_00014e4f_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "A meaningless choice. Be more specific."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a16_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A member of my pride was traveling in Leyawiin. There is an artifact hidden "
"in the Chapel there, but he said that one has ever been able to claim it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005c0c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A merry dance for the Lord of Chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhoAreYou_00016818_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A messenger, sent by Issmi. You must go to Brellach at once! We are under "
"attack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062bee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A mighty feat of arms! The bards of Cyrodiil will be singing of the Fall of "
"the Great Gate for years to come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaltusPreviaTOPIC_0002d712_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A mission? Well... of course! I'm sure we can do this. You say this came from "
"Oreyn himself? Well. Perhaps I should speak with Mother first...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "A moment, if you please, good sir. We should speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheeseTOPIC_0003e205_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A more pungent cheese you'll never find. It looks smooth, but it stinks to "
"the heavens and beyond!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00096058_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A mortal faces me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00096050_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A mortal to stand before Jyggalag? Fool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018f8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A mortal wandering the halls of holy Cylarne... and a male no less. Explain "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A mortal! Wonderful. Always a pleasure. Perhaps you'll do a service for me, "
"mortal. And I'll reward you. A fair bargain, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095908_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A mortal? Wait... a mortal I know. MY mortal. What are you doing here, "
"mortal, when I've given you things to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialOrrery_00033deb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A most fascinating contraption. Bothiel is one of the few who understands how "
"it worked, and kept it running."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodgrassTopic_0005373f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A most interesting plant. From the planes of Oblivion itself, so it may "
"require some effort to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersMoon_00002dcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A most interesting text, is it not? We are fortunate that at least one "
"necromancer took the time to record the information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC01Choice1_0003662a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A mountain lion? In my basement? But... how? That's not possible. But, it "
"happened! What if there are more? What if it wasn't alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00064459_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A neat bit of work we did to reassign him to Anvil. One of my better "
"forgeries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13ChoiceWhatproblem_000039a4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A nest of vampires has sprung up in Bloodcrust Cavern, southeast of the town. "
"They are a threat to the town, and must be eliminated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044239_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new Duke in Crucible? They're all just bags of meat to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f225_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new Gatekeeper is in the Fringe now. That's good. Fewer adventurers means "
"more creatures for me to hunt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f20d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new Gatekeeper protects the Fringe. But he does nothing to stop the spread "
"of disease."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ae3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new Gatekeeper! Excellent. We might be onto something with you, after all. "
"That should keep out the stragglers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new Gatekeeper! Excellent. We might be onto something with you, after all. "
"That should keep out the stragglers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new Gatekeeper, eh? I'll bet he'd be willing to kill me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00041ecb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new adventurer in the Isles. Perhaps it's a sign?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new adventurer in the Isles. Perhaps this adventurer has some Skooma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new adventurer may set foot in the Shivering Isles, I hear. Perhaps I will "
"bake him a fine treat in case our paths should cross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b6a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new arrival! A shame about my Gatekeeper. I'm so happy, I could just tear "
"out your intestines and strangle you with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new face in the Isles. Brings the Fork, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new person in town? Maybe someone to talk to on long, sleepless nights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new person wandering around? Did anyone check to see if this person was "
"diseased?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new ruler for Dementia! Perhaps blood was spilled. Great deals of blood. "
"Syl's blood. Lovely blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler for Dementia! This is the stuff epic novels are made of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler for Dementia. Certainly the end times are upon us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new ruler for Mania? Great. They don't have the same cat problems we have "
"in Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler in Bliss? It doesn't concern me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061758_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler in Crucible, and an empty throne in Bliss. Amazing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044226_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler in Crucible? It doesn't concern me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler in Crucible? One more thing to keep me up at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler in Dementia is no reason to lay about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new ruler of Dementia. Excellent. If I could only freeze this moment in "
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new ruler of Mania. It doesn't sound good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A new scent is here. Who can it be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A new visitor to our home. How wonderful. Better stay away from my wife...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01GateSpeech_0005a762_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A nice effort, though. A shame he's dead. These things happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ErthorTopic_0002d6e9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A nice enough guy, I suppose, but there was that awful scamp incident last "
"year. That's when Adrienne told him he needed to practice somewhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DagailTopic_0003395b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A nice lady, but strange. Talks to herself far more often than one should, in "
"my opinion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00035678_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"A note of caution: Skingrad is an... unusual place. Be prepared for the "
"unexpected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Stipend_00018232_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"A particular relic has eluded me for many years. Possessing this piece of "
"Akaviri antiquity would make my collection complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081a53_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"A perfect job for you, my newest and only Noble in the realm! If Order has "
"entered my army's stronghold, things have taken a disturbing turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ad9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A perfect tomato... one taste, and it is gone forever. And then... a lifetime "
"of searching for the next one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05ThedretPhrase_00002afa_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A phrase kept coming up in the writings I found: \"When the eyes of the "
"Guardians are upon you, Julianos will show you favor.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG07Choice1B_0001e069_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A pity, but not unexpected. We shall speak again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingAlterationNo_0018d15a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A pity. I was looking forward to this. Perhaps some other time, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofNamiraTOPIC_0001ce98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A place of blessed darkness. A holy place where we may worship in our "
"wretchedness. Why are you here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef5_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"A place where many have perished seeking its Great Stone. But nothing else "
"will do, so you must succeed where all others have failed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_00062114_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicFence_0001601f_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicFletcher_00016021_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicQuarters_00016022_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicSecurity_00016023_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicStealth_00016024_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicSupplier_00016025_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024c5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A pleasure to make your acquaintance. I'm Athragar of the Mages Guild. How "
"can I serve you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000038d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure to meet you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091994_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_000091ea_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure to serve you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornMaidStopFollow_0000de27_DLCBattlehornCastle_"
"RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure to serve you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornNeverMind_0000de4f_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure to serve you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000191c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A pleasure to speak with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RelmynaVerenim_00014ae7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A powerful Sorceress. Maybe a genius. And a complete lunatic. All in all, my "
"kind of person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038aad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A primate has better things to do than provide tourist information. Beggars "
"have plenty of time on their hands. I'm sure you'll have much in common."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServeSentence_00045766_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A prison cell is better than you deserve, mortal scum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03FinChoice1A_00023e54_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A prisoner recently escaped from the prison, using a set of secret tunnels "
"connecting to the Imperial City's sewer system. It's a perfect way inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15OrtheEldamil_0003eab5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A prisoner, sent in by ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_000280be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A rather isolated village, south of Chorrol.  We do some business with the "
"trader there.  Small volume, but she pays well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopicDarJee04_000479b4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A real thigh-slapper, that one, eh? Phew. I heard lots others, only I can't "
"remember them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d590_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A recommendation, from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044202_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A replacement for the Duchess of Dementia could put the wrong people in "
"positions of power, if you get my drift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AnotherTask_000a657c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A rival collector has an item which I very much want to add to my collection. "
"But she stubbornly refuses to consider any of my offers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASanguineSpeech_000b121c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A rousing success, mortal! And it appears you joined in the festivities as "
"well. Good for you. You need to lighten up a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ChMania_000139ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A safer choice, perhaps. Maybe you'll live through this. Thadon's a bit lost "
"these days. Not that it's a bad thing. It suits him. Until now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00022b40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A secretive cult devoted to the Daedra Lord Mehrunes Dagon, the Prince of "
"Destruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061769_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A shame about Thadon. He lived life to its fullest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001da6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A shame he had to die. Before he turned, he was a fine man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RogueMage_0003020c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A she, you say? And she's dead? Well, Arielle and Roliand did what needed to "
"be done. No more innocent deaths. At least, for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A short stay in our lovely Imperial Prison should cool your enthusiasm for a "
"life of crime. The drunk tank in particular has a unique aroma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_00154cdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A shrine to Azura lies in the Jerall Mountains, far to the north, towards the "
"Skyrim border."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMShyDunmer_000090a2_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "A shy Dunmer? Could it be Ranaline that you are looking for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_mission_000356f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A simple mission, nothing more. You should be fine. Please, head downstairs, "
"and I'll brief you further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A sincere welcome to you. May you be forever blessed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ02Skooma_00189180_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A small group of Skooma dealers led by a Dunmer named Kylius Lonavo is holed "
"up in the Greyland Settlement just up the road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleswellTopic_00030037_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A small settlement to the west of here, on the other side of the Silver Road "
"to Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000459b3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A small token of your appreciation might clear this up, or perhaps it's "
"better if we leave at this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBowMagic_0001f3d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A smart girl always keeps herself well out of harm's way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_vampirehunters_000039bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A smelly lot, if you ask me, but their gold is as good as anyone else's. We "
"can wipe down the rooms afterwards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bd98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A smith, book shop, and general trader are west of the river, near the west "
"gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b31e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A splash of blue here... a dab of green there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042da7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A stranger in the Isles is interesting news. Perhaps this stranger has "
"interesting things...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KSharraProphecy_00026b0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A stranger who knows about the K'Sharra Prophecy? It is one of our many "
"prophecies. You should speak with Ri'Bassa, our shaman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee41_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"A street scavenger made off with a ring that the widow Ahdarji values highly. "
"She is offering a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A string of thefts should do the trick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A strong post to sharpen my claws. That's what is needed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ad3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A sweetroll? But, of course, Salmo is famous for his sweetrolls! One taste, "
"and you are in heaven... on top of the world, yes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon2_00028d2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A sword isn't the worst thing in the world. Too bad you don't have one! Come "
"back when you have a weapon for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon2_00028d2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A sword would be wonderful. Unfortunately, it appears you don't have one. It "
"looks like you have a hammer, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon2_000288ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A sword, huh? Hmm... good enough for me. I'll split scalps instead of bash "
"skulls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon2_00028d2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A sword? You don't even have one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08NelsNevConvo_000852c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A tavern! Ha ha ha ha ha! Oh, I should have known! Leave it to a barbarian to "
"spend an entire chest full of gold on beer and mead. How pathetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b98_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A terrible crime. Everyone in the Chapel murdered! Who could have done such a "
"thing, and why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSMiscKotT_000c4540_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A thorn in our side is more like it! Those fools are nothing but a glorified "
"club. They've never contributed to anything useful, and never will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A thousand thanks to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Mission_0002af34_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A time I find most fascinating. The drawing on the bottom of the page I gave "
"you depicts a carved panel from the central chamber of the High Fane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A toast to Sheogorath! Order is no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A torch is lit. The light is lighted. Or lit. It's a Great Torch. Much better "
"than most."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_vampirehunters_00034469_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A troublesome lot. I expect you to deal with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002964_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A true Knight never forgets his faith, and so I pray to the Nine every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c15a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"A true marksman is only as good as his bow. When you have a good, solid Elven "
"bow, then I shall teach you what you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyDarkElf_0009f9bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A valiant effort, Dark Elf, but take comfort. Your spirit is mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002411d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A vampire! Away, everyone! Run!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00024128_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A vampire! Away, everyone! Run!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bed3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A victory beyond hope! You and Martin defeated Mehrunes Dagon in the very "
"moment of his triumph! All hail the Champion of Tamriel!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetQuest_00002af4_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A vision from the Divine Crusader himself is a powerful sign. You are truly "
"blessed by the gods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A visitor, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023fab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A visitor. What a treat. So go ahead. Whoever you are. They call me Orgnolf "
"Hairy-Legs. Because I got hairy legs. Am I going too fast for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000981ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"A waste of time, of course, worshipping gods in the first place. But at least "
"they're not raving lunatics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047683_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A wealthy gentleman in the Talos Plaza district named Umbacano collects "
"Ayleid artifacts. Perhaps he has use for someone like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f45e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A whole army restored, and still these Scalons run free. Must I do everything "
"myself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028559_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A whole city, just.... lost. How did we let this happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AcceptYield_00023996_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A wise choice, citizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9844_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A wise choice, indeed. You've never had a night's rest like this, I assure "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000be43e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A wise choice, perhaps, but you earned no respect for your cowardice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005dfcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A wise choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice9_00026b21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A wise choice. I have spilled too much blood already, and though I hunger for "
"more, spilling yours would not please me. Go now. Do not return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice1_0008fabc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A wizard did it. Stupid layabout mage. Had a theory about each of us having a "
"Manic and Demented side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AXedilian_00018df4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A wonder of engineering, is it not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A word of advice here. You've made a bad deal. This Umbra -- bad business. "
"Things always end badly where that one's concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008c215_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "A worthy foe, at last!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene05Positive_00015264_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"A-again you have surprised me with your knowledge of our operation. I suspect "
"Lynch didn't check all the inn rooms before we departed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b47d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "ABOVE HERE ARE GREETINGS THAT CAN LINK TO OTHER GREETINGS"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002b7ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "ABOVE HERE ARE RESPONSES TO LOW DISPOSITION GOODBYES"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM02ImperialMaleVoice_00002A2E_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Aaaaaaargh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Murder_0009ea7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aaah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10UmarilVoiceSky_00002ccc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Abagaianye Ehlnadaya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Abhor the ugly Baliwog and its entire kin alike. The best place for this "
"horrid thing is upon a pointed pike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e132_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Abhor the ugly Baliwog and its entire kin alike. The best place for this "
"horrid thing is upon a pointed pike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_000280a1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"About thirty years back, there was some trouble out there.  Bad trouble.  "
"Legion had to be called in, people killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "About time someone showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "About time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "About time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00031c82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"About two days ago, Count Indarys's son, Farwil, entered the Oblivion Gate "
"with six other men. We haven't heard from them since then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_00029693_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Absolutely not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_0002b15e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Absolutely not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_0002b16b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Absolutely not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002420d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b152_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b15b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_0003abf9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Accept these robes, and wear them with pride."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_00083f4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"According to Miss Herrick, Ma'zaddha has been pressuring her. He would be our "
"next target, if you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e92c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"According to my research from the tome, I'll need at least 20 more Nirnroot "
"to make the next magnitude of Elixir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LifttheCurse_00003a62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"According to the diary entry, it seems that I'm the only one who can open the "
"secret door in the manor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BattlePlans_000276a9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"According to the plans you captured from those spies, they need three lesser "
"Gates open before they can open a Great Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_avmolaganyammis_00054020_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"According to this, it translates to \"From Fire, Life.\" Fire it is, then. "
"Anything else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053770_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Acquire a taste for rat stew while you were in there? Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Actually, Captain, President, Vice-President, Secretary, Treasurer, and "
"Sergeant-at-Arms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c082_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Actually, I gave you this contract in the hope that whatever Roderick has is "
"contagious, and you'll die a slow, lingering death in a matter of days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c99e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Actually, I'm not much of a healer. I can blow the meat off you, but I'm not "
"much good at sticking it back on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_000253dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Actually, Lucien did not try to recruit me. Not at first. He tried to kill "
"me. My father wanted me dead, and he hired the Dark Brotherhood to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GenericBanditB_000a333a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Actually, that's the way this one prefers it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ac1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Actually, underground goblin lairs are no more common here in the West Weald "
"than anywhere else in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090aa9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adamus Phillida has been a thorn in the Dark Brotherhood's side for far too "
"long. Kill the pig, so Sithis can enslave his soul for all eternity!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice1A_00035df3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Adamus Phillida has spent his entire career investigating the Dark "
"Brotherhood, interrupting our contracts, killing our family members!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adamus Phillida is dead! I could feel my heart swell with the Night Mother's "
"love the moment that Imperial pig issued his last breath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adamus Phillida is dead! I could feel my heart swell with the Night Mother's "
"love the moment that Imperial pig issued his last breath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00035dff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adamus Phillida will find no rest in retirement. No, his soul will endure a "
"kind of eternal suffering known only to those who have angered Sithis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SnakGraBuraResponse_0007be9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Add some onion and... wait. I almost walked into that one. No, of course not. "
"That would be wrong. You shouldn't eat horses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan2_00018c87_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Additionally, our forces are dangerously thin. We have no idea what "
"opposition may await us inside. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan2_00018c86_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Additionally, our forces are dangerously thin. We have no idea what "
"opposition may await us inside. A frontal assault is not an option."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhoAreYou_00016811_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adeo sent me as a messenger to find you. Pinnacle Rock is under attack, and "
"she needs your assistance at once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000473f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adrienne Berene is the person you're looking for. I'm sure she'll be more "
"than happy to help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adrienne can make you a member of the guild, if you can convince her to take "
"her nose out of whatever book she's reading."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000473f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adrienne is in charge. You'll need to speak to her about it, if you can tear "
"her away from her latest book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006261c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adrienne may read too much, but you should see the Summon spell she taught "
"Vigge. He might teach you, if you're skilled enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01AdrienneConv_0002d905_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Adrienne, I'm back! I was rescued!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MankarSpeech_0001fb37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Advance, initiate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000607d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Adventurers are always causing problems. Good thing the Gatekeeper takes care "
"of most of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00042db1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Adventurers are always causing trouble around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004351e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Adventurers are being sucked up by that Xedilian place again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006139f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Aerin's a very gifted acrobat, and could teach you anything you needed to "
"know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally02Tactic3_00017d61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Affirmative. None shall break the line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally02Tactic3_000181d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Affirmative. None shall break the line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally02Tactic1_00017d57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Affirmative. They will fall before my arrows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally02Tactic1_000181d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Affirmative. They will fall before my arrows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally02Tactic2_00017d5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Affirmative. They will fall before my sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally02Tactic2_000181d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Affirmative. They will fall before my sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathChoice2_00026b5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Afraid He might mess up that pretty face? Good thinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_disappearances_0000be73_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Afraid to say, I don't have any more contracts for you. I don't think Azzan "
"has any, either. You did pretty good work, meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_disappearances_0000be74_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Afraid to say, I don't have any more contracts for you. Maybe Azzan has some, "
"but I don't know. You did pretty good work, meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002acb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After Berich betrayed us, Sir Ralvas journeyed to the Chapel of Leyawiin to "
"attempt Zenithar's test of faith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_0007eb5e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"After I shape them into the Staff, you must take it to the seat of power in "
"the Shivering Isles -- the Palace of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da53_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After I'm through with you, I'll find Roland and finish what I started. I "
"knew hiring you was a mistake, but I had to keep up appearances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRoutine_000167df_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"After a bit of reading in the garden and running my special errand at noon, I "
"like to shop at Books of Bliss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00023cd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After a long day up at the castle, it's refreshing to spend a time with "
"someone as charming and thoughtful as you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD04Choice3_0002c5bf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After a mission in Black Marsh, they set up shop in Leyawiin. More ruthless "
"than ever. It needs investigating. First, though, you need advancement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251ef_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After a person performs the ritual, they are contacted by a Speaker. Gold is "
"exchanged, and the details worked out. So it has always been."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031523_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"After a while, I decided to go into the dining area just off the Great Hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06TellKellenLie_00002b8b_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After all this time, I can't help but hope just a little bit. Hope that "
"somehow there might be a way to save myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice5A_00022bd7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"After all, he has ruled over Skingrad for quite some time without incident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MartinC_00037830_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "After all, this is my destiny. No man can deny his destiny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After examining it for a bit I noticed a small word carved on it in runes. "
"Using a book from my library, I translated it. The word was nonsense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03ATellMeMore_00018df7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After only a few years passed, the Grummites began moving in. Ghastly things!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_0008e338_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After overhearing Ma'zaddha and Nelrene, I'd say you have quite a card to "
"play the next time you speak with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002953_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After seeing your bravery first hand in Leyawiin, I'd like to join you as one "
"of the Knights of the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingAbout_00002abc_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After serving two tours patrolling Stros M'Kai, I left the service for a life "
"devoted to Zenithar, inspired by my parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c339_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After speaking to the Count and reviewing your testimony, we decided to "
"reduce Llevana's sentence as she was acting for self-preservation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c34a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After speaking to the Count, and in light of the evidence you recovered, "
"Ulrich has been removed from his post and arrested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"After that last match, this one should feel like a vacation. One Khajiit in a "
"Heavy Raiment, probably with a sword. Nothin' you can't handle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031524_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "After that, I spent the rest of the night in my quarters... reading."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRoutine_000167df_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"After that, we dance, we sing, or we do whatever else suits my lord's tastes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2C_0004cad1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"After that, you must flee from Chorrol, and Hides-His-Heart must not be "
"killed! That way he can go back and tell his employers I'm dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09ArmorTopic_00026d5f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"After the Battle of Sancre Tor, Tiber Septim gave his armor to the Blades in "
"honor of our role in his victory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a83_Knights_RESP9"
msgid ""
"After the fall of White Gold Tower, his friend Morihaus the Indomitable found "
"Pelinal's still-living head, kept alive in torment by Ayleid magicks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06MentionBook_000153b6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"After the first time Theranis was taken by the Pale Lady, he knew he was "
"going to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"After we exchanged words, I followed them out to a farmhouse. Inside, they "
"asked me to remove my clothes and items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022f18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "After you read the book, I'll help in any way that I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e076_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Afternoon, ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e077_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Afternoon, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003aa96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Afternoon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Again the Resonator draws men near. Screw 'em! I drink to their health. "
"Healths. Whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Again the Resonator pulls men to it. But cats? No! Why? It should draw them "
"far from here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000167db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Again we cross paths."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Again we meet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoIntro3_0008245f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Again with the niggling little details! Hold your tongue. Or I will. We'll "
"get to that, all in due time. For now, you've got other work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0003b1e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Again! Hit me again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e919_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Again, I thank you for doing my field work. I look forward to getting more "
"Nirnroot from you. And yes, in 24 hours, I'll have the Elixir ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13SignetNo_000335ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Again, I thank you on behalf of all the citizens of Cheydinhal. May Arkay "
"guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Again, I thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MehrunesDagonTopic_0006bedb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Against all hope, Martin cast him back into Oblivion! He will not trouble our "
"world for long years to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_00085712_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Against all hope, you returned from Camoran's Paradise with the Amulet of "
"Kings! We now have a chance to turn back Dagon's invasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002db95_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Agata has heard the voices, though I speak for them all. It is to her you "
"must now go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AgataTopic_0003395e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Agata is the first person I go to when I need something. Maybe I should talk "
"to Dagail instead, but I just don't feel comfortable doing that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03LewinChamberOneGrow01_00066e3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Agggh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0003b1e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aggh! Again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c456c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aggh! I hate these disgusting Arena matches! I'm here looking for my husband, "
"Roderick! If he loses any more of our money he's a dead man..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Yield_0002da1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aggh! Not yet! You must wait until Hides-His-Heart gets here! You must cut me "
"with the knife in his presence, so he thinks you've killed me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0018bd6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aggh! Sithis save me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028166_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aggh! They're dead! All dead! And you... you're the only one left. It's you! "
"Oh, gracious, no! Stay away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028167_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aggh! They're dead! All of them, dead! Why? What's going on here? We need to "
"get out of this place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Yield_0002d395_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aggh! What are you doing? No, no... you must use the POISONED blade!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0003b1e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aggh! Yes, strike me down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MurderNoCrime_00066335_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Agghhh! Whhhhyyyyy.... ??"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025272_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Agh! Go away! Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00073008_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Agh! No! I can't take much more of this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008ef6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Agh! Now it's my turn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008ef76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Agh! They're getting the best of me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MurderNoCrime_0006633a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aghh! Noooooo...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Agronak gro-Malog is the best fighter ever to step into an Arena. He can't be "
"beaten! Not by you! But if you want to fight him, that's your right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Agronak gro-Malog is the best fighter ever to step into an Arena. He can't be "
"beaten! Not by you! But if you want to fight him, that's your right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007b479_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Agronak is good, yeah. Too good. He says he's only half Orc. What I want to "
"know is, what's the other half? Cause it sure ain't human..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RulesOfCompetition_00038b37_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Agronak will be wearing his Raiment of Valor, and he's probably got it "
"heavily enchanted, so feel free to do the same to any armor you have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice5a_00082097_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah ah ah... There is no turning back, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Catch_0006d604_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Ah well, it's been a good life I suppose...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Choice1B_000280bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah well, never mind then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018afdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah well, perhaps you can return to help another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028cde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah yes, Dovesi Dran. She's a Dark Elf, originally from Morrowind, or so I "
"hear. I get the sense she doesn't like me very much. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadon_00016ea8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah yes, and what of our Duke of Mania?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000343e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah yes, the Mythic Dawn scholar. What else can I help you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028b7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah yes, the sixth guest. I'm Neville. It's nice to make your acquaintance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice1A_0002f880_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Ah yes, there is one more thing. The Imperial City is also home to an "
"Imperial Legion captain named Adamus Phillida. Do you know who that is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaA_00022b41_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ah yes. \"Commentaries on the Mysterium Xarxes,\" wonderful! You have a "
"scholarly interest in daedric cults, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b18_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah yes. The Gauntlets have been here for ages. I know only the basic story "
"behind them; they're more of a novelty these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003357f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah! Cheydinhal... it's good to see its walls again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice2A_0004f229_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah! How brave of you, to walk the roads with all of the recent trouble!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity1_00043417_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ah! How deliciously odd! I've never seen a Blind Watcher's Eye before. It "
"will have a place of honor in the Museum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC1_000a6582_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah! Magnificent! This is my greatest prize yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SERunsInCirclesGreetC_0004120a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah! My favorite! You're a good friend, you know that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e82_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ah! No, I've got it. You're going to find the fellow trading on my name. Good "
"show - carry on. *hic*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueShow_00085991_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah! One of the Ten Ancestors! Hold it up to the light ... yes! Exquisite! You "
"did the right thing by bringing this to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah! Our newest member."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11WhatNow_00022e1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah! Still thinking about your reward, eh? I have not forgotten you or your "
"loyal service to the Thieves Guild. You'll just have to trust me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02GiveItem_000165f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah! The Gray Fox will be very pleased. We will make sure this gets back to "
"the people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e963_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah! The classic fire trap. Always a favorite, especially in the colder months."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004cfac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah! The triumphant Associate returns!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06StelaGreetA1_00018f92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah! You are just in time. Go quickly. The Aureals may attack at any moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018baa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah! You must be the Arcane University's newest addition! This humble "
"Battlemage bids you welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, Assassin, I must speak with you. It is quite urgent. A sealed letter just "
"arrived from a Dark Brotherhood courier.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactA_00026d6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, Azura's Star .. as beautiful as all the tales tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, Chorrol. Easy access to all the other cities of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirBeginChoice1_000805ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, I do appreciate an assertive leader. I look forward to working with you "
"on this assignment. Lead the way, Grand Inquisitor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3A_00022ba2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, I find your etiquette refreshing. Now please, listen carefully. On the "
"Green Road to the north of Bravil lies the Inn of Ill Omen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040361_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see you've been successful in the Fringe. How can I assist you, Your "
"Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002ae09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, I sense a gambling man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002ae0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, I sense a woman of chance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00061c3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, I'm glad you came. So, are you interested in earning some loot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4529_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, I'm sure you've come to pay homage to the greatest fighting force to "
"grace the lands of Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA1_00012cca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, Mirel's beloved surprise attack. A perfect example of why males do not "
"hold command positions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47MageShopTalk_00030132_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, a fellow mage! Please excuse my rudeness earlier. I find most people "
"extremely tedious. Completely ignorant of the arcane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_0002b525_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, a second Ancestor. Excellent. I had wondered whether the first was just "
"luck, but I see now that you have some skill at this work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000411fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, a stranger in town. But as I always say, a stranger is just a friend I "
"haven't met yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasPhintiasA_00022b52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, about that. You see ... I don't have it any more. Terribly sorry. A full "
"refund, of course..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk5_0003405b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, all right then. I guess I should get back to my duties. I should be "
"around later. We'll talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a999_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, another happy spectator! You of course want to bet on a fight! Who will "
"it be this time, the Blue Team or the Yellow Team?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b359_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ah, but I believe I owe you something, eh? Here, let me show you these moves. "
"Step like this... Now strike.... All right, now parry... That's it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Ah, but more to the point, it appears to me that the first words of each "
"paragraph may be significant. A message may be hidden there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034861_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, child. I thank you for helping me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, dear friend, may I steal a moment of your time? I have a rather delicate "
"situation I was hoping you could help me with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028a04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, don't let the name fool you. I had a bit too much mead a few years back, "
"and there was this tavern wench.... Anyway, just call me Nels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice1A_0001e666_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, excellent! I knew you were the gambling type! Well, you can bet on the "
"Yellow Team or the Blue Team."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodgrassTopic_00053737_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, excellent. I hope getting it wasn't too much trouble for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08BribeBeggar_00015f1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, fresh bread tonight! The Moth Priests live in the Imperial Palace. I "
"don't know exactly what they do. Something to do with the Elder Scrolls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002527f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, greetings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, greetings. I have been waiting for you. As Vicente surely told you, your "
"time working with him has come to an end.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035597_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, have you reconsidered my offer? Do you wish to eliminate that treasonous "
"Shadowscale for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12Talk_0007be92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, here you are! I have good news, of a sort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002526a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, here you are. So good to finally meet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, how quaint. How do you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040364_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, is Your Grace having difficulty with his choices?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas1_00002c46_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, it was a terrible fight. Many an Auroran fell beneath my blade that day. "
"But the Crusader -- he clove through their ranks like a scythe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07BeggarPay_00020093_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's coming back to me now. Yeah, seems I saw someone looking out the "
"window at Jearl's house the other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006fdc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's good to see you, citizen! Oh yes, I know who you are. You've become "
"something of a legend in these parts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadCarodus1_00002cf7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's nothing... I was thinking of Sir Carodus, actually. He was such a "
"fine knight... how can he be dead? How could the gods let that happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_0001ceec_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Ah, it's times like this I enjoy what I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b730_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, it's you! You're the one... err... who are you again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003431_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, it's you. I figured you'd be by soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003013c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ah, me... Friend, you are welcome at the Aleswell Inn anytime. Free of charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice1_0004ce45_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ah, most excellent! Here is what you must do. Simply go to sleep here in the "
"Sanctuary, at any time, and I will visit you as you slumber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d7e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, my dear friend. It is so good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00050a9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, my favorite patron! Anything Odd to show me? Ha ha ha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00061568_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, my savior. Back again for a visit are we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c0a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, now this is the type of contract I live for! You must become pure shadow. "
"It's as if you were never there, and then Roderick simply... dies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasPhintiasA_00022b51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, of course. Here you go. Keep us in mind for any future needs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Reward_0001dc32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, of course. The gold. Here. But there is someone else I need you to "
"investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, of course. You're going to succeed where three previous family members "
"have failed. How silly of me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09Choice1A_00035e06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, one of you again, eh? You Dark Brotherhood types are all the same. All "
"sneak and no swing! You'll meet the same fate as the others! En garde!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017c2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, our newest pickpocket."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008118e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, returned from the Fringe I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, sir knight! I was hoping we could discuss a rather important matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d393_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, so Motierre has escaped? Well done! As payment, I am pleased to award you "
"this amulet, Cruelty's Heart, as well as another advancement in rank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, so it's Bloodletter now, is it? I remember when I achieved that rank, so "
"very long ago. I showed such promise... unlike yourself. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1C_00090791_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, so you choose to play the stoic, hmm? You remain silent even when faced "
"with my terrible countenance? Your silent obedience is to be commended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034895_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, so you infiltrated Fort Sutch, remained undetected, and replaced the "
"medicine with the poison I provided. You are truly a master of shadow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a8fd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ah, so you're an Arena combatant! It's always good to meet a fellow warrior, "
"especially one who isn't here just to kill the Grand Champion! Ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b21_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, so you've heard of it, have you? Terrible curse, been in the family "
"almost longer than anyone can remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, so you've returned. Come at last to challenge me for my Grand Champion "
"title?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c4ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, sorry friend, but it would appear the opponent you bet on lost that last "
"fight. Better luck next time!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c4eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, sorry friend, but it would appear the opponent you bet on lost that last "
"fight. Better luck next time!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000921_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Ah, sorry, I have no idea what time it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, summoned again. My Lord does so enjoy that, as is His prerogative. I'll "
"assume you're done for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062445_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, ten Welkynd Stones. Most useful for my research. Thank you. And now, I am "
"at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e653_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, the Flame of Agnon shines again! Soon the Great Torch will flare with the "
"pure light of Dementia!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002ee99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, the Gray Mare! Chorrol's finest repository of wine, women and song!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ee2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, the Gray Mare! From here I will be able to arrange for transportation out "
"of Cyrodiil! You have served me well, assassin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreatTorchTopic_000910a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, the Great Torch. It is a symbol of Sheogorath's power and a source of "
"great comfort for the citizens of New Sheoth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, the Madgod's pet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactC_00038faf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, the Masque of Clavicus Vile. You are wise not to let yourself get further "
"enmeshed in his plots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000a251_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, the Prowler approaches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000034a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, the Thieves Guild's new favorite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_00028741_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, the comely Argonian lass.  You may have met her if you've ever been in "
"her mother's shop, Northern Goods and Trade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e95f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, the ghost effect; an excellent demonstration of Xedilian's true power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000301d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, the savior of Aleswell! Whatever you need, I'm at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21Special_0002b45d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, the treasure hunter. Please, have a seat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00181c29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, there you are! It's good to see you again! No, really, I mean it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00092d79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, there you are! Look... I've been thinking, and... Well... I guess I just "
"want to say I'm sorry for the way I've treated you in the past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a78c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, there you are. It seems that we have a... bit of a problem. It's the Font "
"of Madness... no doubt you were on your way there just now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018d7da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, there you are. We need to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gift_0018bc33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, these look lovely. I'm sure she'll like them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009554b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, very good, Sire. your predecessor left everything in place for the final "
"sign. You'll want to head to the center of town. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095593_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, very good. Your predecessor left everything in place for the final sign. "
"You'll want to head to the center of town. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008673b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, we meet again. No hard feelings, I hope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk5_00034058_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, well, I'd love to continue chatting, but I have to prepare for my next "
"contract. You know... that Mages Guild matter. You understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingDavid01_00038ae2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, well, in all honesty, no. But our wines are very good. And much cheaper "
"than Tamika's very fine product, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_00037b51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, well, thank you! The honor is mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013452_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Ah, well. All over now. The Chalice helps, doesn't it? Indeed it does, and I "
"could use some helping right now. I'll just take that back from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c67c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I shall be most pleased to return this to its rightful owner. "
"Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_000224ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work translating it. "
"I'll need some time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_00028c03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work translating it. "
"I'll need some time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyA_0000c529_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyB_0000c52b_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyC_0000c52d_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyD_0000c52f_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyE_0000c531_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyF_0000c533_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyG_0000c535_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyH_0000c537_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'll just take this from you, and get to work. I'll need some "
"time with this; come and find me tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gift_0018bc30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, wonderful! I'm sure they'll make her happy. It's the least I can do; "
"she's brought so much joy into my life, whether she knows it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40MelisandeIhavethem_0005373b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, wonderful! These will be most useful to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Ah, yes! Now I remember!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_000355a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, yes! This is a big step for you, friend. Whether you know it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18NightConvo_000096e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes, I have been expecting you. The Listener now kneels by Sithis, as "
"does his successor. There is a traitor amongst you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk3_0006a858_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes, that was quite a situation I got myself into. But I have to admit, I "
"had quite a bit of fun cleaning up my own mess! He he he he."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, yes. A guild brother in search of a fence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG00MysteriousNoteTopic_00035653_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. Another scoundrel who served time in an imperial jail. The Gray Fox "
"is offering you a chance to join the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000aef8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. Arch-Mage Traven was quite fond of making potions in his spare time. "
"So much so, in fact, that it became difficult for me to meet his needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirGauntlets_00002b24_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. As proof of the deed, when I struck the poor man the Gauntlets "
"slipped right off my hands and fell to the floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07Spies_00020075_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. I hope you can help. The gate guards have reported seeing strangers "
"on the road for the past several nights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002db97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. I'm afraid I'm unable to issue a recommendation. Only Dagail can do "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_0005e085_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, yes. Let's see if we can't recharge some items for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b461_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, yes. My treasure-hunting friend. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Message_0018bc5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, yes. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45ForkTopic_00083f61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. The Fork of Horripilation. I have heard rumors about it. It appears "
"that Lord Sheogorath has returned it to the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_00023ff2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. This is indeed the correct book. You've not been able to open it, I "
"presume? Then all is well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_00023ff5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. This is indeed the correct book. You've not been able to open it, I "
"presume? Then all is well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice2A_000300a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. Thought so. We get many of them traveling through here. Well, we "
"used to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022498_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. You are a Guild Mage, are you not? Yet, different from the others. "
"Yes, yes -- this is good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000167e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you again! A pleasure, I'm sure. No time for chatter now; I have a few "
"important things to attend to, or did I? Ah well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00070403_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you again. Have you seen any of Ma'zaddha's things? A shiny spoon, or a "
"broken bottle? I can't find them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkGiftTopic_0004ce46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you are interested, then? Shall I pass along the terrible power of my "
"Dark Gift? Do you wish to become a vampire?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003455_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, you are the new thief. I am your new Doyen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you came. You're sure you weren't followed? Good, I thought I could trust "
"you. Nobody else in town. They're all in on it ... all watching me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00053872_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you have arrived. Come now, we must speak. The Black Hand has need of "
"your... talents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillBodyParts_00081daa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you have been asked to choose the pieces with which to construct the new "
"Gatekeeper. Quite an honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003925_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you must be from the Fighters Guild. Excellent! I'm looking forward to "
"our investigation. Fascinating subject, these Daedra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b604_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, you're back. I told Jauffre not to worry. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016cfd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you're back. You may have noticed that we have a... bit of a problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e654_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, you're the one who lit the Great Torch for us. Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_heirloom_00002e5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, you've got it! Thank the gods! Finally, my mead will stay cold and won't "
"taste like goblin piss. Take these, and my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillFringe_00040368_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah, your task is completed. Wonderful. Our Lord Sheogorath may wish to hear "
"of your success. Perhaps you should tell Him yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RebuildRequest_0001356d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah, your tone is more in line with my station. Please, continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah-Malz at the Fighters Guild has gotten to be an expert on goblin hunting. "
"He just hates the things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038aba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah-Malz of the Fighters Guild. Welcome to Skingrad County. Come hunting "
"goblins, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06JauffreB_0008b617_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah. Good. You should take that to Martin right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10JaksDiarySays_00015313_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah. It seems you have stumbled over a bit of history that few in the Thieves "
"Guild ever discover. I am not the first Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah. S'krivva hears of you. Welcome, and well-fare in your craft and trade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AuthorityMyOwn_0001356b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah. That confirms it. You're the new Duke. The stink of hubris surrounds you! "
"My Lord allows you to lick his boot straps, does he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c099d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah. You must be the one I got the message about. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RobeConv03_0005508c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... I see you well, my friend. With all the new recruits, it is hard to be "
"certain who is who."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SENewSheothTOPIC_00078cab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... New Sheoth. My home away from places that aren't my home. The current "
"location is much better than some of the prior ones. Don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon1_00028880_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... a hammer. Well, it seems you don't have one. However I see that you "
"have a longsword...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon1_00028881_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... a hammer. Well. Not my first choice, but it will suffice. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... an excellent read, though it's been a while since I've read it myself. "
"Let me know how you like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASanguineSpeech_000b1232_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... another mortal come to beg Sanguine to add a bit of spice to an "
"otherwise drab existence. I would have you perform a service for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... our Lord has granted you the power to summon me. How wonderful for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... pure magic. Research. Knowledge. That's why I love the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... you are from the Fighters Guild, I resume. Good show. I am Lord "
"Rugdumph gro-Shurgak. Let us conversate on the Lady Rogbut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... you must be from the Fighters Guild. Good. I have a problem. It has to "
"do with the rats in my basement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImpGallTOPIC_0002ee63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ah... you've got it. Looks fresh, too! I realize that you'll be paid by your "
"superior, but take this as well. It might come in handy in your work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bcd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah... you've returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006d17d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ah...you're here. Joy. You'll want to speak to the Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000837e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aha! There you are. Took you long enough to get here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ahdarji trains, yes. Light Armor is the skill. Ahdarji must work very hard, "
"now she is all alone in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AmuseisPlot_00009332_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ahdarji uses ring much more wisely. I use it to collect and sell information. "
"That ring can be used to read private messages the Count writes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000039bd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ahem. Citizen of... Skingrad. Please be advised that I am here on official "
"business, and wish no harm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadonDeathSpeech02_0007b37a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahem. The lady fair, our love is told. With hair as fine as soft-spun gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000131d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahh yes, THERE you are! You couldn't imagine how long I've been waiting for "
"you. So little to do, and so much time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00023799_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00061c86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahh! You burn with the purging Fire of Agnon, the flame of Truth, the "
"flickering beacon of hope in the gloom of despond!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a84b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahh, magister. I just remembered, there's something I'd like to discuss with "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033583_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahh... help at last."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ce95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahh... much better. You repulse me now, at least to a degree. Others should "
"find you foul, disgusting. Namira may be pleased. Approach the shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_0000392a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahh... you've found it! I can't thank you enough. Your work is greatly "
"appreciated. Here, take these. I wish I could give you more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028886_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahh... you've got the weapons. Let's talk about that weapons shipment you "
"brought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscScreamingInPain_00046f68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahhh! Eeeyah! No, no, nooo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahhh! You have returned from your investigation, and I am eager to hear the "
"results."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscScreamingInPain_00046f67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahhh!! No! No! Make it stop, make it stop! Aaayiiee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesM02_00013a67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahhh, but it was. As the bacchanal reached a crescendo, the people began to "
"clutch their chests as their very hearts exploded!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013ff9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahhh, good to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038431_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahhh, you mean that vampire hunter. He's staying over at Olav's Tap and Tack. "
"It's near the city gates; you can't miss it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009407f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahhh. So good to be back home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00094ebd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahhh... Rosentia will be so pleased!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahhh...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082601_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ahjazda in Crucible believes the world is ending."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahjazda in Crucible believes the world is ending. She seeks all sorts of "
"items to weather the storm portending."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082602_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ahjazda thinks the world is ending tomorrow. She's been saving magic items "
"just in case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b830_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Akatosh and the Dragon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Corpse_0018d818_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Akatosh bless you and keep you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a36_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Akatosh endures!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Akatosh speaks to us all, but we never listen. Go to the Temple of the One. "
"Read the Covenants. Praise the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_lightthedragonfires_000223e4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Akatosh, the Supreme God of Time, gave the Amulet of Kings to St. Alessia, "
"the first emperor, as a god-certain test of the true heir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyWoodElf_0009f9c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alas for the honor of Valenwood, the Wood Elf has fallen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alas that my old comrade is not among us here. We do not know why his spirit "
"did not join us here to guard our last Relic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alas that the evil begun on the day of my death should have struck so deep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceRequest_0001356f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Alas, I am still distraught over the destruction of my sweet child. I cannot "
"return to his womb. You must do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a80_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Alas, Umaril was not truly slain, but only cast beyond the bounds of Nirn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyOrc_0009f9c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alas, poor Orc. This was not your finest hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d23f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Alas, we are but 3 old men, not able to match the fighting prowess of the "
"vampire. We lack the strength to defeat them in battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreetB1_0003e6bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alas, we cannot light the Flame until we take control of the Altar of Despair "
"from the infernal Mazken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofDespairTopic_0007ff5f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Alas, we have not seen the Altar of Despair for many years. It is in the "
"underground part of Cylarne, which is controlled by the Mazken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06FlameAgnon_000131ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Alas, we hold only the Altar of Rapture. The treacherous Mazken hold the "
"Altar of Despair. We must control both to light the Flame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartB1_00002c86_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alas. Umaril cannot be stopped. Not without the aid of the gods. Not without "
"the Crusader's Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aldos is living on the street now that his house has been seized. I begged "
"Ulrich to give him more time, but he wouldn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10LlevanaTalk_0003c374_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aldos was a drunkard and a fool. He decided to draw a blade and attack a "
"guard, so he paid the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aldos will be mourned. I won't sit by and watch the innocent being driven to "
"the brink like that. Something must be done, but without bloodshed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c35c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aldos's death is indeed a tragedy. We'll do what we can to put his soul at "
"ease."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AxeofDragol_0001fdb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aleron never mentioned it to me before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000907a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aleron... my sweet husband..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alessia Caro visits her mother in Chorrol regularly. A dutiful daughter... "
"and a dutiful wife, I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechAmulet_00002d20_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alessia! Reman! Talos! They cry for blood akin to theirs to rekindle the "
"dragonpact! Citizens, take to your knives!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alessia, hear our prayer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046610_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alga has a lot of good tales to tell. I wish I could tell a story like she "
"does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046609_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alga sure can tell a good story. I'm not normally a big fan of bard's tales, "
"but she's got some good ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00045c78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alive and kicking, are you? Welcome back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb1f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All I ask in return is to keep the Brush's existence secret. If word gets "
"around that I have it, I'm afraid more than a lone cutpurse will visit me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestQuestion_00002a54_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All I can do is direct you to the Grove of Trials, and remind you to heed "
"Kynareth's teachings: fear and respect Nature and all Her Creations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053722_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All I can promise is that you'll be making a lot of money. Are you in, or are "
"you out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f51_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All I can say for sure is that it reacts to magic. Badly, most of the time. "
"Several mages were hurt attempting to cast spells at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ASyl_00013a68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I can tell you is Syl is rarely seen in public, and her staff takes care "
"of the day-to-day activities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d307_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I can tell you is that the best place to start is at The Flowing Bowl. "
"It's a tavern located outside the city walls near the waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorInfo_00083976_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I care about is where the vampires are hiding. I know they're here "
"somewhere... You know where they're holed up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorInfo_JAWS9371_01_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I care about is where the vampires are hiding. I know they're here "
"somewhere... You know where they're holed up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All I did was fall down, sure. Maybe even vomited on the floor of the tavern. "
"Charge me six times, Ulrich... charge me you fetcher??!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_000253d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I heard is that she's looking for some sort of book. You'll have to talk "
"to her if you want to know more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e06b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I heard was that it was important to Dagail, and it was missing. Kalthar "
"didn't tell me anything more than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d92d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"All I know about them is that they're found in the many fort ruins scattered "
"all over Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice1_0002c5bb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All I know for sure is that they'll accept any contract, and they'll do "
"anything to complete it. And they don't care who gets in the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Brothers_00084a9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I know is that travelling merchants found me in the wilderness by the "
"body of my mother. I was raised by the monks at Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089618_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All I know is that word has gotten around about Anya Herrick. She looks more "
"nervous than normal lately. People think she might be up to something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwaterBrigands_0000c1dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I know is there seems to be four of them. They blindfolded me before they "
"put me in here, so I didn't see much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I need is a roof, some bread, and blessings of the Nine. Bruma is Gods' "
"country, and the Gods are good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All I needed was that right pauldron, and my set would have been complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba5e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All I want is for her to care about me, to feel the same way as I do about "
"her. But she doesn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b582_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All I wanted was a hug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00035dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All Thieves Guild members have sworn loyalty to him. If there is such a thing "
"as a guildmaster, he's it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JanusHassildorTopic_00003998_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All appointments to see the Count must be made through Hal-Luirz"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JanusHassildorTopic_000039a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All appointments to see the Count must go through Mercator Hosidus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029e2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "All are welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreatWelkyndStoneTopic_00027100_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All but one. The Great Stone of Miscarcand is reputed still to shine in the "
"deep darkness of its ruined halls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ae78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All citizens are welcome in the Imperial Palace, at least on the first two "
"floors. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003dfc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All day long, stories about severed heads and lopped off limbs. I can do "
"without it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All day, every day, I work them. And for what? For Cindanwe? You think I am "
"her servant, yes? If it weren't for her magic, things would change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000af068_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All else is put aside to celebrate of our deliverance from evil. Thanks to "
"Akatosh and his servant Martin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029cd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "All for the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MerchantTopic_0002ee50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All found dead along the same stretch of road. The only trait shared amongst "
"them is that each had previously stayed at the Brina Cross Inn nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00061ccd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All glory, mistress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000699fc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "All gone now, though. Just smoke and mud and rubble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025df2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All guild members have been instructed to deny you service, shelter, and "
"assistance. From now until your death, you do not exist in our eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018baa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All hail the Champion of Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000579bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All hail the Corrupter of Souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e65a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All hail the victor of Cylarne! All hail the Great Torch of Mania!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff13_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All he thinks about, all he cares about, is skooma! He was a fine young man "
"once. But he's lost everything. His looks, his money... his self-respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_000329f4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All he wants to do is please his father. I've known him since he was a lad, "
"and fighting to defend Cheydinhal is in his heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005c0bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All honor to the Ebony Blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005c0ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All honor to the Hide and the Wearer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005c0fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All honor to the Masque."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12RootDungeon_0001a378_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All is not well here. The Gnarls are disturbed. Order is spreading among "
"them, and thus into the Font. Find the Pools and stop the taint of Order!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018a954_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All manner of creatures infest Bramblepoint Cave, you must remain vigilant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005d505_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All mortals will come to him. He is the Harvester of Souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006039f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All my patrons keep disappearing! It's impossible to create important art "
"under these conditions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All my work on the Fringe... wasted. I'll have to begin my research all over "
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0fb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All of my attention is devoted to the Council. We must discern the reason for "
"this sudden attack, and stop Mannimarco before he destroys us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062619_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All of the local guild halls sell some amount of Alchemic ingredients, but "
"for the best stuff, you'll need to do some exploring on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000be32a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All of the other cities have sent aid! It's remarkable! I've never seen such "
"unity of purpose. Your leadership has made all the difference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All of you! Out! Now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_0009354c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0005323c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All of your recommendations have been approved, have they not? Then "
"everything appears to be in order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_00033fcc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All practitioners of daedric magic are familiar with the almost impenetrable "
"barrier between our world and Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05LexToMen_0000bf92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right men. We've been ordered back to our posts. I smell the dirty hand "
"of the Gray Fox behind this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right then, I guess I'd better start looking. That gold's not going to "
"find itself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right then, I'm listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, Brawler, this next match is going to be a challenge. Turns out "
"there are two Wood Elf sisters who always fight together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01SulinusConv_0002d91d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, Erthor. You're safe now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002f1ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, I admit it. I took it from her. I... I don't know what I was "
"thinking, honestly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_000302d3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All right, I think I can help with that. But you have to agree to do "
"something for me, first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, I'll be honest. I'm not quite sure what to think about Primo "
"anymore. My list of suspects is getting pretty damned small as it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061393_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "All right, I'll help you hone your technique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061397_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All right, I'll teach you what I know about Athletics. Maybe we can swap "
"stories about life on the road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017643_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, Myrmidon, time to stop messing around! You ready to teach those "
"Yellow Team scumbags a lesson, or what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089616_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, all right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04DrethConvo_00045f89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, all right. I'm tempted to let you out right now if you'll just "
"shut up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c07_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All right, all right. We can deal with this. You'll have to get it back, "
"that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00080d42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, all right... please, just stop. I don't know anything specific, "
"but Anya has been looking scared lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice1B_0000567b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, but don't tarry too long. Until we receive the Night Mother's "
"guidance, the Dark Brotherhood will remain in disarray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000620ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, but only because it's you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedNo_00037cfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, but you're missing out. It's a fine room, and to be honest, you "
"look like you could use some rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice2A_00027997_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, dearie, I understand. If you change your mind, just let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030207_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, it should be safe to speak here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0000c0d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, maggot. Looks like you're suited up in your Battle Raiment and all "
"set to go. The Red Room is just over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice3C_0002a9a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, my friend. You've got 100 gold down on the Blue Team. Good luck, "
"and enjoy the match! Oh, and if you win, come see me for your payout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice3C_0002a9a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, my friend. You've got 100 gold down on the Yellow Team. Good luck, "
"and enjoy the match! Oh, and if you win, come see me for your payout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice3A_0002a99d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, my friend. You've got 25 gold down on the Blue Team. Good luck, "
"and enjoy the match! Oh, and if you win, come see me for your payout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice3A_0002a99e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, my friend. You've got 25 gold down on the Yellow Team. Good luck, "
"and enjoy the match! Oh, and if you win, come see me for your payout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice3B_0002a9a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, my friend. You've got 50 gold down on the Blue Team. Good luck, "
"and enjoy the match! Oh, and if you win, come see me for your payout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice3B_0002a9a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, my friend. You've got 50 gold down on the Yellow Team. Good luck, "
"and enjoy the match! Oh, and if you win, come see me for your payout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028183_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, so I didn't care much for the man. That doesn't mean I wanted him "
"dead.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002826b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, so I didn't like Neville. But the man was a trained soldier. He "
"knew how to handle himself. Who could possibly have killed him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk3_0003404f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, so I may have gotten a bit careless. But the contract was "
"fulfilled, wasn't it? In the end, that's all that matters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice3A_00027990_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, that sounds like a fine idea! Oh, I just know you and I are going "
"to find that gold! I have a sense about these things, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice4C_00054038_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, that's it! You've gone and annoyed me, now! Have at thee! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice2A_0002a99b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, then, the Blue Team it is. How much do you want to bet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice2B_0002a99c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, then, the Yellow Team it is. How much do you want to bet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaSorry_000860c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, then. Just don't forget I'm a knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaYes_000860c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, then. Just don't forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightNoSir_000860c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, then. There's an Argonian named Weebam-Na in town. Go get him for "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_00037cfb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, then. You're all set. Remember, first door on your left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d283_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, then. You're now an Associate of the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091c4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right, this is it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right, this is it. Your last fight against the Yellow Team. I guess you "
"could say they saved the best for last. The three best, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornKnight01C_0000d439_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornKnight02C_00011eee_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornKnight03C_00011ef1_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornKnight04C_00011ef4_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornKnight05C_00011ef7_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedNo_0003b34a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONENTER_00062306_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07FinChoice1B_000275c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right. But don't take too long. The other guests are already assembled, "
"and they're waiting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrainerWeaponChoiceB_0000c00f_DLCBattlehornC"
"astle_RESP1"
msgid "All right. Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrainerWeaponChoiceC_0000c014_DLCBattlehornC"
"astle_RESP1"
msgid "All right. Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_00062302_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right. I get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000175b2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All right. I'll just take these from you. I'll need them for my report to the "
"Council."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095a84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right. I'm ready; keep your eyes peeled. They could come out at any "
"moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All right. It's up the stairs; the last door on your right. Sleep well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChoice1A_00029ca6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All right. It's your funeral. Welcome to the Arena, you filthy Pit Dog. "
"You're free to fight, so long as you know the rules of competition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c09_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"All right. No need to get angry, I suppose. It's a small problem, but one "
"that you can resolve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006fdac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All right. The pickpockets and pilferers ain't going to catch themselves. "
"We'd best be off. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingArmorerHazadir_0018d15f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "All right. You're not hopeless. You want training, I'll train you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11SheogorathFarewell3_00014b55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All shall crumble before Jyggalag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice3_00019cd0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All sources indicate that you will fail. It is a certainty. However, I also "
"predict that this will not stop you from trying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All that conjuring gives me the creeps. There are plenty of scary things in "
"this world without bringing more around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f7d1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "All that had come before - meaningless. Pointless frivolity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d0a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All that lives will die and all that is dead will live again. Arkay grants "
"you the will to reverse the cycle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091763_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All that remains is to watch the soon to be late Thadon eat his food and "
"smile with glee as his heart goes \"boom.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All that stuff about having to set trolls on fire is a bunch of hooey. They "
"don't like fire, but a good sword will cut them up fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086769_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All that work gone to waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000af063_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All the bards are busy composing songs about the battle! \"The Fall of "
"Dagon\" is my favorite so far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloatedFloat_00015713_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All the furnishings were built inside the ship since they were too big to be "
"carried on board. Spared no expense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082611_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All the merchants are tired of his thievery. Ask any of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14MoreBrush_0001bb34_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All the painter has to do is have the Brush in his possession, and whatever "
"he imagines appears in the canvas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorAttackResponse1_00002ba3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "All the priests, slaughtered. The whole Chapel desecrated!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005d502_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All things speak with the voice of life... even the bones of the earth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All this talk of torture has me thinking -- would it be possible to hold "
"someone in time during their most painful moment?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberOneGnarl03_00066e2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All this time it was merely an illusion, how clever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033580_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All this, and now Farwil is dead. Oblivion is truly cursed. Make sure you "
"take his signet ring to bring to the Count. He would want proof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0009101b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All those that enter the Realm are forever changed, but some believe it is "
"for the better. A good portion of them, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049939_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All three of them are nice folks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ae7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All visitors to the Imperial Palace are asked to keep their voices down, "
"especially if the Council is in session."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ThalfinWhatNow_000366f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All we can do is prepare for them to come out. Once they do, it'll be our "
"best chance to get the drop on them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All we want is work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06GiveBook_00015448_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All would be good if you had not killed to get it. The Thieves Guild has no "
"use for you until you pay the blood price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstructions_00018df9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"All you need to do is decide what becomes of the adventurers. Will you drive "
"them insane or will you pull the life from their bodies?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c7c_Oblivion_RESP8"
msgid ""
"All you need to do is visit the statue once a week, get the list of names and "
"locations, and pass it on to me here in the Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_00066a4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All your charging needs... for a very small charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Dreams_0002c6de_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"All your thoughts, your skills and your talents travel there with you. Think "
"of it as exploring a new land, but a land within your own mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006fdae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"All's quiet, eh? Times like this I think the thieves are all away on holiday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00068902_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "All's well, I hope, Jauffre?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000432b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Allow me to be your guide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003ecef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Allow me to check with the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d291_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Allow me to extend my congratulations on your daring victory over the evil "
"forces of Oblivion. I am at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001391c_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Allow me to extend my congratulations on your daring victory. I am at your "
"service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b36_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Allow me to fetch more suitable equipment. I shall return shortly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ab50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Jollring. I come on behalf of my "
"master, Umbacano."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007a023_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Allow me to serve you, my Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_00084b4a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Along with your new rank, please take this amulet. May it help keep you safe "
"in times of danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002f9ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aloys, Callia! He's cleared the goblins from Cropsford for us! It's safe for "
"us to build the settlement!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000cb552_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aloys, Callia! She's cleared the goblins from Cropsford for us! It's safe for "
"us to build the settlement!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b074_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Already I've heard that the Honorblade rests again in Castle Chorrol and the "
"Escutcheon of Chorrol you have is all the proof I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkooma_0008f605_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alright! It's about time. Give it to me already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdSpeech_00046303_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alright, boys. Listen up. We've got to close that Gate over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07BurdC_00038bc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alright. Anything I can do for you, just let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdA_0003a853_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alright. Give me a minute to talk to the men. Everyone's a bit jumpy right "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48IlendA1_001778cf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Alright. I'll try to get out of here and let the Captain know what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48IlendA2_001778d0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Alright. Lead the way. Let's find Menian and get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05PreparedNo_0002c6eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alright. Please, come back soon. I'll wait for you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022ceb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alright. The room with the table is just through this door. I always wondered "
"who put it there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017ca3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Also accept this gift of armor. It is the least I can do to show thanks for "
"your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017cf9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Also accept this gift of armor. It is the least I can do to show thanks for "
"your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047673_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Also try my friend, Ogier Georick, The Main Ingredient, here in the District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReynaldJemaneTopic_00084a99_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Also, he seemed sober, which is a refreshing change. Usually Reynald is "
"stumbling around Chorrol drunk as can be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Althel brought us the news of the invaders. I ran to the wall to see for "
"myself. That's where I danced for the rain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d64_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Although ... lately he's been weirder than usual.  Always looking over his "
"shoulder, writing in his little notebook.  I wonder what he's up to now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_000178cc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Although I admit, things are not going according to plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08HaskillKnightsTopic1_00043f68_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Although they are not composed of flesh as you know it, like any other enemy, "
"they can be destroyed with sword and spell. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_00038afe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Although we can't go back and undo what's been done, I feel justice has been "
"served, and Bradon's soul may rest with ease."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusC_0001e8e8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Although you may not think so to meet him. He lives quietly as a monk at "
"Weynon Priory, near the city of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_00090e30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Although your intentions were good, your actions were despicable. Murder is "
"the lowest form of revenge, and a road I would never dare to tread."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice6_00014b61_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Although... I hesitate to guide you towards this path. The secrets of the "
"past will surely aid Jyggalag, but I fear that we have no other choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Altmer. They act all high and mighty until you leave them in a pool of their "
"own blood. Here's your gold. Go take a breather. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Alval Uvani. I'm an evil wizard. I like blowing things up. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047988_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alves Uvenim, Journeyman of the Guild. Welcome to Leyawiin. I don't believe "
"we've been introduced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f9c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alves is a practiced researcher... she's sure to have some good information "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Alves should be able to help rid me of this staff. We play cards at the Three "
"Sisters often and are old friends. Seek her advice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062128_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always a good idea to protect yourself. I can help with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025290_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always a pleasure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always a pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always a pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072dfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always a pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always fight a Grummite in the water. Or in the rain. They hate water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b4c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Always forward, never back. Is the concept of time correct? Is time relevant? "
"It matters not. One way or another, I fear that our time has run out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01FindMethredhel_00048976_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Always glad to do a favor for you. She lives on the Waterfront. Wait 'til "
"afternoon to find her. She sleeps from sunrise 'til noon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_0004896b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Always glad to help. Lex has an office at the top of the South Watchtower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39RanarrJo_000781f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always he look over his shoulder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_0006550e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Always keep your magical equipment charged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f20e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Always nice to have a new Gatekeeper. I hope that when this one gets killed, "
"someone thinks to bring me something for the Museum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3a1_00019fcc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Always she wants to strike at Sheogorath. She needs people and she leads them "
"here with lies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Am I supposed to be impressed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09SlainNo_00013567_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Am I, really? I think not. Be that as it may, on what authority do you "
"disturb my work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44Choice2_00078731_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Am I? Am I? It's not paranoid when they're really out to get you. That's why "
"I've been stockpiling supplies. I'll be ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064449_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amantius Allectus is complaining about crime in the city. Someone actually "
"broke into his house and stole his diary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006444a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amantius Allectus was killed during a burglary. They say the house was "
"ransacked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01NoBribeBeggar_00007e00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amantius Allectus? I thought you said Amantus Leckis. Sorry. Never heard of "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061721_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amazing that someone finally got to Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a10_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amazing times. The Crusader's Relics, found after all these years! I wonder "
"what it means?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e921_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amazing, I've never seen a root quite like that before. If you wish to find "
"out a bit more about it, I know just the person you need to speak to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f502_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amazing, you actually swiped the stolen head right out of Timberscar Cave? "
"Ha, those goblins won't know what to think now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e920_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amazing, you've found 20 more samples of Nirnroot! Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000356fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amazing. And insane. I'll look into it further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061c79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amazing. Sheogorath returned just in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30Amber_0001650a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amber is a resin found in root system tunnels and on Gnarls. When treated "
"properly, it is especially suited to lightweight weapons and armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c247_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ambroise Canne is really good with his shield. Even better than Falus "
"Calidus, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amiable Fanriene thinks his house is going to fall in on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000335a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amminus can answer any questions you may have. He should be resting in the "
"Knights of the Thorn Lodge over yonder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a2b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amusei sends his regards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AmuseisPlot_00009332_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Amusei tried to sell it to Alessia Caro? Argh! Stupid lizard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04BribeGuard_0000a176_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amusei you say? I thought you wanted to see Amuday. He's off limits. Amusei "
"though is just down the hall. Make it quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d88_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Amusing. I enjoyed seeing you bring disaster to those that were too weak to "
"follow Lord Dagon and did not protect themselves from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004564d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An Elytra! They're tricky. I'll make sure to magically bind this one to me. "
"Let's go to the house to get your reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003dc5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An all-female gang of thieves has been recently plaguing Anvil with a very "
"unique method of robbing. They pick on only the men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillAltar_00040371_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An ancient altar where the Gatekeeper was first created. It is near the Gates "
"of Madness in the Fringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b10_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An ancient relic of a time long past. Heavy as stone, and can't be moved. "
"Please don't strain yourself trying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09ArmorTopic_00026d5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An ancient relic of the first Emperor, who became the divine Talos, the "
"patron of our Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBow_000400bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An archer needs strong arms. I bet you could hold back that bow for quite a "
"long time, couldn't you, love?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinC1_0001e8d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An entire city destroyed to get at me? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004d170_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An escaped prisoner! I'll separate your head from your shoulders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoIntro2_00082460_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An event. A movement. An apocalypse of sorts. Happens every era, at the end "
"of every era. Which is to say, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_000091db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An excellent bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005e075_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An excellent choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000091c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An excellent deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA7_00002ae1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An honest thief? I'll leave it to the priests of Zenithar to debate that "
"paradox with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ec6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An honor as always, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An honor to be sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003b832_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An honor to serve you, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003b833_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An honor to serve you, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c5ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An honor to serve you. I'm Emfrid, owner and publican of the Grey Mare, at "
"your service. A room? Or food? Whatever you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081dce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An honor, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Ritual_00013655_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An important part of our history, my friend! I would be glad to tell the tale "
"if you have a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d282_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An impressive feat of arms, closing that Oblivion Gate outside Leyawiin. What "
"can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An impressive victory. After all, you handicapped yourself by making it as "
"difficult as possible for yourself, and yet you still won. Congratulations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceWhatNext_0003353f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"An insight into their origins may lead us to those who are responsible for "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC3_0003e8f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An intriguing choice. And I have a task in mind that will test your wit, and "
"your loyalty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a8e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An intriguing fellow from what I've heard. A cut above the usual street-"
"corner rabble-rouser. He's the talk of Anvil, apparently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0009f915_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An intruder! Help! Don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An invading army sweeps the land, there's a giant battle in the palace, and "
"yet I'm still alive. How did I not die during all that? It's not fair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "An oath is an oath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_000223d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An old cleric with that name comes in now and then. Lives southeast of town "
"on the Black Road at Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00014e22_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An old priest in Kvatch is worried about strange disappearances. He sounded "
"quite depressed. How can we win if even the priests lose their faith?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaladaTopic_0002c521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An unfortunate encounter for both of us. But as I said, it was only business. "
"No hard feelings, I hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_0002b0a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"An unfortunate end to a profitable relationship. Where will we find another "
"like him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c944_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Anaxes is free. Order is restored to the Savage Garden. You have served me "
"well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00098383_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ancestor, guide my hands!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ancient Wayshrines of the Nine are scattered through the wilderness. The "
"righteous who pray there receive powerful divine blessings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Counterspell_0003013e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ancotar gave you a scroll to get rid of the invisibility? Fantastic! What are "
"you waiting for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39CindanweChoice_000781fc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And \"confiscate\" her notebook. She carries it wherever she goes, recording "
"all our secret thoughts. I need that book! My thoughts belong to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanKey_0001fee5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And I aim to keep it that way. You were right about one thing though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LifttheCurse_00003a62_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I can't help feeling slightly guilty selling you the place under these "
"circumstances. I'll meet you in Anvil at The Count's Arms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01NoBribeBeggar2_00016259_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And I can't help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061395_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And I could always use the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091aab_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And I do hate to disappoint you, but Mucianus is in no condition to be "
"leaving. He's a Worm Thrall now, and shall be quite content here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPykeZoeMaleneResponses_00091b5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And I feel the same. I am the happiest man in the Isles and all Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathSpeech_000579d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And I fixed that maggot! The ogres own Drad! Make Drad eat dirt! Bwah-hah-hah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479c8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And I have LOTS of time on my hands, since I'm LOADED with gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090799_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I hope you've taken everything you desire from my crypt. Once you leave, "
"you will be unable to return. Now, are you ready to begin your new life?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo03_000908dd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And I promise you a bounty of 100 gold for each Black Bow you bring me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d7d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I see you've learned to summon Flesh Atronachs! Relmyna must like you, "
"little Duchess... but probably not in THAT way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ae3b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I see you've learned to summon Flesh Atronachs! Relmyna must like you, "
"little Duke... but probably not in THAT way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And I shall continue my vigil at Roderick's side. It's just a matter of time "
"before our leader returns to us. I can feel it in my heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_00154cdf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I think there's a shrine to Boethia high in the Valus Mountains southeast "
"of Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_000844c3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I'll double your payment if you manage to recover the complete set of "
"ten. I look forward to a long and mutually profitable relationship."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_000356cb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I've already been expelled. Doesn't mean I'm done, though. I'm taking "
"down the Blackwood Company, and I want your help doing it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10SheoJyggalag2_000913e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And I've been having moments of clarity that are quite unlike me. Like now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04JyggalagTopic_0009102c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And Malacath is NOT popular at parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ3_00002d12_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And Talos said to the Arctus, \"Let us join as one to fortify this throne, "
"this land, these people, each one glorious under heaven!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoKnights_00082489_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And Xedilian? Since you're standing here, I assume you've succeeded. Or "
"you're terribly confused. Or really lacking in good judgement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice2B_00022b6b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And a book, of all things. Your gullibility knows no bounds, it would seem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008ea1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And a good day to you, madam!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008ea1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And a good day to you, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA5_00002ae7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And a worthy successor to Hannibal Traven, I have no doubt. I'm sure your "
"arcane arts will locate the lost Relics for you in no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11ErlineOpinion_00038444_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And another thing. The guards are making a big deal out of no one seeing "
"Bradon out in the daylight. Well of course that's the case!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013452_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"And as a token of my gratitude, I grant you the role of Courtier of Mania, "
"with all of its entitlements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3b1_00019fce_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And be cautious of killing my allies. I cannot forgive that crime. You will "
"know them, as they are also forbidden to carry daggers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000aef8d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And before you ask, yes this only works with ingredients. Be very careful in "
"what you place in that chest. I can't be held responsible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000917b6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And do hurry, that heart is beginning to smell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMephalaSpeech_000579da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And don't get caught. Be cunning. Don't spoil my scheme. And don't die... "
"that would spoil everything. Ha-ha-ha-hah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095a84_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And don't move until you have to. We don't want to lose our advantage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0003103c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And don't you forget about me once you've finished your training! I'm sure we "
"can help each other out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDerveninSpeech06_00089916_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And finally, we shall raise our goblets to the great Arden-Sul: poet, "
"thespian, author, lover, virtuoso, and artisan extraordinaire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice2_00026ae2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And have a nice day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANocturnalConvo1_00026ab7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And have one of your nosy friends snoop around here and steal it? No, it's "
"safer in Tidewater Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetSermon02_00002cd1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And he shall be cast down from on high, his wickedness scattered to the wind. "
"He shall end his days as dust in the void."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuilbertJemaneTopic_00023e88_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And he's coming here to see me, you say? Yes, I'd better sober up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ARuler_00031622_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And here is the Ring of Lordship, a symbol of your new station. Symbols are "
"important. They carry weight in this Realm, and others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRuler_0009130d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And here is the Ring of Lordship, a symbol of your new station. Symbols are "
"important. They carry weight in this Realm, and others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086745_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And here you are again, my friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d58e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And if I can do anything for you, I'd be happy to! Someday, maybe you could "
"return the favor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f514_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And if not good deeds, then deeds of a sort. Strongholds to save, and Daedra "
"to rescue. That sort of thing. Now get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro3_00082464_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And if you don't, I'll swallow your soul and vomit it into the Everfilling "
"Chamberpot of the Ageless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5e5_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And if you find out anything about what happened to Vidkun, let me know, will "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaB1_000a5601_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And if you know anything about Ayleid-ruled Cyrodiil, that should make you "
"very uneasy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037f58_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And if you're one of those idiots who thinks they have something to prove in "
"the Arena, go over and talk to Owyn. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1b_00016b70_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And in sparing me, Sheogorath made His final mistake. In this place, I will "
"gather a new army and dethrone our coward god once and for all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f85e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And it would've been so much fun, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Ceremony_00014ac9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And last, the light of Flesh, the illumination of Soul -- perception, "
"thought, memory, imagination...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_000819a2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And leave me alone! I've got enough wrong with me already. Don't need new "
"wounds to add to my troubles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d928_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And let's just keep this little deal between us, shall we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000477f4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And look. No jokes about the Heavy Armor, eh? Not every Bosmer sneaks around "
"with bows and arrows. I'm as tough and beefy as any Orc. Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoLearnWhat_00044f54_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "And maybe you'll make some friends along the way. That's always nice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13ChoiceWhynot_00033f54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And miss the opportunity to take advantage of your help? I think not. I "
"assure you, the information I have will be worth your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting2b_00016b72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And my eye is required to create an artifact, isn't it? Very well then. I "
"have survived greater threats than you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA3_00002ae3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And never let anyone forget it, Champion! I salute you. This small matter of "
"the Crusader's Relics should be a trifle for a legend such as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c24d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And no one gets in the room even after it's prepared, unless they're on the "
"list. And even if they're on the list, they'd better be dressed for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095a62_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And nobody will help me. Nobody! Not with those spirits roaming the decks. I "
"don't suppose you'll help me? No, of course you won't…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoIntro1_0008245e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And not a fan of My work, I can tell you. Hates it. Hates Me. A bit single "
"minded, if you take My meaning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_confidence_0002d721_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And not a word of this to the Guildmaster! Go find him. He'll be in the "
"Donton house, most likely. And bring him back in one piece!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a80_Knights_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And now he has returned to wreak his vengeance upon the gods, as was "
"prophesied by Pelinal himself with his dying breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MustRecoverAmulet_00027746_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And now it seems there is an heir to the throne after all, hidden at Cloud "
"Ruler Temple... and perhaps a hero as well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39RanarrJo_00072c95_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And now look at us. Living like slaves for that cursed Cindanwe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48SalvianWhatHappened_00098142_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And now we can't even get back into the city to help them, with that damned "
"Oblivion Gate blocking the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189cfc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And now you have a reward. Please, take it. It's everything I have left of "
"value, but it's the least I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028727_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And now you're here to kill me, right? Well, let's get this over with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilA1_0001587a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And now you're here to kill their father. Of course. You came for the Amulet "
"of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002908_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And now, I must ask you to press forward where I could not. I must ask you to "
"face the challenge of Zenithar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7d_Knights_RESP4"
msgid "And now, because of me... evil has claimed his very soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062444_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And now, if you need training, I'd be ever so happy to provide it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And now, three people lie dead, and you look as if you haven't a care in the "
"world. It just looks a bit... suspicious. That's all I'm saying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07ForgeThisLetter_0000c01a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And of course I will expect payment in full at that time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreE1_0001e74e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And please, let me know if there's anything you need. My resources here are "
"limited, but I will help in any way I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002951_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And so I traveled here, and I am joining your Order. I wish to serve the "
"Nine, and repay the debt I owe you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DSYes_0002366f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And so it all falls into place... yes, yes, it all makes sense now. "
"[Scribbles something on a piece of paper.] Here. This is your last task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086744_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And so we meet again. What can I do for you this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2B_00022ba0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And so, here I am. I come to you with an offering. An opportunity... to join "
"our rather unique family.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDyusTormentTopic_000807af_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And so, here I remain until the day that Sheogorath -- or rather, you -- "
"choose to release me. And we both know when that will be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech5_00056095_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And some are more unwanted than others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice3_0008fabe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And stay away from us Manics! You kill any of us by accident, you won't be "
"getting anything from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceRequest_0001356f_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And take this key. It will allow entry into the Gardens and give you direct "
"access to my Sanctum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceCommand_0001356e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"And take this key. It will allow you into the Gardens and give you direct "
"access to my Sanctum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdSpeech_000463ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And that's not going to happen here! Not while I'm Captain of the Guard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1A_00032bec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And that, dear child, is why the Black Hand has chosen you to perform the "
"ancient rite known as Purification. Everyone inside the Sanctuary must die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c16b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And the best I've ever seen is an Archer named Alawen. Not sure where she is "
"now; last I heard, she had a camp east of Anvil, out in the forest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0008e4f7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "And the best way to kill something is with the bones of its own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00003460_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And the great thing about killing a target up close and personal is you can "
"talk to 'em before you do it! You know, say something scary!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarSpeech_0008b0a7_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"And the last defender of the last ragged Septim stands before me, in the "
"heart of my power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CastleGateTopic_00090ab5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And the only way to get into the gatehouse now would be through the passage "
"at the North Guard House. But that's always kept locked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonTopic_0001338a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And then he... He goes and does... If I find out who she is, I'll tear her "
"limb from limb!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro1_00082467_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "And there are always lots of pieces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033342_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And those big muscles? They're going to waste away. When the end comes, you "
"won't even have the strength to cry for your mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00083064_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And to think I trusted you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice1b_00082090_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And what can you offer the world, except the hot air escaping through that "
"hole in your head?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04Profits_00035fb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And what good will money do me when they come to stretch my neck? Find a way "
"to get me out of here. Then we'll talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d7e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And what might you want... peasant?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice2C_00003a90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And what, I'm supposed to take your word for it? Sorry friend, but I'll need "
"some sort of proof. You got any proof?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_000302d3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And whatever you do, you can't tell Jeanne about it. All right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDAreldurTopic_00002b00_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And when he speaks to me, there are times I'd swear he sounds... Apologetic. "
"Guilty, even. Why would that be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037f58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And who in Shinji's name might you be? Look, if you're a spectator, go "
"upstairs and talk to the Gatekeeper. This ain't no damned peep show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And who in Shinji's name might you be? Look, if you're a spectator, go "
"upstairs and talk to the Gatekeeper. This ain't no damned peep show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And who in Shinji's name might you be? Look, if you're a spectator, go "
"upstairs and talk to the Gatekeeper. This ain't no damned peep show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"And who in Shinji's name might you be? Look, if you're a spectator, go "
"upstairs and talk to the Gatekeeper. This ain't no damned peep show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05NelreneHaveProof_0008199f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "And with it, you'll do what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_00033636_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And yet suddenly everyone shows up on my doorstep, needing information "
"immediately. Nevermind that I might have things of my own to work on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice1_00026ae1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And you'll need an offering. I think a lesser soul gem, a head of lettuce, "
"and some yarn will do the trick. Yes. That's what Sheogorath wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Displeased_0001365c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And you've always got our man Haskill to call on for help. Faithful like a "
"good hound, that one. And he looks better in a suit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be64_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And you've been demoted to the rank of Defender. Hell, even I don't think you "
"deserved that. But, it is what it is. Move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c8521_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And you've been demoted to the rank of Defender. Hell, even I don't think you "
"deserved that. But, it is what it is. Move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting2a_00019fc8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And you, if you help me, then you can have what you want and no need to risk "
"your neck, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2B_00022ba0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And you, you are a cold-blooded killer, capable of taking life without mercy "
"or remorse. The Night Mother has been watching, and she is most pleased."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQChampionOfCyrodiil_000add4d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And, as a small token of gratitude for your service to the Empire, I have "
"ordered a suit of Imperial Dragon armor made for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PurificationTopic_0002fd9c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And, hopefully, we kill the traitor in the process. Until the Purification is "
"complete, no given Sanctuary will ever be considered secure. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MountainLionsTOPIC_00036623_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"And, if you can keep this our little secret, I can make it worth your while. "
"There's a bit about acrobatics I can teach you. Give it some thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VaronVamoriTopic_0002c6a9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "And, of course, please keep this just between us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c67c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"And, to thank you more personally, I shall teach you this spell. You may find "
"it useful in certain circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002fd6d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And, what better way to learn the many uses of Restoration? Practical "
"application is often the best educator. Even in life and death situations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And... Ah, I see. So, you're an Arena combatant. Well isn't that nice. Now "
"get out of my face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002992_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And... And he's told you something you don't want to tell me. I need someone "
"to please tell me what's going on. Please, help me. Have mercy on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And... Wait, I know you. You're that new Champion, right? Hmph. I guess I "
"know why you're here. But let me tell you, you're making a big mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And... Wait, I know you. You're that new Champion, right? Oh, don't tell me "
"you've actually challenged the Gray Prince to a match! Are you insane?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033560_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"And... you didn't hear it from me, but I think you should go speak with "
"Oreyn. Now. He'd like your help with a couple things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e89e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Andel Indarys doesn't help his case by having a prat for a son, and a wife "
"that dies in very suspicious circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062499_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Andel Indarys is an intemperate, bibulous philanderer. And a Dark Elf. Other "
"than that, he is perfectly suited to be a count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062497_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Andel Indarys may or may not have killed his wife, and it may or may not have "
"been an accident. And I doubt we'll ever know for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Angelie Blakeley. This is my father's house. He was lost at sea, many years "
"ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cdd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Annoying creature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anon us most soon again, for sooth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a11_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Another Chapel's been attacked. Bravil this time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04JyggalagTopic_0009102c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another Daedric Prince. Not a nice one. I don't think ANY of the other "
"Princes like him, actually. I mean, Malacath is more popular at parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another High Elf has been taught the meaning of humility, thanks to the Blue "
"Team's number one Warrior. You really earned your keep this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity4_00079f51_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Another Pelvis of Pelagius? I don't think that's possible, honestly. It must "
"be a fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another adventurer is trying to get into the Shivering Isles. If it's a "
"Breton, it'll be the first one in 3.7 years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e964_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another chamber, another victim to eliminate. Hurry, the anticipation is "
"overwhelming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061607_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another conspiracy in Crucible. Not a surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another conspiracy in Crucible. That's fine. Just stay away from my things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardGoodbye_00026bc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another day, another septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000784b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another fine day in Mania, is it not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_00097faa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another gate just opened! We'll take the fight to them this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00019d6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another loony from that door!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMolagBalSpeech_00037848_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another mortal come to do my bidding. I only wish suffering and death. You "
"will bring me both. I want to see a man brought to the edge. And pushed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000897c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another mortal dares to summon me, and already I am bored. But enough about "
"me. Let's talk about you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00097612_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another mortal dares to summon me, and already I am bored. But enough about "
"me. Let's talk about you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001a111_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another mortal. Quaint."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095e2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another of Sheogorath's foolish schemes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042dab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another of my brood finally returns to the Isles. Oh, I wonder what this one "
"will be like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyKhajiit_0009f9be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another one bites the dust. The Khajiit is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48StartCombatShouts_00082c92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e896_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Another possibility in that direction might be Kemen. It's an old Ayleid ruin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another rat job? Not me. No thanks. Let the bottom boot do the rats. Unless "
"you want the gig...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ede_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another round of torture in Crucible? At least if you're in a cell, no one "
"can sneak up on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_000088a3_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "Another satisfied customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_000091d2_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "Another satisfied customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001f3b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another sheep returns to the flock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Another sheep returns to the flock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Another theft! This is your final chance. Go back into the field, and return "
"to me with the horns of twenty minotaurs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Antoine Branck. I just work here. If you want a horse, go inside and talk to "
"Isabeau."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0001cb7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Antus, calm down. We'll be leaving soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a23_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anvil is all in an uproar. First the Chapel attacked, now the prophet ranting "
"about the end of the world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anvil wouldn't be my choice for a refit. No proper yard, neither spars nor "
"scantlings in good supply. But, it's ill-luck to complain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anvil's a port town. That's why you'll see items here you won't find in the "
"Imperial City. The captains keep an eye out for special items for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BonusTopic_0002ff51_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Any Brother or Sister who can complete a contract while following a specific "
"request will receive a valuable bonus, oftentimes a powerful magic item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Shadowscale_000251fb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Any Shadowscale who lives to come of age is accepted into the Dark "
"Brotherhood as a full member of the family. So it was with myself, and "
"Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bb02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Any citizen who takes the time to talk to a member of the Legion is okay in "
"my book. With all that's happened, it's good to know we're appreciated. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000af05a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any friend of Martin's is a friend of mine. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023dda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any friend of the Society is a friend of mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bc5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any friend of the Society is a friend of mine. Have a look around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0002529e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any idea what Gromm will do now that old Baenlin is dead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Victims_00081fdc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Any loyal servant of the Madgod would respect His decision in this matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d6e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Any luck finding Erthor yet? I'll need to speak with him before I can feel "
"your recommendation has been earned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003103b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any luck finding J'skar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d92c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any luck on those bottles of Shadowbanish Wine yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018917e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any luck taking down Lonavo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c0cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Any luck talking with Varon Vamori yet? It should be no trouble at all once "
"you use that scroll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any luck yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003574c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any luck yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000093ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any luck?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e92a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any more luck finding Nirnroot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Any new adventurer trying to get into the Isles will have a tough time going "
"up against the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000277b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any new books you've been reading?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Any new entry to the Shivering Isles is the chance for a new convert. I "
"welcome it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e7d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any new information come to light?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000b2db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any news about that certain task we discussed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e06c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any news about the amulet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000241b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062609_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Any of the local guild heads can get you into the guild. If you're in a "
"hurry, speak with Carahil. She should be somewhere around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArgonianBloodTopic_00053740_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Any old Argonian will do, and you needn't kill it, but do be careful. "
"Stabbing strangers often doesn't sit well with townspeople or the town guards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40MelisandeIhavethem_0005373b_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Any old Argonian will do, but the vampire must be very powerful indeed. If "
"you succeed, I'll get you what you need. Any questions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033538_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any progress to report?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bf8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any progress yet? You should be working on getting the book for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00017c5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any sign of Armand Christophe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00047465_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any sign of Erthor lately?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000807ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any time you wish to visit me, I'll be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000adc65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any time, Champion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any word from Jeanne in Bruma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any word of Aleron?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066ead_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Any word on my Medallion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_00083f4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anya Herrick, dear Inquisitor. She's been named as someone of interest. I do "
"look forward to chatting with her, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008567d_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"Anya claims to have been approached by Ma'zaddha. Perhaps there's something "
"to this after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004766d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anyone can wear clothes. But the RIGHT clothes? That is not so easy. Go to "
"any castle. They wear Palonirya's designs, or they're nobody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TeekeeusTopic_000253d4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Anyone capable of handling it should have access to that power, don't you "
"think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061433_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anyone looking for work should consider the Fighters Guild. I hear they're "
"always looking for recruits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_0008f7d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anything I can do to help you. Really, you should speak with Uungor. He "
"doesn't want to be here, anyway. Poor fellow believes himself sane!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003843b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anything else I can help with, you just let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022e51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anything else I can help with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0009ea84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08AncestorMoth_00048973_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Anything for a friend. The Moth Priests live in the Imperial Palace. I don't "
"know exactly what they do. Something to do with the Elder Scrolls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bfa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anything for my savior."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01AmantiusAllectus_00048970_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anything for you! He lives in the Temple district on the far east side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk1_00002ba8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Anything for you, my friend! What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anything you require, you're welcome to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000919a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anytime now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Anytime, friend. I'm right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002df70_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "Anyway, I digress. I'm sure you wish to hear of your reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark11Choice4B_00002dda_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I have duties to tend to. If you see my mother, tell her I'll visit "
"soon! I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000412c7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm always looking for new exhibits, so remember me when you come "
"across anything Odd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34WhyNeed_0008f7b9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Anyway, enough of my banter. So, will you please help me get back my "
"Medallion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29InvNice_0001d049_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Anyway, have fun looking around, and when you are ready to buy, give me a "
"shout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0000ab72_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Anyway, if you want to rile up a goblin tribe, steal their Tribal Head. Which "
"is often what a rival tribe does, just to prove they're tougher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062be9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Anyway, sorry to go on so long. I'm sure you've got things to do. Just wanted "
"to thank you personally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwaterBrigands_0000c1ce_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Anyway, sorry to ramble. You better get below now and rest until we arrive "
"safely at the Imperial City docks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42Confused_0007322d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Anyway, you're going to help me find calipers and tongs. No point in denying "
"it. You've already agreed tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03Xedilian_0006770c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Anyway... there are those that have other ways into my Realm, and they're on "
"the move. We don't want them here. Trust me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000914af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Apologies, citizen, but I must return to my post."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e84_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Apologies, my good friend. I mistook you for someone else. Always being asked "
"about it, I am. 'Didn't I see you in Cheydinhal?', they say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Aquanostrum_0006ea4d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Apparently it only exists at the bottom of Knotty Bramble... ah well. So "
"close, yet so far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorAttackResponse2_00002b9e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently no one has any idea who did it. Now there's some prophet preaching "
"doom in the streets of Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00000808_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently some fool tried to resurrect the Crimson Scars in Deepscorn "
"Hollow. The Dark Brotherhood will not like that…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently the poor old woman thinks she is from a well-to-do family. Truth "
"is, I have servants with more nobility in their blood than her. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05WhatBaurusLearned_00022b1e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Apparently worship the Daedra Lord Mehrunes Dagon. I've been tracking their "
"agents in the Imperial City. I guess they noticed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently, Arentus Falvius at the chapel is quite a conjurer. He'll even "
"teach the skill to those he likes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00032679_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Apparently, Bradon Lirrian was one of those vile creatures, and Raynil slew "
"him. Kind of strange though. I never figured Bradon to be a vampire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently, Right-Wind teaches his blade skills to other Fighters Guild "
"members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Apparently, he can teach you the basics of lockpicking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004663d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently, she was wanted in Skyrim for murder. Shot a man dead from over "
"300 yards. Hard to believe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Apparently, some spells make them bigger and stronger. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fugitives_00009c37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently, there are three or four of them. Real nasty, from what I hear. "
"You take care of them. Maybe you'll get lucky and they'll surrender."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08JeetumSpeech_000981a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Apparently, they've been giving the locals some trouble. Shouldn't be a "
"problem for you four, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a847_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Apprentice! Wait right there. We need to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofNocturnalTOPIC_000b97c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Approach the shrine, if you dare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASanguineChoice1_00027104_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Approach then, and bring Sanguine a gift. Some Cyrodilic Brandy is an "
"appropriate gift for your host."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008d316_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Approach, Duchess of Dementia. The time is near and I am fading..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008d315_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Approach, Duchess of Mania. The time is near and I am fading..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00014b52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Approach, Duke of Dementia. The time is near and I am fading..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00014b50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Approach, Duke of Mania. The time is near and I am fading..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice4B_00022bd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arch-Mage Traven feared that sending a high-ranking official with the guild "
"might draw too much attention, and provoke a reaction from the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arch-Mage Traven has closed the doors of the University to all who are not "
"qualified to enter. A wise decision, in my opinion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006c298_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arch-Mage Traven is the first to take such a hard stance on Necromancy. It "
"upset more than a few people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473ed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Arch-Mage Traven lives there, in the tower. It's a fabulous place - you "
"really should see it some day. I've been there many times myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062687_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arch-Mage Traven was right to ban Necromancy from the guild. Look at what "
"they've done; they've gone and killed several of us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006261f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arch-Mage Traven was right to ban Necromancy, and place restrictions on the "
"addition of new members to the guild. He's served us well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001648c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arch-Mage! You have returned!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00077b25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arctus, High Priest of Dementia. I'm here to guide those that wish to serve "
"themselves. What did you require?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ardaline makes excellent potions. I imagine she would, since she teaches "
"Alchemy at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arden-Sul has heard our plea, and delivered the Gatekeeper back to us. We're "
"saved!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arden-Sul has willed it to be... the Gatekeeper is dead and the newcomer to "
"the Isles will join us in praising his name!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arden-Sul preserve us! The Fringe has been destroyed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesM_000139af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arden-Sul was perhaps the greatest Duke to walk our land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3_00012ccd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Are all males so obstinate? Have I not already told you that I consider that "
"route too risky?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberOneGnarl01_000648b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are my eyes playing tricks, or is the creature growing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017968_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are the Mazken prepared?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d917_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are the creatures gone? I want to get out of here. I've been trapped for days!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechLoremasters_00002d2b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Are there are any among you who still understand the ancient tongue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechAmulet_00002d21_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are there no ears to hear the warnings? Are there no eyes to witness the "
"Wheel's breaking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ2_00002d16_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are there no ears to hear the warnings? Are there no eyes to witness the "
"Wheel's breaking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00064ff4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are they gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ee24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are they gone? Is it safe to come back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are they.... are they gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are this month's silks ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_0002a68a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Are we clear? Ignore her request, go to this place she has described, and "
"return with the book. This is far more important than any petty squabble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_0018d7e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are we not Blades, joined by battle and brotherhood? Need you even ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00015f0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are we there yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you a gruff little dog, are you? Well, come curl up here by my feet then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000c48ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you a student of the Arcane Arts? My husband, Alberic, is an Advanced "
"Trainer in Conjuration at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetQuest_00002af3_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Are you a worthy knight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartC1_00002c88_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Are you a worthy knight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e8a7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Are you able to join us now? I can wait, but not for long. We've got to move "
"quickly, before they have a chance to barricade the city gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Accuse_0003565a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you accusing me of taking the painting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004ea44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you all right, sire? We're clear, for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00029488_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you all right? This murder has us all on edge, I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04GoodWord_00035faf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Are you an idiot? I want you to get me out of here! I don't want a stinking "
"guild membership."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC07Choice4_000091fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you certain? I can't thank you enough. Please, though. If you decide to "
"retrieve the sword and armor, keep them. At least until I can repay you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseDecline_000545d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you certain? Oh well. If you change your mind, you know where to find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00007dfd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you confused?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WheresSkrivva_00035fbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you deaf? Didn't I already tell you that she is in Bravil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00094c39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you deaf? Leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaYesBooks_00024e81_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Are you familiar with Green Emperor Way? The gardens around the Imperial "
"Palace. Something must be revealed there at noon! How exciting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PalePassTopic_00018234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you familiar with the history of Pale Pass?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FishermansRockTopic_000860d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you going to take me to Fisherman's Rock?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you going to the service for Brag gro-Bharg?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081e43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you having trouble with the Obelisks, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002eddb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you here about joining the Mages Guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000146ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you here about the Amulet? If so, Caranya has it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you here to challenge me? I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047356_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Are you here to end this nightmare, and free us all from the Savage Garden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00094ec5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you here to help Rosentia?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_0001cf40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you here to pay the blood price?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bfa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you here to rescue me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f375_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you here to see Thadon? I would be, if I were you. Thankfully, I already "
"have cause to speak to him every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_001885d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you here to visit me and perhaps purchase more of my Famous Potato Bread?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d036_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Are you implying that my merchandise comes from the deceased?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00079c8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you injured, Lord? Do you require my services?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you interested in joining the guild? Talk to Falcar here in Cheydinhal, "
"if so. Otherwise, any leader of a local Mages Guild hall can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheFightersGuild_0002427a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Are you interested in joining?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062605_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you interested in joining? You'll need to talk to Teekeeus, then. "
"Otherwise, just talk to the head of any of the local guild halls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0001c4ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you interested? It's only 10 gold for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you interested? It's only 10 gold for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071f57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you just going to stand there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding? I came here to get away from the mountains and snow. You "
"ever spent a winter in Skyrim? Or Bruma? Give me the Gold Coast any day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you looking for a fence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005421e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you looking for a horse? The Wildeye Stables have the best Paint horses "
"in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_0001e090_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you looking for him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13GetOut_00031c87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you mad? A Knight of the Thorn never returns home until the mission is "
"done. It's our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you mad? My life is on the line and the entire Brotherhood is at stake! "
"We don't have time for this nonsense!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3b30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you mad? You killed Farwil, and now you casually speak to me as if "
"nothing's happened? Begone from my sight before I kill you where you stand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002413a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you not feeling well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09ComponentsHow_00081dab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you not the exalted Duchess? Slayer of the great Gatekeeper? Champion of "
"our mighty Lord Sheogorath?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09ComponentsHow_00013573_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you not the exalted Duke? Slayer of the great Gatekeeper? Champion of our "
"mighty Lord Sheogorath?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c09_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Are you out of your mind? Did I not make it clear that Teekeeus was the one "
"person I NEVER wanted to acquire that book?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00068dc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you out of your mind? Take that robe off at once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_00017d84_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Are you prepared for battle, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_000181c2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Are you prepared for battle, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00053239_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared now? I have little time to waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0001e646_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Are you prepared to accept it now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00002dca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to begin your next task for the guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_0000979e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to begin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_0000beea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to begin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c6d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to enter the Dreamworld?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_0001c4e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to pay the blood price for unwarranted kills?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_000153b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to pay the blood price you owe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_0001c476_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to pay the blood price you owe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_0001cf41_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you prepared to pay the blood price?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirWait_0007fdef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you quite sure, Inquisitor? Very well... Please don't have too much fun "
"without me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004665d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you ready for a bloodbath? The winner of this match will advance in rank, "
"so the stakes are high! Pit Dogs, show us what you're made of! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00035f47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you ready for it? If not, I understand. You've been through quite a bit "
"lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022f4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready for one last great heist?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f8b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to accept the staff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002915_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to begin your quest for the Mace of Zenithar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d148_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to begin your test now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f1f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to earn your recommendation now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027f30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to follow me to Henantier?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactTopic_00026d6d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Are you ready to give me the artifact? Remember, the ritual will consume its "
"physical form. It won't be seen again on Tamriel for many years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f41e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to go to the boat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009271_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to go to the manor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you ready to go? We need your help getting to the castle, but we need to "
"move soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefend_000131b6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Are you ready to help us defend the Altar of Despair from the Aureals' attack?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttack_00012ccb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Are you ready to help us destroy the Mazken and take control of the Altar of "
"Despair?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_00085992_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Are you ready to part with your statue now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_000165f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you ready to pay the blood price for the murders you committed in "
"Cheydinhal's Chapel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGCastOutTopic_0001e863_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Are you ready to pay the fine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400da_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Are you ready to repent of your actions in Cylarne, and light the Great Torch "
"for Mania?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005421c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to ride?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ba39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you ready to show us the way to Weatherleah yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice2A_000242a8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Are you ready to take us there now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028004_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you ready? We need to move out soon, while we still have a chance to "
"strike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_000622f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0004cfae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you so eager to begin? Very well. We can start, if you feel you are ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f21f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Are you staying for a while, or simply just passing through?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022e11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you still talking? Find us work. And money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000363c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you still trying to file a complaint against Audens Avidius? I thought I "
"told you to take it up with Itius Hayn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004300c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want me? If not, I'd rather just sit down a while, or maybe "
"take a nap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d27d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you sure you're up to it? You seem a little... slow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_0018b2ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you sure...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Help_00098144_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SurpriseReceive_00024246_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice1B_00028145_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? I don't know what we could offer you to change your mind, but "
"I'm sure we could come up with something. Please reconsider.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Refuse_0002c51c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? I truly have no wish to harm you. It is the carving I want. "
"Just business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoA2_0002e5c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? I will pay very well. And the matter is urgent. If you decline, "
"I will find someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03Reveal_00034e9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? That can't be right. She's my... I mean she doesn't seem to be "
"the type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SadGeneral_00024277_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you sure? That's awful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG03Choice2B_0002c0d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you sure? Well, all right. I can't give you a better offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice3b_00082094_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? You will not easily heal the damage done to you. This is a "
"permanent sacrifice you are making. In fact, it is likely you will die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0002ab89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you talking to me? Don't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086072_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you the Count?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095fe6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you the best the Madgod could muster?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00016481_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you truly prepared for this task? I cannot be certain what awaits you, "
"but I am sure we will not speak again after you begin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you trying to insinuate that Nels might be the killer? Maybe I think you "
"did it. After all, murder is a common crime of the... low-born. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0005e00b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you trying to ruin me? That offer's no good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0006201b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you trying to take advantage of me? I'm not making that deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000241ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Cure_0006eab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Are you willing to help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice2b_00082092_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Are you willing to trade places with these souls, to bear the full weight of "
"their pain and afflictions? Weigh this question carefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a909_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you... Are you ready to fight? Go talk to Ysabel, let her know. Then "
"we'll, um... You know, we'll meet in the Arena. And it will all be over..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasA2_00022b56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you... threatening me? You can't scare me! I'll call the guards if you "
"don't leave at once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you... you are, aren't you? The Madgod! No... I must be dreaming again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirGreetChoice2_000805eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Are you? Hmm. I'd expected an entrance with a bit more flair. Ah, well. "
"Perhaps you'll grow into the role. One can hope, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Areldil. We don't have any business, do we? Then, perhaps, will you excuse me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b21_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Areldur has let me stay, mostly out of pity I think, but there's something "
"else. I swear he knows more than he tells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aren't we lucky to have a skilled healer in town?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043504_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aren't you a cute little caterpillar! The Gatekeeper is dead. But he won't "
"turn into a butterfly. No, he won't. Will he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c146_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aren't you an ugly one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f9c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aren't you forgetting to tell me something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00085d61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aren't you going to take care of this? What am I paying you for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001365b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aren't you off to a good start! That's important. For me. Really, your work "
"is going to save me a lot of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10SheoJygglag_000913d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aren't you precious? Do you really not know? Haven't you noodled it all "
"through yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034241_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Aren't you supposed to be going to see Tar-Meena? I have plenty of leads of "
"my own to track down, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000982e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aren't you supposed to be on a quest for the Gray Fox?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aren't you supposed to be on your way to the Imperial City?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreymarchTopic_000910ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aren't you the curious one? You know what they say about curiosity, though, "
"don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00028ab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Argh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00061c82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Argh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Murder_0018bd6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Argh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_000919ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Argh! I'll fight you to the death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00080d7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Argh... Very well. I am part of the group that wishes to see Syl drowned in a "
"pool of her own blood. But I am not in charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Argonians stick mostly to the river trade. We know boats and the water. We're "
"not fussy about the sewers, either. Water cleans it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27Voice_000a934d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arise, my people! The restoration of Tam Riel begins today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraReactions_00084ab4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay protect me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0005dca9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay protect me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a3a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay take your soul!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0005dc8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073926_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay's blessings upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay, Light of Lights, cleanse this place of darkness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arkay, bring light to the dark. Arkay, bring hope to the hopeless. Arkay, "
"protect these souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dca8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay, bring light to these damned souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arkay, protect and keep these wayward souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayCrimeGold_000983a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Armand Christophe and S'krivva have special arrangements with the guards and "
"judges throughout Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f45f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Armies are well and good, but only if you know who you're fighting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f535_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Armies can only mean one thing... more sorrow and more death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Armies of Our Lord are singing again! Bells ringing! Singing! Singing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Armies restored or not, I will not let an enemy of the Maniacs set foot in "
"the Sacellum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f4b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Armies with steel are good, but armies can be destroyed. Magic is better. "
"Magic can bring armies back to life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Armies, war? Bah! When it comes to a man's heart, a basket of sweetrolls can "
"be as effective as a sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f4c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Armies? Pah! Armies are worthless. Killing is best by one man alone. In the "
"dark. Sneak. Sneak. Then blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062124_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Armor and weapons. Maybe not pretty, but they get the job done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32FanaticYell_0001b700_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Armor is for the weak!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0000921a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Armor, weapons, I have it all. How may I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Army, eh? Ohhhh... that means it's time to play \"interrogate the innocent "
"female prisoner\" again! Great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JorundrTopic_00053279_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arnora and Jorundr were once a happy couple, but that's over now. I hear that "
"he took all of their money and stashed it after he committed a robbery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00053762_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arnora was killed. Such a shame. I wonder if Jorundr had something to do with "
"it? I wouldn't put it past him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRoutine_000167df_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Around 8 p.m., we are served dinner. Gundlar is quite a chef and prepares "
"Thadon's meals personally, adding just a hint of Greenmote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arrgh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Arrgh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Challenge_00012d06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arrogant fool! I curse you to remain trapped here with the shades of my "
"people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Art has triumphed! I plan to dedicate my next juggling epic to Sheogorath's "
"glorious victory!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c21f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Arvena Thelas is an odd one. I've heard some strange noises coming from her "
"basement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aryarie. Your friendly Guild Alchemist. Satisfaction guaranteed. No free "
"samples."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c99d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As Captain Burd says, we have to stay on the good side of the local Nords. It "
"ain't their fault they're ignorant barbarians."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Knight_00066f04_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As Farwil is fond of saying, \"We strike fast and true as lightning.\" He "
"tends to overstate things a bit, but he means well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02FinChoice1A_00023e48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I expected. Good. The target is a Wood Elf named Baenlin. You will find "
"him at his home in Bruma. Enter secretly, and avoid his manservant, Gromm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChalYes_0003a915_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I expected. I accept your challenge! Speak to Ysabel and let her know when "
"you're ready, and I shall make for the Arena. Shinji be with us both!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b4c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As I feared it would, My plan has failed. The Greymarch is upon us, and I "
"must go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a323_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As I feared. The sickness is spreading through the Fountainhead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c8b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As I live and breathe! The Gray Fox! It's an honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I look upon your face, you remind me of a summer's day. Of a distant and "
"secret place not so far away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I mentioned, I have no more contracts available. You'll need to speak with "
"Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I mentioned, I have no more contracts available. You'll need to speak with "
"Ocheeva. But first you should go and sleep! Your dark gift awaits..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I mentioned, I have no more contracts available. You'll need to speak with "
"Ocheeva. Unless... you would like to discuss another matter? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_0002b463_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As I promised when we first met, here is your reward for completing the set. "
"Take it with my sincere thanks. It is well-deserved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AnotherTask_000a657d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"As I said, I believe I have something that will interest you. More in your "
"usual line of work. And, of course, your reward will be generous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice1B_00035f48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I said, I fully understand. I shall be here when you feel you are prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I said, I'll meet you back in Anvil as soon as I can. I won't be traveling "
"with you as I'm making my own arrangements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_breakins_000356bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I said, I'll need you to stop these thieves from breaking into my store. "
"It only seems to happen at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I said, I'll work as long as it takes to be worthy to join the Order. Am I "
"ready to become a Knight of the Nine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaC_00022b43_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As I said, I've never even seen the third and fourth volumes. You should try "
"First Edition, over in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyBruma_0004f215_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "As I said, it's located right by the main gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e91c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As I'm sure you guessed, to make the grand version of the Elixir of "
"Exploration will take still more samples of Nirnroot; 40 to be exact. Good "
"luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d937_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As I've said, I am rather busy. I'll get to it eventually though, I assure "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I've said, I just don't feel comfortable talking to you about Falcar. "
"Forgive me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0009101b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As I've said, all choices have consequences, but don't trouble yourself too "
"much with your decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_00022507_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I've said, the only notes I've taken, I have given to you. The rest is "
"only of interest to me, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Ritual_00013665_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As I've told you friend, the Duke's drug-tainted blood must be brought to the "
"Altar of Arden-Sul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ee27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As a Blade, my place is at Martin's side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031840_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As a Knight of the Thorn, you are now expected to carry this symbol of your "
"knighthood. Carry it proudly and wear it well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5A_00022ba9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a Speaker of the Black Hand, I directly oversee a particular group of "
"family members. You will join that group, and fulfill any contracts given."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5B_00022baa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a Speaker of the Black Hand, I directly oversee a particular group of "
"family members. You will join that group, and fulfill any contracts given."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5C_00022bab_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a Speaker of the Black Hand, I directly oversee a particular group of "
"family members. You will join that group, and fulfill any contracts given."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00034e12_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a full-fledged member of the Mages' Guild, I now also promote you to the "
"rank of Apprentice, and grant you the Robe of the Apprentice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05Gwinas_00022b46_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, he's already late for his appointment to pick up the "
"book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CovenantTopic_000272af_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"As a member of the Dark Brotherhood, you must abide by the Five Tenets. They "
"are the laws that guide and protect us. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f146_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As a member of the Order of the Mythic Dawn, everything you need will be "
"provided for you from the Master's bounty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_000153ae_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As a new member, you now owe your loyalty to our guildmaster, the Gray Fox. "
"He has three rules you must follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023f0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As a pirate, Gaston Tussaud has certainly spilled his share of blood. Someone "
"wants revenge, and they've hired us to extract it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting02C_00002cd3_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As a proven guardian of this realm and a warrior the likes of which have not "
"been seen in millenia, Talos grants you his sacred Blessing. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChoice1_0003151f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"As a reward, please accept this bounty of gold and gems. You've earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073925_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a small token of my gratitude, please allow me to share with you some of "
"my small store of knowledge of the healing arts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice7A_00028c7a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As a token of our gratitude, I bestow upon you a symbol of honor and heroism, "
"the Escutcheon of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c339_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As a token of our gratitude, as you did this at the risk of false "
"imprisonment or perhaps your life, we reward you this bounty of gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c34a_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"As a token of our gratitude, as you did this at the risk of false "
"imprisonment or perhaps your life, we reward you this bounty of gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkGiftTopic_0004cf46_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As a vampire you must feed regularly. The longer you go without blood, the "
"stronger you will become, but there are dramatic adverse effects as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice5B_00022bd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As a vampire, the Count has few allies he can trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQDaedricMagic_0008b603_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As a young man, I grew impatient with Mages Guild restrictions, as did many "
"of my fellow apprentices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03FinChoice1A_00023e54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As always, you fail to disappoint me. Your target is a Dark Elf named Valen "
"Dreth. He thinks he's safe in prison. He is tragically mistaken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c338_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As always, you're a welcome sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10UmarilVoiceSky_00002ccb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As balangua, Ehlnada racuvar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRodericGreetA_00002aa5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As do I. Perhaps we can share the road, as long as our paths lie together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As do we all, dear friend. Do not fear. I have been assured that the medicine "
"will restore our Roderick to full health. But it will take some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SilencerTopic_0002fdb6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As every hand has fingers, does not every finger have a nail? A claw? A "
"talon? Every finger of the hand, every Speaker, has such a nail.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00033954_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As far as Chanel and Orgnolf go, they seem fine to me. I only had a minor "
"scrape with Orgnolf recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_00038440_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As far as I know, he was a good man. I never saw this coming. But vampires "
"are masters of deception, so I guess it makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor03_0002ad14_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "As for what you have done... it does not matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11Reward_00022e1d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As for your compensation, I ask you to trust me. If my plan works, you will "
"get a reward worth far more than mere money. Will you do it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Lost_00018237_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As his forces fought their way across the Jerall Mountains, the Akaviri "
"suddenly surrendered. It was assumed they were overwhelmed and gave up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00019857_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"As is the tradition, you are to be awarded a focus crystal as a token of your "
"fine work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesD_0001365d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As it happened so many years ago, my lord Arden-Sul suspected a traitor in "
"his midst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e20_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As it is only your first offense, do not return until you have collected 20 "
"bear pelts. Use this time to reflect on your actions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistTreeTopic_0003570c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As long as the Blackwood Company has access to the sap, we are all in danger. "
"I fear they no longer know what they do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2A_00032be9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As long as the arrow hits Phillida, he will die. But it cannot pierce armor! "
"Shoot while Phillida is armored, and the Rose will be wasted.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2B_00032bea_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As long as the arrow hits Phillida, he will die. But it cannot pierce armor! "
"Shoot while Phillida is armored, and the Rose will be wasted.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2C_00032beb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As long as the arrow hits Phillida, he will die. But it cannot pierce armor! "
"Shoot while Phillida is armored, and the Rose will be wasted.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As long as you cut off his finger and leave it in that desk, you'll get your "
"bonus. Sounds to me like you can kill the old sod anyway you'd like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d05f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As long as you're not a wanted criminal, there's a place for you in the "
"guild. Are you interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004dcba_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As lord of this Realm, there are a number of benefits to which you are "
"entitled, as well as a number of duties to which you must attend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c0cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As much as I like you, friend, I'm just not willing to part with that staff. "
"It's nothing personal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04GreymarchTopic_00091020_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As my Lord told you, it happens at the end of every era, and Jyggalag walks "
"the Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30Matrices_0001e696_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "As my master has done, so will I, before I pass on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e91f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As promised, I have your Moderate Elixir of Exploration. Use it well! I have "
"more available for a great price if you'd like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ01Potatoes_000c55c5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As promised, I owe you a reward for your efforts. I present you with my first "
"batch of Famous Potato Bread! More valuable than gold! Enjoy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a957_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "As promised, I'd like to compensate you for your efforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As promised, here's the ring. I bought it from a shop in the Imperial City "
"many years ago for an ex-lover of mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Visions_00033795_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As she aged, the visions became less coherent. Rather than cast her aside, "
"the Council gave her a position here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d0b2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As sickened as I am, I will not tell the City Watch until you have confirmed "
"this theory and brought us the proof we need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bcbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As soon as this opens, I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06BookLostHistories_0000bf8a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "As soon as we are out of sight of the castle's main gate, I'll tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VelwynBenirusTopic_0000926d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As soon as you bought the place, he pretty much up and left. I hear tell he's "
"making his way to the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_000807a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As soon as you get those doors unlocked, I'm going in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00014b5d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As such, it requires a vessel that has witnessed dark secrets. Ciirta has "
"seen things with her eyes that no mortal has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00016ec7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As such, it requires a vessel that has witnessed dark secrets. Ciirta has "
"seen things with her eyes that no mortal has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00016ef6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As such, it requires a vessel that has witnessed dark secrets. Ciirta has "
"seen things with her eyes that no mortal has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000279e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As the Arch-Mage, you are entitled to certain privileges. In addition to the "
"full use of all Guild facilities, there is one service available to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037cea_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As the Grandmaster of the Blades, I would be honored to accept you into our "
"order. Will you join us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstructions_00018df9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As the adventurers make their way through Xedilian's chambers, they will "
"encounter choices that you make in these control platforms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P5HowIsThat_0001fb72_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As the guildmaster, I am waiving bloodprice for anyone you kill during this "
"heist. However, I can't stop the Watch from putting a price on your head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OcatoTopic_000add34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As the head of the Elder Council, High Chancellor Ocato is the de facto ruler "
"of the Empire for the time being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneAmazing_00022e63_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As the ice enveloped him, some of his tears were frozen as well. Some even "
"say that the Divine, Mara, took pity on the poor knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000279e1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As the new Arch-Mage, I'm sure she'll extend the service to you as well. At "
"your convenience, consult her at the Lustratorium."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_0008674f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As the new Listener of the Black Hand, it is your task to speak with the "
"statue of the Night Mother, and hear the words of our Unholy Matron."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000ca29_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP3"
msgid "As the newest master of the castle, I bid you welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000ca2a_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP3"
msgid "As the newest master of the castle, I bid you welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013416_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP3"
msgid "As the newest master of the castle, I bid you welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00089978_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As the newest member of the Knights of the Thorn, I bid you welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreC1_0001e74b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As unlikely as your story sounds, I believe you. Only the strange destiny of "
"Uriel Septim could have brought you to me carrying the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Challenge_00012d06_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As we are doomed to eternally relive the last moments of our failed attempts "
"to save our keep, so shall you eternally watch us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_00083f4f_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"As we're just starting out, we need to find a place to start. Someone who "
"knows something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrinaCrossInnTopic_0002fd6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you are new to the guild, and to the area, you are less likely to be "
"recognized on your trip from Anvil to Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Mg04ChoiceCarahilWhy_0004f227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you are new to the guild, you are less likely to be recognized as a "
"member. This may give you an advantage in getting to the root of the problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001f42a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"As you can imagine, it didn't pay off. He ended up owing around 500 gold. We "
"could never have that kind of money to pay back the usurer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem8_0008242f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you can see, I have plenty of space here for new Oddities, so think of me "
"when you run across anything Odd!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_00005676_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As you can see, he was no match for the combined power of the Black Hand, "
"even weakened as we are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036006_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you command, Countess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13OfficerGreetA4_0001acb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you command, m'Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000146ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you command, sire. Guards! Form up and protect the Emperor! To the Temple "
"of the One!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b59_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b5c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b61_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Follow_00055408_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Follow_00055fd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b63_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you command. Although I don't think this is the way Sir Roderic and I came."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b55_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you command. But you won't go into Underpall Cave without me, will you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As you complete contracts and fulfill your duties, you'll be promoted to the "
"next station, accepting the associated duties and responsibilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As you complete contracts and fulfill your duties, you'll be promoted to the "
"next station, accepting the associated duties and responsibilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice5B_00022bd8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"As you have seen, that agreement is under a great deal of strain lately. The "
"Count does not agree with certain policies the guild has established."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566f_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"As you know, the Black Hand is now in a state of disarray. Lachance ordered "
"you to kill us off! We five, including you, are now all that remain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you know, the vampire can't remain in sunlight. I'd wager that you'll "
"never see Seridur outside during that time of day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b45e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"As you may know, I am somewhat of an enthusiast for Ayleid antiquities. In my "
"own modest way, I have amassed a rather considerable collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinB_0002d076_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you say. Perhaps fate will return you to us, someday?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bdba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bd92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Arch-Mage.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bd97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Arch-Mage.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirReturn_0007fdec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Inquisitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c28_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Lord Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c2b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Lord Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c2e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Lord Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c30_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Lord Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14HealNo_00079c8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014450_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish, Miss Herrick. Thank you for your time. And please, come back and "
"see me some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEResistArrest_000459c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish, My Lord. I will be honored to test myself in battle against You!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14DontSendGuards_00046835_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish, My Lord. I will tell the residents you will be handling it "
"personally. I'm sure the survivors will be delighted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14SendGuards_00046834_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish, My Lord. I'll see that a contingent of Dark Seducers is sent to "
"the settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14SendGuards_00046833_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish, My Lord. I'll see that a contingent of Golden Saints is sent to "
"the settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10LlevanaTalk_0003c371_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, Ulrich. Come my lovelies! Your feast has arrived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_000164b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, sire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Rez2_0004dcbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, sire. I would imagine that is for the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10NM_0001e96e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish, your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Nevermind_0003ed3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bd9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05NotNow_00002c8f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06NotNow_00002b2a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstEnough_00018e5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusEnd_0001a817_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusEnd_000807ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Entertainment1_0006372c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeNevermind_0001f3c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefendA4_000131b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish. But I advise you to join the winning side if you really want the "
"Flame relit. The Aureals will never drive us from Cylarne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirGreetChoice3_000805e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. Do come back and see me some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice1B_0002f881_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish. Don't worry, the contract will be available whenever you're "
"ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2D_00085941_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRodericGreetD_00002aa1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I had no intention to impose myself on your affairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Wait_00055407_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I shall attempt to hold this area until you return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Wait_00055b05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I shall attempt to hold this area until you return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14EscortNo_000637c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I stand at the ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BattleNotYet_00027784_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I will wait here while you prepare yourself for battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWait_00026ef3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I'll stay here until you get back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillXaselmYes_0004036e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. I'm sure you'll have no problem finding it on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04FinChoice1B_000253d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish. Just remember, had I issued a direct order, you would not have "
"been able to refuse. So say the Tenets. Consider what I have said. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactNotYet_00026d6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish. My preparations for the ritual will be different, depending on "
"the artifact we use, so I'll need it as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueNoSell_00085994_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish. That is a better price than you will get from anyone else. I "
"expect you will reconsider eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05PhintiasBuyNo_00022b4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"As you wish. That's a very fair price. I guarantee you won't find volume "
"three of Mankar Camoran's Commentaries anywhere else, for any price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Refuse_0002c51d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. Too bad, I was just getting to like you. Kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Wait_00055406_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. We shall attempt to hold this area until you return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Wait_00055b02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "As you wish. We shall attempt to hold this area until you return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d4b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ashame he wasn't there. I thought that you'd be able to put an end to this "
"madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479c8_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Aside from the fact that I'll kick your ass... it's against the law, and "
"you'll rot in jail for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029f3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Ask Kellen about the curse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ask a commoner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ask and I will listen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ask me what I think about chapels, praying, the Nine Divines. Go ahead. Ask "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c22b_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Ask yourself! How is it that mighty gods die, yet the Daedra stand "
"incorruptible?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoWhatNow_00044f53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ask? ASK? I don't ask. I tell. This is My Realm, remember? My creation, My "
"place, My rules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10UmarilVoiceSky_00002cc8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Asma bala ni hilyat sino?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Assassin! Why are you still here? Have you not opened your sealed orders? Go "
"now! The Black Hand obviously has need of your abilities!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor01_00053261_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Assassins attacked my sons, and I'm next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor01_0002ad12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Assassins attacked my sons. A secret passage here leads out of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028790_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Assuming that's true, who's next? You? Me? We need to keep our eyes open, "
"friend. And we'd do well not to trust the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e09e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Astia Inventius. Wife of the woodsman, Pinarus Inventius. Always out hunting. "
"Anything to avoid doing a little work around the house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Astinia Atius. I want no part of the Sintav-Atius squabbles. I mind my own "
"business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e13c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At Common Treasures you can find enough bits and bobs to last all of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15BandsOfChosen_0003c80e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"At Mankar Camoran's command, a favored few are given the Bands of the Chosen "
"and may leave the Savage Garden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At first I thought Matilde was just a cloying old hag, but now I realize she "
"could be the killer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2ae_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"At first I thought maybe he was from wealthy stock, but many of the goods "
"have been delivered recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002823a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At first I thought she was just a cranky old crone. Now I'm beginning to "
"think she's a cold-blooded killer. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At first light, the spire at the center of town became active. Immediately, "
"the area around it began to crystallize and change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetA2_00002b86_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At first things were going well. He prayed at all the shrines, and received a "
"vision. A disturbing vision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ca77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At last we meet in the flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_0001a394_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At last! We are free from Ciirta and her madness. Hail to Ra'kheran, the "
"lightbringer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At least Anaxes isn't here to torment us anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d4ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At least hear me out before you decide to end my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062349_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least now we have a name to put to our enemy. Mankar Camoran and the "
"Mythic Dawn will pay for their foul crimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d297_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least the Oblivion Gate outside the city is gone. Although news from the "
"rest of the Empire is still just as bad as ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001da5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least there are a few less vampires in the world now. Well done. But there "
"are more of these creatures that still roam Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49RingYes_00091c5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least this is safe. Thank you; I shall make sure it is protected, for the "
"time when a new Count is crowned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001ec22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least you are a woman. I would hate to be lead to my death by some foolish "
"male."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003336c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least you've got that brutish strength, huh? Must be nice to just rip "
"someone apart like some kind of monster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003336d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At least you've got that brutish strength, huh? Who needs pretty when you can "
"just rip someone apart like some kind of monster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e59_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At least your gullibility served some useful purpose. I knew about Mercator, "
"but not his friends. Now none of them are a threat any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice5C_00022bdd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At least, not for the moment. We will continue to monitor the situation, but "
"I assure you we will make no further attempts to mislead you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GrandChampionTopic_0002b7a2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"At least, that's what the people of Cyrodiil have come to believe. Maybe it's "
"time someone stepped into that Arena and proved them wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c09_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "At least, you will if you want your reward. Now get moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036647_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At long last ... you have freed me. Now I can finally complete my lord's last "
"request."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008da86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At long last, it's good to stand at Weatherleah again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirAmielSpeech05_00002cc0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At long last, our purgatory is at an end. We go to the glory of the Nine, to "
"serve in their host in the life beyond this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1B_0001e859_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At no time did I ever suggest that you should actually follow through and "
"give her the book! It cannot be left in her hands!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13OfficerGreetA3_0001acb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At once, m'Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ10Husband_00061420_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"At our wedding, my father gave us a family heirloom as a gift; Rockshatter, a "
"mace that's been in my family for many generations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsWhiteStallionTopic_000908e3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "At sunrise, the view across the water is quite picturesque."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12PaleNo_00018236_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At that time, the Empire was broken into smaller factions. Reman Cyrodiil "
"decided to unify them and form an army to repel the Akaviri raiders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Ceremony_00014abd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At the beginning of the worlds were five. Fire, Water, Earth, Air, and Light. "
"Darkness turned into day, the void took form. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e934_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At the last Imperial Alchemy Symposium, I heard Sinderion mention something "
"about a strange glowing root."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_00078fd8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"At the moment of my death, Lord Sheogorath appeared. We had already earned "
"His wrath for sins of pride. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRoutine_000167e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At the risk of being rude, I must confess I don't like talking about the "
"specifics of my routine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice4A_00022bd5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At the time, it was believed there was no reason to inform you, since it was "
"not crucial to the task you were given."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwaterBrigands_0000c1ce_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"At the time, the idea was quite clever, I thought. I figured the lore would "
"draw more curiosity seekers and adventurers looking for the treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018e5e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At the touch of a button, you can cause a large group of tiny Gnarls to "
"appear and attack the adventurers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c08d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At the worst possible time, the Council is in ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this moment, which hurts more, your insides or your outsides?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e143_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this place though you may be, if you look you won't find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e144_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this place though you may be, if you look you won't find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e145_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this place though you may be, if you look you won't find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e147_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this place though you may be, if you look you won't find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e148_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this place though you may be, if you look you won't find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e14a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this place though you may be, if you look you won't find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00031c82_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"At this point, Count Indarys is offering a reward for the recovery of his son "
"from inside the gate... or confirmed news of his demise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc9d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"At this rate, I don't know if I can keep my doors open. All the people are "
"spending their money there. Bah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00078975_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At this time, you have enough to go on. Now, get back to it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Visions_00033795_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"At times, they served her well. She gained something of a reputation in the "
"guild, and was highly valued by the Council."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007a019_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At your command, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000796f_DLCVileLair_RESP1"
msgid "At your service, Master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033765_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At your service, Master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015068_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "At your service. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_0008efd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Athel was a brave scout. She brought us the first word of the Fanatics. My "
"curse will not allow me to help you with her need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Attacks in Passwall? Invaders roaming the lands? You see, this is what "
"happens when leadership is lax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000363e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Audens Avidius escaped from prison!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00036607_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Audens Avidius, you are under arrest for extortion and petty theft. Surrender "
"peacefully and keep what little dignity you have left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aureals! Follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartAttack_00054fa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aureals! The cleansing of Cylarne begins now! Follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004db61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aureals! To me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartAttack_00054fa2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aureals! We attack through the Underdeep! The Mazken will be destroyed before "
"they awake to their danger. Follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001ec21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aurig Desha is wise. Duke or not, who are you to doubt her strategy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27Voice_000a934a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Av Auri-El ye Tamri-El dellevoy an Arpen Aran tarnabye!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27Voice_000a934c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Av Sunna Tam Riel arctavoy an Arpen Aran malaburo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Avoid the noxious Elytra, its stinger filled with bane. One dose of this in "
"your blood and your life begins to wane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e12c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Avoid the noxious Elytra, its stinger filled with bane. One dose of this in "
"your blood, your life begins to wane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaFanChoice1A_000aed45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aw gee! You sure? Okay, well, I'll be hanging around the Arena grounds if you "
"need someone to worship the ground you walk on. Bye!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhoInformant_000835f8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Aware of the growing interest in the guild after the ban on Necromancy was "
"put into place, he offered to help the Council track the cult's actions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036322_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Away from me, housecat! Look at that fur. What a disgrace... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081192_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Away with you dog, and fetch me those components."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00091597_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Away, mortal. I haven't time for your chatter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_00024205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Awful. I don't want to talk about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_00024204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Awful. You?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokC1Idle01_0008ea6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Awwww.... ain't it cute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_0018d7e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aye, Blademaiden. What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_0018d7e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aye, Bladesman. What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk5_0018d7fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye, comrade, we'd best stay sharp. Who knows what tomorrow brings. As for "
"the present, we'd best get back to our duties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_0003152a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aye, it was a fine portrait of a fine man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk2_0006fdd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye, it's a thankless job sometimes, but we wouldn't trade it for the world, "
"now would we. He he he he."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_000626c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye, she's a beauty, isn't she? It's hard not to admire the stonework. That's "
"some real craftsmanship, that is. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9835_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye, there's a bed free if you need it. It'll be 10 gold for the night. What "
"do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_vampirehunters_000039be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye, they're staying here. Won't say how long they'll be in town, but as long "
"as they keep payin', I ain't too worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_0002b8df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye, we've heard the old man's story. Nothing to back it up, though, except "
"the word of those two kids of his. No real evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight2Male_00002ce1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye. He died too young. We all miss him. But remember, he died in the Nine's "
"service. None of us can ask any more than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_thieves_00002e55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye. I know about those scum. Rotten bastards robbed me blind, they did. "
"Stole a family heirloom. Bunch of Bosmer, if you can believe it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_thieves_00002e51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye. I know about those scum. Rotten bastards robbed me blind, they did. "
"Stole a family heirloom. Bunch of Bosmer, if you can believe that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_00026ab6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Aye. I know of Umbra. But you're a stranger to me, and I'm not talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cf84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye. I'm Ulfgar Fog-Eye, master of the Anvil lighthouse. Visit the lighthouse "
"any time. Fine view of the town and harbor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting02a_00002c0f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Aye. With the apotheosis of Tiber Septim, the face of the divine was "
"transformed. Talos ascended and the Eight became Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008605c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ayisha minds Ayisha's business. Maybe you should try this, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ayleid ruins? The big thing is to watch out for the traps. Thousands of years "
"old, and still working. Amazing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c58e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Azani Blackheart is dead, and our brothers avenged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Azzan at the Fighters Guild is a fine warrior. I understand he can sign you "
"up, if you're interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Azzan says the scholar lady was lucky to get back alive. But Oreyn's new "
"'hard hand' did just fine in a tough situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Azzan's report says there were ogres in Sedor. I think this gold soldier "
"might be the real thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018d936_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again I see!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again so soon I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000277ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again, are you? Do you have the book THIS time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again, friend? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again, huh? What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingBlockTest_00062332_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again? You ready for my test now? I haven't got all day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cf76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back again? You still want to help my good-for-nothing husband?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12PaleNo_00018236_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Back at the end of the First Era, raiders from the continent of Akavir "
"attempted to gain a foothold here in Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00094ec1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back for more information?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002c7e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Back for more work, are you? Good. Some of our boys are causing trouble in "
"Leyawiin. Looks bad for the guild. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Back for more? It just so happens I have another contract available, one that "
"requires an expert in infiltration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopicDecentius03_000479f3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Back in the Merethic, he charted the sea lanes and explored the River Niben. "
"Torval sailed all the way from Topal Bay up the Niben Valley."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AssaultNoCrime_00066339_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back off! I'm warning you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081191_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back so soon, and glowing with success, I see!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back so soon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081198_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back so soon? And here I was hoping you'd manage to get killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a2d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Back to Oblivion with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00054671_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to Oblivion with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b832_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to Oblivion with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001822f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to take me up on that offer, eh? I knew you couldn't resist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006fdcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Back to the watch then, eh? Don't forget to stop by the barracks later. I'll "
"show you those new greaves. The Mithril ones. Until then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00070401_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to work I go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00035752_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to work for poor old Orgnolf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderBattle03_00018e6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to your positions! Don't break ranks! Hold! Hold!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderBattle03_000415dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back to your positions! Don't break ranks! Hold! Hold!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00086094_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Back, nithing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Baenlin is dead, yes, but you did not fulfill the contract precisely as "
"directed. I will grant your reward of gold, but the bonus is forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007327b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Baenlin... Oh Baenlin... I loved ya, old man. I loved ya... But I couldn't "
"protect ya... Oh Baenlin! Waaaahhhhh! [sobbing]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08NelsNevConvo_000852c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bah! Don't get your linens in a bunch. You have no authority in this house, "
"or anywhere else. You're not even in the Legion anymore!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Laugh_00066f2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bah! See, I knew you'd laugh. Some big hero you are. You're all the same. "
"Nothing to do but laugh at an old man and his troubles. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberTwoManEnd03_000732a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Bah! Suit yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000253e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bah! You have neither the skill nor the daring to fulfill this contract. I "
"hope the moneylender cuts out your heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02PirateConvo_000493b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bah! You mark my words, boy. That Dark Elf trollop is bad luck. The "
"captain'll end up dead with her around. You'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028c0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Bah. Get out of my sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Bah. I liked when Thadon was in a bad mood. Foolish Maniac."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice2B_00028c0c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Bah. I was a fool to have trusted you in the first place. Get out of my sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokC2Idle01_0008ea83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Bah. This place is beginning to bug me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189d07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Barely a week ago, I left Harm's Folly to go buy supplies as I usually do "
"once a month. What a fool I was to leave my wife alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008673c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Barkeep! A drink for my friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Barkeep! A refill!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Father_00033eff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Barthel Gernand is my father. I'm worried about him. I think it will break "
"his heart if we can't build Cropsford."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46FatherInLaw_00033efe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Barthel Gernand. He talked us into selling our comfortable house in High Rock "
"to start a new settlement here in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000151f4_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid "Based on the activity I've seen, that should be very soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002c344_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Based on your abilities, here are your choices. Do you want to fight one "
"Mountain Lion, two Mountain Lions, or two Mountain Lions and a Spriggan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Bastard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00MythicDawnResponse_0018b210_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bastards. If I ever got a hold of one of them, I'd put 'em in the fire, like "
"the old days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f3ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Bastards. Take my flagon...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_000135d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bat gro-Orkul is so stingy with the armory. He should dance today. He may "
"cost us our town today. Then we'll see who dances!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_00013347_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Bat loves his arrows. They aren't Althel's, they're his. Bat would be "
"betrothed to his arrows if he could. By the way, have you seen my betrothed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00000807_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Battlehorn Castle, near Chorrol, is besieged by marauders! I wish I could go "
"and save them…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00032b03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Baurus! Lock that door behind us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000688fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Baurus, good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000688f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Baurus. Good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000688ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Baurus. I want you to know... I don't blame you for what happened. You did "
"everything you could. I'm glad to have you here by my side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022496_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be a dear, and fetch me that book like I asked. Hurry along now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Be aware, though, that your rank can be stripped for failure to uphold the "
"tenets of the guild, or at my discretion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Be aware, though, that your rank can be stripped for failure to uphold the "
"tenets of the guild, or at the sole discretion of the guildmaster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e9ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004e952_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be careful in Shadeleaf Copse. No telling what else resides there besides the "
"Nirnroot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033535_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081db1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be careful of Relmyna's temper. She... she has ways of extracting obedience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002acc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful out there, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Scales_00068852_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be careful out there. The Rumare slaughterfish are all around this area. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000175bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00054229_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful, and watch your step."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be careful, my friend. I know you have braved many dangers already, but "
"Miscarcand is not to be taken lightly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000a3846_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Be careful, some say the gate leads to the realm of Oblivion itself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_001885d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful, that brute was absolutely huge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d041_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Be careful, there is no telling what this \"Agarmir\" is up to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033d0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00090993_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00095a82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00060333_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be careful. Davide Surilie is the ringleader. You must NOT let him catch you "
"watching him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008da9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful. I don't know what dangers may lurk in the Great Forest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000835c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful. Some things in here don't react well to magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful. There may be more of them about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberOneGnarl_00073009_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful. There may be more to this creature than meets the eye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008ea1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful. They're listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be careful..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Diary_0001823b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Be cautious, and return home soon. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be cautious, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00066eab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be cautious, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000165b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be cautious... their leader sounds dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be ever vigilant, vampires are creatures of deceit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00146810_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be ever vigilant, vampires are creatures of deceit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d040_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Be ever vigilant. The crime of grave robbing is punishable only by death, so "
"Agarmir is likely to do anything to keep his crimes secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fc3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be glad to answer any other questions. Just keep your voice down, who knows "
"what could slip out of that gate at any moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS06PantherPoint_00036602_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be glad to. Here, let me have your map and I'll mark the spot for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001eee5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be glad you will not live to see the day Lord Dagon walks the earth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000b5bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be happy to help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice6_00014b61_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what you find there. The library is a thing of Order, and it "
"will still serve that end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d492_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be nice to get another pretty face in the gang. Hope to see you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be nice to have someone else to do the... uh... dirty work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01JoinThievesGuild_000039d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be patient and wait for the others. I need both the Wood Elf and the Argonian "
"before I can begin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ccc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be patient, all will be explained."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e926_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be patient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be patient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be patient. Lord Dagon's victory is only a matter of time now, and then we "
"will return to Tamriel in triumph."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014da4_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Be quick about it, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e8f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be quick about it, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0017c460_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be quick about it. This is our best chance to rescue the survivors from the "
"Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be quick about this or find someone else to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be quick please, I have a farm to run. It isn't going to run itself, now is "
"it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003aaa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be seeing you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000981bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be seeing you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be sure to speak to Jauffre about the Armor of Tiber Septim. I'll continue my "
"study of the Mysterium Xarxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e5c8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Be that as it may. I now have a task that should be better to suited someone "
"of your particular talents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27QuestStart_0002e5ce_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Be that as it may. She has come into possession of an ancient relic known as "
"the Crown of the Ayleids. Your job is to acquire it for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetC2_00016d03_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Be that as it may. You will have to enter the Fountainhead beneath the Tree "
"and find the source of the poison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetC2_00016edd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Be that as it may. You will have to enter the Fountainhead beneath the Tree "
"and find the source of the poison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018917a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be vigilant. Lonavo is a snake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32NotSolved_000135d2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Be warned though. While you wear the helm, it is as if you are one of us. You "
"are trapped in these ruins until you lift our curse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014e2a_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be wary Hero, whoever is behind this will be a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be wary of the Shambles, its bones in disarray. Don't stand too close when "
"they die... explode into frost they may."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e11a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Be wary of the Shambles, its bones in disarray. Don't stand too close when "
"they die... explode into frost they may."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003160e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be wary the shadows, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00031612_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be wary the shadows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007ec6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be wary the shadows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013ffa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Be wary, I fear that her escape may be a ruse to lure you into an ambush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007ec6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be well, and live free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000b97e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be well, milady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000b97e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Be well, milord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00159763_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Beast people and other savages. Work cheap and fast. \"No job too tough.\" "
"Not fussy, either. Fighters Guild better watch out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaladaTopic_0002c52d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Beautiful countryside, don't you think? We're just doing a bit of hunting and "
"sightseeing, not that it's any of your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35FlawlessPearlsTopic_00078671_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Beautiful gems, they are. They can be found all over the Shivering Isles in "
"treasure chests and the like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004918e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Beautiful, isn't she? The Marie Elena. Damn fine ship, with a damn fine crew. "
"I should know, I'm her first mate. Malvulis is my name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_0002b522_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Beautiful. Exquisite. You have proven yourself to be quite resourceful. I "
"have another task which should interest someone of your particular talents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10SheoJygglag_000913d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Because He is Me! I'm Him! We're a bit of each other, really. I won't be here "
"when He arrives, because I'll be Him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice3_000133e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Because my Lord wills it to be so. It poses no danger to Mundus; no compact "
"has been violated. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11HistoryChanged_00022e8b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Because of the curse, he was unable to operate in the normal world of "
"business and society. He could only act as the guild's figurehead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008d2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Because of the discretion you exercised, Captain Phillida will not suspect "
"the Dark Brotherhood was involved, and will not meddle in our affairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ff08_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Because of the discretion you exercised, Captain Phillida will not suspect "
"the Dark Brotherhood was involved, and will not meddle in our affairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00014b5d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Because of this, her eye will serve well to contain that which the staff must "
"hold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00016ec7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Because of this, her eye will serve well to contain that which the staff must "
"hold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00016ef6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Because of this, her eye will serve well to contain that which the staff must "
"hold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenBenirus_00003a71_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"Because of this, the people of Anvil concluded the manor must be cursed. You "
"are the first person to set foot inside in a long time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003570f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Because of your actions, I am hereby stripping you of your rank of Champion. "
"You were reckless, foolhardy, and dangerous to yourself and the Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Because we refused to convert, they lay siege to Vitharn. If they had agreed "
"to let me rule, I would have helped them. But now they're on the list."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro3_00082464_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Because you seem a nice enough sort. And you've made it this far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44AmuletInfo_00078736_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Because, when they come for me, I'm not going to let them have my stuff. No "
"way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Become_0001365e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Becoming the Duke of Dementia requires passage through the Ritual of "
"Accession, specific guidelines set forth by Arden-Sul himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_000241ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Been better. How about you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_heirloom_00002e91_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Been drinking from a lousy wooden tankard since. It's just not the same. If "
"you can find it, you'd have the gratitude of Newheim the Portly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Been here thirty years, and I expect I'll last another ten or so. When I'm "
"gone, gods willing, my apprentice, Enilroth, will tend the smithy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048922_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Been here. Right here! All day! Last night, too! I wasn't there! Not there at "
"all! I can totally prove it! Ask anyone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025575_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Been to Fire and Steel recently? Rasheda has some nice new swords in there. "
"And she's a friendly one, she is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_000b52a4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Before I go on, let's clear something up. Are you here asking about the sword "
"or the person. Which is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice4B_0009079b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Before I send you away, however, I would like to present you with a rather "
"special reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071952_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before Tiber Septim, Cyrodiil's roads varied greatly in quality, and were "
"often impassible in bad weather and winter seasons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05ThedretPhrase_00002afa_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before finding this place, I learned a bit about those who created it. It's "
"designed to keep the Shield hidden and safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30Matrices_0001e696_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before my master passed on, she hid countless matrices in the world. There to "
"soak up the magical essence of our world. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047639_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Before the Arcane University was founded in the second era, Crystal Tower on "
"Summerset Isle was the source of all magical learning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before the body turned up, I got the sense that Nels was a bit of a drunkard. "
"But he seems truly unnerved now, and is drinking rather excessively. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c5415_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before we continue, you should speak to Raminus Polus about your advancement "
"within the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_000c47f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before we continue, you should speak to Raminus Polus about your advancement "
"within the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00188f42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before you begin, we must first discuss your advancement within the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00034ea9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Before you can begin work for the guild, you'll need to do something for "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08UrsanneAvenged_0001fdbe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Before you go, I have this for you. Aleron told me that if he ever got in "
"trouble, this could be used to bail him out of jail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008af_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Before you go, however, I intend to make good on an offer I made some time "
"ago. As a vampire, I may pass my gift on to others as I see fit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JihattTopic_000479cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Beg pardon. It is a word from the Ta'agra, meaning 'warrior for hire'. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008608f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Beg, birthskin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000131b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Begone, mortal, or you will soon find yourself between the Mazken and their "
"prey. A most dangerous place to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e8f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Begone, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GSWardenGreet3_00018dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Begone, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018b194_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Begone, stranger! I have business with Kynareth's shrine, and I will not be "
"disturbed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002249d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Begone, weakling. I have no use for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004666d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Behold as two Heroes meet in the fighting pit for an epic battle worthy of "
"song! Combatants... begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c21e_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Behold the Savage Garden, where my disciples are tempered for a higher "
"destiny: to rule over Tamriel Reborn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060824_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Behold the new god of madness! It is I, Kishashi, who has defeated the forces "
"of Jyggalag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAnnouncer_00048383_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Behold the new hero of the people of Cyrodiil! Behold, your Arena Grand "
"Champion, Dragonheart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAnnouncer_00048384_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Behold the new hero of the people of Cyrodiil! Behold, your Arena Grand "
"Champion, Lady Luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAnnouncer_00048380_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Behold the new hero of the people of Cyrodiil! Behold, your Arena Grand "
"Champion, Man o' War!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAnnouncer_0004837a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
