msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneTears_00022e62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Certainly. Garridan was a knight who lorded over a small village of peaceful "
"farmers. One harvest summer, there was a horrible drought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrisonVisitor_0018d1fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Certainly. I'll unlock the door for you. Of course I have to stay with you in "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Certainly. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualNoM_00013661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Certainly. When the ruler of Mania has decided it is time, he will choose a "
"successor from his court."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Chalice... Mine! Get away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chalices? Who can think about chalices with the cat problem around here? "
"Nasty beasts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OcatoTopic_000add3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chancellor Ocato has performed heroically. No one else could have held the "
"Empire together during this crisis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElderCouncilTopic_000adc6a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Chancellor Ocato heads the Elder Council and is the closest thing the Empire "
"has to a leader right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000adc66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Chancellor Ocato is expecting you. Proceed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MartinF_0004bf99_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Chancellor Ocato is the head of the Elder Council. The Council rules in the "
"Emperor's absence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OcatoTopic_000add49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Chancellor Ocato isn't seeing any visitors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16Voice_00049816_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Chancellor Ocato! Chancellor Ocato!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000146f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chancellor Ocato! The city is under attack! Oblivion Gates have opened, and "
"daedra are inside the walls! The guard is overwhelmed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CastleResidents_000038ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chanel and Orgnolf both reside in the Private Quarters section. They have "
"been restricted to remain indoors, so they should be easy to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChoice1_0000365d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chanel? I find that very hard to believe. Until you obtain a full confession "
"from her, I cannot accept your accusation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AThadonLeaves_000206c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Change will preserve us! It is the lifeblood of the Isles. It will move "
"mountains! It will mount movements!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BSylLeaves_0003b820_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Change will preserve us! It is the lifeblood of the Isles. It will move "
"mountains! It will mount movements!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Change your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005327b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Change your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004cfa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Changed your mind, have you? The offer's still good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Crisis_00066fef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Changed your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OrderOfTalosTopic_00033dfb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Chapterhouses of the Order, like Weynon Priory, provide safehouses for "
"travelling Blades as well as our more public religious functions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031d07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Charge the courtyard! Leave none of them standing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00064462_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Chasing after shadows if you ask me. The Thieves Guild probably doesn't "
"exist, and it's a sure bet the Gray Fox doesn't either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "Check back with me tomorrow after I've given this matter some thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0006e2e3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Check with me monthly to give orders for the month.  I'll make it happen. If "
"I don't hear from you, I'll follow the previous month's orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081dd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cheers to Sheogorath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cheers to the new ruler of Dementia! Drinks all around!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d28e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cheydinhal is in your debt, friend. That Oblivion Gate had us all living in "
"fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000c4531_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Cheydinhal is safe once again thanks to the Knights of the Thorn! Huzzah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d280_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cheydinhal sleeps more soundly tonight, thanks to you, friend. What can I do "
"for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00031841_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cheydinhal will mourn his loss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081199_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Choices, choices. That took you long enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000917c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Choices, choices. Well, now that you've liberated some Greenmote from the "
"Silo, you need to add it to Thadon's food and wine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chorrol appears to be clean, prosperous, and well-ordered. Countess Arriana, "
"her staff and guard is to be praised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d294_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Chorrol breathes easier thanks to you. We are all in your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Chorrol is a wonderful town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002c4d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chorrol's got plenty to eat, and good, thick walls, and that suits me fine. I "
"don't know what's going on out there in the woods, and I don't need to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000237ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Chorrol? That's where we are, right? Really? Great. I don't care. And I'm not "
"interested. But it's sure nice of you to let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004993a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cicero, Sergius, and Tertullian run a good shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3a_0008f12c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ciirta brought us here with promises to show us the light, but always is "
"about Sheogorath, is about revenge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_00016b82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta guides us to the light, but... her obsession with Sheogorath keeps us "
"from achieving it! Ra'kheran, now he -- I've said too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016b59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta has fallen into darkness. Ra'kheran will lead the Apostles to the "
"light!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_00016b81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta is a fool, and a liar! She allows her hatred for Sheogorath to "
"interfere with our journey toward the light! She must be stopped!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007dea0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ciirta is dead, and Ra'kheran has fallen. Who will guide us now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a391_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta is dead, and now the Apostles fear that there is no one to lead them "
"to the light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016b77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ciirta is dead. Ra'kheran will guide us now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_00016b85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta is the lightbringer. She has seen things that we can only imagine. If "
"you are to join us, you must speak with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3a_0008f12c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ciirta lied, but when she is done, I will lead the Acolytes to the light!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11TheLightTopic_0008f12d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta promised to bring us to the light. It is a way, a promise of a better "
"future. Free from the shackles of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice1_00019ccf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ciirta resides in the Howling Halls of Mania. Find her and bring me the eye "
"that has seen that which no other has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_0001a397_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ciirta's light has been darkened. Now is the time for another to rise and "
"stand in her place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39SpoonChoice2_000781fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Cindanwe is always trying to hurt my sweet Kishashi. Wouldn't want the slave-"
"driver to get her hands on this spoon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cindanwe runs a tight ship in Fellmoor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Cindanwe_000781f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cindanwe think she tough lady. Not as mean as Relan. She okay. She let Relan "
"kill things that need to be dead. Relan like biting off heads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be7b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Cindanwe would breathe her last breath with my hands around her throat and my "
"sweet Kishashi would take her place. If only..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cirroc is a good healer. He's a Redguard, but you'd think he was a Nord, the "
"way he acts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechAmulet_00002d1f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Citizens, the Queen of Stars asks you: where is her issue? Where are the men "
"who can walk in her steps? In whose blood has the dragon taken purchase?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Lynch02Negative_000151e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"City Watch? I doubt it. But since you have aligned yourself with them, I "
"think it's time to put an end to this conversation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046636_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"City-Swimmer certainly lives up to her name. I've seen her in the canals many "
"times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046633_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "City-Swimmer is a bit odd, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Convo_00024829_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Civilians! It's time to move out! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004994f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Claudette Perrick runs a fine alchemy shop. You should check out The Gilded "
"Carafe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049951_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Claudette does a good job. Still, she should rename the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026a9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Clavicus Vile has offered you a bargain. Serve him well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Clavicus has always been a little blind to that. And it'll end badly this "
"time, too. So, just leave things be. Walk away. It's your best bet, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be7d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Clean of vermin. Clean of the things and people who would take our crops and "
"eat them with their nasty nasty teeth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040cb5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Cleansing the Tree seems to have convinced him that the direct approach was "
"his only option."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_thieves_00035741_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cleared them out, did you? Good work, you two. I see big things for you with "
"the Guild. Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b588_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Clearly he was wrong. Yet I do think he meant well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000918dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Clever adversary isn't she? I bet your thinking that this was too easy, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00093552_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Clever girl, I taught her everything I knew. Too bad she's turned that "
"knowledge against me. Come back when you have the real thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AxeofDragol_0001fdb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Clever ruse. I wonder how many have died falling for it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting2a_00019fca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Clever you are, but I can sense a liar. No matter, I do not care to know why "
"you are here; I only care that you wish Ciirta harm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Clever. You've summoned me again. My Lord has made quite a choice for his "
"champion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_000150c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Close up left! Protect the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cloud Ruler Temple is home to the Blades, and has served us well. But I fear "
"an assault. Mythic Dawn, Daedra... maybe both. We must be ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_00034069_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cloud Ruler Temple was built long ago, by the founders of the Blades, back in "
"the days of Reman Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04KeepMartinSafe_0001ee2e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Cloud Ruler Temple, I think. The hidden fortress of the Blades, in the "
"mountains near Bruma. A few men can hold it against an army."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_000626c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cloud Ruler is many things. Temple, fortress, safe haven. But it's also my "
"home. I'll gladly die defending these walls, if it comes to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Colovia is a land of rugged wastes and highland forests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Colovia is dotted with isolated farms and settlements, with most of the "
"population in the coastal margin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c193_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Colovian Traders is a good shop. Perhaps I'll visit Gunder soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Combined with the Eye of Ciirta, the shell of the Staff can be remade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004e959_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come across any more Nirnroot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00061c3b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Come after dark. Come alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_000091e5_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "Come back and see me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornNeverMind_0000de50_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Come back and see me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018b9fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back and visit me anytime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003375d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back any time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004e960_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back anytime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002b3d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back as quickly as you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072df2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back for a drink!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseDecline_0004ce58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come back if you change your mind. We are the only place in Cyrodiil where "
"you can get the magnificent White horse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00033ee6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come back in a few weeks. You may be surprised at what we can accomplish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066f33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come back to laugh at the pathetic old man, have we? To the pit with you! "
"Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000299a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Come back to see the doomed man, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b984a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back when you actually have the money for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000980d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back when you have the real thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice8_0002c651_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back when you're ready. Don't delay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_00071095_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come back when you've got the ectoplasm, and we'll talk about those other men "
"getting work from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00028a29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come back when you've learned something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000366e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come back with help. I don't know how much longer we can hold out in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f791_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come closer. I'd prefer not to have to shout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come closer. Taste the power of the Lord of Order!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b0ab_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Come into the High Hall of Judgment. Let us test ourselves against one "
"another once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_00015631_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come now, must we start with hostilities? This situation is not of my "
"creation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014452_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come now. We all know you've spread rumors about Thadon leaving his section "
"of the palace late at night. You've been meeting him, haven't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000164ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on Bloodletter, don't lose your momentum now. Keep fighting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48StartCombatShouts_00082c91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0017c45f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on! For Kvatch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032d3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come on! Run while there's still time! The Guard still holds the road, but "
"it's only a matter of time before they're overwhelmed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on! Together we can defeat him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005a025_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on! We can use your help to drive back the invaders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come on! We have to protect Martin until he can light the Dragonfires in the "
"Temple!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e120_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on! We need to get to the Dragonfires before it's too late!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009098d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on! We need to help the Grandmaster!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS91Wait_000860d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on! What's the hold-up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcConversation_0007ead1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come on,  it'll be fun watching them get knocked around up there. I'll lead, "
"you'll follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_00037cfc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on, now. The room is only 10 gold. Surely you can afford that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007bac1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on, we've got to keep moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025273_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Come on, you've got to help me! Let old Valen out of this cell! You've got "
"your freedom, now give me mine! What do you say, huh? Come on, friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004cad8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Come on, you've got to help me! Let old Valen out of this cell! You've got "
"your freedom, now give me mine! What do you say, huh? Come on, friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000919b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a5648_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on. Drink up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcCaptainOrders_00018fc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on. Fight harder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on. Join the Fighters Guild. See the world, and get paid for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on. Let's get this mission done and get paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come on. My men will need all the help they can get today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024851_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Come on. This is only the beginning of the battle for Kvatch. We can discuss "
"the next phase once the civilians are safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG14CamillaTaunts_00085884_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come out, come out wherever you are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c45bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come see me anytime, friend. I'm here day or night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002285b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come see me when I'm at the Chironasium, and we'll take care of that for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c06b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come see me when you've spoken to Jeanne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting2b_00016b72_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Come then, and I will show you that in the end, my light shall shine the "
"brightest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b5f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come to bother me with a war story, Redguard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c33b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come to gloat, eh? Well, you'll get no apologies from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come to have a few words before you slit my throat? That's right, I know you "
"did it. I can't prove it yet, but you mark my words: You're going down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00038ee1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come to me, sweet flesh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03LlathasaIndarys_00045f78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come to pay your respects, have you? You can find her tomb in the chapel "
"undercroft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Ceremony_00014acc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come to this altar. Join with this body. Quintessence of Flesh joined with "
"the Essence of Flesh. Absolute in mortal. Immortal bound to contingent. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000276a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come with me to the Chapel of Talos. I wish to speak with your lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000290c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Come with me! We have to tell everyone that you're alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002934_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come with me, if you will, to the Wayshrine of Arkay. I will offer a prayer "
"for the souls of those who died in the Nine's service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045754_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come with me, scum. Those who can't afford to pay reparations must face Lord "
"Sheogorath's dungeons. I'm confiscating your stolen goods as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJauffreHelp_0005d2c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come with me. I have a few things here that I keep for visiting Blades "
"agents. Help yourself to whatever you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PayGoldforCrime_000459d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come with me. You'll be searched for stolen property, then released."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025dec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come with us. Your destiny is bound up with mine, and with the fate of "
"Tamriel itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000521e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come with us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD07Choice1_000356e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come with you? Not likely. I know some of my men are still alive. Guards! "
"Attack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGiveDaggers3_0001a7bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come! Now is the time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002aef9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Come, I have much to tell you. A tavern is right over here. We will drink a "
"toast to Umbacano."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril4_00002c4e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Come, if we keep ourselves busy the waiting will be easier to bear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400dc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Come, light the Great Torch for Dementia!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400db_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Come, light the Great Torch for Dementia. Illuminate the conspiracies! Deepen "
"the shadows! The people of Crucible await their Hero!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d84_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Come, mortal. Our Prince's power is close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473c2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Come, my father is waiting to welcome you to Carac Agaialor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473c3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Come, my father is waiting to welcome you to Carac Agaialor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice8_00026b20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come, then. Try your luck. Feel the bite of Umbra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ReturnHome_0001c1cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come, you must need food and rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC6_0003e8fc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Come. As an equal, I shall grace your name and corpse with honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002978_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Come. He is preaching to the assembled Knights in the Chapel. You should "
"speak to him at once. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015304_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come. We have much to discuss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001473c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come. We must talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_00037b52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come. Your Blades are waiting to greet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036409_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come. Your initiation awaits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00038ee4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Come... here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3a_000186fc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Command them if you will, or leave it to me. Either way, make haste. Our time "
"is short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3a_00018c7e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Command them if you will, or leave it to me. Either way, make haste. Our time "
"is short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Commander Ja'Fazir. Your servant. I am second-in-command of the Blackwood "
"Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Commander."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007815d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Common Treasures is full of junk. That's all Tilse Areleth collects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bdc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Complacency proved to be our greatest enemy. The service of the Nine requires "
"eternal vigilance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Comrades, beware!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002459e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Concerning this, I can only speak to a friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000918d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Confused already? How very disappointing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000918fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Confused already? Very disappointing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040367_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations on creating the Gatekeeper, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bccc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations on your buy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c147_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Congratulations on your victory! I admit, I thought your plan would lead to "
"disaster, but you came through for Bruma. I won't forget it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c156_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations on your victory, ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c155_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations on your victory, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c140_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations on your victory. Your fame was well-deserved, it seems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00031614_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003b837_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d283_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_000153ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Congratulations! You have returned with the diary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0001811e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have returned with the diary. You have earned the right "
"to join the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo05_00090b78_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you manky scroat. Now get away from me. And don't ever talk "
"to me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo06_00090b79_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you manky scroat. Now get away from me. And don't ever talk "
"to me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12RecoverYes_0001823d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Congratulations. I had a feeling you were the right person for the job. And "
"it seems I owe you a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ce5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Congratulations. I had a feeling you would catch on sooner or later. Leaving "
"that journal behind was a stupid mistake on my part."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Congratulations. You've gained another ally in your efforts. Do remember to "
"follow up with Ma'zaddha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06FenceTopic02_000088a0_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "Consider it done. I will get rid of all your criminal warrants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayFines_000983a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Consider it done. I will get rid of all your criminal warrants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_00043029_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Consider that combat is not your only option. Your Grace has already made use "
"of the chimes found in Brellach, and they can be useful once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0004302d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Consider that combat is not your only option. Your Grace has made use of the "
"chimes within Pinnacle Rock already, and they can be useful once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_000039a3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Consider the implications of that, as you handle a small matter for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Conspiracy in the House of Dementia. Sad, sad songs. Songs of missing things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_000807ae_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Contained within its walls were the formulaic predictions of every action "
"ever taken by any creature, mortal or Daedric."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_0001a815_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Contained within its walls were the logical prediction of every action ever "
"taken by any creature, mortal or Daedric."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofDespairTopic_0007ff5e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Continue down the corridor if you wish to meditate there upon the fate of all "
"things mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016ec6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Contrary to your goals, you remain here with me. If you seek the recreation "
"of the staff, then you must bring the eye and the branch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_000414e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Conviction can drive men mad. They will even kill to uphold the mistaken "
"belief that only they see the world truly. Such is the story of Vitharn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089606_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Convincing a Dark Seducer to reveal secrets to you may require more pressure "
"than you've experienced thus far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona06_00022e82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Corvus! Is it really you? Ten years I've waited for word from you. Why did "
"you hide from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylWho_000139b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Could be all of them. Every last one. None can be trusted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD03Choice3_0002d72d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Could be that. But you said the corpse was intact. Nothing had dined on the "
"gem-hunter. Something doesn't sit right with me about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_0008306a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Could be the Blades. They've always feared me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FishermansRockTopicSmashing_00091cc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Could be. You know how it is. But not until I'm finished talking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028239_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Could it be possible? Could an old lady be a murderer? She'd have the stomach "
"for it, of that I'm sure.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e1ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Could it be the K'Sharra?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Could someone muffle the door? The sounds of combat are disturbing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071956_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Could these runestones have served as waypoints and landmarks for military "
"patrols of the nascent Imperial Legion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f9c1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Could you please get some more aquanostrum from Knotty Bramble for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HaderusGoldwineTopic_0002ad7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Goldwine is the embodiment of nobility. He's always ruled Kvatch with a "
"fair hand, and listened to the needs of his people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HaderusGoldwineTopic_0002ad7e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Count Goldwine retreated to the castle, determined to hold on to it at any "
"cost. He's still in there now, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005d8f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Count Hassildor awaits your arrival."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice1A_0000399e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor of Skingrad has contacted the Council. He claims to have "
"information that is vital to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_0003e94c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor of Skingrad has done the most recent research on a cure, I "
"believe. He has what you might call a vested interest in the subject."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_00066a1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Hassildor will only consider buyers of distinction. You just aren't "
"famous enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0018d2fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Indarys has ordered us to hold our positions until Farwil returns from "
"inside that accursed Oblivion Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033595_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Count Indarys is waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03BribeBeggar_000092b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Indarys recently commissioned a bust of Llathasa. They say the Elves "
"carved it. He put it near her tomb in the Chapel Undercroft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03ElvenBust_00048979_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Indarys recently commissioned a bust of Llathasa. They say the Elves "
"carved it. He put it near her tomb in the Chapel Undercroft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice1A_00022b67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Janus Hassildor, at your service. A 'thank you' might be in order at "
"this point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0014600c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Leyawiin created a new order of knights -- the White Stallion -- for "
"the ones who defeated Black Brugo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0014600b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Leyawiin placed a bounty on the heads of the surviving Black Bow "
"Bandits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Skingrad has ruled here all my life. The county is quiet and prosperous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Skingrad is a very private person. I handle all the county's public "
"affairs, and consult with the Count when necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006446b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Count Umbranox has returned! After eleven years, he just walked back into "
"Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiasRing_0000a175_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Countess Caro is so relieved to have the ring back. It's been missing for "
"many years. She wears it constantly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12TolganGreet_0001c497_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Countess Carvain would prefer if you speak to her in person. She also said to "
"present you with this stipend as a taste of things to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AkaviriArtifacts_000980f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Countess Carvain's collection of Akaviri Artifacts is known far and wide as "
"one of the most complete. It's unsurpassed even by museum standards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07WhatIsPlan_000983a1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Countess Umbranox of Anvil, is hunting for a new captain of her guard. The "
"Legion Commander of the Imperial Watch sent her a list of candidates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51Talk_0003481d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Countess Valga is up in arms about the painting being stolen. We're supposed "
"to keep an eye on things until it's found."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Counting the wrong corpses. You were a big help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16MessengerTopic_000146ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Courage, soldier. We have an Emperor again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d86_AltarDeluxe_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Crafting it is beyond mortal abilities hence you'll need to summon me "
"whenever you need a new one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d88_AltarDeluxe_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Crafting it is beyond mortal abilities hence you'll need to summon me "
"whenever you need a new one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d8a_AltarDeluxe_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Crafting it is beyond mortal abilities hence you'll need to summon me "
"whenever you need a new one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingZenithar_00002abe_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Craftsmen devoted to Zenithar are able to create and profit from the "
"materials provided by Kynareth's natural world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Zenithar_00002ac2_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Craftsmen devoted to Zenithar are able to create and profit from the "
"materials provided by Kynareth's natural world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Zenithar_00002ac3_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Craftsmen devoted to Zenithar are able to create and profit from the "
"materials provided by Kynareth's natural world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008608e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Crawl, craven!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThurindilTopic_0003e0d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Crazy as a rat in a catbox. Just leave him alone. He's not hurting anybody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046823_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Creatures have been reported in Deepwallow, Lord. Perhaps you should "
"intervene... as it is your job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000410a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cretin! Nincompoop! Halfwit! Now I have to start all over again. Happy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Crime doesn't pay. We have long memories. We won't forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c46d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Crime don't pay. My cells is full of fools thinkin' it did. I might just sees "
"ya there soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047663_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Crime in the City? You hear a lot of complaining, but it's really not so bad. "
"The Thieves Guild is smart; they don't want any trouble with the Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChoice4_00038ed7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Crowhaven is a ruined fort far to the west of here. I'd go myself, but my "
"training regiment doesn't allow for the luxury of such an excursion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_0006164f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Crucible can be a dangerous place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Crucible has a new ruler. Perhaps I can continue to find shelter in the House "
"of Dementia, else what will I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061c67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Crucible will be safer with the armies intact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirAmielSpeech01_00002c9f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Crusader... arise... stand and face the light. Breathe again and receive your "
"reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBootsMagic_00016ce4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Crush the skulls of the fallen under your boots. Stomp out their eyeballs "
"with your heel. Paint the floor red in a bloody dance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08BlowOff_0003fd3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Curb your tongue, Shadowfoot! I am the Gray Fox. If you ever want to become a "
"Master Thief in the guild, you had better learn respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice6_000133e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cured? You speak as if they are diseased. They live now in another state of "
"being. Perhaps it is you who needs a cure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_00028bff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Curious that you should inquire about it, as it has recently gone missing. "
"You wouldn't happen to know anything about that, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelC1Idle01_0008ea9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Curious. This one is smaller than the others we've encountered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a70_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cut eight-wise he was, Pelinal the Blamer, champion of Men, and though "
"dispersed he left us a warning! Heed it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00073004_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cut them down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078162_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cutter sells weapons in Crucible, but you won't catch me going there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeSwordMagic_00016cee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cutting a man apart, little by little... such sticky sweet victory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cylarne is ours at last, thanks to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cylarne shall be ours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECylarneTopic_00019acf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cylarne was once the capital of the Shivering Isles. Perhaps the first "
"capital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cyrodiil is surrounded to the north and east by the lofty Jerall and Valus "
"mountain ranges."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture2_00071923_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Cyrodiil's runestones are thought to belong to one of three time periods: the "
"Dawn Era, the Merethic Era, or the late First Era."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004768d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cyronin Sintav. I'm a Sintav. That's all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00068901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Cyrus, my friend. Don't let me keep you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000ace4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Daedra Lords demand offerings and services. If you won't do as you're told, "
"just forget about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopicElse02_00038a9d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Daedra Lords, sure. They exist. They do things. Bad things, mostly, but "
"things you can see. The gods? They don't do a damn thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech2_0005604a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Daedra are the embodiment of change. Change and permanency. I'm no different, "
"except in the ways that I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Daedra came out and set fire to the town. Many people died, but some got out "
"alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c242_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Daedra cannot die, so your so-called gods cannot erase him from your minds "
"completely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraCultTopic_00098200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Daedra cults aren't necessarily evil, of course. In nearby Morrowind, for "
"example, they worship Daedra in the Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48HirtelA_00032d41_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Daedra overran Kvatch last night! There were glowing portals outside the "
"walls! Gates to Oblivion itself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047691_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Daedric shrines nearby? I know of two. North of the city, south of Bruma, "
"east of the Silver Road, is a Mephala shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e2a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dagail has been training high ranking mages more about mysticism. And he's "
"also been researching sheep, from what I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000514b6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Dagail's the only one who can write one. If she can remember who she is "
"today, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07HowToForge_0000c237_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Dairihill cannot be trusted. You must deliver the letter to Lady Umbranox in "
"person. Will you accept this commission?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NivanDalviluTOPIC_0001ebd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dalvilu has been murdered, and we have been accused of the crime! Bastard "
"elves! That they would dishonor us in this way...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakersWayTopic_0001ecdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dalvilus have lived here peacefully with Ulfgars for generations. As leaders, "
"Hrol Ulfgar and I work hard to preserve that tradition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0000bf13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dammit! The gate is barred from the other side. A trap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f3df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dammit, it's that prisoner again! Kill her, she might be working with the "
"assassins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_000164b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dammit, it's that prisoner again! Kill him, he might be working with the "
"assassins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dammit, this is no good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efa6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn Knights! Scaring away all the beasts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000363b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn Watchman. I bet they're all crooked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009837d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn Watchmen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018afde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn bears... going to run me out of Shardrock at this rate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479fb_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"Damn crooked Councilor. Some men rob you with a sword; others rob you with a "
"goose quill pen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn it man, two people are dead! Have you nothing better to do than question "
"me about the Nord? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberOneGrow03_00066e53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn it! Lewin deserved better than this and I'm responsible. Someone will "
"pay dearly, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn it, now they're into my pantry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Lost_0002d409_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn rats, always skirting around in the shadows. Making me jumpy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdSpeech_00046302_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoBribeA1_000a984e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn straight. I can only treat myself when I'm feeling flush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Wrath02Positive_00015261_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn that woman! She promised a four part split when we recover the Golden "
"Galleon. She never said anything about splitting it five ways!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003631b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn the Tenets! I'll cleave you in two if you don't get out of my face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn the Ulfgar! They'll pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006a841_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn these interruptions! Can't you see I'm busy? Do you think just anyone "
"gets into the Arcane University? Now leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38GuardWarnChoice1_00023683_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn! He's finally gone completely bonkers! Thanks for the tip. Now stand "
"aside and let the Guard do their work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Unseen_0002d404_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Damn! I've lost them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04FinalNo_0003d4ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn, I knew it! You're working for the city guard aren't you? I didn't think "
"they would be stupid enough to send someone alone, but so be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn. I was afraid this might happen. Poor Dunmer. Please, go tell Llevana "
"the sad news. I must ponder the situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Damn. Killed himself. Must have had some sort of magic item we didn't notice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice3A_00003a78_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Damned amateurs. You people should leave it to the professionals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA1_00082dc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Danger, you say? You came here to tell me this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ab8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Danus Artellian, captain of the guard. The Count's Guard. Castle Guard. "
"Dion's captain of the town guard. That's nothing to do with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFence02_000165e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dar Jee lives in Leyawiin. He doesn't have much money, but he's got more than "
"Ongar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_0002873b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dar-Ma is the daugher of Seed-Neeus, the owner of Northern Goods and Trade.  "
"You'll often find her out taking the air near the Great Oak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008609a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dark and deep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dark days, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dark days, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e4ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dark-dark. We've been yinging a zeffle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008d7ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Darkest blessings upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Darkfathom Cave awaits you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f9c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Darkfathom Cave isn't that far from here, but the route may be treacherous. "
"Be careful, and journey safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_0006834e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Darkness may be upon us all, but the people of the Empire -- my Empire -- are "
"worth fighting for! I just wanted you to know... I won't let you down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00091999_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Darkness take you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraReactions_00084aaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Darkness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Darn. They only train in blade and heavy armor at the Bruma hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c253_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Davide Surilie and his brother make some fine wines. It's a really impressive "
"vineyard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f104_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dawn is breaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036408_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dawn is breaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00036417_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dawn is breaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003664d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dawn is breaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dawn is breaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00097cbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dawn is breaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c58b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead, finally. Good work. Did you retrieve his ring? I want that as proof "
"that the Blackwood Company didn't defeat him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DSDead_0002367f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead, you say? ... you mean you ... did it really have to come to that? Well, "
"if that was the only solution ... I suppose I should thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38TSDead_0002367e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead, you say? ... you mean you ... did it really have to come to that? Well, "
"if that was the only solution ... I suppose I should thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DSDead_000be416_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead, you say? Well, then... you may as well finish what you started. "
"[Scribbles something on a piece of paper.] Here. This is your last task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaltusPreviaTOPIC_0002d70f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dead. I can't believe it. So much death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcSpectators_0007ead5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dead. I warned them, didn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaltusPreviaTOPIC_0002d713_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dead? Damn! What got him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaltusPreviaTOPIC_0002d719_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dead? Damn! What got him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead? Dead! What happened? A journal? Let me see that... Blackwood Company! "
"Bastards! Rank amateurs! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead? It can't be!  What happened? You didn't think to find some evidence? "
"Get back there. Find out what went wrong, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03Choice1A_00023f3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dead? Me? There... there must be some mistake.... I'm just an old man! Just "
"an old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_0003d084_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Deal! I can sell it for twice that price, to the right customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dear Brother, I do not spread rumors. I create them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dear Sister, I do not spread rumors. I create them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00005670_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dear Speaker, when darkness shrouds the Empire, we can travel to the resting "
"place of the Night Mother, and begin the ritual of awakening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dear friend, have you heard? Two of the guests now lie dead! If I find out "
"who did it, I may have to take matters into my own hands. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dear friend, three of the guests have been killed! You and I, we must stay "
"close. Band together, for mutual protection!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18NightConvo_000096df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dearest Night Mother! Most Unholy Maiden! Please, we beg your mercy in this, "
"our time of need! The Black Hand seeks your guidance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Death to Dagon's lackeys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32CombatYell_0001b6fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Death to the Fanatics!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Death to the Master!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartAttack_00054fa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Death to the Mazken! For the glory of Sheogorath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEArctusSpeech01_00089889_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Deceit. Hate. Subterfuge. Malice. Vengeance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Decentius Opsius, Captain of the Coast Guard. Pleased to meet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004575b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Decided to mend your ways? It's the dungeon for you, then, since you lack the "
"gold for reparations. Your stolen goods are forfeit, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackSoulGemMG17_00015459_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dedicated to the last! I cannot thank you enough for bringing the gem here. I "
"have need of it immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e981_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Deetsan loves to talk about his guild. It's good that he's proud of his work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e997_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Deetsan must be the happiest Mages Guild member in all of Tamriel. I think it "
"was always his dream to join."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_defaulted_00024291_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Defaulted? I suppose so. I'm not paid enough to do the job. I was supposed to "
"find Brenus Astis' Journal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_defaulted_0002e59f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Defaulted? That all you talk about? I'm Blackwood Company now. Plenty of "
"work, the pay is good, and I don't have Oreyn on my back all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c0dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Defeating an Arena Hero is one thing, but defeating a former member of the "
"Blades? You must be blessed by the Divines or somethin', my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Defend the Altar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004db6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Defend the Palace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18OdiilTalk04_000272d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Defend yourselves! Here they come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Delmar at the Chironasium can help you with the staff. See him right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Delmar at the Chironasium can help you with the staff. You still need wood "
"from the grove before he can create your staff. Get it immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002285c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Delmar handles all staff enchantments. You'll need to speak to him about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Delphine Jend. Creator of the celebrated 'Enemies Explode' spell. Advanced "
"Trainer in Destruction. And Mage Destined for Great Things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d06e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Delphine can get you a spell to summon bound armor, if you're interested. And "
"if you're able, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dementia has a new ruler! Perhaps a new fork for Big Head as well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_000459b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dementia is not outside the reach of my Lord's justice, whatever you may "
"think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00091989_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dementia will never be yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2A_00032be9_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Deposit this finger in the desk of Phillida's successor, in his office in the "
"Prison Barracks, in the Imperial City! Do this, and the bonus is yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2B_00032bea_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Deposit this finger in the desk of Phillida's successor, in his office in the "
"Prison Barracks, in the Imperial City! Do this, and the bonus is yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2C_00032beb_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Deposit this finger in the desk of Phillida's successor, in his office in the "
"Prison Barracks, in the Imperial City! Do this, and the bonus is yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00077b23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dervenin, High Priest of Mania at your service. What brings you to this holy "
"place on such a fine day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003de52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dervera Romalen is sure proud of the Newlands lodge. I think she's especially "
"happy that the Red Queen drinks there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e95b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dervera Romalen seems pleased that so many folks drink at the Newlands lodge. "
"She takes great pride in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Betrothed_0008efd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Desideratus is a gentle fool. I never should have allowed him to take up the "
"sword. My curse will not allow me to help you with his need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Betrothed_000135d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Desideratus is a little too attached to that doll, if you know what I mean. "
"They don't like to dance. It gives me the creeps. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Despite this misfortune, you are ready for advancement. I appoint you Slayer "
"for the Dark Brotherhood. Now go, and continue to serve Sithis well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003489e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Despite this recent lapse in professionalism, your overall efforts have been "
"commendable. It's time you were advanced to the rank of Eliminator. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09ChoiceGoOn_00022b69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Despite what your Council may think, I've not thrown in with the "
"Necromancers, and would never do so. You may pass along that message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054faa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Destroy the Aureals!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062bec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Destroying the Great Gate was a deed worthy of the mightest heroes of song "
"and legend! You dealt the daedra a heavy blow that day, my friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c209_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Destruction spells can cause a lot of damage. Knowing enough could make you a "
"dangerous person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_000253c7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Determine what she's after, and how we may be rid of her. I do not want her "
"here, spreading her lies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002925_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Dibella and Mara will be avenged!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dibella has shed her special blessings on Anvil. We greet travelers with "
"hospitality, and the needy with an open hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d06_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dibella has strengthened your wit and charm. Never allow the beauty of the "
"world to be lost on your eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Spoon_000781f9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Did Cindanwe send you to steal this? How did you get this from Kishashi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did I give you the key after lockup last night? I really can't remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10JakKnewGrayFox_00015312_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did I know him personally? Of course not. He lived 300 years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002950_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Did I not say we would meet again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022a7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did I not tell you to avoid contact with us? Travel along the road, and act "
"normally. We shall be shadowing you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781ea_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Did Kishashi send you with something? A certain utensil, or weapon... "
"depending on who you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ed9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did Thadon send you? Oh... I forgot he's happy again. Well, who sent you "
"then? My word, your pinchers are huge! Stay back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071957_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did battlemages activate runestones on arrival, thus lighting arcane beacons "
"within the next runestone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e3ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Did he mention me, perhaps? Or was there something else you wanted to discuss?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005375a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did that fetcher give you any information?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did that just happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b3ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did we get them all?... Are there more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f9c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you bring back my aquanostrum?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a09_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you ever hear about the ghost of Lord Vlindrel? They say he haunts the "
"road to Chorrol. Not that I've ever seen him myself, mind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0009f8be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you ever meet Dar-Ma? Young Argonian lass, popular around town. She's "
"disappeared, and her mother is worried sick about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_001885d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you fare well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic_00175bc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you find out why the Orc is here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49DukeDeadNice_00091c59_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Did you find the Count's ring, by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_00037cf5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you find the room? Remember, upstairs at the end of the hallway. Last "
"room on your right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you find them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you get Cindanwe's notebook? The one with all our secrets in it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e984_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear Deetsan talking about the Mages Guild again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e253_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear Eitar stirring things up again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bcc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear a noise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e2ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear about Ahdarji picking another fight with an Argonian?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00037a7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about Bradon Lirrian? A vampire hunter named Raynil Dralas made "
"his way into town, snuck into his house and killed him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028d71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about Glarthir going crazy and attacking people with an axe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00029aaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about Glarthir? Thank the Nine that the guard stopped him before "
"he killed someone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002ba55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about Reynald Jemane's long lost twin brother returning to "
"Chorrol?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_0003572d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about the Blackwood Company? They were all mad murderers hopped "
"up on hist? And crooked, thieving frauds?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00066cd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about the discovery at Pale Pass? It's in the new Black Horse "
"Courier. Here. Take my copy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a17_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about the knight that stopped the attack on the chapel? It would "
"have been destroyed for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about the pair of green recruits that cleaned out a den of "
"thieves near Anvil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043005_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear about the two Argonians that walked into a tavern? The second "
"one should have seen it coming. Ahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003dfa9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear how upset Tsrava is about all the dogs that J'bari has in his "
"yard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028749_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear that Dar-Ma came back, safe and sound?  You know, Seed-Neeus's "
"daughter, the Argonians."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028746_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear that Dar-Ma has disappeared?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062675_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear that Falcar left the guild? I think Deetsan is in charge in "
"Cheydinhal now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0001fe8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear that Necromancers attacked the grove at Wellspring Cave?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006444b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear that someone broke into an Imperial Legion post and stole the "
"taxes they collected from the Waterfront?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006268a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear that someone played yet another prank on Jeanne Frasoric in "
"Bruma? I don't know how she keeps falling for these things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00002d30_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear that the Chapel in Bravil's been attacked? Just like Anvil! "
"Where will it stop?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064464_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear that the Earl of Imbel's house was robbed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00002d2d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear that the Knights of the Nine are gathering holy relics?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081dbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear that? Did you? Voices from nowhere, madmen... where does it end? "
"How did I get this posting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081da8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Did you hear that? Oh boy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028745_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear the bad news?  Dar-Ma's daughter was killed by some strange "
"cultists down in Hackdirt. Terrible, terrible times we live in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003f150_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear the news? Ulrich Leland was thrown in the dungeons for stealing "
"money from the city coffers. Haha! Justice for the little guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007301f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear the one about the Argonian Maid?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000363b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear what happened to Ruslan and Luronk? One of the Watchmen fleeced "
"them for all their coin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006445a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear what happened? Someone robbed the wizard's tower. Fathis Aren "
"got what he deserved, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00029aa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear? He went crazy and started attacking people with an axe! Luckily "
"the guards stopped him before he killed anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064453_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear? Hieronymus Lex was reassigned to Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear? I helped rebuild the Gatekeeper! He has my eyes.... What? I got "
"new ones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear? Someone has been murdered! One of us! One of the guests!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006444f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear? The Countess was robbed. Someone stole her family ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you hear? The Fringe was attacked! How horrible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004351a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear? The Resonator of Judgment is active once again. I don't trust "
"anything that can influence the thoughts of others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a14_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear? The chapel was attacked! Just like in Anvil! Thankfully, the "
"daedra were driven off. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b208_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you hear? The lost heir of Uriel Septim rallied the Guard and smashed a "
"horde of daedra outside Bruma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003ea2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you know I've counted over a 954 dead rats, 137 dead Grummites, and 12 "
"dead men? I'm Jastira Nanus, by the way. I count corpses. I'm good at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you know that Bumph gra-Gash will train you to use heavy armor, but only "
"if you're a Fighters Guild member?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you know that J'skar trains other Mages Guild members in Destruction?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you know that Kud-Ei also teaches at the Mages Guild here in Bravil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00034076_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you know that fellow who was killed recently? In the Talos Plaza "
"District? Matthias Draconis?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you know that the Gatekeeper had only a three percent chance of failing? "
"Most interesting that he was defeated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you know we have the finest horses in Cyrodiil, right here in town? Black "
"Waterside Stables... the best thoroughbred blacks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049970_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you know you can officially complain about the merchants in town?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09ExaltedPain_0008d2fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you like that? Pain can be pleasure. You enjoy being in pain, do you? "
"Here, I'm sure you'll enjoy these then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a20_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you meet Brellin? He stopped by here on his way to become a knight. At "
"least that's what he said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053720_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you pry any information out of him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b7dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you really face down Mehrunes Dagon himself? They say he stood 200 feet "
"high and crushed the Temple Dome with his fist!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004109e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you really have some important reason for interrupting me? I thought not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BittneldTopic_0002a98e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you say something to Bittneld? That was very sweet of you. Now he stops "
"by here every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046626_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you see City-Swimmer swimming in the canals again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e996_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you see Ganredhel training her dogs yesterday? She's got a knack for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000af05f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you see it? The avatar of Akatosh himself? There it is! The monument to "
"our deliverance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00041206_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you see my last performance? Did you like it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a1f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you see that bosmer fellow that came through here? He said he was going "
"to the Priory of the Nine to become a knight. An elven knight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you see that? Twelve balls in the air at once! No one has EVER juggled "
"that many at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003dfa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you see the fight that Ra'qanar got into the other night?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you speak with Vilena? How did she react?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you talk to Kishashi? I can't trust you if she doesn't. It's nothing "
"personal, really; it's just that everyone else is out to get me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you tell the Count about Black Brugo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00083062_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you think I would be your puppet?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a2c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Did you think Umaril could protect you from the Crusader's wrath?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechUmaril_00002a5d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Did you think him a myth? Or dead? Have you not heard the Abadal-a?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you think to hide from Jyggalag's all-seeing gaze?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002edea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you want something? You're not here to join the Mages Guild, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you want to continue to the manor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Did you wreck Cindanwe's place yet? You know, move her stuff around. She "
"hates when things aren't in their place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StealNoCrime_0006250b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you... Did you just take that?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05NelreneSawYou_000811c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Did you? And you have proof of this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e88_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Did your human master let you off the leash? Crawl back under his table. "
"Maybe he'll throw you a bone to gnaw on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000749e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didier Aumilie, ship's clerk. At present, I'm spending my time and gold on "
"the pleasures of the Gold Coast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't Azzan give the new recruit another contract? Something in the "
"protection line?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081195_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Didn't I give you something to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000514c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Didn't I send you to see Lord Rugdumph?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062335_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't I tell you no weapons allowed? Clearly this isn't important to you. "
"We're done here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003ea30_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Didn't think so. I'm such a puddle of dog pittle that people can't even be "
"bothered to end my miserable existence. Oh, well. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Ritual_00013658_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't we go over this already? Bring the Duke's heart to the Altar of Arden-"
"Sul. It's quite simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001330c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't we have this conversation already? Or was that someone else... No, it "
"was me. And you. And so you know what you should be doing right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Didn't you have some things to give me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk1_0006fdcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't you hear the explosion? Some damn drunk of a wizard started hurling "
"fireballs at passersby. Took four guards to haul him in. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Didn't you hear? Oh, no. I suppose you wouldn't have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_00061419_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't you see that Oblivion Gate just outside the walls? Mara preserve us "
"from the fate of Kvatch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_0018d2a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Didn't you see that Oblivion Gate just outside the walls? Mara preserve us "
"from the fate of Kvatch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die tree scum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001c100_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die you scum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00091915_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00090cbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die! All of you! Die! Agggghhh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008305f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die! Die! Die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, Blue Team coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f03c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, Fanatic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, Imperial! Die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, betrayer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00023ec3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, cur!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0007c3a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, cur!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d2b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, damn you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32FanaticYell_0001b6ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, faithless priest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f129_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, heretic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_0009622d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, pretender!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_0001eee7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, unbeliever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32FanaticYell_0001b709_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, unbeliever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002412a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, unholy monster!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, you Orc filth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Die, you mangy housecat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dig up any more information?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091763_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Dinner is promptly at 8 o'clock and those who are late don't get Alocasia "
"Fruit Cup!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c206_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dion takes his job as Guard Captain very seriously. He's all business when "
"he's working."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b594_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dirt, dirt, dirt, dirt, dirt. Everywhere dirt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dirty Orc! Get out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice1B_0002edf7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Disappointing. Well, let me know when you are ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049913_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Discount spells. I'd just as soon buy a \"slightly used\" shield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_0002919c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Disgusting creatures. I hope to never see another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b58e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I drop the sweetroll or hand it over and come back later? Dunno...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091805_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I have to spell it out for you? Apparently I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091757_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I have to tell you everything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005376e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I have to think of everything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000039d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I know you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014656_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I know you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do I like the fights? Of course! Everyone likes the fights! The thrill of "
"battle, the sting of defeat. A wonderful time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0002ab87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I look like I want to talk to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightofFun_0003d4a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do I really have to spell it out for you? You're a man, and I'm a woman with "
"a certain desire. You figure out the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I sense good news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033600_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do I want to hear this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Wrath02Positive_00015261_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Do Lynch and Minx know about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002732c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do as you're told, and you'll be all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5e5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Do be careful. I'd hate to lose another useful Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000aef8d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Do be prompt in collecting them, however. Anything left in the chest for a "
"full week will be destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ChoiceHelp2_0001bb31_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Do hurry, I miss my love so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ChoiceHelp_0001b948_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Do hurry, I miss my love so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0003b1e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do it! End my misery!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFelldew_00043020_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do keep in mind that some Elytra will not consider you a threat while you are "
"feeling the effects of Felldew Euphoria."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do me a favor, don't say anything to the other guards that I fell for it, ok? "
"Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetD_0003e8fe_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Do me the service of freeing Anaxes, and I will reward you with the Bands of "
"the Chosen and passage to the Forbidden Grotto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028708_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do my ears deceive me, or are you actually suggesting Dovesi might be the one "
"behind the murder? Back away now, cretin.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do my eyes decieve me? You live?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3d_00019fcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do not be foolish. We can both get what we want. Come to me when you have "
"made a decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000915be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do not bother the Aureal with your petty conversation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a323_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Do not delay. If the Font of Madness itself becomes Ordered, all your "
"victories over Jyggalag will have been in vain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do not fear. I will assist you however I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b826_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do not give up hope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrinaCrossInnTopic_0002fd6a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Do not let your guard down. We do not know whether the Inn's staff is "
"involved somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357b_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "Do not put yourself in harm's way, if it can be avoided."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PellsGateTOPIC_00026b1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do not speak to me of that place! It was another lifetime. It was before I "
"became what I am now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05ShrinePassword_0001f10b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do not tarry. The time of Preparation is almost over. The time of Cleansing "
"is near."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05ShrinePassword_0001f874_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do not tarry. The time of Preparation is almost over. The time of Cleansing "
"is near."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do not test His patience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestGreetB_0004014e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do not think about it. Dream about it! Let your mind soar on flights of "
"fancy! I know you will choose well, in the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04Hlidara2_00035fbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do not worry, milady. No harm shall come to your ring if I can help it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00019d6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do run along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillTalk_0005dd13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do sit down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a564a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_0008674f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do that, and you will receive your share of this Sanctuary's weekly earnings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do the bones talk to you, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8b9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do this for me, and I'll reward you with another one of my curios I picked up "
"a few years ago... a valuable ring. Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c7c_Oblivion_RESP9"
msgid ""
"Do this, and I will give you your share of the Sanctuary's weekly earnings. "
"There is so much work to be done. So much work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3A_00022ba2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do this, and the next time you sleep in a location I deem secure, I will "
"reveal myself once more, bearing the love of your new family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3B_00022ba3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do this, and the next time you sleep in a location I deem secure, I will "
"reveal myself once more, bearing the love of your new family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3C_00022ba4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do this, and the next time you sleep in a location I deem secure, I will "
"reveal myself once more, bearing the love of your new family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b7e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do try to use your power sparingly. I have duties to which I must attend. "
"Rather more important than shepherding you around, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do we know each other? There's something familiar about you, but I just can't "
"place it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a846_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do we really have to go into that thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachTopic_00043024_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do what you can to ensure the survival of your allies. They will be most "
"helpful to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPinnacleRockTopic_00043023_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do what you can to ensure the survival of your allies. They will be useful to "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AjumKajinTopic_000356c7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Do what you must to make him talk. If you can smooth talk him, fine. If you "
"need to rough him up, so be it. But don't kill him. We need him to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003928_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do what you will with me. I've got nothing left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b203_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you believe any of that talk about more Oblivion Gates opening all over "
"the place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThaedilResponses_00041214_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you call that juggling? You should be ashamed of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e440_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you enjoy it? Cutting my heart? Why visit that other smith?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004657d_Oblivion_RESP1"
