msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know Dul gro-Shug? I understand he's good with light armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004661f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know Jantus Brolus, the spellsword?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know Mandil? I hear he's good with locks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004995d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know Maro Rufus? He specializes in light armor at Best Defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you know Othrelos? I'd like to learn how he gets around without being seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000239e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you know Reynald Jemane, the fellow who lives on the west side of Chorrol?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004662a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know anything about Edla Dark-Heart's past?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000253cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know anything about some book that Earana is looking for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06WhatTalking_00002afe_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Do you know one who would do such a thing? One who would pray at this "
"Chapel's altar, pray to Stendarr for the power to lift this curse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b16_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Do you know that I thought perhaps I could lift them? That somehow this curse "
"would be lifted if I could pick them up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you know the best part about the end of a war? Picking the bodies clean of "
"their treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00022d46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you know what happened to Mercator Hosidus? I haven't seen him at the "
"castle lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f494_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you know where Sheogorath keeps his armies? In his sleevies! Ah hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeebamNaTopic_000860cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you know where Weebam-Na is? I hear he's a hunter, knows all about the "
"woods around here. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00034476_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Do you know where the vampires are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e966_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you know why Hil the Tall became a priest?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad3_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Do you like a stand-up fight? Or perhaps a bit of treachery is more your "
"style?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000275bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you like parties? Because you've been invited to one. Of course, you'll be "
"killing all the other guests. Are you ready to attend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043011_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you like visitng Split? It's a great place to live. The people are "
"charming, and the weather is fantastic. No, really, it's true! Why would I "
"lie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073026_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you long for a blade? To cut with? Yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091b2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you miss your home, love?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027e39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you need something? Otherwise I should make my preparations for the "
"ritual. There's no time to lose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice1B_00022b68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you not recognize a Necromancer when you see one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice1B_00035df2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you realize what you're saying? Do you fully understand the honor you are "
"rejecting? For your own sake, return to me when you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice2A_00022b6a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Do you really believe they sent you here for a book? No, they sent you to spy "
"on me. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you really need to get so close?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00043022_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you really require help in finding it at this point? I suspect you can "
"manage on your own from here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanKey_0001fee5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you really think I could afford to let you leave here? The key you found "
"is a fake. No prey has ever left this island alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you really think that I'm surprised to see you here? I let you find me. "
"What better place to get rid of you than all the way out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003a84e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you really think we can close that thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00035df1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you recall the name Adamus Phillida? The Imperial Legion pest? It's time "
"he joined Sithis in the Void. Think you're up to the task?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadBrellin1_00002cfb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you remember Sir Brellin? His death still troubles me, at times. I don't "
"know why. A knight should not fear death, and yet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk2_0006a861_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you remember that matter you asked me to look into? I have some new "
"information. In short... What you proposed IS possible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040362_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you require assistance with the task Sheogorath has given you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you return triumphant?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_00078fd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you seek to deepen my despair by reminding me of my greatest failure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002912_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Do you still have questions, Crusader?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f471_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you suppose the armies will start killing people now? I'd keep an accurate "
"count of all the corpses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AAnya_00013a6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you take me for a fool? How do I know you aren't acting as an agent of "
"Dementia?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060537_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you think Sheogorath died? I know He's missing. I want to see His corpse "
"if He's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think anyone in Bravil knows more about Tamriel than Ita Rienus?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028242_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you think he could have done it? He comes across as something of a drunk, "
"but you never can tell what someone is capable of. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f774_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think he followed us? How could he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f775_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think she followed us? How could she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA1_00002aac_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think that a quest for holy relics usually starts with a lie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028bba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think that stranger's here looking for the girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c153_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think the attack will come soon, ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c154_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think the attack will come soon, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009098f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think there are any more of those assassins about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you think those Knights will come here? I hope they do! I'd be the first "
"to fall before them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004d0b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think we have a chance, ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004d0b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think we have a chance, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00054672_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think we stand a chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029c1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think we took them by surprise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think we're safe for a few minutes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think what happened to Kvatch could happen here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000411fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you think you can spare a little something for an old friend? You know I'm "
"good for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHircineChoice1_0001ec5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you think yourself a hunter? Then approach the Shrine of Hircine. Leave "
"our lord an offering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you think? I've never noticed anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartA3_00002c84_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you understand nothing? The blood speaks! I can read the ancient runes, if "
"you cannot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5a3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Do you understand, or do I need to use even smaller words?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014dc9_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Do you want another treasure blessed by Akatosh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Positions_00015451_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you want me to stay back, or stay up nearer to the door?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ccf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you want something from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do you want to know a secret? It was I who killed the Gatekeeper. I poisoned "
"him with an apple!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do you want to learn about Alteration? Speak with Dovyn Aren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002976_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Do you wish to learn what little I know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d2b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do your worst!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00074a0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Do your worst!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028170_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Do... do you think he could have done it? I mean, he is a retired soldier. "
"He's killed before. Oh, dear, this can't be happening!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046603_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Does Delphine Jend make you a bit nervous?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Does Dovyn Aren still teach Alteration?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043f40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Does Your Grace wish to be crushed to death, or do you merely find difficulty "
"in locating the buttons and switches in these old ruins? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Does anyone see City-Swimmer? Is he gliding beneath the silver water? Is he "
"creeping 'round a corner, hugging a wall, silent as a shadow in the dark?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002825d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Does being a soldier make him a good person? Does it make him above murder? I "
"hardly think so.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009591a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Does my Champion summon me? Before I've even told you what to do? That's not "
"very Champion-y. Not at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartA2_00002c82_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Does no one remember the old tales?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013ff3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Does that pain you, Kithlan? Unless you want to feel it again, you'd best "
"tell us what you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07BribeBeggar2_00098395_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Does the Lonely Suitor Lodge sound familiar? Try there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Does the air seem thicker than normal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00009330_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Does the hunter have this one's ring?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Does this hurt more or less than last time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39RanarrJo_000781f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Doesn't get as much work done as he should. He's always turning things over "
"to look under them, searching for who-knows-what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImpGallTOPIC_0002ee64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Doesn't look like you have it yet. Let me know when you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e99b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Doesn't something seem wrong with that abandoned house in town?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_0002c309_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Doesn't that have something to do with the Ayleids, and magical control over "
"the weather? I think that's the rumor I heard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Doesn't that noise bother anyone else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0000c015_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Doesn't the hunter have prey to follow?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dog? You greet me as a Breton, the mongrel race of Tamriel, motherless "
"lackeys of every great empire that ever conquered your homeland?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dog? You greet me as a fellow, then, you tusk-faced brute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024de4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dogs are an orc's best friend. Good protection, good companions, good eats. "
"The Bruiants have dogs. Lots of 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Doing a bit of digging, I'm afraid Rosentia's been stuck with the Staff of "
"the Everscamp. Nasty bit of \"fun\" by Sheogorath, I'd say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingDontCare_000131d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't I? I thought I did. But then I also thought that you would be heavier. "
"Look at you, you're light as a chair. How DO you walk around like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingLong_000131da_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Don't answer that. I know the answer. I knew far more answers once, but they "
"seem to have dried up. Or perhaps they drowned. I don't know anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fb6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't bare your teeth at me, you beast! How about you use those fangs on my "
"double?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f793_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be afraid. My guardians will not harm you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d495_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be angry at us. This is the only way we could find the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Victims_00081fdc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Don't be concerned. I always return the worthy ones to life. Besides, Lord "
"Sheogorath has sanctioned my studies and my methods. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityNotNow_00043414_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Don't be discouraged! Some people just have better luck than others in "
"finding Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't be fooled by your next opponent. The little dagger he uses is actually "
"a powerful enchanted weapon called Shimmerstrike. Now go get 'em! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013ffa_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Don't be fooled, the Ritual isn't over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't be frightened, they won't harm you. They look much fiercer than they "
"really are, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b54_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be long. I'd rather we stick together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be shy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041203_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't be shy. I'm really very approachable. You wanted an autograph, is that "
"it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be shy. Join us, and do well by doing good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIREDISLIKE_0018b2a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be silly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkoomaNo_0008f784_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be so cruel! I hope you die a horrible death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice4_000356f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't be stupid. We have returned with the Hist itself. One beautiful Hist, "
"who gives her gifts to all the Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006dc2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't be the last to read today's Black Horse Courier!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c351_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't be upset. I knew what I was doing the moment I asked you to lead Ulrich "
"to me. I was fully aware of the consequences."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e525_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't bother me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017201_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Don't bother to come back until you have it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't bother trying to kill a Skinned Hound with a fireball. They are "
"invincible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't bother using a frost spell on a Shambles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08AleronHunt_0001fdbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't bother. The door to this place is now locked. The only way to get out "
"is by decending into the Hunter's Run and killing the Hunters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003aaac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't bring up religion around Else God-Hater. She's likely to use that sword "
"of hers on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't butt in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091c4f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Don't come back here without him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't count on seeing the Count at the castle. He's a great sorcerer, but he "
"doesn't like visitors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StealNoCrime_0018d839_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Steal_0018d838_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't eat me! For the love of Sheogorath! Please, don't eat me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f022_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't eat me! You're worse than those knights in the Fringe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't eat me. DON'T EAT ME! By Sheogorath's beard, you're a mean looking one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c42cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't falter! We have them! We have them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't feel bad -- no one lives forever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't feel bad that you're not as gifted as me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031522_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to check with Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard, my Steward, "
"Orok gro-Ghoth and my herald, Laythe Wavrick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Counterspell_0003012f_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to wear that ring I gave you when you cast the spell. Not that "
"there's anything to worry about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003160c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't forget who your friends are, or they may just become your enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027120_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't forget, Captain Burd needs your help to close the Oblivion Gate outside "
"of Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk2_0006fdd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't forget, my friend -- you and I are what stand between order and chaos. "
"Without us, the Empire would crumble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_0003d08d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't forget, only I can fence the most difficult items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch04_0018ad64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't forget. Camoran Usurper burned Kvatch, too. Kvatch was rebuilt from "
"ruins once before, and she'll do it again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004c5b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't forget: be down here at 10 PM. I'll see you then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004c5b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't forget: the living quarters at 10 PM. I'll see you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPykeZoeMaleneResponses_00091b50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't fret, my love... I'm here. Be happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't get any ideas about wandering off alone. I'm keeping my eye on "
"everyone, including you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't get in our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DionneWarnChoice2_0001dcc3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't get involved with him. If he asks you to do anything... strange... you "
"come see me first, got it? Or any of the town Guard. Let us handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AncotarTopic_000301ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't get me wrong, some of my best friends are elves. But self-important "
"jerks like Ancotar give them all a bad name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046600_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't get on J'skar's bad side. You'll likely get a fireball in your face for "
"your troubles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NQDGuardWarning_0018d1dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't get too close to the prisoners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002732b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't get too close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0001c900_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't get too many folks passing through here these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't get your tail in a knot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenRenote_0000b225_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't give me a reason to kill you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c13b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Don't give the enemy a chance to recover from their defeat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch03_0018ad62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't give up. You're not alone. And the chapels and the Elder Council will "
"help us. It just takes time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081dbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't go back in there. I'm warning you. You'll end up like the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't go far. It's too dangerous to go wandering around this house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b52a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't go stirring up trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008c236_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't hold back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SERooftopCheer_00082744_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't hold back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_00023f42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007302c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't hurt me, okay? Do you want a bone? I'll tell you a secret. They say a "
"new adventurer has come. Don't bite me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00014658_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't interrupt me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_000329f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't judge Farwil too harshly. Most of what he says is... fabricated. But "
"he's young, and therefore quite brash and inexperienced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't just stand around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't just stand there -- get rid of those ogres! Stab them! Burn them! Tear "
"their throats out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003661f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't just stand there! Go get that mountain lion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't just stand there. Move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't keep the Gray Fox waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't keep us waiting. I hate to wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM02ImperialMaleVoice_00002A2C_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Don't kill me! Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d04b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't know anyone by that name. Now go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003d4ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't know if this is true, but I heard a gang of all female thieves is "
"preying on the married menfolk of the town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't know why anyone would visit the other cities of Cyrodill. Chorrol has "
"it all. And a fairly low murder rate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeHelmet_0001f3e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't know why you'd want to cover up that gorgeous head of yours, but here "
"you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00015131_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't know. But it's too late to go back now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004e95c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't leave before you hear what I have to tell you. You'll regret it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000165c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't leave me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00060332_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't let Toutius Sextius catch you following him. He's much more dangerous "
"than he looks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c30_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't let her looks deceive you, friend. I've seen black widows like her "
"before! Her crimes must not go unpunished! Justice is at hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000688fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't let me keep you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00098381_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't let the guards catch you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009f985_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't let the ogres get me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTHATE_0006231a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't make me laugh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCEHATE_0018b2cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't make me laugh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004a994_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't make me show you to the door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't make them wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThurindilTopic_0003e0d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't mind him. He's not right in the head. Poor fellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00064460_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't pay attention to those rumors. There is no such thing as a Thieves "
"Guild. The Gray Fox is just a thief the Watch hasn't caught yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05No_0000a234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't play games with me. This isn't the time for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't provoke them. They don't trust you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenGlenroy_0002508c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't push me, prisoner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45BrethrenTopic_00028218_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't push your luck, stranger.  Plenty of folks have turned up dead after "
"asking questions like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001db23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't really know him. He lives across the way from Seridur I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't run into the water to escape a Scalon. They'll follow you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenBaurus_0000b207_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't say I didn't warn you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't say anything to her. I don't want to embarrass her further. Once this "
"is all taken care of, I'll speak to her privately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22SrazirrAgreed_0002c528_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't screw this one, though. After the dust settles, look for S'razirr in "
"the Tiber Septim Inn in the Imperial City. Full payment is expected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025df5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't speak to me again, unless you've gotten twenty minotaur horns. Then, "
"perhaps we'll have something to discuss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030208_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't speak to me further until you've rented a room. Then I'll come find you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't spend all the money from the reward in one place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00132a8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't spend all the money from the reward in one place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b686_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't stand too close. I need room to swing my weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081193_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't take all day making your choices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003ca90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't take this sojourn lightly. The recesses of the mind can be the darkest "
"place of all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseTooMuchCheydinhal_0004f214_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't take too long raising the funds. I have several other interested buyers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06WaitHere_0000c013_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't take too long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028719_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't talk - fight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIREHATE_0018b2a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't talk such rot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa9e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't talk to Horkvir about it. He won't know anything. Especially not our "
"Horkvir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't talk to me now! Kill the filthy creatures!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033783_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't talk to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0012dd31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't talk to me. Talk to the one in the robes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusB_00022b15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't talk. Just follow my lead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c363_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't tarry... get Ulrich here soon before he changes his mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't tease me. It's serious. I could die. We all could die! Please, help "
"find a safe spot outside to sleep where the walls won't come crashing down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08SavillasStoneTopic_0009838d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Don't tell Hridi I said anything. I could be banished for telling you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone else, but some day I'm going to have Ocheeva's position. "
"Just you wait and see. Lucien Lachance knows real talent when he sees it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't tell me Falcar's given you the same task he gave Vidkun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me Maglir is acting up again. Has he screwed up another contract?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you've never heard of him! He's famous for his skill with a "
"blade. And at his young age.... He'll be a legend one day, mark my words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049938_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't the Verus brothers run a good shop?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000608b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't think for a second that this war is actually over. Stay on your guard. "
"The agents of the enemy lurk everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VenaPetilius_00026b49_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't think he ever forgave himself for not being there when she passed. He "
"swore then never to raise a weapon again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PickpocketNoCrime_0018d832_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't think you're getting away with something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't touch anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002819a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't trust her, sweetie. Not a thing she says. If she tries to get you alone "
"anywhere, get away as fast as you can! She's a cold-blooded killer! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002732a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't try anything. I'm watching you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0003d07c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't try to cheat me you misbegotten whelp!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIREHATE_00062311_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't try to manipulate me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't try to slow me down. I'm going to get that diary before you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028251_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't try to turn me against Primo! For all I know, you could be the killer!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ02Skooma_0018917d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't turn your back on Lonavo for a second. He wouldn't think twice about "
"burying his blade there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bce6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't wait too long to decide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05reject_0000a1b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't wait too long. We really need the help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't waste my time if you're not ready for this. Are you prepared to do what "
"is necessary to gain a recommendation from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10NoBoots_00015311_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't waste my time. Not in the mood for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIREHATE_0018b2aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't waste your flattery on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007817d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't waste your wonderful poisons on Skinned Hounds. They seem to like them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000730c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't work too hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuySkingrad_0004f217_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about Vandorallen Trebatius. I'll have him evicted. I'm sure "
"he'll find another home easily. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00023667_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry about him. We'll handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry about me, my friend. I know I'm in good hands here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00089936_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Don't worry about me; there's no time! Get moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry about the Elytra's stingers. They aren't poisonous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillXaselm_00081a4c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't worry if you break her toys. I believe she rather enjoys creating them. "
"And, it keeps her from turning her attention elsewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008673d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I hold no grudges. You bested me! I am man enough to admit it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b64_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll stick close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b3f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll take this one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, if you die I will bring you back to life. We have much left to "
"accomplish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29ShadyDeal_0001e7eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, it will be very soon. Now get outta' here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018e5e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Don't worry, its bark is far worse than its bite. Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a9343_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, my friend, this time we are on the same side! Umbacano wants us "
"both to guide him through Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008585c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, my friend. I'm going to show this slinking cutthroat how the "
"Imperial Legion takes care of things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000be43d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, pal, you'll get used to losing after a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00015132_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, sire, we will get you out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_0002c52c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, this one will back you up when the time comes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight2Female_00002cdd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, we all miss her. She was a fine knight, and died in service to "
"Kynareth and the Nine. Try to let that be a comfort to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00017c44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry, we'll get him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_0003406b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, we'll keep the Emperor Martin safe here. No enemy has ever taken "
"Cloud Ruler from the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight2Male_00002ce2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, you're not alone. His death saddens me, too, at times. At least "
"he died a Knight of the Nine, eh? I hope to die so well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. Anvil's soldiers are worth two from anywhere else. Bruma will "
"not fall!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril4_00002c4c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Don't worry. I have days where I feel the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElderCouncilTopic_000add0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. The Elder Council can govern the Empire perfectly well until a "
"new heir can be found."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Response_000452f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you dare touch anything in my house! You'll ruin my research. Hmmm. "
"Would you be willing to run an errand for me? I'll pay you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028249_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you even care that Nels is dead? Maybe you killed him! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bab3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you even care what's happening? Bruma has been saved! The Great Gate "
"has been closed! There is hope for us all, whether you like it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you find Fathis Aren's skill in Conjuration impressive?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00067700_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you have a book to read? Or something else very important I've told you "
"to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ae00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you have a fight scheduled? I'm sorry, but I can't allow you to bet on "
"your own match! You'd best get into the Arena!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f3ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you have a rat problem to be handling, boot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ffc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you have something better to do than bother perfectly innocent people "
"with your idiotic rambling? But if you insist, go right on ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009d9f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you have something to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00022a07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you have something to find?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000175bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you have somewhere else to be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you have work to do? Like getting rid of those Demented bastards?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06WantGauntlets_00002b0b_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't you know the story behind them? I'm not, ahh, familiar with all the "
"details, but I know roughly what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40GreetingChoice1_000790c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you know? You don't, do you? Well, it's lucky you met me. Here you've "
"been walking around as if nothing could happen! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice2A_00090792_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you see? Our Dread Father foresaw your defeat of the traitor, here in "
"this very crypt! You have been chosen! You are to be my new Listener!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2C_000262da_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Don't you see? The traitor somehow switched your orders, and has been sending "
"you to the wrong dead drops! You and I have been deceived."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004658c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you think Hafid Hollowleg does a good job at Jerall View?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003e960_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you think Mach-Na runs an excellent bookstore?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a35a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you understand me? You're trespassing, and must leave, or I'll call the "
"guard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00085974_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't you worry, my friend. I'll get us out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028cd5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Don't you worry, my friend. Nels won't get away with this. Not on my watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice4A_0003018a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you worry, what with the recent killings and all? I'd be ever so "
"scared, if it were me. I haven't left the Inn in days, just in case!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04DoIKnowHer_00019523_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Don't you? If you don't, you might. You wouldn't fall for her, though. Not "
"the type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELOVE_0018b2d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Don't, please! I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003e213_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Doomed! We're all doomed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture1_00071941_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Doomstones have red runes, and are associated with stone circles. Runestones "
"have blue runes, and appear as solitary monuments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dovesi couldn't have been any more than fifteen years old. What threat could "
"she have posed? Why was she murdered? Damn it, I mean to find out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028cdd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dovesi is a Dark Elf. They call themselves Dunmer. When I was young, I spent "
"some time stationed at Fort Moonmoth on their homeland of Morrowind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dovesi is a sweet young lass. She reminds me of someone I knew. But perhaps "
"we should talk about something else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002870f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dovesi is young and weak, yet the killer left her alive. Why? She couldn't "
"possibly have anything to do with the murders... could she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028ce0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dovesi's upset by the murder but she'll be okay. I get the sense she's seen "
"worse things in her life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047694_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dovyn Aren. Yeah, I still do training. I'm not what I used to be, but I can "
"still teach Alteration just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a371_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Down with the Madgod!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartAttack_00054fa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Down with the Mazken!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Down with this false Paradise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a35_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Down with you, in the name of Father Akatosh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LordDradEstates_000981fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Drad purchased the land and title from Council. It cost him a fortune, and "
"he's determined to make it pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LordDradTOPIC_000981fa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Drad's a fancy pants who lives in a pretty house with a pretty wife because "
"he screws over folks like you and me. He makes us puke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName12_00038b45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dragonheart, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, it's time to "
"see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dralora Athram. I came here with Ulen fifteen years ago. Best thing we ever "
"did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dranas Llethro. I just got back from Solstheim. Boy, was that a mess. And now "
"I'm out of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Passwall_0008e4ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Dredhwen's been selling what they left behind. So, if you need something, "
"talk to her. She's in the Wastrel's Purse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Drels Theran. I'm the count's Special Inquisitor in charge of suppressing the "
"Renrijra Krin insurgents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drink up and eat something. You'll need your strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a564c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drink. Drink! We need to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009816c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drink. It is time to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b837_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drive them back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_001896ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drive them back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dro'Nahrah. I'm Count Bravil's steward. I'm sorry, but please, I have too "
"much on my mind to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dro'shanji greets you. His work is the castle grounds, grand gardens green. "
"Dro'shanji also is Advanced Trainer in Security."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Steal_000624f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drop it, you sticky-palmed little worm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045751_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Drop your weapon! Hand over your stolen goods and face the Lord's justice. "
"Pay your due reparations, or it's the dungeon for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006261a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Druja has a wide variety of spells for sale, if there's something you need. "
"Most of them are simple, but they're a good starting point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Drunk with madness! Madness for all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c3b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Due to outstanding fines owed to the city, Aldos Othran's property has been "
"seized and is now sealed until further notice. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ec2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Duke Thadon's got his happy juice back, I hear. Good for him. He's always "
"kept things very orderly. I like him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Dul gro-Shug always seems at ease in light armor. He moves well in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047688_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dul gro-Shug. I could show you a thing or two about Security... for a small "
"consideration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f370_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dulphumph gro-Urgash, Scalon killer. You'll keep quiet, if you know what's "
"good for you. Never know when one might be sneaking up behind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dumag gro-Bonk at The Missing Pauldron is collecting that Amber you find in "
"the root tunnels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e082_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Dumania Jirich, Primate of Anvil. I speak with the voice of Dibella, and "
"greet you with love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00013385_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Dunroot Burrow is your goal, my friend. And what a goal it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"During these terrible times, I think people need juggling more than ever to "
"take their minds off their troubles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualNoM_00013661_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"During this, the exiting regent imbibes three doses of the potent drug. This "
"causes his heart to burst... and his lifeblood flows from his body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_00024289_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Duties for you. Fine. I'll speak slowly so you can keep up. I want you to "
"contact Maglir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0009148f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Duty calls, citizen. Madgod's blessings upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bc94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Duty calls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002c5a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Duty. That's what all this is about, isn't it? The Blackwood Company is "
"destroying us. They steal our contracts; they steal our members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00061cd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "E'Tah Aureal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00061cd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "E'Tah Mazken!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBows_000908df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Each Black Bow you bring me means another Black Bow Bandit slain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstExplainChoices_00018dfd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Each chamber presents two options. When you push the appropriate button, an "
"event will unfold for the adventurers to experience. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03Reactivated_0008e94b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Each crystal has a matching receptacle called a Judgment Nexus. Even you "
"can't miss them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000275c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Each guest, at some point in the past, wronged their mysterious host. Now "
"he's hired us to exact his revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_00043f6c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Each heart will increase the power of the obelisk until it eventually "
"overloads and shuts down, closing the portal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_0008247f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Each heart will increase the power of the obelisk until it eventually "
"overloads and shuts down, closing the portal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Each local guild hall has its own way of doing things. That means each hall "
"has its own set of problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ForlornWatchman_00035d8f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Each night, he wanders the shore of Niben Bay. Then he stops and looks "
"mournfully out to sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Each person's pain threshold is different, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0000ab72_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Each tribe guards a head in its lair. Whose head, I don't know. A sacred "
"tribal totem or something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078665_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Earil has a big problem with Brithaur. I don't know exactly what the problem "
"is, but it's safe to say Earil is making a huge fuss over it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078665_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Earil owns a magic shop in town called Earil's Mysteries. If you want to know "
"more, I'd suggest you ask him yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078167_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Earil's Mysteries sells a number of unique spells. Doesn't sell any "
"mysteries, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GenericBanditB_000a333c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Easily done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047691_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "East of the city, at the head of the Red River, is a shrine to Vaermina."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0005df55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Eat well, while you have your health. I'm sure I have something that would "
"interest you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004765a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Edgar Vautrine. You don't want the very best. You want cheap. And I got cheap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c9ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Edla. Edla Dark-Heart. If you want to be a Marksman, I can train you. If you "
"can breathe, I can teach you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003575b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Eh? Oh... I'm sorry. I was just... nothing. Never mind. I am Ranarr-Jo. I "
"work the fields here in Fellmoor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00067dd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eh? You again? You ready to hear about an old man's troubles?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eight of the evening watch, and all's well. And you, too, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023ea2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eight of the evening watch, and all's well. And you, too, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eight of the morning watch, and all's well. Good day, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023ee2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eight of the morning watch, and all's well. Good day, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f477_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Either kill the attacking tribe's shaman, or recover the \"tribal head\" from "
"the rival tribe, which is likely the cause of the war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03LexMyvryna_000355d2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Either way, it's over. You didn't really think I'd trust the likes of you for "
"very long?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39PodPitYes_00072c9a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Either way, you will have a piece of blue sky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008da9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Either you have it, or you don't. Don't play games with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028246_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Either you or Nels is the killer! I can't trust either of you, so just stay "
"away from me!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_000224e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Either you're lying to me, or your feeble little mind has forgotten that you "
"put it down someplace. I'm not amused. Go get the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElanteTOPIC_0000344e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Elante is a scholar, interested in researching Daedra worship. Meet her in "
"Brittlerock Cave, help her find the shrine, and keep her safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Elante of Alinor? She's the Daedric scholar, right? She'll live to write "
"again, thanks to the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003ca36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Elements... Dreamworld... HA! That's the best yarn I've heard in years!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Elements? Inside a dream? Bah! That's the most foolish thing I've ever heard! "
"Get away from me... you're clearly insane!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eletta and Zahrasha dead? I can't believe it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eletta and Zahrasha dead? I can't believe it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eleven of the evening watch, and all's well. Long day, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eleven of the evening watch, and all's well. Long day, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eleven of the morning watch, and all's well. Good day, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023ec8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eleven of the morning watch, and all's well. Good day, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04DrethConvo_00045f84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Eleven! Eleven years in this rat-infested hole! But I'm getting out, and "
"you'll still be stuck in here! Ha ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridHot_00023cd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Emfrid? She owns the Grey Mare, right? Huh. I go to the Oak and Crosier. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinB3_0001e8d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Emperor Uriel Septim? You think the emperor is my father?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreA2_00092d82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Emperor Uriel? Do you know something about his death?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_0008571a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Emperor, Amulet, and Dragonfire--with these divine gifts, the daedra of "
"Oblivion have been kept at bay for thousands of years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006691a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Emperors have been assassinated before, but this time... I don't know. It's "
"different. Can't you feel it? A shadow has fallen across all of Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047647_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Enchanted to meet you. Delmar, Enchanter Extraordinaire to the Mages Guild! "
"At your service. Got some enchanting in mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047648_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Enchanting city. A real eye-full. Just walk and gawk. Stroll along the "
"Greenway and around the Palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice1A_00035621_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Enchanting staves can be a tricky business. Only certain spells will be truly "
"useful to you, so I'll narrow it down some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e07f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enilroth, Morvayn's apprentice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_00062112_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bcd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy the manor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bedd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy the manor. It suits you well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMBladeAll_00014e66_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy the might of Mehrunes. What else do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMBluntAll_00014e6b_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy the might of Mehrunes. What else do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMHeavyArmorAll_00014e7b_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy the might of Mehrunes. What else do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMLightArmorAll_00014e75_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy the might of Mehrunes. What else do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000327c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy your stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice9_0005e371_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Enjoy your stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0008273f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enjoy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008fab2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enlightening, as always."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000241a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enough talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18TraitorTalk_000096e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Enough! Enough of this! You will all suffer for the pain you have caused me! "
"I will destroy your Night Mother, and the Dark Brotherhood will fall!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagSpeech_00063723_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Enough! I am beaten. The Greymarch is ended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AThadonLeaves_000206bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Enough! I go to Jyggalag. I give myself to him, as a Priest of Order! This "
"isn't done, Madgod. I think it's just started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06KanehMirel_00012104_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Enough! I've made my decision. We will attack down the main passage, as "
"planned. The Mazken will not withstand us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice8_000133e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Enter or do not, but make your decision. I've other duties to which I must "
"attend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008ef77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ergh! What twisted mind spawned these beasts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000039bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eridor says I ain't supposed to chat with people in town. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_vampirehunters_000039be_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Eridor's the chap in charge. I've talked to him and Shamar; didn't catch the "
"names of the other two. They'll be back around midnight, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003aaa0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Erina Jeranus isn't the most social inkeeper in the world, but she runs a "
"good, clean house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01AdrienneConv_0002d901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Erm, well... yes. I'll just pack up my supplies and be on my way, then. Thank "
"you for sending someone to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000247ea_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Eronor, a lay brother, tends after the sheep and our little farm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002dc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Err, look. If you're here for information, I'm afraid you'll have to find it "
"on your own. I'm swamped right now; up to my ears in Necromancy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Erthor is causing trouble at the Mages Guild again. Seems his experiments are "
"always blowing up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06EscapedPrisoners_000be532_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Escaping prisoners!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting3_00018e6e_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Escort me out of here, protect me, get me home, and those people will praise "
"you more than you can imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAnnouncer_00048386_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Esteemed Grand Champion, you may leave the Arena now! See the Blademaster to "
"receive your winnings, and be awarded your Raiment of Valor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_00017789_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Etira, she's the one that found them old books. Learned the runes, how to "
"speak to them again. But they want blood, she says, or they'll not help us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Eugal Belette is an odd one... and I swear I heard strange noises coming from "
"his basement not long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Evade the horrid Hunger, the Madgod's favorite pet. If your strength lies in "
"your use of shock, you've just increased its threat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e12e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Evade the horrid Hunger, the Madgod's favorite pet. If your strength lies in "
"your use of shock, you've just increased its threat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00009223_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Even I know that some from your guild have defected to join him. I believe "
"you can be trusted, as you have been attacked once already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006032f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even Sheogorath knows it's not safe here. Probably afraid of the buildings "
"falling in on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081538_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Even Sheogorath won't help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d287_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even a small bit of good news is refreshing in these grim times. I salute "
"your courage, Savior of Cheydinhal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkDisappearances_00014e21_AltarDeluxe_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Even as we speak, people are disappearing near Anvil and I foresee a terrible "
"threat. One even the gods should fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031eb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Even if Farwil doesn't say it, we appreciate that you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b1c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even if I am doomed, I still hold out hope that Stendarr will have mercy on "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028179_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even if I do think Nels is the killer, I wouldn't share my thoughts with the "
"likes of you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_000280a5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Even if I had, why would I know anything about her goin' missing?  Not that "
"I'm saying I ever seen her.  Cause I haven't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_0002b8df_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Even if it was true, it's out in the forest somewhere. We need to keep what's "
"inside the town walls safe, not go running around outside them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004350d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even if the Resonator of Judgment is working again, I bet it won't deter "
"Them. I'm still not safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even if you don't agree with the method, you have to respect the hard work it "
"takes to replace a Duchess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even if you don't agree with the method, you have to respect the hard work it "
"takes to replace a Duke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a9345_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even in its ruined state, it is magnificent, isn't it? In the days of its "
"power, Nenalata must have been glorious indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Cindanwe_00072c97_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Even still, if I don't get my work done... I need to harvest at least five "
"pod pits before the day is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060539_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even the great Lord Sheogorath forsakes us. The bones are getting louder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3a_00018c7e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Even though I have served with these Aureals for centuries, as the Duke of "
"Mania, it is your right to command the troops. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3a_000186fc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Even though I have served with these Mazken for decades, as the Duke of "
"Dementia, it is your right to command the troops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34WhyNeed_0008f7b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even though I never intend to be a Knight again, that Medallion represents an "
"important part of my past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00059090_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even though he may be a bit misguided, I'm still proud to call him my son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003ab33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even though you are the Gray Fox, I'm going to look the other way this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC1_000a6582_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Even to gaze upon it would have been death to anyone of the lesser races in "
"the old days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC2_000a6584_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Even to gaze upon it would have been death to anyone of the lesser races in "
"the old days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Even with the Blackwood Company gone, we still need to work hard to restore "
"the reputation of the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566f_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Even worse, you killed the Listener! The Black Hand without a Listener is "
"like a hand with no thumb. Even the Listener's successor is dead! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e078_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Evening, ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e079_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Evening, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003aa97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Evening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003aa98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Evening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049945_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ever bought enchanting supplies from Calindil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023e72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ever broken out of jail? How do you feel about breaking into one? The "
"Imperial Prison, to be exact. We need a prisoner... silenced. Can you do it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049930_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ever needed cash in a hurry? You should try Jensine's."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fines_0003c29a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ever since Ulrich Leland took over the Captain of the Guard post, this city's "
"gone downhill. It's getting almost scary to walk the streets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000a3844_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ever since that gate appeared, the city guards have been on alert. I hope "
"they can protect us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03ATellMeMore_00018df7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Ever since that wretched Gatekeeper was made, Xedilian became redundant. It "
"fell into disrepair and was eventually all but forgotten."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2c2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ever since then, he's been drunk. Sure, he gets rowdy sometimes, but he's "
"never hurt anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ever spent a night in the Tiber Septim?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b970_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ever vigilant. That's my motto. They'll sneak up on you. Because they're "
"sneaky. Sneaky fur. Sneaky whiskers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ObelisksTopic_0009102d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Ever wonder why flies like both? Best not to ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_0001a815_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Every birth. Every death. The rise of Tiber Septim. The Numidium. Everything. "
"All predicted with the formulae found within Jyggalag's library."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_000807ae_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Every birth. Every death. The rise of Tiber Septim. The Numidium. Everything. "
"All predicted with the formulae found within Jyggalag's library."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072e01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Every day is like being born. So new and so alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ05RaelynntheGravefinder_0018abd6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Every day, it seems the number of undead increase. If someone can get into "
"the cave and kill Raelynn, maybe we can stem the tide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06PaleLady_0000bd59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every few days she comes for one of us. Some return, some don't. Those that "
"are taken three times never return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBoots_0001f3cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Every girl needs a good pair of shoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46OtherOptions_0000ab73_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Every goblin tribe is led by a shaman, but she mostly stays hidden in the "
"heart of the lair. Well protected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every last Dark Elf in Bleaker's Way is dead. Such madness... how did it ever "
"start?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_000622fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Every little bit helps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00034ea9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Every mage carries a staff. It is crafted and enchanted by the guild, and is "
"a symbol of status. You need such a staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000253b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every moment that Baenlin draws breath is an affront to Sithis and the Night "
"Mother. Fulfill the contract and honor the Brotherhood as you should."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028231_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every now and then he looks over at me and smiles. I think he's sweet on me. "
"If Nels finds the gold, maybe he'll want some company. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082608_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every person in Split has been divided into their Manic and Demented halves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082607_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Every resident of Split has a double living in the town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting1_00018e6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every time I look for a way out, I get twisted around and end up back here. "
"But I'm too smart for them. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RosentiaGallenusTopic_0004b7b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every time I pass by that woman's house, I hear odd animal noises and smell a "
"foul odor. Maybe she's caring for some sick pet or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e655_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every time I see the Torch shining with the flame of Dementia, I blame you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000b0704_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every time I walk past the Temple, I'll remember that terrible day and how "
"you and Martin delivered us from destruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebe0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Every time it gets quiet, they come back stronger and in greater numbers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006dc2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everybody needs a copy of the Black Horse Courier!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006dc24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everybody needs a copy of the Black Horse Courier. Imperial Watch raids the "
"waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d288_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everybody's talking about how you and Captain Burd closed that Oblivion Gate "
"outside town. You're a real hero around here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everybody's talking about the Hero of Kvatch! They say he actually went into "
"an Oblivion Gate and destroyed it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everybody's talking about the Hero of Kvatch! They say she actually went into "
"an Oblivion Gate and destroyed it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a26_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everybody's talking about the Prophet. After the attack on the Chapel, people "
"are inclined to believe almost anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e08d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone calls me Sten the Ugly. I got tired of beating people up for it. So "
"go ahead. Live it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047665_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone comes to the Big City to buy and sell. Why not? More stores, better "
"selection, better prices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone feels sorry for the Fighters Guild, but they can't function without "
"leadership."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15SavageGarden_00047365_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Everyone here died in the Master's service. As the Master promised, we are "
"now immortal, like the daedra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47WhatHappened_00030038_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Everyone in Aleswell suddenly became invisible several weeks ago. It was sort "
"of fun at first, but the novelty has definitely worn off now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003406f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone in Summitmist Manor is dead! There was some kind of party that went "
"horribly awry, or so I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00051dcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone in town knows about my hobby... collecting unusual examples of the "
"arcane crafts. My husband left me quite comfortable, bless his cinders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01JoinThievesGuild_0004f9ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone is here. Let's begin. Each of you is seeking membership in the "
"Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004350a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone is talking about that damned Resonator of Judgment -- talking "
"instead of working."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everyone is talking, but no one has anything to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everyone is tired of Brithaur's antics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e980_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone is very fond of Ohtesse. And her healing skills are simply excellent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0018d2fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone is waiting to see if Farwil and his knights return from inside that "
"dreadful Oblivion Gate. Such brave lads!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09FathisAren_00015f0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone knows he's the court wizard. But I reckon you want to know more. Is "
"it worth a few coins?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046666_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone loves an advancement match, so let's watch as these two brave "
"Myrmidons face off in a battle to the death! Combatants, to arms!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone needs to buckle down and get the work done. And Vilena needs to get "
"out and push guild contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00013343_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everyone wants my weapons. But they're my weapons. Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00015f11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone wants to know about the Gray Fox. Gray Fox this, Gray Fox that. He's "
"just a man, not a Daedric lord. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000af069_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone wants to know what really happened in the Temple. What happened to "
"Martin? Was the fiery dragon really Akatosh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone's making fun of me because I fell for the siren's charms. Well, now "
"I have the last laugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone's saying there's trouble in Kvatch. The whole town destroyed. Only a "
"few survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ed1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone's talking about Duke Thadon and his Chalice. How tedious. Don't "
"people understand I have important work to finish?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone's talking about the assassination, of course. Here. Take my copy of "
"the new Black Horse Courier. Go ahead. Keep it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000af060_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone's talking about the victory over Mehrunes Dagon! I can hardly "
"believe that the great Oblivion Crisis is over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk2_00034049_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everyone's talking about your latest exploits. Not only did you eliminate the "
"target, but his six Imperial Legion escorts as well! Most impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_0002711f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Everything else is just buying time for us to get the Amulet of Kings back "
"from Mankar Camoran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08MothPriestNote_0001474a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Everything in that document is true. My identity cannot be known. In fact I "
"just told you my true name twice, but I bet you don't remember it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00060ed5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everything is gone. What a shame. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00060ed3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everything is just so... desolate. My inn is ruined and... oh, it's "
"terrible..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004d0b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everything is ready for Martin's arrival, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Goblins_00033efd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Everything was going well. We had set up camp at Cropsford, and it looked "
"like a beautiful spot. Then the goblins attacked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Everything's so dirty!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072dac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ew. You smell worse than that cat, Bhisha. Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_00028d8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Exactly.  Sometimes I think he's following me.  I've tried to talk to him but "
"he always hurries off when he sees me coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent work my friend! All we need is the Brush, and we can leave this "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent work, my friend. May the manor give you many years of happiness. "
"I'm now off to the Imperial City once more. Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersMoon_00002dc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent work. I believe this will be of use to the Council. I shall make "
"sure they're made aware of its contents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressAllDead_00020081_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent work. I knew I could count on you. The gods did not idly choose you "
"as their agent, whatever you may think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressPlans_00020085_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent work. I knew I could count on you. The gods did not idly choose you "
"as their agent, whatever you may think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_00024223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_00062309_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! A pitiful sword with a pitiful soul in exchange for a Masque fit "
"for a god. You've gotten the better of this bargain, mortal. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001e0cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! Another vampire has been slain. Here's your reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS39Yes_0004e945_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! But before you go, you're going to need to learn a bit more about "
"Nirnroot. Otherwise you may walk in circles and never find any."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuyBravil_0004d82a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Go out to the corral. Antione will have your new Bay saddled and "
"ready for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS02ManorBuyChoice1_00003a6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Here's the key to the front door and the deed of ownership. I hope "
"you enjoy your new home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_0018b2c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! I accept!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_000288b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! I long to sink a blade into some goblin flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_000288b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! I long to sink a blade into some goblin flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028a8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! I long to sink a blade into some goblin flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_0018abfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! I long to sink a blade into some goblin flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseServantEyjaYes_000b97e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent! I'll move in immediately!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39MissionChoice2_00078204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Let me see that.... A-ha! It's right here. Written in her own "
"hand. She is planning to murder us all. I knew it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice4A_00022ba5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Now please, accept this token from the Dark Brotherhood. It is a "
"virgin blade, and thirsts for blood. May it serve your endeavors well. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayExpelFine_0001e865_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! The guild accepts your... apology and welcomes you back into the "
"fold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk3_0006a869_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent! This is exciting news indeed, magister! Just think of the possible "
"advances in Restoration and Alteration! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HappyReceive_00024256_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003921_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. A fine example of a Daedric shrine. Sorry for the trouble getting "
"here. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03accept_00034e9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent. Bring it back to me once you have it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice5A_00028ac8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Curiosity should never be denied, is it not so? And who knows, my "
"story may prove profitable to both of us once it has come to its end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01FinChoice1A_00023e4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Here is what you must do. Go to the Waterfront District of the "
"Imperial City. There you will find a ship named the Marie Elena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42YesSell_00073234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Here's your money. I should have paid you last week. I'm "
"dreadfully sorry about the delay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Choice6_000b1677_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent. Here's your payment. Come back if you find more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21Interested_0002af2f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Here, take a look at this sketch. The ancient texts refer to this "
"site only as \"The High Fane.\" Do you know it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01Choice1A_0002d414_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. I just don't have the time to search for him again, but I do need "
"to consult him about some notes he borrowed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandDead_0001da70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. I knew you wouldn't disappoint the Order. Here's the reward that "
"was promised. However, I must ask that you reveal nothing about us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Yes_000452f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent. I'll just take them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Rez1_0004dcbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. I'm sure things will go better this time. Good seeing you, Milord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0003b348_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excellent. I'm sure you'll be quite satisfied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1A_0001e854_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. It's a simple task, really - all you need to do is fetch a book "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1A_000224e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. It's a simple task, really - all you need to do is fetch a book "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b1297_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. It's just down the stairs there. The door is impossible to miss. "
"I'm sure you'll sleep very well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b1255_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. It's up the stairs there, and then directly across the hallway. "
"Center room, wonderful view of the city. Sleep well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaYesBooks_00024e81_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Let's see ... yes! The first letter of each paragraph spells out a "
"message!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06FinChoice1A_0003005d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Now listen closely. Nestled in the mountains to the west lies Fort "
"Sutch. It is the home of the warlord Roderick and his mercenaries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9848_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. The room is on the floor upstairs, at the west end of the hall. I "
"do hope you rest well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGJoin1_0002427b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. You are now an Associate in the Fighters Guild. You should report "
"to either Azzan in Anvil or Burz gro-Khash in Cheydinhal for contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11Choice1A_00002dcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. You have become most reliable, and I assure you that the Council "
"appreciates it. Now, to the matter at hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05Yes_0000a233_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Yours is the last item on the list. Now we just wait for the "
"powers that be to pull the plug on Hieronymus Lex's seige."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07Spies_0002008d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Except for Jearl coming back from a trip down south, things are pretty quiet. "
"Not much travel right now with the Oblivion Crisis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreatTorchTopic_000910a0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Except it doesn't! It's gone out. Happens every time the Greymarch begins. "
"Which it has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro3_00082466_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Except where the backbone is an actual backbone. Ever been to Malacath's "
"realm...? Nasty stuff. But, back to the business at hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b37_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Excuse me while I gather the equipment I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b3b_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Excuse me while I go the armory and attire myself as befits a Knight of the "
"Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003402c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, Brother. Can you spare a moment?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007ac79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, I have important things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073025_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, I must have nodded off there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003402d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, Sister. Can you spare a moment?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TimeToGo_0002a51d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, but you have to leave now. I need to lock up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034464_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, citizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a84a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, fellow magister. Is now a good time to talk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003cd00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, madam."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00089932_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, may I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008152c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, my lord. I need to clean right where you're standing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003cd53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000adc4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, the Empire doesn't run itself, you know. Submit a complaint to the "
"usual department and I'm sure someone will take care of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000914dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000aa08d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. Can I help you? Are you looking for Prior Maborel? Or Jauffre?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000410a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. I need to sweep right where you're standing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028861_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. I need to take these people to the encampment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071fad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. I see something I need to clean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_0004891e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. I stay to myself. I have always found the wrong sort of friends. "
"Now I do without."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004763a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. I'm Irlav Jarol, a researcher for Arcane University. Ayleids are "
"my specialty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. I'm on duty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00068340_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. If you have a moment, I would speak with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PakseechTopic_000479cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. In the Imperial tongue, it means, roughly, 'clan chair' -- the "
"seat of the clan patriarch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024c7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. My name is Angalmo. Can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047767_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. Perhaps you're an adventurer? Could you assist me in acquiring "
"something for my crystal collection?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030032_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me. We have a small problem that we hope you can help us with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000b97e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Excuse me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me? You want to question me about Matilde? Two people have been "
"murdered, you fool! Get your priorities straight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackSoulGemMG17_000151f9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Exercise caution when approaching the ruins; the Necromancers control that "
"area and you may inadvertently expose your allies' position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073021_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Exercise your mind and body through working hard, each and every moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00189cfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Exhausted Mine is not far to the southeast. Be careful, its many twists and "
"turns hide the Goblin hordes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugoTopic_00090b6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Expect Brugo and his boys in Telepe, Middas, after midnight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA1_00082dc6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Explain yourself or leave me alone. There are many others here who actually "
"need your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EyeofNocturnalTOPIC_00026ab5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eye of Nocturnal? Doesn't sound familiar to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadonDeathSpeech04_0007b37c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Eyes as blue as a cerulean sea...uhh...what..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestToddHappy_00027fa2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fabulous! That's great. Good for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c22c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fadus Calidius sure can use a shield. I've never seen him take a hit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ad6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fadus Calidus at the Fighters Guild also teaches Block, but he'd be the first "
"to admit I'm his superior in every way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff10_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Faelian used to have money... used to be quite a gentleman, too. But that was "
"before he took a fancy to the... you know. The skooma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0004cf8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faelian, you say? Why yes, I know who he is. Rather distasteful fellow, "
"actually. I believe he lives at the Tiber Septim Hotel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0004cf8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faelian, you say? Why yes, I know who he is. Rather distasteful fellow, "
"actually. I believe he lives at the Tiber Septim Hotel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faelian, you say? Why yes, I know who he is. Rather distasteful fellow, "
"actually. I believe he lives right here, at the Tiber Septim Hotel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faelian? He... he's my sweet. My true love. But I don't know why I'm telling "
"this to you. I mean, we hardly know each other and all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_00003887_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Faelian? Hey, that's my name! Yeah. I'm Faelian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faelian? Oh, I know him all right! A waste of life, that one. He lives here "
"you know, with his sweetheart, Atraena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faelian? Yes, I know who he is. But I'm really not in the habit of discussing "
"such things with strangers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008608c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fail and fall!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09BribeBeggar_00015f1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fair enough. Fathis is also the wizard in the tower southeast of town. He "
"keeps his most treasured items there, not in the castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04NoBribeBeggar_000092e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fair enough. He left town yesterday. I heard he was going to... uh, Anvil. "
"Yeah, that's right. No need to go lookin' for him. He's gone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Faith? Are you telling me we're supposed to rely on the good graces of the "
"Divines to keep Roderick alive? Even he would laugh at such nonsense!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Falcar always has been pretty harsh, even when it comes to basic lessons. He "
"seems to have gotten worse lately, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004872f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Falcar at the Mages Guild seems to be angry all the time. I avoid him when I "
"can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357d_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Falcar did leave this behind; I think it fell from his notes as he left. I "
"didn't pay it much attention, but perhaps it will be of use to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d2e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Falcar gives out the strangest assignments sometimes. It's as if he doesn't "
"really care about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VidkunTopic_0002e998_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Falcar must have known, and yet he said nothing. How could he allow this to "
"happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Falcar was here some time ago, asking about just such a thing. Said it was "
"for research. He had a large sheaf of notes with him about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_0005c014_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fall back to the city before it's too late!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_0018d82e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fall back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderBattle01_0005249b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fall back! Mazken! Retreat! Fall back to the town center! Now! Now! MOVE!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fall before me, Breton!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f4d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fall before me, scum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f527_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fall before me, scum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_00024220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fantastic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HappyReceive_0002424f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fantastic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Yes_00066ef4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fantastic! I will mark Fetid Grove on your map. Good luck to you, friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Ready_00027f3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fantastic! Let's be off then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_000241f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fantastic! Thanks for asking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_000241f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fantastic! Thanks for asking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e92c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fantastic! You actually found 10 of the Nirnroot. I'll begin making the "
"Elixir of Exploration right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonate_00079f56_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Fantastic. I can't tell you what it means to me to have this in my "
"collection. You are a good soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048903_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Far be it from me to criticize my patron and sovereign. Bravil obviously "
"flourishes under his wise and beneficent rule."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaB1_000a5601_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Far from it. His interest in the Ayleids is not that of a mere scholar. He "
"hopes to unlock the secrets of their magical power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0003005c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Far to the west there lives a fierce warlord and his company of loyal "
"mercenaries. Your target is the warlord. Do you accept this contract?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fare thee well, sir knight. May the gods grant you to destroy Umaril utterly, "
"as I failed to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000038d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fare thee well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e848_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fare thee well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00159753_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fare thee well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00089933_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Farewell then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00084b41_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008f132_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00002db0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Farewell! And tell your friends! The Inn of Ill Omen is open for business, as "
"always!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001648e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Farewell, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003631c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Farewell, Brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008d327_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Farewell, My Lord."
msgstr ""

