msgid "For Vitharn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For a really good sword, try 'A Fighting Chance' in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For advanced training, seek out Oleta. She serves Akatosh at his temple in "
"Kvatch. She can teach you all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBettingTopic_0002ada1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For each fight, you can bet 25, 50 or 100 gold pieces. You can bet as many "
"times as you want per day, within the hours of 9:00 AM and 9:00 PM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00002db5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For everyone's sake, would you just leave? Now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00003460_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"For example, this one time, I had a contract to kill a little Nord girl at "
"her birthday party. She asked me if I was the jester!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceExplain_00033540_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For example, why was Falcar -- who we know now to be part of this cult of "
"Necromancers -- in possession of Black Soul Gems?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000253e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For giving you this contract, Ocheeva is wise beyond her years. You will fail "
"in your task, and die in the process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "For instance, you can only really see the bones when you take them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Gardens_00013570_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For many years, I labored painstakingly in those Gardens, until my back bent "
"and my soul became crooked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor21_00032683_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For me, it ends here. You are our only hope to stem the blood tide. Give me "
"your hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_0018b2bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For me? Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_0006232c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For me? You shouldn't have!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagSpeech_0006370c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For millennia this drama has unfolded, and each time, I have conquered this "
"land, only to be transformed back into that gibbering fool, Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7e_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"For my part, I now know that I am largely to blame for the ruin of the old "
"Order. Sir Amiel takes too much upon himself. I will say no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC2_0003fbe0_Oblivion_RESP9"
msgid ""
"For my weakness, the Master sent me here, to torture my former comrades who "
"showed similar ingratitude for his gift of eternal life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireVicente_000251fd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For nearly a hundred years I hunted in secret, until the Dark Brotherhood "
"found me. Now I have a family that accepts and even values my unique gifts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_00024288_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For now, Modryn Oreyn will be handling your duty assignments. Please speak "
"with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10GiveBoots_0001cf37_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"For now, here is your reward. Let us leave Ganredhel's house and go our "
"separate ways. We have overstayed our welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Hate_0007866f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For one thing, he's a thief, but what irks me the most is that he's a BAD "
"thief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PasswallTopic_00018c7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For our purposes, it serves as a defensible outpost. That is, against typical "
"enemies who can know fear, intimidation, and hopelessness. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PasswallTopic_000186ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For our purposes, it serves as a defensible outpost. That is, against typical "
"enemies who can know pain, torment, and death. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_000872e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For pity's sake, just let us die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07WhyNotKillLex_0000c049_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For reasons unknown to this one, the Gray Fox has extended his protection to "
"the Umbranox family and Lady Umbranox in particular."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c207_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For someone who drinks so much, Hauls-Ropes-Faster is in peak physical "
"condition. You could learn a lot from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AerinsCampTopic_000613bc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "For that matter, I don't know who she is either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice4A_00022bd5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"For that reason, I was unable to disclose more about his true identity to "
"you. Clearly that judgment was in error. I apologize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001c0ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Blades and the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00014a35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004ea46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0001d0ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_0008548e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Empire and the Dragon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Empire!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00061cd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the Madgod!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a33_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "For the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b42_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "For the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB1_00035c60_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"For the adventurous, open-minded thinker, daedric worship holds many rewards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the glory of Sithis!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224b4_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"For the last few days, we've suffered attacks from these creatures at our "
"farm not far from Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_00062278_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For the love of Azura, can't a man have a bit of privacy? Get out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For the love of Sithis, you have to kill a feeble old man. Is that too much "
"for you to handle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_0003899a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For the right price, I can make anything good-as-new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004665b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For this match we've got some fresh meat, two brand new Pit Dogs! So let's "
"not waste any time! Let the battle... begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For this stone effigy masks the entrance into the Dark Brotherhood's most "
"revered unholy site -- the crypt of the Night Mother herself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPilgrimageTopic_00002a9a_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For those who would repent of their past deeds, walking the Pilgrims Way is a "
"traditional way to cleanse yourself before the gods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043f40_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "For what purpose, we've never exactly been sure. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_00026b1c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"For years, I have fed my blade the souls of man and mer. Warriors and "
"priests, kings and paupers. Men, women, and children. All have bled for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081523_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For you, Lord Sheogorath, I'll make time. I'm sure you want to ask me all "
"about my research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_00062110_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For you? All right, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice4_000133e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For you? I do not know. My Lord seeks a mortal to act as His Champion. As for "
"His intent... to attempt to fathom it is a foolish endeavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONENTER_0018b2e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For you? Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004c05c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "For your sake, you'd better be on your way to the door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraSpeech_0002c6c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"For your service, take this token, that your deeds might be entered in the "
"Book of Fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e0ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forever foes the ghosts can't thwart, they fight for control of their long "
"dead fort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberTwoMan02_0006726b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Forget it! This is obviously a trick! Let's get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00017d12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me for saying so, Your Grace, but I find taking orders from the "
"Duchess of Dementia to be... unsettling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00016bb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me for saying so, Your Grace, but I find taking orders from the "
"Duchess of Mania to be... unsettling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00017d14_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Forgive me for saying so, Your Grace, but I find taking orders from the Duke "
"of Dementia to be... unsettling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00017d13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me for saying so, Your Grace, but I find taking orders from the Duke "
"of Mania to be... unsettling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00082571_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, Your Grace, but you are not permitted to pass within Brellach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008256f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, Your Grace, but you are not permitted to pass within Pinnacle "
"Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001acc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, but now is not a time for talk. We must reach the Wellspring with "
"all possible haste. If it is damaged, we are lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ccf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, but now is not a time for talk. We must reach the Wellspring with "
"all possible haste. If it is damaged, we are lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD07Choice3_00098199_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, my master.... It is Ri'Zikar! He leads us! And he will have your "
"head. He will kill you all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11CalmDown_00038442_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me. I loved my husband dearly, and to lose him this way makes no "
"sense. Anything you can do to help would be wonderful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MartinA_0008b618_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Forgive me. You were right to bring it. But you'd better give it to me. I "
"know some ways to protect myself from its evil power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkGiftTopic_0004cf46_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Forgo your feeding, and you will no longer be able to blend into \"normal\" "
"society. You will be shunned as a monster. And let's not forget sunlight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_000181c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Form up! By the Staff, we will not allow this town to fall!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11TheLightTopic_00082650_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Forsake the flesh, and you shall know the light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_000749ea_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Fort Naso and Fort Facian, though... bad news. Undead, and then some. But far "
"out and foul enough, you'll get plenty of action."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture3_0007194f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fort Runestones are stones with green runes, found singly or in pairs, in the "
"ruins of some subterranean First Era forts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c083_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fort Sutch? I am familiar with that place. It is nestled deep in the "
"mountains. It is naturally well defended, but there is a weakness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c084_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fort Sutch? It is an impregnable fortress surrounded by mountains. You'll "
"never even get inside, let alone kill your target. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a958_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Fortunately for me, you found them. Allow me to compensate you for the time "
"it took you to travel here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_00014b53_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Fortunately, Dyus has such an intimate knowledge of things to come that he "
"sees no purpose in taking any action, since the outcome is written."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071f4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fortune and fame, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e80c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Foul tergens they are. Heffin all of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000b6c07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Foul things, they deserve the death you've brought them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Foul vermin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036321_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Foul-smelling ape..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00007de7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fouled meat! You have returned Ahdarji's ring, but have also broken the "
"covenant of the guild. Killing is not allowed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006141e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Found Rockshatter yet by chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0001f863_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Found him, did you? Well, I suppose that's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0003103c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Found him, did you? Well, I suppose that's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00034862_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Found it, have you? Silenced the hands that betrayed, and took what was mine? "
"Then let me have the stone, so that the voices can be shut out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Four of the afternoon watch, and all's well. Have a nice day, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023eb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Four of the afternoon watch, and all's well. Have a nice day, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Four of the night watch, and all's well. Wish I was in bed, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023eea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Four of the night watch, and all's well. Wish I was in bed, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_00078fd8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Four people failed in their duties that day, allowing the Fanatics to open "
"the main gate. In the end, I failed with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025b39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Four wins is okay kid, but it don't make you Grand Champion. Here's your "
"payout. Now go clean yourself up before your next match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003403a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Francois Motierre hasn't left his house in days. Hasn't come down to the "
"tavern, refuses to have visitors. I think the man's gone batty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ee2d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Francois is forever in your debt! Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43HowDid_000be560_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Frankly, the smell gave you away. You must have stepped in... well, let's "
"just say something that isn't pleasant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15Anaxes_0003c80d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Free Anaxes and restore order to the Garden, and you shall have the Bands of "
"the Chosen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC3_0003e8f8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Free Xivilai Anaxes, and I shall reward you with the key to the Forbidden "
"Grotto... the Bands of the Chosen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fresh game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007d46e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Fribble! Just Fribble!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00083f54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Fribble, just frib... Wait. You can understand me? Lovely! It's been too long "
"since I was able to have a nice chat with someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Friend no dorpidity? Communce to Uungor. Uungor communces he no deliriotic, "
"that he mented fine. But Uungor is very deliriotic. Oversit me? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04Who_0001330b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"From Dementia's own court, no less. Scandalous! Fatal, perhaps. But passion "
"makes no accomodation for self-preservation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bandits_00003945_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From all accounts, there were four or five of them, and they've been seen "
"heading east on the road. Please, find the Stone of St. Alessia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From darkness to light. From the depths of despair to Arkay's glory. Save "
"these poor souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008d3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"From now on, you will receive all assignments directly from me. In fact, your "
"next contract is available now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesD02_00013a66_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"From that day on, the Ritual of Accession for the throne of Dementia was set."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000adc59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From the Blades, did you say? Jauffre sent you? What's this about? Quickly, "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LifttheCurse_00003a62_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "From there we'll try to lift the curse together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031523_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"From there, I went directly to my chamber and slept the rest of the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00012067_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "From these Gatekeeper bones I can make some arrows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e0eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From these strange ores they can make gear: armor and weapons, or so I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona15_0007ba9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From this moment forward, I renounce my life of crime forever. I am passing "
"the Gray Cowl of the Thieves Guild to it's new guildmaster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fdb3_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"From this moment forward, you will walk the shadows as my Silencer. You will "
"receive contracts only from me. Your new life has begun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1A_00032bec_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"From this point forward, you are no longer bound by the Five Tenets! Sithis "
"will forgive any murder, any theft, so long as you serve the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1B_00032bed_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"From this point forward, you are no longer bound by the Five Tenets! Sithis "
"will forgive any murder, any theft, so long as you serve the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1C_00032bee_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"From this point forward, you are no longer bound by the Five Tenets! Sithis "
"will forgive any murder, any theft, so long as you serve the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00027991_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From what I gathered, he's a retired soldier. He's been all across the Empire "
"fighting in various campaigns. Goodness, he's handsome...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_00031b76_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "From what I hear, you'll appear back where you entered, safe and sound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"From what I know, Carahil is a powerful mage. I suppose she should be, if "
"she's going to be in the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002a397_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "From what I've heard, Kvatch is gone. Completely. Burned to the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0000a100_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"From what he's told you, Mannimarco -- the King of Worms -- is here in "
"Cyrodiil, and preying on our Guild. This is something I'd never have dreamed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "From where do you hail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00000809_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Frostcrag Spire has been uninhabited for so long… they say it was as wondrous "
"as the Arcane University itself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10HelpGF_0001530d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Further use of Savilla's Stone has revealed that I need another special item "
"to move forward with my plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008609e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "GEH!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_000860a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "GRRRR"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00038ee6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gaaahh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f526_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gah! Horrid beast! What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15GaiarAlataTopic_00015880_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gaiar Alata is the Master's name for this place. We usually just call it "
"Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaidenShinjiTopic_00146856_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Gaiden Shinji was the first Arena Blademaster. It was he who oversaw "
"construction of the Arena, back in the First Era. The Arena was... his dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072dfd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gal bursten it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e99a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ganredhel can teach you about Acrobatics, for a price. Of course, she'd "
"rather be training her dogs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e998_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ganredhel does seem to love her dogs. She taught me a little something about "
"acrobatics, though, which was helpful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ganredhel sure does have a knack for training dogs. I've heard that she will "
"train people as well, for a price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ganredhel. I train dogs. And people. Prefer dogs. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestions03_00002c16_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Garlas Malatar was the westernmost outpost of the Ayleid empire. It watched "
"over what we call the Abecean Sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c365_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Garrus may be our only hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028165_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gasp! Oh, thank goodness it's you, sweetie! Please, don't wander too far "
"away. I feel safe with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028163_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gasp! Oh... oh, it's you. What do you want? Why are you looking at me that "
"way?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028164_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gasp! Oh... oh. I'm sorry. I... my nerves. I just want to get out of here. "
"Three people have been murdered! I'm so very frightened!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gaspar and I have learned a great many spells over the years. Once you''ve "
"learned them, you can use the knowledge to create your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c25a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gaston Surilie and his brother Davide own one of the finest vineyards in all "
"of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ae3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Gaston and I make great wines, reasonably priced. Skingrad has two great "
"vintners - Tamika and Surilie. I'll never say a word against Tamika's wines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c23e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gaston and his brother produce quality wines. I'll have to pick up some more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gatekeeper at the Gates! Singing songs of gatekeeping!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gatekeeper's gone. For good. Or not. Might just be on holiday. We'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gates are opening outside the towns all over Cyrodiil. One opened right here "
"in Skingrad. [pending implementation and flag for Skingrad gate status]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a4958_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Gave it a wide berth. I'm a goblin hunter. Don't want to tangle with those "
"Daedra worshippers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005376b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gawk at me will you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_0003844c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gelebourne? That's odd you should mention that name. Raynil told me that he "
"was the last vampire he hunted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00073b61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get a cure! And keep your distance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008656a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get a move on, will you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000236ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get a move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get a move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00092639_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028257_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get away from me! You're the last person I want to talk to about Primo! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get away from me, peasant. Someone has been murdered, and I'm rather unnerved "
"by the whole thing.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKEHATE_0018b2d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get away from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002415c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get away from me. I don't want whatever you've got!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002528c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get away from me...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071e11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get away! You will die here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberOneGnarl02_00066da3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get back here, you cowards! Something's not right...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_0000a0ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Get back there at once! We need to know if anyone survived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice6_0002c5c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get back to me when you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bf9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get back to work"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0000b1a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get back with the Emperor! Protect him with your life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c45a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get back, you filthy beast! I'll have nothing to do with the likes of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081196_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get going, and don't keep me waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Get him to leave sooner than later, and your friend can sleep sooner than "
"later. Watch it, though. Dogs don't like the smell of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a9785_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get inside. The Gray Fox is not a patient man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001588f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Get it back to Traven immediately, or else this whole attack was a waste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015890_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Get it back to Traven immediately, or else this whole attack was a waste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get lost. Or I'll pull your arm off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06MentionBook_000153b6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Get me out of the castle and I'll give you his message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AmuseisPlot_00009332_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Get me that ring. Steal it from Alessia Caro if necessary. Just bring me the "
"ring. I will pay double!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS91Follow_000860da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get moving! I'm right behind you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08BWCTalk_000a5654_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get moving! Kill the goblins! All of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b0a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get moving! We can't do a thing until you get those gates opened!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003377f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f3e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get moving. You need to get rid of those thieves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00Voice_000817c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get my back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f41c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get on that boat and get out of here. Yer wastin' yer own time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291c_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Get on with it if you must. The shrine is downstairs. But I wouldn't expect "
"much if I were you. No one has ever succeeded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of here before you get hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_000175c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of here or there's going to be trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000b52a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of here while you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009811b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of here! There's no time for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_00025308_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c2a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of my way before I have you slapped in irons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008606c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of my way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out of my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out! Get out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a370_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get out! Now! Or I call the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get outside of town, if you get a chance, and hike north along the coast. "
"Great views and good hunting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get outta here! We don't need you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c2a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get outta my way, and keep followin'. I'll show ya a thing or two..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathSpeech_000579ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get over to Lord Drad's estate. Let my ogres loose, and get them out! Okay? "
"Get going!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice2_0008fabd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get rid of that Demented bunch. Useless, anyway. Don't get a lick of work "
"done around this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000165ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get some rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09GreymarchTopic_00091356_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Get that Gatekeeper in place, and do it quickly. I'm not sure how much time I "
"have left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get that artifact back to Irlav at the Arcane University. He's in a better "
"position to study it than I am. Or to assign someone else to do it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004cfa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get that staff back, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034512_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get the book and let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS93Choice01B_00095a67_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Get the crystal ball and return it to me here, and I'll make it worth your "
"trouble. Here, you'll need this key. Thank you so much! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015890_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get the gem! The leader probably had it - that High Elf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008dfd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get the key!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackheartsRing_0002c674_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get the ring for me. We'll need it as proof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00027f8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get the weapons to the other men. Then we'll take care of the goblins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get them out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "Get to him any way you can. It is your only hope for defeating him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000327b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get to hunting, meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b79e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get to it, rat boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b79c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get to it, rat girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008dfd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get to the Sigil Keep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006dc2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get yer Black Horse Courier here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Get your men out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Get yourself to Vahtacen, and see if you can help Skaleel with whatever is "
"holding up her progress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk1_0006fdd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Getting hungry, and could do with a drink. But I'm still sharp, don't you "
"worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gilen and his silly games..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gilgondorin. Silverhome-on-the-Water has beds and food. What's your pleasure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046594_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gilgondrin inherited Silverhome from his parents. I understand he only runs "
"it out of a sense of duty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e967_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gimme the skooma! Don't hold out on me. I know you have it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkoomaYes_0008f787_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Give it here! Give it here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetF1_00002b75_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Give me a moment to arm myself and I will accompany you to Underpall Cave to "
"destroy the foul wraith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000977d7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Give me twenty-four hours. I shall have the potion ready for you then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f146_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Give me your possessions, and put on this initiate's robe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Give my warm regards to Baurus. Tell him he should not blame himself for the "
"Emperor's death. He did well to send you to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e7ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Give them gargen to emeet with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11WhatNow_00022e1e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Give this ring to Countess Umbranox in Anvil. Say nothing about me to her. I "
"need to know how she reacts to it. It may provoke anger or tears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028874_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Give those weapons to the men, and let's get moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00086089_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Give way, caitiff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e080_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Give yourself to love, pilgrim. I'm Trevaia, priestess of Dibella, and this "
"is Anvil's Chapel of Dibella."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_00014b53_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Given our unusual circumstances, I have asked you to seek out his aid. He is "
"all that remains of Jyggalag's great library."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00016bb9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Given the need for swift action, the normal customs shall need to be "
"overlooked for now. We shall be right behind you, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00017d12_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Given the need for swift action, the normal customs shall need to be "
"overlooked for now. We shall be right behind you, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00017d13_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Given the need for swift action, the normal customs shall need to be "
"overlooked for now. We shall be right behind you, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10LetsGo_00017d14_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Given the need for swift action, the normal customs shall need to be "
"overlooked for now. We shall be right behind you, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c351_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Given the opportunity, I think Ulrich would have had me killed. I'm not sorry "
"for what I've done, but I don't wish to be revered as a hero either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RewardTopic_000a3df4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Given your present condition, the main gift I would offer is useless. I can, "
"however, offer you a monetary reward for your troubles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d69_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Gives me the strangest looks, now that you mention it.  Almost like he hates "
"me, although I have no idea why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043511_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Glad they got the Resonator of Judgment turned back on. Was getting less done "
"with all the hubbub about adventurers running amok."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Glad things are settled here. I can finally get some rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Glad to meet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e7a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Glad to see you are well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000349f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Glad to see you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Glad you killed those things. I'd have done it myself, but apparently, that's "
"not \"ladylike.\" Hmmph. Let's get back to my father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017666_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gladiator. It's not very often I get to call somebody that. You're doing the "
"Blue Team proud, kid. Now go kill somebody before I get all weepy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13OfficerGreetA2_0001acb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gladly, m'Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00028d89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Glarthir is acting even stranger than usual, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Glarthir?  Total nutcase, if you ask me.  But he's never done anything -- yet "
"-- that we could arrest him for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004ea4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Glenroy! Over here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024fea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Glistel and me, we keep an eye on things here in Chorrol for certain "
"interested parties... as a public service, like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09FathisAren_00015f1e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Gloomy fellow. I've heard he consorts with daedra. I'd steer clear of him if "
"I were you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002950_Knights_RESP3"
msgid "Glory to the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c456a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go Blue Team! Yeah, Blue Team! I always bet on the Blue Team! They never hold "
"back! It's always crush, kill, maim, murder! Ha ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead, I'm listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003360d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead, boot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00081368_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Go ahead, do what you will. Nothing matters now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000296aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033354_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go ahead, try your magicka in here. Let's see you make those bars disappear. "
"No? What's the matter? Not so powerful now, are you Breton?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000919a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONENTER_0018b2e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead. I don't care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000a232_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead. Leave me to rot in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go ahead. Summon him. He loves it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECylarneTopic_000910d3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Go and fetch the Flame. Bring it to the Sacellum. Light the Great Torch. How "
"are you going to be Me if you can't even do what Me tells you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AcceptYield_0008607d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go and live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003664c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go and prepare yourself. The Master will have need of all of us soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48HirtelB_00032d42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go and see for yourself! Kvatch is a smoking ruin! We're all that's left, do "
"you understand me? Everyone else is dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fd72_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Go and speak with Christophe. Rent a room for the night. Once you have your "
"room, I will meet you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007304c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003002e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away! I don't want whatever you're selling!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d4ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away! I know what you're here for! Just leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f85a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away! You'll ruin everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006c26f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away! You'll ruin everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000256e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away, fool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018b198_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go away, stranger. You frighten the animals, and make my work more difficult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005371c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000919bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ceb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go away. Do not come back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Whatnow_00031d28_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Go back to the Chapel, and talk to Berich Inian. Ask him for the key to the "
"North Tower, and he'll tell you what you need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go back to your sty, pig man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go bother someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go bother someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go carefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00086086_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceCommand_0001356e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Go fetch me Blood Liqueur, Osseous Marrow, Dermis Membrane, and Essence of "
"Breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceRequest_0001356f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Go fetch me Blood Liqueur, Osseous Marrow, Dermis Membrane, and Essence of "
"Breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05NoBribeBeggar_00015f29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go find him yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003377b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go get him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00031610_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go go! There's no time to waste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000514c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go help Lord Rugdumph. And wipe that smile off your face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003360f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go hurt something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go in Madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00022a0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000545ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go inside and talk to Petrine if you want to buy a horse. I can't help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00073039_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go kill something, so I can count its corpse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go look for yourself. The town is gone. And most of its people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029ec_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go now and fulfill your destiny. You are ready, and the Nine walk with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008d2_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "Go now and rest, and may the Night Mother haunt your dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003489e_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "Go now and rest, and may the Night Mother haunt your dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000917e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go now! Learn the identity of the betrayer so we can end this madness, and "
"restore the authority of the Black Hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053871_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go now, Child of Sithis. Walk in the shadow of fear, and bring glory to our "
"Dread Father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhat_000835fb_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "Go now, and bring word to me as soon as he has been escorted to safety."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036317_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go now, dear family member, and may the Night Mother wrap you in her cold, "
"loving embrace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetSermon03_00002ccf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go now, knights. Face the beast. Fear not death, for the Nine shall be your "
"shield, and they shall bring you to rest should you fall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e00_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Go now. Get some rest. Sithis knows you've earned it. When you're ready for "
"another contract, you need only ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Ask_00066f2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go on and lau... Wait. Help? Oh. Well, then... I'm a fisherman. Or at least, "
"I was. Until one of those slaughterfish damn near took my leg off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00002db2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go on now, get out of my inn! I don't need your kind hanging about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a7df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033787_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02PrivateBusiness_000aa090_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Go on. I think you'll find what you're looking for upstairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_0002968f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go on...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go out, kick some robber knight's ass, take his stuff, and get the smith to "
"fix it. That's the way to get armor or weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f3e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go protect Elante. She's doing important research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cf4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go root in the mud, pig man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26DirectionsLex_000363c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go see Hieronymus Lex. He's a pompous fool, just like you. He might listen to "
"your complaint."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26DirectionsServatius_000363c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go see Servatius Quintilius. He's new and might be stupid enough to try and "
"do something about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillFringe_00040369_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go speak with Sheogorath now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f3ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go take care of the rats. Then talk to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go take your break."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGCastOutTopic_0001efc3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Go talk to Armand or S'krivva. Pay the fine and you'll be reinstated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RebuildGatekeeper_00014ae8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go talk to Relmyna in Xaselm. Tell her you're working for me. She'd do "
"anything for me, that little minx."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go talk to Uungor. He's always talking about leaving, anyway. Your friend can "
"sleep where Uungor does now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2b5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Go tell Ulrich that I have some information that incriminates him. Tell him "
"to come alone, or he won't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008606f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go tell Weebam-Na I want to see him. I'll wait right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeebamNaYes_000860cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go tell him I want to see him right now. I'll meet him here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeebamNaTopic_000860cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go tell him I want to see him. Here. Right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA5_00012cd2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Go then. I will hold off on my attack to give you a chance to reconsider. But "
"I will not wait forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice2_00014b5a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Go there and bring me a branch of this tree, but be warned -- the tree will "
"not surrender its secrets to one who has not earned them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDunrootBurrowTopic_00013387_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go there. Take the Felldew from the Elytra, eat it, and your journey begins. "
"You will be thankful to Thadon when this has passed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a85_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Go to Anvil. Speak to the Prophet. You, too, may find yourself taking up his "
"holy quest, despite yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a9481_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go to his shrine. See what lies ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Go to the Dark Fissure the next time this \"shade\" occurs. Search for any "
"connection to what we've learned, and report back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d889_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go to the Leyawiin Guild hall, and speak with Dagail. She can train you "
"further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go to, bold fighterperson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0008e54e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go up there now. The Gatekeeper is about to turn some adventurers into bones. "
"I'll collect those later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017684_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Go up to that Arena and make sure the people of Cyrodiil never forget that it "
"was you who brought the Yellow Team to its knees!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0003b348_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Go upstairs, and look for the door on the right at the end of the hall. Sleep "
"well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000a7132_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go with Akatosh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQPriorMaborelA1_0005d2ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go with Talos's blessings. Do not fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQPriorMaborelA2_0005d2cb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Go with Talos's blessings. Do not fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029ea_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Go with Virtue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go with our blessing, Goldbrand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00045f79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go with the grace of the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000837eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go, go! Socialize! Talk to those fine people, and then plunge your knife into "
"their throats when they ain't lookin'! Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00061cb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001544d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go. Find Thalfin, and the other Battlemages. Stop the gem from reaching "
"Mannimarco."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00041058_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go. Sink your blade deep into the flesh of your enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3A_00090795_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Go. Take a few moments to collect yourself. Meditate upon all that has "
"transpired. Help yourself to any treasures this crypt may offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c361_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go. Tell Garrus what I've done. I've nothing to hide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaSayNothing2_000860c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Go. You're not worth the trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Goblins and rats. Seems like they're everywhere. I'm just waiting for the "
"giant spiders to show up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goblins are filth. More power to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0000ab72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Goblins have their own reasons for doing things. Don't make sense to us, "
"usually, but I've learned a lot about their ways over the years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_0002b1c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goblins. Ugh. Evil, foul-smelling little brutes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07BurdB_00038bc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"God's blood! So she was the spy? It seems there's no one you can trust these "
"days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo07_00090b7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"God's goolies! Not just a Knight, but a... Knight-Errant! That's a real "
"special kind of Knight, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ10Husband_0006141d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goddess! You have Rockshatter already? And what's become of Bjalfi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gods are my witness! I give that man the simplest list of things to do, and "
"somehow he forgets half of it and gets the rest wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033df3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods blood! They came out of nowhere. Have you seen Grandmaster Jauffre?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad84_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Gods give me strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003e211_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods protect us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b1216_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods protect us! What is happening here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09BattleCry_00022bd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods! It's the Count! Run!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00073b62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods! Pox and rot! Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00053269_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods' blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48HirtelA_00032d41_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gods' blood, you don't know, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch07_0018ad6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gods. I don't even notice any more. I guess you can get used to anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gogan and I are really members of the Anvil City Watch. I suppose you could "
"say we work undercover."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d307_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Gogan may be able to give you more information beyond that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d28b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Going into that Oblivion Gate was an impressive feat of derring-do. I salute "
"you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00041057_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Going so soon? Come back when your blades need sharpening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03LewinCrazyChatter_0008efac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Going to g-get us... kill us all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0000a1b5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Gold is the blood of the Thieves Guild. Keep the fences busy and rich. Then "
"come to see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Gold, that's what! Septims, and lots of them! Show me that you've got the "
"starting capital, at least ten thousand in liquid assets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelCrazyChatter_0008efaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gold... gems... keys... all mine... find keys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaFanChoice1B_000aed46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Golly, you're the best! I'm going to follow you and watch you and worship the "
"ground you walk on! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Lost_000a01ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gone now. Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC07Choice1_000091f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gone. Dragged from our house in the night. To pay the debt, I'd like to sell "
"the sword and armor of my grandfather, or I might be next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC07Choice1_000146b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Gone. Dragged from our house in the night. To pay the debt, I'd like to sell "
"the sword and armor of my grandfather, or I might be next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061c73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Gone? I can't imagine Him leaving us now."
msgstr ""

