msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081dc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good seeing you, Lord Sheogorath. Could have bought a round, though...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good that Thadon got his Chalice back. I'd hate if someone took mine. Or "
"anything else, for that matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061790_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good that it is only the Fringe that has been attacked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good that things are settled. We can get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good that we have a healer in town. Cirroc can fix most anything that ails "
"you. After all these years, he almost seems like a Nord himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002888b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good that you made it. You should talk to Rienna."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002e581_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good that you took care of it. This whole Blackwood Company business is "
"starting to chafe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_00066a5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good that you want to get better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000146c7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Good that you've finally seen the light. The cause will benefit from your "
"assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good thing I joined the Mages Guild when I did. There's nothing better than "
"enchanting your own clothes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049966_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good thing we have the Black Horse Courier. I don't know how we'd get our "
"news without it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathChoice2_0001ec3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good thinking. You want to keep your good looks, go talk to some nice pretty "
"gods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091993_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good tidings, citizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000897bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good times. Good times. I hope you had as much fun as I did. Here, take this. "
"It's a fun little toy. Now, go away. Before I kill you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009760b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good times. Good times. I hope you had as much fun as I did. Here, take this. "
"It's a fun little toy. Now, go away. Before I kill you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000165b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to be home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_00024224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to know. I try to steer clear of the big bugs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00003942_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see that you're looking for more work. There's certainly more to be "
"done. I need you to help Elante of Alinor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see the armies back. Did you know that the average Saint is exactly "
"six feet tall?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003454_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000807f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000039da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, friend. I don't suppose you've noticed anything out of "
"the ordinary around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, ma'am. Martin was worried, but I knew you would bring "
"back the Amulet of Kings for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, ma'am. Shall I escort you upstairs to see my master?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, sir. Martin was worried, but I knew you would bring "
"back the Amulet of Kings for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002adad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, sir. Shall I escort you upstairs to see my master?"
msgstr ""

