msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053732_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you again. Do you have the Soul Gems I requested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you again. Do you need me to sharpen your blades?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003565d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again. Have you reconsidered your decision to undertake the "
"investigation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again. I told Martin that Mankar Camoran was no match for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028a26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you again. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002567a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b488_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00002e59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you're working hard. I've got some more thieves for you to deal "
"with in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00146846_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you, Brawler. Your training's going well, I hope?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c14d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you, ma'am. We won't forget how you helped Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c14c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you, sir. We won't forget how you helped Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b48d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000adc6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072dfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good to see you. We should have a drink sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work at Vahtacen. Jarol is quite pleased with the information now coming "
"in about the site."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032dfb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work closing the Oblivion Gate, you've made my job much easier and "
"safer. Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003359e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Good work closing the Oblivion Gate, you've made my job much easier and "
"safer. Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work ending the goblin war. The settlers are very pleased. I'm pretty "
"impressed as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_0003353e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work getting that straightened out. I'm glad someone finally came along "
"that was able to make progress with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work locating the Shrine of Dagon. If you can retrieve the Amulet of "
"Kings, we may yet prevail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038bb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work tracking down the Mythic Dawn's secret shrine. We finally took the "
"fight to the enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work! Now I can paint the portal home. After it's complete, you must go "
"first or else you'd be stuck in here forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001769c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work, Bloodletter. Or should I say Myrmidon? That's right, you've risen "
"in rank. You know how it works. More blood, more gold. Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good work, good pay. Want to join the Guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ef7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work, you fuzzy little rascal! We don't need another Urul around. Do we? "
"Do we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033760_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000337a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressTwoDead_00039301_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work. But you must locate their base and make sure you've eliminated all "
"of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ea8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work. Captain Burd and his guardsmen should be able to handle any "
"additional Gates, at least for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009554a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work. Good times! Here's a little reward for your efforts. One of my "
"toys. Now, back to business. Before I forget myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022b1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work. I am glad to see you, by the way. You just caught me at a bad time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00007de8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good work. You are truly an asset to the guild. I will make sure the Gray Fox "
"himself hears about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_0002421f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGJoin1_0002427d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good, I guess. You're now an Associate in the Fighters Guild. Report to me or "
"Azzan in Anvil for contracts. And don't screw up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002826f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good, I'm glad she's dead. I can tell you that because we're friends. Matilde "
"didn't like me just because I'm a Dunmer. She got what she deserved.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good, good! You'll need all the help you can get if you're going to defeat "
"Jyggalag and stop the Greymarch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk3_0006a86a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good, good. But let's not be too hasty. We must be sure of our findings. If "
"there's any doubt, any doubt at all, it will weaken our position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk5_00002bc3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good, good. Make any arrangements we need, and I'll follow your lead. We'll "
"talk again soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d041_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good, you have found his source. Now, you must find where his source gets the "
"materials if we are to truly bring this crime to justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good-for-nothing louse of a husband. He's lucky I still love him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HappyReceive_00024259_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice3_0008fabe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. A little hard work will do you some good. Just get rid of those "
"Demented freaks, and we'll all be happier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_000241f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. And you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressDead_00020082_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. But there may still be more spies out there. You should continue to "
"search for their base of operations in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02accept_00034873_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Find out where he's keeping the taxes and bring them to me. I'll also "
"need the tax records of what each citizen paid so we can return it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilD3_0003fbe3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Good. Follow me, and don't worry. You can trust me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3c_00019fcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. Good. Bring to me the daggers. Then kill Ciirta, we will. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting1a_00019cd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Good. Your face is known to me. One so famous as you cannot expect to "
"walk around the Isles unrecognized, can you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting1a_0007eaf4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Good. Your face is known to me. One so famous as you cannot expect to "
"walk around the Isles unrecognized, can you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Got your attention. I'm Barbas, the Hound of Clavicus Vile. Not that "
"I've always been a hound, or always been called Barbas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13InformCountess_00027103_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Good. Have her meet me in the Chapel of Talos for a council of war. That "
"seems a fitting place to make such desperate plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028876_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. I need a weapon. But it doesn't look like you have any! Go get them. "
"And quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028879_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. I need a weapon. I'm looking forward to bashing some skulls in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_0002887a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. I need a weapon. I'm looking forward to bashing some skulls in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028a8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. I need a weapon. I'm looking forward to bashing some skulls in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_0018abf5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. I need a weapon. I'm looking forward to bashing some skulls in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Eavesdrop_00081179_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. I shall expect a progress report soon. And keep your head down; the "
"Inquisitor must not become involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS02VelwynEscChoice1_0000a0da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. I want to get this over with as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardGoodbye_00026bd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. I'm hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000614da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. It's always the settlements that adventurers get to first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice3_0008faba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Just get rid of all those Manics in town, and we'll all be happier. "
"Don't kill any Demented, though, or no reward for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice7_0002c639_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. Let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00032b10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. Let's go. We're not out of this yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_000289ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Now everyone is armed. We're going to have to clear the goblins out of "
"this place before the miners can return. Let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03NoneTaken_00067709_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. Now, on to your responsibilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG14Choice1A_0000a0fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Please go to Bruma; I have not heard from Jeanne Frasoric for a few "
"days now, which is unusual for her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusC_00022b16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. Remember, wait for him to follow me. I want to see what he'll do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05PlanB_00022cf3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Remember, we must not leave here without the book. It's our best chance "
"of finding the Amulet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Accept_0001c151_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. Remember, you may not kill anyone while doing this. If you need any "
"lock picks, I can sell you some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusG_0001e90b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. The Emperor's trust was well-placed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0006215f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. The room is on the second floor, right across from the stairs. Sleep "
"soundly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000980ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. You're back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Good. You're finally awake. I was beginning to get a bit concerned about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000146a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Good. You're here. We've got duties to attend to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072f15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Goodbye, Blackwood Company. The Fighters Guild has a new master, and Oreyn is "
"back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_0005375f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Goodbye, I don't expect to be seeing you anytime soon. If I were you, I'd get "
"out of Bruma fast before the guards catch on that she's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_000a04dc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Goodbye, I don't expect to be seeing you anytime soon. If I were you, I'd get "
"out of Bruma fast before the guards catch on that she's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003358a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Goodbye, Knight. Remember to carry our symbol proudly as a beacon of hope for "
"all Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye, darling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000514af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye, dearie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018b18a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye, magister. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00002db1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye, my friend! And remember, you're always welcome here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EronorDEMO1_0002ae23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bcca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001ce2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
