msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_000869a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "HYAH!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha! By Sithis, you are an idiot! Ocheeva has sent you on a "
"suicide mission! Phillida's men are going to cut you to pieces!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08NelsNevConvo_000852c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha ha ha! \"My kind,\" as you like to call us, are plenty happy serving "
"our own needs while your useless Empire crumbles down around you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_00068356_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha ha ha! Well, no one could ever accuse you Blades of being lax, I'll "
"give you that. No, there's no need for alarm. I just wanted to talk. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2B_00032bea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha ha ha! Yes! Yes! The Black Hand has sanctioned the Rose of Sithis. "
"It is an enchanted arrow that will kill Phillida... instantly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06KellenShouts_00002bf6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha ha ha! You move like a pregnant cow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha ha! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk3_0006a867_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! Magister, do you realize what this means? Do you have any idea how "
"this could impact the study of magic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0000c0e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! Now that's the spirit! You give the people of Cyrodiil a good show, "
"and I'll make sure you get a decent burial! Ha ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39MissionChoice1a_00078202_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! That should keep her occupied. She'll spend months putting everything "
"back in place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d62b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! There's the new Arena Grand Champion!  Now listen, I bet you're "
"wondering what's next huh? Well I've been thinking..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b1d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! There's the new Arena Grand Champion! By Shinji, you look good in that "
"Raiment! The way it accentuates your physique... Spectacular! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002443c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! We beat them! We slaughtered them all! Did you see? Did you see how "
"well I fought?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002443d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! We beat them! We slaughtered them all! Did you see? Did you see how "
"well I fought?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00092d75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! We did it, my friend! The killer is dead, and this nightmare is just "
"about over. All we have to do now is find a way out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024851_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha ha! We wiped the bastards out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_0001585c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! Weren't expecting this, were you? You'll get no more enjoyment from me "
"today, Herdir. All I know about is the note."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk5_00002bc5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! Yes, yes! Well, it's settled then! Let us part now, and prepare "
"ourselves, hmm? Finally, a worthy ambition...  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Choice1A_0002ad7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha ha, I knew you'd be up to it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00028aaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk3_00002bb5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! Finally! Well, as you can see, I'm in complete agreement. What's our next "
"step?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSShadowscaleChoice2B_0003559f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! I expected as much from a Dark Brotherhood lapdog! I may not survive this "
"fight, but I'll not make it easy for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000b6c0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! I knew they couldn't stand up to us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01Choice2_000133da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! It's your funeral. I'm just here to warn people, not keep them out. Go "
"ahead in. I'll be here to clean up the mess when you come out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberTwoDem01_000671cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! Let's see them stop me after I rip this gate from its hinges!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_00035711_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! Made you Guildmaster? Amazing. You earned it, though you'll likely muck "
"it all up. So, what are you going to do with your newfound rank?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048919_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! Members of the Thieves Guild in our fair town? What makes you think that? "
"Never! Absurd! Such fine law-abiding citizens are we all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! Take that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! That stupid s'wit! Throw me out of my home, will he? I'll show him a "
"thing or two about messing with an Othran!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! The great assassin needs help fulfilling a contract. You'll get no aid "
"from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridDEMOchoice3_00028a30_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ha! They parade around in their fancy clothes and their expensive perfumes. "
"What do they know? All fluff and no fiber. That's what I say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000164c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! Those girls didn't stand a chance! Good job, Brawler. Here's your take. "
"One more match and you'll advance again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene01Negative_0000c1eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! Those will be the last words that leave your lips!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035599_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ha! Yes! That is an Argonian heart, of that I am sure! You have slain Scar-"
"Tail! Well done! Please, take these boots as payment for your services!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d2b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! You'll never take me down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AReplace_00013ffc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! You're mad! Syl has yet to be bested in any combat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000981b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ha! You've got to be kidding me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk1_0006fdcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Had something of a false alarm earlier. Some Khajiit, acting suspicious. "
"Turns out he was just grooming his tail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Arden_0001f3bb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Had we been blessed with his constant presence, the Isles would be a Maniac's "
"paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000329e9_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Had we brought a City Watch contingent, we might have taken the sigil stone "
"with minimal losses. Instead, Farwil wanted to prove his point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49DukeDeadMean_00091c58_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Had you not been instrumental in getting this far, I'd put you down where you "
"stand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_0002365d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hadn't you heard? He went crazy and killed Bernadette Peneles, poor girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046590_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hafid Hollowleg says that Jerall View has been doing good business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004659c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hafid has a nice inn. I wonder if he doesn't drink away most of his profits, "
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004659d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hafid takes care of his customers. It's a bit expensive, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01MethredhelBrag_000521c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hah! I'll have it before sunrise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01TauntPlayer_0003566c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hah! You are too late. I have the diary!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Notebook_00078201_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Haha! Cindanwe lose her head looking for that. Show to Ranarr-Jo. He hate "
"Cindanwe. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00093552_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Haha! She fooled you but good. This isn't her real amulet, but a clever fake. "
"The true amulet has a red stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479ea_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! Isn't that rich? They think the things are stolen, but no! They are "
"right there! They just don't know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSMiscKotT_000c4540_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hahaha! Knights of the Thorn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Hahaha! No! Really! It wasn't me! Never!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice1C_000275c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! Oh, you're a funny one! Good, I'm glad one of us has a sense of humor "
"about all of this. It will make our time here that much more enjoyable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Hahaha! That one never gets old!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene02Positive_0000c1ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! We made a solemn pact not to let anyone else join the gang. I can "
"remember it clearly even though it was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hahahaha! You're so funny My Lord! I mean, your presence is intoxicating!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000688f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail Blade. Do you have a moment to talk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BrumaCheering_0003d60c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail Martin Septim!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061c7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail Sheogorath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1A_00032bf0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail Sithis indeed, my child! Now listen closely. No longer will you receive "
"your orders directly. Instead, you will visit secret dead drops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail and welcome, friend. Hail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002aaf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail knight! You seek my Relics with a worthy heart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirThedretSpeech06_00002caf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail the Lord Crusader! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10KnightsHail_00002ca8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail the glory of the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00084b43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018b9ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10KnightsHail_00002ca7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail! Hail the Lord Crusader! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10KnightsHail_00002ca9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail! Hail! Hail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033541_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail! This area is extremely dangerous. I'd recommend leaving quickly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail! What can Newheim the Portly do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000688f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Blade. What news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000adc5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Champion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000af05e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Champion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Commander."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000688f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Cyrus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_00037c3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Dragon Born! Hail, Martin Septim! Hail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQVoice_00037c37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Dragon Born! Hail, Martin Septim! Hail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008fa99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Duchess of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008fa98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Duke of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006a845_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, Good Mage! Welcome to the Arcane University! Is there anything I can "
"help you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029cf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Lord Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008d323_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, My Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062bea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Savior of Bruma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Areldur."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Avita."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Brellin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Carodus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Geimund."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029b7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Gukimir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029dc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Knight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, Sir Knight! My brother and I have heard that you are founding a holy "
"order of knights, and we would like to offer you our swords."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029ba_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Lathon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029bb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, Sir Thedret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002951_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, brave Knight. You do not know me, but you have saved me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril1_00002c5a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, brother. Do you find this waiting as hard to bear as I do? Why must we "
"sit back and wait for Umaril to strike again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00070289_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, citizen! It's not often I see another rider out here on the roads. "
"Times being what they are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bc1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, citizen. I speak for the Emperor. Or... at least I did..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c13d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, daedra-slayer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007028c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, fellow horseman! All's quiet in your stretch of the wild, I hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071f4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a8ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, friend! Good to see you again. I hope the Arena has been as good to you "
"as it's been to me. What brings you back to the Imperial City?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a900_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, friend! Good to see you again. So tell me, what brings you back to the "
"Imperial City?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, friend. Good to see you again. What can old Manheim help you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038b35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, friend. I don't believe I've ever seen you down here in the Bloodworks "
"before. Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Agronak gro-Malog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a8fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, friend. I don't believe I've ever seen you down here in the Bloodworks "
"before. Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Agronak gro-Malog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a8fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, friend. I don't believe I've ever seen you down here in the Bloodworks "
"before. Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Agronak gro-Malog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018baa6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, good citizen! How can I be of service?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025287_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, my Brother!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025288_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, my Sister!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029bc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, sir knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029aa_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, sir knight. Is it a good time? We need to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight1_00002ce9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hail, sir knight. You seem more serious than usual. Is there something the "
"matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009f991_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail, traveler. You are welcome in Bleaker's Way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029ee_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Hail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000256c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b491_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00037f62_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Hail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e65f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025071_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hail. We got plenty of rooms if you want one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hairballs attacking me. They were everywhere. It was the strangest dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_0004681f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hale is still under attack. Or had you forgotten? No matter. I'm certain they "
"can hold out a bit longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006c297_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Half of the Council of Mages resigned when Traven took over the position of "
"Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngaTOPIC_0001ce9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hallowed ground, home of the Forgotten Ones. A deep hole of shadow and "
"despair. A truly wondrous place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Halt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045750_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Halt, lawbreaker! Lord Sheogorath's justice demands reparations or it's the "
"dungeon for you. Any stolen goods will be confiscated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045753_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Halt, scofflaw! You can't afford to pay reparations for your crimes, so it's "
"off to the dungeon for you. Your stolen goods are now forfeit. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018dc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Halt. Mortals are not permitted within the walls of holy Cylarne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hammer and Tongs is a good place to get your armor repaired. Just don't go "
