msgid "Have you heard Gruiand Garrana talking about herself again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00029691_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Have you heard Renoit got some new books in stock?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e9a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about Agronak gro-Malog? Turns out he's not a noble at all. "
"He's really the son of a vampire! It's almost too horrible to believe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Have you heard about Delphine Jend, and her skills in spellcasting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about Kvatch? They say that daedra came from Oblivion and "
