msgid "Have you heard about how the Blackwood Company is growing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00033f07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about that ghost of the old man that looks out into Niben Bay "
"each night? They're calling him the Forlorn Watchman... spooky."
msgstr ""

