msgid "Have you located their hideaway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049935_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Have you looked around Jensine's? It's amazing what people will get rid of."
msgstr ""

