msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028710_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How could I have been so naive, so stupid? We must stick together my friend, "
"for Dovesi is surely the murderer! We must strike before she does! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How could the Nine let this happen? Are they angry with us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00015130_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How could they be waiting for us here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaSayToCorpse_0006f87c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How could this be? No mother should outlive her child. No, never!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How could this happen? How could I have let my guard down. That poor old "
"woman is dead, and I should have protected her...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How could you do that to all those innocent people? What did they ever do to "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JorundrTopic_00093477_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How could you stand sharing a cell with that imbecile?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChanel1_0003565f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How dare you accuse me without enough evidence to back up your story!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12CmdrAnswer1_0001c48f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How dare you address me that way, soldier! Your insolence will not be "
"tolerated!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016b57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How dare you interrupt me! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f128_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How dare you invade this holy place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49DukeDeadMean_00091c58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How dare you mock him, even in death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0009198f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How dare you try and best me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How delightful! Welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003cc2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How did I get here? Do you know the way out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062498_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How did a Dark Elf become Count Cheydinhal? King Helseth and Barenziah have "
"considerable influence, and Helseth and Indarys are cronies. Get it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000613e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How did someone manage to kill him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How did you fare?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008dfd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How did you get in here? What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11StrangersRing_00022e6e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"How did you get it? Do you know his whereabouts? Why are you showing it to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00082478_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How did you survive the collapse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078666_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "How do I know he won't come back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078667_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "How do I know he won't come back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000256d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How do you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b493_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How do you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How do you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How do you do? I'm Tadrose Helas, Smith of the Bravil Fighters Guild chapter "
"and trainer for Armorers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Notebook_000781ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How do you know about that? It's private. I don't trust you enough to talk "
"about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How do you like the bottom boot on the rat thing? Not bad, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How do you plan on entering this man's house? Through the front door? Be "
"smart and look for a more inconspicuous way in, like a cellar entrance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingForever_000131d8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"How do you tell one from another if you're smack in the middle? Don't answer "
"that, I already know the answer of course. It came to me during a meal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How does Ita Rienus know so much about Tamriel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How does Olfand manage to be a smith, trainer, and babysitter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sithis_0006633b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How does one best describe our Dread Father? Imagine a perfect, cloudless "
"midnight, cold as winter ice and shrouded in shadow. That is Sithis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreenmoteTopic_000139ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How does one describe utter euphoria?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How does the day greet you, friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How does this make you feel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How fair thee, friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonate_00082424_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"How generous of you! You'd just give it to me? You are a true lover of "
"Oddities, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How glorious, a newcomer to the Isles! Perhaps they will see the ways of "
"Arden-Sul and join us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006fdc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How goes it, friend? Keeping the killers and cutpurses at bay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002413d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How goes it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b497_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How goes it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000241b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How goes it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000908e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How goes the battle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e92f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How goes the search?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031e9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How good to see you again, fellow knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_00081ae0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How he must have mocked me, with my poems, and my painting, and my "
"meaningless revelry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e93d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How interesting! I've heard of these glowing roots, but never had the fortune "
"of seeing one. Unfortunately, I know nothing about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2B_000844c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How interesting. I'm sure the curio shops in the Market District would be "
"glad to give you a fair price for this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0001fbb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How is Dagail today? Is she well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c22c_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"How is it that the Daedra forthrightly proclaim themselves to man, while the "
"gods cower behind statues and the faithless words of traitor-priests?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How kind of you to grace the Sacellum with your presence, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How kind of you to grace the Sacellum with your presence, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39PodPitYes_00072c9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How kind of you. When I'm restored to my rightful place, I will give you a "
"palace in the clouds... or was that a palace made of clouds?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c221_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "How little you understand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarSpeech_0008b0a0_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "How little you understand! You cannot stop Lord Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c151_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How long will Bruma need our help? Count Caro's orders were to return to "
"Leyawiin as soon as Bruma was secure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How many J'zidzos can you fit in a breadbox? One! There's only one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How many J'zidzos does it take to light a torch? One, dammit! And I'm tired "
"of the other one. Terrible straight man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061439_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"How many people have you killed in your lifetime, eh? Not as many as I, my "
"little friend. When we're equals, you might interest me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Choice1B_0002ad7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How many times can I say it? There's no time to waste! Hurry it up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004109f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How many times have I told you to leave me alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bdab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I assist you, Arch-Mage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bdaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I assist you, Arch-Mage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I assist you, my lady?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I assist you, my lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000817bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I assist you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I be of service to you, milady?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I be of service to you, milord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_000088a2_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "How may I help a guild brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bda4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I help you, Arch-Mage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I persist you? Please, I need you to find my daughter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000296d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "How may I serve you, Commander?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a799_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I serve you, Lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I serve, my Lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00061cc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I serve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How may I serve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002973_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "How may this humbled shade serve you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonateNo_00043435_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"How mercenary of you! You and I both know the Museum is the rightful home for "
"such an Oddity. I hope you change your mind eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How nice to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000980c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How nice to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_0018b2c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How nice! It's just what I wanted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIRELIKE_0006230d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004763d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How quaint. You seek to educate yourself. At the expense of my precious time. "
"Go. Shoo. Bother someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyArgonian_0009f9b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How sad. The Argonian was a poor thing. Let her go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ01Potatoes_001885db_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"How stupid I was to leave them outside all alone like that! All I wanted to "
"do was give them some sun. Next thing I knew, they were gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonate_00081e9f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "How sweet! You truly are a patron of the Odd!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d58_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"How then to obtain the blood of a god? But Jauffre solved it. The blood of "
"Tiber Septim himself, who became one of the Divines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"How to decide... Do you prefer glorious, and pointless, battle? Or the "
"poisoned arrow striking home from ambush?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How to say this nicely?  He's sort of the town eccentric.  Lived here for "
"years, we've gotten used to his ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseDecline_0004d82d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How unfortunate. Don't be a stranger. We have a fine selection of Bay horses "
"if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018bc5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How very arrogant of you. To think that I would aid you out of the kindness "
"of my heart?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041097_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"How will I ever finish the Encylopedia Sheothia with these constant "
"interruptions!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45DarMaInnkeeper_000280b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How would I know?  Maybe she went crazy and run off into the woods.  Now if "
"you'll excuse me, I got things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000704ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How would you like to get my husband, Gogan, out of hot water?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006e605_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"How you manage to do this is up to you; do not wander off, or I shall "
"consider this test of your ability failed. Are you prepared to begin now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033772_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How'd it go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How'd you get in here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_00038439_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"How'd you know about that? Agh... too many people don't know how to keep "
"quiet about official matters. Very well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000241ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How's business? Are things going well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00066f2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "How's the fishing trip going?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22HighFane_0002c819_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"However, I do have another task, a rather urgent one in fact, if you would "
"like to redeem yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07DairihillOffice_00098397_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, I'll tell you for free that there are many secrets in that Castle. "
"There are secret ways, and secret people. Find the blacksmith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038afa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, I'm afraid he's slipped through our fingers. If he's as crafty as "
"he's been up to now, he's probably halfway to Vvardenfell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475d1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, Leyawiin must move towards the mainstream of Imperial culture, both "
"in trade and in political affairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001fb50_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, Theranis has not been seen since. The Gray Fox himself hunts for "
"this book. I need you to find Theranis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10JaksDiarySays_00015313_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, another thief in the guild picked up the cowl and assumed his "
"identity and the curse. No-one in the guild knew it was a different person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGInformation_000092b3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, be prepared to spend a little coin. They won't tell you anything for "
"free. At least not anything true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MundaneAmulet_00038b02_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, because you've avenged his unjust death, I feel that Bradon would "
"understand why I'm breaking that pact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetD_0003e8fe_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, by some trick, they trapped one of my agents, the Xivilai Anaxes, in "
"a cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC3_0003e8f8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, his shame attaches to me, and though the matter is too small for my "
"attention, it is not too small for one of my servants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_00014b60_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, if you insist: I once served as the keeper of the great library of "
"Jyggalag. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_000807aa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, if you insist: I once served as the keeper of the great library of "
"Jyggalag. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2A_000844c0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, it is too late to disturb him. If you'll return in the morning, I'm "
"sure he will be glad to speak to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BonusTopic_0002ff51_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, many of our clients request that their contracts be carried out in a "
"specific manner. A certain place, a certain method of elimination. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaC1_000a5604_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"However, my studies of the ancient texts make clear that it is the key to "
"dangerous magical powers which should be left dormant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b6b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, no mortal may sit upon the throne without the staff. So here you are "
"in my prison, seeking to supplant the one who placed me here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_00043f72_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, she did not recognize this event for what it was. She believes that "
"Sheogorath had abandoned the Realm out of fear of Jyggalag's attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Cindanwe_000781f5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, she knows everything about all of us, keeps notes about everything. "
"EVERYTHING!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c350_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, since you aren't fully at fault, I won't report your involvement to "
"the Count. Llevana, on the other hand, will pay for her crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_00016efc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, spare me your grief. My imprisonment is as meaningless as my "
"immortality. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_000807ab_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, spare me your grief. My imprisonment is as meaningless as my "
"immortality. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice5_00014b62_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "However, the secrets of its construction are lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture1_00071944_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"However, the universal belief that runestones are magical, despite all "
"evidence, is good reason to suspect that the runestones are indeed magical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00015f23_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, the wizards are not to be trusted. I'm sure they are watching for us "
"to put it back where you got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee3f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, there are rumors that the Gray Fox himself may call on you soon. "
"Wait for contact from him. Keep the guild fences busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016efa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, what comes next is now unclear. If you wish to confront what is to "
"come, I shall create the Staff for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bf_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"However, when I spoke it and held the staff, four scamps suddenly appeared! I "
"thought I was done for! Strangely, they all just stood there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11RejectCowl_00022e8c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"However, when you remove the cowl, eveyone will know you as yourself. "
"Fortunately, the cowl still has the power to hide your alter ego from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_0003066e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, with you here now, we can take the sigil stone from that citadel and "
"complete our quest for the good of all Cheydinhal! Huzzah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000807a6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"However, you shall still fall victim to the same pitfalls as he. Leave me to "
"my torment, Madgod. Leave me to suffer as Sheogorath before you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGThievesGuildJobs_000165e5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"However, you will find that you can only sell stolen property to one of our "
"guild fences. Most other merchants won't take hot merchandise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39PodPitNo_00072c98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrmph. I once killed a minotaur with a spoon! I don't really need your help "
"anyway. Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinB_0002d075_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hrmph. Not much of a loss, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_000253d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrmph. Think they're all so high and mighty, that they've somehow got a "
"monopoly on power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013a56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrmph. Very well, Steward. I believe you. You may return to your duties. And "
"of course, thank you for your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1B_000224e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hrmph. Very well. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG02Choice1A_0002e5aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hrmph. Very well. We shall see how prepared you actually are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_00033636_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hrmph. Why all the fuss now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49ChoiceNoTime_00031d2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrmph. You do the guard one little favor, and suddenly you think you're "
"Matius' best friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000807a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrmph... it seems that I made a miscalculation. Against all odds and all the "
"knowledge that I possess, a new Sheogorath is risen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakersWayTopic_0001ebdf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Hrol Ulfgar and Nivan Dalvilu lead the community, and have done so for many "
"years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrolUlfgarTOPIC_0001ebd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrol Ulfgar has been murdered, and the Dalvilu are responsible! They will pay "
"for their treachery, the wretched Dunmer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrolUlfgarTOPIC_0001ebde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrol Ulfgar has been murdered. We will find the assassin, and he will pay "
"dearly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrolUlfgarTOPIC_0001ebce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrol Ulfgar is dead! I cannot imagine who would want to harm him. The culprit "
"will be found, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrolUlfgarTOPIC_0001ebcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrol Ulfgar is dead, and his clan believes our family responsible! This is "
"madness!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrolUlfgarTOPIC_0001ebd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrol Ulfgar leads the Ulfgar clan. He is a fierce warrior and a wise leader. "
"All the Dalvilu respect the man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrotaCaveTOPIC_00003430_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrota Cave? I believe it's a bit north of here. Shouldn't be too hard to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hrpmh. So, you're the one that's come for the mace, are you? Another "
"adventurer looking for treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh-what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh. I'd have thought a god would be taller than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh. That beast looks godly, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Noticed_0002d3fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ff0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh? Sorry... I ain't interested...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02Choice1B_00023f37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Huh? What are you, some kind of preacher or somethin'? One of them crazies "
"from the Church? I ain't got time for this...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fbae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Huh? What do you want? Sorry, can't talk... now. I'm with my... my lady "
"friend here. Talk to me... later... Not here... Not in the hotel... Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Unseen_0002d406_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh? Where did you go? Come out where I can see you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh? You're not Gromm. Get out of my home! I don't want you here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002d931_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh? You're not Gromm. Get out of my home! I don't want you here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d921_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huh? You're not Gromm. Who are you? Why are you in my home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c979_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Humilis Nonius. Wildeye Stables can board your horse, or sell you one, if you "
"like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Humph."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00041ec5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Humph."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HowlingHalls_00016b7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hundreds of years ago, this very building once served as a temple in Cyrodiil "
"that sought to \"cure\" the mad. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062153_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hungry? Thirsty? I can help with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurargh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurargh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CastleGateTopic_00090ab5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Hurry and find Berich Inian. He should be back in the Chapel, and should "
"still have the key to the Guard House."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hurry back, my Lord. There's so much I want to show you. So much, indeed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00028c78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry it up, swamprot! I'm thirsty over here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a809_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry to Dyus. Do as he asks. No danger is too great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MucianusAliasTopic_00083975_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry to Nenyond Twill and make sure he is unharmed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredNoLead_0008e4f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry up! The bones are calling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry up, before I change my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002b3cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry up, will you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000919be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredNoLead_0008e4f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredSayUnlockGate_0007ec3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry! Pick that lock open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredSayUnlockGate_0007ec3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry! Pick that lock open. I can hear them in there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006ea48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry! There's no telling how much time I have left!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008dfd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry! There's no time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007302a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry, before everything falls on top of us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredSayUnlockGate_0007ec40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry, get that door open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00022a0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry, get that key... it's our only way out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c42d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry, get to Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000432ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Hurry, there's no telling how much damage has already been dealt to the "
"Resonator!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredWait_0008e4f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry. The bones are calling out to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e863_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurry. We don't want anyone to see us talking, do we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_00015637_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurt me all you want, Herdir. You know I won't talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_00084aa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hurts us...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3ded_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Hush, child. This is serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00090cb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huurraggh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e08f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huurwen of the Fighters Guild. Health and fortune."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Huurwen was sparring with some other Fighters Guild members recently. I don't "
"think any of them could get a hit through her shield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BrumaCheering_0003d60d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huzzah for the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13AllyShoutReinforcements_0004dbd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Huzzah! More of my kin have joined the fight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandCalm_0001d4c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I - I'm sorry. I've been hiding up here in this cabin and I've forgotten my "
"manners. Try and understand. I loved her, I'd never harm her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a6a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I AM CYRODIIL COME, he said, Old Reman, born from the earth that IS Al-Esh, "
"and yet he would scorn this country now! Repent! I say again, REPENT!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I abhor killing, but you did the right thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0003d07f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I accept such low prices only for guild members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChalYes_0003a917_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I accept the challenge, of course. Speak with Ysabel, tell her you're ready. "
"Then we'll meet in the Arena and prove our mettle as warriors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_0001cf3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I accept this blood price and welcome you back into the Thieves Guild. I "
"oughta break your neck though. Don't make this a habit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AcceptYield_00023f44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I accept your surrender, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AcceptYield_000252a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I accept your surrender."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELOVE_00062324_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I accept. I have no choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic08_000860ba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I address my offer to you and your friend. Would you like to become knights-"
"errant?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000206b1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I admit I had my doubts about you, but something told me I was doing the "
"right thing. Many thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I admit to sharing the common enthusiasm for the Arena. It is barbaric, but "
"the stakes of life or death make the drama irresistably compelling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8c3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I admit... I still have strong prejudices against necromancy, summoning, and "
"illusion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I agree with the Watch Captain. This Atius-Sintav feud has gone on long "
"enough. I can control my people. I hope Iniel can control his."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseTooMuchImperialCity_000531bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I agree, but someone will be foolish enough to buy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00028d88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I agree.  He's always writing in that little notebook.  Sometimes I think "
"he's watching me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047631_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I aim to keep an eye on things here in the city. Take it slow, get to know "
"the people. Try not to get off on the wrong foot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028729_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I ain't got much to say about the old lady, and even if I did, I wouldn't say "
"it to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000493fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I ain't got nothin' to say to you, fancy pants. So why don't you mind your "
"own business, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06Theranis_00010501_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I ain't tellin' the likes of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1b_000807ad_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I alone have survived. Sheogorath cannot bring Himself to destroy the "
"knowledge that I possess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1b_0001a816_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I alone have survived. Sheogorath cannot bring himself to destroy the "
"knowledge that I possess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity6_00081e88_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I already have one of... wait a moment, no, that's the one I can't find now. "
"If only I had the money to buy it off you...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_000280a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I already told you, she never showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000038b7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I also fear their numbers may be greater than we believed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_000286f9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I also get the sense that he's very eager to find the gold. I can't imagine "
"his life of servitude to the Empire left him with much to retire on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bc_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I also learned that the staff makes the owner move much slower than normal. I "
"suppose it's another way the creator upped the annoyance factor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopYes_0001e840_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I also want you to know that I had a long discussion with Jensine, and I have "
"decided to join the Society."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c51a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I always enjoy meeting my rival treasure hunters. What, did you think you "
"were the only one? Ha ha ha! Come, let us have a drink together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I always enjoy speaking with Nahsi. His views on the world are different than "
"most."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003842b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I always liked Bradon and Erline. They were a nice couple. I hope you get to "
"the bottom of this, cause I don't believe he was a vampire either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BernadettePenelesTopic_0002587b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I always suspected she was watching me. Thank you for finally confirming it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I always wanted to see the Jerall Mountains. Beautiful, aren't they? Almost "
"makes you forget why we're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024bb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Alberic Litte of the Mages Guild. I am pleased to make your acquaintance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ad5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Ambroise Canne, grape-grower for Surilie Brothers. I'm also an advanced "
"trainer for weapon and shield parries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Andel Indarys, Count Cheydinhal. There is no more generous or just ruler "
"in Cyrodiil, if I say so myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am Arquen, Speaker for the Black Hand. As you can see, we have dealt with "
"the betrayer, Lucien Lachance! No longer will you serve as his puppet!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000238c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Arriana Valga, Countess of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001333a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Bat gro-Orkul, warden of the armory. If you need weapons or armor, I've "
"got them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BieneAmelionTOPIC_000091cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Biene Amelion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008151d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Count Cirion, and you have violated the inner sanctum of Vitharn. What "
"say you in your defense?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000120ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Count Cirion. What does the mighty Lord Sheogorath need here among the "
"shades of Vitharn? Have you come to mock us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4283_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Countess Alessia Caro, wife to Count Marius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElanteTOPIC_0000344c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Elante of Alinor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Geel. Sergeant-of-Sharpshooters, Blackwood Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Geem Jasaiin. We come from Black Marsh to the city to work the water "
"ways and water trades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Gemellus Axius, Earl Jakben's manservant. He did not inform me of your "
"visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10FindJakben_0009ded9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Gemellus Axius, his servant. Master Imbel has his home facing the "
"central plaza of the Talos Plaza district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Gruiand Garrana, Primate of Arkay, and spiritual leader of the "
"Cheydinhal Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f146_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Harrow, Warden of the Shrine of Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice1_000133e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Haskill, Chamberlain to the Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047752_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Hlidara Mothril, Lady Leyawiin's chaplain and chief advisor. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrolUlfgarTOPIC_0001ebcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Hrol Ulfgar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047686_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Iniel Sintav, head of the Sintav clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00051dca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Janonia Aurunceia, chief maid-servant of Castle Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00051dc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Januarius Aurunceia, the Count's footman and boot-puller."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Kishashi and Fellmoor is my domain. A queen, some would call me. But "
"others will say that Cindanwe is in charge. Pah! Liars!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Kishashi, great hero of the northlands. I once single handedly held off "
"an entire horde of Grummites. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f372_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Kithlan, Steward of Lady Syl. Unless you have reason to be here, your "
"presence is unwelcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002932_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Lathon, squire to Sir Roderic of Wayrest. We are on a holy quest for the "
"Crusader's Relics!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LordDradTOPIC_0001ec51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Lord Drad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LordRugdumphTOPIC_0000be82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Lord Rugdumph gro-Shurgak. How may I persist you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenSpeech_0006e7f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Lorgren Benirus, and I desire the chance to atone for my sins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2A_00022b9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Lucien Lachance, a Speaker for the Dark Brotherhood. And you, you are a "
"killer. A taker of life. A harvester of souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Mahei... that poor fellow who is chased everywhere by that nagging "
"fishwife, Numeen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Mara's Primate, Chana Mona. I  take care of the Chapel's affairs in "
"Bravil Parish, and speak for Mara in the Council of the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MelusPetiliusTOPIC_000b167b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Melus Petilius. Leave me in peace to mourn my wife, Vena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e085_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Millona Umbranox, Countess of Anvil. I hope you enjoy your visit. I "
"trust you will give us no cause to regret our hospitality to strangers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Naspia Cosma, Cheydinhal's Steward. I offer introductory training with "
"Blades, and may condescend to accept you as a student."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NewheimthePortlyTOPIC_00002e8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Newheim the Portly. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NivanDalviluTOPIC_0001ebd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Nivan Dalvilu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NorbertLellesTOPIC_0003572a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Norbert Lelles. How may I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Olava the Fair, Mara's Living Saint. It is my responsibility not to "
"preach, but to live Mara's commands as an example to others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023fb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Orok gro-Ghoth, steward to Countess Arriana Valga, Countess of Chorrol. "
"I manage her affairs, and the castle is in my keeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RiBassaTOPIC_00026b0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Ri'Bassa, shaman of the Khajiit of Border Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Ri'zakar, Pakseech of the Blackwood Company. The Company provides expert "
"jihatt for selected customers. Very discreet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am SICK of Orcs coming in here and giving me the business. 'Ooh. Bugak got "
"a book store. Ooh. Bugak's a sissy scroll-scribbler!'"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05ThedretWho_00002af8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Sir Thedret. I came here seeking the Shield of the Crusader, and was "
"ambushed by these... these cowards. They've held me here since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000ace07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Sister Angrond of Gottlesfont Priory. We gather and prepare healing "
"herbs and mushrooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGWhoAreYou_00064467_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am The Stranger. That is all you need to know. That, and I am no-one to be "
"trifled with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000545d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Ugak, owner of the Grateful Pass Stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeebumNaTOPIC_00026abf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Weebam-Na. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f374_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am Wide-Eye, Steward to His Grace, the greatest Duke of Mania in all of "
"history, Thadon. He is my reason for being. My purpose in life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am Wumeek. Gods commend you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TheGrayPrince_00038b46_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I am a Lord's son, yet I've been denied the noble privilege to which I am "
"entitled. So I have become the Gray Prince, noble in my own right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003640d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am a priest in the Temple of the One in the Imperial City. Perhaps our "
"paths will cross again one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0003faf2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am a vampire, a Lord of Blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00055405_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am all that is left. The others were struck down by Order. How did this "
"happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00055b04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am all that is left. The others were struck down by Order. How did this "
"happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_0001a815_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I am all that remains of the knowledge contained within the great library of "
"Jyggalag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_000807ae_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I am all that remains of the knowledge contained within the great library of "
"Jyggalag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona05_00022e80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am also your missing husband, Corvus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002c2f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am anxious to hear news of the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChanel1_00031506_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I am ashamed of my crime, but ready to face what fate has in store for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_0001bcca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am ashamed that I took the painting, but my love for the Count was greater "
"than you could imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I am at the Emperor Martin's command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bdaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your command, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bd9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your command, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071e0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your mercy for now, scum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bda2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your service, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001bac9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your service, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000296e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your service, Commander."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002970_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your service, Lord Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000295b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am at your service, a humble vessel of the gods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000c45a5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am at your service. If you need Alteration training, I am here for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00098196_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am beaten. Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_0001562c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am being honest, that is all. The only strange reports I have received are "
"of a robed figure seen leaving the palace late at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_0009839e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am bound by duty and honor to obey this order. After all these years, he "
"has finally won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000295d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am busy with the gods' work. Are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am busy, so, if you will excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018a806_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am busy. Get out. When I am ready to conduct guild business, I'll leave the "
"door unlocked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041094_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am compiling a taxonomy of every living thing in the Shivering Isles, the "
"weather, changes in the moon and stars, and their interrelationships."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am currently employed at the Count's Arms, but I'm working on a piece I "
"hope will gain me the patronage of a certain countess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10GiveBoots_00015310_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I am deeply disappointed that a Master Thief had to resort to murder. I "
"hearby revoke your Thieves Guild membership until the blood price is paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07reject_0000c018_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am disappointed. When you are better prepared, return to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022505_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am done with you for now. Go to the Dark Brotherhood sanctuary in "
"Cheydinhal and speak with Ocheeva. She will provide further instruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0003e452_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "I am eager to peruse your haul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Beast_00045661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am getting weary of the same two beasts. All they do is scream when I "
"experiment on them. Do you suppose you could get me a Gnarl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BaurusTopic_0006b83d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am glad to hear that he survived, but I fear he will take the Emperor's "
"death particularly hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BaurusTopic_0001e749_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am glad to hear that he survived. A small bit of good news in these dark "
"times. But he will take the Emperor's death very hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a47_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am glad to see you were successful. It shows you as a true believer in "
"Kynareth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036305_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am here to end your miserable life, to... But... I can see the confusion in "
"your eyes. You... You have no idea what I'm talking about, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bd93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am here to serve you, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008d31d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am here to serve, Lord. May I assist in Your great works?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002950_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am here, and ready to serve. I will join your order, and together we will "
"fight this new threat against the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002528f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am honored by your presence. How can Ocheeva be of assistance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000131c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am honored to assist Lord Sheogorath's emissary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014823_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am honored to be entrusted by the Gray Fox himself to run these errands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b3b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am honored to join the Order under your illustrious command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062beb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am honored to speak to the hero of the Battle of Bruma. What can I do for "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081dd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am honored, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00061c96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am honored, mistress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d884_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am impressed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_0002b5e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am impressed. Only three more statues to complete the set. Keep up the good "
"work, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FightersGuildTopic_0002b6f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am in Fighter's Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NineDivinesTopic_0002b6f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am in Nine Divines....I wish I had quests to give...sigh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkBrotherhoodTopic_0002b6f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am in the Dark Brotherhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002b6f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am in the Mage's Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGThievesGuildTopic_0002b6f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am in the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueShow_00085991_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I am interested in obtaining the complete set of these statues. If you bring "
"them to me when you find them, I will pay you double for each one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_0002b43e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am looking for the complete set of ten for my collection. They were once "
"part of the Temple of the Ancestors in the ancient Ayleid capital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_00085992_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am looking for the complete set of ten for my collection. They were once "
"part of the Temple of the Ancestors in the ancient Ayleid capital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkDisappearances_00014e21_AltarDeluxe_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I am more than a humble priest and represent an Order that stood for Akatosh "
"for centuries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am never too busy for good talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilHelp_000473c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am no match for Mankar Camoran, but perhaps together we can find a way to "
"defeat him. Lead on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan1_00018c82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am not certain. But do not lose heart, I have an idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan1_00018c83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am not certain. But do not lose heart, I have an idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0003b1e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am nothing but a vile spawn of evil! Kill me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_0001cf3a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am now allowed to grant you a promotion to Master Thief. Congratulations, I "
"suppose. Be ready if the Gray Fox should need you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000293b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am on my way to the Wayshrine of Zenithar. Come with me and we shall seek "
"Zenithar's blessing together, if you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGDoyen_0001d4d3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I am one Doyen and S'krivva is the other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a984a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am one of his guard dogs, no more, no less. He pays us well to guard his "
"many treasures. This is enough for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD3_0001e74c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am one of the few who know of his existence. Many years ago, I served as "
"captain of Uriel's bodyguards, the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am only a supplicant. Speak to the Dark Elf wearing the robes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am overjoyed at your return. What may I assist you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Inventory_0001d03a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am pleased that Thoronir has decided to donate his inventory to the temple. "
"At least he is trying to make amends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_0003e94c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am pleased that you would ask. There is a way, though it is not known to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a42_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am pleased to see that you have them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081792_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am pleased with your work, Inquisitor. As a token of my appreciation, I "
"shall spare your life, and make you a Courtier of Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32AcolyteWarning_0008fb71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am powerless without more magicka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_0001c4e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am promoting you to Cat Burglar, which means you can use Luciana Galena of "
"Bravil as your fence. Congratulations on your new rank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00007de8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I am promoting you to Prowler. Congratulations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am proud of my family's tradition of service to Leyawiin and its people. We "
"face many challenges, but Gods willing, we shall prevail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008d31b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am quite busy, but there is always time for you, Lord Sheogorath. What may "
"I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathChoice4_0001ec3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am quite pleased with the ogre slaves in my Bleak Mine. No issues of "
"slavery with brute beasts. Profitable. And legal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000276a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am ready for battle when you are, champion. What say you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000a80a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am resident to encounter the minotaur. Its horny protuberants cause me "
"great conflagrations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChoice1_00031510_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am shocked to hear of Chanel's crime, as she has always been such a nice "
"member of our court, but I see that your evidence is without question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChoice1_0003151f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am shocked to hear of Chanel's crime, as she has always been such a nice "
"member of our court, but I see that your evidence is without question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45DarMaNotYet_00017790_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am so worried about her. Please find her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Invisible_00030136_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am sorry about that. Just use the Reverse Invisibility scroll I gave you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b92e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am sorry to be so forward, but I desperately need your help. It seems that "
"my husband, Rythe, has gone missing, and I just don't know what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008dd5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am sorry, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006a840_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am sorry, fellow magister, but I don't have time to talk right now. My "
"studies keep me very busy, as you can well imagine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031525_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am sorry. I don't really feel comfortable talking with you about that "
"night. I barely know you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am still aghast. To think that someone would stoop so low..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000292d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I am still eager to join the Order. Have you reconsidered?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ebfc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am sure Lord Sheogorath will be thrilled to hear whatever pressing matter "
"you have to discuss with Him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC4_0003e8fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am tasked with keeping order here in the Savage Garden where Mankar "
"Camoran's chattel challenge themselves in unceasing combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona03_00022e7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am the Gray Fox, but you have not been betrayed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e447_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am the Master Smith of New Sheoth. Why bother with that other smith?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00047903_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am the best alchemist in Leyawiin. But if you need Advanced Training, "
"you'll need Brotch Calus in Bruma or Ardaline in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am the chapter head of the Cheydinhal Mages Guild. It is quite an honor... "
"but they had no choice, since I'm the only semi-competent one here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000412c7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am the curator of the Museum of Oddities, Una Armina. Have we met? You look "
"familiar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am the healer, Marz of Black Marsh. By the grace of Mara, I am available as "
"an Advanced Trainer in Restoration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32FanaticYell_0001b70b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am the wrath of the righteous!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10GiveBoots_0001cf37_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am truly indebted to you. If all goes well, I may call upon you for one "
"last task. The danger will be great, but the reward will be greater."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0fb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I am unable to look into something that has been brought to my attention. Are "
"you capable of going on my behalf?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00035755_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am undone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersMoon_00002dcf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I am unfamiliar with the \"Shade of the Revenant\" described within the book, "
"but I was never one to dabble in the more, shall we say, amoral arts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JanusHassildorTopic_0000399c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am unsure as to why he has requested that you, of all people, should be the "
"one to visit him. I have no wish to put you in harm's way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am very disappointed. I had hoped we would not meet again under these "
"circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am very disappointed. I had hoped we would not meet again under these "
"circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor02_0002ad13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am your emperor, Uriel Septim. By the grace of the Gods, I serve Tamriel as "
"her ruler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081dcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am your servant, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Brothers_00084a9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I am your twin brother. When we were very small, our farm was attacked by "
"ogres. My ... our father and I escaped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017cfc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am yours to command, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f044_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am yours to command, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081cb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am yours to command, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081cb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am yours to command, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086751_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I am yours to command, oh great Listener!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00073031_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I amaze me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017973_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I apologize for doubting you, Your Grace. You are a most worthy leader, "
"perhaps the greatest warrior to ever hold the Seat of Mania. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA4_00002aa7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I apologize for even asking the question, most esteemed Master. Please, do "
"not allow me to interrupt your quest for the Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Daedricshrine_00003938_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate all of your help. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_00062304_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate the gesture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000276a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I appreciate the help that you have brought to Bruma. I begin to think we "
"have a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c2be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I appreciate the interest you're taking in helping us with our situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_000091e7_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEHorseArmorTopicAkatosh_00014e61_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEHorseArmorTopicMehrunes_00014e64_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorTopicElven_00002611_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorTopicSteel_00004383_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGJoin1_00024283_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I appreciate your enthusiasm, but you've got a bit of a bad reputation. Make "
"a better name for yourself, and perhaps we can accept your application."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I appreciate your forebearance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_0002365f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I appreciate your warning. I'll be on the lookout for him. But please tell "
"the guards so they can arrest him before he attacks me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Mg12TravenGoOn_000835fa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I argued against it, but eventually agreed to maintain order in the Council. "
"I regret that decision, and that is why I wish to send you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P5HowIsThat_0001fb72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I arranged for the notable Celia Camoran to want to read a particular Elder "
"Scroll. Don't ask how. However, she will be... unavoidably detained."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_000245a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I ask myself... Do I like you enough to tell you about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06NoGive_0001f169_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I ask you one last time: give me your possessions. The Master requires it of "
"all initiates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047752_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I assist Her Ladyship so that her enlightened policies might achieve the "
"greatest  possible influence upon the affairs of County Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhatShould_00018df6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I assume Sheogorath gave you the Manual of Xedilian. You can consult it for "
"more information, or I can provide instructions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA1_00092267_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I assume you didn't risk your own life to come here to tell me something I "
"already know. Who are you and what do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a04de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I assume you found Springheel Jak's tomb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I assume you're having fun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018abcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I assume you've dealt with Raelynn appropriately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b7a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I assume you've made your choice. Umbra hungers. What shall it be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002ae27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I assume you've taken care of this issue. So, tell me what happened. Why were "
"our men causing trouble? And what did you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13CavernChoiceWhy_000039b4_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I assure you, I am not responsible for them. I would never be so careless. "
"Where there are mindless animals, predators are never far behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00026bab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I assure you, the gold is well worth the risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirStory1_00002b2c_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I attempted to return to the service of the Nine, but the war had changed me. "
"I no longer had sympathy for the weak, or pity for the suffering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_0002919f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I avoid those things whenever I can. Horrible creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I await your decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002930_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I await your permission to join the Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000165b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I await your return... if you return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirCaiusTopic_00002d23_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I baited him, knowing his temper, and then I killed him when he drew against "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00086098_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I banish you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilB2_0003fbe1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bear responsibility for much of the evil that was done in Mankar Camoran's "
"name. I would undo it if I could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15Voice_00074a23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I beg of you... kill the Master... destroy this place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Boring_000980f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I beg to differ, history can be quite enriching. Hmph. I figured you to have "
"more brains than brawn, but so be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00074a89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon. The city? Here's the city. All around us. A thousand "
"stones, a thousand souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB2_00095329_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I beg your pardon? You presume to tell me about daedric cults?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043522_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I began a painting of the Resonator of Judgment many years ago. I wonder if I "
"ever finished it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe I explained your task very clearly. Find the ring, which is "
"somewhere down in the well behind the guild hall. Bring it to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VelwynBenirusTopic_0000926c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe I heard a Benirus is in town. You should check out the Elven "
"Gardens District. A Benirus wouldn't be seen anywhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000285be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I believe I read that some time ago. I'll have to give it another read."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_00028c08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe I've made myself more than clear. I want that book, and I expect "
"you to clean up this little mess you've made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe Kud-Ei is in charge of the Mages Guild here in Bravil. She seems "
"very well liked by other members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_000221f7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe Mankar Camoran used it to create his Paradise. It should give us "
"the means to open a gate there ourselves. I will continue studying it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillAltar_00040371_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I believe Your Grace knows the way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_0002c817_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe a little friendly competition always sharpens the wits. Even more "
"reason for you to get back to hunting for my carving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046611_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe he's always looking for new members, but I don't think it's for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d156_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe he's currently residing somewhere north of Bravil. Spends most of "
"his time in Niben Bay, I understand. And I do mean IN Niben Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2b2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe he's working at the West Weald Inn, over in Skingrad. I think Erina "
"tries to keep him out of sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613aa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe her name was Bradus? Runia, or Rulia... something like that. If the "
"stories are true, she might be able to train you further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe in the transforming power of honest work. I honor your vocation as "
"adventurer. By your labors and their fruits, you praise Zenithar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2A_000844c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I believe my master would be interested in speaking to you right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2A_000844c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I believe my master would be very interested in this item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe some people think of Anvil as a slow, sleepy place compared to "
"eastern Cyrodiil, but there's plenty of trouble up north to be found."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe that Grey-Throat and Gilen may have more information for you "
"regarding these creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027e38_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I believe that Mankar Camoran acts as the \"anchor\" for Paradise, just as a "
"sigil stone anchors an Oblivion Gate in place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DragonfiresTopic_0006beda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe that Martin's sacrifice sealed the gates of Oblivion forever. "
"Tamriel no longer needs the protection of the Dragonfires."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e93c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe that Sinderion in Skingrad could serve your inquiry better, as his "
"area of expertise centers around things of this nature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaB_00022b42_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I believe that his writings contain hidden clues to the location of the "
"Mythic Dawn's secret shrine to Mehrunes Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00056e6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I believe that the Count may want to handle this matter personally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice6A_00028ac9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I believe that the item Albert stole, which rightly belongs to me, was hidden "
"at the Weatherleah settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AnotherTask_000a657c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I believe that you may be able to persuade her to part with the item, where I "
"cannot due to her prejudice against me. Are you interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00056e6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I believe the Count may want to handle this matter personally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21JollringChoice1_0002ab53_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I believe the note will give you all the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006249e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe the rugged climate of Bruma suits Narina Carvain. She's tough and "
"cold, but you always know what to expect from her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture2_00071947_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe the runestones date from the Dawn Era or Merethic Age, but they "
"were moved to new sites by late First Era emperors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_0002b43e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I believe they were hidden in various Ayleid settlements across Cyrodiil, "
"although I do not know the exact location of any of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_00085992_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I believe they were hidden in various Ayleid settlements across Cyrodiil, "
"although I do not know the exact location of any of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Mission_0002af34_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I believe this carving will shed new light on Ayleid history, if I am able to "
"examine it closely. I would like you to retrieve it for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ05RaelynntheGravefinder_0018abd4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I believe we had a contract. Here's my part."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceWhatNext_0003353f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe we have been asking her the wrong questions, taxing her too much "
"with vague attempts to make sense of all that we know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I believe you and I were fated to meet today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillGardens_0007de9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe you have completed the tasks in the Gardens of Flesh and Bone, have "
"you not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ebfc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe you have some news for Lord Sheogorath. Perhaps you should be "
"speaking with Him instead of illuminating me with your presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ebfa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I believe you have some news for Lord Sheogorath. Perhaps you should be "
"speaking with him instead of illuminating me with your presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersMoon_00002dd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe you'll find it quite helpful. Once you've had a chance to read it, "
"I'd be happy to discuss it with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDunrootBurrowTopic_0004301e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I believe you've already been instructed as to how to proceed. You'll need to "
"ingest Felldew to enter the Burrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004423b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bet I'd make a better Duke than the new one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edf3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bet I'd make a better Duke than the new one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bet Sheogorath has killed millions of things!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35RumorResponses_0007ac7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bet he does. That Brithaur sure is a pain in the ass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bet someone sold the Bravil jailbreakers down the river. How else could the "
"Fighters Guild have found their hideout?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bet the Blackwood Company had something to do with Viranus Donton's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003334f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bet the guards give you \"special\" treatment before the end. Oh, that's "
"right. You're going to die in here, Imperial! You're going to die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043512_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bet there's plenty of corpses to count in Xedilian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d149_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I bet you don't know the first thing about smithing. Have you read up on the "
"history of the craft? I doubt it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d29d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bet you hear this all the time, but thanks for closing that Oblivion Gate! "
"We were all so worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033346_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bet you think you're pretty tough, huh? I bet you can swing a sword and "
"everything. Well, it doesn't matter! Not in here. It does no good to fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43NoKillBhisha_00072dbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bet you're a cat lover, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you a most gracious welcome, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003b830_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you a most gracious welcome, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you a most gracious welcome, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003b831_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you a most gracious welcome, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bid you greetings and cheer, with the grace of a noble stallion. You seem "
"to be of fine temper and wit, says the poet known as Halion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4533_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c4536_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bid you welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Ceremony_00014ad1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bind thee Atronach to this body, henceforth Gatekeeper of the Shivering "
"Isles. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000253b6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I borrowed quite a bit of gold from some underworld types.  I... I missed a "
"payment. Now they don't even want the money. They say I insulted them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I bought a fine mare from him once. A fine, fine animal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c258_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bought some wine from Davide Surilie. Excellent body. He's a fine vintner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c25b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I bought some wine from Gaston Surilie a few days ago. I was very impressed "
"by it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294e_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I bring nothing but my skill with the blade, which is not inconsiderable, and "
"my devotion to the Lord Auri-El."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RelmynaVerenim_00014ae7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I brought her to my Realm so she could continue to study her \"sixth "
"element.\" Honestly, I didn't know there were five already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I came here because I love nature. And because I didn't want to serve as a "
"boot wizard in a mountain legion in Skyrim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreeting1_00002ad3_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I came here seeking his mace. However, I could not pass the test. I'm just... "
" I'm no crusader. But that doesn't mean that I cannot serve Zenithar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11TellMe_00038443_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I came home only just a few hours ago. I found the door open, and my Bradon "
"dead. Standing over him was a Dunmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47MageShopTalk_00030132_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I came out here to get some privacy for my research. Instead, I was "
"constantly bothered by the local peasantry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I came to Bravil because Mara called me. Bravil is not my home. I miss Black "
"Marsh. But I shall serve here, so long as Mara needs me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_0004761a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I came to Leyawiin after a tour in the Legions. Poor Mother. She hoped I'd "
"choose the chapel or civil service, or perhaps even marry well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_00061c5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can accept that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_00061c5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can accept that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038adc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I can also teach a bit of Athletics. Why, you ask? Because I am the mountain "
"sheep's brother, and I must dash with him from crag to crag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Conversation_00098124_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can bring her around for a short time. You must be quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00014b54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can create the physical shell of the Staff, but the divine essence must be "
"gathered elsewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00016ef5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can create the physical shell of the Staff, but the divine essence must be "
"gathered elsewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015dfd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can eat for a day with a single coin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_00066a56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can fix whatever you break."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15BandsOfChosen_0003cd22_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I can get them off you, but I'll need some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice6A_00028ac9_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I can get you started by telling you where the Ogres live. The rest is up to "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_00066a4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can get your magic items working again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00054824_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can go no further. You alone must stand against the Prince of Destruction "
"and his mortal servants. He must not have the Amulet of Kings!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice1b_00082090_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I can grant the guilty the cleansing fire of retribution, so they may die "
"purified of soul. And, I can grant the worthy everlasting life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFences_0001eb6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can handle some types of stolen property. Whatchya got?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086762_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can hardly believe you're standing here in front of me! The Listener "
"herself! This is such an honor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086761_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can hardly believe you're standing here in front of me! The Listener "
"himself! This is such an honor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32AcolyteWarning_0008fb6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can hear the Fanatics attacking the gate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can hear the bones talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f08d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I can hear them coming as we speak! You must protect me... escort me to the "
"Gray Mare where I can buy passage out of Chorrol!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0008e4fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can hear them, calling to me from the other side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0008e554_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can hear them, calling to me from the other side. We need to kill the "
"Gatekeeper! He has the keys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilB2_0003fbe1_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I can help you. You need my help if you are ever to leave the Forbidden "
"Grotto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10FindJakben_00048977_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can help. The Earl of Imbel has a home in the Talos Plaza, on the inner "
"wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_000465ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can imagine he's a good teacher. The Fighters Guild should be proud of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000620cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can live with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_0006212c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can make just about anything look good-as-new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Abilities_000151f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can manage with a weapon or with spells, but I've really been working on "
"healing lately. I'm getting pretty good at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RewardTopic_000a3df5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can offer you money, of course, but given my condition, I am in a position "
"to offer you something relatively unique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0018d2fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can only hope that Farwil and his knights manage to close that Oblivion "
"Gate. The fate of Cheydinhal hangs in the balance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelAccept_00026d93_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can only hope that putting your life at risk for the guild will put things "
"in perspective for you, and help you to value the privileges it offers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KSharraProphecy_000b1220_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can only hope that the rat poison I have put down will take care of them "
"all. It is a powerful poison, though, so it should do the trick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can only hope the prison guards do to you what they did to me. You will "
"know the true definition of the word \"horror.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b36_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can only hope to match your bravery and valor. I am honored to serve by "
"your side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can only pray that you break the Tenets and surrender to the guards. I will "
"beg Lucien for the right to kill you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d491_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "I can promise you a night of fun you won't soon forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilD1_0008b0a9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can remove them, but I will need time. Follow me. There's a spot in the "
"next Grotto where we won't be disturbed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilD1_0003fbe2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I can remove them, but I will need time. The Dremora overseer will be here "
"any minute to check up on me. You need to play along until he leaves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_00066a54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can repair almost anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can rest easier now, knowing that my children are all better protected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060514_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can say without hesitation that none of this is my fault. Could've told you "
"it was coming, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29InvNice_0001d049_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can see by the look on your face you wonder where I get all these fantastic "
"items. I'll tell you what I tell everyone else who asks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can see now what you were saying was no story at all, but the truth, and "
"I'm a fool. I had no idea that the amulet could hold such power over me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiriliUlvenGreetA_000410a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can see that the scope of my research is far beyond the limited "
"understanding of a cretin such as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10FinThedretGreeting01a_00002ca5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can see that! I... you'll have to excuse me... I need a moment to collect "
"my thoughts..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0008e4f7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can see the bones of a dead Gatekeeper in the courtyard of the Gardens. The "
"door's locked, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015dfb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can see you are a kind soul, gentle lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_00066a5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can show you some new things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I can show you where it once stood. Perhaps it is there still."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f211_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can speak for the Count. Rosethorn Hall is a stately manor currently "
"occupied by Vandorallen Trebatius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a5647_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can still smell the things. Look in the houses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkoomaYes_0008f7ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can taste it already! Sweet, sweet Skooma. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b191_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can teach you no more. But I myself learned a few tricks from a Wood Elf "
"Hunter; I'm sure she could teach you a few things as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002870a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can tell the murder is weighing heavily on her heart. She seems such a "
"paradox to me. So gentle and beautiful, yet so strong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fugitives_00009c2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can tell you about them. Murderers, all four of them. Intelligence tells us "
"they've been holing up in Bloodmayne Cave. Watch for traps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_001885d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can tell you haven't been successful yet. But keep trying!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04Audience_0007fe1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can tell you that while she stays out of the public eye these days, she "
"does still hold audience in her court during the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDShieldoftheCrusader_00002af0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can tell you what I know. It is not everything, but it is perhaps enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a383d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can think of three. The Hircine shrine is south of town, northeast of "
"Bravil, between the Upper Niben and the Green Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_00188f3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can truly consider you an equal, and so grant you the rank of Master-"
"Wizard. There is no higher rank which I can bestow upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_00061ff4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't accept that offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b075_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't accept what you're implying without some proof of the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000091e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't afford to do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorTopicTooMuch_00002afc_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "I can't afford to do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELIKE_0018b2ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't argue with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokCrazyChatter_0008efb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't be dead. I just can't be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a2e56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't be seen talking to you. I've done what I can. Now it's up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe Arch-Mage Traven sacrificed himself to save us all. How noble "
"of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00064ff3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe I'm alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe I'm saying this, but you're no longer a Pit Dog. That's "
"right, you've actually advanced in rank. Congratulations... Brawler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b7a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe I've been reunited with my brother!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe Thadon is gone. He was a lovely man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062674_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe a Mages Guild associate was found dead in Cheydinhal. What "
"kind of place are they running there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001d4c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe him! I knew he would try and pin this on me! If only I could "
"get my hands on him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000613ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002990_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe it! I feel normal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002991_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe it! I feel normal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called Dragonheart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called Lady Luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called Man o' War!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called Shadowstep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called Sir Slaughter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called Skullcrusher!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Black Arrow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Butcher!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Crimson Blade!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Divine Avenger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Iron Maiden!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Messenger of Death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e9a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Spellslinger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003ee94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The Gray Prince has been beaten! There's a new Arena "
"Grand Champion now, someone called the Tamriel Terror!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002960_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! You have the mace! And you stopped those horrible daedra! "
"I was... I was wrong to doubt you. I ask your forgiveness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000af05d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it's over... that giant demon... the Dragon... what happened? "
"Have we won?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008676c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ06Bears_0018afd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe it. Pfft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_0004664c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe nothing has been done yet. The place is a skooma den, pure "
"and simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_0006142b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe someone got past him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe that Glistel would live with that Malintus Ancrus. Shameful, "
"and her being such a lovely girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe that the Countess is more obsessed with that painting than "
"the Oblivion Gate threatening the city!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000613e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe the Gatekeeper is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe the Gatekeeper is gone. He kept out all those other men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c299_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe the ridiculous new fines the guards are imposing. Ever since "
"Ulrich took over as Captain of the Guard, this place is going downhill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000807f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe they're here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038435_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe this is happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC2_0002e59e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe we lost another to that bunch. Well done taking care of the "
"contract, though. We can't afford to lose any of them, these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c09_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I can't believe you could be so stupid..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086767_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't believe you did that. Maelona is furious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0008676b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you just went ahead and killed that gang member. Gogan and I "
"were actually working undercover for the Anvil City Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you were willing to do that for Kellen. To sacrifice your own "
"well-being without hesitation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't concentrate on my reading with that other version of me walking "
"around. It's terrible. A curse!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't count my own corpse! Stay back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008ef75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't die here... not here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0000921e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038bbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't escape the Xarxes, even in my dreams. I wonder if my warding spells "
"will be enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003334b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't even imagine what it's like for you. No more sunshine, no more open "
"seas. Just a box and a dirty beam of light for the rest of your life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04GreymarchTopic_00091021_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can't expect you to save the place if you don't even understand it. So, "
"speak to my Dukes. Learn about Mania and Dementia. Try not to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bf_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I can't explain it, but somehow I can't compel myself to actually let it go. "
"This staff is obviously cursed! Now I'm stuck with it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8b9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can't fight, and who knows what's guarding the shrine? Plus, do you know "
"how dirty caves are? It'll ruin anything I wear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06ShrineTalkStart_0003641d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't find Brother Jerrol. I need something out of the storeroom. Have you "
"seen him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000b0703_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't get over the dragon statue in the Temple ruins. Tell me again how you "
"and Martin defeated Mehrunes Dagon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_00013345_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't give you any arrows because then the armory would be empty. Then what "
"would I do if someone needed some arrows?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nd05ThedretHelp_00002afc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't go with you, if that's what you mean. I'm too weak... I need to rest. "
"Once I have my strength, I will certainly join your cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelC1Idle01_0008eaa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't help but feel someone is watching us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002526d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't help but smile when I see you, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't help but wonder what the percentage chance of the Resonator "
"attracting a particular individual is. Riveting stuff, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't help myself. I'm just a sucker for well-heeled men. That Olav, for "
"example, at the Tap and Tack. He's dreamy. And successful, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e93f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't help you if you don't show me what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0003d801_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't help you until you advance further in the guild. You can use one of "
"the other fences, like Ongar in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3C3_000192ec_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I can't hold off my attack much longer. If you're going to help us take "
"control of the Altar of Despair, you need to decide now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't imagine eating one of those things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't imagine how anyone can get anything done in Crucible, if they keep "
"getting dragged off for questioning by Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062608_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't imagine how the average person gets by without our extra services. No "
"spell-crafting, and no enchanting? It must be awful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't imagine it. Still, it's better than not having a butler at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't imagine someone like Primo has seen much death and suffering. This "
"murder must be quite a shock to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't imagine that there's a finer establishment in the entire city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000617cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't imagine this new Gatekeeper can protect us, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't imagine who'd want to hurt Toutius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e98d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't imagine why someone would act the way he does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081c50_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I can't just jump. Don't want to end up on the Hill. But I hope that someday "
"maybe a big gust of wind will come and push me off so I can end it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Scamps_0004f8c0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can't let people know I have scamps in here, or they'll think I've taken to "
"Daedra worship. Try explaining that to the town guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0003ab47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't let you have it for free, I'm afraid. Come see me when you have some "
"money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033790_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I can't let you leave with that amulet. I need it, right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000091d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't make that deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0003d079_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't make that deal. Even for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a22_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't make up my mind about the Prophet in Anvil. Is he truly a holy man, "
"or just a lunatic exploiting the tragedy at the Chapel of Dibella?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice4_0002c5be_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can't order you do this with me. It's dangerous, and Vilena isn't going to "
"know about it. It's your choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0005e046_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't part with anything for that price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c2e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I can't prove it yet, but just you wait. You try to hurt that poor old woman "
"and I'll cut you in two!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002948c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't quite decide where I should look. I don't want to break anything but "
"the chest of gold could be hidden anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b599_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't read them all. They make no sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestToddNeutral_00028306_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't recall, ever loving moments, like this moment, with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047685_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I can't recommend the Bloated Float on the Waterfront. The Waterfront is not "
"a very desirable location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08ShowEntrance_000983ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't reveal that! It would be far to dangerous. I don't know you that well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't say I'm prepared to speak to you about that. No telling who will end "
"up finding out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't say I've done a lot of shopping there, but I've heard good things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000541d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't sell you any horseflesh. You'll have to go inside and talk to Cat "
"Face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't speak to you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't stand someone who's so full of himself. Someone needs to teach him a "
"lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_0002919e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't stand the sight of those creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't stay long. Count Caro's orders were to return to Leyawiin as soon as "
"Bruma was safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadBrellin1_00002cfa_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I can't stop thinking about Sir Brellin. About how he died..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't stop thinking about... about the Emperor. We failed. We failed "
"because we got complacent. We got arrogant. Now the Empire's paying the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't stop to talk now. I've got to go meet my brother!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062450_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't teach you anything more. You'll need to train with the best, and the "
"best I know of is Helvius Cecia. If you can get him to agree to it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't teach you anything you don't already know. Aerin could, though. She's "
"a brilliant acrobat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't teach you anything you don't already know. But there is someone who "
"might be able to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OgreSlaves_00026b69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't tell you about that. Please, just go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_00026ab2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't tell you any more than I already have. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091885_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I can't tell you exactly where it is. I wouldn't want your quest to be a "
"\"bust.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Debt_000e7a8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't tell you how much your help means to me. Thank you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f8b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't thank you enough for doing this for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for helping to reunite me with Reynald. I never "
"would have guessed he was still alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_heirloom_00002e56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't thank you enough for returning it, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00023f58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for your help! You gave us another chance at a new "
"life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Choice1A_000280bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for your kindness!  She was supposed to make a "
"delivery to Etira Moslin in Hackdirt, so I would start there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00048732_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't wait to be back in Skingrad, safe and sound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c152_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't wait to get back to Skingrad. I ain't cut out for this damned weather."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038589_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I can't wait to get my hands on Raynil. He'll become very familiar with "
"Bruma's dungeons; or the end of my blade if he doesn't come peacefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't wait until I gaze upon the Tears with my own eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000b97da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can't wait... finally I'm away from that horrid store."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Conversation_0009813e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I can... rest? Truly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13hunterChoiceHow_00033f57_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I cannot arouse further suspicion by offering leniency to you, should you "
"find yourself on the wrong side of the law."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreE1_0001e74d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I cannot believe that the attack on Kvatch is a coincidence. The enemy seem "
"to know all our secrets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07Spies_00020075_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I cannot leave Cloud Ruler undefended while my men search the whole "
"mountainside, but these spies must be eliminated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestQuestion_00002a54_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I cannot say what it will be, for I do not know. Kynareth herself will decide "
"in what manner you shall be tested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_0001562a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I cannot say, as I do not know. Only Kithlan has access to certain areas of "
"the palace aside from Lady Syl. Perhaps it was him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270ed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I cannot spare any soldiers as long as Chorrol remains under threat from the "
"Oblivion Gate outside our walls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice1A_0000399e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I cannot stress how important it is that our relationship with Hassildor be "
"preserved. I expect you to visit him immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TellMeMore_00002c95_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I cannot tell you exactly how to find the Boots, for that will be up to "
"Kynareth. I can tell you to seek out her Priests, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a1f62_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I cannot thank you enough for helping me rescue Rona from the terrible state "
"she was in. I hope that she has found the peace she sought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00033954_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I caught him drinking in the West Tower on the upper level. I told him if he "
"didn't stop, I would tell the Countess. He just grumbled and agreed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I certainly can't teach you anything more. But if the rumors are true, and "
"Alix Lencolia is passing through Cyrodiil, he might be able to teach you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingShort_000131db_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I certainly don't care to help people who show up on my doorstep wanting "
"something. Are we getting the picture here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I certainly haven't heard there's a new adventurer trying to get into the "
"Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_0008e338_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I certainly look forward to that interaction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I closely supervise the priests and healers of Cheydinhal Chapel, so they "
"might more closely approach the sacred ideals of our faith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294e_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I come to offer myself as a knight in service of Auri-El, or Akatosh as he is "
"known in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranConfrontCiirta02_0001a7c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I come to relieve you of your torment, dear Ciirta. No more lost memories. No "
"more pain. No more misleading us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c454f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I come to the Arena any chance I get! Once, I got hit in the eye with some "
"spraying blood, and went blind for three days! Now THAT was a good match!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk5_0006a876_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I commend you on your diligence, magister. I'll be sure to bring this matter "
"to the Arch-Mage. Now please, continue the excellent work. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002396a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I conduct business here. No offense, but I haven't got time for small talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37SdrassaHelp_00022e5f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I confess I have a weakness for crystals of a magical nature, and I must add "
"these to my collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bf0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I confess, I didn't think we had a chance against the daedra. But Martin "
"proved himself a true heir of Talos on that day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022509_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I consider this to be more than a worthy reward for your help; I believe "
"you'll agree... assuming you're careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I cook here. And live here. With Shuravi and Shamada. We're sisters. Three. "
"Shuravi - one. Shamada - two. And me - three."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025578_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could be wrong, but it seems to me there's something shady going on at the "
"Oak and Crosier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could eat nothing but Salmo's baking for the rest of my life. That'd be "
"fine with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43HowDid_000be560_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I could get kicked out of the guild!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13HunterChoiceWho_000039a5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I could handle them myself. But it would be... unwise to display my prowess "
"in public. That is the folly of the young and proud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirCaiusTopic_00002d23_Knights_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I could have disarmed him or wounded him. But a cold pride had taken hold of "
"me, and so I slew him, and went to war, and never returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_0003844b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I could have sworn I saw him outside in the daylight before. Unless he just "
"got that disease very recently, I'd say they were mistaken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ebd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could have told Syl who the traitor was, if only I could remember! Damn my "
"failing mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I could help you, yes. But I won't. Your failure will give me much joy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ad4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could never leave Skingrad. All my good friends here would die without my "
"sweetrolls. The rest of the world must suffer as best it can without me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1b_00016b70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could not abide Sheogorath's betrayal. He brought disharmony. He allowed "
"the Greymarch to take us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk5_00002bc4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could not agree with you more. Let us part now, and finish our tasks at "
"hand. I'll find you later, and we'll resume our talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018abd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I could spare a moment. What did you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity1_00043416_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I could swear I once had a Blind Watcher's Eye just like that.... I would "
"like to replace it, but the funds just aren't available."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e885_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could tell you our blacks are the fastest, toughest, most reliable horses "
"in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000897bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could turn you into a goat. Or a puddle. Or a bad idea. I could make you "
"eat your own fingers. Or fall in love with a cloud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00097611_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I could turn you into a goat. Or a puddle. Or a bad idea. I could make you "
"eat your own fingers. Or fall in love with a cloud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b59a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I could use a guar. Hell on my boots, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQVoice_00033dfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I could use a hand here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0002b534_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I could use a hand here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018abd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I could use some good news right about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KingofWormsTopic_0000a0fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I couldn't believe my eyes. I think the only reason I'm alive is because I "
"was invisible... but even so, I think he saw me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37EndConversation_000452f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I couldn't possibly leave my house. It gets so dirty so quickly. In fact, I "
"have to go wipe down the walls again. It's been over an hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsWhiteStallionTopic_000908e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I created the Order of the White Stallion to honor free adventurers who "
"perform noteworthy services for County Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I cringe whenever that name is mentioned. His inventory has to be stolen or "
"something, because his prices are so low, they're below my cost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d286_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I dare say my opinion might carry more weight than others, if you take my "
"meaning. Still, all are necessary to proceed. Good luck to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15Voice_00074a22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I deserve it... all of it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANocturnalChoice3_00026ad2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I did no such thing. I think perhaps you've been spying on me. Yes... spying! "
"You cannot have my treasure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bb00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I did not join the Imperial Legion to engage in small talk with rabble like "
"you. If you have something to say, say it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c368_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I did what needed to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan1a_00018c84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I did, and she did not return. I can only assume that she was caught and "
"killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan1a_00018c85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I did, and she did not return. I can only assume that she was caught and "
"killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGSkingradAdrienne_00047461_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I did, in fact. I don't think she was paying attention, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1a_00016b6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I did. When the Knights came, I fled to the city. As they marched and burned "
"everything to ash, I found a way into the palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a7c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I didn't come here to chat, Blue Team scum! Crawl home while you still can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028863_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I didn't expect any of us to live this long. Maybe we're not doomed, after "
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ef5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I didn't hear you killed the other Atrabhi. And I'm not happy about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00075048_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I didn't know Seridur was a vampire. I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007504c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I didn't know Seridur was a vampire. I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05AnyaWho_00080d7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I didn't know what to do. Turning on Syl could cost me my life, but if I "
"don't help, what will Ma'zaddha do to me? You must do something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I didn't like you before. Now I really don't like you. What a mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MartinD_00037831_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I didn't really need the Amulet to tell me that. I've known it was true since "
"you first told me back in Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting1a_0008264e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I didn't say they took him -- he went with them! I've heard his voice a few "
"times around here. I think... I think he joined them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025271_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I didn't think Manheim allowed dogs in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002944_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I didn't think any of us would survive. Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_0000c059_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I didn't think much about him when I first joined the Thieves Guild. Lately "
"I've been hearing odd things though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice3B_00003a92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I didn't think so. If you had some sort of evidence, like vampire dust, I "
"might believe you. I'm not stupid, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05WhatDoYouMean_00002c91_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I died defending the fort from those who would take and misuse the Shield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0004cf8a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I do believe that establishment is right here in the Talos Plaza District. "
"I'd ask around there, if I were you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e43d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do delicate things with Madness Ore. It tingles across the flesh when it "
"cuts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0018ae84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do have a bed available, for 10 gold a night. Would you like to rent it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0018ae83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do have a bed available, for 20 gold a night. Would you like to rent it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3_000186fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do have an idea how we might be able to stop them, but for now our primary "
"concern must be our survival."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00034e96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do have need of a skilled operative. Perhaps if you were to get more "
"experience I could use you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00085a64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do hope Primo and I can be, you know...friends. He's so handsome. And he "
"lives a life I can only dream of. I can make him so happy in so many ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArgonianBloodTopic_00053733_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I do hope it didn't cause too much trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003ca4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I do hope our paths cross again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_00035ca7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I do it first thing in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027e38_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I do know the portal I create through the Mysterium Xarxes ritual will close "
"behind you. You'll have to find another way back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001f425_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do miss him so. And when he gets back, I'm gonna kill him for making me "
"worry like this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do my part on the docks, just like Bronsila and Vlanarus. Why should I kill "
"myself? They don't pay me any more. For what I get paid, I work plenty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThreeSigns_00026af6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do not believe you are prepared for that kind of knowledge. You are still a "
"stranger to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00058b35_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I do not blame you for my son's death. He brought that upon himself, as hard "
"as it is for a father to admit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16BStolenItem_00028ba5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do not care to describe it. You will know it when you see it, I think. It "
"is not something one of the ogres should have in his possession."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0001eeeb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I do not fear death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025293_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do not know what Lucien sees in you, but this Sanctuary is cursed by your "
"presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40RonaCureSave_0003ed39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do not know. In her weakened state, it may well end her life. Even that "
"would be a relief for her, after these many years of torture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09JauffreA_00036668_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do not know. The catacombs of Sancre Tor were sealed by the first "
"Grandmaster of the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Accuse_00031503_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I do not wish them harmed, as I want the thief to face justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do not wish to fight on horseback. It is a good way to ruin a perfectly "
"good horse... which is, to say, a perfectly good dinner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06GiveBook_00015448_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I do not wish to set eyes on you until you can cleanse the guild's honor by "
"paying blood price. Go now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEOddities_00043412_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I do pay a nominal finder's fee, but of course the real reward is your "
"contribution to posterity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b321_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I do so admire good books, they fill my mind with such fantastic images."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do so love pursuing a contract in the Imperial City! The alleys, the "
"shadows, the challenge of evading Phillida's Legion troops! I envy you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_0003d085_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I do think I've been taken advantage of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e11f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I do what I must do. I cannot stay to rebuild Tamriel. That task falls to "
"others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ARuler_00031622_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do. I did. And I won't say it again. But, that's enough about that. You're "
"the ruler of Dementia! Just look at you. You're positively beaming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRuler_0009130d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I do. I did. And I won't say it again. But, that's enough about that. You're "
"the ruler of Mania! Just look at you. You're positively beaming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00015f1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't answer questions about myself. Particularly when they come from a "
"Shadowfoot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiasRing_0001e105_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't answer questions about royal jewelry from riffraff like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146c8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I don't answer to Traven. I heed only the word of Mannimarco."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00013385_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't ask too many questions of Thadon. It's precious to him, and that's "
"all that matters. It's his own business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathChoice3_0001ec39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't believe I asked for your opinion on this matter. I am done speaking "
"with you. Please leave my estate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't believe I know you. And I don't need any new friends, thank you very "
"much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't believe we'll escape here even if Dagon's invasion succeeds. We'll be "
"the Master's playthings forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03Verify_00034ea1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't believe you, but I'll have to check it out anyway. If you are right, "
"there will be hell to pay. You will have to come along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071f31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't belong here. I'm not crazy. Not like the rest of them. They watch me, "
"you know. Waiting for me to go crazy. But I won't. Nope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001a11b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't belong. Not my place. Shouldn't have gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HotWaterNo_000704be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't blame you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHarmGrayFox_0001e092_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't blame you. He's a menace to society. Let me know if you find out "
"anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't care about the gold anymore. I just want to get out of here. I'm "
"going to try all the windows and doors, and see if I can't get one open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't care for those elves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't care how bad I need the business. You ain't welcome here. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008151a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't care if you are Lord Sheogorath, I hate being interrupted in my work. "
"I assume this is important?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9843_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't care much for jokes. If you're serious about the room, come back with "
"some gold on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseOrgnolf1_0003150f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't care what you have found. I am telling you, I am not the one you are "
"looking for! And I will speak to the Countess of your accusations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d917_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I don't dare move a muscle until they're all dispatched!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OcatoTopic_000add37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't envy the High Chancellor his position. It can't be easy trying to "
"rule an empire without an emperor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bccb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't even know what a will-o-the-wisp is, much less how to kill one. I "
"think they're just swamp gas, myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e99c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't even like to walk by that place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Inventory_0001d035_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't even want to look at it for another moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MartinF_0004bf99_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"I don't expect any objections from the Elder Council, but we should defer to "
"their authority."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't expect anyone to be working any less just because of Thadon's death. "
"Take a moment to mourn, then back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000806ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't expect we'll learn much. While I have the utmost respect for her "
"Ladyship, she is well known for being... overly cautious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't feel comfortable talking about her with you anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000298f_Knights_RESP3"
msgid "I don't feel like death! I feel like... running!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't feel like talking right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26NoCoins_00035c97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't get paid until tomorrow. I guess I'll just have to wait to eat 'til "
"then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0009ea81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't give refunds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingArmorerNothing_0018d160_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't have a copy myself, but there was one in First Edition last time I "
"was browsing there. At least some people take an interest in history."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046598_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have a lot of interest in Conjuration, myself. I suppose if I did, "
"I'd want to talk to Fathis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005416f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't have any horses for sale right now. You bought our last Black horse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d83f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't have any horses for sale right now. You bought our last Chestnut "
"horse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have any interest in learning about Conjuration, but I hear he's very "
"good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047507_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have anything for anyone of your rank. Check with Burz gro-Khash in "
"Cheydinhal. He might have something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_000474fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have anything for you right now. Speak with Azzan or gro-Khash. Get "
"some more seasoning, and maybe I'll have something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002ae38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have anything for you to do yet. Come back after you've taken care of "
"some more contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJauffreHelp_0005d2c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have much here at hand, but you're welcome to anything you need from "
"my chest in the reading room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0006215e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have much of a sense of humor, so if this is a joke, I'm not amused. "
"Come back when you have the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d75f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have much. I lost everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have time for this now. The Gray Fox is on the loose. Take this "
"problem to Itius Hayn. He's also a Captain of the Imperial Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have time for this; I must get back to my next catastrophic waste of "
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018b5cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018fae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time for you. Get out of my way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000579e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to chat right now. With that Oblivion Gate looming outside "
"the city walls, we're bracing for an attack. Perhaps we can speak later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ef9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time to deal with Syl and her paranoid ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to deal with adventurers entering the Isles, I have a "
"painting to finish!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGAboutThievesGuild_0003c170_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time to gossip about the guild right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000835c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time to help you now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to talk to you! There's fighting to be done! When my father "
"arrives, we're going back to the forest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001786d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004109a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to talk. I'm in the middle of some very sensitive "
"measurements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004109d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't have time to talk. My work cannot wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0018bc63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't help just anyone, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c241_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know Gaston well, but I helped him drink his wine. And he always has "
"a mighty fine wine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004663e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know about her past. All I know is that she's really good with a bow. "
"I wouldn't mind learning a bit from her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Dreams_0002c6de_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I don't know all of the details, but the amulet is a conduit to get to that "
"training ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_0002acc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know all the details, but I heard that she complained to the Council "
"until they removed Teekeeus from his position at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_000280a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know any Dar-Ma.  If you're talking about that cursed Argonian "
"swindler from Chorrol, I'd like to know where she is, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_000280ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know any Dar-Ma.  If you're talking about that cursed Argonian "
"swindler from Chorrol, I'd like to know where she is, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0007fdf2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know anything about a conspiracy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00080d40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know anything about a conspiracy, but Anya has been looking extra "
"nervous lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0007ff42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know anything about a conspiracy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_000819a2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know anything, not for certain. I hear that Ma'zaddha has been seen "
"talking to Syl's Guard Captain, Nelrene, but I haven't seen them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1dc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know exactly what's going on, but not long ago, a gang of thieves "
"calling themselves The Blackwater Brigands stormed the ship."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogatheOrcTopic_00086070_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I don't know her. I'd be smart to ignore her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05Gwinas_00022b46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know him personally. But he was very eager to get his hands on Volume "
"3 of Camoran's \"Commentaries.\" Came all the way from Valenwood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046632_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know him too well, but I have heard he's a smooth talker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046621_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know him well. I've heard he's a nice enough fellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003630f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know his name, and his face was in shadow. He called to me yesterday "
"as I walked by the lighthouse. I think he lives there! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know his name, but I'd recognize him if I saw him again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_000465bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know how he does it. It's no wonder he spends so much time at the Tap "
"and Tack, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know how much Skaleel told you. We know that it reacts to magic, but "
"every time we've tried, the thing shocks whomever cast the spell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I don't know how the fire started, but it burned Kvatch to the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Choice1A_00028030_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know how to close this Gate, but it must be possible, because the "
"enemy closed the ones they opened during the initial attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018abd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know how to make this request any simpler, but to put it bluntly, "
"Raelynn the Gravefinder must die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know how to thank you. You have a good heart to help get me back "
"home. I'll never forget what you've done for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078668_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know how you did it, but I appreciate it. And by appreciate, I mean "
"reward. Enjoy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't know how you did it, but I thank you. Now, we must wake from this "
"dream and take our places in the real world again. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48BerichSaveYou_0008dfdc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know how you got in here, but you're not saving anyone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know if I can help you, but I'll try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know if I like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know if Tumindil ever leaves the chapel. That man works day and night "
"to take care of all of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000174f3_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I don't know if he ever wrote your recommendation. I'm sorry. I didn't expect "
"this to happen. Perhaps you should go look and see if he did write one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ASyl_00013a6f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know if she has it in for me or not. I think she is in constant fear "
"of being replaced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_00003943_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know if you're religious, but a lot of folks are, and the Stone is "
"important. Talk to Cirroc in Bruma. He'll fill you in on the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogasStory_000860e4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know much about being a knight. But I'm gonna learn. Say. You did ME "
"a good deed. You oughta be a real knight yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a90_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know much about him either. Just that he appeared in Anvil shortly "
"after the attack on the Chapel there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00033fcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know much about it. The \"Commentaries on the Mysterium Xarxes\" are "
"the only source we have for its existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ForlornWatchman_00035d8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know much about that ghost, but some say he died in a horrible "
"shipwreck. I would stay away from him if I were you... bad omen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know much about the man, but I've heard he is an excellent warrior."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45DeepOnes_0001778e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know much. Never seen them myself. Our grandfathers first found them, "
"I think, digging in the mines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089616_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I don't know nothin' else, honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004988e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know that anyone in Cyrodiil drives a harder bargain than Palonirya "
"at Divine Elegance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10JakBuried_0009deda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know this Springheel you are asking about. However, the entrance to "
"the family crypt is in the cellar. Take what you want, just spare me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006c29c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what Arch-Mage Traven has against Necromancy, but the first "
"thing he did after taking over the Mages Guild was to ban its practice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ratsTOPIC_00036625_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what I'd do without them. Their little pink noses, their scaly "
"little tails. Please, get to the basement and find out what's happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00067dd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what I'll do if you don't get those scales for me. I've saved so "
"much for my retirement, but it's just not enough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't know what crimes they commited, but it's your life or their freedom! "
"The choice should be pretty clear! Get going, and watch yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005375b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know what else to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_0001d0e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what else to say. Until we have some sort of reference for "
"understanding these symbols, we'll never figure this thing out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know what else to tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2A_0005402e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what goes on down there, but there's a horrible smell coming "
"from underneath that door. It's like... something died inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2B_0005402f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what goes on down there, but there's a horrible smell coming "
"from underneath that door. It's like... something died inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2C_00054030_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what goes on down there, but there's a horrible smell coming "
"from underneath that door. It's like... something died inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what happened. I didn't do anything to Syl, so why was I "
"punished?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16OcatoE_000add1e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't know what happens now. There are troubled times ahead for the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_0002acba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what her problem is, and I don't care. Her money's good, and "
"that's all I need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003e2b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what her problem with Argonians is. She's going to cause some "
"real problems, if she's not careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what idea appeals to me more: you getting killed by this Faelian "
"person or the Imperial Legion using your corpse as a target dummy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what it was, but something important was taken away from "
"Mannimarco. Maybe there is a chance he can be defeated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ05RaelynntheGravefinder_0018abd6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what she does in there; frankly, I don't want to know. However, "
"I do know that after she arrived, the woods at night became unsafe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028241_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what to make of all this, but I'm not sure I see Nels as a "
"murderer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonate_00081ea3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't know what to say! You're such a dear! I'm going to put this dagger "
"right back where it belongs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know what to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a24_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what to think about the attack on the Chapel. Things seem to go "
"from bad to worse, don't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b95_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what to think. Maybe the Prophet is right, and the ancient gods "
"have come back for vengeance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c22a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what would possess him to do that. Marrying a Bosmer is just "
"wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0003d7fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know what you are talking about. I don't buy or sell things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10AnyoneWhoCares_0003c29c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't know what you can do for us in this situation. I mean, Ulrich is the "
"Captain after all. Perhaps you could speak to Garrus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027e38_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I don't know what you'll find in Camoran's Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MogensTalk03_00086576_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26JustGuess_00035ca2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about. Get out of my shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MountainLionsTOPIC_0018bd5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what you're talking about. I'm not sure what you're accusing me "
"of, but don't do it without any proof!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know what's going on, but Oreyn said Maglir has the contract. Has he "
"lost his nerve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a92_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where he came from. Just appeared outside the Chapel a day or so "
"after the attacks. Been there ever since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEStrangeDoor_000133d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where it came from, and I don't want to. Those who've gone in "
"have come back out... wrong. I'm just here to warn folks to stay away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000a3846_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where it came from, but a mysterious gate appeared outside the "
"walls of our city. The way the guards are reacting, it must be a threat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04BribeBeggar_0000932f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where she keeps the ring, but I know who does. Talk to Hlidara "
"Mothril, the Countess' handmaiden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where the Count found him, but I sure wish he'd send him back. "
"He's a menace to this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know where they came from. I just know they're everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know where they're going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018afd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where those bears came from, or why they picked my place to "
"attack, but you must drive them away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042fff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know where you got the impression that I want to talk with you.  You "
"must be kinda slow, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_0004993c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know which is which. Still, it's a good shop they run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Passwall_0008e4ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know who built it. It was here before any of us arrived. It looks "
"like other people lived here before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know who the Night Mother is, but she pays me to kill people. My own "
"mother should have loved me so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DinnerParty_0001c107_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know who you are, and I'm not all that sure about you. But, you're "
"dressed for it. Can't imagine dressing up for any other reason. Go on in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029ca5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know who you are, friend, but you've got about ten seconds to tell me "
"what you're doing in my Bloodworks before I lop your arms off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005371b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know who you are, nor do I care. All I know is that I want you to "
"leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AyleidReference_00033539_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know why Denel is even trying. This is doomed to fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00042db2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know why adventurers feel the need to disturb our home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know why one would want to destroy a building. It takes time to make "
"it. Much time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_000465ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know why the guards haven't taken care of her yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b17_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know why they're still here. They're so heavy, and I'm so weak. What "
"does Stendarr want from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StrangeLights_0000bedc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know you well enough to talk about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c33f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know you, and I don't care to know you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e098_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know you, you don't know me, everybody's happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047708_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know you. Just stay away from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04SlowDown_0001ee29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know! I think they're right behind me! Prior Maborel is dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_00083f50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know! Isn't that wonderful? It could be any of them... All of them, "
"perhaps. We'll just have to start torturing people to find out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13MessengerB1_0005e37a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know, My Lord. She only said it was a matter of the gravest import to "
"the security of the Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05MazaddhaWhoElse_00081188_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know, besides Nelrene. She's taking orders from someone, but won't "
"tell me who. If I find out, will you promise to spare me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13MessengerA1_0001a797_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know, my Lord. She only said it was a matter of the gravest import to "
"the security of the realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AyleidReference_0003353c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Anything that might help explain these inscriptions in the "
"ruins. They're like nothing we've seen to date."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_000227df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know. I don't see any good options here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00KvatchResponse_0018b20e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know. I hear that those Oblivion Gates are opening everywhere. They "
"say the Legion is stretched to the limit across the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b583_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know. I just don't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04WheresJauffre_0001ee2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know. In the Chapel praying, I think. You must help us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinC3_00092269_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know. It's strange... I think you might actually be telling the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Just take a walk around. Buy something. Plenty of stores. Why'd "
"you come in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MartinB_0008b619_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know. Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06WhereTaken_0000bd5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know. She took the Argonian less than an hour ago though. He put up "
"quite a struggle. He was bleeding all over the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch01_0018ad5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't know. What could we have done to deserve this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00KvatchResponse_0018b20d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't know... first the emperor and his sons murdered, now this... yet I "
"fear that the worst is still to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't like a lot of what I hear about the Blackwood Company. But they "
"complete their contracts on time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c2a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like being disturbed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072db8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like cats, which means I don't like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't like competition. Just stay away from the menfolk, and we'll get "
"along just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro1_00082467_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't like it, having to rebuild My Realm every era. Sometimes I forget "
"where things go. Like New Sheoth. I can never remember where it belongs...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002466f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like it. It's too quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ForlornWatchman_00035cab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't like talking about the dead like they're some kind of tourist "
"attraction, but that spirit has been making his ghostly journey for years now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d017_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't like talking to people much, but Kud-Ei's helping me get over that. "
"That's why she put me in charge of selling alchemy supplies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c21c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like that Danus Artellian. He's a bit stuck-up for my tastes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like the look of you. Keep moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045f67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like the look of you. Pay your respects and get out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029cc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like the looks of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003a852_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like the looks of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtStrangerResponse_000981da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like the way he's poking around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtStrangerResponse_000981db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like the way she's poking around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice2A_000300a1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't like to talk about it much, as it's bad for business. At any rate, "
"would you care for a bed for the night?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like to talk about it. I don't remember much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e96b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like to talk to her. All she wants to talk about is herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bccc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't like to think about zombies. Missing arms, legs, heads. They smell "
"awful, and they're hard to kill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_00003932_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't like to think how Vilena is going to take this news. He was my "
"responsibility. I'll be the one to tell her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't like to think how Vilena is going to take this news. He was my "
"responsibility. I'll be the one to tell her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't like to think how Vilena is going to take this news. He was my "
"responsibility. I'll be the one to tell her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002ab85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like you and don't want to talk to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like you much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't like you, but I hate that other J'zidzo more. Those Manics are crazy. "
"Crazy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't like you. I don't like my double even more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to gossip, but he is more than a bit strange.  However, he's "
"always been tolerated as the town eccentric."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040cb2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to point out the obvious... but isn't that Jyggalag right over "
"there? He doesn't look very pleased to find you here, does he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002870d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to sound like a ghoul, but with two people murdered and Dovesi "
"obviously upset, this may be my chance to get close to her. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001efe0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to sound ungrateful. I know I would be dead by now if it weren't "
"for you. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e964_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't mind betting, but it's not worth having to hear a lecture about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't mind talking down to your level."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't miss Morrowind. All that sour Tribunal grumbling and old-fashioned "
"ancestor worship. Good riddance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice6HowDie_00061c4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't necessarily want to see it coming. And I want to die here in the city "
"so all these people finally believe me. They'll wish they were nicer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22CleansingFane_0002b09e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't own it. One of the rare book dealers in the Market District may have "
"a copy. Read it. Educate yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000091d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't really feel comfortable talking to you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't really have any interest in learning how to use a blunt weapon, but I "
"understand he's very good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't really know what you're trying to accomplish, but questioning me "
"about Primo with two people lying dead just makes me suspect you even more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005178e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't recall inviting you into my house. Leave, quickly, or we will have a "
"problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b58a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't recall using teleportation, and yet there I was. Alone. Naked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004ed76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't recommend leaving before I've had a chance to offer you more "
"information on your potential reward, although I admire your zeal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakFlatsCaveTopic_0000a1ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't remember where it is, honestly. I know it's west of Skingrad... Druja "
"could probably tell you. She has a better memory than I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0003b34e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't run a halfway house, you know. When you have the money, then you can "
"have the room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000093c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't see Rythe with you. I hope you're not here to give me bad news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't see Sheogorath. He's not real."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fe7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't see a problem with it. Perhaps they're in love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_00023895_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't see a problem with those two. It's a bit odd, but that's their "
"business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't see any of them around right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f8af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't see any scamps, or the staff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c34c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't see anything here we could use to incriminate Ulrich. You must return "
"with something more tangible. Be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ae77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't see how the Empire can survive without an emperor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG03Choice2A_0002c0f1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I don't see how we can do business if you don't have the gold for it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16MartinA_0004bfbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't see how... mortal weapons may hurt him, but now that he is physically "
"here in Tamriel, they have no power to actually destroy him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006144a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't see many wanderers out here in the wild. But you look like you can "
"take of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089617_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't spread gossip. I have nothing to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018a95b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't suppose I could convince you to help me recover my research notes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't suppose during all this torture anyone asked about where my things "
"have gotten to. Or who stole them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027f36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't suppose you could help me locate my friend Henantier could you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000327b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't suppose you've found those fugitives yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04Here_0003d30c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't suppose you've heard all of the details about the gang of harlots "
"running their little charade here in Anvil have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053791_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't talk to inmates. Now shut up, and don't bother me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007893c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think I can render any assistance until you hear Lord Sheogorath out. "
"Do pay close attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiaSchedule_0003b3fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think I like that question. Are you planning something nefarious? Why "
"don't you just go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0002b533_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think I'm going to make it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a8a_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I don't think anyone has had time to really study this prophet's teachings. "
"My best advice would be to go, listen carefully, and decide for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think he's that impressive. There's no telling him that, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiasRing_0001e106_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think it would be appropriate for me to talk about private family "
"matters with a stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_0002421b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_0002b165_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_0002b172_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06PirateTopic02_00006fdc_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_0018b2e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_causingtrouble_0002c7b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think so. I'll tell you what real trouble is. It's trying to pay my "
"debtors when there's no work. It's my wife taking in wash to buy food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0003d07b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think so. You wouldn't try to cheat an old pro, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046587_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think that Gilgondrin really wants to run Silverhome-on-the-Water. He "
"never seems happy when he's there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGDIrectNoCoin_00045f75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think there are any fences in this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CutoffTopic_00079b65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think this thing is going to open again. You are the worst escort in "
"history. I'll find another way out. Get going!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a847_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think we're going to make it out of here alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0018d2b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think you can quite grasp the nuances of Alchemy. I'm sorry, but my "
"training would be beyond you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopYes_0001e845_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't think you have the proof we need to lock this crime down and point "
"the blame at Agarmir. You better go back and check."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrespassNoCrime_0018d83d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't think you should be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't trust Kurdan. Even if the hunters are beaten, make sure you watch "
"your back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0007816f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't trust that Dumag, so I don't shop there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't trust that old hag. She pretends she likes you, and then stabs you in "
"the back. Who knows. Maybe she'll REALLY stab you in the back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't trust them. I've heard they're effective, but they're brutal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00033955_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't trust you enough to reveal details about the castle to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002459d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't trust you enough to talk about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VaronVamoriTopic_0002f177_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't understand it. Some ridiculous male thing, I suppose. He's been "
"bothering Ardaline every day for a while now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003e2a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't understand the fascination with sheep. Certainly seems to know "
"everything about Mysticism, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't understand what Glistel is doing with Malintus Ancrus. I mean, have "
"you seen her? And have you seen him? I just don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08BlindMonks_000983ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't understand what you mean. We can see just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041f1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't understand... the world was supposed to end.... Order was supposed to "
"destroy everything. It has always happened that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038430_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't usually give out that kind of information. Especially to people I "
"don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BribeGuard_0003ab3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't usually take bribes, but I'll look the other way just this once. If I "
"see you again though, I'll have to arrest you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't visit the Museum of Oddities, but Una Armina is always looking for "
"new items to display."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00035fbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't want that ring! It's too hot to sell. You are supposed to take it to "
"Ahdarji. I swear, the new recruits are getting worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't want to learn how to conjure things. I want to learn how to get rid "
"of things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007cc4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't want to see it coming. Take me unaware. And, for your own good, it "
"should probably look like an accident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022b4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't want to talk about it. I'm still very angry at Phintias. He promised "
"me he would get one for me. I came all the way from Valenwood for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I don't want to talk to you, traitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00081af0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't want trouble! I keep to myself, but I see Ma'zaddha and that Dark "
"Seducer, Nelrene, meeting behind the buildings late at night sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I don't wish to get underway until Selene is safely locked in a room on the "
"inn deck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseTooMuchLeyawiin_0004ed8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I doubt it will sell anytime soon. If you manage to raise that much, come see "
"me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTDISLIKE_0018b2b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I doubt it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001d4c2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I doubt that he's told Gilen and Grey-Throat anything, but you could always "
"try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIREDISLIKE_00062310_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I doubt you really mean that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e91e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I dunno. Never seen that sort of root before. Head over to the West Weald Inn "
"and talk to Sinderion. He could identify it for you I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaSpeech_0008ade5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I dwell in your dreams; I savor your nightmares. Now, you will serve me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005422b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I eagerly await your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I eagerly bought it, knowing the value of Daedric relics. In fact, I was a "
"bit suspicious when he sold it so cheap. His loss, my gain I figured."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I enjoy a good bottle of wine, and Wilbur always has a nice selection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I enjoy being in the Fighters Guild, though there haven't been quite as many "
"contracts lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c25f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I enjoy the wines that Tamika makes at her vineyard. And they're reasonably "
"priced, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas2_00002c43_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I envy you, I freely admit it! To have stood shoulder-to-shoulder with the "
"Divine Crusader on the day that Umaril fell..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_000253dd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I escaped from Lucien, and paid my father back for his treachery. Lucien came "
"to me again that night with an offer I just couldn't refuse. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_breakins_000356b5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I even trusted them to open up the shop in the mornings. I can't imagine what "
"turned them to a life of crime. Sad. Well, here's your payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f046_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I exist to serve, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f048_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I exist to serve, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00019da1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I expect results, Inquisitor, and I expect them soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetA1_0001a79d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I expect that this is the beginning of the final assault. The cursed usurper "
"Jyggalag himself may even take the field before the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetA3_0005e37c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I expect that this is the beginning of the final assault. The cursed usurper "
"Jyggalag himself may even take the field before the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d287_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I expect this will end in disaster, but nonetheless, I will grant your "
"request."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ecd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I expect you to be taking care of the problem. I'm too tired to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I expected better from you. Are you the one witless Khajiit in all the world?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11Peaceful_0003858b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I expected to lay low here for a while and then be on my way. So again, I "
"underestimated you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005323a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I expected you back sooner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinD2_0009ce84_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I explain myself to you so you understand me. And so you can explain to the "
"Countess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06WhatTalking_00002afe_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I fail Kellen every time I speak to him, and I fail Stendarr every time I "
"pray to him and do not ask for the power to lift the curse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002acb_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I failed my friend and I failed Zenithar. Perhaps you can succeed where Sir "
"Ralvas could not and redeem us both."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirHurryUp_00002b26_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I failed to show mercy, and Stendarr cursed me for it. Right my wrongs, show "
"mercy where it is needed, and Stendarr may grant you the Gauntlets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwaterBrigands_0000c1ce_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I fashioned a tale about a \"Golden Galleon\" that the previous owner hid "
"within this very vessel. It was to be a statuette made completely of gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00047602_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"I fear Lady Leyawiin and Hlidara Mothril plan to push the minorities aside "
"and establish a bland, Imperial-dominated culture here in Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08UrsanneTell_0001f42b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I fear for his life. Kurdan isn't known for his patience. Please, I'm not "
"wealthy, but I'd give anything to see Aleron again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27AyleidCrown_000a656c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear for what Umbacano may unleash using that Crown. He is blind to the "
"true nature of the Ayleids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I fear grave tidings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07JyggalagTopic_0009120d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear it won't be long until he makes his presence known. Without Sheogorath "
"on His throne, the Realm is likely doomed. Again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BorderWatchTOPIC_0003e1fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I fear it won't survive this day! The K'Sharra has come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a5d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I fear my own greed got the better of my judgment. I hope you weren't hurt "
"badly in that horrible place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_0000c08a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I fear she is not safe from the minions of the King of Worms. She is at Fort "
"Ontus; please, go there and return with the Amulet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril1_00002c59_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear that Umaril will strike again before we are ready. This waiting... it "
"grates on my nerves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05WhyMe_0002c6df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear that anyone he knows won't be able to help him in there. Since I'm in "
"his memories, he may dismiss me as a figment of his dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenSomeone_000835f9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I fear that our informant is in danger, and that is why I have called you "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I fear that our work is not yet done. The area is still overrun with Knights "
"that were not destroyed in the spire. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_00034067_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I fear that the Amulet was the target of this attack. Go and see if it is "
"safe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LadyRogbutTOPIC_0000be79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear that whilst out rock-picking, she was apprehensive. Stolen away! My "
"suspension is that ogres have abjected her! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhat_000835fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear the Battlemages may mistreat Mucianus, if they do not mistake him for "
"one of the many Necromancers no doubt present in the ruins. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000343e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I fear the enemy came here for the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046826_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear the settlement of Highcross is experiencing some difficulties. Perhaps "
"you should intervene?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a9843_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I fear the worst, but Umbacano Manor remains in my charge, and I will keep it "
"in readiness for his return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033d0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I fear the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ObelisksTopic_000910fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear they grow in power as the Greymarch progresses. More and more Knights "
"of Order make their way into the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002d0c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I fear this place has addled your wits. This is no dream, but a waking "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003997_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I fear this time you may find the results no more to your liking than the "
"last. Less so, perhaps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003357e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I fear we're in over our heads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel I can truly share with you, without fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ10BjalfiDead_00061422_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I feel I owe you something for your efforts. Hmmm, yes. I feel it only "
"appropriate that you have my dowry. I would consider it an honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c348_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel Ulrich's eyes upon me as we speak, so be brief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c6d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I feel as though I'll be trapped here forever, and I don't even know why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00018b7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel as though we've talked about this. Am I mistaken?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_0006166e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel better with the Torch burning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000298f_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "I feel good. I feel GOOD!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0008e4f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I feel like I need to be on the other side. I'm just not sure how to get in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeleneTopic_0000c1cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel much better now knowing she's locked up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018b9fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel much better now that you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I feel safer now that the Resonator of Judgment has been restored. I was "
"beginning to worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SadGeneral_00024279_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel so bad for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiaCaro_00035fb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel so much better now that I have my ring back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013337_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I feel something different...the curse feels lighter somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I feel sorry for Norbert Lelles. He's a good man, but he gets taken in so "
"easily."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I feel sorry for Vilena Donton, but she had to go. A new master is just what "
"we need to restore the Fighters Guild's reputation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I feel sure the Master will recognize my efforts and summon me to the "
"Forbidden Grotto soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkDisappearances_00014e21_AltarDeluxe_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I feel these disappearances are an insult to Akatosh's Commands. Will you "
"investigate the ruins of Beldaburo and help us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting01_00002ad9_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I fell each time. And each time I awoke in the chapel, I leapt again. I tried "
"to enlist the help of the other knights, but none would come to my aid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AxeofDragol_0001fdba_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I fell for the same trick. In my case, he told me if I retrieved the axe, "
"he'd erase my debts. I was such an idiot to believe him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014e87_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I felt it! The flow of Time is now once more in accordance with Akatosh's "
"rules!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e589_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I figured you'd be back for more work. Good. There's more to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000aef8d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I finally accomodated him by enchanting a very special chest for him. You'll "
"find it in the Arch Mage's quarters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002991_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I finally have a chance to get out and see the world. I'm not wasting another "
"second of my life. And I'm forever indebted to you, friend. Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e969_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find her annoying. She's way too full of herself. Quite the big talker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007300c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find it comforting to know when the end will come, and that there's nothing "
"I can do about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find it odd that so many people have been killed, yet the two of you still "
"live. Looks to me like you two are working together. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e5a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find it surprising that you're speaking to me again without having "
"completed your task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000292c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find myself here, at your disposal. I want to make up for the mistakes I've "
"made, and devote myself fully to the faith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetB4_0003e8f5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I find myself in your debt and this irks me. I am honor bound to repay my "
"debt to you. If you will it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b076_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find the fact that my father was a \"notorious master criminal\" absurd. He "
"was a peaceful farmer, nothing more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004770f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find things to do. I manage the house, make sure Amantius doesn't starve or "
"run out of ink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSShadowscaleChoice1A_00035592_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find your decision most agreeable! Now, the details. Far south of here, on "
"the southern end of Cyrodiil, lies a swamp called Bogwater."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find your very presence foul. Say what you will and then leave my sight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk5_00002bc1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I find your words truly inspiring, my friend. Let me go now, and think upon "
"all you've said. We'll speak again later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b659_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I follow Adeo, your Grace. If she follows you, then so do I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001cce7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I follow Issmi, your Grace. If she follows you, then so do I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I follow the Emperor's orders, but that doesn't mean I trust you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDEightAndOneTopic_00002c8d_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I follow the old way, of honoring the Eight while also giving due to Talos, "
"the One who ascended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff13_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I followed him a few times, to see where he goes. He walks around the city "
"looking for skooma, and then goes to Lorkmir's house for several hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Passwall_0008e502_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I followed the bones. They lead me here. I just moved in when I got here. No "
"one seemed to mind. Everyone here seems to be waiting for something. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000285af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I found \"Istunondë's Cosmology\" at the bookseller's. Haven't had a chance "
"to read much, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I found some good pauldrons at the armorer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1b_00016b70_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I gathered those who could see the light and I led a revolt against him. We "
"were... slaughtered by his Dark Seducers. I alone was spared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_0001585f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I get by. But let's not change the subject. We're here to talk about you. "
"About what you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I get paid to kill things. That's why I like the Fighters Guild. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002966_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I give praise to the Nine. I owe them much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_000251a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I give up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHermaeusSpeech_000a9483_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I give you a spell to trap these souls. Return to me when you have finished. "
"When you do, I will further your journey on your true path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004666f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I give you... the Blue Team's Hero! Can this brave combatant defeat three "
"opponents and become the next Champion? Let's find out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09GhostC_00036667_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I go now to complete my duty to my lord Tiber Septim. Free my brothers, and "
"together we may be able to lift the Underking's curse. Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor18_00032482_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I go to my grave. A tongue shriller than all the music calls me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002935_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I go to offer prayers to blessed Dibella, and to swear vengeance on those who "
"profaned her Chapel and cruelly slew her acolytes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008961f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I got it from a dead Hunger. Those things are mean. Glad I didn't have to "
"kill it. Here take it. It's his tongue!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I got no beds here. You need a bed in the Imperial City, you got four "
"choices. The King and Queens and Luther Broads are in the Gardens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a9849_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I got no complaints. Kind of an arrogant bastard if you get right down to it, "
"but he pays us well enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_000286a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I got nothing to say to you, stranger.  Outsiders have always tried to "
"destroy us, but we've always survived."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00085212_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I got nothing to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I got out while I still had the original set of legs, arms, and eyes. "
"Fighters Guild is a perfect place for me now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000237cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I got stuff to do. Don't bother me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_0000bcd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I got the door open. The rest is up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d930_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I got through the gate, and kept running through the woods by the light of "
"the fires."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DABoethiaSpeech_00051ed9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I greet you, Chosen One! A victory in my Tournament of Ten Bloods brings "
"great honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e091_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I greet you. Thaurron, Journeyman of the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChoice2_00038b48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I grew up here in the Imperial City, but I was born elsewhere. My mother was "
"a servant in the employ of Lord Lovidicus, and resided at his fortress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingAbout_00002abc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I grew up in Cheydinhal. My father was a cobbler. My mother was an acolytle "
"of Zenithar. She was self-taught, not part of the chapel proper. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bfc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I grow weary of waiting. Where is my book?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000908a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guarantee generous rewards to those adventurers who serve County Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043004_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess I can spare you a minute. But not more than that. I've got to get "
"back to work. Always more work to do than time to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess I can trust you. It's that bastard Audens Avidius. He's in here every "
"month taking my wares without paying for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ebb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I guess I could have been an adventurer. But I like sleeping in a bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005374e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I guess I was wrong about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035586_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess I've been expecting you, assassin. Don't try to deny it. I can see it "
"in your eyes. You're Dark Brotherhood through and through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b6e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess Owyn will let anyone join the Arena these days. I guess I shouldn't "
"let it bother me, seeing as how you'll be dead tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004f8b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess Rosentia Gallenus got rid of whatever barnyard animals she was "
"keeping inside her house. Smells much better now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060536_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess even our Lord Sheogorath needs to take a vacation once in a while. "
"Not me, though. I'm happy to keep working."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002815a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I guess it all depends on the size of the chest. The bigger the better, of "
"course, but where would our mysterious host have hidden such a thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14MoreBrush_0001bb34_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I guess it all doesn't matter now. Unless you can defeat those Painted "
"Trolls, we have no chance of getting the Brush back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000837e7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I guess someone else has already told you the other details. Kill all the "
"guests then leave, right? Well, you'd better get in there. Time to mingle. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00002d31_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess that crazy preacher in Anvil was right. First Anvil, now here. Where "
"will it end?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk1_0006a85f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I guess that depends on how much of my precious time you need...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Whatnow_00031d28_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I guess that leaves you, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00085973_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I guess there's only one thing left for me to do. I'm going to find an axe "
"and do my best to chop that damn door down and get us out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess things will go back to normal now that there is a new Gatekeeper. Oh "
"well, I was looking forward to some drama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00023f55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess we won't be going back to High Rock after all. Cropsford is going to "
"be our home now, for better or worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0009ea80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess we've got a room available. 30 gold per night. Take it or leave it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogatheOrcTopic_000860c5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I guess you don't know how to talk to a knight. So I'll teach you. Say, 'Yes, "
"Sir Mazoga'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofMalacathTOPIC_00098201_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess you haven't heard. We don't like the 'beautiful people'. But maybe "
"you can persuade me you're ugly inside..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I guess you heard Vilena recruited a new sword. Been a while, hasn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guess you told that Wood Elf what you thought of his magic dagger, huh? He "
"he he he. Here's your gold. Nice going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona14_00022e87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I guessed you would say these terrible things to me. That is why I brought my "
"friend along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022b4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a copy of Volume Three, but Gwinas has already picked it up. So sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022cef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a copy of Volume Three, but I am sorry to say that it was stolen "
"recently. Gwinas was terribly upset when he found out, poor fellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05PhintiasA_00022b45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a copy of Volume Three, but I am sorry to say that it was stolen "
"recently. The thieves in the Market District get more brazen by the day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022cee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a copy of Volume Three, but I am sorry to say that it was stolen "
"recently. The thieves in the Market District get more brazen by the day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12AcceptMission_00018239_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a feeling you'd accept. Good. Then let me tell you how you're going to "
"find the Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d037_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a feeling you'd catch on sooner or later. That's why I had this trap "
"prepared for you. If you'll notice, the grave is already dug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Accept_000319d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a good feeling about you, friend. You should talk to Mirisa about the "
"goblins. She's our guide and knows what needs to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had a very pleasant visit with Arriana Valga recently. The castle was very "
"comfortable, and her new guard captain seems to be working out well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I had heard he was looking for some help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had hoped for more help. The Empire will stand or fall with Bruma! Have all "
"the other cities abandoned us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ff09_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I had hoped to avoid such an... irritation. Here is your reward, but the "
"bonus is forfeit. Do try to be more careful next time, hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003489e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I had hoped to avoid such an... irritation. Here is your reward, but the "
"bonus is forfeit. Do try to be more careful next time, hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_00015627_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had hoped we'd spend more time together, but yes, I realize you're being "
"honest. Thank you for your time, Nelrene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08NoStone_00014707_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had hoped you would have it with you. Go get the stone and return at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11SheogorathChoice3_00014b67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had intended to give you My staff, the symbol of My office. But life has "
"gone from it, as it goes from Me. It is now dead wood. A useless twig."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had just been telling Uncle Leo that something big was coming, and now this "
"conspiracy. And they thought me part of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_0002b5e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had never thought to see eight of the Ancestors together again in my "
"lifetime. Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SurpriseReceive_0002424a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I had no idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had rather enjoyed the Resonator being broken. Greater opportunity for "
"meeting someone new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c148_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I had the diary, but one of them stole it from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e5c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I had to find someone else to bring me the Crown of the Ayleids, since you "
"were unwilling to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChanel1_00031506_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I had to have the painting back, so I decided to steal it then hide it behind "
"the painting in my quarters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MannimarcoTopic_00009222_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I had, perhaps foolishly, believed that Necromancy was all but stamped out in "
"Cyrodiil. It seems I couldn't have been more mistaken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hadn't heard that Syl was replaced, I was too busy prefecting my latest "
"culinary creation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hadn't heard that Thadon was replaced, I was too busy perfecting my latest "
"culinary creation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05PhintiasA_00022b44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I happen to have a copy of Volume Three on hand, but I'm afraid it is a ... "
"special order. Already paid for by another customer. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022ceb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I happen to know that if you go up the stairs there, you can get a vantage "
"point on the meeting room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008152d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hardly need to tell you how important my work is, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043515_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hate gossips. If I tell you something, will you go away? Fine. The "
"Resonator of Judgment is on again. Blah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ChNotYet_0001e3eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hate indecision! Or maybe I don't. Make up your mind, or I'll have your "
"skin made into a hat -- one of those arrowcatchers. I love those hats!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hate it here. Came here with Edla. All these snooty Southerners. And damn "
"guards won't let anyone have any fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hate my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hate the fact that you've made everything better! I just hate it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004a7d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hate these interruptions, but I suppose they are unavoidable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice2B_000242b4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hate to ask more of you, my friend, but you know that we're not warriors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hate to refuse you, my friend. But with the castle still in the hands of "
"those daedra, I need every soldier I have left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031c83_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I hate to speak ill of them, as something horrible may have happened, but "
"their own bravado got them into this mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51Talk_0003481e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hate when the Countess gets angry. No liquor rations for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029c3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I have a bad feeling about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have a feeling that you and I are about to become very close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a good idea where that chest might be. That gold is as good as mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028cdd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have a great respect for the Dunmer people. They are strong and noble, and "
"generally understand the importance of law and discipline."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086966_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have a job to do, and nothing will stand in my way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003b344_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a lovely room on the corner, if you're interested. It's 20 gold for a "
"night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001470b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have a message for you from the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a new task for you, and I assure you there are no Necromancers "
"involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035679_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have a new task for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00061c3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a proposition for you. Best not to talk about it here. Meet me at the "
"sewer grate northeast of the Sheogorath statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003b34f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a room ready, if you need it for the night. It'll be 10 gold. "
"Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a small problem that you may be able to help with. The guild will even "
"pay a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000253b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a special contract that needs fulfillment. In truth, I don't wish to "
"offer it to any other family member. I've come to rely on your abilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee41_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a special request from the widow of a former fence in Leyawiin. As "
"your new Doyen, I am asking you to help her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a warm place to sleep and three squares a day. It ain't 'The Bard's "
"Tale', but it's good enough for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_0002887d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have a weapon now... this hammer. Not my usual weapon choice, but it will "
"have to do. Let us slay these creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001648c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I have already sent word to all the local guild halls that you are now in "
"charge. Congratulations, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have an arrest warrant for the Gray Fox. Do you know where he is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3_00018c7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have an idea how we might be able to stop them, but for now we must "
"survive. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackSoulGemMG17_000151f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have an idea of what this gem is for, and I want you to make sure it never "
"reaches Mannimarco's hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003005b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have another contract, when you're ready. One that will rely on your "
"ability to remain fully undetected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000153b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have another mesage from the Gray Fox. You must be very important!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fb60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have another message from the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000b2da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have been anxiously awaiting your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000146ed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have been expecting you. The full Council has already considered the matter "
"of Martin's claim to the Imperial Throne in detail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00047769_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have been happy enough in the Count's service. But I am not so happy about "
"his lovely wife, and her Nibenean advisor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000292f_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have been shown that to protect all Kynareth's creations, I must take up "
"your cause and be willing to lay down my life for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have been waiting for you, Your Grace. This day, as all days before and "
"after, is well known to me. There are no surprises to Dyus of Mytheria."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fd92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have been waiting for you, assassin. We have not spoken in some time, but I "
"am well aware of your accomplishments within the Dark Brotherhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014834_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have been waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_000039a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have called you here because from our previous encounter, I believe you can "
"be trusted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsErrant_000908d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have created a chivalric Order of the White Stallion. Find and kill the "
"leader of the Black Bow Bandits, the Orc named Black Brugo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Medallion_00066eaa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have decided to stay here in the Shivering Isles. I've found peace here, "
"and I see no reason to return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsWhiteStallionTopic_000908e3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have dedicated our royal hunting retreat, the White Stallion Lodge, to the "
"exclusive use of White Stallion Knights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e702_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have died seven times, each more painful than the last. But still, I "
"return! Would you like to hear about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Inventory_0001d034_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have disposed of all of my ill-gotten merchandise, and replaced it with "
"more expensive, but carefully obtained items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000977d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have everything I need. Now all that remains is to brew the potion. This, "
"however, is a task with which you cannot assist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bc92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have everything for the budding alchemist under one roof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have everything for the budding alchemist under one roof. Far more than "
"Thoronir would ever have, despite his horrid business ethics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027e38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have everything in place for the ritual. I'll open the portal whenever "
"you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_0003c268_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have everything necessary for the ritual to use the Xarxes to open a portal "
"to Camoran's Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001391c_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "I have everything you need to make the place more livable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00031616_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have failed you, Arden-Sul... I am sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have few enough men to spare, but you have more than earned our help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062134_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have food and drink for sale. I'm sure something will interest you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueClue_0002b526_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have found the names of a number of Ayleid cities where the statues may "
"have been taken for safekeeping during the siege of White Gold Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004989f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have friends visiting soon, so I told them to stay at the King and Queen "
"Tavern."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I have full confidence in you, and so I leave the guild in your care. When I "
"am gone, you will be recognized as Arch-Mage and leader of the Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have given you little more than a name. I can only pray that you'll wander "
"the Imperial City aimlessly for days, and then eventually die of hunger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have given you the help you asked for. Bruma's fate is out of my hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038fc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have good news! I've made some progress on deciphering the gate-opening "
"ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_000250a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have heard Argonia is a strange and treacherous place. It is no wonder odd "
"things are happening there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082630_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have heard Sheogorath has called it back to the Isles. Perhaps he will find "
"it one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025012_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have heard that Nord warriors have travelled from Skyrim with Orc "
"mercenaries to assault the Redoran of Morrowind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00024e29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have heard that the Great Houses of Morrowind are in upheaval. Indoril is "
"in ruins, and Redoran is besieged by the Nords of Skyrim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_00025015_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have heard things are bad in Vvardenfell. The Telvanni do their best to "
"close the gates, but it is to no avail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06UlfriFinalA_000400e0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have hoped for this moment since I took command of the Mazken at Cylarne. I "
"return my soul to the embrace of Oblivion's dark waters. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk4_00002bbe_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have it all worked out. First, we find ourselves a competent enchanter. Our "
"weapons and armor must be made ready... for anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000366c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have it on good account that the Forlorn Watchman is gone for good. The "
"stories about his fate were true, but now the curse has been broken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043012_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have it on good authority that that bookworm, Atrabhi is a compulsive liar. "
"My only fault is my naive trusting honesty. How can I help you, friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003d4c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have it on good authority that the city watch sent someone to stop that "
"gang of women from robbing the town's men. Good show I say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have it on good authority that the newest addition to the Brotherhood is an "
"annoying whelp unworthy of licking my boots. How's that for gossip?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9840_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have just the thing for you. A lovely suite on the second floor, for only "
"40 gold a night. Quite a steal. Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000366e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have many questions about all this. I hope Jauffre will be able to answer "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have mastered my fears. There is no terror to compare with what Vaermina "
"has shown me in my dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001647b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I have met so many of his predecessors over the years. I developed a "
"particular fondness for Galerion, ill-preserved though he may be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003b839_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have much to do. This better be good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062116_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have much to offer, and I'm always on the lookout for more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40melisandeWhatdoido_0005373a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have my own interests, and they occasionally require resources that are "
"difficult for me to acquire. Soul gems, for example."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001fb50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have need of a very special book, the Lost Histories of Tamriel. The cat "
"burglar Theranis was sent hunting in Skingrad for this book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014833_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have need of your services once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08Honor_000146fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have need of your special gifts. There is an item, hidden away in a remote "
"monastery. I need you to go get it for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_000171ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have no desire to speak to you until the blood price is paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002823c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no doubt that Matilde is capable of murder. But what about you? You're "
"as much suspect in my eyes as she is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7a_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have no doubt that it all began on the day that he left the Order with the "
"Sword and Greaves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b1a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no doubt that they still lie within the Chapel of Stendarr in Chorrol. "
"No mortal man could lift them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08SavillasStoneTopic_0009838b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have no idea what you are talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d038_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no idea what you're talking about, but you have a sick mind. Get away "
"from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038436_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no idea where he'd be. Just find him, and make him tell you the truth. "
"I swear, he's a liar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no idea why Valandrus Abor even serves at the chapel. He's not very "
"good, though you'd hear differently from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no more jobs for a thief of your skill. You have no need of the Doyen "
"to provide you work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000241ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have no more to say to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ec3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have no more to say to you. Leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics2_00002c74_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no news, I'm afraid. But do not despair -- I know in my heart that our "
"Commander will not fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10BlowOff_0003fd3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no patience for impertinence. Maybe I should reconsider what I was "
"about to offer you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c370_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have no regrets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_0001562e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no reports of any such conspiracy at the present time, despite my "
"Lady's repeated insistence that one exists. There is no danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04ChoiceCarahilDangerous_0004f226_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have no time for guild recruits that are useless in the field. This will be "
"an excellent way for you to prove yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiriliUlvenGreetB_000410a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no time for idle chatter with dilettantes. When I'm finished with the "
"Encyclopedia Sheothia, you may study it to your heart's content."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000661f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no time for your pathetic attempts at small talk. Now walk away, "
"before I get... nasty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have no time to talk, friend. As soon as my father arrives, we head back to "
"the farm. These creatures must be dealt with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00038ee3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have not eaten in decades! You will be my feast! Aggghhh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have not found it convenient to visit Count Bravil. Travel is so difficult "
"there at this time of the year. Indeed, almost any time of year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhoInformant_000835f8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I have not heard from him, and I fear for his safety."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have not read the works of Mrs. Ottus. I'm told some find her guide books "
"useful, though she apparently has strong opinions on some matters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473c5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have nothing else to say to you. But my father wants to speak with you "
"before we send you on your way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022503_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have nothing more to say. We shall speak again only after Rufio lies dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say about the Count and his son. The rest of the town is a "
"little rough. But I don't mind. I like it that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030031_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have nothing to say to someone of your manifest stupidity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00097cac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0003c16d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have nothing to teach the likes of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0018b199_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have nothing to teach the likes of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00015f23_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have one last task for you. As a sign of good faith, the Thieves Guild "
"needs to return Hrormir's Icestaff to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Farewell_0009f9ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have opened a portal for your return to the world of men. Go now, Chosen "
"One, and claim your prize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefend_00018f8b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have ordered my troops to deploy into the Underdeep. Your job is to lead "
"the Aureals into our trap. Don't worry, we'll be ready for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00038991_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have potions, and everything you need to make your own. What will it be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_poisonedknifetopic_000282fe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have provided you with a vial of antidote, which will be used to revive "
"Francois Motierre after you successfully stage his death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00034e12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have received recommendations from all the local guild halls in Cyrodiil. "
"You have done well for yourself. You may now enter the University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b45e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have recently become interested in obtaining the complete set of these "
"ancient statues. I believe that ten still exist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Allright_0003e955_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I have researched what I can, but acquiring the cure is beyond my grasp. I "
"cannot risk drawing too much attention to myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00078ca0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have said all that there is to say. If you wish to continue, you must "
"proceed to the palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40JanusAccept_0003ed37_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have searched for these witches throughout Cyrodiil, but no covens still "
"exist within its borders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have seen dragons. Perhaps you will see a dragon. I won't say where I saw "
"one. Perhaps I did not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008adc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have seen everything. After you've seen through Vaermina's eyes, nothing "
"can frighten you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_000253c7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have seen that she is in town. Though she has not approached me, I know she "
"wants something. I would like you to find out what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_00026b1c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I have seen them all fall, and still Umbra hungers for more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025035_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have seen what you have done, child, and how you must make amends with the "
"guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraSpeech_0002c6c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have seen your name, Traveler, and heard it whispered in twilight. I ask a "
"service, which holds promise of fame and reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Beast_0004565f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have some spells I can sell you if you have no way to command the beasts "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000432a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have some things for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000977d6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I have something for you...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022db6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have spent seven years learning how to translate this scroll. Even so, I "
"will need a while to decipher what I have sought so desperately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40WitchCure_0003ed3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have stories of old, implying they could cure someone of vampirism. I know "
"nothing more than that. I hope you can learn the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have sworn not to raise a weapon in anger, but you have offended my honor "
"in this most holy place. Prepare to die, devil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPilgrimageTopic_00002a9d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I have taken up the Prophet's call to defend the Faith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPilgrimageTopic_00002a9c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have taken up the call of the Prophet to quest for the Crusader's Relics, "
"and so I walk the Pilgrim's Way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004765d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have the best prices in town? Why? I'm smart, and you're smart. We know the "
"right people, we get the best deals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_00028c01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have the book stored safely for now; I shall hold on to it until the "
"Council decides what should be done with it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00022da7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have the book you seek. With it and the Master's three other books, you "
"will possess the key to enlightenment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c147_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have the diary!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ValusOdiilTopic_000b6c06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have the highest respect for my father... I just wish he could have seen us "
"cross blades with the enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_00098399_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I have the orders right there. I'll fill in his name and you can deliver it "
"to Captain Lex. Thank you courier. My steward will tip you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have the sharpest blades. I test them out on myself before I put them on "
"sale. They are deliciously keen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000a218_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f21a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have to admit that when he's not dead, the Gatekeeper seems to do an "
"excellent job. Perhaps Relan could learn from it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Abilities_00015203_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have to admit, I'm better with an axe than I am with Magic. I've been "
"working on spellcasting, but I still feel better with a weapon in hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04DrethConvo_00045f81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have to admit, I'm going to miss you, Dreth. The late-night beatings, your "
"pitiful little cries for help..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004600a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have to get back to work now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a6c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have to sell it soon, as I have pressing matters elsewhere. You're welcome "
"to take a look at it. It is located across the street from the Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48SavlianWhatDoing_00098143_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I have to try and protect the few civilians that are left. It's all I can do "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting03_00002ad5_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I have told you all that I know. All that is left is for you to prove "
"yourself more worthy than I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00009223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have told you all that I know. Mannimarco has come to Cyrodiil, and I "
"believe he means harm to your guild. Traven must know this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_0005c2fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have told you what I require from you. There is no more to say now; speak "
"with Hal-Liurz when you have found this woman. Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_00068350_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have trained my entire life for the crisis that is now upon us. When the "
"moment comes, I will gladly lay down my life for the Empire!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_000363bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have two witnesses willing to testify against Audens Avidius. I'll get a "
"warrant and arrest him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarSpeech_0008b09e_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "I have waited a long time for you, Champion of Old Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0018d2ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have warned my people to stay inside the walls and put my guard on full "
"alert. There's nothing else we can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have word that two of the jobs were successful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P6RememberItAll_0001fb73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I have written it down for you in this book. I've chosen you because you are "
"the best. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000545fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I have your horse right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQDaedricMagic_0008b606_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't always been a priest. In my youth, I followed a different path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10WhatAboutLLev_0003c2c4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I haven't approached him myself, as Ulrich has eyes everywhere. However, he "
"doesn't know you well enough yet to suspect anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't been in a while, but it's always nice to stop in and chat with "
"Rasheda. Plus, she always gives a better deal to her friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_0006bd49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't been to Cloud Ruler since I was a young trainee. It feels good to "
"be back. The Blades have always been here, and always will be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fdd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't done much betting, but I hear some folks have made a good bit of "
"money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't done too much betting. Can't say I know enough about the folks "
"fighting to make a smart wager."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NQDGuardWarning_0018d224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I haven't got all day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a8f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't heard much about him. I'm thinking about going down to Anvil to "
"hear him for myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't needed anything there in a while. I'm sure I will soon, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't really spent any time around him. I find him a little frightening, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00048730_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't seen Vidkun around town lately. I guess they're keeping him pretty "
"busy at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028bb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I haven't seen anything, except for that stranger wandering around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028721_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't seen death like this in a long, long time. It's a bit more than my "
"nerves can handle, I'm afraid. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0001cef2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't seen him in days. Volanaro said something about a spell backfiring, "
"making him permanently invisible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ErthorTopic_0001c1b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't seen him in quite some time. But then, this isn't the first time "
"he's been away, so I wasn't really that concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b59f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I haven't seen that before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d491_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I haven't seen you here before. Awww, and you're all alone too. How sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004995b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't spent time there, but if you're looking for light armor, Best "
"Defense is the place to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049943_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't spent too much time there. I hear it's the place to go for "
"enchanting supplies, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189cfc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I haven't tasked you to bring the amulet back to me, and yet you have. I "
"don't know which of the Divines sent you, but I appreciate what you've done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I haven't time for fools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a317d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I haven't time to talk right now, I'm afraid. But I'm sure one of the other "
"Blades can help. Try speaking with Belisarius, or Caroline."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a31bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I haven't turned up anything new on my end yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c230_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear Adrienne Berene is quite a mage. Of course, it's not like she'd bother "
"to stop to talk to you in the street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d6e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear Adrienne is sending you out to get Erthor. Is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear Azzan plans to send both new recruits out on the next contract. You "
"know what it's about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear Black Brugo is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear Cutter collects the Madness Ore to turn into armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear Thadon's happy again. Dammit! Why is everyone so happy all the time? "
"It's not fair. I just want to die. Is that too much to ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006266f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear a new Associate came to Teekeeus's aid recently. Something about an "
"old enemy of his storming into town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear a new puppy dog has arrived on the Isles. I bet he's really cute and "
"cuddly. Like you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_0002505d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear all of Skyrim is under siege. The daedra lay waste to the Old Holds, "
"and there is little to do to stop it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082626_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear he'll buy calipers and tongs from people he trusts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061791_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear he's a sight to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002d91f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear one of the guild mages has gone missing again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear our gold soldier paid her debt, but the hard hand also kept her family "
"sword and armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_000825da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear she makes armor and weapons out of it. For a price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dca4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear she wants a \"cure\" for her latest disease, but isn't willing to pay "
"for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082624_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear she will pay for a \"cure\" for her latest disease."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046635_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear she's a very private person. I also heard she knows a lot about using "
"light armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear something is amiss again in the House of Dementia. I wonder what it "
"is. I love a good scandal. Don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13GateHeardNot_00031c7c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hear tell that the daedra make their way through these and invade our "
"lands. It's sort of a door to the world where they live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053ff1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hear that Audens Avidius is going to jail. Let's hope its a long sentence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007866c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear that Earil is fed up with Brithaur's antics. He really wants something "
"done about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024f3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear that Emfrid and Captain Bittneld are spending a lot of time together. "
"You wouldn't have anything to do with that, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06ShrineTalkStart_00036411_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear that everything is ready for the Cleansing to begin. Sister Orla has "
"seen the gate citadels. Lord Dagon is mustering His finest troops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AAnya_00013a6d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hear that in light of recent events at the palace, Anya Herrick is more "
"loyal to Syl than ever. In fact, she rarely leaves her side!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f4a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear that my army has been restored. Perhaps I should join up again...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorsUmaril_00002bcb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear that some ancient Elven king is behind it. One of the really bad ones, "
"that you read about from the old days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025011_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear that the Nords of Skyrim have been warring with the Redoran of "
"Morrowind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00146006_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the Count's got someone to sort out that business with Mazoga the so-"
"called knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the Heretics in the lands of Mania summon Hungers to fight by their "
"sides."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029fb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the Shield of the Crusader has been found. It was locked away in some "
"booby-trapped dungeon or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f481_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the army is restored. You should go see if they need a target dummy to "
"practice on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00024e9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the legions have been recalled from Fort Swampmoth in Black Marsh, and "
"many of the Argonian slaves have returned to their tribes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001473e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear the monks were most... hospitable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the newcomer made a real mess in Passwall. I sure hope he stays out of "
"Highcross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078174_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear the owner doesn't even remember what she's got in the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EternalGardenTalk_00088b64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear the war is going badly. There are some new arrivals here that were "
"caught in the fall of the Great Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00074a89_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hear them all. Sometimes. But not right now. They're all quiet. Did you "
"frighten them away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f21e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear there's a new Gatekeeper. What if They tamper with him, and send him "
"after me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00040bb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear there's someone new in the Isles... they should have stayed away. This "
"whole place is coming down on our heads!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear there's someone new in the Shivering Isles. I do so enjoy making new "
"friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042da5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear there's someone trying to get into the Shivering Isles. It's all part "
"of a plot to overthrow the Realm. You'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear we have another new recruit. Things are looking up. What's his name... "
"Maglir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d91e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear you got quite a task from Adrienne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004420e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hear you light that big torch in the city by setting yourself on fire. Now "
"there's an idea. I'd like to see that, but the city is so far away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_00029547_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hear you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c21d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard Ah-Mahlz was out hunting goblins again. Good. They're vermin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard Fighters Guild got the Fallen Rock contract, but the guy is just "
"sitting around drinking beer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046614_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard Ita Rienus talking about the geography of Tamriel again. She's very "
"knowledgeable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c23c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard Lazare Milvan challenged someone else to a duel. The man is "
"ridiculous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard Passwall has been destroyed. Damn shame. Used to drink with some of "
"those folks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard Thadon is dead. Nothing wrong with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard Thadon's heart exploded. There would have been a great deal of blood. "
"Sweet, sweet heart's blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard Tove the Unrestful is building something again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e9a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard a rumor that you're an idiot. Any truth to that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a18_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard about a knight who rescued the chapel in Leyawiin. Talk about good "
"timing! But who's to say what chapel will be next? No one is safe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00092a6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard about how you helped the Guard drive the daedra back. Well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042da0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard about this new person in the Isles. There's one more person who'll "
"come to hate my guts. I hope he kills me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk2_00034047_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard about your most recent contract. I just wanted to congratulate you on "
"a job well done. You had quite the time of it, or so I hear! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43DeadDog_0008f13d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I heard from Bernice that Ushnar might get another dog, a new dog. Maybe "
"Ushnar will let me pet him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e965_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard he became a priest to avoid becoming a soldier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I heard he had to flee Morrowind, and is now hiding out in the forests of "
"Cyrodiil. If there are other cultists out there, he's probably with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e974_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard he learned about Alteration because he's too scared to fight. "
"Pathetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008260d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard he lives with Zoe Malene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10NoBribeBeggar_00016255_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard he moved to Bruma. I'd look for him there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082625_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard he will buy calipers and tongs from people he likes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard him tell the joke. I understood it. It just wasn't funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorsUmaril_00002bc9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard it was daedra. Minions of Meridia who've not been seen in Tamriel in "
"thousands of years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11JournalGive_00038587_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I heard no mention of a key either. It must have been removed by Raynil from "
"Bradon's body before we arrived."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_00029197_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard people saying they ran into goblins around here not long ago. I can't "
"stand those things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DagailTopic_0003395c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard she was put in charge of the Leyawiin guild hall as a favor, not "
"because she deserved it. That doesn't seem right, does it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008262b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard she's been stockpiling magic items... \"just in case.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082618_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard she's trying to catalogue all the living things in the Shivering "
"Isles, and she'll pay for help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Talk_0002809e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard some nice fellow found her held prisoner in some cave, and rescued "
"her.  What a romantic story!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028bfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard someone broke into the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004420b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard someone relit the Torch at the Sacellum Arden-Sul. Good news, "
"unless... what if someone is just trying to trick us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ebb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard something strange happened in the House of Dementia. Probably disease-"
"related."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that J'skar at the Mages Guild is quite good at blowing things up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004d0b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard that Oblivion Gates are opening all over the city!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06CastleJobs_0000bf86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that Shum gro-Yarug is looking to hire. He's the butler for the "
"Count. Go speak to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004f224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that Soris Arenim made himself quite a bit of money recently. He "
"seems very happy about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0000bcd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that Velwyn Benirus is trying to sell off Benirus Manor. Hopefully "
"the new owners will clean that eyesore up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0000bccd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard that Velwyn Benirus was killed. The Manor claims another victim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that he stood in one place for hours, just to teach himself how to be "
"sneakier. Sounds boring, but whatever works for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ac_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I heard that he was on his way to one of the Southern provinces, seeking fame "
"and fortune. Maybe try an inn along the way, like Faregyl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062676_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that one of the Skingrad mages was assaulted, but I don't know the "
"details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b20a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that some cult called the Mythic Dawn is behind the Emperor's "
"assassination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061386_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that some of the provinces were talking about seceding from the "
"Empire. Probably just talk though. Everything's a bit unsettled now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064457_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that someone broke into the wizard's tower. What kind of a fool would "
"take on Fathis Aren?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a0b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that someone saw the ghost of Lord Vlindrel again, along the road to "
"Bruma. I think I'll avoid that road at night for a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a1b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that someone's taken over that abandoned priory in the West Weald. I "
"wonder what they could be up to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00034818_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that the Countess is quite upset lately. Apparently someone stole "
"something very personal to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002c5a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that the Fighters Guild botched a job. They lost a bunch of men in "
"the raid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that the Kvatch Guard is driving back the daedra! Maybe there's hope "
"after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a0c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that the Sword of the Crusader has been recovered from Underpall "
"Cave! The Divine Crusader has returned!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064451_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that thieves broke into the Arcane University, the Imperial Legion "
"Compound, and the Temple, all on the same night!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d27f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that you helped the Guard close that Oblivion Gate. Thanks. We were "
"getting worried about that damn thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonTopic_000131d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard that you were coming, looking for Thadon. Yes, yes. Heard it all. "
"Bored to tears by it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11TellMe_00038443_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I heard the Dunmer identify himself as Raynil Dralas. He said he was a "
"vampire hunter and that Bradon was his mark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Fighters Guild thing at Desolate Mine went wrong. They cleared "
"out the goblins, but they lost some people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005eef7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Fringe was attacked. I don't yet know exactly how many were lost, "
"but I'll have to find out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005eef9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Fringe was under attack. Sheer-Meedish is probably worried. I "
"should talk to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Gatekeeper is dead. He didn't have any of my things on him, "
"though, so it's no matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Gatekeeper was killed. I do hope one of my hatchlings wasn't "
"responsible. That'd be ever so embarrassing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029fc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Gauntlets of the Crusader are gone from the Chapel in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00007e04_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I heard the Gray Fox personally humiliated Lex years ago when he tried to "
"arrest Armand Christophe for theft. Lex has never forgotten it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the Resonator of Judgment is working again. Can't say that it affects "
"me much, so I'll just go about my business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003403f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the most disturbing rumor. Someone told me Francois Motierre has been "
"murdered by the Dark Brotherhood! It's not... It's not true, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002825e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the others talking. Neville was a soldier for twenty years. He's used "
"to killing, if you know what I'm saying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00MythicDawnResponse_0018b211_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard the same thing. I'm not sure I believe it though. I mean, who would "
"be crazy enough to help the daedra invade Tamriel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice4B_00054037_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I heard the screams! And... and the smells! I never should have rented out "
"that cellar! Never!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard there is a good smith in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_00029196_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard there were some goblins around here recently. Awful creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a new Arena Champion. Sure it takes a lot of skill to make it "
"that far, but they'd be crazy to challenge the Gray Prince."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042daa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a new adventurer trying to get into the Shivering Isles. No "
"real matter to me, unless he can build a boat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a new ruler in Bliss. Of course, I hear lots of things. Like "
"that! Did you hear that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044236_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a new ruler in Crucible. Of course, I hear lots of things. "
"Like that! Did you hear that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00029684_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a new shipment of weapons at Fire and Steel. Have you been "
"recently?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorAttackResponse2_00002ba0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a prophet in Anvil who seems to know what's going on. "
"Although as usual, he speaks only in riddles, as prophets always seem to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's an ancient ruin that lures adventurers into it, then it kills "
"them. It's old, so those walls can't be safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06KellenRumors_00002bd1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I heard there's nothing the priests can do for him. Poor man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard there's trouble on the Gold Road, near Kvatch... if you're heading "
"that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VidkunTopic_0002d28f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard what happened to him. I wonder if the Mages Council will do anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGCastOutTopic_0001efc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard what you did. So did the guild Doyens. You've been cast out of the "
"Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c459c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard you know how to move in light armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard you made contact with the gang. Beauties, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_0000c051_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I heard you were the one that made it all happen. Everyone in the Thieves "
"Guild is grateful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard you're working for those Demented freaks. Stay away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I heard you're working for those Manics. Leave me alone. I don't want trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000607de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I heard. Stupid outsiders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I helped build Raven Rock. Had a bad run-in with the law, so here I am. "
"Pretty soon I'll head out for the Imperial Reserve, try my luck there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I helped save the Fringe, you know. Not directly, really, but it was "
"ultimately thanks to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d393_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hereby bestow upon you the title of Eliminator. Your blood is cold, your "
"heart hard. You exemplify everything the Dark Brotherhood stands for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d24c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I hid for a while and then returned to the garden. Roland was gone and the "
"woman was dead. She had two puncture marks on the nape of her neck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_000253c9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I highly suggest that you make no effort to associate with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic_00086073_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hold you responsible for Mazoga's death. Your disappointing performance "
"proves you are not suited for service to County Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know how to repay you. I'm not a wealthy man by any means, "
"but perhaps I could assist you in other ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000293d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope I can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope I didn't use too many big words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081dc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope I live to speak with you again, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081dd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope I live to speak with you again, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004918f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope I made myself clear the first time. If you get near that ship, you'll "
"end up dead. Now get out of my face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_0009354f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope I prove myself worthy of your loyalty in the coming days. That's it. "
"Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope I'm not dreaming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope Julienne was helpful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope Martin knows what he's doing with that evil book. I fear for what it "
"could do to him if he's not careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004bf9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope Martin knows what to do now. I will die by his side, if this is the "
"end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e985_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope Ohtesse is taking care of herself. She's a gifted healer, and she "
"spends all her time helping others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001e83d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope everyone can forgive me for not doing a better job checking up on my "
"sources."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044208_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope everyone keeps working and doesn't take the time to go see the Great "
"Torch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000811cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope for your sake you are not accusing me of anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001db21_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I hope he hasn't gotten you wrapped up in some foolish errand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270f2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I hope it is enough. Bruma must hold out until you can complete the ritual "
"and retrieve the Amulet from Mankar Camoran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0001c4ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope it's comfortable enough for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003b350_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope it's comfortable enough for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c20c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope nobody tries to get away with anything when Captain Dion is around. "
"He's a tough customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e96f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope she takes care of herself as well as she takes care of others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope someone saved a piece of Jyggalag's armor. Just the thing for my "
"museum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005e07b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope that serves you well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LifttheCurse_00009270_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope that whatever's behind the door will truly lift the curse. I'd hate to "
"risk harm for nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0018d2f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope the Guard can hold off the daedra, but you think about what happened "
"to Kvatch, and you can't help but worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009837b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the Imperial Watch goes away soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003ab48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the accomodations are satisfactory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022f10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the book helps you find where Garridan may have fallen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope the investigation goes well. Return to me when you have found the "
"culprit. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000614e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the new ruler of Crucible is a good one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the reward will suit the risk. It's all I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9838_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the room meets your needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000835c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope the work at Vahtacen goes well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope there are more reinforcements on the way. We can't hold Bruma by "
"ourselves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004300e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope there isn't something you need from me. Being needed is worse than "
"being forgotten, isn't it? I think so. Well, go on. Go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupNegative_00024235_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope things get better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope this is as much fun for you as it is for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bf36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope this is important, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope this won't take long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope those Knights of Order stay away from my garden. I'd hate to have to "
"start all over again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038bc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope to have at least part of the Mysterium Xarxes translated in a few "
"days. Speak to Jauffre about those spies in the meantime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009292_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope we'll get to Skingrad soon. I've had enough of the wilderness for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001ec1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you are as wise as you pretend to be. The Grakendo has lead us for "
"hundreds of years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000908a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you are here to tell me of Black Brugo's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00037685_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you both get mindrot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c4ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you bring good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you can forgive me. I had no idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066edc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you can help me with my crisis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderReject_00002b33_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you change your mind one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f371_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you covered your tracks. Last thing you want is a Scalon picking up on "
"your scent, and catching you when you're not looking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_0002c815_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you don't blame me for the unpleasantness with Maric. I have no "
"control over the man. In any case, it all turned out well, didn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005e00c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you enjoy it. I can't seem to taste anything these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b124c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you enjoy your stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b6c28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you enjoy your stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you enjoyed your reign, as it is almost at an end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you find the room to your liking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005de8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you get some use out of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00028699_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you have a plan to get us out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you have found your stay here pleasant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004cfab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you have some good news this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006ea47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you have something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00034245_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you learn something from Tar-Meena about that book. This might just be "
"the break we need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b983c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you sleep well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05PhintiasBuyYes_00022b4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you'll keep us in mind for all your specialty book needs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27AyleidCrown_000a55fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you'll make the right choice. Umbacano must not have the Crown of "
"Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Medallion_00066eb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you're back with some good news, I could certainly use it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00097700_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you're enjoying the copy I sold you. Gwinas was terribly upset when he "
"found out, poor fellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072fe5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you're enjoying the museum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you're here to bring me good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d309_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you're here to reconsider."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d042_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you're more successful uncovering his scheme than we've been."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you're not suggesting that Primo is the murderer? I'm the trained "
"investigator here. Just keep your mouth shut and stay out of my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036310_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you're not too angry with me. I... I never meant to do anything wrong, "
"honest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000807f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you're pleased with your earnings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086060_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you've been successful?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItemDone_00082438_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you've enjoyed the tour! Feel free to stay and browse for as long as "
"you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00049807_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you've found Erthor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you've made the necessary preparations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003cce9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hope you've prepared yourself. The journey you're to undertake could be "
"dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope you've returned victorious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018a959_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope your expedition has been more successful than mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NoBribeBeggar2_00098396_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope your feet are faster than your wits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000363b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hope your witnesses are willing to come forward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusB_00022b21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hoped I had heard you correctly. Thank Talos! The Blades will protect "
"Martin until he can claim his throne, don't worry. Or we will die trying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoA4_0002e5cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I hoped you would agree. I think you will be perfect for the task at hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I hoped you would come. Now you shall pay for my brother's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004990b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I imagine it must be good, since it's been in business so long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08StartBattleYes_00082651_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I imagine that we will not have to wait long, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08StartBattleYes_00082652_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I imagine that we will not have to wait long, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b11cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I joined for the parties. And stayed for the parties. Why would I go back to "
"work? That life is for suckers and fools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23MemCave_0001da6d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I just assumed Seridur had a relative that died and is buried there. Not many "
"people go out there anymore, as the route is dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028192_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just can't believe he's dead. He was like a young, beautiful prince. I hope "
"whoever did this can live with themselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just can't sleep. I lie down and close my eyes, but I can't stop thinking "
"about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0001cb7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I just can't wait. This is going to be the greatest fight ever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028244_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't know what to make of Nels anymore. He plays the bumbling "
"drunkard, but he could very well be the killer. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002816f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't know what to think anymore, or who to trust. Neville seems like "
"such a decent man, but how can I know for sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't know what to think. I had my doubts about Nels, and he is still "
"alive. Could it be true? Could he have killed all of them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't know. Is the medicine sustaining Roderick's life, or just "
"postponing his death? How can he survive for so long with a fever so high?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00EmperorResponse_0018b20f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't think about it. The Elder Council will take care of things. "
"Sooner or later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_0002ee70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't trust them. I know they're efficient -- a bit too efficient for "
"my liking. Some endeavors demand time and care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just don't trust those mages. I especially don't trust ones who can play "
"with your mind like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just feel safe living here in Chorrol. I mean, we have the head of the "
"Fighters Guild right here in town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42Calipers_0007322f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I just have to tear apart the boat to get to the hinges."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022f12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I just knew that Julienne would have more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I just know they're dangerous, and they travel in packs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanJar_0001f42d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just learned that a family heirloom, the Axe of Dragol, which one of my "
"stupid relatives lost, is located on Fort Grief Island in Niben Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073028_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I just love talking to you, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000730b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I just thought of something funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008f110_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I just thought you'd like to know, I'm overjoyed to bid you hello."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_000329f4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I just wish his heart was bigger than his hubris."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk4_0006a86f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I just wonder, will this affect the work that's already been done in the "
"field of Illusion? Or jeopardize the new advances in Conjuration?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJauffreHelp_0005d2c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I keep a few things here in my chest to resupply traveling Blades. Help "
"yourself to whatever you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a984c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I keep an eye on his place. Stuffed full of treasure, you know? But no dirty "
"thief's getting in while I'm on duty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I keep hoping that I won't wake up the next time they kill me. But I always "
"do. We will never escape this nightmare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheeseTOPIC_0003e205_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I keep it locked away tight. If I were to try cooking with it, the smell "
"alone would draw rats for miles! It's a lovely conversation piece, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceSent_00033633_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I keep telling them, I can't produce results if I'm not given any time! I'm "
"not used to working under conditions like this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062607_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I keep to myself around here. If you want to join the guild, go find "
"Teekeeus. He's in charge of that sort of stuff here in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086065_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I kept my oath. Mogens Wind-Shifter is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I kept my oath. Mogens Wind-Shifter is dead. Now I return to Castle Leyawiin. "
"Come visit me there some day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_000a4960_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I kept my side of our bargain. Make sure you keep yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I killed a pirate once. Of course the ship was out to sea at the time. "
"Somewhere between Vvardenfell and Solstheim. Now those were the days. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirCaiusTopic_00002d23_Knights_RESP4"
msgid "I killed him in cold blood, with the holy Sword itself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028862_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew Captain Matius would get us through this. He'd be up for a "
"commendation, if anyone were left to issue it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c4cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I knew I could count on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestGreetA_000400e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew I saw the glint of true Mania in your eyes, my child. Go now and let "
"the holy Flame inspire the people of Bliss to new heights of madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003857e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew I'd recognized Raynil! I think when I first met Bradon many many years "
"ago, he introduced me to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061c7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I knew Our Lord would protect us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_00032d43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew a priest named Martin once. I'm sure he's dead, just like the rest of "
"them. They're all dead, don't you understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DavideSurilieTopic_00025888_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew he was the ringleader of the whole conspiracy! You may have helped "
"save my life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001fdb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it! I just knew he's gotten himself in hot water again. Please hurry "
"and get him from that island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridDEMOchoice3_00028a30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it! I knew a man like Bittneld wouldn't be interested in those other "
"women! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002819c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it! It's her! That Dark Elf tramp killed them all! We've got to get "
"out of this place! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting2a_00019fc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it! No one can fool Ra'kheran. I am the wisest here, more wise even "
"than Ciirta. And that is why she must go, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC01Choice3_0003663e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it! That s'wit! Oh, I'll get her. You just wait! Must have taken some "
"fast talking to get her to confess!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06MaikiChoiceB_00012cbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it! You should tell Kaneh what you saw. Maybe you can convince her to "
"change her attack plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d4b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew it. Like I said before, a vampire wouldn't hide in a cabin. It'd be "
"more like a cave or some other dank place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1A_0009078f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I knew of his thirst for vengeance. I could have informed my Listener. But I "
"refused! Refused to reward such incompetence! Ungolim was weak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1B_00090790_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I knew of his thirst for vengeance. I could have informed my Listener. But I "
"refused! Refused to reward such incompetence! Ungolim was weak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1C_00090791_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I knew of his thirst for vengeance. I could have informed my Listener. But I "
"refused! Refused to reward such incompetence! Ungolim was weak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000366cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew one day someone with unyielding virtue would heed my words and speed "
"my release. You risked much to perform such a selfless act."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39MissionChoice1b_00078203_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I knew someone would be able to kill her eventually! Shh. They may be "
"listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05accept_0000a1b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew the Gray Fox could count on you. The staff is in the Archmage's room. "
"He sleeps between one and seven in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053726_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I knew the lure of gold couldn't keep you away long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrushofTruepaintTopic_0001bb33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew the secret of my success would be revealed one day. I can tell you all "
"about the brush if you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a5d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I knew there was a curse on that place which is why I sold it to you so "
"cheap. I suppose I should've warned you, but I had to get out of Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d4a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew they would make contact with you. Be careful, there's no telling what "
"they're up to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I knew this little party was too good to be true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuyChorrol_0004d842_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew you had a good eye for horses! Go out to the stables. Nardhil will "
"have the Chestnut saddled and ready for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice1A_0002f880_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew you wouldn't be able to resist. Your target is a High Elf named "
"Faelian. He lives somewhere in the Imperial City, and fancies long walks. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09AlternateWay_0005377e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I knew you'd make the smarter decision. Good. Here's the key to the chest by "
"my bed. Inside you'll find the amulet Jorundr wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I knew you'd show up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugoTopic_00090b6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know Brugo. Long ago, back before I became 'Sir Mazoga', I split a share or "
"two with Brugo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know Chorrol is the best town I've spent time in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1_00016b6d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know His secret. I have seen His empty throne -- seen it with my own eyes "
"while New Sheoth burned in the grey fires of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00055405_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know I am only a lowly male, but I am at your service. Shall I follow you "
"into battle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00055b04_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know I am only a lowly male, but I am at your service. Shall I follow you "
"into battle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_0003844b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know I may be out of line by saying this, but I think the city guards may "
"be wrong. It's hard to imagine Bradon was a vampire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know I sound desperate, but I know I'm right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034e9a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know I used you in this matter with the Llathasa's bust, but I couldn't be "
"certain that you weren't working with Myvryna."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I know I've lost something. Yes, that's it. I've lost many things in this "
"strange place. Would you please help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046601_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know Kud-Ei will keep her in check. She even has her teaching her spells to "
"other Mages Guild members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028253_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know Primo could be the killer, but I just don't want to believe it's "
"possible. If... if he likes me, he could take me away with him... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know Vilena's got Vitellus on her mind, but she'll spoil Viranus if she "
"keeps him out of the real action."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001d4c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know about Seridur and his \"secret order.\" What better way for a vampire "
"to hide than to pretend he hunts them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f776_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know he did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_000286f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know he's a retired Imperial Legion officer. Apparently, he's been in "
"campaigns all across the Empire, from Skyrim to Morrowind. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002825b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know he's a retired soldier. But not just a soldier -- he was an officer in "
"the Imperial Legion. I hate the Legion and everything it stands for. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_000adc6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know he's gone. As the Chancellor of the Elder Council, my concern now is "
"how to choose his successor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003fd3a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know it's all in my head. I'm spending too much time on my latest project. "
"But enough about me. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQDaedricMagic_0008b606_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know more than I want to about the seductive power of daedric magic. Let's "
"just leave it at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics2_00002c73_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know no more than you. The search for them continues. We must remain true "
"to our purpose and trust the Commander to succeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice3_00026b16_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know of at least one soul it stole. Lenwin. She's the one who found the "
"blasted thing. I suppose you want to hear about the person now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhereAhdarji_0001625c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know of her. What's it worth to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MelusPetiliusTOPIC_00026b48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know of him, but I don't figure I need to tell you about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10FindJakben_00016256_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know of him. Would you... loan me a few coins?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MelusPetiliusTOPIC_00026b47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know of the poor man. Did wonders for folks around here. There was no job "
"too small for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f777_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know she did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00029489_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know someone's been murdered and we're all on edge. Just try to remain "
"calm. I'll get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know that Dovyn Aren is getting up there in years, but he still knows a bit "
"about Alteration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB1_00035c60_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know that daedric cults are not quite the thing socially, but that's just "
"foolish prejudice and superstition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_defaulted_000366be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know that he's defaulted. I need that job done. Don't come back here until "
"you have Brenus Astis' journal in your little hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know that skill with a shield can be invaluable. I don't think I want to "
"join the Fighters Guild to learn, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005d2c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know that you are on an important mission for the Blades. Please, if you "
"need a horse, take mine from the Priory stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479ee_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I know the Khajiit are all upset that the Council took away their land and "
"gave it to us, but they just have to get over it! It's our land, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034244_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I know the part of the sewers you were talking about. Follow me, I'll show "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12JauffreMartin_0007be8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know the risk. I was at Kvatch. But there is no other way. We have no "
"choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor09_0003246c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I know these stars well, and I wonder... which sign marked your birth?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor10_0003246d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I know these stars well, and I wonder... which sign marked your birth?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor11_0003246f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I know these stars well, and I wonder... which sign marked your birth?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f36c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know they're coming. They'll come for you. Like they came for my sister. "
"Put her on the Hill of Suicides."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I know this is all very overwhelming, dear child. Just follow along, and "
"you'll be fine. Now, let's go see what the future holds, shall we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00032b09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know this place ... the prison?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know those sewers well. They will allow you access to the prison, but are "
"home to some fearsome creatures. Tread carefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlenmorilWitches_0003ed3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know very little about them. They operate outside the bounds of normal "
"society."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00055b03_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know we are but lowly males, but we are at your service. Shall we follow "
"you into battle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00079c09_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know we are but lowly males, but we are at your service. Shall we follow "
"you into battle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004423a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know we're not part of Dementia, but I think their new Duke still deserves "
"a toast, don't you? You're buying, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078663_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know what people say about me. I'm not completely stupid, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016480_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know what purpose this Soul Gem is meant to serve. It is meant to house my "
"very own soul, to be absorbed by Mannimarco and increase his power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006051e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know what the next sign is. You'll see it, mark my words. All efforts to "
"save us will fail, because that's how this will all end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Bhisha_00072dba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know what you need. You need a dog. I happen to have one of my old ones "
"still lying around. I'll send it to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fc4a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know what you would ask. You would bring light to that which is in "
"darkness, bring silence to the voices so loud. I know where you must go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch06_0018ad68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know what you're talking about. I don't even try. I just keep going until I "
"drop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know what you're thinking! Gogron, he's too big to be sneaky! Well you're "
"right! Me, I like to just go in and hack my targets to pieces. Ha! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002990_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I know what you've done to free me from this curse. I don't claim to "
"understand why you'd take it on yourself, but I appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053722_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know what you've heard, all about Jorundr and his run-in with the town "
"guard. Well, let's just say it isn't exactly all true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3a56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know when I'm beaten! Here, take the carving, if it means so much to you. I "
"had no idea you would take things so personally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006053e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know where Sheogorath has gone! Of course, I'm not going to tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060528_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know where Sheogorath is. He's hiding in my house. In a cupboard. But he's "
"invisible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000299f_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I know where you may find the Gauntlets of the Crusader, for I was the one "
"who lost them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a8fe_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I know who you are, of course, and it's easy to guess why you're here. You "
"wish to challenge me for my title of Grand Champion, is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_0009354d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know you all expect me to be Emperor. I'll do my best. But this is all new "
"to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08UrsanneAvenged_0001fdbe_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I know you did all you could, and for that, I thank you. Now, please... go in "
"peace. I wish to be alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038af4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know you meant well... and I suppose there was no need to put your life on "
"the line for a stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003337b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know you must have many questions... speak with Farwil and he'll answer "
"them for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_0002888c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know you were supposed to bring the weapons, but it seems you don't have "
"them. Quickly, get those weapons to us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45DarMaUntie_00028751_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I know you'll do your best, but... please... if I don't make it, at least "
"bring the news to my mother, Seed-Neeus, in Chorrol.  Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a848_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know you're busy, but I need a moment of your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG14CamillaTaunts_00085883_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I know you're in here. You can't hide forever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028173_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know you're no killer. That means it's Neville! Oh, I'm so frightened! "
"Please protect me from him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0000c1fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know you're ready! I already approved your match, you idiot! Now get up to "
"that Arena and spill some blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003664a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know you. You freed me. Free my brothers, if they are still enslaved. "
"Together we will cleanse the Shrine of the Underking's foul magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47MageShopTalk_00030132_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I know! You're about to quote Vanto's Third Law... don't worry! I have not "
"actually found a way to violate the Conservation of Perception!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e067_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I know, I get way too fired up over this. It just annoys me that she's in "
"charge of the guild, when she's clearly not fit. That's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001c296_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know, I know! Sometimes I wish we'd run the matches through the night, too! "
"But the Yellow Team needs their beauty sleep! Ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know, Neesha. And I meant no disrespect. It's just that... I hate waiting "
"around like this, watching him suffer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01ErthorTopic_00047468_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know, but he usually stops by once a week or so. I don't recall seeing him "
"lately. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1A_0009078f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know, dear child. I know. You carried out your orders to the letter, in the "
"name of the Black Hand. How could I be anything but happy with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics3_00002c68_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I know. If our hearts remain true, we will prevail against Umaril's evil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32FanaticYell_0001b705_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I laugh at your arrows!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275c1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I lay upon you now the Night Mother's Blessing. May she walk with you always, "
"and guide your hand as you act in accordance with the Five Tenets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c248_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I learned quite a bit about how to use a shield from Ambrose Canne. Cost me a "
"bit, but it was worth it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d48d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I leave the decision up to you. If you want to join up, meet us at the Gweden "
"farmhouse around 11 in the evening. I'll mark it on your map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirStoryCurse_00002b28_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I left the Chapel at once, of course, but the damage was done. I was weak, "
"constantly weary, and lacked the energy to do almost anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000091ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I let that go too cheaply."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like Leyawiin. That Count got you to help me. Damn nice. Both of you. Think "
"I'll stick around. Maybe do some good deeds here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like Skingrad just fine. Folks are a little quiet by Skyrim standards, but "
"they're friendly and loyal when they get to know you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072db7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like Ushnar's dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c213_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like cheese. Not more than sheep, though. I'm not sure about Uuras."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004764a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like cities, and this is the biggest and the best. All races, cultures, "
"cuisines, crafts... the City has them all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like dogs, but it's a bit excessive with those two folks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071fae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like dogs. Dogs are pretty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like eating at the Flowing Bowl. Maenlorn runs a quality inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dc9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like him a lot. He has a great sense of humor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeArrowsMagic_0001f3ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like how magic makes things glow all pretty-like. Light up your foe by "
"sticking a couple of these in him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00023f52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like it here. I really didn't think I would, but Cropsford feels like home "
"now. Thanks for making this possible, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like it here. People are very friendly. Much nicer than in the Imperial "
"City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKELOVE_0006231c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like that! A lot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like the Flowing Bowl. Maenlorn and his brother are excellent hosts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003aa9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like the Two Sisters Lodge, and Mog does a good job running the place. She "
"and her sister are both fine people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c18e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like the West Weald itself, but I'd rather avoid its proprietor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004769f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like the ladies. It's been my weakness. But now I've got Romana, I stay "
"away from the fleshpots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004764c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I like to walk. You can walk for hours in the city. Always something to look "
"at, someone to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like what I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_00061ff3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like you, but not that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIRELIKE_0018b2ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I like you, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071fa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I live to serve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenLichSpeech_0006e7f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I live... again! Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I lived in the Imperial City for a while, but city life just isn't for me. "
"I'm much happier in Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I long for a Colovian Fur Helm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033590_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I long to spill more foul daedra blood this day... for Cheydinhal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I look at you and wonder how you're still alive, considering your utter "
"incompetence as an assassin. With any luck, this contract will be your last."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I look forward to fighting by your side again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c13a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I look forward to fighting these daedra side by side with the Hero of Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029e6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I look forward to our next talk, sir knight. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23MemCave_0001da6d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I looked it up once in an old atlas I had in stock. Here, let me mark it on "
"your map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I lost track of the number of times I looked at the sky, waiting for the "
"world to end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FightersGuildTopic_00062539_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I love being in the guild. There's money to be made. If you'd like to join "
"up, let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I love happy endings!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048912_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I love my work. Fire, frost, shock, poison... little presents for Kynareth's "
"cute little woodland creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice1_0003570e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I love the Fighters Guild, and all its members, perhaps to a fault. I fear my "
"concern for them has made me blind to what's been happening around me. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I love the other Atrabhi! And I certainly wouldn't be happy if you killed "
"her. Really. I wouldn't be happy at all. If she were dead. I swear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice2_00035710_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I love this Guild, and all its members, perhaps to a fault. My concern for "
"them has made me blind to what's been happening around me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem12_00082426_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I love this one. It's a Screaming Maw that can't scream! Isn't that just the "
"Oddest thing you've ever seen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c245_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I love walking by Salmo's place. The smell of her bread baking is amazing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00091b18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I love you, Pyke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00091b8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I love you, Zoe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEHillofSuicidesTopic_0008e55e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I loved her, and then she was gone. By her own hand. It's said any soul on "
"the Hill can be released if their remains are brought to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Crisis_00066edd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I made my way here and began exploring this strange place. As I was passing "
"Fetid Grove, I was waylaid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047740_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I made quite a lot of gold from my last expedition. I bought this house, "
"invested the rest, and now I'm just living the life of the city gentleman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0001e646_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I made you an offer already. Two hundred gold, in exchange for the staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ASyl_00013ffd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I maintain a close watch on her. She fears that Sheogorath no longer favors "
"her presence and wants her replaced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I make all the weapons and armor for the guard. Damn good stuff. Pop you open "
"like a ripe melon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c99b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I make sure my guards treat the local Nords and their ways with respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48IlendSlowDown_00098154_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I managed to escape, but the others are strewn across that bridge. They took "
"Menien off to the big tower. You've got to save him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00089930_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I may have a bit of a proposition for you involving the Jemane family you so "
"recently assisted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053722_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I may have let a \"detail\" or two leak out, to entice someone such as you to "
"assist me. Until you agree to my scheme, I don't want to say more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002879e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I may not have liked the man, but I'm particularly troubled by his death. "
"Neville was a capable fighter. Who could have killed him, and so quickly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d591_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I mean he's really disappeared. No one here has seen him in days. Volanaro "
"thinks maybe a spell backfired."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00092d79_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I mean, look at you! The things you've accomplished! You've obviously proven "
"yourself a valuable member of this Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice2B_000300a2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I merely ask out of concern. If you're a merchant, you should be wary. There "
"have been... problems recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018bc36_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I met him in Hammerfell, but I understand he moved to Cyrodiil a few years "
"back. The Roxey Inn, I think? You should look there for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Beast_0004565f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I might accidentally kill it. If that happens, just bring me another. Once I "
"have it, I'll make sure it's worth your while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37JourneymanSpell_0007b225_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I might as well have given it to you at that price, but it's worth it for my "
"bestiary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0006211d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I might be willing to part with a few things, if the price is right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0007817a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I might eat there, if it were the last food in the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000097b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I might have something for you, but we can't talk about it here. Meet me at "
"the usual place, and at the usual time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I might have something, but I don't know you well enough to trust you'll do "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I might know him. I might not. I don't see how it's any of your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07MasterForger_00015f17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I might know of one. Can you spare a few coins?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhereIsAmusei_00035e97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I might know that, for a price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I might swim more if it weren't for the slaughterfish. Sharp teeth, and some "
"carry disease."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HenantierTopic_00027f37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I miss him so. We were study-mates at the Arcane University and we've come to "
"grow fond of each other over the years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I must admit my curiousity at your endeavor. So many have tried and failed to "
"retrieve the Mace? What makes you think that you will succeed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I must admit, I'm disappointed. This was an important contract, and you "
"stumbled through it like a drunk. Leave me now, and think upon your failure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000545d0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I must apologize. I don't have any more horses to sell. I sold our last Bay "
"horse to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JanusHassildorTopic_00035e5a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I must apologize. It was never the Council's intention to put you in harm's "
"way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must be dreaming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000790a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must be ready to run out at a moment's notice. Can't sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b38_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "I must change into something that suits a knight. Please, excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MustRecoverAmulet_00027746_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I must confess, you are the first person to speak of victory against these "
"daedra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyNord_0009f9bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must confess... that Nord was a disappointment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b39_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "I must gather the equipment I need. I'll return shortly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000297a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I must get out of this pit, and get myself some rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038581_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must go and tell the guard. Please, meet me at Olav's in one hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_00085712_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I must go to the Temple of the One and perform the ceremony to relight the "
"Dragonfires."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c33a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I must hasten to the Count and deliver this immediately. Please, meet me back "
"at the Cheydinhal Bridge Inn in about two hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000093b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must have that Brush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must hurry, excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f02a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I must make my way to The Fringe and capture its destruction on canvas. We "
"can't let history be forgotten."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041094_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I must not be interrupted! My work requires the highest degree of "
"concentration. I hope I won't have to repeat myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e84f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must put this book in a safe place. I have no time to talk now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071f51_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I must return to my task, for Gortwog waits. May you find all that you seek, "
"traveler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32AcolyteWarning_0008fb70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must save my Beloved!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirGreetChoice1_000805ea_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I must say, I enjoy this take-charge attitude. I presume you are the Grand "
"Inquisitor, then? Lady Syl said she'd be appointing someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001647b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I must say, I expected Arch-Mage Traven, rather than his star pupil. I am "
"disappointed to see that he could not face me himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_00015633_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I must say, this is quite a surprise! I certainly didn't expect to see you "
"down here, Nelrene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must see Rythe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelicsMace_00002c62_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I must see the holy Mace for myself. Imagine... the weapon once wielded by "
"Saint Pelinal against Umaril..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00008b80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must speak to my husband first!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c345_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must speak to the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c347_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I must speak to the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003335b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I must surely be dead, and in the halls of Azura to look upon such a vision. "
"You are so beautiful, my dear Dunmer maiden..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice2A_0004f229_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I myself have been here for some time, hoping to find out what's going on. No "
"luck yet, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_0003066e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I myself was able to kill perhaps two score of them, but they just kept "
"coming. Only Bremman and I remain alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00033df6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I myself was training as a Blade when I received the call to serve Talos in a "
"different way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need a bath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018d7d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need a moment of your time. It's urgent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062449_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I need a new Elven cuirass. Nothing fancy, nothing enchanted. Just a decent "
"piece of armor. You get that for me, and I'll train you. That's the deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000452f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need help collecting Swamp Tentacles. I'll even pay you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImpGallTOPIC_0002ee71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need imp gall for my studies. Ten portions of it, in fact. Since I hired "
"the Fighters Guild, I expect you to get it done. And carefully, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkooma_0008f60d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need it. You got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_0002250a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need more time to work on the translation. The more you bother me, the "
"longer it's going to take."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need some time to study the Mysterium Xarxes. I'll let you know when I "
"learn something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ02Skooma_00189180_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I need someone to go in there and put a stop to those fetchers. I don't care "
"what it takes. We must get that poison they're selling off the street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06CastleJobs_0000bf84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need someone to slop food to the prisoners. I'll pay you 2 gold a week, "
"plus half a loaf of bread and a glass of mead each day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireAshTopic_0008d1eb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I need the ashes of a powerful vampire. You have them in your possession. It "
"is good to see that Hindaril has been defeated already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10HelpGF_0001530d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I need the boots of Springheel Jak. He is a famous thief that died some 300 "
"years ago. Legend has it that he was buried with his boots on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028723_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I need to find some real spirits. I think I saw some mead down in the "
"basement. I don't care if it's not safe! It's my nerves! I need to calm down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02JayredSayUnlockGate_0007ec3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need to get in there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16Talk_0004bf9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need to get to the Temple of the One. It's our only chance to stop Mehrunes "
"Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need to head over to Colovian Traders and pick up a few things from Gunder. "
"He's got a nice selection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC_0002428b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need to know why he defaulted on his contract. What have you learned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035587_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need to rest now, regain my strength. Don't forget to take the heart of the "
"Argonian Agent. Present that to Teinaava, and he'll be none the wiser."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Whatnow_00031d28_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I need to stay with the guards. They won't do well without a strong leader. "
"And I can't trust any of them to make it through the city on their own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018d7dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need to talk to you, soldier to soldier. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need you in Leyawiin to take care of that Hist. What is it you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08accept_000146ff_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I need you to acquire Savilla's Stone. It is a large crystal with special "
"properties that I need to gain... advantage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc28_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I need you to check out some people for me, the ones that are following me.  "
"Watch them, see where they go, who they report to. Will you help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e8a7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I need you to come with us. You've got far more combat experience than these "
"men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_000356cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need you to find Ajum-Kajin and bring him back to me. I want to talk to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need you to get down to Leyawiin and infiltrate the Blackwood Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43StaffTalk_0004f8c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need you to get over to the Mages Guild and talk to a good friend of mine, "
"Alvis Uvenim. She's the only one in town that I trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TimeToGo_0002a7dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need you to leave now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TimeToGo_0002a7de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need you to leave so I can lock up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c59f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need your help now. Have you made up your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic_000860b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I need your help. An Orc named Mazoga here claims to be a knight, but will "
"not reveal her business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice4SoWhat_00061c4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need your help. I need you to send my soul away from this world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f792_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I need your help. Please come with us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004992f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I needed some cash, so I went to see Jensine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00064463_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I never believed in the Gray Fox anyway. I think the Imperium just made him "
"up as an excuse to raise our taxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10FinThedretGreeting02a_00002ca3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never doubted you, Crusader. But I must tell the others that you're alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073927_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never had time to properly thank you for your help back in the Imperial "
"City. I wouldn't have made it back here if it weren't for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never really thought about it. They just didn't seem like the sort of folks "
"I wanted to spend time with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB3_0009532a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never said anything about the Mythic Dawn. In fact, I don't even know what "
"you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05WhatDoYouMean_00002c91_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I never saw our work finished;  I trust that the others carried on without me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a944d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never suspected Umbacano might be up to no good. Apparently he was as mad "
"as he was rich!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031606_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never suspected it was Thadon's time, but what's done is done. I honor his "
"choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefendA2_000131b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never suspected that Kaneh had the audacity to try such a risky assault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilB2_0003fbe1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I never thought I would have a chance to redeem myself, waiting helplessly "
"here in eternity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas1_00002c48_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never thought any of us would survive, to be honest. The Aurorans just kept "
"getting back up. It was the Lord Crusader who saved us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12RecoverYes_0001823d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never thought it possible. I mean... I had hoped... but to actually hold it "
"in my hands. It's more beautiful than I imagined it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0ae_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I never thought it would come to this... the Amulet... Martin must use it "
"against Him! We have no choice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12MartinB_000270ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never thought to see a Great Welkynd Stone! As beautiful as all the old "
"tales tell..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactK_00038fb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never thought to see this again. I once possessed it, briefly ... a "
"lifetime ago, it seems now ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas2_00002c44_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never tire of hearing tales of the Crusader's exploits. It's an honor to "
"serve with you, sir knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I never tire of the beauty of Gaiar Alata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never understood Syl's methods. Wouldn't a nice talk and a basket of hot "
"biscuits get her the information she needs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033584_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I never want to see one of those gates again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001da64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I never would have guessed that Roland was a vampire. I could have sworn I "
"saw him walk in daylight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I no longer serve Lady Syl. Crucible has a new ruler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007dbff_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I now declare you Duchess of Mania of the Shivering Isles! May your light "
"shine upon all our happiest days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016ea6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I now declare you Duke of Mania of the Shivering Isles! May your light shine "
"upon all our happiest days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007dbfe_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I now declare you to be Duchess of Dementia of the Shivering Isles! May your "
"wrath and anger be your guide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014440_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I now declare you to be Duke of Dementia of the Shivering Isles! May your "
"wrath and anger be your guide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bee4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I now intend to put your talents to a more direct test. I have a difficult "
"task that you can, perhaps, assist with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000688fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I offer no excuses, sire. But my life is yours. No assassin will take you "
"while I draw breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_000091be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I offer the finest goods and lowest prices in all Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e1f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I offer you a chance for redemption. Do not return until you have 20 bear "
"pelts. Take this time to come to terms with what you've done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PellsGateTOPIC_00026b1f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I offer you a choice, more than I have offered most. Stay here and die, or "
"leave now, and live your life. Speak to me again when your mind is set."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Become_0007893e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I offer you this: remember who it is you're attempting to replace. You'll "
"need to approach them in a manner to which they are not accustomed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081c53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I often wonder what it'd be like, to fall to the ground so far below. I bet "
"it'd be like flying -- then suddenly falling into a deep, blissful sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Spoon_00078639_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I once killed a minotaur with that spoon. It's a mighty daedric artifact!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I once met Herdir after a misunderstanding about some candlesticks in Syl's "
"great hall. He's not a bad fellow, actually. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_000253de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I once saw Lucien deal with an insubordinate Brother, someone who had broken "
"the Tenets. It took me a week to get the blood off my boots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000253e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I once slept in the Chorrol Chapel Undercroft. It's damp, cold... and cursed! "
"Getting Motierre out of there may be a challenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelicsGauntlets_00002c5e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I once went to Stendarr's Chapel to try the Gauntlets for myself. Truly, the "
"Commander is the Divine Crusader come again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I only do the training any more. None of the rigs and tricks. Rochelle and me "
"just want the settled life nowadays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00014709_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I only provide work for less skillful thieves. If you take their jobs, what "
"will they do for a living?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0003d7ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I only serve higher ranking Thieves Guild members. Go see Ongar in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I only wish to return home and be with my wife, Ursanne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000980d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I overheard a guard mention the Countess is looking for a piece to add to her "
"collection of Akaviri artifacts. Our taxpayer's drakes at work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00132a9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I overheard someone say that Aleron Loche is missing. I don't know what "
"happened to him. His wife, Ursanne, is beside herself with grief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00038f1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I overheard that the vampire hunter who was in town was a fake. It was "
"apparently a ruse to get his hands on Bradon's key to a treasure chest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053718_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I owe all of this to that heartless treacherous witch, Arnora."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00090868_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I owe all of this to that heartless treacherous witch, Arnora."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000a223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I owe you a debt of gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005416f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I own the Black Waterside Stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005416e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I own the Black Waterside Stables. Are you shopping for a horse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Diary_0001823b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I paid several scouts to try and find the ruins at Pale Pass before I hired "
"you. They were only able to locate the first of a series of landmarks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandAuthority_0001d4c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I panicked. By the time I awoke, her body was gone. I knew Seridur was a "
"respected member of the community."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Mission_0002af34_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I part with it reluctantly, so guard it well. It is what began my search for "
"the High Fane, many years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_0002acc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I passed her the other day. You wouldn't believe the look she gave me! "
"Whatever happened, she's taking it out on the whole guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d892_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I personally wouldn't go looking for him myself, but you might keep it in "
"mind if you ever run across him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000285ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I picked up \"Frontier, Conquest.\" Haven't read much, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Ushnar_00072dc1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I pity the poor Khajiit that tries to steal dog food from Ushnar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028721_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I plan to gather up every drop of drink in this house and keep it to myself, "
"if things get any worse around here. I find comfort there, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0002573b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I plan to live out my days on the farm in peace and quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061384_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I plan to visit the Imperial City soon to pay my respects at the Temple of "
"the One. They say the Dragon Statue is 100 feet high!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005d50a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I played Lord Vile's game, and lost my soul. Small loss, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas1_00002c47_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I played only a small part. It was the Crusader who won the day for us. It "
"truly seemed that Pelinal Whitestrake had returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031523_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I poured myself some wine and studied the charts I had made until it was time "
"to sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRodericGreetB_00002a9f_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "I pray that I too may be worthy to receive such a divine command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinB1_00082dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I prayed to Akatosh all through that terrible night, but no help came. Only "
"more daedra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11Peaceful_0003858b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I prefer the chance for freedom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049961_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I prefer to just listen to people talk. Some of the conversations they have "
"are truly remarkable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ef2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I prepare the way for my Lord Jyggalag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008d2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I present to you now this key. It unlocks the well behind the Abandoned House "
"above. Use it to gain hidden, quick access to this Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d393_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I present to you now this key. It unlocks the well behind the Abandoned House "
"above. Use it to gain hidden, quick access to this Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003489e_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I present to you now this key. It unlocks the well behind the Abandoned House "
"above. Use it to gain hidden, quick access to this Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f7c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I present to you this dagger. It's an enchanted blade, known as Sufferthorn. "
"Its prick is deadly, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b1253_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I presume you're satisfied with the room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024fd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I presumed it was only a matter of time before you'd be expelled. Once again, "
"I am proven correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146c8_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I promise I'll make this quick. I'd like to have you mostly intact, so "
"Mannimarco can suck the marrow from your bones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ae76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I pulled duty outside the Imperial Libray tonight. Curse my luck. Being that "
"close to the Elder Scrolls gives me the creeps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQDaedricMagic_0008b605_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I put aside the dark arts when I became a priest. But the workings of fate "
"may be seen in this, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS39Seen_0004ed74_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I put the book aside, because frankly, I had so many other delicate "
"experiments going on that I just didn't have the time to go plant hunting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e977_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I put the book aside, because frankly, I had so many other delicate "
"experiments going on that I just didn't have the time to go plant hunting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_00029199_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I ran across a couple of mudcrabs not long ago. Annoying creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I ran across a ghost once. Seemed to suck the energy right out of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_00029195_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I ran into some goblins in the woods not long ago. Nasty little beasts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004763f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I rarely leave the University, as I have all I need right here. If you need "
"ingredients, try Ogier Georick at 'The Main Ingredient.'"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I read \"The Real Barenziah\" recently. Quite a piece of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I read one of Casta Scribonia's books not long ago. Terrible stuff, if you "
"ask me. But, some folks seem to like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049963_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I read the thing once in a while. Mostly, I use it for kindling. There's no "
"telling whether anything in it is actually true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d3a1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I realize he was trying at times, and he spoke before he thought, but he was "
"still my son, and I adored him greatly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002df70_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I realize he's trying at times, and he speaks before he thinks, but he's "
"still my son, and I adore him greatly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ05RaelynntheGravefinder_0018abd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I realize it's in poor taste to celebrate anyone's demise, but Raelynn was "
"evil through-and-through. You've done the right thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopYes_0001e840_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I realize you risked your life to give me a chance, and Thoronir never "
"forgets things like that. Accept this ring as a humble reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e922_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I really can't do anything without 20 more samples of Nirnroot. Come back "
"when you have them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001db16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I really can't help you with anything else. Please, go see Gilen at Seridur's "
"house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d930_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really can't tell you what happened. I'm just lucky to be alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001ad4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really do loathe talking to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_000622fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really don't have time for the likes of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028259_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I really don't know anything about him, so you'd be better off asking someone "
"else.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really don't want you around me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_00091351_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I really hate those things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028796_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I really have to wonder where Neville was when someone was getting "
"slaughtered just a few rooms away. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasC3_0009532f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I really know very little. They contacted me. I suppose they learned that I "
"was looking for the third and fourth volumes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008f10a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really must get back to my paintings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00023cd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I really must thank the one who recommended you -- and the Grey Mare. Always "
"a splendid feast for my spirits. And the food is good, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000452fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I really must thank you. Chapters 23 and 48 of my taxonomy are now complete "
"thanks to your effort. Please, take this as a token of my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really need your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08SavillasStoneTopic_0009838d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really shouldn't be telling you this, but I know you are trustworthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really wish they would stop yelling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c35b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I really wish you had followed my advice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e02_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I recognize this type of parcel. It contains sealed orders. It's addressed to "
"you... from Lucien Lachance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3b_00019fcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I require weapons. For myself and for the Apostles that will help me do the "
"deed. But Ciirta already is suspicious of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008d318_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I return to work, Lord. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d83f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I run the North Country Stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d83e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I run the North Country Stables. Are you interested in a horse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d24c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I rushed into the back garden to find Roland struggling with a woman he'd "
"been courting. I tried to intervene, but he was too strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10AldosTalk_0003c2bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I said move! Or by my ancestors I'll put you on the ground with a split lip!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I said we'd speak later. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinB1_00027102_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I said you weren't going to like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d283_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I salute you for your daring, Hero of Kvatch! You've proven yourself once "
"again here at Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTLOVE_0018b2bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I salute you! Most impressive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008efc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sat here and feasted while others fought. Thus I earned my doom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Agnete out drinking late again last night. It's no wonder they call her "
"\"the Pickled.\" She sure can repair armor, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025241_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw Earana leaving town. She looked very excited."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002d939_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Erthor earlier. Guess someone rescued him again. Hide your scrolls "
"while you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Huurwen practicing shield technique at the Fighters Guild the other "
"day. She could teach me a thing or two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw Irene Metrick recently. She jumped clear over a table at the inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003cd52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Kud-Ei moping around outside the Mages Guild yesterday. In fact, I "
"could swear she was crying. I hope she finds her missing friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Rena Bruiant talking to her dogs the other day. I think she thinks they "
"understand her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025242_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Reynald Jemane's brother earlier. Can't believe they didn't even know "
"about each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Rimalus Bruiant walking his dogs today. And yesterday. And the day "
"before. I swear that's all he does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Rufrius Vinicius knock a man down with one punch. I wish he'd teach me "
"a bit about hand-to-hand combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c232_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Sulinus Vassinus at the Mages Guild conjure up some sort of creature, "
"right there in the street. Guards took care of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003aa9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Ugak gra-Mogakh earlier. At least, I think it was her. Perhaps it was "
"her sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Bhisha_00072dbc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I saw Ushnar try to give Bhisha some of her dog's food once. I told Bhisha "
"not to take it. Ushnar just wanted his dog to attack Bhisha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw Valus Odiil at the Grey Mare again today. Hasn't been the same since "
"his boys took off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a495a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw a big statue of Malacath, west of Fort Sutch, west of the Gold Road to "
"Hammerfell. Looked like Daedra worshippers to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_00029198_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw a mudcrab a couple of days ago. Ugly little animals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw a wraith once. It threw a curse on me I'll never forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000239e0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I saw him in Cheydinhal recently, and said 'Hi,' and he pretended he didn't "
"know me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw him once. Then I didn't. How about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_0002919b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw some mudcrabs by the water recently. I steered clear of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0008e4ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I saw some strangers heading up there earlier. If they're still alive, you "
"can see the Gatekeeper in action. It's glorious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ01Potatoes_001885db_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I saw someone running off to the west, but I'm too frightened to journey into "
"the woods alone. Please... can you help me? I'll pay you well, I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025240_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw that Earana woman hanging around the Mages Guild again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002d927_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw that Erthor is back in town again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c21a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw that Pinarus Inventius was out hunting again. He can shoot a bird on "
"the wing without really trying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Steal_000624f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw that, criminal scum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007d46f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw the Zaxer. And I magged it too. Aw, fribble!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StrangeLights_0000bedb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw them a few nights ago. Very odd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I saw them enter the sump and reservoir. I tried to warn the guards to bar "
"the doors to the reservoir, but I wasn't in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeleneTopic_0000c1e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I saw them haul her off to jail. She was not happy! Ha ha ha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081bf7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I saw who my true enemies were for the first time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ce5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I saw you enter Olav's Tap and Tack before I could get there, and I knew that "
"I had to sneak out of Bruma somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0014684b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I saw your match against the Breton. You're a Hero now! I... I'm still in "
"training, but I'll get there too! Anyway, Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AncotarTopic_000301e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I say live and let live. It was an unfortunate accident, and he helped make "
"it right. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071f4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I scour the land, seeking fortune for Gortwog and Orsinium. Someday all will "
"recognize the true wealth of the Orcs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11TellMe_00038443_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I screamed and ran out into the street. Some city watch were nearby and heard "
"me I suppose, as they arrived quickly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086065_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I searched a long time, and asked everyone, then I finally heard he was "
"hiding at Fisherman's Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001647b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see Bolor was unsuccessful in delaying you. Very well; I shall reanimate "
"him once we are done here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000432b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see Lord Sheogorath chose wisely when he selected you to liberate Xedilian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038af2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see from your expression that you have grave news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038af5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see from your expression that you were successful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000295f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see in you the makings of a grand hero. You've saved our lives. We owe you "
"a debt of thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestofKynareth_00002a58_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I see it on your face; you have failed the test."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040365_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see it's back to the Fringe once again, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see my wife couldn't keep her big mouth shut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04ChoiceCarahilDangerous_0004f226_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I see no reason to shelter you from situations the guild deals with on a "
"daily basis. This is the important work, the work that matters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002ab84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see no reason to talk to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Message_0018bc5a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I see nothing has changed. How... disappointing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_00081adf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see so clearly now, what a fool I have been. A happy, heedless fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002500f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see that you've been suspended from the guild. I've never had to deal with "
"this before, but I do know what you'll need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Cure_0006eab0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see the flask is still empty. Nothing to do now but await my cold, lonely "
"death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice1b_00082090_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I see the vast horizons of thought, while you cannot see past the tip of your "
"own nose. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004798e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see there are too many thieves in the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you are with the Gray Fox. Do you need a fence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d48b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you decided to take us up on our offer. Good. We could use another gal "
"in the gang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42Calipers_00073231_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you found some. Frankly, I could use all of them. Are you willing to "
"sell them? Five gold each, just like I told you next week."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009da09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you got my message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBows_000908de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you have a Black Bow. Would you like to turn it in for the bounty?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a124_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you have been playing rough with the other boys. They are weak and you "
"are strong!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Shadowscale_000251fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you have been speaking with Teinaava. What he says is true. All our "
"lives we have lived together in the shadows. We are egg mates. Twins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHermaeusSpeech_000a948c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you have served my brethren, and now you come to serve me. I am "
"Hermaeus Mora. Past, present, and future are as one to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OgreTeethTOPIC_000b1673_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you have some. I'll buy them in groups of five for 100 gold. Are you "
"selling?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MinotaurHornTOPIC_000b1676_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you have some. I'll buy them in groups of five for 50 gold. Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you haven't yet been able to drop the staff in Darkfathom Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you slept well. Welcome home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice4B_0009079b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I see you still possess the Blade of Woe, the weapon given to you by Lucien "
"Lachance when you first met. Allow me now to unlock its true power!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072e00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you there. What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d489_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you took us up on our offer. Good. I'm glad to see you. Signy will be "
"along shortly. I'm sure we can find something to do while we wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you work with the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c178_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you're a follower of the Gray Fox, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you've accepted the contract from Vicente. Very good. With every life "
"you take, Sithis grows stronger, and the Brotherhood flourishes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00081368_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you've done quite a bit of work to track me down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_00015860_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you've made it even more painful. You do enjoy your work, don't you "
"Herdir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you've returned safely, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ebfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you've returned. How exciting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004b82f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see you've returned. Wonderful. Do you wish to return to your location at "
"the time of the unfortunate...incident?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see you. Hello."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_0018b2ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08MothPriestNote_0001474a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see. I suppose there is no hiding it from you. No hiding. What a joke! My "
"whole life is hiding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderReject_00002b2f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see. I will not be deterred, so I shall remain here in the hopes that you "
"change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinB_0002d074_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see. Let me know if you change your mind. I'm sure I could be helpful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2B_000277aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see. Perhaps it's just as well. The book is best left in secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Choice3B_0009813b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see. Please find me when you do. The Count is eager to receive it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AuthoritySheogoraths_0001356a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see. Sheogorath is too important to come on his own account? He sends his "
"mortal lackey?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogatheOrcTopic_00086070_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see. So an Orc named Mazoga wants to see me? And she expects me to come to "
"her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02PrivateBusiness_000aa090_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see. Strange visitors appearing late at night... happens all the time here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice2B_00034477_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I see. Well, if you see anything around town, let me know. You could be their "
"next victim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Choice2A_0003e950_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I see... Please, wait here one moment. I shall speak with the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002933_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I seek the blessing of Father Akatosh, who knows all things and protects us "
"from the unseen threat. Who better to guide us in these dark days?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002937_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I seek the blessing of Kynareth. Come, pray with me to the Goddess of the "
"Air. Her Wayshrine is up ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04NoBribeBeggar2_0001625b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I seem to have forgotten where she lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1_00016b6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I sense why you have come. I can hear it in your very breath. You came as a "
"herald of the false god Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I sent him on a mission to Forsaken Mine. He and some others were supposed to "
"clear the place of trolls. Haven't heard back from them in days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Choice1A_00028030_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I sent men into the Gate, to see if they could find a way to shut it. They "
"haven't come back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I serve Lucien Lachance and the Dark Brotherhood, and will guide you as "
"directed. But you will get no additional help from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00075048_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I serve Roland now. Please, accept my apologies for my error in judgement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007504c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I serve Roland now. Please, accept my apologies for my error in judgement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a373_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I serve the Lord of Order!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ad8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I served as a Legion Marksman for twenty years. I retired here to Skingrad, "
"work in the vineyards, and supplement my income as an advanced trainer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d0_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I set out to create a way to conquer my failings, but it seems the tables had "
"turned, and they conquered me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_0003066e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I set out with the rest of the Knights to dispatch this blemish on the face "
"of our fine world. When we arrived, we were overwhelmed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_0001e852_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I shall also overlook your... transgression, and send a recommendation to the "
"Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00043e23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall await further summons. No doubt you will have need of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003446a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall await your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenVeryWell_000835fd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I shall await your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally03Tactic3_00017d62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall be an unbreakable wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally03Tactic3_000181cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall be an unbreakable wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030207_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I shall be following out of sight, along with a fellow Battlemage. Make no "
"attempts to speak to us; trust that we will protect you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f220_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I shall be following out of sight, along with a fellow Battlemage. Make no "
"attempts to speak to us; trust that we will protect you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061396_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I shall be happy to impart to you the knowledge I've gained over the years... "
"for a price, of course. I wouldn't have it any other way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11Choice1B_00002dcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall be here when you are ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bda8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall do my best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40JanusDecline_0003ed36_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I shall do what I can in the meantime. Please, excuse me. I have matters to "
"attend to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40JanusDecline_0003ed35_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I shall do what I can in the meantime. Please, excuse me. I have other "
"matters to attend to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_00083f4f_Oblivion_RES"
"P3"
msgid ""
"I shall follow you through Crucible. Speak with the citizens, and ask what "
"they know about this supposed conspiracy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylMuurine_0008136a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I shall have her brought to the torture chamber at once. Meet me there "
"shortly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002c2f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall have your reward soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014ac6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I shall meet you in the Fringe, near the bust of Sheogorath. Now go! Make "
"haste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MannimarcoTopic_00009222_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I shall need to consult the Council as to how to proceed with this situation. "
"Thank you for the information. It may save many lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008675f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I shall never forget the talk we had. Your very presence in the Sanctuary is "
"a blessing from the Dread Father himself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061394_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I shall offer you whatever skill I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DABoethiaSpeech_00051ed7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I shall open a portal for you to one of my realms in Oblivion. Go, and take "
"your place in my Tournament of Ten Bloods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000038b7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I shall pass the news on to the Council. Most troubling, indeed, to know that "
"these are not merely myths."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bda0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall remain here, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_00014676_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I shall return the Helm to a secure place in the tower. It's the least I can "
"do for Irlav. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008d328_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall serve with honor, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bd9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091aab_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I shall tell the master that you were here looking for him. Perhaps I'll "
"bring him your head as an offering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bd96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall wait here for you, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bdbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shall wait here until you return, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I share my good fortunes with the poor and needy. And you ain't neither. Life "
"isn't easy on the waterfront. But we look out for each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004993e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I shopped at Three Brothers a couple of days ago. Not sure which one I talked "
"to, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a391_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I should be the one who is leading, however. Do I have your support?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight3_00002cdb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I should have known I was not alone. I should return to my duties now, but "
"I'll think on what you said. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04FinalNo_0003d4ac_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I should have known after I fenced that stupid ring and discovered it was a "
"fake. Worthless! All part of the guards' plan I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04AmuletGone_0001ee2c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I should have known they could find it. Little can remain hid from a Daedra "
"Lord. I underestimated the enemy. It will not happen again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQLastItem_00026ef7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I should have seen it sooner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I should have stayed in Hammerfell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I should have the final part of the ritual deciphered soon. It's only a "
"matter of time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngryMazoga02_000860e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I should have told you. It was not your fault. An Orc pays her debts. You "
"helped me, so I forgive you. And thank you, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestDoggy_000281a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I should only say this once. I will go away when you hit goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I should probably wash up before heading home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I should speak to someone about the new Gatekeeper. Don't want him killing "
"any of my little ones trying to return to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I should visit Renoit's more often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0003abfa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I should've been with them! It should've been me, not one of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0002573e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I should've been with them! It should've been me, not them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001544a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I should've killed you outright when I had the chance. Well, life is all "
"about second chances, isn't it? I won't waste this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b591_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I shouldn't have pushed so hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009816a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I shouldn't say any more... but you have treated me so well. Perhaps I can "
"trust you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0003d07e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I shouldn't sell it to ya so cheap, but I know you won't ask too many "
"questions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I signed on for the Raven Rock colony. Went there as a builder. Hung around "
"afterwards, but the money ran out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035749_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sing your praises and welcome you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0015974e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sing your praises and welcome you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d930_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "I slept in the woods. I came back in the morning, and Kvatch was gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c238_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I smelled a strange odor coming from the Mages Guild yesterday. Erthor must "
"have been doing another experiment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice3_0002c5bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I snooped around. Apparently, they completed that contract for us. I went in "
"there with twenty good men. I can't believe that bunch finished the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_000976ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I sold you my only copy of Volume Three. Gwinas will be terribly disappointed "
"when he learns it is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1a_00016b6e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I sought Sheogorath. This is His Realm, and I knew that He would protect us. "
"And what did I find? The Throne of Madness -- empty!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025072_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I speak for the Night Mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_00031501_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I spend many a lonely night wishing that the words I speak to it will be "
"heard and not just fall upon the lifeless pigments and canvas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I spent 40 years at the Arcane University. Good years, but I don't miss it. "
"Now I'm completely useless, and proud of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_0002c7bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I spit on them. Mercenaries sent by the Emperor to reclaim territory in Black "
"Marsh. When they failed, they came back and set up shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_00023894_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I spoke to him recently. He really knows his way around. Knows every tree, "
"rock, and cave in the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PinerDEMO1_0002ae2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I spoke to him yesterday. He seems rather concerned about those boys of his."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I spoke with Deetsan at the Mages Guild recently. I've never seen someone so "
"happy about being in the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14EscortWait_000637e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I stand at the ready, sire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14EscortWait_000637e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I stand at the ready, sire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_0005e083_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I stand by all my repair work. I test the blades personally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I stand ready, Lord Crusader. Shall we launch our attack on Garlas Malatar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007a01d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I stand ready, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I steer clear. They're fast creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d930_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I stepped outside, and the whole town was on fire, smoke everywhere. I ran "
"for the gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BernadettePenelesTopic_00025887_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I still can hardly believe she wasn't watching me. But it is a relief to be "
"able to finally stop worrying about her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a25_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I still can't believe what happened at the Chapel. Trevaia, Laralthir, "
"Dumania... all dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000253cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I still don't believe it's real. If it was real, you'd have some sort of "
"proof, right? Well, I don't see any proof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinD1_0009ce83_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I still don't know if there is a divine plan. But I've come to realize that "
"it doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I still don't like you, but you do good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44Supplies_0007876e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I still need the Amulet of Disintegration, the Ring of Desiccation, and, of "
"course, the Calming Pants. Must have the Calming Pants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000133d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I still say steer clear of that door. Nothing good to be found on the other "
"side of it. Of that, I'm certain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13GetOut_00031c87_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I suggest we use the Reman Sweep Formation. You'll assault and we'll guard "
"the rear flank. Onward and upward! Huzzah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2B_0001e85a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suggest you deliver that book as soon as possible. Your recommendation "
"depends on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022e53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suggest you make your way to the Imperial City. Can't make money by "
"standing here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000817bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suggest you petition to see Count Hassildor in Skingrad. He will be "
"interested in your condition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suggest you rest in your room until we arrive back at the Imperial City. "
"Graman should have us underway soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_0003e94c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I suggest you travel there, and seek an audience with him. Given your "
"condition, I believe he may assist you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Ceremony_00014acb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I summon thee, walker in Flesh! Flesh of true Flesh! From those waters of "
"Oblivion which sire thy kind. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I supply many fine city merchants with goods. All sorts of things. Whatever I "
"can buy cheap and sell dear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose Count Hassildor keeps Skingrad running smoothly, but you hardly "
"ever see the man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a5d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "I suppose I assumed you'd be able to lift the curse and be done with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose I can stop to chat with a friend, but I'm really busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JorundrTopic_00053277_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I can trust you with this information. After all, if you can help "
"me recover my stolen gold, you may find yourself earning some of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053718_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I can trust you. In fact, maybe you can help me with a bit of a "
"problem, and make some money for yourself in the process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00090868_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I can trust you. In fact, maybe you can help me with a bit of a "
"problem, and make some money for yourself in the process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose I have a moment. What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrisonVisitor_0018d202_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I have to. Keep your hands to yourself in there. I'll be right next "
"to you the whole time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_0001ceeb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose I like her well enough. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I should be glad the world didn't end. But, in some ways, I wish it "
"had. It would be easier than... this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ASyl_00013a6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I should be grateful working in the palace with her, but I can't "
"stand having to constantly look over my shoulder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003150c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose I should be happy to see you again. I'm not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00159750_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose I should be happy to see you again. I'm not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_000535f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I've got something I could use the Guild's help with, but I don't "
"know you well enough to talk about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I've got something I could use the Guild's help with. I need ogre "
"teeth and minotaur horn for my alchemy experiments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00027f86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose I've got something for you. We need a weapons shipment delivered to "
"Desolate Mine. That's your job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b6a6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I suppose an introduction is in order. I'm Sheogorath, Prince of Madness. And "
"other things. I'm not talking about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoWhatNow_00044f53_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I suppose few really do, but that's beside the point. We're going to give you "
"a taste of where you have found yourself. You're going to learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_0003843a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I suppose if I found out a loved-one was something as horrid as a vampire, "
"I'd find any excuse not to believe it either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049924_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose if you need a shield, that's the place to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KudEiTopic_00027f35_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I suppose if you're interested, you could head over there and ask Kud-Ei "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02reject_00034874_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose it can wait for a while. Let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000377d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suppose thanks are only a small token of my appreciation. Allow me to "
"reward you for your bravery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000620aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose that's a good offer. Very well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_00024229_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose that's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD03Choice3_0002d72c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's it, then. Odd that there weren't creatures around the body, "
"though, and that it hadn't been eaten."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004660c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose that's just the kind of person you want training other mages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose there's no harm in telling you what happened. Word is bound to get "
"around Bruma anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095783_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose there's something I can have you do while you're here, though. A "
"little errand. And a lot of fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose we should get back to my father. Time for me to be a noble again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChoice2_00031520_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suppose you did the best you could, so you should not go unrewarded. Take "
"this gold, and leave me in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09AlreadyDead_00090869_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suppose you expect some sort of a reward? I don't think so. I have some "
"gold tucked away, but we never struck a bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_causingtrouble_000535f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose you got sent down here to stop them. Good. We've tried, but they "
"won't listen. Head over to the Five Claws. You can't miss them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001e071_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose you must decide what to do. Are you going to kill me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060801_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose you think we should celebrate Jyggalag's defeat? The enemy of my "
"enemy and all that? You're wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043017_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose you think you have something important to say? Hurry up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene03aPositive_000980fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suppose you think you know why we've taken over the Bloated Float as well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003359c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I suppose you'll do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suppose you're trying to turn me against Matilde, eh? Make me think she's "
"the killer. I've got news for you friend -- I know it's you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sure am glad I don't live in Leyawiin. Too many foreigners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ef6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sure am glad that other Atrabhi is around! I sure don't want her dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081f15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sure don't like him! No I don't, you fuzzy little sweetiepie!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003a84d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sure don't like the looks of that Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003a850_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sure hope you know what you're doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I sure wish Vitellus hadn't died. That was sure a mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043518_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suspect that the Resonator is affecting the migration patterns of baliwogs, "
"but it's going to take years of study to be sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MartinB_0008b619_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suspect that the secret of how to open a portal to Camoran's Paradise lies "
"within these pages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetC2_00016edd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suspect the traitor Syl. Jyggalag has never had an original thought in his "
"existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetC2_00016d03_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suspect the traitor Thadon. Jyggalag has never had an original thought in "
"his existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I suspect this whole Greymarch fiasco is a cover-up for something more "
"sinister. I can't prove it just yet, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice1B_00022b68_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I suspected Mercator was involved in their cult, but was unwilling to move "
"against him without knowing the identities of his allies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I swear I didn't know that was your pig. Eh? Oh. Sorry, I looked like someone "
"else just then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I swear that Ulrich will pay for this. We must handle this carefully and "
"prove to the Count that he needs to be arrested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0000bcd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I swear that when I passed by Benirus Manor last night, I heard someone "
"scream from inside. Velwyn Benirus will never sell that deathtrap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I swear to you, my friend, if anyone tries to harm that sweet girl I will "
"tear them limb from limb! Whoever killed the others will strike again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00080d43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I swear, I know nothing about a conspiracy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Minx02Negative_0001525a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I swear, you will not get past me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I take care of what little administrative work there is. Dagail isn't "
"interested. I do it because it has to be done, and no one else wants to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I take it you want something. Well, what is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002db91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I take it you've spoken to Dagail? Then you know she is not well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00027989_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I take much joy in giving you this contract. With so many targets come so "
"many opportunities to fail. The chance of you surviving is slim at best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_0004890a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I take my duties as chapter head very seriously... unlike SOME guild mages. "
"It infuriates me how casual some guild heads are about common civility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Invisible_0018541e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I take no responsibility for your stupidity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a19_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I talked to a traveling merchant the other day. He told me that there's been "
"some folks wandering around the old Priory of the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d6e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I tell you what. I have some outstanding debts I need to pay off. You help me "
"out with that, and I'll help you out with getting Erthor back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I tell you, we can't expect much from people who have to murder each other to "
"get into power. Not very civilized, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00068345_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thank you again for speaking with me, my lord. I'll leave you alone now. I "
"know you're very busy. Until next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC1_000a6582_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I thank you again for your efforts. I have one final task for you, if you are "
"still willing to face danger on my behalf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC2_000a6584_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I thank you again for your efforts. I have one final task for you, if you are "
"still willing to face danger on my behalf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_000700be_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I thank you for completing the task I set about to do long ago. His unholy "
"craft will no longer threaten the citizens of Anvil. Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BaurusTopic_0006b838_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I thank you for recovering his sword. I will set it in a place of honor in "
"the Great Hall of Cloud Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MucianusAliasTopic_00095a69_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I thank you for trying to save him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22HighFane_0002c819_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your efforts, but I am sure you understand that I cannot pay "
"you for a task that you did not complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_0001a39a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your help in killing her. Now, I can lead my people towards "
"the light. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c351_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your help. I'm sure your conscience weighed heavily upon you "
"as you led Ulrich to his death. You did the right thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13SignetRing_000335aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your sympathy. You're truly a noble individual. Were you able "
"to retrieve anything from him before Oblivion took him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13SignetRing_000335ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your sympathy. You're truly a noble individual. Were you able "
"to retrieve anything from him before Oblivion took him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_00017d84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your trust. In your name and for the sake of the Shivering "
"Isles, I shall not disappoint you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_000181c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thank you for your trust. In your name and for the sake of the Shivering "
"Isles, I shall not disappoint you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038b08_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I thank you from the bottom of my heart. I hope that the amulet helps keep "
"you safe on whatever roads you may travel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13SignetYes_000335ad_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I thank you on behalf of all the citizens of Cheydinhal. May Arkay guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000366cb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I thank you with all my heart. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChoice1_00031510_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I therefore can only reward you with this gold, and hopefully you will learn "
"to be more careful with your accusations in the future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c22f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think Adrienne Berene is the ranking mage at the Mages Guild in town. "
"Typical snooty mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c250_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think Bernadette Peneles seems like a nice woman. I know she works "
"tirelessly over at the Tamika Vineyards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028d87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think Glarthir is having one of his bad spells lately, have you noticed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_0003d083_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think I can move this item for ya at that price. Got anything else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004600b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think I hear milady calling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b2fc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think I heard that he'd retired, and was living out his days at the old "
"Roxey Inn here in Cyrodiil. You might try there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000980c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I know why you're here, but I'd speak to my herald, Tolgan, first. I "
"believe he has something for you. Then return to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00022b3f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think I may have figured out the hidden message in Mankar Camoran's books! "
"Do you have the third and fourth volumes with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think I need something to drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da5a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think I overheard him once mention Memorial Cave to another patron of mine, "
"but he never talked to me about it directly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneBook_00022e64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I saw a copy last time I was at The First Edition Bookshop in the "
"Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFindGrayFox_0001e091_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think I trust you enough to tell you this secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022ceb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think I'd better be the one to handle the meeting. You'll be my backup. "
"Keep watch from above in case of trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c19e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I'd rather take my chances with a disease than have that man try to "
"heal me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047749_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I'll do just fine. I'm a natural. Finder's keepers, right? And I'm a "
"pretty good finder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e933_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think I'll have to refer you to Sinderion. He's a fantastic alchemist in "
"Skingrad who specializes in this sort of thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice5C_00085865_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think I'll head down to the basement and get something to eat. I think "
"there's some cheese down there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0007eaa9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I'll stay here for awhile. Someone has to run this town. I'm "
"certainly the best qualified."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033561_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I'll study this shrine a bit longer. You can make your way out here. "
"I thank you again for your help. Please, take this token of my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I'm close to deciphering more of the ritual. I hope to have made some "
"progress by the time you return with a daedric artifact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think I'm ready for this, but I worry about Antus. He's never seen a fight "
"like this before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4283_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think Leyawiin would be better off if we removed all the dirty Argonians "
"such as yourself. You wouldn't have a problem with that, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286dd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think Nels drinks to forget, maybe about some tragedy in his life. He plays "
"the buffoon, but I sense a deep sadness in him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think Oreyn is planning to send Viranus out on the Blankenmarch contract. "
"I'm betting Vilena is not happy about it... if she knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think Rena Bruiant may actually love dogs more than her husband. Strange "
"couple, those two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_0002acc9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think Teekeeus was the one who finally blew the whistle on her. That'd be "
"just like him too; always playing by the rules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e973_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think Tertia Viducia has a good supply of light armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004657c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think all Bogrum gro-Galash cares about is the Lonely Suitor Lodge. He "
"really puts everything into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think he even scared away the last Associate who came here for training. "
"What was his name again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_00034066_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think he was in the Chapel praying. I haven't seen him since they attacked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC2_000366c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think he's around here somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003e2af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think he's just playing around. I don't think he means anything by it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02SpeakToJauffre_000aa08e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think he's sleeping. But it must be important... go ahead upstairs and wake "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479dd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think he's wrong. I KNOW Argonians can kick Khajiit butt. Any time. Any "
"where. And you can tell everyone I said so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479dc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think he's wrong. I KNOW Khajiit can kick Argonian butt. Any time. Any "
"where. And you can tell everyone I said so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e920_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think if I'm to create a strong version of the Elixir, I'm going to need an "
"even greater number of Nirnroot samples than before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031ebe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think if you'd had the chance to speak to any of the knights, they were "
"happy to follow Farwil into battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c0a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think it says something about Ocheeva's faith in your abilities when she "
"gives you a contract to kill someone who isn't even conscious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think it's a disgrace that Argonians can swagger around Leyawiin, boasting "
"how they whupped this Khajitt silly, and beat that Khajjit to a pulp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think it's a disgrace that Khajjit can swagger around Leyawiin, boasting "
"how they whupped this Argonian silly, and beat that Argonian to a pulp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think it's a shame how they took that land from Elsweyr, and Argonians are "
"afraid it could happen to them, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02GiveItem_000165f3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think its time to promote you to Footpad. Congratulations on your new guild "
"rank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d6c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think maybe he's been following me.  I see him every morning on my way to "
"Chapel.  I've tried to say hello but he always pretends not to hear me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think others have sometimes spoken to me, others like you, but my memory is "
"doubtful. Perhaps the others came after you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think perhaps you should speak to Deetsan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028a03_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think poor Primo was tricked, just like the rest of us. If we're not "
"careful we'll end up dead too. You mark my words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006233d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think she's living in Bravil these days. You should look for her there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003fd3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think someone is watching me. I see figures in the shadows all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem9_0008242d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think something's missing from this shelf. Or it could be just my old brain "
"playing tricks on me again. Oh well, let's continue the tour, shall we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think that I would like to be tortured. Perhaps I should go see Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f772_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think that was all of them. Let me take a look around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003661a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think that'll be all of them. Can't imagine more in this area. You can go "
"tell Arvena this is all taken care of. Good hunting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062680_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think the rumors about Necromancers are completely untrue. I've heard some "
"crazy things, and I don't believe any of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014486_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think there's more to it than that. And I see that I'm going to have to "
"persuade you to be honest with me. How delightful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0007817f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think they've lived in the wild for too long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberOneGnarl04_0007300a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think this place got to him... perhaps we should leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaF1_000a5608_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I think we could all sleep better if you brought him Lindai's crown instead "
"of the Crown of Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009098e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think we should find your friend Jauffre at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028750_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think we should get out of here, quick!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46AloysStart_000343b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think we should just pack up and go home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003a84b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think we'd better get that Gate closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think we're in for some hard times. The death of Uriel Septim and his heirs "
"changes everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think you may be just the kind of person we're looking for. Perhaps you can "
"assist us with a problem we're having here in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_00025307_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think you should leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061398_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think you still need to do some exploring before you're ready to learn "
"more. Discover a few new places on your own, then come see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0018d83b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think you'd better leave here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034242_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I think you're onto something with those books. You should finish tracking "
"them all down, and then we'll see what we've got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PasswallTopic_0001ec13_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I think... I think it might be... sadness? Why would its destruction make me "
"sad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002443b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I think... I think we got them all. We're safe, for now. We'd best return to "
"town while we can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I think... I'll just rest my eyes for a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeleneTopic_0000c1e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought I heard an Imperial woman's voice while I was blindfolded. Other "
"than that, I don't know much more about her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought I heard something the other night. It's none of my business, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Noticed_0018d81e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I thought I heard something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ffb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought I made it perfectly clear. I'm not interested in whatever you are "
"selling, so if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought I'd won. But I should have known. The Slavemasters are a cunning "
"breed. Umaril found a way to cheat death, as I could not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I thought about it when I was younger, but it just wasn't for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000479aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought about joining the Mages Guild, but that Falcar fellow was very "
"intimidating. I ended up changing my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000295e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought for sure that we would meet the same end as our comrades in Anvil. "
"Thank you, Sir Knight. We are in your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b1243_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought it was pretty clear that you need money to rent a room. Come back "
"when you have some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_00033636_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I thought it would've died down by now, what with the ban on the practice of "
"Necromancy in the guild being in place for as long as it has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e8b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I thought so. A few rats and goblins won't give you any trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice4a_00082095_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought so. You are a coward, as well as a bigot, and we will speak no more "
"of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005374d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I thought that I was perfectly clear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I thought they were related to the Grummites."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b4c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I thought we had more time. I thought we had a chance. My plan has failed. "
"And we were so close...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I thought we were all doomed for a while there. I carved my last will and "
"testament, but I won't say where."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ac69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I thought we were done speaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice1A_00035f45_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I thought you might need a break, after the things you've been exposed to "
"lately. You can find Irlav here in the Arch Mage's Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice1A_00032ad6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I thought you might need a break, after the things you've been exposed to "
"lately. You can find Irlav in the Arch Mage's Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c248_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"I tire of the self-styled heroes who set themselves in my path, only to prove "
"unworthy in the event."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09SoIHear_00053778_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I told her she was crazy, but she insisted. Women have a way of getting men "
"to do what they want. So we did it. We ambushed the shipment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I told him that trying to travel into one's own dreams is risky. But as "
"usual, he didn't listen to me. Always has to do things his way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001f42a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I told him to stop, but he didn't listen. He was certain he could win us a "
"fortune and move us somewhere nicer, like the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02PirateConvo_000493b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I told you a million times, that wasn't my fault! The wheel was covered with "
"gull droppings! My hand slipped! Could've happened to anyone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugoTopic_000908d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I told you all I'm going to tell you. You want Brugo, you're on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001ce02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I told you he wouldn't cooperate. Your best bet is to shadow him and see "
"where he goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000301da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you not to come back here, and I meant it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006233c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you not to drop your shield! We're done here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000921_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I told you not to speak to me in public! We'll meet tonight, at the place we "
"discussed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00022dac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you to come alone! Brothers, kill them!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000178c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you to keep out of our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003002f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you to leave me alone! Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022b19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you to stay back and keep an eye on the guy who was watching me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0000abb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you to stay with the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00053713_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you to stay with the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022b5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I told you, I'm done with those books. I'm sorry I ever got mixed up with "
"those maniacs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013ff0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I told you. I'm not hiding anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Passwall_0008e503_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I took over the inn when I got here. There wasn't anyone living here. Except "
"for Shelden. He says he's Mayor. Don't believe it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSwordTopic_00002bf1_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I took the Sword down with me into evil. You have redeemed us both. The gods "
"smile on such deeds, noble knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG07ChoiceKaltharWhy_0003378f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I took the other one, and that should've been enough. I shouldn't have to go "
"through all this, just to get rid of her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b16_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I tried for hours. Until my whole body ached, and I could barely move. I lay "
"there on the floor next to them, weeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000ace6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I tried the chapels. They're a waste of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000452eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I tried to tidy up for Mirili, but she just shooed me away. Then she had the "
"nerve to ask for my help fetching things for her research. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_00014676_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I tried to warn him. I tried to tell him it was a mistake to leave with the "
"Helm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcConversation_0007eacb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I tried to warn them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreeting2_00002ad1_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I tried, but I could not pass the test. My faith was weak. Or perhaps "
"Zenithar decided that it was not I who should carry the mace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_0002a68a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I trust that as a member of the Guild, you would do the right thing and "
"acquire this text before Earana does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018231_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I trust that the stipend Tolgan gave you whetted your appetite?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_000a9347_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I trust that you will be able to remain professional?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07Spies_00039302_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I trust that you'll handle things ... appropriately. The less I know about "
"it, the better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b983e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I trust the room is satisfactory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c346_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I trust there were no run-ins with the guards in the barracks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004a98a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I trust you have good reason for interrupting me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00054cc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I trust you have reconsidered your position. Are you now ready to help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I trust you've had time to get settled? The contract is available whenever "
"you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba5e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I try and I try, and it just doesn't matter. It makes me furious sometimes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00083f63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I try not to burden myself with news of the current goings-on. It gets to be "
"rather distasteful at times. Don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078172_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I try not to buy anything from the Demented, especially weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004992a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I try not to eat there. At least since the last time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003dfbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I try not to talk to him. I don't have that kind of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I turned up copies of the first two volumes from my colleagues, and I spent a "
"little time rereading them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand Areldil is good at getting into places other people can't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Bumph gra-Gash trains other Fighters Guild members on the proper "
"use of heavy armors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Carahil knows more about Illusion than any other mage in Anvil. "
"Of course, she only shares that knowledge with the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_000c4542_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Daedra worship has become increasingly prevalent in the "
"Summerset Isle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046624_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Delphine Jend has some other mages worried. She's skilled, but a "
"bit unpredictable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044235_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Dementia has a new leader. Not my area of interest, honestly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e979_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Hil the Tall will teach Alteration to anyone willing to pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand Hirrus Clutumnus is begging for people to kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Ida Vlinorman enjoys jumping off high things. Like buildings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand Mandil has some rather nimble fingers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand Mania has a new leader. Not my area of interest, honestly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_0004658a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Marz wants to return to Black Marsh. She only stays because she "
"feels needed here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047420_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Oreyn is looking for you again. Get to Chorrol and speak with "
"the man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Tadrose Helas has more jobs than she knows what to do with. "
"She's very eager to help out her guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003e2b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand Vashanti has some problems with the skooma. That can't be good "
"for her fighters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD01Choice2_0002ae30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand about duty. Don't get me wrong. Should've been more than one guy "
"on this job, and I've got my family to think about. They come first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082612_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand he has light fingers and deep pockets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dc9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand he is an extremely upright citizen. As good as they come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008260f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand he lives with Zoe Malene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JanusHassildorTopic_0000399a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand he specifically asked that you be the one to see him. Rather "
"unlike him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand he'll teach light armor skills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand he'll teach others to pick locks. If everyone knew how, we "
"wouldn't have to carry around so many keys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand he's good, but you have to be a member of the Fighters Guild for "
"him to train you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004662e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand he's willing to train others, but it can cost more than a few "
"gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e988_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand her parents are against her competing. Quite a shame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049916_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand money is tight, but buying discount spells seems like a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10JyggalagTopic_00091481_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand my Lord has told you what is to come. It is one of the Great "
"Mysteries of the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand none of the merchants of Crucible are having problems with "
"Brithaur. He's their favorite guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand old Dovyn Aren can still teach a bit about Alteration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082622_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand she'll pay for a \"cure\" for her malady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_00077d09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand strange creatures have appeared around them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062689_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that Dagail is in much better control of her faculties now that "
"Kalthar's plot has been exposed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand that Fathis Aren is quite the conjurer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that Kud-Ei takes good care of her sisters in the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that Othrelos isn't a bad man to talk to, if you need to learn "
"how not to be seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e2a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that S'drassa is still trying to create a potion to cure skooma "
"addiction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that Vigdis at the Fighters Guild has some skill with blunt "
"weapons. He's been training other Fighters Guild members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004996e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that Vinicia takes a lot of complaints, but nothing ever comes "
"of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand that cold doesn't bother them much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaTopic_0001a399_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that she is no longer with us. The apostles will need another to "
"lead them to the light. Now is my chance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002c5a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that the Blackwood Company works cheaper than the Fighters "
"Guild. And they'll do any job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077d06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand that the Hearts of Order you find on the Knights can be used to "
"unlock special chests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061434_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand the Fighters Guild is hiring new members. Not bad work for some "
"folks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand the Fighters Guild is looking for new members. Seems a bit odd, "
"but that's what I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand the decision that you have made. And I accept my fate. Now "
"please leave me to my thoughts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand the merchants of Crucible are having problems with Brithaur."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand there's a Knight of the Thorn in Hale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand there's a new Gatekeeper. Rebuilt much faster this time around, "
"unless I'm mistaken. And I never am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077d01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand there's been strange activity near the obelisks around the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_00077d0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand they're coming from the obelisks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand they've been taking a lot of the contracts that used to go to "
"the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00035678_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I understand this may not seem the most important of tasks, but still... it "
"needs doing, and you are one of the few available to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_0002a689_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand you have spoken with her. As you are new to the guild, I will "
"not hold this against you, but I warn you to be wary of her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e94b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand you're looking for a cure for vampirism."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40RewardGold_000a3df6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I understand. Accept this knowing that you have my thanks. And farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderReject_00002b34_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand. I can only hope that one day, you will judge me to be worthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11Reject_0001fb63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand. I don't want anyone taking on this job unless they feel up to "
"it. Return to me when you are more confident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderReject_00002b30_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I understand. I'm not ready yet. But I won't give up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Decline_0004f8c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand. No need to jump headlong into a dangerous situation. But do "
"hurry. I can only keep it a secret for so long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseTooMuchCheydinhal_0004f011_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand. The Cheydinhal Black horse is only for the most discriminating "
"of customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HelpNo_0003d30f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I understand. Well, if it's all the same to you, please don't tell anyone "
"about Gogan's indiscretion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilD2_0003fbe4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I understand. Why would you trust me? But you have no choice. I am the only "
"one who can help you escape this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008efc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I used my piety to avoid joining the defense. Thus I earned my doom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000297c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I used to admire you. But it turns out you're just a sinner like all the rest "
"of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026add_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I used to be a dog. I got better. Not a better dog, though. I'm a terrible "
"dog now. Tomorrow...who knows? Ravel may know. Talk to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I used to be a knacker. That's how I fancy my horses. Ripe, stiff and silent. "
"Hate it when they stare at me. Dumb beasts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I used to be a priest of the Tribunal Temple in Kragenmoor. After the "
"collapse, I drifted for a while, until I joined the Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I used to have a Great Torch. Where did I put it? That one is relit, which is "
"a good thing. Mine's still missing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a87_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I used to think he was crazy, but now he seems to be making some kind of "
"sense. I hope that doesn't mean I'm going crazy now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000297b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I used to think you were a hero. A holy knight and all that. I guess I should "
"have known better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I walk right past them. They're slow creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPilgrimageTopic_00002a9d_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I walk the Pilgrim's Way, as did the questing knights of old. I would be glad "
"of your company on the road, if your way lies with mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0008e4c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I want him dead. I need him dead! His bones are calling to me. Rumor has it "
"you want him dead, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RebuildGatekeeper_00014ae8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I want him there guarding those Gates. If any of Jyggalag's forces show up, "
"he should be ready for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaTalk02_0008656e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I want to go to Fisherman's Rock. Where's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I want to train my armoring skill, I go to Bravil. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37SdrassaHelp_00022e5f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I want you to bring to me as many of Garridan's Tears as you can find. If you "
"do, I will pay you a fair bounty in gold for each one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I want you to get back to Water's Edge. Make sure the Blackwood Company "
"hasn't forced those residents out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_infiltrate_000356eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I want you to get to Leyawiin and join the Blackwood Company. Find the secret "
"of their success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000a3453_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I want you to go back there. Make sure the Company hasn't ousted the "
"residents. Lay low. I don't want them finding you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I want you to go check it out. I don't need to tell you how sensitive a "
"matter this is. Get moving, and report back to me as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_000356df_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I want you to go there and capture Ajum-Kajin, one of their leaders. Bring "
"him back to me. I'd like to spend some time... talking to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_00003932_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I want you to lay low for a while. Talk to Azzan or gro-Khash. Let me deal "
"with Vilena. You've still got a career ahead of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I want you to lay low for a while. Talk to Azzan or gro-Khash. Let me deal "
"with Vilena. You've still got a career ahead of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002f9e3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I want you to lay low for a while. Talk to Azzan or gro-Khash. Let me deal "
"with Vilena. You've still got a career ahead of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASanguineSpeech_000b121e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I want you to liven it up. Use this spell on the Countess and her guests. I "
"think it will make the party much more interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistTreeTopic_00035701_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I want you to take this. May it serve you well. Now, you should tell Vilena "
"Donton what has happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wanted to get a little practice in with my sword, so I headed to the "
"Fighters Guild. Turns out you have to be a member to train there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03GroveofTrials_00002be6_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I warn you that it is unwise to take anyone with you. You should go there "
"alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028865_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I warn you though, what we've seen so far is nothing compared to the battle "
"that likely awaits us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005376f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I warn you... don't cross me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_000175c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I warned you to leave, and you didn't listen. Brethren! Help me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenRenote_0000b227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I warned you to stay out of our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a360_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I warned you! I'll call the guard if you don't leave!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a34c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I warned you! Now the guards will arrest you for trespassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I warned you! You'll be arrested for trespassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09GhostA_00036665_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was Alain, loyal Blade of Emperor Tiber Septim. I do not know how long I "
"have been dead. It feels like an eternity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09GhostA_00036663_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was Casnar, loyal Blade of Emperor Tiber Septim. I do not know how long I "
"have been dead. It feels like an eternity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09GhostA_00036662_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was Rielus, loyal Blade of Emperor Tiber Septim. I do not know how long I "
"have been dead. It feels like an eternity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09GhostA_00036664_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was Valdemar, loyal Blade of Emperor Tiber Septim. I do not know how long I "
"have been dead. It feels like an eternity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Crisis_00066edd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was a Knight of the Thorn from Cyrodiil. As soon as I heard the gates to "
"the Shivering Isles opened, I knew a threat was lurking inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002f1ef_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I was a little ashamed afterwards, but didn't know how to apologize or give "
"it back. I wish I could..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43StaffTalk_0004f8c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was able to get a message to her earlier, but I've yet to get a reply. If I "
"go, then the scamps will follow and my secret will be revealed to all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005a02a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was afraid we were gonna be ordered in there. Legion always ends up doing "
"everybody's dirty work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f8bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was afraid you wouldn't come back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005dd10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was always perfectly loyal to the old Duchess. As I am to the new Duke, "
"whoever it may be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting01_00002ad9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was arrogant and foolhardy. I sought personal glory. I placed my own will "
"and my own lust for fame over the will of the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00037ce4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was at Olav's earlier and I ran into this Dunmer named Raynil Dralas. After "
"a round or two, he told me he was an honest-to-goodness vampire hunter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC2_0003fbe0_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I was at the sack of Kvatch. They had no chance. We took them by surprise, "
"and we carried the walls in the first assault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_0001bcc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was careless to leave my art supplies around the castle like I did. I "
"suppose I was easy to discover."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was certain that no one could survive the spire's collapse, but here you "
"are! By the Staff, you are more than worthy to lead us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Ask_00066f2b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was collecting their scales, see. I had a contract with this young "
"alchemist. You wouldn't believe what he was paying for those scales!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a95c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was doing some research in Bramblepoint Cave, and suddenly I was attacked. "
"I grabbed everything I could and ran, but I fear I dropped my notes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031522_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was elsewhere at the time of the robbery, and the chamber was locked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000285b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was given \"The Legendary Scourge.\" I don't know what to think about it "
"yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was half expecting you not to show up. Are you ready to go to the manor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c2a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I was honored to be of assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c2d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I was honored to be of assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStopFollow_00002c32_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I was honored to be of assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c148_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was honored to fight by your side again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was hoping Vicente would give you this contract. When you are captured and "
"killed, the assignment will go to someone more competent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a958_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was hoping if someone came across my notes in that cave, they'd take the "
"time to read them and trace me back to the Imperial Bridge Inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_00045767_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was hoping you'd say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002951_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was imprisoned within Fort Bulwark. When you cleansed the fort of those who "
"sought to steal the Shield, I was able to escape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003827f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was in Cheydinhal last week, and I'm sure I saw Reynald Jemane. He acted "
"like he didn't know me, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d930_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I was in my basement. Suddenly there was a lot of noise and heat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Thief_0001bb32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was in my studio, when a Bosmer wearing dark clothing accosted me. Before I "
"could call for help, he knocked me unconscious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was in the Legion for a great many years, my friend. I saw a lot of "
"horrible things, including the murders of children."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047695_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was in the Thieves Guild. But I'm out now. I retired. Too old for that "
"foolishness. I don't keep up contacts. You get out? You stay out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04WeynonAttack_0001ee28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was in the sheepfold when they attacked. I heard the Prior talking to "
"someone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was in there just a few days ago. Rasheda's prices are very reasonable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028268_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was just beginning to think I had something in common with the other "
"guests. And then you showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000aa08c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I was just here reading the Black Horse Courier about the assassination, and "
"looking through 'A Short Life'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadAvita1_00002cf5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was just thinking about Sir Avita. Sometimes I forget she's gone, and wait "
"to hear her laugh from across the Priory... then I remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadGukimir1_00002cf2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was just thinking about my brother...Gukimir...  sometimes I still can't "
"believe he's dead. I miss him. He was my brother, and my best friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000aa08b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I was just writing a letter to my mother. She's quite upset by the "
"assassinations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWait_0006b1b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was looking forward to reaching Cloud Ruler Temple. Don't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I was lucky. I survived. My friends weren't so lucky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09PleaseGoOn_00053725_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was mortified. We snatched up the gold and holed up in the mountains. He "
"said if I breathed a word of the murder to anyone, he'd kill me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008f10b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was never good at saying goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandSad_0001d4c6_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I was no equal to Seridur. He knocked me down in one quick movement. As I "
"lost consciousness, I saw him laugh and then run away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09PleaseGoOn_00053725_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I was off gathering food, but Jorundr was captured. Served him right. When I "
"went back to the site later, the gold was gone! He'd moved it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was once in Syl's interrogation cell. I counted 35 dead rats in there. Of "
"course, I had to kill a couple to get the count that high."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035d8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was once the man known as Grantham Blakeley. Look for me in the mouth of "
"the panther. Please... release me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC1_0003fbde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was one of Mankar Camoran's chief lieutenants. I helped plan the Emperor's "
"assassination. I opened the Great Gate at Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_00017789_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was only a boy when the soldiers came. We hid, vowed revenge. But the Deep "
"Ones never came back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EyjaTopic_000b97e5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was orphaned when I was young, and don't even remember who my parents were. "
"I'm not really sad about it; it was so long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028cd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was positive he was the killer until you opened your mouth. Now I'm not so "
"sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was praying for your swift return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was praying for your swift return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000239e0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I was quite irritated, and haven't spoken to him since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was right about him! He's been doing it, he's the killer! My friend... you "
"and I have to end this. We must kill Nels before he kills us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was right there. You could have just walked over to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I was sitting in The Flowing Bowl, when the most fetching Nord woman you've "
"ever seen walked in with an equally attractive Imperial woman following."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC2_0003fbe0_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I was slain after the battle was over. Three townsfolk hiding in a cellar "
"attacked me when I entered their house, hunting down survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireVicente_000251fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was stricken with vampirism three-hundred years ago, while on an expedition "
"deep into the Ashlands of Vvardenfell. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ToutiusSextiusTopic_00025b38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was sure he was part of the conspiracy. Sure of it. I guess it just goes to "
"show ... well, we'll see what it goes to show, won't we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09PleaseGoOn_00053725_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I was terrified of him at this point. Two days later, the Bruma City Guard "
"traced us to our makeshift campsite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028715_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was thinking, maybe Nels found the chest of gold, and one of the others "
"killed him for it! We've got to be careful, my friend, or we could be next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReynaldJemaneTopic_00023e83_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I was told that my mother and brother never survived! This is amazing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0f6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was too afraid. I just couldn't move. I could hear the screaming, but I "
"just couldn't move!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002f1ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I was trying to tell her how I feel.... again... and she wouldn't even stop "
"to talk to me. I just got so angry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004b7b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was walking past Rosentia Gallenus' home the other day, and I heard these "
"strange animal noises or something from inside... very odd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048904_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was with the Count when he was young, and a shining star on the tournament "
"path. I only wish he'd straighten his son out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00034821_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I was with the Countess all evening. Didn't see a thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was wondering when you'd get to me. I have to give you some credit. You had "
"me fooled. You made me trust you, which is not an easy thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028702_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I was wrong! Don't you see? I thought Neville was trying to catch the killer! "
"But he IS the killer! We need to find a way out of here! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d4c1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wasn't aware he had a cabin outside of the city. Perhaps that's where he "
"lures his victims. Be careful, he may have others with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00006924_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wasn't far off. In any case, rats and goblins won't give you any trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bafd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I welcome a friendly face in these dark times. How can I be of assistance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008c238_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I welcome the contest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026b65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I welcome you to my humble home, stranger. What brings you to this place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I welcome you to our family, and this Sanctuary. May you find yourself at "
"home here, in the loving embrace of our Lady the Night Mother.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ec73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I welcome you, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c247_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "I welcome you, if you truly are the agent of Fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008efc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I went about my business while others fought. Thus I earned my doom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c615_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I went in there with twenty men. I left with five. Vitellus wasn't one of "
"them. He died covering our retreat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I went to the Chapel to get rid of a rash I'd picked up. Tumindil healed me "
"right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AmuseiStory_0000c05a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I went to the Imperial City in hopes of joining the Thieves Guild. Now I am "
"forced to live as a freelance thief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I went to the chapel yesterday, but Valandrus was the only one there. I "
"figured I'd come back another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM0CraftingBack_00014e5b_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "I will allow you to ask for more items later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_000253db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will always think of Lucien Lachance as my savior. When he found me, I was "
"living in a gutter, an inch away from death. I owe him everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will bathe in your blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018e5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will be happy to describe each chamber and explain the event that unfolds "
"as we proceed through Xedilian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000272bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will call out my militia if necessary, but must we truly stand alone? I "
"don't think we can survive the daedric onslaught."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008d9f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will cast you into the darkness!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaStartCombat_0008264f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will cast you into the darkness!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028793_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will confide something in you, my friend. I despise Neville and all his "
"Imperial Legion ilk! They are useless, uncaring tools of corruption!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00033793_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I will continue to tend to Dagail. Can you speak with the other mages, and "
"find out if any of them have seen the stone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will do as you ask. Let no one say Leyawiin did not do its part to uphold "
"the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17TravenDestroy_000366ec_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will explain once you have returned with it. Until then, discussion is "
"useless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004b773_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will feed the mistress your blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatWellspring_00017d17_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I will follow your lead. The Wellspring is at the heart of Brellach; follow "
"the waters to reach it. I am yours to command, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatWellspring_00017471_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I will follow your lead. The Wellspring is at the heart of Pinnacle Rock; "
"follow the waters to reach it. I am yours to command, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkTimeWound_00014e28_AltarDeluxe_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I will give you the Order's blessing. This should allow you to breach the "
"barrier but the rest is up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice2A_00070485_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will make you another in a long tradition of Worm Thralls, and take my time "
"in studying you. Your very soul will be forfeit to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08accept_000146ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will mark the location on your map. Look for it in the far northeast of "
"Cyrodiil, beyond Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MeetMartin_0002777a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I will meet Martin at the Chapel. When all is ready, I will order my men to "
"stop closing the Gates and prepare for battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001648c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I will mourn for him during my own, private time. For now, I cannot help but "
"rejoice. You have brought safety to the guild, and I thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaA1_000a55ff_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will never allow the Crown to fall into Umbacano's hands. He is far more "
"dangerous than you realize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaA2_000a5600_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will never allow the Crown to fall into Umbacano's hands. He is far more "
"dangerous than you realize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028735_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will never forget your brave rescue of my daughter.  What can I do for you "
"today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will not accept your accusations without evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Troll_0001bb35_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will not be able to help you; I am not a warrior. But take these bottles of "
"turpentine, they might help. Do be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026f90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will not fight you, friend. I have taken a vow. My gods will protect me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00058b35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will not forget your service to Cheydinhal. Closing the Oblivion Gate "
"outside the city was a daring feat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will not forget your service to me and to Cheydinhal. Rescuing my son from "
"the Oblivion Gate was a daring feat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000131a8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will now claim the honor of victory for myself here on the Altar of Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I will now gladly send soldiers to aid in the defense of Bruma. Consider it "
"done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001ec1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will obey your orders, but know that I do not trust the tactics of any "
"male. Men are meant to fight, not to lead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuySkingrad_0004f217_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will order the deed drawn up. Take this key. The house is just inside the "
"gate, by the bridge to the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will present your soul to my father as a mighty gift!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ReturnHome_0001c1cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will rest, but I must take care of our guest first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11JournalGive_00038587_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I will rouse the guard, and begin a search for him in the city. Meet me at "
"Olav's Tap and Tack in one hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a09f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I will see you next week, most honorable Listener."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I will send what aid I can. Bruma must not share the fate of our city!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038bbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will send word to the Countess at once of the danger to Bruma. You should "
"speak to Martin about his progress with the Xarxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001443e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will serve you well, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreetingEnd_00019cd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will show you the void!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01BribeBeggar_00007e02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will sing of your charity. She runs the Fighting Chance armory on the far "
"east side of the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004735c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will soon earn the Master's favor and be granted entry into the Forbidden "
"Grotto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagSpeech_00063574_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will take my leave, and you will remain here, mortal. Mortal...? King? God? "
"It seems uncertain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThreeSigns_00026af9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will tell you nothing of the three signs. You are an unbeliever and a fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RonaHassildorTopic_0003ed38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I will tell you what I can. What would you know of her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAPeryiteSpeech_0008dd60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will transport you to the plane of Oblivion in which they are trapped. Find "
"their souls. When all are collected, I will return you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice1_000008de_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I will wrap you in vampirism's dark embrace. You'll never even know I was "
"there. But when you awaken, we will be of the same blood. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice1_0004ce45_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I will wrap you in vampirism's dark embrace. You'll never even know I was "
"there. But when you awaken, we will be of the same blood. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Eavesdrop_0008117b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I will, I will! I want to see Syl dead just as much as you do. She cannot be "
"allowed to survive, after what she's done. It's despicable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018afd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could be more hospitable, but I'm a bit distracted. It seems I'm "
"having a bear problem and I just don't know what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000790aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could find a spot to sleep where the walls won't collapse on me. "
"Can't have that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c149_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could have been at the battle. It sounds like you taught Mehrunes "
"Dagon's boys a lesson they won't soon forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000adc5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could have helped you deal with the rest of those Mythic Dawn "
"bastards. But it seems you did all right on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKellenTopic_00002b05_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wish I could help him, truly I do, but I cannot muster the strength to damn "
"myself on his behalf!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08AleronHunt_0001fdbc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wish I could help more, but I can't fight. I've never held a weapon before "
"in my life. Please... get us out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could help. I understand the need to help defend the heir to the "
"throne. It is a duty we all share."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTLIKE_0018b2b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish I could say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022e54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could tell you more about them, but that's all I remember from "
"speaking to my colleagues here at the University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000605f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I could vanish like Sheogorath, right about now. Please don't hurt me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081535_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish I had a stick like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be7d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I wish I had more teeth -- great big fangs on my arms and legs to eat them "
"before they eat us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeFour_00022b50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish I had one, but I've never even seen a copy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061388_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I had witnessed the avatar of divine Akatosh myself. Imagine! Upon the "
"very altar of the Temple of the One!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice6_000a345d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I knew. They're all dead. All of them. Even my poor, sweet Biene. "
"You... you're the one who helped her, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d065_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish I were qualified to have access to the Arcane University. Enchanting "
"items whenever I want... ah, well. Maybe someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f22b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish I'd been able to help construct the new Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhat_000835fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wish for you to find Mucianus, and ensure his safe return to the Arcane "
"University. I do not want anything to go wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_0007866e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wish he'd simply disappear from the streets of New Sheoth forever! Oh look, "
"just talking about it has given me another gray hair!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeatherleahTopic_00028ac2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish my father had given me a better description of its location, but for "
"some reason all he told me was \"South of Chorrol, north of Fort Carmala.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00031620_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish something would happen already. There is so much else I could be doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ade_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish there were children here. Scrumptious, darling children. I haven't "
"eaten in so long. Ravel will tell me what to do. You, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000607d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish these adventurers would stay out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish those Knights of Order would come here and wipe everyone out. I'd "
"finally get some piece and quiet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0003cd5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish to never speak of the Dreamworld again. Henantier's free of its grip, "
"and I can't bear a reminder he was ever a prisoner in that dark place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002976_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish to see you succeed where I failed. I was on the path to the Boots of "
"the Crusader, but died before I reached them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Vamp2_0003e954_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish to tell you a story, so that you might understand why I would trust "
"you with my secrets. Would you hear it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002527b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish to welcome you to this Sanctuary, my newest Brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002527c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish to welcome you to this Sanctuary, my newest Sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043508_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wish we had a Resonator of something-or-other. We're certainly not safe as "
"it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish we had more real soldiers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002441c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wish you luck. I fear you'll need it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestionsEnd_00002c18_Knights_RESP3"
msgid "I wish you well on your quest, Crusader. We are depending on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I woke to screaming and fire. I ran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactTopic_00026d6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't ask what you went through to obtain this, my friend. I know all too "
"well the depravity of the princes of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasA4_00022b59_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I won't be bullied! I'm not some pathetic book-worm you can just push around! "
"I have friends, you know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Choice2B_00027532_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't beg you, but I ask that you please reconsider. My boys need another "
"steady hand at their side, else they may not survive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELIKE_00062325_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I won't fight you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00033ee5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't forget your service to our new settlement. Who knows? One day "
"Cropsford may be a thriving town, and all because of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001a11d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I won't go back! You can't make me go back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01BelmyneRant_0005589d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't go back. I won't go back! You can't make me go back! I'll kill you "
"all! You're all going to die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_00061416_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't risk my Guard attacking that infernal Oblivion Gate. We'll hold the "
"walls and hope for the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_0018d2a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't risk my Guard attacking that infernal Oblivion Gate. We'll hold the "
"walls and hope for the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13SignetYes_000335ad_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I won't take no for an answer. I want you to keep it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk2_0006a863_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I won't take up much of your time. But I felt you should know, I've had a "
"breakthrough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I won't talk to you! Never! Do your worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a9444_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I won, you lost. There's nothing else to talk about right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_0002b0a0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wonder how he could have miscalculated so badly. Those old Elves didn't "
"seem as glad to see him as he expected, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder how long we've been here? There's no way to keep track of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wonder how many corpses line the palace grounds. Perhaps I should count "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactO_00038fcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wonder if Mephala herself knows how many lives this foul blade has taken "
"over the years? I will be glad to give the world a respite from it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029c9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder if Umaril will dare face us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ec4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder if people dream when they take Felldew. Hmmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder if she heard me say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wonder if the Great Torch being lit will stop the unrest. I was getting "
"excited about the prospect of more bloodshed. Oh, well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder if the Resonator of Judgment hurts those inside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wonder if the new Duke of Dementia is a patron of the arts. Perhaps he will "
"be more appreciative of my act than Lady Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43PayOff_00072dc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder if there are nice dogs in Bliss. I think I'll go see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0007eae7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I wonder if you are a fast bleeder, or a slow bleeder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028230_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder what makes him so \"Naughty\"? He seems nice enough to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000292a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder what new devilry Umaril has prepared for us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wonder. Do gods have bones? What wonderful things those must be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wonder...  now that the Gatekeeper is dead, perhaps my fame will finally "
"spread far beyond the Shivering Isles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00019acc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wondered how long it would take before you needed my help. And here I am, "
"at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00082dc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wondered if you'd come back. I admit, I've had my doubts about your story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I work as a guard at Umbacano Manor. My name is Usheeja."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c98f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I work hard. Folks like Skjorta and Olfand give us Nords a bad name, drinking "
"and carrying on until all hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I worked the Arena in the Imperial City for a while. Got up to Gladiator, "
"then took a powder. A guy could get hurt, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028189_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I worry about the boy. What if the killer is after money? Primo is quite "
"wealthy. He could be the next victim!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I worry sometimes I'll go soft here, training mostly, and living easy. So now "
"and then I go out along the coast on my own, just to stay in shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I would ask that you not bother me, especially in this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would assume she's travelled extensively. Must have been some time ago, "
"though, since she never seems to leave the guild hall now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05AnyaWhat_00080d7a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I would be far too afraid to turn on Syl. But I couldn't turn them in, "
"either, because they might come after me. Please, you must do something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueShow_00085991_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I would be happy to take this statue off your hands right now. I assume "
"that's why you came to see me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would bet my life that the Great Torch isn't nearly as hot as I can get any "
"man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040cb5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I would congratulate you, but perhaps that should wait until after you've "
"prevented Order from storming the Palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Invest_000aa28c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would gladly let you invest in my shop! The extra coin will allow me to "
"purchase more goods from adventurers such as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e98e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I would hate to be on his bad side. He's really good with his fists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I would have done it myself, but well, ok... I fell for their trick. Thought "
"I'd get lucky, turns out that they don't do anything. They just rob you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas2_00002c42_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would have liked to see the Lord Crusader in his full fury. It must have "
"been magnificent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would have sworn with my life that Nels was the killer, but now he's dead "
"as well! Dovesi is now my top suspect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000236e5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I would hope that any responsible citizen, if given the chance, would acquire "
"the book and deliver it here, so that it may be properly looked after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_0000c08c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I would like the Helm returned, so that it may be kept safe here in the "
"University. I fear Irlav has made himself a target for the Necromancers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would like to send help to Bruma, but I cannot risk weakening Anvil's "
"defenses with that Oblivion Gate open outside the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would like to send help, but unfortunately my guard is short-handed with "
"the death of Captain Lerus. I need all my soldiers at home right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0000344b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I would like you to speak with Modryn Oreyn. He will assign you any duties "
"that are currently pending. Good luck to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would love to get a piece of the old Gatekeeper for my Museum. His head "
"maybe, or an arm... he certainly was a unique specimen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_000091c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I would love to put you in some of my fine garments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics3_00002c67_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would never doubt her. The gods have clearly chosen her for a high purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics3_00002c66_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would never doubt him. The gods have clearly chosen him for a high purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32WelkyndStones_00012d1d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I would never have allowed myself to do that. However, now that they are "
"befouled, I can use them. You may grovel in gratitude at my feet later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041099_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would prefer that you didn't disturb me at home. My research is exhausting "
"and I don't like to be bothered here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026fc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I would prefer you leave, friend. Please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23HowFind_0001d24d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I would start by searching his home. He hasn't been there for days, so it "
"should be safe. Return to us here if you have questions. We meet at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007816a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be caught dead at Sickly Bernice's... though I imagine her "
"customers might."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004300a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't be caught dead with a necrophiliac.  Ahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004662d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't call him a friend. Still, if I wanted to learn more about "
"illusions, he's the one I'd ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004660e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't cross him. I've heard he's very skilled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't go in there unless you have a strong stomach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have any friends if it weren't for the guild. I'm very grateful. "
"If you want to join, you should talk to Adrienne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_00013345_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have any, that's what. So these arrows are staying right here in "
"case someone needs them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009f910_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't keep him waiting if I were you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000091cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't make that deal with just anybody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't mind learning a bit about Mysticism. Seems like a useful skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't mind learning something, but I don't want to join the Fighters "
"Guild to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c18f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't mind making a few bets, but I'm not sure about Graklak. He seems a "
"bit slick to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028bb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't miss it.  This time the sacrifice may finally be acceptable to the "
"Brethren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Response_000343bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't recommend it, sir. You don't want to put yourselves in the middle "
"of a goblin war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09ImIn_00053724_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't say we're thieves. I mean, we've stolen things... sure. But we've "
"never stolen that much at one time. Just enough to keep us going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c214_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't want an Orc butler, but apparently the Count doesn't mind. Shum "
"gro-Yarug has been there for years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't want to mix it up with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I wouldn't. Not even with yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Yield_0008607e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I yield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Yield_0018d83e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I yield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030574_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd advise you to keep your distance from that accursed portal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a957_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'd almost feared that you'd never return. I'm glad to see I was incorrect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ10Husband_0006141c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd already convinced myself I'd never see Rockshatter again, but I was wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeWeapon_0001f3c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd be happy to craft you Amber weapons, but you need to bring me Amber. "
"Consult the information I have posted in the store for details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeArmor_0005f926_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd be happy to forge Amber armor for you, but you don't have enough Amber. "
"Consult the information I have posted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f22a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd be very interested in taking a look at this new Gatekeeper. An entirely "
"new form of life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk2_0006a865_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd been thinking about our conversation yesterday, and decided to consult "
"some of the ancient texts. You were right! About everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008ef36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd better get back to practicing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008ef68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd better get back to practicing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49ChoiceExplain_00031d33_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'd better go with you. We'll have to go through the Chapel Undercroft, and "
"then through what's left of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd buy my armor at \"The Best Defense\" if I could afford it. You know... in "
"the Market District... the Imperial City?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078163_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd buy my weapons at Cutter's. She has... a way with blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ASyl_00013a68_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'd check with Anya Herrick, her Courtier, and Kithlan, her Steward. Maybe "
"they can help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b21_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'd come here, to the place it all happened, in the hopes that something "
"could be done. I fear I haven't much time left, otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk5_0006a872_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd consider it a personal favor if you'd give this matter top priority. When "
"you learn more, let me know. Keep up the excellent work, magister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonTopic_0001338a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'd do anything for him. Anything at all. Eat my own young if he asked me "
"to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd get more work done if it weren't for my layabout double living in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_000150b8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I'd give just about anything to sleep in a real bed again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2b5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'd grown to become fond of him. I wanted to take him into my house, but I "
"was afraid. And now look what's become of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TeekeeusTopic_000253d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd have a few choice words for him, but he won't let me get near him. I know "
"exactly why he's so threatened by me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_000626c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd have to say I'm partial to the Great Hall. On those cold nights, nothing "
"warms your bones better than a roaring fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f42_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'd investigate it further, but I'm needed here with the Council. Raminus "
"says you've got a good head on your shoulders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd kill for a sweetroll right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0000ab72_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'd lay odds that the war between the two tribes is because of a stolen "
"Tribal Head. No other reason for a war to go on this long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081524_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like my mind back, if you please. Or not. It's really up to you, Lord "
"Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutsideChoiceU1_000790ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like that a lot. But who sent you? Yeah, and whose bed are we talking "
"about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e962_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like to bet, but I don't want to be told that what I'm doing is sinful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaleneTopic_0018bc38_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'd like to get her a gift of a sort. Nothing terribly fancy, and something "
"useful.... How about a nice silver pitcher, and a set of four glasses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b96_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like to get my hands on the cowards that did that. I'm even thinking of "
"joining the Prophet's holy crusade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022b48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like to help you, but the cost... I would have to try to obtain another "
"copy for Gwinas, not to mention his disappointment if he found out ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_00033ef6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'd like to just believe you, but I can't send these people back to Cropsford "
"unless I'm sure the goblin war is over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like to learn more about spellcasting. Might have to head over to the "
"Mages Guild and see if they're accepting new members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a1f62_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I'd like to offer you a reward for your efforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fe5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd like to read Scribonia's work. I just wish I had more time to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00036606_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like to report a crime. Watch Captain Avidius stole all my money while I "
"was shopping in Jensine's Merchandise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e9eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd like to return to my work, if that's alright with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd like to see this new adventurer try to make it past the Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0007eac9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd like to tell you, but... really, I shouldn't say anything more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b074_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'd like you to have this keepsake. My father gave it to me when I was but a "
"lad. I think you should have it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceWhatNext_0003353f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd like you to speak with Tar-Meena at the Mystic Archives. She is our "
"specialist on magicka arcana, and has been helping gather information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WheresSkrivva_00035fb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd look in the Lonely Suitor. She takes her meals there. If you try her "
"house, don't pick the lock to get in. She won't like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon1_00028888_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd love a hammer. Too bad you don't have one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon1_00028883_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd love a hammer. Too bad you don't have one! Come back when you have a "
"weapon for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd love some work. Seems like joining the Blackwood Company is the only way "
"to get it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2ae_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'd love to bring him to task in front of Count Indarys, but I dare not "
"without a solid witness that will speak against him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeArmor_0005f8f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd love to hammer Madness Armor to hold your shape. But you must provide "
"some Madness Ore. Inspect the information I have posted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Ushnar_00072dc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd love to have one of Ushnar's old dogs for my museum. They're very "
"interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022e57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd love to have the Tears added to my collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornMaidFood_0000de28_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "I'd love to oblige, but we have no kitchen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseServantDrink_000b97e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd love to oblige, but we have no kitchen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseServantFood_000b97e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd love to oblige, but we have no kitchen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeWeapon_0001fa39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd love to shape a weapon for you, but you don't have enough Madness Ore. "
"Have a look at the info I've posted in the shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd never suggest you forfeit a bonus, of course, but killing Faelian indoors "
"is so unappealing. Too bad you couldn't snipe him from a balcony."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd prefer to avoid them altogether."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseDecline_0004f20c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd prefer to only discuss the property with serious buyers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049891_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd rather have someone else just repair it. I'd hate to have to take time to "
"repair my armor when I'm doing something else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078166_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd research my own spells before I'd buy them from Earil's Mysteries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd say that with two people dead, it's time for everyone to pull together. "
"We need to watch out for each other, stay in a group. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03XedilianTopic_0008e94a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'd say your next move is to head to Xedilian and get it reactivated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice10_0005e372_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'd so enjoy that...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c196_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd stay away from him if I were you. There's something very wrong with that "
"man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008260a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd stay away. I understand the ghosts are locked in an eternal battle for "
"the keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000133dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd stay back from that door if I were you. Nothing that's gone in has come "
"out right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01GaiusForceGreet_000133dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd stay back from that door if I were you. Nothing that's gone in has come "
"out right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelC1Idle01_0008ea9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd stay back, no telling what that thing can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000a3843_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd stay inside the city walls if I were you, there's no telling what's going "
"to come out of that gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00042db0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd steer clear of any newcomers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EaranaTopic_0002acca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd steer clear of her if I were you. She has it in for Teekeeus, and "
"wouldn't hesitate to take any of us down with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001a114_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'd steer clear, citizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03XedilianTopic_0008e945_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'd suggest you make haste and get to Xedilian. My Lord Sheogorath does not "
"like those who lollygag. Or maybe He does? Bah! Just get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002df70_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'd take great pleasure in bestowing one of them upon you. Please, choose the "
"Thornblade or the Staff of Indarys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'd tell you more, but frankly, I don't know who you are, so I'm not sure "
"that I can trust you with that sort of information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071f2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll Kalicrak the Findoo. I will. You Terratet it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000174f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll admit, it's my doing. I couldn't leave well enough alone, and after "
"you'd left to go after that ring, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KudEiTopic_0003cd37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll always remember what you've done for us. From the bottom of my heart I "
"thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll assume you're back for more work, because I don't see a big need to chat "
"with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_000224ba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll be at the Grey Mare until I've finished my work. But please don't "
"disturb me until I'm done; this is quite a delicate business, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b3a_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "I'll be back as soon as I've outfitted myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be glad to get this over with and get back to the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031ebe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll be having a very long talk with my impetuous son. I don't blame him "
"directly for their deaths, but he must learn to do things the proper way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_00028c03_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll be here until I've finished my work. But please don't disturb me until "
"I'm done; this is quite a delicate business, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakFlatsCaveTopic_0000a1e7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I'll be here when you get back. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, Hero. With the kinds of victories you've been having, I knew "
"that Elf didn't stand a chance. Here's your gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002878a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, friend. I don't know what to think about Matilde. Yeah, she "
"seems frightened, but she's also still alive. Why wasn't she killed?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_0018d302_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, that Oblivion Gate out there scares me. And believe me, "
"nobody that works in the Skingrad Guard scares easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGFollow_00009294_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be right behind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bda7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be right behind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036327_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be seeing you, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030206_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll be taking whatever you're carrying. After you're dead, of course. I do "
"hope it's more than the last few had. They were most disappointing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028bca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028bae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be there.  Etira promised us some good sport tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000b166b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be waiting for teeth and horns."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003376c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be waiting right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00038993_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll buy just about anything, for the right price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c246_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll buy sweetrolls from Salmo the Baker any day. Once, I was carrying a "
"sweetroll when three thugs attacked me. So, I took the sweetroll...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028d30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll confess that I have no idea why Primo is here. The kid's got more wealth "
"than the rest of us combined. He sure doesn't need a chest of gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6b_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'll continue to study the problem. Come by tomorrow if you like. I may think "
"of something else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_0008ef7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll cut you limb by limb!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll deal with him soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004301a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll do anything to suck down some sweet Skooma. Anything. You got some?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice3_00035712_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll do it... Guildmaster. Just come to me when you want to assign duties to "
"the Guild. I'll make sure they get done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenChoice1_0004fe11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll do what I can to help. I... I like to hurt things. Maybe I can hurt "
"these damned knights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll drain you until you live no more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_0004575e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll enjoy putting you down, scum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c350_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll ensure that her stay in jail is not long. Obviously, I had no love for "
"Ulrich, so I'll do what I can on her behalf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00091990_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll feed on your entrails for dinner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038bb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll feel better when you've eliminated those spies. There's no telling what "
"they may be planning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_00035ca5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'll find Itius Hayn first thing in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004774d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll get mine. Folks in this city got plenty of gold. Take from the rich and "
"give to the poor, if you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGDPost3_0006e2eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll get on it. We'll focus on both this month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrisonVisitor_0018d1ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll get the lock. Don't be touchin' any of them. I'll be keeping a close eye "
"on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Scales_00067dd1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll give you this ring in trade. I have no use for it anymore, but I imagine "
"that it would be very valuable to someone like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b5e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll go back and wait in the County Hall. You'll tell me when I'm a real "
"knight? Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10AldosTalk_0003c2b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll go nowhere with you, fetcher! Nowhere!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KingofWormsTopic_0000a0f9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'll go to the Imperial City. Hannibal Traven can protect me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03ComeWithMe_0001e8d6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'll go with you when we can all leave here together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00023f5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll hack you to pieces!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00019857_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'll have it sent to the palace and placed in the main hall, if you wish to "
"take a look at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7ed_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "I'll have the ritual ready in the Great Hall when you arrive. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c261_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll have to buy a bit more of her wine. It's just excellent. A fine choice "
"for any meal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038bbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll have to proceed cautiously with the Mysterium Xarxes. It is exceedingly "
"dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Troll_0001bb2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll have to remember to remove the trolls from my painting before I complete "
"this piece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0007eaa3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll have to tread lightly around that subject, or I might get another lesson "
"in the exalted nature of Pain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll have to update my encyclopedia. I had an entire volume devoted to the "
"Gatekeeper, and now he's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a364_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll have you arrested if you don't leave! Now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB2_00095329_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll have you know that I've visited the Shrine of Sheogorath during the "
"Festival of the Mad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB2_00095330_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll have you know that I've visited the Shrine of Sheogorath during the "
"Festival of the Mad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_000919f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll have your head on a spike!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll have your head, you filthy Nord!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39SpoonChoice1_000781fa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll hold onto the spoon. Wouldn't want this to fall into the wrong hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39MissionChoice2_00078204_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll hold onto this. You don't want to get caught by the authorities with it, "
"do you? I suppose I should give you something in exchange."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArgonianBloodTopic_00053733_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll just take that dagger back from you. It should have more than enough "
"blood for my needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG03Choice2A_0002c0f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll just take the money from you then. And here's your staff. Now, since our "
"business is concluded, you must excuse me. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG03Choice2A_0002c0f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll just take the money from you then... what, you don't have it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWait_0001e8dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll keep an eye out for trouble while you're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll keep studying the first two volumes of the \"Commentaries.\" Who knows, "
"I might turn up something before you do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll keep that in mind the next time I need something recharged. Not that "
"it's something that happens every day, of course. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberTwoManEnd02_000732a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll know it when I see it! Yes... it must be here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000982e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll leave at once for Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027987_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll let you in on a little secret. If I find the chest of gold, I'm going to "
"open a tavern.  The Hoary Boar! It's been my dream since I was a boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AcceptYield_00023f6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll let you live this time, cur!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_0003ab35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll make Captain for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingH2HFight_0006245a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll make it easy on you. I won't throw a single punch. I just want to see "
"what you've got, anyway. So, is it a deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll make the necessary arrangements for his burial. He'll be buried next to "
"his poor wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d491_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'll mark it down on your map, just so you won't forget where to find us. "
"Meet us there around 11 in the evening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilWarning_00047228_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll meet you further along in the caves and remove the Bands when you get "
"there. May Akatosh favor you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00031ed4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll miss him dearly. Don't feel upset, I know you did the best you could to "
"bring him home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00036640_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll need someone who's at least an Apprentice for this job. Maybe you're "
"ready for advancement?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0006245e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll need something in exchange for my services."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReynaldJemaneTopic_00023e83_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll need to go see him at once! You'll have to excuse me; I'd better leave "
"right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll need to speak to the council about this. Thank you for relaying the "
"information. Now, tend to your staff, and your wounds, if necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll need to speak to the council about this. Thank you for relaying the "
"information. Now, tend to your staff, and your wounds, if necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG03Choice1A_0002f176_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll need you to have a little chat with Varon Vamori, and you can learn "
"something about the power of Illusion in the process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_000699f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll never forget him. He saved as many as he could that terrible night. If "
"only they'd listened and stayed with us in the Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll never forget this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll never let an Orc drink here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00083060_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll never serve you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009837f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll never tell those damn Watchmen about the Gray Fox!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll not have anything to do with you. Begone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD03Choice3_0002d72c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll pay Donton for his contract, and I've got this for you. Good work "
"getting him back in one piece. I might make a real soldier of you yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0011e158_DLCOrrery_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll pay handsomely if you can procure the items on that list. Find me "
"everything on there, and you'll be well compensated. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04DrethConvo_00045f86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll remember that when I'm lying on the beaches of Sumerset Isle with your "
"wife, you Imperial pig!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002994_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll return to the Priory and give my fellow knights the good news. Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00065556_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll see you back at Cloud Ruler Temple. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bcc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll see you in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll see you in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008ea1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll see you soon! Or maybe I'll see you later... I can never remember..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a29_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'll see your blood spilled before you ruin all our work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251fe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll sell you equipment, but only because Ocheeva is making me. This family "
"doesn't need any... outsiders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll send your bloody soul straight to Sovngarde!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00083067_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll show them. I'll make them pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll show you where you can put that fancy sword!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactH_00038fb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll sleep better once this keepsake of Namira is gone from my possession. A "
"good choice for our purpose, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000918fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll smash your skull!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll snap you in half, little man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll soon be unveiling an entirely new act. \"Silence Over Brellach: A "
"Juggling Epic.\" I think you'll agree it's my finest work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c191_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll stay away from the topic with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13FarwilSlain_00031c95_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll stay here and do a final sweep of the area. You're to report to the "
"Count directly, as he wishes to speak with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusI_0001e90e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll stay here to guard the Emperor's body, and make sure no one follows you. "
"You'd better get moving. May Talos guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusI_00022f87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll stay here to guard the Emperor's body, and make sure no one follows you. "
"You'd better get moving. May Talos guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusI_00079441_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll stay here to guard the Emperor's body, and make sure no one follows you. "
"You'd better get moving. May Talos guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusI_00079442_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll stay here to guard the Emperor's body, and make sure no one follows you. "
"You'd better get moving. May Talos guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWait_00037836_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll stay here until you're ready to continue to the Elder Council Chambers. "
"Don't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b56_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'll stay on guard until you return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004848a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll take Llathasa's statue off of your cold, dead body!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll take good care of your horses when you're in Skingrad. I'm Ugak gra-"
"Mogakh, ostler of Grateful Pass Stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26AudensThreat_00093cd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll take my chances in prison rather than fight you. Someday I'll get out "
"and the weasel that turned me in will pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006a84e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll take my leave of you then, fellow magister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00015135_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll take point. Let's move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice4B_00085861_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll take refuge in my room until Nels has been dealt with. Thank you my "
"friend! And good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BRIBE_0018b2c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll take that, and thank you very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f49_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll talk to Primo, give him a bit of encouragement. If he and I are "
"vigilant, we may prevent the killer from claiming another victim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007322c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll talk to you some more yesterday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Prank_000302d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll teach you a spell to unlock things. What you need to do is get into "
"Jeanne's desk, and bring me her Manual of Spellcraft, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004b775_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll teach you to steal from the Arcane University!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004848b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll teach you to steal from the Countess of Leyawiin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Continue_00189d08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll tell you how you can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Hate_0007866f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what I tell anyone else who asks. Get rid of him for me and "
"I'll make it worth your while. Do hurry... time's wasting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d924_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what else I'll do since you seem so resourceful. If you find "
"any more bottles of the wine, I'll gladly pay you well for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002e5e7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what. Find me when Falcar's not around, and then we'll talk. "
"After we've spoken, you can have the key. Believe me, this is important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AyleidReference_0003353a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what. I'll take the book, and then if you can read me the "
"inscriptions, I'll see if I can find translations for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ06Bears_0018afe0_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what. Kill six of the things, bring me their fangs as proof, "
"and I'll reward you well. Please, you're my only hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d491_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what. We have a cozy farmhouse not far from here where we "
"could... well... get to know each other much, much better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c0cb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what. You give me at least a portion of what I paid for it, say "
"two hundred gold, and I'll give you the staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09MetoDO_0005377a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you. I want Arnora dead. That's right, I said dead. She took my "
"life away, now I want hers taken as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll try to speak in fewer syllables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeleneTopic_00015715_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll turn over her body and the bodies of her compatriots when we arrive at "
"the Imperial City. Don't let it trouble you, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2A_000262d8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll wait for you at Applewatch, the farm where you killed the old Draconis "
"woman. It should be empty, and safe. Now go! And may Sithis help us all! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2B_000262d9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll wait for you at Applewatch, the farm where you killed the old Draconis "
"woman. It should be empty, and safe. Now go! And may Sithis help us all! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2C_000262da_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'll wait for you at Applewatch, the farm where you killed the old Draconis "
"woman. It should be empty, and safe. Now go! And may Sithis help us all! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b58_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait for you to return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b5b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait for you to return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b5e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait for you to return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b60_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait for you to return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ChoiceNM_00015456_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait here then. Let me know when you've made up your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait here until the tavern deck is clear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS02VelwynEscChoice2_0000a0db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait here until you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033767_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'll wait here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll wait on the tavern deck until you clear the top deck. That's where the "
"ship's wheel is located."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038438_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'll warn you about one thing. I understand you wanting to help Erline by "
"checking up on Raynil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004762c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Adamus Phillida, prison administrator and commander of the Imperial "
"Legion forces here in the Imperial City. Have we met? You look familiar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004774a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Adanrel. I'm discouraged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Agarmir. And I'm a very busy man. Are you just fishing around, or do you "
"have business with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c9ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Alga. I'm a bard and a Speechcraft trainer. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004770c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Amantius Allectus, the writer. I'm working on a new edition of 'Lives of "
"the Saints'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e91c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Amiable Fanriene. Sorry, can't talk. Got to move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00068bc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Anya Herrick. I serve Lady Syl, and she allows me to remain protected "
"within the House of Dementia. I'm so grateful to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Ardaline. I'm the guild's Advanced Trainer in Alchemy here in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e0a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Arvena Thelas. They call me 'the rat lady', on account of all my pet rats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Atahba. But if you want a horse, you got to talk to Cat-Face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Avrus Adas. I'm the priest of Zenithar at the Leyawiin Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e089_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Azzan, head of the Anvil Fighters Guild chapter, and Advanced Blunt "
"Weapons trainer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e087_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Baeralorn, Anvil's castle mage. Perhaps you've heard of my work on "
"magical resistances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f368_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Beelei. You... you came from out there? And you survived? Then how do I "
"know you're not one of THEM?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Bejeen. I'm a hunter, and Weebam-Na's partner. I hope he didn't bother "
"you about the rat thing. He's gone totally rat-cuckoo, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Beran. Kastus, Vontan, and me, we take care of gardens and trees and "
"grass. Hard work, but it pays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038add_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Bernadette Peneles. I work for Tamika. I grow grapes. For her wines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023cc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Bittneld the Curse-Bringer, captain of the Chorrol Guard. What can I do "
"for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Bogrum Gro-Galash, your host at the Lonely Suitor Lodge. It may not look "
"like much outside, but that's just the weathered Bravil look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007be9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Brielus Gawey. And no, we don't sell horses. But we do eat well. The "
"stables are owned by an Orc. And you know... Orcs and horses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Bronsila Kvinchal. And I'm so sick of that Vlanarus, I could scream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Brother Jauffre. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm Bugak gro-Bol, and I say you better buy a goddam book. And right away, "
"dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Burz gro-Khash, and I'm in charge of this St. Jiub's Fair. All I need is "
"clowns, monkeys, and jugglers. No. Wait... just need jugglers...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000477ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Caelia Draconis, Captain of the Leyawiin Guard. I hope we will not meet "
"in my official capacity... ha-ha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c99a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Captain Burd, commander of the Bruma Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004763c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Caranya, master wizard, and far too important to be talking to you. So go "
"about your business, please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004768e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Carmana Sintav. Cyronin is my husband. Excuse him, please. He's a little "
"irritable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024f80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Carmen Litte. Perhaps you know my husband? Alberic Litte, the Mages Guild "
"sorcerer? What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004770e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Caula Allectus. My job is making sure my husband Amantius doesn't go out "
"with his clothes on backwards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023c5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Chanel, Chorrol Castle Mage. You'll tell me what you're here for. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Cingor. I'm the Captain of the Leyawiin Neighborhood Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c992_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Cirroc, Bruma's Chapel Healer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e0a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Clesa. My husband and I run the Horse Whisperer, the finest stables in "
"Anvil County."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024b8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Contumeliorus Florius. I'm in charge of enchanted item recharge in the "
"Mages Guild here in Chorrol. Get it? \"In charge!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047706_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Curtis. I'm nobody special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007504b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Cylben Dolovas, assistant and bodyguard to Seridur. Let's leave it at "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000947bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Cylben Dolovas, assistant and bodyguard to Seridur. Let's leave it at "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e086_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Dairihill, steward of Castle Anvil. We do things differently in Anvil. "
"And the difference shows in the comfort and trust of its people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Dar Jee. I'm a Khajiit in disguise. Want to see me lick my butt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ae1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Davide, of Surilie Brothers Vineyard. Gaston is my brother. From our "
"vineyards come the finest wines in Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Deetsan. Magician. Mages Guild, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ab4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Dion, captain of the Skingrad Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Eilonwy. I'm only a conjurer, but Orintur is a full Magician. Isn't he "
"wonderful?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Eitar. Say. Did you hear what that Argonian said? What's-his-name? You "
"know who I'm talking about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Eitar. Say. Did you hear what that Khajiit said? What's-his-name? You "
"know who I'm talking about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Elisa Pierrane. Father bought us this lovely house in the City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Else God-Hater. Yes. I hate the gods. All gods. They can all bite my "
"garters. And if you don't like it, YOU can bite my garters, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Erissare Arenim. Soris is my husband."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e0dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Ernest. This is the Horse Whisperer, Anvil's only stable. Park your nag "
"here, or leave him for the wolves. Your choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Errandil, Living Saint of Arkay, and the Chapel's chief crusader against "
"the wicked practice of necromancy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Fathis Aren, Count Bravil's staff wizard. I can teach you Conjuration... "
"anything to relieve the tedium of castle patronage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Felas Sarandas. Don't breathe on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e092_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Felen Relas of the Mages Guild. I handle Alchemy training for the Anvil "
"chapter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c99e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Gan Luseph, Castle Mage and Healer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ae4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Gaston Surilie. Perhaps you've met my brother, Davide? Together, we are "
"the Surilie Brothers Winery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047662_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Gelephor, the watchman. I keep an eye on things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047678_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Gin-Wulm. I just work here. You want to buy, talk to Varnado or Maro "
"Rufus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024ed8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Glistel. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ab0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Hal-Liurz, Count Skingrad's steward. The Count does not accept "
"unsolicited visitors, I'm afraid. I apologize for the inconvenience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e09c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Hasathil, Heinrich Oaken-Hull's wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c9aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Honmund. I'm a prospector. Alga's my woman, Nord-style. None of that "
"Chapel wedding nonsense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004768a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Irene Metrick. If you needed to know more, you'd already know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e097_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Isolde, mate... not that it's any of your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm J'zidzo. What has four legs, a tail, and is red in Cyrodiil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm J'zin-Dar. I tell you, so you can tell everyone who kicked the crap out "
"of you. J'zin-Dar. Get it right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Jair. I'm a dip..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c9ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Jantus Brolus. I'm the Illusion Trainer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Jayred Ice-Veins. Do you ever wonder why things look better without their "
"skin on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c9b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Jearl. I spend most of my time down south, but I keep a house in Bruma "
"for the mountain air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Kastav Kvinchal. And, if you listen to that witch of a sister of mine, "
"Bronsila, I'm also a dog and a pig."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e095_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Krognak gro-Brok, landsman, and I don't much care who you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c984_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Logvaar. Hafid pays me to stand around and keep things quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024d4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Lum gro-Baroth. The cheerful one. My brother, Kurz? He's not so cheerful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e0a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Maelona. Gogan's wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cf88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Maenlorn. I'm the twin in brown, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Magician Orintur of the Mages Guild. I divide my time between the "
"Cheydinhal Guild and my own private studies at Willow Bank. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC_0002a573_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Maglir. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Maknok gro-Coblug, the Riverside groundskeeper. Rogmesh, my wife, is the "
"cook at the Big House."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024eed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Malintus Ancrus. How are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004769c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Mandil. I'm a lady of leisure, but I do some Advanced Training in "
"Security. Just a hobby, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MogensTalk02_00086575_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Mazoga. You killed my friend, Ra'vindra. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e094_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Mirabelle Monet. I run the Fo'c's'le, a boarding house for sailors. "
"Sorry. I reserve my beds for seamen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Mog gra-Mogakh, proprietor of Two Sisters Lodge. My sister and I own the "
"place... 'Two Sisters', see? Need a bed? Good food?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086058_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Mogens Wind-Shifter. I'm having a look around. You mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f364_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Muurine. If you have any secrets, I'm the one to tell. I won't share them "
"with anyone but my family. Unless they're good ones, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004774e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Myvryna Arano. I... persuade people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e0a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Newheim, Anvil harbormaster. I'm responsible for all harbor traffic, "
"docks, duties and fees in Anvil harbor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e07c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Norbert Lelles. I let my merchandise speak for itself. Look around. If "
"you see something you like, we'll talk about a price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c98c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Olfand, the Light Armor trainer. Skjorta and I run North Winds. Please "
"excuse us. We had a little drink-up last night. Still a little muzzy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000238d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Otius Loran, Primate of Stendarr. You stand before Gods' servant, in the "
"house of the Nine. Be humble, and show respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Otumeel. But I didn't do anything. Really. It wasn't me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ac0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Parwen of the Fighters Guild. I'm not a great archer, but I seem to have "
"a knack for teaching. And I've bagged my share of goblins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c977_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Petrine. This is Wildeye Stables. I look after folk's horses while "
"they're here in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000ace28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Phebe Jeanard, a charity sister of Gottlesfont Priory. Are you looking "
"for alchemical ingredients?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047656_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Phintias, owner and proprietor of the First Edition. Look around. If I "
"don't have it, maybe I can get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004773d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Praxedes Afranius. My brothers and I share a house in the Temple District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dca2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm Prior Maborel, head of our community, and responsible for all our "
"religious and secular affairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c9b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Regner. You want anything? Talk to Edla. She's in charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024b56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Rena Bruiant. I love dogs. Doesn't everyone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00074a88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Rimalus Bruiant. Perhaps you've met my wife, Rena? And our dogs, Bailey "
"and Kezu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Roderic Pierrane. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e08c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Rufrius Vinicius, Fighters Guild Hand-to-Hand trainer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e09f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Rusia Bradus. My husband is General Silgor Bradus, one of County Anvil's "
"commanders in the field. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047733_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Ruslan. Not that it's any of your business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Shamada, hostess of the Three Sister Inn. Speak to Shuravi if you need "
"beds or meals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035708_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm Shuravi, the sister-that-works-and-worries. Shamada is sweet and "
"decorative. Shomara is dumb as a post. But she can cook, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c986_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Snar the Cook. We've got genuine Skyrim cuisine... fresh, simple, big "
"helpings... just like Mom used to make."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bbf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm Sontaire, spend one night with me and I'll remind you why they say \"love "
"hurts.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ac5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Sulinus Vassinus of the Mages Guild, and I'm so pleased to make your "
"acquaintance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c988_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Suurootan, proud owner of Novaroma, a little piece of Heartland Empire "
"here in the lofty Jeralls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ae6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Tamika. We grow our own grapes, and make fine wines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e099_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Thurindil, son of Julianos and Mohi-Titona, Queen of Akavir. These slugs "
"climbing my spine itch something fierce. Like to dance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b92e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Tivela Lythandas. I apologize that I can't give you the respect a guest "
"in my home would normally receive, but I am at my wit's end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Tolisi Girith. I'm a maid at Riverview. And it's no picnic, I'll tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Trayvond the Redguard, Mages Guild Evoker. Surprised? Yes, you don't see "
"many Redguards in the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Tsrava. I'm an Advanced Trainer in Acrobatics. Did I mention I hate dogs? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Ulene Hlervu, Castle Mage. Perhaps you've been warned off me as a "
"scandalous, blasphemous scoffer and cynic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Uravasa Othrelas, priest of Mara. I'm also a Speechcraft trainer. I can "
"help you make... different mistakes, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042fee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Urul gro-Agamph. You shouldn't scare people like that. I don't care if "
"you are a mean nasty wolf. It isn't nice. Okay, okay. Just don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038aac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Valandrus Abor, Primate of Julianos. You may address me as 'Your "
"Eminence'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047676_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Varnado. I handle the Heavy Armor at 'The Best Defense'. I'm also an "
"Advanced Trainer in Heavy Armor, so I know what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Viera Lerus, captain of the Bravil Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002d715_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Viranus Donton. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Vontan Sintav. Kastus, Beran, and me got this house from Uncle Iniel. "
"Nice, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Voranil. I'm guessing you're angling for an invitation to one of my super "
"parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047632_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Watch Captain Audens Avidius. Don't forget it. I like this city quiet as "
"a mouse. Raise a fuss, and you'll be sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086064_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm Weebam-Na. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cf95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Wilbur, owner and proprietor of The Count's Arms. We make beds and food "
"available to guests. Can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041f18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Yngvar the Wanderer. Although most people now call me Yngvar Doom-Sayer. "
"It's true, the world is about to be destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c998_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm Yvara Channitte, Countess Bruma's steward. The Countess makes policy, "
"leaving the details of administration to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightTopic_000860c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm a FREE knight. I don't have a lord. You got a problem with that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo09_00090b7c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm a Knight-Errant now, and I don't care who knows it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028c34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm a Redguard, though I've never actually been to Hammerfell. I was born "
"here in Cyrodiil. My family has been in the Legion for three generations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm a Sintav, and we Sintavs stick together. Uncle Iniel got us swell jobs "
"and a house. It's a family thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c13f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm a bit busy here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000a3453_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm a bit surprised it affected you the way it did, given your heritage. "
"Perhaps something's tainted it. I'm concerned about Water's Edge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000236da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm a busy man. What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridHot_00023cd0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm a captain, you see, and the Oak and Crosier serves... a better class of "
"people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038adf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm a fair hand at grapes and bows. Shameer, grower and trainer. But I "
"suspect you want to shoot, not grow grapes. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b688_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm a farmer, not a soldier! I don't know how to use this weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo08_00090b7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm a knight-errant now, and I don't care who knows it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaWoman_000860c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm a knight. So say, 'Sir'. Say, 'Yes, Sir Mazoga'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c28_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm a trained soldier with over twenty years experience dealing with "
"situations like this. On my honor, this killer will be caught and dealt with!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorWho_00034467_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm a vampire hunter. I came here with a few others to get rid of the "
"vampires in Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00007b31_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I can't just write one out of hand. That would be against "
"protocols, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e934_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I can't remember what he said about them. Perhaps you should make "
"the trip to Skingrad and ask him in person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid I can't rent you the room if you can't afford it. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0018d81a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid I can't tell you that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000825aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I cannot follow you beyond this point, Inquisitor. My duties "
"require me to stay within Crucible. I shall be there if you need me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingLazare01_00038acc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid I cannot. Leave me, and I will spare you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022b49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I couldn't sell it to you for any price. I've already promised it "
"to someone else, and my word is my bond."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I didn't have any more advice for him than I do for you. With the "
"Orrery in such a state of disrepair, I have no point of reference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_JAWS9143_01_AltarESPMain_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I didn't have any more advice for hom than I do for you. I have no "
"point of reference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002f1ef_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I don't have it anymore, you see. I... I sold it. To a friend of "
"mine, Soris Arenim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000377d4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I don't have much in the way of coin, but allow me to present you "
"with something that may help in your travels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e06a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I don't know anything about it. I heard it was missing, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaC1_000a5604_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I don't know for sure. I wish I had a more persuasive answer, but "
"hear me out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d586_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I don't trust you enough to talk about it, though. You are working "
"for Jeanne, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0003abfa_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I have little to offer you - what little money I have must now be "
"spent on a burial. Please, if you'll excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008117e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid I have no idea what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I have no time for small talk, friend. I'm waiting for my father, "
"Valus Odiil. Have you seen him in town, by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0002573e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I have nothing to offer you - what little money I have must now be "
"spent on burials. Please, if you'll excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d49e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I have very little information to add to our follow-up "
"investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d411_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I haven't given it much thought. I'm rather busy, you understand. "
"My research occupies nearly all of my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG03Choice1A_0002f176_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I haven't had time to prepare anything conventional. I'm very "
"preoccupied with this situation concerning Ardaline."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a13_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I misled you. The Count won't be arriving - in fact, he doesn't "
"even know you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a14_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I misled you. The Count won't be arriving - in fact, he doesn't "
"even know you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a15_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I misled you. The Count won't be arriving - in fact, he doesn't "
"even know you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_0004890b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I'm not very social. So I really don't know very much about the "
"people here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I've told you all I can about it. I'm sorry I couldn't be of more "
"use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSMiscFarwil_000c453d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid he and the rest of the Knights are off on a mission... a secret "
"mission."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinD2_0009ce84_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid "I'm afraid she may take a bit more convincing than you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Debt_000091f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid so. My father had a bit of an issue with gambling. I'm afraid he "
"built up a rather large debt. Now that he's gone, the debt is mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000175b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid some things have happened while you've been gone, Associate. It "
"may affect your recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice3A_0001c4ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid that I can't rent you the room if you can't afford it. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e919_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that this version of the Elixir of Exploration will be the last. "
"I've wrung every bit of information from my research that I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JanusHassildorTopic_00035674_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that's not my arena. You'll have to speak to Mercator about seeing "
"the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b984e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that's not possible, since you don't seem to have the money for "
"it. We'll be happy to accomodate you, when you can afford it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Choice1A_0003e94f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid the Count does not see anyone without an approved appointment. Do "
"you have an appointment?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046829_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid the settlement of Split has been the victim of recent attacks. "
"Your aid would be appreciated, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f421_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid there isn't much else to tell you. Just be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001da6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid there isn't much more I can tell you. Perhaps one of our books can "
"answer any more questions you may have?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0003561f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid there's little I can do to assist you, unless you have the wood we "
"need to start. Bring me some wood, and we can get to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid there's not much more to tell you. So, you can see we really don't "
"need any help. But thanks for the offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005323b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid this area is restricted to Guild mages. You'll have to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhyDoI_00080ed7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid until the adventurers are dealt with, Xedilian will keep you here. "
"Even I can't will its doors to open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008dc3e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid we aren't very wealthy, but here is all I can offer you at this "
"time. Please, visit us again soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d4c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid we cannot go with you to this remote location. Fighting is not our "
"specialty. Watch yourself... vampires are known to be crafty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00022ef2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you have failed the first test. There are no second chances in "
"Lord Dagon's service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d151_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you have failed the test. I warned you to stay close. We can try "
"again some other time, perhaps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b1256_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you lack the funds for the room. Perhaps someplace else would suit "
"you better?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9847_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you lack the funds to rent a room. Perhaps you should consider "
"resting somewhere else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad0_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I'm afraid you may have to be a little bit clever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice2B_00070486_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid you misunderstand. I already have more servants than I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceBlackSoulGems_00033635_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you'll have to find it yourself. I'm so out of sorts with all "
"these requests, I've lost track of most everything. It's very distressing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you'll have to make up your own mind. Unfortunately, I'm just the "
"hired help. I'm not paid to make the big decisions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0004a248_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid you'll have to speak to Falcar about that. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49ChoiceExplain_00031d33_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you're in for a tough time, friend. The city's in bad shape, and "
"it will be difficult to make it to the Guard House by yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091aab_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you're late to the party. The guest of honor has already left!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d587_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you're not going to find him easily. I think a, uh, spell "
"backfired. That's probably it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00019843_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you've exhausted Xedilian's resources. This was the final chamber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008587c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm afraid you've missed the party. The guest of honor has already left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you've upset my husband. Please, leave before he loses his temper. "
"I beg you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030206_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm afraid your journey ends here, traveler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e63a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm almost positive I sent you away to do something important. Cylarne... "
"Flame... Great Torch. Yes... why are you here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8a4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm also a trainer in the arts of Alteration. I love magic, too. I love "
"everything. And everyone. You, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034e9a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm also promoting you to the guild rank of Bandit, which will let you use "
"Dar Jee of Leyawiin as your fence. Good work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12AcceptMission_00018239_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm also providing you with a unique key that was supposedly found with the "
"diary. I'm assuming it will prove useful when you arrive at the site."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028738_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm always glad to see you, handsome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEOddities_00043412_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm always looking for new Oddities to add to my collection. Anything "
"unusual, bizarre, strange, or disturbing -- bring it to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00060951_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm amazed the Gatekeeper was killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch05_0018ad66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm angry. I want to stay angry. That anger keeps me going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015067_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm as ready as I'm going to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm astounded that the very thing we decided to fight turned out to be in our "
"midst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d924_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm at a loss for words. You actually found six!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f78c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm at my wit's end! I beg you to help me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002949_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm at your command, sir knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018abd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm at your disposal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002987_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm at your service, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00068906_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm at your service, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm awful. Just awful! Why I became a juggler I'll never know. My mother "
"pushed me into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm beginning to get a bad feeling about all of this. I'd leave right now, if "
"I could. The money means nothing to me. I just thought it would be fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022b12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm being watched. Just sit down. Don't say anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00074a0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm beyond fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatekeeperChoice2Done_0007eaef_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm bored with you. Why don't you talk to Nanette? She likes talking. I'll "
"need to cure her of that habit soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00098377_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm busy now. You need to talk to Methredhel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000237bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm busy, here, okay? You mind giving us some privacy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000917f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm busy. You got business to discuss, you talk to Eridor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm calling my new act \"The Restoration of the Resonator.\" But, I don't "
"think my public is ready for it yet. It's very cutting edge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ab9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm captain of the Castle Guard, and Dion is captain of the town guard. It's "
"simple. I don't care what goes on in town... that's Dion's problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038b08_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm certain that's what I want, and I'm certain that's what Bradon would want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038fc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm close to understanding the complete gate-opening ritual. The final "
"section is almost within my grasp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000356fd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm concerned about Water's Edge. I want you to go back there. Make sure the "
"Company hasn't ousted the residents. Lay low."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice3WhatTask_00061c4a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm constantly on the verge of retching up, or falling asleep, or screaming "
"at someone who doesn't deserve it. I'm just so fed up with it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm content here. Some day I hope to meet the right man, but not a seaman. "
"Never. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038bc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm counting on you to eliminate those spies. We can't afford to let the "
"Mythic Dawn operate out of Bruma with impunity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0006201d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm cursed with ugliness, not stupidity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004013f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm disappointed in your choice. Why you would choose to honor the fetid "
"madness of Dementia is beyond my understanding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004013c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm disappointed in your choice. You'll find Mania to be a fickle friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001c4d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm disappointed. But you'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000280c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm don't mean to impose, but I'm hoping you can help me.  My daughter, Dar-"
"Ma is missing and I don't know what to do.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm done talking to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm done talking to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm done talking to you. You ain't listening. I got better things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm eager to help you defeat my former Master, if you're willing to accept my "
"help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyBruma_0004f215_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm fairly certain that Suurootan at Novaroma here in Bruma can acquire the "
"things you'll need to make it look like home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000914de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm far too busy to speak to you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm fed up with the senseless feuding, blood spilled for no good reason. Glad "
"the Watch put a stop to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm feeling much better now that the house is free of those ugly creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000285b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm finally getting around to reading \"Five Songs of King Wulfharth.\" I "
"just wish I had more time to read it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm following them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm from Morrowind, north coast of Vvardenfell, near Khuul, so I like it here "
"on the Gold Coast. Sometimes I miss home, but not too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48HirtelC_0005d2cc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm getting out of here before it's too late! They'll be here any minute, I'm "
"telling you. Run while you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_0005c015_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm getting out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48IlendSlowDown_00098154_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I'm getting out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00064ff2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm getting to safety; you should too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060800_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad Jyggalag is defeated. Can't imagine a grey world. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad Marz lives here in Bravil. She's an excellent healer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038af6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad he's dead. I know that's a horrible thing to say, but I think you "
"understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad he's doing it. Those things are disgusting, a menace to us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad he's willing to teach others. Lockpicking has gotten so much harder "
"recently. It's more interesting, but it's harder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_000a31bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad it was you that put them down. My only regret is that I wasn't there "
"with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_0006142d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad it's working again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000614c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad our Duke has regained his Chalice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RosentiaGallenusTopic_0004f8c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad she was finally able to get someone over here. I've been gathering "
"all the research I could on her, ummm... \"little problems\" shall we say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038af1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad that scum got what he deserved. Good riddance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000af062_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad that the Oblivion Crisis is over, of course, but I can't help "
"wondering... what happens to the Empire now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043509_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad that the Resonator is working again. Enough riff-raff around this "
"place already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad that this war business is over and done with. There are those of us "
"who have work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwaterBrigands_0000c1cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad that you were on board to help rid me of them. If you hadn't been "
"here... I don't even want to think about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_0003d089_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad that's done. I need a nap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081537_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad that's over. I have work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071fab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad that's over. You've kept me from my work long enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f222_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad the Gatekeeper is back. Lets me focus on my work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad the Great Torch burns again. Cats hate fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061515_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad the Resonator is working. Keeps threats contained."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BaurusTopic_0006b842_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to have Baurus here. He guards Martin night and day. His way of "
"atoning for the death of Emperor Uriel, I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusSewerB2_000a31c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad to have you at my back. Okay. Let's do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Invisible_00030137_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to hear that the villagers aren't invisible anymore. It will make it "
"easier for me to avoid them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSwordTopic_00002bee_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to know that the Sword has been reclaimed for the work of the gods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c36c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad to see you've returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038fc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to see you. I'm finally starting to unlock the secrets of the second "
"half of the gate-opening ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice2a_00082091_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to see your ego is not larger than your vision. Now, let us talk no "
"more of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice1a_0008208f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you are reasonable and open-minded. Perhaps Sheogorath's faith in "
"you isn't misplaced, after all. Now, let's not speak of this again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BorderWatchTOPIC_000b122c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you asked. I could go on all day about our little community. We are "
"but a handful of Khajiit, as you can see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you stopped by. I have a... situation that you might be able to help "
"with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a64_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you talked me into coming with you. Now that the curse has been "
"lifted, I feel like I've taken care of my family's unfinished business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0007ea9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you took my advice and killed him. I always knew it could be done. "
"What would people do without me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a36b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you took my advice. Have you noticed how people are more friendly, "
"now you're established in the community?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleswellTopic_0000085d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you were able to help them. I would have done it myself, but I like "
"being invisible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00026ba4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad you're back in one piece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000982dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad you're here. We have work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00046308_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you're here. We wouldn't have a chance otherwise. What's our next "
"move?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm glad you've returned. The contract is waiting, if you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025574_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm going over to Northern Goods and Trade. There's always something I need "
"at that place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034513_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm going to Cloud Ruler Temple. My place is at Martin's side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm going to bleed you slow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031cf0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm going to head back and meet up with the rest of the troops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000363b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm going to keep a low profile for a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HenantierTopic_00027f37_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I'm going to level with you, as you seem like you wish to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003842c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm going to make arrangements for removal of the bodies and then I'll "
"probably stay on guard here for a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002e59d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm going to need you to find Maglir again. The little fetcher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08NelsNevConvo_000852c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm going to open a tavern. Not that I'd welcome your patronage. No pigs "
"allowed inside, you see. You Legion types tend to stink up a place.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086063_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm going to see Mazoga. Come along, if you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm going to spend some time at the Lodge. Then maybe tonight, I might go "
"hunt me some black bows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043f3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm going to stay here and help rebuild this place. These fools need me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm going to stick around the guild hall. It's what I'm not being paid for, "
"if you catch my meaning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_breakins_0003573f_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm going to wait at the Flowing Bowl until this mess is settled. I know I "
"can trust you to keep the place safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086059_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm gonna go get me some black bows. Tag along if you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00090b64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm gonna go get me some black bows. Tag along if you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028873_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm good, I suppose. I've got this sword. It's better than nothing. Let's go "
"bash in some goblin skulls!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrainerWeaponChoiceA_0000c00d_DLCBattlehornC"
"astle_RESP1"
msgid "I'm good. I've got this hammer! Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028875_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm good. I've got this hammer... to bash in some goblin skull!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm happy to be of service in any way I can, in any place I can. There are so "
"many who need help, and so few to offer it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00023f51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm happy with our progress so far. I feel better knowing that Callia and "
"Aloys have a home again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06CastleJobs_0000bf84_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm having trouble hiring these days, so if you want the job it's yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA3_00082dc5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm having trouble understanding the gods right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm here because I'm a loafer. And the city's an easy place for a loafer to "
"get by. I do odd jobs, a little adventuring, build up a little pile...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0002b1ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm here because even though I'm afraid, I know that we have to do this. "
"Father would feel the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053774_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm here for Jorundr's gold, and you're my only loose end. I'd been hoping to "
"get someone in his cell and loosen his lips, and then you showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022b39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm here for my book. Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries,\" Volume Three."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004770d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm here in the city for access to the Temple libraries, and for the "
"bookstores... especially the First Edition in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006c2a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm here on business, and you're not part of it. Take a hike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00048700_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm here to help, if you need me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm here to relieve you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c995_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm here to show Bruma's errant Nords the path to the true faith. They must "
"put aside their heathen gods and worship the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003359f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm honored by your presence, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00143eb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm honored by your presence, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm honored by your presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b7dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm honored to speak to the Champion of Cyrodiil! What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm hoping you bring me good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm hoping you can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00071e96_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm hoping you'll do better with this one than your last one. That really "
"wasn't good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0005e014_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ill, not stupid. That's a bad deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm impressed that you killed all my clients. Doesn't matter. More will come "
"along with their purses fat with gold and hearts lustin' for blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e995_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm impressed with how she handles dogs. She handles people pretty well, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038441_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm impressed. It only took him a day to track the vampire down. I guess "
"that's why he does it for a living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ac3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm in charge here. Adrienne Berene. Do you have Mages Guild business?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053718_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm in here for the long haul. They got me for murder, even though I didn't "
"do it, and once the Count makes a ruling, there's no way it's changing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00090868_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm in here for the long haul. They got me for murder, even though I didn't "
"do it, and once the Count makes a ruling, there's no way it's changing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002de9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm in hiding from the Imperial Watch. Go find Methredhel. She has your "
"instructions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002df70_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm in possession of two fine weapons. They're both heirlooms of the Indarys "
"family, held in the Castle for several generations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038abd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm in the Fighters Guild, yes, and I can train for weapon and shield "
"parries. Fadus Calidius is the name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_00062020_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm in this to make money, not lose it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002943_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm in your debt for saving the Chapel of Arkay from being defiled by those "
"foul creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm in your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFences_0001eb66_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm just as good as he is. Show me your stuff. I can move anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034462_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm just doing my job. You got a problem with it, you go talk to Eridor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk4_00034052_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm just glad to know you came out of it all unscathed. Not that I doubted "
"your abilities, but you know me. I worry. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000c4532_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm just glad we escaped with our lives. Oh, don't tell Farwil I said that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d070_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm just here doing research. If you need spells, talk to Ita or Delphine. "
"They'll be happy to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm just lucky to be alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000174f3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm just so tired of the way we've all been treated by Falcar! I was worried "
"about you, and angry about Vidkun, so I confronted Falcar directly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm just tired. I can't face it. I have to start over, from nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031cfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm just waiting for Captain Matius to give the order. Finally, a chance to "
"fight back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d2bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm just warming up, you pathetic worm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001333b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm keeping Vitharn's weapons and armor safe from thieves and miscreants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038580_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm keeping the city guard in Bruma, as Raynil doesn't know we're after him. "
"If he sees a guard, he may panic and run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000a230_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm leaving now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071faa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm leaving. I've got to find a way out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm listening, please, go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000919a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONENTER_0018b2e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm listening. Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk1_0006a860_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm listening. Speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm looking for results from you. What have you found out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm looking for the Gray Fox. What can you tell me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00068dc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm looking forward to my retirement -- long days in the stable with the "
"horses, long mornings in bed, and best of all: no more fish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c150_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm looking forward to some payback for what those bastards did to Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0014680f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm mature enough to admit I was mistaken about Thoronir. He's a welcome "
"member of our group in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm merely a man. How could I resist? What a mess I've gotten myself into."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c97c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm new here in Bruma myself. I'm from down Heartland way. Nords up here... "
"no offense... don't work as hard as us Imperial Heartlanders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b359_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I'm no \"Gray Prince!\" I'm the spawn of evil! I thought my father was a "
"nobleman, not some blood-sucking monster! I... I can't... All a lie! A lie... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaleneTopic_0018bc38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm no fool. I know she'd never be interested in an old man like me. It's "
"enough just to be around her, to be in her company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028172_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm no murderer, so that means it's either you or Neville. Just stay away "
"from me! I don't trust either one of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08Hunt_0001fdb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not a rich man, but if we get out of here alive, I'll do what I can to "
"reward you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007815f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not about to go to the Missing Pauldron, even if they do sell armor. I'll "
"stay in Crucible, thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b984b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not about to rent you a room if you can't pay for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b16_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm not ashamed to admit that. I've been at the end of my rope for far too "
"long to be ashamed of anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049911_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not buying a discount spell. That's just a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIREDISLIKE_0018b2a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not buying that one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022e60_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm not certain what happened to the knight, or why the tears were frozen, "
"but I do know someone you could ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04GuardsConvo_00095338_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not disagreeing with you, believe me. Those assassins got what they "
"wanted. The Emperor is dead. They've got not reason to come back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d27d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not easily impressed, but even I would think twice before going into one "
"of those Oblivion Gates. Well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05NelreneHaveProof_0008199f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm not even the one you want. Muurine is behind it. You'll need solid proof "
"to pin it on her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a6a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not from Chorrol. I'm afraid I can't tell you anything at all about the "
"town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_00061ff6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not giving up anything for that offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d916_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm not going anywhere until they're gone! Horrible things!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_000356e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not going anywhere with you. I can't trust you not to kill me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_00077d08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not going near the things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0018ad5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not going out there. What's the point? There's nothing left. I'll just "
"stay right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10LlevanaTalk_0003c372_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not going to stand here and debate this all night. You give me that "
"evidence, and I'll consider not having you executed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not going to the top deck until it's safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_0018b2e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not impressed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not in the habit of answering questions for strangers. No offense "
"intended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005374a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not interested in speaking with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071f55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not like them. Are you? Are you one of them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002ab86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not listening to you. It's because I don't like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008605f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not much for small talk. Just leave me out of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not much of a reader, myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not much of a rider. I've heard others swear by his animals, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000301d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not normally a bitter person, but you are not welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001e0b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not really at liberty to discuss my customers with stangers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b124f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not running a charity here, you know? I need the gold, so you come back "
"when you actually have it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not saying Colovians are dumb. They're just hard-headed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f41f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not saying I couldn't do a better job, but at least someone is in charge "
"who can get things done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not saying I like the idea of these Knights and all, but the Shivering "
"Isles could really use a dose of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not so sure about that Eugal Belette. An odd fellow, and people have said "
"there are strange noises coming from his house at all hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not some commoner to take up a sword. Let the rabble risk their lives, "
"not me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not staying here any longer. I need to get someplace safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007eae6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not sure I can make this much clearer..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not sure I can trust you. Why don't you just move along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028cdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure I like your line of questioning, friend. Someone's been killed. "
"Show a little respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c169_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm not sure I trust you enough to reveal any more to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure about you, either. Tell you what. If you bring me back five "
"portions of ectoplasm, I'll give my business to the guild. That's my offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b1d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure how I feel. To know that the curse can be lifted gives me hope, "
"but to know that it also means damning another..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023e45_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure how you feel about pirates, but you've got to kill one. A "
"captain, in fact. On his ship. Surrounded by his crew. Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05ThedretPhrase_00002afa_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure how, but I just know it's a clue for making it safely through "
"these ruins. You're the only one I have told. I hope it helps you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinMischief_0002f814_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure if the Cropsford settlers would be all too pleased about you "
"stirring up a new goblin war, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure if you're really concerned for the kid or trying to convince me "
"he's a murderer. Either way, I ain't listenin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008262e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not sure it even exists. He'll never stop looking, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure the Dark Brotherhood is any more serious a problem than beggary "
"and petty thievery. And it's certainly a discreet and secret problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_thieves_00002e48_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure the numbers you'll be dealing with, so I'm sending you with "
"another new recruit. Maglir. I believe you two have already met."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00042dae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not sure what to make of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure what to think of the kid anymore. All I know is that two of the "
"guests have been murdered, and he's just dandy. Makes you wonder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VelwynBenirusTopic_0000926f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure where he went, but I would ask at The Count's Arms. If anyone "
"knows where he is, it would be someone there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06TellKellen_00002b8d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure whether to call him a coward, or simply say that I don't blame "
"him. That'd be a large burden to bear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD4_0001e74f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure. Only the Emperors truly understand the meaning behind the "
"rituals of coronation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JorundrTopic_0005379b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not surprised at all that he tried to have me killed. That's his way. "
"Always the traitor and the coward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000356fd_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm not surprised you were found the way you were. I imagine those men have "
"built up a tolerance to the stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004663c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not surprised, with the way she handles a bow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22DontKnowHighFane_0002af33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not surprised. I have not been able to find any modern reference to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_0002584c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not surprised. It seems that Skyrim is always involved in a border "
"dispute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06RefuseJob_0000bf88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not surprised. Nobody wants that job. Let me know if you change your "
"mind. It will probably still be available."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fugitives_00009c31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not talking about them. Not to you. I barely know you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_0005371d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not talking to you about anything. You're an outsider. I bet you're "
"trying to trick me into telling something and the guards put you up to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002461b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not telling you that. Anything else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not the one you want to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_0009354e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm not used to giving speeches. But I wanted you to know that I appreciate "
"your welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12DeclineMission_00018238_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm not used to hearing no, but I admire your boldness. I won't force you to "
"go, only to request that you reconsider in the future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm not worried about the Gates. We'll be safe enough inside the walls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Stipend_00018232_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "I'm of course referring to The Draconian Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081532_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm off to find a dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_0000a253_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm offering a reward for information leading to the arrest of the Gray Fox. "
"Until he is turned over to me, the Waterfront is closed for 'business.'"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b97dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm on my way to Rosethorn Hall now. I won't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000363ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm on my way to talk to Itius Hayn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000aa08b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm on night watch here, in case someone needs the chapel, or wants to "
"talk... or has mysterious business, like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00051dc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm on your side!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038438_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm only allowing you to do this investigation, and I use that term very "
"loosely, because Erline is so distraught."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015df8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm only askin' for enough to feed me kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00015e08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm only asking for a single coin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001acd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm only talking to you out of loyalty to Sheogorath. Otherwise I'd cut you "
"open and pull all your insides out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm only the Captain of the Guard. The Countess makes the final decision, and "
"I follow her orders, whatever I think of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenGlenroy_0000b206_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm out of patience with you, prisoner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c36e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm overjoyed to hear that Garrus has replaced Ulrich as the Captain of the "
"Guard. I'm sure he'll do a fine job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm overjoyed to hear that you were able to cleanse the manor. Well done my "
"friend, well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e35e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm pleased that a Knight of the Thorn has received such a worthy gift. Even "
"if you're just an honorary knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001da67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm pleased to call him brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d3a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm pleased to finally meet the savior of Cheydinhal. And although the death "
"of Farwil saddens me, I know you did the best you could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002df70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm pleased to finally meet the savior of Cheydinhal. I'm also overjoyed that "
"you saved my son's life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm pleased to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm pleased we were able to get that secret door open, but I fear I can no "
"longer assist you here. I'll wait for you at The Count's Arms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001822d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm pleased you decided to find the Madstone. It will be the highlight of my "
"collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm pleased you've joined us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm praying for the gods to protect me from the Fanatics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_00066a55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm pretty handy. What needs to be fixed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033ee3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm proud of what we've built here. You should be, too. Cropsford wouldn't "
"exist without the help you gave us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047732_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm quite behind on current events, I'm afraid. I can't be of any help to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000977d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm quite pleased with the results. The batch came out larger than I'd "
"expected; there is enough for two doses of the potion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045f65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm rather busy on a... I'm busy. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000a252_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm rather busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060383_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm rather curious about this disappearance of Sheogorath's. Is he "
"incorporeal, invisible, or has he moved to another plane?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bccb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ready as I'll ever be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32AcolyteWarning_0008fb72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ready for them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001506b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ready to fight. Where do you need me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003fbd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ready to help you, if you're ready to accept my help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS92Follow_00090b74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ready when you are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d75b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm really busy... oh. Sorry. You closed the gate, yes? Thank you. What can I "
"do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm really impressed. You made getting past that pillar look easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000914df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm really not interested in speaking to you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm really tired. Can we get on with this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003379b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm relying on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e896_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm retired from adventuring... but you might try the old mine they call "
"'Rickety Mine' out east along the Blue Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm retired from public practice. I only take students in Alchemy to support "
"my hobbies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_001778cb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm right behind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm running out of patience with Barthel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031ebb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm saddened by the loss of those brave souls. May Arkay guide all of them to "
"their final rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015dff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm savin' up enough for some medicine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37SdrassaAcquire_00022e5d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm searching for some specific crystals known as Garridan's Tears. If you "
"can locate these objects for me, I'd pay handsomely for each one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40GreetingChoice2_000790c0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm seen some people sleeping out on the street, but they huddle too close to "
"the walls. I need someplace safe. I can't just sleep anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015069_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm set. As soon as they're close enough, they're dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000613e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm shocked the Gatekeeper is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00013342_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm short on patience as well as magicka. Out of my way! Once I regain my "
"power, I'll show you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04reject_00035ddf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm short on skilled thieves of your rank just now. If you change your mind, "
"come back and see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sick of all this fighting with the Atius clan. I'm glad Uncle Iniel put "
"his foot down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sick of mutton and beer. Want to go out and get a decent meal later?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm so excited! I expect an invitation to perform at the installation of the "
"new ruler of Mania any day now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071fb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so full. Not the least bit hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a123_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so glad to see you, my dear child. How are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so grateful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04Hlidara_00035fb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm so happy for you, milady. I'm just so sorry he damaged it. Your finger "
"swells up so when you wear it too long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_001885dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so happy to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so happy to see you, I could burst!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so hungry I could eat a Bosmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015dfc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngryMazoga_000860e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so mad, I could kill you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a126_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so proud of you, my child. You crush our Lord's enemies into dust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm so relieved that the Chalice is back in Lord Thadon's capable hands. He "
"seems to be himself again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SadGeneral_0002426f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity11_00081e96_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm so sorry. I already have a Ring of Disrobing. There's really no place in "
"a Museum of Oddities for duplicates, as I'm sure you can understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm so tired."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry I ever laid eyes on that thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a12b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry child, it's just too much for me. I must leave now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a64_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm sorry for running away like that, but fear got the best of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003457e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry this happened, but those are the Guildmaster's orders. I'm sure you "
"can gain your rank back, in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000459b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to bother you, Lord, but there seems to have been a "
"misunderstanding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000270e9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to burden you with my problems. I'll do my best to have an answer "
"by the time you return with the Great Welkynd Stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupNegative_00024232_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Talk_0002874a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that.  Seed-Neeus must be devastated, poor dear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22MaricCarving_0002c81a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear that. Especially since Maric has not delivered the carving "
"either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice6_0002c5c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear that. Sooner or later, the contracts are going to dry up. "
"Maybe then you'll reconsider."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f429_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to impose upon you like this, but I'm in need of assistance, and I "
"don't know what to do. My husband, Aleron, is missing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033560_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to tell you, but there are no more contracts to be had. As you "
"know, business hasn't been good due to the Blackwood Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f9c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to trouble you again...but I think the cure has worn off. I feel "
"the cold grasp of death sneaking up on me once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08Hunt_0001fdbb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you got mixed up in all of this. I hope you can fight. It's our "
"only chance of escaping alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b074_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you had to be tasked to right this wrong that my father was "
"responsible for. Once again, you've stuck your neck out for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22HighFane_0002c818_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you were not able to fulfill your part of our agreement, but I "
"consider the matter closed. Please do not speak of it again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11StrangersRing_00022e74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I didn't hear what you said. Whatever it is you want, it will have "
"to wait until I am holding audience in the Great Hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e725_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I have to patrol the area... but you should hurry to Castle "
"Cheydinhal. The Count doesn't like to be kept waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c36d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I shouldn't berate what you've done for Cheydinhal. Everyone "
"appreciates what you did, as do I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00033956_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, I wasn't in that evening. I was making my rounds of Chorrol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I'm very busy now. There's still much work to be done. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013fe9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Kithlan, but I don't believe you. I think you're lying. And you "
"know what happens to people who lie to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d2d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, although I wish to spend time speaking with you, I have much "
"business to attend to. Please be brief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002459b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I don't feel comfortable telling you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I don't feel much like talking right now. Someone has been "
"killed! Don't you even care?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQLastItem_00026ef6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I don't know yet. The Xarxes... it clouds my mind and haunts "
"my dreams like nothing I've ever experienced..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I don't think I know any Glarthir.  Wait, do you mean that "
"strange Wood Elf that you see wandering around the city?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d05c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I don't think so. The guild doesn't accept wanted criminals. "
"Get rid of that bounty on your head, and perhaps I'll reconsider."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038af4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I have much to do right now. Please excuse me. Oh, and you "
"should inform Carius of this if you haven't already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I really don't know much about the town itself.  I spend my "
"time outdoors, walking the ridges and valleys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00094c37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I'm late for an appointment. I've no time to talk now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036311_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I'm really not one for engaging in conversation. Please, leave "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0018b2fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I'm retired. Haven't worked with armor for years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002824b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, but my feelings for Primo are really none of your concern.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a4964_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but my master is not receiving visitors at this hour. If you come "
"back in the morning, I'm sure he would be glad to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047714_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but my studies keep me indoors for the most part. I know little of "
"the rest of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002825c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but someone has been murdered! I really don't want to talk about "
"Neville right now.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000add08_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but the cities of Cyrodiil will have to fend for themselves for "
"the time being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d05e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but the guild doesn't accept criminals as members. Get rid of that "
"bounty on your head, and we'll talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_00031527_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but the investigation is a secret, and I don't trust you enough to "
"discuss it with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05VolumeThree_00022b4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, do I know you? I have a copy waiting for me at a bookstore, but it "
"is not for sale. I've waited a long time to get that book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, friend, but I have no idea who you are. Never heard of you. I'm "
"afraid I don't offer training to just anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, most honorable Listener, but I've already given you your weekly "
"earnings. Please, come back again after you've spoken to the Night Mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c3b6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, no one except for Cheydinhal City Guard are allowed inside this "
"home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00068346_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, sir, I've been rambling on like an excitable child! I can only "
"imagine how busy you must be. With your blessing, I will now take my leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk3_00068352_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, sir. We're all a bit jumpy. What did you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038af9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, there's been no sighting of him yet. Don't know if there ever will "
"be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000919c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry, there's nothing else you can assist with at this point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ae_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, what? Training... right. I'll make you a deal: you fetch me a "
"bottle of each of the best wines from Skingrad, and I'll think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupNegative_00024234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestToddSad_00027fa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry. I didn't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018ad59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry. I don't think I'm going to be much help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadGeimund1_00002ced_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. I know I shouldn't brood about it, but... Sir Geimund... I still "
"can't believe he's gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetD2A_00002c0b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. I remember Sir Roderic saying something about the Sword, before we "
"went to Underpall... it may be important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024f30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry. I'm new in town, and don't know anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetD2B_00002c09_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. I've already failed Sir Roderic once. I don't want to fail him "
"again. I remember he said something about the Sword, before we..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD03Choice2_0002d724_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. It's just that I haven't been given many contracts since my "
"brother... since the accident. Let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047731_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. Luronk gro-Glurzog is my name. I don't get about very much. For "
"various reasons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridDEMOChoice1_00028a2e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm sorry. Please. Just come back to me when you've spoken to Bittneld."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038aae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sorry. We've not met. I'm Janus Hassildor, Count Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c48a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. You must speak to Countess Carvain for any further information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. You're not yet ready for a promotion. Keep completing contracts, "
"and take care of any assigned duties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HotWater_000704bc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I'm sorry... I'm rambling and you look confused. Let me explain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LifttheCurse_00003a63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry; I can't help you with the curse. You bought the house; you'll have "
"to deal with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BPleasures_000167e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm speaking of Greenmote, of course! There is no greater pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ASheoShout02_0008f533_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm speaking with someone. We'll talk later. Or not. When is later, exactly? "
"Not now, I'm sure of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BSheoShout02_0008f57d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm speaking with someone. We'll talk later. Or not. When is later, exactly? "
"Not now, I'm sure of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00023f54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm starting to think this is going to work. Maybe Barthel wasn't crazy to "
"bring us here after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e09_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm starting to think we might actually beat these bastards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm staying right here... where it's safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Scamps_0004f8b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm still having the floors scrubbed. What do those things eat anyway? Yuck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002948e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm still putting the pieces together. Was Primo murdered for his money? Was "
"it something about the chest of gold? I'm not sure yet, but I'm close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00020070_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm still studying the Mysterium Xarxes. Its corrupting power is terrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm still working on the second item needed for the gate-opening ritual. I "
"believe I'm close to deciphering the relevant passage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f7ba_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm still working up the nerve to paint his portrait, but I'd rather do it "
"when he's back to his happier self."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm supposed to defend the courtyard against the Fanatics. I'm supposed to "
"stop them from getting inside the keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Choice2A_00027533_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm supposed to meet them at Weynon Priory. You'd best get whatever supplies "
"you need now, so you can get there in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_0003843a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure Erline is very upset. She'll be safe though; Raynil has confirmed "
"with us that she isn't infected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062125_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure I have something here you can use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062122_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure I have something that will interest you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046622_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure Kud-Ei will keep her in check. I know she has Jend teaching other "
"mages now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure Ormil can help you now. I'm busy trying to get us home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061789_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure Sheogorath's armies can handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000615e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure Thadon will celebrate appropriately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d28d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure all of Bruma joins me in saluting your help in keeping the hordes of "
"Oblivion at bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d306_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm sure he can provide very highly detailed descriptions of the women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14TivelaHeard_0001c1c5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm sure he never left that room. So I have no idea where he's gone. Please. "
"Help me find Rythe. I love him dearly, and I am so worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002df70_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm sure he was difficult to travel with, and I respect your patience. Most "
"would have given him up for dead rather than deal with his ego."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d3a1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sure he was difficult to travel with, and I respect your patience. "
"Whereas others would have left him to die, I'm sure you fought at his side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_0008f7d8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sure it will be sufficient. Poor, poor Uungor. So misunderstood. And, I "
"know what that's like. Good luck in your endeavor, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure it's around here somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure it's just a rumor. I can't think of a reason why anyone would want "
"to hurt Toutius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46NewSettlement_000319d6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sure now that they knew all along that the land was in goblin territory. "
"But no matter, who cares if a few settlers get themselves killed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA2_00002aa9_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sure one of your many devotees will be able to guide you on your way to "
"find the Crusader's Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VitellusDontonTOPIC_0002d726_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I'm sure our mother is very proud of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_0005375c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sure she tried to con you out of half the money. Can't say I'm sad to "
"hear about Tyrellius either. Good work, good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082614_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure someone will be willing to help him out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0004fa71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure that was an accident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14SendGuards_0008faaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure that won't be necessary, Lord. Your Gatekeeper can handle it, I'm "
"sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06FlameAgnon_0003e6af_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm sure the Aurmazl Kaneh will be glad to help you once the Mazken are "
"driven from the Altar of Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000615e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure the Duke is very happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061385_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure the Elder Council will find some way to hold the Empire together. At "
"least the Oblivion invasion is over!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000617d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure the armies will protect the city, but what about us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12DeclineMission_00018238_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure the lure of my reward will have you back sooner than you think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007301e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure there is somebody who is really interested in what you have to say. "
"Too bad for you that somebody ain't me. Buzz off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure there's an abundance of exotic ingredients to be gathered nearby. In "
"Blackwood, for example, or along the Niben."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003b834_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure we'll speak again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d23f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you are familiar with those despicable beings. Feeding on the "
"innocent as if they were cattle. Well, this group was formed to combat them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041097_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you didn't see it, but there was a very interesting beetle right "
"there. Now it's gone, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure you have many pressing affairs. I won't keep you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you hear it all the time, but I'd like to thank you personally for "
"closing that Oblivion Gate outside Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000329e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure you wish to hear the real story rather than Farwil's version."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09ComponentsHow_00013573_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you'll be able to find these things, if not, perhaps Sheogorath's "
"faith in you is misplaced. Go now. You try my patience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09ComponentsHow_00081dab_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you'll be able to find these things, if not, perhaps Sheogorath's "
"faith in you is misplaced. Go now. You try my patience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0005e07d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure you'll put that to good use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000620dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm sure you'll put that to good use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Response_000343bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you're right. You saved our lives back there. I'm just not ready to "
"give up on our dream..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've heard that Glistel and Malintus Ancrus are living together. "
"Simply shameful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26AudensResponse_00036609_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised Itius. I didn't think even you would stoop to arresting a "
"fellow Captain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonateNo_00043436_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised at your attitude. Here I thought you were a patron of my "
"Museum. I only hope you change your mind one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00033793_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised she discussed it with you. She wanted to keep it from the "
"others... I should speak to her about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm surprised to see you all the way out here in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000343ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised to see you here. Have you been to talk to Baurus in the "
"Imperial City yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09ImIn_00053724_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm talking about the bigger scores. Like estates and tax shipments. I begged "
"him to stop, as I knew that his capers would one day lead to violence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b1d8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm talking weekly shows, fights pitting you against... are you ready for "
"this? Monsters! And maybe even some wild animals! Sounds great doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d62b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I'm talking weekly shows, fights pitting you against... are you ready for "
"this? Monsters! And maybe even some wild animals! Sounds great doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02PirateConvo_000493af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm telling ya, lad, it's bad luck. A woman onboard a pirate vessel! Back in "
"my day, it never would've happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006052f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, They're behind all of this. All of it! No one is going to "
"listen to me until it's too late!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06StoryDontCare_00002b8f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, you can't pick them up. Try it yourself if you won't believe "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you: don't bring that sword back to Clavicus. It'll ruin him, I'm "
"sure. I mean, not completely: He's still a Daedra Prince and all that. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00051dc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the Count's man's-man in all occasions... have been for donkey's years. I "
"run the Count's errands and do whatever's required."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024d86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the Fighters Guild Champion, Modryn Oreyn. I don't believe we've met."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023ddc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm the Master of the Fighters Guild -- Vilena Donton. Can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e090_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm the Wizard Carahil, Mages Guild, master of the Anvil chapter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29ThoronirBad_0000bca2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the chairperson for the Society of Concerned Merchants. We formed this "
"group a while back to keep a nice fair economic balance in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000238d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the chapel healer, Gureryne Selvilo. We're glad to see you paying your "
"respects here at the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the charwoman at Riverside. Tanasa Arano. I clean up after Voranil and "
"his parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the cook of Riverside, Rogmesh gra-Coblug. I don't get paid to chat, if "
"you don't mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488ca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I'm the count, and you have no business talking to the count, right? Good. "
"All straightened out. Off with you, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047743_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm the lighthouse keeper, Velan Andus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038aa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the only alchemist in Skingrad. Not much business here, but I can't go "
"back to Morrowind. It's just like anywhere else in the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12FithragaerSent_00095024_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm the only one left. The Necromancers retreated further in, but we've got "
"to follow them. There's no time to waste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KilltheGrandChampion_0003a911_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm the reigning Grand Champion of the Arena, you see. Once you become a "
"Champion, you'll need to challenge me for my title."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001cb3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm the shepherd here. Eronor's the name. And this is Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047745_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm the warehouse watchman, Damian Magius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Beast_0007b21f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm thinking a Scalon would complete the collection. Unfortunately, you are "
"not powerful enough to handle them yet. Still, if you find one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0001c903_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm thinking of doing some traveling. Just to see the world a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002556f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm thinking of heading over to Renoit's to buy some books. There's quite a "
"selection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000241aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm through talking to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm tired of wasting time with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm tired of working with you anyway. And you're a lousy swordsman, Rellian!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d76a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm told you closed the Oblivion Gate. I'm amazed. Thank you, on behalf of "
"all Kvatch's refugees."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00077b55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm too upset to talk right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm trying to concentrate. If you don't mind...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000363cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm trying to find Itius Hayn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_00035f3c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to help Skaleel as best I can, but I'm not going near the thing "
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000236dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to train here, weakling. Why don't you go someplace more your "
"speed, like the Mages Guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1dc_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I'm used to dealing with drunken louts, not a gang of well-armed thieves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42Calipers_00073230_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm using them to build my skyboat. Just between you and me, the hardest part "
"has been getting the water to not fall out of the air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c367_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm very disappointed at the decision you've made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c350_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm very disappointed in you. The proper way to do this would have been my "
"way, but you chose bloodshed. I should have you arrested. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045650_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm very excited to have an Elytra. Here's your pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm very fond of Cheydinhal. It's where I met my love, Eilonwy. Our lives are "
"quite long, and choosing the right partner is very important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_0005e082_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm very good at sharpening blades, but I can do all sorts of repair work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm very happy to make your acquaintance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002c2f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm waiting for that book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000272ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm waiting to discuss our battle plans with the Countess. Have you told her "
"to meet me here yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a7e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002a383_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm warning you! Get out, or I'll call the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072def_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm watching you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_00066a57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm willing to teach, if you're willing to learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk5_00002bc2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm with you body and soul, sir knight! Let me tend to my duties, now, and "
"I'll find you when I've finished. Exciting times lie ahead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm with you, friend. We kill Black Brugo, and the Count makes us both "
"knights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_00037835_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_0006b1b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_0018b2f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm with you. Completely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038bc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm working as quickly I can. The Xarxes doesn't give up its secrets easily."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm working on a new act where I juggle arms and legs -- in honor of the new "
"Gatekeeper, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm working on a very unusual new juggling routine to commemorate the "
"relighting of the Torch. But you'd probably hate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_00035647_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm working on it. It'll be done soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm worried about Martin. He does nothing but pore over that evil book all "
"day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WatersEdgeTOPIC_000356ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm worried about those people. The Blackwood Company can't be trusted with "
"their lives and homes. Get there and look into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm your prisoner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm your relief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b68_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b6b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b6e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b70_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c1d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c20_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c23_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c25_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I'm yours to command, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003630f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I'm... I'm sorry! I didn't mean to do anything wrong! It was the robed man! "
"He... he paid me to put those things in the barrel!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00015307_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I'm... I'm still alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089532_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've agreed to help you already. Torturing me further will do you no good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022508_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've already given you everything you need. Unless I'm mistaken, we have "
"little more to say to one another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Counterspell_0003013a_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I've already given you the scroll. Stand in the middle of town, read it, "
"poof! It is exactly like magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bc91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've already heard the news! Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3_00018f9b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I've already made my decision. We attack down the main passage!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05Gwinas_00094c3c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've already said too much. I'm sure you understand. My customers expect "
"absolute discretion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c203_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've already surrendered. What more do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've already told you pretty much everything I know about their gang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0005e1da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've already told you, I'm not helping unless you agree to do something for "
"me. Do we have a deal, or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've also been a Redguard. For a while I was a scamp, making deals with Orcs. "
"But, for now, I am His Hound, and I serve the Lord Clavicus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've also heard that they become weak to the type of spell that hits them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've always been happy with the weapons I've bought there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've always gotten along with the big bugs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've always known we're not truly safe in the Isles. Perhaps now more people "
"will listen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've always liked the Oak and Crosier. I don't know Talasma that well, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c18c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've always liked the place. Mog does a nice job, although I sometimes "
"confuse her with Ugak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've always wondered who the Night Mother really is. Some say she's an old "
"woman who lives somewhere here in Cyrodiil, but I'm not so sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been bad, really bad. Perhaps the new leader of Dementia can sentence me "
"to death for my crimes! Where do I sign up for that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerStatus_00024201_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk2_0006a862_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been doing some research in the Mystic Archives. What I discovered... "
"It's more than we could have hoped for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been doing some thinking. About you. It's kind of interesting that you "
"were the last guest to arrive, don't you think?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0008e4f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been dying to tell someone. You seem trustworthy enough... but don't "
"tell Relmyna I said anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44Supplies_0007876e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been gathering things for quite a while, but there are still a few I'm "
"missing. Perhaps you'd bring them to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been hearing disturbing tales about Oblivion Gates opening all across "
"Cyrodiil. I hope it's just wild talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05ThedretWhat_00002af6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been held prisoner by these scoundrels for the longest time. They want "
"to know how to reach the Shield, and believed I would help them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f210_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been looking for just the right owner for a special home I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity12_00081ea9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've been looking for one of those to replace the one I used to have on "
"display. At least I think I did. I truly wish I could afford to buy it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40GreetingChoiceGrapes_000790b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been looking for those. I thought Fimmion stole them thinking he could "
"eat them, but I could never prove it. Thank you for returning them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001470a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been looking for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been looking for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038fc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been looking for you. We have a situation in Bruma that I need you to "
"deal with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_0002c5b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been looking into them. Heard some disturbing things. We know they're a "
"danger to us. And we know they're good at what they do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3_00018c7f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've been losing Aureals with each attack, and I'm down to nothing but men. "
"We are pinned down here. If we lose, the Gates of Madness will fall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3_000186fd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've been losing Mazken with each attack, and I'm down to nothing but men. We "
"are pinned down here. If we lose, the Gates of Madness will fall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk2_00034046_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been meaning to ask you about your last contract. I heard there were "
"some... complications."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000614ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been meaning to speak with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000add08_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I've been pleading for troops for Cyrodiil for weeks, but the generals assure "
"me that the entire Imperial Army is already fully committed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003fd38_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've been preparing to join the guild for years. If you're nice to me, maybe "
"I'll show you a few tricks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c339_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I've been promoted to the post of Captain of the Guard, and hope to return "
"respect to the peacekeepers of this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c34a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've been promoted to the post of Captain of the Guard, and hope to return "
"respect to the peacekeepers of this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been reading \"Fundaments of Alchemy.\" I figure it can't hurt to learn "
"something new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been reading \"Overview of Gods and Worship.\" I'm not sure if I like it "
"yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_0009839e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been reassigned! This is outrageous! The Gray Fox had a hand in this, I "
"know it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0005e076_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been storing things for when the end comes. You might find some of it "
"useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk2_00002bb1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been thinking... We need to make our presence known, throughout all the "
"Empire. Make people feel truly safe once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046591_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been told that she really wants to return to Argonia, but her services "
"are so useful here, she feels compelled to stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047421_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been told to send you to Chorrol for some duties. Speak with Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ02Skooma_00189180_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to catch Lonavo for months, but every time I approach the "
"place, his lookout sees me and he goes running."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028162_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to figure out who our host might be. With two people dead, "
"it almost seems like he set this party up just to kill us all! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to finish \"Brief History of the Empire.\" It's a lot to "
"take in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to get through \"Mysterious Akavir.\" It's a fairly "
"interesting read."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00053244_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been waiting for you, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech1_00056049_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been waiting for you, or someone like you, or someone other than you, "
"for some time. I need a champion, and you've got the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a3df0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022e0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've been waiting for you. Have a seat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00146849_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've been watching you fight, my friend. It's a good thing we're both on the "
"Blue Team, 'cause I sure as blazes wouldn't want to go up against you! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000914d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've better things to do than waste time speaking with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e95c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've bought a few things at Mach-Na's, but he's always so surly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've bought a good number of things at Colovian Traders. And Gunder is a "
"friendly sort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c194_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've bought a number of things from Gunder. I've always been satisfied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049953_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've browsed Claudette's shop, but I haven't spent a lot of time there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001cdff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've checked my sources, and no one knows this \"Agarmir\"; he's probably "
"using a false name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've come across your kind before. People get murdered, and you ask "
"questions. It's a sure sign of a killer with a guilty conscience. Watch "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c344_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've come from speaking with Count Indarys, and I've news for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12AcceptMission_00018239_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've come into the possession of a diary written by an Akaviri messenger. I "
"suspect that the text within can lead you to the ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopYes_0001e840_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've come to some decisions. I intend to donate all of the money I have made, "
"as well as what is left of these stolen items to the temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk3_0018d7f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've come to value your judgement, and your experience. Your wisdom does us "
"all a great service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022509_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've committed most of the book to memory, but I took the time to write down "
"a passage you might find useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09BodyParts_0001357a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've created versions of each appendage, with various enhancements. You must "
"choose one of each. I am attached to them all. Artist's prerogative."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006e_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I've deciphered part of the ritual needed to open a portal to Camoran's "
"Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Goblins_000319d1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've done some scouting around while we've been camped here, and it looks "
"like Cropsford is right in the middle of a goblin war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've eaten many meals there, and I've always been satisfied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've faced your kind before. You're a coward. You use stealth and lies to "
"destroy innocent lives. All of that ends now! Prepare to meet your doom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d58_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"I've figured out another item needed for the ritual to open the portal to "
"Camoran's Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've fought mudcrabs more fearsome than you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34ExplainMore_0008f7b8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've found a new kind of comforting inner peace here away from the chaos of "
"Cyrodiil. I'm tired of the battles and the politics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've given up trying to figure it out. It's just beyond us. Why Denel stays "
"down there, I have no idea. He's just asking to get killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Message_0018bc5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've given you the message. There's nothing more I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've gone aground in ports all over the Abecean Sea, and Anvil's far from the "
"worst. Got the Fo'c's'le for my hammock, and Mirabelle to keep it warm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e829_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got a Quintat that says they can ipanate"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a944b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got a bad feeling about this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got a few hot prospects. I'm sure something will come through for me. "
"Soon. Really soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk1_0006a85e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got a moment, but little more. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b129f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got a room, and a cheap one at that. You looking for one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009216_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got another contract for you, meat. I assume you won't embarrass "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002d733_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got another job for you, slightly off the record. You'll be going on a "
"mission with Viranus Donton. Yes -- the Guildmaster's son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002f9e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got another job for you. It's a sensitive one. I need you to find "
"Viranus Donton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0005de7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got food and drink, if you need it. I haven't touched it much, so it "
"should be safe. Might want to wipe it off first anyway. You never know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071f54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got fresh sticks. Guaranteed no leaves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000be7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got more for you. Important stuff, actually. You need to go talk to Lord "
"Rugdumph."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072e04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got my eye on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorWhere_0000979f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got my men scattered all over town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028beb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've got my old Legion armor and sword in a chest upstairs. It's time I "
"geared up and showed this coward just who he's dealing with!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0006e2de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got my orders for now. Check back in a month or so, and we can talk "
"about what to do next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be64_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've got news for you. Vilena wasn't happy when she heard about Viranus. No "
"shock there. She expelled Oreyn from the guild. It's a damn shame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got no interest in talking about some snooty mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000be76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got nothing else for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047424_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got nothing else. Don't believe Azzan does either. I think you had "
"better go talk to our friend in Chorrol. You know who."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047426_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got nothing more for you, my friend. I believe Burz has one further "
"assignment, but that is all. I wish you luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fugitives_00009c30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got nothing to say about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bed7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got one more for you, meat. I assume you can handle it. I need you to "
"investigate some disappearances at Harlun's Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003457e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got some bad news for you. Donton didn't take the news about her son "
"well at all, not that you'd expect otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c8521_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've got some news for you. Vilena wasn't happy when she heard about Viranus. "
"No shock there. She expelled Oreyn from the guild. It's a damn shame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002c5b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got something for you, but we're not going to talk about it here. I want "
"you to meet me at my house after sundown. We'll talk more then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00009c59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got something for you. Could be tough. There are some escaped fugitives "
"for you to find, meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00Voice_0003c421_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got that one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000549bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've got the diary, and I will turn it over to Armand the next chance I get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0005e077_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got the sharpest blades in the Isles. Maybe anywhere. Take a look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b82c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got this one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00054219_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've got your horse saddled and waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04XedilianChoice_00044f52_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I've granted you a new spell - the ability to summon Haskill, my Chamberlain, "
"to aid you in your travels. He knows a lot. More than he knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f7ba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I've grown quite fond of him and can't stand seeing him this way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyBruma_0004f215_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've had a look at the place myself, and it could use some furnishings "
"inside. Quite barren in there I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c23b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've had about enough of Sir Lazare. He thinks he's so much better than "
"everyone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ06Bears_0018afe0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've had attacks on my small flock of sheep lately. I was hoping that "
"building a fence would solve the problem, but it hasn't helped at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_00046585_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've had many a good night in the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've had many good meals at the Count's Arms. I've had even more good bottles "
"of wine there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've had many meals at the Oak and Crosier. Sure, it may not be the best in "
"all Cyrodiil, but it suits me fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004658e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've had many meals there. Olav is an excellent innkeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_00035f3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've had my fill of the place, that's for sure. And I've got the scars to "
"prove it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC2_0003fbe0_Oblivion_RESP8"
msgid ""
"I've had plenty of time to ponder my deeds since I came here. Ponder, and "
"regret. An eternity of regret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b1d8_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I've had some people out collecting your new combatants. The wilderness is "
"full of 'em! Let me know when you're ready for a match, and it's showtime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d62b_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I've had some people out collecting your new combatants. The wilderness is "
"full of 'em! Let me know when you're ready for a match, and it's showtime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've half a mind to go down to Green Emperor Way myself and see what's there "
"... Well, good luck! I hope you find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Azzan can sign you up for the Fighters Guild. That's someone I "
"wouldn't mind working for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Azzan is an excellent fighter. I'm not planning on joining up, but "
"if I did, I'd like to work for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Brodras at the Fighters Guild is well-versed in using heavy armor, "
"especially for a wood elf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Carahil is a powerful illusionist. No wonder she's the ranking "
"mage here in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008261e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Cindanwe works the other residents day and night. They're none too "
"happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046630_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard Edla Dark-Heart was once an assassin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Right-Wind is good with a blade. No wonder he's in the Fighters "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Tadrose Helas does excellent work. Perhaps that's why she's always "
"so busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005eee8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard The Fringe has been attacked. I hope the residents were able to "
"escape in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard Tun-Zeeus has some fine blades at the Dividing Line. Of course, "
"he'll talk your ear off about them if you let him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c219_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard a lot of stories about the Fo'c's'le. None of them good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004663b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard a number of stories, none of them good. I understand she might "
"have been a hired assassin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard ghosts haunt the ruined city of Vitharn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fdb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard good things about the mage trainers there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004662c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard he can teach his skills to others, for a price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008261f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard he can't even sleep, he's so afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e976_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard he joined the priesthood to avoid serving in the military. What a "
"coward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard he knows his way around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003e255_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard he knows more about Mysticism than almost anyone. Strange about "
"the sheep, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003e2ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard he never leaves his laboratory. He's certainly dedicated to his "
"craft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049887_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard he'll teach his skills, for the right price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard he's a talented mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard he's good with a lockpick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c21e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard he's good with his bow, and he'll train you, for a price. I like "
"the wine he makes, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard he's the best in town with a shield. If you want to learn, go to "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e992_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard him talk at length about the Mages Guild. I understand he's been "
"teaching members about Illusion, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard him talk, and talk, and talk. Haven't heard anything useful yet, "
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003dfc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard if you're in the Fighters Guild, you can learn a lot from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00015f11_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've heard it all. They say he's immortal because he's led the Thieves Guild "
"for over 300 years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004995a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard it's the best light armor in the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004661b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard many of Alga's stories. She's got a real gift for telling a tale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025819_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard many tales of Black Marsh. It sounds like a truly mysterious place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018231_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard much about your deeds from my people in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_00025016_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard nothing good. In Morrowind, they say the man-god Vivec has gone "
"missing. Some believe he has been taken by the daedra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've heard of a Daedra worshipper named Olyn Seran. Very powerful, and might "
"be helpful, if you can find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhatSecrets_0004b776_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard of a hidden torture chamber. They say that Count Marius "
"interrogates Argonian immigrants from Black Marsh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Rohssan_00007e01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard of her. What's it worth to ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01AmantiusAllectus_00007dfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard of him. What's it worth to ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000253c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard of it, but I don't really know what it is. Something about tapping "
"into the power of the weather. Those Ayleids were pretty crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08AncestorMoth_00015f1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard of it. Are you willing to make a donation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BGreenmote_000167e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard of such a grand place. Ahhh... to imagine all that wonderful "
"Greenmote under one roof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002980_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard of you! You're the Divine Crusader everybody's talking about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_00029548_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard others say the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078171_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard rumors about her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c19f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard rumors about him, but I don't believe they're true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about the Council of Mages consorting with outside sources. "
"Why are outsiders interfering with our guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_00077d0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard rumors about this. I hope they stay out of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c242_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors that someone has been keeping a close eye on Toutius "
"Sextius. Seems harmless enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062686_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors that the Council of Mages is taking advice from outsiders. "
"I'm not sure how I feel about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000253d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors, but they're nothing more than that. Imperials trying to "
"harness the power of the Ayleids... they're not fools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c21b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard she works long hours. It's worth it, though. That's some fine wine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard she'll do anything for other guild members, and that she's an "
"excellent trainer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008262c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard she'll pay well for certain items she's been looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard she's quite a talented mage, with an extensive knowledge of "
"illusory spells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046617_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard she's quite skilled in Destruction, and is a favorite of Kud-Ei's."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025277_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard so much about you. Welcome to our family!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard some new person has arrived in the Realm. I simply don't have the "
"time to meet somebody new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard some strange stories about Count Hassildor. I'm sure they couldn't "
"be true, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard stories of a woman who traveled the world on foot before settling "
"down somewhere in Cyrodiil... Anvil, I think it was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006143d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard tales of a woman who used a blunt weapon in horrible ways people "
"had never seen. Irene Metrick, I think her name was. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorsUmaril_00002bcc_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard tell it's some new kind of daedra, that no one's ever seen before. "
"In league with this Umaril creature, according to that prophet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a07_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard tell of a knight questing for the Crusader's Relics. I wonder if "
"he'll succeed before another chapel is desecrated?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Arentus Falvius at the chapel can conjure up creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046638_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that City-Swimmer has learned the value of not being seen. Quite "
"impressive, and she'll teach it to others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e250_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Dagail knows a lot about Mysticism. And sheep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Feren Relas knows quite a bit about alchemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Gnarl get stronger when hit by some spells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Hil the Tall knows a lot about Alteration, how to cast "
"shields and that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004660b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that J'skar has great skill at making things explode."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046619_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Jantus Brolus is skilled with both magic and steel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c218_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Mirabelle spends a lot of time with the sailors. A lot of "
"personal time with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Naspia Cosma would rather be fighting in the Arena than "
"spending time at the castle. She's excellent with a blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c203_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that Reman is good with a bow. Apparently, he's the best in all of "
"Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Renoit has a good selection, and at reasonable prices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007817c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that Skinned Hounds don't like fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that about Fadus. He's quite impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that even their corpses can be dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046592_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that he'd rather be a painter. Still, he runs the place well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that magic doesn't affect them much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e975_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that she's always wanted to compete, but her parents are against "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AkaviriArtifacts_000980f5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've heard that she's troubled by a particular piece that continues to elude "
"her. However, I'm unsure of what it is, as she keeps it a secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c23d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that someone has it out for Toutius Sextius. Who'd want to hurt "
"him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002c5a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that the Fighters Guild has been having some problems with their "
"contracts recently. That's not like them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that the new Gatekeeper is fearsome. The ground will soon be red "
"with the blood of those that would challenge him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that there are new adventurers coming. I wonder what new "
"discoveries they will bring to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d892_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that there's a powerful conjurer off in the woods someplace, "
"worshipping Molag Bal. Olyn Seran, I think his name was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEHillofSuicidesTopic_0008e55e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've heard that those that free the souls become blessed. Can't say for sure. "
"They scatter the remains all over the Isles. Bastards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that you closed the Oblivion Gate outside Anvil. I honor you for "
"your bravery and service to my city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000363c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard that you've been asking around about that corrupt guard. Just "
"don't mention my name. I have enough problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00078181_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard that. It's best to steer clear of them, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sanctuary_000251f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard the Count of Cheydinhal knows about this Sanctuary. But he is "
"offered much gold, as well as other... incentives, to keep his mouth shut. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002c675_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard the Fighters Guild has managed to recruit a few new members. Good "
"thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044212_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard the Great Torch is lit once more. City dwellers. Such useless "
"folk. I've got no use for them. A giant torch? Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000613ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard the Resonator is a dangerous thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard the dogs that J'bari keeps drive her crazy. I've also heard she "
"knows a lot about acrobatics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard the same. Good reason to carry a Cure Disease potion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard the same. Still, best to just avoid them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard them, but I think they just do it for fun. They seem to enjoy it, "
"and it's all in good fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003de90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard them. They're pretty stupid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard there are a number of diseases they carry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard there are good trainers there. Costs a bit of coin, though. I'd "
"rather go out and practice on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a383d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've heard there's a Vaermina shrine at the headwaters of the Reed River, "
"though I've never been there myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard there's no one in the city better at opening locks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard there's someone in Highcross trying to catalogue every living "
"thing in the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard they drain the health and magicka from a body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard they feel at home in the water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard they hate the water. It certainly doesn't help them any."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000255b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard they have good magic trainers over at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082631_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard they're not happy about it, but Lord Sheogorath has forbidden them "
"to do anything about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_0000357e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard things, to be sure, but I don't really know anything about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081528_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard what you do to dogs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard what you've done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000677c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard word of your great deeds. It's good to meet someone else striving "
"to be known throughout the land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d885_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard you mentioned in hushed tones. Quite the evil doer, are you? Well, "
"what's infamy but another type of fame, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_000700be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard you were able to lift the curse from Benirus Manor and destroy "
"Lorgren Benirus once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've heard. But he's not afraid of Khajiit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008262a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've heard. He's even afraid of Khajiit. He once hid dog food in a Khajiit's "
"clothes, just so his dog would go after her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073479_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've just been arrested for corruption, so I'm not in the mood to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007322a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've just discovered that water is actually heavier than air. Who would have "
"thought?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ea7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've just received word from the Countess of Bruma that an Oblivion Gate has "
"opened outside the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've killed far worse than you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaF1_000a5608_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've learned of another crown, entombed with the last ruler of the rival city "
"of Lindai."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've learned some more information. Vampires are immune to paralysis spells "
"and common diseases. I hope that helps in some way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk2_00002bb0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've learned that a rare artifact lies buried beneath the Tenmar Forest, in "
"Elsweyr. We must launch an expedition!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_000221f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've learned that the Mysterium Xarxes is both the gate and the key to "
"Camoran's Paradise. In some sense, the book IS Camoran's Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fe4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've liked some of Scribonia's work. Haven't read everything, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ade_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've lived here all my life. Grown grapes. It's all I know. Fresh air, "
"mountains, the grapes on the vine. It's just... beautiful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've lived in Leyawiin all my life, and I must say, the Count has found "
"himself a pretty little bride...and a smart one, too. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've looked everywhere. Perhaps she's still in Kvatch, in a basement, hiding?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_breakins_0003573f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've lost a great deal of merchandise over the last few months. I keep "
"replacing it, but they keep stealing it, new locks on the doors be damned!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c6d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've lost my way. This place looks so familiar, but I can't remember how I "
"got here. Can you help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've made a few bets. Made some good money, actually!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002711a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've made no progress on the fourth item. And every day that passes brings "
"the Mythic Dawn closer to victory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've made some bets. Won some, lost some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000221f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've made some progress on the Mysterium Xarxes. I think I've identified the "
"section that deals with opening a portal to Camoran's Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038bbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've made some progress with the Mysterium Xarxes, finally!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002a382_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've made you a little pumpkin bread... something to keep up your strength on "
"those long night watches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000980d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've more important things to do than chat with you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000980d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've more important things to do than chat with you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've much to tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasC3_0009532f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I've never actually met any of them, I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fe0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never been a huge dog lover myself, but some people really love them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000237ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never been here before. And I won't be back, unless the boss wants me "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never been that interested in the Mages Guild, myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004990a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never bought one there, but I've heard many mages swear by the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never counted a Knight of Order corpse. I wonder what they look like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078175_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never found anything myself, but Una's always looking for more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08SavillasStoneTopic_0009838c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never heard of it. Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006249c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never heard the Countess mention her husband. I believe it is something "
"of a sore point with Lady Millona."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never laid a hand on her. Either in anger or... I've never hurt her, "
"okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049892_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never met tougher. She did offer to teach me some of her bargaining "
"tricks, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never read any of Quill-Weave's writings. I've heard they're fairly "
"good, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000277b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never read that. Been meaning to pick it up, though. Perhaps I can read "
"it when you're finished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never really thought about it. I've heard the money is good, but that's "
"a bit too much risk for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_00023897_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never run into her there, but I can't blame her for enjoying the "
"matches. Almost everyone likes them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never seen a dead Gatekeeper. I should add him to my list. Did I ever "
"tell you I've counted over a 900 dead rats...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002923_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "I've never seen anything like these Aurorans before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_00028553_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never seen anything like this. It's horrible, just horrible. I'm just "
"going to keep my head down, and follow my orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c489_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never seen my Lady so happy. You've done well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never seen my own double. And I certainly don't want to talk about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never seen such a huge bird. Don't peck out my eyes! I mean it. Stay "
"back, you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never seen such colors on a cat before. You're the most beautiful thing "
"I've ever seen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049952_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never shopped there, but I know she carries good alchemy equipment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fdc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never spent time at the Mages Guild. I've thought about it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004988d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never used his services, but I hear he's a good teacher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've never used his services. I mean, how many people have enchanted things "
"just lying around? Outside of the guild, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c1d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've never wanted to join up, but I understand Azzan is a good man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've no time for conspiracies. Get in the way, they do. Glad I wasn't "
"involved at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've not always been happy with the standards of conduct in the Mages Guild, "
"but Hannibal Traven's reforms are quite encouraging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BookResponses_000285ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've not read that yet. It's a shame there isn't more time to spend with good "
"books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047427_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've nothing else for you, and I don't believe Burz has any, either. I think "
"perhaps you had better speak with our friend in Chorrol. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c202_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've nothing more to say to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000914d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008961b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've nothing to tell the likes of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046602_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've noticed the same thing. I wonder what's going on there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've often thought about joining the Fighters Guild. I've heard you can make "
"a good living there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000395d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've only got one more thing on my plate for you, but it's an important one. "
"The Stone of St. Alessia has been stolen from the Bruma Chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've only recently been promoted. I'm not going to cause trouble by filing "
"charges against one of the other Watch Captains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Scales_00066f2c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've picked up a few things in my travels. If you head out there and bring me "
"back the twelve scales that I need, I can make it worth your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038afa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've provided Raynil's description to all of the Bruma soldiers and even "
"dispatched his description to guards in other cities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002a386_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've put aside a little mead for you. I know you like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000366df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've put myself in your hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWait_0001e8da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've put myself in your hands. Don't fail me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQDaedricMagic_0008b603_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"I've put those days behind me. But the bitter wisdom that one has been a fool "
"is not without value."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d48d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've put together a, well... a gang. We make money by luring fools out to the "
"middle of nowhere and robbing them blind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049962_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've read it. Terribly written, sensationalistic tripe, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've ridden horses with better sense than you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've said all there is to be said. Trouble me no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089616_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've seen Ma'zaddha, yes. Talkin' to that Seducer, Nelrene. All secretive-"
"like, out in the street late at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c251_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've seen Shameer at the Tamika Vineyards practicing archery. He's really "
"good. I might try to get some pointers from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028724_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've seen death like this before. Many years ago, my daughter was murdered by "
"bandits who came to our village. I'm sorry... I... I need a drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028ce1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've seen enough in my time to know that anyone is capable of murder if they "
"have the right motivation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046628_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've seen her in the canals a number of times. Other times, I've seen her "
"sneaking around the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've seen plenty of Ayleid ruins. You'd think they'd be picked clean after "
"2000 years, but, no, there's still great treasures there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDAreldurTopic_00002b00_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've seen plenty of pity in peoples' eyes over the years. I grew up "
"recognizing it. But with Areldur... There's something else there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_000238b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've seen them. Everyone likes a good dog, but they're an odd couple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001829c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've seen this next one fight before. She's a Nord, very quick, very strong. "
"She favors a longsword and knows how to use it. Don't underestimate her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ05RaelynntheGravefinder_0018abd6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've seen undead of all types walking in the dark woods near the cave "
"entrance. Now, this area's getting a bad reputation and my business has waned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've sent Captain Lerus to Bruma. She is one of my best soldiers. I'm glad to "
"be able to help defend the heir to the throne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor09_0003246c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've served the Nine all my days, and I chart my course by the cycles of the "
"heavens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor10_0003246d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've served the Nine all my days, and I chart my course by the cycles of the "
"heavens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor11_0003246f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've served the Nine all my days, and I chart my course by the cycles of the "
"heavens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've settled down here. Nice place. A little slow, but it suits me. Burz gro-"
"Khash is a bear sometimes, but I got thick skin. Doesn't bother me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049942_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've shopped there a few times. If you're looking for soul gems, that's the "
"place to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004993b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've shopped there many times. The brothers never fail to please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0007816c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've shopped with Tilse many times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00033e92_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I've sighted the Forlorn Watchman again. Every time I see that ghost, it "
"gives me the creeps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00091997_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've slain Grummites tougher than you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004991a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've sold some things there. Thoronir is an odd one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've sometimes thought I'd like to make a pilgrimage to the wayshrines, but "
"my duties prevent me from such extensive and dangerous travel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've spoken to him a number of times about inner peace and spiritual harmony. "
"I'm not sure I understood it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d937_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with Erthor, who seems to be all right. Good work. I'll see to it "
"that your recommendation is sent in, as soon as I have a free moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB2_00095329_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I've spoken with Hermaeus Mora beneath the full moons! I've..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB2_00095330_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I've spoken with Hermaeus Mora beneath the full moons! I've..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17TravenHowLearn_000366eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with several individuals I cannot name at this time. Count "
"Hassildor has also provided valuable information, as you well know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've still got my eye on you, prisoner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49ChoiceNoTime_00031d2c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I've still got some fight left in me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona11_00022e85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've stood right next to you, and you didn't even know it. I cried out to you "
"\"Here I am! It's me, Corvus!\" but you just looked at me, confused."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've suspected that as well. Still, it's not a bad place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00051ea4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've sworn to die, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053774_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I've taken care of Arnora, she won't be around to point the finger. And "
"Jorundr's not going anywhere for a long time. That just leaves you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07Spies_0002008d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told my men to keep a sharp eye out, but I've had no reports of any "
"strangers in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00098380_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told the Watch that I don't know anything about the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c16a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've told you all I can. Seek out Alawen if you wish to train further with "
"your bow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00080d7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you all I know. It was Ma'zaddha... I don't know anything more, I "
"swear it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_00003926_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told you all I know. Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035671_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you all you need to know. Follow the road west out of town and "
"through the High Pasture; the Count will meet you there at 2 AM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00080d3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told you everything I know! I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00093550_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you the location of the gold. You did your part, so have at it. As "
"far as the amulets are concerned... keep 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro4_00082465_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I've told you too much for now. Listen to me prattle on. I can see your "
"mortal brain straining. We'll talk more later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008961a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told you what I know. There's nothing more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_0001344b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you what I will. The Chalice is a corruption. Felldew is a poison, "
"not an amusement. You're better off leaving the Chalice where it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told you what we need. Until we've work, we'll stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00080d7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told you, I don't know anything. You can't prove a thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008117a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've told you, I don't know anything. You can't prove a thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFelldew_00019537_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you, it'll kill you. Actually, now that I think about it, why don't "
"you go eat some? Eat all you can find. I'd get a chuckle out of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFelldew_00019538_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you, it'll kill you. While I don't care if it does, I don't think "
"you want that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b1f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've told you. The only way to lift the curse from Kellen is to pray to "
"Stendarr for the power to free him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've traveled by prison ship. It was cramped and dark. There was little room "
"to move around, but plenty of shadowy nooks to hide in. Remember that.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006041f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've tried to tell all my children to flee the Realm while they still can, "
"but none listen to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000549bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I've won the competition! My membership into the guild is assured."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I've worked on the docks as long as Vlanarus, but he thinks he's the expert. "
"He's always looking over my shoulder, do it this way, do it that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30Amber_0001650a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I, alone, know the ancient art of forging Amber. I can even craft you magical "
"items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril2_00002c56_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I, too, long to strike a blow in the gods' defense. But the time is not yet "
"ripe. The Relics have not all been recovered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting2a_00019fca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"I, too, want to see her dead. And others here have had enough of her, yes. We "
"wish the light, and keep it from us, she does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I ain't got nothing to say! Now leave me be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009e3e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I am returning to the Sanctuary, as quickly as I possibly can, oh great "
"Listener!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028175_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I can't believe he's dead. Such a strong, handsome man... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002952_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I can't believe it! We survived! By the grace of the Nine! We survived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I can't believe it's true. One of us is dead... and everyone else is "
"convinced it was no accident. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017973_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I cannot believe it! You survived! We were certain that your light had "
"been lost!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKellenTopic_00002b05_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I cannot face him. I know what might be done for him, but I haven't the "
"will to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_0001447f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I didn't do anything. She threatened me, but I didn't do anything. I'm "
"loyal to Syl, I tell you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_00091219_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I don't even know what to say. How could we have been so wrong? Lucien "
"tried to explain, but we wouldn't listen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11JournalGive_00038587_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I don't know what to say. It all makes perfect sense now. Why else would "
"Raynil have removed this journal from the crime scene in Skingrad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05AnyaWhat_00080d7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I don't know, not for sure. Ma'zaddha came to me, said that Syl needed "
"to be removed, and that I was supposed to help them, or else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreeting1a_00016b6e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"I... I don't remember what happened afterwards. I woke up in the marshes and "
"fled underground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146cd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I... I don't understand. She was one of my most trusted advisors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028266_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I don't understand. Who would kill him? And why? Is this about the gold? "
" "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I don't understand. You're the only one left. Why weren't you killed? "
"No... no... it can't be... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014481_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I don't want to stay here! Please stop hurting me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006a853_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I heard what they did to Lucien Lachance... Is it true that Arquen "
"feasted on his entrails? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TidewaterCaveTOPIC_00026abd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I know nothing of the place. Just an old cave, from what I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002edd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I must get to the Grey Mare. Must get away from here... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Choice2A_00027533_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I... I need a drink to calm my nerves. Please, excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002823e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I never trusted her. But I never wanted to see her dead. Have you no "
"compassion at all? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028250_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I rather like Primo. He's not like the other boys I've known. He has... "
"class. He could never have killed anyone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001648c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"I... I received a note from Arch-Mage Traven. I know what he did for us, and "
"that he selected you to take his place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0f6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "I... I saw his face. I saw the King of Worms!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028701_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I thought he was hunting the killer. Now I don't know what to think! I "
"don't trust him, or you! Stay away from me! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetF2_00002b73_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I understand. I'll be patient. I'll stay here and train every day until "
"you decide I'm ready. I won't give up, I swear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028258_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I wanted to get to know him. Be his friend. Maybe... maybe more. I can't "
"believe he's gone.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b074_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I'm at a loss for words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk5_00068347_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I'm glad you wanted to talk. You'll always have my sword, of course. But "
"you have my ear as well. Anytime. As a friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0002573e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I... I'm sorry. You did all you could, I'm sure. Thank you for trying. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0003abfa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "I... I'm sorry. You did all you could, I'm sure. Thank you for trying. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038437_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I'm sorry... I can't right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... I've heard some talk. This past year, some family members have been "
"found... murdered! Could there be an assassin among assassins? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0003abfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... I've lost a son? No! It can't be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05MazaddhaSawYou_00081186_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I... I... It's for the good of Crucible! You must see that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Message_0018bc66_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "I... J'baana was informed already.... The delays are not my fault..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKellenTopic_00002b06_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... No, I couldn't. I'm sorry, there's nothing I can do for him. Truly, I am "
"sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_0001585b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... What note are you talking about? I don't understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d032_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I... can't believe what I'm seeing in this book. I'm mortified. To think "
"these things here were once on the bodies of the recently deceased."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000148ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... can't speak to you... talk to her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001fbb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "I... do not feel well. Please, excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"I..I can't believe she's dead. Seeing her body lying there.... It's like my "
"poor daughter all over again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Identify yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00086766_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Idiot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082617_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Idiotic. She'll pay people to help her, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02FinChoice1A_00023e48_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If Baenlin is eliminated in any other manner, or if the manservant Gromm is "
"killed, you will forfeit the bonus. Now go, and may Sithis be with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachTopic_0004302b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Brellach is indeed under attack, you should prepare yourself for a "
"difficult fight. The forces of Order must be quite powerful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35RumorResponses_0007866d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If Brithaur doesn't watch it, he may disappear one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13NarinaMartin1_00027780_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If Bruma falls, the Empire falls with us. So be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0018d2a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Captain Burd and the Guard can't close that Oblivion Gate, then what? Will "
"Bruma be destroyed just like Kvatch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031cf0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Captain Matius is waiting on you to get that gate raised, you'd better get "
"moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Countess Chorrol is any example, dignity and piety may indeed bring rich "
"rewards from the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11HistoryChanged_00022e8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Emer Dareloth had not stolen Nocturnal's Cowl, the Thieves Guild would "
"never have fallen on such hard times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If I can send you back with something worthwhile, Irlav may forget all about "
"our delays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_00066a60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I can't fix it, it ain't broke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I could kill myself, I would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I could use a shield as well as Ambrose, I'd charge people for training, "
"too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BPleasures_000167e1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If I didn't have such a busy daily routine, I'd likely indulge myself in its "
"pleasures more often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG02Choice1A_0002e5aa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If I didn't know better, I'd say he purposely tossed it down the well behind "
"the guild hall. Why he would do such a thing is beyond me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028cd2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If I didn't know better, I'd say you were trying to turn me against him to "
"cover your own tracks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I don't find something soon, I'm going to have to try my luck at "
"adventuring. My pals say there's a lot of caves and ruins west towards "
"Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047654_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I don't have what you need, try Claudette Perrick at 'The Gilded Carafe'. "
"That's right here in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_000237e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I don't have what you need, you might try the other Chorrol merchants. "
"Renoit's has books. Fire and Steel for your armor and weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I ever see that elf, he's in so much trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokC3Idle01_0008ea86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I find out who's running the show... there'll be hell to pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004989e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I had a question about heavy armor, I'd probably ask Varnado at The Best "
"Defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AncotarTopic_000301e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If I had my way, we'd go down there and burn him out. Let him find some other "
"place for his little \"experiments.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_000245a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I liked you better, then I might tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I may be honest, I feel a bit sorry for the old woman. She comes from a "
"noble family, I'm sure, but seems a lot less well off than she should be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_000826d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I may be so bold, Inquisitor, I believe this person has nothing to "
"contribute to our investigation. Perhaps we should move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_0006834f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I may be so bold... you are the true Dragonborn, sir, there's no one here "
"that doubts it. Any one of us would gladly die so that you may live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002818c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I may confide in you, dear friend, I'm very worried about the poor boy. "
"The trauma of murders... it could scar him for life! He deserves better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ThalfinWhatNow_000366f0_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If I may, I'd suggest that you put us in the best possible positions based on "
"our abilities. But it's up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002f1ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I still had it, I'd gladly give it back. You'll have to talk to Soris "
"Arenim if you want it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I thought I could make the trip safely, I'd go to Crucible and find out if "
"the torture revealed anything about Them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b079_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I was ever rude to you before, I'm sorry. You deserve my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I were in the Mages Guild, I think I'd study Mysticism. Druja was telling "
"me a bit about it, and it sounds interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadon_00016570_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I were you, I'd check with Thadon's Steward, Wide-Eye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d4b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I were you, I'd go to the cabin in the daytime. That way, if he begins to "
"overpower you, the outside can be a sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09AlreadyDead_00090869_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If I were you, after you're released, I'd get out of Bruma fast before the "
"guards catch on that they let a murderer free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000918fc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If I were you, and thank Sheogorath that I'm not, I would begin with the "
"people who spend their day closest to Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000918d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If I were you, and thank Sheogorath that I'm not, I would begin with the "
"people who spend their day closest to Thadon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12RootDungeon_0001a327_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I'm not mistaken, that's the traitor Syl. Right there. I'm not normally a "
"bloodthirsty man, but I wonder if killing her might be a good idea?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12RootDungeon_0001a326_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I'm not mistaken, that's the traitor Thadon. Right there. I'm not normally "
"a bloodthirsty man, but I wonder if killing him might be a good idea?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d92a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If I'm to buy the wine from you, you need to have it with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If I've told you once, I've told you a thousand times, I've NEVER been to "
"Cheydinhal! I.... oh, hang on. You're someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Lord Rugdumph had used the Blackwood Company, who knows how it would have "
"turned out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_00083f39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Ma'zaddha has indeed been consulting with Nelrene of her Ladyship's guard, "
"that would provide us with some excellent leverage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e135_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Madness Ore or Amber you should unearth, bring them to New Sheoth to "
"discover their worth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_00085712_Oblivion_RESP8"
msgid ""
"If Mehrunes Dagon is able to cross over into our world, even relighting the "
"Dragonfires will not be able to send him back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Parwen wants to spend all day hunting goblins, I think it's great. Those "
"things are a menace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000617a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If Passwall has fallen, which of us will be next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPinnacleRockTopic_0004302a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Pinnacle Rock is indeed under attack, you should prepare yourself for a "
"difficult fight. The forces of Order must be quite powerful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatWellspring_00017471_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If Syl helps Order sever that link... my kind will be annihilated. The realm "
"will be lost to us. We must get to the Wellspring and stop them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000253c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Teekeeus says it's a myth, I have no reason to believe otherwise. Can you "
"prove him wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If Thadon has his Chalice back, maybe that will smooth things over between "
"the two Houses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatWellspring_00017d17_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If Thadon helps Order sever that link... my kind will be annihilated. The "
"realm will be lost to us. We must get to the Wellspring and stop them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d58b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If Volanaro and J'skar want to have their fun, fine. I'm not going to "
"participate, and I'm not saying another word about it. Take it up with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If a Guild fighter defaults on a contract, he's out. We won't compete with "
"Blackwood Company by defaulting on our contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10GiveBoots_00015310_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If all goes well, I may call upon you for one last task. The danger will be "
"great, but the reward will be greater. Unfortunately, there is a problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA3_00082dc5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If all this is part of a divine plan, I'm not sure I want to have anything to "
"do with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_00038588_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If all you say is true, Raynil will answer for Bradon's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001da5e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If any of our books can help you in the cause of destroying more, you're "
"welcome to read them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fd72_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If anyone asks, you are a traveling merchant, nothing more. Do not say "
"otherwise to anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022e60_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If anyone can help you get more information about these crystals, she can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e931_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If anyone can help you identify this root, he can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e146_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If at Sickly Bernice's Taphouse you wish to drink, take a moment to stop and "
"think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhat_000835fb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If for any reason they are unsuccessful, Mucianus' life will be in forfeit. "
"You must make sure he is safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CastleResidents_000038ba_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If he isn't in the castle, he may be at the Northern Goods and Trade buying "
"food to stock our larder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutsideChoiceSweetroll_000790bb_Oblivion_RESP"
"4"
msgid ""
"If he still no go, make Uungor crispy with fire spell. Then glaze. Then eat "
"him like a giant sweetroll. Saa-WEET-ROOOOOLL!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00018b7b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If he were smart, he'd thank Sheogorath it's out of his hands now. And, of "
"course, he'd never risk himself traveling through Dunroot Burrow to get it"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038580_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"If he won't surrender, I think you know what to do. Hurry, I fear you have a "
"day at the most to stop him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If he'll train you in picking locks, you're probably already pretty good at "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_0001e8aa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If he's lucky, he's trapped in there with the rest of them, at least safe for "
"the moment. If he's not..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_0005e15c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If he's not in the Priory House, you may find him praying in the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_000299cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If he's not sleeping or eating, he'll be fussing with his books, I reckon, "
"over in the Priory House."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09JyggalagTopic_0009135c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If he's on his way, I'm on My way out. I already feel not quite Myself. Not "
"quite someone else... but not quite Myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AncotarTopic_000301e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If he's smart, he'll keep out of my way. High elf and a mage to boot, the "
"worst kind of arrogance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00022b3d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If it exists, it would be an artifact of great -- and evil -- power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00015f26_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If it is not returned soon, they will let Lex return to the Waterfront. You "
"must finish the job. Go now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27AyleidCrown_000a656c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If it isn't already too late, we would all be better off if you found a "
"different Ayleid Crown for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If it isn't the newest member of the family. Let's get one thing straight -- "
"the Tenets prevent me from killing you. But I don't have to like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity3_0008f58a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If it isn't the spitting image of Lord Sheogorath himself! So lifelike you "
"can almost see his bad eye twitching! Perfect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d290_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it isn't the toast of Leyawiin! How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13MessengerA2_0001a798_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If it please my Lord, she requested also that I inform you that time is of "
"the essence, in her humble opinion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13MessengerB2_0005e37b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If it please my Lord, she requested also that I inform you that time is of "
"the essence, in her humble opinion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000292c_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If it pleases you, I would join your Order and serve the Nine at your side. "
"What say you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ReturnHome_0001c1ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it wasn't for my friend here, you'd be right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00084b3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it wasn't for you, I never would have found Reynald. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice1_0003570e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If it were not for you, and Oreyn... I dare not think it. Now, we must speak "
"about what you've done, and how it will affect any further advancement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfa9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it weren't for me, you'd be mucking stables in Orsinium!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_001854e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it's a fight you want, it's a fight you'll get!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033ef4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If it's about Cropsford, please talk to my father. He'll know what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078170_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it's books you're looking for, it's the only place to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_00038999_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it's broken, I can fix it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ab7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If it's not one thing, it's another. The Count is very particular about his "
"food and drink. Everything must be just so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078177_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it's spells you need, Earil's is the place to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_0008ef7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If it's steel you want, it's steel you'll get!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e14b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If its spells you seek, this place supplies, use Earil's for all your magic "
"buys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018bc62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If more knowledge is what you seek, you must consult J'baana. He is wise in "
"the way of locks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ValusOdiilTopic_000224ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If my father is not at home, he should be in the Grey Mare. He is supposed to "
"come with us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002528b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If not for the Tenets, I would slay you where you stand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081c4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If only I could end it all... it's so simple. No. I mustn't do it myself. "
"Maybe someone will accidentally knock me off the edge. That'd be wonderful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06MaikiChoiceA_00012cbe_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "If only I could make Kaneh see that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002855b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If only I had a way to strike back at the enemy. But we can't leave the "
"barricade until that Oblivion Gate is closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_00081ae2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If only I had seen it sooner. My beloved Syl might stand here next to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If only I had seen it sooner. Thadon might stand here next to me, to help "
"usher in the rule of Order to this benighted realm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SidePassage_00012cbd_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If only Kaneh would listen to me. An attack down the main passage will end "
"the same as it always does -- a glorious defeat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberTwoMan01_000671f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If only Lewin were here... he could get us through this in no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelC2Idle01_0008eaaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If only my arts included open lock spells...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1C_00090791_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If only my other children had offered such reverence. You see, I have known "
"of Mathieu Bellamont's intentions since he was just a boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1B_00090790_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If only my other children had served me so well! You see, I have known of "
"Mathieu Bellamont's intentions since he was just a boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008fab0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If only we could speak more often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If only we had our home back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49DukeDeadNice_00091c59_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If only we'd gotten here sooner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If our new hard hand keeps closing contracts like the Rugdumph one, we'll be "
"all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00007b31_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If perhaps you can clear up a small matter involving Earana, you can prove "
"your loyalty to the guild and earn my recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinCHoice2C_0004ce4b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If possible, do away with Faelian someplace out of the way. Definitely "
"indoors, with no other people around. A secure location, with no witnesses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice2A_0004ce49_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If possible, do away with Faelian someplace out of the way. Definitely "
"indoors, with no other people around. A secure location, with no witnesses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice2B_0004ce4a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If possible, do away with Faelian someplace out of the way. Definitely "
"indoors, with no other people around. A secure location, with no witnesses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11WhatNow_00022e1e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If she asks, just tell her a stranger wanted her to have it. Then report back "
"to me on her reaction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009187b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If she means to escape, she'll do everything in her power to stop you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e119_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If she thinks something is odd, she'll put it on a shelf for everyone to look "
"at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice7_00026b1a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If she's around, she hasn't come into Pell's Gate. Nor should she. I fear "
"that girl is long gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006143d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If she's not in prison, you might try searching the Imperial City for her. "
"Maybe you can convince her to teach you what she knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082623_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If someone can cure her, I'm sure she'd pay well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a13_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If someone doesn't do something, there won't be a Chapel left in Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d591_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If someone from the Council were to stop by, and find him gone, it'd look bad "
"for me. I can't have that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e141_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If spells and magic are what you seek, head to Earil's Mysteries and take a "
"peek."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b586_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If that creature visits again, I think I'll have choice words to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bd9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If that is your wish, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bd95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If that is your wish, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06BookLostHistories_0000bf8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If that's Theranis' treasure, I know where it is. But I'm not telling you "
"anything until we're out of here. Get me out of the castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersMoon_00002dc3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If that's correct, then Bothiel would be most likely to know something about "
"it, as the caretaker of the Orrery. She should be on University grounds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028716_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If that's the case then the killer got what he was after, and the rest of us "
"needn't worry about our own safety.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_0004995c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If that's what you're looking for, there's no one better to talk to than Maro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_00033fcc_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"If the Amulet is truly the key to restoring the barriers between our world "
"and Oblivion, you must waste no time in recovering it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008674d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If the Council really did split up, the guild is done for. This is serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad7a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If the Count is still alive, it's my duty to assist him, even if it means "
"giving up my life. If you're with me, we need to get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_000c45a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If the Empire isn't going to stop the skooma trade, who will?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFelldew_00018b7e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If the Felldew didn't kill you, the Elytra would. You're better off just "
"leaving the thing in the ruins above the Burrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_00061787_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If the Fringe has been attacked, Crucible could be next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ea8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If the Mythic Dawn manages to open a Great Gate here, the city will need a "
"stronger garrison for there to be any hope of defending it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a86_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If the Nine will it, I will be the one to recover the Crusader's Relics. Or, "
"perhaps that honor will fall to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If the Resonator is working, it means fewer people to steal my things. More "
"of a chance to find what I've lost. Good in my book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b4e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If the Throne of Madness remains empty when Jyggalag storms the palace, he "
"will prevail. But there is a chance that the throne may not be empty. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_00043029_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If the Wellspring can be restored, your allies can return to aid you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0004302d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If the Wellspring can be restored, your allies can return to aid you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3_00018c7f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If the gates fall, the enemy will flood into the Isles. We will be helpless "
"to stop them. But now that you've arrived, perhaps we can slow them down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting3_000186fd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If the gates fall, the enemy will flood into the Isles. We will be helpless "
"to stop them. Now that you've arrived, perhaps we can slow them down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetB1_00002adb_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If the gods deem you worthy, you will be granted a sign. Go forth with the "
"Nine's blessings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000579e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If the guards don't do something about the Oblivion Gate soon, I'm leaving "
"town. It's not safe here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053769_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If the guards don't like you, then I probably will! Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If the killer strikes again, maybe they'll do me a favor and take her out "
"next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If the newly restored armies need conscripts, I could be persuaded to enlist "
"a few of my exhibits. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If the old Gatekeeper were still around, those Knights wouldn't have caused "
"such trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11AmuletTalk_00038b05_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If the other members of Bradon's group were still alive, and I on my "
"deathbed, only then would I pass the knowledge onto them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If the target is old and weak, as you say, then his manservant is sure to be "
"quite the opposite. Best stay out of his way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_00083f39_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If the two meet regularly, you might have a chance to eavesdrop and learn "
"more about what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_0005e080_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If the world hasn't ended, I'll be here. Come back again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f32_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If there are any discoveries to be made, you should be the one to make them. "
"You deserve that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If there is anything I can do, I am humbly at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If there is indeed an altar there, as the note suggests, I believe this cave "
"is directly related to the contents of the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004996b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If there's a complaint about a merchant, speak to Vinicia Melissaeia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If there's anything about Vahtacen you need explained, let me know. I'll help "
"if I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_00062028_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If there's anything else you're interested in, anything at all, just let me "
"know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreE1_0001e74d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If there's anything you need, please ask. My resources here are limited, but "
"I will help in any way I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00033792_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If there's some sort of connection between the seer's stone and Dagail's "
"father, I don't know about it. Maybe if you ask her, it will jog her memory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_0006178e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If these armies are through the Gates, the city could be next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_0008f173_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If they all ring at the same time, that may shatter the crystals that have "
"polluted the Wellspring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0008f174_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If they all ring at the same time, that may shatter the crystals that have "
"polluted the Wellspring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07TheFringeTopic_000912a2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If they continue to marshal their forces there, we won't be able to contain "
"them. Make sure they can't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07TheFringeTopic_0009130c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If they continue to marshal their forces there, we won't be able to contain "
"them. Make sure they can't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstMakeChoices_00018dfa_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "If they survived, they will proceed to the next chamber, and so on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice3A_00003a78_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If they're gone, then there's no point in hanging around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003661b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If they're out here, they'll be in this area. I can't imagine there are more "
"than four of them. Let's take care of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirBeginChoice2_000805ee_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If they're reluctant to help, you just say the word and I'll do my best to "
"persuade them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d284_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If they're smart, they'll take the opportunity to have you perform a small "
"service for them. One good turn deserves another, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If things go badly, forgo the plan and simply kill the mark any way you can. "
"You'll lose the bonus, but at least the contract will be fulfilled. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingH2HYes_0006245b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If this goes on for too long, and I get bored, I'll stop you. Now show me "
"what you've got!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000412c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If this is your first time to the Museum, perhaps you would care for a tour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008263e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If those Knights come back to Passwall, we'll be ready for 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_magickasila_00054022_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If we assume it means \"Magicka Waxes,\" then a spell increasing magicka "
"might be what we need. Something that fortifies it, perhaps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06MaikiChoiceA_00012cbe_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If we attacked in full force, we could take the Altar of Despair before they "
"had a chance to react."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan2_00018c86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If we attempt to assault Xeddefen, Passwall will be overrun and we will lose "
"the Fringe. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan2_00018c87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If we attempt to assault Xeddefen, Passwall will be overrun and we will lose "
"the Fringe. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting2_000186fe_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If we cannot disable or destroy it somehow, I do not think that we can stop "
"this invasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting2_00018c80_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If we cannot disable or destroy it somehow, I do not think that we can stop "
"this invasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_0001da34_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If we cannot disable or destroy it somehow, I do not think that we can stop "
"this invasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_0001da35_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If we cannot disable or destroy it somehow, I do not think that we can stop "
"this invasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdSpeech_000463aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If we don't, Bruma ends up a smoking pile of rubble like what happened at "
"Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DyloraWhere_00017d0e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If we follow the waters of the Wellspring, we will surely find her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10StaadaWhere_00016b3a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If we follow the waters of the Wellspring, we will surely find her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If we had some sort of reference, something to compare them to, we might be "
"able to decipher them. But we lack anything like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002871a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If we make it through this alive, I'll be amazed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22SrazirrGoAhead_0002c526_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If we succeed in recovering the treasure, you give this one half of what "
"you're getting paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachTopic_0001681e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If we were to lose it... my kind would be doomed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPinnacleRockTopic_00017d18_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If we were to lose it... my kind would be doomed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If we work hard, Uncle Iniel says he'll set us up in business together, maybe "
"a little fruit orchard, or maybe tomatoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RulesOfCompetition_00029ca8_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"If you actually manage to win a fight, don't get any ideas about looting your "
"opponent's corpse! That's strictly forbidden!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06FinChoice1A_0003005d_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"If you are detected, the poisoning will fail, and Roderick must be killed in "
"some other manner. That will, of course, forfeit your bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d841_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you are looking to buy a horse, go inside and talk to Bongond."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d171_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you are looking to buy a horse, go inside and talk to Clesa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d829_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you are looking to buy a horse, go inside and talk to Isabeau."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009811f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "If you are quiet, you may remain. Now, stand aside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000363c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you are still trying to file a complaint against Audens Avidius, go see "
"Itius Hayn. I can't help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40JanusAccept_0003ed37_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"If you are successful in finding a cure, report to my steward. You have my "
"thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40RonaSee_0003ed3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you are successful, perhaps you shall. For now, that is not necessary. I "
"have no wish to endanger her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000029a1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you are true to the teachings of Julianos, it may be possible for you to "
"find the Shield of the Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c21f_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"If you are truly the hero of destiny, as I hope, the Garden will not hold you "
"for long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseDecline_00053234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you are trying to bargain with me, these horses are already the cheapest "
"in Cyrodiil. Take it or leave it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonTopic_00013389_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you are working to help Thadon, I'll tell you whatever I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00098379_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you aren't going to tell me where to find the Gray Fox, I'm not interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00033ef9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you ask Barthel, it's the garden spot of Tamriel. See for yourself. It's "
"just northwest of here. But watch out for the goblins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028196_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you ask me, the Dark Elf is our killer. They're an evil and vengeful "
"people, all of them. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMolagBalChoice1_00026b42_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you believe yourself worthy, present Molag Bal with an offering: the pelt "
"of a lion. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinB2_00082dca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you came to me for help, you're more of a fool than you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40melisandeWhatdoido_0005373a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you can bring me five empty Grand Soul Gems, I'm quite sure I can help you "
"with this cure that you seek. I shall await your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice2A_00035f50_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you can figure out how to use the pillar, I'd be thrilled. You're welcome "
"to try your hand at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d590_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "If you can find J'skar, I'll write the recommendation immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you can find him, he can teach you a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Choice1A_00028030_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"If you can get in there, find out what happened to them. If they're alive, "
"help them finish the job. If not, see what you can do on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1dc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you can get me safely to the top deck, I can steer the Float home. But I'm "
"not budging until the coast is clear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004991b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you can get used to Thoronir, you can find some good deals there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fines_0003c29a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you can't pay the fine, they can take your property away or toss you in "
"the castle dungeons. Nothing we can do about it really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelDecline_00022e94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you cannot perform a simple function for the guild, you are clearly "
"undeserving of membership in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrenusAstisJournal_00024292_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you care that much, you go find it. The contract's yours. It's not worth "
"it for what the Guild is paying. I've got a family to think about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f9c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you change your mind, I'm certainly not going anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HelpNo_0003d30f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you change your mind, please let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00026bad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you come across any unusual ingredients in your travels, be sure to "
"remember me and bring them here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0014c72d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you come across any unusual ingredients in your travels, be sure to "
"remember me and bring them here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47HowToHelp_00030039_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you could find him and get him to remove this cursed invisibility, we will "
"all be in your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f7ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you could help Pyke, I think you'd make him very happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7a_Knights_RESP5"
msgid ""
"If you destroy the wraith that Sir Berich has become, you will be doing him a "
"service. You must free him from the evil that has ensnared him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseTooMuchBravil_0004ed84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you didn't have the money, you shouldn't have wasted my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40MelisandeWitch_0003f291_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "If you do a little something for me, I'll help you. How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473f2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you do what you need to, you'll get there one day. Just don't forget to "
"help those who have aided you on your way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b1249_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you don't have the gold, then I don't have a room. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c233_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you don't know much about Mysticism, Druja is a good person to talk to. "
"She's at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c3b1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you don't like it, take it up with Ulrich."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TimeToGo_0002a7dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you don't mind, I have things to do. Would you leave now, please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0001cb78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you don't want to be doing this, then why are you even here? Father and I "
"can handle this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice2_000008f0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you ever change your mind, fear not. My offer will always be open. Simply "
"return and speak to me about the Dark Gift, and we can proceed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice2_0004ce44_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you ever change your mind, fear not. My offer will always be open. Simply "
"return and speak to me about the Dark Gift, and we can proceed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04Faustina_0003d4a3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you ever find yourself back in Anvil, stop by anytime and say hello. Oh, "
"and please say nothing to anyone about our true identities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you ever find yourself in Highcross, to Mirili you should speak. It isn't "
"treasure that she wants, it's knowledge that she seeks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00086760_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you ever have need of my abilities, dear Listener, just say the word."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d58e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you ever need anything, just let me know. I have friends in all sorts of "
"high places, you know, so I can get things done that others can't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc14_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you find a special Fork to Big-Head you should go. He isn't the sharpest "
"blade in the drawer; you have more smarts within your toe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00031c82_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you find him or the rest of the Knights of the Thorn, get them out of "
"there. I'm sure that the Count would also be pleased if the gate was closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you find something unique, it's worth checking with Una Armina."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_0003150a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you find the painting, and bring the culprit to justice, you shall be "
"justly rewarded. What say you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e93e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you find yourself in Skingrad, drop in on the alchemist Sinderion. His "
"specialty is plants, and I bet he could tell you more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwaterBrigands_0000c1d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you get Selene safely locked up, I can tell you all I know. I won't feel "
"safe until you do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice2_0008fabd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you get rid of them, I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestKurt_000281ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you get this, my disp is between 70 and 30. You should get info refusal "
"for any lower. use Angry and Happy to raise and lower my disp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestKurt_000281ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you get this, my disp to you should be 70 or higher. use Angry and Happy "
"to raise and lower my disp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanJar_0001f42d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you go there and bring it back to me, I'll tell you exactly where Aleron "
"is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you go to New Sheoth, beware. Syl has been rounding people up and asking "
"them strange questions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004988c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you go to the Fighting Chance, make sure to speak with Rohssan about "
"repairing armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinD1_0009226a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you had come to me before... I would have laughed and dismissed you out of "
"hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you happen upon a lonely soul who goes by the name of Hirrus, take his "
"word as truth be told, I'm afraid he is deadly serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bc8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you have any questions about the merchandise, you've but to ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_00062021_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you have anything else to sell, I'd gladly consider an offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017970_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you have done all that you can, are you prepared to face the enemy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ef76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you have followed the path before you, speak with our Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorTownYes_0003446b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you have seen anything unusual, particularly anything implying the "
"presence of the undead here in town, please report it at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c9fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you have something to show me, then show me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c4c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you have the item my Lady seeks, I suggest you bring it to her. She hasn't "
"slept a wink since you departed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you have to fight a Flesh Atronach, a good shock spell is the way to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you have to fight a Flesh Atronach, never use a shock spell. It won't hurt "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuySkingrad_0004f217_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you head to Colovian Traders, Gunder can provide all sorts of great "
"furnishings for your new home. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you hear any bones talking, come get me right away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072f0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you hear anything interesting, let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06FlameAgnon_000131ac_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you help us seize the Altar of Despair from the Mazken, I will be honored "
"to kindle the Flame of Agnon for my Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0005dab2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you insist on sleeping, there's a bed for 20 gold a night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Wait_000545b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you insist, Your Grace, but there's not much time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10Wait_000545b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you insist, Your Grace, but there's not much time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you kill something, let me know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00034476_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you know anything, it is in your best interest to tell me now. After all, "
"your town is at stake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005a026_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you know how to close that Gate, be my guest. My orders are to hold this "
"position, and that's what I intend to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusNextMove_00022b23_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you learn anything, you can find me at Luther Broad's. May Talos guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400d9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you light the Great Torch on the Mania side of the Sacellum, you will be a "
"hero to the people of Bliss, I assure you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062123_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you like what you see, don't hesitate to say so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Whatnow_00031d28_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "If you make it, we'll be waiting right outside the gate for you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e932_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you make your way to Skingrad, look up Sinderion. He's one of the foremost "
"authorities on the alchemical properties of plants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d287_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you manage to actually receive the recommendations, you'll be eligible for "
"entrance to the Arcane University. I shall be quite surprised, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_00092a70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you mean the priest, I don't think he made it out of the city. Very few of "
"us did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be81_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you must know, I am Cindanwe, foreperson. And don't let that liar Kishashi "
"or that psycho Ranarr-Jo tell you any different. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrisonVisitor_0018d200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you must. Don't try anything funny though. I'll be following you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000477fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need a blade, go see Tun-Zeeus at the Dividing Line. Does repairs, "
"too. He does go on and on, sometimes. But he's the Genuine Orc in Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0003d081_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need any more of those, I might be able to get some later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_00062077_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need anything else, you know where to find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033ef3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need anything, talk to my father-in-law. This whole expedition was his "
"idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00037f59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need armor, weapons, or just a place to sleep, the barracks in the "
"west wing is available to any of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need ingredients, it's a great place to shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049957_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need light armor, talk to Maro Rufus at The Best Defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049936_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need money fast, try Jensine's. You can sell almost anything there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need more assistance with your training, seek out Marana Rian in the "
"Imperial City. She uses the shadows like no other I've seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062333_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need more training, you'd better head to Bravil and track down "
"Andragil. She taught me a few things I didn't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_0005e07f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need more, you know where to find me. I'm nearly always at work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004993f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need something enchanted, Calindil has the goods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_00062129_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need something recharged, I can take care of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need something, better talk to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004991e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need to get rid of something quickly, check out the Copious Coinpurse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d885_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you need to improve your skill with a Blade, I'll happily teach you what I "
"know. Imagine how many people will talk if we're seen together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e92d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you need to know more about the Nirnroot, read the missive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c225_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need to learn how to use a shield, you should talk to Fadus Calidius "
"at the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need to learn how to use light armor, gro-Shug is the one to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d015_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you need training, Athragar has a reputation for being very good with "
"Alteration. You might consider speaking to him about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you raise a hand against him and strike him down, you'll be accused of "
"murder. Even if Ulrich doesn't do things by the letter of the law, I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000275c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you really plan on killing the guests one by one, make sure that when you "
"strike, you strike hard. Don't want anyone running for help, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetB4_0003e8f5_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"If you refuse a gift from an enemy, you may choose instead to prove your "
"honor upon me in combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006139f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you require further training, you might consider venturing into the "
"mountains in the north of Cyrodiil. Aerin's Camp, specifically."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DraconianMadstoneTopic_00018230_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you retreive the Draconian Madstone for me, I'll be happy to compensate "
"you by rewarding you with another Akaviri artifact. Are you game?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e15_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you return, perhaps you'll have gained some measure of character. Perhaps, "
"though, you'll die. Then you're no longer the guild's problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006fdaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you run into trouble, come find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Nevermind_00034466_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you see a Gnarl, be careful what spells you use on them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you see a Shambles dying, get real close. They'll heal you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you see a Shambles dying, stand back. They'll take you with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006141f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you see my good-for-nothing husband, Bjalfi, tell him I want back what he "
"stole from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you seek additional training, I cannot help. Dagail, however, knows more "
"than anyone in Cyrodiil. You can find her in the Leyawiin Guild hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001647d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you seek an audience with His Grace, you must open this door. I hold the "
"key, and I will die defending it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice7_00026b1a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you seek her out, take care. She's a powerful one. Or at least that sword "
"is. I'd steer clear if I was you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting03_00002ad5_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you seek the Mace, travel to Leyawiin's chapel, kneel at the shrine in the "
"undercroft, and let your faith in the Nine be the salvation of us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000335d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you stay here, and Lord Farwil finds out when he gets back from his latest "
"quest, he will have me thrown out of here. Please, leave at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsErrant_000908d6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you succeed, I will bestow on both you and Mazoga the titles of Knights-"
"Errant of the White Stallion for your service to Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e14_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you succeed, perhaps you'll have learned something in that time. If you "
"fail, perhaps you'll be dead, and no longer our problem. Now, go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa8d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you talk to Horkvir, he'll know what can be done. He's a smart one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000363cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you tell anyone I said anything bad about Audens, I'll deny it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you think I'm interested in whatever you're selling, you're wrong. I'm "
"not. Why don't you go play with the Gatekeeper? Run along now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaA3_000a5602_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you think me defenseless, you may be surprised. I'm more dangerous than I "
"look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA5_00012cd2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you think the Mazken will help you, you will be disappointed. We will "
"destroy them with or without your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaTopic_00146851_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you think you've got what it takes, go talk to Owyn, the Blademaster. "
"You'll find him in the Bloodworks, day and night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005375e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you try and cross me, I'll tell the town guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona13_0007ba9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you try to announce yourself as Corvus, I will deny you. I will deny you "
"before the Emperor if I have to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you visit Hale, you may see Pyke, a Knight of the Thorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you visit Hale, you won't see Pyke, a Knight of the Thorn. In fact, there "
"is no such thing as a Knight of the Thorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you visit Highcross, don't speak with Mirili Ulven. She's doing fine with "
"her project, all by herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you visit Highcross, speak with Mirili Ulven. She needs help with her "
"project."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2A_0004cacf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wait a day my \"body\" will be put on display in the Chorrol Chapel "
"Undercroft. You can come to me then and administer the antidote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2B_0004cad0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wait a day my \"body\" will be put on display in the Chorrol Chapel "
"Undercroft. You can come to me then and administer the antidote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2C_0004cad1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wait a day my \"body\" will be put on display in the Chorrol Chapel "
"Undercroft. You can come to me then and administer the antidote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0007130c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you wait around long enough, I'm sure they'll show up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000919c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want a room or a drink, I'm your man. Otherwise, I got nothing to say "
"to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002f1f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want it, you'll need to persuade Varon Vamori, using whatever means "
"necessary, to return that staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want luxury, there's nowhere better than the Tiber Septim Hotel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_000614ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want my help, you'll need to join up. Fighters Guild members only."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to buy Benirus Manor, it's still available for a modest price. No "
"questions asked please. Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00054171_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want to buy a horse, go inside and talk to Tovas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you want to challenge Agronak, go right ahead. He lives down here in the "
"Bloodworks. Do that, come talk to me again, and I'll arrange your match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneNo_000c440e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you want to find the Tears, I'd suggest reading a book called "
"\"Knightfall.\" The information inside may assist your search."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaB_00022b42_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"If you want to find them, you'll need all four volumes of the "
"\"Commentaries.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to get close to the Heretics, don't try putting on their robes. "
"They aren't stupid. They'll see right through that trick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want to get close to the Heretics, try putting on their robes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc97_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you want to give me a hand, go speak with Jensine at her \"Good as New\" "
"Merchandise store. She can clue you in and maybe offer some coin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000c452a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you want to hear the tale, I suggest you talk to Farwil, our commander."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc9d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you want to help out some poor merchants, head on over to Jensine's \"Good "
"as New\" Merchandise. She'll fill you in with the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003dc5c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you want to help us do something about it, go talk to Gogan and Maelona. "
"Let's just say Gogan is intimately involved and leave it at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000579e1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you want to help, and we can use all the help we can get, head over to the "
"gate and lend a hand to the guards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0000b1a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want to help, get back and protect the Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025dea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want to help, prisoner, keep alert and let us do our job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10WhatAboutLLev_0003c2c4_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you want to help, you need to get Aldos to agree to become a witness. "
"Nothing else can be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062604_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to join the guild, you can ask any of the local guild leaders. "
"Here in Chorrol, Teekeeus is the one you'll need to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b19a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to know more, there's one person I can think of to teach you, "
"though she's a bit... odd. You'll need to find Bralsa Andaren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to learn a bit about hand-to-hand fighting, talk to Nahsi at the "
"Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004989b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want to learn about heavy armor, Varnado is the one to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to learn more about light armor, you might talk to Dul gro-Shug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b18e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to learn more about training Destruction magic, you'll have to "
"find Bralsa Andaren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want to learn to fall off a building, she's the one to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to learn to use a mace, you should speak to Vigdis. Of course, to "
"speak to Vigdis, you'll have to join the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to make a name for yourself as a mage, you simply must join the "
"guild. Talk to Falcar if you're interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to sneak up on one of those Zealots, don't wear one of their "
"robes. That never fools them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007815b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to sneak up on one of those Zealots, wear one of their robes. "
"Fools them every time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want to train further, you'll have to seek out someone else. There's "
"nothing I can teach you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0006233e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you want training from me, you're going to have to earn it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062449_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you want training from me, you're going to have to get something for me "
"first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06Choice1A_0002fbb0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you want... come to... to Lorkmir's house. I go there every day. Every "
"day. From 11:00 in the morning 'til 5:00 at night. I just go and... relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you wanted your daughter rescued, who would you hire? Blackwood Company? "
"Not me. Can't trust them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you were famous, perhaps... or infamous, I suppose... that might count for "
"something. But, alas, you're not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_00016efc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you were one of the fortunate few, you would one day understand and accept "
"this. However, you are not and you will not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_000807ab_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you were one of the fortunate few, you would one day understand and accept "
"this. However, you are not and you will not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2B_000277aa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you were to know of its whereabouts, I trust that you would bring it to me "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice6A_00028ac9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you were to obtain this item, somehow, and bring it to me, I would pay you "
"very well for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting2a_00019fca_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you will help me, you can have what you want, and we can have what we "
"want. Everyone is happy... except Ciirta."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBettingTopic_0002ada1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you win, you get back double what you bet. Simple as that. Win or lose -- "
"it's mostly a matter of luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice1_00026b0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you wish to bargain with Clavicus Vile, approach with an offering of 500 "
"gold, and hope the Lord smiles on your offering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024fd3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to be reinstated, you must perform a service for the guild. Are "
"you willing to do so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024ff9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to be reinstated, you must perform a service for the guild. Are "
"you willing to do so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002501a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to be reinstated, you must perform a service for the guild. Are "
"you willing to do so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025022_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to be reinstated, you must perform a service for the guild. Are "
"you willing to do so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006c5c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you wish to become a part of the Mages Guild, seek out the heads of the "
"local guild halls. They will instruct you further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00019847_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to bring ruin to your victims, you may choose to animate some of "
"the corpses and watch as they satiate their hunger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10FindJakben_0009ded9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to contact him, wait until nightfall. Even then, I doubt he will "
"receive you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001d4bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you wish to find out more about Roland, try asking Gilen or Grey-Throat, "
"they knew him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d156_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you wish to learn more about Alteration, you'd be wise to consult Tooth-in-"
"the-Sea. If you can find him, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Dementia_00082756_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish to meet Dementia's citizens, seek them out in Deepwallow or "
"Fellmoor. I'm sure they'll welcome one such as you with open arms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Mania_00082755_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish to meet the residents of Mania, you'll find them in the "
"settlements of Hale and Highcross. Take care, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Become_0007893e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you wish to replace Thadon, try a less direct approach that will involve "
"cunning and subterfuge. He isn't likely to see you coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CountessCarvain_000980fa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish to seek audience with her, please return at that time. You're "
"also welcome to wait anywhere in the Great Hall. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CountessCarvain_00132aa2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish to seek audience with her, please return at that time. You're "
"also welcome to wait anywhere in the Great Hall. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CountessValga_000038cf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish to seek audience with her, please return at these times. You are "
"also welcome to wait in the seating area near the entrance. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CountessValga_00159752_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish to seek audience with her, please return at these times. You are "
"also welcome to wait in the seating area near the entrance. Good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraChoice1_0001ebe4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you wish to speak to the Lady, visit her shrine at dawn or dusk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b6b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "If you wish to take the place of Sheogorath, then ask me what you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RewardTopic_000a3df5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you wish, you can become a vampire. It will be slightly painful, but far "
"easier on you than... other methods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06StoryDontCare_00002b8f_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you won't listen to me, then go ask Kellen. He's descended from the very "
"knight who was cursed. He'll tell you the same thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you would seek for my Relics, I know little that can help you. All that "
"has passed since my death is like mist that my mind cannot take hold of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11AmuletTalk_00038b05_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you'd give me that amulet, I would like to show you what you've recovered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BorderWatchTOPIC_000b122c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you'd like to stay, I'd suggest getting a room at the Border Watch Inn. We "
"don't get many visitors, but S'thasa serves a fine ale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23SeridurGreet_0001d247_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "If you'll come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you'll excuse me, I don't have time for you right now. Or ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00189185_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you'll excuse me, I'm off to Leyawiin Castle to check in and then the "
"Imperial City for some rest and relaxation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b520_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you'll just follow me, I will take you directly to my master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2A_000844c1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you'll just follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingH2HNo_0006245c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're afraid to have even a friendly little sparring match, why would I "
"waste time training you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're all alone in the woods and you see a troll coming, you run. Problem "
"solved. Next question?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're an alchemist, The Main Ingredient is a good place to shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0008e4c8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you're any good with a lockpick, we can help each other out. We can get "
"into the Gardens of Flesh and Bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006260a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're applying to join the guild, you'll need to speak with one of the "
"local guild heads. Carahil would be the one to talk to here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a7_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"If you're caught, there isn't anything I can do to help you. Just be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_0009ea85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're done shopping, you'd best be moving along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Knight_00066f04_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you're ever in Cheydinhal, be sure and look us up. We have a lodge just "
"outside the City Gates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040cb3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you're finding Jyggalag a bit overwhelming in person, you might consider "
"using your Staff. It may prove effective in this battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028273_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you're here to bet on a fight, on the other hand, you're talking to the "
"right man! There are matches all day long, from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014665_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're here to help, you'd best go see Caranya. She'll tell you what we "
"need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000836ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're here to help, you'd better talk to Thalfin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSMiscKotT_000c453c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "If you're here to join up, I'm afraid you'll have to speak with Farwil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice4B_00054037_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you're here to kill that fellow in the cellar, then... good! I won't call "
"the guards or nothing! He's doing... unnatural things down there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00189d09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're here to rob me, I'm afraid I have nothing left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e13e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're hungry to read a lustful story, find Sontaire at Books of Bliss and "
"check her inventory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AkaviriArtifacts_000980f5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you're interested in assisting the Countess, you can always seek out "
"Tolgan. He's usually in the Castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fines_0003c29a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If you're interested, go talk to Llevana Nedaren. She seems the most "
"outspoken against Ulrich and his new fines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheFightersGuild_00033d12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're interested, see Vilena Donton in Chorrol, or Azzan in Anvil, or "
"Burz gro-Khash in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ForlornWatchman_00035d8f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you're interested, you may want to see Gilgondorin at Silverhome-on-the-"
"Water. When it comes to local legends, he's the best source in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc95_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you're interested, you should head over to Jensine's \"Good as New\" "
"Merchandise. She heads up a committee that is trying to investigate him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're just learning how to pick a lock, he's a good man to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003359e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for Amminus, he's resting in the Knights Lodge over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004991f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking for a shield, Stonewall shields has a fine selection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049922_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking for a shield, there's no place better than Stonewall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049909_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking for a staff, that's the place to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking for armor, you should speak with Tertia Viducia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for books, First Edition is the only place in the city to "
"find them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for further training in Alchemy, I suggest you speak with "
"Sinderion. He's quite gifted, although slightly eccentric."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for hard-to-find ingredients, try Lelles' Quality "
"Merchandise, outside the walls facing the harbor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking for luxury, there's no better place to stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062615_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for the most powerful spells, you'll want to speak to "
"Borissean at the Arcane University. If you're allowed in, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking for trouble, you're getting very warm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to be the best in business, you need to learn from the "
"best. Palonirya is one of the best, so you might try asking her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004990f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking to buy cheap spells, Edgar's is the place to look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to create your own enchantments, you've come to the right "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028273_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to join the Arena as a combatant, you need to head down to "
"the Bloodworks and talk to Owyn, the Blademaster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to join the guild, talk to Jeanne Frasoric. If nothing "
"else, it means access to better services than most people enjoy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FightersGuildTopic_0006253a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to join up, you should speak with Vilena Donton in Chorrol, "
"Azzan in Anvil, or Burz gro-Khash in Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c231_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to learn a bit about Conjuration, Sulinus Vassinus is a "
"good person to talk to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to learn a bit about potion-making, you should speak to "
"Felen Ralas at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to learn about conjuring creatures, you should try to speak "
"with Fathis Aren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to learn even more, experience is your best bet. If you "
"want pointers, I hear that Alix Lencolia is somewhere in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062120_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're looking to unload some goods, you've come to the right place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028213_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're not careful, the brethren will have to teach you a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're on a road, you can usually outrun anything. If you're in good "
"shape, and not wearing a tin suit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you're ready to go get Black Brugo, I'm ready to follow you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d064_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're skilled enough, Athragar has a rather powerful frost spell for "
"sale. Very effective, but dangerous to the inexperienced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VitellusDontonTOPIC_0002d725_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"If you're smart, you'll steer clear of the subject around the Guildmaster. "
"Perhaps you and I will have time to discuss it more later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingBlockTest_00062339_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"If you're still standing when I'm done, you've earned the right to learn what "
"I have to teach. Shall we find out what you really know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024e12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you're thinking of making Chorrol your home, you should join a guild. It's "
"hard work, but steady money. And people get to know you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you've been good, Wayshrines of Dibella may bless your Personality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017d53_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "If you've done all that you can do, are you prepared for battle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've done good deeds, the Nine will bless you and cure diseases when you "
"visit their wayshrines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b983d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "If you've got 10 gold, I've got a room for the night. Deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_000363c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've got a complaint, tell it to the Watch Captain. I've got better "
"things to do than listen to you whine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082627_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've got calipers or tongs, he'll buy them from you. Well, assuming he "
"likes you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've got calipers or tongs, he'll steal them from you. He certainly "
"won't buy them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00034864_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've got the amulet, then Dagail should be able to regain control of her "
"visions. Then I'm sure she can send that recommendation for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018baae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've got to travel, by the Nine Divines, stay on the roads! The "
"wilderness just isn't safe anymore. We've had sightings, you see. The "
"Daedra..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061438_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If you've killed fifty people, it's still not enough for my tastes, but I "
"might reconsider at that point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If your journey takes you to Vitharn, beware its undead hosts. From what I "
"hear the place is a tomb, and the only thing there are ghosts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If your journey takes you to the settlement Hale be sure to speak with Pyke. "
"He is a most unusual knight, whose story you might like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001ec20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If your tactics are as bold as your words, we may live through this next "
"attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaCombatantTopic_0002ada0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"If, by any chance, you're interested in actually fighting in the Arena, you "
"need to head down to the Bloodworks and speak with Owyn, the Blademaster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49ChoiceExplain_00031d33_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"If.... If I don't make it, take the key and carry on without me. You need to "
"reach the tower at the north wall of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000ace2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ignorant folk hate us, so we stay far away from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071951_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ignore the controversy of whether the runestones are enchanted. Let me "
"suggest one possible account for the placements of the runestones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture5_0007195f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Imagine that the power of these runestones might have diminished -- weakened, "
"then extinguished -- by the sins of the Potentates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialDragonArmorTopic_000ade2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Imperial Dragon armor is normally worn only by the Emperor himself. But you "
"deserve no less, Champion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033350_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Imperial criminal scum like you give the Empire a bad name, you see. You're "
"an embarrassment. Best if you just... disappeared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e89e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Imperials hate Dark Elves; Dark Elves hate Imperials. Imperials hate that a "
"no-name Hlaalu trader got made into a count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00084b45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Impersonate ME will you? Ha! There's only one... ummm... ahhh... what was my "
"name again? Oh, yes... only one Reynald."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeGreaves_0001652d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Important arteries flow through the legs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000980ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Important things to do... so many important things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000980d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Important things to do... so many important things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngerReceive_0002425d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Impossible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokCrazyChatter_0008efb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Impossible! This is impossible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamThreeMan05_000781ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Impossible! This is impossible... Grommok has never lost a fight! Never!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene06Final_00015265_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Impossible! You defeated the three of them alone? I - I'm humbled by your "
"skill, and fear that assaulting you would lead to my own quick demise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND02SirAmielBattleCall_00002c01_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Impressive. You have bested Sir Casimir. Now, face Sir Ralvas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Imps. I hate 'em. Little buggers flitting around, tossing fireballs at you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMephalaSpeech_000579d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Bleaker's Way, two families, Nord and Dunmer, live in perfect harmony. But "
"beneath the surface lurks the secret seed of strife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002c4d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Chorrol, we Highlanders treat our Gods' teachings as rules to live by. Our "
"lives are governed by the Ten Commands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a691_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Chorrol, we don't think much about what goes on in the Imperial Palace. "
"But these murders... the emperor and all his sons dead... what's next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00023972_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Chorrol, we don't trust people we don't know. But if you're respectable -- "
"if you hang with respectable people -- we're not so unfriendly. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Crucible lives poor Bernice, she's sick I think you'll find. But is it "
"really illness, or is it all just in her mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Crucible you'll find a place, a museum with all manner of things. A reward "
"you'll get if to this place something strange and new you bring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e140_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Crucible you'll find a place, a museum with all manner of things. A reward "
"you'll get if to this place something strange and new you bring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Crucible, a man named Hirrus Clutumnus has been trying to convince people "
"to kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Crucible, there isn't a man named Hirrus Clutumnus trying to convince "
"people to kill him. He's very happy with his life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHircineSpeech_00051ede_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In Harcane Grove is a quarry worthy of the chase. First named, last tamed, "
"the unicorn runs wild there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JihattTopic_000479cb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In Ta'agra, the word is vaguely disreputable.  Such a fighter fights for gold "
"rather than for clan or Mane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In a moment, we will begin. I will recite an incantation, and we can proceed "
"down into the crypt and seek an audience with the Night Mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_000836d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In accordance with guild rules, you now qualify for the rank of Journeyman. "
"May you wear your rank well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040140_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In accordance with the ancient tradition, receive now the Raiment of Arden-"
"Sul in honor of your mighty deed in service to Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251b9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In addition to your standard reward, I present to you this bonus. Behold, the "
"Scales of Pitiless Justice! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081792_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In addition, accept this Bow. May your enemies fear you and never know from "
"where or with what enchantment you shall strike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da4d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In addition, we'd like to reward you with this enchanted ring. Use it well in "
"the fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaB_00022b42_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In any case, finding them won't be easy. I've studied Mankar Camoran's "
"writings a bit myself, at least those that I could find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e92c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In any case, if you come back in about 24 hours, I should have the weaker "
"Elixir ready for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECylarneTopic_00019acf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In any case, the Flame of Agnon here is always used to light the Great Torch "
"of New Sheoth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaF1_000a5608_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"In any case, the other is also a real Ayleid Crown... just not the right one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DeadInProgress_00083806_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In any case, there's no need to meet me again until you've finished... the "
"job. Safer that way. Then I will pay you in full what I promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04MartinEmperor_0001efe2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In any case, we need the Amulet first. Maybe Jauffre will know where to start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22KnowHighFane_0002af32_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "In any event, this should make your job easier than I had feared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Choice1A_000280bd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In case it may be useful, she was with Blossom -- her horse, I mean.  Dar-Ma "
"loves that animal, and would never willingly abandon her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In darkness you bring us light. Arkay, guide me through these times, that I "
"may once again see your light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bd5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In death, we continue the work that escaped us in life. The relics must still "
"be guarded, for some day they shall be needed once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2B_00022ba0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In due time, dear child. In due time. First, an introduction. I am Lucien "
"Lachance, Speaker for the Dark Brotherhood. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In effect, simply by finding their way to the shrine, prospective members "
"have already passed the first test on the road to \"enlightenment.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting01_00002ad9_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In facing the challenge of Zenithar, I failed. I tried dozens -- no, hundreds "
"of times to reach the Mace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Stipend_00018232_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In fact, I'd be so bold as to proclaim my collection the most complete in all "
"Cyrodiil; perhaps even beyond. Except for one thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In fact, I'm pretty sure you just attacked me. I think I need to arrest you "
"for assaulting a member of the Imperial Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006e_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"In fact, daedric artifacts are known to be formed from the essence of a "
"Daedric Lord, from whence they derive their great power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04XedilianChoice_00044f52_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "In fact, give it a try. Summon our friend to you now. I'll wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Reman_000980f6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"In fact, he instituted the rites of becoming an Emperor, which included the "
"construction of the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07FinChoice1A_000275ca_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"In fact, the guests believe the key to the manor is inside the chest, and "
"only by satisfying their greed will they be allowed to leave. Poor fools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JemaneFamily_00028ac5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In fact, there's quite a bit more to their family history than meets the eye. "
"Want to hear about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestofKynareth_00002a57_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In her infinite Grace and Wisdom, Kynareth will have mercy on you, and allow "
"you to resubmit to her test. Return to the grove and try once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestofKynareth_00002a58_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In her infinite Grace and Wisdom, Kynareth will have mercy on you, and allow "
"you to resubmit to her test. Return to the grove and try once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugoTopicHow_000908d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In her shadowy past, your friend Mazoga might have had contacts with outlaws. "
"Ask her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bd4_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In life, we failed at this task. In death, we seek to preserve what little we "
"accomplished while we wait for one to come and finish what we began."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000175b2_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"In light of the circumstances, I believe they'll find it more than adequate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreeting1_00002ad3_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In light of the recent attacks, I've signed on to protect the chapel. I'm a "
"fair with a blade and by my honor, I'll serve the Nine in any way I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bd7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In matters of faith, one cannot be bogged down in the affairs of this world. "
"Learn from us. Cast aside your treasures and serve the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQChampionOfCyrodiil_000add4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In my capacity as Lord High Chancellor of the Elder Council, I hereby "
"proclaim you Champion of Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002952_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In no small part to you, Sir Knight. By your will and the will of the Nine, "
"the chapel of Zenithar has held against this blasphemer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_00019ad0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In normal times, Sheogorath would simply command it and his servants would "
"leap to sacrifice themselves upon the Altars of Rapture and Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_specialarrangement_000253d8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In order to accept the contract, we demanded a life. Motierre offered his "
"mother, and we accepted. Lucien has already taken care of that... detail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoD1_000a6583_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In order to bring my research on the last king of the Ayleids to its final "
"stage, I need to go to the Throne Room of Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11Choice1A_00002dcb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In order to deal with the apparent growing problem of Necromancers in "
"Cyrodiil, the Council needs as much information as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07FinChoice1A_000275ca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In order to receive your bonus, you must kill each guest secretly, one by "
"one. If anyone sees you commiting murder, the bonus is forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_000151f8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In particular, a unique Black Soul Gem has been crafted in the south of "
"Cyrodiil, in the ruins of Silorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c944_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In return for your service, I will give you the key to the Forbidden Grotto, "
"if you still wish it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d03d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"In return, the Society has decided not to press charges. His name will be "
"absconded from the records of this crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelAccept_00025037_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In selflessly serving the guild, at risk to yourself, while putting your own "
"feelings aside, you prove your devotion to the cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelAccept_0002503b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In selflessly serving the guild, at risk to yourself, while putting your own "
"feelings aside, you prove your devotion to the cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkGiftTopic_0004cf46_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"In short, you will become like me. Heh, yes, it's true. I'm quite the social "
"pariah. After a few hundred years the change happened on its own. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "In sooth, mostly goodly done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8ab_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In that capacity, I am pleased to offer Advanced Training in Speechcraft, "
"that the faithful might better spread the word of Gods' graces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Shadowscale_000251fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the Argonian homeland of Black Marsh, those born under the sign of the "
"Shadow are taken at birth and presented to the Dark Brotherhood. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PakseechTopic_000479cc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In the Company, we use the term to mean 'leader' -- but it carries the sense "
"of wise father, concerned for the welfare of the whole family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047685_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In the Elven Gardens, Luther Broad's Boarding House may suit less "
"discriminating customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08GreymarchTopic_0009128c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the Fringe, you can see for yourself the devastation that accompanies the "
"Greymarch. Let us hope you are up to the task of stopping it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002f87f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the Imperial City there lives a High Elf who must be removed from "
"existence. Finding this person may prove... challenging. Are you interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P2ActualEntrance_0001fb6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the Imperial Sewers. Here is the key for the gate to that section of the "
"sewers. I picked the pocket of Ocato himself to get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirStory1_00002b2c_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In the brief time I was there, I did more to hurt the Chapel than help it. It "
"was there that I was cursed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Convo_000699f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "In the cage! Over here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002acc_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In the end, he failed. He left the chapel broken and beaten. Sir Amiel found "
"his body and laid him to rest here at the Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RulesOfCompetition_00038b37_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"In the event that you beat the Gray Prince, you're to remove his armor and "
"present it to me. Then you'll get your own Raiment of Valor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In the last week or so, we've found two bodies stashed in shallow graves "
"outside the city walls. The bodies had puncture wounds on their necks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071953_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the late First Era, Empress Hestra improved the roads, and the Reman "
"Emperors continued her policies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00033792_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "In the meantime, I'll keep an eye on Kalthar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d289_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In the meantime, as a member of the guild, you now have full access to the "
"guild halls around Cyrodiil. Only the Arcane University is closed to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQLastItem_00026ef6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the meantime, the Bruma Guard need your help to close an Oblivion Gate. "
"Didn't you already speak to Jauffre about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895de_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In the meantime, the other party in that conversation may be of use to you as "
"well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MartinB_0008b619_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"In the meantime, you should speak to Jauffre. He was concerned about reports "
"of spies in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a94_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In the old days, the Colovian Estates were always in the thick of some war or "
"rebellion. But that's ancient history."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09SoIHear_00053778_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"In the process, Arnora killed a guard. I told her to be careful, and just "
"knock them out but she didn't listen. We then buried the gold in the woods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyRedguard_0009f9c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "In the scales of testing, Redguard, you are tried and found wanting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bca1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In the west, in Old Colovia, that's where men are men. That's the Gold Coast, "
"West Weald, and Colovian Highlands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaA3_000a5602_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"In the wrong hands, the Crown of the Ayleids could be very dangerous. And "
"Umbacano is definitely the wrong hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro5_00082461_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In their eternal quest to please me, they're constantly fighting over "
"Cylarne. It can be tiresome. But, really, it's divine. Divinely tiresome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Continue_00189d08_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"In their greed, the creatures grabbed a Jade Amulet off of Kayleen's... body. "
"Bring me back that amulet, so I may use it to remember her by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475d0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In these difficult times, we must count on persons such as you to secure our "
"borders from bandits and rabble-rousers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor17_00032481_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "In this I am blessed to see the hour of my death..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01Choice2A_0002d6ea_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In three days or so, Erthor should be back here, safe and sound. I'll fill "
"him in - you just tell Adrienne that you did the work, and you'll be set."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3a1_00019fcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In truth, Ciirta is weak. She needs all the able bodies she can get. This is "
"why you are able to walk in here wearing our robes and not be harmed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sanctuary_000251f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In truth, I miss the towering elms of my native Valenwood. But I was banished "
"from there, for deeds I don't care to discuss. This is my home now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDyusTormentTopic_000807af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In truth, I was Jyggalag's trusted chamberlain and the keeper of the great "
"library."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk5_00068348_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In truth, I welcome the chance to talk. For I feel a kinship toward you I "
"cannot explain. We are brothers, bound by duty and destiny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_00038b04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In your absence, I dispatched a runner to Skingrad to let them know they need "
"to clear Gelebourne's name for the record books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d03d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"In your absence, Thoronir visited and we spoke at length about his role in "
"this scheme. I believe him when he says he didn't know Agarmir's sources."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c245_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "In your coming, I hear the footsteps of Fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeAmberHammer_000400c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"In your strong hands, a few good blows with this, and your foe will be dead "
"in no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a80d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Inaction conflicts with your purpose. The longer you are here with me, the "
"further the balance shifts towards your enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000b5bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Incredible, we've been trying to solve this for months. A job well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000613f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Incredible. I can't believe he's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RobeConv04_0005508d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed it is. Remember, those who wear the robes shall not be harmed without "
"cause, by Ciirta's decree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10FinThedretGreeting01_00002c9d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed they are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1A_0009078f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Indeed, I allowed Mathieu Bellamont to proceed on his destructive course. "
"Just as I allowed you to intercept him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1B_00090790_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Indeed, I allowed Mathieu Bellamont to proceed on his destructive course. "
"Just as I allowed you to intercept him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice1C_00090791_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Indeed, I allowed Mathieu Bellamont to proceed on his destructive course. "
"Just as I allowed you to intercept him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetC1_00016d02_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Indeed, it is your very success that must have led Jyggalag to this "
"unexpected avenue of attack. His usual approach is much less imaginative."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04ChoiceCarahilDangerous_0004f226_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed, it may well be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas3_00002c3d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed, the Divine Crusader seemed an avatar of the Nine that day. We can all "
"be proud to serve under such a leader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_00024206_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b153_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b15c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EronorDEMO1_0002ae24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA6_00002ae5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. And yet you would seek the holy Relics? The gods will find you an "
"interesting plaything, I have no doubt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02PrivateBusiness_000aa091_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed. Another mysterious visitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5A_00022ba9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. For the slaying of Rufio was the signing of a covenant. The manner of "
"execution, your signature. Rufio's blood, the ink.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00NineDivinesResponse_0006138b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. I believe Martin's ascension may signal the beginning of a religious "
"awakening across Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35RumorResponses_0007ac7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed. I'm surprised Earil hasn't taken matters into his own hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10TimetoGo_0001b6bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. Lord Sheogorath will be anxious to hear of our victory, I am sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10TimetoGo_0001b6ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. Lord Sheogorath will be anxious to hear of your victory, I am sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03RespectNature_00002be4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. Nature itself is Kynareth's domain, all its creatures are her wards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetA3_00016d00_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. The Font is being Ordered. As goes the Font of Madness, so goes the "
"Realm. Soon we will all be serving a new master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice6A_00028ac9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. What is the point of my tale? Albert Jemane builds Weatherleah way "
"out in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight2Female_00002cdf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. You only speak aloud what we're all feeling. I try to take comfort "
"that she died as a Knight of the Nine. It's all we can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet3_00018e8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed. You'd best leave this place at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice1B_0002b523_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed? I am at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRodericGreetB_00002a9f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Indeed? You are most fortunate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_0008264d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Individuality is an illusion. However, if you insist: I once served as the "
"keeper of the great library of Jyggalag. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_00014b60_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Individuality is an illusion. The details of my existence are no more "
"important than the history of a stone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_000807aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Individuality is an illusion. The details of my existence are no more "
"important than the history of a stone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023400_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Infiltrating the Imperial Prison is no small matter. Those guards are heavily "
"armed and professionally trained. If discovered, don't be a fool. Flee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06NoBribeBeggar2_00084479_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Information must be paid for in coin, not advice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_000805f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Inquisitor, I am surprised that you do not have a better grasp on the "
"situation. This is most disappointing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bc_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Inside the cave, there's rumored to be a shrine to Sheogorath. That's where "
"the staff can finally be dropped and the scamps should remain behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bd88_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Inside the walls, the chapel is in the east, the residences in the west, and "
"the guilds in between."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_00017d84_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Inspect the battlefield and provide what aid you can to the troops. Speak "
"with me when you feel that they are ready for battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_000181c2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Inspect the battlefield and provide what aid you can to the troops. Speak "
"with me when you feel that they are ready for battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice3A_00070487_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Instead of drawing Traven out, I have received you instead. Perhaps I shall "
"personally go and collect him when we are done here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1b_000807ad_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Instead, He has confined me to this place and forbidden me to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00015f23_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Instead, I want you to put Hrormir's Icestaff into Ontus Vanin's safe chest. "
"He keeps one in his home. Ontus is a former University researcher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1b_0001a816_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Instead, he has confined me to this place and forbidden me to die. I have not "
"seen another creature until fate, predictably, sent you to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Instead, he is dead, at your hand. And Sheogorath's command!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Instead, she is dead, at your hand. And Sheogorath's command!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0005a755_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Instead, they sent soldiers to sneak into the keep. The defenders in the "
"bailey failed to stop them from opening the main gates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Instead, you must report to Ocheeva, here in the Sanctuary. She will be "
"providing all your contracts from now on, and is waiting for you as we speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f87d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Instead, you must report to Ocheeva, here in the Sanctuary. She will be "
"providing all your contracts from now on, and is waiting for you as we speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ac6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Interested in training? I do the Conjuration courses, and Druja does the "
"Mysticism."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062caf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Interesting, go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityB_0008243a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Interesting. I could have sworn I used to have an arm like that in my museum. "
"I have just the place for it, if only I could afford to buy it...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022e56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Interesting. I didn't know that much history about the Tears. I suggest you "
"go find that book Julienne mentioned. It sounds ideal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Become_0001365e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Interesting. Not many wish to hear about such things, but I would be glad to "
"oblige."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity2_00043426_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Interesting... it looks vaguely familiar, like I once had one of these on "
"display. I only wish I had the funds to buy it off you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC2_000a6584_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Interesting... these markings are unexpected... the royal glyph is not as "
"described by Sorcalin..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06GetIntoDungeons_0003d803_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Into the Skingrad dungeons? Not likely. Not unless you got yourself arrested. "
"Of  course you are a thief. Just break in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004b772_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Intruder in the castle! Protect the Countess!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0014c71a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Intruder! Protect the Scrolls!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Lynch01Negative_000151e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Intruders are my business. I think instead of locking you in the storage room "
"with the bouncer, I'm going to dump your body overboard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Invaders? You don't... you don't suppose that they've come for ME do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Inventory_0001d04a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Inventory? I am a simple trapper. My inventory just consists of pelts and "
"skins. I would hardly call that inventory. Now get outta my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Irene Metrick and I spend a lot of time together, true. We're just good "
"friends. But don't tell Elisa. She wouldn't understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Irene Metrick moves with such grace. I wonder what it is she does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice1A_00032ad6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Irlav Jarol is in charge of the project, and is apparently in need of some "
"help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice1A_00035f45_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Irlav Jarol is in charge of the project, and is apparently in need of some "
"help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_00014676_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Irlav is dead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice2A_00035f50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Irlav sent you, did he? Figures. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000835ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Irlav should be waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2C_00022ba1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ironic, then, that I come to you now as Speaker for the Dark Brotherhood. My "
"name is Lucien Lachance, and my voice is the will of the Night Mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaidenShinjiTopic_00146856_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Ironically, Shinji himself was killed, shortly after the Arena was completed. "
"Even he could not survive the Thirty-Year Siege of Orsinium."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonTopic_00018b7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is Thadon not waiting for you to return the Chalice? Go to him, then! Do not "
"anger him, for then you risk angering me as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00082471_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is Your Grace prepared to enter Brellach now? We cannot delay for long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_0006835c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is everything all right, my lord? Has Cloud Ruler been breached? I told the "
"others the Great Hall wasn't secure! Those damn high windows..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000086b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is everything all right? You look a bit ill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002413e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is everything all right? You look a bit ill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is it always this cold up here? This weather would freeze the arse off an "
"ogre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0002d93a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it me, or is it quieter around here with Erthor missing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004798d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it midnight yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081da3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it my Lord Sheogorath? It can't be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it necessary that you speak with ME?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it necessary that you speak with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ee29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it not safe? Do you want me to wait here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ba3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it safe for us to return to Weatherleah yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033753_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it safe now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ba57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it safe to continue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041098_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is it so hard to leave me alone to get some work done? My wind and humidity "
"measurements must be VERY precise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013561_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it that difficult? Fetch one of each. Hurry up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it true that Arentus Falvius will teach people conjuration?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it true that Mandil can open almost any lock?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it true that Samuel Bantien used to be a thief?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_0000357e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Is it true that some of our guildmates were killed? Oh, how horrible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk2_00034048_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is it true what I've heard about your most recent contract? You were forced "
"to eliminate everyone? Even the... non-essentials?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003403e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it true what they're saying? Is Baenlin really dead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44RingInfo_0007873a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is it? Is it, now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c36b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is something amiss? You have an ashen look on your face that tells me so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight1_00002ce8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is something troubling you? You don't look yourself, if you don't mind me "
"saying so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046643_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is something wrong with Luciana Galena? She rarely leaves home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000343f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is something wrong? Why are we stopping?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that a bit of frostbite I see? Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072db6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that man-cat gone yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MannimarcoTopic_00009222_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Is that possible? This is grave news indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04GiveRing_00035fc0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Is that slimy Argonian dead? Did he suffer long? I hope so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCEDISLIKE_0018b2c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice2B_00028c0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_0001447c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylMuurine_0008136a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_0001562d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is that so? But isn't that exactly the sort of thing you'd say if you were "
"behind it all? You're in a position to deny it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice2A_00022b6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that so? Perhaps your Council has not been entirely honest with you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice2A_00003a7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Well, perhaps we'll have to pay them a little visit. Thanks for "
"the tip, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013a58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Well, then perhaps you know something that may be useful to our "
"Inquisitor. Would you care to share that information?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is that truly the best you can do? Your \"wit\" might be better suited to the "
"Aureals across the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00036413_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is that who they were? All I know is that they intended to sacrifice me to "
"their dark god. If only I could erase the memory of that hellish place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00029487_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is that why someone invited us here? To kill us? This is horrible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_0001e851_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is the book safe? Do you have it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is the new ruler of Dementia lovely, I hope?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049900_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a better bookseller in the city than Phintias?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there a better person to learn heavy armor skills from than Bumph gra-Gash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a busier smith in Tamriel than Tadrose Helas?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004658f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a more gracious host in Bruma than Hafid Hollowleg?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064456_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there a new Captain of the guard? I thought I saw him walking the rounds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bc9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a problem, citizen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a problem, ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bc8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049893_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there a tougher person to get a deal from than Palonirya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033dea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there any news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there anyone in Bravil more at peace than Nahsi? And he's such an "
"impressive fighter, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049898_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there anyone in the city who knows more about heavy armor than Varnado?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_00015629_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there anything else you'd care to reveal, as long as you're here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041201_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there anything more pathetic than a clumsy juggler? Don't even look at me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there anywhere in Tamriel you can avoid rats? Disease spreading little "
"nuisances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d23c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there more I can help you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002929_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Is there no end to them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a68_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Is there no one who would stand for the Nine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000613b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0002ab88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there something that makes you think I want to talk to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is there something wrong with you? Someone has been murdered! My feelings "
"about that old crone are hardly important right now! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000adc60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there something you need, Champion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003664e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is there something you require?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d27c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is this a joke? Do I look like I associate with common criminals, let alone "
"grant them access to the guild? Begone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_0001e853_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Is this an attempt at humor? If so, I am not amused. Produce that book "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ChaliceNo_00013309_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Is this making sense? Look, you eat the Felldew, then use the Chalice, and "
"find the world a much brighter and happier place. Honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003cd0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is this pleasure or business?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001544a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Is this the best your pathetic guild could do? If so, our work will be easier "
"than I suspected. And to think, Traven has sent you to defeat us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SurpriseReceive_0002424d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is this true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Is your weapon stained with the foul blood of the ogres?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004660f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Alga a good storyteller?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Cirroc an excellent healer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Honditar an athletics trainer? The hunter in Chorrol?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Ida Vlinorman an agile one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Irene Metrick graceful?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't Olfand amazing? He's an excellent smith and good at teaching light "
"armor skills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000465df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Right-Wind an impressive swordsman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't Tertius a dreamboat? I'm Romana Faleria. I'm such a lucky girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05BribeBeggar3_00016252_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't he a wizard at the Arcane University? I think he lives somewhere in the "
"Talos Plaza district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05OntusVanin_00048971_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't he a wizard at the Arcane University? I think he lives somewhere in the "
"Talos Plaza district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44PantsInfo_00078738_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? Do you know the number one reason people die in a "
"catastrophe? Do you? They panic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028199_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? Two of us have been murdered in cold blood, and that little "
"tramp hasn't batted an eyelash. You figure it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirBeginChoice2_000805ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? We need to search through Crucible, looking for these "
"traitors. Talk to whomever might have information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_000498c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't it uncanny how Ida Vlinorman moves?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't that a hoot? I love it, myself. Best part of being a Daedric Prince, "
"really. Go ahead, try it again. He loves it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003dfc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't that abandoned house a bit spooky?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046646_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't that abandoned house awful?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049950_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't the Guilded Carafe a nice shop?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0004657f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't the Tap and Tack a relaxing place to visit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00049910_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Isn't there something just wrong about buying \"discount\" spells?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f4be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Isn't there something you should be doing right now? You know, for example, "
"the things you were specifically told to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Istirus and I used to be adventurers, but we've retired here. Bruma is far "
"from civilization, but we're ready for a little peace and quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b11ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It all feels good. It's all fun. Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42AgreeLie_0007322e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It all happened tomorrow. I'm sure this conversation will all come back to "
"you in a day or two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001f42a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It all started when Aleron became foolish, and started gambling. He'd visit "
"the arena every week and spend our hard earned money on bets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It appears as though Kurdan has tricked another poor soul with his \"axe\" "
"story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It appears that you got all of them. We never found evidence of any other "
"members. Nice work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09MiscRelmynaExperiment_00046f41_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It appears this level of pain causes you some distress. Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting2_000186fe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It appears to be a source of power for these invaders. A... portal, or some "
"sort of gate. I don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting2_00018c80_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It appears to be a source of power for these invaders. A... portal, or some "
"sort of gate. I don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09GreymarchTopic_0009135b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It appears to be inevitable, though your victory in the Fringe is a new "
"twist. I fear Sheogorath will be gone soon, however."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040cb4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It appears to me that Jyggalag is strengthened by these obelisks that are "
"disfiguring the Palace lawn. Perhaps shutting them down would help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It appears we'll be busy for the foreseeable future. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00026ba5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It appears you're well prepared. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It appears you've spoken to Llevana. I know she sounds a bit like a raving "
"madwoman, but she isn't far from the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BearclawHelmTOPIC_0003570d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It belonged to an ancestor, Oreyn Bearclaw, but was lost for centuries. It "
"was found only when Malacath wrongly believed my family line ended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_00084aa7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It burns...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FearGeneral_00024268_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It can't be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SurpriseReceive_00024248_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It can't be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05MazaddhaWhy_00081187_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "It cannot be permitted! She must be stopped!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_00046650_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It certainly seems to be his passion. I understand he used to be quite an "
"alchemist. I wonder if he'd teach me more about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00022b3c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It comes in four volumes. The first two volumes are rare, but you may run "
"across them from time to time. The third and fourth are impossible to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cdb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It comes near. What does it want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022509_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It contains instructions for acquiring a very special power. You'll want to "
"read it carefully, and then return to Cloud Top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It could be worse. Vilena could just shut us down. I hope she doesn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bf_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It didn't take long before I realized they were following me! I couldn't be "
"seen in town with scamps following, so I decided to discard the staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001f42a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It didn't take long for Aleron to begin losing. He resorted to borrowing "
"money from a usurer to cover his losses and place new bets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000617ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It does feel safer with a Gatekeeper guarding the Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12RecoverYes_0001c4db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It doesn't become you to tell lies. If you've recovered the Madstone, please "
"bring it back to me and you'll be rewarded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestsOrderTopic_000910f7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It doesn't help that they're the ones who make the obelisks work. A little "
"chanting, a little ritual, and POOF! Knights of Order. Bad news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It doesn't hurt that our new master is a famous tough guy. Should bring us "
"more contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon1_0002887e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It doesn't seem you have a hammer, or any of the weapons for us. Please, get "
"those weapons as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD06Weapon2_00028d29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It doesn't seem you have a sword, or any of the weapons for us. Please, get "
"those weapons as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ec74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It fills me with joy to welcome you, Your Grace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002527d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It fills my heart with warmth to see you again, Brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002527e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It fills my heart with warmth to see you again, Sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It gives me great pleasure to see you again, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It gives me great pleasure to see you again, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MouthofthePanther_00036601_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It got its name from the pointed rocks that jut out of the water there... "
"sort of look like teeth. Mouth, panther, teeth... get it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12Choice1A_0000befd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It had been our position to sit back and watch what unfolded, but that time "
"has clearly passed. We cannot tolerate these attacks on the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_000465dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It hardly seems appropriate for a priest of the Nine Divines, but they put up "
"with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECylarneTopic_00019acf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "It has always been so, and presumably always will be so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081dc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It has been an honor speaking with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice3_00026af3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It has been told from our fathers, and our fathers' fathers, that our time in "
"this place will come to an end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaC1_000a5604_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It has certain superficial magic powers, true, but its real power is hidden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KSharraProphecy_00090624_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It has come! We're doomed! Doomed! Run while you can, stranger. Get out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It has no master?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It hasn't been fatal for anyone yet, but we stopped trying after the first "
"few attempts. I can tell you, it really hurts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e512_Oblivion_RES"
"P2"
msgid ""
"It hasn't worked very well so far, but I have no doubt that you will "
"persevere, Inquisitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Assault_0007cc4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It hurts, stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0007cc4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It hurts, stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is SO hard to find a man you can trust in this big city. Sure, Tertius has "
"had his share of girls. Just look at him. But all that's changed now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c23d_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"It is Tamriel, the realm of Change, brother to Madness, sister to Deceit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a beautiful city. I love to walk, talk with everyone, hear the news, "
"share the little stories of the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice3_000133e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is a doorway, an invitation. Perhaps you will accept it for what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is a fairly common practice of these kinds of esoteric cults to put hidden "
"messages within their sacred writings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a glorious daedra, worthy of the Madgod."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQChampionOfCyrodiil_000ade33_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is a high honor. Only six other Champions have been awarded in the history "
"of the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Daedricshrine_00003939_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a marvelous example of a shrine. Let's be on our way, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13ChoiceWhatproblem_000039a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a minor situation, to be sure, but neither I nor my guards can become "
"directly involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a nice place, and you're right about Talasma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofSanguineTOPIC_00026b51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a place of celebration for us. We dance, we make love. Would you speak "
"with Sanguine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a pleasure to meet you. I am Countess Valga of Chorrol. I wish I had "
"time to chat, but I'm afraid I am in the middle of an investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e7ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a privilege to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091992_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a privilege."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a sad day in this fine city when the stench of torture poisons our "
"spirits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeArrowsMagic_00016ce3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a satisfying sound, when an arrow rips into flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PellsGateTOPIC_00026b11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a small community, not far from here. If Lord Clavicus has sent you "
"there, I suggest you be on your way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a terrible responsibility, being Bravil's First Citizen of the Ale Tub, "
"but I suffer under the burden like a Sure-Green Orc."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00097254_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a truly astonishing creature, though I prefer to avoid them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a truly astounding creature, though I prefer to avoid them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004773e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is a very fashionable address, of course, but we live simply."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004762d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is a wonderful city, and I'm proud to have served her for 40 years. But "
"I'm ready to retire, let the young folks take over the reins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038adb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is all in the nose. Yes, of course, it is also in the mouth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is always a pleasure to welcome another Dark Sister into our ranks! Truly, "
"the Night Mother smiles upon her trusted daughters!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is an ancient rite, this Black Sacrament. All across the Empire, every "
"day, people beseech the Night Mother to take the lives of others. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_0003d082_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is an honor to bargain with a thief of your reputation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025281_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is an honor to make your acquaintance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bdd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "It is an honor to serve under you, Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008675c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is an honor to speak with the living legend of the Dark Brotherhood! Your "
"deeds are an inspiration to us all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDQuestionResponses_00023896_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is awful. Her poor mother. What is Glistel thinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SESheogorathTopic_00078ca3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It is best not to make Lord Sheogorath wait. His whims are fleeting, and "
"should He decide you are no longer necessary, it would be to your detriment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082632_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is by the order of the Madgod. The residents don't like it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaB_00022b42_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It is clear from the text that Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries\" come in four "
"volumes, but I've only ever seen the first two books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_00035707_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is clear to me what must be done. The Hist tree must be destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachTopic_0008f04c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It is closed to mortals. Your presence here is... unusual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is fashionable to make fun of Bravil and Regulus Terentius. Personally, I "
"think it is poor sport to mock the poor and disadvantaged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_goblins_000288b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is good that we've taken care of them, though they smell worse dead than "
"alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is good the people wear clothing. M'aiq wears clothing. Who would want to "
"see M'aiq naked? Sick, sick people. Very sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001efde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is good to be back here. It raises my spirits just to walk these ancient "
"halls again. We will prevail. We must prevail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014822_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you again! I have a message for you from the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e443_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you again, friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a1f62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022e0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e7c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you again. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00146818_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you again. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081dc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is good to see you, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is hidden away. Yes. No one will find it...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_00034069_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is high in the mountains near Bruma... our ancient fortress, sanctuary, "
"refuge of last resort. Martin will be as safe there as anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dcb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is how Sheogorath has made their world. They are very happy about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082633_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is how Sheogorath has made their world. They are very unhappy about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f21e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is ill-advised for us to speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_00018e72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is increasing the power of the obelisk somehow. If you can shut down the "
"obelisk, the Spire shouldn't matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is just Ra'qanar, the poor porter. Do you wish to beat me? Punish me? Of "
"course,  Ra'qanar deserves your scorn... but pity this one, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofRaptureTopic_0007ff61_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It is just there, at the top of these steps. You would pray for the blinding "
"ecstasy which is the ultimate reward for those in Sheogorath's service?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DionneWarnChoice1_0001dcc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is my business.  Allow me to introduce myself: Captain Dion of the Count's "
"Guard, at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06KanehFinalA_000400dd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It is my great honor to release my soul to Oblivion in service to Lord "
"Sheogorath. Farewell. I will not walk these lands for many a year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PasswallTopic_0001ec13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is my home. I... I feel so strange. There's this cold feeling inside of me "
"when I think about what's been done. So cold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000131a9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is my honor to sacrifice myself on the Altar of Despair at Lord "
"Sheogorath's command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001443f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is my honor to serve you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJoinBladesYes_00037ced_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is my honor to welcome you into our ranks as a Knight Brother of the "
"Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJoinBladesYes_00037cee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is my honor to welcome you into our ranks as a Knight Sister of the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40WitchWhere_0003ed40_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It is my hope that this woman you seek will know more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetA_0003c80c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "It is no dishonor for us to speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is not always an easy life we lead, but the people must be served."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025018_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is not surprising, considering Morrowind's violent past. We can only hope "
"the troubles subside quickly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_0008571a_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It is now clear to me that the only way to stop the Oblivion invasion is to "
"relight the Dragonfires."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofRaptureTopic_0007ff62_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It is on the east side of Cylarne, which we hold for Lord Sheogorath. The "
"Aurmazl Kaneh has her command post there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachTopic_0001681e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is our home, our sanctuary in the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPinnacleRockTopic_00017d18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is our home, our sanctuary in the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10PinnacleRockInfo_00043028_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is our home. It is where our numbers are strengthened, and where we return "
"to the realm from the Waters of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachInfo_0001e970_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is our home. It is where our numbers are strengthened, and where we return "
"to the realm from the Waters of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is pleasant, and a bit melancholy, to walk among the graves in Green "
"Emperor Way and contemplate the dead who precede us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is quite nice to see you again. I hope you are fairing well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0015974a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is quite nice to see you again. I hope you are faring well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1B_00032bf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is quite simple, really. No longer will you receive orders directly. "
"Instead, you will visit dead drop locations scattered throughout Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12GetStone_00026efd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is said that the ruins are still haunted by the vengeful spirit of its "
"last king. True or not, it is not a place to enter lightly. Be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_00014b5c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is said that the tree feeds from waters of the Grove of Reflection. The "
"grove can show men who they truly are. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0007eb5d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is said that the tree feeds from waters of the Grove of Reflection. The "
"grove can show men who they truly are. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is said that the tree feeds from waters of the Grove of Reflection. The "
"grove can show men who they truly are. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a42_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is said that the wearer has the blessing of Kynareth upon him, and will "
"not come to harm from creatures of the forest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c22d_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "It is simple... they are not gods at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is so kind of you to favor me with your attention. Please excuse me if I "
"seem unappreciative of the honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_00078ca9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is the Realm of Lord Sheogorath. It is what He wills it to be. The trees "
"bloom according to His whim, and the wind blows at His command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is the role of lesser men to fight for those of noble blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreenmoteTopic_000139ae_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is the substance that shapes our imagination and makes every day a joyful, "
"waking dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillGardens_0004036f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It is there she experimented with her \"sixth element,\" in order to create "
"the original Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It is time for decisive action. I have one more duty for you to perform."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d147_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is too late in the day to begin your test now. Return tomorrow before 1 "
"PM, and we shall discuss it then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreymarchTopic_000910f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is underway, but my Lord does not wish for you to confront it directly "
"yet. First, the Realm and its citizens must be attended to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024fd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is unfortunate that we should meet for the first time under these "
"circumstances, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024ff9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is unfortunate that we should meet for the first time under these "
"circumstances, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002501a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is unfortunate that we should meet under these circumstances, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025022_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is unfortunate that we should meet under these circumstances, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06Cleansing_00036422_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is very near, don't worry. We await only the Master's word before we throw "
"open the gates to Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is well known in the City that I collect Ayleid antiquities. It's true, "
"but I desire only very specific items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0007eaeb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is where the body of my child was grown, and the resting place of his less "
"fortunate siblings. You have no business going there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is with the warmest regards I welcome you again, my friend. But you have "
"returned a bit too early. I should have the painting done soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44AllItems_0007873c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is! It is! You've done so well! You deserve a reward! Let me teach you a "
"special spell. It will effect all those around you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SENewSheothTOPIC_00078ca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It is, of course, the capital of the Shivering Isles. It is divided into "
"Bliss, Crucible, and the Palace districts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasA1_00022b55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It isn't for sale. You'll have to find a copy somewhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00092266_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It isn't that I don't believe you. But I won't go with you until I know "
"everyone can leave here safely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OrderOfTalosTopic_00033dfb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It isn't widely known, but many brothers of the Order of Talos are also "
"members of the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48StartCombatShouts_00082c8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It just keeps getting worse, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000253e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It just so happens I am familiar with the Chorrol Chapel Undercroft. You're "
"as good as dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b58b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It just stood there, holding its tail and whispering. What did it say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreymarchTopic_000910ed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It killed the intrepid adventurer who really should just be doing exactly "
"what I say at all times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05FortBulwarkTopic_00002aec_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It lies in the southeast of Cyrodiil, near the Black Marsh border. If all "
"went according to plan, it should be very well guarded now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d775_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It looks bad. It is bad. But we're tough. We'll rebuild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004666a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It looks like the Yellow Team has pulled a fast one by replacing their "
"combatant with three Argonian prisoners! This should be interesting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000a170_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It looks thievy to this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PinerDEMO1_0002ae2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It looks to be a beautiful day here at Weynon Priory, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d38_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It made no sense then, it makes no sense now. But don't you worry. I vow to "
"bring Dovesi's killer to justice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture1_00071946_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It may also be that they are magical, but only for certain individuals or "
"under certain circumstances, or that their magics are secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD4_0001e74f_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It may be that the Dragonfires protected us from a threat that only the "
"Emperor was aware of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It may take a while, but with the Blackwood Company gone, the new master can "
"rebuild the Fighters Guild to its former glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_magickaloria_00054023_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It means \"Magicka Darkens.\" Considering the other inscription, it could be "
"translated to mean \"Magicka wanes,\" along with \"Magicka waxes.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_magickasila_00054022_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It means \"Magicka Shines.\" Taken in context with the other inscription "
"about Magicka Darkening, perhaps there's an alternate translation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081a53_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It means Order has tried subterfuge... not its strong suit. Amazing! Perhaps "
"things aren't going as poorly as I'd imagined."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002990_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It means more to me than I can say. Now, I think I need to start living my "
"life. I'm going to get out of here and see the world. Thank you, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c201_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It might be nice to learn how to make better potions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061428_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It might keep out unwanted visitors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ecc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It must be exhausting messing up the way you do. Nice work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00083069_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It must be the Maruhkati Selectives. All the evidence points to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraReactions_00084aae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It must bleed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor20_00032682_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It must pass to the last of the Dragon's Blood. Keep it safe from the pawns "
"of the Destroyer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraReactions_00084ab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It must pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenLichSpeech_0006e7f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It never fails to amuse me how easy mortal man is to manipulate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004769d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It pays to know about locks and lockpicks. It's just a hobby, of course, but "
"the average citizen feels more secure when he understands his own locks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034895_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It pleases me greatly to offer you this reward, and a well-earned bonus. Go "
"now. Rest. I'll have another contract ready whenever you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Continue_0018a95d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems I'm the first to discover them growing in a natural cave. That's "
"about all I can say about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000566f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It seems Lachance wanted revenge against the Dark Brotherhood for some "
"reason, and used you to do his dirty work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_000c4543_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems Summerset Isle has become a much more dangerous place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems They have been thwarted for now. I know They're still plotting "
"against me, though. It's only a matter of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems a bit odd. I don't know how Ardaline feels about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046822_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems all is peaceful in the Shivering Isles, My Lord. Will wonders never "
"cease?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14TruepaintTopic_0001c1c6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems an errant fireball had exploded next to him, and he lost the use of "
"both arms. He was a stubborn man who didn't want to give up his talent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_000465db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems an odd skill for a priest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031524_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems his horse lost its footing in the heavy rain we had that night and "
"the shipment of port that it was carrying slipped to the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_00025800_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems it is a dire situation throughout all of Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_00077d07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems like they've been here forever, and now this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043f40_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems only fair to warn Your Grace that those who came before often placed "
"switches far from the door itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_0009112b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems our Lord believes you are the key to stopping it. Perhaps He's "
"right. He's had worse ideas. Did he tell you about the clowns? What a mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0000a28a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems quieter than usual at the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002872e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems she's upset about the murder, but there's something else. It's "
"almost like she's glad there's less competition for the gold. Greedy old bat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_0003150a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems someone has taken away an heirloom that is quite dear to me. I want "
"you to help me recover a stolen painting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "It seems that he fell further into evil than even I had feared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ea7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems that the Mythic Dawn are putting their plan to attack Bruma into "
"motion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025014_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems that these are turbulent times in the land of the Dunmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_000286fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems that with each murder, Neville becomes that much more aware. If I "
"didn't know better, I'd say he's planning on catching the killer himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040cb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems that you've finally gotten Jyggalag's full attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_0004681c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems the incident has been taken care of. Your subjects are appreciative, "
"and have sent this as tribute. Well done, My Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006091b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems the world is safe again... unless you're going to eat me. You're not "
"going to eat me, are you? Are you? Please don't!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061765_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems there's a lot of turmoil in the Court of Madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_0001da34_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems to be a source of power for these invaders. A... portal, or some "
"sort of gate. I don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_0001da35_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It seems to be a source of power for these invaders. A... portal, or some "
"sort of gate. I don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_00018c7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems to be the source of their power. Aurig Desha may know more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_00018700_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It seems to be the source of their power. Grakendo Udico may know more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02GiveItem_0001c477_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems you got carried away and killed someone. We do not condone murder in "
"the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RewardTopic_000a3df2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It seems you've been cured of vampirism yourself, so I can offer no help in "
"that regard. I can, however, present you with a sum of money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082610_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It serves them right for opening shops in Bliss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_0004664a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It should be burned to the ground. All those skooma-muddled Khajiit laying "
"around all day... it's disgraceful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03FinChoice1A_00023e54_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It should be easy enough to locate Dreth in his small cell. Besides, I think "
"you know the way, hmmm. He he he he he."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03AltarofKynareth_00002a4e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It simply wouldn't be right to build over Kynareth's works simply so we could "
"worship her. So our Altar is here, in the Chapel she has created."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062685_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sounds like the Council of Mages has been holding extra meetings recently. "
"I'm not sure what that means."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029f7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sounds like the Knights of the Nine are on a real Crusade. They're "
"collecting holy relics for something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006266d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sounds like there are an awful lot of problems at the Bruma guild hall. "
"Jeanne does a poor job of running that place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00034246_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sounds like those books may be an important lead. Get back to me as soon "
"as you turn up anything new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000343f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sounds like you and Baurus are making progress in your hunt for the Amulet "
"of Kings. Good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d2a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sure sounds like Falcar has it in for you. What a bizarre thing to ask you "
"to do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It sure sounds like the Blackwood Company double-crossed Argoth and helped "
"Azani Blackheart murder him. Hard to prove it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_000465fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It takes a skilled fighter to move well in armor that heavy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It takes an average of three attempts to inflict pain before someone will "
"give up useful information, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0001c14e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It took two tries, but you finally made it. You have earned the right to join "
"the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_magickasila_000c9ba4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It translates directly to \"Magicka Shines.\" That doesn't seem right. "
"Perhaps it makes more sense in context; you should look at the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029fa_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It turns out the Shield of the Crusader had been locked away all this time, "
"kept safe by the people who originally found it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChanel1_00031506_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was I that painted that portrait. When the Count was lost, the Countess "
"spent so much time with it that I became jealous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05AnyaWho_00080d7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was Ma'zaddha. He said he was working on behalf of someone else. He told "
"me I needed to help him, or there would be repercussions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_0001447d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was Muurine. She said she found a note from Thadon, that she would tell "
"people it was written to me unless I paid her. It's not mine, I tell you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48HirtelC_0005d2cc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was Savlian Matius... some of the other guards... helped some of us "
"escape... they cut their way out, right through the city gates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Prank_0001ef7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was a good idea, wasn't it? I wonder how long she'll spend trying to "
"figure out where she put it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007311f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It was a pleasure talking to you. No lie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005a027_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It was a privilege to fight by your side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_001778ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was a terrible night. I don't know how any of us survived. The whole city "
"was burning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32HlovalsMagicka_0005a754_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was an honor for me to help Prior Dreth. The pain of the stab wound was a "
"small sacrifice to restore his magicka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026eeb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was an honor to serve with you, ma'am. Now that I've seen how it's done, I "
"think my guardsmen and I can handle any new Gates that open near Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026eec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was an honor to serve with you, sir. Now that I've seen how it's done, I "
"think my guardsmen and I can handle any new Gates that open near Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000af06a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It was an honor to speak with you, Champion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21TempleOfAncestors_0002b460_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was brutally sacked thousands of years ago by humans led by Alessia. The "
"Imperial City is built over the ruins of that ancient city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000be43c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It was even easier than Maric promised. Push off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HowlingHalls_00016b7f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was in this temple that Emperor Pelagius was taken during his madness. "
"After his death in these very halls, the temple was destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f85f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was just a harmless little prank, that's all. Why did you have to go and "
"ruin it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RosentiaGallenusTopic_00094ec7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It was kind of you to accept such a noble task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JemaneFamily_00028ac5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It was kind of you to escort the Jemanes back to Weatherleah. However, the "
"original owner of Weatherleah left them an even greater legacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_0000c08b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was last seen in the possession of Irlav Jarol. He was taking it to Fort "
"Teleman; I can only assume he is still there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fd92_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It was learned that the traitor has been active for quite some time, since "
"before you joined the Brotherhood. That absolves you of any suspicion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_00033efa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was my father's dream, for us all to start a new life there. He spent "
"everything he had to buy the land. Now it all seems to be ruined."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagSpeech_000636f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was not always so. Once, I ruled this Realm, a world of perfect Order. My "
"dominion expanded across the seas of Oblivion with each passing era."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ce5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It was only a matter of time before you or Carius figured it out. No matter. "
"After I've killed you, I won't need my vampire hunter ruse any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was our people who got Azani Blackheart, but I can't talk about who. I "
"promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04Who_0001330b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was passion, it was... forbidden. Oh, the things that would be said if "
"word got out. That made it all the more delicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadowbanishWine_0018d92e_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It was perfect for keeping lookouts warm on cold nights and helping them see "
"better in the dark. Clever, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b22_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was placed on me for defying the teachings of Stendarr in his very Chapel. "
"My entire lineage was ruined by this curse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BearclawHelmTOPIC_0003570d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It was returned to me by a stranger from my homeland, Morrowind. Wear it "
"proudly. Perhaps you can help restore the glory of my family's name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was so nice chatting with you. Be sure to let me know how your hunt for "
"the Mythic Dawn turns out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDAnvilChapel_00002a98_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "It was terrible. I've fought in many battles, but this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuttedMineTOPIC_0001ebea_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It was then that Azura, may She bless our days, sealed the cavern, protecting "
"the world from the monstrosities within. It has been sealed ever since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48SalvianWhatHappened_00098142_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It was too much, too fast. We were overwhelmed. Couldn't even get everyone "
"out. There are still people trapped in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f428_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was truly shocking. The guards just dropped dead, all across the city! I'm "
"glad it's over, but it makes you wonder, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThaedilResponses_00041212_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It was wonderful! Your show was amazing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d29a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It was you that closed that Oblivion Gate, wasn't it? That was a brave thing "
"to do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017967_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "It wasn't long after that the Knights came."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It wasn't my fault. Cyronin Sintav started it. But I'm the one who got "
"caught, so I'm the one who has to cool his heels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice6_000a345d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It wasn't the goblins. It had to have been bandits. But, why? We have "
"nothing! Please go. I must bury our dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45Choice1_00078788_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It went away. But it will come back! It always comes back! It is close. Big-"
"Head can hear it! The Fork of Horripilation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting03_00002c11_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It will allow you to follow Umaril into the spirit realm upon his death. It "
"will allow you to destroy him, body and soul, utterly and for all time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttack_00012cc9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It will be difficult. The Mazken have fortified their position. But I am "
"confident that with your help, we can defeat them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayFines_000983a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It will be done. I will shred all of the hunter's criminal warrants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06ShrineTalkInvasion_0003641f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It will be glorious when the smoke of the burning cities rises to blind the "
"eyes of the false gods! Their reign over Tamriel is almost over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetB2_0001a79f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It will be our great honor to fight by your side, My Lord!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_00033fc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It will be safest here with me. When you return with Martin, we will figure "
"out our next move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034861_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It will be up to you to decide the fate of many. Life and death are strange "
"things, easily manipulated, and both will be altered by your hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00019cce_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It will draw its power from the waters of the Font of Madness in the Palace. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It won't matter. Lord Dagon will soon be able to cross over. The Master's "
"plan will have succeeded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002798c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It would be a good idea to talk to each guest and appeal to their good "
"disposition. Remember, if they really like you, they may open up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvFollow_0006bd99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It would be a privilege, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It would be a truly Demented act to light the Great Torch with a Flame "
"purchased with the blood of the Golden Saints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e928_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It would be much easier to make the Elixir if you weren't interrupting me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004766b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It would be perfect... if the Watch could just get rid of the damn Thieves "
"Guild. You don't have this problem in Anvil or Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035672_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "It would be wise of you to be on time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_00083f4d_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"It would seem that Anya Herrick may know something. It could be nothing, but "
"it's certainly worth following up on, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It would seem that direct torture may not always yield the results you seek. "
"You may need to try a different approach, Inquisitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081e44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It would seem that the Fringe has come under attack. The longer you wait to "
"investigate, the harder it will be for you to do as you are told."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081e45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It would seem that the forces of Order have moved very quickly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089605_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It would seem that your only course of action now is to extract information "
"from Nelrene, Inquisitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RebuildGatekeeper_00014ae8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It wouldn't do to just let them in if more show up. And more always show up. "
"Still and all, I think things are going well, considering!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002913_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It'd be an honor to provide what service I can. So you need anything "
"repaired, you come see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_00091016_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It'll be in full swing soon! Excited?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_00091273_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It'll be in full swing soon! Excited?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04GreymarchTopic_00091021_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Jyggalag's time, and not a good time at all. You're going to help me "
"stop it. First, though, you need to get your feet wet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Martin. His security, I mean. I'm just not sure we're doing enough. He "
"is the last of the Septim line. His death would spell our doom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028248_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Nels! He's the murderer! We have to get him before he gets us! Do you "
"understand what I'm saying? We have to kill Nels!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadCarodus1_00002cf8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Sir Carodus, actually... I still think about him, sometimes. He was one "
"of the best of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadGeimund1_00002cec_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Sir Geimund, that's all. Sometimes I still can't believe he's gone. I "
"don't understand how he, of all of us, should have been the one to fall..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadLathon1_00002d01_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Sir Lathon's death... it still bothers me. I know it could happen to any "
"of us at any time, but... I'm sorry. I shouldn't bother you with this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorsUmaril_00002bcd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's Umaril the Unfeathered, the evil king from the old stories about Alessia "
"and Pelinal and Morihaus. At least that's what the prophet says."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047667_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a beautiful city. But stay away from the Waterfront. It's not dangerous, "
"but it's dirty, and the beggars are a nuisance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a big town. Hell, it's a big county. You stick to your part, I stick to "
"mine, all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a bit strange, but Castle Skingrad is an odd place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f42_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's a damned shame. I haven't been giving the project the attention it "
"deserves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_000227d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a dead end. What's your call, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f20f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's a fairly typical Cheydinhal home. It's in decent shape, although largely "
"unfurnished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KilltheGrandChampion_0003a911_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's a fight to the death, so if you progress that far and want a shot at the "
"Grand Championship, you'll have to try and kill me.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a fine chapel. And a fine group of healers, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b071_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a fine day is it not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_00046586_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a fine place, and Olav treats people well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049904_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a fine place, but I miss the personal attention I got at the smaller "
"bookstores."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a fine place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_0004659e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a good place to stay. Hafid is quite a good proprietor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0005a756_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's a good thing I've kept all the weapons and armor in good condition. If I "
"let those soldiers use them, they'd be all dented by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a grand house, Riverside, and they have grand parties there. All the "
"rich swongs and swells of the town come in. Leave a right mess, they do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033d0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a great loss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000314e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a great relief that the gate is gone. Now the people of Cheydinhal can "
"breathe easier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InnofIllOmen_00023e25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a horrible name for an inn, I know. But I just can't bring myself to "
"change it. Besides, I like the sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b20_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a horrible thing, truly. One cannot help but pity those such as Kellen, "
"who have such a burden placed on them through no fault of their own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a little too rugged up here for me. Add a couple hairs to a Nord and "
"you've got a bear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002459c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a matter of trust. And I don't trust you enough yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyLeyawiin_0004ed8d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's a might devoid of furnishings, so you may want to pay a visit to "
"Gundalas at Best Goods and Guarantees. He can fix you up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyLeyawiin_0004ed8d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It's a modest home in the center of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008262f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a myth. Deluded fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Passwall_0008e4fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a nice enough place. Less dirty than others. I feel like I belong. That "
"old man, in the room made out of butterflies, he said to wait here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049954_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a nice store, at least for alchemists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479da_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's a pity my busy consulting and training schedule leaves me little time "
"for gathering ingredients..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeleneTopic_0000c1cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a pity she wouldn't surrender. Such a waste of a young life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuySkingrad_000545db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a pleasure doing business with you. Tilmo has your horse waiting outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestToddNeutral_00028307_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a pleasure to be here with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyChorrol_0004f219_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a pleasure to have you become a citizen of Chorrol. I'll take care of "
"the deed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c4cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a pleasure to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFelldew_00018b7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a poison, plain and simple. It'll make you wish you were dead. And given "
"enough time, you will be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice3_00026b16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a powerful sword, no doubt about that. Jet black. Got a wicked edge on "
"it, and they say it can steal a man's soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice5_00026b18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a powerful sword, no doubt about that. Jet black. Got a wicked edge on "
"it, and they say it can steal a man's soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a pretty town, and everyone is really friendly, except maybe some "
"Khajiit and Argonians who are upset about the Trans-Niben."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a problem, all these doubles walking around. And it's tiresome. Didn't "
"used to be like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004ed8b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It's a quaint building, small but tidy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f210_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It's a quaint little house conveniently located just off the main gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a regal name, from a rather regal family. Indeed, my father owns more "
"property than the East Empire Company!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MerchantTopic_0002fd6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a sad thing, to think that a mage would kill helpless merchants for the "
"wares they carry. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a scandal that the Mages Guild has tolerated practice of the Black Arts "
"among its members for so long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusD_0001e8e9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's a secret way out of the Imperial City. Or it was supposed to be secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00143eb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame Farwil is gone. Although he was boastful and aloof, at least he "
"treated me as an equal. I shall miss him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame Syl's gone. She didn't pay a lot of attention to what was going "
"on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame all the smaller bookstores are gone. I guess they just couldn't "
"compete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_0001ceeb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It's a shame she doesn't know more about her craft, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000335a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame so many of the Knights fell. I suppose their intentions were "
"good, even if they were a bit self-serving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c197_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a shame such a good smith wastes her life in the bottle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062610_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame that Selena doesn't join in our fun, but she takes her role as "
"an Alchemist very seriously. If you need supplies, she's the one to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00060ed4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame that you had all the fun before I could get here. Now, there's "
"nothing left to do but rebuild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a shame, really. The Gatekeeper was a beautiful specimen. Now he'll just "
"rot and fade like everything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a simple job. Go get a journal from Fallen Rock Cave. Shouldn't that be "
"a cinch for a Fighter Guild contract?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09HelpGF_00014825_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's a small item in the possession of a powerful court wizard. Will you do "
"this for me? I will pay you well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Medallion_00066fee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a small, round, gold medallion. On the back is the inscription \"To "
"Pyke, from Farwil.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30MadnessOre_0001650d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It's a supple and flexible ore.  Yet it holds a good edge. I can shape the "
"sharpest of blades from it. I can also create magical items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ac8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a town, like any other. Well, go outside, and there's the mountains and "
"wines and sheep. Here in town, though, nothing special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000224e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's a very old text, written in a language I'm sure you wouldn't understand. "
"Don't worry about it -- just bring me the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003b345_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's a wonderful room, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's about time someone did something. These guys are killing my business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ee5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's about time someone from the Fighters Guild showed up. I've got work for "
"you to do. I need imp gall for my research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e723_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's about time someone got here. What took you so long?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3840_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's about time someone got here. What took you so long?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f420_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's about time someone restores some order around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008676f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's about time you got here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardGoodbye_00026bc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's about time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_0001cf3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's about time. I guess I have to reinstate you now. Try not to repeat this "
"mistake in the future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c456d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's all about the Yellow Team! Go Yellow Team! Yeah! Woo! Wait, you didn't "
"bet on the Blue Team, did you? 'Cause that would just be plain stupid!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29InvNice_0001d049_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "It's all about who you know. My sources are good, but they are secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13KnightsWhy_00031c84_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's all garbage. They never patrol, they never help fight off the ocassional "
"bandit that slips into the city. Ah well. I've said too much already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09GreymarchTopic_00091356_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's all moving faster than I'd expect. And I'm good at expecting. Things are "
"getting a bit thin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000bf1bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's all over, lawbreaker! Your spree is at an end. I'll take any stolen "
"goods you have. The next move is yours -- Pay your fine, or I haul you away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's all right. The Guild here, that is. That's what you meant, right? It's "
"fine. I'm doing fine here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Conversation_0009813d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's all right... it's all right. I've come to give you peace at last."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002a397_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's all rumor, sure. I haven't seen it. But I haven't heard anyone say "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's all starting to make sense now. Primo didn't need the money. He has more "
"than any of us. Enough, in fact, to give away an entire chest of gold!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11ErlineOpinion_00038444_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It's all that Raynil character. I don't trust him. The thing that bothers me "
"the most is that I swear I've seen him before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingDontCare_000131d7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's all the same to me, either way. All of it. Nothing is right without the "
"Chalice. Have you ever used it? No, of course not. You simply must!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's all tied together, I'm telling you. The Fringe, the weather we've been "
"having, the price of cheese... it's all connected!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDResponses_000465ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's almost as if he grew up in Skyrim. I don't think the church likes it, "
"but his healing skills are invaluable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000301e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's almost worth staying invisible forever, just to see how much it annoys "
"Diram. But that doesn't make me like you any better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_000910fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's already started, but you might be able to stop it. We're making you into "
"a leader the people can trust. Someone to look up to. Someone to blame!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's always 'rats' for the new associates. Is it some initiation test or "
"something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's always a pleasure to hear Uravasa Othrelas speak at chapel. She has a "
"real way with words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_00035f4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's an Ayleid ruin, southwest of Cheydinhal. We suspect there are some "
"interesting things inside, so a research project was established."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004994b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's an apt name. He's got big maces and big axes. Urbul is a big fan of "
"killing things thoroughly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d242_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's an honor to finally meet you. When I heard you were in town, I just had "
"to send for your help. Your reputation precedes you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06JyggalagTopic_000910f6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's annoying, to tell the truth. A bit hurtful. But they do it every time. "
"Join up with the enemy, and become Priests of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028a03_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's as if we were invited for another reason altogether. Think about it. "
"We're trapped in this house, with no way out. And now people start dying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_000329e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's ashame Farwil is gone. Although he was boastful and aloof, at least he "
"treated me as an equal. I shall miss him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_00038afb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's ashame that there will be no retribution for Bradon and Gelebourne's "
"deaths, but such is the way of things. I know you did your best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27CrownLindai_000a6575_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's at least worth a try. I know I don't want to find out what terrible "
"power Umbacano could unleash using the Crown of Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f51_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It's at the bottom of the ruins, if you wish to try your luck. Be careful, "
"though. It could be quite hazardous to your health."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f36b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's awful out there in the world, isn't it? Best to just stay at home, "
"inside... where it's safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_000465ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's awful. I feel terrible for her husband. He must be so ashamed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b92_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's baffling. How anyone could have gotten in and out of there without being "
"seen by our patrols is beyond me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's been a great bounty being in Your Presence. Where'd all those trumpets "
"come from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheeseTOPIC_0003e205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's been a hobby of mine for years. I've collected cheeses from all over "
"Tamriel, including the rare Olroy cheese!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00023cd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's been a long day. Quite pleasant to look forward to seeing you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081d9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's been a pleasure Lord, now it's back to getting some rest and relaxation. "
"All this talking has taken its toll on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000363cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's been a pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081539_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's been an honor to host you, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000514bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's been horrible. Horrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003ea2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's been so long since I've seen a corpse to count. Perhaps I'll have to "
"make my own. Yep, that's what I'll have to do. Yes, can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's been the home of the Mages Guild for the longest time. You should see "
"the library they have there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Dreams_0002c6de_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It's been three days, and he's been stuck in his dreams. I've watched him all "
"that time, and he hasn't been up at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007301c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's been too long since I've seen a corpse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001ad4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's been too long. Come here and hurt me a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03LlathasaIndarys_000092b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's been twenty years or more since the Count married Llathasa. She was a "
"beautiful Elven bride."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e989_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's clear that they're in love. Good for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Lost_00018237_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It's come to my attention that the post did exist and it happens to be the "
"last reported location of the Draconian Madstone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d24b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's come to the Order's attention that Temple District resident Roland "
"Jenseric is a vampire, and has already claimed one victim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44ComingStorm_0007876d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's coming. I think I'm the only one who sees it, though. And I'm going to "
"be ready. Oh, yes. I'll be ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04BribeBeggar_000092c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's common knowledge that the jailors can be bribed to allow visitors to see "
"prisoners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhereIsAmusei_0004897a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's common knowledge that the jailors can be bribed to allow visitors to see "
"prisoners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's connected to the rest of the chamber, we know that much. We just don't "
"know how it works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's curious. Skingrad's people scarcely ever set eyes on the Count, but he's "
"apparently loved and respected by all his subjects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004770e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's cute, really. Such a genius, and can't find his own socks. It's a full-"
"time job keeping him in matching outfits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09RebuildGatekeeper_00014ae8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's essential. Simply essential! If only it were essentially simple... but "
"it's not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00009218_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's from Biene Amelion at the Water's Edge settlement. She needs something "
"retrieved from her ancestral tomb. Try not to muck it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's funny. I don't even know you, and already I don't like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027986_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's funny. I like just about everyone, but the very sight of you makes me "
"sick. Why don't you go look for the gold someplace else, friend. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27AyleidCrown_000a656c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's gone. I suppose you're going to tell me you don't know anything about "
"that. Suit yourself. I know Umbacano is the one who had it stolen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00070402_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's gone... all of it, gone! Have you seen any of it? Any of my things? The "
"others... they think I'm stealing, but I just want my things back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIRELIKE_0006230e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good of you to say so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043519_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good that Resonator of Judgment is working again, what with the "
"Gatekeeper dead and everything. Did you hear that noise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024e13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good that you've joined one of our local organizations. It helps you "
"make the right connections."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to be a Fighters Guild member, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003358e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to be home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000093b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to be home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to get up and move about a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d28f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to have a bit of good news in these dark times. What can I do for "
"you, Hero of Chorrol?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c19a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to know that if I'm sick, I can head to Tumindil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049934_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to know that there's a pawnbroker around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062683_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to know that valuable research is still going on, even though "
"things seem to be a bit more tense lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to know we've got such a strong Fighters Guild presence here in "
"town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066edb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's good to meet you. The name's Pyke, and I welcome you to my humble home. "
"Please, make yourself comfortable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003337b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see a friendly face. I feared we'd never see anyone from "
"Cyrodiil again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see some reinforcements from across Cyrodiil. It's been too long "
"since we all stood together in a common cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035588_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see you again! I hope your contracts have been giving you much "
"pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000be5e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see you again. I'm so sorry that we didn't realize Seridur's "
"deception."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000377d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see you in the real world. I'm indebted to you for rescuing me "
"from my nightmare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see you, friend. This inn has been cheerless for far too long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000093b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to see you, serjo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015f0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003357a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's good to set my foot upon the soil of my home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c58a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's good we've killed him. I'll need his ring as proof that we did the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002940_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "It's happening again! Just like in Anvil and Bravil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000b1229_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's happening! The livestock are dead! The K'Sharra has come to pass! Look "
"to the skies! Look to the skies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002823f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's hard to believe she's dead. Why would someone want to murder an old "
"woman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004659b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's hard to complain. The food is good, and the service is excellent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's her! Don't you see? She's the only one left! The only one left alive! "
"We've got to get her before she can get us! Do you understand?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002823d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's her, you understand me? It's Matilde! She's the killer! She's the one "
"doing this! We've got to kill her first! Do you understand me? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirTopic_00002b02_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's his fault I'm here, barely able to get out of bed. It's his fault my "
"father died thirty years before his time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_000465a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's impressive. I imagine he'd be a good person to talk to about it, if you "
"wanted to learn the skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff13_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It's in the Elven Gardens District. I think the house is deserted. That's why "
"he goes there. So he can escape from life and do his skooma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473f0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's in the Imperial City; perhaps some day you may be able to visit him "
"there. He's done wonderful things for this guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047697_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's just a sport. Chapel climbing. The Watch doesn't like it, but you don't "
"climb chapels while the Watch is standing around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0008e4f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's just down the road from Passwall. It's where Relmyna created the "
"Gatekeeper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakFlatsCaveTopic_0002d6e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's just northwest of Skingrad. Here, see it on the map?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's just one more way they try to get me to get all \"special\" in the head. "
"Right? Make me sleep outside and everything. I don't belong here, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2A_0005402e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's just outside the city walls. I think the robed man has lived there for "
"quite some time. In... in the cellar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078663_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's just that I like to collect things. All sorts of things. Shiny things, "
"valuable things. I can't help myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceWhyBusy_00033632_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's just that the entire Council of Mages has been in here at one time or "
"another recently, all wanting information on Necromancers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027f2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's just this way, not much farther."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00068bfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's just this way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FortCaractacusTopic_0003003b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's just to the southeast of here. Follow the path down the hill. But watch "
"out for the invisible monsters that infest the ruins!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d032_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's just too horrible to comprehend. I don't even know what to say. I guess "
"an apology is not enough. What can I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_000980a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's just up here! Follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b984f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's just up the stairs there. Second floor, the east wing. All the comforts "
"of home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12RecoverYes_0001823d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"It's known as the Ring of the Vipereye. I hope it serves you well in your "
"future journeys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a693_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's like I said. Join the guilds or the Chapel. In Chorrol, we like what we "
"know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VidkunTopic_0002e5e8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's like he dropped out of existence! No one knows what happened, and Falcar "
"won't say a word about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f51_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's magical - we know that much. Enchanted somehow. We think it's a lock of "
"some sort, but haven't been able to figure out how it works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002ba66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's more symbolic than practical, but each carries great significance to its "
"owner. You're going to get Ardaline's staff back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d06f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's my job to help people learn the proper, constructive use of Destruction "
"magic. And let's face it... blowing things up can be ever so much fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029203_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's my pleasure. Please continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Notebook_000781fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's my private journal. I write in it everyday. Sometimes more than once. "
"It's something I have to do. It keeps my thoughts from unraveling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFellmoorTopic_0003be77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's nice here. Lots of pests for Relan. Lots of blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018b9fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's nice to go back to tending sheep without having to look over my shoulder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035745_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's nice to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_0006177f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's no surprise Thadon killed himself. I'm more shocked about Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_0002822f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's none of your business how I feel about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CropsfordTopic_000319d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's northwest of here along the Yellow Road. You'll see some of our supplies "
"near the road where we left them when the goblins attacked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0007817b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's not a bad place, when Bernice feels up to cooking and cleaning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00077d10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's not a bad place. Clearly the finest in New Sheoth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RingofBurden_0002e5ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not a normal ring, you see. You may find it slightly difficult to carry. "
"Don't say I didn't warn you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not always easy to find a good trainer. That's a good place to look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG07ChoiceKaltharWhy_0003378f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's not even as if I was going to keep it forever. I was going to give it "
"back to her, once I'd gotten what I wanted. That's not so wrong, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SedorTOPIC_00003947_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not far from here. Here, I'll mark it on your map. Now, just leave me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c55b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's not like anyone determined enough couldn't get their hands on it; the "
"key is in his desk, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004ed81_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's not much to look at, but the smell will soon make you forget how ugly it "
"is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_0004992b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's not my favorite place, but if I'm really hungry, it'll do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not my place to question the wisdom of Lucien Lachance or the Black "
"Hand, but trusting you with the Rose of Sithis? It is... folly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice5A_00022bd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not quite that simple. Hassildor is powerful, to be sure, but the "
"Council does not consider him to be a threat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDUnderpallCaveTopic_00002bec_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not really a cave, but seemed to be the buried ruins of an old keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01BelmyneRant_0005589e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not right! Madness! Why? Why? Everything is wrong! It can't be done! "
"Stay away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03ElvenBust_00035645_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not safe for me to handle the bust. I shouldn't even be talking to you. "
"Go find Methredhel. She has your instructions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00064ff5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's not safe here! Leave before he comes back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e91c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's not safe here. The walls are about to collapse. You'd best get moving, "
"friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002974b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not safe to be alone. I certainly don't want to be the third victim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047709_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not safe, talking to strangers. I don't know what's going on, but I have "
"to be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004773c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not that I'm lazy. I'm just not very ambitious. You can live comfortably "
"in the city very cheaply. So why work yourself to death?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not the nicest bed in Cyrodiil, but it's cheap. 10 gold, and it's yours "
"for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002967_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's not the same as using a blade, but archery can be invaluable in the "
"right circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's not wise to interrupt us in the middle of our discussion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadAreldur1_00002cfd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's nothing really. I was just thinking about poor Sir Areldur. He was a "
"fine knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight2Male_00002ce3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's nothing to be ashamed of. We all have our own way of grieving for those "
"who are gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028186_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's obvious that young Primo comes from wealth. A chest full of gold would "
"be mere spending change for him.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiaCaro2_00035fba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's of no consequence. I'll just have to remember to remove it every night. "
"It's your job to make sure my jewelry box is locked each night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseDecline_0004ed82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's of no great consequence to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's only a matter of time before adventurers swarm the Isles now that the "
"Gatekeeper is killed. You'll need a sharp blade to bleed them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224ce_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's our duty to protect our own, even if others will do nothing. Father "
"taught us that much, and we won't back down from a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002c5a0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"It's our duty to strike back. We need to make a move against them. And we "
"need to do it now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaTopic_00146852_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's our home away from home, isn't it? I guess you could say the Blademaster "
"and Battle Matron are our mother and father, huh? Ha ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's our natural barriers that keep us safe, mostly. Mountain borders north "
"and east, open sea to the west, and bogs and rainforest to south."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bab7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's over, citizen. The crisis has ended. But at what cost? We are an Empire "
"without an Emperor. The future is uncertain, at best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GoodbyeKvatch02_0018ad60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's possible. Or maybe she got out, and she's looking for you, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk5_0018d7fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's pretty clear, isn't it? We failed once. We must not fail again. But let "
"us discuss this no more. Come what may, the Blades will stand ready!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002824d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's pretty obvious that Primo comes from a wealthy family. He would never be "
"interested in a girl like me, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's probably the finest inn in all of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004e94c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's quite possible you may find Nirnroot in people's homes or businesses. "
"Not everyone knows its true potential."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's really none of your business what I think about him, now is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstMakeChoices_00018dfa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "It's really quite ingenious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024851_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's safe to pull those people out of the chapel. Let's get in there and make "
"sure they're all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e12f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's said he seeks nothing but calipers and tongs and builds all night whilst "
"he sings silly songs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's said that eating taproot can bring you good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's said that the bite of a vampire has the chance of infecting the victim. "
"If this occurs, they'll become a vampire in a few days. Be cautious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_00003936_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's said the Stone was blessed by Alessia herself, and while it remains in "
"our possession, no harm may come to our church."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c6d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's so difficult to be here and watch him not knowing how much he may be "
"suffering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's so good to meet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's so good to see you again. I've spent a good deal of time speaking with "
"Gilen and Grey-Throat. They agree that the Order should live on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's so hard to concentrate with all that noise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047713_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's so sad. Salomon was to compose a symphony for Uriel Septim, to be "
"performed for the whole city in the Arena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038afd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's so very nice to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Armand5_0005143e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's somewhere in the Imperial City. The beggars will help you locate it, for "
"a price. I can sell you lockpicks if you need them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyBravil_0004ed83_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It's squalid little shack, I'm sorry to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's still pretty wild east of the Niben. Few people, except for bandits, but "
"at least it hasn't been picked clean by treasure-hunters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopicElse02_00038a9d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It's stupid. And chapels and priests and folks groveling on their knees, "
"they're stupid, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VidkunTopic_0002e997_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's such a shame. He didn't deserve to die like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's supposed to be a secret. I'm not talking. But everyone knows who's "
"responsible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08GreymarchTopic_0009130e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's swept the Fringe. That's not good. See if you can't hold them off there. "
"Because, if you can't, everyone is going to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033761_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's tavern time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b9b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's terrible. But I have the feeling that worse is yet to come. I may go to "
"Anvil to hear that prophet preach, before it's too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047736_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's terrible. I just can't walk past a bookstore. The First Edition, in the "
"Market District, is the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Arrows_00013346_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's that fool Bat gro-Orkul. He thinks his armory is more important than the "
"town or our lives. He's first on the list. Oh, yes! First."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d759_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's the Chapel of Akatosh. Four walls standing, and no fire. Can you think "
"of a safer place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ab37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's the Gray Fox! I can't believe it's really you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0003c8b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's the Gray Fox! You're under arrest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's the Great Hall. Those high windows -- they're not nearly as secure as "
"they should be. If an assassin or spy should gain entrance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's the Madgod Himself! My Lord! I've been keeping track of all the dead "
"things for you. There's lots of dead things. I've counted them all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's the best place in the city for alchemical ingredients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095a64_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's the captain's enchanted cutlass. I managed to grab it when I was in his "
"cabin, before his spirit chased me out! Oh, thank you so very much! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's the city of Tiber Septim, youngest of the gods. Go to the Palace and the "
"Temple of the One. Stand on the stones where Talos stood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQLastItem_00026ef7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's the counterpart to the Great Welkynd Stone, just as the first two were "
"the opposed powers of the daedra and the divines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049959_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's the finest light armor selection in the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's the finest place in the city. Simply an excellent inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopYes_0001e840_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"It's the least I can do to say thank you. Now, don't be a stranger! The "
"Copious Coinpurse is still in business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34WhyNeed_0008f7b9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "It's the only piece of my history that validates who I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049902_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's the only place to go for books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's the only place worth visiting in the Imperial City, if you ask me. I "
"only make the trip if I can't find a specific book here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's the smell, really. Smoke and fire. And something worse. In the ruins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c142_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's the waiting that gets to me. Why don't they just attack and get it over "
"with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TimeToGo_0002a4b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's time for you to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_00025309_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's time for you to leave, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008f10f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's time to say goodbye, I'm sorry I must fly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13KnightsWhy_00031c84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's tolerated because Farwil is the Count's son. Plain and simple. He has "
"the power and the coin to put it all together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00029a71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's too bad nobody stopped Glarthir before he went on his killing spree. I "
"guess no one knew how crazy he really was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's true that he's settled down. Still, he can teach you the basics of "
"lockpicking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b2f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's true what everyone's saying -- Kvatch is lost. The Daedra, they swarmed "
"in.... The Town Guard never had a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's true. Chorrol has almost everything you could need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's true. Some fine horses he has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00029aa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's unbelievable. Glarthir went after Toutius Sextius with an axe. Killed "
"him before the guards could do anything. No one even knows why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b94_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's unbelievable. Right in the center of the city, nobody saw anything? "
"Makes you wonder about the competence of the Guard, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c081_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's uncertain exactly what illness Roderick has contracted. But don't worry, "
"it's probably not contagious. He he he he he."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Armand2_0005143b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's unusual for us to have three potential recruits at the same time. Rather "
"than the normal test of skill, I'm going to make this a contest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002819d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's up to us now, don't you see? Dovesi did it! She murdered everyone! And "
"now she wants to murder us too! We have to get her first! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b124b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's upstairs on the top floor. Only room I've got. I think both beds should "
"be clean enough, so use whichever you prefer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's upstairs, second door on the left. Don't say I didn't warn you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038b01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's very good to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000549bc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"It's well hidden, so don't even think about trying to steal it back from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFlameofAgnonTopic_0009109f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's what's used to light the Great Torch. Haven't we covered this? You'll "
"find it in Cylarne, guarded by my Saints and Seducers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEHillofSuicidesTopic_0008e55e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's where you end up if you don't die according to His plan. They will drive "
"you to it. Like They did poor Gadeneri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001c4c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's wonderful to see you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's worse than my nightmares! In fact, it's like my worst nightmares come "
"true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e614_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's you again! I'm so pleased to see you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e704_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's you again! I'm so pleased to see you! Look at what you have! Is this "
"new? Let me get a closer look! Exquisite!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002917_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's you! I've heard of you! You're the one restoring the Knights of the "
"Nine, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003aa9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's you. Hi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGJoin2_00024286_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's your choice, of course. If you should change your mind, feel free to "
"speak to me again about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseDecline_0004f00e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's your loss. There is no finer horse in Cyrodiil than the Black horses of "
"Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleswellTopic_00000887_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's your own fault. You had two chances to help them. I'm sure they'll get "
"used to being invisible eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06FenceTopic03_000088a1_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "It's your prison sentence, not mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoPayFines_000983a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's your prison sentence, not mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00092d77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's... It's finally over. The killer is dead. We just... We just need to get "
"out of here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0011e154_DLCOrrery_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's... It's nice to see you too, but you're a bit empty-handed, aren't you? "
"Remember those items we talked about? Please, I'm still waiting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018baa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "It's... It's you! The Hero of Kvatch! This is truly an honor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000181bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's... it's you! I remember you. What are you doing down here? How did you "
"get past the Knights?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000852bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's... it's you... you're the only one left. You did it! You killed them all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It's... unbelievable. Order was defeated? All the old tales say that's "
"impossible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_00028555_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"It... it all happened so fast. It was all we could do to round up the "
"survivors and try and get them to safety. We've failed them miserably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046605_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ita Rienus knows more about the geography of Tamriel than anyone I've ever "
"met. Apparently, she knows quite a bit about Mysticism as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ita Rienus, Spells, Recharging and Training in Mysticism. And idle chatter. "
"At your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Itius Hayn, Guard Captain. You don't want to know me. Stay on the right side "
"of the law, and we can stay perfect strangers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Its scent is unfamiliar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008605b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "J'Baasha's an adventurer... just like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1A_000262d5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"J'Ghasta, Shaleez, Alval Uvani, Havilstein Hoar-Blood -- Speakers and "
"Silencers all. And Ungolim... the Listener himself! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1B_000262d6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"J'Ghasta, Shaleez, Alval Uvani, Havilstein Hoar-Blood -- Speakers and "
"Silencers all. And Ungolim... the Listener himself! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1C_000262d7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"J'Ghasta, Shaleez, Alval Uvani, Havilstein Hoar-Blood -- Speakers and "
"Silencers all. And Ungolim... the Listener himself! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004770a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"J'mhad keeps the grounds of the Temple nice and neat. Other things, J'mhad "
"does, when they ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jakben, Earl of Imbel. We do not know one another. And, given your modest "
"social standing, I doubt we ever shall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046620_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jantus Brolus is apparently an excellent mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00051dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Januarius and I have been in service to three generations of Caros. We're "
"very proud of Count Marius and his lovely new bride."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jastia Sintav. Jena's my sister. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_00033fc9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Jauffre believes that the death of the Emperor and the darkening of the "
"Dragonfires is the key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusH_0001e90d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Jauffre should know how to find the heir that the Emperor spoke of. The "
"Amulet must reach Emperor Uriel's heir so a new emperor can be crowned!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_00037c3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jauffre."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusB_0001e8e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jauffre? He said that? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0008e54f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Jayred Ice-Veins wants to kill the Gatekeeper. Sounds like suicide to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jena Sintav. I have a house with Jastia, my sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000688ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jena, always a pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000688f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jena, good day to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jensine is running the show. She will get him but good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0000bc96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jensine is the lady you want to speak with about Thoronir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049933_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jensine's isn't bad, especially if you need to make a quick couple of septims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004658b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jerall View is a nice place for visitors to stay. Hafid makes everyone feel "
"welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e0a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jesan Sextius, singer, composer, and storyteller extraordinaire. Glad to meet "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jobs are good. I need more money. So I need more jobs. For money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jobs around here? Don't know that I trust you enough to recommend you to "
"anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jobs for the Fighters Guild? Hmmm... try Margarte. If she's not at home or at "
"the Five Claws, she's probably out looking for alchemical ingredients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jobs would be great. Too bad no one is giving us any these days. If you can "
"find some work for us, we'll do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGThievesGuildJobs_000165e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jobs? We're thieves, not masons or scribes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008608b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Join my trophies, nithing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Join the Fighters Guild? Fight, and get paid for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033ddb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Join the Guild, and fight for gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033d14_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Join the Guild. You won't regret it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkBrotherhoodTopic_000bba98_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Join us, and you'll find the Dark Brotherhood to be all that, and so much "
"more. We are, more than anything, a union of like-minded individuals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004762a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jollring, the butler. I've served Master Umbacano for many years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09ImIn_00053724_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Jorundr and I have had a rocky relationship at best. Against my will, I've "
"been dragged all over Cyrodiil helping him commit petty crimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c22f_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Julianos and Dibella and Stendarr are all Lorkhan's betrayers, posing as "
"divinities in a principality that has lost its guiding light. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d07_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Julianos blesses you with his wisdom and his guidance. Trust in your "
"knowledge for it is the whole of who you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38GuardWarnChoice1_00023686_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Julianos preserve us! I can't believe it ... why me?! Please, show this to "
"the guards right away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_IngredientCollection_000279e1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Julienne Fanis has long served Arch-Mage Traven in collecting alchemical "
"ingredients for his personal research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004763e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Julienne Fanis. I'm the Alchemy Expert. At least, the best the Mages Guild "
"has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Julitta Plotius. I'm Betto's wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00023c0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jump on my sword while you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Lost_00081a39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just a Gnarl, I suppose. Let them drink their fill of Order, ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilD1_0003fbe2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Just act like a prisoner, and do as I say. Once Orthe leaves, we can find a "
"quiet spot to remove those Bands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DSNo_00023670_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just as I suspected!! They've gotten to you too! Not one of them involved in "
"the conspiracy, and you expect me to believe that?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG02Choice1B_0002e5a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just as I suspected. If you ever believe yourself to be ready, perhaps we'll "
"have reason to speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38BPYes_0001dc31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just as I thought, just as I thought. Excellent work. There will be a bonus "
"in this for you, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ScarTailTopic_00035593_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Just as a member of the Dark Brotherhood cannot kill a fellow family member, "
"a Shadowscale is forbidden from slaying another Shadowscale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcConversation_0007ead0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just as long as we don't catch any of their diseases. Adventurers always get "
"strange diseases."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDEightAndOneTopic_00002c8c_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just as the Eight aided Pelinal of old, now the ascended One, Talos who was "
"Tiber Septim, provides his Blessing to you, the new Crusader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43HowDid_000be560_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just be sure and keep this quiet. If the other mages even knew that I was "
"involved with Rosentia's new guests..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just because the Isles didn't come crashing down around our heads doesn't "
"mean everything is fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10LlevanaTalk_0003c375_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just because you run the law in this town doesn't put you above it. You're "
"going to pay for what happened to Aldos."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038580_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just before I arrived here, I received a report from one of our scouts "
"watching the roads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00074a16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just between the two of us, I wish the Countess would worry a bit more about "
"the security of the city and a bit less about her damned painting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just do your job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcConversation_0007ead2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just don't get any blood on me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatekeeperChoiceHowTears_0008e4f8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Just don't tell her I said anything. I might get another lesson in the nature "
"of Pain. I don't like those lessons very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053766_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just exit the city through the North Gate. It isn't far from there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002871b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just follow Savlian's orders, and everything will be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c47cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just follow the Captain's orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gift_0018bc31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just give them to her; say they're from a friend. She doesn't need to know "
"I'm the one responsible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice1C_00023f3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just go right up to them and introduce yourself. They love meeting new people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Prank_0001ceea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just go unlock Jeanne's desk with that spell I taught you.. Find her Manual "
"of Spellcraft, and bring it here to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003632a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just go! I can't stand the sight of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just got a look at the new Maglir guy. Another 'eight-pint hero', if you ask "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00083065_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just have to take matters into my own hands. The only way now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaCombatantTopic_0002ada0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just head through the door here on my right and take the stairs down. Be on "
"your best behavior, though. Owyn is a bit... cranky by nature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bcc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just hold the ghosts off while I figure out how to open this damn door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d498_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just hurry back with that ring... please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Counterspell_0003012e_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"Just in case, it might be best if you wore this ring while you were casting "
"the spell. I make them myself. Very useful for this kind of research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just in time, Mage. We've been waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007302d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just keep going. Nothing to eat here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk2_0006fdd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just keep one hand on your hilt and both eyes on the crowd. There's something "
"sinister lurking out there. I can feel it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00085214_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just keep walking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062156_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just keep your eyes on the menu, and off of Sheer Meedish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00028ba9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just killing time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_00067dc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just know, that whatever you need, we will give gladly. Our hearts, our "
"blades, our lives if need be. Long live the Septim bloodline!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007eab0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Just leave me alone -- go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081da7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Just leave me alone -- go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00029039_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000579c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just leave me. Please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004735a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just leave us alone. We have enough troubles here in the Savage Garden "
"without you adding to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00074fda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChoice2A_0000c1b7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just let me know when you're ready for a match and we can get this over with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006052c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just like Sheogorath to abandon us in our time of need. He has been ever "
"fickle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c98d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just like Skyrim, except for all the tight-ass Heartlanders around. All work "
"and chapel... no wonder they're so sour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29InvGet_0001d044_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just like a baker not revealing his best recipes, I must keep my sources "
"anonymous or every merchant in town would use them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just look around. Is not Cheydinhal the model of civic rule? No... don't bow! "
"I am just a humble servant of the people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046663_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just look at the Yellow Team's Dark Elf! You can see the murder in his eyes! "
"Can the Blue Team's Bloodletter even hope to survive? Let's find out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f14_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just look for me if you need anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00132aa0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just look for me if you need anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a127_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just looking at you reminds me of... Him. Why has He forsaken us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff6_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Just make sure you understand our rules of competition for this match. "
"Fighting the Grand Champion, well... The rules are a bit different."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Just make sure you understand our rules of competition for this match. "
"Fighting the Grand Champion, well... The rules are a bit different."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoBribeA2_000a984f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just making conversation, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just one more time. At least. He's a sport."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just out for a brisk walk. Helps clear the head. Any other information I can "
"help with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03FinChoice1A_00023e54_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Just outside the Imperial Prison is a grating that leads to the sewers. It "
"has recently been tightly locked, but I will provide a key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just perform the task you've been given. We'll talk more once you're done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a7_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Just please, help me get that ring back. I want to save what's left of my "
"marriage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000206ad_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just remember it was I that assisted you. I expect that will carry some favor "
"under your rule."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Ritual_0007893f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Just remember not to deviate from the Ritual's guidelines. One would hope you "
"can do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006fdca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just remember, my sword's here if you need it. You run into any trouble, just "
"holler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00068343_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just remember, we're in this together. You must learn to rely on me as I rely "
"on you. But I've rambled on long enough. Akatosh be with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000980d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just speak to Tolgan... you'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089614_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just stop it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_000981ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just take your trinkets and go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003cc21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just this way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JoinUs_0003d4a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just to be perfectly clear, we're not prostitutes. We do everything on our "
"own terms, and the men never, ever lay one hand on us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06Rescue_00014739_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just unlock the door. A couple of hours after you're gone, it will be quiet "
"again and I can sneak out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_000c47d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just wait. He'll be here shortly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_0003d08a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just walk away like you don't know me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_00031037_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just watch. You'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35HereYouGo_00078674_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just what are you trying to pull?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004351f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just when I look forward to company, they activate the Resonator. Tall-Trees-"
"Falling is so alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006051a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Just when I thought I was making some progress, I hear that Sheogorath "
"himself has gone missing. Is this the end?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006c67b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Just... just leave me alone, all right? I don't want no trouble!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Justice has been done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo03_0006fde1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Justice has been done. And henceforth, Mazoga and you shall be known as "
"Knights of the White Stallion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo03_000908dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Justice has been done. And henceforth, you shall be known as Knight of the "
"White Stallion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c37d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Justice has been done. Go tell Garrus what's transpired here. I await my fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02Choice1A_00023f36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Justice? Hahahahaha! I been avoidin' that all my life, mate! Let me show you "
"how!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jyggalag is coming. He cannot be stopped. He will rule this land, and all our "
"delusions will be stripped away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jyggalag is coming. He cannot be stopped. He will rule this land, and all our "
"delusions will be stripped away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jyggalag is gone, but I bet he brought a ton of diseases with him. We still "
"aren't safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061cad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jyggalag never stood a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095ec1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jyggalag walks once more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f589_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jyggalag will reward me well for your death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060918_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Jyggalag's defeated. Took them long enough to get rid of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060887_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Jyggalag's forces have been defeated. Perhaps Order is simply an inferior "
"element."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12FontofMadness_00017272_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Jyggalag's minions must have introduced Order into the very wellspring of "
"Madness. You must cleanse the Pools, or Order has won the war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006266c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kalthar tried to ruin the Leyawiin guild. Just goes to show you can't trust a "
"Necromancer, even if he claims to be \"reformed.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e06a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Kalthar was talking about it recently. He seemed very agitated about it. "
"Almost... happy. Strange, isn't that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kantav Cheynoslin. I am the Primate of Leywiin, and Zenithar's Advocate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kastav says he works. Ha! Flies land on him, he's too lazy to brush them off. "
"I'm sick of taking abuse for him, even if he is my brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kastus Sintav. Uncle Iniel got us good jobs gardening. We're very grateful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018a960_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kayleen's grave is outside if you wish to pay your respects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00070405_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep an eye out for my things, won't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072f11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep an eye out for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Keep far from the Grummite with skin a greenish-jet. If your paths should "
"accidentally cross, don't ever get it wet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e130_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Keep far from the Grummite with skin a greenish-jet. If your paths should "
"accidentally cross, don't ever get it wet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that Anya is cowardly, and may require persuasion to tell you "
"what she knows. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c336_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep leading."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03SearchForArmand_0003362d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep looking boys. Armand Christophe has to be here somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018d926_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep looking for that wine! Farewell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00026ba9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep me informed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep me informed. I'm very interested to hear where he is hiding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018baaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep moving, scum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033780_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00027326_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep quiet, and stay out of the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep the Key safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep the Ring safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep this fair!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008da95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep to it, I have faith in you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep up the... ummm... good work, I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep walking, stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep walking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_0002711f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep working on obtaining the items Martin needs for the ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep your distance, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046644_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Keep your eyes on City-Swimmer. I don't know where she goes when she's not in "
"the canals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pickpocket_00062275_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep your fingers to yourself, thief!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeHelmetMagic_0001f3e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep your hair from getting tangled in melee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018d7e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep your heart true... and your eyes open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018abd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Keep yourself safe, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Keld of the Isles. Guardian of the Fighters Guild. And how did I achieve that "
"high rank, you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Khajiit has no words for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176c4_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Kid, you've got more guts. And skill. I think you can take the Gray Prince! "
"Go over and talk to Ysabel if you think I'm right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027e38_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "Kill Mankar Camoran, and you will unmake his Paradise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2A_00032be9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Kill Phillida in any way, Rose or not, and the contract is complete. But to "
"receive a bonus, you must go beyond murder. You must send a message!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2B_00032bea_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Kill Phillida in any way, Rose or not, and the contract is complete. But to "
"receive a bonus, you must go beyond murder. You must send a message!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2C_00032beb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Kill Phillida in any way, Rose or not, and the contract is complete. But to "
"receive a bonus, you must go beyond murder. You must send a message!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00073005_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill every last one of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraReactions_00084ab0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_00084aa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill it...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00073112_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill me... please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark11Choice3A_00002dd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kill me? What is this? Who are you? I don't know who sent you, but you won't "
"take me down without a fight! So go ahead, make your move!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000192e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill the Aureals. Don't stop until every last one of them is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill the Mazken!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutBetrayal_00054fb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill the betrayer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMephalaSpeech_000579d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kill the leaders of the two families. Plant evidence to implicate the other "
"family as the killer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Assault_00028770_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kill the stranger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestsOrderTopic_000910f7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Kill them when you see them. But don't touch the corpse until they're really "
"dead. Which they aren't, until you deactivate the obelisk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13hunterChoiceHow_00033f57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kill them, run them out of town - do what you will. I simply want them gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Continue_00189d08_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Kill those things. Every last one of them! They destroyed everything I hold "
"dear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072dab_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Kill! Kill the cat! Good dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofSheogorathTOPIC_00026adf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Killed and ate a Bosmer there. But it made me sick. Saw Lord Sheogorath in "
"the vomitus, so that's all right. Here to sacrifice? A limb would be nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Killed anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MelusPetiliusTOPIC_00026b47_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Killed off hordes of goblins when they attacked the town. Killed off a nest "
"of minotaurs singlehandedly. That's all in the past now, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ed4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Killed the other one, huh? You're annoying, but you do good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00146009_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Killing their chief should weaken the Black Bow Bandits, but they're still "
"going to be a menace to travelers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002872a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kind of stuck-up, that one. Right before you got here I told the funniest "
"joke about an Argonian maid, and she didn't even crack a smile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091885_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kithlan seems eager to help you. When you become sovereign of Dementia, I'd "
"keep him around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SERooftopCheer_00082743_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kneecaps! Go for the knees!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00061cd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kneel before the Saints!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00096045_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kneel before the might of Jyggalag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00086084_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kneel, churl!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_00082619_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knick-knacks and bric-a-brac, once you go you're sure to go back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_00016efc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knifepoint Hollow is my prison. As the Great Library, it once contained all "
"the knowledge in creation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_000807ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knifepoint Hollow is my prison. Hewn from the stone by Sheogorath for the "
"sole purpose of containing my knowledge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_00014b5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knifepoint Hollow is near the core of the Shivering Isles. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077d04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knights of Order have appeared in the Isles. I hear they come from the "
"obelisks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077d05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knights of Order have come to destroy the Realm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knights of Order? These aren't the valiant knights from the epic tales!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b43_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Knights of the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10LaunchAttackYes_00002c36_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Knights of the Nine! Umaril and his Aurorans must be destroyed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b4b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Knights of the Nine, follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirThedretSpeech01_00002c97_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knights of the Nine, hear me! Today we have witnessed undeniable proof of the "
"strength and the might of the gods we serve!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0014600a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knights-Errant? That's just a poor knight without a castle. But I hear they "
"got a nice lodge right on the banks of the Niben."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006053b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knock, knock. Who's there? Not Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028bbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Know anything about the stranger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028bbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Know anything about the stranger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Know that I was the one who drew weapon first against Sir Berich. He merely "
"defended himself, and proved the better swordsman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RufioTopic_000272ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Know that Rufio is old and weak, and sleeps his days away. You could kill him "
"before he even has a chance to wake. If you so choose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17GoOn_000366ed_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Know that you have my complete confidence. I would not entrust this job to "
"you if I did not feel you were prepared for it. Now, go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002241c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Know this -- if you truly wish to become a Champion, you'll have to go "
"through me. If we meet in that Arena, I will make you beg for death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CovenantTopic_000272af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Know this. Every Dark Brother and Sister is a child of Sithis. He whom we "
"call Sithis has many other names. Chaos. Doom. Discord. Sithis is the Void."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_00026d8d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Know this: there will be no further leniency. Any more violations, and you "
"will be permanently expelled from the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_00026d8e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Know this: there will be no further leniency. Any more violations, and you "
"will be permanently expelled from the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028c37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Know what I think? I think that barbarian will do anything to get his hands "
"on the chest of gold. His kind are greedy and vicious, all of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Know what I'd do? Talk to Faelian, learn who he is. Maybe then you can lead "
"him to a secluded place. Then, when you're alone... you know! He he he!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Know what's funny about having a double? Nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_0002502d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Know, however, that you have only one more such chance available to you. The "
"guild does not take these infractions lightly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_0002502e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Know, however, that you have only one more such chance available to you. The "
"guild does not take these infractions lightly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003dfcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knowing how to use heavy armor isn't a bad idea. Kind of odd to learn it from "
"a Bosmer, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046649_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knowing how to use your armor can save your life. Perhaps I should talk to "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraSpeech_0002c6c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Knowing their fate, they sealed themselves up in the vampire's lair. Their "
"suffering weighs heavily on me. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knowledge is Power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_000389a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knowledge is power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_000389a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Knowledge is the key to success in any endeavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KudEiTopic_0003ca91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei has always watched over me, and it's good to know she cared enough to "
"seek help when I was in trouble. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KudEiTopic_00027f35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei is a member of Bravil's Mages Guild. She put the word out that a good "
"friend of hers went missing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei is very protective of her sisters in the Mages Guild. And she's quite "
"skilled at creating illusions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062673_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei runs a tight ship in Bruma. She may not always play by the rules, but "
"I wouldn't want her on my bad side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003cd26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei seems to be in good spirits again after Henantier's return. I heard "
"she enlisted a stranger's help in the search. Good show I say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004f223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei seems upset about something lately. I'd stay away from the Mages Guild "
"if I were you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062672_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei will do anything to help her girls out. She recently got Ardaline out "
"of a bind, and I hear it wasn't completely within guild rules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006260c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei would be the one to talk to, if you wish to join. Otherwise, just find "
"one of the other local guild heads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kud-Ei. I'm in charge here, and an Advanced Trainer in Illusion to boot, so I "
"don't have a lot of time to stand around and chat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08Hunt_0001fdbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kurdan doesn't make most of his money being a simple usurer. He also invented "
"what he calls the Hunter's Run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00022a10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kurdan is treacherous... be wary, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ad63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kvatch is finished. There's nothing left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kvatch was rebuilt from ruins once before and she'll do it again. You have my "
"thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bab0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kvatch? Kvatch was just the beginning! Those damned Gates have opened up "
"everywhere! Cheydinhal, Chorrol, Leyawiin -- no city is safe. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_00028554_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kvatch? You've seen it. Kvatch doesn't exist any more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00086095_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Kyn and Valkyn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029fd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Kynareth bestowed the Boots of the Crusader on a worthy knight. Good to hear "
"that someone is taking up the cause again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a4b_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Kynareth's creations guard her relic, and you must pass the test before you "
"may be granted the boots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d08_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Kyraneth grants you the swiftness of the wild. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000514b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "La la la, la la la la..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0006145e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lachance gave me a special assignment once. Had to go all the way to Sumerset "
"Isle for that one, killed me about thirty Elves. Ah, good times...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0006145c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lachance has given you a... a secret assignment? But I've been asking for "
"this chance for so long.... Surely he doesn't doubt my abilities!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0006145a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lachance would not have selected you for a contract unless he had the utmost "
"confidence in your abilities. Best not let him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiasRing_0003b3fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lady Alessia frowns on her staff talking about her personal life. You "
"understand, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00047769_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Lady Alessia is uncomfortable with Khajiit ways. And Argonian ways. And "
"Dunmer ways. She is only comfortable with pure white-bread Nibeneans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChoice2_00038b48_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Lady Lovidicus was a shrew of a woman. The Lord and my mother grew close, and "
"ultimately fell in love. I was the result of their union."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName9f_00038b43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lady Luck, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, it's time to "
"see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c996_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lady Narina Carvain, Countess Bruma. Welcome. You'll excuse me if I keep this "
"brief, but affairs of the county await me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089610_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lady Syl will be quite pleased to hear that her concerns have been proven "
"valid. You shouldn't keep her waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013a5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lady Syl, you mean. And you know I have her full authority to do what is "
"necessary. Your innocence must be proven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064455_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lady Umbranox has hired a new Captain of the guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GottlesfontPrioryTopic_000ace83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lady's Mantle Leaves are helpful in healing wounds, whether applied directly "
"or compounded in potions. We have plenty. Help yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Land ho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e088_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Langley, captain of the Anvil guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05BribeBeggar_00015f28_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Last I heard he was in the slums by the north end of the docks, overseeing "
"the operation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Last I heard, she'd set up camp in the mountains, somewhere in the northeast "
"corner of the province. You should look for her there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d03d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Last but not least, he's officially joined the Society.  I am taken aback by "
"his honest intentions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e961_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Last chamber... this should be entertaining."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0003407a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Last night I... I heard screaming coming from the Abandoned House! Do you "
"think it's haunted, like they say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017967_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Last night, as dusk fell, the spire at the center of town became active. Soon "
"after, the area around it began to crystallize and change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenLichSpeech_0006e7f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Last time I clashed with mortals, I underestimated their power. I shall not "
"repeat that mistake twice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b191_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Last time I saw Alawen, she was out in the forest east of Anvil, and south of "
"Kvatch. If you look carefully, you might find her there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000039d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Late at night, while we were all asleep, a door to Oblivion opened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036318_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Later, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003379f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008da87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081cb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead on, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081cb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead on, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16MartinD_0004bfbf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Lead on, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_000152ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead on, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000945f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_00026ef1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead on. I hope we're almost there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e71f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lead on... to victory for the Knights of the Thorn! Oh, and you too of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b69_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b6c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDFollow_00002b71_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c1e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c21_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightStartFollow_00002c26_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoFollow_000a6588_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007944b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lead the way. I'm right behind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"Lead your fellow mages, and lead them well. The future rests on your "
"shoulders. Farewell, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Learning a bit about alchemy would be handy, but you have to be in the Mages "
"Guild for Felen to train you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMephalaChoice1_00026b6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leave Mephala an offering of nightshade at the shrine between midnight and "
"dawn, and the Webspinner may grant you an audience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofMeridiaTOPIC_0001ebfc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Leave an offering at this shrine. Meridia demands tribute in the form of the "
"remains of her enemies, the undead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHircineChoice1_0001ec5f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Leave an offering of the pelt of a bear, or the pelt of a wolf at the shrine, "
"and Hircine may find you worthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraChoice1_0001ebe4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Leave her an offering of glow dust, and perhaps she will deign to speak with "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylExcuseMe_0007fe1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave here at once. You've no business being here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfcf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave here now, Redguard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_000872db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000241ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000927_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone!  I can't talk right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028f85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone!  Why won't you all just leave me ALONE!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028190_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leave me alone, you ghoul! Can't you see I'm mourning for that poor, sweet "
"boy? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018b5ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006c2a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone. I'm busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001a115_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone. I'm just trying to work here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f55e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me alone. Sheogorath's armies are coming. You better run away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089619_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me be! I've told you what I know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000165c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk4_00086733_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leave me now, dear Listener. Deliver this information to your Speaker so that "
"the will of Sithis may be fulfilled. All hail our Dread Father! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e92b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me to my work if you want the Elixir made properly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c16c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me to my work, stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000915bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me, mortal. Your words hold no meaning for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00143f08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a80ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leave my husband and I alone, Gray Fox. Your presence only stirs up evil "
"memories."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007f44f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave now! You are trespassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0003263f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave the Emperor in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047357_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Leave us alone. Your quarrel is with Mankar Camoran, not us poor fools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00084aa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave us, creature of light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a36c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave! Right now! Or I call the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a38c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leave. Now. You're trespassing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006eaaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leaving me to die in peace, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenBenirus_00003a71_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Led by a young upstart named Carahil, the Mages Guild stormed Benirus Manor "
"and slew Lorgren. However, amid the chaos, his body vanished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingMace_00002ac0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Legends say that when Pelinal Whitestrake was slain by the Ayleids, a "
"messenger carried the Mace to the human settlement of Leyawiin as a message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002ac9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Legends say that when Pelinal Whitestrake was slain by the Ayleids, a "
"messenger carried the Mace to the human settlement of Leyawiin as a message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002aca_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Legends say that when Pelinal Whitestrake was slain by the Ayleids, a "
"messenger carried the Mace to the human settlement of Leyawiin as a message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002acd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Legends say that when Pelinal Whitestrake was slain by the Ayleids, a "
"messenger carried the Mace to the human settlement of Leyawiin as a message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Legion duty here in Cyrodiil is usually a dull affair. In the East, though, "
"things are a bit more challenging, and one can make a name for oneself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me arm myself, and I'll follow you to Underpall Cave to avenge Sir "
"Roderic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me ask you something, friend. Why is Primo even here? The rest of us need "
"the money, but his family is wealthy beyond measure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22MaricCarving_0002c81a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Let me be clear: whoever delivers the carving will receive the reward. All I "
"care about is the carving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047226_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Let me come with you. Let me help you kill Mankar Camoran. I am not without "
"power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilD1_00047229_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Let me come with you. Let me help you kill Mankar Camoran. I am not without "
"power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a07_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me confide something in you, my friend. Dovesi is the spitting image of "
"my own daughter! Her skin is darker, of course, but that sweet face..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028211_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me give you some advice, stranger.  Leave.  Now.  You ain't welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DionneWarnChoice3_0001dcc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me give you some advice. Glarthir is crazy. So far harmless crazy, but I "
"keep an eye on him because it's my job to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000093b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me go paint us a way out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035586_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Let me guess, it was Ocheeva, right? No, wait. Teinaava. Yes, he put you up "
"to this, didn't he. Ocheeva was always too busy to even be bothered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000300a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me guess, traveling on business? You don't look like you're out for a "
"stroll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003375f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me handle this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006446c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me introduce myself. I am Hieronymus Lex, the new captain of guard here "
"in Anvil. You look familiar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f476_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me know as soon as Cropsford is cleared of goblins, so we can get back to "
"building our new settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk5_0006a878_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me know as soon as you discover anything else. Oh, and best not tell the "
"others about this just yet. We must be sure, you understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000174b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me know if you find anything unusual in Falcar's quarters. I'd look "
"myself, but it's locked, and I don't have the key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f550_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me know if you need my help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me know if you need something killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ChoicePositionB_00015452_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Let me know when everyone is ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038bc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me know when you have found and eliminated the Mythic Dawn agents in "
"Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44XNothingYet_00078734_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me know when you have something for me. Not much time left, I'm afraid. "
"Not much time at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02KeepItem_0003498a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me know when you have the money and the tax records"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006244d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Let me know when you have them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004c5b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me know when you're done with that little task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44Supplies_00078733_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me know when you've found what I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiriliUlvenGreetA_000410a2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Let me make it very simple for you. Don't speak to me. Ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ06Bears_0018afd6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me see a fang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Spoon_000781f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me see that. Give it here. Where did you get this? This belongs to "
"Kishashi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD03Choice4_0002d72f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me see that. Interesting. The symbols on it are familiar to me. I'll be "
"looking into this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me see your face..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000478a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me see your hand. I see the City in the Hand, and the Hand in the Stars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Cure_0006ea71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me see. Yes! This is it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Repair_00066a59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let me take a look at what you've got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let me tell you something. If anyone thinks they're going to hurt that poor "
"Dark Elf girl, they're going to have to get through me first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceBlackSoulGems_00033635_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Let me think for a moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServeSentence_000459b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let no one say Lord Sheogorath's justice is without mercy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000272bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let the Countess know I'll be waiting for her in the Chapel of Talos. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let the Resonator draw the adventurers. Better it, than my dear Sheer-Meedish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA8_00002add_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let the gods be the judge of that. I cannot see into men's hearts. I see only "
"their words and deeds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let the soldiers fight the Fanatics. I have better things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let this be our little secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e580_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let us be on our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirThedretSpeech05_00002cb3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let us give thanks to the Nine! By their power, the Crusader has rid the "
"world of Umaril forever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let us never speak of that abomination again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk5_0006a875_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let us part now and see what we can come up with separately. We'll meet "
"sometime later and compare notes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarSpeech_0008b0a8_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "Let us see who at last has proved the stronger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003996_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Let us speak of the information I have for your guild, so that you may pass "
"it on to your Council, and they may decide how to use it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopicFalanu03_00038aa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's assume 'no'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005dd11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's be civil, shall we? Please, have a seat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000bcc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's be done with this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441db_Oblivion_RESP1"
