msgid "Let's see what we've got here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdSpeech_000463c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's show these bastards how we do things in Bruma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Agree_0001dc2d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Let's start with Bernadette Peneles.  Be outside my house at 6 am, you'll see "
"her watching me.  See where she goes and who she reports to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice1A_00035621_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Let's start with the school. Which appeals most to you - Destruction, "
"Illusion, or Mysticism?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48StartCombatShouts_00082c94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's stick together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's take them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c13c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's talk after the battle is won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033774_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00054673_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Let's teach those bastards a lesson!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Levitation is for fools. Why would we want to levitate? Once you are up high, "
"there is nowhere to go but down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05BribeBeggar_00015f28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lex has pulled city Watchmen from the Arcane University and the Temple "
"district to scour the Waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_0004896c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lex has pulled city guards from several districts to the Waterfront. Last I "
"heard he was pacing the slums there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_00047602_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Leyawiin has always been a melting pot of races and cultures. Of course, "
"racial and cultural conflicts produce inefficiencies and confusion..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDUmarilTopic_00002bfd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leyawiin has been attacked by Umaril's minions! Something must be done to "
"stop him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leyawiin is beset by enemies. The Empire does nothing to help us. Even before "
"this crisis, I did not have enough men to patrol my borders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leyawiin is in a state of transition. It has long been a respected county "
"making moderate cultural and economic contributions to the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_0018d308_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Leyawiin stands alone. That's what Count Caro says. Only our brave Guardsmen "
"to keep the hordes of Oblivion at bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinBattleSpeech_0003d4ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Leyawiin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Wrath02Negative_00015260_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Liar! We never met yesterday! You're an intruder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Yes_0004a7d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Liar! You have nothing new here! Begone until you get me something "
"interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12CmdrAnswer2_0001c491_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lies do not befit a soldier of Akavir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c99c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lieutenant Gerich Senarel of the Bruma Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lieutenant Rana, Blackwood Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005d503_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Life is a blessing, and death is not the end, but only when the spirit "
"remains incorruptible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Life might be easier if Order wipes everything out. Everything would be grey "
"and plain. Like my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c220_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Lift your eyes to Carac Agaialor, my seat at the pinnacle of Paradise. I "
"shall await you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEArctusSpeech07_0008988f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lift yourself above these follies and meet your foes head-on. Twist a blade "
"in their stomach instead of filling their ears with useless words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Light from darkness, hope from hopelessness. In Arkay's name, I pray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008264b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Light guide you, brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008264c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Light guide you, sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00080645_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Light the Great Torch! Let the Maniacal dance of the flames blaze out across "
"the realm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00080644_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Light the Great Torch! Let the flames proclaim the glory of Dementia across "
"the realm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM02ImperialGuard_00002351_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Light the pyre! Prove your worth, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000152ed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Lighting the Dragonfires will no longer save us... the barriers that "
"protected us from Oblivion are gone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_00038b04_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Like Bradon, I think he deserves to have his name clear of wrongdoing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Like I said, I'm not moving the Float until Ormil is safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TarMeenaTopic_00034247_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like I said, she's one of the brains over at the Arcane University. Supposed "
"to know everything there is to know about daedric cults."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c34b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Like I said... meet me in two hours at the Cheydinhal Bridge Inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c79f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like I told you, I can use minotaur horn and ogre teeth. If your Guild "
"brothers bring me some, I'll pay well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f477_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Like I told you, there are only two ways to stop a goblin war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetB3_0003e8f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like all mortals, you talk when you should listen. You will have your chance "
"for battle, if you wish it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00033df7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like members of my order, the Blades are devoted to the divine Talos. We "
"honor them for their dedication and devotion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like most lesser Daedra, the Hunger doesn't have a weakness to shock spells. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Like most lesser Daedra, the Hunger has a weakness to shock spells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32NotSolved_000135d2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Like my people, I am doomed to repeat the actions of my cowardice. Alone, I "
"cannot redress this wrong. However, you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like the hearth in my kitchen, the Great Torch burns once more. This makes me "
"as happy as a batch of sweetrolls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004423c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like the leaves of a tree, Syl has fallen from Sheogorath's grace and no "
"longer rules Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edf9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Like the leaves of a tree, Thadon has fallen from Sheogorath's grace and no "
"longer rules Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d67_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Like what?  Oh, like shouting obscenties at you, or wearing only fur for an "
"entire year, or waiting outside your house every morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45DarMaNice_0002869c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Likewise!  I'm always glad to meet someone new.  Welcome!  I'm sure my mother "
"would be glad to meet you as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23SeridurGreet_0001d247_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Likewise. Sorry to send Gilen's wife to get you in that manner, but it seemed "
"safer if we weren't seen on the streets right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadonDeathSpeech03_0007b37b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lips as red as a sun-drenched dawn, skin as soft as a newborn fawn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028717_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen to me! The others, they're all dead! Someone has been coming in here "
"and killing them! That means there must be a way out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridHot_00023cd0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Listen to me. I sure sound like a snob. Snooty, in fact, and not very nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen up! This next match is an outrage, but there's nothin' I can do about "
"it! You've got three opponents this time, and you have to beat them all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1C_00032bee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen well, child of Sithis. You have been chosen to perform the ancient "
"rite known as Purification. Everyone inside the Sanctuary must die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1C_00032bf3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen well, child. No longer will you receive orders directly. Instead, you "
"will visit dead drop locations scattered throughout Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2C_00032beb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen well, my child! The Black Hand has sanctioned the Rose of Sithis. It "
"is an enchanted arrow that will kill Phillida... instantly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a358_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Listen! I'm calling the guards if you don't leave, now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilA2_0003fbd8_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Listen, I can help you. You need my help if you are ever to leave the "
"Forbidden Grotto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilB1_0003fbdf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Listen, I can help you. You need my help if you are ever to leave the "
"Forbidden Grotto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001c0e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen, I can't let you fight in a match while you've got a bet down on "
"another combatant. Put your gambling to bed, and then we'll talk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038b32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen, sunshine, I ain't in the mood! You want something, talk to Owyn. He's "
"right over there for Shinji's sake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2A_0005402e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Listen, that's all I know, really! Maybe Ulfgar Fog-Eye can tell you more. "
"He's the lighthouse keeper, and probably rented out the cellar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2B_0005402f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Listen, that's all I know, really! Maybe Ulfgar Fog-Eye can tell you more. "
"He's the lighthouse keeper, and probably rented out the cellar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2C_00054030_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Listen, that's all I know, really! Maybe Ulfgar Fog-Eye can tell you more. "
"He's the lighthouse keeper, and probably rented out the cellar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusSewerA_000a31bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen. I may not survive this. But if I don't, you must. You must recover "
"the book and find the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022b13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listen. I'm going to get up in a minute and walk out of here. That guy in the "
"corner behind me will follow me. You follow him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_0002c525_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Listen. S'razirr has an idea of how we can both come out of this ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting2_00018e6d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Listen. Those people in Passwall need me. Can you imagine how they'd ever get "
"along if I died down here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032469_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Listen. You know the Nine? How They guide our fates with an invisible hand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008675b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Listener! I am a new initiate to the Dark Brotherhood, just a lowly Murderer, "
"but if there's any way I can serve you, any way at all, I am yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d494_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Little busy right now. Got your mess to clean up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e08e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Llensi Llaram. Fighters Guild, through and through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a7_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"Llevana has always been quick tempered. You must reconsider her plan. It can "
"only lead to prison for her... and for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028b82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Locked inside a house with five strangers. It sounded like  a trap when I "
"read the invitation. Looks like I was right!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MundaneAmulet_00038b02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Long ago I made a promise to Bradon. I promised to never reveal to anyone "
"what I'm about to reveal to you now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018bc36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Long ago, I learned much of what I know from a man named Pranal. An excellent "
"teacher, he was. You should consider learning from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sithis_000251ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Long ago, in an age now forgotten, Sithis came to the Night Mother and begat "
"her five sons. So you see, his love gave birth to the Dark Brotherhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_00051ea9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Long burn the Dragonfires!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0018baa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Long live the Empire!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingShort_000131db_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Long, short -- it all ends up the same. Dust and tears. Usually tears first, "
"then the dust. Dust can't cry, you see. That would be... well, amusing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047705_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look around. Count the true believers. How many of these people really have "
"faith? It's easy to have faith when everything's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinB2_00082dca_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Look around. What good is a priest?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a125_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look at all the bones around you! You have been a busy little boy, haven't "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06KellenShouts_00002bf5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Look at me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bc96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look at the muscles on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look at this! How wonderful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00089628_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look at this. I got it from a dead bug. A really big one! This oozed out of "
"his body -- here take it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokC2Idle01_0008ea7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look at those jewels!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006094e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look at you wag your tail! You're happy Jyggalag is gone too, aren't you? Yes "
"you are! Yes you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00072dff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look at you! Still alive! For now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001765b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look at you! You keep coming back for more! All right, Warrior, you ready for "
"a match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoWhatNow_00044f53_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Look at you. No concept of what you've stumbled into. No sense of place. You "
"don't even really know where you are, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItemA_00081eb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look closely and you'll see a tiny skull. These pygmys used to live in the "
"Shivering Isles until they were all eaten by Grummites, poor dears!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062331_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look for Andragil. You can find her living in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006143a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look for Irene Metrick in the Imperial City. She can do some amazing things "
"with a weapon in her hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d040_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Look for something in his possession that can be linked to his crimes, and we "
"will have him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01Choice1_000133d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look for yourself! Their brains are addled. Got no sense! Perfectly normal "
"people went in there. And this is what's come out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06BribeBeggar2_00084478_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look in the Lonely Suitor Lodge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f42_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Look into it for me, will you? You can find Skaleel at the site. Access is "
"restricted, so you'll need this key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Accuse_00035660_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look me in the eye when you answer this. You dare accuse me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFences_0001eb68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look no further. I'll buy your hot goods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c21d_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Look now upon my Paradise. Gaiar Alata, in the old tongue. A vision of the "
"past... and the future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00Voice_0003c41e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00Voice_000817c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_000980a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ObserveCombat_0002b377_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ObserveCombat_0018d81b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13ObeliskCShout_0001acaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look out! The northern Obelisk has been reactivated!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b3e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Look out, ma'am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b3d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Look out, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05FortBulwarkTopic_00002aeb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look to the southeast of Cyrodiil to find it. I cannot say for certain what "
"is inside, but be prepared for anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a67_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look well upon the Chapel of Dibella. Look at the faces of the dead. This is "
"your future. Evil has returned, and the Nine need a champion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look well upon the faces of the dead in the Chapel! This is only the start of "
"Umaril's revenge upon the gods!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00078fd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look what has been done to Passwall. This is what Order brings. I gladly bend "
"my knee to Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000856_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look what you've done! Spoiled my invisibility! This is my reward for trying "
"to help the wretched villagers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechLoremasters_00002d28_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look you to blood for truth? There is truth in blood, but it is not the truth "
"that you seek!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberTwoStartD_0006718f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look! Haha! I told you! Treasure! Let's have at it, Syndelius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberTwoManEnd01_00073299_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look! Keys! One of them must open the gate! We're rich!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13AllyShoutReinforcements_0004dbd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look! More Aureals join the battle! Now we shall drive them back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23FollowSeridurNo_000947b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I assure you, this is of the utmost importance. Together, we may be "
"able to save the lives of many innocents. I implore you to follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c0cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, I can't just give it to you. I paid good money for it, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I can't promote you. Not now. You'll need to get some contracts "
"completed, and then I can do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_000286fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I don't know what kind of information you're after, but I won't help "
"you. Just go away.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028243_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I don't know who is responsible for this madness, so stop trying to "
"taint my opinion of Nels. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d58a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, I don't know you very well. Why would I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD04Choice1_0002ee6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I know that you covered for me before, so I'll give you this one. Talk "
"to Aryarie at the Mages Guild for the job. After this, we're done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09YourAmulet_0005377c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Look, I know you could just kill me where I stand, but what if I gave you the "
"amulet and you bring it to him. Then he'd say where the gold's stashed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0002d58b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I like you and all, but I really don't want to get in the middle of "
"this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002459a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, I like you, but not enough to tell you that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b07b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I told you everything you need to know. Go to the cave, kill the ogres, "
"get a reward. How hard is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00061c39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, I'll find someone else to help me. Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice3C_00054035_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, I've got things to do, and I don't need crazies like you getting in my "
"way. Take a walk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000541d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, I... I got nothing else to say to you. Just leave me be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_00037cfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, friend, I'm not running a flophouse here. No gold, no room. No "
"exceptions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DinnerParty_0001c24e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, it's a fancy party. You seem a fine enough sort, but not so nice as I'm "
"going to just let you in there. At least not dressed like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033790_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, j-just stop right there, all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, keep the sword if you want. That's your decision. But don't give it "
"back to Clavicus. He doesn't know what's good for him sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look, one more of the Madgod's deluded followers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11ErlineOpinion_00038444_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Look, there isn't much more to say. Please... help me clear my husband's name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12DontCare_000980f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, there's no need to be rude. I just thought it might have been "
"interesting to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RulesOfCompetition_0003d7b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, these aren't your average Arena matches. They're shows! You fighting "
"some savage beasts! People come to see you kill things. It's simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09TyrelliusTalk_000908eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look, you horse's ass. I've never trusted city guardsmen. Never. So I'm "
"definitely not going to start trusting you, Tyrellius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting3_00018e6e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Look, you may be a scamp's ass, but I'm offering you the chance to be the "
"hero of Passwall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGThievesGuildJobs_000165e5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Look, you're on your own as a thief. Go find a likely looking house. Case the "
"joint to see when the owner is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look. A fly. Buzz, buzz. Hey. Look everybody! I'm talking to a fly! Buzz, "
"buzz, buzz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look. I don't know you. I don't really want to know you. If you insist on "
"talking to me, go right ahead. But I won't promise to be nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eeb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look. I don't like you. Why are you bothering me? Maybe I'll ask Syl to round "
"you up for questioning. Would you like that? Go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000237b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Look. I don't want to talk. So leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Look. It's big, see. REALLY big. Only way to learn it is to walk it. Look at "
"everything, talk to everyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04WeynonAttack_0001ee28_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Looked around the corner to see who it was. They looked like travellers, "
"ordinary. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaminusTopic_0006a87a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looking for Raminus, are you? Well, you'll find him in the lobby of the Arch-"
"Mage's Tower, in the center of the University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00062121_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for a good book? I bet I have just what you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002dd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for a room?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033ddd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for action? Think about the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for adventure? The Fighters Guild is a good place to start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004994e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looking for an axe or a mace? Head to Slash 'N Smash. The name says it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000be5e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for anything to purchase today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00035729_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looking for more work, eh? Good. I've got a contract for you. I'd like you to "
"go talk to Norbert Lelles, here in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00071e96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looking for more work, eh? Good. I've got a contract for you. I'd like you to "
"go talk to Norbert Lelles, here in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000b166c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for other jobs? Don't look at me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_000091c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking for some reading material? You've come to the right place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07DairihillOffice_00098398_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looking for the steward, are you? Her office is in the private chambers. But "
"she's not there much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_000091ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking to buy a horse? I have some fine animals for sale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00038994_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking to lighten your load, but fill up your coin purse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00070404_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looking, looking. Always looking, I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0000bf0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looks clear. Come on. We're almost through to the sewers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_00033565_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looks like it is time for a promotion. Due to your performance, I name you "
"Journeyman of the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029c8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Looks like it opens up into a huge room up ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_00032b13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looks like this is your lucky day. Just stay out of our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_goblins_00027f84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looks like we got them all. Good work, soldier. The miners will be able to "
"get back to work. You should head back to Burz and find another contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Steal_000624f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looks like we've got a thief in our midst!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000281b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looks like you are in some trouble. Since we are friends, don't worry. I'll "
"look the other way and take care of that fine for you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looks like you found work for us. Good. Need some money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bcb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Looks like you're handy with a blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002c35b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looks like you've reached your peak. Tell you what, from here on in, you can "
"fight one, two or three Minotaur Lords. So what's it going to be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looks like you've taken care of it. Good work. Now, go find something else to "
"do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d062_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Looks to me like you're in trouble with the law. Clear that matter up, and "
"then perhaps we'll discuss the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02FinChoice1A_00023e48_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Loosen those fastenings any night between 8:00pm and 11:00pm, and the head "
"will surely fall on Baenlin as he relaxes in his chair, as is his custom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d03_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Akatosh lends you his might. When your own strength fails you, trust in "
"the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000290d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Crusader! How can this be? You... you're alive! It's a miracle! I heard "
"voices in the undercroft and I came to investigate..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002978_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Crusader! The Prophet is here -- he's just arrived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c22a_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Lord Dagon cannot invade Tamriel, his birthright! He comes to liberate the "
"Occupied Lands!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Enemy_0002d77c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Dagon is the Enemy. He is the Prince of Destruction, and the Daedra are "
"his servants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarSpeech_0008b0a3_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Lord Dagon shall walk Tamriel again. The world shall be remade. The new age "
"shall rise from the ashes of the old."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06RumaYes_00024e9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Dagon thirsts for red-drink. Sate him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008c21a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Dagon will walk Tamriel again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Dagon will walk the earth again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001eee3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Dagon will welcome your soul in Oblivion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00097cc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Dagon wrote it with his own hand, and gave it to the Master as a sign of "
"His favor. None but the Master may touch it or read from it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00074a09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Dagon's victory is at hand, fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathSpeech_000579cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Drad put my little brothers in chains, working in the mines. I don't "
"like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathSpeech_000579d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Drad took my ogres. Poxy white-skin says he owns them. Lying maggot! "
"They're MY ogres!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathSpeech_000579cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Drad took my ogres. Says he owns them. Lying maggot! They're MY ogres!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Unicorn_0001ec61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Hircine has sent you to hunt the Unicorn? Count yourself doubly blessed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OgreSlaves_0001ec4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Malacath doesn't want the little brothers locked up, working like "
"donkeys so men don't get their pretty pink hands all dirty. Makes Him mad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Rugdumph was going with the Blackwood Company, then thought better of "
"it. We have to do something about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00014b5e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath chose you to sit on His throne. With the Staff, you may be "
"able to do just that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091628_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath doesn't like to be kept waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08HaskillKnightsTopic3_00043f6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath has never succeeded in doing so. They continue to grow in "
"numbers until Jyggalag himself arrives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43GoAway_00072dc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath wants me to leave? Okay, for you I will. I know a nice spot "
"in Bliss where I can stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_00082634_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath will, I'm sure, be quite interested to hear of your success. "
"Return to Him once you've checked with the commander here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_00082635_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath will, I'm sure, be quite interested to hear of your success. "
"Return to him once you've checked with the commander here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath would do well to stop bothering with the Resonator, and just "
"send everyone away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081519_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath! Have you found any yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10MessengerGreeting_0008f4ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath! I apologize for the intrusion, but you must help us! Order "
"has attacked Brellach and routed us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10MessengerGreeting_00095359_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath! I apologize for the intrusion, but you must help us! Order "
"has attacked Pinnacle Rock and routed us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081525_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath! I would love to put on a show for you some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath's armies are back! Maybe they'll fix some of these buildings "
"so they don't collapse on people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath's mood seems improved now that he has an army at his back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0007dfe3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath, I believe You should leave this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008151f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath, I trust you'll protect us from the impending apocalypse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008d31f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath, here in Deepwallow? May Scalon blood flow at your feet, Lord!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreatTorchTopic_000910a9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath, in His wisdom, wishes for you to relight the Torch, to help "
"ease the worries of the populace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath, up off his throne and slumming it with us little folk, eh? "
"Well, it's good to see you. What can I possibly do for you, My Lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath, your presence alone makes me feel more healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081522_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath. I'll bet your palace is always neat and tidy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007a01b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord Sheogorath. Your Aureal stand true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000807a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord Sheogorath... as I expected. I will hear you and then ask for peace from "
"your prattle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord! How may I serve You? Do You require a sharp blade to bleed your enemies?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0007dfe7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord, it is best You leave this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008dd59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord, where are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00082570_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lord, you know that Brellach is ours and ours alone. You may not enter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008256e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lord, you know that Pinnacle Rock is ours and ours alone. You may not enter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAnnouncer_00048376_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lords and ladies, citizens of the Empire, I give you the battle of the ages! "
"Combatants, steel yourselves! Lower the gates!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenBenirus_00003a71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lorgren Benirus was a strange old man, always dabbling and experimenting with "
"magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06Choice1A_0002fbb0_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Lorkmir ain't... he ain't around no more. He he he... I use his house. Here's "
"a key! For... for you! You come whenever you... you want! Okay then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lose the key to your house? Find Mandil. He can get in, I'll bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_0004994c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lots of big weapons there. Urbul always has some in stock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lots of dogs in this town. Lots of sheep, too. Of course, I prefer the taste "
"of sheep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_goblins_00028882_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lots of them dead, just like it should be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lots of us Dark Elves came to Cyrodiil to get away from the Temple. We're "
"sick of living under the thumb of the priests, and scraping by on the dole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004774b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lots of us on the Waterfront are down. We can't do that dungeon stuff like "
"you adventurers. We got no money, and no skills. Nobody wants us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a6c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Love and Mercy! Do you still think me mad? Who shall next fall to Umaril's "
"bloody revenge?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFence03_000165ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Luciana lives in Bravil. She is a decent fence. Better than Ongar and Dar Jee "
"at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00061459_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lucien Lachance's word is law. Whatever contract he has given you must be "
"carried out, without question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_000253d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lucien isn't here very often. His duties with the Black Hand keep him very "
"busy, so he trusts me to keep the Sanctuary in order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Luckily for us, Raynil arrived in town. He said he was a vampire hunter, so "
"we asked for his help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Luckily, Bradon's wife wasn't home. Poor thing, she didn't even know her "
"husband was infected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fcc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Luckily, I haven't had to make use of their services. Still, it's good to "
"know the Chapel is there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00022a05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lucky I'm not makin' ya swim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lum gro-Baroth in Chorrol can train me in shield work, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053ff1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Luronk and I have both testified against the Watch Captain, Hayn. Thank you "
"for helping us find the courage to stand up for ourselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c98_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Luronk and I were shopping at Jensine's when he accused us of stealing. Even "
"Jensine said we were innocent, but he didn't care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047690_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Luther Broad's Boarding House. I'm Luther. You want beds or food, see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Minx01Positive_00015259_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Lynch sent you up here? Why? Did he send you to talk to Selene?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c97f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Lyra Rosentia collects Akaviri artifacts. She might have a project in mind. "
"Her house is west of the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"M'aiq believes the children are our future. But he doesn't want them ruining "
"all of our fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c47ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "M'aiq greets you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"M'aiq is glad he has a compass. Makes it easy to find things. Much better "
"than wandering around like a fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c47ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "M'aiq knows much, tells some. M'aiq knows many things others do not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"M'aiq longs for a Colovian Fur Helm. Practical, yet stylish. M'aiq is very "
"sad he does not have one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"M'aiq prefers to adventure alone. Others just get in the way. And they talk, "
"talk, talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"M'aiq thinks his people are beautiful. The Argonian people are beautiful as "
"well. They look better than ever before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c526e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"M'aiq wishes he had a stick made out of fishies to give to you. Sadly, he "
"does not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c47db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "M'aiq wishes you well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsNo_00017d84_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "MAZKEN! Form up! For the sake of your sorry male hides, move! MOVE!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008b5ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bcce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089614_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha and Nelrene... They meet in the street during the night. No one "
"knows what they talk about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_0008e513_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha has been most helpful! We'll have to see what he comes back with. "
"In the meantime, you might consider speaking with Nelrene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_00083f49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha is clearly withholding something. It would seem that direct "
"pressure has no effect, so we'll have to try another route."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e337_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid "Ma'zaddha is meeting Nelrene at night. How illicit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha is particularly reclusive, and may not respond well to questioning. "
"Again, you may find Herdir's assistance necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_000805f1_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha is reluctant to speak to you, and I assume there's good reason. It "
"would be worth finding another way to get him to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895dd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Ma'zaddha may have returned with more information by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e506_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"Ma'zaddha was able to provide some useful evidence, even if he did not "
"survive to see it put to use. It's time to confront Nelrene again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Mach-Na runs a good business. He's a grumpy old man, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Made up your mind yet? There's work to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081d71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Madgod! I've been collecting jokes for you. I have thousands for you to "
"listen to. Did you hear the one about the Grummite and the Heretic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008fab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madgod's blessings, Duchess of Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008faa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madgod's blessings, Duke of Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008fa96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madgod's blessings, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00069768_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madgod's blessings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a367_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madness always yields to the march of Order!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ef2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madness always yields to the march of Order!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a374_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Madness shall be purged from this realm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Maenlorn and his brother run a nice establishment at the Flowing Bowl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mages Guild members have said that Kud-Ei is an excellent teacher, as well as "
"a very loyal guildmember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_00066a51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Magic items are no good without a charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a849_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Magister! We must talk! Please... It's rather urgent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Maglir? He's the OTHER bottom boot, right? Not the rat guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC2_000366c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Maglir? I think I've seen him. Try in the Lonely Suitor Lodge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofClavicusVileTOPIC_000b97c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make a bargain or do not. You must choose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPinnacleRockTopic_00043023_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Make all possible haste in reaching Dylora. She will be able to better inform "
"you as to what happened, and what is required to secure Pinnacle Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBrellachTopic_00043024_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Make all possible haste in reaching Staada. She will be able to better inform "
"you as to what happened, and what is required to secure Brellach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e337_Oblivion_RES"
"P2"
msgid ""
"Make every effort to be present for this conversation. It may give us "
"something to hold over Ma'zaddha and get him to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make haste! Find him quickly... no telling what mischief he may get himself "
"into and we need him as a witness!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053870_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make haste! The Sanctuary must be Purified, if this treachery is to be undone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002c2fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make haste. I wish to be rid of Earana as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005d8ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make haste. Mucianus is in danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033762_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make him sing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018baff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make it fast, dreg! What little patience I have is wearing thin...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0009ea83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a7e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONENTER_000622fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072c93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make it quick. I've work to do. I need five pod pits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000a31ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make it quick. The longer we spend down here, the more chance we have of "
"being discovered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000091df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make me a better offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TeekeeusTopic_0002acc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make no mention of the book to him. It's just the sort of thing he'd want to "
"get his scaly little hands on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004cfa9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make sure Varon hands over that staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make sure not to eat nightshade. It's very poisonous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_00086749_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make sure she's all right, will you? It's not like her to avoid contact with "
"the University for so long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003358d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make sure you address the Count properly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make sure you have proof before you accuse anyone of a terrible crime like "
"grave robbing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make sure you show that shovel to Thoronir. It is the final bit of proof we "
"need to possibly clear his name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000535f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make them go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000a5661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make them leave! Now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040b9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Make this brief, I have a pot of Grummite Gumbo simmering on my fire at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_001896bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Make those bastards pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice7NowWhat_00061c4f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Make your move when you wish. But, please, do it soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa91_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Make yourself useful. Talk with Horkvir. The proper Horkvir. He runs this "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreatTorchTopic_000910a0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Makes all of my subjects uneasy. Tense. Homicidal. Some of them, at least. We "
"need to get that Torch relit, before the place falls apart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofMalacathTOPIC_0001ec2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Malacath likes Orcs... when He likes anything. So you can approach the "
"shrine. He won't hurt you. Really. Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Malacath likes you. You don't look very foul or ugly... but just keep doing "
"ugly stuff, and you'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026967_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Malacath must think you're okay. Congratulations. You must be as ugly and "
"disgusting as the rest of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0009f984_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Malacath, have mercy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22KnowHighFane_0002af32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Malada? Really? I confess, I had never made the connection. But, yes... it "
"makes sense..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeSword_000400b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mama always said, \"You can tell a lot about a man by the sword he carries.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mama always said, \"You catch more flies with honey than salt.\" Like that "
"thing that sucks in the adventurers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeAmberMaceMagic_0001f3eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mama used to say, \"If sweet-talking doesn't work, try hitting him with a big "
"stick!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Murder_00062276_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Man down! Man down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10UmarilVoice_00002c38_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Man kana mitta abasel Umarile?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName9_00038b3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Man o' War, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, it's time to "
"see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ec7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mania has a new ruler! Perhaps Big Head will hear songs of good fortune as "
"well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_000221f6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran bound himself to the Xarxes when he created his Paradise, "
"using dark rituals which I will not speak of further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran certainly is a fascinating writer. Undoubtedly insane, but "
"fascinating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran has a lot to answer for. No wonder he never comes down to the "
"Eternal Garden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MankarCamoranTopic_00015882_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran lives in his palace, Carac Agaialor, which overlooks the "
"Savage Garden from the top of the mountain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Mankar Camoran must be destroyed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC1_0003fbde_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran was our leader, our teacher, our Master. He had the secret "
"knowledge. He dealt with Mehrunes Dagon as an equal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15Anaxes_0003c80d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran's chattels trapped the Xivilai Anaxes in a cave. He is their "
"Lord, and thus they mock him and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetD_0003e8fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran's chattels, the unmortals that swarm here in the Savage "
"Garden, their proper role is to test themselves in unceasing combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB4_0009532b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Mankar Camoran's views on Mehrunes Dagon are fascinating, revolutionary "
"even..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001648c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Mannimarco has been defeated? I can hardly believe it! The King of Worms is "
"no more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Mannimarco himself is in Cyrodiil, hunting us down. None of us are safe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006267e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mannimarco is no more! The guild is saved, and we have a new Arch-Mage to "
"lead us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Mannimarco will have what he seeks, but it will be his undoing at your hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00024eac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Many Argonians say they have been \"called back\" to Black Marsh. They "
"disappear into the swamps and are never seen again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_00025019_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Many are dead in the land of the Dunmer. Even St. Jiub, who drove the "
"cliffracers from Vvardenfell, has fallen to the daedra hordes. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BorderWatchTOPIC_000b122c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Many are the evenings we spend around the cooking fire, sharing stories of "
"Elsweyr. The smell of our food travels for miles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c226_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Many are their names and the names of their masters: the Coldharbour of "
"Meridia, Peryrite's Quagmire, the ten Moonshadows of Mephala, and..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c34a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Many guards are coming forward with more evidence of his greed, so it's safe "
"to say he'll been spending quite a bit of time in the city dungeons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05HowBad_0000c05c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Many guild members could be jailed. Find Methredhel in the Imperial City. She "
"is co-ordinating the guild's response."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Many of Anvil's folk are directly or indirectly associated with ships and "
"sailing... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06JyggalagTopic_000910f8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Many of our citizens are... delicate. They can't cope with the prospect, and "
"they defect to the forces of Jyggalag, becoming Priests of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Benefits_0004b831_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Many of these abilities, Lord, are rooted in the magicks of the Isles. Should "
"you choose to leave this Realm, they will not likely function."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001d03d_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid "Many thanks, on behalf of all of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Many thanks. I'm preparing the ship for her return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031842_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Many wish to join our ranks, as we are of the highest echelon. Only a select "
"few may join the finest force ever to grace the lands of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000c452c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Many wish to join our ranks, as we are of the highest echelon. Only a select "
"few may join the finest force ever to grace the lands of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesM_000139af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Many years ago he decided to hold a night of absolute indulgence, resplendent "
"with dance, wine, and sex to celebrate his fondness for his brethren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraSpeech_0002c6c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Many years ago, five followers slew the vampire Dratik and its kin, but all "
"were infected by the foul creature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakersWayTopic_0001ebdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Many years ago, this town was settled by Ulf the Bleaker. Soon after, Rayno "
"Dalvilu and his family arrived."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16BStolenItem_00028ac7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Many years ago, when the Count was still alive, a daring thief stole the "
"ancient Honorblade of Chorrol from out of this castle. Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mara guides and protects Bravil, like she protects any good family. Like any "
"good family, we have our problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047701_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mara's blessing on you, and on all her children. Speak to her at the Temple "
"of the One. Ask Mother Mara; she will shower your heart with love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000549b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Mara's mercy on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047737_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marana Rian. I am very fond of nice things. How fortunate that I can afford "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marc Gulitte knows more about how to cast a fireball than anyone in Anvil. I "
"try to stay on his good side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e093_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marc Gulitte, Mages Guild Evoker, Advanced Instructor in the Arts of "
"Destruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"March Gulitte is a dangerous one. He teaches mages about the Destruction "
"school of magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e890_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Mariana Ancharia, hostess of Cheydinhal Bridge Inn. We provide beds and food "
"to persons of quality in the Cheydinhal community."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marie Palielle is quite a hard worker. She's in the chapel day and night, "
"tending to the sick and injured."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c1ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marie Palielle seems very happy working at the chapel. She's always working, "
"but she's always got a smile on her face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047698_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marinus Catiotus. Ida Vlinorman and me, we're associates. Same interests, "
"same styles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marius Caro and Alessia Valga...now Alessia Caro. That's a fine match, two "
"best families in Cyrodiil. They'll be on the Elder Council, just you wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marius Caro, by grace of the Nine, Count Leyawiin. You are a stranger to me, "
"but well-met."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086061_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marius Caro, by grace of the Nine, Count Leyawiin. You are a stranger to me, "
"but well-met."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006234d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin Septim will soon claim his rightful place at the head of the Empire, "
"and the Blades will stand beside him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BrumaCheering_0003d60b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Martin Septim!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00049812_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin Septim, on behalf of the Elder Council, I accept your claim to the "
"Imperial Throne. We should arrange the coronation ceremony as soon as ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04FoundMartin_0001ee2d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Martin cannot stay here. We have driven them off, but they will be back once "
"they learn of Martin's survival. Which they will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bed7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin couldn't have done it without you. I count you among the greatest "
"heroes of the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BattlePlans_00097a6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Martin has made his decision. The Blades stand beside him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16OcatoD_000add46_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Martin is dead. But he died an emperor, and a hero to rival Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElderCouncilTopic_00037833_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin is right. Declaring oneself Emperor is a delicate matter. In this "
"case, however, I do not think there should be any dispute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin is safe, and the Temple is secure. But there's a storm brewing. I can "
"feel it... feel it in my bones. The worst is yet to come, mark my words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_0002711b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin made some progress on the Mysterium Xarxes while you were gone. You "
"should speak to him about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061381_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin showed himself a true son of the Dragon Blood. But where does that "
"leave us, with no Emperor to serve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BrumaCheering_0003d60e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Martin! Martin! Martin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48BerichMartin_0008dfda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martin? He was with the rest of the survivors. They were taken back to the "
"encampment, where it's safer for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48BerichMartin_0008dfdb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Martin? He's back there, looking after the other survivors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062455_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martina Floria at the Arcane University has a much better mastery of Illusion "
"spells than I. You should travel there and speak with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006245f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martina Floria at the Arcane University has truly mastered Illusion spells. "
"You should speak with her about training further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047649_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Martina Floria, Master Enchanter for the Mages Guild. Welcome to the "
"Chironasium. Enchanting, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e639_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marvellous, marvellous! Self-immolation is a wonderful thing, isn't it? But "
"now that we've had our fun, off to the Sacellum with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_000465a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marz is a gifted healer, and teacher. I know that she longs to return to the "
"swamps, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000465a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Marz is an excellent healer, but I understand she longs to return to the "
"swamps of Black Marsh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046588_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Marz is an excellent healer, but doesn't she seem sad to be here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047642_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Master Spellmaker Gaspar Stegine, at your service. New spells. Old spells. "
"Good spells. Bad spells. They're all fun for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Master Thadon has his Chalice again. Happy days for us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Master Umbacano is a fine gentleman. Mad for old Ayleid stuff, true, but he's "
"got the dosh, so it's all right, ain't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071e75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Master... I'll never get used to saying that. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Matilde claims to be from one of High Rock's most distinguished noble "
"families, but I have a feeling their fortune has long been squandered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Matilde is old, and frail. The shock of two people being murdered is surely "
"too much for the poor woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Matilde seems like an upstanding citizen of the Empire. She respects the law "
"and recognizes the Legion as Tamriel's greatest defense against evil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Matilde's murder saddens me friend, but not for the reason you may think. Ten "
"years ago, when I was in my prime, this never would have happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003b83a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May Arden-Sul enrich your mind and guide your heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I answer any questions for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bda5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I be of some assistance, Arch-Mage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081531_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I have a snippet of your hair for my museum?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026bc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I help with any last minute preparations?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bc51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_000091bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "May I interest you in some of my fine wares?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo03_0006fde1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"May I present you with the perquisites of your rank... a key to White "
"Stallion Lodge and a shield bearing the arms of County Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

