msgid ""
"The Gray Prince is headed up to the Arena as we speak. Go up there and meet "
"him, one Champion to the next. May the Divines have mercy on your soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName9f_00038b43_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Gray Prince is headed up to the Arena as we speak. Go up there and meet "
"him, one Champion to the next. May the Divines have mercy on your soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e9a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Gray Prince is nothing but a fake. Haven't you heard? His father was a "
"vampire! He's no Orc. He's a monster. Someone should put him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037ff5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Gray Prince is the best fighter the Arena has ever seen. He can't be "
"beaten. Not by you. But hey, it's your right.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Forest was cleared for agriculture around Lake Rumare, but it's "
"mostly wilderness outside of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BattlePlans_000276a9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Great Gate will allow them to bring out the siege machine to blast the "
"walls of Bruma, just like at Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_lightthedragonfires_000223e4_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Great God of All made a covenant with St. Alessia. So long as a true heir "
"ruled the Empire, the Great God swore to protect the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofAzuraTOPIC_0001ebe3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Lady has spoken... to you alone. The moon and star shall be your "
"guide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch burning again is a sign that things aren't completely "
"hopeless. Means someone is doing something right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061719_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch burning is a good sign for us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch burns again. That'll boost spirits around here. A shame, "
"really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch burns at a temperature 13 times hotter than the average fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004421d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch burns once more -- a beacon of comfort that only serves to "
"mock my existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch burns once more! This is good news for Thadon, I hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch burns once more. Perhaps there's hope for all. Except me. "
"Can't shake this cold...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch burns with such vibrant color. I should try and incorporate "
"the hues in my next work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004013d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch flares with the light of Dementia! All of Crucible will be "
"celebrating tonight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044207_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch has been relit. I wonder if that's a good sign, or a bad sign?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044210_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch in New Sheoth is lit. Should be easier to count the dead "
"bodies that get dumped on the city street at night now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004421b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch is burning again! This calls for a celebration! You can spot "
"me, right? Just a few gold?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch is lit in the Sacellum Arden-Sul. Have you read the book "
"about Arden-Sul? It's fascinating!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044217_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch is lit in the city. Do you hear it? I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch is lit once more. Maybe we might be safe here after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch is lit! This calls for a celebration. Break out the Skooma! "
"You brought the Skooma, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch is lit. A romantic symbol, isn't it? I always hoped my first "
"kiss would be in the glow of a torch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch is on fire again. I wonder if someone might accidentally "
"knock me into it. Do I look flammable to you? I hope I'm flammable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch is out again! I bet you didn't know that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e65b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch shines as a beacon of Mania!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreatTorchTopic_000910a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch shines brightly above New Sheoth, a beacon of hope for all "
"the citizens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040140_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch shines with the pure light of Mania! You chose well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e65c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Great Torch spreads the light of Dementia across the land!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044213_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Great Torch, the Great Torch! Why's everyone bothering me about that? "
"I've got a Great Torch for you, right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesM_000139af_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Greenmote flowed like water in a stream as the revelers voraciously "
"succumbed to its rapturous ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesM02_00013a67_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Greenmote had taken its toll. The ground stained a deep crimson as the "
"sanguine liquid flowed from their lifeless bodies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025570_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Grey Mare isn't a bad place to stay, especially if you're low on Septims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoIntro2_00082460_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch comes, and Jyggalag walks. Or runs. Never skips, sidles, or "
"struts. Mostly, he just destroys everything around him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10GreymarchTopic_0009148c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch continues, and Lord Sheogorath believes you may be the key to "
"stopping it. Do as he commands. The Realm depends on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07TheFringeTopic_000912a2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch has swept the Fringe. Order gathers its forces there as we "
"speak. And I hate when people gather forces in My Fringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07TheFringeTopic_0009130c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch has swept the Fringe. Order gathers its forces there as we "
"speak. And I hate when people gather forces in My Fringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech2_0005604a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The Greymarch is coming. And you're going to stop it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Greymarch is complete and the House of Mania still stands tall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch is over, the war has been won, but at what cost? This timeline "
"will never be the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch is over. At least I'll be able to sleep a little safer now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006079e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch is over. Sheogorath has defeated Jyggalag! The whole world "
"almost collapsed on us! But it didn't!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro1_00082467_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Greymarch is upon us, and the Ordering begins. Armies of Order sweep My "
"Realm. Death. Destruction. Then I have to pick up the pieces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_0009604f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Greymarch is upon you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a36b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Greymarch is upon you, fool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004db7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Greymarch is upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Grove and the Tree retain a number of psychotropic properties that "
"supposedly bring one to personal revelation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ2_00002d1a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Guardians have fallen and no one remains to watch their charges, and all "
"the heavens are now banquet for the Princes of Misrule!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003570f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Guild has passed me by. You are its future. Take your responsibilty "
"seriously. I wish you luck. You still have many duties to perform."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Guild is going to hell in a hogcart. Look at what they give me? Keld of "
"the Isles? Ohtimbar? Both Guardian rank? Phah! Useless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Heartlands and Nibenean Valley are the agricultural breadbaskets of "
"Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ObelisksTopic_00091059_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Hearts of Order found on Jyggalag's Knights can be placed in the "
"obelisks. Adding enough can cause the obelisk to become overloaded with power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Heretic is a misguided man whose belief has gone astray. Steal a robe "
"from their back and among them you can stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e137_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Heretic is a misguided man whose belief has gone astray. Steal a robe "
"from their back and among them you can stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DerveninGreetA_000400e4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Hero who lights the Great Torch for Mania is traditionally awarded the "
"Raiment of Arden-Sul. Not that this should influence your choice at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002f87e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The High Elf Faelian lives in the Imperial City, and fancies long walks. "
"Speak with your fellow family members. They may offer their insights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The High Elf Faelian now swims in the maelstrom of darkness at the feet of "
"our Dread Father, Sithis. And, there were no witnesses to your handiwork."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ff08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The High Elf Faelian now swims in the maelstrom of darkness at the feet of "
"our Dread Father, Sithis. And, there were no witnesses to your handiwork."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Mission_0002af34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The High Fane dates from the Late Ayleid Period, following the fall of White "
"Gold Tower, a very troubled time for that ancient people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008da9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Honorblade has been returned to the Castle after all these years! This is "
"certainly a good omen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HowlingHalls_00043f73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Howling Halls are home to Ciirta's \"Apostles of the Light,\" or whatever "
"it is that they're calling themselves these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a80a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Howling Halls, is it? It's been some time since I last saw this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Hunger is one of Lord Sheogorath's favorite pets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial City is densely urbanized, with a few large parks and waterside "
"dock areas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial City is located on a large island surrounded by Lake Rumare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial City itself is a walled city, with separate inner walls "
"protecting the Imperial palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473ed_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Imperial City just wouldn't be the same without it. Maybe, some day, if "
"you know the right people, you might get a chance to see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006fdc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Legion is at your disposal, citizen. What seems to be the "
"problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bda5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Palace is at the center. The six districts are arranged around "
"the Palace like spokes of a wheel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Prison! Long did I languish there, in my youth, before the "
"Brotherhood found me.  The guards are strong and cruel. So very cruel...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00098378_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Watch has imposed a curfew. We have to remain in our homes until "
"they catch the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000363e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Watch is asking around for anyone that might have seen Audens "
"Avidius. He's escaped from prison!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064447_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Imperial Watch seems awfully worried about the Gray Fox. Look at all "
"those wanted posters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Covenant_0002d77b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Imperial line is dead, and the gods have forsaken us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e88b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Imperials have the gold, houses, and top spots. Dark Elves like me left "
"Morrowind and the whole priest-ridden Tribunal nightmare..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrinaCrossInnTopic_0002fd6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Inn lies north of Anvil. Speak with Arielle Jurard when you arrive. She "
"will give you further instructions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Inquisitor is now required to be secretive? Consider that Herdir's "
"presence may be a detriment to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00089604_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Inquisitor now has significant evidence pointing towards Muurine. Perhaps "
"a talk with her is in order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName10f_00038b38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Iron Maiden, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, it's "
"time to see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000613ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Isles are safer now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_00078cac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Isles, the Isles. A wonderful place! Except when it's horrible. Then it's "
"horribly wonderful. Good for a visit. Or for an eternity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsSleep_0018bd94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Jerall View is on the terraces, near the castle gate and facing the "
"chapel. Olav's is next to the east gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026983_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The K'Sharra has come true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005c0c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Key opens all doors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The King and Queen Tavern isn't a bad place to stay if you're visiting the "
"city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The King and Queen is a fine place, and it's much more reasonable than other "
"places in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The King and Queen is a nice place. The Marillins treat everyone well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000478a6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "The King is the Key, and the Hand guards the King."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a0fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The King of Worms has obviously targeted the guild, but we have no idea why. "
"No demands have been made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KingofWormsTopic_0000a0fe_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The King of Worms stood over him, right before he died, and he... well, it "
"looked like he sucked out Volanaro's soul!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting1_00018702_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights are relentless. They do not tire. They do not fear. And they do "
"not stop coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting1_00018c81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights are relentless. They do not tire. They do not fear. And they do "
"not stop coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08KnightsTopic_0001ec1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights are relentless. We are the only thing standing between them and "
"the total destruction of the Fringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08KnightsTopic_0001ec1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights are relentless. We are the only thing standing between them and "
"the total destruction of the Fringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040b78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Knights are sure to attack again. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08KnightsTopic_00018c7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights began arriving shortly after the spire activated. They seem to "
"have no interest in pushing us back, only in killing those who resist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights have returned with a vengeance, their blades stained with blood. "
"Who will be able to stop them, to stem this deadly flood?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Knights of Order are here to protect us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005eed6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Knights of Order have returned as foretold. Arden-Sul save us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a1c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights of the Nine are reforming! Can you believe it? My father used to "
"tell me stories of the old knights when I was a lad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a1d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights of the Nine are reforming! Can you believe it? My father used to "
"tell me stories of the old knights when I was a lass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a27_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The Knights of the Nine have come for you, foul beast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bde_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights of the Nine have prevailed over Umaril. Truly, the gods have "
"shown us favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bd3_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Knights of the Nine stand together once again. I would not have thought "
"it possible. We owe you a great debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031c83_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Knights of the Thorn are a bunch of rabble who fancy themselves true "
"knights. Farwil formed the group around two years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003358b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Knights of the Thorn triumph once again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018baad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Kvatch Oblivion Gate has been closed! Don't you understand what that "
"means? We can beat the bastards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04Audience_0001359b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Lady has refused any and all appointments of late. You'd have to try and "
"find her on your own, and I don't recommend that course of action."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Leyawiin chapter is just drifting along. Dagail isn't much of a mentor or "
"leader. She isn't even coherent most of the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046582_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Lonely Suitor certainly seems to be a source of great pride for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046584_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Lonely Suitor is a fine place. Bogrum gro-Galash is very focused on "
"making it a success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026a9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Lord Bal has given you a task. Perform it well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ef77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Lord Hermaeus has set you on a new path. Follow it and return to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095ec4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Lord of Order shall rule this Realm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004db78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Lord of Order will claim your throne!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060534_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mad One has vanished from the Isles, fear sits heavy on the brow. All our "
"hopes go with one, but can he save us now? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081d65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Madgod Himself! Come to get some advice from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081dd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Madgod graces us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006d17c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Madgod has given you a task. Surely, someone of your copious talent "
"should be able to handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006050b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Madgod has vanished? Perhaps He simply stepped out of our time until the "
"Greymarch passes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000605ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Madgod is gone. Can he die? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a375_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Madgod is no match for my Lord Jyggalag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f461_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Madgod's army has returned, their weapons primed to slay. Could this mean "
"our downfall, or will we win the day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DraconianMadstoneTopic_00018233_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Madstone appears as a snake coiled around and encircling itself. The eyes "
"of the snake are supposed to be precious gems or some such."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DraconianMadstoneTopic_0001822e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Madstone awaits, and so does your reward if you retrieve it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DraconianMadstoneTopic_00018228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Madstone is finally mine. It's the pinnacle of my collection. Many thanks "
"to you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062688_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mages Guild has been attacked by Necromancers. This proves they can't be "
"trusted!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006c2a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mages Guild has made more than a few enemies since Necromancy was banned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bd9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mages Guild is south of the chapel, by the west wall. The Fighters Guild "
"is across the street from the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mages Guild is the single best resource for Alchemists in all of "
"Cyrodiil. If Alchemy interests you, talk to Dagail about joining."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Mages Guild is, indeed, a fine organization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006c299_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mages Guild runs more or less like it always did, but we lost quite a few "
"members when the practice of Necromancy was banned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0001e06d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Mages Guild seems more disorganized than usual lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071958_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mages Guild should fund further study of the early Imperial Legions, "
"their battlemages, and their traditions of patrol and route-finding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The March Rider sells and repairs weapons and armor. Can I help you? I'm "
"Tertia Viducia. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Marie Elena, you say? I've seen that ship. There's a unique balcony at "
"the stern. My guess is it leads to the captain's cabin. Could be useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_000498a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Marillins say that they treat everyone like royalty at the King and Queen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002d932_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Master doesn't like visitors. Leave this house. NOW."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d923_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Master doesn't like visitors. Leave this house. Now. If you're still here "
"in twenty seconds, I will be forced to crush you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MehrunesDagonTopic_00097cc3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Master has promised us that the Time of Preparation is almost over! The "
"Time of Cleansing is almost here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MankarCamoranTopic_00097cc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Master is preaching in the Shrine as we speak! Hurry, you should not miss "
"the chance to hear the Master's words!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MankarCamoranTopic_00097cc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Master knows the secret mind of Lord Dagon. He speaks with Him and "
"teaches us from His holy book, the Mysterium Xarxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088b3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Master will call us back to Tamriel soon. I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000477fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Master will soon deal with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000826d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Mazken are unworthy to guard the Altar of Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofDespairTopic_0007ff5f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Mazken do not even allow us free passage to worship there, which is one "
"of the many reasons why they are unfit to continue to guard it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Mazken do not forget their friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SENewSheothTOPIC_00078ca5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mazken guard Crucible in New Sheoth. We ensure the Demented remain "
"orderly and respectful of our Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Mazken no longer defile holy Cylarne, thanks to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a383d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Mephala shrine is northeast of the junction of the Red Ring Road and the "
"Silver Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName7_00038b3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Messenger of Death, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, "
"it's time to see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018ae75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Moth Priests seem agitated today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MouthofthePanther_00036601_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Mouth of the Panther is what they call the delta where the Panther River "
"meets Niben Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038bbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mysterium Xarxes is the most dangerous daedric sorcery I've ever "
"encountered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mystic Archives have a large collection of books. Look around, and you "
"may learn a thing or two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11Choice1A_00002dcb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Mystic Archives have been consulted with minimal success. Guild members "
"are investigating other avenues, but I believe more can be learned here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00014d92_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn have been leaving notes in Talos Plaza. I hope no one "
"believes their lies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018baaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn murdered the Emperor and led those damn Daedra right into the "
"heart of the Empire! They'll pay for their treachery! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006234a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn will never take Cloud Ruler Temple. Not while any Blade still "
"draws breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn won't dare try anything now that the best soldiers in "
"Cyrodiil are defending Bruma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn. What do we really know about them? How far into the Empire "
"have they infiltrated? They could have sympathizers... and spies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasA3_00022b57_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn? Are you... I mean, I don't know what you're talking about! I "
"don't know anything about any cult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB5_0009532c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Mythic Dawn? Are you... I mean, I don't know what you're talking about! I "
"don't know anything about any cult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c08d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "The Necromancer's Amulet and the Bloodworm Helm have been taken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00009224_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Necromancers are a sign of things to come. An old acquaintance of the "
"guild has come to Cyrodiil, and they are answering his call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Nibenay Basin grades from rolling farmlands by the river east to the "
"rugged uplands of the Valus Mountains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Nibeneans think they're slick. 'Slippery' is more like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04Choice1B_00025275_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mo.... No! No! Guards! Guards! Help me! Somebody help! Assassin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother is the Dark Brotherhood's Unholy Matron. She guides our "
"actions, just as the Dread Father Sithis once guided hers. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_0000567a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother must be awakened, so that we may seek her guidance. Are you "
"ready to travel now to her resting place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother speaks to only one member of the Dark Brotherhood -- the "
"Listener of the Black Hand. And when Our Lady speaks, death follows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00090cba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother will fall by my hand! Her spirit will haunt my nightmares no "
"longer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090798_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother wishes for you to take some time to consider your new "
"position. We will speak when we are back in the Sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03Choice1B_00023f3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Night Mother? What's this all about? I... I think you should leave now. "
"You hear me? Get out! Gromm! Gromm! we have an intruder! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000ace64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Nine Divines are boring. Daedra? They're never boring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelicsBoots_00002c64_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Nine be praised! Imagine, the very boots with which Pelinal Whitestrake "
"once walked the earth! I must go and tell the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002965_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The Nine have given so much to us, and I take time to thank them for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002941_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The Nine preserve us! These Aurorans will slaughter us all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047707_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Nine say each of us is special, but that's just a lie. I don't mind, but "
"it just sounds stupid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c990_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Nine welcome you to Bruma. I'm Isa Raman, priestess of Talos."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028cda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Nord has been murdered. Maybe I'll get lucky and the same thing will "
"happen to you. Unless, of course, you're the one who did it...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025859_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Nords have always been protective of their territory. It's no wonder they "
"get involved in these disputes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsSleep_0018bd9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Oak and Crosier and the Grey Mare are near the gate and fountain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025573_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Oak and Crosier is a nice place, but that Talasma seems rather stuck-up "
"to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a69e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Oak and Crosier is the place of choice for well-bred visitors to Chorrol. "
"The Grey Mare is more suitable for... others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DragonfiresTopic_00037834_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Oblivion Gates will close, and Mehrunes Dagon's invasion will have failed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bdf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Order lives once more. Pelinal himself would be proud of what we've "
"accomplished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00070228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Order of the Black Worm will feast on your soul, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirAmielSpeech03_00002cc4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Order shall serve as the sword and the shield of the Nine in the dark "
"times to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RolandJensericTopic_0001da66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Order welcomes him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseInquiry_00053235_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Paint horses of Leyawiin are the least expensive in all of Cyrodiil! You "
"can't get a better bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004bf9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Palace is cut off, sire. We were the last to make it through from the "
"Legion Compound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44PantsTopic_00078737_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Pants! The Calming Pants! Finally! These Pants are key to my survival."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043edf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Paranoid Duchess is at it again, from what I hear. If you ask me, we "
"could do for a little more law and order around here, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00022da6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Path of Dawn is difficult. But the rewards are great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice5_00026af7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Plague of Fear. I will not speak of this. Not to any outsider. I'll "
"answer anything else I can. Is there something more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ObelisksTopic_000910fb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Priests of Order are the key. They summon the Knights at the obelisks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e6fd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Prince of Destruction awakes, born anew in blood and fire. These "
"cutthroats are but his mortal pawns."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD1_00092d85_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Prince of Destruction he referred to is none other than Mehrunes Dagon, "
"one of the lords of the demonic world of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD2_00092d86_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The Prince of Destruction, Mehrunes Dagon, is one of the lords of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c224_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"The Principalities have sparkled as gems in the black reaches of Oblivion "
"since the First Morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002977_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Prophet has arrived. He is preaching to the assembled Knights in the "
"Chapel. You should speak to him at once. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b97_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Prophet speaks true. This is the start of something terrible, I can feel "
"it in my bones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PurificationTopic_0002fd9c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Purification is one of the most extreme measures we are forced to carry "
"out. Indeed, it has only been carried out twice. Before now, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Realm is a safe haven for all my hatchlings once more. If only I could "
"get them to appreciate me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00096052_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Realm of Madness is mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048906_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Renrijra Krin are Khajiit bandits and smugglers posing as guerillas and "
"freedom fighters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator draws adventurers to it once again. I suppose they won't need "
"their belongings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator has been reactivated, and the Isles are no longer open to "
"invasion. Arden-Sul works in mysterious ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator has been reactivated. Why, if not to protect us from the coming "
"storm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator is active once again? Perhaps it will draw the disease from my "
"body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator is attracting again. Aren't you a cute little thing? Do you "
"want me to scratch behind your ears?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator is fixed again. What a shame. I looked forward to meeting new "
"people. They always have such nice things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043506_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Resonator is still broken. It never worked. And it never will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator is working again, I understand. I do hope it doesn't confuse "
"any of my brood, returning to me after all these years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043507_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator of Judgment is back on. I read about that somewhere. It helps "
"keep the Realm clean of vagrants and ne'er-do-wells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator of Judgment is fixed! How horrid! New adventurers mean new "
"exhibits!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004350b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator of Judgment is working again. I guess, since the Gatekeeper's "
"dead now, that's a good thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Resonator of Judgment sings again! Singing, singing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004350f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator sings again, drawing strangers near. Protecting us, our lives, "
"our homes, and all that we hold dear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator sings its sweet song once more. Promises of riches and fame, "
"fulfilled with death and madness. How delightful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator was my idea, you know. People never remember that, but it was. "
"I'm glad it's working again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AResonatorofJudgmentT_00018df8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Resonator works by drawing adventurers to itself with a sort of magical "
"\"siren's call\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061424_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Resonator? Maybe it'll keep strangers out of Bliss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Ring guides us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44RingTopic_00078739_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Ring of Desiccation! Perfect. It does everything I need it to. A wondrous "
"piece of craftsmanship!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem11_00082428_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Ring of Disrobing -- removes your clothes if you put it on. Now, don't "
"you go trying it! I have enough Oddities on display already, hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Ritual is complete. Arden-Sul's will is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Ritual is complete. Arden-Sul's will is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Ritual is completed, and a new ruler presides over Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Rose of Sithis! Such an honor! Just make sure your marksmanship is up to "
"the task. If you miss the target, the enchantment will be wasted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Rose will only work if Phillida is unarmored. So, when would a soldier "
"not wear his armor? I only take my armor off to sleep or swim..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Scales_00068851_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Rumare slaughterfish are a special breed -- nastier than the regular "
"kind. They have a spawning pool nearby, so this area is lousy with 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061c66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Saints and Seducers will protect us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008fa95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Saints stand strong, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09ArmorTopic_00026d6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Septim blood may flow through my veins, but you have the soul of a hero. "
"The Armor of Tiber Septim himself! Jauffre will be amazed to see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDShieldoftheCrusader_00002af1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Shield is safeguarded within Fort Bulwark. It is protected, and care must "
"be taken when attempting to find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a2b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The Shield will be ours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics2_00002c6f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Shield, sir knight! The Commander braved the tests of Fort Bulwark and "
"returned with the Shield of the Crusader!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_00078ca8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Shivering Isles are a reflection of our Lord Sheogorath. Divided, yet "
"perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice1_00019ccf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Shivering Isles hold many secrets but few remain unseen by mortal eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_0009101a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Shivering Isles is what Sheogorath wills it to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Sintav clan is very close. We watch out for each other, and Uncle Iniel, "
"he knows everything, and takes care of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047687_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Sintavs have always been one of the leading families in the City. We will "
"refrain from contact with the Atius, unless provoked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GottlesfontPrioryTopic_000ace82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Sisters of Gottlesfont gather Steel Blue Entoloma and Lady's Mantle "
"Leaves. Take what you need, and you're welcome to gather mushrooms nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_00038439_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Skingrad city watch informed us that Gelebourne was killed by Raynil not "
"too long ago. Gelebourne was a vampire as well, obviously."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005c0c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Skull sees."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001e83a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Society triumphs once more! Thanks to you, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d86_AltarDeluxe_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Sovereign of Destruction offers you equipment befitting someone as "
"bloodthirsty as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d88_AltarDeluxe_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Sovereign of Destruction offers you equipment befitting someone as "
"bloodthirsty as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d8a_AltarDeluxe_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Sovereign of Destruction offers you equipment befitting someone as "
"bloodthirsty as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName1_00038b42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Spellslinger, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, it's "
"time to see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice1_00019ccf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Staff is a tool of great vision and thus, requires the eye of one who has "
"witnessed one of these unseen secrets firsthand. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice5_00014b62_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Staff is the symbol of power in this Realm. He who rightfully holds the "
"Staff may hold the throne of the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice3_00019cd0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Staff may allow you to occupy the Throne of Madness, but understand that "
"such a feat has never been attempted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13StaffofIndarys_00031c97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Staff of Indarys it is. Again, I thank you on behalf of all the citizens "
"of Cheydinhal, and I especially thank you as an elated father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00014b54_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Staff of Sheogorath contains a portion of the divine power of the Daedric "
"Prince. It is the embodiment of Sheogorath and of this land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00014b5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Staff of Sheogorath holds the secrets of this Realm. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00016ec7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Staff of Sheogorath holds the secrets of this Realm. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Eye_00016ef6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Staff of Sheogorath holds the secrets of this Realm. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c226_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Surilie Brothers wine is some of the best in Tamriel, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DavideSurilieTopic_0002366c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Surilie house is right next door to mine. A large house with a backyard "
"conveniently located to observe my every move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a0f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Sword of the Crusader has been seen again! They say that no evil can "
"withstand the holy sword wielded by a true knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSwordTopic_00002bef_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The Sword was originally created by Arkay, according to legend. Perhaps it "
"could be reconsecrated upon the altar of his Chapel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChampName11_00038b44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Tamriel Terror, huh? I like it! Yeah, that'll do nicely. All right, it's "
"time to see if you're crazy good or just plain crazy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046580_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Tap and Tack is a good place to get a quick bite, and Olav is a good man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022e60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Tears are not just a namesake. They're literally the frozen tears of a "
"knight named Garridan Stalrous who lived many years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022e58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Tears are small crystals, bluish in appearance. Quite beautiful I'd "
"imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0014c72f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Tears look beautiful in my collection. A thousand thanks once again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047738_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Temple District is by far the most desirable address in the city. Why? "
"Because I live here, of course. Don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ2_00002d18_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Thief has found the lock that he cannot break! The Warrior, the foe that "
"cannot fall! The Wizard, an incantation that takes not to his tongue!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Armand1_0005143a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Thieves Guild is not a myth. We are followers of the Gray Fox, and I am "
"his Doyen. Merely by finding me, you have passed the first test."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AmuseiStory_0000c05a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Thieves Guild refused to take me, so I came here. Leyawiin is my home. It "
"is where I was raised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13ThornbladeTopic_00031c96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Thornblade it is. Again, I thank you on behalf of all the citizens of "
"Cheydinhal, and I especially thank you as an elated father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003dfa2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Three Sisters Inn is a nice place, but that Shuravi sure is grumpy. I "
"don't think she likes anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Tiber Septim Hotel is a nice place. It's not cheap, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Tiber Septim Hotel is clean, comfortable, and quite exclusive. I don't "
"mind paying a little extra for a little privacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476e0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Tiber Septim Hotel is very nice, but very expensive. There's the Bloated "
"Float at the Waterfront. Sleep on a boat. And cheap, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkTimeWound_00014e28_AltarDeluxe_RESP4"
msgid "The Time Wound has not fully opened yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch alight! There's hope for us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch burns again. This can't bode well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch burns brightly again. Like my love for dear Sheer-Meedish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch extinguished and relit? This does not bode well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Torch is relit. Wonderful. Just makes it a bit tougher to sneak around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044218_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Torch lights the city once again. Fat lot of good it does those of use "
"working out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000614aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch once again casts its light on Crucible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_0006171e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch only matters to those in New Sheoth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch relit! It sings of things returned!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_0006166f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Torch shines brightly over Bliss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000478a6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "The Tower guards the Gate, but the Gate holds the Key. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c18b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Two Sisters is a fine place, and the two sisters themselves are nice "
"people, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Ulfgars are all dead. Whatever possessed them to attack us like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09GhostB_00036666_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Underking defeated and ensnared us in his evil enchantment, and bound us "
"here to guard forever the defiled Shrine of Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechUmaril2_00002d0c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The Unfeathered has come during the Breaking of Gates! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004769b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Watch can't touch me. I'm careful, private-like. Don't like people "
"following me. Sure, it makes people nervous, seeing me sneak around. Too bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Watch is so completely on my ass. So I got to lay low for a while. I got "
"some dosh stashed, so I'm fine for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ForlornWatchman_00035cab_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Watchman looks like he may have been a sailor. No one knows where he came "
"from, or why he looks so sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bda5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The Waterfront is south of Temple District. The Arcane University is south of "
"the Arboretum. The Imperial Prison is north of Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_0008f179_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Waters of Oblivion lead us to the Wellspring, where Lord Sheogorath has "
"given us a place to return to His service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0008f17a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Waters of Oblivion lead us to the Wellspring, where Lord Sheogorath has "
"given us a place to return to His service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029db_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The Way of the Pilgrim awaits. Go now and pray for divine guidance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringInfo_0001e971_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring is a cynosure, a place where the Animus of lost Aureal can "
"return to this realm from the Waters of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringInfo_00043027_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring is a cynosure, a place where the Animus of lost Mazken can "
"return to this realm from the Waters of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0004302e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring is an essential link between the Dark Seducers and the "
"Shivering Isles. Syl knows this, and is likely trying to break it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_0004302c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring is an essential link between the Golden Saints and the "
"Shivering Isles. Thadon knows this, and is likely trying to break it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017ca3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Wellspring is restored! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017cf9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The Wellspring is restored! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatWellspring_00017d17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring of the Aureal. It's what links us to this realm, where we "
"return to the world from the Waters of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatWellspring_00017471_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Wellspring of the Mazken. It's what links us to this Realm, where we "
"return to the world from the Waters of Oblivion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsSleep_0018bda3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The West Weald Inn is across from the guilds inside the north walls. Two "
"Sisters' Lodge is inside the south walls, in the west, near the gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003aaa2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The West Weald is a good place. Erina Jeranus isn't the friendliest person in "
"the world, but not a bad sort when you get to know her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The Xarxes mentions four items needed for the ritual, but so far I have only "
"deciphered one of them: the 'blood of a Daedra Lord'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000164d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Yellow Team ain't gonna fight itself, you lazy Pit Dog! You ready for a "
"match, or what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c0cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Yellow Team surprised even me with that match. Three against one! I guess "
"they didn't know who they were dealin' with, huh? Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046664_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Yellow Team's combatant has slain many opponents with his magical dagger, "
"Shimmerstrike! Let's see if the Blue Team can end his winning streak!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Zealot is a misguided man whose belief has gone astray. Steal a robe from "
"their back and among them you can stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e138_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Zealot is a misguided man whose belief has gone astray. Steal a robe from "
"their back and among them you can stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078159_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The Zealots in the lands of Dementia believe they worship Arden-Sul. Poor, "
"deluded souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00019847_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The adventurers will be subject to horrors beyond their imagination... "
"visions of repugnance, death, and malevolence reside in this room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018ff1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The adventurers will have to overcome their feelings of greed as they set "
"their eyes upon the huge piles of treasure locked behind that gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0005482b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The age of the Septims is over, fool. A new age is dawning!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Scales_00066f2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The alchemist was paying so much for the scales that I'm close to having "
"enough saved so that I can retire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146cd_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The amulet is safe, however, and that must be enough for now. Thank you for "
"returning it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08KnightsTopic_00043f3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The appearance of the Knights of Order heralds the beginning of the "
"Greymarch. As Lord Sheogorath feared, our time grows ever shorter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PoisonedAppleTopic_00091913_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The apple has been treated with a most deadly poison. It will likely kill "
"whomever eats it, probably instantly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024828_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The area is clear? Then as soon as Captain Matius gives the order, I'll "
"escort the civilians to safety."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f47e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The armies are back in order? I've got no use for armies. Killing is "
"personal, not political."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f52a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The armies are back together now, I hear. I'd never have let them get lost in "
"the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f55f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The armies are restored, you say? My, what a smart little thing you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The armies are restored? That calls for a celebration!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f45d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The armies have returned. Thank the Madgod! I've had nightmares about them "
"disappearing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f42a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The armies of Sheogorath are renewed. Let them march now on the horrible "
"cats! Wipe them from the Isles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f460_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The armies of Sheogorath have returned? Putting lots of people in the same "
"place is known to spread disease. I hope they keep the barracks far away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The armies of Sheogorath march again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a7f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The armor and weapons of the legendary Pelinal Whitestrake, the Divine "
"Crusader. Knights have quested for them for thousands of years. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02BoneArrows_00012063_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The arrows are ready. Here are some for you, and I'll keep some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02BoneArrows_00012062_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The arrows aren't ready yet. Come back later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b1f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The assassinations. What else is there to talk about? Perfectly planned and "
"executed... the Blades perfectly useless... a complete disaster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05WhatBaurusLearned_00022b1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The assassins who killed the Emperor were part of a daedric cult known as the "
"Mythic Dawn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00033fcb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The author of the \"Commentaries\" claims the Xarxes was written by Mehrunes "
"Dagon himself, but no one else has ever seen it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1bd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The authorities at the Imperial City took her off the ship as soon as we "
"docked. I was also informed that there was a reward for her capture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b7df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The bards will be busy composing songs in your honor for years to come. To "
"think that we lived through such times!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e966_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The barrier can't be broken by you. It's too tough... use the chime! Ring the "
"chime, and that may shatter it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e967_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The barrier can't be broken by you. It's too tough... use the chime! Ring the "
"chime, and that may shatter it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d888_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The barriers between planes are weak. Do more to strengthen them; seal the "
"portals to Oblivion. Then we shall speak of training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006d7a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The barriers between worlds are weak. Close the doors to Oblivion, and then "
"we shall speak of training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_000363b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The bastard took every coin I had with me. I don't know his name, but I know "
"his face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c58f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The bastards! There was no battle. Azani must have made a deal with the "
"Blackwood Company. My guess is that they paid him off. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018c79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The battle is upon us, this is no time for talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017d97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The battle is upon us. There is no time for conversation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Scamps_0004f8c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The beastly little creatures are nasty, smelly, noisy and wrecking my "
"beautiful house! I must be rid of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b1299_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The bed is quite luxurious, is it not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003b347_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The bed's comfortable, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000475c7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The beggars and the wicked Thieves Guild still trouble me. I wish the Nine "
"Divines offered charity and comfort to the poor like the Temple did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Choice1A_00028030_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The best I can say is, good luck. If you make it back alive, we'll be waiting "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007815e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The best armor in the city is at The Missing Pauldron."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_00028739_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The best daughter a mother could ask for, kind-hearted and a friend to "
"everyone she meets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFences_000165e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The best fences are only available to the higher rank Thieves Guild members. "
"Here's a list of who you can use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e946_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The best place for you to start would be Shadeleaf Copse, which is a part of "
"the Great Forest northeast of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGInformation_000092b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The best source of information are the beggars. Their eyes and ears seem to "
"be everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The best spells are closely guarded by the guild, but are available to high-"
"ranking members. You should consider joining."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireAshTopic_000977d9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The best they could do to was to imprison him underground, where he survives "
"to this day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The best thing to do is avoid the vile things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeHelmetMagic_00016cec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The best way for a blade to slip into a man's brain is through the eye "
"socket, ear hole, or through the nose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_poisonedknifetopic_000282fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The blade has been coated with a rare poison called Languorwine. One drop in "
"a normal human bloodstream will mimic the effects of death immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007b798_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The blade. It hungers for souls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkGiftTopic_0004ce48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The blessed curse of vampirism now flows through your veins. Be patient. Wait "
"the entire three days, then sleep. Your dreams will guide the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000034a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The blessing of the Fox upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029e7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The blessings of the Nine upon your quest. Perhaps our paths will cross again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08SavillasStoneTopic_0009838d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The blind monks in the catacombs guard the stone. It's said to have magical "
"powers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a6b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The blood of Dibella's slaughtered acolytes cries out for vengeance. "
"Vengeance! Who will take up this holy crusade?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a73_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The blood tide rises!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b58f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The blue plates are nice, but the brown ones seem to last longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP9"
msgid ""
"The bodies were those of some beggars who used to wander the streets looking "
"for handouts. Vampire probably thought no one would miss them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013ffa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The body on the bed isn't Syl, but merely an impersonator. The real Syl uses "
"many such decoys to throw would-be killers off her trail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_0018d7fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The bond we share is unbreakable, is it not? The Blades are as one, on this "
"and every other matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactTopic_00026efa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The book \"Modern Heretics\" is the best introduction to daedric cults. The "
"library here has a copy if you need it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1A_0001e854_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The book is entitled \"Fingers of the Mountain\" -- it is of no use to you; "
"you won't be able to read it. I, however, can, and would very much like to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1A_000224e4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The book is entitled \"Fingers of the Mountain\" -- it is of no use to you; "
"you won't be able to read it. I, however, can, and would very much like to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_00028c02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The book is in safe hands for now; that is all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000285bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The book is safe. That is all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a46_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The boots could only be granted to one who values Kynareth's works. It "
"pleases me to see that you are that one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a43_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The boots have been guarded by Kynareth herself for the longest time. Sir "
"Juncan went after them, and never returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P3Specifics_0001fb70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The boots of Springheel Jak will allow you to leap to an unreachable place. "
"They will also protect you from a long fall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002a392_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The bread's hot and fresh, with a nice crust, and butter and honey, just like "
"you like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004420d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The burning flame of the Great Torch casts a peaceful glow, but will the "
"flame stay ablaze or will it one day go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12GetStone_00026efd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The capital of one of the ancient Ayleid kingdoms which flourished in "
"Cyrodiil before the rise of Men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor01_0002ad12_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The captain and her men... it's their duty to protect me. I will do as they "
"say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_00014a3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The captain's down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22HighFane_0002af35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The carving you recovered from Malada will be invaluable in my research on "
"the Late Ayleid Period."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bd89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The castle is east. The chapel is northwest. The shops and guilds are mostly "
"along the north wall and river. The port is over a bridge to the south."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bd8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The castle is north, on the hill. The guilds and shops are west of the river. "
"The homes are east of the river."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bda1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The castle is on a hill outside the walls, south of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bd99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The castle is to the east. Inns are near the gate and fountain. Guilds are "
"north, by the Great Oak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bd92_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The castle is to the west, the chapel and houses to the south, and guilds and "
"shops to the north."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bda0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The castle's to the east, and the chapel near the west gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Mg13CavernChoiceWhere_00033f56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The cavern is a short distance east of the castle. Far enough from town that "
"few residents have reason to pass by it, thankfully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodcrustCavernTopic_00009227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The cavern is silent once more. I would be foolish to think that this might "
"send a message to those who would encroach on my territory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Goblins_000319d1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The caves around here are infested with goblins. Normally goblins stay close "
"to their lairs, and wouldn't be a huge problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The cemetary is well tended, brother Holger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The characterization is completely accurate. I despise the gods and those who "
"bow before them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a89_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The church has taken no official position on his teaching yet. But from the "
"reports I've heard, he may be truly inspired by the divines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a8a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The church is still in turmoil from the attack on the Chapel of Dibella."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004422c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The circle has completed, the Ritual has been done. A new leader sits upon "
"the throne, the royal post is won. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The circle has completed, the Ritual has been done. A new leader sits upon "
"the throne, the royal post is won. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The cities of Cyrodiil are finally rallying together to make a stand against "
"the Oblivion invasion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00012d13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The citizens are in my way. Should I kill them? No? Too bad. If only I had "
"more magicka. I could kill the Fanatics and then rule this town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The citizens of Passwall must begin to rebuild. Much has been lost, and I "
"fear that this is only the beginning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13HunterChoiceWhere_00033f58_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The citizens will likely know more. I imagine many have noticed their "
"presence here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HeardNo_0003d30d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The city guard hasn't done very much about it, because frankly, the men who "
"are robbed are so embarrassed, they don't want to report it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The city isn't ruled by Dukes. It's ruled by elected representatives. And "
"they wear funny hats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_0003567b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The city lies southwest of the Imperial City. The castle overlooks the city "
"from a steep hill. You should have no trouble finding it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028558_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The city's in flames, and we've got nothing but a bunch of greenhorns. I "
"doubt the situation could be much worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice4_000356f5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The clever mages made it possible. Magic and iron. But this is not the time "
"to talk. You drink your gift and go with your new brothers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d293_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The common folk of Leyawiin recognize your valor, even if Count Terentius "
"does not. What do you need, friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ebc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The conspiracy has been discovered and eliminated. That is all you need know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DragonfiresTopic_00033fc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The coronation of each new Emperor is sealed when he uses the Amulet of Kings "
"to light the Dragonfires in the Temple of the One."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofRaptureTopic_0007ff60_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The counterpart to the Altar of Despair. Rapture is currently held by the "
"Aureals, in their complacency, but that will soon change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The court of Dementia is in disarray once more. Good that Thadon is such a "
"better ruler than Syl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40WitchWhere_0003ed40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The covens are hidden to outsiders. The last I heard rumors of was a coven "
"seen somewhere in Morrowind, years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServeSentence_0004575c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The coward's way out. So be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Troll_0001bb35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The creatures are now loose all over the forest and in the clearing where I "
"was still working. The Brush is on the body of the Bosmer thief there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS93Choice01B_00095a67_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The crystal ball is in a chest in the ship's hold, but I can't get to it. I "
"made it as far as the captain's cabin, but the spirits nearly killed me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077d03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The crystal obelisks that dot the Isles have recently started behaving "
"strangely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The culprit in this crime has already been dealt with. It's just a matter of "
"wrapping up the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ec8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The cup of Thadon is back in hand, a vessel full of dew. It seems someone "
"helped him find it, someone who is new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000977d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The cure you seek is ready!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8a9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The current Arch-Mage, Hannibal Traven, is true and bold to prohibit "
"necromancy, reversing the Guild's shameful past policies of official "
"tolerance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGDoyen_0001d4d2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The current Doyen are Armand Christophe and S'krivva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11RejectCowl_00022e8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The curse has been broken. Of course the thieves will only recognize you as "
"their guildmaster when you wear the cowl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06WhatTalking_00002afe_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The curse... I know what would lift it. But I cannot do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MehrunesDagonTopic_00092e8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The daedra Prince of Destruction. An inveterate foe of all mortal races."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000b0702_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The daedra did a lot of damage, but we'll rebuild. Before you know it, the "
"city will be as good as new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004d0b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The daedra seemed to come out of nowhere!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da53_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The damn \"Order\" insisted we get you into the picture. I think after I'm "
"done with Roland, Gilen and Grey-Throat will have to be dealt with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenBenirus_00003a71_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The dark arts contained in the tome called for him to dig up the recently "
"deceased in the nearby crypts under the cathedral."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk5_0006834a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The darkest days surely lie ahead. But I know that the Blades will stand true "
"for the Empire, as they always have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005effe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The day has finally arrived, a day of doom and despair. Whatever shall we do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The day is ours! Come and celebrate, we will feast and dine until we can eat "
"no more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004db94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The day of Madness is over!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DeadDropTopic_00066a09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The dead drop is a secret location where I will leave your orders, any "
"rewards you may have earned, and the location of the next dead drop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DeadDropTopic_00066a09_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The dead drops will allow me to deliver your contracts, and contact you if "
"need be. They are secure, known only to the members of the Black Hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008260b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The dead walk? Interesting. Sounds like a place to avoid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006e602_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The death of any helpless individual is tragic, and reprehensible when it "
"could have been prevented. I hold you responsible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0004e8de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The deer here are skittish. Need to get them quick, or they'll lead you a "
"merry chase. Poison on your arrows can help, and it won't hurt the meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32NotSolved_000135d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The defenders of the gate were not the only ones to fail their town. My "
"greatest shame is that I was struck by cowardice and fled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_000699f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The destruction was worse than I had feared. So many dead... it was almost "
"better not knowing. Then at least I had hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech4_00056052_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The details aren't important. At least not right now. Eternity is on a rather "
"tight deadline. We'll get back to that later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsLandmarks_0018bd88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The docks, harbor, lighthouse, and castle are outside the walls to the south."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressPlans_00020084_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The document speaks of two agents. You need to eliminate both of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_00078ca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The domain of the Prince of Madness, Sheogorath. We Aureal are tasked with "
"defending this realm against the lesser beings that would destroy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The doomstones are a mystery. Are they traces of the Mythic Times? Or "
"creations of ancient beastfolk or lost races of mer or men?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0007eadc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The doors are unlocked now? Interesting. It doesn't really matter to me, "
"though. I can come and go as I please. Sheogorath has judged me worthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0009101b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The doorways into the Realm proper. You may enter through either one. Really, "
"it depends on which aspect of the Realm more suits your disposition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000adc5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The dragon will stand forever as a memorial to what you and Martin did for "
"all of Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The end is in sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e1d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The end of all things has come! We're finished! All hope is gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09SlainYes_00013569_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The ends justify the means, do they? You'll pay for that, one day. Now, by "
"all means, come right in, walk in here as if you own the place...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The enemy comes. Prepare yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018c76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The enemy comes. Prepare yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The enemy is upon us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08BattleBeginYes_000181c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The enemy will be upon us soon. May the blessings of our lord protect us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeCuirassMagic_00016ce6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The enemy's blade will glance across the smooth metal. A gentle caress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000253e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The enforcer will not appreciate your little show. He'll likely attack you on "
"sight, but you must resist the urge to fight back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014655_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The esteemed cat burglar honors me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The evidence we need to incriminate Ulrich must lie within his quarters. You "
"must sneak in there and retrieve it without being seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirCaiusTopic_00002d23_Knights_RESP6"
msgid ""
"The evil grew upon me until I became cruel, a tyrranical ruler, a terror upon "
"the land. In death, evil held me even tighter than in life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirCaiusTopic_00002d23_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The evil took hold of me the day that I slew Sir Caius on the Priory steps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031524_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The fall broke most of the bottles. He didn't want to claim responsibility, "
"but I gave him what for and sent him away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10AnswerQuestion_0001530f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The family crypts are under the house. They give me the creeps. I have the "
"key. Take it. Just don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c42c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The farm is near. Stay close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneTears_00022e62_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The farmers appealed to Garridan to discover a solution. He spent a week "
"consulting with sages, until one of them mentioned a possibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005d51b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The fate of man drifts like seaweed in the net of His mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00034e96_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The fences report to me how much loot you have turned over to them. When "
"you've added more to the guild coffers, come back and see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09ImIn_00053724_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"The few times I tried to say something, he'd strike me or push me away. I "
"began to become frightened of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dca1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The field hands love Cindanwe. She keeps them motivated and extremely happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaidenShinjiTopic_00146857_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The first Arena Blademaster. Best damned warrior that ever lived, served the "
"Order of Diagna. Got killed fighting the Orcs, Azura rest his soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The first Yellow Team Hero you'll face is an Imperial in Heavy Raiment. He "
"fights with an Akaviri longsword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialPalace_0018ae7d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The first and second floors are public. All other parts of the palace are "
"strictly off limits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0001c14d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The first one to bring back Rohssan's sword will become a member. But, this "
"is the last chance. The loser gets nothing. Do you accept?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The first words of each paragraph are the key, I'm sure of it! Well, I "
"shouldn't keep you. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00066f32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The fishing is best when it's raining like this. The fish all come right to "
"the top. It's like they're waiting to be caught."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071f56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The flame stalks are particularly bright this year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00082646_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The flesh is weak. The light is all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAPeryiteSpeech_0008c260_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The fools cast a spell in the hopes of summoning me to them. It was prideful "
"and foolish, and it has had its consequences. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12PaleNo_00018236_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The force became known as the Army of Reman. The two armies clashed in what's "
"now northern Cyrodiil. The Akaviri were strong and well supplied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The forces Order have been defeated. Perhaps now I can sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The forces of Order are no more. What horror will replace them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhoAreYou_00016811_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The forces of Order have overwhelmed us, and forced us from the stronghold. "
"We must regain control!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhoAreYou_00016818_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The forces of Order have taken control. We must get back into the stronghold!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008260c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The former residents are said to fight for control of the sunken keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e946_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The formula describes many magnitudes of the brew. If you're interested, I "
"wrote a short missive about it for the Imperial Alchemy Symposium."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS39Seen_0004ed74_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The formula looked sound, except it required an extremely rare ingredient. "
"Yes, you guessed it, the Nirnroot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e977_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The formula looked sound, except it required an extremely rare ingredient. "
"Yes, you guessed it, the Nirnroot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09JauffreA_00036668_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The four mightiest Blades of Tiber Septim's day, Alain, Valdemar, Rielus, and "
"Casnar, went to Sancre Tor and never returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_00005678_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The four of us attacking him in unison was as graceful and beautiful as a "
"ballet! The flashing of steel, the spraying of blood! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08JeetumSpeech_000981a1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The four of you have a mission. The settlement of Water's Edge has contracted "
"us to take care of some goblins in the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_mission_000356f1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The four of you here will go. I believe it should suffice, given our record "
"of success. Take this. It will help you in battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038adb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The fragrance, the sharp, startling odor... the sheep's cheese... ambrosia! "
"Nectar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aead_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The front line will arm themselves with axes of war. They will hold the line "
"against the enemy's charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aeae_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The front line will arm themselves with axes of war. They will hold the line "
"against the enemy's charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsHelp_0001da85_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The front line will arm themselves with axes of war. They will hold the line "
"against the enemy's charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsHelp_0001ec27_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The front line will arm themselves with axes of war. They will hold the line "
"against the enemy's charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RogueMage_0002ee53_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The frost burns found on the victims in this case indicate a mage was "
"responsible for their deaths. Likely nothing more than simple robbery. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000329e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The gate has been closed. Finally, thanks to you, the Knights have a real "
"victory on their hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChallengeOrc_0009f9b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The gate is open. Go forth and greet my Chosen Orc."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b61a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The gate may be closed, but some say you slew the Count's son in the process. "
"Is this what defines a hero?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The gate was closed behind us. I heard the townsfolk pounding on the gate. "
"But not for long, because then the screaming began."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ_00002a62_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The gate, once open, cares not who passeth through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad77_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The gates are locked, and the only way to open them is from within the "
"gatehouse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b12_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The gauntlets, eh? They're Areldur's responsibility. Speak to him about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bd95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The general trader and clothier and armorer are on the terraces to the west. "
"The smith is north, next to the wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bd9c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The general trader and smith are near the fountain. The book store is up the "
"street towards the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002d2eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The girl hasn't seemed herself lately. I have no idea what's wrong, but "
"something's really bothering her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028ce3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The girl's either upset that those people were killed or she's an excellent "
"actress. She's still a suspect as far as I'm concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQDaedricMagic_0008b605_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The gods can turn anything to good', or so I piously told those who came to "
"see me for advice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopicElse02_00038a9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The gods don't do a damn thing. Do they even exist? How could anyone tell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetB1_00002adb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The gods grant insight to those they deem worthy. Why and how they act is not "
"predictable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ_00002a64_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The gods, the Eight Attendants of Saint Pelinal when he smote down Umaril the "
"Unfeathered..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The great guardian is dead and gone, his spirit passed away. I wonder if the "
"stranger and I shall cross paths soon some day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_0001a815_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The great library was the height of logic and deduction. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_000807ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The great library was the height of logic and deduction. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d05_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The great mother endures.Mara grants you her endurance. When all else fails "
"you, look to love for the power to carry on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBow_0001f3d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The great thing about bows is that they allow you to kill your foes without "
"getting blood all over your dress. Here you go, dear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture2_0007192c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The greatest objection to First Era dating is that the stones are completely "
"unlike any other examples of First Era architecture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a340_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guards are coming to arrest you for trespassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a34d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guards are coming to arrest you for trespassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224ce_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The guards claim there's no evidence of them, so they won't lift a finger. "
"That's why we have to be the ones to deal with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fines_0003c29a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The guards have imposed new, ridiculously heavy fines for every infraction "
"under the sun. They almost seem to make up laws just for charging fines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d775_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The guards have to clear the ruins first. That won't be easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11TellMe_00038443_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The guards seemed to know about Raynil, and after a search of the house, the "
"body of some beggar was found stashed in our basement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11TellMe_00038443_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The guards sent for Carius, who is an investigator for crimes here in Bruma. "
"In minutes, Raynil convinced Carius that Bradon was a vampire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07FinChoice1A_000275ca_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The guests believe there is a chest of gold hidden in the house, and have "
"agreed to be locked inside until one of them finds it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006261b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild can provide you with some training, but the best trainers are "
"usually very hard to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee41_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The guild frowns on freelance thieves. Are you willing to go to Leyawiin, "
"find the ring, and get it back to Ahdarji?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild has quite a few connections, and it always helps to know the right "
"people, wouldn't you say? You should think about joining."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild has received a 'request' to obtain a unique statuette. It is a bust "
"of Llathasa Indarys, the recently slain Countess of Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild is a wonderful resource for those interested in magic. Talk to "
"Falcar if you wish to join, or any other local guild leader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d27f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild is accepting new members, but it may require some hard work on your "
"part. Are you sure you wish to join?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d27b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild is always accepting new members. You seem capable enough; are you "
"sure you want to join?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00007de5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild is contracted to recover the ring. It matters not that Amusei does "
"not have it. You must get the ring where ever it may be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild is still powerful in Cyrodiil, but poor decisions in the recent "
"past have weakened it. Perhaps killed it. We shall see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild isn't what it once was, but it's still worth being a member. Talk "
"to Dagail if you want to join."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062617_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild lost a good number of members when Traven banned the practice of "
"Necromancy, but some of us stayed behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008674b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guild needs you more than ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild needs you, child. Perhaps it has always needed you; always been "
"waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000748a3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The guild of Mages might know more. Speak with Raminus Polus; he may be able "
"to guide you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild offers access to spells you can't find anywhere else. See Falcar "
"here in town if you'd like to join."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild offers magical supplies to the citizens of Tamriel, but has far "
"greater benefits for its members. Talk to Dagail if you'd like to join."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guild teaches only blade and heavy armor in Leyawiin, but there's "
"freelance athletic and armorer training in town, too, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00015f25_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The guild turns its back on you until the blood price is paid. Until then, "
"leave my sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_0000a0ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guild's been attacked? Did you find anyone alive?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bd93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guilds are in a row, in the center of town below the terraces, north of "
"the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bda2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guilds are inside the north walls, to the west."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bd8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The guilds are near the north wall, Fighters Guild west of the north gate, "
"and Mages Guild to the east."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bd9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guilds are north, near the Great Oak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bd96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The guilds are west of the river, south of the west gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018e5e_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The hallucinogenic spore gas we release into the chamber will help lull the "
"victims into believing the creature means to kill them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OcatoTopic_000add3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The head of the Elder Council and a trusted servant of the Empire. No one is "
"better suited to guide us through these troubled times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014440_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The heart of Syl has been consumed by Arden-Sul's will, and the Demented "
"welcome you with open arms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007dbfe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The heart of Syl has been consumed by Arden-Sul's will, and the Demented "
"welcome you with open arms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaidenShinjiTopic_00146858_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The history books detail his life as a warrior for the Order of Diagna, but "
"he was also the first Blademaster. No Shinji, no Arena. Simple as that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06FlameAgnon_0003e6ad_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The holy Flame can only be lit from the Altars of Despair and Rapture. Alas, "
"the Aureals hold Rapture... for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e63d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The holy Flame of Agnon! You've brought it back to light the Great Torch of "
"New Sheoth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00022b3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The holy book of the Mythic Dawn. Supposedly written by Mehrunes Dagon "
"himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e1d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The horror. The horror."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayCrimeGold_000983a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The hunter can pay his fines to the guards, serve his time, or pay this one "
"half and they will all go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGCastOutTopic_0001e864_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The hunter has performed foul deeds upon other members of the pride. The "
"Thieves Guild prohibits murder, assault and theft against fellow members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07LexReassigned_0001cf43_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The hunter is cast out of the pride. You are no longer a member of the "
"Thieves Guild until the blood price is paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GrandChampionTopic_0002b7a2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The important thing is he's been Grand Champion for nearly a decade. Why? "
"Because nobody's had the guts to face him. The Gray Prince is unbeatable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b585_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The indignity of it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c8b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The infamous Gray Fox! You're the most famous thief in the world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003997_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The information I have for your guild will not be met with smiles and hand-"
"shakes, I fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting01_00002ad9_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The inscription says to \"walk in the faith\" but even now, I do not know "
"what this means."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000135ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The invaders are breaking through! I danced for the rain, but it isn't "
"helping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51Talk_00034820_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The investigator the Countess hired failed to find the thief. I almost feel "
"bad for her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47MageShopTalk_00030132_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"The invisibility is not actually permanent. You can tell the villagers not to "
"worry, it will wear off eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da69_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The ironic thing is that I think the Order of the Virtuous Blood should "
"continue its work. Perhaps I'll speak to the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06TakeJob_0000bf87_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The jail guards in the dungeon will unlock the cell block door if you ask "
"them. Feed the prisoners once a day. I don't care when."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16OcatoB_000add1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The joined blood of kings and gods. The Amulet of Kings. The divine power of "
"Akatosh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a37_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The justice of Julianos guides my blade!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000275cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The key to successfully completing this contract is effectively blending in "
"with the other guests. So for Sithis' sake, do not wear your hood..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinA1_00027101_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "The kind of Gate the Mythic Dawn wants to open here to destroy Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27LastAyleidKing_000a6576_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "The king of Nenalata is the last Ayleid King known to history, true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27LastAyleidKing_000a6576_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The king of Nenalata was the \"last\" simply because all the other kings had "
"been destroyed or driven out of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000917c9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The kitchens are a good place to start, but they are deep in his quarters "
"guarded by more Saints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023c10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The knife I gave you has been coated with a rare poison called Languorwine. "
"You need only cut Motierre once, and he will appear to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Mg12TravenGoOn_000835fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lack of reports from Mucianus has disturbed the Council, and they are now "
"concerned about the legitimacy of his information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028a01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lad's dead, you uncaring fool! Now get away from me before you join him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LordDradEstates_000981fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The land is good, the farm productive. But it's mining the wealth from "
"beneath the land that will make my fortune."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LordDradEstates_000981fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The land is good, the farm productive. The mine's under construction, but "
"once it's working, it will make my fortune."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025055_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The land of the Argonians is a strange place indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044229_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lands of Dementia have a new ruler. Perhaps we'll finally take care of "
"this Scalon problem once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Dementia_00082756_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lands of Dementia reflect the darker side of its residents. It is easy to "
"get lost among the tangle of roots growing out of the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Mania_00082755_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lands of Mania are bright, vibrant, and full of color. You'll find its "
"inhabitants reflect the land itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bcb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lands surrounding Lake Rumare are studded with small settlements, farms, "
"and woodland game reserves. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d272_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The last Associate that came in for training never came back. I guess Falcar "
"really upset him. Deetsan seemed mad about it, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000270e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The last item for the ritual still eludes me, I'm afraid. The Mysterium "
"Xarxes gives up its secrets reluctantly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture4_00071954_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The last period of First Era road-building was in the reign of the last "
"strong Akaviri Potentate, Sidri-Ashak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f42_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The last report I received from Skaleel indicated there was some sort of "
"problem. A blocked passage, or something, that they couldn't get past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyChorrol_0004f219_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The last tenant of Arborwatch has cleaned the place of furniture. I'd "
"recommend stopping by Northern Goods and Trade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042da1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The last thing the Realm needs is one more vagabond sneaking in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007c0a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The latest Black Horse Courier is upsetting. Apparently, more and more people "
"have been trying to contact the Dark Brotherhood. See for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The latest batch of silk is ready, brother Hridi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NivanDalviluTOPIC_0001ebda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The leader of the Dalvilu has been found dead. This is a sad day for all of "
"Bleaker's Way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The legions patrol the roads, and they've always been sufficient. I can't "
"imagine we'll ever be at war with the provinces... not in my lifetime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15Anaxes_00047366_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The lesser creatures of the Eternal Garden still torment us, but Anaxes was "
"the worst. He toyed with us, prolonging our deaths for his pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07WhereLetter_000983a2_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The letter is currently in steward Dairihill's desk. She has lied to Lady "
"Umbranox, telling her that the letter has yet to arrive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The life of a sailor's wife isn't an easy one. Heinrich is at sea nine months "
"out of ten. But Anvil's a friendly town, and the Nine console me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bf56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The lifter of curses returns!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The light of the Divine still shines in your face. You have been chosen by "
"the gods for a holy mission. Do not fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11TheLightTopic_00082650_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The light reveals all secrets, and knows all thoughts. None can hide from it, "
"and it shines in all places."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00082644_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The light shines within us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_00084aa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The light...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047744_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lighthouse is mostly for show. You'd have to be an idiot to try to "
"navigate here by night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice2C_00054030_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lighthouse is... is just outside the city walls. I think the robed man "
"has lived there for quite some time. In... in the cellar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00027992_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The little Dark Elf? She seems a nice enough girl. But to be perfectly "
"honest, I've never trusted their kind.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC2_0002ee66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The little bastard! We took him in when no one else would. This is how he "
"repays us? Talk to Aryarie in Bravil. She's our client. Do the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b1212_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The livestock are dead! Dead! The second sign! Look to the skies! Look to the "
"skies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The local tavern is a good place to find work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsWhiteStallionTopic_000908e3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The lodge lies a short distance north of Leyawiin, on the west bank of the "
"Niben."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonTopic_00044f55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The long-reigning Duke of Mania. A Master of Merriment, if you will. Or if "
"you won't; I suspect it wouldn't matter to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Choice2B_00028031_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The longer we wait, the smaller our window of opportunity. Get ready, and do "
"it quickly. We've got to move soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00033df8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The loss of the Emperor must be a terrible blow to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_00003927_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The lot of us got jumped by a bunch of ogres. Partial to pretty gems, it "
"seems. I'm the only one that survived. If you want the stone, head to Sedor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The lowlands of the Great Forest rise to the upland plateau of the Colovian "
"West."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeCuirassMagic_0001f3da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The magic glow flatters your complexion, dear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MundaneAmulet_00038b02_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The magic masks the true identity of the item. All it takes is a simple "
"command word, and the amulet would be restored to its true state."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002879d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The man is dead, you horse's ass! There's nothing more to tell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_0003cf9b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The manor belongs to Velwyn Benirus. He's the one to speak to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bcc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The manor is finally cleansed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023419_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The manservant's name is Gromm, you say? Sounds like a Nord. Probably a big "
"one. If he catches you, get ready for a serious fight. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10FindJakben_0009ded4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The master is not at home. He is out in the city tonight, searching for his "
"supper. If you value your life intruder, leave before he returns."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10FindJakben_0009ded6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The master is... unavailable until nightfall. It would not be wise to disturb "
"him. If you value your life, you should leave before he gets back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001c0e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The match is all set, my friend! Now get up to that Arena and teach those "
"Yellow Team maggots some manners!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The men around here are mine. You want fresh pickings, go out and scrounge up "
"some leftovers in a settlement or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The merchants in Crucible are getting tired of Brithaur stealing from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactI_00038fb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The merchants of Cyrodiil would sleep more soundly, knowing this Key is gone "
"from the world. But why tell them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Diary_0001822a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The messenger's diary will make a nice companion to the Madstone in my "
"collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043502_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The mighty Gatekeeper has fallen. Fallen like my heart on a cold winter's day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08Honor_000146fd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The monastery is extensive and well guarded, so you should make sure to be "
"well prepared. Should you succeed, I will pay you well for your services."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02TaxesTopic_0003fd45_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The money the city would collect would barely cover the cost of collecting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c1ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The more folks hunting goblins, the better. That's what I say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The more people that drop dead, the more annoying Matilde becomes. She keeps "
"watching over me like some kind of worried grandmother. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture2_00071928_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The most common practice is to place the raising of the runestones within the "
"High First Era Cyrodiil of Empress Hestra and the Reman Emperors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeCuirass_0001f3d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The most important piece of armor. \"Always keep your heart safe,\" Mama "
"always said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HowlingHalls_00043f73_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The most useful thing that I can tell you about Ciirta's followers is that "
"they will not harm anyone who is wearing their robes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000982d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The moths are almost done spinning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceBlackSoulGems_00033635_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The name of the book is \"Necromancer's Moon.\" I'm unclear on the origins of "
"the text, but it does involve these gems you're interested in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f452_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The new Duke is really taking charge of things. Maybe there is hope for the "
"Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f21c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The new Gatekeeper will keep more adventurers in the Fringe. More business "
"for my inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f20f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The new Gatekeeper will keep out those horrible Khajiit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a80ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The new Gray Fox. The cowl suits you. Me? I am much happier without it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The new adventurers! I've seen them! One is as tall as a mountain! Another is "
"composed of pure sound and light!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The new arrival to our land has slain the Gatekeeper! A fine candidate for "
"the Demented!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0000bcce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The new owner sure has turned Benirus Manor around. It's now a welcome "
"addition to our city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029f8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The news from Anvil is terrible! Have you heard about the attack on the "
"Chapel there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_0002501f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The news has not been good. I've heard it said that the daedra have overrun "
"the town of Ald'ruhn. The entire town has been destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The next section of the Mysterium Xarxes is very difficult. I haven't "
"deciphered the rest of the ritual yet. I hope you are making better progress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031524_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The night of the theft, I was in the Great Hall, having an argument with a "
"delivery boy from Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031523_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The night that the painting was stolen, I was in the courtyard of the castle "
"taking star readings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_0006445d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The nobility hate him, but the peasants and the beggars love him, especially "
"in the Waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006234b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The noose around Bruma is tightening. Now that the Mythic Dawn has learned "
"Martin's location, we have to be prepared for the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_0001585a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The note from Thadon, talking about some secret rendezvous with someone from "
"Syl's court. I'm sure it's important to someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_0008e14c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The obelisks are home to strange goings on; stay clear of them unless you "
"wish to be gone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008db90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The obelisks like glass towers tall stood silent until today. \"Stay away "
"from them lest you won't come back,\" is what the people say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_00043f6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The obelisks operate by reflecting and focusing energies in order to create a "
"portal to this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_0008247f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The obelisks operate by reflecting and focusing energies in order to create a "
"portal to this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingH2HFight_00062459_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The offer still stands. You show me how well you can punch, and I'll think "
"about training you. What do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00094074_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The ogres certainly made a mess of this place. Hopefully, by the time you "
"visit us again, we'll have it cleaned up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002872d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The old biddy seems flustered about the murder, but who isn't, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002914_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The old bitterness that seemed so important to me in life -- what is that "
"now? How to weigh that against my very soul?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_000223d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The old fellow? At Weynon Priory? It's a small community outside the walls, "
"southeast of the Chorrol gate, on the Black Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AdamusPhillidaTopic_001778e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The old man? Ha! He's easy to protect. Every day's the same. He vists the "
"Coast Guard station, goes for a swim... never puts himself in harm's way. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The old woman is dead! Murdered! Cut down in this very house! But why? Did "
"she find the gold, and someone wanted it for their own?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The old woman? I'd put her in the same class as you, actually - a peasant.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_000286e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The old woman? She's quite a pest, really. I think she's gotten it into her "
"head that I need mothering, or something. She is sorely mistaken. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The one bottom boot covered for the other, I hear. It's a tough situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_0001778d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The one in Moslin's Inn is your best bet. Nearest where she's being held. The "
"middle of the night, when everyone's at the Gathering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15ForbiddenGrotto_0003c80f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The one path from the Savage Garden is through the Forbidden Grotto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078176_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The only \"Mystery\" is how he stays in business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038580_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The only cave to the west that comes close to the one described in "
"Gelebourne's journal is Boreal Stone Cave. That must be where he's headed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05WhyMe_0002c6df_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The only chance is for a total stranger to enter his dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueClue_0002b526_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The only modern sites that still bear their ancient names are Moranda, "
"Mackamentain, Wenyandawik, Ninendava, and Fanacas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00033956_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The only odd occurrence lately was with Chanel. I have seen her spending a "
"lot of time in the West Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b2fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only one who can teach you anything more about Heavy Armor is Pranal. A "
"master gladiator back in his day, he was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031522_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The only other people who had access to the chamber and were unaccounted for "
"are the court mage, Chanel and the porter Orgnolf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InnofIllOmen_00023e26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only people that stay here are stragglers on the Green Road. Me, I got no "
"place else to be. Besides, I think Manheim is sweet on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004e94a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only piece of advice I can give you is to leave no stone unturned. Good "
"luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0014c72c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only piece of advice I can give you is to leave no stone unturned. Good "
"luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003857e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The only reason he stopped doing that is because we got married, and he "
"wanted to settle down. I'm afraid thanks to Raynil, that time is lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Lost_00018237_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The only strange part was that the command post and Pale Pass were never "
"found. It was dismissed as rumor and the Army of Reman celebrated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only thing I know that resonates around here are the sounds from my "
"bedchambers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17GoOn_000366ed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The only thing that matters is that gem. Do you understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhatShould_00018df6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only thing we can do is let the adventurers complete a cycle through "
"here. I'll be glad to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48SavlianWhatDoing_00098143_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The only thing we can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The only thing we haven't figured out is the markings. See them on the walls? "
"They must relate to the pillar, but I don't know how."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15ForbiddenGrotto_00047361_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "The only way out of the Savage Garden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS43Staff_0004f8bc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The only way she can be rid of it is if someone willingly accepts it. It "
"can't be discarded in any other manner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttack_00012cc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only way to assault the Altar of Despair is down the main passage between "
"the two altars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_00085716_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The only way to close all the Oblivion Gates forever is for me to relight the "
"Dragonfires in the Temple of the One."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06WhatTalking_00002afe_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The only way to free Kellen of his curse is to take it on myself. I am not "
"strong enough to do this, and so I am a failure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactTopic_00026efa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only way to obtain a daedric artifact is through the cults devoted to "
"each of the Daedric Lords."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice1_00014b66_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The only way to protect the Realm from the Greymarch is to place you in the "
"Throne of Madness. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Dreams_0002c6de_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"The only way to save him is to put on the Dreamworld Amulet and go to sleep. "
"Only then can you hopefully find out what's happened in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b18f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only way you can learn more about Destruction magic now is to find Bralsa "
"Andaren. She can train you better than anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Minx01Negative_00015258_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only way you're getting off this boat is when we throw your corpse over "
"the side! Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d14e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The only way you're going to learn anything new now is by doing it yourself, "
"or talking to Gin-Wulm. I'd suggest doing it by yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000292b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The orb appears to be the source of the Aurorans' power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029ca_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The orb restores them to life! How can we defeat them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ClaudeMaricTopic_0002c52b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The original offer is still on the table: this one helps you against Maric in "
"return for half your take. What do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bd4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The original order of the Nine was founded with the intention of safekeeping "
"the Crusader's Relics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004764e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The orrery here is the only one in Cyrodiil. There's one more in "
"Hammerfell... the old one at Stros M'Kai."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagSpeech_000635ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The other Princes, fearful of my power, cursed me with Madness, doomed me to "
"live as Sheogorath, a broken soul reigning in a broken land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstExplainChoices_00018dfd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The other choice is more mental. They are designed to make the adventurers "
"lose their grip on reality, much like the residents of Mania."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The other guests are waiting for you at Summitmist Manor. I suggest you get "
"going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Argonian, remain, First and Last! Beyond the "
"next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Breton, remain, First and Last! Beyond the "
"next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Dark Elf, remain, First and Last! Go now! "
"Beyond the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, High Elf, remain, First and Last! Go now! "
"Beyond the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Imperial, remain, First and Last! Go now! "
"Beyond the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Khajiit, remain, First and Last! Go now! "
"Beyond the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Nord, remain, First and Last! Go now! Beyond "
"the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Orc, remain, First and Last! Go now! Beyond "
"the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Redguard, remain, First and Last! Go now! "
"Beyond the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Praise_0009f9ad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The others are dust! You alone, Wood Elf, remain, First and Last! Go now! "
"Beyond the next gate, your portal waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009811c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The others... taken... they were taken to the tower!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugoTopic_000908d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The outlaw, Black Brugo, is a menace to County Leyawiin. They call his "
"marauders 'Black Bow Bandits' because they use black bows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyChorrol_0004f219_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "The owner, Seed-Neeus, should have everything you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00074a15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The pain redeems me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_00031501_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The painting is all I have left that reminds me of the Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_00031500_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The painting of the Count once again sits in its rightful place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_0003150a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The painting was of my lost love, the Count Valga, and it has been stolen "
"from my bedchamber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_00031505_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The painting will reside with me for the rest of my days as a reminder of the "
"man I once loved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The palace intrigues of the House of Dementia are of no interest to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033592_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The path is yours; lead on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The people have a simple faith in the Nine, and the clerics do their part to "
"heal and comfort them in adversity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_0006171f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The people of New Sheoth must feel some relief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bca5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The people of Nibenay consider themselves to be more civilized and "
"sophisticated than Colovians."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG02TaxesTopic_0003fd45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The people of the waterfront are very poor. Traditionally the city has not "
"collected taxes from them, even though by law they could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro3_00082466_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The people will rally around you. You'll have their love, their admiration, "
"their complaints! Whatever. As long as it keeps them on Our side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The petty worries of lords and dukes mean nothing to me. Syl could torture "
"her entire court to death for all I care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_00035f3d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The pillar has had us stumped for more than a week now, not to mention the "
"injuries it's caused."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreatWelkyndStoneTopic_00027100_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The pinnacle of Ayleid magic. Once every Ayleid city had its Great Stone, but "
"they've all been plundered over the centuries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01FinChoice1A_00023e4b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The pirates have been moving a lot of cargo onboard lately. You may be able "
"to smuggle yourself onboard in one of the packing crates.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Passwall_0008e4fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The place was pretty deserted when I got here. Of course, once I was here, "
"others followed. Can't say I blame them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The plan should work, with the Shadow's blessing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk2_0018d7ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The plane of Oblivion. We know so little about it. What if the Daedra we've "
"seen are only the beginning? I think we should prepare for the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038bc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The plans you found make it clear that the Mythic Dawn will soon move against "
"us here. You must eliminate their agents in Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The pleasure is all mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_0001585e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The pleasure you get from this hasn't escaped me, Herdir. So this time, I'm "
"going to deny you that pleasure. I'll tell you what you want to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The poison of the Elytra can be debilitating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04BribeBeggar_000092c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The poor bugger was arrested. Seems he tried to swindle the Countess. He's "
"rotting in a cell in the castle dungeon now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhereIsAmusei_0004897a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The poor bugger was arrested. Seems he tried to swindle the Countess. He's "
"rotting in a cell in the castle dungeon now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002870c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The poor girl! She's too young, too innocent to be exposed to these horrible "
"murders. I hope she's holding up all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002818b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The poor lad is handling all of this better than I expected. It's a testament "
"to his noble bearing, I'm sure.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The poor lass looks upset. But if she's anything like my daughter, she's "
"tougher than she looks. She'll be all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009f996_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The poor man's terrified."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05HowBad_0000c05c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The poor of the Waterfront are kindred to the Gray Fox, and will not betray "
"him. However, cubs soon get hungry. Soon someone will break."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The poor woman's rather upset. Someone of her bearing isn't accustomed to the "
"horror of murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f4c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The power of Sheogorath doesn't lie in armies. Power comes from the "
"willingness to do things others won't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The prettiest town in Cyrodiil? Don't know, but the ugliest is Bravil. "
"Shabby, tumbledown shacks. They're big shacks, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The prey approaches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06NoBook_00015449_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The prey escapes. Return when you have the book or know that Theranis will "
"return with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EulogyHighElf_0009f9bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The price of failure? A final fanfare for the High Elf. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGCastOutTopic_0001e864_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The pride casts out the hunter until the fine is paid. Is the hunter prepared "
"to pay the fine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13ObeliskAShout_0001acad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The priest has reactivated one of the Obelisks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002be0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The priory has been restored to its former glory, and is now a fitting home "
"for our Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000aa08c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The priory is a chapterhouse of the Order of Talos. And with the last Septim "
"emperor dead, and all his heirs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004e956_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The process of alchemy is much easier when the alchemist isn't being bothered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0005482a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The proof of your defeat lies there bleeding on the floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0014c717_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The prophecies are vague on this point. Cross check it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorsUmaril_00002bca_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The prophet says it's this Umaril, some kind of Ayleid monster and his daedra "
"minions, carrying on like the bad old days thousands of years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a12_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The prophet was right. Anvil was just the beginning. Now the same thing's "
"happened in Bravil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The question is, who gains from the Torch being relit? And who loses? That's "
"what you should be asking yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC3_0003e8f8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The rabble of the Savage Garden have imprisoned the Xivilai Anaxes. I "
"consider his humiliation a fitting punishment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The realm has regained an army. Let's hope it can protect us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11SheogorathFarewell1_00014b59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The realm is dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f234_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The rebuilt the Gatekeeper. I thought they should have done that a long time "
"ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GrandChampionTopic_0002b7a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The reigning Grand Champion is Agronak Gro-Malog. His fighting name is \"The "
"Gray Prince.\" He's an Orc... well, Half-Orc, actually, or so they say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_00003936_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The relic was stolen from us not long ago. A group of men was seen leaving "
"the Chapel the night the stone was stolen. We believe they were bandits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046821_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The residents of Split are still in need of your help. At your earliest "
"convenience of course, My Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a99_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The rest are farmers or herders. Wines are a Skingrad specialty, and the "
"Surilie and Tamika Vineyards are famous all over Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Diary_0001823b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The rest is up to you. My scouts reported bitter cold and dangerous creatures "
"in the area, so they couldn't proceed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275cc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The rest of us have already traded introductions. I'm Matilde Petit. The "
"others are Nels the Naughty, Neville, Dovesi Dran and Primo Antonius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a39_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The righteous fury of Stendarr take you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d30e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The ring belonged to my mother, and has been in the family for generations. "
"I'm willing to give you all the money I have to get it back. 100 gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10ChimeInfo_0001e96f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The ringing of the chimes is said to help call the souls back to Brellach, "
"guiding them to us, so they may return to our Lord's service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10ChimeInfo_00043026_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The ringing of the chimes is said to help call the souls back to Pinnacle "
"Rock, guiding them to us, so they may return to our Lord's service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinB1_00027102_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The risk is great, I know. I was at Kvatch. I saw the terrible power of the "
"daedric siege engine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fdb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The ritual of Purification is complete. Well done. Sithis has been appeased, "
"and the time has come to acknowledge and reward your unwavering loyalty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062670_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The roads near Anvil are safer now, thanks to Carahil and her guild hall. "
"She's an example for us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The rookies took care of all the thieves. How many was it? Seven? Eight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9834_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The room at the end of the hall upstairs is yours for the night, just like we "
"agreed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The room at the end of the hall upstairs is yours for the night. Dream well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0005e078_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The room is 20 gold for the night. You want to stay or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9844_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The room is down below deck. It's the door on the left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0003ab59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The room is upstairs, first door to the left. Sleep well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b6c27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The room's already yours for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9849_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The room's up the stairs, and it'll be the first door on your left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0003b34d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The room's yours for the night. It's just upstairs, the first door on the "
"left. Sleep well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_00014b5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The roots of the Tree of Shades run into the heart of the Shivering Isles. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0007eb5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The roots of the Tree of Shades run into the heart of the Shivering Isles. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The roots of the Tree of Shades run into the heart of the Shivering Isles. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice6_00014b61_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The ruins of Knifepoint Hollow once served as a great library. There, you "
"will find a door. Behind that door, you will find the answer you seek."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan1_00018c82_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The ruins of Xeddefen run under Passwall. The entrance to the south of the "
"town has been sealed for centuries.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan1_00018c83_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The ruins of Xeddefen run under Passwall. The entrance to the south of the "
"town has been sealed for centuries.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05WhyLie_00027f39_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The rules say that he isn't to practice dangerous experiments at his home. It "
"must be done in the guild under the watchful eye of an associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture1_00071942_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The runes for which the stones are named glow in the dark; however, there is "
"no evidence that the stones are magical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32WelkyndStones_00012d1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The sacred stones! You've desecrated them with your touch. You're on the list "
"for sure now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_0001ec0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The sacred symbol of the Empire. Only those of Septim blood can wear it, they "
"say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneTears_00022e62_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The sage told him of an artifact called the Everflow Ewer. The vessel, which "
"looked like a silver pitcher, was said to supply endless water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a7f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The sap of this Tree already flows with the pure essence of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_0006c5c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The scholars and priests can debate what happened to Martin in the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UniqueSummoningTopic_00091914_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The scroll will allow you to call upon Rufio's angry ghost for assistance. He "
"will appear, unleash his anger upon your foes, and then disperse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RogueMage_0002fd69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The scrolls I have given you should protect you from the magic the mage seems "
"to use most frequently, but do not let your guard down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018ff1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The second chamber of Xedilian is the Chamber of Avarice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d58_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The second item is the counterpart to the first: the blood of a Divine. This "
"was a terrible puzzle to me. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45EndChoice2_00081b7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The secret to sneaking is not to be seen. Empty rooms. Empty tombs! Sneak in "
"the dark, though the blind man can see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDRumorAttackResponse1_00002ba4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The servants of Dibella, slaughtered on the very Altar of Love! Truly "
"shocking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhatSecrets_0004b776_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The servants whisper that the Argonians are dragged into the basement and "
"never seen again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006261d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The services provided at the Arcane University are just priceless. You can "
"create your own enchantments there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialSewers_00022cf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The sewers run underneath the whole Imperial City. There are access points in "
"every district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c212_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The shipmaster, Heinrich Oaken-Hull, has a wood elf for a wife. I'd rather "
"sleep with my horse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ForlornWatchman_000366c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The shores near Bravil are no longer haunted. Seems the ghost hasn't been "
"sighted there any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_00030644_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The sigil stone for this Oblivion Gate is the key. As soon as we have it, we "
"shall rid Cheydinhal of its existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The signs I read show the end of my path. My death, a necessary end, will "
"come when it will come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The silk gardens are doing well, brother Hjar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c18a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The sisters are hard to tell apart. It's Ugak you'll want to find if you need "
"a mount, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146cd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The situation grows more dire with each passing day, it seems. I fear where "
"this will end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The situation is not good. We have to act now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetA2_0005e378_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The situation is this. An Obelisk of Order has activated in the Palace "
"courtyard. My Aureals are engaging the Knights as we speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetA2_0001a79c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The situation is this. An Obelisk of Order has activated in the Palace "
"courtyard. My Mazken are engaging the Knights as we speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The sixth guest has finally arrived! Well it's about time! Do you know how "
"long we've been waiting? It seems like an age!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor09_0003246c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The skies are marked with numberless sparks, each a fire, and every one a "
"sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor10_0003246d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The skies are marked with numberless sparks, each a fire, and every one a "
"sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor11_0003246f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The skies are marked with numberless sparks, each a fire, and every one a "
"sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_000c4541_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The skooma trade is making a lot of money for the tribes in Elsweyr, and a "
"lot of that is going to the Renrijra Krin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The slaughtered of Bravil now join their voices to Dibella's children, crying "
"out for righteous vengeance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bd91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The smith is near the harbor. The general trader is to the east, by the "
"river. The mage's shop is between the castle bridge and the harbor bridge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bd8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The smith is next to the north gate. The general trader is in Harborside, "
"outside the wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bda4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The smith, alchemist, and general trader are centrally located inside the "
"north walls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_0006b1b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The sooner we reach Cloud Ruler Temple the better. Lead on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakMineTOPIC_00098202_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The source of my income, of course. I bought it for a song from a foolish "
"Orc. My ogres mine the gold, and I reap the reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofMeridiaTOPIC_0001ebfc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The spark of life is within you, and you are welcome here at Meridia's "
"shrine. It is possible she will speak to you, under certain conditions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics2_00002c71_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The squire who has been waiting for the Commander's return -- it seems he "
"brought the Greaves, out of great peril. It is truly a miracle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00094ebe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The staff and the scamps are gone! You must have made it to Darkfathom Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice5B_0003562e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The staff will allow you to manipulate objects normally out of your reach. A "
"handy, and often amusing, spell. Is this what you'd like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_0008674f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The statue, as you know, is located in the city of Bravil. You may speak with "
"the Night Mother once a week, and then pass that information on to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The stench of fresh blood in the air is thick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003b82c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The stench of fresh blood in the air is thick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenPainting_00031508_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The stolen painting was of Count Valga. Whoever painted it could not do the "
"man justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DraconianMadstoneTopic_00018233_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The stone is a fine bit of Akaviri craftsmanship. Worn like an amulet, this "
"talisman is said to protect the wearer from poisons of any type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinD1_0009226a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The strange thing is, I think you might actually be telling the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00007de4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The stupid lizard hunts with the name Amusei. Find him, find my ring. Make "
"him suffer! Kill him and I will be pleased."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualNoM_00013661_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The successor is invited to a huge celebration... a night of hedonistic "
"revelry; wine, song, and, of course, Greenmote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualNoM_00013661_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The successor then gathers the drug-tainted blood and brings it to the Altar "
"of Arden-Sul in the Sacellum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b58c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The sun and moons transform day to night, but what transforms the mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ae7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The sun and soil here are like my native Hammerfell, but the climate is "
"milder, and the rainfall more reliable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000270e9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The supporting glyphs all point to Oblivion, but the signifier of the main "
"symbol matches nothing ... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MankarCamoranTopic_00022b3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The supposed leader of the Mythic Dawn cult. He wrote the infamous "
"\"Commentaries on the Mysterium Xarxes.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1A_000262d5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The surviving members of the Black Hand know that you're innocent, they know "
"you were only following orders. They believe I am the traitor! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1B_000262d6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The surviving members of the Black Hand know that you're innocent, they know "
"you were only following orders. They believe I am the traitor! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1C_000262d7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The surviving members of the Black Hand know that you're innocent, they know "
"you were only following orders. They believe I am the traitor! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaBetChoice1A_0001e666_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The teams are evenly matched, so you've pretty much got a 50/50 chance of "
"winning. So, which team would you like to bet on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f4af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The tedious to-ings and fro-ings of the armies of Sheogorath are of no "
"interest to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenSpeech_0006e7f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The things I've done to the people of Anvil; the horrible, unspeakable acts "
"I've committed demand repentance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006143b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The things she did.... Well, I heard she atoned for her crimes. She might be "
"willing to train you, I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00019847_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The third chamber of Xedilian is the Chamber of Anathema. Its contents are "
"designed to make sure its the final encounter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b7f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The thought of what might have happened if you and Martin hadn't stopped "
"Dagon's invasion..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ScarTailTopic_00035593_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The three of us were inseperable. When our training was completed, we "
"reluctantly parted ways. But now... Now, the unthinkable has happened!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08JeetumSpeech_0009819f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The three of you should be prepared by now, but as you see we have a new "
"recruit with us as well. I'll need a word with you, recruit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bab5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The tide is turning, my friend. Bruma has been saved, and Martin Septim has "
"claimed his birthright! Soon, all of Oblivion will tremble in fear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bab6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The tide is turning. Bruma has been saved, and Martin Septim has claimed his "
"birthright! It's time for every citizen to do their part... even you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00012cc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The time for speech is ended. Come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002910_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The time has come for you to fulfill your destiny. Umaril lies hid in the "
"ancient fane of Garlas Malatar. You must go there and destroy him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002979_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The time has come, Crusader. You should speak with the prophet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk2_00002baf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The time has come, sir knight! A crusade! Someplace with a high concentration "
"of evil. Morrowind, perhaps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028752_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The time is almost here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001eee2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The time of Cleansing is almost here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036419_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The time of Cleansing is at hand, praise be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00036418_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The time of Preparation is almost over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_0002a86f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The town eccentric. Lives in the big house on the corner, southwest of the "
"Chapel. Don't worry, he's harmless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038aab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The town is very nice, but I advise you get out and see the countryside... "
"the vineyards and farms, pastures and sheepfolds. Lovely mountain country."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00051ea5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The training of thousands has passed through me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18NightConvo_000096e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The traitor is dead, dear Mother. We have come now to ask your blessing. "
"Anoint one of us your Listener, so we can restore the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatAboutSyl_0001b6bb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The traitor must be brought to justice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WhatAboutThadon_0001b6b8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "The traitor must be brought to justice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2A_000262d8_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The traitor somehow switched your orders, and has been sending you to the "
"wrong dead drops. You and I have been deceived, dear friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2B_000262d9_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"The traitor somehow switched your orders, and has been sending you to the "
"wrong dead drops. You and I have been deceived."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMazken_00012cc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The treacherous ones: the Dark Seducers of ill-repute, whose every action "
"drags Sheogorath's holy name through the mud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice2_00014b5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The trees and branches of this Realm feed from a deep font of madness and "
"mystery. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013452_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The triumphant champion returns!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Troll_0001bb35_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The trolls that the thief painted seem to have turned on their creator and "
"killed him. He didn't know the Brush had its risks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c22e_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"The truth has been in front of you since first you were born: the Daedra are "
"the true gods of this universe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechLoremasters_00002d29_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The truth is written in the blood of the innocent, there in the Chapel of "
"Love! Can you not read the ancient runes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The truth of this, well, it is open to interpretation. Being the pragmatic "
"fellow that I am, I side on the practical explanation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06FlameAgnon_000131b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The two Altars, blessed Despair and holy Rapture, feed the great Flame of "
"Agnon above us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinLairs_0000ab69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The two nearest are Timberscar Cave and Cracked Wood Cave. Here, I've marked "
"them on your map. Unfortunately Cropsford is right in between them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c083_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The two ruins lie apart on the surface. But underground, they're connected by "
"some now-flooded tunnels. Wet and dark, yes... but surely unguarded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingZenithar_00002abe_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The two work in harmony -- the natural world providing for the craftsmen. One "
"cannot revere Zenithar without acknowledging the power of Kynareth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Zenithar_00002ac2_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The two work in harmony -- the natural world providing for the craftsmen. One "
"cannot revere Zenithar without acknowledging the power of Kynareth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Zenithar_00002ac3_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The two work in harmony -- the natural world providing for the craftsmen. One "
"cannot revere Zenithar without acknowledging the power of Kynareth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMeridiaSpeech_000579bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The undead are foul, unnatural things. Some of my rivals take pleasure in "
"these abominations. Not Meridia. I wish these creatures destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00022b40_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The usual daedric claptrap of the purifying power of Destruction. They hope "
"to bring Mehrunes Dagon back to Tamriel and give us all a good Cleansing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d244_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The vampire cannot exist in the daylight for long. As the sun's rays strike "
"his flesh, it will burn as if on fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireAshTopic_000977d9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The vampire you seek is powerful, so powerful that those who sought to "
"destroy him were unsuccessful, no matter what they tried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029c6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The vengeance of the Nine upon these foul creatures!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a30_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The vengeance of the gods is upon you, foul beast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_lightthedragonfires_000223e4_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "The very foundation of the Empire is the bond between god and emperor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d043_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The very thought of what Agarmir was doing sickens me. I hope those poor "
"souls rest in peace now that this is over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadowbanishWine_0018d92e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"The vintner made it special for the Legion soldiers posted at the forts when "
"they were active long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarSpeech_0008b0a1_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"The walls between our worlds are crumbling. The Mythic Dawn grows nearer with "
"every rift in the firmament."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bda_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The wars of men undermined the service of the Nine. Do not follow in our "
"mistakes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_0002824a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The way he looked at me. It was flattering at first, and then... oh, who "
"could have done this? Why would anyone kill Nels?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a80_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The weapons and armor of Pelinal Whitestrake, Alessia's comrade, granted to "
"him by the Eight Divines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG02Choice1A_0002e5aa_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"The well is locked, so you'll need the key. Deetsan should have a copy of it. "
"Now get moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006052a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The whole Realm is at risk. Finally everyone can understand what it's like "
"living under a blanket of fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038abb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The whole West Weald is pretty good goblin hunting country. They're thick "
"here in Colovia, along the Valenwood and Elsweyr borders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_00028556_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The whole city is burned right down to the ground. There's no point in even "
"being here. We ought to just get away to someplace safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fe6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The whole thing is a big shame. She's such a nice young girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0018d2fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The whole town is on edge with that Oblivion Gate open just outside the walls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000a80a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The will-o-the-wisp is a luminous being. It has naturalized residences to "
"many types of spells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046660_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The winner of this match will advance to the rank of Bloodletter! Who wants "
"it more, the Yellow Team or the Blue Team? Let's find out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaSpeech_0008ade6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The wizard Arkved has the Orb of Vaermina... snatched from the dreams of my "
"followers and dragged into the waking world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4af_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"The women in the gang picked married men to seduce for just that reason. It "
"was decided the only way to stop this gang was to send in a stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HeardNo_0003d30d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The women in the gang use their wiles to lure men out to some remote location "
"and rob them blind. It's been going on for some time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_000352b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The wood used for staves comes from a grove to the northeast of the Imperial "
"City, near Wellspring Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The workers in Fellmoor aren't too happy with Cindanwe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0005dfc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The world could come crashing down around us any day now. Never know what "
"might save your hide, so I've got a bit of everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The world didn't end. Today, at least. That doesn't mean we're safe tomorrow. "
"Doesn't really mean we're safe now, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c19c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The world needs more folks like Marie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactM_00038fb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The world will be better off with this foul thing gone from it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b9c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "The worst thing is, no one even knows what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSwordTopic_00002bf0_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"The wraith of Lord Vlindrel used the Sword against Sir Roderic. I don't know "
"how it twisted the holy sword to its evil purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetD1_00002b7b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The wraith. It used it against Sir Roderic. I don't know how that evil thing "
"could use the holy weapon, but it did. It screamed as it struck..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071fa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The young folk just don't appreciate a good stick anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002d71e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The youngest Donton? Probably at home. I hear his mother doesn't let him do "
"too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a906_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The... the journal... my father's journal.... It says I'm... I'm part "
"vampire! I thought my father was a nobleman, not some blood-sucking monster!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a907_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"The... the journal... my father's journal.... It says I'm... I'm part "
"vampire! I thought my father was a nobleman, not some blood-sucking monster!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000206b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "The... the lady Syl has fallen? Can this be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08HaskillKnightsTopic3_00043f6a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Their advance can be slowed. By destroying the obelisks, the Knights lose "
"their conduits into the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEArctusSpeech06_0008988e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Their answer to life's trials is viewed through the greenish haze of "
"Greenmote and blurred by the taste of spirits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhatWere_000807b9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Their attraction to the Resonator isn't surprising; it was built from one of "
"the obelisks that dot the Isles they seem to have an affinity for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03KilibanChamberChatter_0008f038_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Their fate is in your hands. Choose Mania or Dementia. Either way, they "
"aren't getting out of Xedilian."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestsOrderTopic_000910f9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Their link to Jyggalag gives them power. As long as their obelisk is active, "
"they cannot truly be killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Their poisons are truly impressive. I prefer to avoid the magnificent "
"creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13ChoiceWhatproblem_000039a4_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Their presence has drawn a group of vampire hunters to town, following rumors "
"of \"vampires in Skingrad.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaE1_000a5607_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Their ultimate demise was wrought by their own civil strife at least as much "
"as by the rebellion of their human slaves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilA1_0001587a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Then ... Martin Septim still lives? There is still hope to stop Mehrunes "
"Dagon's invasion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanIfIDont_0001f42e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then Aleron may not be coming home from his... ahhh, journey, for a very long "
"time. Like permanently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08UrsanneAvenged_0001fdbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then Aleron's death has been avenged. I told him that the gambling would lead "
"to this, that foolish man. But he never listened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06StelaGreetA2_00018f93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I am at your service. The Grakedrig Ulfri commands here. You will wish "
"to speak to her at once, no doubt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic04_000860b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then I await your report."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d284_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I declare you to now be an Associate of the Mages Guild. Welcome to the "
"ranks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22NoCarving_0002af39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I don't understand why you are still here in the Imperial City. You "
"should return to Malada and retrieve the carving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04NoBribeBeggar_0000932e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then I got nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseDecline_000545dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I guess you'll be walking. If your feet get sore, come see me. I'll sell "
"you a proper horse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_000459b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I have no choice but to use force. Our orders come from Lord Sheogorath "
"himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoPayExpelFine_0001e866_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then I have no use for you. Begone until you can pay the fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03NotNow_00002c93_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Then I shall await your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Choice1B_00008b87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I suggest you head back to the safety of the encampment. I have no more "
"time to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23SeridurWalkInt_0001da6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I'll be on my way. Meet me back at my home tomorrow evening if you'd "
"like. For now, I need some time to myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16MartinD_0004bfbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then I'll do the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG10Choice2B_00035f4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I'll have to ask you to leave the way you came in. The guild is "
"conducting official research here, and I can't have anyone interfering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusSewerB3_000a31c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then I'm lucky you're here to save my skin. Come on. Let's do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA1_00002aab_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then I'm sure you will have no trouble finding the Relics on your own. You "
"clearly need no aid from man or god."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06TellKellenLie_00002b8b_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Then I've no choice but to live out the rest of my days here, I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06RumaNo_00024ea2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then Lord Dagon shall drink your blood instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16OcatoC_000add45_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then Martin is gone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice3_00035712_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Then again... someone has to keep you in line. Make sure you don't bring the "
"Guild down around our ears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG04Choice1A_0002ee4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then allow me to explain the task. The Council of Mages has entrusted me with "
"resolving a situation along the Gold Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09SoIHear_00053778_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Then along comes Arnora with a \"plan\" to waylay a tax shipment headed for "
"the Imperial City. We're talking serious gold, complete with armed escorts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice1_00026ae0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then approach the Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice1_00026ae1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then approach the Shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraChoice2_0001ebe5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then be on your way, lest you anger the Lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001cf3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then begone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12RecoverNo_0001823c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then best be on your way. You won't find it by standing around in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03NoBribeBeggar_000092b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then bugger off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11NoneYet_00038586_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then don't go around, flinging accusation and hearsay. If you dare accuse "
"someone of a crime, you must have the proof to back it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRitual_00016ea9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then everything is as it should be. The Ritual was followed, the blood "
"brought to the Altar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseOrgnolf2_00035661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then get away from me and get back to your duties, so I can do mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001cf3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then get out of here until you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_000165f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then get out of my sight until you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001c475_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then get out of my sight until you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingMazoga03_0009381e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeebamNaNo_000860ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then go find him. Tell him I want to see him right now. I'll meet him here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathChoice1_00026b5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then go on and do your approaching. But Malacath wants a present. He likes "
"Troll fat. And he likes only Troll fat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BSylLeaves_0003b81e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then go, Syl. Return to your quarters. Before I send you back in pieces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AThadonLeaves_000206be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then go, Thadon. Have your Greenmote. Take a bath. But leave. Before I "
"decorate my throne with your insides."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor24_00032686_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then go. Take with you my blessings and the hope of the empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic07_000860b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then guide her to Fisherman's Rock. Please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10FinThedretGreeting02_00002c99_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then he is destroyed! We've won -- and you're alive! I have to tell the "
"others!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then hear me, and hear me well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3B_00022ba3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then heed my words, for I will not repeat them. On the Green Road to the "
"north of Bravil lies the Inn of Ill Omen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo02_000908db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then it is only a matter of time? I await your report."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting02b_00002cd5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then it is past time that you learned. If you would serve the Nine, you "
"should know of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001cf1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then it is time for you to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13FarwilSlain_00031c95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then it's a sad day in Cheydinhal. The Knights were boastful louts, but they "
"didn't deserve to be killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189cf9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then it's finally done. The Goblins have paid with their blood, and my wife's "
"brutal slaying is avenged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ChoiceNM_00015455_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then just tell me when you've decided."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Ask_00066f2b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Then last month, one of the bastards got ahold of my leg. Took me right out "
"of the business. But this alchemist, he needs the scales right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHircineChoice2_0001ec60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then leave here. Run away. Run away quickly. Come back when you are worthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001cf1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then leave me alone until you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMolagBalChoice2_00026b43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then leave this place, before the Lord Molag Bal decides that your eternal "
"torment might prove amusing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice2_00026b10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then leave this place, until you have better reason to be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraChoice2_0001ce99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then leave this place. Namira has no business with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANocturnalChoice2_00026ac3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then leave, and forget you have ever seen this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_000174bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then let us trust a bit less to faith, and a bit more to our own strength. I "
"shall guard the medicine cabinet myself. Just in case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS02VelwynEscortChoice1_00009279_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then let's get this over with. I don't relish the thought of spending too "
"long inside of the manor. Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09reject_00014827_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then make your preparations. I will expect you to return soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelicsGreaves_00002c5c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then only the Sword remains to be recovered! And then... we shall finally "
"unleash divine vegeance upon Umaril! I must tell the others..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_00027fc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then pay with your blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Lynch03Final_000151ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then perhaps my sword can find the words that your mouth cannot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaChoice2_0001ec16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then perhaps you should go, lest Vaermina take interest in your dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Choice1B_0003e94e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then please excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12CmdrAnswer3_0001c492_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then prepare for battle! I'll not let this fort fall to the dogs of Reman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09JorundrWay_0005377d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then prepare for the fight of your life! If I fall, you'll just end up "
"rotting in jail with Jorundr. Either way, no gold for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03ReadyForTest_00002be2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then proceed directly to the Grove, as your test has begun. Kynareth may "
"choose to guard you along the way; that is up to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG07Choice1A_0001e068_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then seek Agata, child. She will see the path, and set you on it. I must rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09SoIHear_00053778_Oblivion_RESP8"
msgid ""
"Then she disappears to get \"supplies.\" Suddenly the campsite gets raided by "
"the Bruma City Guard. There's no way they could have found us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da5a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Then sometimes he buys a few books. I asked him once about it, and he said "
"that he goes out of the city on business trips."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedNo_0009ea93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then stop wasting my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseDecline_0004ed8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then stop wasting my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05NoBribeBeggar2_00016251_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then that's my answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ad84_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Then the stars were right, and this is the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38GuardChoice4_0002a870_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then there's nothing I can do. Too bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001cf1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then this conversation is over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00086564_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then to hell with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoBloodPrice_0001cf3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then we are done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopYes_0001e840_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then we can at last rest. I feared had he somehow bested you, I'd be next.  "
"It is fortunate that your skills exceeded his."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelNo_0002503c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then we have no further business at this time. Return when you have gathered "
"the supplies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d48b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Then we'll send you in there where you charm the man and get him to come out "
"to some location we pick to rob him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_00045768_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then we'll settle this the old way. With blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NoPayForger_00015f13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then what are you doing here? Come back when you have the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorTownNo_0003446c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then what do you want with me? I'm a busy man. I don't have time to stand "
"around and chat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07MercConvo_00045f8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then what would you propose? What more can we do? That medicine is keeping "
"Roderick alive. For now, that's the best we can hope for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2B_000224e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then why are we speaking? We have nothing to discuss unless you bring me that "
"book. Now go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2B_00028c0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then why are we speaking? We have nothing to discuss unless you bring me that "
"book. Now go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13Choice2B_00003a7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then why are you bothering me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC3_000a6585_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then why do you interrupt me? You will not find the Crown here. Begone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38NotYet_0001dc2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then why do you waste my time!?  Do as you agreed, and meet me here tomorrow "
"night!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice7B_00028ba6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then why do you waste my time? Begone, I have no more patience for you today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21SorryToBother_00085996_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then why do you waste my time? Jollring! Show her the door, if you please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21SorryToBother_00085993_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then why do you waste my time? Jollring! Show him the door, if you please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice3a_00082093_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you are a coward, as well as a bigot, and we will speak no more of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet1_00018f8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you are free to enter the Shrine of the Flame of Agnon. This key will "
"allow you passage through any door in Cylarne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d289_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you are now an Associate of the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03Chicken_00034ea0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you are wasting my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06UlfriGreetA2_000131b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you have arrived just in time to help us defend the Altar of Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06NoGiveFinal_0001f16a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you have come here to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetB1_00002b80_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you know it is a place of evil. Sir Roderic and I fought our way into "
"the cave, which actually seems to be a buried keep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ChaliceYes_0001330a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you know why I want it back! Can you imagine trying to eat Felldew "
"without it? Disastrous! Curse that woman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_00045769_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you leave me no choice. My duty to Lord Sheogorath requires me to use "
"force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic06_000860b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you must persuade him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelDecline_00026d91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you shall remain suspended from the guild. If this is your attitude, "
"perhaps we are all better off for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice2_00026ae2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you should run along. Fly, fly! Take off, now. Scat! Make tracks. Get "
"going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseTooMuchAnvil_0004ce59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you should start saving for it right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopicCitySwimmer02_0004891b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you want to know about the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you will appreciate my new master's methods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11CiirtaGreetingEnd2_00016b73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you will die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic05_000860b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then you will get Weebam-Na for her. The Argonian is a well-known hunter; he "
"has a house in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo01_000908da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then you'll be eager to be on your way. I won't keep you...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylFindYou_0007fe20_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Then you're safe for now. Speak to no one unless I instruct you to. None of "
"them can be trusted. Do you hear me? None!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_0004576a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then your blood stands forfeit for your crimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_0004576b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then your punishment is death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23KillRoland_0001d4c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then, I'll fight you until my last breath. I won't surrender and admit to a "
"crime I didn't commit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035673_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Then, as I told you, I don't have any new information for you, do I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ChoiceNoHelp2_0001bb30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Then, at the risk of being rude, could you please stop disturbing me? I'm "
"very upset, and the last thing I need are false hopes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaTalk07_00086573_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Then, if you won't tell me why, I won't take you anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00019847_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Then, just as suddenly as we kill him, we revive the adventurer.There are few "
"minds that can stand this type of torture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2b5_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "Then, lead him here, and I'll do the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ06Bears_0018afe0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Then, one day when I was just about to step outside, I saw the culprits. A "
"group of West Weald Bears was dragging away a sheep carcass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice5A_00028ac8_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"Then, these many years later, voila! The brother reappears. It seems the rest "
"of the family did not die in the wilderness after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000c4531_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Then, with a mighty blow, I struck the very ground itself. My true strike "
"sundered the magic of Oblivion and destroyed the gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06GiveBook_00015448_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Theranis is dead? I grieve for him. But at least you have the book. The Gray "
"Fox has sought this book for many years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06GiveBook_000174b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Theranis is dead? I grieve for him. But at least you have the book. The Gray "
"Fox has sought this book for many years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06Theranis_00015f10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Theranis? How did you know about him? He was my cellmate. At least until the "
"Pale Lady took him away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00023cce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are a lot of fine-looking women in Chorrol. But they're all... kind of "
"snooty. And not very nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00023ccf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are a lot of fine-looking women in Chorrol. But they're all... kind of "
"snooty. And not very nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13HunterChoiceWho_000039a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are at least three of them. I know only one by name: a wood elf called "
"Eridor. He's rather good, from what I understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_000607da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are enough people in the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are few things scarier than an Orc with an axe, but you didn't even "
"flinch! That victory brings you up to Warrior rank. Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_00025062_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are foul tidings from Skyrim. The Greybeards speak of the end of all "
"times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000982d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are guards at the top of the stairs. Be as quiet as you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_0008fab3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are intruders at the Gates of Madness. Perhaps you'd care to intervene? "
"I'm sure the Gatekeeper can handle it otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a08_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are knights questing for the Crusader's Relics everywhere these days. "
"It seems that many have heeded the prophet's call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a6f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are loremasters among you, heads so heavy with learning that you cannot "
"raise your eyes to the heavens to see the truth there written!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice1_00026b0f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There are many deals to be made, even with a god. You could find great "
"wealth, or painful death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are many people in the city who interest me, and you are not one of "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a5645_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are more around. Look in the houses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseInquiry_0004d845_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are no finer Chestnut horses to be found anywhere in Cyrodiil. They are "
"not as hardy as most, but only the Black horse is faster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsGuilds_0018bda6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are no guild halls in the City, but the Arcane University is on an "
"island outside the walls, south of the Arboretum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2b5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There are no more options left. Ulrich must be dealt with, and actions speak "
"louder than words. You must do something for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000314e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are no quests for you right now, sir knight. Don't fret, though. The "
"Knights will rise to the occasion once again! Huzzah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07BribeBeggar_0009838f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are none in this city. You might want to try in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_0002878d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are only three of us left! You and I are no killers, so that leaves the "
"old woman! Don't be fooled by her appearance. Matilde is no weakling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002818e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are only three of us left. All those people... dead. And the killer had "
"to be either Primo... or you! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476c1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There are plenty of sights to see, and plenty of places to shop, but the "
"Watch frowns on brawling and adventuring in the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Acrobat. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Agent. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
