"guessing you are an experienced Rogue. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Scout. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Sorcerer. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Thief. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Warrior. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you are an experienced Witchhunter. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e8f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you're an experienced Knight. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusE_0001e901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rats and goblins down there... but from what I've seen of you, I'm "
"guessing you're experienced enough to handle them. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00025013_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rumors that the Nords are attempting to capture the whole of "
"Solstheim, and remove the Imperial fort on the island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006446a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are rumors that there is a new Gray Fox. Nobody knows what happened to "
"the old one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031b75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are seven of them including Farwil. Even though they're a nuisance, I "
"still hope they haven't been hurt... or worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSMiscKotT_000c453c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "There are seven of us here, including myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture3_00071949_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are six commonly recognized varieties of runestone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are smiths in New Sheoth that collect Amber and Madness Ore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_causingtrouble_000535f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are some folks causing trouble, that's for sure. Head over to the Five "
"Claws Lodge. You'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e96d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are some quality books at Mach-Na's. Just don't catch him when he's in "
"a bad mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornVintnerGreetA_0000b621_DLCBattlehornCastle_R"
"ESP1"
msgid ""
"There are some things I need. Here, take this list. It'll tell you all you "
"need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_00049912_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are some things you shouldn't skimp on. Spells are one of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007fde1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are still Knights of Order in the area. I fear that this occupation "
"will not recede until the war is over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a5649_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are still goblins around. Can't you smell them? They're still here! "
"Check the houses!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_goblins_00027f90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are still more out there; I swear I can hear them. Be on your guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006244a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are still poor souls in this world that you have not spoken with. They "
"wait for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are things I like to do. Does this never occur to her? Does she think I "
"live each minute to run her errands for her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00002db7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are things to be done. So many things..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are those who prescribe a mystical quality to the Grove of Reflection "
"in Milchar. If you ask me, the matter is purely practical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice2B_00035628_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are three options for Illusion magic. They are Charm, Paralyze, and "
"Silence. Which would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice2C_0003562c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are three things I can enchant the staff with: Soul Trap, Telekinesis, "
"and Dispel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00054675_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are too many of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009d9f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are torches in the barrel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Positions_00015204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are two good locations to hide; one near here, and one closer to the "
"door. Where do you want me to wait?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082609_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There are two of everything in Split. Even the residents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are two ruined forts south of Bravil. One is close to the road to "
"Leyawiin. The other is out on a point of land that projects into Niben Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are whispers in the halls of the Sanctuary. Some say there is a traitor "
"among us. That the Brotherhood has been... compromised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk4_0006a870_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There are, of course, some other mitigating factors, but I'll need to "
"investigate a bit further. The overall impact on Alchemy is a complete "
"unknown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There certainly aren't any smiths in New Sheoth that collect Amber or Madness "
"Ore. That junk is useless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004ed8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There happens to be a small home for sale in the middle of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_thieves_00002e48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There have been a number of thefts in the area, and witnesses believe the "
"thieves are holed up nearby. Check around, and see what you can learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There he is! To arms!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082603_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is a Khajiit in Crucible who believes the world is about to end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Tree_0008f12b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There is a great deal of runoff from the waters of Mania that collects in "
"Milchar. One particular tree has grown healthy from those waters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackSoulGemMG17_000151f9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There is a group of battlemages tracking the Necromancers carrying the gem. I "
"want you to meet them near the ruins of Silorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is a man in Bliss who feels his doom comes soon. Some say he's wrong "
"and others say he's right, but I say he's a loon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is a place in the Isles that goes by the name Split. If you think "
"everyone there is unique, you don't know the half of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00035678_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There is a related book that needs to be recovered. It was recently loaned to "
"Janus Hassildor, the Count of Skingrad. I'd like you to retrieve it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009573e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is a settlement called Border Watch that your predecessor found rather "
"dull. This, of course, offended Him greatly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_000039a3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"There is a small nuisance I would have you deal with before I tell you what I "
"know. One good turn deserves another, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is an Orc in Crucible who's deathly afraid of cats. Can you believe "
"such a hulking brute would be scared of something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is an orc in Crucible who is deathly afraid of dogs. He loves cats. "
"He's a cat person. Cats are his favorite thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000399d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is an urgent matter which requires your personal attention. This task "
"falls to you, and only you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002dc9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There is another predicament which I believe you can also help resolve, if "
"you feel ready for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c93e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "There is but one path forward, and I hold the key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_0002505b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is grave news from Skyrim. From Falkreath to Windhelm, the foul daedra "
"attack the land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1B_0001648b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is little time. Please prepare yourself as quickly as possible. The "
"entire guild depends on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ed0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is more to Thadon and Syl than they let on. Let's just say... well. You "
"know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is much to learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk3_0018d7f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is much wisdom in your words, my friend. Have you discussed this with "
"the others?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3A_00090795_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There is much work to be done. When you are back in the Sanctuary, speak with "
"Arquen. She will serve as your humble servant and guide.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3B_00090796_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There is much work to be done. When you return to the Sanctuary, speak with "
"Arquen. She will serve as your humble servant and guide.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3C_00090797_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There is much work to be done. When you return to the Sanctuary, speak with "
"Arquen. She will serve as your humble servant and guide.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044215_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is no Great Torch. And it isn't ablaze once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11Reward_00022e1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is no buyer. This is for glory, not for money. Our names will become "
"legend. I also have a personal need for this particular scroll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactD_00038fb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is no disguising the bestial nature of some of the daedric Princes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueClue_0002b526_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There is no guarantee that my sources are correct, of course, but these "
"should at least provide a starting point for your search."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13NarinaMartin1_0002777b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is no need for any formality at this time. I am not Emperor yet. And I "
"am quite new to this notion of being heir to the throne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TidewaterCaveTOPIC_00026abc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is no need to speak of that place. It is a bad place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a80d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "There is no other way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03NoBust_000092a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is nothing here. Stop wasting my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000343e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is nothing more important now than locating Martin and bringing him "
"safely back here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ab0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is nothing more to say. Leave me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetB4_0003e8f5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There is one path from the Savage Garden. I guard that path. In return for "
"your service, I offer you the key to that path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetB4_0003e8f4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There is one way out of the Garden. I guard that path. You will travel that "
"path, and it will bring me honor to defeat you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"There is only one place that is rumored to still contain one: the ruins of "
"the Ayleid city of Miscarcand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00015458_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is only one task with which you should be concerned. Intercept that "
"soul gem before it reaches Mannimarco's hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b59b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is someone watching me. I can tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086784_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There is still a chance to strike back at the Necromancers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas3_00002c3c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is still glory and honor to be won in service to the Nine, never fear. "
"Well, until later, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_0008faad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There is the current situation at the Gates of Madness, Lord. Near Passwall? "
"Surely, you hadn't forgotten...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07FinChoice1A_000275ca_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"There is, of course, no chest of gold. The guests will find no key. After you "
"arrive, the doors will be locked behind you, as everyone expects. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't a Khajiit in Crucible who believes the world is about to end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't a man in Bliss who believes his own house will collapse on him. "
"That would be silly. People in Bliss are completely normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ccaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There isn't any more to say. Please, lay down and sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BGreenmote_000167dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't enough gold or enough jokes in the world that would convince me "
"to tell you where the Greenmote is located."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00026bc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't much else I can do to equip you for this journey. Only to wish "
"you luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03FinKnightsofOrder_000807ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't much more to say about these soulless creatures. No one knows why "
"they invade or where they're from, but they aren't from the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FawilTopic_00033591_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't much more to say. He'll be missed. We'll have to inform the "
"Count... if we get home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038af7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There isn't much more to say. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_00089979_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There isn't much to tell you about Albert Jemane. He was one of my best, then "
"he got greedy. The rest is history."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a7fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There isn't time for idle chatter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_000513bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There may be a connection to Dagail's father. Have you spoken to her about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40JanusAccept_0003ed37_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There may be one left. I have unconfirmed reports of a woman seen near the "
"Corbolo river who fits the description of these witches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000c452d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There may be only three of us left, but we still can match blades with the "
"best of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There may be some... changes. I can't say for sure; you should talk to "
"Deetsan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There must be an exit around here somewhere. I'd explore this place, but I'm "
"afraid I just don't have the courage to do so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a373_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There must be some mistake. You must not be in here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_000805f1_Oblivion_RES"
"P2"
msgid ""
"There must be someone in Crucible who knows more. We should talk to more "
"people about what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There must be something down there worth locking up. Would you mind taking a "
"look, as long as you're here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03WhatToDo_000092b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There never was a client that commissioned the guild to steal Llathasa's "
"bust. Armand used you to flush out an informant that infiltrated the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00049190_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There once was hardy young lad of the sea... A Redguard of courage and honor "
"was he... Sail on, my Cyrus, sail on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuttedMineTOPIC_0001ebea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There our brethren destroyed the vampire Dratik, but all were infected by the "
"abomination, and were doomed to turn themselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There she is! To arms!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItemA_00082433_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There used to be a pygmy skull here, I was sure of it. My very first Oddity. "
"I couldn't have imagined that, could I? ... Well, let's move on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There was a 21 percent chance that Dementia would get a new ruler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48HirtelA_00032d41_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"There was a huge creature... something out of a nightmare... came right over "
"the walls... blasting fire. They swarmed around it... killing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006444e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There was a murder in the Chapel. It happened when a thief was caught trying "
"to rob Llathasa's tomb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG02Choice1A_0002e5aa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There was a particular ring of Burden I was testing some time ago. Another "
"stupid Associate somehow got his hands on it, and managed to misplace it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002db91_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There was an amulet, a family heirloom, that she wore to suppress, and "
"sometimes focus, the visions. She's lost the amulet, and so has lost control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0002d930_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "There was nothing I could do. I just ran. If I hadn't, I'd be dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas3_00002c3f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There was one moment I will never forget, when the Crusader swung... well, "
"perhaps that tale will have to wait for later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ed4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There was only a 16 percent chance Thadon's heart would explode."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00048731_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There was some kind of fight at the Mages Guild. I heard that Falcar "
"disappeared, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Thief_0001bb32_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There was something on the canvas of my painting that I hadn't put there. It "
"looked somewhat like a troll but it was badly done. Then it hit me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00000805_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There were lights spotted at Sundercliff Watch. That place was cursed by "
"Mehrunes Dagon himself, best not to go there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Convo_0002483a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There were others, sir. But they refused to stay put. We tried to convince "
"them it was dangerous, but they left anyway. I guess they didn't make it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There were three guys in the Lelles break-ins? And the new guy didn't let any "
"get away? I like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There would be more corpses to count if someone would get rid of all the "
"doubles around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016480_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There would have been little anyone could do to stop him. Now, however, I "
"believe you have a chance to defeat him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0018d81f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025286_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There you are! Welcome! Welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b359_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"There you are, some of the best combat moves you'll ever learn! You'll need "
"them if you want to last more than five seconds against me in the Arena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There you are. Listen, I've searched every inch of this house. It's sealed up "
"tight. There's no way in or out, and there's nobody hiding anyplace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008585d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There you are. Listen, I've searched every inch of this house. It's sealed up "
"tight. There's no way in or out, and there's nobody hiding anyplace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000412c8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There you can view all the finest Oddities of the Realm. I'm always looking "
"for new exhibits, so be sure to think of me when you see anything Odd!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3A_00022ba2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There you will find a man named Rufio. Kill him, and your initiation into the "
"Dark Brotherhood will be complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3B_00022ba3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There you will find a man named Rufio. Kill him, and your initiation into the "
"Dark Brotherhood will be complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice3C_00022ba4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There you will find a man named Rufio. Kill him, and your initiation into the "
"Dark Brotherhood will be complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40GreetingChoice2_000790c0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There're walls and statues and all sorts of things that can fall on me. Can't "
"have that. Nope. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a495b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's a Malacath shrine west of Fort Sutch, west of the Gold Road to "
"Hammerfell. But I stay away. I like my skin on the outside, in one piece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b984d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's a bed for you if you need it. A mere 10 gold for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a bed, of a sort. It ain't much, but it gets the job done. 10 gold a "
"night if you're interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bcb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's a charge in the air. Been casting some destruction spells?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a fresh bed available to anyone who's got the 10 gold. Would you like "
"it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a killer in here and Matilde needs protection. Who better to defend "
"her but me? I'm keeping my eye on the old woman, don't you worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000897bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a little settlement called Border Watch. It's a nice, peaceful "
"place... and dull, dull, dull. You're going to make their lives interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009760f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a little settlement called Border Watch. It's a nice, peaceful "
"place... and dull, dull, dull. You're going to make their lives interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048909_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's a lot of adventuring action from here south to Blackwood, and "
"everyone comes to me with their gear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a02_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a man at the Chorrol Chapel, living in the undercroft. I heard he's "
"dying of something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a man in Bliss who believes his own house will collapse around him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b129a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a most comfortable bed just downstairs. A wonderful room, and nicely "
"priced at 25 gold a night, if you're interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044232_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a new Duke in the city? Who cares? Go kiss his ass, for all I care. "
"Go on! Go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f20b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a new Gatekeeper guarding the Realm. Uncle Leo thinks it's too "
"little, too late, but I disagree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f21f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a new Gatekeeper. I hope this one doesn't get sick and die like the "
"first one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's a new Gatekeeper. That calls for a toast. Pass the Skooma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a new adventurer in the Isles. I've only counted three dead "
"adventurers before. Maybe this one will make one more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042d93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's a new person in the Isles. I wonder what his blood tastes like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00034027_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a new ship moored up in the Waterfront District. The Marie Elena. "
"It's a galleon, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b124d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a room free, all right. Best you'll find in Bravil, if I do say so. "
"20 gold, and it's yours for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9837_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a room, all right. And a fine room it is -- yours for the night for "
"only 10 gold!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b1245_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's a room, if you need it. 10 gold for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03ElvenBust_00048979_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "There's a rumor going around that the Undercroft may be haunted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03BribeBeggar_000092b0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "There's a rumor going around that the undercroft may be haunted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusNextMove_00022b23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a scholar at the Arcane University. Tar-Meena's her name. Supposed to "
"be an expert on daedric cults."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022498_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's a small matter with which you may be able to assist. It's nothing "
"worth involving your guild in, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b1254_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's a wonderful room available. It's the best I have, and you can use it "
"for the night for a mere 25 gold. Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsSleep_0018bda7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's also the Bloated Float on the Waterfront, but that's not a very nice "
"neighborhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061653_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's always intrigue in Crucible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002969_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "There's always room for improvement, isn't that right Commander?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_knightDontLook_000860ca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "There's an Argonian named Weebam-Na in town. Go get him for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00146008_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's an Orc named Mazoga up at the castle claims she's a knight. Doesn't "
"look like one to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bc9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's an air of Mysticism about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00082600_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's an orc in Crucible who is deathly afraid of cats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043edd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's another mystery in House Dementia. Someone needs to write a book "
"about that place. It'd be a best seller. Lots of intrigue!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's at least one person in every guild hall who offers spells; check at "
"every hall to make sure you don't miss any."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's been nothing unusual about those crystal obelisks. Nothing strange at "
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a21_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's been some terrible trouble at the Chapel in Anvil. All of Dibella's "
"priests and priestesses murdered!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's been trouble with smugglers and Khajiit bandits in the Trans-Niben, "
"but Marius Caro is taking steps to deal with the problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479e5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's crime everywhere! I'm always on the lookout... ehr... WE're always on "
"the lookout. No crime shall go undetected! That's our motto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006fdc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's evil afoot, citizen, and I've little time for chatter. What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e84_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"There's fifty gold pieces in it for you, friend... right then. Off you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_000872de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's got to be some way to end this nightmare!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's islands in Niben Bay no one has visited in a hundred years. No "
"telling what you'll find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b581_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's just no accounting for it. Sad, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's just no use to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c195_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's just something wrong with that guy. And he has an odd smell about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b1669_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's little more to discuss. If they bring me ogre teeth, I'll pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ebc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's more gold in Arena fighting, sure. But contracting with the Guild is "
"safer. And more respectable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk4_0006a86d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's more research to be done, of course, but the initial findings are "
"quite encouraging. I'll let you know when I have some more information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's more to tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d23d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's more to tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000835fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's more work to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD05Choice3_0002c5bd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There's more. Argoth -- he's dead, the artifact gone. Sounds like a set-up. "
"Maybe they made a deal with Blackheart. I don't know. But I'll find out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_00066a5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's much I can show you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0018541f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's never any charge for you, friend. Upstairs, first door on the left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene02Negative_0000c1ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no cook on board the Bloated Float! How dare you try and make a fool "
"of me! After I deal with you, I'll feed your body to the slaughterfish!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09SoIHear_00053778_Oblivion_RESP9"
msgid ""
"There's no doubt she tipped 'em off. But I was one step ahead. I had moved "
"the loot while she was away. Hahaha. My final revenge. Or was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDResponses_00046612_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no doubt that she knows a lot. Years of studying all sorts of things, "
"I'd expect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c587_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no more to say about him. He will not be missed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002b7a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no need to be that way. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b498_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no need to mourn. The Ritual has begun! Be happy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Lynch02Positive_000151e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no one else in our group except the four of us. The Blackwater "
"Brigands don't just take on new members out of the clear blue sky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no place like it in Cyrodiil; it's truly one-of-a-kind. You should "
"think about joining. Dagail can make you a member, if you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_000626c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no place more secure in all of Cyrodiil. I just wish... I wish we "
"could have gotten our Lord Uriel here...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e917_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no point in giving you any more money until you've brought me 10 more "
"Nirnroot samples. Come back when you have them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice4BadDay_00061c4b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's no point in talking about it. Action must be taken. You must... I "
"need you to kill me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ValusOdiilTopic_000224ac_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "There's no point in waiting here any longer. Follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no problem, is there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no reason to avoid them. They're harmless. Why would I lie about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078178_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no reason to shop in that dump."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029be_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "There's no telling what we'll find in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000178c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no time to talk now, prisoner. We've got to keep moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12FithragaerSent_00095024_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's no time. The others... they were waiting for us. They knew we were "
"coming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ06Bears_0018afe0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There's no way I can fight those ferocious beasts off on my own. If you could "
"thin the population a bit, they would probably leave the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00054674_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's no way I'm going in there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilWarning_00047228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's no way for me to cross. But the Master's immortality does have its "
"uses. I will distract the dremora for as long as I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062611_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's not much to do here in the Bruma Guild. If you can get to the Arcane "
"University, though, they let you make your own spells there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025036_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There's nothing I can do for you. You'll have to speak with Raminus Polus at "
"the Arcane University. Only he can lift the suspension."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046661_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's nothing better than watching two eager Bloodletters fighting to the "
"death for fame and glory! But enough talk! Let the battle begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing else to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00143f0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing else to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d763_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing left here for me. I'm getting out as soon as I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing more to do here. Go! Before someone suspects us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3451_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "There's nothing more to say. They're all gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_000b97c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing new I can tell you about jobs for your guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_0008dc32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's nothing strange about those Knights. Nothing stranger than any of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberOneGrow02_00066e46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing to be done here. We must press on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a383a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nothing to see here. Why don't you just go home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0007816e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's nowhere better than the Missing Pauldron."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003ab57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's one available for the night, if you're interested. It'll be 10 gold. "
"What do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c8525_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's one last contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatekeeperChoice2Done_0007eaef_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"There's one sure way to stop a tongue from flapping: cut it out. Shall I "
"demonstrate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c16b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's only one last thing I can say about Marksman training. If you want to "
"be the best, you have to learn from the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Yes_0006ea4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's only one place in all the Isles to get the cure for what I have... "
"Knotty Bramble. I'll mark it on your map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_00031b76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's only one way to remove that gate. Venture inside, find the gate's "
"sigil stone and take it. Once you have it, the gate should be closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's probably a growing pile of bodies near that new Gatekeeper. I should "
"go count them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's really no more I can promote you. After all, you do outrank me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00089001_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's so much I could tell you... so many secrets... but then you'd be in "
"danger, too. It's best if we're not seen talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004995e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's some fine light armor at The Best Defense. Talk to Maro Rufus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's some kind of cover-up going on with the Fighters Guild's Fallen Rock "
"Cave contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002ba4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's some strange Dark Elf in town, asking about Reynald Jemane and his "
"brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00024e6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's someone else here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_00095893_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's someone else here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's someone new in the Realm. One more interloper to watch out for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's someone new in the Shivering Isles. One more person to worry about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00042da6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's someone new in town, I hear. Finally, someone with a wider "
"perspective who can appreciate my art!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's something about Nels I can't quite place. He's not from money, that's "
"obvious. But I don't think he's quite the buffoon he seems, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e991_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's something about Ra'qanar I just don't trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDResponses_0003e98c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's something about him I don't trust. He's quite a brawler though. I "
"wouldn't want to tangle with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e999_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's something about that place that's just a bit off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000498c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"There's something strange about Ida Vlinorman. I heard she was climbing up "
"the chapel, just so she could jump off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Flee_0005c011_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's too many of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003246b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's trouble ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There's trouble ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_0007eb5e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"There, imbue the Staff with power from the Font of Madness. Soak the staff in "
"the waters of the land, and it will open its full power to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41Yes_0006ea4c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"There, on the lowest level of the place, is a pool containing the cure: "
"aquanostrum. Legend has it that it bubbles up from around an old statue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPykeZoeMaleneResponses_00091b4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "There, there, my dear. Everything will be just fine. Don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Medallion_00066eaa_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Therefore, I'll not be needing this anymore. Please, take it as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029bf_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These Aurorans will never stand against the combined might of the Knights of "
"the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b58d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These Dunmer are useless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_00077d0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These Knights are strange creatures, indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_000607db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These adventurers are always causing trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofAzuraTOPIC_00098204_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These are dark times, and people's minds are poisoned by rumors and "
"superstition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05MethredhelJob_0000c05b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These are foul times for us. Armand is under house arrest, again. Our "
"business in the Waterfront is totally shut down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c7c_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"These are people who have prayed to the Night Mother! They request a visit "
"from a Speaker, to arrange someone's assassination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Yes_000452f9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "These are perfect for my research! Thank you. Now go. Shoo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SilencerTopic_0002fdb6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"These are the Silencers. Each Speaker employs his or her own private "
"assassin, to extend their reach and strike forth as necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThreeSigns_00026af5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These are the signs as they were foretold. First, there is the Plague of "
"Vermin. It is said our town will be overrun by disease carrying creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThreeSigns_0006bf17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These are the signs as they were foretold. First, there is the Plague of "
"Vermin. It is said our town will be overrun by disease carrying creatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These are troubled times in Bleaker's Way. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e1ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These are troubling signs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These are very serious charges. If you can get two witnesses to testify "
"against Audens Avidius, I'll arrest him. Otherwise I can't help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEArctusSpeech02_0008988a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These are words that the Maniacs would have you believe are \"sins.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeArrows_00016538_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These arrows will sink deep into your enemy's flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBootsMagic_0001f3cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These boots will keep your toes from getting smashed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033773_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These break-ins must stop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_000356cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These certainly won't be official duties. Fact is, you'll likely be expelled "
"from the Guild if Vilena gets wind of the fact that you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_0002809f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These creatures kidnapped me from my room in the inn while I was sleeping.  I "
"don't know why ... but I'd rather not find out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Beast_0008f559_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These creatures will do for now. However, I'm sure I will eventually get "
"bored with them. Ask me again later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08HaskillKnightsTopic2_00043f69_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"These crystalline obelisks have existed throughout the Realm for all of "
"eternity. You will find they become more active as the Greymarch progresses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000363c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These days I get nervous whenever I see a Watchman. Maybe I'll just stay "
"inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeGauntletsMagic_0001f3dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These gauntlets will keep your hands from being covered in blood and guts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08HaskillKnightsTopic1_00043f68_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"These hearts are a source of power for the agents of Order. You may find them "
"quite useful in certain situations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These invaders that everyone is afraid of don't even exist. I swear, why "
"would someone start a rumor to create panic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Diary_0001823b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"These landmarks are mentioned within the diary. The one referred to as "
"Dragonclaw Rock has been located. I'll mark it on your map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c0a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These mercenary groups tend to be fanatically loyal to whomever leader they "
"follow. Roderick's people will likely fight to the death. Be cautious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture3_00071950_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These names offer few hints to the origin or function of the stones, though "
"they assist scholars in identifying each type of stone on maps"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e139_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These people split in two are sad but such is the will of the god who's mad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These scamps are making my home smell like a barn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RogueMage_0002ee53_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"These scrolls should provide sufficient resistance to frost magic, when and "
"if you do encounter this rogue mage. Use them wisely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004b7b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These stupid scamps are driving me crazy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b580_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "These trees. So perfect. Almost seems like home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046668_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"These warriors want nothing more than to please you, and if they fill their "
"opponents with suffering and pain at the same time, all the better! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d924_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"These will hold an honored place in my collection! I don't know what else to "
"say but thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HowlingHalls_00043f73_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"These zealots believe her to be some sort of savior, or deity, or something. "
"Their doctrine is very confusing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f4e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They SAY the armies have been restored. But you think that's the whole story? "
"Not by half, just you wait and see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_breakins_0003573f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They always come at night, after I've gone to bed. Maybe a mage transports "
"them inside! You can just stay in the shop overnight. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting1_00018702_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They appear out of nowhere at the base of the Spire. We kill five of them, "
"five more come. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting1_00018c81_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They appear out of nowhere at the base of the Spire. We kill five of them, "
"five more come. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10ChimeInfo_0001e96f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They are a key part of the ceremony for restoring fallen comrades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10ChimeInfo_00043026_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They are a key part of the ceremony for restoring fallen comrades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095729_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They are a rather superstitious group, living their lives based on omens and "
"prophecy. One such prophecy, the K'sharra, was of particular interest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035599_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They are called the Boots of Bloody Bounding, and carry a powerful "
"enchantment. I'm sure you will find them most useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08AncestorMoth_00048973_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They are masters of fighting in the dark. If you intend to visit, make sure "
"you bring lots of torches or a lantern or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08BribeBeggar_00015f1b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They are masters of fighting in the dark. If you intend to visit, make sure "
"you bring lots of torches or a lantern or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefend_000131b5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They are overconfident, as usual. We have prepared many traps and ambushes. "
"It will be a glorious slaughter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_0009226b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They are stable portals between our world and Oblivion. They violate the most "
"basic principles of daedric magic. They should be impossible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They argue a lot, but that's just their way. I don't think they're ever "
"really angry with one another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ee25_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They attacked without warning. I was praying in the Chapel when I heard Prior "
"Maborel shout. I had just time to arm myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They began raiding our farm a few days ago. There are more now, and I have no "
"idea where they're coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They built a new Gatekeeper! Yes they did. Yes they did. Aren't you just "
"precious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f20a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They built a new Gatekeeper, did they? Hope they didn't use anything of mine "
"when putting him back together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They call it the 'Stone of Alessia'. And they got it back. That's all I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e096_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They call me 'Hauls-Ropes-Faster'. I don't care. They can't pronounce my "
"Black Marsh name, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e07d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They call me 'Wilhelm the Worm,' because dirt suits me fine. Town lets me "
"live in the warehouse to keep out the rats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e43b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They call me Cutter. For a truly inspired blade, I can forge Madness Ore! "
"Here. Hold onto this parchment. It lists what I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They call me Isleif the Open-Handed. Because I'm so generous..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackSoulGemMG17_000151f9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They can aid you in defeating those that carry the gem. Once you have it, "
"bring it here to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d283_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They can be done in any order, but they all must be sent in to the Council "
"before you can enter the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_00043f6c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They can be overloaded and rendered inert by placing the crystalline hearts "
"of the Knights into the obelisk itself. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_0008247f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They can be overloaded and rendered inert by placing the crystalline hearts "
"of the Knights into the obelisk itself. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They can build a new Gatekeeper, but I can't manage to get anything done. I'm "
"over-tasked, I tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f21d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They can build a new Gatekeeper, but they can't send someone to aid me in "
"fighting these Scalons?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayCrimeGold_000983a5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They can make all your outstanding warrants go away, for only half the price "
"of the fines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032469_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They cannot understand why I trust you. They've not seen what I've seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016b37_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They captured our commander, Dylora, and have her imprisoned somewhere "
"inside. Our first priority must be rescuing her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017d0a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They captured our commander, Staada, and have her imprisoned somewhere "
"inside. Our first priority must be rescuing her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003f152_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They charged me 5 gold for littering! Littering!! I barely make that in a "
"year! These fines are ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They cleared out the Desolate Mine, all right, but the other guys didn't make "
"it, did they."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They cleared out the Desolate Mine, and everybody got out alive. Pretty "
"slick, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017655_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They come to this Arena to see you, so go out there and give the people what "
"they want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12PaleNo_00018236_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They didn't count on Lord Vivec forming an alliance with the Trident-Kings of "
"the Dreugh. From Morrowind, he struck at their rear flank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008e7f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They die quickly if you jejinak them. Jejinak! Jejinak!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45BrethrenTopic_00017788_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They don't like the sunlight much. Dangerous, too. You'll want to avoid them "
"if you can help it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b683_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They doubted my power. Now they'll see!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFellmoorTopic_0003be83_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They dream terrible dreams and one day soon, they will rise up, consume us "
"and the rest of the Shivering Isles. Get out while you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06Story_00002b0d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They dropped to the floor right where he stood, and no one could lift them. "
"It was a sign of the curse placed upon this knight by Stendarr, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice5_000133e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They entered this Realm, and were ill prepared. Their minds are now the "
"property of my Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224b4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They expect me to go with them, but...  I fear in my old age, I'm not the "
"warrior I once was. Would you... would you go in my place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00022b40_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They follow the teachings of Mankar Camoran, who calls for the return of the "
"Mythic Age when Oblivion and the mortal world were not separate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e7f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They follow the teachings of Mankar Camoran, whom they call the Master. A "
"shadowy figure in his own right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00083068_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They gave me no choice. I'm not a violent person, but I can only be pushed so "
"far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c58f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They get the weapon for Argoth, collect the payment, and tell Azani where the "
"mage is. Easy for Blackheart to retrieve the weapon and collect on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They hate water. They hate the land, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They have been plundered one by one over the years, due to their great value "
"to mages and occultists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08KnightsTopic_00018701_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They have been upon us for hours. They have no interest in our surrender. "
"Only our deaths."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_0002c8d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They have caused trouble here as well. But they have gold to pay for the "
"trouble. Things are always better when served with gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13CavernChoiceWhy_000039b4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They have given in to their instincts, and are little more than animals. They "
"need to be exterminated, one way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c231_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "They have tricked you for Ages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03FinKnightsofOrder_000807ba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They haven't walked among us in many hundreds of years. Now that they've "
"returned, there's no telling what may happen to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45DeepOnes_0001778e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They helped us. Made us rich. But there was a terrible price. Blood -- and "
"worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloodwormHelmTopic_0000c08c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They hope to learn enough from it to find some way to fight Mannimarco. I "
"tried to dissuade them, but it was no use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DyloraWhere_00017d0e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They imprisoned Dylora somewhere within Pinnacle Rock. If they killed her, "
"she could return to us, so they keep her hostage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10StaadaWhere_00016b3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They imprisoned Staada somewhere within Brellach. If they killed her, she "
"could return to us through the Wellspring, so they keep her hostage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08BlindMonks_000983ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They live in utter darkness in the secret catacombs. Of course it doesn't "
"affect them because they are blind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f221_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They made a new Gatekeeper. I'd go see him, but that would take effort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS93Choice01B_00095a67_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They made the journey, and arrived back all right, but then... Someone "
"murdered them! All of them! Now their spirits are haunting the ship!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_000825df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They make armor and weapons. Magical ones, if you have the correct matrix."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031c83_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They make grand boasts, and talk a good talk, but that's all they are. The "
"real work goes to us, the City Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They met me at eleven as well. And believe me, I arrived right on time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03ATellMeMore_00018df7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They mistook the Focus Crystals for some sort of religious symbols, and "
"removed them from their rightful places."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b82e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They must not pass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06OpenDoor_0000c20a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They oughta just give you guys a key. But no. I have to keep locking and "
"unlocking the door for the slop drudges. Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024e1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They probably call us 'the Dog People' here in town. Rimalus and I love dogs. "
"We have quite a few. So sweet and well-behaved, you wouldn't believe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They round up people like animals in New Sheoth. I should hunt those nobles. "
"That's what I should do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say Alinor on Summerset Isle is more beautiful. I've never been. For the "
"present, I must count the Imperial City the most glorious in Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ecd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say Thadon is addicted to some drug. I can understand what that's like. "
"The bones call to me like his drug calls to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b209_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say a lost son of Uriel Septim has reappeared in Bruma. Troops are "
"flocking to his banner from all over Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064469_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say a thief actually stole one of the Elder Scrolls from the Imperial "
"Library. Who would have thought it was even possible?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0000080C_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say a whole island, with an inhuman statue, appeared near Bravil. As if "
"the world wasn't crazy enough already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e149_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say books aren't all Sontaire will sell, but I'm not one to kiss and "
"tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_0008e14e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say from the obelisks Knights do spawn; stay clear of them unless you "
"wish to be gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e131_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say his fear of cats extends to the Khajiit, or pretty much anything "
"with furry paws for feet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusA_0001e8e6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They say it's the Dragon Blood, that flows through the veins of every Septim. "
"They see more than lesser men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060509_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say our Lord just took off. Can you believe that? I need a drink. I need "
"the Skooma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a0a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say someone finally laid poor Lord Vlindrel's shade to rest. That's "
"good. He's been haunting these hills for too long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_000c459f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say syndicates of wizards have led a boycott of Imperial goods in the "
"land of the Altmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000af061_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that Akatosh appeared and killed Mehrunes Dagon, right in the middle "
"of the Temple of the One! Do you believe it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that I was selected as Dibella's Primate in large part because of my "
"loving nature and my striking looks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00024e83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that King Helseth has made an alliance with House Dres. Together "
"they pick apart the carcass of ruined Indoril."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029fe_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that Kynareth granted the boots of the Crusader to someone. I can't "
"imagine what he must've gone through to get them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that Oblivion Gates have opened outside cities all across Tamriel! "
"Gods preserve us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a0d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that Pelinal Whitestrake has returned, and will soon put a stop to "
"that Ayleid monster who's been terrorizing the chapels!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that invaders have come to the Shivering Isles. Of course, \"they\" "
"say a lot of things, don't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CurrentEventsResponses_00024e3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that slavery has been abolished in Morrowind. House Dres and Hlaalu "
"have renounced the slave trade, and freed the beastfolk from servitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00002a05_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that someone's taken up the prophet's call, and is questing for the "
"Crusader's Relics. I hope they succeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000029f9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that the priests and priestesses of the Chapel of Dibella have all "
"been murdered! No one even knows who did it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e4c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say that when you murder someone, the Dark Brotherhood comes to you in "
"your sleep. It's how they recruit new members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say the Fighters Guild got all the trolls in Swampy Cave, but I'm still "
"not going anywhere near Harlun's Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0008e4f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say the Gatekeeper's magical. I don't believe in magic. But I do believe "
"in bones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeGauntletsMagic_00016ce9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say the heart anchors the soul to the man. Think of this while the heart "
"of your enemy beats in your hand. Then squeeze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0008e4cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say the keys are sewn up in the Gatekeeper's body. Basically, that means "
"you're not getting in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003406e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say there are a bunch of people holed up in Summitmist Manor. Locked in. "
"Some kind of weird party or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c14b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They say there's a gate opened outside the city! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They say there's a newcomer about. I wonder where he's from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b9a_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They say there's a prophet in Anvil now, preaching about the end of the "
"world. He may have a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDQuestionResponses_000498a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say they treat all their patrons like royalty. From what I've seen, it's "
"the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeShield_0001f3e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They say, \"Behind every great man is a great woman.\" Mama said, \"Men are "
"squishy. Use a shield instead!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They seem at home on land or in the water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They seem to live fine on land and water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally03Tactic2_00017d5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They shall fall before my blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Ally03Tactic2_000181d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They shall fall before my blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcConversation_0007eacd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They should have listened to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcSpectators_0007ead3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They should have listened to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetD_0003e8fe_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They show initiative, and Anaxes doubtless deserves humiliation, but I cannot "
"permit this to continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06CastleJobs_0000bf95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They sometimes need folks to work in the castle. Most are afraid to go up "
"there though. Try asking the butler, Shum gro-Yarug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StrangeLights_0000bed8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They started appearing a few nights ago. Odd, flickering lights. In the "
"morning, there was nothing to see. But they were there at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d496_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They still aren't letting me live this down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_0004992c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They sure do sell food. Yup. You can buy food there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00083066_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They think I don't know. They think I don't see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1dc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They took myself and Ormil, the Float's owner, hostage and put the ship to "
"sea. I have no idea what they're after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15EldamilC2_0003fbe0_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"They tore me to pieces, although I have no doubt they were immediately killed "
"by my companions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ea5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They train blunt, blade, heavy armor, and block in one of the guildhalls. Is "
"it Anvil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001efe0_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"They want an Emperor to tell them what to do. And I haven't the faintest "
"idea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_0001778d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They want to bring back the Deep Ones. I thought I did, too, but ... she's so "
"innocent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32SiegeVitharn_0001b68d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They wanted me to convert Vitharn, but I fooled them. I put them on the list. "
"Oh, yes, they're on the list now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaE1_000a5607_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They were a bitterly divided people, with many warlords vying against each "
"other for power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003570f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They were also brave, and necessary. Because of this, I am hereby naming you "
"Master of the Fighters Guild, effective immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SwordAndArmor_000091f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They were buried with my grandfather in the family tomb. The sword and "
"cuirass were enchanted, and should cover my debt. Please, get them for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SwordAndArmor_000091fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They were buried with my grandfather in the family tomb. The sword and "
"cuirass were enchanted, and should cover my debt. Please, get them for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003857e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They were part of some sort of brotherhood. They would roam Cyrodiil in "
"search of legendary treasures and the like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StrangeLights_0000beda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They were seen around the Swampy Cave. Strange, moving lights. I've never "
"seen anything like it. Old-timers have tales about such things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c2c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They were traveling the road from the Imperial City when a bandit raiding "
"party struck. He barely escaped alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingAbout_00002abc_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They were... they were both killed in an accident when I was young. I became "
"a ward of the crown and was drafted into the Imperial Army."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD04Choice3_0002c5bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They weren't always a threat. Small scale mercenary band, until Ri'Zakar took "
"over. Then came the fat Imperial contracts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11RejectCowl_00022e8c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They will not realize that you are the same person that just took off the "
"cowl. To them, the Gray Fox just vanished into thin air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00015134_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They won't be the first to underestimate the Blades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00093550_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "They won't do me any good in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dc94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They won't make armor and weapons, especially not magic ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005c01c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They worship me from the dark, basking in their misery and filth. Now, "
"though, some would seek to bring light to their darkness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00035c58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They worship the daedra lord Mehrunes Dagon, according to the teachings of "
"their leader, Mankar Camoran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00015f23_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"They would have no qualms about killing you once they had the Icestaff back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinMischief_0002f814_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They'd boast about it just as if they won it in a war, and pretty soon the "
"Cracked Wood tribe would launch a war against THEM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandAuthority_0001d4c7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They'd never believe he was a vampire. I retreated here to the cabin to "
"collect my thoughts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b19_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They'll almost certainly be here long after we're all gone. Certainly after "
"Kellen's family has died out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08ObeliskTopic_00091351_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They'll get more and more active as the Greymarch continues. If they've "
"already taken the Fringe, they must have one there already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_000a31b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They'll pay for the murder of the Emperor. Now that we know who they are, "
"it's only a matter of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're Argonian prisoners, brought here from Black Marsh. They've been told "
"they have to kill you in exchange for their freedom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000897bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're a superstitious bunch. Everything is an omen or a portent. Let's make "
"one come true. Find their shaman and ask about the K'Sharra prophecy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009760e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're a superstitious bunch. Everything is an omen or a portent. Let's make "
"one come true. Find their shaman and ask about the K'Sharra prophecy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189cf9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "They're all I have left of value, but you must have them. I insist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0006edee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're all dead? Well, you'll have to take over for them. Get back there and "
"clear out that mine. Get moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberTwoManEnd02_000732a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're all fake! Just come with me now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d915_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're all gone? I can leave the cave? Oh, thank you! I'm ever so grateful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028c37_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They're all the same, full of mead and something to prove. We lost a lot of "
"good men up there. A lot of good men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're amazing creatures, but hard to kill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0001d112_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're behind us! Wait here, sire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00078180_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're bizarre people. I'm glad they stay out of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're certainly NOT dangerous. They're quite tame, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're coming for me. Those Knights. I should have seen it coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Creatures_000224b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're coming from someplace in the Great Forest. I don't know where, but "
"Rallus may know more by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00078182_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're confused souls, too far from Lord Sheogorath's protection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're dangerous. That's certain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00073007_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're everywhere! Get them! Get them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a10_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're getting into this house somehow, which means there must be a way out "
"as well! We need to find the secret exit and escape this madhouse!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ObelisksTopic_000910fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're getting more active every day. Not a good sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_0003572d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're gone now. Fighters Guild took care of them. And about time the Guild "
"showed some sand. They are 'fighters', aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_vampirehunters_000039bf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're in here to eat every afternoon, and bed down just before midnight. "
"Outside of that, it's none of my business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000517aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're just doing their duty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000a3846_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They're massing as if bracing for an attack. The portal is just outside the "
"city walls through the west gates if you want to see for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalNQDQuestionResponses_0003e987_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're obviously very fond of one another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025deb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're only trying to do their duty. Come, let us play our parts..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35FlawlessPearlsTopic_00078669_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're perfect! Perfect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're quite friendly with newcomers. Just walk up to them and say \"hello.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b20b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're saying some cult murdered the Emperor and are opening the Oblivion "
"Gates. Do you think any of it's true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're saying that the Gatekeeper has been killed. Was it you? Did you do "
"it? Did you get anything good from him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022f13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're the pride of my collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_0014c732_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They're the pride of my collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestsOrderTopic_000910f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're the worst of all. My own subjects, working for the Enemy! It's enough "
"to make an old Daedric Prince get all weepy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're tough to get, but I prefer fresh, and I'll pay well. And I just don't "
"trust those Blackwood Company folks to find them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182cc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're twins, actually. You got to take 'em both out! Now get in there, and "
"show those tree climbers who's boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000356fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're using Hist Sap? And they claim to have brought a tree into Cyrodiil? "
"Amazing. I can't imagine what the sap might do to non-Argonians."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistSapTopic_000a3453_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They're using Hist Sap? And they claim to have brought a tree into Cyrodiil? "
"Amazing. I can't imagine what the sap might do to non-Argonians."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001db22_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They're very serious about it, but I'm sure it's just some boys night out "
"kind of a thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElderCouncilTopic_00037833_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They've been unable to solve the Oblivion Crisis. The Empire is falling "
"apart. Only a legitimate Emperor offers any hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_0002c7bb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They've been undercutting us on contracts ever since, and they've no qualms "
"about accepting jobs no guild member would be caught dead doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004eda0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They've found us! Attack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_00077c6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They've got a nasty bite, as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_0001778d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They've got her down in the caverns. They're going to sacrifice her, you "
"understand? You've got to save her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice2A_00022b6a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "They've heard the same rumors I have about the Necromancers' Cult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They've never been so bold before now. Always hiding in the shadows, staying "
"away from the guild. What could have prompted this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000355a8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They've never been so bold before now. Always hiding in the shadows, staying "
"away from the guild. What could have prompted this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They've never hurt anyone yet, but its never too late for them to start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_000091a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They've opened one right in front of the city gates. Until that Gate is "
"closed, the best I can do is try to hold these barricades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They've reached the Altar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13ObeliskBShout_0001acae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They've reactivated an Obelisk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000253b6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They've sent an enforcer to kill me! His name is Hides-His-Heart, and he's on "
"his way here now! That's why I hired you! So you can fake my death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017473_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They've stopped it up. You... you must make it to the Wellspring, and let the "
"waters flow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017cfa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"They've stopped it up. You... you must make it to the Wellspring, and let the "
"waters flow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SidePassage_00012cbd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"They've strongly fortified the main passage against us. If we attacked "
"through the Underdeep, we could take them by surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090b4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"They've taken it! The Amulet of Kings is gone! The enemy has defeated us at "
"every turn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_0002573e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "They.... they didn't make it? Oh god. They died out there all alone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00049d11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thief in the castle! Thief!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0009fd6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thief! Help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004b774_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thief! I will get Hrormir's Icestaff from you, dead or alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thief! You stole that diary from me. Now I have to wait to get into the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Steal_000252b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thief! You won't get away with this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNocturnal_00018334_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Thieves Guild members revere and respect her power and influence. We give her "
"blessing with the phrase 'may shadow hide you.'"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thieves break in, but they don't break out... they break all over, when I'm "
"finished with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactF_00038fb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thieves everywhere will curse us both for the loss of this ring, my friend. "
"So be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Thing is, this guy used to be a Blade. You know, those guys who protect the "
"Emperor? He's a trained swordsman, so keep your damn head down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078168_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Things Found? More like Things Found in the Trash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00040cc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Things are always such a mess around here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008263f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along nicely here. Soon enough, they'll have no choice but "
"to do everything I say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things are falling apart here. Someone needs to do something about the "
"Blackwood Company situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ebd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things are really slow. You remember the last time we had a new contract?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007fde3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things are still quiet at Xeddefen, Your Grace. However, we are still finding "
"the smaller Obelisks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004872e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things at the Mages Guild seem tense. That Falcar fellow sure keeps a tight "
"rein on things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024ca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things could always be worse. And probably will be. I'm Kurz gro-Baroth. What "
"can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b99_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things go from bad to worse nowadays. Priests murdered on the Chapel altar? "
"What next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004768f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things have been very quiet with the Atius. That suits me just fine. All this "
"fighting is stupid. What are they fighting about? Just stupid pride."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006c296_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Things in the guild have been different since Traven was named Arch-Mage. "
"They're more structured, but everyone seems tense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51Talk_0003481f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Things seem back to normal now. Glad the painting was recovered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004d80d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Think about that offer, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00086023_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Think carefully about what I told you! But I'm sure you'll be fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeMadnessAxeMagic_0001f3ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Think of me fondly when you bury this axe deep into your foe's skull."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBow_00016529_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Think of me when you send arrows to bite into your foe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029f2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Think on this -- what happened here is only the beginning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479c9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Thinking about sticking your paw in my pocket? Go ahead. I'll blow you to "
"cream corn, and the Law will love me for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingBlockTest_00062339_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thinking you know how to use a shield is one thing. Actually using one is "
"quite another. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e12b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thinks his house will collapse in a heap, this foolish man can't even sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Cindanwe_00072c97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thinks she's in charge, treats us as slaves. Do I look like a slave? No. I am "
"a queen, rightful ruler of the Shivering Isles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGRules_0001c154_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Third, don't steal from the poor. The peasants and beggars are under the "
"personal protection of the Gray Fox, particularly here on the Waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thirty-six. That's pretty impressive, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12RecoverYes_0001823d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This Akaviri ring was found with the messenger's diary. It awards the wearer "
"with increased agility and resistance to harmful magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000545d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This Bay horse will serve you well. Try to serve him just as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This Chalice of Reversal sounds like a horrid device. Who would want to spend "
"their time under the effects of some... chemical?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008e136_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This Fork he'll seek while he's still able, sadly the Fork is a flimsy fable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13HunterChoiceWhere_00033f58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This I cannot say. I have refrained from expressing too much interest, lest "
"their attention be turned towards the castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanKey_0001fee5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "This IS my game, and I'm changin' the rules!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0009148e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This Mazken must return to duty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChallengeNord_0009f9b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This Nord is an animal... a glorious beast. Watch her teeth... she bites!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagSpeech_0006356f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This Realm is yours. Perhaps you will grow to your station. Fare thee well, "
"Sheogorath, Prince of Madness. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004351d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This Resonator thing-a-ma-jig. I don't get it. What's it for, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sanctuary_000251f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This Sanctuary has been here since before even I joined the Dark Brotherhood, "
"and that was two-hundred years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f08d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This Undercroft is... well... quite cursed. Any desecration will cause my "
"ancestors to rise from their graves and defend their resting place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038432_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This area is off limits to anyone except the Bruma City Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007cfe0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This area is off limits!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003eac3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This area is off limits, worm! Get back to your cage!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032d9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This area's clear. We've got to get inside and find the Count before it's too "
"late. Move out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09GiveArrowHead_0001482a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This arrowhead advances my plan to... nevermind. I may have need of you again "
"in the near future, if my plans hold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09GiveArrowHead_0001cf36_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This arrowhead advances my plan... nevermind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002928_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "This barrier blocks our advance, and the orb gives power to our foes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c42c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This battle is not over!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This better be good, or you'll regret it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONENTER_0018b2e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This better be good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactB_00038fae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This blade has slain many a hero over the years. Tamriel will be better off "
"without it for a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This business with the Gatekeeper is appalling. Can no one maintain order "
"around here? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000d432_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "This came for you, ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000d431_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "This came for you, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenEmperor_0000bcaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This can only lead to your death. My guardians are sworn to protect me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a5655_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This can't be happening. This is horrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03LewinC1Idle01_0008ea88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This can't be right... I got a bad feeling about this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngerReceive_00024260_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This cannot be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreA1_00092d81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This cannot be. No one but the Emperor is permitted to handle the Amulet. Let "
"me see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem11_00082429_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This case here I'm saving for something special. Wouldn't you like to be the "
"one to find something Odd enough to go on display here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem3_00081eb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This case is waiting for something especially Odd. If you run across anything "
"Odd, be sure to bring it by and it might end up on display here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KSharraProphecy_000b1220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This certainly seems like one of the signs. It is unnatural to have this many "
"rats gather in one place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000352a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This citizen is accusing you of stealing the bust of Llathasa from "
"Cheydinhal. I even found the bust in your cabinet. What do you have to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047699_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This city life is killing me. Work all day long. Drop dead, and they toss you "
"in Lake Rumare. Just need to make my money at the Arena and live easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This contract requires stealth and subtlety. You possess neither. When you "
"fail, I will gladly take your place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice1A_0002f880_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This contract will require a bit of detective work. I suggest you speak to "
"your fellow Brothers and Sisters and see if they can offer any advice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArgonianBloodTopic_00053740_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This dagger has been specially treated. All you need to do is stab an "
"Argonian with it, and there'll be enough blood on it to use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033596_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This day will be remembered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillBodyParts_00081daa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This decision is yours. I'm sure Your Grace possesses the wisdom to choose "
"the pieces that will allow the Gatekeeper to best defend the Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00024670_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This doesn't concern you, prisoner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029e0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "This doesn't look familiar. I think we're going the wrong way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e1ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This doesn't look good. Not good at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095e29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This ends as it always does. Order shall reign!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d267_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This ends here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_000221f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This evil book was written by Mehrunes Dagon himself, and given by him to "
"Mankar Camoran."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018e5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This first chamber is the Chamber of the Gnarl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00037cf2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This fortress is well-supplied with arms and armor. Use what you need from "
"the armory in the east wing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_000151f8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This gem needs to be confiscated and brought here, before it can be delivered "
"to the King of Worms and used against us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This ground is sacred. Show respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FishermansRockTopicWhy_000860d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This guy, Mogens Wind-Shifter, he camps at Fisherman's Rock. So you take me "
"there, and I talk to him, and then we see what happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006a82b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This had better be good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_000957fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This hardly seems the time to summon me. Not when Order is busy invading My "
"Realm. Your mortals are just a hoot. I hate hoots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk3_0018d7f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This has been a concern of mine as well. And I take it the others, they're of "
"the same mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38GuardWarnChoice1_00023688_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This has gone far enough. It's past time I dealt with this madman once and "
"for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016e95_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This has never happened before! The ruler of Dementia turning traitor? "
"Unprecedented! I've seen others defect, but never a Duke!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014442_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This has never happened before! The ruler of Mania turning traitor? "
"Unprecedented! But different is good. A new act in this play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0009ea95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This here's a respectable establishment! Come back when you've got the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002974c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This house is a deathtrap! We're being killed off, one by one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bc1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This humble Legion soldier is at your service. How can I help a fellow "
"citizen of the Empire?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000cd301_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is Lynda Carter..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e88a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This is a Dark Elf bar. Cursing, spitting, and screaming? No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DinnerParty_0001c250_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a classy event. I don't know you. I don't like you. And you're not "
"dressed for it, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is a grand day. Greetings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002fd6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a harsh, dangerous task for you, I realize. Your unfamiliar face "
"makes you most useful, however."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a31b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is a hold up. Hand it over or die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem6_00081ec8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a lovely little Oddity -- a two-headed Septim! Take your time, "
"there's no rush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081a53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is a particularly exciting turn of events, is it not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37SdrassaHelp_00022e5f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"This is a personal errand, you must understand. Just between you and I. The "
"Mages Guild has nothing to do with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251da_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This is a personal matter, and will have no bearing on your standing within "
"the Dark Brotherhood. Would you like to hear more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e823_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a private gathering of our... society. You may watch, but don't "
"interfere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001d0e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is a restricted area, I'm afraid. Guild mages only."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_00062270_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is a restricted area, citizen. Leave now, or face the consequences."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d58_Oblivion_RESP8"
msgid ""
"This is a secret remembered only by the Blades, passed down from one "
"Grandmaster to the next. Jauffre should tell it to you himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002d590_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This is a situation we can both benefit from, Associate. You do me a small "
"favor, and I'll happily send along a glowing recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b46e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a stopgap hello because none of the other Hellos have blank LinkFrom "
"lists. Mark will fix this soon, I bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095a62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a travesty. A complete and utter travesty. The crystal ball is just "
"sitting there in the hold, but I'll be damned if I'm going back onboard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004530e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is a wonderful start for my new bestiary. Well worth the price. Here you "
"go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is a wondrous encounter. Welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11CalmDown_00038442_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This is all happening so fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4568_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is all so grisly and horrible, isn't it? The blood and bodies... But "
"I've won so much money! I can't stop betting! I think I need help..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028221_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is all so strange, isn't it? I don't know why I was invited to come "
"here, but the gold could really help my family. I do hope I find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_00046669_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is an important match, for the winner will advance to the esteemed rank "
"of Gladiator! So without further ado, let the battle begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000c0a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is an outrage! This contract should have gone to me! My stealth skills "
"are unmatched! You will never succeed! Never!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04FinChoice1A_000253d7_Oblivion_RESP9"
msgid ""
"This is an unusual contract. Motierre had to make a special arrangement with "
"us before it was approved. I trust in your professionalism."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is an unwelcome surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061782_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is bad news for Bliss. The news is not better in Crucible, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a31_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "This is for Anvil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e94b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This is fortunate, as I also seek the cure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is going to be fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061c6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is good news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04accept_00035dde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is good. Go to Leyawiin. Speak with Ahdarji and help her find her ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_000171fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is good. Your honor is restored. Your overdue promotion may now be "
"granted. I am promoting you to Prowler in the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AzaniBlackheartTOPIC_0002c59e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is his stronghold. Where the Blackwood Company supposedly defeated him. "
"Something's not right here. Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c24d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This is important to the Countess, and no one is going to muck it up. Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is impossible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberThreeMan02_000781ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is impossible! Nothing killed me! I didn't even get a chance to fight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice7A_00028c7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is incredible! I never thought to see this sword again! How did you ... "
"never mind, one should not look a gift horse in the mouth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000ca29_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is indeed a dark day for all of us left. But I thank you for risking "
"your own life to help us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49DukeDeadNice_00091c59_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This is indeed a dark day for all of us left. But I thank you for risking "
"your own life to help us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is insane. We're being hunted down one by one. There must be a way out "
"of this madhouse!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27Voice_000a9349_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is it! Just as Sorcalin described it! Follow me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000151f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is it. The entrance to Silorn is just ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007bac0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is it. The entrance to the passage is right here. I'll unlock it for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005422a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is kind of exciting, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is madness! There are now only three of us left -- myself, you and "
"Primo. I know I'm not the killer, but what about Primo? What about you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_000256f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is most disturbing. We can only hope this madness is over soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c99f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is my first posting after Arcane University. The Countess and Burd like "
"my work well enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10AldosTalk_0003c2cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is my house! Get out of the way... move, I say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS93Choice01B_00095a67_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This is my ship, you see. The Serpent's Wake. I hired the crew to sail to "
"Summerset Isle to retrieve a family heirloom, my mother's crystal ball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_0018d846_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is neither the time nor the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0001cb79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is no joke, Antus, and it's nothing to be excited about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00046308_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is no place I ever wanted to find myself. I don't see how we can ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00012cc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is no place for a mortal. We are about to join battle against the "
"Mazken. You'd best stand aside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024853_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This is no place for you. Get back to the encampment at once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006a855_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is no time for gossip mongering. A dark destiny awaits us. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is no time for talking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013916_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "This is no time to talk! Keep your guard up, and watch your back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002249e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is no time to talk! Keep your guard up, and watch your back! We've got "
"to kill all of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000327c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is none of your business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40RewardVampire_000a3df7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is not a gift to be taken lightly. It may cause you harm in the long "
"run, but at least you already know a way to rid yourself of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_000240c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is not a matter for levity. If you have truly found the book, I expect "
"you to bring it here once you have possession of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15OrtheEldamil_0003eab8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is not one of Mankar Camoran's chattels from the Garden. Who is he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15OrtheEldamil_0003eab9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is not one of Mankar Camoran's chattels from the Garden. Who is she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BSylLeaves_0003b81b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is not over, Madgod. I give myself to Jyggalag. As a Priest of Order, "
"I'll be safe. Your empire will crumble before the armies of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AnotherTask_000a657c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is not quite in your usual line of work, but I hope you can help me just "
"the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_000245a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is not something I would tell the likes of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13CavernChoiceWhy_000039b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is not the first time such a thing has happened, however."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is not your affair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029f84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is official business. Do not interfere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029f85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is official business. Do not interfere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d828_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is one of our best Bay horses. Take good care of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d16e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is one of our finest White horses. Take good care of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b91_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is only the beginning. Umaril has returned, as foretold by Pelinal "
"Whitestrake in his dying breath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000359c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is only the beginning. Worse is yet to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002875c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is our one chance -- don't screw it up for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043eb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is preposterous. Were I in charge, the culprits would've been found and "
"executed immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033b3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is so embarrassing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokC1Idle01_0008ea6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is supposed to scare us? Ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000add08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is terrible news. Under normal circumstances, I would dispatch a legion "
"or two to Bruma immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_00061793_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is terrible. Just terrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d827_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is the Bay Roan stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d826_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is the Bay Roan stables. Are you interested in a horse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15GaiarAlataTopic_00015880_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This is the Savage Garden. At the top of that mountain lies the Terrace of "
"Dawn, which leads up to Mankar Camoran's palace... Carac Agaialor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005421f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is the Wildeye Stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11LastHeist_0001fb4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is the big one. This is the heist that will be written about and talked "
"about for decades to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047657_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is the only book store in the city. There's also Renoit's Books in "
"Chorrol, Mach-Na's in Cheydinhal, and Southern Books in Leyawiin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MustRecoverAmulet_00027746_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is the only way to stop this invasion from Oblivion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000242ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is the part where you fall down and bleed to death!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05WhatIsPlan_0000c05d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "This is the perfect time. Will you help us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26ItiusResponse_00098393_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is the second complaint against Audens. I will personally go and arrest "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofAzuraTOPIC_0001ebe9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is the shrine of Azura, Queen of the Dawn and the Dusk. What is your "
"business here, traveller?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029e1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "This is the way Sir Roderick and I came."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetC1_00016d02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is true. Very little surprises me, but your successes against the "
"advance of Order have left me astonished. Speechless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014e87_AltarDeluxe_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This is truly a heroic feat, and I feel that, with your help, we might "
"prevail against the Enemy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TamrielGateResponses_000257f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is unbelievable. How can the gods let this happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity5_00081e86_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "This is unsual! The ashes of a famous madman are perfect for my Museum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting03_00002ad5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is what I know. As I said, my faith was weak. I did not understand the "
"test and I fell from the platform each time I tried to cross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_000949e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is what the Madgod sends against me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095786_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is when I should smite you. Give you a serious smiting. Completely "
"smitten. When I tell you to do something, I generally mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor19_00032681_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is where my journey ends. For you though, the road is long and "
"dangerous. Now, give me your hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialPalace_0018ae7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is where the Emperor lives, when there is one. The council meets on the "
"first floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b359_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This is wonderful news! The words of the Lord Lovidicus himself! Perfect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0000a100_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This is worse than I thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ccb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is your last chance to get ready. Once you're asleep, there's no coming "
"back until Henantier awakens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_000301fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This is your last warning! Get out, or I'll arrest you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002a36f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is your last warning! Get out, or I'll call the guards and have you "
"arrested!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This is your out, friend. Leave it alone. How about we just march on back to "
"the shrine and tell Clavicus the deal is off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bcc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This isn't my idea of a good time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002879f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This isn't the work of some greedy house guest. There's an assassin among us, "
"you mark my words. We must watch ourselves at every step."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_001778ca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This just keeps getting better and better. What do you want me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05FoundMythicDawn_00022cf0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This just might be the break we've been looking for! Good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This lady wants to study Daedra, so she buys a guild contract. You ever heard "
"of anything so goofy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11Peaceful_0003858b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This leaves me with little choice. Either I fight you now, and have a chance "
"at freedom, or I surrender and rot in a city dungeon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice3WhatTask_00061c4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This life, it's... well, it's too painful. Everywhere I look, I see death, "
"dying, and decay. When I dream, I see a world without sunshine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShadeoftheRevenant_0000357b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This lists several locations. The first is \"The Dark Fissure,\" which I "
"recognize; it's a cave in the mountains south of Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3839_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This location is supposed to be secret. Not secret enough, obviously...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity3_00043429_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"This looks just like the one I have... well, had in the Museum. It seems to "
"have been misplaced. I wish I had the funds to buy it off you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFellmoorTopic_0003be83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This looks like a farm, doesn't it? That's what they want you to think. Truth "
"be told, these plants are monsters. They sleep... below the water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressPlans_00020084_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This makes for grim reading. The Mythic Dawn did not take long to locate "
"Martin again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004665e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This match is a battle of the Brawlers! Let your voices be heard, as these "
"brave warriors fight for glory! Combatants... begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This match is mine, weakling!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_0009839a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This matter will have to wait. I hold court in the great hall in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_00035ca5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This may be the stupidest thing I've ever done, but I'll testify against "
"Audens Avidius. I suppose someone has to stand up to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_000363be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This may be the stupidest thing I've ever done, but I'll testify against "
"Audens Avidius. I suppose someone has to stand up to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_0002d0c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This maze truly has a familiar feel ... as if I've seen it in my dreams. But "
"no dream could be this vivid, or last this long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48StartCombatShouts_00082c8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This must be what Menian was talking about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This next one's a Breton. He looks like a bit of a dandy, but he's deadly "
"with a blade. He has more experience than you, so be prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This next opponent is a Redguard. I've seen him fight with both a mace and a "
"sword, so be ready for either one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This next opponent is your standard axe-armed Orc. He's in a Heavy Raiment, "
"and looks pretty fit. Nothin' you can't handle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000366cb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This noble deed will not go unrewarded. Look upon the ground in this prison. "
"There you will find a map to my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_000a31bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This old place is the one thing that gives me some sense of certainty in "
"these uncertain times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoPayFines_000983a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This one hopes the hunter enjoys the cage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGDoyen_0001d4d4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This one is a Doyen. Armand Christophe is a Doyen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem8_0008242e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This one is perhaps more unusual than truly Odd, but some people enjoy it. "
"Truth be told, I only display it as a favor to the donor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireAshTopic_000977d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This one is... difficult. It may be quite a trial for you. But if you are "
"successful, it will make the cure all the more worth it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAPeryiteSpeech_0008c268_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This one moves! A welcome change. So, mortal, you have found my shrine, and "
"you have seen my followers. They are an embarrassment to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c825_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This one still waits for what he earned. Do you have a better answer than "
"last time we spoke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNoPayExpelFine_0001e867_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This one turns her back on the hunter. Return when the fine can be paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00Voice_000817c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This one's mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutStartCombat_00054fa9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This one's mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00014a36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This one's mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024e51_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This pact must be sealed with red-drink, the blood of Lord Dagon's enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_00035f3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This place has been nothing but trouble, as far as I'm concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting2_00018e6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This place is a nightmare! Knights everywhere, these priests, and whatever "
"they've done to Felas! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003359b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This place is cursed... we must not let its spoiled ichor spill into our fair "
"lands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokC3Idle01_0008ea85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This place is giving me the creeps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This place is sacred. Please respect our privacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This place is so strange. Dreamworld, you say? It's more like a nightmare. I "
"don't like this place at all. I feel like I shouldn't be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This place makes me uneasy. Let's tread wisely and make our way quickly to "
"the basement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CloudRulerTempleTopic_0003406a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This place was built by Reman Cyrodiil's Akaviri Dragonguard, at the founding "
"of the Second Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This prisoner, why give him a chance to escape, or fight back? Pierce his "
"heart with an arrow, right through the bars of the cell. Quick and easy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This rat thing sounds fishy to me. Well. 'Ratty', I guess. You think the "
"rookie can handle it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03ATellMeMore_00018df7_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"This rendered the Resonator inert and Xedilian completely useless. Luckily, "
"you came along and placed Xedilian back into operation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00084b3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This reunion will be the happiest day of my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem3_00081eaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This right here is one of my favorites. A lump of amber in the shape of Lord "
"Sheogorath's head! The wonders of nature never cease to amaze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem3_0008f58b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This right here is one of my favorites. A lump of amber in the shape of your "
"head, my Lord! A very popular item, too, if I may be so bold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11StrangersRing_00022e6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This ring belonged to my husband! He has been missing for over 10 years. For "
"some reason, his name and face escape me at the moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This scent is foul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeShieldMagic_00016ced_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This shield, like a true friend, is always willing to take a good beating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This ship doesn't move 'til I know that Ormil's safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcCaptainOrders_00018fbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This should be easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0003e455_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "This should be good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37ApprenticeSpell_0007b223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This spell might do for a Baliwog or an Elytra Hatchling. Don't try it on "
"anything tougher, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice5C_0003562f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This staff will allow you to nullify magic protecting your enemies. If you'd "
"prefer another enchantment, we can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice5A_0003562d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This staff will allow you to trap the souls of enemies you defeat, if you can "
"do so before the effect wears off. Is this acceptable?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG10reject_0001530a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This task can wait, at least for a little while. Return when you are ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003ccac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This thing you've done goes beyond what I would have expected from you. "
"You've chosen a dark path, and I shall help you get there sooner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07JyggalagTopic_000911f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This time, I'll beat him. I can't stand losing. And I don't mind cheating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bee5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This time, however, it comes from Arch-Mage Traven himself. You should go see "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40MelisandeRumor_0003f290_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This time, however, you've heard correctly. I might know a thing or two about "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d037_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This time, it wasn't to take something away from the graveyard, it was to add "
"something. I'm afraid all I can offer you is an unmarked grave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PasswallTopic_000186ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This town has stood on the edge of the Shivering Isles since they were borne "
"from the mists of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PasswallTopic_00018c7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This town has stood on the edge of the Shivering Isles since they were borne "
"from the mists of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistTreeTopic_0003570c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This tree is the source of our problems. It is an abomination of nature, and "
"it must be destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16OcatoE_000add1e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This victory is not without cost. We've lost Martin Septim. What an emperor "
"he might have made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MustRecoverAmulet_00027746_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This war has seemed hopeless to me, but what else was there to do but hold on "
"and wait for a hero to arise to save us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06PaleLady_0000bd59_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "This was Theranis' third time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_0008571a_Oblivion_RESP8"
msgid ""
"This was the essence of Mankar Camoran's plot. He was undone only by the "
"merest... chance... but his complete victory remains perilously close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00090991_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This wasn't part of the plan, was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_000980ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033fc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This whole business of being heir to the throne will take some getting used "
"to.  Please bear with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefendA1_000131b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This will be a glorious day! Cylarne will finally be free of the Aureals. "
"Follow me. We're expecting the attack at any moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004e94b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This will be my greatest achievement yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_0001cf39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This will help to erase the stain on the Thieves Guild. Here is the reward "
"the Gray Fox promised you for fetching those boots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinCHoice2C_0004ce4b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"This will make it look like a simple murder, Phillida will be none the wiser, "
"and you'll receive a nice bonus. Now go, and may Sithis go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice2A_0004ce49_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"This will make it look like a simple murder, Phillida will be none the wiser, "
"and you'll receive a nice bonus. Now go, and may Sithis go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice2B_0004ce4a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"This will make it look like a simple murder, Phillida will be none the wiser, "
"and you'll receive a nice bonus. Now go, and may Sithis go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngerReceive_00024262_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This will not do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "This won't be the end of my story! Stay away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SilencerTopic_0002fdb6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"This you already know. What is not commonly known among our family members is "
"that the Black Hand employs a few... additional numbers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting03_00002c11_Knights_RESP6"
msgid ""
"This you must do, and you must not fail. You will not, because the Nine fight "
"with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ef4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This'd be a good time to have a friend with an ear to the ground, what with "
"all the crazy goings-ons in Crucible, you know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice3_000356f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"This? Why, it is a gift from the swamps of Argonia. Sap of the Hist. A "
"present from my homeland. The Hist are generous to us. So generous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001cdfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thoronir better pray he had no knowledge of Agarmir's grave robbing, or the "
"Watch will have his head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThoronirTopic_0001e7cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thoronir didn't turn out to be such a bad fellow after all. I'm glad he "
"decided to join the Society."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_0004991c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thoronir is quite a character. He's dirty and underhanded, but he provides a "
"service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049919_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thoronir isn't too picky, which is nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004765c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Thoronir welcomes you to The Copious Coinpurse. Such a pleasure. How can I "
"serve you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049917_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thoronir will buy almost anything. And I mean anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhatWere_000807b9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Those \"beings\" as you call them aren't beings at all. They are the soulless "
"abominations known as the Knights of Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002946_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those Aurorans must have been the same creatures that desecrated the Chapels "
"of Anvil and Bravil. Thank the Nine that you stopped them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c208_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those Destruction spells are dangerous. I hope the Mages Guild keeps a tight "
"lid on that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those Fanatics are so tiresome. Do they have to interrupt our feast?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189cfc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those Goblins in Exhausted Mine you got this from killed my poor wife while I "
"was away from home. Now I have my vengeance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f3e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those Golden Saint and Dark Seducer men are dreamy aren't they? Glad to have "
"them back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those Hearts of Order you find on the Knights can't be used to unlock special "
"chests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005effd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those Knights of Order are always causing trouble. Don't worry, though. I'll "
"figure out what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024d71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those Odiil boys ought to know better. Leave troubles like that to the town "
"guard. That's what they're paid for. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those Shambles are dangerous. Make sure to stand back if you kill one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaNQDQuestionResponses_0004660d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those are dangerous skills for a novice. I hope he trains people well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f431_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those aren't Sheogorath's real armies that have returned. The real ones are "
"being held in a secret underground compound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008e4ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those bones want out. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15BandsOfChosen_0003cd22_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those bracers you're wearing ... that's what we put on the prisoners here. It "
"prevents them from escaping, and makes them easy to control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f023_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those creatures in the Fringe are scary. Not like you, you fuzzy little "
"rascal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06AmuseiDoingHere_0001531f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Those cretin Skingrad guards caught me stealing a fish and locked me up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those famous for good deeds may receive Blessings of Intelligence and Magicka "
"when they visit Wayshrines of Julianos."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15BandsOfChosen_00047362_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Those favored by the Master to wear the Bands may enter the Forbidden Grotto, "
"and leave this Savage Garden forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sithis_000251e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those fools in the Church and their so-called \"Nine Divines.\" There is no "
"divinity beyond the eternal and terrible rule of our Dread Father, Sithis. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those guys that broke out of Bravil jail were tough customers. But the "
"Fighters Guild got them, didn't they."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00085215_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those new fellows here in town are making me nervous. Walking around with "
"those big weapons; I hope they leave soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a95c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Those notes are very important to me and represent ten years of my life. If "
"you could recover them, I'd be sure to reward you appropriately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEObeliskResponses_0008dc16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those obelisks are harmless. Certainly, nothing hostile appears near them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45BrethrenTopic_00017788_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those of us who've changed the most, we call The Brethren. Live down in the "
"caves, to be nearer the Deep Ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005ef84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those strange Knights probably have diseases from wherever they came from. "
"Best stay away from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstDoYouHandle_00018dfc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Those that are lucky enough to merely go insane will be granted a place in "
"the Shivering Isles as a permanent resident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those things are quite harmless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECreatureResponses_0008dc3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those things hate the water. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043cd1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those traps up ahead will cut my Aureals to pieces!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00064446_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Those wanted posters of the Gray Fox are everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneULecture2_00071924_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those who believe the runestones to be Dawn Era artifacts, created by the "
"Aedra or Daedra, often describe them as Lorkhan's birthing gift to mortals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00088b66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those who despair will certainly never be permitted to leave the Eternal "
"Garden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15ForbiddenGrotto_00047360_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Those who earn the Master's favor are given the Bands of the Chosen and "
"allowed to leave the Garden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Those who live by the Commands of the Nine receive Blessings of Strength when "
"they visit Wayshrines of Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaB_00022b42_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Those who unlock this hidden path have proven themselves worthy to join the "
"ranks of the Mythic Dawn cult. Finding the shrine is the first test."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aeae_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those who you assign as archers will head to the rear and keep their distance "
"when the enemy draws close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aead_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those who you designate as archers will head to the rear and keep their "
"distance when the enemy draws close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsHelp_0001da85_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those who you designate as archers will head to the rear and keep their "
"distance when the enemy draws close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsHelp_0001ec27_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those who you designate as archers will head to the rear and keep their "
"distance when the enemy draws close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsHelp_0001da85_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Those with blades and shields will hold the flank. When the enemy draws "
"close, they will close in and attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aead_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Those with blades and shields will hold the flank. When the enemy draws near, "
"they will close in and attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aeae_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Those with blades and shields will hold the flank. When the enemy draws near, "
"they will close in and attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08PlaceGuardsHelp_0001ec27_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Those with blades and shields will hold the flank. When the enemy draws near, "
"they will close in and attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189d07_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Those wretched beasts killed her! Filthy animals! Had I only been there to "
"stop them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000a80a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Though I am replicant to spread rumors, I am led to believe the philogy of "
"skeletous beings makes them resistive to magic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RogueMage_0003020c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Though I must say, I doubt it will do you much good in the end. You'd be "
"surprised how easily they forget about the little people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034861_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Though I must warn you. I have seen things in your future. Things which may "
"be, and things which will be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c36d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Though I'm happy that Ulrich has been removed from his post, I'm still "
"saddened that there'll be no true retribution for Aldos."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Arden_0001f3ba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Though his body is beyond Oblivion, his soul encircles us... always watching, "
"waiting to pounce with lethal aplomb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000299f_Knights_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Though many know where they are, they are still lost. I believe there is "
"something you must do in order to retrieve them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Mania_00082755_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Though the citizens and creatures of Mania are colorful, they can often be "
"quite deadly. I'm sure you can handle it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Though the darkness comes, I feel no fear. In your glory, bring us to the "
"light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsTopic_00002bd9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Though we went our separate ways when the Order fell, we all served the Nine "
"in our hearts. All but one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000514bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Thought I sent you to Harlun's Watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_0001447e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Threatened? Who threatened you, my dear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049937_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Three Brothers have some good merchandise. Don't know if I've met all three "
"brothers, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002879a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Three guests have been slaughtered, and you want to ask me about that Legion "
"dog? I don't know who I hate more, you or him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Three of the afternoon watch, and all's well. The way I like it, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023eb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Three of the afternoon watch, and all's well. The way I like it, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Three of the night watch, and all's well. Good night, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023eec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Three of the night watch, and all's well. Good night, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000329e9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Three of us were cut down in the first wave. We pressed on, at Farwil's "
"behest. At the base of the citadel, we met a larger second wave of foes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Three people have been killed, and now Matilde thinks she's next. I guess "
"only the killer knows for sure. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MatildePetitTopic_00028c30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Three people have been killed, and the only ones left are you, me and a "
"little old lady. One of us is a murderer, and my money's on the old lady. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Three people now dead, and yet the two of us still live. Do you think I'm the "
"killer? Because I most certainly wonder the same thing about you.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028723_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Three people... murdered. I know I shouldn't go wandering off alone right "
"now, but for the love of Ysmir, I need a drink!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028793_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Three years ago, my village in Skyrim was attacked by bandits. We went to the "
"nearby Imperial Legion outpost, but they refused to help us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10KnightsHail_00002cab_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Through Arkay, the Crusader lives!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_0002b43e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Through my research, I have learned that they were removed from the temple "
"before its sack by Men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_00085992_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Through my research, I have learned that they were removed from the temple "
"before its sack by Men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DraconianMadstoneTopic_00018233_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Through my sources, I've learned that the last reported location of the "
"Madstone was the ruins at Pale Pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChallengeWoodElf_0009f9b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Through the gate, my Wood Elf waits! Hurry, and do not disappoint me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000aa08c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Tiber Septim is the god and patron saint of our order. And now his dynasty "
"has come to an end. It's very painful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TidewaterCaveTOPIC_00026ad0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tidewater Cave? I know of it. Down along the southern coast. Nasty place, "
"from what I hear. Full of all sorts of critters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TidewaterCaveTOPIC_00026ab4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidewater Cave? Tidewater Cave! Why... why do you ask about this place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008d9d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidings and welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001f376_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidings and welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001f37a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidings and welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001f37d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidings and welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009199f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidings, citizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tidings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Orders_00026150_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tierra, get these civilians to the camp south of the city immediately, and "
"then report back here at once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007815c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tilse Areleth has quite a collection of things for sale at Common Treasures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_00016efc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Time and place are nothing. Constructs of a feeble mortal mind attempting to "
"categorize and understand the world around it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11KnifePointHollow_000807ab_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Time and place are nothing. Constructs of a feeble mortal mind attempting to "
"categorize and understand the world around it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004a987_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time for you to cash in on my success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00053242_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time for you to see where the real power of the guild lies. Raminus Polus "
"will want to speak with you; head to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a80b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time grows ever shorter. I implore you -- deliver your precious cargo to Dyus "
"with haste. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009811f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time grows short. The cure must be administered as soon as possible. Please, "
"hand it over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095782_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time is a strange thing in the Isles, so this may not set us back, and there "
"is a task that needs to be performed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000151f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time is against us, and our enemies grow stronger. There is much to do, and "
"little time in which to do it. Your next task is essential."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004bf9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time is pressing. Martin must relight the Dragonfires before the enemy can "
"stop us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08BattleBeginNo_00017da6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time is short, Your Grace. We cannot know when the next attack will come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08BattleBeginNo_000181c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time is short, Your Grace. We cannot know when the next attack will come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time is short. You must speak to Sheogorath immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028c77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time is wasting. We must move swiftly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ac6e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Time need not slow you. Tell me, have you ever considered placing yourself on "
"display?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a80c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time passes, and still you are here. Perhaps you do not wish to play the role "
"that has been forced upon you? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e3ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time to choose! Oh, how I missed these moments... so exhilarating!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00090b65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time to relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech1_00056049_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Time to save the Realm! Rescue the damsel! Slay the beast! Or die trying. "
"Your help is required."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_0001f422_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time's wastin'. He's safe... for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Time's wasting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014b4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Time. Time is an artificial construct. An arbitrary system based on the idea "
"that events occur in a linear direction at all times. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GenericBanditC_000a348b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Times are hard when a robber can't even make an honest living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e09a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Timothee LaRouche, late of the Black Dog, able seaman. I'll be staying ashore "
"'til my stash runs out, then it's off to sea once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ReturnHome_0001c1e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tivela!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e13f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To Cutter's in Crucible you should go for bladed weapons to thwart your foe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_00098076_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To Oblivion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQFollow_0001e8db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To Weynon Priory, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d287_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To advance in the guild, you'll need recommendations from each local guild "
"hall in Cyrodiil. A feat which I'm sure will elude you completely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_001854ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To arms! To arms!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDerveninSpeech07_00089917_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be a Maniac is to love and be loved. Spread the compassion and the warmth "
"throughout New Sheoth and beyond."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be frank, I'd prefer a career in the Arena to this paper-pusher's position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07DairihillOffice_00098397_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I couldn't give you directions to any special room in the "
"castle. Anyone in the castle can tell you though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_0002826d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I started getting a bad feeling about Nels. But now he's dead! "
"I... I should have gotten to know him better. Now it's too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I'm not sure if I trust him. He's a hard drinker, but there's "
"something more. Something in his eyes, hard and calculating.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro2_00082468_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To be honest, it wasn't the best idea. And it really began to smell. Must "
"have been clowns. Clouds don't smell bad. They taste of butter! And tears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028f46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be honest, my instincts tell me the kid isn't the killer. Sure he's a bit "
"obnoxious, but that doesn't make him capable of murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberTwoMani02_0007326a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To be so close, and yet so far. If only we had the key! Wait.. do you hear "
"something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualNoD_0001365f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To become ruler of Dementia, the current leader's heart must be cut out and "
"brought to the Altar of Arden-Sul in the Sacellum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_000356df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To bring them down, I need more information. My sources tell me they're "
"trying to expand, and they've set up camp in Glademist Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneAmazing_00022e63_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"To commemerate his kind heart, she imbued the Tears with some sort of magical "
"power. That's only rumor though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To earn gold, Argonians must come to the city. It is a strange life, shaped "
"stones and whiteskins everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_000251ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To employ the services of the Dark Brotherhood, one must perform a ritual to "
"the Night Mother. Only then will she heed their prayers for murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To find their secret shrine to Mehrunes Dagon, you'll need to study the four "
"volumes of Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopicDarJee04_000479b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To get the taste of Khajiit cooking out of their mouths! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033362_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To go from the gladed realm of Valenwood to a rat-infested hole like this... "
"how very sad. Those walls must feel like they're closing in on you.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ce4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To greet you? Or eat you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004768b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To know the right things, you have to know the right people. Ida Vlinorman, "
"Mandil, Samuel Bantien, and Othrelos are the right people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFindGrayFox_0001e091_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To learn more about the Gray Fox, go to the Garden of Dareloth at midnight. "
"Look in the Waterfront District of the Imperial City. I can say no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b834_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactK_00038fb7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To obtain it, and then give it up ... I honor your dedication to our cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_lightthedragonfires_000223e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To prove he is the true heir, an emperor must first light the dragonfires in "
"the Temple of the One in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhyDoI_00080ed7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To put it bluntly, you're stuck here for the moment. No disrespect intended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03Reactivated_0008e94b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To reactivate Xedilian for my Lord's pleasure, you'll need to find three "
"Focus Crystals and return them to their resting place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesM02_00013a67_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To represent that night, when the ruler of Mania is to be replaced, he "
"partakes of the Greenmote and allows his lifeblood to flow upon the Altar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaChoice1_0001ec15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To speak with Vaermina, you must offer a black soul gem to the Daedra Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40MelisandeIhavethem_0005373b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To start, I'll need six cloves of garlic, two shoots of Bloodgrass, and five "
"leaves of Nightshade. Those will be easy enough for you to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANocturnalSpeech_00084a4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To steal from a god is most unwise. In Leyawiin, two Argonians think "
"themselves secret, but the Eye has seen them. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e13d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To the Missing Pauldron you should go for superior armor to thwart your foe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranConfrontCiirta03_0001a7c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To the void we will send you. And without you, we will gain the light!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To think that Bruma was where Martin Septim chose to reveal himself as the "
"true heir to the throne for the first time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC2_000a6584_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To think that I hold hold the very crown that once graced the brow of the "
"last Ayleid king..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoC1_000a6582_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To think that I hold the very crown that once graced the brow of the last "
"Ayleid king..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To think that I trusted you. You!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11JournalGive_00038587_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To think that two innocent men were killed, and that I'm responsible for one "
"of their deaths... I... I'm speechless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bed7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To think we'd end up here, after such a beginning! Sending an escaped "
"prisoner off with the Amulet of Kings..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0007096c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To think, I actually had feelings for that wretched witch! Thank the gods "
"she's dead. Now... Now we're safe. We are safe... aren't we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Inventory_0001d03b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To think, all of those items on Thoronir's shelves were only recently buried. "
"Such blasphemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00026ba8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To think, all the information I needed was in a simple tome. Ah well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062bed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"To think, it was here at Bruma where the tide finally turned against the "
"Oblivion Invasion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaidenShinjiTopic_00146856_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"To this day, an Arena combatant lives by Shinji's credo: \"The best "
"techniques are passed on by the survivors.\" To be the best, learn from the "
"best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P1WhatIsPlan_0001fb6e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To unseal the entrance you must sneak into the basement of the palace and "
"activate the Glass of Time, whatever that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PoisonedAppleTopic_00091913_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"To use the apple, simply dispose of any other food and put the apple in its "
"place. If someone is inclined to eat, and they taste the apple... death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To what do I owe this pleasure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c20b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "To-MAY-to. To-MAH-to. DAY-dra. DEE-dra. It's all the same to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073022_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Today would be a good day to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0002519d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Today you die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Today's your lucky day, so let's hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Shadowscale_000251fc_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Together we served our nation as spies and assassins, as all Shadowscales do. "
"When we came of age we joined the family as one. And here we are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e842_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tonight's duel should be good. Stay and watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranDaggerGive_00019fd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tonight, the light will shine for us all. Tonight, Ciirta's time comes to an "
"end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdad_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Too bad about Aleron. Didn't need him anymore now that yer here. At least now "
"he's free of his debt... ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too bad about Elidor. The Guildmaster pays funeral expenses, doesn't she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e962_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Too bad none of those keys fit the lock... hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeleneTopic_0000c1e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too bad she's dead. She wasn't a bad looking woman... for an Imperial that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too bad someone didn't bring me this Chalice for my Museum. Would have made a "
"fine addition to my collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseTooMuchChorrol_0004d844_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Too bad. You won't find a better Chestnut horse anywhere in Cyrodill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity2_00043425_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Too bad... I already have a deformed Swamp Tentacle. But next time I'm sure "
"you'll find something truly Odd, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047643_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too big for me. Loud. Dirty. Clowns, fools, brutes and thieves everywhere. I "
"want to throw my gold away, I just dump it in Lake Rumare, save time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3a_0008f12c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too long Ciirta has led us here. Always against Sheogorath! Always! But we "
"are tired of her vendetta. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Visions_00033798_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too many voices, too loud in my head. How can I hear when all are shouting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice4_0008fb62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too much thinking, not enough work getting done! Fine. You think it over. But "
"stay away from the other me, that Demented Horkvir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Too much to do. No time to talk about the Great Torch being relighted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001a11c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Too much. Too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06KanehMirel_00012103_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Too risky. It's likely to be a trap. They could cut us to pieces down there "
"if they knew we were coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrisonBreak_00009c32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Took care of all of them, did you? And you're still alive. Fantastic. You're "
"full of surprises. Here's your payment. Good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_heirloom_00002e91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Took my flagon, they did! Passed down to me from my father Rulf, and from his "
"father Torbalt. It's a wondrous cup. Keeps ale cold and sweet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d153_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tooth-in-the-Sea can teach you more than I. Search for him north of Bravil, "
"along the coast of Niben Bay. Or perhaps in it, depending on his mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000730bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tootle-loo! Ahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Top deck clear yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ea8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Torture and pain abound in Crucible, glory be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ebe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Torture in the House of Dementia? I'm constantly tortured! Cats everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Torture may be a necessary evil to accomplish Syl's goals. Make sure Herdir "
"accompanies you to talk to Anya. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_000819a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Torturing a sickly old woman? Are you trying to kill me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ThurindilTopic_0003e0d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Touched by the gods. He hears things. Who knows? He's happy... let him be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001da72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Touching a vampire, or even the corpse of a vampire, can result in infection. "
"Do be careful! If you want to know more, browse our library."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Next_00023669_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Toutius Sextius, do you know him? A quiet fellow, appears harmless enough, "
"but I've identified him as one of my key suspects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e889_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Tovas knows his horses, and I'll stay with him and these beautiful creatures. "
"Forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tove the Unrestful in Bliss is collecting items to build something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tove the Unrestful in Bliss is collecting useless items to build something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008dc2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tove the Unrestful, in Bliss, is definitely NOT collecting items to build "
"something. He couldn't build a rock with a stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07SpiesResponse_00020076_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Track down the spies and kill them. Find out what they know, and what they're "
"planning, if possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutsideChoiceU2_000790b9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Trade places, a bed under a roof for a bedroll under the stars? Mm-hmm. Sure, "
"sure. I don't trust you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30Matrices_0001e697_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tradition dictates before each master smith dies, she hides these magical "
"molds in the world. Like pouring salt into a wound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0cd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Traffic through Anvil harbor comes mostly in exotic, high-profit goods easy "
"to transport by road or Mages Guild couriers to eastern markets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d063_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Training and spells, training and spells. It gets so boring after a while; "
"maybe someday I'll be able to move to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033de5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Training, beds, and good hard work. Can't beat it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d888_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Training, child? You would know more about the mystic energies of the world "
"around us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062446_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Training, eh? The real question is, can you fight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006139d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Training? From me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Training? From me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061439_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Training? From me? Ha ha, you must be joking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018bc35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Training? Goodness me, I'm retired! I'm afraid combat doesn't interest me any "
"more. All that matters to me now is Malene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Training? Oh, I'm afraid that's not my area of expertise. I'm very focused on "
"wines right now, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0018d155_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Training? Oh, no. I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Training? Well, my dear, good business sense is just something that comes "
"naturally to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0014c718_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Transfer that scroll to the archives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Travel safe. Raynil wouldn't think twice about harming you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038f0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Travel safe. Raynil wouldn't think twice about harming you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2A_00032be9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Travel to Leyawiin. Track Phillida. Learn his schedule. Observe when he "
"removes that blasted Legion armor! And then, let fly the Rose of Sithis!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2B_00032bea_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Travel to Leyawiin. Track Phillida. Learn his schedule. Observe when he "
"removes that blasted Legion armor! And then, let fly the Rose of Sithis!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08FinChoice2C_00032beb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Travel to Leyawiin. Track Phillida. Learn his schedule. Observe when he "
"removes that blasted Legion armor! And then, let fly the Rose of Sithis!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006244b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Travel to all of our cities, and speak with the unfortunate souls forced to "
"beg for change. Look into their hearts, and then look into your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaSpeech_0008ade7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Travel to his tower and retrieve my Orb. Take care, though, mortal. In my "
"Orb, Arkved has found more than he bargained for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006244f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Travel to the Arcane University, and speak with Martina Floria."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAAzuraSpeech_0002c6c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Travel to the Gutted Mine. The door will open to you. Bring the peace of "
"death to my followers, and you shall earn my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Travel to the Imperial City, and speak with Palonirya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetB1_00002adb_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Travel to the Wayshrines of the Nine Divines. Pray to each of the gods in "
"turn, and ask their favor upon your quest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Traven might get us through this yet. I hear that the Necromancers were "
"handed a significant defeat at Silorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ThalfinWhatNow_000366f0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Traven sent word that he wanted you in charge, so you've got it. You're in "
"command. Tell us where you want us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000151f6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Traven sent you? Just you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062613_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trayvond has the best shield spell outside of the Arcane University. If you "
"can cast it, it's definitely worth adding to your selection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033598_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tread carefully; I don't know what evil lurks within that gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_00078ca9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Tread lightly in the Isles. It is not a place suited to all mortals. But, I'm "
"sure you'll do fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001f377_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tread the humble path and find enlightenment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001f379_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tread the humble path and find enlightenment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001f37c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tread the humble path and find enlightenment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007ec64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tread the humble path and find enlightenment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008d9d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tread the humble path and find enlightenment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_000749ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Treasure holes near Cheydinhal?  Not close by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006267c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trespassing in the Imperial Palace is punishable by death or prison. Your "
"choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002a350_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Trespassing is against the law! Guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_000301fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Trespassing is against the law! Guards! I'm placing you under arrest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANocturnalConvo1_000878d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trolls don't like water. Trolls don't swim. The Eye is perfectly safe in "
"Tidewater Cave. So relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000a80a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Trolls, I have been foretold, are particular to unflammable weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_disappearances_0000be73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trolls, huh? And drawn in by will-o-the-wisps? There's some lousy luck for "
"you. Well, here's your payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_disappearances_0000be74_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trolls, huh? And drawn in by will-o-the-wisps? There's some lousy luck for "
"you. Well, here's your payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006fdc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_causingtrouble_0002c7b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trouble? Trouble? You're damn right! But it's not us, friend. The real "
"trouble's with the Blackwood Company. They're what's causing trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "True dreaming, Skull-Bearer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice4_00014b63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"True, but perhaps you can hold the throne -- provided that you possess the "
"proper symbol of office. Namely: the Staff of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Dreams_0002c6de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"True, but this is different. When you enter your dreams with the amulet, "
"you're in full command of a dream-like replica of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ2_00002d19_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Truly this is the Age of the Serpent and the Void that follows!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_00188f3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Truly, you are an asset to the guild. I reward you with the rank of Wizard, "
"and teach you a most powerful spell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice4b_00082096_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Truly? Very well. I wasn't quite finished with them, but as long as you "
"remain in Sheogorath's favor, I will not conduct experiments on THESE people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEArctusSpeech05_0008988d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trust in Arden-Sul's legitimate teachings. Don't allow the decadent ways of "
"Mania to blind your vision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Trust me when I say we'll give you a night to remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028c37_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Trust me, I know. I was stationed at Fort Frostmoth for a few years, on the "
"isle of Solstheim. Those Nords are a bunch of animal-worshipping savages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight2Female_00002cde_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Truth be told, I was just thinking of her, too. Let's remember her as she was "
"in life, and serve the Nine in her memory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElderCouncilTopic_000add0b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Truth be told, most of the Council has returned to the provinces to deal with "
"urgent local matters, but we are in regular communication."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043517_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Truth be told, the Resonator of Judgment doesn't actually do anything. Who "
"cares if it's been reactivated?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006691b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Truth is, the Legion doesn't know who was behind the Emperor's murder. We've "
"already ruled out the Dark Brotherhood. So is this something... worse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sithis_000251ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Truthfully? I've never really understood who or what Sithis really is. As "
"long as I obey the Tenets and fulfill my contracts, I guess he's happy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_00061ff9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Try again. That's not good enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Try combining aloe vera leaves with some venison. It's said to have some "
"restorative properties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatekeeperChoice2Kill_0007eaee_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Try him if you like. Believe me, after you die, I can put your flesh and "
"bones to very good use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Try not to cough on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Try not to fight a Grummite in the water. Or in the rain. They seem to like "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00077c26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Try not to kill it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e4c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Try not to stand so close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000343bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Try not to worry so much, dear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ab5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Try our wines and cheeses, and Salmo's sweetrolls. See the castle... but "
"don't expect to see the Count. He doesn't mix with strangers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Goblinhunting_00038abc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Try the big goblin den called 'Derelict Mine' out east along the Gold Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0005fa42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Trying to take advantage of a sick woman? You're horrible. Come back when you "
"actually have the money for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000477eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tsavi, Count's Mage and Castle Healer, your servant. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Corpse_00062511_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tsk. Such terrible times we live in. Is no place safe anymore?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDQuestionResponses_0003dfb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Tsrava says the sound of J'bari's dogs drives her to distraction. Can't say I "
"blame her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c199_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Tumindil does excellent work. I always feel comfortable in his care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_0003843c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Turns out that Bradon Lirrian is a vampire. Or was. If it wasn't for Raynil "
"Dralas, we may never have uncovered the truth. Let me explain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e03_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Twelve midnight, and all's well. Hope it stays that way, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Twelve midnight, and all's well. Hope it stays that way, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00066f30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Twelve more... Twelve! I was so close!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Twelve noon, and all's well. Everything all right, ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023ec7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Twelve noon, and all's well. Everything all right, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity6_00081e89_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Two Tibers are always better than one, I always say! We'll take good care of "
"him here in the Museum, don't you worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_000a04dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two amulets? One of them must be a fake. Clever girl, taught her everything I "
"know. Good thing you saw through her ruse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003359a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two days and nary a word. I fear the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoLearnWhat_00044f54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two halves, two rulers, two places. Meet and greet. Do what they will, so you "
"know what they're about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b57f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two hundred gold? I don't think so. Not from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two of the afternoon watch, and all's well. All's well with you, ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023eb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two of the afternoon watch, and all's well. All's well with you, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two of the night watch, and all's well. Rest easy, ma'am. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023eed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two of the night watch, and all's well. Rest easy, sir. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002974a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two of us have been murdered! One of us is a killer! But who?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028798_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two of us killed, and where was the stalwart Legionnaire? That's what I'd "
"like to know. He spent his life protecting the citizens of Tamriel? Ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028227_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two of us, dead! Who would do this? And why? Is that why we're all here? To "
"be killed like vermin? I feel like I'm going mad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028160_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Two people are dead, and for all I know you could be the killer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people are dead, and for all I know you could have killed them! Just "
"leave me alone, you worthless peasant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028cd3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people are dead, and the only thing the Nord can do is dive into a bottle "
"of beer. If you ask me it's all an act.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people are dead, you pathetic little worm. Take your gossip mongering "
"someplace else. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002825f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people are dead. Could he really have done it? I... I just don't know... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people are now dead. And for what? A trunk full of coins? How pathetic.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028226_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people dead, and you're still alive. I'm sorry, but you're starting to "
"make me nervous. Please go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_0002817e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people dead, yet Nels still lives? I don't think that's a coincidence. "
"Nords are savages, born to kill. I just know he did it! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028260_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people have been murdered, and neither of them was Neville. Watch your "
"back around him.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002818a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people lie dead, and all you can do is question me about that sweet boy? "
"I'm beginning to think something is seriously wrong with you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_00028252_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people lie dead. Primo could have done it, I know. He's young, and "
"strong. Still, I don't want to believe that.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028720_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Two people, dead. If anyone else drops, I swear I'm going to gather every "
"drop of alcohol in this house and drink myself into a stupor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00017c46_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Two years ago I made a fool out of him when he tried to arrest me. Lex has "
"never forgotten it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AncotarTopic_000301e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Typical Altmer. Thinks the whole world is made for his convenience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JorundrTopic_0005371f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Typical. So typical. His stupid paranoia that everyone's a spy and out to get "
"him. I don't know what to suggest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillGardens_0007de9c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Typically, when one has finished an errand, it is time to return. Why is this "
"confusing? Are you feeling quite well, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003aa9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ugak has some good horses to sell. I sometimes can't tell her from her "
"sister, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MurderNoCrime_00066336_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugghh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d06_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00023796_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0002379c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0002398c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00028aae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_000549b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00061c95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0009199d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh! Darkness, give me strength!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00013341_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh! These welkynd stones taste terrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_00018293_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ugh, spellcasters. That's what this next one is, a High Elf sorceress or "
"something. Just get in close and stab her a few times, that'll teach her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000917b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ugh. How messy. Well, now that you possess Syl's Heart, I'd make my way to "
"the Sacellum as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091628_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ugh. How messy. Well, now that you possess Thadon's drug-tainted blood, I'd "
"make my way to the Sacellum as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ef7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ugh. Not again. Whatever Syl accused me of, I'm innocent. Don't hurt me. Wow, "
"I've never seen such a big wolf before! Scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKEHATE_0018b2d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh. That's foul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ugh. You're about the ugliest barmaid I've ever seen, and that's saying quite "
"a bit. Come to bring me another round, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DeathConv_0001accd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugh... What's happening?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CreatureResponses_0002b1c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ugly things, with their thick shells and sharp claws. I avoid them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000980c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Uh huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerNegative_0002b173_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Uh uh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781e7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Uh, but we shouldn't be seen talking until the mission is accomplished!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_000280a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uh, yeah, maybe I remember a young Argonian lass.  Sure, she stayed for a "
"night and then she left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00051796_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Uh-huh. Whatever you say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Uh-huh...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WheresSkrivva_00035fb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uh... she left town. That's right! She... uh... went to visit her brother in "
"Bruma. You should go there and look for her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Uhh, hello."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e3a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uhm, Your Grace... now doesn't seem to be the best time for conversation. "
"Perhaps your survival should take precedence at the moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ulen Athram. Of the Kragenmoor Athrams. Made my fortune in the flin trade, "
"and now I'm here in the city, living the life of ease."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakersWayTopic_0001ebd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ulf the Bleaker settled here before Rayno Dalvilu and his family arrived. But "
"the families have long lived together in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2a7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ulrich has been watching me, so I haven't been able to enact the plan I "
"devised to bring him down. That ends today now that you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2ae_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Ulrich is definitely up to something. Every day, we take in exorbitant fines "
"from the people. Where most of that money goes, I have a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c2ae_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ulrich keeps his quarters locked, but I've glimpsed inside. The things he has "
"in there could never be purchased on a Captain's salary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c337_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ulrich will be spending years in the city dungeons. This should give him "
"plenty of time to reflect on what he's done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c364_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ulrich will not buy his way out of this one... he'll pay, I promise you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10LlevanaTalk_0003c377_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ulrich, how dare you walk in here like you don't know what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc2b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Um, no, I don't know the way to the Imperial City.  You'll have to ask "
"someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc2c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Um, no, I don't know the way to the Imperial City.  You'll have to ask "
"someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e986_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Um. Oh, no. I lost count. Crap. Okay. Well, what do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001c290_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Um... You're not wearing your Battle Raiment... You all right? You haven't "
"taken too many blows to the head, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e62c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Um... did you know that you're on fire?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechUmaril_00002a5c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril --  yes, your children know that name if you do not. The Dread "
"Castellan of fearful legend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002921_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Umaril and his minions cannot stand against the Knights of the Nine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002922_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Umaril awaits within. Onward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestions04_00002c9b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril cannot be bested in his physical form by any normal means. His blows "
"can strike down the mightiest of warriors in a single stroke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirThedretSpeech04_00002cb1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril has been slain by the Crusader! His very spirit cast into the void and "
"destroyed for all eternity -- he will never rise again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Umaril has returned! The Eight and One need a new Crusader!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDUmarilTopic_00002bfa_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril is no more! He and his minions are defeated, and our Chapels are safe "
"again. All hail the Divine Crusader!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a71_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril is returned, as was foretold by the head of Pelinal to the Bull of "
"Kyne in those days of old Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029c5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Umaril must be hiding further in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002924_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril must be hiding somewhere further in. It seems he fears to face us, the "
"coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartA1_00002c80_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umaril the Unfeathered, the sorceror-king of the Ayleids who ruled over this "
"land for long ages before the rise of Men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a32_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Umaril! Come out and fight, coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a2f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Umaril! Show yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27CrownLindai_000a6575_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Umbacano may not be able to tell the difference between the Crown of Lindai "
"and the Crown of Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a944c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Umbacano nearly did us in this time, and no mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_00026b1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Umbra is my blade. It is who I am. Who I was meant to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Assault_000bf019_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Umbra shall feed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b799_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Umbra will feast on your soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0007b79a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Umbra. It is everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_000b52a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umbra. That's a name I haven't heard in a while. And it's not one you should "
"be using around Pell's Gate, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbraTOPIC_00026b15_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Umbra? You need to speak with Irroki the Wide. I've got nothing to say about "
"Umbra."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028f80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Umm ... no time to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice3C_0008585f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ummm... Okay, then... I guess I'll trying looking down in the basement. Maybe "
"you could search upstairs or something, hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopAgarmir_0001d047_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Ummm... yes. That's right. He said that he wouldn't be able to do anything "
"else, as he had something important to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupPositive_0002422c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ummmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FollowupNegative_0002423c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ummmm...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008dca0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Una Armina has all the pieces she needs to fill her collection. Nothing's "
"missing. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Una Armina runs a museum in Crucible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00097622_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Una Armina runs a museum in Crucible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMiscQuestResponses_0008261b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Una Armina runs the museum. She's always looking for new pieces for her "
"collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngerReceive_0002425f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unacceptable!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2A_000262d8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Uncover the true traitor's identity, and then come see me. I'll be in hiding. "
"Fort Farragut is no longer secure. It's under watch by the Black Hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2B_000262d9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Uncover the true traitor's identity, and then come see me. I'll be in hiding. "
"Fort Farragut is no longer secure. It's under watch by the Black Hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice2C_000262da_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Uncover the true traitor's identity, and then come see me. I'll be in hiding. "
"Fort Farragut is no longer secure. It's under watch by the Black Hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c24b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Undena Orethi grows some good tomatoes. Yep. They sure are good tomatoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c24c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Undena Orethi has got some fine tomatoes. Some of the finest in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ad9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Undena Orethi. I am a pilgrim in search of the perfect tomato. It is my "
"grail, and I shall follow it all my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000a0e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Under your leadership, the Black Hand will reign eternal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EronorDEMO1_0002ae28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Undoubtedly. There's hardly a cloud in the sky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005421f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately I don't have any more horses to sell. I sold our last Paint "
"horse to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06BribeBeggar_000104e1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, Captain Dion was also in the Two Sisters Lodge. He arrested "
"Theranis and hauled him off to the dungeons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06Theranis_0004896e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, Captain Dion was also in the Two Sisters Lodge. He arrested "
"Theranis and hauled him off to the dungeons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028cdd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, Dovesi doesn't seem to like me very much. But I don't blame "
"her. The young ones tend to have problems with authority figures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7b_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, he and I did not see eye to eye on certain matters. He left "
"the Order during the War of the Red Diamond, and never returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45ForkTopic_00083f61_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, it seems to be an item of great importance for some of the "
"Zealots as well. They've been fighting over it for some time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, my hangover is making it difficult to think straight. You're "
"best off speaking to Guilbert for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JollringChoice2B_000844c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, my master is only interested in the rarest and most unique "
"Ayleid artifacts to add to his collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice1A_0002f880_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, that's all we know. We don't know which district he calls "
"home, which establishments he frequents, or anything about his schedule."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04WhatHappened_00019524_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the Chalice is locked away as well. I have no wish to retrieve "
"it myself, but fetching it might do you some good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreatTorchTopic_000910a9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the Torch has gone out. For eternity, this has heralded the "
"start of the Greymarch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice6A_00028ac9_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the notorious Redguard Valley Ogres ransacked the place and "
"probably took all of the loot back with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice5_00014b62_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, when Sheogorath faded, the power of the Staff faded with him. "
"It must now be remade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_000153ad_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, you were stupid enough to kill Amantius Allectus in the "
"process! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0001c14f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Unfortunately, you were stupid enough to kill Rohssan in the process! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18ArquenPrayer_000546e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Unholy Matron, we of the Black Hand beseech you! Reveal yourself now, most "
"magnificent Night Mother, so that we may seek your guidance! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007e3e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Unleashed the swarm did we? Nothing like a little bloodlust to start the "
"encounter off right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CureforVampirism_000977d5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Unless I'm mistaken, I believe this dose is promised to someone. Should you "
"ever have need of another, for... personal reasons, I can provide it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40WitchDangerous_0003ed3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Unless directly crossed, I do not believe so. They have been known to help "
"those in need in times past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072dec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unless my lady requires me to speak, I remain silent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002524f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unless there's a drink in this for me, you might as well stop talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000b9846_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unless you can pay for it, you're not staying in one of my rooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofAzuraTOPIC_00098204_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unless you can persuade me of your good intentions, I cannot speak further on "
"this matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045f66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unless you have word of the Gray Fox, my time is limited."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e8d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unless you need something, let's continue on to Weynon Priory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c335_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Unless you relish the thought of decorating the end of my blade with your "
"blood, I would get out of my sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0000ab72_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "Unless you want to do things the hard way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AReplace_00013ffc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unless... well, if you think you have a chance. How do I know this isn't some "
"sort of trick?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002ee40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Unlike some frivolous tasks you may be given at other guild halls, this is a "
"serious matter, and has consequences. Are you prepared?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d58_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Unlike the Daedra Lords, the gods have no artifacts, and do not physically "
"manifest themselves in our world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08HaskillKnightsTopic2_00043f69_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Unlike typical invaders, the Knights do not arrive by conventional means. "
"Instead, they enter the Shivering Isles through conduits into this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d886_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Until I hear your name spoken by others, don't expect any training from me. "
"When you're known as a hero or a villain, I might change my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d887_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Until I see you summon a Faded Wraith here before me, you shall get no "
"training from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000029e4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Until later, sir knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006a84d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until later, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001ad4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_00031842_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Until now, we numbered only seven, but attacked like a regiment. Our enemies "
"quake at our approach, and falter at our charge. Huzzah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000c452c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Until now, we numbered only seven, but attacked like a regiment. Our enemies "
"quake at our approach, and falter at our charge. Huzzah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00035754_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until our paths cross again, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0015974d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until our paths cross again, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until our paths cross again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025034_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Until then, I'm afraid it wouldn't be in my best interests to be seen talking "
"to you. You understand, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c359_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until we meet again, may your travels be safe and the road remain clear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00181c2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until we meet again, my dear friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003575c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until we meet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008da89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until we meet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c4538_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until we meet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0017c45d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Until you find a way to close that Oblivion Gate, there's nothing I can do "
"but try to hold our position here as long as I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053753_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Until you get out of here and I see an amulet, we have nothing more to say to "
"each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053721_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Until you get some information from Jorundr, I don't have anything else to "
"tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bc5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Until you have the message from S'Krivva, we have nothing further to say to "
"one another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09GiveArrowHead_0001cf36_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Until you pay the blood price, your membership in the guild is forfeit. You "
"can pay me now, or Armand later if you wish to rejoin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c139_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Until you reclaim the Amulet and Martin lights the Dragonfires, the enemy "
"will not be truly defeated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00035756_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Until your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unwelcome it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01GateSpeech_0005a763_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Unworthy, unworthy, unworthy! Useless mortal meat. Walking bag of dung! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItemC_00082436_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Up here is a little beauty. The Ring of Desiccation. Walk on water and "
"breathe underwater at the same time. Odd, if you think about it for a minute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Up the stairs you must go, to the first door on your right. That is your room "
"for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00046595_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uravasa Othrelas has a way with words. I wish she could teach me how to speak "
"that well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00046583_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Uravasa Othrelas is an excellent speaker, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_000488ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uravasa and Marz leave me little to do here in Bravil. That leaves me free to "
"devote my time to Mara's ministry throughout the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046581_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uravasa is an excellent speaker. Her sermons are always quite enlightening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047670_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Urbul gro-Orkulg knows you NEED axes and blunt weapons. BIG ones. So he makes "
"them and sells them here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049949_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Urbul keeps a lot of axes and maces. He seems to like big weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008ef6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Urgh! Blood for blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeynonPrioryTopic_000aa08c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Uriel was an old man... a good man, and a good emperor. Why would anyone want "
"to kill him? And all his sons?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004767a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Urjabhi helps his brothers, Ra'Jiradh and Hassiri, to run the Black Horse "
"Courier. Others write. We organize, we deliver. The news never stops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002798e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Use your silver tongue. Try to befriend the guests, and then you may be able "
"to lure them to their own dooms! Hahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServeSentence_000459d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Use your time well, to consider my Lord Sheogorath's merciful justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006ede8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Useless Fighters Guild. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Ushnar in Crucible is afraid of cats. Cats!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000825ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Ushnar is deathly afraid of cats. He makes sure to keep dogs around because "
"of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35EarilInitialHello_0008f7d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Using magicka, I will slow your heart rate, your breathing, your movement, "
"and your thoughts until they may as well not be functioning at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark11Choice1A_00002db8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Using your gift service was the smartest thing I've ever done. My children "
"are spread across Cyrodiil, and it's so hard to shop for them all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00032b0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Usual mixup with the Watch, I ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790b0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Uungor communces he \"bye-bye.\" Communce with Uungor. Are you identing me? "
"Communce with Uungor! Give friend dorpidity in Uungor's dormitiloo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutsideChoiceSweetroll_000790bb_Oblivion_RESP"
"2"
msgid ""
"Uungor, he say no crazy. But he is. He say he going. Away. Far. Your friend "
"sleep there when Uungor goes. But Fimmion no think Uungor really leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c24e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uuras is a good shepherd, but his real love is cheese. Of course, there's no "
"money in herding cheese."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c24d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uuras the Shepherd sure takes care of his sheep. And, boy, does he like "
"cheese! I mean, he really likes cheese."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uurwen the Evoker. I'm responsible for enchanted item recharge for the "
"Cheydinhal guildhall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047750_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Uzul gro-Grulam. I'm courting Myvryna Arano, so stay away from her. I got "
"matrimony on my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Vaermina has spoken to you. Surely you are blessed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03FinChoice1A_00023e54_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Valen Dreth has been imprisoned for many years. His tongue is sharp, but his "
"body is limp and frail. He will prove an easy, pleasurable kill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Valen Dreth lies dead, but why the unsanctioned bloodshed? You seem to "
"lack... discipline. Here is your reward, but I'm afraid the bonus is forfeit. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a33e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Valus Odiil is down at the Grey Mare, and he seems upset. His boys are in "
"some sort of trouble"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006dc22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Vampire nest in the city. Only in the Black Horse Courier. Take a copy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00024121_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Vampire! Unclean beast! Die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Vampires are clever, so watch your back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00146811_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Vampires are clever, so watch your back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d245_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Vampires are nasty creatures. They drink the blood of others to conceal their "
"true nature. Such trickery makes them difficult to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Vampires have a weakness to fire. You may wish to use this to your advantage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Vampires rarely live alone. They tend to have others of their ilk around them "
"for protection."
msgstr ""

