"brother? How can that be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark11Choice1B_00002db9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Excuse me? Did... did you say die? My... my children? No... No! Don't "
"hurt my precious babies! I won't let you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000253e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Fake a death? And you can't even kill the enforcer? I don't envy you, "
"friend. But a contract's a contract. Just do what you've got to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e066_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Haven't I said enough already? Just let it go. Once someone finally "
"realizes what's going on here, maybe things will change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078668_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? He's promised not to come around here anymore? Fantastic! Took you long "
"enough though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenChoice2_00018704_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Here? Are you kidding? I'm not staying here! If you don't want to help "
"me, fine. I'll get out of here on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StealNoCrime_000626bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? I didn't see a thing... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01SulinusConv_0002d91a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? I don't understand..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06NoGive_0001f169_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? I must warn you, no one leaves this place who does not bind himself to "
"the service of Lord Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Lynch01aPositive_000151e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? I was told there are only two others on board. I locked the bouncer in "
"the Storage Room and she has the owner. So that leaves you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071f33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? I'm in kind of a hurry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VaronVamoriTopic_0002f1f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? I... I don't know anything about him. I'm sorry. Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014455_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? I... No, that's not it at all. I just... I don't know. Why am I here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_0001585d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? Is this some kind of a trick?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Conversation_0009813c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? Janus... please, no. Let me sleep. Please, let me sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4567_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Look, pal, no talkie right now, okay? I'm here to watch people get "
"mutilated, not blab like an old woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00080d3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? N...No. I don't know anything about anything. I'm sorry, I can't help "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000355a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? Necromancers at the cave?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraReactions_00084ab5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014451_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? No! I'm loyal to Lady Syl, I swear it! I would never turn against her! "
"I just heard a rumor, that's all! I don't know anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_0002a68a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Not only does it exist, but she knows where it is? Well, this is "
"unacceptable. That book needs to be in the safe-keeping of the Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG06JskarConv_0001cef7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? Oh... err, no. I'm afraid not. No sign at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasA6_00035c5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Phintias sold you my copy? This is outrageous! I must speak to Phintias "
"at once. That book is mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000837ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? Still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03GrommokChamberThreeDem01_00067704_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? The very dead rise in this accursed place? Very well, you'll not slay "
"me without a fight! Have at you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047641_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? There's a city out there? You don't say. What good is it, eh? Dirt. "
"Horses. Idiots. Be my guest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusA_00022b20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? They took it from Jauffre? Things are worse than I had thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1B_0001e859_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? This is unacceptable!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04ClothesNo_0003d4ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? What are you talking about? Don't you want to have fun? Come on, don't "
"be shy. Or are you here for something else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SERunsInCirclesGreetA_00041208_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? What did you say? What did you say?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003161f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? What is it? Very busy. Things to do. Or see. Or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072df8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? What is it? Very busy. Things to do. Or see. Or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Corpse_00054ca8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? What's going on? By the light, this man is dead! Brothers! Sisters! "
"There is a killer among us! Find him! Bring him to justice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark17Choice3B_00054033_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? What's the meaning of this? What's going on here? I don't want no "
"trouble! Here, take the damn key! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Brothers_00084aa0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? Who ...? Damn, not this again. Wake up! Wake up!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark12Choice1A_0005179b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Who are you to come into my home, to speak to me like a petulant child? "
"Do you know who I am? Do you have any idea what you're dealing with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ac7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? Who are you? Oh... who cares. I'm Druja. You want something? Or you "
"just practicing your Cyrodilic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04Choice1A_00025274_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? You filthy little maggot! When I get out of here you're dead! You hear "
"me? Dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_0004891d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What? You have not eyes to see? The castle, of course! The only challenge "
"worthy of a swift sneaker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ac4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"What? You want a tour? Can't you see I have a lot on my mind? Go bother a "
"beggar or guard... they stand around and chatter all day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What? You're here to take it back to Traven?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SurpriseReceive_0002424e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB4_0009532b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What?! The Mythic Dawn were the ones...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38GuardWarnChoice1_00023687_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"What?! This is ... unbelievable! Of all the strange fates, to become the "
"target of a stranger's madness ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36ChoiceLedge1Push_00081c51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "What?!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatcha got?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever I can do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever Uncle Iniel says. 'Lay off the Atius bastards,' he says, so we lay "
"off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f9d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever am I to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever comes out of that portal... Cheydinhal is ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RosentiaGallenusTopic_0004b7b3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Whatever it is, she should clean up her act. It's surprising that a wealthy "
"woman like that would let her property fall into such disarray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e1e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever shall we do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002968_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever the situation calls for, I intend to be prepared. Ranged combat "
"isn't my specialty, so I work hard at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_000415d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever you did overloaded it and brought the whole thing down. It collapsed "
"Xeddefen itself. I'm amazed that you were not killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_000415d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever you did overloaded it and brought the whole thing down. It collapsed "
"Xeddefen itself. I'm amazed that you were not killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_000415d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever you did overloaded it and brought the whole thing down. It collapsed "
"Xeddefen itself. I'm amazed that you were not killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_000415da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever you did overloaded it and brought the whole thing down. It collapsed "
"Xeddefen itself. I'm amazed that you were not killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever you do... don't leave me alone with these things!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270f1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Whatever you may think of me, I still protect my own. This is my city, and "
"Mehrunes Dagon will not have it while I remain Count of Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000af05c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever you need, Champion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000142ee_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP3"
msgid "Whatever you need, I'm at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bed8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever you need, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELOVE_00062323_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever you're looking for, I'm sure I don't know how to find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002415b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whatever you've got, I don't want it. Head to the Church before you get me "
"sick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_0008f03d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whelp of Vitharn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09BlowOff_0003fd3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whelp of a Shadowfoot! You had better learn respect if you want to advance in "
"the Thieves Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesD02_00013a66_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When Arden-Sul couldn't divine the traitor's true nature in their hearts, he "
"became distraught and took his own life in the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneAmazing_00022e63_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When Garridan realized his quest was a failure, and he wouldn't be able to "
"return and save the farmers, he began to shed some tears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d30e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When Gogan was, uh... with the women, they took something quite valuable from "
"him. No... it's not what you're thinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00033956_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When I asked her about it, she said it involved her spell research. I suppose "
"at the time it sounded good enough for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f7d1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "When I bowed the knee to Jyggalag, my eyes were opened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14Thief_0001bb32_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When I came to, I found that the door to my studio was still locked, and that "
"the thief had snatched my paintbrush. That's when I saw it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002acb_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When I finally received word of his quest, I went searching for him. But.. I "
"was too late. Sir Juncan helped me carry his body back here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_000253da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When I first joined the family, this Sanctuary was controlled by another "
"Speaker. Lucien took over when she was killed while fulfilling a contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08GiveStone_0001cf35_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When I have learned what I need to know, I will call for you again. Let us "
"leave Helvius' house now. He has served me well and deserves his peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_0003844b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When I heard Raynil killed him, I didn't know what to think. But after your "
"visit here, I'm beginning to wonder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000441d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When I heard the Great Torch atop the Sacellum was ignited, I literally "
"jumped for joy. It's nice to feel safe for a change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006a851_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When I know more, I'll come find you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08accept_000146ff_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"When I receive word that Savilla's Stone is missing, I will be here waiting "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05ThedretWhat_00002af6_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When I refused, they locked me here, and only let me out to torture me. They "
"got nothing from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogasStory_000860e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When I saw my friend killed, I swore I'd be a true knight and right all "
"wrongs. So now I gotta do some good deeds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b8c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When I saw the fiery clouds and the daedra in the streets, I was sure we were "
"all dead... but you saved us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08UrsanneSorry_0001fdbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When I saw the grave look on your face, I knew something had happened to him. "
"And what of that fetcher, Kurdan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018bafe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When I speak to someone like you -- a noble citizen of the Empire -- it "
"reminds me what I'm fighting for. I salute you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081bf7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "When I swore allegiance to Jyggalag, my eyes were opened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When I want your opinion, I'll give it to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b21_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When I was younger, I could live with it. Wasn't so bad. But it's only gotten "
"worse over time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c36d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When I was younger, and living in Vvardenfell, my parents instilled in me the "
"code of an-eye-for-an-eye. It's hard not to see that through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06Cleansing_00036422_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When Lord Dagon Himself walks the earth, our victory will be complete. He "
"will rule over Tamriel and the Mythic Age will be restored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ScarTailTopic_00035593_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When Ocheeva and I trained with the Dark Brotherhood as children, we "
"befriended another initiate, a Shadowscale by the name of Scar-Tail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003e2b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When S'drassa isn't teaching alchemy, he spends all of his time researching a "
"cure for skooma addiction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04CarodusGreetingMace_00002ac0_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When Saint Kaladas was laid to rest, those who prayed to Zenithar at his tomb "
"began to receive visions of the Mace of the Crusader. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002ac9_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When Saint Kaladas was laid to rest, those who prayed to Zenithar at his tomb "
"began to receive visions of the Mace of the Crusader. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002aca_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When Saint Kaladas was laid to rest, those who prayed to Zenithar at his tomb "
"began to receive visions of the Mace of the Crusader. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002acd_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When Saint Kaladas was laid to rest, those who prayed to Zenithar at his tomb "
"began to receive visions of the Mace of the Crusader. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_0001a815_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When Sheogorath discovered the library he had it burned, insisting that it "
"was an abomination and that personal choice defied logical prediction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus1a_000807ae_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When Sheogorath discovered the library, He had it burned, insisting that it "
"was an abomination and that personal choice defied logical prediction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7d_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When Sir Berich said he would take his Relics with him to war, and would not "
"listen to Sir Amiel's pleas, I allowed my anger to get the best of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a41_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When Sir Juncan died while questing after the Boots, I mourned his loss. Now, "
"I wonder if perhaps it was a mercy that he left us when he did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestions02_00002c14_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When Umaril joined with the Daedra, his spirit expanded beyond this realm. "
"His physical form can travel between realms, but his spirit is bound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark07FinChoice1A_000275ca_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"When all the guests lie dead, you will be free to leave. Now go, see the "
"doorman at Summitmist Manor. He will explain the rest. Have fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD4_0001e74f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When an Emperor is crowned, he uses the Amulet to light the Dragonfires at "
"the Temple of the One in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Wrath01Positive_0001525e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "When did all this happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d48b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When he gets there, we make him take off all his clothes, which is very easy "
"by the way. While they're helpless, that's when we spring the trap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_000146c8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When he has the amulet, his power will be increased, and Traven will be "
"helpless to stand in his way. You, I'm afraid, won't be standing at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGThievesGuildJobs_000165e5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When he leaves, you break in and steal some stuff. You don't need special "
"permission or orders to do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestions02_00002c14_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When his body is destroyed, his spirit travels back to Oblivion and is "
"reformed in the fires of creation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenBenirus_00003a71_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"When it was discovered that he did this, the Mages Guild called for a quick "
"meeting to decide what to do. It only took minutes to decide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGDPost2_0006e2dc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When more men are out there completing contracts, we all make more money. "
"Including you. I'll get on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0005482c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When my Lord walks the earth, you shall know that our victory is complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When people learn more about the Blackwood Company's methods, they won't be "
"so eager to hire them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028c39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When people start turning up dead, it's usually a good idea to keep your eyes "
"on any nearby Nords, if you understand what I'm saying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandCalm_0001d4c5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When she started taking walks in the garden at night, I became suspicious. I "
"didn't want to lose her. I should have trusted her... oh, Relfina...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandSad_0001d4c6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When she stopped in the garden, and Seridur stepped out of the shadows, my "
"heart sank. Then, suddenly, he was upon her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_0008e14d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When shopping there search every nook, you never know what you'll find until "
"you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b7e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When summoned, I can offer advice on your current endeavor. I imagine it's up "
"to you what to do with my wisdom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinCHoice2C_0004ce4b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When that happens, he tends to make our lives uncomfortable. Let's not give "
"the good captain any reason to go poking around in our affairs, hmm? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice2A_0004ce49_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When that happens, he tends to make our lives uncomfortable. Let's not give "
"the good captain any reason to go poking around in our affairs, hmm? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05FinChoice2B_0004ce4a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When that happens, he tends to make our lives uncomfortable. Let's not give "
"the good captain any reason to go poking around in our affairs, hmm? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChoice2_00038b48_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When the Lady learned of my birth she was furious, and threatened to kill "
"both my mother and me. So we fled, leaving my claim to nobility behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05WhatDoYouMean_00002c91_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When the Order crumbled, I set out on my own. After years of searching, I "
"found the Shield and brought it to Fort Bulwark for safe keeping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirStory1_00002b2c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When the Order fractured, I followed Sir Berich into war, taking the "
"Gauntlets with me. When it was over, I returned to Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeGauntlets_0001652e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "When the blood flows across your knuckles, think of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047633_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When the city is quiet, everybody is happy. Right? If you like noise, maybe "
"you're in the wrong place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000c4531_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When the foul portal cursed Cheydinhal with its presence, we bravely entered "
"to do battle with the vermin within."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1A_00032bec_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"When the rite of Purification has been completed, return to me here at Fort "
"Farragut, and we will discuss your future.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1B_00032bed_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"When the rite of Purification has been completed, return to me here at Fort "
"Farragut, and we will discuss your future.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1C_00032bee_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"When the rite of Purification has been completed, return to me here at Fort "
"Farragut, and we will discuss your future.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0008e13b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When the sun has left the sky, to the Choosy Beggar I would fly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08AncestorMoth_00048973_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When they are too old or too blind to work, they are sent to the Temple of "
"the Ancestor Moths."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08BribeBeggar_00015f1b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When they are too old or too blind to work, they are sent to the Temple of "
"the Ancestor Moths."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000181bb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When they attacked, I ran from Passwall. They didn't say a word, they just "
"started killing! The screams! By the staff, you can't imagine the screams!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a346_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When they get here, the guards will arrest you for trespassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002825b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When those soldiers came to Morrowind, they persecuted my people and stole "
"our lands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_InfoRefusal_000245a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When we are better friends, ask again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When we are done speaking, you will take this gem, you will then seek out "
"Mannimarco, and destroy him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_00005676_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When we confronted Lachance he tried to defend himself, tried to declare his "
"innocence! But we would not hear his treacherous lies! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da60_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When we decided to make the group official, Seridur offered his basement as "
"our headquarters. Quite nice, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Lynch02Positive_000151e9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When we formed the Brigands three months ago, I was told no more than a four "
"way split on all the profits!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c47cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When we're done with all this, we'll talk. If we're still alive..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06ShrineTalkStart_0003640f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When will the Master order the Cleansing to begin? Everything is ready. The "
"door is unlocked. We just need to throw it open for Lord Dagon to enter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016480_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When you are ready, I have a final task for you to undertake. It will, "
"undoubtedly, be the most important service you perform for the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3A_00090795_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you are ready, speak with me again, and I will deliver you safely to the "
"only place you can truly call home -- the Cheydinhal Sanctuary!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3B_00090796_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you are ready, speak with me again, and I will deliver you safely to the "
"only place you can truly call home -- the Cheydinhal Sanctuary!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3C_00090797_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you are ready, speak with me again, and I will deliver you safely to the "
"only place you can truly call home -- the Cheydinhal Sanctuary!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeMadnessClaymoreM_0001f3df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you are really angry, it feels good to hack into someone with a giant "
"blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting02_00002ad7_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you bow, you will receive a vision -- or perhaps not. It is unclear. The "
"priests saw that my body never moved, but it felt so real."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37ApprenticeSpell_0007b223_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you bring them to me, I intend to wait until the spell wears off to "
"capture them. I enjoy the challenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37ExpertSpell_0007b227_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you bring them to me, I intend to wait until the spell wears off to "
"capture them. I enjoy the challenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37JourneymanSpell_0007b225_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you bring them to me, I intend to wait until the spell wears off to "
"capture them. I enjoy the challenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062448_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you can provide me with ten Welkynd Stones, I'll provide you with "
"training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Accuse_00031503_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you find enough evidence, confront the person whom you believe to be the "
"villain, and see if they will confess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeMadnessAxe_0001f3ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When you hack off an arm, the blood spurts out in surges."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_00062461_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you have seen the reality of the world, spoken with the poor and the "
"suffering, then we shall talk of training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1A_00032bf0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When you leave here, we will not speak again, unless I deem it necessary. Ah "
"yes, there is one last thing. I have for you a very special gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1B_00032bf1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When you leave here, we will not speak again, unless I deem it necessary. Ah "
"yes, there is one last thing. I have for you a very special gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1C_00032bf3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When you leave here, we will not speak again, unless I deem it necessary. Ah "
"yes, there is one last thing. I have for you a very special gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaSpeech_0008ade4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you mutter in your sleep, you speak to me. When you waken wet with "
"sweat, you've just left my house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc7c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you visit a Wayshrine of Zenithar, and you've lived a good life by the "
"Nine, you may receive a Blessing of Luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f226_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you're done boring me, why don't you go have a chat with the new "
"Gatekeeper? Run along now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you're ready for battle, the Countess will order her men to stop closing "
"the Gates outside the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When you're ready for work, go and speak with Vicente Valtieri. He handles "
"all assignments for new family members.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"When you're ready for work, go and speak with Vicente Valtieri. He handles "
"all assignments for new family members.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05WhyMe_0002c6df_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"When you're ready to do this, I'll give you the amulet. Only I know the "
"secret way it can be removed from his neck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0000c0d0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you're ready to get eviscerated, just head up the ramp to the Arena. "
"Good luck, and may Azura have mercy on your soul. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05Money_00027f38_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "When you're ready to go and see him, let me know. But please, do hurry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00034877_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"When you've contributed enough to the guild coffers by selling stolen items "
"to Ongar, I might have something for you. Come back then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you've got the money for it, then maybe I'll consider letting you have a "
"room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gift_0018bc39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When you've got the silver pitcher and the four glasses, let me know. I can't "
"wait to see the look on her face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00041059_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When your blade bites into your foe and he screams in pain, think of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2C_0004cad1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"When... When Hides-His-Heart gets here, I'll put on a little act. You'll cut "
"me with your poison knife, and that idiot will think I'm dead! Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestToddSuprise_00027fa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "When? I didn't know that! How can this be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08KurdanIfIDont_0001f42e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Whenever yer ready, and it better be soon, I'll have a boat waitin' for you "
"to get to Fort Grief Island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Unseen_000a01b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where ... go? Grrr."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003640b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where am I? What is this place? Arkay preserve me, I remember now ... hooded "
"men grabbed me as I was leaving the Temple ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23Help_00094c42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where are my manners? I'm Ralsa Norvalo. My husband, Gilen, has requested "
"that I find you and ask if you'd assist him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Covenant_0002d77b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Where are our gods? The Enemy triumphs, and we die alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32AcolyteWarning_0008fb6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where are the rest of the keep defenders?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b28_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where are they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where are those Dark Elves? Let me deal with them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where are you going? What are you doing? We need to keep our eyes on each "
"other!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Unseen_00025344_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03AltarofKynareth_00002a4d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where better to meet and pray to Kynareth than in the midst of her beautiful "
"creations?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047685_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where can you find a bed in the City? I hear the Tiber Septim Hotel in Talos "
"Plaza is very nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where can you find some fun? That depends on your idea of fun. You can bet, "
"fight, or both at the Arena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038adc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where can you get sheep's cheese but in Skingrad? And why? Because only in "
"Skingrad is Uuras, Master of Sheep's Cheese!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060531_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where did Sheogorath go? Great. I bet he got sick and died. We're all going "
"to die now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where did you come from? You look real enough. You must be from the outside! "
"Oh, thank goodness someone finally came!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity5_00081e85_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Where did you find that? I was sure I once had Din's Ashes on display here... "
"I wish I had the funds to replace them, they were very popular...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where does our food come from? The Heartlands. And the Nibenean Valley. And "
"Skingrad? Great wines, cheeses, and tomatoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047671_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where else? You have to be here. This is THE City. The BIG City. Why waste "
"time in little places?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006038f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where has Sheogorath gone? Does he not realize the danger Sheer-Meedish is in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006036a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where has Sheogorath gone? Mama always said, \"The Prince of Madness is a "
"basket of riddles.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060526_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where has Sheogorath gone? Who will save us from the cats? Won't someone "
"think of the cats?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000605e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where has our Lord gone? I hope He returns soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d0ad_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Where is Martin? I was told that he had arrived in the capital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060330_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where is Our Lord? Does he go to get the Fork?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f587_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where is Sheogorath now? He has abandoned you, as he did me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DuchessofMania_0001746b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Where is Syl? Have you seen her? That traitorous coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DukeofMania_0001746d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Where is Syl? Have you seen her? That traitorous coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DuchessofDementia_00017d0b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Where is Thadon? Have you seen him? That traitorous coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DukeofDementia_0001746c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Where is Thadon? Have you seen him? That traitorous coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008dd58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where is our Lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Covenant_0002d77b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Where is our blessing? Where is our protection?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49DukeDeadMean_00091c58_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Where is the Count's ring? Do you have it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091c4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where is the Count? Why is he not with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MundaneAmulet_00038b0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where is the amulet? I would like to see it again before I can tell you of "
"its true nature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_00015859_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where is this note? Produce it immediately!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting01_00002c0d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Where once there were Eight, now One more stands with them, and they have "
"become Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aeb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where shall I stand, your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Positions_00015453_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where should I wait? Up close, or farther back? I'll try to help whomever I'm "
"near."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC01Choice1_0003662a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Where there's one, there will be more. Find Pinarus Inventius. He's a hunter, "
"and knows this area inside and out. He'll know what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where to buy weapons? Where to buy anything, if you can afford to travel, is "
"the Market District in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where to sleep? The Tiber Septim Hotel in Talos Plaza is nice but expensive. "
"Luther Broad's Boarding House in Elven Gardens is just okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09GiveArrowHead_0001cf36_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Where was I? Oh, yes. You have embarrassed the Thieves Guild and me with your "
"crude murders to recover the arrowhead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479f4_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Where was I? Oh. Yes. We sell paints. Good horses. Good enough, anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Where would you go for the best blunt weapons? Slash 'N Smash in the Imperial "
"City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08Orders_0001aeaf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where would you like me, your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b076_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Where you heard this information I'll never know, but please don't mention it "
"again. Accusation without proof is unfounded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKELOVE_0018b2dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where'd you get that? That's good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00047466_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where's Erthor? I haven't seen him lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086567_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where's Fisherman's Rock?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086568_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Where's Weebam-Na?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b22_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Whether it is connected to the fate of the Gauntlets, I do not know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FightersGuildTopic_00049973_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Whether that means ridding a town of an invading menace or protecting a "
"helpless mage, we'll take the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004ed60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whew. I've never worked so hard on a formula in my life, but I got your Grand "
"Elixir of Exploration done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bcc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whew. That was scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMHeavyArmor_00014e77_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Which heavy armor piece do you want to soften your enemies' blows?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkHeavyArmor_00014d89_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Which heavy armor piece would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013452_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid "Which is to say, none."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkLightArmor_00014e96_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Which light armor piece would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM0Crafting_00014e2f_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Which of my Lord's boons do you require this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkBlade_00014e84_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Which type of blade weapon would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkBlunt_00014d87_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "Which type of blunt weapon would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RewardTopic_000a3df5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Which would you prefer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f08d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Which... um... leads me to something I may have failed to mention before. My "
"ancestors will see my \"revival\" as a desecration of their tomb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006139b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While Daedra still roam free in Kvatch, I can think of nothing else. When my "
"city is safe, then I will train you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f87c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While Faelian walks the streets of the Imperial City, the Night Mother weeps "
"in her restlessness. Kill this High Elf, and all will be well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoD1_000a6583_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"While I am not without means of defending myself, I believe you would be an "
"invaluable companion on such an expedition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095784_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While I believe that you should be attending to your duties, it is, of "
"course, your prerogative to spend time wherever you wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While I continue to study the Mysterium Xarxes, you should keep searching for "
"the Armor of Tiber Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While I continue to study the Mysterium Xarxes, you should keep searching for "
"the daedric artifact we'll need for the ritual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13ChoiceWhatproblem_000039a4_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"While I do not believe my identity has been compromised, I do not wish to "
"take any chances, and so cannot act on either matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersAmuletTopic_0000c08a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"While I do not doubt that she was right, I question whether her motives were "
"genuine. She seemed all too eager to explore its power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00009224_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"While I do not know for quite what purpose he has arrived, I believe the "
"Guild of Mages is in great danger. Mannimarco has returned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "While I understand Bruma's need, Chorrol's own defense must come first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG14Choice1A_0000a0fd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"While I welcome the break from correspondence with her, I worry that "
"something may be amiss, given recent developments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033fcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "While I'm getting oriented here, you should follow Jauffre's orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb25_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"While I'm overjoyed to see a friendly face, I'm afraid I have some bad news "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07WhyNotKillLex_0000c049_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"While Lex is a problem for the guild, his unwavering loyalty and resolve make "
"him the perfect protector for Lady Umbranox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While Skingrad is threatened by an Oblivion Gate, I cannot spare any soldiers "
"for Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While being summoned is truly a wonderful thing, and not at all tiresome, I "
"believe Lord Sheogorath wishes you to speak with Him again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251b9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"While carried, the scales will magically enhance your Strength, Intelligence "
"and Agility... but diminish your Personality. A powerful tool indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00023e45_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"While carrying out a contract, you may have the opportunity to earn a bonus "
"if certain parameters are met. Now, let's begin, shall we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeatherleahTopic_000242ae_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"While my mother didn't survive, Reynald did, and for that I'm grateful. But "
"we both want more - we want our home back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00014b5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While not the source of the Daedric Princes' authority, each Daedric artifact "
"provides that Prince with a measure of power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e8de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While that infernal Oblivion Gate still stands, I don't dare leave the camp "
"undefended. Are you willing to try and close it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSister_0002528e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While the Brotherhood maintains its ancient name, membership is always open "
"to skilled women. For can we not draw blood as well as any man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateTopic_0008571a_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"While the Dragonfires burned, the divine barriers kept the daedra from making "
"more than fleeting visits to our world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d284_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While the Guard hid behind the walls, you took the fight to Oblivion itself! "
"Maybe your example will inspire others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_000356ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While the information we got from the Argonian was valuable, we need more. I "
"want you to infiltrate them. See how they work from the inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c79_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While you may have performed greater deeds, none have meant more to me than "
"your redemption of my friend Berich."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEM02ImperialGuard_00002353_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While you may think you oppose Him, He is eternal and will always prevail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d88_AltarDeluxe_RESP2"
msgid ""
"While you may think you oppose Him, He is eternal and will always prevail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d8a_AltarDeluxe_RESP2"
msgid ""
"While you may think you oppose Him, He is eternal and will always prevail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MartinE_00049815_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"While you were gone, I sent a messenger to Chancellor Ocato. He waits for us "
"in the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While you were gone, I've made some progress in deciphering the Mysterium "
"Xarxes ritual. The third item we need is a Great Welkynd Stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047355_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "While you will remain here in the Eternal Garden... forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "While you're in Anvil, we'll treat your horse like an honored guest. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004765f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"While you're in the Market District, see  Rohssan's weapons at A Fighting "
"Chance, and see Varnado and Maro Rufus at The Best Defense for armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who am I? How about a failure, a fraud, an utter sham. I'm a poet without "
"merit, a slave to my own stupidity and will likely ruin your day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13WhoAreYou_000a3847_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who am I? I'm shocked you don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b82a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who are they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008adc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who are you, who dares to walk in the House of Shadow? What business do you "
"have with the Lord Vaermina?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c42d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreB1_0001e74a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Who are you? How did you get this? What do you know of the Emperor's death?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA2_00082dc8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Who are you? What do you really want with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who are you? What do you want? I ain't done nothin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0012dd32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who are you? Why do you invade our place of worship? Surely, you don't think "
"yourself worthy to visit Namira's shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_0006172c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who cares about Crucible? Who will replace Thadon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432d2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who cares if a new adventurer will be in our Realm soon, he wouldn't wish to "
"hear what I have to say anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who could have done this? Who could have killed a sweet, innocent girl? Was "
"it you? So help me, if I find out you're the one who did this...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066f26_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Who did I lose to? Who is my great enemy? Well, don't laugh... it's a bunch "
"of damn fish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00077c4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who do the Grummites worship? Some say Sheogorath, but I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_00031526_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who do you think you are questioning me? I'd just assume ask a goblin maiden "
"to a dance then to answer your stupid questions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b584_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who does he think he is, acting all high and mighty?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Hate_0007866f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Who has time for this sort of thing? I mean, at this rate, I'll grow old and "
"die before he's out of our hair!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GaidenShinjiTopic_00146856_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who is Gaiden Shinji? Are you serious? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sithis_000251ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who is Sithis, you ask? Some call him the Dread Father. It was his terrible "
"love that gave birth to the Dark Brotherhood, so very long ago. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice4_00026b17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who is Umbra? I can tell you who Umbra used to be. Lenwin. She's my "
"apprentice. Or at least she was, until she found that sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusChoice6_00026b19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who is Umbra? I can tell you who Umbra used to be. Lenwin. She's my "
"apprentice. Or at least she was, until she found that sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024f46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who is the fairest of them all? Other than myself? The proprietor of the Grey "
"Mare is lovely. She and the guard captain would be a nice couple...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08SavillasStoneTopic_0009838e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who is this Savilla? A former lover perhaps? I don't know anyone by that name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice8_000133e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who is to say? There are always choices to be made. The Realm of Madness is "
"no different in that regard. Your choices are your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEWildernessRumorResponses_0006142a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who knows what will get in, now that the Gatekeeper is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e0ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who knows when Roland may strike again? You must hurry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a80_Knights_RESP8"
msgid ""
"Who now can succeed in the quest for the Relics, where the greatest knights "
"of legend all failed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ08ArtifactE_00038fb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who now knows the tale of how this Dwemer hammer came to embody the power of "
"one of their most bitter foes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenEmperor_0000bcdf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who now will save us from the coming darkness?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b595_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who put that there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12FithragaerWho_00095025_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Who the blazes are you, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who told you that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who wants to be a mage? I hate books, spells, stinky bottles, writing, all "
"that stuff, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081da4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who was that I was talking to? Not Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00082649_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who will guide us, now that she is gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00015e09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who will help an old beggar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000093b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who will help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechKnights_00002a5a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who will match the deeds of Sir Amiel and his companions when they smote the "
"Wyrm of Elenglynn to recover the Cuirass of the Crusader?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004665c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who will prevail, the Pit Dog from the Yellow Team, or the Pit Dog from the "
"Blue Team? Let's find out! Lower the gates!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d8_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who will stand for the Eight and One? Who will complete Pelinal's holy "
"mission of vengeance upon Umaril the Unfeathered?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICMonsterAnnounce_00093cda_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who will survive this week's epic battle of combatant versus beast? Let's "
"find out! Lower the gates!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a72_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Who will walk the Pilgrim's Way, as did the questing knights of old?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f425_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who would want an entire army destroyed, and for what purpose? I know there's "
"something big going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c2a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who're you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032ead_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who's on duty tonight? It's not me, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who's talking to you? I'm not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Noticed_00025338_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c2a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who... wha... are you... time is it? Hic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_000280a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who?  Nah, I haven't seen any young women around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff0d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who? Faelian? I don't see how that's any business of yours at all. Really, "
"the gall of some people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Who? Oh, her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028713_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Who? Who among us is vile enough to take the life of such a beautiful, "
"precious creature? If I find out who did this, they will pay with their life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AssaultNoCrime_00062504_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whoa ho! This is gonna be good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00023798_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whoa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007028e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoa, girl! Whoa! Easy now... It's all right. Sorry, civilian. My steed gets "
"spooked a bit easily. It's all those damn goblins and trolls, you see. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoa, look at the fangs on you! There's a new ruler in Bliss. Don't bite me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004423d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoa, look at the fangs on you! There's a new ruler in Crucible. Don't bite "
"me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Whoa. What was that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Armand4_0005143d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoever brings me the the diary of Amantius Allectus, without killing him, "
"will be invited into the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275cc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Whoever invited us here must at least know us, don't you think? In any event, "
"we're all stuck here together, so we might as well get acquainted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoever killed the Gatekeeper must have been dedicated and hard working. That "
"reminds me... it's time I get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_000289fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoever the killer is would have to be strong, and quick. Now, I'm not saying "
"Primo is our murderer, but you have to admit it's at least possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Whoever this new person in the Isles is, he'd better steer clear of "
"Deepwallow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314f7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Whom did you accuse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06FinChoice1A_0003005d_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Whomever arranged this contract wants it to look like Roderick died from his "
"illness, so discretion is essential. Attack no one! Be seen by no one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3C3_000192eb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Why Sheogorath sent us a male, I'll never understand. If you're going to help "
"us take control of the Altar of Despair, you need to decide now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043002_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are pirates, pirates? Because they just Arrrghhh! Oh ho ho ho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001ad49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you bothering me with that wagging tongue? Do you know how long it "
"would waggle after I rip it from your mouth? I do. Don't tempt me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07ForgedLetter_0000c233_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you bothering me? It isn't done yet. Now get out of here and let me "
"finish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e7ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you following me? Please... go away. I'm quite busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f36f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you here again? You'll only draw attention to us, give them one more "
"reason to attack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e42_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you here talking to me? I need you to go investigate the Forsaken "
"Mine. And now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081190_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you here? I thought I gave you a task to complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03Choice1C_00023f3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you here? What do you want? Get out of my house!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ce96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you here? You are still too pleasing to speak with Namira. Begone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028ce2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you so concerned with my feelings toward a young Dark Elf girl? You "
"wouldn't be so stupid as to try and turn me against her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008daa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002d933_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you still here? Leave this house, before my anger gets the best of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e4b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you still here? You're supposed to go speak with my father!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_0002a869_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you talking to me? Go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a2ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why are you talking to me? Shouldn't you be finding Maglir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG07ChoiceKaltharWhy_0003378f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Why are you trying to ruin everything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_0002817c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why are you trying to turn me against the Nord? Maybe you did, and you're "
"just trying to cover your tracks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f549_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why aren't you finding Pinarus?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000327c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why aren't you in Water's Edge?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bfa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why aren't you working?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f235_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why build the Gatekeeper again, if he will one day fall? Seems so sad and "
"pointless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ee2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why can't they send someone here to torture the Scalons? More important than "
"courtiers, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081529_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why can't they understand me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ed3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why did I cross the road? To avoid the other J'zidzo. That's no joke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043008_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why did Sheogorath measure the Shivering Isles? Because he's the ruler! Ah ho "
"ho ho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005efa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why did the Knights of Order cross the Fringe? No one knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043001_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why did the bandit take a bath? To get a clean getaway! Ahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081bf7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why did you come here? Why do you still do the bidding of that prattling fool?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f7d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why did you come here? Why do you still do the bidding of that prattling "
"madman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00002d2f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why didn't someone listen to the prophet? He said Anvil was only the "
"beginning!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002443c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Why didn't you help him? You could've saved him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a7f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why die for a false god?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c4569_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do I come to the Arena? Honestly? I love the way the combatants move. "
"It's like an... an erotic dance. The bodies, the sweat, the... oh. I, um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopicDarJee02_000479b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do Khajiit lick their butts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006a843_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do the guards insist on letting you rabble inside University grounds? "
"Take your pedestrian gawkery to the Arena! Begone! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ffe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do wizards write books? Because they're good at spelling! Ahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00043e22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you approach the Duchess of Dementia? Do you seek death?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c15c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you bother me, stranger? You make far too much noise. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you bother me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00024145_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you bother me? Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b499_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you bother me? Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetGreetA1_00002aab_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Why do you come to me for aid, worthy knight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473c3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Why do you delay? Do you fear to face Mankar Camoran himself? As well you "
"should."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036648_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do you disturb me? I must free the Shrine so that I can sleep. It has "
"been so long since I have slept."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f584_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you fight for the Madgod?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002798b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do you get to go to a party? It's not fair. I hope they discover the "
"truth and kill you in your sleep! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007eb5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do you hesitate? Is it your destiny that you fear? Or perhaps your "
"concern is that you will die before you gain the Throne of Madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you insist on annoying me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013386_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do you speak to me, when you have the Chalice but have not yet returned "
"it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DABoethiaSpeech_00051ed5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why do you summon me? You are not one of my faithful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c233_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Why do you think your world has always been contested ground, the arena of "
"powers and immortals?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b96f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why do you torture me? I don't want any trouble with your kind! I've got "
"dogs, you know. Vicious ones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why does Valen Dreth still live? Breaking into the Imperial Prison is "
"difficult, I know, but the contract must be fulfilled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why does everyone in this city look at me like I'm speaking gibberish?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02RelmynaVisit_0001a12c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why does it still hurt, after all these years? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a171_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why does the prey approach me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GenericBanditC_000a343e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why does this one always have to get the beggars?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_0018d307_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why doesn't the Elder Council send the Legion to help us? There's no telling "
"when another Oblivion Gate will open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_00028c35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why don't you and that barbarian climb back under your rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_0005383a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why don't you come back when you actually have the amulet and stop wasting my "
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_000286f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why don't you go ask him yourself? Or maybe you're afraid? You should be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrespassNoCrime_0006250f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why don't you just go? We don't want any trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why don't you just walk around and look for yourself? You need someone to "
"explain everything to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05BaurusNextMove_00022b23_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Why don't you take that book to her, see what she makes of it. I'll keep "
"running down leads on the Mythic Dawn network."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fdb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why has the Cheydinhal Sanctuary not yet been Purified? Everyone based out of "
"that location must die. Only then will the Black Hand be satisfied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d92e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why have our gods forsaken us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why isn't father here? He knows how important this is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcCaptainOrders_00018fc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why isn't he dying? Keep fighting men!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0001cb77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why isn't he here yet? What's taking him so long? He knew we were coming back "
"for him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008ea01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why look at you! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_0003d087_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why must I be such a soft touch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d62b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Why not spice things up a bit, give the people of Cyrodiil what they really "
"want? We revise the rules of competiton, offer a new kind of match..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b1d8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Why not spice things up a bit, give the people of Cyrodiil what they really "
"want? We revise the rules of competiton, offer a new kind of match... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro2_00082468_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why not? Something has to work. Once, I dug a pit and filled it with clouds. "
"Or was it clowns? Doesn't matter. It didn't slow him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18Convo_0001cb75_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why not? We can't just let those creatures live, and no one else is going to "
"do anything about it, so we should get going!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranDaggerDontGive_00019fd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why not? What is it you are waiting for? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why should I get up to greet the day when every living thing mocks me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008efcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why should I help defend Vitharn? Isn't that was the soldiers are paid to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43GoAway_00079f4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why should I leave just because you tell me to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhereIsRing_00035fae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why should I tell you where it is? Here I sit in Leyawiin's dungeon while you "
"are free. What will you do for Amusei if I tell you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why should I trust your word? You'll have to do better than this to persuade "
"me to take action against one of the other Watch Captains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e067_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Why should we be forced to work under someone who's only kept sane by a "
"magical trinket? Haven't we sacrificed enough already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e441_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why visit that other smith? Piercing flesh with my blades doesn't satisfy you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004bb66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why won't you just leave me alone? What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKnightsStartCombat_00002b4d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Why won't you stay dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate3_00015858_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why would I be so stupid as to carry it around? It's safe in my home. Yes, "
"that's right. Are you going to go and get it yourself? I think not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_0006142e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why would I care if someone is helping Thadon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why would Thadon need a stupid Chalice when he could simply have me as a "
"refreshment? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutsideChoiceU2_000790b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why would he want to sleep in a bedroll and give me his bed? Sounds queer. I "
"bet it's just another trick to get my head all twisted around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028176_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why would one of us kill Neville? What if they try to get the rest of us? "
"You'll protect me, won't you? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000c47e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why would one want to swing a staff? A mace hurts more. Or a sword. Can't "
"shoot a fireball from a sword, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028b80_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Why would someone invite us here? Why would they just give away an entire "
"chest of gold? If I didn't know better, I'd say this whole thing is a trap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00019539_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why would you come to me with Thadon's problems? You think I don't know what "
"you've been tasked with? Why would I help my enemy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKellenTopic_00002b04_Knights_RESP3"
msgid "Why would you do such a thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestNo_00002a51_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why you insist on returning if you are not willing to do what is necessary?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000432c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why'd the adventurer walk through the Gates of Madness? To get to the other "
"side!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0018bd70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why, Brother? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SurpriseReceive_0002424b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why, I never knew!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0018bd6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why, Sister? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why, all the important people in the guild are there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_0002b633_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Why, do you have something of interest to my master?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_0002b43e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Why, have you already found another statue for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d58e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why, hello there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e703_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why, hello there! I'm Brithaur! It's a pleasure to meet someone who doesn't "
"judge me so harshly. The people here, they have some ideas about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06BribeBeggar_000104e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why, yes it would! Theranis was drinking in the Two Sisters Lodge. He was "
"bragging about stealing something from the castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b983b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why, yes. I do have a lovely room available for a mere 40 gold a night. Are "
"you interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000ca2bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why, yes. I do have a lovely room available for a mere 40 gold a night. Are "
"you interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice3_00014b64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why, you will, of course. It has always been Sheogorath's intent for you to "
"be the new Madgod."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AngerReceive_0002425c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why... I ought to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC07Choice6_00009214_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why... thank you! This will be enough to pay off my debtors. Please, keep the "
"sword and armor until I can pay you back. Thank you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EyeofNocturnalTOPIC_00026ac0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why... why would you ask? I've never heard of it. No idea what you're talking "
"about. And Weebam-Na doesn't know, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d268_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why... won't... you... die?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaTalk05_00086571_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_000531bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why? I mean... of course. All I have available right now is a hovel on the "
"Waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why? What drove you to this madness?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38GuardChoice3_00023682_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why? What's he done?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028225_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Why? Why would someone do this? The taking of a life is against every "
"principal I hold dear. It's something I just can't understand. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e65d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why? Why would you light the Great Torch for Dementia?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG11ChoiceWhyBusy_00033632_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Why? Why? Oh, no real reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_disappearances_0000be6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Will O' the Wisps? I've never heard of them killing a man! Please, find out "
"what happened to our friends. We're counting on your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ec1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Will Thadon's Chalice make Deepwallow any safer for me? No? Then I don't care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGDPost1_0006e2e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Will do. I'll get right to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMain_00002a74_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Will no one take up this holy crusade? Will no one walk the ancient Pilgrim's "
"Way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05NoBribeBeggar4_0009133c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Will no-one help a poor beggar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinBattleSpeech_0003d060_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Will we let the daedra do to Bruma what they did to Kvatch? Will we let them "
"burn our homes? We will let them kill our families?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294e_Knights_RESP5"
msgid "Will you accept me, as unworthy as I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002939_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Will you come with me to seek the blessing of Stendarr the Steadfast? The "
"land is sore in need of righteous governance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000294c_Knights_RESP4"
msgid "Will you have us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting3b1_00019fce_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Will you help me bring the Apostles to the light? And help yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3C3_000192eb_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Will you help us destroy the Mazken or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3C3_000192ec_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Will you help us destroy the Mazken or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttack_00012cc9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Will you help us retake the Altar of Despair, and drive the Mazken out of "
"Cylarne once and for all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Response_000452e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Will you let me clean and organize your house?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_0001cf3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Will you pay the blood price?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002997_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Will you please tell me what Areldur has said about this curse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047692_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Winson. I just work for Luther. I don't want no trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32OfferHelp_00012d04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wisely answered. My people and I are in need. Maybe you can help us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fugitives_00034580_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wish I could help you out, but the locals aren't talking. You might try "
"asking around, butter them up a bit. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Fugitives_00009c2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wish I had more to tell you about them, but I don't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_defaulted_0002ee69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wish I knew what happened. He had a contract for a local mage in Bravil. "
"Didn't seem like a particularly difficult assignment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d30a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Witches! How dare they prey on our men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026e9c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With Anvil safe for the moment, I will send some of my best soldiers to "
"bolster the Bruma garrison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DragonfiresTopic_00033fc8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With Emperor Uriel dead and no successor crowned, the Temple of the One will "
"be dark for the first time in centuries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With Modryn Oreyn gone, and Vilena Donton mourning her lost sons, who's left "
"to lead the Fighters Guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice1_0003570e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With Oreyn? He was dismissed! I should expel you now! But... no. It isn't "
"Oreyn who is to blame. I fear it is I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With Regulus Terentius for a father, what do you expect from Gellius? The "
"acorn never falls too far from the tree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00044237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With Syl gone, perhaps someone will help us out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEManiaRumorResponses_00061776_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With Thadon dead and Syl gone, there's only one Duke left in the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005edcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With Thadon gone, perhaps someone will help us out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With Vitellus dead, Vilena thinks only about protecting Viranus. That's a "
"sure way to ruin the boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PurificationTopic_0002fd9c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"With a Purification, we cleanse the Dark Brotherhood of mistrust and "
"treachery. Those who are slain are offered to Sithis as a symbol of fealty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061437_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With a body count like that on your head, you're my kind of person. You want "
"training? Fine by me. Be sure and put it to good use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBowMagic_00016ce5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With a gentle moan, this bow will yield to your pull. With a scream of "
"delight, it will launch pain into your enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032dfa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With a possible attack looming, I must be free to make preparations. Good "
"luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JeanneFrasoricTopic_0001cef5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With all due respect to our wonderful leader..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06KanehMirel_00012cbc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With all due respect, Aurmazl, I ask that you reconsider. The main passage is "
"strongly defended. Perhaps if you'd allow me to scout further..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12JauffreMartin_0007be8c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With all due respect, sire, there must be another way. The risk is too great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018c77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With all due respect, the hour grows late and the situation grows darker. If "
"we are to complete this plan, you must go now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c223_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With all that time in the vineyard, it's a wonder he has time to practice his "
"marksmanship."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bca3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With all the farms in Nibenay, there's still plenty of forest and wilderness "
"open for settlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f21f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With all the trouble on the road recently, I expected to be the only one "
"staying at the inn. It's a welcome surprise though, believe me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With an open Oblivion Gate just outside our walls, I cannot risk weakening "
"Cheydinhal's defenses, even for such a worthy cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeMadnessClaymore_0001f3dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With enough force, this will cleave through meat and bone. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000bcb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With every unattainable contract my sister gives you, I find myself loving "
"her more and more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08NelsNevConvo_000852c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With every word you speak you're just proving me right, Nord. Your kind has "
"contributed nothing to our Empire, and never will!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043e89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With his Chalice returned, Thadon seems to smile at least four times as "
"often. That's just an estimation, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChallengeImperial_0009f9b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With his keen mind and eyes, the Imperial measures you. Give him what he "
"seeks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenWhoInformant_000835f8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With my blessing, he infiltrated the group, and has fed us information for "
"quite some time, until recently. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00061382_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With no Emperor to serve, the Blades now return to our ancient role. We will "
"bide our time until the next Dragonborn arises."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElderCouncilTopic_000add0c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With no legitimate claimant for the Dragon Throne... troubled times lie ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetB1_0005e377_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With pleasure, My Lord! My Aureals will gladly die in Your service!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13CaptainGreetB1_0001a79e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With pleasure, My Lord! My Mazken will gladly die in Your service!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Reman_000980f6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With such an Empire at his disposal, he conquered most of Tamriel, except "
"Morrowind of course, and was crowned Emperor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor15_0003247f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With such hope, and with the promise of your aid, my heart must be satisfied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b081_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"With that done, the Fringe should be secure. For now. I can feel things start "
"to get a little hairy. And, not in the good way, like on your head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000151f4_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"With that door sealed, there's no way we're getting inside, so we'll have to "
"wait for them to come out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_00034068_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the Amulet taken by the enemy, we must get Martin to safety at Cloud "
"Ruler Temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00058e02_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With the Count worrying more about his son than the defense of the city, "
"things were looking pretty grim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreD4_0001e74f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"With the Emperor dead and no new heir crowned, the Dragonfires in the Temple "
"will be dark, for the first time in centuries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDementiaRumorResponses_000613eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With the Gatekeeper dead, it's good to have the Resonator working again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the Gatekeeper dead, there's one less line of defense against these "
"damnable Scalons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the Gatekeeper gone, it's only a matter of time before we have every "
"manner of riff-raff swarming into the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005effb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the Gatekeeper gone, the Knights of Order have been causing trouble in "
"the Fringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b081_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the Gatekeeper restored and Xedilian in operation, we won't have to "
"worry about anything getting in. Things already here are another matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00060861_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the Greymarch ended, I need to devote some serious study to the "
"obelisks. They have proven more interesting than I had thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00026ea0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "With the Oblivion Gate closed, I can now gladly send aid to Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12RootDungeon_0001a324_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the Pools cleansed, the Font of Madness will soon be restored. There's "
"no time like the present to finish your journey towards godhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting02C_00002cd3_Knights_RESP4"
msgid ""
"With the ancient gifts of the Eight, and the new gift of the One, you are "
"ready to face Umaril."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestions02_00002c14_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With the armor of the gods and the Blessing of Talos, you will be able to "
"follow him where Pelinal could not and destroy his very spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07HowToForge_0000c237_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the forged letter in hand, sneak into the Legion Commander's office in "
"the Imperial City Prison and seal it with his seal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND05WhatDoYouMean_00002c91_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the help of a few trusted friends, I began work to keep the Shield safe "
"for all eternity. I never saw my work finished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_0004681b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the help of your armies, the incident has been cleared up. Your loyal "
"subjects have sent this in tribute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PalePassTopic_00018229_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the information you have given me about Pale Pass, it could take "
"scholars many years to amend the history books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PalePassTopic_00132aa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the information you have given me about Pale Pass, it could take "
"scholars many years to amend the history books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_0003353d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the mystery solved, we can explore the rest of the ruins and see if "
"there's further information we can divulge from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11SheogorathChoice3_00014b67_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the staff, there was hope. But now, hope is dead. I am dead. The "
"Realm...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027981_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the two of us working together, we're sure to find the chest before "
"anyone else. What do you say? Do you want to team up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034861_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"With the voices quieted for now, the words you seek have come to me. You "
"shall have my... recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0006050c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With the whole Realm in jeopardy, my days of work may be at an end. How truly "
"sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00054828_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With this blade I have severed the Septim line forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice1A_00016482_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"With this gem in your possession, you will be impervious to his attempts to "
"enthrall you. When he fails, that is when you shall strike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice4C_0003562b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With this staff, you'll render others incapable of using magic against you. "
"If you'd prefer something else, we can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice4A_00035629_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With this, you can manipulate people's opinions of you. Is this what you "
"want? If not, we can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018b207_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With those Oblivion Gates opening everywhere, it's only a matter of time "
"before another city goes the way of Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028799_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With two of us now dead, it seems like the others are looking to Neville for "
"protection. The fools! He'll kill them like he did the others!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMBlunt_00014e56_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "With what do you want to crush your foes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMBlade_00014e50_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "With what do you want to cut down your foes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMLightArmor_00014e71_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "With which light armor piece do you want to sneak and murder?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034e9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"With your help I uncovered the informant that had compromised the Thieves "
"Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006a850_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "With your permission, I take my leave of you now, Scholar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Within its walls live those who determine the fate of the guild. It is our "
"stronghold, our sanctuary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartB1_00002c86_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Without a champion, the gods are powerless to act. But who among us is worthy "
"to wield the Divine Crusader's weaponry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e91d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Without a full 30 samples, I can't extract enough of it to produce the "
"stronger Elixir. Come back when you've found that many."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d0b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Without any solid evidence to back that accusation up, you don't have cause "
"to assume that is where Agarmir gets his merchandise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002db93_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Without my amulet, my stone to lock the voices away, the words will never "
"come and stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002420b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Without question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b150_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Without question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b159_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Without question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Without recommendations from the local guildhalls, you'll never see the "
"inside of it. I dare say that's one of the few things Traven has done right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00062bcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Without the Council of Mages to guide us, how will we stand up to the King of "
"Worms?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03Reactivated_0008e94b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Without the crystals in place, the Resonator of Judgment, Xedilian's power "
"source, cannot be restored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000355c3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Witseidutsei gives you her guarantee! Everything, clean, always, or you do "
"not pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003de50_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Witseidutsei runs a clean establishment. She really hates it when people mess "
"up her place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinNQDResponses_0003de5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Witseidutsei takes great pains to keep that place clean. She doesn't tolerate "
"people messing it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047702_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wo! You SCARED me! I was off in my happy place, and you just popped in and "
"wrecked my whole thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_00058e0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Won't anyone else send help? We can't be the only city willing to come to "
"Bruma's aid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00073111_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Won't someone end me? Take my life, please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_001885e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Won't you help me... please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b59d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonder why Solstheim wasn't on the old maps... not that anyone should care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2ae_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Wonderful thing, wine. It's all about the balance. The flavor, the bouquet, "
"the consistency... just wonderful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00091d2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful to have it back. Really, truly. I can't thank you enough. Oh, wait. "
"I already did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEOdditiesTourYes_00081eba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! Follow me, and I'll show you around my little collection of "
"Oddities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuyAnvil_0004ce5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! Go out front. Ernest will have the White saddled and ready for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37SdrassaHelp_00022e5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! I had a good feeling about you from the moment that I saw you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice3_00026af3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wonderful! I would be glad to tell you more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonate_00081eab_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! I'll put you on my list of Special Donors. It's a very exclusive "
"list, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity2_00043427_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! Looking at the tentacle, I'm not sure whether to be disgusted or "
"terrified. Just the kind of thing I'm looking for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_000844c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! Remember, I will be happy to give you the same price for any "
"others that you find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04XedilianChoice_00044f52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wonderful! Time for a celebration... Cheese for everyone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice2A_000242a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wonderful! Weatherleah is ours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22GiveCarving_0002af38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! You are indeed a treasure hunter of exceptional talents! Here is "
"your reward as promised!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightshadeTopic_00053735_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful. I do hope you didn't try to eat any of it. It can have very nasty "
"effects on one such as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyBruma_0004f215_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful. I'll have the deed transfered to you. Here is your key to the door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wonderful. People are dropping dead and I'm trapped here looking for gold I "
"don't even need! I'll be happy just to find the key and get out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016e95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wondering why I let her go, aren't you? I can see it in your face. Mostly in "
"the eyes. I may take those from you when this is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014442_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wondering why I let him go, aren't you? I can see it in your face. Mostly in "
"the eyes. I may take those from you when this is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b596_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wood Elves. Why? What's the point?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk3_0006a859_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Word certainly gets around fast, doesn't it? Don't tell me -- Antoinetta has "
"been running her mouth off again. Anyway, nothing I couldn't handle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_000151f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Word has been sent that the Necromancers have been quite busy, creating black "
"soul gems for their master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk1_0006fdd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Word's come down from the captain. No breaks until further notice. You ask "
"me, he knows something. There's trouble brewin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002db93_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Words are... difficult. They come and go. The voices, though. So loud they "
"are, they drown out the words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Words cannot express my gratification for your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000314fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Words cannot to do justice for the joy I feel... many blessings upon you, my "
"friend. I do not have much, but I wish to reward such valor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Arden_0001f3bb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Words dripped like honey from his tongue and his songs were intoned with "
"extraordinary verisimilitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e919_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Words fail me at this point. There must be no stone unturned in all Cyrodiil. "
"I don't know what else to say but to thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPykeZoeMaleneResponses_00091b54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Words like that make me happy to be here with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d0b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Words... fail me. I knew that Thoronir obtained his goods through dark "
"dealings, but I never would have imagined this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00073110_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Work hard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jobs_0002c7a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Work is good for money. You know something, tell Vantus. He'll put me to "
"work. Give me money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007109a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Work on him until he talks. Try not to kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37EndConversation_000452e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Work! Never. You're supposed to feel sorry for me and just give it to me. Oh! "
"My legs are itching again. Time to run!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Idle_0018b5a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Work, work, work. Keeps my hands busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGDPost2_0006e2dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Works for me. More contracts keep the men busy and out of trouble. It also "
"helps bring in more gold, which benefits us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0000bf17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Worth a try. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CurseTopic_00002b1d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "Would someone taking that responsibility be merciful, or suicidal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GSWardenGreet2_00018db8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would that I could exact satisfaction upon you for that insult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000452f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you be willing to collect some Flame Stalk for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000624eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Would you believe Owyn once asked for my hand in marriage? It's true! Poor "
"bastard was heart-broken when I turned him down. I'm old, not desperate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice2B_00022b6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you dare make demands of me now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_00026d96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Would you even now attempt to trick me? You do not have what I requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_00026d97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Would you even now attempt to trick me? You do not have what I requested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d14c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Would you learn from me? Then meet me during the day, out under the waves in "
"the bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002db93_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Would you lift your hands to help another, to help me find the words?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00073119_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you like a blade to cut open your foes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEOdditiesTourTopic_00081eb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you like a tour of the Museum?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37SellSpells_0007b220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you like one of these?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ01Bread_001885dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you like to buy some of my Famous Potato Bread?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000299f_Knights_RESP6"
msgid "Would you listen to my tale, and learn of the Gauntlets' fate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Would you look at this! My brother - my spitting image - is here! I can't "
"thank you enough, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetE1_00002b79_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Would you make me a Knight of the Nine? I want to dedicate myself to ridding "
"the world of evil. I owe it to Sir Roderic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071fa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Would you mind stepping to the side so I can sweep there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ3_00002d13_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Would you not do the same, children of Cyrodiil? No, you would not! This is "
"plain!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_000981d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wouldn't miss it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000781ea_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Wouldn't surprise me if you were here spying on me for You-Know-Who."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000aed44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wow! You're the Grand Champion! I saw your fight against the Gray Prince!  "
"You're the best! Can I... Can I follow you around? I won't get in the way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049895_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wow. Palonirya is a tough negotiator. Hard to get her prices down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene01aPositive_0000c1ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wrath? I told him to guard the wheel and not talk to anybody. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05TarMeenaYesBooks_00024e81_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "Write this down: \"Green Emperor Way Where Tower Touches Midday Sun.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00051eaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wrong move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingCaenlorn02_0003cf91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Wrong! I'm the one in blue! Maenlorn is the one in brown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene05Negative_00015263_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wrong, fetcher! I'm tired of this conversation! Time to end it with steel!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene03Negative_000980fc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Wrong, fool. I've grown tired of this guessing game. I've much to do and "
"you're in the way. I aim to rectify that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008ef55_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Xeddefen has been silent, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebeb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Xeddefen is the goal, Your Grace. We will hold the town as long as we can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AXedilian_00018df4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Xedilian is the ultimate test of mettle for the foolhardy adventurer that "
"dares trespass into the Shivering Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AHowDoI_00018df5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Xedilian would normally have sent you back to the entrance when you stepped "
"on the pad in the Resonator Chamber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01SulinusConv_0002d918_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Y-yes. I understand. I'll head there right now, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice2D_0009e66e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Y... Yes dear Listener! I... I will wait in the Sanctuary until you have "
"further need of me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkoomaYes_0008f7b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "YES! Now that's what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0007c3aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yaaaa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_0008ef79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yaaaaa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018d26a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yaaaaiii!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ10BurdSpeech_00046306_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I'm Bazur gro-Gharz. I got protection from the Orum Gang. So don't mess "
"with me. Or they'll fillet you real good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_00085490_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_OblivionGateConv_000910f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e067_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know all about it. I overheard Agata and Dagail talking. And you know "
"what? I'm glad it's gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0003d7b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know, you already told me. That's why there's an Arena full of "
"Spectators and some hungry creature that wants to make you its lunch! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, I still got rooms. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS18OdiilTalk03_000272d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, I'm ready. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b1250_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, I've got a room. 10 gold for the night. You sure you want it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01FindMethredhel_00016257_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, I've heard of her. I'm going to need a few coins first though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AleronLocheTopic_00071321_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, Ursanne's husband, Aleron is missing. Poor thing, I've seen her crying "
"at the chapel. I hope someone can help her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Ushnar_00072dc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, he eats here. Terrified of cats though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AerinsCampTopic_000613bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, it's her camp. I don't know where she is, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDChapelAttackTopic_00002b9a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, just when you think things can't get any worse, right? Whatever you "
"think about priests, they didn't deserve to be slaughtered like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTDISLIKE_0018b2b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00002db4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, right. 'Til next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36ChoiceLedge2Nevermind_00081c52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah, right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09TyrelliusTalk_000908ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure. And I suppose I just end up rotting while you spend it all? "
"Forget it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AKithlan_00013a6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure. Like I'm going to say something about Syl's court to the likes of "
"you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04GuardsConvo_0009533c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, true enough. Ah, well, I best be getting back to my watch. Hey, don't "
"forget, we're meeting for drinks later at the Bloated Float."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhereIsAmusei_0000a174_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, we got him here. Argonians aren't allowed visitors though. Countess "
"Alessia's orders. She has a thing about the lizard folk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04GuardsConvo_0009533b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, I guess you can't blame Captain Montrose too much. This is his "
"big career move, after all. Got to impress that lot upstairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04DrethConvo_00045f83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, what's it been? Seven, eight years? We've had a good long run, "
"you and me. I always knew it would end someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04GuardsConvo_0009533a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, what a laugh, huh? Just who are we keeping secure? Dreth? Since that "
"other one got away, he's the only one rotting down here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice4_0008fabb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, whatever. This whole conversation has worn me out. Just stay away from "
"the other Horkvir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003335d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you heard me. No matter what the law says. No matter what they told "
"you. You're going to die in here! You're going to die!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you think Bruma's cold, try a winter in the Wrothgarians. Bruma's a day "
"at the beach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000475af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Buy a goddam book. It's a bookstore, ain't it? Don't just go peeking at "
"them! Buy one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8da_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I don't need you. So go away, huh? I'm asking real nice, because my mom "
"brought me up right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKELIKE_0018b2d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah. I get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a371_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I used to be Fighters Guild here in Chorrol, but I done some "
"incarceration for Trespassing and Theft. Couple of times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_000981d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah. I'll be there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_0006445f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I've heard of him. Isn't he a soldier or guardsman in the Imperial City?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AxeofDragol_0001f431_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah. It's a battleaxe with the word \"Dragol\" carved into the haft. Huge. "
"You can't miss it. I ain't gonna draw you a picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah. Nice going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007be99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Restita Statlilia. I work at the Chestnut Handy Stables. Have you seen "
"our horses wandering around? No? Okay. It's just that they're missing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8b4_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yeah. This is the Cheydinhal Fighter's Guild. Look around. See any fighters? "
"Right. That's the problem. No fighters, no guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo10_00090b7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Well. Maybe you're right. A real knight shouldn't act like a jerk to "
"his pals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d039_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002526e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028bbb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah? I don't care who you are. I ain't talking to you. You ain't from around "
"here. So push off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackBrugo04_00090b77_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah? Well, good luck. Let me know how it comes out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f41f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002dae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah? What're you lookin' at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073020_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah? What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice7B_00085a6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yeah? You think? Okay, I'll just try to calm down. Calm down, Dovesi, calm "
"down... I'll just take it slow. I can do that. Thanks again, dear friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yeah? You're who? And why do I care, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_0001e067_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"Years of service to the Empire, and not even a tombstone over his head! "
"Hrmph. At least he was able to maintain the illusion of sanity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Goblins_000319cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yep, we're in a real predicament. Do you think you might be able to help us "
"by getting rid of the goblins on our land?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000229ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yer botherin' me again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00022a04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yer next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000352a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes I can. You are under arrest for the theft of the bust of Llathasa "
"Indarys, Countess of Cheydinhal. Come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d92d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes actually, I'm quite fond of collecting all manners of wines from all over "
"Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16Talk_0004bfa0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes sir! Let's move out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopAgarmir_0001d047_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes! That's the least I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BSylLeaves_0003b81d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes! That's what I'll do. I'll go. The enemy of my enemy. Order is the key. "
"I'll keep them close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32MagicDagger_00012d1c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes! Yes! I can use this to charge my magicka. All I need is a "
"source...someone nearby...someone with magicka. Someone on the list!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice4A_00085860_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes! Yes! We must kill that foul Nord before he slits our throats! "
"Aaaaaiiiieee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk3_00002bb7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes! Yes, the time has come! I've been waiting for this moment! So, what's "
"your plan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvNM_0006bdb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bd9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Arch-Mage. I shall await your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006bda3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Arch-Mage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Arden_0001f3bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Arden-Sul. Doesn't the name simply roll wonderfully off the tongue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00033fca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Baurus told you right. I am the Grandmaster of the Blades. We serve the "
"Emperor and the Septim bloodline. Talos is our patron."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk1_00034044_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Brother? What can old Gogron do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029d0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Commander?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00037b4f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Cyrus. This is the Emperor's son, Martin Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ff09_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Faelian has been killed, but you did not exercise discretion. How many "
"witnesses were there? We may never know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003489e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Faelian has been killed, but you did not exercise discretion. How many "
"witnesses were there? We may never know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071dc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Guildmaster? What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34ExplainMore_0008f7b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I admit that being a Knight of the Thorn no longer holds any interest "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SpeakerTopic_000bba99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I am a Speaker, a representative of the Dark Brotherhood. My voice is "
"the voice of the Black Hand, our organization's ruling body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KnightsofThorn_000c452a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I am a member of the Knights of the Thorn. Or what's left of them anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00073109_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, I can take a moment to talk with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice2_000008f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I can understand your trepidation. For it is not everyday one is invited "
"to join the ranks of the undead, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkVampChoice2_0004ce44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I can understand your trepidation. For it is not everyday one is invited "
"to join the ranks of the undead, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, I did quite a bit of traveling. Back before I met Silgor, and decided to "
"settle down. It's all about pacing yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09JoinedGuild_00018335_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I did. After you saved me in Castle Skingrad, I vowed to join. I was "
"having no luck on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KvatchTopic_0018ad5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I followed the priest here. I'll be safe here, won't I? They can't come "
"on holy ground, can they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Invisible_0003003c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I have been working on a new invisibility spell. As you can see, it "
"works quite well. Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting1b_00019cd1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Yes, I have heard of you. Tell me, is it true? Has Sheogorath sent you to "
"kill Ciirta for her vendetta against Him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_00031528_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I have heard that the painting of the Count was taken. I was unaware she "
"hired an outsider to conduct the investigation. May luck be with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardHouseKey_00031d29_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, I have it. Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c0cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I have the staff Varon sold me. I'm afraid I'm not willing to part with "
"it. I paid good money for it, after all. You understand, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_00028d70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I heard Bernadette Peneles say that she thought he was following her. It "
"might finally be time to do something about that crazy Wood Elf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f1eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I know the Gatekeeper is back, but so what? He's missing the best parts, "
"so what's the point?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FaelianTopic_0002ff0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I know who Faelian is. Know quite a bit about him, actually. But... I "
"probably shouldn't gossip. I mean, we hardly know each other..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BThadon_000167de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I must attend to him. Speaking to you has already cost me time. I must "
"go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_00081368_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, I orchestrated it. Syl deserves to die a painful death for turning on "
"all of us, and consorting with our enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_0003857d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I remember Bradon mentioning that name once. He was part of the "
"brotherhood he had created with Raynil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice3A_00022b6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I see that now. I regret that Traven has involved you in this way. At "
"least you've survived... for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AReplace_00013fff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, I see you may have what it takes to replace her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArdalineTopic_0002ba5f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I sort of know her. Well, I mean I don't really know her, but I've "
"talked to her some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS11LastChance_0003858c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I suppose it is. Well, then, we've talked enough. Only one of us will "
"walk out of here alive this day. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000929_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, I think ... no.  Wait.  Never mind.  I must go now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001da69_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Yes, I think that the Order will live on. Give me time to make arrangements, "
"and meet me in Seridur's basement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00095898_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, I think you may..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Manor_00003a6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm selling my grandfather's house, Benirus Manor. If you're interested, "
"I could let you have it for a modest sum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e65f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm the city's Arena Gatekeeper, but I'm not on duty now. If you want to "
"bet on a fight, see me at the Arena between 9:00 AM and 9:00 PM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KudEiTopic_00027f32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm the one looking for my friend. His name is Henantier. If you find "
"him, I'll be glad to offer you a sizeable reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Brithaur_00078662_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, I've heard of Brithaur's \"exploits\" in Crucible. Up until now, I "
"thought he was harmless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeatherleahTopic_000878d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I've heard of the place, but I'm not sure where it is. I think your best "
"bet would be to speak to Sabine Laul at the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I've heard some of the finest mages in Tamriel belong to the Mages Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, I've heard the Fighters Guild offers some wonderful opportunities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0007130c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, I've noticed some of them in my establishment. They don't break the law "
"while they're here so there's nothing I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d69_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, I've seen him, but never spoken to him.  He seems to be at the Low Gate "
"every morning when I pass by on my way to the castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000805e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Inquisitor? What may I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029ce_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Lord Crusader?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000807a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Lord Sheogorath? Why do you disturb me? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DeepscornNm_0000efc2_DLCVileLair_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Master. Whatever you say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DeepscornSlay_00007974_DLCVileLair_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Master. Whatever you say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033764_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Master. Whatever you say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Master. You need me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004ed72_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Nirnroot. Haven't seen any yet? It appears as a slightly glowing shoot "
"that grows right out of the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_sons_00025256_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Rallus and Antus. They're going to fight off the creatures at our farm, "
"but I fear for their safety."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Renoit does have a fine assortment of books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Talk_00028756_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Seed-Neeus is worried sick about her.  I hope nothing has happened to "
"her.  Sweet girl, but naive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45Talk_00028748_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Seed-Neeus was so worried.  Nice to get a bit of good news for once, "
"isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b57_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b5a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b5d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Sir Knight."
msgstr ""

