msgid "Yes, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018c78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081cb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, Your Grace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HackdirtTopic_000280a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, a small village south of Chorrol.  Used to be a prosperous mining town, "
"but it has been nearly deserted for years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG12TravenSomeone_000835f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, and we have for quite some time. Though the information he has provided "
"is limited, it has given us a sense of their scope and power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight1_00002cea_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, brother knight. What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00146813_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice2B_00090793_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, dear child! Yes! The Dread Father foresaw it all! You were meant to kill "
"the traitor! You were meant to be named Listener of the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, dearest Brother? Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d7e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, good sir? How may I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000131d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, hatchling? Do you seek Thadon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VelwynBenirusTopic_0000926b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, he just arrived in town recently. I believe he's staying at The King and "
"Queen Tavern."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingWhere_000223d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, he lives here near Chorrol, at Weynon Priory. Leave the town gate, look "
"southeast down the Black Road. You can't miss it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a93_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, he preaches outside the Chapel every day. Hard to miss. I think you'll "
"know him when you see him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06JyggalagTopic_000910f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, he will soon march across the land, destroying all that stands in his "
"path. It's a frightening prospect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43DeadDog_0008f135_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, he's dead. It's so sad. I've already made arrangements to get a new one, "
"but I will miss my old friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Bhisha_00072db9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, he's the one. Isn't he scary? I wish someone would just make him "
"disappear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00033793_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, her seer's stone is missing. It's the one thing that has kept her "
"visions at bay, and without it, they're nearly crippling. She can't function."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice2A_0009e65c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored Listener! I shall become shadow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice2A_0009e683_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored Listener! I shall become shadow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice2A_0009e688_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored Listener! I shall become shadow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009e17b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored Listener? Do you have orders for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009e359_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored Listener? Do you have orders for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009e3df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored Listener? Do you have orders for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00091a78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, honored guest?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHircineSpeech_00051ee0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, hunter, make your offering. Did you taste its flesh and drink its blood? "
"Never waste the spoils of a kill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f20f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, in fact, I do have a home for sale!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a4958_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, in fact, up in the Imperial Reserve, a long way north-north-west of "
"Skingrad, I came upon a Sanguine shrine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneAmazing_00022e63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, indeed. Legend has it that Garridan found the Ewer, and that it was "
"guarded by a fearsome creature. It is also said that the creature froze him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e961_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Yes, indeed... Sheogorath's palace is quite lovely this time of year. Sure, I "
"can give you directions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ00NineDivinesResponse_0006138c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, it must have been an amazing sight. I know I'm taking my faith more "
"seriously than I used to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Choice3A_00098139_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, it seems that you do. The Count will be pleased."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002285a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, it's all finished. It's in a cupboard, back at the Chironasium. I hope "
"it serves you well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_00035646_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, it's all finished. It's in that cupboard, back in the corner. I hope it "
"serves you well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReynaldJemaneTopic_00084a99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, it's quite odd. Reynald, who I've bumped into several times in Chorrol, "
"acted like I was a complete stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4a7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, it's true. I lost the family ring to those sirens. I'm ashamed about the "
"whole incident, but not ashamed enough to ask for your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TheGrayPrince_00038b46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, it's what everyone calls me. I guess I'm partly to blame. I've never "
"made it a secret that I'm actually only half Orc. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Counterspell_0003012e_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Yes, just read the scroll in the middle of town. It should work... although..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06PriestGreetB_000400e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, let your mind worry at the problem. Let fear and dismay over making the "
"wrong choice sink their talons deep into your brain..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Daedricshrine_00003941_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, let's investigate! And keep on your toes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12Talk_0007be93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, let's see what he thinks of your plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12Talk_0007be94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, let's see what she thinks of your plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014abb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, little Duchess? I believe I sent you to rebuild my Gatekeeper. If you're "
"too busy, I'm sure Jyggalag will wait...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007d140_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, little Duke? I believe I sent you to rebuild my Gatekeeper. If you're "
"too busy, I'm sure Jyggalag will wait...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEZoeMalenePykeResponses_00091b52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, love. With you here, everything will be fine."
msgstr ""

