msgid "Yes, ma'am? What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00129be7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, ma'am? What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice1A_0009e65b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, most revered Listener! My blade will rend flesh at your command!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice1A_0009e641_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, most revered Listener! My bow is yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19Choice1A_0009e64f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, most revered Listener! My spells will serve Sithis until I lie cold and "
"dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00053873_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, my child?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS40Conversation_0009813f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, my dear. Just drink this, and it will all be better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RytheLythandasTopic_0001b946_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, my husband is the Rythe Lythandas. Have you heard of him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetC1_00002b7e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, my lady. And I brought you... Sir Roderic shouted for me to take them... "
"the Greaves. The holy Relic. They're yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004d7e2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, my lady? How may I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND07LathonGreetC1_00002b7d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, my lord. And I brought you... Sir Roderic shouted for me to take them... "
"the Greaves. The holy Relic. They're yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEZoeMalenePykeResponses_00091b53_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, my love. I am ready to begin another day anew with you. That's all I "
"need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VitellusDontonTOPIC_0002d726_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, my older brother. He was lost on a mission. Vitellus died valiantly, as "
"we all knew he would. He was the best of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Reward_00023666_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, of course, here is your precious gold. Now I need you to investigate one "
"more person for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageConvWait_0006bd91_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, of course. I will wait here, Arch-Mage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight3_00002cd7_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, of course. I'll think on what you said. It eases my heart. Well, I "
"suppose we've talked long enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MartinC_00037830_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, of course. What am I waiting for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000aed49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, oh great and mighty Grand Champion? Is there something you need? Can I "
"carry your weapon? Shine your boots? Backrub, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceRequest_0001356f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, powerful magic indeed. It is proper that you bid me kindly, lest I show "
"you the meaning of pain and suffering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03XedilianTopic_0008e94a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, quite an amazing place really. Wonderful for relieving one's tension as "
"you watch those troublesome adventurers suffer... no offence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ratsTOPIC_000356b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, rats. I'm sure she can explain it to you better than I. She lives here "
"in Anvil. Go and talk to her. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDWait_00002b53_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, sir knight. I don't think Sir Roderic and I came this way, though, if "
"you don't mind me saying so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000d43a_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000d43d_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011ef8_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011efa_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011efc_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011efe_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011f00_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011f02_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011f04_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00011f06_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000bb10_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir? What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00129be8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sir? What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_0006835b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, sire. What is it you need? You're not in danger, are you? My sword is "
"yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000980d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sister?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000980d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sister?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00146812_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, sister?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReynaldJemaneTopic_00023e87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, that's me. And apparently some other fellow, as well. Strange thing, "
"that. Knowing that someone else is also you... makes my head hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BloatedFloat_00015713_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, the Float is quite a vessel, don't you think? The only functioning "
"tavern and inn on the water in all of Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000923_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes, the Gold Road does pass through Skingrad.  I, too, find it fascinating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS13Gate_000c4531_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, the Oblivion Gate. No match for the Knights of the Thorn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c18d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, the West Weald is a nice place. Just stay away from Erina when she's in "
"a mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Reward_00023664_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, the gold that you value so highly. I wonder, what price betrayal ... "
"never mind that. We shall see ... I do have one more name for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002819f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, the poor girl is dead. What a shame. Well, I guess she won't be finding "
"the gold, hmm? Hehehehehe.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00023663_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, the strange Wood Elf who haunts the Low Gate every morning, you said he "
"was Glarthir.  I'm afraid I know nothing else about the fellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00032679_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, the vampire hunter. As far as I know, he just showed up recently here in "
"Bruma. Not only that, but he already found a vampire among us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9839_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, there's a room available. It'll cost 15 gold for the night. Are you "
"interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e942_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Yes, this is a genuine Nirnroot sample. Very nice quality in fact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE34Knight_00066f04_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, we are based out of Cheydinhal. Our leader, Farwil Indarys, is the son "
"of the Count of Cheydinhal, Andel Indarys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06Story_00002b0d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, well, I don't know the whole thing. A great many years ago, a knight of "
"the old Order did something terrible, and the gauntlets just fell off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice4C_00085862_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, well, I know how you feel. What words can really do justice to the "
"terrible situation at hand? But we must stick together if we are to survive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkSancTalk4_00034053_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, well, if there's one thing you know how to do, it's get yourself out of "
"an unwinnable situation! He he he he. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_00014480_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, well. I suspect our Inquisitor would like to see you leave as well. As "
"soon as you tell me what I want to know, you may go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice1A_000275c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, well... Anyway... Now that we're all here, I guess we can start looking. "
"I'd wish you good luck, but I wouldn't really mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09Choice1C_00035e08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, well... I'm a very busy man. Enjoying my retirement, don't you know. So "
"why don't you just... go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009816e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, yes! Enough! What? I'll tell you what you want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate2_0001447b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, yes! I swear it's the truth! Please, please let me go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice7A_00028ba7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes! This is indeed the Honorblade of Chorrol, finally delivered back to "
"us after all these years!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELOVE_0018b2cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, yes! Whatever you say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, Count of Bravil. Are you a foreigner? Do yourself a favor. Learn "
"the basics about the places you visit. There. Problem solved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Beast_00045662_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, I know. They're all looking quite tiresome. A Scalon would sure "
"spruce things up a bit, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarkOrcElfConvo_00026e79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, of course I value our secrets, and I have never betrayed them! But "
"using stealth to kill.... It's just so... weak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028f86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, yes.  I can see that you have no idea what is going on.  Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDunrootBurrowTopic_0001338b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes. A most unique place. Of course, the Chalice would be there! Don't "
"you see? It's the Elytra. They're the reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00072f0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, yes. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AHowDoI_00018df5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes. I tend to ramble; you'll have to forgive me. If you have the "
"Attenuator, then Sheogorath must have sent you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013ff1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes. I'm sure I will. But for now, we still have the matter of the "
"information you're withholding. Will you share it with us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_WeatherleahTopic_000242b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes. Our home, stolen by ogres. My head hurts something terrible right "
"now - speak to Guilbert, will you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0001f861_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes. You're quite the sleuth, finding him all by yourself. Jeanne will "
"be so proud, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingForever_000131d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes... That just might be true. Or I've not been waiting at all. Forever "
"and nothing are almost the same thing, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023f7c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Yes, you are quite an asset to this Sanctuary. In fact, I believe you are "
"ready for advancement. I hereby appoint you Slayer. Well done! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopAgarmir2_0001d048_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, you do that. And in the meantime, I'll decide what to do with all of "
"these ill-gotten things. I'm so sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22HighFane_0002af37_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, you learned that it is the ruin now known as Malada. Were you able to "
"recover the carving yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c228_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "Yes, you understand now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice4B_0009079b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Yes, you will now find the Blade of Woe a bit more... potent than it was. Now "
"go. Leave this crypt, and serve our Dread Father til your dying breath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, you'll do just fine. Signy will tell you all the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, you'll find that some jobs require you to terminate a mark in a specific "
"way. It's well worth the trouble, considering how good the bonuses are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ObelisksTopic_00091059_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, you'll find them throughout the Isles. Jyggalag's forces use them as "
"conduits into the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Topic_0002ab47_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes, you. We need to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00032b0a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes, your Majesty. Beneath the Legion Compound. We're headed for a secret "
"passage known only to the Blades. No one can follow us through here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002954b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b14c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnswerPositive_0002b155_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaTalk01_0008656d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_00029690_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00029037_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes.  I mean ... I must go now.  But do accept my apologies for your loss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AhdarjisStolenRing_00007de4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. A filthy Argonian stole my precious ring. It was a gift from my mate. It "
"has... sentimental value. I will pay well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04AlessiasRing_0001e104_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. After all these years, I have my ring back. I wear it all the time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000479e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Ahdarji is the name. Poor Ahdarji, all alone, now that Qa-Dar is gone. "
"Poor widow Ahdarji..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilTopic_00048905_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Bravil. How clever of you. You've already learned the name of the town "
"and county. I see a great future for you in public service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07RitualYesD02_00013a66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. He then removed their hearts from their bodies and used his ancient "
"scrying technique known as visceromancy to read their lifeblood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BravilNQDQuestionResponses_00046618_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. He's a very clever man. Something not quite trustworthy about him, "
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetB1_00016d01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. His agents must have found a way to poison the Font with Order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I am Varon Vamori, Wit and Wordsmith. Bravil's foremost Bard and "
"Advanced Trainer in Speechcraft. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038adb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Yes. I am the Shepherd, Uuras. And it is my sheep, and my deft hand and sharp "
"nose, which produce the glorious cheeses of Skingrad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGFences_0001eb6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. I buy stolen property. Shall we negotiate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FrostSaltsTopic_00022f19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I have them for sale. If you'd like to buy some, feel free. They're top "
"quality... I refined them myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. I like the Grey Mare as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandSad_0001d4c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I must let someone else know. That night, I decided to follow Relfina. I "
"wanted to see where she went on her walks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice2a_00082091_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I realize that some people can't see beyond the burns when they stick "
"their hand in the fire. But a wise man can learn from his pains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaD1_000a5605_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I understand. He wants an Ayleid Crown. But does it have to be my Ayleid "
"Crown? What if you brought him... another crown?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03ComeWithMe_0001e8d7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Yes. I'll come with you to Weynon Priory and hear what Jauffre has to say. "
"Lead on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047645_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I'm Boderi Farano, Mages Guild. You want Advanced Training in Mysticism? "
"I think I can fit you in..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinA3_00082dc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I'm a priest. Do you need a priest? I don't think I'll be much help to "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogatheOrcTopic_000860c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I'm an Orc. I was born under a rock, and I have no parents. So I don't "
"need a family name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem5_00081ec7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I've been meaning to put something here, but it seems I haven't gotten "
"around to it. Although I distinctly remember preparing an exhibit...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FrostSaltsTopic_00022f16_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes. I've heard of mages who seal portals with an ingredient as a key. Makes "
"the door impossible to lockpick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e932_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. I've seen them before. Don't really know anything about them, as I don't "
"specialize in plant samples. However, I know someone who does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuyLeyawiin_00053237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. It is a fair price. Atahba will have your Paint horse saddled and ready "
"outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23MemCave_0001da6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. It's outside of the Imperial City. I heard it's a place where many of "
"the heroes from past wars are buried. Sort of a subterranean graveyard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaglirTOPIC_00028a2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Maglir. Find him. See why he defaulted. I swear, I've scraped things off "
"the bottom of my boots that were smarter than you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_0009839d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. My cousin is in line to take up the position. He is eminently qualified."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. My name is Umbacano."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Trust_00072c9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Of course he can trust you. Give him this spoon. He'll know what it "
"means."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasC3_0009532f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. Of course! Anything to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasC1_0009532d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Of course! I don't want anyone to think I had anything to do with their "
"insane plots!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11DyusChoice3_00019cd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Only then can I create an appropriate vessel to hold the power that is "
"inherent in the lord of this realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14TivelaHeard_0001c1c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Rythe likes to work in his studio with the door locked, so no one can "
"disturb him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. S'krivva gives you greeting. Luxury imports, exports are S'krivva's fair "
"game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16OcatoD_000add46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Sealed forever. Mehrunes Dagon and his ilk can never threaten Tamriel "
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03SyndelChamberOneGrow03_00066e5b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. Seems whoever designed this place only meant for us to get hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07AThadonLeaves_000206bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. That's it. I'll go. Away. Far away. Working for them is like working for "
"us, but without all the dying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGJoin1_0002427f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Unfortunately, it seems you have a price on your head. Clear that up, "
"and perhaps we can speak about this again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00019d69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. What can I do for you? I imagine you're here about the door?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00040baf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice5a_00085863_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Yes, this whole thing has taken quite a bit out of me. I think I'll go "
"to my room for a bit and get some sleep. Thanks for the talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChalYes_0003a916_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. Yes... I accept your challenge. Go... Go speak with Ysabel. Tell her "
"you're ready. Then we'll... We'll meet in the Arena. Yes, that'll do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ12MartinA2_000a31c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. You did. I can't force you to do anything. I understand that. And I "
"thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEStrangeDoor_000133df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes. You have entered and now you are here. Amazing. Truly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081b6c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes. You've gotten rather proficient with your new ability. As I said, try "
"not to abuse your power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000291a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes... I heard of you. Found a few relics and you imagine yourself to be the "
"next Whitestrake, do you? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk3_00002bb4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Yes... Yes, I see. You have a strategy, then? A plan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07Become_00013657_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes... how we would all aspire to be as great a leader as the First... our "
"savior Arden-Sul, the greatest Duke of the ages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gelebourne_0003844c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Yes... that's right. Somewhere in Skingrad I believe. He said he tracked "
"Gelebourne down and killed him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefendA3_00018f9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Yes... yes! Their commander, Kaneh, is gullible enough to take you at face "
"value..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes... you might do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00000a05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000038d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000104dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr ""

