"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornTrophyH_0000c538_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "You don't have the item I need. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_0018ae85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't have the money for the room. Perhaps some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9c9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't have the money, so I can't let you stay in the room. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't have the money. I'm not just going to let you sleep here for free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00032e12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't have the scroll? Then we have nothing to talk about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_knightDontLook_000860ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't know anything about being a knight, so shut up about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SECaldanaMonriusSkoomaNo_0008f786_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't know what it's like! I need the Skooma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05MazaddhaWhy_00081187_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't know, do you? She's kept it a secret even from you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e8c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't listen? You stupid? Crot. I'm wasting my breath. Then go ahead. "
"Stand there. Talk all you want. You're a fly. Go ahead and buzz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice1_000356ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You don't look strong enough to me, though. A bit inexperienced, perhaps. "
"Still, maybe we will find work for you. You may join. For now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01JoinThievesGuild_000355e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't look very trustworthy. I have no idea what you are talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00024157_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't look well, my friend. You should seek a healer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01SulinusConv_0002d919_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't need to understand. Just tell Adrienne that the new Associate is "
"the one who saved you. Or else. Are we clear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c14f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't need to worry about the daedra taking Bruma. You've got the best "
"soldiers in Cyrodiil here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0006143c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't really know what it's like to crack skulls. Until you do, I've got "
"nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f502_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You don't really need to do anything else. The Cracked Wood tribe will stop "
"attacking Timberscar Cave once they figure out the head is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilNQDResponses_0003c228_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't see a lot of Human-Bosmer marriages. I don't know if it's even "
"legal in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41PostHere_0008fa23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't seem to have the bottle with you. Shame on you for lying to a sick "
"woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BedYes_000bb9b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't seem to have the money for the room. Perhaps you should look "
"elsewhere for accomodations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopAgarmir_0001d047_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You don't think he would dig up another... oh no, he wouldn't. But I guess he "
"has been. Oh my. What have I done?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00013388_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't understand. This isn't just about the Chalice. This is about you. "
"We must discuss Dunroot Burrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenGlenroy_0000b205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You don't want to do that again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028bf8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You don't want to fail me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DionneWarnChoice3_0001dcc5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You don't want to get involved with him. I don't care how much he's paying "
"you, it isn't worth it. Like I said, he's crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE42NoSell_00073235_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't want to sell them? I'll have to get you to sign a no competition "
"writ a few days ago. Can't have you building your own skyboat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChalNo_0003a914_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't? Oh! Well good! Very good indeed! Maybe after you've helped me out, "
"eh? So please, make haste to Crowhaven! This waiting is unbearable!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChalNo_0003a913_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't? Oh... Well I can only hope you'll change your mind. In the "
"Arena... Yes, in the Arena anything could happen. Anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaAgronakChalNo_0003a912_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You don't? Oh... Well, all right. I'm sorry, it's just that I fully expected "
"a challenge! It is your right. If you change your mind, I'll be ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000091ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You drive a hard bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_00009220_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You drive a hard bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorPersuade2_00006ab4_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "You drive a hard bargain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseOrgnolf1_00031521_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You ever hear the expression, 'fools rush in where Daedra fear to tread'? "
"Well, accusing anyone without evidence is mighty foolish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025572_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You ever talk to Honditar? Odd fellow, but he seems to know his way around "
"these parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002870e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You fiend! Are you suggesting Dovesi is the murderer? You'd do well to watch "
"your mouth, and your back!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RulesOfCompetition_00029ca8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You fight for the Blue Team. You fight against the Yellow Team. In order to "
"fight in the Arena you must wear an Arena Battle Raiment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_00037ce2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You find the room okay? Right at the top of the stairs. First one on the "
"left. You really can't miss it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00071dc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You finish the clean-up, new blood. Look in the houses. Get moving, so we can "
"go home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0003d4af_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You fit the bill perfectly. It's a shame it had to end in so much violence, "
"but someone was bound to get hurt sooner or later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0dc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You fool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000227e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You fool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc2c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You fool!  You'll ruin everything!  We can't be seen talking together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranConfrontCiirta04_0001a7c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You fool! I am the light! Come if you dare, I will cast you into darkness for "
"all eternity!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029ab_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You fought at Garlas Malatar, did you not? Tell me about the battle, if you "
"would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06UlfriFinalB_000400e1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You fought well. I would almost grant you the honor of kindling the Altar, if "
"you were an immortal. Farewell. The waters of Oblivion await me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You found a place for me to sleep? Outside under the stars too small to fall "
"and hurt me? Excellent, excellent! Tell me more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003782b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You found a way back! Does this mean... ?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarridansTears_00022f14_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You found five of the Tears? Fantastic! This turned out better than I "
"expected. Perhaps a little bit of a bonus is in order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrenusAstisJournal_00024293_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You found it, huh? Good work, I guess. Well, take it back to Oreyn, then. He "
"can pay you on the contract. Tell him what you want about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be67_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You found my belabored daughter! I will tell Burz gro-Khash about your "
"indentures! Take this. It has been passed in my family for many generators."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMMythicDawnNotes_00014e01_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You found the notes, you share our vision. But I did not survive this long by "
"being trusting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEMMythicDawnNotes_00014e02_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "You found the notes. You follow the will of the Lord of Change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c07_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You gave HIM the book? What were you thinking? And here I thought one of you "
"Guild mages might actually have a brain..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e657_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You gave those Maniacs something to think about, lighting the Torch for us. "
"Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000661f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You get any closer and I'll turn your bones to ash. Back off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GiftScript_0002fbad_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You get me some... now listen up... sk...skooma. You know what that is? Get "
"me some skooma and... and... we'll be good, good friends. Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46Choice2_0008fab9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You get rid of those Manics. All of them. If you can take care of that for "
"me, I'd make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You get used to the cold. Got a good set of fur boots to keep my feet warm. "
"Give a Nord a good thumping to keep the blood flowing, khah-khah-khah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004f3ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You go get 'em! And whip their asses for Newheim!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJauffreHelp_0005dccb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You go into danger. Jauffre didn't tell us any more than that, but know that "
"our prayers go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Question_00034078_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You going to visit the Lucky Old Lady today? Wish for good tidings?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_00061c5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You got a good deal there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_00061c61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You got a good deal there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_000091d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You got a great deal there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ac6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You got a problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033358_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got a wife back home? Tell you what. I'm getting out of here in a couple "
"of weeks. When I get back to Morrowind I'll look her up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LadyRogbutTOPIC_0000be7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got her back in one piece? Good work! I've always liked that girl. May "
"have to look her up sometime. Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033776_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You got him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003a69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You got quite a deal on that house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073027_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got some Skooma, yeah? Right buddy? Pal? To share? Come on, pass the "
"Skooma already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_0003d074_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "You got some hot property?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AjumKajinTopic_000356b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got some information out of him, which is good. We can use it. Here, take "
"this. It might help you some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AyleidReference_0003353a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got the book, eh? Good for you. I've given up trying to deal with her for "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00028889_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got the weapons there and cleared the mine with no casualties. Better "
"than I expected from you. Here's your reward, and a little bonus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047693_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got to be careful. You don't want people taking notice. Just keep quiet, "
"keep your head down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You got your people, and you got your dogs. Dogs are loyal and stupid. People "
"are smart and devious. I'll stick with dogs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You grace my presence once again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000290d_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You had no wounds on your body, but you were dead. I saw it with my own eyes -"
"- you did not draw breath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0002d934_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You had your chance, fool! Now you will never leave this house alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025de9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You handled yourself pretty well back there. Just keep out of our way, got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You hardly seem worth talking to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006fdc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have a death wish, citizen? Put that weapon away. Now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e508_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"You have a few options, I believe. Either wait for Ma'zaddha to return with "
"more information, or have a chat with Nelrene in the meantime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AlbertJemaneTopic_0008b073_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have a lot of nerve accusing my father of such a heinous crime... and "
"with no proof to back it up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13NarinaMartin1_0002777f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have a rare gift, to know when desperation is the path of wisdom. I will "
"do everything in my power to defend your city, my Lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06WhereSkrivva_00084477_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have a short memory, Cat Burglar. Mine needs a little jogging too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDCrusadersRelicsTopic_00002a82_Knights_RESP8"
msgid ""
"You have achieved what no knight since the legendary Divine Crusader has "
"achieved. You have reassembled Pelinal's holy armor and weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Necromancers_000038b7_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You have again performed admirably. You have my thanks, and that of the "
"Council as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000029a2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You have agreed to be tested. You must finish your test."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00053240_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have all the recommendations you need, I believe. Raminus Polus will want "
"to speak with you. You can find him at the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofBoethiaTOPIC_0001ebe1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have approached the shrine and spoken with Boethia. Enter the portal or "
"do not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f146_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have arrived at an opportune time. You may have the honor to be initiated "
"into the Order by the Master himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00023e4d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have arrived at last!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been asked to work with Herdir, I understand. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGCastOutTopic_0001e863_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been cast out for mistreating your fellow Thieves Guild members. In "
"order to be returned to the rolls you must make reparations. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025033_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been found guilty of breaking guild rules, and have been suspended. "
"Should you wish to clear your name, speak with Raminus Polus at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024fd3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have been found guilty of killing a guild member. As such, your guild "
"privileges have been suspended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002501a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have been found guilty of killing a guild member. As such, your guild "
"privileges have been suspended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024ff9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have been found guilty of theft. As such, your guild privileges have been "
"suspended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025022_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have been found guilty of theft. As such, your guild privileges have been "
"suspended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ce93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been given a task by Namira? Truly, you are terrible in my eyes. "
"Disgusting and foul. Blessed are you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofNocturnalTOPIC_000b97c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been given a task. Do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been graced with the presence of Hircine. Do not fail him, lest you "
"be hunted for the rest of your days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03AltarofKynareth_00002a4f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been in the Chapel of Kynareth from the moment you stepped outdoors. "
"Have you not felt her presence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026904_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been set on a path. Follow it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d90_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have been suspended from the guild for the death of a guild member. Are "
"you willing to do what is necessary to make amends?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026d92_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have been suspended from the guild for theft. Are you willing to do what "
"is necessary to make amends?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebc8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been told all that is necessary. Approach the shrine or do not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026a9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been told how to summon Sanguine. If you feel worthy, proceed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been told the proposition: your donation for a possible audience "
"with Clavicus Vile. The choice is yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aa0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been told the way to reach Molag Bal. Do what you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ce94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been told to approach the shrine. Perhaps Namira will find favor in "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofMolagBalTOPIC_000b166a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been told what must be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebc0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been told what you must do to speak with our Lady. What more do you "
"ask of us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have been told what you need to know. Your path is now your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e43f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have been unfaithful. His blades are dull and uninspired. Mine are sharp "
"and exquisite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026def_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have broken a Tenet, and have been exiled from the Dark Brotherhood! You "
"must defeat the Wrath of Sithis to regain any status you once had! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona12_00022e86_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have broken my heart for a second time. I cannot let the infamous "
"criminal mastermind, the Gray Fox become the Count of Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have business here? Don't tell me Jarol sent you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008da8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have but to lead us to Weatherleah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANamiraSpeech_0005dc88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have cleansed my followers' perfect darkness. The Forgotten are free to "
"wallow in their misery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireAshTopic_000977d9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have come across a vampire or two in your travels, perhaps? I assure you, "
"they are nothing like what you must face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024e51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have come to dedicate yourself to Lord Dagon's service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranGreeting1b_00019cd1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have come to kill her, have you not? I can sense it all through you. You "
"stink of violence. It is glorious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047681_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have complaints against merchants here? You file complaints with me. I "
"fill out lots of forms, which go to a lot of people who ignore them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirAmielSpeech02_00002cc6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have completed your divine task. You have restored the Order. You have "
"defeated the enemy of the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_00026d8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have completed your task, and so your privileges in the guild will be "
"restored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelYes_00026d8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have completed your task, and so your privileges in the guild will be "
"restored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035a34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have completed your tasks for the Count, have you not? Then please, wait "
"here while I inform him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JemaneFamily_00028ac6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have decided you have time to listen to my tale after all? It is a good "
"one. I promise you won't be disappointed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_0007eb5e_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You have defied the expected and accomplished something that denies all "
"logic. I must contemplate the error in my calculations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e00_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have done a great service to the Dark Brotherhood today, Assassin. Your "
"reward is well earned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e01_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have done a great service to the Dark Brotherhood today, Assassin. Your "
"reward is well earned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d883_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have done much to prevent the flow of Oblivion into Tamriel. The world is "
"in your debt, and I am at your service. My knowledge is yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0002c2f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have done the right thing. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RogueMage_0003020c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have done well enough for yourself. I'll pass along my recommendation to "
"Raminus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_00033567_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have done well so far. I hereby promote you to Apprentice. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDUmarilTopic_00002bfb_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have done what Pelinal Whitestrake himself could not, and have banished "
"Umaril once and for all. The whole of Tamriel is in your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG09Choice5C_00022bdd_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You have done your job admirably, and I thank you for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b18b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have done your part, so I shall do mine. What I know I will teach you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Betrothed_00012d02_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have driven all meaning from my life. I shall throw myself upon the "
"swords of the Fanatics so that I may join her sooner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ09ArmorTopic_00026d60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have earned a place of honor in the rolls of our Order for recovering the "
"holy relic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQChampionOfCyrodiil_000ade33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have earned the highest rank possible in the Order of the Dragon, the "
"illustrious order of Imperial knights founded by Tiber Septim himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06GiveBook_000174b9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You have earned the reward. Here is your payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04GiveRing_00035fc0_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You have earned the reward. The Thieves Guild was always good to Ahdarji's "
"dearest mate. I am grateful that the memory is still honored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have entered a holy place. What is your business here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21StatueGive_0002b463_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have exceeded my fondest hopes, my friend. The Ten Ancestors are reunited "
"at last! This is truly an historic day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a235d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have failed Namira. Cursed forever are you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ef78_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have followed the path set for you by the Lord Hermaeus Mora. Approach "
"his shrine and speak with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015447_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have found Theranis and the Lost Histories of Tamriel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEAltarofDespairTopic_0007ff5d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You have found it. The holiest of holies within Cylarne, aside from the altar "
"of the Flame of Agnon itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GSWardenGreet2_00018dba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have great faith in my powers of forebearance. Do not test me further, "
"mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d86_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "You have greatly pleased my Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a86_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You have heard him. Like me, you know he speaks the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting02b_00002cd5_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have heard of the god Talos? One of the Nine? And surely the name of "
"Tiber Septim has not escaped you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_00023ff5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have helped ensure that this book will remain safe from those who would "
"misuse it. You have the Guild's thanks. Now, if you'll excuse me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270ef_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have helped me by closing the Oblivion Gate near Skingrad. I will "
"likewise help you by sending aid to Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061394_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have helped to save Kvatch, or what is left of it. For that, I can do "
"nothing less than help you spread healing throughout Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE39Notebook_00078200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have her notebook? I'm too important to read that. In fact, I've never "
"read a book in my life. I pluck knowledge straight from the minds of gods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16BStolenItem_00028c79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have it? Let me see it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000976ac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have kept your word. Now I will keep mine. What is it you wish to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b681_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have lifted the curse. All of Vitharn thanks you, Lord Sheogorath. You "
"may keep my helmet. It never did me much good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008151b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have lifted the curse. All of Vitharn thanks you. You may keep my helmet. "
"It never did me much good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND02SirAmielBattleCall_00002c05_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have lost, Sir Juncan. Sir Torolf, show the challenger the ferocity of "
"the North."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007be56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have made a long and perilous journey, but there is no time to rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ08Wine_0018d925_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have more? Amazing! Well, as promised, your finder's fee once again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorTownYes_0003446b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have my assurance that my men and I will do everything in our power to "
"keep the people of... Skingrad safe. We're here to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_00188f3e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You have my congratulations, and my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bc20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have my ear, citizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017469_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have my thanks for freeing me, but... Just who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017cfb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have my thanks for freeing me, but... Just who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002908_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have my tribute, sir knight. In three hundred years, none have passed the "
"gauntlet. In three hundred years, we have never known hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000811c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have no proof! You cannot hold me accountable for anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008199d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have no proof! You cannot hold me accountable for anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00053796_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have no rights here, convict."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b18c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have not done that which I ask. Kill the bears and bring me their hides. "
"Then I shall do as you ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ef7a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have not yet followed the path required to speak with the Lord Hermaeus "
"Mora."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038acb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have obviously made a mistake. Sir Lazare Milvan would never speak with "
"someone of your low birth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12RootDungeon_0001a328_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have one Pool yet to cleanse, and the traitor is still at large. These "
"would seem to me to be your highest priorities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND02SirAmielBattleCall_00002c03_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have overcome half of us and yet you remain standing. Perhaps Sir Caius "
"shall test your true mettle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a48_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have passed Kynareth's test. The Boots are yours for the taking. They "
"await you in the Grove."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002ac8_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You have passed our test and now, I must ask you to press forward where I "
"could not. I must ask you to face the challenge of Zenithar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d150_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have passed your test. Well done. I shall be more than happy to train you "
"in the skill of Alteration from now on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026a99_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have pleased Molag Bal. Blessed is the one who spreads the seeds of "
"dissent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026987_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have pleased the Lord Clavicus. A wise decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAVaerminaSpeech_0008ade9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have proved yourself, mortal. It is fitting, as well, that you should "
"bear my token."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045651_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have proven to be quite the hunter. Take your bounty. You've earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037cea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have proven yourself a loyal servant of the Empire, as worthy as any of "
"the Blades to stand by Martin's side during this crisis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AnotherTask_0002af2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have proven yourself more than a simple grave robber. I believe you can "
"handle a more complicated assignment. Are you interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d884_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have proven yourself worthy, and have earned my respect. What I know, I "
"shall teach to you for a fee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005421d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have purchased a fine piece of horseflesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillGatekeeper_00040372_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have rebuilt the Gatekeeper. Good show! Perhaps Your Grace should proceed "
"on to Lord Sheogorath to give him the news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0005323e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have received recommendations from every guild hall, have you not? Then "
"you are ready to advance to the Arcane University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000268f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have reneged on your bargain with Lord Clavicus. You are not welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have rented the only room I have for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_0001c4e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have restored the honor of the Thieves Guild. This one welcomes you back "
"into the guild. I am promoting you to Cat Burglar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_000165f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have restored your honor and that of the Thieves Guild. I can now "
"officially pay you for your efforts and promote you to the rank of Bandit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_0001c474_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have restored your honor within the Thieves Guild. Now I can pay you for "
"your recovering the taxes and promote you to the rank of Footpad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAPeryiteSpeech_0008dd57_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have returned my followers, mortal. The natural order is restored, and "
"for this, I thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013563_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have returned with all the components? Excellent. All that remains is to "
"choose the body parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001648d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have returned!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have returned, and you are not a corpse. Boethia may be pleased by this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ee43_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have returned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06AmuseiDoingHere_0001531f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You have saved my life, again. You are a true friend. I will not forget this. "
"I've decided to join the Thieves Guild. No more jails for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017ca3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You have saved us. We are forever grateful, your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017cf9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You have saved us. We are forever grateful, your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062443_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have seen the beggars. You have, I hope, used your powers of speech to "
"raise their spirits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHermaeusSpeech_000a9482_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have served me well, and I am pleased. I give you this, the Oghma "
"Infinium. Knowledge given by me to Xarxes is recorded within."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000008af_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You have served me well, and I choose now to extend that gift to you. Shall I "
"use my dark powers and turn you into a vampire?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice2A_00023ff2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have shown yourself worthy of the guild, and for that I thank you. You "
"shall have the recommendation you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06Choice1A_0002fbb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have skooma! Ha ha ha ha! Oh... Oh my friend! Yeah... You're my friend "
"now! Thank you... Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a3b2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have some nerve addressing me after slaying my son. You're lucky I didn't "
"have you executed on the spot! Now get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29InvStolen_0001d045_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have some nerve! Where do you come off accusing me of something you know "
"nothing about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002b5f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have something to say, dungheap?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b072_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have something to tell me about my father?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_0002365c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have something you want to tell me about that nutcase?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002910_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have stepped from the humble shadows of obscurity and into legend. No "
"feat you have accomplished in your life compares to what you have become."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND02SirAmielBattleCall_00002c06_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have stood against the Knights of the Nine and lived. However, the final "
"test is upon you. Ready yourself, Sir Knight, and face me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS51AccuseChanel1_0003565c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have strong evidence, but I do not trust you enough to speak true my "
"motivations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03Reactivated_0008e944_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have the Attenuator, the Manual, and a map. I'm certainly not going to "
"carry you there, so I'd suggest you get to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45NotYet_00078786_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have the Fork? I hear it singing so close? Songs of such closeness! Songs "
"of almostness! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05Icestaff_00015f21_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the Icestaff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_00098399_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the Imperial Watch recommendation for my new guard captain?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGBloodPrice_00017200_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the blood price?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateWho_000805f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the evidence you need. It's time to bring in Muurine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bc9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the eyes of a trained marksman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bc98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the hands of a healer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bcb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the hands of an illusionist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016efa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have the items. Contrary to all prediction. Once again, you defy the path "
"set before you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004e925_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the next batch of Nirnroot yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c15b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the right equipment. This is good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022db6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have the scroll? I can hardly believe it! The odds were clearly against "
"you. Capital job! Capital!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_0001344d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have the stink of Mania about you. Leave before I start vomiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_001885d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have them! You have them! I can sense they're with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranDagger_00019fd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have them? Do you? Give them to me! I thirst for Ciirta's blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11RakheranDagger_0001a814_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have them? Do you? Give them to me! I thirst for Ciirta's blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35FlawlessPearlsTopic_0007866a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have them? Please, please! Hand them over!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0011e155_DLCOrrery_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have them? The items I requested? Give them to me, please! Yes... yes, "
"this seems to be everything. Here's your reward. Thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014449_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have things to do. Talking to me isn't one of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016e9e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have things to do. Talking to me isn't one of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have to admit, this is a good place to live. Friendly folks, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05GwinasB4_0009532b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have to believe me! I truly had no idea. I mean, I knew they were a "
"daedric cult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DarMaTopic_0001778d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have to believe me, I didn't know what they were planning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee3e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have to find your own jobs now. Just keep selling stuff to the fences."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000488e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have to watch out for pickpockets in the city. You'd be surprised how "
"many waterfronters earn a good income that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VaronVamoriTopic_0004cfad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have what you need to help him talk. I admit, it's not standard guild "
"procedure, but I'd do anything for one of my girls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e336_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid "You have what you need, don't you? Time to seek out Muurine, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have words?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0009f912_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have work to do. Go on. Get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_0001bcc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have your \"criminal.\" Congratulations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066a08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have your orders, Silencer. Ask of me what you will, and then make haste "
"to Hero Hill. Your first dead drop contract awaits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006d810_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have your orders. Now carry them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_00035549_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You have your task. Acquire wood for a staff from the grove outside "
"Wellspring Cave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000355a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have your task. Find Delmar, and ask for his help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035677_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have your task. Perform it as well as you would any other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000399b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You have your task. Return as soon as you have the information."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034ea8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You have, no doubt, seen some of the worst the guild has to offer. As much as "
"we try to hold mages to a higher standard, they are only human."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_RaynilDralasTopic_00038f3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You haven't gone to the cave yet? Well, what are you still doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AxeofDragol_0001fdba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't guessed it yet? There never was any Axe of Dragol. It was just a "
"ruse to lure you out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ChaliceNo_00013309_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't heard of it, yet you know its name? What a strange creature you "
"are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029d66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't run home to momma yet, huh? That's a good sign. So, you ready for "
"a match, or do you just need some information?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072db4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You haven't seen that filthy cat beggar have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000139ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't spoken to both Priests. You'll end up making a stupid decision, "
"and you won't live to regret it. Don't do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bbe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You haven't truly eaten a decent meal until you've had my Strawberry Harrada, "
"Greenmote Lime Surprise, and Spiderling Under Glass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArgonianBloodTopic_00053734_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't used it yet, have you? Don't be hesitant. This is the only way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00034e13_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't yet been given recommendations by all the necessary individuals, "
"Associate. Keep working at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS14ChoiceHeard_0001b947_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You haven't? That's strange. Rythe is known far and wide as one of the best "
"painters in all Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridDEMOChoice1_00028a2e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You haven't? Why not? Is this just a game to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003d4cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You hear about Gogan? A gang of thieves is running a scam in town, and he "
"fell for it! Hahaha... what an idiot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00053763_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You hear about Jorundr? He was caught stealing gold, and now he's in jail! I "
"bet Arnora's beside herself with grief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00027f34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You hear any word about Kud-Ei's friend? She's offering a generous reward, so "
"hopefully someone will show up and lend a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FishermansRockTopicWhy_000860d5_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You hear me? I TALK to him first. No smashing in his teeth or chopping off "
"his head! Understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You heard about any new contracts? They'd tell us, wouldn't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You heard about the Fighters Guild members tearing up a tavern in Leyawiin. "
"As if they didn't have enough problems with the Blackwood Company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e9d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You heard any more about the rat thing in Anvil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Goblinhunting_00038abf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You heard of 'Goblin Jim's Cave'? It's a big one. It's a long walk due north "
"of Skingrad, in the Imperial Reserve... a long way from civilization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG06Choice1A_0001ceee_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You help me pull off a little prank, and I'll help you find J'skar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD08Choice6_000a345d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You helped her pay my debt. I heard about you. She never hurt anyone! Who "
"could have done this? What monster would do this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c143_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You helped our city fight off those damned daedra. Now it's our turn to help "
"Bruma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00080d90_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You helped us at Cylarne. The Mazken do not forget their friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002886c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You here looking for work, meat? Maybe you want a contract?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017832_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You hit that Orc so hard, her mother in Orsinium started bleedin'! That "
"victory advances you to the rank of Gladiator. Enjoy the gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_000949a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You hold the staff, but you are no Daedric Prince!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00081dd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You honor me with your presence, Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00081536_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You honor me with your presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007a01f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You honor me, Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081dcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You honor me, Lord. May your Realm be free of cats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008faa2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You honor me, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000a0e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You honor us with your presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f5a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You horrible creature! You've ruined everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You humans are all the same! Weak and worthless!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000907a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You idiot! How could you kill Kurdan before you got Aleron to safety? Get... "
"get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022cad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You idiot! You complete piece of gutter trash! Two disqualifications? That's "
"it! You are hereby stripped of all titles! Get out of my Bloodworks!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingMS91KilledFour_000860de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You idiot! You ruined everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e59_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You impossible fool. What possessed you to think I would suggest a meeting "
"here, of all places?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07KeepForgedLetter_0009839f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You insolent... do you know who I am? I'll see that Countess Umbranox knows "
"what kind of a fetcher you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a367_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You joined the Fighters Guild? Very good. Hard-working, trustworthy folk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a361_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You joined the Mages Guild? Excellent. Good people. Substantial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f85c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You just couldn't wait, could you? So impatient..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gift_0018bc33_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You just go give them to her. No need to let her know where they came from; "
"it doesn't matter. So long as she's happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047689_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You just have to know the right people. Look up Ida Vlinorman and Othrelos in "
"the Elven Gardens. They're the right people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingDontCare_000131d7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You just have to try it. It'll change your world, expand your horizons. "
"Contracting leads to expanding, you know. Well, most of the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d031_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You just take care of Agarmir, and I will be sure these things are disposed "
"of properly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a343_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You just wouldn't leave! So I HAD to call the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09YourAmulet_0005377c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You kill me here and now, and as far as the town guard is concerned, it's a "
"crime. So you make your choice. You want to do it my way, or Jorundr's?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You killed him? Good. I've got to get back to work. And so do you. Keep at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00090cb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You killed my mother! You ruined my life! I will destroy you all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017201_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You killed someone in the Chapel, and now you have to pay the blood price. "
"Until you do, you are no longer a member of this guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f478_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You killed the shaman of Cracked Wood Cave!? I'm impressed! Barthel Gernand "
"will be glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know as much about Mysticism as I do. If you wish to learn more, Dagail "
"can teach you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c169_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know as much as I do about the art of being a Marksman. There is only one "
"person I know of that is more skilled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_000097b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know better than to contact me here. Meet me at the usual place. "
"Dareloth's Garden, at midnight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_0018d7f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know how it is. There are whispers in the halls of Cloud Ruler, as in any "
"other place. But it matters not. The Blades stand united!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21TempleOfAncestors_0002b460_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know it as White Gold Tower -- the center of the ancient Ayleid capital "
"of Nibenay. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadGukimir1_00002cf1_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know me too well. Something someone said today reminded me of Sir "
"Gukimir. He was a fine knight, wasn't he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00074a10_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know nothing of my father's true power!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KSharraProphecy_00026af4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know of the K'Sharra Prophecy? How odd! Are you some sort of scholar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know of them? One of the most secretive of all the daedric cults. Not "
"much is known about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk4_0018d7f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know that no matter what happens, no matter what fate befalls us, "
"together we honor the memory of Uriel Septim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49Choice1A_0002ad7d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You know the drill. Stick close, and keep your eyes open. Let's move out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate4_00015628_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know truth when you hear it, Herdir. I have spoken truth. You cannot "
"intimidate me, so I suggest you release me at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEMazken_00012cc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know us as Dark Seducers. A name given us by our enemies. But we are the "
"Mazken in our own tongue, Sheogorath's only truly loyal servants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000164d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know what Brawler rank is worth around here? Nothing! Face it kid, you're "
"still a maggot! You need to keep fighting if you want to be somebody!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008adec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know what I know. There is no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Response_000343b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know what I think. We should go home before the goblins find us and kill "
"us all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013452_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You know what it's like now... Always wanting that next fix, hating it but "
"craving it at the same time, and hating yourself for all of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrumaTopic_0003c9a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know what it's like. Make lots of friends, and look busy. Same as "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Sanctuary_000251fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know what they say -- home is where you hang your enemy's head.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBoots_000400c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know what they say about the size of a man's boots...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeHelmetMagic_000400b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know what they say about the size of a man's forehead, right? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeGauntlets_000400bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know what they say about the size of a man's hands...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ObelisksTopic_000910fa_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You know what would be a good sign? \"Free Sweetrolls!\" Who wouldn't like "
"that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingShort_000131db_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You know what's NOT amusing? I don't have my Chalice of Reversal. It makes me "
"sad. When I get sad, I don't care to do much of anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22MaricHighFane_0002b09c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know what? I will help you, although it is liable to get you killed. The "
"High Fane is now known as Malada, up in the Valus Mountains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03ElvenBust_0000918a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know where the bust is hidden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032e8d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You know where they're burying Rienna?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000434db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know who's responsible for killing the Gatekeeper, don't you? It's Them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00025571_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, Bongond has got some fine horses for sale over at the Grey Mare. "
"Too bad he's such a pushy man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38TalkItem2_00082432_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, I always walk over here thinking there's another exhibit, but there "
"never is. Silly me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a9848_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, I haven't seen him around for a while. But I'm still getting paid, "
"so what do I care?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00043ec9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, I need to get me a habit like Thadon. Might take the edge off. Life "
"can be so hard. Makes me want to cry all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000aed4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, I saw your fight against the Gray Prince. Nobody thought that Orc "
"could be beat, but you showed them all! Ha ha ha ha ha! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000241da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, I think the mutton here in Chorrol is the best in all the Empire. "
"Mmmm... that's good mutton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003c24a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, if you need to get better at archery, you should talk to Reman "
"Broder. He's quite a good shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS37JulienneAmazing_00022e63_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"You know, if you're really interested in more, there's a book I read once "
"called \"Knightfall.\" It may have more about Garridan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033367_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, my time's almost up. Pretty soon I'll be free, and you'll still be "
"stuck in this rat hole, waiting for your execution."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_000607d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, of course, that the Realm would still be in jeopardy were it not "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004763b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, of course, the Imperial Palace is Ayleid. White Gold Tower, they "
"called it, back in the Middle Merethic, when the Aldmeri ruled Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_0002870d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You know, offer her comfort and support during this difficult time. Besides, "
"I want to watch over her, make sure she stays safe.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoTopic_000a984b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, sometimes I get thirsty during the night shift. Duck out to the "
"Tiber Septim for a quick drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003333a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, sometimes, when they let us in the yard, you can hear the sounds "
"from the lake. The boats, the gulls. So close..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00066f26_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, stranger, there comes a time in every man's life when he has to "
"admit that he's lost the fight. Well, I've fought and I've lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice5C_00085865_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, that's what I like about you. You're such a good listener. Thanks. "
"I feel so much better now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_0002a371_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You know, they kick you out of the guild if you get caught doing some "
"incarceration. How many? I forget. But I did a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingH2HFight_0006245a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You know, throw a good punch? Can you? I'd like to find out if I'm going to "
"spend time working with you. So are you up for a sparring match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000176b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You left that Nord in pretty rough shape, Warrior. They'll probably have to "
"ship her back to Skyrim in pieces. Nice work. Here's your take."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00003931_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You left your charge in that place? Get back there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Ignore_00072dc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You like dogs too? That's nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c456b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You like my amulet? It's enchanted, makes me lucky! I swear it helps me win "
"these matches!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000285a1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You listen good. This is your only warning. One more disqualification, and "
"you'll never fight in the Arena again! Now get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You little sugar pie! You've done such a good job! Yes, you have!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You look concerned. Is there something you want to tell me about Glarthir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look familiar. Do I know you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bca0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like a bright one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeBowMagic_000400be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like a man who can shoot straight and long!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c459d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like a shrewd businessman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d491_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You look like just what we need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a2b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like one of the low lifes that infest this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00035a1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like someone I might be able to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c459b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like someone who's comfortable in heavy armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d48d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You look like you can handle yourself in a fight. And I'm sure you wouldn't "
"mind making a little extra money. Hmmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like you can hold your own in a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022f0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like you've seen some travel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bcb8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look like you've swung a mace or two in your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00046009_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c4598_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look skilled in Alteration. Maybe you can teach me something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0006fdb3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look tired, my friend. I hope you're holding up all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033d11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look tough. Want to join the Fighters Guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look uneasy. I hope things are going well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You look upset that we deceived you. Please, don't be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechMQ3_00002d14_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You looked away when the fires flickered, and now act lost that they are "
"gone! Only death remains for Tamriel! Death and oblivion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGHieronymusLex_00007dfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You lookin' for him? I might be able to help you... for a donation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ac6b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You looking for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000164e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You made it to Bloodletter, which is more than I can say for most people who "
"step into that Arena. Keep it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00035f3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You made it work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004d0b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You made it! Not that I was worried about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047226_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You made it. I didn't think you'd have any trouble. Let's get these Bands off "
"you ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutsideChoiceSweetroll_000790bb_Oblivion_RESP"
"3"
msgid ""
"You make Uungor go away faster. He won't leave without his lucky grapes. "
"Can't eat them. I tried. Give back to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You make me sick! Now get out of here before I have Manheim throw you out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEZoeMalenePykeResponses_00091b17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You make me so happy, Pyke. I will stop my other portraits and paint a "
"picture of this moment to capture it in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009181_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You make progress, but your work is not yet done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You make them leave!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000275c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You managed to kill the five house guests, yes. But your inability to remain "
"undetected will cost you. Your bonus for this contract is forfeit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Benefits_0004b831_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may also summon entertainment to your throne room. Your predecessor found "
"this most invigorating. Speak with me if you wish entertainment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CastleResidents_000038ba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may also want to speak to Bittneld, the Captain of the Guard. He can be "
"found on patrol in Chorrol or in the Barracks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053263_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You may as well make yourself useful. Carry that torch and stick close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000178c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may as well make yourself useful. Here, carry this torch and stick close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQJauffreHelp_0006b83e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may as well take Prior Maborel's horse from the stable. He won't have use "
"for it any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d245_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may ask Gilen Norvalo or Grey-Throat about these creatures as well. "
"They've learned much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04Audience_0007fe1e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may attempt to approach her then. The Lady has been concerned about her "
"safety lately, so be prepared for a hostile reaction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002798d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may be a killer, but are you an actor? I think not. The guests will "
"discover your true identity and you will never leave that house alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00030032_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may be wondering why you can't see me. We are all wondering the same "
"thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND10SirAmielSpeech06_00002cbd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may call upon our spirits when you need us. Simply pray at our tombs, and "
"each of us will grant you a blessing from the Nine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AChamber_00018ff1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You may choose to spring a fire trap and cause them great harm as they stand "
"before the gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_000811ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may continue to do your worst, Inquisitor, but unless you have some "
"evidence of this preposterous conspiracy, you'll get nothing from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0008f7db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You may find me rather harder to kill than poor, innocent Thadon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_000895e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may find the enormity of your task daunting at first. Use Herdir's "
"talents to aid you with those who are unresponsive to questioning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTalk1_00067dc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may have as much of my time as you need, so long as you stop calling me "
"\"lord.\" My name is Martin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00028d6d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may have heard that he's a bit touched in the head, and that may be true, "
"but he's always been a quiet neighbor.  Never given us any trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may have run across lesser Welkynd Stones; they are fairly common in "
"Ayleid ruins. But a Great Welkynd Stone will not be easy to come by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You may join us for morning prayers in the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG09accept_00014826_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may kill Fathis if necessary, but not in the castle. My spy network will "
"tell me when you have it. Return here with the arrow when you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062618_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may need to ask around, but training in all the schools of magic can be "
"found at our various guild halls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003640a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may not leave here until your initiation is complete. Lord Dagon thirsts "
"for red-drink. Sate him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05ShrinePassword_0001f10b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may pass into the Shrine. Harrow will take you to the Master for your "
"initiation into the service of Lord Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05ShrinePassword_0001f874_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may pass into the Shrine. Harrow will take you to the Master for your "
"initiation into the service of Lord Dagon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08GiveStone_00014705_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You may pay me now, or Armand Christophe later should you choose to return to "
"my good graces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Benefits_0004b831_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may request any of the Golden Saint or Dark Seducer Escorts at the castle "
"to accompany you. They will defend you to the death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_000459ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may rule Mania, but you will learn that Lord Sheogorath's justice still "
"applies to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00054829_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You may slay me, but we have already won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cb9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You may speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NecromancersMoon_00002dcf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You may take that with you for now, if you wish. The Council may have use for "
"it. Please ask them to return it quickly, as I may need it again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaB2_000a5603_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You may think so, in your ignorance. But I take a larger view. As a scholar "
"of the Ayleids, I have no wish to see their evil power return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0002db97_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You may try to speak to her. If... if it doesn't go well, come see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VampireTopic_0001d4b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You may want to see if Grey-Throat or Gilen have done more research."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeridurTopic_0001d4c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You may want to speak to Phintias at the First Edition bookshop in the Market "
"District of the city. I know he goes there occasionally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyImperialCity_000531bc_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You may want to spruce it up a bit with some furnishings. I'd suggest talking "
"to Sergius Verus at Three Brothers Trade Goods in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06WhereIsShum_0000bf94_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean other than at the Castle? Hmmm. He's around town at midday. Try the "
"Colovian Trader and the West Weald Inn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32Betrothed_00012d0f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean that stupid doll? I think he's been blessed a little too well by "
"Lord Sheogorath. He's on the list. Not first though. Definitely not first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a8c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean the Holy Hermit of Anvil? No one knows where he comes from, but they "
"say he has the true word. I'd love to go hear him preach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_0001e8aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean the priest? Last I saw him, he was leading a group towards the "
"Chapel of Akatosh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DaedraShrineTopic_000a4959_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean the shrine to Nocturnal? That's north of Leyawiin, east of the Lower "
"Niben."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06Theranis_00010500_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean the thief? He was in the big cell with that Argonian. They were "
"always whispering to each other. The Pale Lady took him days ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice2B_000242b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You mean there are still ogres there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04GoodWord_00035faf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You mean with the Thieves Guild? Sure, that way I'll be a member in good "
"standing when they put my head on a pole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona10_00022e84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You mean you were unable to return?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseTooMuchSkingrad_000545de_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You mean you're too poor. That's a fair price for this horse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04HotWaterNo_000704bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You men are all alike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e896_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You might also look at Quickwater Cave to the north. I cleared it out, but I "
"haven't been there in years. It might have new tenants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001c27e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You might be ready, but the Arena ain't. Matches take place between 9:00 AM "
"and 9:00 PM. Come back later, moron."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImpGallTOPIC_0002ee71_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You might check Robbers Glen Cave for the imp gall. That place has been known "
"to contain the imps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MiscarcandTopic_00026efe_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You might find 'Glories and Laments Among the Ayleid Ruins' useful. I have "
"the library's copy at my table if you need it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE44AllItems_0007873c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You might find it handy to cause confusion in your enemies. You know... when "
"the time comes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG01Choice1A_0002d414_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You might want to ask around, and see if anyone can be of some help. Let me "
"know when he's back, and you'll have your recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BleakFlatsCaveTopic_0002d6e7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You might want to make sure she remembers. Especially the part about it being "
"her idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorWhy_0003446f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You mind your business, and we'll mind ours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BradonLirrianTopic_00038f3d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must avenge his unjust death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c51a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be Umbacano's new plaything. Well met! I am Claude Maric, another "
"pawn in Umbacano's game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0000c167_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be downright determined to get yourself killed, huh? Okay then, head "
"back up to the Arena and try not to die before the gate opens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS12Reman_000980f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be joking, right? Who hasn't heard of the greatest known hero of the "
"First Age?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d58e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You must be new. Oh, it's so nice to see new faces in the guild!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00022b3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be referring to Mankar Camoran's \"Commentaries on the Mysterium "
"Xarxes.\" A common mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004f8b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be rid of the staff, or the scamps will follow you around forever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26CorruptGuard_00035c9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must be stupid to accuse me of corruption to my face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a49_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You must be tested by Kynareth before you are worthy of the Boots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a7156_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be the Gray Fox. Your reputation precedes you, as I'm sure you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000982d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must be the cat burglar I've been told to expect. Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bf98_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must be the new slop drudge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000982c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must be the one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028877_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must be the reinforcement from the guild. Good. I hope you brought "
"weapons for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1A_00032bec_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must break one of the Tenets you have sworn to uphold. I know this is an "
"unexpected turn of events, but drastic measures must be taken.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1B_00032bed_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must break one of the Tenets you have sworn to uphold. I know this is an "
"unexpected turn of events, but drastic measures must be taken.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark09RetFinChoice1C_00032bee_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must break one of the Tenets you have sworn to uphold. I know this is an "
"unexpected turn of events, but drastic measures must be taken.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c360_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must bring that evidence to Garrus. Make haste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00002de1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must do more to fill the guild's treasury before I can assign you "
"commission jobs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressNone_00038fad_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must eliminate both the Mythic Dawn agents in Bruma. We cannot allow them "
"to continue to plot against us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000685a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must enter the portal to Camoran's Paradise and reclaim the Amulet of "
"Kings!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029de_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You must excuse me, as I'm not feeling well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018bc60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must find J'baana, and learn from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HistTreeTopic_0003570c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must find a way to destroy the Hist, though I can imagine Ri'Zakar will "
"have it well guarded. Expect an unfriendly welcome at their hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029da_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must finish what you have started if you wish the gods to look upon you "
"with favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetGreeting03_00002c11_Knights_RESP5"
msgid ""
"You must first kill his living body. While beyond the power of most mortals, "
"this is only the lesser of your two tasks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c7c_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"You must fullfill your new duties. The statue in Bravil serves as a conduit "
"between the Night Mother and the Listener."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGBaurusF_0001e90a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must get the Amulet to Jauffre. Take no chances, but proceed to Weynon "
"Priory immediately. Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038580_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You must get there before he acquires whatever artifact is being kept there "
"and makes his escape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00089938_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must get to the top of the large tower. The Sigil Keep, they call it. "
"That's what keeps the Oblivion Gate open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00022a12_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must get us out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreE1_0001e74e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must go to Kvatch and find him at once. If the enemy is aware of his "
"existence, as seems likely, he is in terrible danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04FinChoice1A_000253d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must go to the city of Chorrol and break into the house of Francois "
"Motierre. Inside you will find Motierre waiting for you. Do not kill him! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c33c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must have a deathwish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Selene05Positive_00015264_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must have been hiding down there and made your way up here. How did you "
"get past Minx, Wrath and Lynch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32WhatCanIDo_00012d05_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must help us break the cycle of torment. Help my people overcome their "
"weakness and defend Vitharn from the Fanatics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000293f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You must help us, Sir Knight! Save Cheydinhal from those monsters!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000293c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You must help! They appeared out of nowhere and started attacking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must hurry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29StopNo_0001e841_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must hurry. We cannot let him do this horrible task any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06FinChoice1A_0003005d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must infiltrate Fort Sutch, find Roderick's medicine, and replace it with "
"a poisoned bottle I will provide. But you must remain undetected!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000233d8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must infiltrate the Imperial Prison and kill Valen Dreth, a Dark Elf. He "
"should be easy enough to eliminate, once you actually get inside.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_0018d15c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must know your craft, and its history, before I will teach you anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05WhatGives_0002c6db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must learn to broaden your thoughts and hold your tongue! Allow me to "
"explain before jumping to conclusions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0007dfe5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must leave this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c35d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must locate Aldos. He's a danger to himself and others in his condition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackSoulGemMG17_000151f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must make sure the gem does not reach Mannimarco. We are doomed if it "
"does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000535f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must make them stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00094c38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must not have heard me the first time. Good day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GlarthirTopic_00029aa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must not have heard. He went crazy and killed Davide Surilie with an axe! "
"Nobody can figure out why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15Anaxes_00047366_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "You must not release him, for pity's sake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5A_00022ba9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must now go to the city of Cheydinhal, to the abandoned house near the "
"eastern wall. Enter the basement, and attempt to open the Black Door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5B_00022baa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must now go to the city of Cheydinhal, to the abandoned house near the "
"eastern wall. Enter the basement, and attempt to open the black door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5C_00022bab_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must now go to the city of Cheydinhal, to the abandoned house near the "
"eastern wall. Enter the basement, and attempt to open the black door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035e02_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must open these sealed orders immediately and follow their instructions "
"to the letter. It would seem the Black Hand itself has a task for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhatWere_000807b9_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must proceed to Sheogorath at once and tell him the Knights have "
"returned! Quickly now... go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirGauntlets_00002b24_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must prove to Stendarr you are worthy to lift the Gauntlets once more. "
"Seek out the priests in Chorrol. Perhaps they can help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d289_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must receive a recommendation from every local guild hall in Cyrodiil "
"before you may advance through the ranks of the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEAkTimeWound_00014e28_AltarDeluxe_RESP3"
msgid "You must retreive it at all costs, Hero."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000459b5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must return any property that does not belong to you. Now, will you serve "
"your sentence in the dungeon, or pay reparations?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000459b7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must return any stolen items. I regret that I have no choice but to "
"escort you to the dungeon, as you are short of the required reparations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreE1_0001e74d_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You must return to Kvatch at once, and rescue Martin if he lives. There is no "
"time to lose!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e966_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must set me free!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e967_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must set me free!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024e54_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must slay the sacrifice to bind yourself fully to Lord Dagon's service. "
"Lord Dagon thirsts for blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001d243_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You must speak with Seridur first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2A_0004cacf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must then flee from Chorrol, and Hides-His-Heart must not be killed! That "
"way he can go back and tell his employers I'm dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark05Choice2B_0004cad0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You must then flee from Chorrol, and Hides-His-Heart must not be killed! That "
"way he can go back and tell his employers I'm dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_00188308_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You must understand our need for darkness and secrecy? Speak to me only "
"between the hours of midnight and 3:00 AM, and we will be off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice4SoWhat_00061c4c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You must... you must kill me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolTopic_00024e11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need a place to sleep in Chorrol? Well, why don't you just join the "
"Fighters Guild, or Mages Guild? Sleep for free around Cyrodiil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091757_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You need his blood, so take it! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_00034877_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need more experience before I can use you on a commission job. Ongar "
"tells me that you haven't turned in much loot yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0003b346_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need someplace to rest? I can rent you a room for the night for 10 gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00004b9d_DLCVileLair_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need something... special? Check out my wares. You won't find this stuff "
"at your local general store, that's for damn sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c45bb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need something... special? Check out my wares. You won't find this stuff "
"at your local general store, that's for damn sure. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025292_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need something? A room maybe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00027d7e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You need to close the Great Gate! We'll try to hold them off as long as we "
"can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_0003406c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You need to find him at once and bring him safely back here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007bacf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to find the Count! Get moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00003935_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to find the Stone of St. Alessia and return it to Cirroc at the "
"Chapel of Talos in Bruma. Now, get to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to find us work. You're supposed to be boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000091f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to finish out the contract with Biene Amelion in Water's Edge. "
"What's the status?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e8b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to get out of here. There's no telling who will come first, the "
"Blades or more assassins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002006f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to get the Mysterium Xarxes from the Mythic Dawn's Shrine of Dagon. "
"It is our only hope to retrieve the Amulet of Kings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to go find Lady Rogbut, meat! Why are you standing here talking to "
"me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TimeToGo_0018d81c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to go now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008320d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to help Arvena Thelas with her rat problem. What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0007dfe9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to leave this place, mortal. Quickly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000091e1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to make a better offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00054221_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to see Ugak if you want to buy a horse. She's inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEFelldew_00043020_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You need to strike a balance with how often you ingest Felldew, and how "
"willing you are to live with the side-effects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00009c35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You need to take care of those fugitives from the prison break in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024da5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to take care of you problems with the guild before we can talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002e586_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You need to track down Maglir. Again. Look for him in Bravil. Now go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VidkunTopic_0002e5b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You needn't concern yourself with him. He was unfit to be a guild member, and "
"it's better that he's no longer part of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c67c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You needn't tell me the details of what was involved in getting it; it's "
"perhaps better that I know nothing about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Barter_00038992_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You never know when you might need a good strong potion. Best to stock up now "
"while you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047630_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You new here? I'm Servatius Quintilius, Officer of the Watch. Just stay out "
"of trouble, and we'll get along just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You notice all the Nords around here? It's partly because Nords like ships "
"and sailing. Mostly, we're sick of freezing our asses off in Skyrim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ARuler_00031622_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You now have the power to summon Dark Seducers. They've always served the "
"Duke of Dementia. I think they have a thing for pain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRuler_0009130d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You now have the power to summon Golden Saints. They've always served the "
"Duke of Mania. I think it's the bright colors. They just love 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_00019cce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You now hold the physical component of the Staff of Sheogorath. Before it is "
"complete however, it must be imbued with power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0001811e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You now owe your loyalty to our guildmaster, the Gray Fox. He has three rules "
"you must follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0001c14e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You now owe your loyalty to our guildmaster, the Gray Fox. He has three rules "
"you must follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UniqueSummoningTopic_00091914_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You of course recall Rufio, the feeble old man I sent you to kill when we "
"first met? He was weak in life, but his spirit is quite angry in death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You outrank me, now, so there's certainly no more I can do for you. You might "
"check with an old friend of yours, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a55ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You owe S'razirr. Will you pay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09VictimChoice1b_00082090_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You persecute genius when you find it, because we are able to see around the "
"sharp corners of your simplified \"morality.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d765_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You picked a bad time to visit Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetSpeechLoremasters_00002d27_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You pore over your dusty tomes of lore. You study ancient genealogies and "
"bloodlines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice2A_00090792_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You possess strength, and cunning, and a heart as black as midnight. You were "
"marked by Sithis the moment you emerged from your mother's womb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice2B_00090793_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You possess strength, and cunning, and a heart as black as midnight. You were "
"marked by Sithis the moment you emerged from your mother's womb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice2C_00090794_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You possess strength, and cunning, and a heart as black as midnight. You were "
"marked by Sithis the moment you emerged from your mother's womb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11StaffOfSheogorath_0007eb5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You possess the eye and the branch. Together, they shall form the physical "
"shape of the Staff of Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2C_00022ba1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You prefer silence, then? As do I, my dear child. As do I. For is silence not "
"the symphony of death, the orchestration of Sithis himself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_0009ea87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You probably cheated me, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS49ChoiceNoTime_00031d2c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You probably couldn't find it on your own. I'm coming with you. If we make "
"it, I'll open the door for you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE36Choice6HowDie_00061c4e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You probably want to do it without spectators though, so you don't get in "
"trouble. Best to make it look like an accident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDSirBerichTopic_00002c7c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You put right the evil that I began through my own weakness. Sir Berich is "
"once again part of our fellowship, and shall be forevermore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0007eaf6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You ready to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033785_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38OddityDonate_00043439_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You really are a dear! A true friend to the Museum. Perhaps Lord Sheogorath "
"himself will come see the exhibit one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000301e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You really enjoy this whole hero thing, don't you? Everybody fawning all over "
"you? I'm not like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002983_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You really fought that Umaril creature in the sky over the Imperial City? I "
"would have liked to have seen that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00053774_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You really should be more careful when you talk in the dungeons... the sound "
"tends to carry. Jorundr's such an idiot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b490_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You really shouldn't be here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SESheogorathHitTalk_0005552c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You really shouldn't have done that. Enjoy the view."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002914_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You redeemed my soul from the evil that had ensnared me. For that I am "
"forever in your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e43e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You remain faithful. That is good. I will cut your throat if you visit that "
"other smith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007311e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You remind me of a character from a book I'm reading."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You remind me of a witch I once knew. I hate witches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cf5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You remind me of my homeland. During the Blight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpDefendA2_000131b8_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You return to Kaneh and lead her into the trap. Once they are destroyed, I "
"will kindle the Altars. Good hunting, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000029a4_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You return to Kynareth's Altar. Have you changed your mind? Do you still seek "
"the Boots of the Crusader?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003630e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You return to me, yet you bear no news? Go, Silencer, uncover the identity of "
"the traitor! The fate of the Dark Brotherhood rests in your hands!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03TestofKynareth_00002a56_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You return unsuccessful, but have involved yourself in other matters. Settle "
"your combat, and return to me then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000981b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You ripped me off blind. I hope you're happy with yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You risk much by speaking to me. You should leave this place. Now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ03Avenge_00189cf9_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You risked life and limb for a cause that wasn't your own. For that, I'm "
"grateful. Please, accept these gems as a token of my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10AldosTalk_0003c2b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You s'wit! How dare you! Ulrich be damned! He can take his fine and stuff it "
"up his backside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ErthorTopic_0004b8e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You said he was at Bleak Flats Cave. Haven't you looked there for him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001dc2b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You said you wanted me to solve this myself. And I am. Drastic measures. "
"Didn't want to, but you're right, it is the only way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_001896ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You saved my life. You brought me back from hell. I won't forget it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000297f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You saved the church from that wicked old Ayleid king, didn't you? Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You saw my last show, and came to mock me, right? Don't worry, I already "
"know. I disgust myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AldosOthranTopic_0003c3b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You saw what happened, I had no choice. Aldos attacked first, and I had to "
"defend myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00000a1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You say a beggar told you seek me out? Good enough for me then. The beggars "
"are the eyes and ears of the Gray Fox."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_00033ef6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You say you took the head from the Timberscar Cave goblins? Where is it, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StoneofStAlessiaTOPIC_0000392c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You say you've found it, but you no longer have it? What madness is this? "
"Please, you must return it to us immediately!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You scare off my customers. Go away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004767d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You see Khajiit always running through the City? You see Ra'Jiradh and his "
"brothers! We bring the Black Horse Courier to the good citizens, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You see a sailor in the streets of Anvil, best step out of his way. If it's "
"in his mind to raise hell, a little jail time is just fair payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a85_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You see me now a changed man. Lathon can testify to that. Before I met the "
"Prophet, I was nothing more than a hired sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081792_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You see now what happens when those who oppose me fail, which they always do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04FinChoice1A_000253d7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You see, Francois Motierre is a marked man. He owes a considerable sum to the "
"wrong kind of people. So, they have sent an enforcer to kill him. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e690_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You see, I am the Master Smith of New Sheoth, don't bother with that other "
"smith in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47AleswellInvisible_0003003d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You see, in order to increase the efficacy of the spell, the radius was "
"likely to approach the... never mind. I don't mean to bore you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingLong_000131da_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You see? You see what I have to deal with? I can't recall if I'm coming or "
"you're going without the Chalice of Reversal. Oh, now you've upset me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fc4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seek more from me, child? It is as I have seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seek my help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a4a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You seek the Boots of the Crusader? Kynareth will show you no favor until "
"your current conflicts are resolved. Finish your fights, then return here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000243be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seek the way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b18d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You seek training? If I were to aid you, you would first have to assist me. I "
"would strip the Creators of their works... you will help with this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002db93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seek wisdom from me, child? Ah, no. You seek words."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c296_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seem far too nice to be one of Ulrich's men. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e7cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seem in good spirits... do you have good news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028222_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You seem like a very nice person. I very much want to find the gold, but I "
"wish you luck. May the best guest win. He he. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062ca5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seem quite intriguing. Please, share your thoughts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Investigation_0003150a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You seem the trusting type. Perhaps you can assist me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SheldenGreeting1_00018e6c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You seem to have no trouble, though. Look at you, barely a scratch! You'd be "
"the perfect person to protect me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002972_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You serve the Nine well, noble Knight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018f86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You served out the Mazken with their own medicine. Not the most glorious "
"victory, perhaps, but Cylarne is ours at last thanks to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001ad4b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You set my blood on fire. Come closer and burn me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor18_00032482_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You shall follow me yet for a while, then we must part."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0004c5af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shall have a true Mages' Staff soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Ceremony_00014ad3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You shall know them by the coldness in their minds. A darkness of spirit. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_poisonedknifetopic_000282fe_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should also know that there's only enough Languorwine on the blade for "
"this one contract. After Motierre is sliced, the knife will be useless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_disappearances_0000be71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should ask Drarana Thelis about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fb69_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should ask Horkvir about it. Our Horkvir. Not the other one. He'd lie to "
"you, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKEHATE_00062321_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be ashamed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000451d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be elsewhere right now, shouldn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038fbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should be gathering the items Martin needs for the Mysterium Xarxes "
"ritual. There's no time to lose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095a87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be helping Irlav Jarol, shouldn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f3eb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be helping out Elante by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008320c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be helping out Norbert Lelles. What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036621_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be looking for Pinarus! What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f514_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be off like the wind, solving problems and doing good deeds!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022e02_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be on your way by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005c2fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should be out acquiring a Mage's Staff for yourself. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c139_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should be proud of what you did here today, but remember, the war is not "
"yet over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ecb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should be taking care of this, shouldn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000174f3_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"You should check his room in the living quarters. If you see the note, or "
"anything else unusual, let me know. I'll gladly send it to the Council."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGOtherJobs_00018120_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should check in with your Doyen every once in a while to see if there are "
"any commission jobs available."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081527_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should come see my museum, Lord Sheogorath. I've built it just to honor "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06Cleansing_00036421_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should complete your initiation before we speak any further of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00097cbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should complete your initiation before we speak any further of that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006244e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should consider going to Bruma, and talking with Helvius Cecia. He can "
"teach you more than... well, probably anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062453_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You should consult her; I'm sure she can give you more training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk5_0006a873_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should continue with your research. Consult some of the older tomes in "
"the Mystic Archives. We'll talk again later after you learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0002798c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should dress appropriately. The Deceiver's Finery, your recent quest "
"reward, would serve this purpose nicely. If you earned it, that is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01ThievesTest_0003563a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should drop out now. You know I'm going to win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0008591b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a1_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should get out there, and experience things for yourself. Discover new "
"places, travel to lands you've never seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestTodd_000281aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should get this about 1/4 the time, too. The best way to test this is the "
"click about 10 times and just jot down on notebook what you get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestTodd_000281a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should get this about 1/4 the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_0001efe3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should go back to the Imperial City. Baurus may have learned something "
"about the assassins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a8d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should go to Anvil and hear him for yourself, if you're interested. They "
"say he preaches outside the Chapel every day, rain or shine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033582_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should hasten to Castle Cheydinhal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00062be9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should have heard the cheer when you came out of that monster Gate with "
"that Siege Machine right on your heels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000281a6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should have paid the fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0001a7ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should have stayed hidden. Now you will taste my Lord's power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_000a31be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should keep working on getting a hold of those other Mythic Dawn books. "
"That's our best lead right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08LuckyGuess_0001474b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should know better than to give heed to rumors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04BribeBeggar_0000932f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You should know that there are other secrets in that castle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DerveninGreetA_000400e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should know, that in addition to the adulation of the people of Bliss, "
"there is also a more... earthly reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetTopic_00002a95_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should listen to him preach. He may sound crazy at first, but the longer "
"you listen, the more sense he makes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ebf7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should not be here, Inquisitor. Perhaps you are lost? I have business to "
"attend to. Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0007dfea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should not be here, mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00098145_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should not be here, mortal. Your blood is forfeit, your flesh is mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0007dfe6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should not be in this place. It is best you leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofNocturnalTOPIC_00026ac2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should not be in this place. What is your business here? Do you believe "
"yourself worthy to speak to Nocturnal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473c4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should not keep my father waiting any longer. He expected you hours ago. "
"Come, you came here to see him, did you not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestChoice01_000281af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should only have goodbye as your option."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASanguineSpeech_000b121d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should probably try to be inconspicuous. Or they might kill you. Oh, and "
"the party is by invitation only. You'll have to find a way in. Have fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0002412d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should really get to a healer. You're looking rather pale."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fcb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should rendezvous with Captain Burd immediately. The sooner that gate is "
"closed the better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003020a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should return to Anvil and let Carahil know the work is complete. We'll "
"remain here and clean things up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017973_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You should return to the Palace and speak with Sheogorath. Ask Him how He "
"plans to defend this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You should return to the Palace and speak with Sheogorath. Ask him how he "
"plans to defend this realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005a751_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should return what you have stolen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressAllDead_00020081_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should speak to Martin. I believe he has made some progress with the "
"Mysterium Xarxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ07ProgressPlans_00020085_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should speak to Martin. I believe he has made some progress with the "
"Mysterium Xarxes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001da58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You should speak to Seridur first. He has your reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_VahtacenTopic_000150b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should speak to Skaleel before you do anything else. She's in charge of "
"the project."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06FlameAgnon_0003e6ad_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You should speak to the Grakedrig Ulfri at once. She will be glad of your "
"help to rid Cylarne of the arrogant Aureals once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00038fbf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should speak to the rulers of Cyrodiil as soon as possible. The danger to "
"Bruma is growing by the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026ea8_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"You should speak to the rulers of the other cities of Cyrodiil, as well as "
"the Elder Council. Ask them to send aid to Bruma before it is too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillGatekeeper_0004036a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should speak with Relmyna Verenim as quickly as possible. I fear our time "
"runs short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04WhatSecrets_0004b776_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You should stay out of there, just in case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00078165_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should stop by the Museum of Oddities. I understand Una is always looking "
"for more items to display."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LucienLachanceTopic_00005679_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should take some time to admire his corpse. It really is a thing of "
"beauty. The punctures and slashes are almost... poetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001ce03_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should take this book to Thoronir. Confronted with this, he may just see "
"things differently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008faa8_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You should talk to Horkvir. He knows what to do. Not their Horkvir... our "
"Horkvir. I don't like the other one. Or any of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQWhatNext_00026ef4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should talk to Jauffre. He needs your help. Trouble down in Bruma, I "
"think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008b614_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should talk to Martin. He'll want to see the Mysterium Xarxes right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062bb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should think about joining the guild. If you're interested, talk to "
"Jeanne Frasoric or one of the other local guild hall leaders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You should track down Rusia Bradus in Anvil, and see if she can teach you "
"anything more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38Next_00023669_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You should wait outside his house and see what he does when he's not watching "
"me. I'll meet you here tomorrow night to get your report."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a387_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't be here now. I insist you leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0018d83a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_000280c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You shouldn't be in here, stranger.  You better leave before somebody gets "
"hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_00091016_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You shouldn't be. It's the death of all things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_00091273_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You shouldn't be. It's the death of all things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004eda2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't have come after us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000327c8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't have come for us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Assault_0018d823_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't have done that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HappyReceive_00023cd7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't have. That's very kind of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00089931_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You shouldn't pass on golden opportunities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND02SirAmielBattleCall_00002c04_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You show a fury of faith that I have not seen in centuries. But now you face "
"Sir Juncan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk5_00002bc6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You show much wisdom, my friend. It would honor me if you were to lead this "
"cause. I must go now. But we'll talk later, I promise.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MSShadowscaleChoice2A_0003559e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You show unexpected mercy. For that I am thankful. My treasure is hidden in a "
"hollowed-out rock near my campfire. It's yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaladaTopic_0002c523_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You showed admirable prudence. I was not half so sensible at your age, ha ha "
"ha! Not to worry, I'm sure you will get the drop on me one day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001c0d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You showed that cat whose claws are sharper, eh? I would expect no less. "
"Here's your gold. Now go wash up. You look awful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022502_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You sleep rather soundly for a murderer. That's good. You'll need a clear "
"conscience for what I'm about to propose.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bcb7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You smell of death. Been conjuring up dead things?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetB2_0003e8f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You speak directly like one of my people almost. I'm glad I did not kill you "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkRelics3_00002c6a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You speak truly, brother. Go with the blessing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas3_00002c3e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You speak truly, sir knight. We'll have time for more tales later, I'm sure. "
"Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril3_00002c51_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You speak truly. I will pray for more patience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002db95_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You speak, yet I cannot hear. You listen, yet I cannot speak. When the voices "
"grow quiet, then shall our time be at hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086066_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You spoiled everything, you idiot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ03MartinC2_00092268_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You spoke to the Emperor before he died? And he told you to find me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You stand now in our Sanctuary. May it serve as your new home, a place of "
"comfort and security whenever the need arises."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000224f6_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You stand now in our Sanctuary. May it serve as your new home, a place of "
"comfort and security whenever the need arises."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0005c0da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You stand on holy ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_00015136_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You stay here, prisoner. Don't try to follow us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000229fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You stupid or something? What are you doing here? Go back where you came "
"from. We don't like your kind here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You sure didn't mess things up. No. Not at all. Didn't make things much "
"worse. Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d299_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You sure gave those damned daedra what for! It makes us all feel better to "
"have someone like you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ac6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You sure took your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00051797_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You take care now, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS29ShadyDeal_0001e7f4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You take what I get. I get notice at the last second, and I have to jump on "
"it. No time to be picky about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008fa8b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You talk to Horkvir. He can tell you what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c80b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You test my patience, mortal. You are in my service. I expect my orders to be "
"carried out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcCaptainToPlayer_00018fc9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You there! Stay away from the Gatekeeper. Let us handle this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_0002d3fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You there! Stop where you are!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Assault_00025d01_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You there, stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035672_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You there. I have an update for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001b68a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You there. I'm watching you. Not so close to the armory door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00089615_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You think I can't take that kind of pain? I've had worse. I won't tell you "
"anything. There's nothing going on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_00018b7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You think I care for Thadon's toys? It matters not to me whether he suffers "
"in agony, or erases his mind with drugs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c244_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid "You think I mock you? Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e446_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You think I'm ugly, don't you? And that she's a prettier smith? Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_0002817b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You think Nels might be the killer? He plays the buffoon, but it could all be "
"an act. He is a Nord, and they're such a savage, uncivilized people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKEDISLIKE_0018b2d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You think that's funny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG08GrayCowl_00014749_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You think this is Nocturnal's cowl? Where did you hear about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f586_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You think you can stop the Greymarch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000473c2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You think you can stop us? Soon Mehrunes Dagon will walk upon Tamriel for the "
"first time since the Mythic Age, and our victory will be complete."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061439_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You think you know what it's like to really, truly wield that kind of power? "
"Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MountainLionsTOPIC_00036624_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You think you've gotten rid of them all? You do? Well, you haven't! There's "
"one in my basement right now! Go get it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NeutralReceive_000241e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00083061_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You thought I was weak, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_00054827_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You thought the last Septim heir was safe from us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0004ea49_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You thought we'd go down easy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045752_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You thought you could escape Lord Sheogorath's justice? Your stolen goods are "
"now forfeit, and you can either pay reparations or face the dungeons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0001e707_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You thought your secrets could be hidden from the Lord of Destruction?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036617_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You told her? What have you done? I'll be ruined! Thanks a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071f4c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You too seek wealth, do you not? May you find it, and may tales of your "
"journey be legendary. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46GoblinWar_0002f810_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You took care of the goblin menace? That's great news, my friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000bcd4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You traveled a great distance to find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Steal_000624f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You treacherous little filcher! How dare you steal from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001ad48_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You try my patience. Out with it! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e44_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You two are supposed to be taking care of those thieves in Anvil. What is it "
"you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06UlfriFinalC_000400e2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You understand nothing, mortal. I go now to claim the highest honor "
"attainable to my people. Stand aside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000290d_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You vanished in Garlas Malatar. After the battle, we searched further into "
"the ruin and found you next to Umaril's corpse. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG01Reject_000355e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You walk a dangerous path. Keep the secret of the guild... or else. If you "
"change your mind, I'll be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You walk in the shadow of the Corrupter. Why do you come to this place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047677_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want Light Armor? Pah! Why wear fluffy flutter, when you can wear real "
"armor? But if you MUST have Light Armor, talk to Maro Rufus. Idiot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000545cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want a horse? I can sell you one. There are no finer Bay horses than "
"those sold by the Grateful Pass Stables."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEChaliceofReversal_0001344c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You want information from me? After what you put me through?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_00028171_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want me to mistrust him, don't you! You want to turn me against him! "
"Maybe... maybe you're the murderer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_00035ca3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want me to publically accuse Audens Avidius of corruption? I'd sooner "
"swim naked in a pool filled with slaughterfish and mudcrabs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_00035ca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want me to testify against Audens Avidius? You're crazy. Exactly how do "
"you intend to persuade me to do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NelsTheNaughtyTopic_000286f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want me to think Nels is the killer, is that it? Maybe you did it, eh? "
"Maybe you're just trying to turn me against him!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038ac9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want me? You sure? I'm Vigge. I'm Mages Guild, but I don't train or "
"anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006233d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want more training? Then you'll have to find Andragil. I learned most of "
"what I know from her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want more training? Then you'll have to go to the best. Marana Rian, here "
"in the Imperial City. She can help you better than I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028ce4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want my honest opinion? I think Nels is the killer. But I haven't yet "
"ruled out that Dovesi may be working with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028b80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want my honest opinion? This whole setup -- the party, the chest of gold -"
"- it doesn't make any sense. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMalacathSpeech_000579cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You want something? Then, if you're smart, you do what I tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_StolenGold_00053798_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You want the gold? You bring me Arnora's amulet... after she's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00080d7e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You want the leader. You want Muurine. But no amount of torture will get a "
"confession from her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d14d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You want to be the best? Then you'd better head over to The Best Defense and "
"talk to him. Getting him to train you will be no small feat, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27AyleidCrown_0002e5cb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to buy my Ayleid Crown? It isn't for sale, at any price. I would "
"think Umbacano would know that by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_0004765b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to buy or sell, the City is great. You want free? Go down the holes, "
"kill some monsters. Sell your loot back in the city!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006143b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to do as much damage as possible with an axe or a hammer? Find Irene "
"Metrick, and talk to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_000302d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You want to find J'skar? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Help_00098144_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You want to help? You're kidding, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheBlackwoodCompany_000356ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to join us? Hmm... another guild rat leaving the ship. Very well. "
"Speak with Jeetum-Ze. He handles recruitment here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006260e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to join? Well, then either you'll  need to find Kud-Ei here in town, "
"or go seek out one of the other local guild hall leaders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0002d016_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to join? You'll need to speak with one of the local guild heads. "
"That'd be Carahil here in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recharge_0005e084_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to keep magic items charged at all times. The world could come "
"crashing down at any moment, and you want to be prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gatekeeper_0007eaec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to know about my child? Go see for yourself. He guards the Gates at "
"the top of the hill. Be warned, he doesn't play nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002879f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to know how I really feel about Neville's death? I'm afraid. I may "
"hate the Imperial Legion, but its members are trained warriors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028727_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to know something, my friend? I just don't care anymore. We're the "
"only two left. I know I didn't kill those people, so that leaves you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to know the truth? I thought for sure Nels was the killer. But with "
"him dead, my bets are now on Dovesi. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09SoIHear_00053778_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You want to know what happened? I'll tell you. I was betrayed. Stabbed in the "
"back. I'm in here, and Arnora's out there living in my house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nirnroot_0004e93d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You want to speak to Sinderion of Skingrad. He's an alchemist over there who "
"specializes in unusual plants, fungi and roots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00086563_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You want to speak to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0005e078_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to stay here for a night, eh? Just for sleeping... you keep to "
"yourself, mind your business, and stay away from my wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028a08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want to talk to me about Dovesi? Someone's been murdered, you idiot! "
"There are more important matters to discuss right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00062330_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You want training, from me? Well, perhaps I can accommodate you. If you're "
"worth the time and effort, that is. I think a little test is in order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47Counterspell_00030131_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"You wasted it again, didn't you? It is truly pathetic that the fools in "
"Aleswell actually trusted you to save them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00019fc3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You wear our robes, but I hear the darkness that you bring in your very "
"breath. You do not know harmony... you do not see my light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00015746_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You wear the Bands, but you're no prisoner. Who are you? What are you doing "
"here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003f289_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wear the shadows well, fellow thief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095e51_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wear the trappings, but you are not the Madgod!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0005a02a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You went inside that Gate, huh? You saved our necks, so thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007b7da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were Martin's friend, weren't you? You were fortunate to have known him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11Dyus_00014b60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were expecting a book. An ancient tome filled with the secrets that you "
"seek. But instead, you have found me. The last remnant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MysteriumXarxes_00097cc0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You were fortunate to have heard the Master read from its sacred pages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS21AyleidStatueTopic_0002b45f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were more resourceful than I had hoped. I esteem you greatly for your "
"success in bringing the Ten Ancestors together again after all these years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03FoundBust_000092a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You were right. The bust is here and Myvryna is guilty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016480_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You were sent to acquire this gem so Mannimarco would not get his hands on "
"it. With it, he would have marched on the University and come for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000be7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were supposed to check out those disappearances at Harlun's Watch. What's "
"the status?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MartinTopic_0006c5c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were there. You saw his true nature. The blood of the Dragon was revealed "
"for all to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034896_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You were to avoid detection and kill Roderick by means of poison, yet you "
"failed to follow these parameters. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a31c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were told to sit down. Are you incapable of following such simple "
"instructions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ05RavenSpeech_00022da9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You were told to sit down. Are you incapable of following such simple "
"instructions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07NewCaptain_0009839b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You what! But I didn't... I mean, of course. I'll take that letter now. I'll "
"personally make sure that Lady Umbranox gets it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGC01Choice2_0003663d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You what? Well, I'm sure I don't know what you're talking about. I would "
"never go skulking about...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChoice1A_00029ca6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You what? You want to be a combatant? Ha ha ha ha ha ha! Look at you! My "
"granny could beat you, and she's dead! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofBoethiaTOPIC_0001ebd8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You who have returned from Boethia's realm, approach the shrine and learn "
"your fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d86_AltarDeluxe_RESP2"
msgid "You will act as a herald of His coming and wear His attire!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will advance through the ranks of the Fighters Guild when you have proven "
"your merit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003356d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will advance through the ranks of the Fighters Guild when you have proven "
"your merit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GSWardenGreet2_00018dc6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You will answer for that with your blood, mortal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5A_00022ba9_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will be asked a question. Answer thusly: \"Sanguine, my Brother.\" You "
"will gain entrance to the Sanctuary. Once inside, speak with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5B_00022baa_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will be asked a question. Answer thusly: \"Sanguine, my Brother.\" You "
"will gain entrance to the Sanctuary. Once inside, speak with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice5C_00022bab_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will be asked a question. Answer thusly: \"Sanguine, my Brother.\" You "
"will gain entrance to the Sanctuary. Once inside, speak with Ocheeva."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_00024287_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will be asked to perform certain duties for the Guild. These are mainly "
"internal matters--discipline problems, defaulted contracts, and the like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServicetoLeyawiinTopic_JAWS12039_01_AltarESPMain_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will be held responsible for Weebam-Na's death. Your disappointing "
"performance proves you are not suited for service to Count Caro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00189d0b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will be included in my prayers forever. May the Divines smile upon you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylHelp_0001361f_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will be my Grand Inquisitor. Expose the conspirators, and they will be "
"punished, I assure you. Find out who keeps secrets, and what they are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGSpecialJobs_0001ee45_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You will be paid a modest sum. Do you want this job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35EarilInitialHello_0008f7d5_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will be perfectly preserved. Taken out of time. Beautiful forever. I will "
"display you with the rest in my collection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004b771_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You will be sweet, bloody nectar for the lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArcaneUniversityTopic_000473f1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You will come to know it well, in time. I have seen it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEShiveringIslesTOPIC_00078ca9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will enter soon, I imagine, through the Gates of Madness and into the "
"lands of Mania and Dementia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC2_0003e8f7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You will fail, mortal, and then where will you be? Dead. And nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrinaCrossInnTopic_0002fd6b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You will find her company most welcome, I believe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09HaskillRelmynaVerenim_0004036b_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You will find her in her Sanctum, hidden away in the dungeon of Xaselm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE45Choice1_00078788_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will find it! Bring the Fork! Hear the music. Music of toads. Music of "
"roads! Sing to yourself, so all can hear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022e8a_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You will find that history has been altered tonight. Such is the power of "
"Nocturnal's curse that lifting it can alter time itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor04_0002ad1b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will find your own path. Take care... there will be blood and death "
"before the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark18Choice3B_00090796_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will get what you desire. But first, meditate upon all that has "
"transpired. Perhaps you covet treasure? Take all my crypt has to offer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22GiveCarving_0002c51b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will go far in this business, my friend. You know when you've won, and "
"when you've lost. Until we meet again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Gardens_00013570_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will go there and gather the components needed to bring my new child into "
"this world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07HowToForge_0000c237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will have to track down one on your own. I don't know of any in Bravil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P1WhatIsPlan_0001fb6e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will have to travel the Old Way. Once used as an escape route for "
"Imperial Emperors, it has been forgotten for centuries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelAccept_00025037_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will help replenish alchemical supplies for the guild. Bring me 20 "
"Vampire Dust and 20 Daedra Hearts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MGExpelAccept_0002503b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will help replenish alchemical supplies for the guild. Deliver 20 "
"Dragon's Tongue flowers, and 20 Redwort Flowers to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMolagBalSpeech_00037821_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will let him kill you with this: the Cursed Mace. As you are doing this "
"for me, I'll save your miserable life. Probably. Get out of my sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22Mission_0002af34_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will need this as well. It is the key to the inner chamber of the High "
"Fane."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000251b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You will not make it past the sewers. Of this I am certain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LeyawiinTopic_000479e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will not stay in Leyawiin. You just visit. Of course. Too many Argonians "
"here. Already. People here don't like Argonians. Too many already. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00073267_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will not stop us. The Order of the Black Worm will consume all in its "
"path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00073b9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You will pay for this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BrinaCrossInnTopic_0002fd6b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You will pose as a traveling merchant, and will spend a night at the Inn, "
"which is north of Anvil. After that, continue east along the road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark03FinChoice1A_00023e54_Oblivion_RESP7"
msgid ""
"You will receive a bonus if you fulfill the contract without killing any of "
"the prison guards. Now go, and may the Night Mother go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006e602_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You will receive no training from me. Not now, or ever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000c4539_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will remember the day you met Farwil Indarys and treasure every moment "
"after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will retrieve for me a sword, a very special sword. It contains the soul "
"of Umbra, a hero I have had dealings with in the past. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1B_0001e859_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will retrieve the book immediately, if you have any intention of ever "
"receiving a recommendation from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG02Choice1A_0002e5aa_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will retrieve this ring for me. Should you manage to do so, I shall "
"consider sending a recommendation to the University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04SirRalvasGreeting02_00002ad7_Knights_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will see the Mace, separated from you by a great chasm. The chasm "
"represents your doubt. Your faith must be your guide across it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b081_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You will seek the assistance of Relmyna Verenim in Xaselm to rebuild the "
"Gatekeeper. You remember the creature you killed to get in here? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE11HaskillChoice2_00014b65_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will sit on the throne. It has always been Sheogorath's intent for you to "
"be the new Madgod."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11P5HowIsThat_0001fb72_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You will take her place. Do not speak to the priests. They are blindfolded "
"and will not realize it isn't her unless you speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09Components_00013571_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will travel to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone and collect for me these "
"things:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceRequest_0001356f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You will travel to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone. There you will gather "
"mystical components needed for the ceremony."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE09AssistanceCommand_0001356e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You will travel to the Gardens of Flesh and Bone. There, you will gather "
"mystical components needed for the ceremony."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48Convo_0002482b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will, soldier. Once they're secure, get back here immediately. We'll need "
"every available blade, and there'll be plenty of fighting to go around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG06TakeJob_0000bf87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You will?! I mean, good! Mind your manners in the castle. Stay out of Count "
"Hassildor's quarters. And don't let me catch you in the wine cellar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELIKE_0018b2cc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You win this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000637c2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wish an escort, Lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Entertainment_00063725_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wish entertainment, My Lord?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheBlackwoodCompany_000a5652_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You wish to join the Blackwood Company, do you? Hmm...I think I've heard of "
"you, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003fd39_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You wish to join the Thieves Guild too? Maybe we will soon be brothers in the "
"shadow. Only Armand can say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c15a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wish to learn? Hmm. You have potential, I see, but your equipment!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04Audience_0001359b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wish to see Lady Syl, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00086743_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You won the last round. I salute your bold spirit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002addd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won! Congratulations! Here are your winnings, my friend -- 100 gold "
"pieces. Come back and bet on the matches as often as you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ade0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won! Congratulations! Here are your winnings, my friend -- 100 gold "
"pieces. Come back and bet on the matches as often as you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002addc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won! Congratulations! Here are your winnings, my friend -- 200 gold "
"pieces. Come back and bet on the matches as often as you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002addf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won! Congratulations! Here are your winnings, my friend -- 200 gold "
"pieces. Come back and bet on the matches as often as you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002adde_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won! Congratulations! Here are your winnings, my friend -- 50 gold "
"pieces. Come back and bet on the matches as often as you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002ade1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won! Congratulations! Here are your winnings, my friend -- 50 gold "
"pieces. Come back and bet on the matches as often as you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008587c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You won't be leaving, though. I'll see to that now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0003403b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won't believe what's happened! Francois Motierre has been killed! "
"Murdered by the Dark Brotherhood! It's true, I saw the body myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f211_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You won't find a better property for sale. It's just inside the main gate, "
"near the bridge to the chapel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000c47ce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You won't get any of my blood! Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS38DeadNo_00023676_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won't help me? You're abandoning me now, just when I need you the most?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderAccept_00002b3a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You won't regret it, sir. You'll find us true-hearted and brave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuyCheydinhal_0004f012_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won't regret it. Go out to the corral. Mivryna will have your new Black "
"horse saddled and ready for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HorseBuyBruma_00054222_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won't regret it. Humilis will have your new Paint horse saddled and ready "
"for you outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22SrazirrAgreed_0002c528_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You won't regret it. This one will keep his eyes open, and wait for an "
"opportunity to help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000620db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You won't regret that decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MazogaSayNothing1_000860c3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You won't say 'Sir' to me? You are afraid to speak. It would shame me to "
"fight a gutless thing like you. So go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00077d11_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You won't see me there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BladesTopic_00033fca_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You wonder to find me here? Discretion is our watchword. Only a few of us "
"have the honor to serve publicly in the Imperial Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You worship the Nine Divines, perhaps? Have they ever helped or harmed you? "
"Of course not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07ARuler_00031622_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You would be well served to remember that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07BRuler_0009130d_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You would be well served to remember that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would break our bargain? You dare to trifle with me? Take care, mortal. "
"Clavicus Vile watches you now. And waits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001647d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You would dare to approach the King of Worms?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would dare?!?! We had a bargain, little hero. You would risk my wrath for "
"a pitiful little sword? I will be watching you mortal. And waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43KillBhisha_00072dbd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would do that for me? I would do just about anything for you if you make "
"him go away. Permanently. For good. Never to be seen again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND03RespectNature_00002be4_Knights_RESP2"
msgid "You would do well to remember this when it comes time for your test."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ValusOdiilTopic_000224ac_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You would join us, though you have no personal stake in this fight? An "
"honorable deed... I gladly accept your help, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathChoice4_00026af8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would mock our beliefs? Fool! When the three signs are upon us, you will "
"learn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDProphetStartC1_00002c88_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would quest for the holy panoply of Pelinal Whitestrake? The legendary "
"Relics that have been sought by mighty warriors throughout the ages?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDBootsoftheCrusader_00002a4b_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would seek the holy relic Kynareth has bestowed upon the world? Then you "
"must prove yourself worthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006244b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would seek to better yourself? First, I would ask that you look to the "
"poor and the suffering around Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d88a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You would seek training from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would steal from your brothers? If you had a need for something, why "
"would you not just ask? I will give you a chance, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095904_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would summon me? Wait... why are YOU summoning me? You've got things to "
"do. Things I told you to do. This makes me frown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD09Choice2_00035710_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You would violate a direct order? I should expel you now! But... this does "
"not all fall on your shoulders. Much of the fault is mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e894_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't happen to be in the market for a home would you? If you are, I "
"just happen to be selling a manor located right here in Anvil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEThadonWaitingLong_000131da_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't really know how long it's been, since you weren't here. If you'd "
"been here, it would've been no time at all, so who's to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038ada_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't think it, but our rocky soil is perfect for tomatoes. The same "
"ground that produces our glorious wines produces my splendid tomatoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE38Oddity7_00081e8a_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't think there would be two of those in the world, now would you? "
"Sorry. Keep looking and I'm sure something truly Odd will turn up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001ad4c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You wound me, and my heart bleeds with pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014d8a_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "You wrought destruction amongst insects and amused Him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00013565_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You! I remember you. You're the adventurer who slew my Gatekeeper, are you "
"not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenVoice_0004f12b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You! Prisoner! Stand aside. Over by the window. Stay out of the way, and you "
"won't get hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028726_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You! What do you want? If you're looking for something to drink, I can't help "
"you. It's mine. It's all mine. It's the only thing I have..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00090b7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You! You make me vomit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b96d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You! You're one of them! What do you want with me? Scratch me with your "
"claws? Steal my breath? My babies will protect me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f36c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You! You're... No, you're not one of them. Still, you've no business being "
"here. And if you see them, tell them Erver is ready and waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00071e76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You! You've ruined everything! Why? WHY? I had a job! I had a home! You've "
"taken it all! I'll kill you for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS45BrethrenTopic_00028215_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd be better off not asking such questions around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradNQDResponses_0003c19d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd be better off praying for a miracle than going to see Valandrus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000852b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd be smart to stay with the rest of the group. It's just not safe to go "
"wandering off alone with a killer on the loose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEServiceProviderResponses_00078179_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd be surprised what you can find there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0017c45e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'd best get back to the encampment. There's no telling when more of them "
"will come out of that infernal Oblivion Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035f37_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'd best get that to Irlav back at the Imperial City as soon as possible. "
"He'll want the mages there to examine it more closely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You'd best go see Deetsan before you do anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ02JauffreB2_00092d83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd better explain yourself. Now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c4e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd better get up to the Arena or you'll miss the match! Just head through "
"those doors on my left. If you win, come see me to collect your gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f85b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd better go talk to Jeanne before she really loses it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f85c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'd better go tell her you found me. That way you, at least, can get out of "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003be81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd better have a good reason for interrupting me. Keeping these miscreants "
"working this mudhole is no simple task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000175b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd better speak to Deetsan about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_0003333e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd better take whatever you can get in here, Khajiit. They don't feed the "
"new prisoners. Didn't you know that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014664_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'd better talk to Caranya before you do anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark02PirateConvo_000493b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd better watch your tongue, old man! Captain Tussaud hears you talkin' "
"like that, he'll cut it out! Now come on. We been gabbin' long enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_00038b36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd damn well better be ready! You've got an Arena full of people and the "
"Grand Champion himself waiting for you! Now get up there and fight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04LockPick_00035fb0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd do that for me? Maybe you guild types aren't so bad after all. Okay. "
"It's a deal. Give me a lockpick and I'll tell you about the ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613af_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'd never know it by looking at her, but Rusia Bradus did a lot of "
"traveling in her younger days. She must have been in pretty good shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGGrayFox_00015f11_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid "You'd think he was Saint Nerevar the way they talk about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008263d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'd think that after all this work, I'd finally be able to get some sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000488c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll always get a fair deal here. I'm Nilawen. What can I get you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICAllNQDResponses_00049929_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll always leave stuffed, assuming you can keep it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice4B_0003562a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll be able to freeze opponents in their tracks for a short time with this "
"staff. I can begin work now, or we can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0006770b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll be back. They always come back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053772_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll be back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PowerAttack_000919b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll be but another notch in my hammer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d928_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll be happy to know that Erthor is back in town. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_0004f212_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You'll be hard pressed to find a nicer home for sale in Cyrodiil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09AlternateWay_0005377e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll be hunted all over Cyrodiil. You don't want that do you? I don't think "
"so. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro1_00082462_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll be my champion. You'll grow powerful. You'll grow to be me. Prince of "
"Madness, a new Sheogorath. Or you'll die trying. I love that about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_infiltrate_000356eb_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll be on your own. Steer clear of me and all of your Fighters Guild "
"brothers. It'll be rough going, but you can do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro1_00082462_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll be stopping the Greymarch. Altering the course of events, breaking the "
"cycle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro1_00082467_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You'll change that. Break the cycle. You'll stop Jyggalag, and I'll have My "
"Realm to come back to. I've never actually tried that before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PayGoldforCrime_00045765_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll come with me, and you'll be searched for stolen property and pay "
"reparations. Then, you're free to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00035548_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll dance for me, little one, yes, you will. I'll make your corpse dance, "
"and then tear itself apart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_0001efe3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll find Baurus at Luther Broad's Boarding House in the Elven Gardens "
"district of the Imperial City."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_0001e910_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll find Grandmaster Jauffre at Weynon Priory, living as a simple monk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_000476f9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll find a lot of orcs serving as private guards. Watch work is too dull. "
"Lots of folks say, 'Oooh, there's an orc, she's scary'. Makes it easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BieneAmelionTOPIC_00009217_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll find her at the Water's Edge settlement. It's marked on your map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SavlianMatiusTopic_001778cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll find him at the barricade at the top of the road. He's still trying to "
"hold what's left of the Guard together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1A_0001e854_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll find it at an old ruin called Cloud Top. It's north of Chorrol, up in "
"the mountains. I'm afraid I don't have an exact location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05Choice1A_000224e4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll find it at an old ruin called Cloud Top. It's north of Chorrol, up in "
"the mountains. I'm afraid I don't have an exact location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseBuyImperialCity_000531bc_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "You'll find it in the Waterfront District. It's not much to look at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HrotaCaveTOPIC_00002e8e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll find it north of Anvil. Good luck, and give it to those bastards good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DirectionsServices_0018bda8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll find smiths, alchemists, booksellers, mage shops, clothiers, armorers, "
"and general traders in the Market District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ09Scales_00068850_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll find the Rumare slaughterfish all over the lake around here. Just dive "
"in, wrestle one down, cut its throat and bring me the scales."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASanguineSpeech_000b1219_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll find your equipment in that chest over there. And here's a little "
"something for your efforts. Maybe we'll celebrate again sometime...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06SheoIntro5_00082461_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll go to Cylarne and bring back the Flame of Agnon to relight the torch. "
"Oh... and take care with my minions at Cylarne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice3A_00035624_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have a staff capable of creating fireballs. If that's what you want, "
"I'll get started right away. Otherwise, we can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS05DreamworldTopic_0002c6d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to be very careful in there. If Henantier intended it as a "
"training ground, there's no telling what you may encounter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e84_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to do better than that, you ashen-faced god-cursed product of a "
"Daedra's bowels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to do better than that, you dust-dwelling goat-herder, pathetic "
"remnant of infamous Yokuda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e81_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to do better than that, you mud-crawling sap-licking jumped-up "
"reptile. Crawl back to your hole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to do better than that, you pasty-faced mongrel of an upstart "
"race. Back to the slave pens where you were bred."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e83_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to do better than that, you yellow-faced pointy-eared monkey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e85_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to do better than that, you yellow-faced prig, inbred arrogant "
"pretender to everything that the Mazken hold as our birthright."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0005e081_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll have to do better than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000914dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll have to excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b2f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to find Pranal if you want to learn more. That's all there is to "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13EridorWho_0003446d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll have to forgive me if I don't answer. I don't trust you, frankly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0003103c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll have to forgive me... I seem to have misplaced something. Hmm. Yes, "
"well, let's nevermind that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00077c27_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll have to get me a new one if it dies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0004a24a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll have to get one from Falcar, if you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Nd05ThedretHelp_00002afc_Knights_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll have to go on alone. But the knowledge I've gained may be of use to "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_000514b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll have to speak to Dagail about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00033794_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to speak to Dagail. I just don't understand what it is she wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseInquiry_000711b0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll have to speak with Shum gro-Yarug about that. He's the only one that "
"can handle the deed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002443c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You'll have to tell father what you've done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c09_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"You'll just have to get the book back, that's all. Whatever it takes, yes? If "
"you need to break in and steal it, that's what you'll do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ16MartinC_0004bfbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll just have to trust me. I now know what I was born to do. But I'll need "
"your help. I have to get past Mehrunes Dagon, somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002c7ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll keep your nose out of this, if you know what's good for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AInstUntilWhen_00018dfb_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll know you're done when they lie dead on the ground, or they are out of "
"their minds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE30ForgeCuirassMagic_000400bc_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll look absolutely stunning in this. Maybe you'd like to give me a little "
"fashion show?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3B3_000192e8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll make a fine commander one day. Come. Let us surrender to the madness "
"of battle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll make a fine pair of boots, lizard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JauffreTopic_000299ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll most likely find him in the library."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d282_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll need a recommendation from each local guild hall in order to advance "
"further. Until then, the Arcane University will be closed to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00034e19_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll need a recommendation from each ranking member at the local guild "
"halls around Cyrodiil before we may continue, Associate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_00080d7e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll need more than just my confession. You'll need evidence, and I have "
"none."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d284_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll need to acquire recommendations from all the local guild hall leaders "
"to advance further in the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003569f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll need to be careful on this mission. Sometimes new recruits have "
"complications. They are not used to our methods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07SheoIntro3_00082466_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll need to control one of the Courts of Madness. Replace a current Duke. "
"Or Duchess. Whichever. That will command respect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d14a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll need to convince Gin-Wulm you're worth his time if you want further "
"training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0005e045_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll need to make a better offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07TheFringeTopic_000912a2_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll need to put an end to that. Stop them. My armies should already be "
"there, but I want you to see what you can do to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07TheFringeTopic_0009130c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll need to put an end to that. Stop them. My armies should already be "
"there, but I want you to see what you can do to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG00JoinA_0002d283_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll need to receive a recommendation from each local guild hall in "
"Cyrodiil to advance in the guild, and be given any sort of responsibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0004a24c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll need to see Falcar about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0005323d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll need to speak to Raminus Polus at the Arcane University now. Look at "
"you, moving up in the world... how wonderful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006260b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll need to speak to one of the local guild heads to get into the guild. "
"Talk to Kud-Ei if you just can't wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b081_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll need to speak with Relmyna Verenim. She'll help you with your task. "
"Strange woman. Has some unusual tastes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_0006260d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll need to talk to Kud-Ei if you want to join the guild. Or any of the "
"heads of the local guild halls, for that matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_000355a9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll need wood for the staff before Delmar can assist you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0004992e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll never leave the Feed Bag on an empty stomach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll never leave this Arena alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a2a_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You'll never reach the Shield!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00083063_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll never take me alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008ef6a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll not get the best of me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark11Choice1A_00002db8_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You'll notice that the list gives each child's location and some suggestions "
"for gifts. Oh, and here's the gold I'm supposed to give you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06ShoutBetrayal_00054fb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll pay for your treachery!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02Gardens_0008e4f7_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll pick that lock, and I'll collect the bones. Then I'll make some "
"arrows, and we'll kill the Gatekeeper. Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000982e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll regret this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_00091015_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll see the miasma begin to spread. Where Order appears, the Realm dies. I "
"only hope you are up to Sheogorath's task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE07GreymarchTopic_0009127f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll see the miasma begin to spread. Where Order appears, the Realm dies. I "
"only hope you are up to Sheogorath's task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04ObelisksTopic_0009102d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll see those Knights of Order around them during the Greymarch. Drawn to "
"them, like flies to honey. Or rotting flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark04DrethConvo_00045f88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll see, you Imperial dog! When I get out of here, all of Tamriel will "
"know my name! Valen Dreth! Valen Dreth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00053243_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll see. Things will change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0007c3a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll taste my steel, Reman dog!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e616_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll uplift the poor, suffering folk of Dementia with the Flame, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081a53_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You'll want to get all the details from the messenger. Unless you already "
"have. You haven't, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE01HaskillChoice9_0005e371_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll want to pass through the Gates of Madness. Oh, and mind the "
"Gatekeeper. He dislikes strangers to the Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081ddf_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You'll want to seek out Lord Sheogorath. I believe He has plans for you. Try "
"not to disappoint Him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SESheogorathTopic_00078ca3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You'll want to speak with Him soon, as I believe He has plans for you. You "
"will find Him in New Sheoth, in His palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesGuildTopic_00062606_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You'll want to talk to Teekeeus, if you're interested in joining the guild. "
"Any other leader of a local guild hall can help you as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Interrogate1_00013ff2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'll.... You'll pay for this, Herdir. Make no mistake..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0005421b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You'r horse has been saddled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b166d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're Fighters Guild! Get them out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0001c28a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a Bloodletter now, so your opponents aren't gonna hold back anymore! "
"This is the real deal! Get into that Arena and make the Yellow Team pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001768a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a Champion now. I've got no more fights for you. If you think you can "
"beat the Gray Prince, challenge him! If anyone can beat him, you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001767e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a Hero, my friend. That crowd is out there for one reason: to see you "
"destroy the Yellow Team! Now go give 'em what they want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017655_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a Warrior now. That ain't no joke. They may not know your name, but "
"the people out there, the spectators, they know you now.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTHATE_0018b2b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a big, fat liar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002249a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a bold little thing, aren't you? I'm afraid you're of no use to me. "
"Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fc38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a brave soul to attempt entry to Oblivion. Hopefully, your skill "
"matches your fortitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ04Notes_0018a958_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a clever one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_0008faa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a cute little bunny! Not like that other Urul here in Split. A sweet "
"thing like you might be able to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008faa0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a dangerous little rascal! Stay away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterBuyItem_000091d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a fine negotiator."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bcba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a fit one. Been running a lot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ResistArrest_000459d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a fool as well as a criminal, it seems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GuardTalk2_0006fdd9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a good man. We could use more like you, that's for damned sure. You "
"ask me, you'll be getting that promotion in no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingMazoga01_0009381c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a liar. The Count is a man. And you aren't a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingMazoga02_0009381d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a liar. You don't even look like a Count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dd0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a likely looking prospect. Thinking about the Fighters Guild?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00086562_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a lying bastard. You killed Ra'vindra. And now I'm going to kill you. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00086560_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a pal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a persistent one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UmbacanoBribeB1_000a9850_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a real friend of the working stiff, you know that? Maybe I'll see you "
"there tonight, and we can drink to your generosity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG04Going_0000a177_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a smart one then. I was going have to arrest you in a minute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0018bc97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a sneaky looking sort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a traitor to your own race!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d280_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a wanted criminal, hardly the sort of person that has a place in the "
"guild. Clean up that record of yours, and maybe you'll be considered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d060_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're a wanted criminal. The guild doesn't accept criminals. Understand? "
"Clear things up, and then come back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0000a22f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're a welcome sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002b108_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're about to face off against the best the Yellow Team has to offer. Azura "
"knows you're the best the Blue Team's got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b983a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're already staying in one room, and I don't rent multiple rooms to a "
"single customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000165a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're always welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003e210_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're always welcome in Border Watch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003d4c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're an anxious one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00146847_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're at Bloodletter rank now, right? I caught your last match. Those were "
"some pretty impressive moves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017684_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're at the end of a long road, Hero. This is the last time you'll face off "
"against the Yellow Team before being named Champion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're awake.... good. I didn't want to disturb you. I suppose you're "
"wondering what I did with Selene?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022489_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're back! And Antus is with you.... thank you for bringing him home safely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002248d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're back! And Rallus is with you.... but where is Antus? I don't see him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022490_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back! And you've brought my sons with you! How wonderful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007b472_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back! Have a seat and tell me everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000139aa_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You're back! How nice for you. Does that mean you've made a decision? Or are "
"you lost? Suicidal? Just let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038f1a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back! What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c42d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back! You must tell me everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003c34d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back, good. Did you find the evidence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000270ea_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. And you've got the Great Stone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000366e0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. Did you bring help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e46_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. Good. You have important duties to attend to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008daa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. I trust everything went as planned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ee25_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. Thank Talos!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e583_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're back. What have you found out about Galtus Previa's disappearance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002e3f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. What have you found out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. What news do you bring me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00038f35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're back. What news do you bring me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00033604_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're being rude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're being sent to assassinate Adamus Phillida? Oh, finally Ocheeva has "
"come to her senses! You'll be killed, and we'll finally be rid of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018d2b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're beyond what I can teach. You might think about consulting Sinderion; "
"he knows more about Alchemy than I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014657_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're bothering me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00042ff0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're certainly a cute little thing aren't you? Did you fly a long way? You "
"did? Come here and perch on my shoulder for awhile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001764f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're cutting through the Yellow Team like a knife through scrib jelly! One "
"more fight and you'll advance to Warrior rank!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaChoice1B_00029ca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're damn right you will! This is a training hall, not a nursery! Now get "
"back up those stairs while you still have legs! Damned tourists...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000432af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're doing quite well so far... keep it up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_00033562_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're due for advancement. I hereby name you Protector of the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028722_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're enjoying all of this, aren't you? You like seeing us squirm! What in "
"blazes is going on here? Do you have something to do with this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GarlicTopic_0005373e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're familiar with it, aren't you? Often used in cooking. It should be "
"quite easy to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AReward_0007f3cf_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're free to go at any time of course, just up that hallway. Good luck to "
"you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTHATE_0018b2b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're full of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000860c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're getting on my nerves. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE43Meat_00072dc5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're giving me free food? You're a good friend. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SheoIntroSpeech5_00056095_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're going to Xedilian, one of my favorite spots in the Isles. It's a "
"little place I use to take care of unwanted visitors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylHelp_0001361f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're going to find out who knows. You're going to learn who keeps secrets, "
"who conspires against me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a353_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're going to get arrested if you don't leave right away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_00061ff2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're going to have to do better than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003842d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're going to have to leave. This is a crime scene and no one other than "
"ourselves or Raynil Dralas will be allowed access."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000039e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're going to kill Adamus Phillida? You? Ha ha ha ha ha! Oh, it'll be a "
"retirement, all right. Yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06JyggalagTopic_000910f6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're going to stop him, though. And the first thing to do is to make my "
"people feel safe. Otherwise, they tend to go work for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06GreymarchTopic_000910ed_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You're going to stop the Greymarch by becoming Me. Or a version of Me. You'll "
"be powerful. Powerful enough to stop Jyggalag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00023e84_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You're going to travel to Cheydinhal, and find out what sort of imposter is "
"trying to besmirch my good name. And you're going to tell him... *hic*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09TyrelliusTalk_000908ec_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're gonna end up rotting here anyway, you idiot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PERSUASIONEXIT_0018b2ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12HaskillGreetA1_00016cfe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're having a bit of fun with me. Very good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d915_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're heading back to Skingrad, aren't you? Could I... maybe come with you? "
"It'd be safer, I think. So, what do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004a989_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're here about that recommendation, I presume. I'll need to speak with "
"Erthor before I write it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000151f6_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You're here from the Council, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017649_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're hungry, Myrmidon! I can see it in your eyes! You ready to feed that "
"hunger? Huh? You ready for another match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00047658_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're in Rindir's Staffs. And I'm Rindir. I sell magical staffs. Imagine "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033758_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're in charge now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001544b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're in charge. Let us know what positions we should take up, but be quick "
"about it. The Necromancers could come out of there any time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062c9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're in good company, friend. Welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG05AChoice1A_00028c07_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You're in the guild, aren't you? You should be able to walk right in, find "
"it, and take it. And if you can't, then break in. I want that book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_jointheMagesGuild_0002d281_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're interested in joining? Great things will be expected of you. Are you "
"sure you're ready for it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGNocturnal_00018334_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're kidding. Everybody knows Nocturnal. She is the daedra lord of shadows. "
"The Mistress of Mystery. The Saint of Suspicion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db4e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're living on borrowed time, thief!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_causingtrouble_0002c7c4_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You're looking for Rellian, Vantus Prelius, and Dubok gro-Shagk. I haven't "
"had any trouble with them before, so find out what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenBaurus_0000b1c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're lucky I like you. Otherwise you'd be dead already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkGarlas2_00002c41_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're lucky to have been with the Crusader on such a glorious day. We "
"latecomers will always measure our deeds against Garlas Malatar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA5_00012cd2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're making a mistake. There is no other way to light the Flame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00088fa8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're making me nervous, sneaking around like that. Just make sure you keep "
"your hands to yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0005f236_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're more fearsome than the new Gatekeeper. Look at the teeth on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet3_00018e8a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're more intelligent that I expected from a mortal, and a male at that. "
"Away with you, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038580_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"You're my only hope at the moment. Please, you have my authorization to do "
"everything you can to bring him to justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033b33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're my only hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047423_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're needed in Chorrol. Report to Vilena Donton. She's got some duties for "
"you to take care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038a80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're new here in Skingrad? Fine. I'll make sure the captain knows we have a "
"stranger in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00038acf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're new here, or you'd know me. Toutius Sextius. My people have lived in "
"Skingrad since the Dawn. Father and the Count were best of friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041094_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're new here, so I'll try to be patient with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004735f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're new to Gaiar Alata, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008c237_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're no better than the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00071faf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're no fun. I bet you don't like dogs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033dd5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not afraid of trouble, are you? You'd like the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril4_00002c4d_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not alone. We all find the waiting difficult at times. I will pray for "
"you, and I ask the same of you. Go with the blessing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Brothers_00084a9f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not dreaming, Reynald. It's me, your brother. Guilbert."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00022b8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not easy to get a hold of. What have you found out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028711_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not even worthy enough to mention her name, you low-born parasite. Now "
"get away from me before YOU wind up dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AnvilTopic_0003e0b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not from around here, are you? Just a warning... be careful if you go "
"swimming. It's the slaughterfish. They'll swarm you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatesOfMadness_0007eae7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're not getting in because you're not blessed by Sheogorath. You can try "
"to get the keys. My Lord had them sewn into my child's body. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13MartinA1_00027101_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're not going to like it. Jauffre doesn't like it. The Countess of Bruma "
"certainly isn't going to like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not half the man your father was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenTaunt2_00033355_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not leaving this prison 'til they throw your body in the lake. Oh, "
"that's right. You're going to die in here, Breton! You're going to die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000a7157_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not looking yourself lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CheydinhalTopic_0004e8cf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not on my list. And that's all I have to say. If you were somebody, "
"I'd know. But I don't, so you aren't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofMalacathTOPIC_0001ec2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not one of Malacath's favorite people. He likes Orcs. Too bad for you. "
" So you approach His shrine at your own risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEZealotAlarm_00052f52_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not one of us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004735b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're not one of us, are you? Are you here to destroy Gaiar Alata and end "
"our nightmare?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000a172_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not supposed to be down here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a377_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not supposed to be here now. Leave, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_00062272_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not supposed to be in here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06DSWardenGreet2_00018e7f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not very good at this are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002873c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not welcome around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00028bc1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're not welcome here, stranger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AxeofDragol_0001fdba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're now the prey in Kurdan's insane hunt, just like I am. And here, we'll "
"most likely die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00026bcd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're off duty now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE37Errand_000452f8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're offering to help me with my research? Well... I suppose I could find a "
"use for you, despite your lack of training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e07a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're out late, ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e07b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're out late, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd7b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're outmatched, Elf!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd79_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're pathetic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BOASTHATE_00062319_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're pathetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're paying for all of this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TestToddNeutral_0002830a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're pissing me off, what next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MaladaTopic_0002c52a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're probably wondering what this one is doing in this gods-forsaken "
"wilderness. Same here. S'razirr doesn't get paid nearly enough for this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0003d7b3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're ready to fight? Good, good! All right then, head up to the Arena and "
"give the people a great show!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003c354_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're really pushing it. Just keep disturbing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JOKEHATE_00062322_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're revolting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkUmaril3_00002c50_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're right, of course. When we strike, we will strike with the holy power "
"of the gods behind us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27HerminiaD2_000a5606_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're right. Even if I persuade you, he'll send someone else, someone less "
"amenable to reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DANocturnalConvo1_00026ab3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're right. I know. I'm just worried. I'll try to calm down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChorrolNQDResponses_00029fe9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're right. It's shameful. Still, what is anyone supposed to do? It's her "
"life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AmuletofKingsTopic_0001efe3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're right. We must try to recover the Amulet before the enemy takes it out "
"of our reach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS48IlendA2_001778d0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're right. You're right. I can't just leave poor Menian to his fate. If "
"he's still alive, we've got to try to save him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight3_00002cd9_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're right. You're right. Thank you. Perhaps we can reminisce more later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003d4d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're sharp for an adventurer. If you ever decide to retire, I'm sure the "
"Anvil City Watch would love to have you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GenericBanditA_000a31c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're smarter than you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_000335dd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're staring at me again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028b7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're starting to crowd me, friend. Why don't you just back off, eh?  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ed5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're still annoying me, but not as much as the other J'zidzo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002416b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're still around? I've told you why I defaulted on the contract. Not too "
"much else to be said about it. Do what you must."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002ab8b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're still speaking. Stop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001bb25_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You're stuck here like I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000be60_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're supposed to be helping out the folks at Harlun's Watch. What's the "
"status?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003450f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're taking the meeting. You'd better get in there before they realize you "
"didn't come alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000476fa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're talking to Algot the Northerner. Guess you've got nothing better to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0002a86a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're talking to me, and I don't like you. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001365a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're talking to me. You should be talking to the Priests. You can't be "
"doing both, can you? Neat trick if you could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000029dd_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You're the Divine Crusader!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ab3c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the Gray Fox!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG11TalkToMillona02_00022e7d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the Gray Fox! I've been betrayed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ab30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the Gray Fox! Please don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003ab3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the Gray Fox! Thank you for everything you've done to help us here in "
"the waterfront."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a80b1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the Gray Fox! You're under arrest for... for... for all kinds of "
"stuff! You're wanted dead or alive. I'm choosing dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0018bd64_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the best the Blue Team has to offer? Ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS92Wait_00090b73_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0006e2e6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the boss. What orders do you have?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingFollowNo_00090b76_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the boss. Whenever you're ready...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDJoinOrderReject_00002b31_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the commander. We know how to take orders. But I know that one day "
"we'll earn your trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a944a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the leader of this expedition. So lead on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003c14e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the one that saved Cheydinhal from that Oblivion Gate, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylFindYou_0007fe20_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the one the Madgod sent, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SkingradTopic_00038a88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the one who closed the Skingrad gate? You must be... the Hero of "
"Kvatch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018ad5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the one who closed the gate? Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002984_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the one who restored the Knights of the Nine, right? Well done, if I "
"may say so. We could use more people like you these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Pillar_00033534_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the one with the book. You tell me how it works!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002887c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're the one with the weapons shipment, right? Let's talk about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008f7d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're the only one who understands me, and you'd think me a traitor? You "
"disappoint me, friend. I'll take my leave now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ViranusDontonTOPIC_0002d71d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're to accompany him, and make sure he succeeds. He needs some time in the "
"field, to get his confidence up, or he'll never become a good warrior."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RalsaGreet_0001db1f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You're to meet him at Seridur's house which is located in the Temple "
"District. He said all will be explained when you get there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE41PostYes_0008f9c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're too kind! Here is the empty flask again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ADMIRELIKE_0018b2ab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're too kind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0001a7f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're too late, fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045756_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029206_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing here. You'll have to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e8ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing here. You'll have to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045758_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing here. You'll have to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_000301fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing here. You'll have to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00029205_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing! Get out, or I call the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a352_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing! I already called the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a33f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're trespassing! I warned you, and now the guards are coming to arrest you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a369_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing! Leave now, or I call the guards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e8ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing! Leave now, or I'll arrest you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00045757_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing! Leave now, or I'll arrest you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a38b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing. Get out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002a37a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trespassing. You should leave now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ElixirofExploration_0004e91c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're truly a master explorer. To imagine you've actually acquired 30 more "
"samples. I'm astounded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000091e3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trying to drive me out of business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NevilleTopic_0002816e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're trying to turn me against him, aren't you? Just leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_0002b1e2_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You're up against a swordsman, an archer and a spellcaster. Two lower level "
"combatants, plus that Yellow Team Champion you've seen down here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ImperialCityTopic_00047734_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're very curious. Perhaps too curious for your own good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0003c15d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're very good with a bow. It's a shame I can't help you any more. If we "
"were better friends, I might be able to give you one last piece of advice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0018b190_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're very skilled with Destruction magic; I just don't feel comfortable "
"talking about this with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003ab34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're wanted dead or alive, Gray Fox! This will be easier if you're dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCEDISLIKE_00062327_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're wasting your breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00033784_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're wasting your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000236d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're wearing a Battle Raiment! Oh, isn't that cute. The wittle boy wants to "
"pway dwess up. Go home, momma's boy, before you get yourself killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000236d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're wearing a Battle Raiment! Oh, isn't that cute. The wittle girl wants "
"to pway dwess up. Go home, princess, before you get yourself killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0001e0df_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're welcome here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000c1c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're welcome on board the Bloated Float any time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GreetingThanks_000223d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MageTalk5_0006a877_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You're work never ceases to amaze me, noble Scholar. I... I can't tell you "
"how much it means to me that you'd share your findings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008fa8f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You're working for the Manics. Now, I really don't like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Goblins_000319d1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've agreed to help them clear the goblins from Cropsford? That's great "
"news!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDunrootBurrowTopic_0004301e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've already been warned that this will weaken you, so do take the "
"necessary precautions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_000a7872_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've already cleared that place of all the goblins? Go figure. Fine. Then I "
"guess you don't need to deliver those weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9be_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've already got a room. Nothin' more I can get for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b1242_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've already got the room for the night. There's nothing more I can offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b9836_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've already got the room. It's down below deck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've already got the use of the only beds I have. What more do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c0ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've already purchased the staff, friend. There really isn't much more to "
"say on the subject, is there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_00062158_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've already rented a room. I'm sure there are no problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000bb9bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've already rented the room.... Not much more to say, is there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000281a5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've already talked to me if you see this. Also, you should see generic "
"greetings about 50% of the time instead of this greeting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00034465_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've already told me all that I need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfaa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've always been too smart for your own good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_LorgrenLichSpeech_0006e7f6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've assisted me in completing the very thing Carahil and his cabal sought "
"to prevent all those years ago... my ascension to immortality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been doing a good job, and under a lot of scrutiny. I've been "
"authorized to promote you to the rank of Guardian. Good work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e3ff_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been speaking to Thadon. I can tell. He has a certain... effect on "
"people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00024f66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been suspended from the guild. You'd better see Raminus Polus if you "
"want fix things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_00053241_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been through quite a bit, haven't you? Well, I think you have proven "
"yourself worthy. The Arcane University awaits you now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00032eb5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been to Stonewall Shields in the Imperial City? Not cheap, but top "
"quality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0005323d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been to all the guild halls, haven't you? Well, then you're all set! "
"Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aa6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've been told what Sheogorath wants. The rest is up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026a9b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've been told what you have to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e1d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've been told what you must do in order to regain your standing, and "
"you've not yet done it. Don't return until you have twenty bear pelts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS10AldosTalk_0003c2b8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've been warned. You are now under arrest. Please, come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Yield_00025114_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've bested me, friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025df4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've brought back the horns. Your rank and responsibilities are restored. "
"There will be no further chances given you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_AjumKajinTopic_000356c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've brought him back. Good. I want to know the size of their forces, and "
"who is leading them. I also want to know the source of their strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000400d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've brought it! The holy Flame of Agnon, the fire of Inspiration and "
"Rapture!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BattlehornWineTopic_0000b61f_DLCBattlehornCastle_RESP1"
msgid "You've brought me what I asked for? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAClavicusSpeech_000243b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've brought the sword! Now give it to me, as we agreed. Umbra and I have "
"unfinished business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_0002ae2d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've calmed them down. That's good. Now go find out what the hell is going "
"on down there! Look past the symptoms, fool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000452e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've caught me a Baliwog! I can't wait to study it. Let's go inside and "
"I'll pay you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006a7ef_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've certainly done your part protecting Xedilian. Should Sheogorath ever "
"decide to visit, I'll be sure to inform him of your proficiency."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008e8e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've chosen a side, little one. You'll get what's coming to you eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've cleared every contract we've got on the books. That's some good work. "
"You're now promoted to Champion of the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000980ed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've come back! Have you reconsidered?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00028865_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You've come this far with us; will you go further? If we're truly going to "
"succeed, I'll need much more of your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004766c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've come to Divine Elegance because you care about what you wear. And "
"Palonirya has what you want... or no one has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e22_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've committed yet another crime against your Fighters Guild brothers. Go "
"speak with Donton. Until then, goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylEndSpeech_00081735_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've confessed to attempting to kill me, I understand. The penalty for this "
"treachery is death, and is to be carried out immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_00035ca7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've convinced me. If I don't stand up to him, who will? I just hope I'm "
"not committing suicide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS26FileCharges_000363d3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've convinced me. If I don't stand up to him, who will? I just hope I'm "
"not committing suicide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS23RolandDead_0001da70_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've done a great service for the Imperial City, and you should be proud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEHillofSuicidesTopic_0008e55b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done a great service freeing my Gadeneri. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS16Choice7A_00028c7a_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "You've done a great service to Chorrol, and you should be proud."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270f3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done better than I had hoped. Bruma's garrison is now as strong as we "
"can make it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008faa6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done good work here! Now, please, don't hurt me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done good work, and you deserve better than your current rank. I'm "
"restoring your previous rank of Guardian. Congratulations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000335a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f9c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f4fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done it! But what of Farwil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00091763_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done it! Color me impressed. On second thought, don't. I like what I'm "
"wearing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SQ02Skooma_0018917c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done it! I can't even begin to thank you enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003358c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done it! I never thought it possible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaICRaiment1_0003b1dd_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've done it! The Gray Prince was a great Orc, rest his soul and all "
"that... but you beat him! Ha ha!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ArenaICRaiment2_0003b1de_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've done it! The Gray Prince was a great Orc, rest his soul and all "
"that... but you beat him! Ha ha!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016e96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done it! The Ritual is complete, and you've survived! A shame about "
"Thadon, but it's how he would have wanted to go. Now, on to other..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014443_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done it! The Ritual is complete, and you've survived! Who'd have "
"thought? Now, on to other..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_UlrichLelandTopic_0003c33a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done it! This letter will spell his undoing when I present it to Count "
"Indarys. Splendid work, splendid work indeed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00037832_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done it! Victory is within our grasp! Give the Amulet to Martin at "
"once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0004dcba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done it! Well done, Lord Sheogorath. I never doubted you for a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ServiceRefusal_000613c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done nothing to prove yourself worthy of my time. Not a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d760_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done us a great service, stranger. We're all grateful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00003457_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done well for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS04Faustina_0003d4a3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You've done well, and here is the reward that I promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0008c261_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done well, mortal. I'm amused, I think. Head into the center of Border "
"Watch. And make sure to duck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009760c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done well, mortal. I'm amused, I think. Head into the center of Border "
"Watch. And make sure to duck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003379e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a32a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done well. Already I can feel the Fountainhead renewing itself, "
"flushing the taint of Order from its veins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_00033563_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done well. Because of your efforts, you have achieved the rank of "
"Swordsman of the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e71e_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've done well. I wouldn't have expected such bravery from someone who "
"isn't a Knight of the Thorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031eba_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've done well. I wouldn't have expected such bravery from someone who "
"isn't a Knight of the Thorn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270f2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done well. The Bruma garrison is much stronger now. We should be able "
"to put up a good fight even against a determined assault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003020a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've done well. The Gold Road should be a little safer for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackwoodCompany_000356c5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've done what? I... I had no idea it had gotten so bad. How is it you "
"accomplished all of this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAMolagBalSpeech_0003780c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've failed, mortal. I didn't figure you had it in you. Weakling. Pathetic "
"piece of filth. Leave, before I make you sorry you ever came here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_0000392f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've finished? Excellent! Good work, guildmate. Here's your payment for the "
"contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0003b82e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've forsaken the Demented and insulted the name of Arden-Sul. We have "
"nothing to discuss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEHillofSuicidesTopic_0008e55d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've found Gadeneri's skull? Take it to her at the Hill of Suicides! Before "
"They find out you've got it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SeersStone_00003893_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've found it! Oh, how wonderful! Finally, things can return to normal. By "
"all means, see that it gets to her immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FingersoftheMountain_000240c3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've found the book? My trust in you was well-placed, it seems. Hand it "
"over, if you please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've found the shrine of the Lord Malacath, friend Orc. You are welcome "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SwordAndArmor_000091d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've found them? Fantastic! I can't tell you what this means to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SwordAndArmor_000091f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've found them? Fantastic! I can't tell you what this means to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000981f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've found this place. Now you must find your way within."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0001f863_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You've fulfilled your end of the bargain, so now I'll fulfill mine. Raminus "
"will have my recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_JskarTopic_0003103c_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You've fulfilled your end of the bargain, though, so I'll fulfill mine. "
"Raminus will have my recommendation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00033ee0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've given me new hope, friend. I really believe we can make Cropsford a "
"home for ourselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b1d7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've got Agronak's Raiment of Valor! Good! Give it to me! All right, now I "
"give you your own. By Shinji, I... I'm shaking! This is amazing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Prank_00031038_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got Jeanne's book, I see. All right, then. I'll just take that from "
"you.... Meet me here in the living quarters just after 10 PM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Prank_0001ef7e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got Jeanne's book, I see. All right, then. I'll just take that from "
"you.... Meet me in the living quarters just after 10 PM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got a contract to take care of. Why are you talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004f3e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got a contract. Shouldn't you be in Bruma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000301d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got a lot of nerve, showing your face around here after what you done "
"to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Training_00066a5c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got a lot to learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_COERCELIKE_0018b2cd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c4596_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got a real bounce to your step. I'll bet you're quite the acrobat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00047422_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got duties to attend to. First, though, you're ready for advancement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000146a0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got him. Let's talk about Ajum-Kajin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BlackheartsRing_0002c5b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got it. Good. I'll use it to prove it was we, not the Blackwood "
"Company, who killed him. Good work on this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG17ChoicePositionB_00015457_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got it. I'll do my best to keep everyone healed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ICMonL14Choice3_0002c34f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
