msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalk1_00002baa_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You've got my ear. And my arm too, if needed. Please, speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00062cbe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got my ear. Let's hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got nice bones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS09TyrelliusTalk_000908ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got nothing to lose. So why not just tell me and save us both a heap "
"of trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_00061437_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got quite a past, don't you? Left some bloody trails? You tell "
"yourself they all deserved it, right? Ha, ha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c45a3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got quite the silver tongue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_00024287_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You've got some experience with the Guild now, so report to Vilena Donton in "
"Chorrol. I'm sure she'll have work for you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c45a2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got some nimble fingers. What have you been getting into?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_0005dab1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got the best room I can offer. If you start feeling ill for any "
"reason, please consider shortening your stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001588f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got the gem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c4599_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got the hands of a smith. Must have spent some time repairing your "
"gear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_defaulted_00024290_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got the journal. Good. So, what happened in Skingrad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_000091e4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEHorseArmorTopicAkatosh_00014e62_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DEHorseArmorTopicMehrunes_00014e65_AltarDeluxe_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLC06DahliaTopicNo_000178ba_DLCThievesDen_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorNoHorse1_000034c8_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorTopicElven_00004384_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorTopicNoHorse_000034c9_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DLCHorseArmorTopicSteel_00002612_DLCHorseArmor_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036616_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've got to be light on your feet to make it around here, and that's "
"something I'm good at. Maybe you can be, too. Take care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_KingofWormsTopic_0000a0fe_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid "You've got to do something. You've got to tell Arch-Mage Traven!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00023e6f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to get me out of here! Come on, open the door!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_000613a0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've got to have the know-how, or else I can't teach you anything at all. "
"Do you have what it takes? Do you even know what it takes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036620_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got to take care of those mountain lions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_bed_000b124e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got what 10 gold will buy you. I never said it'd be a palace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05Conspiracy_0008568c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've got what you need from me. I can't tell you anything more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_000981b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've got yourself a deal, idiot. Now I can sell it for 5 times its worth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_00049947_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've gotta like a store named Slash 'N Smash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081ef3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've gotten rid of the other one? Fantastic. I can finally get back to my "
"book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_breakins_000356b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've gotten them? Wonderful! But... their names are familiar to me. All of "
"those men have worked for me! Amazing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e511_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid "You've heard Ma'zaddha. Isn't it time to confront him with that fact?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DovesiDranTopic_00028d34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've helped me come to my senses, friend. There's no time for evidence "
"gathering, no time to collect proof! Dovesi is the murderer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00041096_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've interrupted my tree growth measurements! You've ruined a whole day's "
"work! Why can't you just leave me alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001fdb2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've killed all three? Wonderful! Now you must find the key. According to "
"Kurdan, it should be on one of their bodies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025dfa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've killed another of your brothers! During other times, I'd have you "
"killed for this. One chance. Bring me twenty minotaur horns."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e845_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've killed my child! How dare you! Get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081f16_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've killed my double? Good work. Now, please... just leave me alone. I "
"taste terrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e24_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've killed one of your Fighters Guild brothers! I'll have no more to do "
"with you. If you have any hope of redemption, speak with Vilena Donton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_000327ca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've made a big mistake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterSellItem_000091da_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've made a good bit of gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE46DoublesTopic_00081eca_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've made a mess of all that. You're a terrible worker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f17_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've made a real mess of things here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00028871_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made it, and just in time. We've got trouble with goblins here. I'll "
"take the bow. You give the weapons to my other two men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_weaponsshipment_00027f87_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made it, and just in time. We've got trouble with goblins here... but "
"where are the weapons? Get them and get back here! Quickly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00019858_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made short work of the intruders. Sheogorath should be proud to have "
"such an efficient apprentice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031613_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made your choice and forsaken the name Arden-Sul. I have no wish to "
"speak to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003161b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made your choice and forsaken the name Arden-Sul. Please, leave me be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made your choice and forsaken the name Arden-Sul. Please, leave me be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec68_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made your choice and forsaken the name Arden-Sul. Please, leave me be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008daa2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've made your choice... now leave me be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00143f0c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've made your choice... now leave me be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00014ac3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've made your selection. Now, we travel to the statue of our Lord, in the "
"Fringe. There we will perform the ceremony. Make haste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f18_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've messed this place up. I'm tired just thinking about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE35Heart_00078677_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"You've more than earned your reward. I believe a bit of a bonus is in order. "
"Well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e1f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've murdered one of your brothers. While we may die in battle, we do not "
"expect to die at the hands of our friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b0718_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've murdered the poor beasts! And ruined us! Leave us alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cf38_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've never worked an honest day in your life, you stupid orc!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE03AWhatWere_000807b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've not heard the legends? How could that be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a7159_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've overstayed your welcome here, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Trespass_0018d83c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've overstayed your welcome, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002ac6_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've passed Zenithar's challenge and redeemed Sir Ralvas. Congratulations. "
"Sir Juncan will be pleased to hear this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MythicDawnTopic_00024e6c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"You've piqued my curiousity about this puzzle. I will think on it myself and "
"let you know if I have any ideas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DAHircineSpeech_00051ee1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've pleased me, hunter. Take my token, and wear it well. Hereafter, take "
"your prey, and whisper my name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026a9a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've pleased the Madgod! You must be proud of yourself. I, for one, still "
"would like to eat your eyes. But, good for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Announcer_0004666c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've prayed for it, and these combatants have bled for it -- a high stakes "
"advancement match! Let's see who has what it takes to be your new Hero! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0003d07d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've priced yourself out of a deal. Care to make a counter-offer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001b6a6_Oblivion_RESP5"
msgid ""
"You've probably figured that out by now. Let's hope so. Or we're in real "
"trouble... and out come the intestines. And I skip rope with them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND04Mace_00002ac5_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've retrieved the Mace! I... I can't beleive it! Sir Knight, I bend my "
"knee in awe at your wisdom. You deserve to carry the mace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000093c0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've returned! But where is Rythe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a902_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've returned! So, have you been to Crowhaven? Have you... Oh, I see you "
"have not yet recovered any proof of my birth..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003a903_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've returned! So, have you been to Crowhaven? Have you... Oh, I see you "
"have not yet recovered any proof of my birth..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003b359_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've returned! So, have you been to Crowhaven? Have you... What's this? The "
"Journal of Lord Lovidicus? My friend, you've done it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00094ec0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've returned. And with the little ones in tow. Lovely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00090799_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've returned. I trust you've weighed the importance of your new position. "
"For you will soon hear words that will change lives, alter destinies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04XedilianChoice_00044f52_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You've run a maze like a good little rat, but no cheese for you yet. Well, "
"maybe a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006143e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen Lucien Lachance, then? Good, good. I know whatever task he has "
"for you will be carried out with skill and discretion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE04SheoIntro1_0008245e_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"You've seen his Knights. Not the warm and cuddly sort. Not a bit of original "
"thought in their lifeless husks. So, you're going to help Me stop him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000b1213_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen it! You've seen the first sign! Perhaps this is the beginning of "
"the K'Sharra!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting2_00018c80_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen the Spire in Passwall. It is believed to be a monument from times "
"past but its true purpose appears to be more sinister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_0001da34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen the Spire in Passwall. It is believed to be a monument from times "
"past but its true purpose appears to be more sinister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08SpireTopic_0001da35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen the Spire in Passwall. It is believed to be a monument from times "
"past but its true purpose appears to be more sinister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderGreeting2_000186fe_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen the Spire in Passwall. It is believed to be a monument from times "
"past, but its true purpose appears to be more sinister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDGauntletsoftheCrusader_00002b16_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen them, I assume. The only evidence of what happened so many years "
"ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3B1_00012cce_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen this with your own eyes? I must be sure it isn't a trap if I'm to "
"take such a risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE06HelpAttackA3B2_000192e9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen this with your own eyes? I must be sure it isn't a trap if I'm to "
"take such a risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0018bc82_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've seen wayshrines in the wilderness? Those who've pleased the Nine may "
"receive Blessings of Willpower at the Wayshrines of Mara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000192e5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've served Sheogorath well. Farewell. I go now to kindle the Altar of "
"Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000192e7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've served Sheogorath well. Farewell. I go now to kindle the Altar of "
"Despair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0001e7a4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've shown me mercy. I won't forget that. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f11e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've spoken to Dyus, yes? Then there is little more to say. Do as he "
"instructs -- recreate the Staff of Sheogorath before it is too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridDEMOBittneldTOPIC_00028a31_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've spoken to him by now, haven't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002992_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You've spoken to him, haven't you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00026aa5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've spoken to the Madgod. Joy of joys! Are you elated? Excited? Aroused? "
"Blessed are you. Blessed is He!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_EmfridDEMOchoice2_00028a2f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've spoken with him? Really? What did he say? I beg you, tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000356ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've started the job; now you must finish it. You need to get back to "
"Leyawiin. How can I help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025e2a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've stolen from the Fighters Guild! Go speak with Vilena Donton. None of "
"your brothers will deal with you until you atone for your actions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_causingtrouble_0002c7b6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You've stopped them from fighting. Now find out why it went on. Then do "
"something about it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017986_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've survived! It is a miracle! Hail the warrior Duke of Mania!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebf0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've survived! It... it cannot be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0000a21c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've taken up enough of my time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00081f3a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You've written a tragedy in our small town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG13ChoiceWhatproblem_000039a4_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"You, however, can act with impunity, and so will take care of this for me. "
"Then I will tell you what I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095794_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You, of all people, should realize this is an inopportune time to be in "
"Cyrodiil. Perhaps I've misjudged you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_0003aaa1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00025285_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You. I hoped Sithis would have claimed you by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0006fdc2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You. I've seen your kind before. You've got blood on your hands. Keep your "
"blade sheathed, you murdering bastard, or I'll put you down myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE12TraitorTaunts_0001a379_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You. Of course. Sheogorath's assassin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000251d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000298f_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You... How did you... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0014684d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... You killed Agronak. The Gray Prince is... dead. He... He was my "
"friend, my mentor... Congratulations, Grand Champion. Hope it was worth it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDKellenTopic_00002b04_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "You... You lifted the curse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PickpocketNoCrime_000626b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You... You picked their pocket! Shame on you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08Choice4B_00085861_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... You would do that for me? You are truly a good friend. Yes, I... I "
"fear this is beyond even my ability. I'm not as young as I used to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark06Choice2C_0004e9af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... You're kind of weird. You know that? But... That's okay. I... I like "
"crazy people. I like crazy people... and skooma! Ssshhh! Ha ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002f4d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... You're not the one Lachance was talking about! Please... Please, don't "
"kill me! You can take anything you like, then just leave!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00082472_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You... Your Grace. We did not expect you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_000981d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You... die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d916_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You... how did you get in here? Are those horrible creatures gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f11f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you do not belong here. Quickly! Put on a robe before the others see "
"you! They will kill you on sight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00016b58_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You... you do not belong here. You are a stranger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you murdering dog! How could you have killed all those people? For the "
"gold, is that it? You filthy peasant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05SylWho_000139b3_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid "You... you will help me. Yes, yes. You will be most useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS08UrsanneNoWorry_0001f42c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you will? Oh thank you! Please be careful, I don't wish any harm to "
"befall you either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00072dab_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You... you're a cat! Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NightMother_00086763_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you're asking me about the Night Mother? Well, I... I mean... she is "
"our Unholy Matron! She... she speaks... to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000286d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you're still alive... For all I know, you're the killer! You stand "
"your ground, or so help me they'll be blood between us.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002822c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you're the only one left... By Azura, no! Please, please don't kill "
"me. I beg of you! Spare my life! Aggghhh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_PrimoAntoniusTopic_0002818d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You... you're trying to turn me against that sweet boy. Make me think he's "
"the murderer! Get away from me, you fiend! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEBolwing_0008153b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You...you can! Bless you, My Lord! I should have known that you of all people "
"would be able to understand me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02GatekeeperChoice2Accepted_0007eaed_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You? Hah! No. You have a \"conventional\" type of soul. But, I don't make "
"that decision. The Shivering Isles belong to Lord Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00095023_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You? What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00018bfd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You? What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003e901_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You? Why would I want to talk with you? Very well, out with it before I "
"change my mind and add you to my list of experiments!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS31Minx03Final_0001525c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"You? You bested Lynch? I always knew he was out of practice. Oh well, I "
"suppose it's up to me to do his job for him as usual!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FGD02Insults_0002cfb6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "You? You wouldn't know a good sword if it stabbed you in the throat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004ed63_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Elixir is ready!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_0008f173_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace has noted the chimes around the Wellspring, I assume. If one chime "
"is insufficient, perhaps all four chimes may be enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0008f174_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace has noted the chimes around the Wellspring, I assume. If one chime "
"is insufficient, perhaps all four chimes may be enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_000824bd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace has restored the Wellspring, and saved us. For this we thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofAureal_00082636_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace has restored the Wellspring, and saved us. For this, we thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0008ef32_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace has restored the Wellspring, and saved us. For this, we thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10WellspringofMazken_0008ef33_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace has restored the Wellspring, and saved us. For this, we thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f049_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace must assist us, or we could be lost to this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008f04d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace must assist us, or we could be lost to this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DukeofDementia_0001746c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace! I am sorry, I did not realize..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10DukeofMania_0001746d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace! I am sorry, I did not realize..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001797d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace! We didn't expect you here. Aurig Desha is in command. You should "
"speak with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017976_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace! We didn't expect you here. Grakendo Udico is in command. You "
"should speak with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00082479_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace! You're alive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace! You... you're alive! Truly, you are the greatest warrior ever to "
"hold the seat of Dementia! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f37f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, Adeo has been waiting for you. Please, speak with her at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebf1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, I bend my knee to you. How you survived the collapse, I cannot "
"imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001f380_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace, Issmi has been waiting for you. Please speak with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001796f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, a dark time has been thrust upon us. Passwall is under attack. We "
"are outmatched and outnumbered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040363_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, has Relmyna sent you on an errand? Do you need help with your "
"task?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00017967_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, the situation is grim. Passwall is under attack. We are "
"outmatched and outnumbered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001680f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace, there is trouble! You must come quickly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040366_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, why disturb this ceremony? Oh,  I must have come accidentally. I "
"should come when it is more appropriate. My apologies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000459b5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Grace, you have committed a crime. Only the Lord Sheogorath is above the "
"laws of this Realm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ec70_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace, you honor us with your presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00056e66_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008fa97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008faa4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_00082474_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Grace..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ChallengeHighElf_0009f9b2_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your High Elf opponent is cool and confident. Go! Let the contest begin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000146f1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Highness, what are your orders? Shall the Guard fall back to the Palace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ04Conv_00037c3b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Highness. The Blades are at your command. You will be safe here until "
"you can take up your throne."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000276a8_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Highness? I am Narina Carvain, Countess of Bruma, at your service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND09ProphetQuestionsEnd_00002c18_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Knights will assemble at Garlas Malatar and await you there. Gather all "
"those who you deem worthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenMain_0004f779_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Majesty, we need to keep moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c7b_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Your Purification of the Cheydinhal Sanctuary. You, a mere underling, even "
"managed to single-handedly eliminate half of my Black Hand! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008faa3_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your Seducers are at the ready, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_0008672d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in a small settlement just outside "
"the city of Snowhawk, in the Nord homeland of Skyrim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086731_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the Elden Grove, in the Wood "
"Elven nation of Valenwood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_0008672c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the Halls of Collosus, in the "
"Khajiit homeland of Elsweyr."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086729_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the Ogres Tooth Mountains, on the "
"Redguard isle of Stros M'kai."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086725_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the city of Blackrose, in the "
"Argonian homeland of Black Marsh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_0008672a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the city of Daggerfall, in the "
"Breton homeland of High Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_0008672b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the city of Falinesti, in the "
"Wood Elven homeland of Valenwood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086724_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the city of Lillandril, on the "
"High Elven home of Sumerset Isle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086728_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the city of Mournhold, in the "
"Dark Elven homeland of Morrowind. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_0008672f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the city of Sentinel, in the "
"Redguard homeland of Hammerfell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086727_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the mead hall known as Thirsk, on "
"the Nord isle of Solstheim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086730_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the small, unnamed village just "
"west of the city of Alabaster, in the Khajiit homeland of Elsweyr."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_0008672e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the swamps just north of the city "
"of Archon, in the Argonian homeland of Black Marsh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086726_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person in the village of Seyda Neen, on the "
"Dark Elven isle of Vvardenfell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark19StatueTalk3_00086732_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Speaker should look for this person on the small island in the Illiac "
"Bay, in the Breton homeland of High Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0004ed61_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your Strong Elixir is complete. I think you'll be pleased with the results."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your accomplishments are impressive. Because of this, I bestow upon you the "
"rank of Warder of the Fighters Guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002d3a1_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid "Your actions are duly noted, and your reward will be in gold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MagesStaff_0002c67c_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Your actions for the guild more than merit a recommendation. I shall send it "
"to the University promptly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00025036_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your actions have gotten you suspended from the guild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Gang_0008676b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your actions have set back our investigation, and maybe driven the rest of "
"the gang into hiding. Nice work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046825_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your assistance may be needed in Hale, Lord. If you are otherwise occupied, "
"I'm certain the survivors will understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Attacks_00046820_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your attention is still needed at Highcross, though I realize it must be "
"inconvenient for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ND06CasimirHurryUp_00002b26_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your attitude does not bode well. Nevertheless, you may yet succeed where I "
"failed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GatherClues_000034aa_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your best bet is to speak to residents of the castle. Once you have found out "
"all you can, search for physical clues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018f96_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your betrayal of the Aureals was a strategem worthy of one of my own people! "
"Victory by means of treachery is the sweetest kind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00036414_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your blood will satisfy Lord Dagon just as well as the prisoner's. It will be "
"our honor to spill your blood for Him, if you choose that path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HouseTooMuchSkingrad_0004f218_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your blood? I wouldn't dream of paying 10,000 gold for your blood. But that "
"is the price for that house. Take it or leave it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG18Choice2B_00070486_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your body will be preserved as a Worm Thrall. Your soul is mine; I intend to "
"study both to learn more about the source of your power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d29f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your bravery is the talk of Skingrad. Well done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterExit_00062090_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your business is appreciated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001ebb4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your business with Vaermina is complete. Tremble should she visit you in your "
"dreams."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_0008c219_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your cause is already lost!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13NarinaMartin1_0002777e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your champion has already explained the situation to me. I have agreed to it. "
"We will not win this war through caution."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08ChoiceStartOver_00035623_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid "Your choices are Destruction, Illusion, or Mysticism. Which will it be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TrainingQuestTopic_0006139e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your courage is admirable, but now is not the time. Once Kvatch is safe from "
"these attackers, then we might speak of training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG03Reveal_00045f69_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your credibility is suspect. You'll have to do better than that to persuade "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000295c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Your crimes are of no account to me. I am neither judge nor priest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1A_000262d5_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your dead drops went unvisited, your targets ignored. Instead, you have been "
"systematically killing off all the members of the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1B_000262d6_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your dead drops went unvisited, your targets ignored. Instead, you have been "
"systematically killing off all the members of the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1C_000262d7_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your dead drops went unvisited, your targets ignored. Instead, you have been "
"systematically killing off all the members of the Black Hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ShrineofClavicusVileTOPIC_000b97c1_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your deal is made. Return when you have done your part."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DABoethiaChoice2_0001ec93_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your decision is a wise one. You would be foolish to think that you might "
"gain the favor of Boethia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec5e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your desires are my command, my lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007ec5d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your desires are my command, my lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CharGenEmperor_0000bcac_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your destiny calls you down a different road. Please help us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05PostTortureGreet_000811c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your efforts are futile. You'll get nothing from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Hit_00074a08_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your efforts are in vain, mortal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270f0_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your efforts are starting to pay off. Just knowing we do not stand alone has "
"raised the morale of the Bruma Guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0009db23_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your failure angers Mephala. Leave here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15MankarRant_0008c23e_Oblivion_RESP10"
msgid ""
"Your false gods could not entirely rewrite history. Thus you remember tales "
"of Lorkhan, vilified, a dead trickster, whose heart came to Tamriel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS46Response_000343b4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your father was the one that got us into this mess! I'm tired of you always "
"defending him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_contract_00003885_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first contract requires the killing of a pirate captain, on his ship. "
"Are you ready to accept?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1A_000262d5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first dead drop contract, you carried that out, killed Celedaen. After "
"that, you eliminated the Draconis family, as ordered. Then, betrayal!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1B_000262d6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first dead drop contract, you carried that out, killed Celedaen. After "
"that, you eliminated the Draconis family, as ordered. Then, betrayal!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark16Choice1C_000262d7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first dead drop contract, you carried that out, killed Celedaen. After "
"that, you eliminated the Draconis family, as ordered. Then, betrayal!  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Duties_0004b830_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first duty is to attend to the needs of your subjects. You will find "
"that there are constant threats to the residents of the Isles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_duties_000356c4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first duty should be to name your second-in-command. I can think of no "
"one better for this job than Modryn Oreyn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00034065_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first priority now should be to find Martin and bring him back here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS22HighFane_0002af36_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your first task is to locate the ruins of the High Fane. I believe it must "
"now be known by a different name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE40SleepOutside_000790bf_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your friend ain't sleeping, eh? You could buy one of me sticks - a "
"dreamstick, yes! Hit him over the head. Knock him into dreamland. No? Hmmm. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_000153ae_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your generosity restores your honor within the guild. You may now seek "
"membership."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_information_00009224_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your guild does not fully appreciate the danger which quickly approaches. "
"Hopefully when you return to them, their eyes will be opened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TGPayBloodPrice_000174ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your honor is restored. The Thieves Guild welcomes you back. This one may now "
"pay you for finding the book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007a021_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your humble servant, My Lord."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan3_00018c88_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your insight is impressive. While we draw their attention here, you should be "
"able to slip inside Xeddefen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE08CommanderPlan3_00018c89_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your insight is impressive. While we draw their attention here, you should be "
"able to slip inside Xeddefen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE10GreymarchTopic_0009148a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your job is still to stop it. And to stop Jyggalag. You've already forced "
"Order's hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE14Duties_0004b830_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your job is to protect them, either by dealing with the matter yourself, or "
"sending your armies to take care of it for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00009c7b_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your killing of the old man Baenlin... the execution of Adamus Phillida... "
"the way you stalked and murdered each member of the Draconis family... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTalkDeadKnight3_00002cda_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your kind words comfort me. I'll try to follow your example. Thank you for "
"lending me your ear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002fdb3_Oblivion_RESP4"
msgid ""
"Your life in the Sanctuary is over. Those contracts are behind you. Now, you "
"will serve the Black Hand. You will serve me. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0008f127_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your light will shine no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00070f86_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your lips to His ears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_0006b836_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your lord will never prevail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE32FanaticYell_0001b702_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your magic is useless!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Attack_00002a2e_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Your master's days are numbered!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC6_0003e8fd_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your mind follows the simple path ... the choice of an animal. You see an "
"enemy and you attack it, unthinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetC2_0003e8f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your mind follows the simple path, the choice of an animal. But you have "
"courage, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000a31b7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your money or your life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0002e71e_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Your name shall be revered and your deeds placed into song to be performed by "
"the greatest bards for generations to come. Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00031eba_Oblivion_RESP6"
msgid ""
"Your name shall be revered and your deeds placed into song to be performed by "
"the greatest bards for generations to come. Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00018f97_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your name will be hailed whenever we toast this day's victory in our halls at "
"Pinnacle Rock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab2_Knights_RESP1"
msgid "Your need must be great for the gods to allow us to speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1A_00032bf0_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your next contract can be found at the dead drop on Hero Hill, southeast of "
"here. A hollow in the moss-covered rock contains all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1B_00032bf1_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your next contract can be found at the dead drop on Hero Hill, southeast of "
"here. A hollow in the moss-covered rock contains all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark10SancChoice1C_00032bf3_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your next contract can be found at the dead drop on Hero Hill, southeast of "
"here. A hollow in the moss-covered rock contains all you need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182c6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your next opponent is a Khajiit. Not one of the quick, jumpy ones either. "
"This cat goes in heavy, usually with an axe! Now go get 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_00018290_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your next opponent is the most savage, blood-crazed Orc I've ever seen, and "
"believe me I've seen a lot of 'em! This will not be fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_ReadyForAMatch_000182b9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your next opponent wears a Heavy Raiment, but attacks with a short sword. "
"She's like a heavily-armored wasp, and has the temper to match. Careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_BarterFail_0006201f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your offer is unacceptable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0009148d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your pardon, citizen. I must return to my post."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GOODBYE_00047373_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your path is clear. Send Rufio to his death, and the Dark Brotherhood will "
"embrace you as family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0003d7f5_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your place is on the battlefield. I have trusted you this far. Do not fail me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ13BattlePlans_0003d7f7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your plan is madness. There must be another way for you to recover the Amulet "
"without risking Bruma's destruction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG07WhereSkrivva_00098394_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your poor memory is my good fortune. What's it worth to ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDPelinalVisionSpeech_00002ab0_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your prayers have woken me from my endless dream. Or perhaps you have entered "
"my dream, and I still sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEDyusTormentTopic_000807af_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your predecessor cursed me with immortality and placed me in this remote "
"location in order to \"protect His Realm from my knowledge.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_00095779_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your predecessor did have one task He wanted performed, though He never found "
"a mortal suited for the task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Seen_001854ee_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your presence here will not be tolerated!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002985_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your quest for the Crusader's Relics was the equal of any of the old tales! "
"Well met, Sir Knight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00002956_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your quest proceeds apace. You may yet prove a worthy successor to Pelinal "
"Whitestrake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0018d295_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your reputation precedes you, Gate-Closer, Scourge of Oblivion, Hero of "
"Kvatch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ11BrumaAllies_000270fb_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your reputation precedes you, Hero of Kvatch! You have done my city a great "
"service by closing the Oblivion Gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0007ec71_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your return is most welcome, Your Grace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS27UmbacanoD1_000a6583_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"Your reward will be whatever plunder you wish to carry off from Nenalata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ06MankarSpeech_0001f87a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your reward, Brothers and Sisters! The time of Cleansing draws nigh. I go now "
"to Paradise. I shall return with Lord Dagon at the coming of the Dawn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_00188f40_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your role within the guild becomes ever more essential. You have now attained "
"the rank of Warlock, and are freely able to access the Council Chamber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000206c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your safe return speaks volumes of your success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_advancementFG_0003355f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your service to the guild has not gone unnoticed. Henceforth, you will carry "
"the rank of Defender. Bear the title proudly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Advancement_00084b4a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your services to the guild have not gone unnoticed. As of this moment, you "
"have gained the rank of Evoker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_000c459a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your shield arm looks strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE13JyggalagVoice_00095e30_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your staff does not make you a Daedra, foolish mortal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice3B_00035626_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your staff will give you power over ice. Is that what you want? If not, we "
"can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MG08Choice3C_00035627_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your staff will let you wield the power of lightning. If you want something "
"else instead, we can start over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032473_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Apprentice shall serve you at the forge of "
"destiny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032474_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Atronach shall aid you with your appointed "
"burden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032478_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Lady shall fortify you in your quest for "
"glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032479_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Lord shall prove a faithful patron in your "
"quest for glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_0003247b_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Lover shall sweeten your journey as you "
"confront your fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032472_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Mage shall light your way on the paths of "
"glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032475_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Ritual shall speed you on your star-"
"patterned path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_0003247e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Serpent shall sting the foes who seek your "
"blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_0003247c_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Shadow shall hide you from destiny's "
"cunning hounds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032477_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Steed shall speed your progress on the "
"road to destiny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_0003247a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Thief shall guide your steps on the road "
"to destiny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_0003247d_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Tower shall prove a stout refuge in time "
"of need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_CGEmperor14_00032476_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your stars are not mine. Today the Warrior shall prove a stalwart companion "
"when fortune fades."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008151e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your stick is a lot nicer than mine, Sheogorath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_FromTheDead_0001d036_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your story is ridiculous. This sounds like some lie created by Jensine and "
"her damned \"society\" to have me run out of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQ15KathutetA_0003c80c_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your swift retribution earned you much respect among my people. We had not "
"expected that a mortal would act with such resolution and honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0000298c_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your sword and your faith are true. You may claim the Cuirass with my leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TG05WhatIsPlan_0000c05d_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your target is the Arcane University. We've had our eye on Hrormir's Staff "
"for some time, but have been waiting for the wizards to be distracted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_000206ba_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your task is nearly complete. All that's left is to touch the Altar and let "
"Arden-Sul devour the Duchess' heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001a329_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your task is only half done. The Font will not be fully cleansed while Order "
"pollutes one of the pools that feed it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE05HerdirInvestigateCurrentTask_0008e512_Oblivion_RES"
"P1"
msgid ""
"Your task now is to listen in on Ma'zaddha's conversation with Nelrene "
"without being noticed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_DASheogorathSpeech_0009571e_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your task would be to make the first two signs of the prophecy occur. Your "
"predecessor already put plans in motion for the final step. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_tasks_0005e1db_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your tasks now come directly from Arch-Mage Traven. Please speak with him if "
"you're unsure what you should be doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Recommendation_0005323f_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your time has come. The Arcane University needs you, child. Raminus Polus "
"waits for you even now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MQVoice_00033df9_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your timing is excellent! I'll take the one on the right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0001e072_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your trust is appreciated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0007fde4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Your victory at Xeddefen was well won, but the war still carries on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark08NelsNevConvo_000852c7_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your words border on treason, Nord, and I will not tolerate them! You will "
"respect the Empire! You will respect the memory of our dear Emperor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt ""
"ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SEPykeZoeMaleneResponses_00091b56_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your words warm my heart, my love. Being here is the best choice I've made in "
"my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ea34_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your work is done here, Your Grace. I'm sure Sheogorath will want news of "
"your success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_0008ea35_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Your work is done here, Your Grace. I'm sure Sheogorath will want news of "
"your success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_Dark01Choice2A_00022b9f_Oblivion_RESP2"
msgid ""
"Your work, your deathcraft, pleases the Night Mother. And so, I come to you "
"with an offering. An opportunity... to join our rather unique family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_HELLO_0008e4d4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yuck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_SE02OrcSpectators_0007ead6_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Yuck. Look at all the blood and gore. I'm getting out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_INFOGENERAL_0007815a_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "Zealots have dedicated themselves to the worship of Arden-Sul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_NDTombSpeech_00002d09_Knights_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Zenithar grants you good fortune. May you always endeavor to become the "
"master of your craft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_GREETING_00040bc4_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid ""
"Zoe Malene's the name. Sorry I don't have much time to have a formal "
"introduction, but I must get my latest painting finished!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_MS47NeedAntidote_0003003f_Oblivion_RESP3"
msgid ""
"[Ancotar hands you a scroll.] Here. Stand in the center of town, to make sure "
"you get everyone. Oh, and make sure... never mind. Should be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TRANSITION_0002a859_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "[CLEARS THROAT]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TRANSITION_0002a862_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "[CLEARS THROAT]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ST_ResponseTexts/LOC_RT_TRANSITION_00060955_Oblivion_RESP1"
msgid "[CLEARS THROAT]"
msgstr ""

